export const DETAILS = {"toyota-rav4-hybrid-luxury":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, roughly half the TW average of 12,000-15,000 km/yr. All checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7000 / 21000 / 35000 / 49000 / 70000). Two consequences are baked into every number below. (1) Resale is quoted from LOW-MILEAGE listings, which in the TW RAV4 market sit clearly above the mileage-blind average — visible directly in the fetched 8891 rows: a 2023 2.5 Hybrid 旗艦 at 62,900 km asks 819,000 while the same trim at 119,400 km asks 755,000. (2) Servicing is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven: Toyota TW's interval is 每 6 個月或 10,000 公里，以先到者為準, so at 7,000 km/yr the 6-month clock always fires first and this owner pays for roughly 20 shop visits across 10 years while covering only 70,000 km. That makes per-km maintenance cost look high and makes age-based consumables (tires, 12V battery, brake fluid, coolant) — not wear-based ones — the dominant spend. Tax (牌照稅/燃料稅) and insurance are excluded by design throughout. IMPORTANT on price platforms: all 8891 and SUM figures are 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking). Every private_sale_price below is converted DOWN from that level by 11% (factor 0.89) at every checkpoint including year 1, and dealer_tradein_price is a further 13-14.5% below private. An earlier draft of this record used a 7% retail→private spread at year 1, which is outside the realistic 8-15% band; that has been corrected. Note also that the two platforms disagree more than commonly assumed — for 2021 2.5 Hybrid 旗艦 at comparable mileage, 8891 sits roughly 17% below SUM (8891: 88,000 km = 538,000; SUM: 92,558 km = 648,000) — so retention ratios here are blended toward the 8891 (lower) side rather than taken from SUM alone.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, but not from nothing — correcting a prior draft that claimed 'no genuine data exists'. 8891 (fetched 2026-08-11) DOES already carry 6th-gen listings: a 2026 Adventure 4WD at 5,499 km asking 1,198,000 against a 1,330,000 list = 90.1% of list at roughly 6 months, dealer retail. Stepping that to 12 months / 7,000 km gives ~87% dealer retail, applied to real_cost = ~897,000 dealer RETAIL asking. private_sale = 897,000 x 0.89 = ~800,000; dealer_tradein = 800,000 x 0.87 = ~695,000. TWO corrections against the prior draft, both downward. (a) It used a 0.93 retail→private factor here, a 7% spread, which is outside the realistic 8-15% band; the standard 0.89 is used instead. (b) Its 1-year proxy read 8891's 2025 model-year listings (935,000 and 949,000) against a 2.0 豪華 list of 1,010,000 to get 93% retention, but 8891's own row labels identify those cars as a 2.0汽油旗艦 (list 1,170,000 → 79.9%) and a 2.5油電曜黑魅影 (list ~1,260,000 → 75.3%). That trim mismatch inflated 1-year retention by roughly 14 points. The 5th-gen 2025 cars are additionally depressed by being an outgoing generation undercut by the new 1,040,000 entry price, so the 6th-gen Adventure data point is the better guide and is what is used. Low-mileage listings quoted throughout."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"Predecessor-generation ratio, re-anchored on HYBRID comparables. 8891 (fetched) shows 2023 (3-year) 2.5 Hybrid 旗艦 at 62,900 km asking 819,000 and at 63,100 km asking 819,000, against a 5th-gen Hybrid 旗艦 list of 1,260,000 (KingAutos, fetched) = 65.0% dealer retail; the same trim at 119,400 km asks 755,000 = 59.9%. Interpolating that mileage slope down to our 21,000 km checkpoint, and allowing for a stronger premium at the very low end, gives ~70% dealer-retail retention. 0.70 x real_cost = ~722,000 dealer RETAIL asking. private_sale = 722,000 x 0.89 = ~650,000; dealer_tradein = 650,000 x 0.87 = ~565,000. CORRECTION vs the prior draft (690,000/600,000): it anchored this checkpoint on a 2022 SUM listing described as '旗艦', but the SUM row reads 2.0 旗艦版 — a GASOLINE car — and 8891 shows the powertrains diverge sharply at this age (2023 2.5 Hybrid 旗艦 = 65.0% of list; 2023 2.0汽油旗艦 at 60,000 km = 628,000 = 53.7%; 2023 2.0汽油尊爵 at 60,000 km = 618,000 = 55.7%). Using a hybrid anchor is both more correct and, usefully, confirms the 'Toyota hybrids hold value above market' expectation directly in the data. Quoted from low-mileage listings."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"Best age/mileage match in the set. SUM (fetched) lists two 2021 RAV4 2.5 Hybrid 旗艦型 at 38,000 km and 38,012 km, both asking 750,000, plus a 旗艦版 at 44,412 km asking 688,000 and one at 92,558 km asking 648,000. Against a 2021-era Hybrid 旗艦 list of ~1,200,000 (final 5th-gen list is 1,260,000 per KingAutos, fetched; the 2019 launch price for Hybrid FWD 旗艦 was 1,139,000, so a 2021 car sat between) the 38,000 km cars read ~62.5% dealer retail. That is blended DOWN to ~59% because 8891 for the same year and trim runs far below SUM — 8891's 2021 2.5 Hybrid 旗艦 at 88,000 km asks only 538,000 (44.8%) where SUM's 92,558 km car asks 648,000 (54.0%), a ~17% platform gap. 0.59 x real_cost = ~608,000 dealer RETAIL asking. private_sale = 608,000 x 0.89 = ~541,000, rounded to 555,000 to keep a modest low-mileage premium for our 35,000 km checkpoint versus the 38,000 km comparables; dealer_tradein = 555,000 x 0.865 = ~480,000. CORRECTION vs the prior draft (585,000/508,000): it took the comparable's list as '~120萬' and then applied a further +1.5 point low-mileage nudge on top of a car that was ALREADY low-mileage (38,000 km over 5 years = 7,600 km/yr, essentially this buyer's own duty cycle), double-counting the premium. Confidence held at medium: the comparables are 5th-gen 旗艦, not 6th-gen 豪華."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"Predecessor-generation ratio, DOWNGRADED to low confidence in this pass. The prior draft rested this checkpoint on a single SUM row — a 2019 Hybrid 4WD 旗艦 at 50,879 km asking 698,000 against a 1,249,000 launch list = 55.9% — which this fact-check could NOT reproduce (the SUM 2016-2019 query returned only 2016/2017 rows, and the 2019-2026 query was not re-fetched). The independent 8891 evidence for 2019 cars sits materially lower: 2019 2.5 Hybrid 旗艦 at 110,000 km asks 580,000 (46.4% of the 1,260,000 list) and 2019 2.0 豪華 at 96,000 km asks 458,000. Retention is therefore shaded from 55.9% to ~54% dealer retail for a low-mileage 49,000 km car. 0.54 x real_cost = ~557,000 dealer RETAIL asking; private_sale = 557,000 x 0.89 = ~496,000, quoted 490,000; dealer_tradein = 490,000 x 0.857 = ~420,000. Cross-check against the trade-in end: 小曾車庫's 收購行情 table (fetched) gives 5代 (2019-2025) a 480,000-1,100,000 band and states explicitly these are 收購的上限值 (acquisition CEILING values) that real offers fall below. Scaling our 420,000 up to the comparable's 1,249,000 purchase cost gives ~509,000, sitting just above their 480,000 floor for the oldest 5th-gen cars — consistent, given ours is a low-mileage example. Confidence low, not medium: the primary anchor is unverified and the two platforms disagree."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the PRE-predecessor generation, because the 6th gen is 7 months old and the 5th gen only reaches 7 years, so no 10-year data exists for either. Uses the 4.5-gen (2016 facelift) RAV4 2.5 Hybrid 尊爵, list 1,250,000 at launch, now exactly 10 years old. SUM (fetched and re-verified in this pass): 2016 2.5 Hybrid 2WD at 90,155 km asking 439,000 = 35.1% of list; at 120,000 km asking 488,000 (condition outlier); at 190,533 km asking 368,000. 8891 (fetched) corroborates: 2016 2.5 HYBRID 尊爵 at 133,000 km asking 360,000. Our checkpoint is 70,000 km — well under half the TW norm for a 10-year car — so retention is lifted ~2 points to ~37%. 0.37 x real_cost = ~381,000 dealer RETAIL asking; private_sale = 381,000 x 0.89 = ~339,000, quoted 340,000; dealer_tradein = 340,000 x 0.855 = ~290,000 (a wider dealer margin than at earlier checkpoints, because gross margin on cheap old stock is proportionally larger). Cross-check: scaling our 290,000 to the comparable's 1,250,000 cost gives ~352,000, inside 小曾車庫's 4.5代 290,000-600,000 ceiling band. Low confidence: different generation, different trim, and by year 10 the HV battery is 2 years past its 8年/16萬公里 warranty, which measurably depresses hybrid values in TW even when the pack is healthy. Acknowledged discontinuity: the 7→10 year drop is steeper per year than 5→7, which is unusual for a depreciation curve; it is retained rather than smoothed because it reflects two real effects — the battery-warranty cliff and the switch to a different (weaker) comparable generation."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Toyota TW new-car free-inspection policy (滿月 + 半年/1萬公里) plus Mobile01 owner receipts for the 1萬公里定保 at ~2,940元. Only one paid visit falls inside year 1 because the first two checks are free. Covers 0-1y."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers 1-3y. Four time-triggered visits at ~2,800元 average (bracketed by Mobile01 receipts: ~2,940元 for a 1萬公里定保, ~3,400元 for the 3-year T30 定保 at 35,000 km including tire rotation), plus brake fluid ~1,500元 and cabin/air filters ~1,600元."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers 3-5y. Scheduled service extrapolated from 5th-gen owner receipts (~3,000元 per time-triggered visit x4 = ~12,000元); 12V aux battery from TW hybrid replacement norms (~6,000元); brake fluid ~1,500元. REVISED DOWN from a prior draft figure of 35,000 by moving the first tire set out of this window — see plan_notes."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers 5-7y. Extrapolated from 5th-gen scheduled-service pricing and TW dealer quote norms for tires, pads and transaxle fluid. REVISED UP from a prior draft figure of 24,000 by moving the age-out tire set into this window, which also restores a monotonically rising maintenance curve. Deliberately excludes German-style out-of-warranty risk items (air suspension, water pump, coil packs) — that guidance targets German cars, and the TW owner-forum record for the 5th-gen RAV4 Hybrid shows no systematic unscheduled failures in this age band."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers 7-10y. Extrapolated. Scheduled-service component follows the same time-driven cadence as earlier windows; consumables priced from TW norms. HV battery replacement cost of ~62,000元 and the 8年/16萬公里 battery / 5年/12萬公里 motor warranty terms come from U-CAR's Toyota hybrid Q&A (search-snippet only; the page body returned HTTP 403). Low confidence: no 6th-gen or even 5th-gen car has reached 10 years, so the whole window is a projection from generic Toyota hybrid age behaviour rather than from receipts."}],"sources":[{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 — 2026 Toyota RAV4 規格配備／價格表","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/toyota/2026-toyota-rav4","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED IN THIS FACT-CHECK PASS. Primary source for the official list price. Returns 2.5 Hybrid 豪華 = 1,040,000 and the full 6th-gen TW lineup (尊爵 1,170,000 / 尊爵+ 1,220,000 / 旗艦 1,300,000 / Adventure 4WD 1,330,000 / GR Sport 4WD 1,390,000 / PHEV 4WD 1,490,000), plus 229 hp combined, e-CVT, FWD. Confirms the prior researcher's list_price exactly, so list_price was NOT changed."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Toyota RAV4 二手價格行情與個別車輛列表","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/rav4","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED IN THIS PASS, at row level rather than range level — this is where the prior draft's largest error was found. Row-level data used: 2026 Adventure 4WD @ 5,499 km = 1,198,000 (6th-gen cars ARE already listed, contradicting the prior claim that none exist); 2025 2.0汽油旗艦 @ 12,000 km = 935,000; 2025 2.5油電曜黑魅影 @ 13,200 km = 949,000 (the prior draft mis-assigned these two to a 2.0 豪華 list of 1,010,000); 2023 2.5 Hybrid 旗艦 @ 62,900 km = 819,000 and @ 63,100 km = 819,000 and @ 119,400 km = 755,000; 2023 2.0汽油旗艦 @ 60,000 km = 628,000; 2023 2.0汽油尊爵 @ 60,000 km = 618,000; 2021 2.5 Hybrid 旗艦 @ 88,000 km = 538,000; 2019 2.5 Hybrid 旗艦 @ 110,000 km = 580,000; 2016 2.5 HYBRID 尊爵 @ 133,000 km = 360,000. All are dealer RETAIL asking prices and are converted down before use."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — RAV4 used listings, model years 2021-2024","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=4&brand=TOYOTA&model=RAV4&year1=2021&year2=2024&sort=year&sortpage1=asc","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED IN THIS PASS. Confirms the 5-year anchor: 2021 2.5 Hybrid 旗艦型 @ 38,000 km = 750,000 and @ 38,012 km = 750,000; 2.5 Hybrid 旗艦版 @ 44,412 km = 688,000, @ 77,957 km = 768,000, @ 92,558 km = 648,000. Also shows that the 2022 car the prior draft used for its 3-year anchor is listed as 2.0 旗艦版 @ 49,000 km = 798,000 — a GASOLINE car, not a hybrid, which is why the 3-year checkpoint was re-anchored on 8891 hybrid rows."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — RAV4 used listings, model years 2016-2019","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=4&brand=TOYOTA&model=RAV4&year1=2016&year2=2019&sort=year&sortpage1=asc","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED IN THIS PASS. Confirms the 10-year anchor: 2016 2.5 Hybrid 2WD @ 90,155 km = 439,000; @ 120,000 km = 488,000; @ 190,533 km = 368,000. NOTE: this query returned only 2016 and 2017 rows (77 listings, paginated), so the 2019 rows the prior draft relied on for its 7-year anchor could NOT be reproduced here — the reason the year-7 checkpoint was downgraded to low confidence."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — RAV4 used listings, model years 2019-2026","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=4&brand=TOYOTA&model=RAV4&year1=2019&year2=2026&sort=year&sortpage1=asc","note":"NOT RE-FETCHED IN THIS PASS. The prior researcher cites this page for the year-7 anchor (2019 Hybrid 4WD 旗艦 @ 50,879 km = 698,000, and the same car at 71,269 / 131,971 km). The URL form is valid — two sibling SUM queries were fetched successfully — but these specific rows are UNVERIFIED, and 8891's independent 2019 rows sit materially lower. Treated as a weak single source; year 7 is marked low confidence accordingly."},{"name":"KingAutos — Toyota RAV4 車款介紹 (outgoing 5th-gen TW price list)","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/toyota/rav4","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED IN THIS PASS. Supplies the denominators for every retention ratio: 2.0 豪華 1,010,000, 2.0 尊爵 1,110,000, 2.0 旗艦 1,170,000, 2.5 Hybrid 尊爵 1,150,000, 2.5 Hybrid 旗艦 1,260,000, 2.5 Hybrid 旗艦 4WD 1,380,000. The 1,260,000 figure is what showed the prior draft's year-5 comparable list of '~1,200,000' to be at the low end."},{"name":"小曾車庫 — Toyota RAV4 中古車收購行情 (dealer TRADE-IN price table by generation)","url":"https://www.littletsenggarage.com/toyota-rav4-used-car/","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED IN THIS PASS. Gives the 收購 (trade-in) end of the chain rather than asking prices: 5代 (2019-2025) 480,000-1,100,000; 4.5代 (2016-2019) 290,000-600,000; 4代 180,000-330,000. The site states plainly that these are 參考行情表 and represent 收購的上限值 (acquisition CEILING values) that real offers fall below, and that 5th-gen cars 已經不太會照權威收 — so they are used as optimistic upper bounds to validate the retail→trade-in conversion, never as medians."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [菜單] 2026 RAV4 6代 旗艦版 (real transaction menu, 2026-07-08)","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1783523377.A.F7E.html","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED IN THIS PASS; the article id decodes to a 2026-07-08 timestamp, consistent with the claimed date. Real 6th-gen deal sheet: list 1,300,000, 空車折扣 70,000, 成交 1,230,000, plus 舊換新 50,000 / 廢鐵價 23,000 / 空汙補助 7,500 (all tax rebates, excluded here). Confirms 領牌稅金 is billed separately as 實報實銷, which is what makes registration tax cleanly separable from onroad_fees."},{"name":"WeWanted 購車好幫手 — Toyota RAV4 成交菜單列表","url":"https://wewanted.com.tw/car_menu_list.php?s_brand=Toyota&isOtherBrand=n&s_model=rav4","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED IN THIS PASS. 2026 6th-gen transaction records: 尊爵+ 1,200,000 (vs 1,220,000 list), GR Sport 1,340,000 and 1,351,000 (vs 1,390,000), PHEV 4WD 1,490,000 (full list), and a 2.5 Hybrid at exactly 1,040,000 — i.e. an entry-trim-priced deal with zero cash discount. No menu for the 豪華 trim is labelled as such, so the 25,000 discount remains INFERRED rather than observed."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 — 92.5萬起，Toyota RAV4 第五代正式在台亮相 (2019 launch prices)","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/28323-toyota-rav4.html","note":"SEARCH-SNIPPET ONLY, carried over from the prior researcher and not re-verified in this pass. Source of the 5th-gen 2019 launch list prices used in the year-7 denominator: 2.5 Hybrid FWD 旗艦 1,139,000, Hybrid e-Four 旗艦 1,249,000, 2.0 豪華 925,000."},{"name":"KingAutos — 豐田 Toyota RAV4 小改 84.9萬起上市 (2016 4.5-gen TW price list)","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/47165","note":"SEARCH-SNIPPET ONLY, carried over and not re-verified in this pass. Source of the 4.5-gen (2016) list prices used as the denominator for the 10-year extrapolation: 2.5 Hybrid 尊爵 1,250,000, 2.5 Hybrid 旗艦 1,390,000, 2.0 豪華 959,000."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 售價維持104萬，Toyota大改款RAV4入門豪華版增電動收折後視鏡","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/87180","note":"HEADLINE ONLY — article body returns HTTP 403. Independent corroboration that the 豪華 trim price is 1,040,000."},{"name":"U-CAR 特輯 — [養車成本] 5代 Toyota RAV4 燃料牌照稅、零件與定保價格","url":"https://collection.u-car.com.tw/collection/article/2983","note":"SEARCH-SNIPPET ONLY — body returns HTTP 403, so the per-interval price table could not be read. Usable recovered figure: cumulative BASIC scheduled maintenance to 150,000 km stays under 50,000元. This is a main reason no maintenance checkpoint is rated high."},{"name":"Mobile01 — 分享一下5代RAV4滿3年的保養費用","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=264&t=6791047","note":"SEARCH-SNIPPET ONLY — thread body returns HTTP 403. Recovered receipt: 3-year T30 定保 at ~35,000 km, basic service plus front/rear tire rotation, ~3,400元 at a Toyota dealer."},{"name":"Mobile01 — 請問RAV4 一萬公里保養費用, 現在是多少?","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=264&t=6253604","note":"SEARCH-SNIPPET ONLY. Recovered receipts: 1萬公里定保 at 2,396元 historically and ~2,940元 more recently; a 2017 RAV4 2.0 paid 6,578元 at the 2萬公里 service; half-yearly services reported between 1,470元 and 2,356元."},{"name":"U-CAR 問答 — Toyota RAV4 Hybrid 車型的電池更換費用是多少？","url":"https://aigc.u-car.com.tw/answer/toyota-395-5896564","note":"SEARCH-SNIPPET ONLY. Source of the HV battery figures in the year-10 risk note: replacement ~62,000元; HV 電池保固 8年/16萬公里; HV 系統馬達保固 5年/12萬公里."}]},"toyota-alphard-hev":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/yr. Midpoint 7,000 km/yr used at every checkpoint (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km). Taiwan sells exactly one Alphard HEV specification (2.5 HEV 七人座) through 和泰汽車, so this is the exact trim, not a proxy; the 3,300,000 PHEV 六人座 is a separate variant and is NOT priced here. Two consequences drive the record. (1) SERVICING IS TIME-DRIVEN, NOT MILEAGE-DRIVEN: Toyota Taiwan's T30 interval is 每 6 個月或 10,000 公里，以先到者為準 (verified on toyota.com.tw) — at 7,000 km/yr the 6-month clock always fires first, so the owner pays for 2 visits/year and never reaches a mileage trigger. T50 additionally fires on 單數年 and T60 on 雙數年, so those are calendar-driven here too. Tires, brake fluid, coolant and the 12V battery age out before they wear out. (2) RESALE IS ABOVE THE MILEAGE-BLIND AVERAGE: Taiwan Alphards are heavily used for airport transfer / 商務接送, so the public listing pool is dominated by 100,000-200,000 km cars. Every listing found sits far above this buyer's mileage, so each value checkpoint is adjusted UP from observed listings toward the low-mileage end, using a consistent slope (~5 TWD/km at years 1-3 where the observed mileage-price gradient is steep, tapering to ~3 TWD/km by years 5-10 where observed listings show the gradient flattening). Tax (牌照稅/燃料費) and insurance are excluded from every figure by design. All money in TWD.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"high","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"DIRECT current-generation data, INDEPENDENTLY RE-VERIFIED for this audit. I fetched auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/alphard myself and confirmed every figure the prior researcher cited, to the TWD: 2025 Hybrid 2.5L 2萬 km -> 2,980,000; 2.3萬 km -> 2,998,000; 5萬 km -> 2,750,000; 7萬 km -> 2,688,000. Also confirmed the near-new anchor: 2025 PHEV 1,000 km -> 3,138,000 against its 3,300,000 list = 95.1% of list at DEALER RETAIL. All of these are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking), not private-sale prices. Applying the 95% near-new ratio to the HEV's 3,160,000 list gives dealer retail ~3,000,000 at this buyer's 7,000 km, consistent with and slightly above the verified 20,000-23,000 km listings, as the low-mileage adjustment requires. ADJUSTMENT MADE: dealer retail 3,000,000 -> private_sale 2,700,000 (-10%, the standard TW 車商售價 vs 自售 spread) -> dealer_tradein 2,380,000 (a further -11.9% for 車商收購). No dealer asking price was copied into private_sale. Confidence high is genuinely earned here: five same-generation listings that I re-fetched and matched exactly, plus an independent near-new ratio anchor. Retention of 84% of real_cost at one year is extreme by general-market standards but correct for this model — TW Alphard/Lexus LM demand and allocation limits are the known outlier case."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"DIRECT current-generation data, but thinner than the prior record implied. The 40-series launched in TW Jun-2023, so genuine 3-year-old cars exist only as Jul-Dec 2023 registrations. AUDIT CORRECTION: the prior record excluded '2023 Executive Lounge 2.5L' listings as run-out 30-series cars (TW sold the 30-series as a single Executive Lounge trim until Jun-2023) yet still used a 51,807 km / 2,488,000 datapoint as a clean 40-series anchor. My own 8891 fetch shows that car listed as '2023 Executive Lounge 2.5L, 5.1萬 km, 248.8萬' — i.e. it falls under the researcher's own exclusion rule. The filter was applied inconsistently, keeping the datapoint that suited the answer. Verified 2023 EL 2.5L population on 8891: 5.1萬 km -> 2,488,000; 10萬 km -> 1,990,000; 10萬 km -> 1,770,000; 12萬 km -> 1,770,000. Bracketing evidence I do trust: verified 2025 HEV at 5萬 km -> 2,750,000 and 7萬 km -> 2,688,000, so a 3-year car at 21,000 km must sit below the 1-year figure and above the high-mileage 2023 cars. Estimated dealer retail at 21,000 km ~2,745,000. ADJUSTMENT MADE: dealer retail 2,745,000 -> private_sale 2,470,000 (-10%) -> dealer_tradein 2,160,000 (-12.5%). Raised slightly from the prior record's 2,450,000/2,140,000 to keep the low-mileage uplift consistent with the slope used elsewhere. Confidence medium: bracketed by verified listings on both sides, but clean same-generation same-age datapoints are scarce and one of the two the prior record relied on is of ambiguous generation."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION — the 40-series is only 3 years old in TW and no genuine 5-year-old car exists. Method per instruction: a 2021 car is the 30-series 2.5 Hybrid Executive Lounge, whose official 和泰 list was 2,860,000 (Jun-2021) rising to 2,920,000 (late 2021), verified via the 7Car price history I re-fetched (2018 2,650,000 -> Feb-2020 2,710,000 -> Aug-2020 switch to 2.5 Hybrid 2,840,000 -> Jun-2021 2,860,000 -> late-2021 2,920,000); use 2,880,000. Verified dealer RETAIL asking on 8891 today: 2021 EL 2.5L 6.3萬 km -> 1,888,000 and 9.79萬 km -> 1,880,000, plus SUM 73,811 km -> 2,020,000. AUDIT CORRECTION — THIS IS THE MAIN NUMERIC FIX IN THE RECORD: the prior record adjusted this cohort from a ~78,000 km mean up to 35,000 km by only ~120,000, an implied slope near 1-3 TWD/km, while using 5 TWD/km for the same adjustment at year 3. That inconsistency alone pushed year 5 down and manufactured a depreciation curve that ACCELERATES between years 3 and 5, which no car does and which contradicts the known TW Alphard outlier-retention behaviour. Applying a consistent (and still conservative, because the observed 5-year-old gradient is genuinely flatter) ~3 TWD/km over the 43,000 km gap gives dealer retail ~2,100,000 at 35,000 km. Retention ratio = 2,100,000 / 2,880,000 = 0.73 of the predecessor's original list. Applying 0.73 to this car's real_cost 3,205,000 gives a dealer-retail-equivalent of ~2,340,000. ADJUSTMENT MADE: -> private_sale 2,110,000 (-10%) -> dealer_tradein 1,855,000 (-12%). Corroboration: 小曾車庫, a TW buying dealer, published Jul-2024 收購 (trade-in) guidance of 2,100,000-2,550,000 for 2020-2023 hybrids; the prior record's year-5 trade-in of 1,770,000 sat implausibly far below that band two years on, whereas 1,855,000 is consistent with it. Confidence low: predecessor-generation extrapolation and a large mileage adjustment."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION — no genuine 7-year-old 40-series exists. A 2019 car is the 30-series 3.5 V6 Executive Lounge, official 和泰 list 2,650,000 (Feb-2018 TW launch price, unchanged through 2019, verified via 7Car). AUDIT CORRECTION: the prior record quoted five 2019 asking prices including '185,000 km -> 1,388,000' and '186,495 km -> 1,368,000'. My own 8891 fetch shows those two high-mileage 2019 listings (18萬 km and 18.5萬 km) are published as 電洽 — price NOT disclosed. Those two figures were invented and they fed the cohort mean. I discarded them. Verified 2019 3.5 EL dealer RETAIL asking that actually exists: 8.4萬 km -> 1,558,000 and 11.85萬 km -> 1,429,000, mean ~1,493,500 at ~101,000 km. Adjusted UP to this buyer's 49,000 km at ~3 TWD/km gives ~1,650,000, at 5 TWD/km ~1,754,000; I used ~1,700,000 dealer retail. Retention ratio = 1,700,000 / 2,650,000 = 0.64 of the predecessor's original list. Applying 0.64 to real_cost 3,205,000 gives a dealer-retail-equivalent of ~2,050,000. ADJUSTMENT MADE: -> private_sale 1,830,000 (-11%) -> dealer_tradein 1,590,000 (-13%). Net effect of removing the two fabricated datapoints and reworking the arithmetic was small (prior record had 1,810,000/1,560,000), so the prior year-7 figure was substantially right despite the bad inputs. CAVEAT ON THE RECORD: the 2019 donor data is the 3.5 V6, not a hybrid, because that is what exists at that age in TW. The hybrid is the more sought-after drivetrain locally, so this ratio is more likely conservative than optimistic. Confidence low: predecessor generation plus a cross-powertrain substitution."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, AND THE WEAKEST POINT IN THIS RECORD. A 2016 Alphard in TW predates 和泰's official import (which began Feb-2018 at 2,650,000), so 2016 cars are 外匯車 parallel imports with no official TW list price — the clean ratio method partially breaks here and I am saying so rather than inventing a list price. Verified dealer RETAIL asking: abc好車網 2016 3.5 Executive Lounge -> 1,898,000 (I re-fetched this listing myself and confirmed the 189.8萬 asking price; the page does not publish mileage, which is one reason confidence is low). 8891 verified nearby anchors: 2019 3.5 EL 8.4萬 km -> 1,558,000 and 11.85萬 km -> 1,429,000. Mileage largely stops setting the price by this age — the verified 2021 cohort shows a 63,000 km car asking 1,888,000 and a 97,900 km car asking 1,880,000, essentially identical — which is why the low-mileage uplift here is modest despite this buyer's exceptional 70,000 km at ten years. Estimated dealer retail for a 10-year car at 70,000 km ~1,500,000-1,650,000. Using 2,650,000 (the earliest official 30-series TW list) as the donor denominator gives a ratio of ~0.53; using a plausible 3,000,000 parallel-import transaction price gives ~0.47. I retained the prior record's 0.49. Applying 0.49 to real_cost 3,205,000 gives a dealer-retail-equivalent of ~1,570,000. ADJUSTMENT MADE: -> private_sale 1,400,000 (-11%) -> dealer_tradein 1,190,000 (-15%). The year-7-to-year-10 slide is intentionally faster than year 5 to 7, reflecting the out-of-warranty discount TW buyers apply once a hybrid MPV's HV battery is a decade old. Confidence low, and at the low end of low."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Covers 0-1y. Toyota TW official T30 schedule (toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx, re-verified) = 6 months or 10,000 km, whichever first; at 7,000 km/yr the 6-month clock fires, so 2 paid visits in year one. RAISED FROM THE PRIOR RECORD'S 9,000: the prior record costed both visits as plain T30s, but Toyota TW's T50 fires 單數年 and year 1 is an odd year, so the 12-month visit is a T50 (adds cabin filter and brake fluid over the T30). Build-up: T30 ~4,500 (0W-16 low-viscosity synthetic ~4.2L, filter, flagship-model labour — above the 500-1,000 oil + 100-200 filter item ranges published by drivinginstruct/pkcar because those are small-car figures) + T50 ~8,500 + ~1,000 consumables = 14,000. Confidence medium: the interval and the odd/even rule are officially sourced, the TWD amounts are assembled from item ranges since 和泰 publishes no package price."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers 1-3y (not cumulative). Reviewed and retained from the prior record — the odd/even calendar logic is correct here. 4 × T30 at ~4,000 = 16,000, plus the year-2 T60 (~9,000: air filter, coolant, brake fluid, 60+ point inspection) and the year-3 T50 items (~4,000 incremental: cabin filter, brake fluid) less overlap with the base T30s already counted. Item prices from pkcar.vip's Toyota TW ranges (brake fluid 2,000-4,000, air filter 300-1,000) uplifted for flagship labour. At 21,000 km the 20,000/40,000 km mileage triggers are never the binding constraint, so the calendar rule governs throughout. Nothing breaks in this window — full factory warranty. Confidence medium."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers 3-5y. Reviewed and retained from the prior record; the build-up is sound. Dominated by ONE item: the first tire set. At 7,000 km/yr the tires reach ~35,000 km with plenty of tread but are 5 years old, and TW shops will not warrant 5-year-old rubber on a 2.2-tonne MPV — so this is an AGE replacement, not a wear replacement. pkcar.vip quotes 17,000+ per tire for this class as an original-fitment figure; a realistic aftermarket premium tire at ~8,500 fitted × 4 + alignment ~36,000. Remainder: 4 × T30 (16,000), iridium spark plugs (~7,000), coolant (~4,000), brake fluid (~3,000), 12V AGM auxiliary battery (~7,000 — hybrids use a small AGM, not a cheap flooded battery). Total ~73,000, rounded to 72,000. The 3-year warranty expires inside this window, which is why it is the first period carrying own-risk. Confidence medium."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers 5-7y. RAISED FROM THE PRIOR RECORD'S 48,000. The prior build-up (4 × T30 16,000 + first front pads and disc skim 12,000 + brake fluid 3,000 + cabin/air filters 5,000 + engine & inverter coolant 5,000 + A/C service and battery check 4,000 + assorted age items 3,000 = 48,000) counted all four visits as bare T30s, but this window contains a year-6 T60 and a year-7 T50 on the calendar rule, and it is the first window entirely outside the 3y/100,000 km warranty on a mechanically complex flagship (twin power sliding doors, rear climate unit, e-mirrors). Added ~8,000 covering the T50/T60 uplift over bare T30s plus a modest unscheduled-repair allowance, giving 56,000. The window is still cheaper than the 3-5y window because no tire set falls here — that is a genuine consequence of age-based tire timing, not an arithmetic slip. First front pad change genuinely deferred this long because the hybrid's regenerative braking does most of the deceleration; a non-hybrid MPV would have needed pads twice by now. Confidence low: no receipts exist for a 40-series Alphard at this age anywhere (the generation is only 3 years old), so this is a reasoned build-up from item prices and hybrid wear behaviour."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers 7-10y, a 3-year window so naturally the largest. Reviewed and retained from the prior record. Build-up: 6 × T30 (24,000) + second tire set on age (38,000) + 12V AGM battery (7,000) + spark plugs on the calendar rather than mileage (7,000) + brake fluid × 2 (6,000) + rear pads and front discs (14,000) + power sliding-door motor/roller work, a well-known Alphard wear point (12,000) + suspension bushings, A/C and misc age items (11,000) = ~125,000. That is ~42,000/yr, or ~29,000/yr excluding the tire set — high for a Toyota but appropriate for a decade-old 3.2M flagship MPV entirely out of warranty. THE BIG ASSUMPTION, UNCHANGED AND STILL UNVERIFIED: no HV traction battery replacement is budgeted. At 70,000 km a Toyota hybrid battery is very unlikely to have failed, and Toyota TW's extended hybrid-battery coverage should still apply for much of this window — but I could not verify the exact current TW warranty term, so if that assumption is wrong this figure could rise by 150,000-250,000. Confidence low."}],"sources":[{"name":"Toyota Taiwan 官網 — Alphard 車型頁／價格","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/models/alphard/pricing","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED 2026-08-11 for this audit. Official 建議售價. Shows the Alphard line as $316.0~330.0萬 and confirms both a plug-in hybrid and a HYBRID powertrain in the range; 316萬 is the HEV 七人座 used as list_price, 330萬 the PHEV 六人座 (excluded). The page shows only the range, not per-trim prices, hence the 2GameSome cross-check below. Primary source for purchase.list_price."},{"name":"2GameSome — 增列 PHEV 插電式混合動力車型！Toyota 新年式 Alphard 316 萬起發表上市","url":"https://2gamesome.com.tw/article/view/5636","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED 2026-08-11. 和泰汽車 announcement of 2025-02-06: HEV 3,160,000, PHEV 3,300,000. This is what resolves the toyota.com.tw range into per-trim prices and confirms the currently-on-sale trim structure. No later TW price change found."},{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點 — 300 萬的豐田還真不遜色 Toyota Alphard 試駕","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/83781","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED 2026-08-11. Predecessor (30-series) official TW list price history, the denominator for the years 5/7/10 retention ratios: Feb-2018 3.5 V6 2,650,000 -> Feb-2020 2,710,000 -> Aug-2020 switch to 2.5 Hybrid 2,840,000 -> Jun-2021 2,860,000 -> late-2021 2,920,000. Also confirms 和泰 official import began Feb-2018, which is why a 2016 car has no official TW list price."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Toyota Alphard 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/alphard","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED 2026-08-11 — the single most important audit step. Primary used-car source; all figures are dealer RETAIL asking (車商售價) and were discounted to private-sale level before use. Confirmed exactly: 2025 Hybrid 2萬 km -> 2,980,000, 2.3萬 km -> 2,998,000, 5萬 km -> 2,750,000, 7萬 km -> 2,688,000; 2025 PHEV 1,000 km -> 3,138,000 (near-new ratio anchor); 2023 EL 2.5L 5.1萬 km -> 2,488,000, 10萬 km -> 1,990,000/1,770,000, 12萬 km -> 1,770,000; 2021 EL 2.5L 6.3萬 km -> 1,888,000, 9.79萬 km -> 1,880,000; 2019 3.5 EL 8.4萬 km -> 1,558,000, 11.85萬 km -> 1,429,000. IMPORTANT NEGATIVE FINDING: the two highest-mileage 2019 listings (18萬 km, 18.5萬 km) are published as 電洽 with NO price — the prior record's '1,388,000' and '1,368,000' for those cars do not exist on the page and were removed from the year-7 calculation."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — TOYOTA ALPHARD 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=TOYOTA&model=ALPHARD","note":"NOT RE-FETCHED in this audit (web-search budget exhausted), so the figures below are carried over from the prior researcher unverified and are flagged as such: 2023 2.5 Hybrid 49,107 km -> 2,688,000 and 51,807 km -> 2,488,000; 2021 2.5 Hybrid 73,811 km -> 2,020,000. Note the 51,807 km / 2,488,000 car matches an 8891 listing that is badged '2023 Executive Lounge 2.5L', i.e. of ambiguous generation, so it is treated with caution at the year-3 checkpoint rather than as a clean 40-series anchor."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2016 Alphard 3.5 Executive Lounge 中古車物件","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2137427","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED 2026-08-11. 2016 30-series 3.5 Executive Lounge asking 189.8萬 = 1,898,000, listed by 雷神國際汽車. Used as the optimistic bound for the year-10 checkpoint. The page does not publish mileage, which is one reason year-10 confidence is low. (The prior record's source name for this entry contained a stray Cyrillic word, 'листинг' — a text artifact; the URL and price are genuine and confirmed.)"},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2017 Alphard 3.5 Executive Lounge 中古車物件","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1997803","note":"NOT RE-FETCHED in this audit; carried over unverified. The prior record described it as a 2017 EL asking 1,978,000, but that figure appears nowhere in its own year-10 checkpoint reasoning (which lists 2017 EL asking prices of 1,298,000 / 1,338,000 / 1,268,000 / 1,198,000). Treated as unconfirmed and given no weight in the final year-10 figure."},{"name":"小曾車庫 — Toyota Alphard 收購價分享","url":"https://www.littletsenggarage.com/2024/06/toyota-alphard-.html","note":"NOT RE-FETCHED; carried over from the prior researcher. A TW buying dealer's own 收購 (trade-in) 行情 reference dated Jul-2024: 2nd-gen 2015-2020 1,350,000-2,100,000; 3rd-gen 2020-2023 hybrid 2,100,000-2,550,000. Used in this audit as a corroborating sanity check that the prior record's year-5 trade-in of 1,770,000 was too low, and as qualitative support for a relatively tight retail-to-private spread (dealers struggle to acquire Alphards because private sellers hold out near new-car money)."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan 官網 — 愛車養護與保證（定期保養）","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED 2026-08-11. OFFICIAL maintenance schedule and the backbone of maintenance.plan_notes: T30 每 6 個月或 10,000 公里 (30+ checks); T50 單數年或每 40,000 公里自 20,000 起 (cabin filter, spark plugs, 50+ checks); T60 雙數年或每 40,000 公里自 40,000 起 (brake fluid, coolant, 60+ checks). Explicitly states package content and prices are not published online and must be obtained from a service centre ('請洽 TOYOTA 全台服務廠'), which is why all period_cost values are assembled bottom-up. The verified 單數年/雙數年 rule is what exposed the prior record's missing year-1 T50."},{"name":"安心道路救援中心 — 台灣地區 TOYOTA ALPHARD 全方位保養指南","url":"https://pkcar.vip/%E7%9F%A5%E8%AD%98%E7%A7%91%E6%99%AE/%E5%AE%89%E5%BF%83%E5%A0%B1%E4%BD%A0%E7%9F%A5%EF%BC%81%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3toyota-alphard%E5%85%A8%E6%96%B9%E4%BD%8D%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97/","note":"NOT RE-FETCHED; carried over. Alphard-specific TW maintenance guide giving item-level TWD ranges used to build period_cost: oil filter 300-800, air filter 300-1,000, spark plugs 2,000-3,000, transmission fluid 3,000-5,000, brake fluid 2,000-4,000, single tire 17,000+, labour ~500-1,500 by interval."},{"name":"道路駕駛教練推薦台北 — Toyota 汽車保養費用一覽表","url":"https://www.drivinginstruct.com/toyota%E6%B1%BD%E8%BB%8A%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E8%B2%BB%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E8%A6%BD%E8%A1%A8/","note":"NOT RE-FETCHED; carried over. Secondary TW Toyota service-item price table (oil 500-1,000, oil filter 100-200, air filter 200-500, spark plugs 400-1,000, brake pads 800-2,000, tires 1,500-5,000). Explicitly small-car-weighted, so used as a floor and uplifted for the Alphard's size and flagship labour rates rather than applied directly."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — Toyota 大改款 Alphard 台灣發表","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/75275","note":"COULD NOT BE FETCHED IN THIS AUDIT — returned HTTP 403. The prior record cited it for the 40-series TW launch (Jun-2023, 3,150,000, single HEV spec, 500-unit annual allocation). Those facts are consistent with the verified 2GameSome article (which describes the Feb-2025 increase to 3,160,000) and with the 7Car generation history, but the launch price and allocation figure themselves remain UNVERIFIED by me. They affect only background reasoning, not any number in the record."},{"name":"Mobile01 — TOYOTA 阿法 Alphard 開始要崩盤了嗎!?","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=264&t=7124303","note":"COULD NOT BE FETCHED (HTTP 403), by the prior researcher or by me. It was the SOLE basis for the prior record's purchase.discounts = 30,000. Because an unreadable source cannot support a number, and because verified 8891 data shows lightly-used Alphards asking 94-95% of new list (behaviour inconsistent with a discounted new car), discounts has been corrected to 0 in this record. Listed here only to document what was rejected and why."}]},"lexus-es300h-luxury":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr, well under the TW average of 12,000-15,000 km/yr. All checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7000 / 21000 / 35000 / 49000 / 70000). Two consequences. (1) Resale: at every age this car carries roughly HALF the odometer of a typical TW listing, so every value_checkpoint is benchmarked against the LOW-MILEAGE end of the observed 8891 band, never the mileage-blind average. (2) Maintenance: Lexus TW's published schedule is 6 months / 10,000 km, then 12 months / 20,000 km, 24 months / 40,000 km, 48 months / 80,000 km — whichever comes first. At 7,000 km/yr the TIME trigger always fires first, so the owner pays for 2 visits a year (20 visits over 10 years) while covering only 70,000 km. Keeping every one of those visits on time is also the precondition for Lexus TW's free 5th-year warranty extension, so it is not optional spend. Tax (牌照稅/燃料稅) and insurance are excluded by design throughout. THIS PASS: the whole value_checkpoints block was rebuilt after a cross-vehicle review found the curve sitting below Toyota RAV4 Hybrid at every age and 10 points under the sibling NX 350h at 5 years. The cause was a denominator/repricing error, not a data error — the 8891 evidence itself was re-fetched and held up. Maintenance was not challenged by the review and is carried forward unchanged.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — the 8th-gen ES has been on sale in Taiwan only since 2026-04-28, so no 1-year-old current-gen car exists. CORRECTED UPWARD IN THIS PASS from 1,260,000/1,110,000. Best evidence is a genuine 8th-gen data point re-confirmed on 8891 (snapshot 2026-08-11): a 2026 MY ES 300h 頂級版 asking 1,783,000 with 33 km — a near-new dealer flip at 90.5% of its 1,970,000 list at roughly 0.2 years. Decaying that to 1.0 year on a model that launched with 1,000+ pre-orders and a delivery queue (a 1-year-old car is available NOW, which supports price) gives ~88% dealer retail ask; 0.88 x real_cost 1,705,000 = ~1,500,000. Sibling cross-check: the NX 350h and RX 350h records both imply ~90% dealer-retail retention at one year, so 88% for a sedan is deliberately conservative against its own showroom. SECOND anchor, now treated as a floor rather than the primary: 7th-gen 300h 豪華版 on 8891 at ~1.4 years — 1,588,000 @ 20,000 km (桃園), 1,558,000 @ 25,000 km and 1,558,000 @ 25,800 km (高雄, both re-fetched today) — which is 76.8-78.2% of that car's 2,030,000 list; see the year-3 note for why that denominator now understates. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: dealer retail ask x 0.885 = private sale (1,330,000), then x 0.875 = dealer trade-in (1,165,000). These are the same haircuts the NX 350h record uses, replacing the slightly heavier ad-hoc haircuts used here before. Every 8891 figure quoted is 車商售價, never what the owner receives."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the 7th-gen ES300h 豪華版 at the same age. CORRECTED UPWARD IN THIS PASS from 1,015,000/890,000 — this is the checkpoint where the reviewer's denominator objection bites hardest, and it is upheld. THE ERROR: the prior draft took today's 8891 asks for 7th-gen ES300h 豪華版 cars, divided them by that car's 2,030,000 list, and applied the resulting ratio to our 1,705,000 real_cost. But those asks are August-2026 asks, i.e. already marked down because a brand-new, better-equipped 8th-gen ES 300h 豪華版 now costs 1,770,000 — a 260,000 (12.8%) cut to the same nameplate. Dividing a post-cut used price by the pre-cut 2,030,000 list charges that price cut to the car twice: once in the numerator, where the market has already repriced it, and again when the depressed ratio is multiplied onto the already-lower 1,705,000 base. That is exactly the systematic under-statement the review describes, and it is why the whole curve sat under a RAV4. RE-FETCHED EVIDENCE (8891, snapshot 2026-08-11): 2023 MY 300h 豪華版 1,318,000 @ 30,000 km (台中) and 1,350,000 @ 57,500 km (台北) — note the higher-mileage car asks MORE, so mileage is not driving this small sample. Centre ~1,334,000. Raw ratio to the 2,030,000 list = 65.7%; ratio to the current 1,770,000 replacement price = 75.4%. Neither is right on its own: 65.7% double-counts the cut, and 75.4% assumes outgoing-generation dealer stock has been fully and instantly repriced, which it plainly has not. INDEPENDENT THIRD ANCHOR, new in this pass, which resolves the ambiguity: the ES 200 豪華版 — a Lexus ES sedan that actually listed at 1,770,000, our car's exact price point. Its 8891 asks (re-fetched today, all 實體車行) are 2023 MY 1,008,000 @ 60,000 km, 2022 MY 1,098,000 @ 33,000 km, 2022 MY 1,008,000 @ 60,000 km. Mileage-correcting the 3-year point to our 21,000 km gives ~1,160,000 for a gasoline ES 200, and the same dataset shows the hybrid carries a 6-16% absolute premium over the gasoline car at matched age and mileage (e.g. at 4 years: 300h 豪華版 1,278,000 @ 27,000 km vs 200 豪華版 1,098,000 @ 33,000 km). That lands an 8th-gen ES300h at 3 years / 21,000 km at ~1,250,000-1,280,000 dealer ask, i.e. ~74% of real_cost. SETTLED AT 74% dealer retail = ~1,262,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: x 0.885 ask-to-private (1,115,000), then x 0.875 private-to-trade-in (975,000). Result is 65.4% of real_cost, which now sits between the RAV4 Hybrid (63.0%) and the NX 350h (69.3%) as the cross-vehicle review expects, with the sedan-versus-SUV gap preserved rather than erased."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED and INTERPOLATED — no current-gen data exists. CORRECTED UPWARD IN THIS PASS from 890,000/775,000, applying the same de-contamination described at year 3. VERIFIED 7th-gen 豪華版 brackets on 8891 (snapshot 2026-08-11): 2022 MY (4 yr) 1,278,000 @ 27,000 km (台中) and 1,288,000 @ 39,000 km (桃園); 2020 MY (6 yr) 1,012,000 @ 57,000 km (高雄) and 828,000 @ 70,000 km (新北). Straight 4yr-to-6yr interpolation gives ~1,145,000 at 5 years and ~42,000 km; our car is at 35,000 km, at the low-mileage end of that band, so ~1,180,000 in absolute money. Expressed against the outgoing car's own list (2,030,000 facelift / ~1,890,000 pre-facelift, blended ~1,960,000) that is 60.2% — the contaminated figure the prior draft used. Expressed against the 1,770,000 current replacement price it is 66.7%. INDEPENDENT ES 200 CONSTRUCTION, the tiebreaker: the ES 200 豪華版, which genuinely listed at 1,770,000 (facelift) / 1,730,000 (pre-facelift), shows 2022 MY (4 yr) 1,098,000 @ 33,000 km = 62.0% and 2020 MY (6 yr) 958,000 @ 55,000 km = 55.4%, interpolating to ~58.7% at 5 years and ~44,000 km, or ~60% at our 35,000 km. Add the hybrid premium visible in the same dataset and an 8th-gen ES300h lands at ~64-65% of a 1,770,000 base. SETTLED AT 64.5% dealer retail = ~1,100,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: x 0.885 ask-to-private (975,000), then x 0.875 private-to-trade-in (855,000). Result is 57.2% of real_cost — inside the 55-60% band the review asked for, and between the RAV4 Hybrid (53.8%) and the NX 350h (62.3%). Confidence stays LOW: this is an interpolation between two extrapolations, one of the two denominators (~1,890,000 pre-facelift) could not be verified, and year 5 is exactly where the free warranty extension expires, which usually puts a step in the curve that a smooth interpolation does not capture."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no genuine 7-year data exists for a generation three months old. CORRECTED UPWARD IN THIS PASS from 750,000/645,000, but by less than the younger checkpoints, because the new-car price cut contaminates a used price less and less as the car ages: a 7-year-old car is priced off its own segment floor, not off the showroom sticker. RE-FETCHED 8891 EVIDENCE (snapshot 2026-08-11), all 實體車行 asks: 2020 MY 300h 豪華版 1,012,000 @ 57,000 km (6 yr) and 828,000 @ 70,000 km (6 yr); 2018 MY 300h 豪華版 818,000 @ 69,500 km (屏東縣, 8 yr); 2019 MY 300h 豪華版 858,000 @ 140,000 km and 829,000 @ 160,500 km. HONESTY NOTE: the prior draft's headline anchor, a 2019 MY 豪華版 at 980,000 @ 51,000 km, could NOT be re-found on today's re-fetch of the same pages and may have sold; it is therefore no longer load-bearing. Rebuilt instead by interpolating the two rows that ARE live at low mileage — 6 yr @ 57,000 km = 1,012,000 and 8 yr @ 69,500 km = 818,000 — to ~915,000 at 7 years, then nudged to ~940,000 because our car is at 49,000 km, below both comparables. Against the ~1,890,000 pre-facelift list that is 49.7%; against the 1,770,000 current replacement it is 53.1%. SETTLED AT 54.5% of real_cost = ~929,000 dealer retail ask, taking the modest low-mileage credit the stated method requires. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: x 0.875 ask-to-private (815,000), then x 0.865 private-to-trade-in (705,000) — slightly wider than the year 1-5 haircuts because the spread between listings genuinely widens at this age. Caveat kept honest: this year's 8891 spread is noisy (the 140,000 km 2019 car asks more than a 70,000 km 2020 car), the ~1,890,000 denominator could not be verified — KingAutos's partial pre-facelift trim list does not even show a 300h 豪華版 — and no 7-year data can exist for this generation. Low confidence."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED ACROSS TWO GENERATIONS — still the weakest point in this record. Nudged up in this pass from 520,000/440,000 for curve consistency, not because new evidence appeared. THE ANCHOR WAS RE-VERIFIED THIS PASS on the 2015-2018 filtered 8891 page (snapshot 2026-08-11): 2016 MY 6th-gen ES300h 豪華版, 570,000, 77,000 km, 台北市 — mileage 7.7k/yr, almost exactly this buyer's profile — and it is confirmed 個人自售 (private individual), the ONLY private listing on that page, every other row carrying the 實體車行 dealer badge. It is therefore already a PRIVATE ask and needs no dealer-to-private haircut; the pre-audit draft that applied one was double-discounting. KEY SIMPLIFICATION available here that is not available at the younger checkpoints: the 6th-gen ES300h 豪華版 listed at ~1,790,000 and our car lists at 1,770,000, so this is very nearly a like-for-like transfer in absolute money rather than a ratio applied across different price points — which is also why the new-generation price cut barely distorts this checkpoint. Build: 570,000 private ask, less ~5% for private ask-to-transaction negotiation, plus ~5% credit for our 70,000 km against its 77,000 km and for the newer TNGA-K platform ageing better; the two net out, so private_sale_price = 570,000 (33.4% of real_cost). Dealer trade-in at x 0.855 = 490,000. Cross-check from the dealer side, also re-verified today: 2016 MY 旗艦版 (the TOP trim) asks 628,000 @ 60,000 km and 628,000 @ 62,000 km from dealers in 新北市, implying roughly a 550,000-580,000 dealer ask for a base 豪華版 at 70,000 km, which lands private in the 490,000-570,000 zone. Confidence LOW: two generation jumps, a single private anchor, and the 6th-gen 豪華版 list of 1,790,000 is the one denominator this record still cannot independently verify — U-CAR was re-tried in this pass and still returns HTTP 403."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Intervals and the free first-month inspection VERIFIED at lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx; warranty terms VERIFIED at lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx. Per-visit NT$ costs are typical Lexus TW dealer pricing for a 2.0L hybrid, sanity-checked against the VERIFIED 自由時報汽車 figure of ~NT$30,000 to 60,000 km. Covers 0-1 year. Unchanged in this pass."},{"y":3,"source":"24-month interval VERIFIED at lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx; 3-year tyre and 12V battery coverage VERIFIED at lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx. Per-visit costs are TW market estimates. Covers 1-3 years. Unchanged in this pass."},{"y":5,"source":"48-month interval VERIFIED at lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx; free 5th-year extension VERIFIED at lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx. Tyre and 12V battery costs are TW market estimates for 18-inch premium rubber and a Lexus hybrid AGM battery, not sourced receipts — hence low confidence. Covers 3-5 years. NOTE this period is deliberately heavier than the following one because both age-driven consumables land here. Unchanged in this pass."},{"y":7,"source":"Intervals VERIFIED at lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx; warranty expiry (5yr/140,000km with free extension, HV battery 8yr/160,000km) VERIFIED at lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx. Brake and contingency figures are estimates, not receipts, and no 7-year data can exist for a generation three months old. Covers 5-7 years. Low confidence. Unchanged in this pass."},{"y":10,"source":"Intervals VERIFIED at lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx; warranty windows VERIFIED at lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx. Everything beyond the scheduled visits is extrapolated for a 7-10 year old low-mileage Lexus hybrid in Taiwan — no receipts found for this generation (on sale 3 months) and none possible at this age. Covers 7-10 years. Low confidence. Unchanged in this pass."}],"sources":[{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — official ES showroom page","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/showroom/ES","note":"RE-VERIFIED in this pass (2026-08-11). Official brand site; shows the ES line at NT$177~250萬. Because the 8th-gen lineup contains no ES 200, the 177萬 floor of that official range can only be the ES 300h 豪華版 — this is the logical closure on the naming trap."},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 — Lexus ES 大改 177萬起上市","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/318711","note":"RE-VERIFIED in this pass. Full Taiwan launch trim table: ES 300h 豪華版 1,770,000 / ES 300h 頂級版 1,970,000 / ES 500e 頂級版 2,050,000 / ES 500e 旗艦版 2,500,000; launch 2026-04-28; hybrids 30,000 and EVs 50,000 below pre-order pricing. Its 1,770,000 minimum and 2,500,000 maximum match the official showroom range exactly."},{"name":"SanjiNoir 黑侍樂讀 — 2026 Lexus ES 發表","url":"https://www.sanjinoir.com/2026/04/28/2026-lexus-es-launch-price-specs/","note":"VERIFIED in the original audit. Independent confirmation of the 2026-04-28 Taiwan launch, the NT$1,770,000 ES300h start price, and the 2.0L hybrid / 197 PS combined / 25.8 km/L powertrain. Also notes 1,000+ pre-orders, which supports the strong year-1 retention used here."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [菜單] 2026 Lexus ALL NEW ES300h 豪華版","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1777728977.A.063.html","note":"VERIFIED in the original audit, not re-opened in this pass. Real post dated 2026-05-02, Taipei, cash deal on the 豪華版: list 1,770,000, discount 97,000, final 1,673,000. It is a 舊換新 deal, which is why a 貨物稅 rebate line appears — that line is excluded here as a tax item."},{"name":"KingAutos — 2024 Lexus ES 300h 豪華版 spec/price page","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/spec/11331","note":"VERIFIED IN THIS PASS — upgraded from 'not opened directly'. Page reads 2024 Lexus ES 300h豪華版, 定價 203 萬元. This is the hard confirmation that the OUTGOING 7th-gen ES 300h 豪華版 listed at 2,030,000, which makes the new generation a 260,000 price CUT on the same nameplate — the fact that drives the whole value_checkpoints correction."},{"name":"KingAutos — Lexus ES trim price table","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/es","note":"RE-VERIFIED in this pass. Shows the 7th-gen facelift lineup (the page still labels it current): ES 200 豪華版 1,770,000 / ES 200 頂級版 1,950,000 / ES 250 F Sport 2,180,000 / ES 300h 豪華版 2,030,000 / ES 300h F Sport 2,200,000 / ES 300h 旗艦版 2,490,000, plus a partial pre-facelift list (ES 200 豪華版 1,730,000, ES 200 頂級版 1,910,000, ES 300h 尊榮版 2,210,000). Two uses: it confirms the outgoing ES 200 豪華版 also sat at 1,770,000 — the coincidence behind the naming trap — and its pre-facelift list notably does NOT contain a 300h 豪華版, which is why the ~1,890,000 denominator used at years 5 and 7 stays flagged as unverified."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus ES, all listings including ES 200 gasoline","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/es","note":"NEW SOURCE, added and verified in this pass (snapshot 2026-08-11). This is the page that supplied the decisive independent anchor: the ES 200 豪華版, a Lexus ES sedan that genuinely listed at 1,770,000 — our car's exact price point, and a used curve that was never distorted by a generational price cut. Rows used: 2023 MY 1,008,000 @ 60,000 km (台中) and 978,000 @ 99,000 km (新北); 2022 MY 1,098,000 @ 33,000 km (台南), 1,008,000 @ 60,000 km, 998,000 @ 107,000 km, 919,000 @ 123,000-127,000 km; 2021 MY 1,098,000 @ 78,000 km (宜蘭) and 848,000 @ 100,000 km (台中); 2020 MY 958,000 @ 55,000 km (新北), 898,000 @ 85,000 km, 888,000 and 858,000 @ 64,000 km; 2019 MY 698,000 @ 130,000 km. All 實體車行 dealer asks. Mileage on 8891 displays in 萬 units and was converted (e.g. '3.3萬' = 33,000 km)."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus ES, model years 2019-2022 (all powertrains)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/es?y%5B%5D=2019_2022","note":"NEW SOURCE, added and verified in this pass (snapshot 2026-08-11). Used to put the ES 200 豪華版 and ES 300h 豪華版 side by side at matched ages, which is how the hybrid's 6-16% absolute premium over the gasoline car was measured. Key matched pair at 4 years: 300h 豪華版 1,278,000 @ 27,000 km versus 200 豪華版 1,098,000 @ 33,000 km."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus ES hybrid listings (all years)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/es?power%5B%5D=2","note":"RE-VERIFIED in this pass, snapshot 2026-08-11. Primary used-car source for the hybrid curve. Carries the near-new 8th-gen cross-check used at year 1: a 2026 MY 300h 頂級版 at 1,783,000 with 33 km, i.e. 90.5% of its 1,970,000 list. Unless a listing is explicitly 個人自售 these are 車商售價 (dealer retail asks) and were discounted 11.5-12.5% to private sale and a further 12.5-13.5% to trade-in before entering value_checkpoints."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus ES hybrid, 2023-2025","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/es?power%5B%5D=2&y%5B%5D=2023_2025","note":"RE-VERIFIED in this pass (snapshot 2026-08-11), and it added rows the prior draft did not have. Year-1 band: 2025 MY 300h 豪華版 1,588,000 @ 20,000 km (桃園), 1,558,000 @ 25,000 km and 1,558,000 @ 25,800 km (高雄). Year-3 band: 2023 MY 300h 豪華版 1,318,000 @ 30,000 km (台中) and 1,350,000 @ 57,500 km (台北) — the higher-mileage car asks more, which is why mileage correction at 3 years is treated as a small nudge, not a strong slope. Also 2024 MY 300h 豪華版 1,408,000 @ 69,000 km (台南). All 實體車行."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus ES hybrid, 2019-2022","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/es?power%5B%5D=2&y%5B%5D=2019_2022","note":"RE-VERIFIED in this pass. Anchors for the 5- and 7-year points: 2022 MY 豪華版 1,278,000 @ 27,000 km and 1,288,000 @ 39,000 km; 2020 MY 豪華版 1,012,000 @ 57,000 km and 828,000 @ 70,000 km; 2019 MY 豪華版 858,000 @ 140,000 km and 829,000 @ 160,500 km. IMPORTANT NEGATIVE FINDING: the prior draft's headline 7-year anchor, a 2019 MY 豪華版 at 980,000 @ 51,000 km, was NOT present on re-fetch and may have sold — year 7 was rebuilt without it."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus ES hybrid, 2015-2018","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/es?power%5B%5D=2&y%5B%5D=2015_2018","note":"RE-VERIFIED in this pass INCLUDING seller type, which is the load-bearing detail. The 10-year anchor is a 2016 MY 6th-gen ES300h 豪華版 at 570,000 with 77,000 km in 台北市, and it is explicitly 個人自售 (private individual) — confirmed again today as the ONLY private listing on that page, every other row carrying 實體車行. It is therefore already a private ask and takes no dealer-to-private haircut. Dealer-side cross-check on the same page: 2016 MY 旗艦版 at 628,000 @ 60,000 km and 628,000 @ 62,000 km (新北市); also 2018 MY 300h 豪華版 818,000 @ 69,500 km (屏東縣), used as the upper age bracket at year 7."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 保證方案 (warranty)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx","note":"VERIFIED in the original audit, term by term: 4 years / 120,000 km basic; free 5th year / 140,000 km extension conditional on servicing every six months without delay, forfeited by one missed appointment; 12V battery 3 years unlimited mileage; tyres 3 years against manufacturing defects. Drives the zero-contingency years 1-5 and the out-of-warranty items in years 7 and 10."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 保養計劃 (maintenance plan)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"VERIFIED in the original audit. Official intervals: free inspection in the first month after registration, then 6 months / 10,000 km, 12 months / 20,000 km, 24 months / 40,000 km, 48 months / 80,000 km. Establishes that at 7,000 km/yr the schedule is time-driven, and that there is no free scheduled-maintenance programme beyond the first month."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 定期保養項目表 (service item table)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service_maintenance.aspx","note":"NOT independently verified — the interval structure was confirmed instead via the maintenance-plan page above. The per-interval item detail attributed to this page (which visit adds spark plugs, brake fluid, transmission fluid) should be treated as unconfirmed, which is part of why the per-visit cost basis is flagged as an estimate rather than sourced."},{"name":"自由時報汽車 — Lexus ES 保養費用分析","url":"https://auto.ltn.com.tw/news/19015","note":"VERIFIED in the original audit. States that cumulative scheduled maintenance to 60,000 km is ~NT$30,000, and that ES200 / ES250 / ES300h are all about the same. That is a mileage-driven 6-service figure; used as a per-visit sanity check rather than a direct total, since this buyer reaches 60,000 km only after ~8.5 years and ~17 time-driven visits."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 正式售價189萬起，Lexus 新一代 ES 300h 國內發表 (2018-10-02)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/43743","note":"STILL NOT VERIFIED — re-tried in this pass and still returns HTTP 403 to automated fetching. Cited for the 7th-gen pre-facelift ES300h 豪華版 list of ~1,890,000, the denominator for part of the 5-year and all of the 7-year retention ratio. Treat as unconfirmed; KingAutos's partial pre-facelift trim list does not show a 300h 豪華版 at all, so this denominator carries real uncertainty and is a main reason years 5 and 7 stay low confidence."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 開價173萬元起，第6代 Lexus ES 正式上市 (2012-09)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/16890","note":"STILL NOT VERIFIED — same 403 restriction on re-try. Cited for the 6th-gen ES300h 豪華版 list of ~1,790,000, the denominator for the 10-year point. The 173萬 in the headline is the entry ES 200, not the ES300h, and 6th-gen ES300h trim naming in Taiwan changed at the 2015 facelift. This is the main reason the 10-year checkpoint stays low confidence — though its impact is muted because the 6th-gen 豪華版 and our car list within 20,000 of each other, making that checkpoint close to a like-for-like absolute transfer rather than a ratio applied across price points."}]},"lexus-nx350h-luxury":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year; midpoint 7,000 km/year used at every checkpoint (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km), roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. Two consequences drive the record. (1) Resale: at every age the car has about half the mileage of the typical listing on 8891 / FindCar / SUM, so it sits at the top of its year band; every used figure below is uplifted for that and the uplift is stated per checkpoint. (2) Maintenance: Lexus Taiwan's interval is 每半年或每行駛1萬公里，以先到者為準 (verified on the 風傳媒 cost breakdown of the official table). At 7,000 km/year the 6-month clock always fires first, so servicing is fully TIME-driven — 2 visits a year, 20 over 10 years, regardless of how little the car is driven. Low mileage does NOT cut the visit count for this brand; it only keeps each visit on the lighter side of the price book and defers high-mileage milestone items. Drivetrain (FWD vs E-Four AWD) for this specific trim could NOT be confirmed on any reachable source — lexus.com.tw/showroom/NX does not break out per-trim specs and the Yahoo 汽車 trim page omits 驅動方式 — so no drivetrain claim is made. Tax (牌照稅 NT$15,210 + 燃料稅 NT$7,200 = NT$22,410/yr, confirmed on 風傳媒) and all insurance are excluded from every figure by design.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from a prior 1,630,000/1,420,000. Anchor re-fetched and confirmed: FindCar 找車網 lists a 2025 NX350h at 39,000 km asking NT$1,728,000 — that is 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL), and the car carries 5.6x our mileage. Uplifting for 7,000 km gives dealer retail ~NT$1,790,000 (86% of list), a smaller uplift than the prior record's NT$1,830,000 because two independent cross-checks cap it: 8891's entire 337-listing NX inventory tops out at NT$1,680,000 asking, and 8891's 2025 NX200 菁英版 at 10,000 km asks NT$1,458,000 = 85% of its NT$1,710,000 list, i.e. ~85-86% retail retention is the real 1-year ceiling for this nameplate. Chain applied: private sale = dealer retail x 0.885 = NT$1,585,000; dealer trade-in = private x 0.875 = NT$1,385,000. Medium confidence: one directly-matched 2nd-gen listing plus two cross-trim cross-checks."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"MATERIALLY CORRECTED DOWN from a prior 1,520,000/1,330,000, which was the dealer-retail trap: the prior private_sale_price sat ABOVE the best-matched dealer RETAIL ask in its own evidence set. Re-fetched evidence for 3-year-old cars: FindCar 2023 NX350h at 24,410 km asking NT$1,458,000 (closest mileage match to our 21,000 km) and at 28,108 km asking NT$1,650,000; abc好車網 (東威汽車) 2023 NX350h 豪華版 at NT$1,798,000 and NT$1,898,000 — both listings verified live, but those equal 90% and 95% of the trim's NT$1,990,000 launch list at three years old, which is not credible retail retention even for a Lexus hybrid, so they are treated as shop-window outliers rather than centred on. Independent cross-check on SUM 汽車網 (81 listings): 2023 NX 豪華版 petrol cars at 48,760-52,684 km ask NT$1,258,000-1,378,000, and 8891 shows 2023 NX200/NX250 豪華版 at 29,000-59,500 km asking NT$1,258,000-1,298,000; scaling that band up ~14% for the 350h's higher list and up again for our much lower mileage lands at ~NT$1,560,000 dealer retail — squarely on the FindCar pair and far from 東威. Dealer retail centred at NT$1,560,000. Chain: private = retail x 0.885 = NT$1,380,000; trade-in = private x 0.875 = NT$1,205,000. Downgraded from 'high' to 'medium': four real listings exist, but they span a 30% range for the same model year, which is not a high-confidence evidence base."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from a prior 1,330,000/1,160,000. The 2nd-gen NX reached Taiwan only in Dec 2021, so genuine 5-year-old cars barely exist and 2022 cars (4.5 years) are the closest real data. Two conflicting reads were reconciled rather than one being taken: FindCar 2022 NX350h 頂級版 at 39,168 km asks NT$1,678,000, which de-trimmed to 豪華版 (頂級 launch list 2,190,000 vs 豪華 1,990,000) is ~NT$1,525,000 — the optimistic read; SUM 汽車網 2022 NX 豪華版 at 30,307 km asks NT$1,239,000 which, scaled up ~14% for the 350h's higher list, is ~NT$1,412,000 — the conservative read. Floor confirmed by FindCar's high-mileage 2022 NX350h cars at 106,886 km asking NT$1,399,000 and 113,000 km asking NT$1,288,000, which our 35,000 km car must clearly beat. Dealer retail centred at NT$1,400,000. Chain: private = retail x 0.885 = NT$1,240,000; trade-in = private x 0.875 = NT$1,085,000. Medium confidence: real comparators, but they are 頂級版 or petrol trims at 4.5 years, not 豪華版 350h at 5."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no genuine 7-year-old 2nd-gen NX350h exists in Taiwan (generation launched Dec 2021). Predecessor-generation method, with the denominator corrected: abc好車網's 2019 NX300h 頂級版 asking NT$936,000 (listing re-fetched and confirmed) is 47.0% of that trim's NT$1,990,000 launch list per CarNews' Aug-2014 Taiwan price announcement — the prior record used a NT$2,090,000 denominator that appears in none of its cited sources, understating the ratio. Those 7-year cars typically run ~100,000 km against our 49,000 km, so a +15% low-mileage premium is applied (the prior record's +27% is not supportable from the spread actually observed on SUM/FindCar), giving a 7-year dealer-retail retention of ~0.54. Applied to real_cost NT$1,990,000 that is ~NT$1,077,000 dealer retail; private = x0.885 = NT$955,000; trade-in = x0.875 = NT$835,000. Sanity floor: FindCar's 2017 NX300h at 71,021 km asks NT$838,000 at nine years, so a seven-year car at 49,000 km must sit above that. The step down from year 5 is steeper than years 3-5 partly for real reasons (the 4-year/120,000 km warranty has lapsed and buyers start pricing hybrid-battery risk) and partly as an artifact of switching to a cross-generation basis — stated rather than smoothed away. Two LEXUS CPO listings showing 2016 NX300h at 129.8萬/149.8萬 were excluded as implausible against 8891/FindCar 2016 data in the 62-84萬 band, almost certainly a mis-parsed year field."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the 1st-gen NX300h. Best comparator, re-fetched and confirmed: FindCar lists a 2017 NX300h at 71,021 km asking NT$838,000 — nine years old at almost exactly our 70,000 km target, so almost no mileage adjustment is needed (note this car appears on 8891 as an F Sport, a higher trim, so it is treated as the optimistic end). Bracketing it: FindCar 2016 NX300h at 140,000 km asks NT$628,000, 8891 lists a 2015 NX300h 旗艦版 at 53,000 km for NT$658,000, and FindCar's 36-listing NX300h average is NT$758,000 at typically 110,000-157,000 km. A 2016 car at 70,000 km therefore sits at ~NT$760,000 dealer retail = 40.2% of the NX300h 豪華版's NT$1,890,000 launch list (CarNews, Aug 2014, verified). Applying 40.2% to real_cost NT$1,990,000 gives ~NT$800,000 dealer retail; private = x0.885 = NT$710,000; trade-in = x0.875 = NT$620,000. Trimmed from a prior 745,000/650,000, which leaned on the F Sport comparator without discounting for trim. Confidence low — cross-generation extrapolation, and 10-year hybrid values hinge on HV battery condition, which is outside the 8-year/160,000 km warranty by then."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Official Lexus TW 定保 table as reproduced by 風傳媒 (full cycle to 100,000 km in the NT$53,670-64,350 band; ~NT$5,835/visit for this variant), cross-checked against a verified PTT work order — first 半年保 ~NT$3,300, 10,000 km service just over NT$7,000 — and Mobile01 owner reports of NT$4,000-7,000 for a fuller annual service. Year 1 is the cheapest year: the 6-month visit is nearly empty on a new car (~NT$3,000) and the 12-month visit is a time-based oil service rather than the fuller 10,000 km milestone, since the car has covered only 7,000 km (~NT$6,000). Downgraded from 'high' to 'medium': the itemised official table could not be retrieved directly, and the corroborating receipt is an NX200 gasoline car, not a 350h hybrid."},{"y":3,"source":"Four visits at official-table pricing plus the milestone items. Nudged up from a prior NT$22,000 because the window contains both the 10,000 km and 20,000 km milestones (air cleaner + cabin filter) and a time-based 2-year brake fluid change, and the verified PTT work order shows the 10,000 km service alone exceeding NT$7,000 — a flat ~NT$5,500/visit average under-counts it. Build-up: ~NT$3,500 + ~NT$7,000 + ~NT$4,000 + ~NT$7,000 for the four visits, plus ~NT$2,500 brake fluid. Downgraded from 'high' to 'medium' for the same reasons as year 1: no itemised official table retrieved, and the receipt is an NX200 gasoline proxy."},{"y":5,"source":"定保 portion ~NT$22,000 for 4 visits from the official table via 風傳媒; the step up is consumables, not servicing. Tyres and the 12V AGM battery are the two age-driven replacements that land in this window for a low-mileage owner, and the published NT$53,670-64,350 定保 figure explicitly EXCLUDES both, which is why this period is much larger than years 1-3 despite the same visit count. Arithmetic: 22,000 定保 + 34,000 tyres + 10,000 battery = 66,000. Medium confidence because tyre replacement timing is owner-discretionary (some stretch to year 6)."},{"y":7,"source":"CORRECTED UP from a prior NT$42,000, which did not add up against its own item list: ~NT$24,000 of post-warranty 定保 plus ~NT$12,000 of front pads leaves only ~NT$6,000 for disc work, brake fluid, transaxle and coolant checks, A/C service, wipers and bulbs combined. Rebuilt: 定保 ~NT$24,000 (official table via 風傳媒, uplifted because post-warranty visits attract chargeable inspection items) + front pads ~NT$12,000 + disc resurface ~NT$6,000 + brake fluid ~NT$3,000 + A/C, wipers, bulbs and minor age items ~NT$7,000 = NT$52,000. Pads land here rather than earlier precisely because this is a hybrid — regenerative braking commonly stretches front pads to 80,000-100,000 km, so at 49,000 km the front set is only now due. No tyres in this window (replaced year 5, next set ~year 10). Medium confidence: 定保 is table-grounded, wear-item timing is estimated."},{"y":10,"source":"Longest window (3 years, 6 visits) and the one where every 10-year TIME-based item lands at once. Intervals from Lexus TW owner material (每半年或1萬公里, confirmed via 風傳媒); spark plug and coolant intervals are Toyota/Lexus long-life specs where the 10-year clock fires even though the car has covered only 70,000 km — exactly the low-mileage pattern. Split: 定保 ~NT$40,000, consumables ~NT$66,000 (tyres 34,000 + 12V 10,000 + plugs 8,000 + coolant 4,000 + rear pads 10,000), age-related repairs ~NT$15,000, rounded to NT$120,000. Confidence low: no receipts exist for a 10-year-old 2nd-gen NX350h (generation launched Dec 2021), so this is built from published intervals plus normal 10-year wear patterns rather than observed spend, and the HV battery tail risk is excluded rather than guessed at."}],"sources":[{"name":"Yahoo 汽車 — 2026 Lexus NX 350h豪華版 車款介紹","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/lexus-nx-2026-350h%E8%B1%AA%E8%8F%AF%E7%89%88","note":"VERIFIED by fact-check fetch. Primary list-price source: NT$2,075,000 (207.5萬) for the 2026 NX 350h 豪華版, plus specs (2487cc, 190hp engine / 243hp combined, 19.4 km/L, CVT). Does NOT state 驅動方式, so no FWD/AWD claim is made in this record."},{"name":"KingAutos — 2026 Lexus NX 全車系 11 車款價格表","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/nx","note":"VERIFIED by fact-check fetch. Independent confirmation of NT$2,075,000 for 350h豪華版 and the full 11-trim ladder (200菁英版 1,710,000 / 200豪華版 1,810,000 / 250豪華版 1,975,000 / 250頂級版 2,075,000 / 350h豪華版 2,075,000 / 350h頂級版 2,275,000 / 350 Overtail 2,340,000 / 450h+豪華版 2,375,000 / 350h旗艦版 2,575,000 / 350 F Sport 2,630,000 / 450h+ F Sport 2,845,000). Also corroborates the PTT deal sheet's 257.5萬 list for 350h旗艦版."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — NX showroom (official)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/showroom/NX","note":"VERIFIED by fact-check fetch. Official brand site; confirms the NT$171~284.5萬 NX range, consistent with the KingAutos ladder, but does not break out per-trim pricing or per-trim drivetrain."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 車主權益 / warranty (official)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx","note":"VERIFIED by fact-check fetch. New car 4 years / 120,000 km; HV battery 5yr/100,000km factory + 3yr/60,000km distributor = 8 years / 160,000 km; BEV battery 8yr/160,000km at >=70% capacity; self-paid genuine parts 2 years / 50,000 km. Confirms NO complimentary scheduled maintenance is bundled."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 新車準時保養愛車享延長保證方案 (official)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/news_detail.aspx?nw=563&fn=1","note":"VERIFIED by fact-check fetch. Article dated 2023-12-29, program effective Jan 2024: 8 consecutive on-time 定保 with factory packages earns a free warranty extension of 1 year or 20,000 km, transferable with the car; a missed service can be bought back for ~NT$25,900. This is a warranty benefit, not free servicing."},{"name":"風傳媒 風生活 — Lexus NX 養車成本分析","url":"https://www.storm.mg/lifestyle/11068074","note":"VERIFIED by fact-check fetch. Confirms the 每半年或每行駛1萬公里 interval, the excluded taxes (350h: 牌照稅 NT$15,210 + 燃料稅 NT$7,200 = NT$22,410/yr; NX200: NT$17,410/yr), and reproduces the official 定保 table with full-cycle-to-100,000 km totals in the NT$53,670-64,350 band across variants — the band that the NT$58,350 calibration for this trim sits inside."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [心得] NX 一萬保養工單簡易分享","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1739612571.A.93F.html","note":"VERIFIED by fact-check fetch, dated 2025-02-15. Owner runs a 6-month cadence at low mileage: ~NT$3,300 for the first 半年保, just over NT$7,000 for the 10,000 km service after declining the cleaning package, and notes other owners' 10,000 km work orders run NT$4,000-5,000. IMPORTANT CAVEAT the prior record omitted: this is an NX200 GASOLINE car, not a 350h hybrid, so it is a proxy rather than an exact match — one reason maintenance confidence is capped at medium."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [菜單] NX350H 旗艦 (posted 2025-10-08, deal 2025-10-03)","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1759933934.A.BA1.html","note":"VERIFIED by fact-check fetch. Real dated deal sheet: 2025 NX350h 旗艦 星焰黑, list 257.5萬, cash discount 22萬 (-8.5%), self-paid accessories +3.2萬, transaction 238.7萬, cash via Lexus Pay at 南港. Basis for overriding the 'Lexus never discounts' default; scaled down to NT$120,000 (5.8%) for the volume 豪華版 trim, and the 3.2萬 accessory line grounds onroad_fees."},{"name":"Mobile01 — 請問 LEXUS 原廠保養費用","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=346&t=6919545","note":"NOT DIRECTLY VERIFIABLE — the fact-check fetch was blocked at the domain level, and the original researcher also read it only via a search summary. Owner-reported band (~NT$3,000+ for a light 半年保, NT$4,000-7,000 for a fuller annual service) is therefore treated as weak corroboration of the PTT receipt, not as independent evidence."},{"name":"8891 新車 — 2022 Lexus NX350h 售價 199-219萬","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/feature/1883","note":"VERIFIED by fact-check fetch, WITH A CORRECTION: the page gives the 2022 NX350h range as 199-219萬, i.e. 豪華版 NT$1,990,000 and 頂級版 NT$2,190,000. The prior record additionally claimed a 350h 旗艦版 at NT$2,490,000 at launch, which this source does not support. NT$1,990,000 is the retention denominator used for the 2023 comparators."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus NX 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/nx","note":"VERIFIED by fact-check fetch. 337 listings, asking prices spanning NT$558,000-1,680,000 — the NT$1,680,000 ceiling across the ENTIRE used NX inventory is the key cross-check that caps the year-1 figure. Data points used: 2025 NX200 菁英版 @10,000km NT$1,458,000; 2025 NX200 特仕版 @3,500km NT$1,460,000; 2023 NX200 豪華版 @29,000-45,000km NT$1,258,000-1,298,000; 2023 NX250 豪華版 @59,500km NT$1,298,000; 2017 NX300h F Sport @71,000km NT$838,000; 2015 NX300h 旗艦版 @53,000km NT$658,000."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — lexus nx350h 二手行情","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/lexus%20nx350h","note":"VERIFIED by fact-check fetch. 8 listings, average NT$1,498,000. Main 2nd-gen dataset: 2025 @39,000km NT$1,728,000 (year-1 anchor); 2023 @24,410km NT$1,458,000 and @28,108km NT$1,650,000 (year-3); 2022 頂級版 @39,168km NT$1,678,000 (year-5); high-mileage 2022-2023 cars at 106,886-113,000km asking NT$1,288,000-1,399,000 that quantify the mileage penalty. All are 車商售價 (dealer retail)."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — nx300h 二手行情 (predecessor generation)","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/nx300h","note":"VERIFIED by fact-check fetch. 36 listings, average NT$758,000, range NT$618,000-1,050,000, mileage typically 110,000-157,000 km. 1st-gen dataset for the year-7 and year-10 extrapolations. Key comparator: 2017 NX300h @71,021km asking NT$838,000 — nine years old at almost exactly our 70,000 km target (8891 shows the same car as an F Sport, so it is the optimistic end). Bracketed by 2016 @140,000km NT$628,000 and 2015 @130,000km NT$618,000."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2023 Lexus NX 350h 豪華版 (東威汽車) NT$1,798,000","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2100990","note":"VERIFIED by fact-check fetch (listing is real). Dealer RETAIL asking price for a 3-year-old 豪華版. Treated as an outlier, not centred on: NT$1,798,000 is 90% of the trim's NT$1,990,000 launch list at three years old, which no other Taiwan source supports. Mileage is not published on the listing."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2023 Lexus NX 350h 豪華版 (東威汽車) NT$1,898,000","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2066696","note":"VERIFIED by fact-check fetch (listing is real). Second 東威 asking price, 95% of launch list at three years — the reason the year-3 dealer-retail centre was moved DOWN to NT$1,560,000 rather than up toward these figures. Mileage not published."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2019 Lexus NX 300h 頂級版 NT$936,000","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2181168","note":"VERIFIED by fact-check fetch. The 7-year predecessor-generation anchor. Against the CarNews 頂級版 launch list of NT$1,990,000 this is 47.0% retail retention (the prior record used a NT$2,090,000 denominator that appears in none of its sources). Mileage not published; typical for the cohort is ~100,000 km."},{"name":"CarNews — Lexus NX300h 台灣正式售價 (2014-08-25 launch)","url":"https://www.carnews.com/article/info/afca1927-4b09-11e8-8ee2-42010af00004/","note":"VERIFIED by fact-check fetch. 1st-generation launch list prices, the denominator for the year-7 and year-10 retention ratios: NX300h 豪華版 NT$1,890,000, 頂級版 NT$1,990,000, 旗艦版 NT$2,160,000 (NT$2,190,000 with panoramic roof), F Sport NT$2,050,000, AWD F Sport NT$2,160,000."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — Lexus NX 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=NX","note":"VERIFIED by fact-check fetch. 81 listings, the independent third-party cross-check that broke the year-3 tie against the 東威 asks: 2024 豪華版 @13,462km NT$1,399,000 and @29,372km NT$1,430,000; 2023 豪華版 @48,760km NT$1,378,000, @50,776km NT$1,258,000, @52,684km NT$1,270,000; 2022 豪華版 @30,307km NT$1,239,000 and @98,000km NT$1,158,000; 2020 @80,000km NT$1,080,000; 2019 @86,546-99,530km NT$958,000-1,088,000; 2018 @105,830-144,433km NT$778,000-888,000."}]},"lexus-rx350-luxury":{"assumptions":"Low-mileage owner: 6,000-8,000 km/yr vs the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/yr. All checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years. This cuts two different ways. (1) Servicing: the Lexus TW official 保養計劃 sets the interval at 6 months / 10,000 km, so at ~7,000 km/yr the schedule is entirely TIME-driven — two dealer visits every year, roughly 3,500 km apart, never a mileage-triggered one. Low mileage therefore does NOT halve the service count; it only makes each visit cheaper. (2) Resale: 7,000 km/yr puts the car well below the mileage a Taiwanese used-car buyer expects at a given age. MATERIAL CORRECTION APPLIED IN THIS REVISION: the previous version of this record misread 8891's mileage badges by a factor of ten — it recorded the 2024 RX350 旗艦版 as '3,120 km' and the 2023 RX350 頂級版 as '4,200 km', when the site prints 3.12萬公里 (31,200 km) and 4.2萬公里 (42,000 km). Both were re-fetched on 2026-08-11 and the 萬 reading is confirmed (the same page's 2.2萬公里 and 11.9萬公里 badges were recorded correctly as 22,000 and 119,000 km, so the unit convention is not in doubt). Consequence: the year-1 and year-3 anchors are NORMAL-to-high mileage cars (14,000-15,600 km/yr), not near-delivery ones. That means the low-mileage premium this profile earns at those points is real and was previously ASSUMED AWAY, not double-counted — the opposite of the year-5/year-10 error. It is credited here, but capped by the trim-price ceiling (see the 3-year note). Tax (牌照稅/燃料稅) and insurance are excluded from every number by design. Engine is 2393cc, sitting just under the 2,400cc line, i.e. the 1,801-2,400cc 牌照稅 bracket (~11,230/yr) — the same bracket as the 1,998cc predecessor RX200t/RX300 used for the long-horizon extrapolation, so no tax-bracket distortion contaminates the retention transfer. Note this is NOT true of the RX350h (2487cc), which sits one bracket up; that difference is discussed in the checkpoint sources as one of the two forces holding the gasoline/hybrid resale gap small.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"REVISED (was 1,800,000 / 1,580,000) — a small evidence-driven trim, not a rewrite. Two corrections drove it. (1) MILEAGE UNIT ERROR FIXED: the 8891 comparables are NOT near-delivery cars. Re-fetched 2026-08-11: 2024 RX350 旗艦版 is 3.12萬公里 = 31,200 km asking 2,198,000 (dealer 東威, 認證車), and the 2023 RX350 頂級版 is 4.2萬公里 = 42,000 km asking 1,898,000 — the previous version recorded these as 3,120 km and 4,200 km. (2) The abc好車網 2025 RX 350 旗艦版 at 2,480,000 (dealer 上達汽車) was re-fetched and CONFIRMED to publish no mileage at all, so it cannot carry the weight the previous version put on it. NEW ANCHOR FOUND that constrains the early curve directly: SUM 汽車網 lists a 2024 RX350, 2400cc, 21,000 km, 原鈑件/原廠保養/新車保固中, dealer 台新汽車 (台南), asking 1,858,000 — a genuinely low-mileage TWO-year-old current-generation car. At 豪華版 list that is 75.5% dealer retail at 2 years. Back-solving one year gives a year-1 dealer retail asking of roughly 2,020,000 (82.1% of list), slightly softer than the 2,050,000 the previous version used. CEILING CHECK: a new 豪華版 transacts at ~2,210,000 before 領牌, so 2,020,000 is ~91% of the new street price — near the credible maximum for a one-year-old car. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale set 11.4% below dealer asking = 1,790,000. The 8-15% band is used near its middle, not its thin end: at one year old the private seller faces the WORST competition of the whole curve, because the buyer's alternative is a brand-new car at ~2,210,000 with a full 4-year warranty, and a private seller with no warranty transfer, no financing and no 認證 must discount hard to close that gap. dealer_tradein set 12.0% below private = 1,575,000. Cross-vehicle check: this puts the gasoline RX350 level with the RX350h at year 1 (both ~79.7% of their own real_cost), which is the expected relationship — at one year the two cars are still trading on discount-off-new, and the gasoline's larger cash discount is already inside its lower real_cost."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"PRICE UNCHANGED at 1,560,000 / 1,360,000, but the REASONING BEHIND IT IS CORRECTED and the previous justification was wrong in a way worth recording. Re-verified live on 8891 2026-08-11: the 2023 RX350 頂級版 asking 1,898,000 (dealer 東威, 保固中) carries 4.2萬公里 = 42,000 km, NOT 4,200 km as previously recorded. So it is a NORMAL-mileage 3-year-old (14,000 km/yr, above the Taiwan average), and the previous claim that 'its 4,200 km is BELOW this profile's 21,000 km, so the ratio needs no upward nudge' is exactly backwards — this profile at 21,000 km runs HALF that car's odometer and does earn a premium over its 70.8% ratio. Two further live points bracket it: SUM 汽車網 shows a 2023 RX350, 2400cc, 77,210 km, asking 1,688,000 (dealer 順久車業, 嘉義) — the high-mileage end — and a 2024 RX350, 21,000 km, at 1,858,000, i.e. one year newer at identical mileage. WHY THE NUMBER DID NOT MOVE: the mileage credit is absorbed by a hard trim ceiling. Crediting ~3 points of mileage onto 70.8% and ~1.5 points for base trim would imply a 豪華版 dealer asking near 1,845,000 — only 53,000 below the 頂級版 comparable, a trim that costs 220,000 more new. That is not credible. Capping at the ceiling gives ~1,770,000 dealer retail asking (72.0% of 2,460,000, up from the 1,750,000 basis used before), and the private-sale haircut of 11.9% brings it back to 1,560,000. An abc好車網 2023 RX350 豪華版 at 2,278,000 remains EXCLUDED as a stale or misclassified outlier — it exceeds the 頂級版 asking price, which is not credible for a base trim. dealer_tradein 12.8% below private = 1,360,000. DIRECTIONAL CHECK AGAINST THE RX350h, using a like-for-like pair found this revision: SUM lists a 2023 RX 油電, 2500cc, 4WD, 36,132 km, 白金認證, with Mark Levinson / 電動吸門 / 360環景 / 通風加熱電動座椅 — i.e. RX350h 旗艦版 spec — asking 2,158,000 = 70.8% of its 3,050,000 list. The gasoline 2023 頂級版 at 42,000 km asks the SAME 70.8% of its own list. Since the flagship trim structurally retains a LOWER percentage than a mid trim, an equal percentage from the flagship hybrid means the hybrid is ahead on a like-for-like basis by roughly 1.5-2 points at 3 years. That is the size of gap carried here (69.5% vs the RX350h record's 71.2%)."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"RE-RESEARCHED AS THE REVIEWER ASKED, AND CONFIRMED UNCHANGED at 1,310,000 / 1,130,000 — but on a much better evidence base than before, and with one of the two denominators it previously used shown to be wrong. EXTRAPOLATED: the 5th-gen RX launched in Taiwan in Nov 2022, so the oldest car on the market in Aug 2026 is under 4 years old and no genuine 5-year data for this generation can exist. DENOMINATOR CORRECTION: the previous version priced the predecessor facelift as 豪華版 2,270,000 / 頂級版 2,390,000 / 旗艦版 2,590,000. The TVBS 2021 Lexus RX spec table was fetched live on 2026-08-11 and gives 300豪華版 2,270,000 / 300頂級版 2,440,000 / 300 F Sport 2,640,000 / 300旗艦版 2,640,000 (all 1998cc). The 頂級版 and 旗艦版 figures previously used were the 2015 pre-facelift numbers applied to facelift cars; every ratio below now uses the verified facelift table. NEW MILEAGE-DISCLOSED 5-YEAR CROSS-SECTION, all fetched live from SUM 汽車網 on 2026-08-11 (2021 RX300, i.e. exactly five years old): 旗艦版 27,277 km asking 1,599,000 = 60.6%; 旗艦版 52,000 km 1,498,000 = 56.7%; 旗艦版 82,540 km 1,498,000 = 56.7%; 旗艦版 69,000 km 1,428,000 = 54.1%; 豪華版 151,627 km 1,090,000 = 48.0%; unspecified trim 100,218 km 1,199,000. Six-year support: 8891 2020 RX300 豪華版 22,000 km 1,238,000 = 54.5% (弘達國際泰山旗艦店, explicitly 「原鈑件、低里程認證車」 — certified, so its ratio carries a certification premium and is NOT the non-certified rate); SUM 2020 頂級天窗版 100,000 km 1,198,000 = 49.1%; SUM 2020 F-Sport 101,000 km 1,328,000 = 50.3%. Four-year support: SUM 2022 頂級版 39,192 km 1,599,000 = 65.5%. BUILD: the 27,277 km five-year 旗艦版 at 60.6% is the closest mileage match to this profile (it runs 5,455 km/yr, marginally below this owner's 7,000). The five-year 旗艦版 set implies a mileage gradient of about 1.5 points of list per 10,000 km, so this profile's 35,000 km costs ~1.2 points; base trim is credited ~1.5 points the other way; and ~1.5 points are taken off for the gasoline RX350's specific weakness in Taiwan (it is the slow seller of a hybrid-led range and is cleared with 250,000-310,000 cash off, so used buyers benchmark it against a ~2,210,000 street price rather than the 2,460,000 list). Net ~59.5%, i.e. ~1,465,000 dealer retail asking — within rounding of the 1,476,000 the previous version reached by a cruder route, which is why the price does not move. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale 10.6% below dealer asking = 1,310,000; dealer_tradein 13.7% below private = 1,130,000. Confidence stays low: the ratio is still transferred from a different generation and a different engine (2.0T vs 2.4T)."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"CORRECTED DOWNWARD (was 1,100,000 / 930,000). The previous version took a 7-year high-mileage floor of ~42% and added a NINE-point low-mileage premium to reach ~51%. The new mileage-disclosed cross-section shows that premium is roughly double what the market actually pays. Measured gradient at six years: 2020 RX300 豪華版 22,000 km 認證 at 54.5% versus 2020 頂級天窗版 100,000 km at 49.1% and 2020 F-Sport 101,000 km at 50.3% — about 5 points of list for 78,000 km, i.e. ~0.7 points per 10,000 km, and part of even that is the certification premium rather than mileage. Applying the real gradient instead of the assumed one: take the six-year ~100,000 km level (~49.7%), credit this profile's 49,000 km (+3.6 points), subtract one year of age (~4.5 points), and subtract the same ~1.5 points for the gasoline model's discount-driven drag, giving ~47.3%. A second route agrees: the seven-to-eight year floor points — 8891 2019 RX300 F Sport 119,000 km asking 1,088,000 (元禾國際, 新北市), SUM 2018 旗艦版 119,000 km 1,038,000 = 40.1% of 2,590,000, SUM 2018 RX300 111,407 km 1,098,000 — sit at 40-46%, and adding ~4-5 points of mileage credit for a 49,000 km car lands in the same high-40s band. ~48% of 2,460,000 = ~1,180,000 dealer retail asking. Sanity check in absolute money: that is 90,000-140,000 above what real 111,000-119,000 km cars of the same age are asked for, for a car one generation newer with less than half their odometer — a credible spread, whereas the previous 1,255,000 was not. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale 11.9% below dealer asking = 1,040,000; dealer_tradein 14.4% below private = 890,000. The private/trade-in spread widens with age because dealers hold older stock longer. NOTE ON CURVE SHAPE: this leg is deliberately the steepest per year of the whole curve (~6.0 points of real_cost per year versus ~5.6 for years 3-5 and ~4.4 for years 7-10). That is not smoothing — it is the warranty cliff. Lexus TW cover is 4 years / 120,000 km plus a free 5th year earned by punctual servicing, so cover lapses exactly at the start of this window, and Taiwan buyers reprice a Lexus the moment it is out of warranty. Confidence low: cross-generation transfer, pre-facelift comparables whose list prices could not be verified, and thin 7-year 豪華版 data."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"CORRECTED DOWNWARD (was 900,000 / 750,000). This is the point the reviewer flagged, and re-research says the reviewer is right: the previous figure made the gasoline RX350 cross ABOVE the RX350h at ten years, which the evidence does not support. THE ANCHOR THAT SETTLES IT, found this revision and fetched live from SUM 汽車網 on 2026-08-11: a 2016 Lexus RX200t, 2000cc, 76,792 km, dealer 上藝汽車 (新北市), described as 全場認證五大保證 / 僅跑7萬多 / 原廠保養, asking 838,000. That is the single best-matched ten-year comparable in the entire dataset — 76,792 km against this profile's 70,000 km is essentially the same odometer, so NO mileage premium is owed on top of it, which is precisely the mistake made twice before at this checkpoint. Against the RX200t 豪華版 list it is ~38% of original, and that 38% is a CERTIFIED, dealer-warranted, dealer-retail ask. Supporting cluster, all live: SUM 2016 RX200t 136,914 km 798,000; SUM 2017 RX 94,465 km 828,000 (note the 9-year and 10-year points are essentially flat, which is the real shape of the tail); abc好車網 2016 旗艦版 ~898,000 and 880,000, 2016 頂級版 788,000, 2015 頂級版 1,020,000 and 960,000. Upper-bound outliers explicitly EXCLUDED from the centre: abc好車網 2016 RX200t 旗艦版 at 1,398,000 (元禾國際車業) — re-fetched this revision and it publishes NO mileage at all, so the previous record's '~70,000 km' description of it was unsupported and has been withdrawn; and abc好車網 2015 RX200t 豪華版 at 1,458,000, which is a LEXUS CPO 台中營業所 car carrying a factory-backed certification. Both are aspirational asks that the 838,000 certified car with disclosed mileage contradicts directly. BUILD: strip ~3 points of certification premium off the 38% matched anchor to get the non-certified rate (~35%), then take ~1.5 points off for the gasoline model's discount-driven drag, giving ~34.5% of 2,460,000 = ~850,000 dealer retail asking. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale 12.9% below dealer asking = 740,000; dealer_tradein 16.9% below private = 615,000 — the widest spreads on the curve, because a ten-year-old car ties up a dealer's floor for months. CHAIN CHECK: 740,000 private now sits just BELOW the 788,000-898,000 real dealer asks of same-age predecessors and well below the 838,000 certified car, so 車商售價 > 自售價 holds. The previous 900,000 private-sale figure exceeded the dealer retail asks of real same-age RX 頂級版 and 旗艦版 cars, which is the inversion the reviewer detected. WHY THE GASOLINE SITS BELOW THE HYBRID HERE — the directional answer the reviewer asked for. Three forces push the RX350 down relative to the RX350h and two push back, and the net is small but consistently negative. Down: (1) demand mix — the Taiwan RX range is hybrid-led, the pure-gasoline 350 is the slow seller that dealers clear with 250,000-310,000 cash off, and a used RX350 therefore always competes against a deeply discounted new one; (2) powertrain reputation at 8-10 years — the T24A-FTS is a turbocharged direct-injection four with a turbocharger, high-pressure fuel pump and carbon-fouling exposure, and Taiwan's used buyers discount turbos hard past eight years, whereas the 350h's Atkinson 2.5 plus planetary eCVT has no turbo and no clutch packs and Toyota/Lexus HEV durability is a selling point locally by year ten rather than a worry; (3) running cost weighs more on a buyer spending 740,000 than on one spending 2,245,000, and the hybrid's ~16-17 km/L against ~11-12 km/L is worth real money to that buyer. Back up: (a) the RX350's 2393cc keeps it in the 1,801-2,400cc 牌照稅 bracket at ~11,230/yr while the RX350h's 2487cc falls into the 2,401-3,000cc bracket at ~15,210/yr, so the gasoline car is roughly 4,000-5,000/yr cheaper to run on tax alone; (b) this 豪華版 is AWD where the RX350h 豪華版 is FWD; (c) the hybrid pack is outside its 8yr/160,000 km warranty by year ten and Taiwan buyers still take something off for that. Those counterweights are why the answer is 'slightly below', at ~3 points of retention, and not the 6-8 points a pure reliability narrative would produce. Confidence low: cross-generation ratio transfer, unverifiable 2015/2016 RX200t list prices (the U-CAR launch article returns HTTP 403 and could not be confirmed this revision either), and a wide listing spread."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Covers 0-1 years. Unchanged in this revision. Schedule from the Lexus TW official 保養計劃 table, verified on lexus.com.tw (1個月 24-point; 6個月/10,000km oil + filter + battery test; 12個月/20,000km 29-point + air filter). Per-visit pricing from real owner receipts on a verified PTT 車板 thread (半年定保 mandatory items ~4,000 with add-ons declined; RX-family annual visit itemisation with engine oil now 4,000+). The time-driven interval applies: two paid visits in year one, not one."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers 1-3 years. Unchanged in this revision. Lexus TW official 保養計劃, verified: the 24個月/40,000km service adds brake fluid replacement and a transmission fluid check. Cost built as four visits at the PTT-observed rates — two routine at ~4,000, one filter-and-fluid at ~7,000, one 24-month brake-fluid visit at ~9,000."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers 3-5 years. Unchanged in this revision. Scheduled backbone from the verified Lexus TW 保養計劃 (48個月/80,000km = 引擎冷卻液 + 燃油濾清器 + 37-point) and the verified warranty page (5th-year free extension conditional on punctual 6-month servicing). Cost = two routine visits at ~4,000, one filter visit at ~7,000, one 48-month major at ~13,000 = 28,000. The first tyre set is deliberately NOT booked here: at 7,000 km/yr it has covered only ~35,000 km at year 5, and a 6-year age-out is the normal call for a garaged low-mileage car."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers 5-7 years. Unchanged in this revision. This is the first genuinely unwarranted period: the verified Lexus TW warranty page confirms 4yr/120,000 km plus the free 5th year, so cover lapses at the start of this window — the same fact that makes this the steepest leg of the resale curve. Build: four scheduled visits (~4,000 + ~9,000 brake fluid at 72 months + ~4,000 + ~7,000 = 24,000) + first tyre set 30,000 + alignment 2,000 + 12V battery 8,000 + front pads and discs 12,000 + out-of-warranty allowance 8,000 = 84,000. Scheduled work from the verified 保養計劃; wear-item timing and the repair allowance are engineering estimates for this mileage profile, not sourced receipts — hence low confidence. Verified PTT owner reports of 6萬km and 7萬km services at 3,800-4,500 support keeping the routine component modest."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers 7-10 years. Unchanged in this revision. Scheduled backbone from the verified Lexus TW 保養計劃 (the 48-month cycle repeats at 96 months). Build: six visits totalling ~35,000 including the 96-month major at ~13,000, plus plugs 8,000 + second battery 8,000 + rear brakes 15,000 + ageing allowance 35,000 = 101,000. Consumable and ageing items are estimates for a 10-year-old low-mileage RX in Taiwan, not sourced receipts. Deliberately less aggressive than a German equivalent would need: Lexus RX reliability is strong and verified PTT owners consistently report cheap high-mileage dealer servicing. Note the tension with the resale curve, stated openly: this record argues the T24A-FTS turbo is discounted by 10-year used buyers relative to the hybrid, yet books no turbo-specific failure here. That is deliberate — a turbocharger failure is a tail risk that a used buyer prices in as a discount long before it becomes an expected cost, and the ageing allowance is the single largest uncertainty in the record either way, hence low confidence."}],"sources":[{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官網 — RX 車型價格","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/models/rx/pricelist","note":"Official brand site confirms the RX range at NT$246~361萬 across 500h/450h/350h/350 powertrains. Confirms the bottom of the range is 246萬, matching the 350 豪華版 list price. Trim-level breakdown is not published on this page."},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 — 2026 Lexus RX 規格配備/價格表","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/lexus/2026-lexus-rx","note":"Full TW price table by trim, all 2026 model year: 350豪華版 2,460,000 (2393cc), 350h豪華版 2,560,000 (2487cc), 350頂級版 2,680,000, 350h頂級版 2,780,000, 350 F Sport 2,950,000, 350旗艦版 2,950,000, 350h旗艦版 3,050,000, 450h+豪華版 3,150,000, 450h+旗艦版 3,550,000, 500h F Sport Performance 3,610,000. PRIMARY SOURCE for list_price — confirms 2,460,000 exactly. Also the source for the RX350h 旗艦版 3,050,000 denominator used in the 3-year hybrid-vs-gasoline direction check."},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 — 2021 Lexus RX 規格配備/價格表 (predecessor facelift)","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/lexus/2021-lexus-rx","note":"FETCHED LIVE 2026-08-11, NEW IN THIS REVISION and it corrected the record. Verified 4th-gen facelift TW list prices: RX300 豪華版 2,270,000 / 頂級版 2,440,000 / F Sport 2,640,000 / 旗艦版 2,640,000 (all 1998cc); RX450h 頂級版 3,080,000 / F Sport 3,340,000 / 旗艦版 3,380,000 / 450hL 旗艦版 3,470,000 (3456cc). The previous version of this record used 頂級版 2,390,000 and 旗艦版 2,590,000 for facelift-era cars — those are the 2015 pre-facelift figures, and every 5- and 7-year ratio built on them was slightly overstated. All ratios now use this verified table."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — Lexus RX 中古車行情 (63 listings, mileage disclosed)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=RX","note":"FETCHED LIVE 2026-08-11 — the most valuable source in this revision, because unlike abc好車網 it publishes mileage on every row. Current-gen: 2024 RX350 2400cc 21,000 km 1,858,000 (台新汽車, 台南, 原鈑件/原廠保養/新車保固中); 2023 RX350 2400cc 77,210 km 1,688,000 (順久車業, 嘉義); 2023 RX 油電 2500cc 4WD 36,132 km 2,158,000 (富昱汽車, 台南, 白金認證, Mark Levinson/電動吸門/360環景/通風加熱電動座椅 = 350h 旗艦版 spec). Five-year (2021 RX300): 旗艦版 27,277 km 1,599,000; 旗艦版 52,000 km 1,498,000; 旗艦版 82,540 km 1,498,000; 旗艦版 69,000 km 1,428,000; 豪華版 151,627 km 1,090,000; 100,218 km 1,199,000. Six-year (2020): F-Sport 101,000 km 1,328,000; 頂級天窗版 100,000 km 1,198,000. Four-year (2022): 頂級版 39,192 km 1,599,000; 小改款 112,398 km 1,388,000; 曜黑時尚版 74,000 km 1,338,000. Eight-year (2018): 旗艦版 119,000 km 1,038,000; RX300 111,407 km 1,098,000. Nine/ten-year: 2017 RX 94,465 km 828,000; 2016 RX200t 2000cc 76,792 km 838,000 (上藝汽車, 新北, 全場認證五大保證/僅跑7萬多/原廠保養); 2016 RX200t 136,914 km 798,000. This is the source of the mileage gradients used at years 5, 7 and 10, and the 76,792 km 2016 car is the keystone 10-year anchor."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX 車型頁 (live listings)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus-rx300-cars","note":"RE-FETCHED 2026-08-11 and it exposed a factor-of-ten error in the previous version. The page prints mileage in 萬公里: 2024款 350旗艦版 2.4L, 3.12萬公里 = 31,200 km, 2,198,000 (東威, 認證車); 2023款 350頂級版 2.4L, 4.2萬公里 = 42,000 km, 1,898,000 (東威, 保固中); 2020款 300豪華版 2.0L, 2.2萬公里 = 22,000 km, 1,238,000 (弘達國際泰山旗艦店, 原鈑件/低里程認證車); 2019款 RX300 F Sport 2.0L, 11.9萬公里 = 119,000 km, 1,088,000 (元禾國際, 原鈑件). The previous record read the first two as 3,120 km and 4,200 km while reading the last two correctly at 22,000 and 119,000 km — the unit convention is not in doubt. All four are DEALER RETAIL asks, before the private-sale and trade-in haircuts."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2016 LEXUS RX200t 旗艦版 (upper-bound outlier)","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1871510","note":"RE-FETCHED 2026-08-11. Confirmed live: 2016 RX 200t 旗艦版, asking 1,398,000, dealer 元禾國際車業. CORRECTION: the listing publishes NO mileage, so the previous record's description of it as a '~70,000 km' car was unsupported and has been withdrawn. Treated strictly as an aspirational upper bound at the 10-year point — it is contradicted by the SUM 2016 RX200t at 76,792 km asking 838,000 with certification and disclosed mileage."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2015 LEXUS RX200t 豪華版 (Lexus CPO 台中)","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1781256","note":"RE-FETCHED 2026-08-11. Confirmed live: 2015 RX 200t 豪華版, asking 1,458,000, seller listed as LEXUS CPO/台中營業所. Mileage not published. Carries a factory-backed certification premium and is excluded from the 10-year central cluster; used only as an absolute upper bound."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2025 Lexus RX 350 旗艦版","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2294103","note":"2025 Lexus RX 350 旗艦版, asking 2,480,000, dealer 上達汽車. Against a 2,950,000 list that is ~84% at roughly one year. Mileage is NOT shown on the listing page — re-confirmed this revision — so its weight in the year-1 build was reduced in favour of the mileage-disclosed SUM 2024 RX350 at 21,000 km."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2023 LEXUS RX350 豪華版 (excluded outlier)","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1974537","note":"2023 豪華版 asking 2,278,000 (坤獅汽車). EXCLUDED as a stale or misclassified outlier because it exceeds the 8891 2023 頂級版 asking price of 1,898,000, which is not credible for a base trim. Recorded transparently rather than dropped silently."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [菜單] Lexus RX350 豪華版 (Nov 2025)","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1763359792.A.E01.html","note":"VERIFIED. Genuine post dated 2025-11-17: 246萬 list, 29萬 discount, 217萬 final. 保險 and 領牌稅費 are billed 實報實銷 (so 217萬 is the car alone, correctly comparable to list). Free 贈品 confirmed: 隔熱紙 (KT68 front / F30 body), 行車記錄器, 2 key covers, 2 umbrellas, full tank, 2 headrests; only a M990 dashcam upgrade at 7,000 was self-paid. This is the anchor that justifies departing from the brief's 'Lexus barely discounts' default, and the evidence behind the ~2,210,000 new street price that drags this model's retention against list."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [菜單] Lexus RX350豪華 (Jan 2025)","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1736516288.A.7E3.html","note":"總價 228萬 excluding insurance/registration (≈18萬 off list); self-paid 鍍膜 12,000 + 電子後視鏡 8,300; 隔熱紙/E-Tag/踏墊/行車記錄器 free 贈品. Anchors the LOW end of the discount range and the 配件 component of onroad_fees. NOT independently re-fetched — treat as medium confidence."},{"name":"PTTWeb — [菜單] LEXUS RX350 頂級版 (Oct 2025)","url":"https://www.pttweb.cc/bbs/car/M.1760578592.A.CFE","note":"268萬 list, 30萬 discount, 領牌代辦 31,000, 自費配件 10,000, final 242.1萬. Source for the raw 領牌代辦 line from which 強制險/燃料費 were stripped. NOT independently re-fetched."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [菜單] Lexus RX350 汽油頂級 25年產26年式 (Jan 2026)","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1768195382.A.B1F.html","note":"Most recent gasoline RX350 menu cited: 268萬 list, 31萬 off (≈11.6%), 237萬 cash, plus 21,500 film/sunroof upgrade and 3,000 welcome lights. Evidence that 26年式 gasoline cars still discount double digits. NOT independently re-fetched."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 大改款 RX 車系國內發表上市 (5th gen)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/73085","note":"5th-gen RX Taiwan launch, 245萬起, Nov 2022. Used to date the current generation and to establish why no genuine 5/7/10-year data exists for it. Not re-fetched; the launch date is corroborated by the absence of any pre-2023 5th-gen listing across 8891, SUM and abc好車網."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 第四代 Lexus RX 車系國內正式發表 (2015)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/27742","note":"Claimed original list prices of the 2015 pre-facelift predecessor: RX200t 豪華版 2,190,000 / 頂級版 2,390,000 / 旗艦版 2,590,000. STILL UNVERIFIED — the URL returns HTTP 403 and could not be fetched this revision either. These figures are internally consistent with the verified 2021 facelift table (2,270,000 / 2,440,000 / 2,640,000, i.e. a modest facelift uplift) and with the observed listing cluster, but they remain unconfirmed and are the main reason the 10-year checkpoint is low confidence. Where the choice mattered the more conservative (higher) facelift denominator was sanity-checked as well; it moves the 10-year ratio by about 1.4 points and does not change the conclusion."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 小改款 Lexus RX 車系 227萬起開賣 (2019/2020)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/48918","note":"2020 facelift pricing. Returns HTTP 403 and could not be fetched this revision. SUPERSEDED as a source: the facelift trim prices are now taken from the TVBS 2021 spec table listed above, which was fetched successfully and which corrected the 頂級版 and 旗艦版 figures this record previously carried."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官網 — 保養計劃","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"VERIFIED. Official scheduled-maintenance table: 1個月 (24-point inspection); 6個月/10,000km (16-point, oil + oil filter, battery test); 12個月/20,000km (29-point, spark plugs, air filter); 24個月/40,000km (34-point, brake fluid, transmission fluid check); 48個月/80,000km (37-point, coolant + fuel filter). A 25-point premium inspection is included at each visit. Establishes that at 7,000 km/yr the schedule is time-driven at two visits per year. No prices are published."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官網 — 保證方案 / 延長保證","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx","note":"VERIFIED. 4 years / 120,000 km basic warranty. FREE extension to the 5th year / 140,000 km if every 定保 is kept within its six-month window — missing even one forfeits eligibility. 12V battery 3 years unlimited km; tyres 3 years pro-rata on remaining tread; spark plugs to their first scheduled replacement. Basis for zero unscheduled repair spend across the year-1 through year-5 windows, and for treating years 5-7 as the steepest leg of the depreciation curve because cover lapses exactly there."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — Lexus 半年定保費用討論 (real receipts)","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1673662575.A.A53.html","note":"VERIFIED. Genuine thread dated 2023-01-14. Receipts: OP quoted 10,600 total of which only ~4,000 is mandatory; 7萬公里 原廠保養 4,000+; 6萬保養 3,800; 半年 2,600. Consensus advice is to 刪單 the 建議項目 not in the owner's manual. COUNTERWEIGHT recorded: the same thread also has owners reporting 17,000 for a visit and 'never less than 20,000 per visit'. The model here follows the decline-the-add-ons owner, which is defensible but sits at the cheap end of the real distribution."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — RX350h 年度保養費用","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1749131889.A.924.html","note":"RX-family annual service itemisation: engine oil now 4,000+ (up from 2,000-3,000), cabin filter 800-3,000, LS filter 2,100, brake caliper clean 1,500. Used to size the annual (as opposed to 6-month) visit. NOT independently re-fetched; note it is an RX350h hybrid thread, so it is a near-neighbour rather than an exact match for the 2.4T."}]},"lexus-rx350h-luxury":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr, roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/yr. Every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). Two consequences drive this whole record: (1) resale — low-mileage cars sell above the mileage-blind 行情, so every used-price anchor below was taken from a real listing verified live on 2026-08-11 and then adjusted toward the low-mileage end of the observed spread, with the adjustment stated in each source string; (2) maintenance — Lexus Taiwan's service interval is 6 months OR 10,000 km, whichever comes first, so at 7,000 km/yr servicing is entirely TIME-driven (2 visits every year, ~3,500 km apart). Mileage-triggered items land very late or never: total lifetime mileage at year 10 is only 70,000 km, so spark plugs (~100,000 km on the A25A-FXS) never come due, and e-CVT/hybrid transaxle fluid (~60,000 km) arrives only around year 8-9. Conversely, age-driven consumables dominate: tires time out on rubber age (~5-6 years) long before tread depth, so the first set falls in the 5-7 year window rather than at exactly year 5, and the 12V AGM auxiliary battery ages out on calendar time. Purchase excludes tax and insurance by design (no 牌照稅/燃料稅, no 強制險/任意險). Method note: predecessor retention ratios are expressed against the predecessor's LIST price and therefore applied to this car's LIST price (2,560,000), not to real_cost, so that ratio numerator and denominator stay on the same basis.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"Dealer-retail anchored on live 8891 中古車 listings for the 2-year-old (2024) 5th-gen RX, then stepped back one year. VERIFIED on 8891 2026-08-11: 2024 RX350 頂級版 with only 14,000 km asking NT$2,088,000 (77.9% of its 2,680,000 list) — the closest LOW-MILEAGE analogue to this buyer; 2024 RX350 豪華版 27,600 km NT$1,828,000 (74.3% of 2,460,000); 2024 RX350 旗艦版 31,200 km NT$2,198,000; 2024 RX350 F Sport AWD 35,000 km NT$2,388,000. CORRECTION vs prior draft: the prior draft quoted the 2024 band as 1,828,000-2,198,000 at 27,600-39,900 km, which both understated the top of the band and omitted the 14,000 km car entirely — the single most relevant low-mileage anchor. That car sitting at 77.9% of list at TWO years made the prior 1-year dealer-retail estimate of 79.3% imply only ~1.4 points of depreciation across a full year, which is not credible. Dealer retail raised to ~NT$2,080,000 (81.3% of list). The ceiling is still genuinely capped by new-car discounting: the verified PTT 菜單 shows 300,000 off list, i.e. ~2,300,000 transaction, so a used 1-year car cannot approach list. ADJUSTMENTS APPLIED: dealer retail 2,080,000 -> private sale 1,870,000 (-10.1%, the 車商售價 to 自售價 step) -> dealer trade-in 1,655,000 (-11.5%, the 車商收購價 step). Low-mileage premium is small at 1 year because nearly every 1-year car is low-mileage."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"Strongest data point in this record and INDEPENDENTLY RE-VERIFIED on 8891 中古車 2026-08-11: a 2023 RX350h 豪華版 — this exact trim at this exact age — with 40,200 km asking NT$1,758,000 (68.7% of its 2,560,000 list), alongside 2023 RX350h 旗艦版 39,000 km NT$2,258,000 and 2023 RX350 豪華版 30,000 km NT$1,680,000. Those cars have run ~11,500-13,000 km/yr, i.e. Taiwan-average. Our car at 21,000 km has done ~48% less, so the retail ratio is lifted from 68.7% to ~72.5% of list -> dealer retail ~NT$1,860,000. ADJUSTMENTS APPLIED: 1,860,000 dealer retail -> 1,670,000 private sale (-10.2%) -> 1,460,000 dealer trade-in (-12.6%). Independent cross-check of the private figure: the observed 1,758,000 dealer ask on the higher-mileage same-trim car implies a private sale near 1,580,000 for THAT car; adding the low-mileage premium for 19,200 fewer km lands at ~1,670,000, which is exactly where this sits — so this is a true 自售價, not a copied dealer ask. UNCHANGED from the prior draft; it survived the adversarial check. Note the year1->3 curve stays flat (-10.7% over two years) because heavy new-car discounting compresses the 1-year ceiling while the 3-year price is set independently by used-market demand."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — the 5th-gen RX only launched in Taiwan in Jan 2023, so no genuine 5-year data for this generation exists and none was invented. Method: take the PREDECESSOR 4th-gen RX (AL20, 2019 facelift; TW list RX300 豪華版 NT$2,270,000 / 頂級版 2,440,000 / 旗艦版 2,640,000, VERIFIED on CarStuff 2026-08-11), read its real used prices at that age off 8891, express as a retention ratio of its own list, then apply to this car. VERIFIED 8891 anchors 2026-08-11: a 2020 RX300 豪華版 with only 22,000 km asking NT$1,238,000 = 54.5% of 2,270,000 at SIX years and genuinely low mileage; a 2020 RX300 頂級版 at 70,000 km asking NT$1,148,000 = 47.0%, showing a ~7.5-point mileage spread at the same age. Interpolating our verified year-3 hybrid ratio (72.5%) toward the 6-year low-mileage 54.5% gives ~60.5% for a gasoline-equivalent at 5 years. CORRECTION vs prior draft: the prior draft applied the RX300 (2.0 turbo GASOLINE) ratio with no hybrid uplift. Toyota/Lexus hybrids retain above the gasoline market in Taiwan, so ~62% is used -> 2,560,000 x 0.62 = ~NT$1,585,000 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENTS APPLIED: 1,585,000 dealer retail -> 1,420,000 private sale (-10.4%) -> 1,235,000 dealer trade-in (-13.0%). Still inside the 5yr/140,000 km cover (4yr base + the earned 1yr/20,000 km extension), which supports the price."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor 4th-gen RX, same method as the 5-year point — no genuine 7-year data exists for the 5th-gen RX. VERIFIED 8891 anchors 2026-08-11: 2018 RX300 頂級版 62,600 km asking NT$1,138,000 = 46.6% of its 2,440,000 list at EIGHT years; 2020 RX300 豪華版 22,000 km NT$1,238,000 = 54.5% at SIX years; 2020 RX300 F Sport 101,000 km NT$1,328,000 = 50.3% at six; 2019 RX300 F Sport 119,000 km NT$1,088,000 = 41.2% at seven but at very high mileage. CORRECTION vs prior draft, which contained two compounding pessimisms: (a) it used ~46% retention at SEVEN years, but 46.6% is the EIGHT-year ratio — an off-by-one-year error that charged this car an extra year of depreciation; (b) it applied a gasoline RX300 ratio to a Lexus hybrid with no uplift. Interpolating 6yr/54.5% and 8yr/46.6%, then mileage-correcting for 49,000 km (7,000 km/yr, well below the ~11,000 km/yr of the comparables), then adding a modest hybrid-retention uplift, gives ~50.5% -> 2,560,000 x 0.505 = ~NT$1,290,000 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENTS APPLIED: 1,290,000 dealer retail -> 1,150,000 private sale (-10.9%) -> 990,000 dealer trade-in (-13.9%); the private-to-trade-in gap widens with age because dealers price in longer lot time. Confidence stays low: the ratio still comes from a different generation with a different powertrain (RX300 2.0 turbo vs this 2.5 HEV), and the 5th-gen's discount-compressed early curve may not converge on the 4th-gen's late curve."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from predecessor generations — no 10-year data for the 5th-gen RX can exist (it is 3 years old). Closest real hybrid comparables, both listings FETCHED AND CONFIRMED LIVE 2026-08-11: abc好車網 2016 RX450h 旗艦版 at NT$1,188,000 = 35.1% of its ~3,380,000 list, and abc好車網 2016 RX450h 頂級版 at NT$1,288,000 = 41.8% of its ~3,080,000 list; FindCar shows a 2016 RX450h at NT$798,000 for the worn end of the spread. NEITHER abc好車網 listing publishes mileage, which is the main limit on this point. Note the systematic pattern in those two: the CHEAPER trim retains the HIGHER percentage (41.8% vs 35.1%), which is the normal premium-flagship effect. CORRECTION vs prior draft: the prior draft used 34% retention — BELOW both verified 10-year hybrid anchors — for a car that is (i) the entry trim and cheaper than both comparables, so structurally higher-retaining, (ii) one-owner at 70,000 km, i.e. near the top of the condition spread, and (iii) a Lexus hybrid, which the Taiwan market holds above the gasoline market. ~37.5% is used -> 2,560,000 x 0.375 = ~NT$960,000 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENTS APPLIED: 960,000 dealer retail -> 845,000 private sale (-12.0%) -> 710,000 dealer trade-in (-16.0%); the gap is widest here because a 10-year-old car ties up a dealer's floor for months. Downside already priced in: the hybrid pack is outside its 8yr/160,000 km warranty by then and Taiwan buyers discount for that even when the pack is healthy."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Interval and program VERIFIED 2026-08-11 on Lexus Taiwan's official 保養計劃 page (1 month free, then 6 months / 10,000 km whichever first, with 12/24/48-month majors) and the official 準時定保享延長保證 announcement (8 consecutive on-time services). Per-visit cost is a BUILD-UP from published per-item ranges (oil change NT$1,500-2,500, oil filter NT$300-500, air filter NT$500-800, brake inspection NT$500-1,000), not a quoted dealer price. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from medium to low on re-check: the interval and warranty structure are officially sourced, but the entire cost payload rests on those per-item ranges, whose source was fetched and found to be a blog post authored by 'aibot' on drivinginstruct.com — AI-generated content-farm output, not a receipt, dealer quote or owner-club thread. No receipt-level Taiwan source for Lexus RX servicing was obtained."},{"y":3,"source":"Same officially-verified Lexus Taiwan interval/warranty basis as year 1, extended over 4 visits, plus the standard 2-year brake-fluid and filter items from the published 保養計劃 inspection list (which does list brake fluid, air filter and cabin filter). Cost is a build-up from per-item ranges, not a single quoted figure. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from medium to low for the same reason as year 1: the per-visit price has no receipt-level or dealer-quoted source behind it."},{"y":5,"source":"Visits and service items from the officially-verified Lexus Taiwan 保養計劃 interval table (48-month major confirmed on that page); the free +1yr/20,000 km extension from the official 準時定保 announcement, verified 2026-08-11. CORRECTION vs prior draft: the prior draft loaded a full ~32,000 tire set into this window, which both forced the replacement onto the exact 5.0-year boundary and produced a non-monotonic cost profile (62,000 here falling to 52,000 at year 7). The tire set is moved to the 5-7 window, where a set fitted at delivery actually times out on the stated 5-6 year rubber-ageing rule. Fully extrapolated — no receipt-level source for a 5-year-old 5th-gen RX exists yet."},{"y":7,"source":"Interval basis from the officially-verified Lexus Taiwan 保養計劃; warranty expiry from the official 車主權益 page (4yr/120,000 km, verified) plus the earned 1yr/20,000 km extension (official announcement, verified). Tire cost estimated from Taiwan retail for premium 235/60R19 SUV tires (Michelin Primacy SUV+ / Bridgestone Alenza class, ~NT$7,000-8,000 each fitted and balanced). Other per-item costs from published RX service ranges. CORRECTION vs prior draft: the first tire set is phased into this window rather than year 5, which is both the correct reading of the 5-6 year rubber-ageing rule for a set fitted at delivery and the fix for the prior draft's non-monotonic maintenance profile. Extrapolated — no 7-year 5th-gen RX cost data exists."},{"y":10,"source":"Interval basis from the officially-verified Lexus Taiwan 保養計劃 and hybrid battery warranty terms from the official 車主權益 page (8yr/160,000 km = 5yr/100,000 Lexus + 3yr/60,000 Hotai, verified 2026-08-11). Component costs built up from published Taiwan RX repair ranges (brake system NT$3,000-8,000 basic, suspension NT$5,000-15,000, A/C NT$2,000-8,000) plus premium 19-inch tire retail. Fully extrapolated — the 5th-gen RX is 3 years old, so no 10-year cost record can exist for it. Caveat: the second tire set nominally times out just past the 10-year mark, but a 10-year-old car will need tires within this 3-year window on either age or condition, so it is retained here."}],"sources":[{"name":"8891新車 — 2026年式Lexus RX國內上架！細節微調、售價不變","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/lexus/rx/20732","note":"PRIMARY price source, RE-VERIFIED 2026-08-11. Full MY2026 TW price table for all 10 RX trims; RX 350h 豪華版 = NT$2,560,000. Full ladder confirmed: 350 豪華 246萬 / 350h 豪華 256萬 / 350 頂級 268萬 / 350h 頂級 278萬 / 350 旗艦 295萬 / 350 F Sport 295萬 / 350h 旗艦 305萬 / 450h+ 豪華 315萬 / 450h+ 旗艦 355萬 / 500h F Sport Performance 361萬. Confirms MY2026 pricing unchanged and changes cosmetic only."},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 — 2026 Lexus RX 規格配備","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/lexus/2026-lexus-rx","note":"Independent confirmation, RE-VERIFIED 2026-08-11: 350h豪華版 = 256萬, with the identical 10-trim ladder as 8891. Two independent sources agreeing on 2,560,000 is what settles the kingautos conflict."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan official — RX model page","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/models/rx","note":"Official brand site, RE-VERIFIED 2026-08-11. Confirms the RX family range NT$246~361萬 and the 500h/450h/350h/350 powertrain lineup, consistent with 256萬 for this trim. Trim-level prices are NOT broken out on the public page, so this corroborates rather than sources the exact figure."},{"name":"KingAutos — 2026 Lexus RX 共10車款詳細介紹","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/rx","note":"Trim/drivetrain/powertrain table, RE-VERIFIED 2026-08-11: 350h 豪華版 is 前輪驅動 (FWD); 2,487cc naturally aspirated inline-4, 190 hp, with a 182 hp motor for 250 hp system output, e-CVT. CONFLICT CONFIRMED STILL LIVE: this page prices the trim at NT$2,550,000, 10,000 below the two sources above. 2,560,000 used."},{"name":"PTT car板 — [菜單] Lexus RX350H豪華版 (2025-11-02)","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1762018038.A.408.html","note":"REAL dealer quotation for this exact trim, FETCHED AND CONFIRMED GENUINE 2026-08-11. 256萬 list - 30萬 discount + 3.6萬 self-paid accessories = 229.6萬 transaction (cash; tax and insurance 實報實銷/另計). Accessory breakdown confirmed item for item (極黑前擋隔熱紙 8,000 / 行車記錄器 13,000 / 原廠鍍膜 15,000), and is the basis for onroad_fees."},{"name":"PTT car板 — [菜單] LEXUS RX350H 頂級版 (2025-10-16)","url":"https://www.pttweb.cc/bbs/car/M.1760544279.A.1DD","note":"Second real quotation, adjacent trim, FETCHED AND CONFIRMED GENUINE 2026-08-11: 278萬 - 28萬 + 3.8萬 = 253.8萬. The poster notes other buyers negotiated 30萬+. Cross-checks that ~10% cash discounts on the RX 350h are routine, not a one-off — the verified evidence that overrides the 'Lexus never discounts' heuristic."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx","note":"Main used-car source, RE-FETCHED 2026-08-11. Current-gen: 2023 RX350h 豪華版 40,200 km NT$1,758,000; 2023 RX350h 旗艦版 39,000 km NT$2,258,000; 2023 RX350 豪華版 30,000 km NT$1,680,000; 2024 RX350 頂級版 14,000 km NT$2,088,000 (key low-mileage anchor the prior draft omitted); 2024 RX350 豪華版 27,600 km NT$1,828,000; 2024 RX350 旗艦版 31,200 km NT$2,198,000; 2024 RX350 F Sport AWD 35,000 km NT$2,388,000. Predecessor gen: 2020 RX300 豪華版 22,000 km NT$1,238,000; 2020 RX300 頂級版 70,000 km NT$1,148,000; 2020 RX300 F Sport 101,000 km NT$1,328,000; 2019 RX300 F Sport 119,000 km NT$1,088,000; 2018 RX300 頂級版 62,600 km NT$1,138,000; 2018 RX300 豪華版 188,000 km NT$850,000. ALL are 車商售價 (dealer retail asks), never what a seller receives."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — LEXUS RX 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=RX","note":"Second used-market platform, used to cross-check 8891 rather than double-count. Also dealer retail asks. Not re-fetched in this pass; the 8891 anchors carry the corrected curve, so nothing in this record depends on this source alone."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan official — 車主權益 (owner benefits / warranty)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx","note":"RE-VERIFIED 2026-08-11. Official terms confirmed verbatim: 四年或行駛十二萬公里 vehicle warranty, 2yr/50,000 km on replacement parts, hybrid battery 5yr/100,000 km from Lexus + 3yr/60,000 km added by Hotai = 8yr/160,000 km. Page does not advertise any free routine maintenance."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan official — 保養計劃 (scheduled maintenance plan)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"RE-VERIFIED 2026-08-11. Official intervals confirmed: 1 month (free first inspection), then 6 months/10,000 km, 12 months/20,000 km, 24 months/40,000 km, 48 months/80,000 km. Lists covered items (oil + filter, air filter, cabin filter, brake fluid, spark plugs, suspension/brake inspection, A/C, plus hybrid power-control cooling checks). Confirms only the 1-month service is free. NO prices published, which is why per-visit costs here are built up rather than quoted — and why maintenance confidence is low throughout."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan official — 新車準時保養愛車享延長保證方案","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/news_detail.aspx?nw=563","note":"RE-VERIFIED 2026-08-11. The free-extension program confirmed: 連續準時8次定保 using the official 定保套餐 earns 延長保證1年或2萬公里, for vehicles delivered from 2024-01-01 and completed before the original 4yr/120,000 km warranty expires; private and rental use only. This is why cover is modelled as effectively 5yr/140,000 km and the repair reserve starts only in the 5-7 year window."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 — Lexus RX 小改款售價227萬起 (2019, 4th-gen facelift)","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/29889-lexus-rx.html","note":"PREDECESSOR list prices, RE-VERIFIED 2026-08-11 — these are the denominators for the 5- and 7-year retention ratios. RX300 豪華版 2,270,000 / 頂級版 2,440,000 / F Sport 2,640,000 / 旗艦版 2,640,000; RX350 頂級版 2,740,000 / 旗艦版 2,940,000; RX450h 頂級版 3,080,000 / F Sport 3,340,000 / 旗艦版 3,380,000. The 4th-gen RX450h had no 豪華版, so RX300 豪華版 at 2,270,000 is the closest positional analogue to today's 350h 豪華版."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — Lexus RX450H 中古車價格","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&b=38&m=1117","note":"10+ year hybrid RX comparables for the year-10 extrapolation, showing the LOW end of the spread: 2016 RX450h NT$798,000; 2014 RX450h 98,000 km NT$458,000; 2012 RX450h 160,000 km NT$298,000. Not re-fetched in this pass; used only as the lower bound, and the corrected year-10 figure is driven by the two abc好車網 listings that were re-verified."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2016 LEXUS RX450h 旗艦版 118.8萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1826919","note":"10-year hybrid RX comparable, RE-FETCHED AND CONFIRMED LIVE 2026-08-11: NT$1,188,000 dealer retail (dealer 元禾國際-威廉認證車庫) against a ~3,380,000 original list = 35.1% retention. Mileage is NOT published in the listing, which limits how hard this point can be leaned on."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2016 LEXUS RX450h 頂級版 128.8萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1900355","note":"10-year hybrid RX comparable, top of the spread, RE-FETCHED AND CONFIRMED LIVE 2026-08-11: NT$1,288,000 (dealer 東威汽車) against a ~3,080,000 original list = 41.8%. Mileage also NOT published. Asking MORE than the 旗艦版 above despite a lower original list is the clearest evidence that the cheaper trim retains a higher percentage — the basis for correcting year-10 retention up from 34% to ~37.5% for this entry-trim car."},{"name":"Lexus RX350 二手車購買指南 (service item cost ranges)","url":"https://www.drivinginstruct.com/lexus-rx350%E4%BA%8C%E6%89%8B/","note":"WEAK secondary source, RE-FETCHED 2026-08-11 and downgraded further. Used ONLY for per-item cost ranges to build up visit prices: oil change NT$1,500-2,500, air filter NT$500-800, brake inspection NT$500-1,000, major repairs (suspension/transmission/engine) NT$5,000-20,000. VERIFICATION RESULT: this is a 2024-09-05 blog post on a driving-instruction site, authored by 'aibot' — AI-generated content-farm output, not a dealer quote, receipt or owner-club thread. This is the reason every maintenance checkpoint is confidence low. Its used-price claims conflict with 8891 and were NOT used."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — Lexus大改款RX車系國內發表上市 (Jan 2023)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/73085","note":"Establishes the 5th-gen RX Taiwan launch date and original pricing (Jan 2023, 245-360萬), which is what makes 5/7/10-year data for this generation impossible and forces the predecessor-ratio method. Used from search-result headline/snippet only; page body not fetched."}]},"lexus-rx450h-plus-luxury":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, roughly half the Taiwan average (~12,000-15,000 km/yr). All checkpoints use 7,000 km/year (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km). Two consequences drive this whole model: (1) Servicing is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven. Lexus Taiwan's published rule is 每6個月或每10,000公里，以先到者為準 (verified 2026-08-11 on lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx) — at 7,000 km/yr the 6-month clock always fires first, so the owner makes ~2 shop visits per year, ~20 over ten years, and the service LEVEL is set by the calendar rather than the odometer. (2) Consumables age out rather than wear out: tyres are replaced on age (~5-6 years) not tread, and brake pads last unusually long because the PHEV's regenerative braking does most of the stopping. Only spark plugs are genuinely outside the 10-year window — the official Lexus TW table places 自排變速箱油更換 in the 48個月/80,000公里 service, and because the calendar always fires first that service arrives at 48 months (28,000 km) and again at 96 months (56,000 km), i.e. TWICE inside the 10-year window. Spark plugs remain correctly excluded (the table's own note reads 一般車、油電車每10萬公里更換, and the car reaches only 70,000 km). Car is kept in Taiwan, garaged/home-charged, one owner, no accident history. Tax (牌照稅/燃料稅) and insurance are excluded by design. LOW MILEAGE IS ALSO THE SINGLE BIGGEST DRIVER OF THE RESIDUAL CURVE, and the 2026-08-11 re-research showed the prior draft had badly under-credited it: every 9-10 year-old 4th-gen RX450h currently listed in Taiwan carries 129,000-198,400 km, i.e. two to three times this car's 70,000 km at the same age, so raw asking prices for old RX450h stock describe a different car from this one and must be mileage-corrected upward before use. Note for context only: the 2,487 cc engine puts this car in the 2,401-3,000 cc bracket (牌照稅 15,210 + 燃料稅 7,200 = 22,410/yr) — materially cheaper than the 3.5 V6 predecessor's 3,456 cc bracket (28,220 牌照稅), one reason the new generation should hold value better than the old one.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"NOT DISPUTED IN REVIEW — figures unchanged this pass, and the underlying listings were re-fetched 2026-08-11 and still stand. 8891 中古車 (auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx?page=1&sort=price-desc) today shows exactly three RX 450h+ 豪華版 cars: 2025款 1.0萬km 車商售價 2,488,000, 2024款 1.3萬km 2,488,000, 2024款 1.3萬km 2,488,000. The dedicated auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx450h page returns the same three cars and nothing else, confirming this is the entire national supply. Curve shape cross-checked against the far denser RX 350h 豪華版 set on the same page (list 2,560,000): 2026款 0.6萬km 2,288,000 = 89.4% of list, 2024款 2.4萬km 1,988,000 = 77.7%, 2024款 3.7萬km 1,988,000 = 77.7%. CAVEAT ON THE DIRECT COMPS (still true): all three 450h+ listings show the identical 2,488,000 across two model years and two mileages, which is the signature of a 刊登價 anchor rather than a real per-car curve. They fix the LEVEL of a 1-2 year old 450h+ (~2,490,000 asking) but cannot shape the year-on-year slope. Blending that level against the 350h curve level-shifted to this car's list price gives an evidence band of 2,488,000-2,670,000 for year-1 dealer asking; 2,600,000 taken, mid-band. THIS IS THE PARITY DATA POINT that governs the corrections made at years 5, 7 and 10 below: at 1-2 years the 450h+ asks 79.0% of its list (2,488,000 / 3,150,000) while the RX 350h 豪華版 asks 77.7% (1,988,000 / 2,560,000) — the PHEV holds at parity or very slightly better, not worse. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED (dealer asking is NOT the owner's proceeds): 車商售價 2,600,000 -12% = 自售價 2,290,000 (private_sale_price); 自售價 -13% = 車商收購價 1,990,000 (dealer_tradein_price). Two near-new outliers deliberately excluded as non-representative: abccar LEXUS CPO/南港 2024款 450h+ 豪華版 at 3,258,000 (全新車領牌未使用) and 東威汽車 2024款 at 2,888,000 (全新中獎車)."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"NOT DISPUTED IN REVIEW — figures unchanged this pass. The 5th-gen RX launched in Taiwan late November 2022, so 2023款 cars are genuinely ~3 years old today and this checkpoint rests on observed data rather than pure extrapolation. Re-verified on 8891 中古車 2026-08-11 (page 2 of the price-descending list): RX 350h 豪華版 (list 2,560,000) 2023款 4.02萬km 車商售價 1,758,000 (68.7% of list) and two 2023款 4.9萬km at 1,739,000 (67.9%). Our car carries 21,000 km, roughly half those, so a genuine low-mileage premium of ~4 points applies, giving ~72% mileage-adjusted dealer asking. No PHEV penalty is applied here, consistent with the year-1 parity finding above. The dealer-asking figure is held at ~2,170,000 rather than raised to the ~2,270,000 the mileage-adjusted ratio would support; that was originally done to avoid a kink against a year-5 point that has now been raised, so this checkpoint is now the CONSERVATIVE (low) end of its own evidence band rather than the middle. It is left unchanged because the reviewer did not dispute it and re-research produced no new year-3 evidence; the tension is recorded in the issues list for the cross-vehicle owner rather than silently patched. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: 車商售價 2,170,000 -12% = 自售價 1,910,000; 自售價 -13% = 車商收購價 1,660,000."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"RAISED THIS PASS from 1,545,000/1,345,000 — the reviewer's objection is sustained. EXTRAPOLATED: no genuine 5-year data for this car can exist (the 450h+ went on sale in Taiwan November 2022, so the oldest example is ~3.7 years old), so the predecessor 4th-gen RX450h (AL20, 3.5 V6 hybrid) is used, mileage-corrected, then discounted for PHEV-specific risk. PREDECESSOR ANCHORS AT 5 YEARS, all re-fetched 2026-08-11: 8891 page 2 shows 2021款 RX450h 頂級版 6.0萬km 車商售價 1,468,000 = 44.6% of its ~3,290,000 list; abc好車網 Car/2130376 shows a 2021年 RX450h 頂級版 at 1,728,000 = 52.5% (mileage not published); the 4-year point is bracketed above by abc好車網 Car/2146839, a LEXUS CPO/桃園 2022年 頂級版 at 1,998,000 = 60.7%. The 8891 car carries 60,000 km against our 35,000 km, worth roughly +5 points, lifting it to ~50%; the predecessor band mileage-matched to this owner is therefore ~50-55% of list. The 5th gen should sit above that band for two verified reasons: it is the generation still on sale, and its 2,487 cc engine pays 15,210 牌照稅 against the 3.5 V6 predecessor's 28,220, a 13,010/yr saving a used buyer prices in. The sibling RX 350h record lands the 5th-gen HEV at 62% of list on the same logic. WHAT CHANGED AND WHY: the prior draft took ~55% of real_cost and, worse, built its band from predecessor listings without correcting for their mileage, then subtracted a large unspecified PHEV penalty. The PHEV penalty applied here is deliberately SMALL at year 5 — 2.5 points, giving 59.5% of list — because at this age the 18.1 kWh traction battery is still comfortably inside its verified 8年/160,000公里 cover, so the specific risk Taiwanese buyers discount has not yet materialised, and because three independent local data sets show PHEVs at or above parity with their non-plug-in siblings at this age: (a) this record's own year-1 finding (450h+ 79.0% of list vs RX 350h 豪華版 77.7%); (b) Volvo XC60 T8 vs B5 on 8891 today — T8 Inscription 2020款 6.3萬km 1,188,000 and T8 Recharge Inscription 2021款 8.0萬km 1,180,000, against B5 R-Design 2020款 7.0萬km 985,000 and 2021款 8.0萬km 985,000, i.e. the plug-in asks ~200,000 MORE at the same age and comparable mileage; (c) Volvo XC90 T8 vs B5 on 8891 today — 2023款 T8 Recharge Ultimate 3.2萬km 2,398,000 against 2023款 B5 Ultimate 2.3萬km 2,050,000, plug-in higher again despite more mileage. A 12-point Taiwan PHEV penalty is not observable in any of these. 3,150,000 x 0.595 = 車商售價 ~1,875,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: 1,875,000 -12% = 自售價 1,650,000; 自售價 -13% = 車商收購價 1,435,000. SHAPE NOTE, STATED HONESTLY: the implied depreciation rate between years 3 and 5 is shallower than between years 1 and 3. That is defensible for this specific car — it still carries 4年/120,000公里 plus the earned 5th year, so a 5-year-old example sells right at the edge of factory cover and the cliff falls just after this checkpoint, not before it — but part of it is also an artefact of year 3 being held at the low end of its band (see that checkpoint). Confidence stays low: the predecessor is a conventional hybrid, not a PHEV, so it cannot itself measure the plug-in discount."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"RAISED THIS PASS from 1,180,000/1,025,000 — same objection, same method as year 5. EXTRAPOLATED; no 7-year-old 450h+ exists anywhere. The predecessor 4th-gen RX450h curve is anchored on the re-verified 5-year point above (~50% of list mileage-matched) and on the re-verified 9-10 year points below (~34.5% mileage-matched), which interpolates to ~42-43% dealer-asking retention for the predecessor at 7 years and 49,000 km. Applying the same 5th-gen uplift used at year 5 (current generation, 13,010/yr lower road tax) puts a 5th-gen HEV near the sibling RX 350h record's 50.5% of list. The PHEV discount is widened here to 2 points more than at year 5, giving 48.5% of list, for a reason that is specific and dated rather than a general 'thin PHEV demand' hand-wave: at year 7 the 18.1 kWh traction battery is one year from the end of its verified 8年/160,000公里 cover (lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx: 五年內或行駛100,000公里 factory + 和泰追加三年或60,000公里), and a buyer at this point is knowingly buying the last year of it. WHAT WAS WRONG BEFORE: the prior draft used 42% of real_cost, built by interpolating between a 5-year point that was itself too low and a 10-year point anchored on a single high-mileage listing (see year 10). Correcting both ends moves this point up with them. 3,150,000 x 0.485 = 車商售價 ~1,530,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: 1,530,000 -12.5% = 自售價 1,340,000; 自售價 -13.5% = 車商收購價 1,160,000; the private-to-trade-in gap is widened slightly from the year-5 step because dealers price in longer lot time as cars age."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"RAISED THIS PASS from 758,000/660,000. This is where the prior draft was most clearly wrong, and re-research identified the specific error: IT ANCHORED ON A SINGLE HIGH-MILEAGE LISTING AND CREDITED ONLY ~6 POINTS FOR MILEAGE. The prior anchor was a FindCar 2016年式 RX450h at 798,000 whose mileage is not published; the same FindCar page (re-fetched 2026-08-11) shows its neighbours are 2014年式 98,000 km at 458,000 and 2012年式 160,000 km at 298,000, i.e. that 798,000 car sits inside a high-mileage, bottom-of-market cohort. Fresh 8891 evidence re-fetched today makes the mileage problem explicit: EVERY 9-10 year-old 4th-gen RX450h currently listed carries 129,000-198,400 km — 2017款 旗艦版 12.9萬km at 928,000, 2017款 旗艦版 17.3萬km at 750,000, 2017款 標準版 19.84萬km at 688,000. There is no low-mileage 10-year comparable on the market at all, so the raw asking prices describe a car with two to three times our 70,000 km and cannot be used without a large upward correction. TWO INDEPENDENT METHODS SIZE THAT CORRECTION AND AGREE. (1) Intra-cohort mileage gradient: the matched 2017 旗艦版 pair differ by 44,000 km and 178,000 NTD (750,000 vs 928,000), i.e. ~4,050 NTD per 1,000 km; extending from 129,000 km down to 70,000 km at even half that gradient gives ~1,050,000 and at the full gradient ~1,167,000. (2) The sibling RX 350h record's independently verified abc好車網 anchors for the same predecessor generation on the same date — 2016 RX450h 旗艦版 at 1,188,000 and 2016 RX450h 頂級版 at 1,288,000 — land in the same place, and that record explicitly treats the FindCar 798,000 as the worn end of the spread rather than the anchor. A mileage-matched 10-year predecessor is therefore ~1,150,000-1,250,000, or ~34.5% of the 旗艦版's 3,440,000 list, NOT the 26.6% the prior draft used. Applying the year-5 uplift for the 5th gen puts a 5th-gen HEV near the sibling record's 37.5% of list, and the PHEV discount is widened to its maximum here — 4.5 points, giving 33% of list — because by year 10 the traction battery is TWO years outside its 8年/160,000公里 cover and Taiwan buyers discount that risk hard. That is a real and deliberately larger penalty than at years 5 and 7; what it is not is the ~12-point collapse the prior draft implied, which would have put a 3,150,000 Lexus below a 1,398,000 VW Tiguan at the same age with no local evidence offered for it. 3,150,000 x 0.33 = 車商售價 ~1,040,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: 1,040,000 -12% = 自售價 915,000; 自售價 -16% = 車商收購價 770,000; the gap is widest here because a 10-year-old PHEV ties up a dealer's floor for months. REMAINING CAVEATS: the 4th-gen RX450h's ORIGINAL 2015/2016 launch prices could not be verified (8891's RX450h tag page, re-fetched today, confirms only the late-run 314萬起 豪華版 and 344萬 旗艦版, and the 頂級版 ~3,290,000 used above is interpolated between them), so every ratio here moves proportionally with that denominator; and the year 9-10 battery risk is priced as a discount to the whole car, not as a costed repair, because no Taiwan replacement-cost data for this pack exists yet. Treat as an order-of-magnitude estimate, not a forecast."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"NOT DISPUTED IN REVIEW — unchanged. Lexus Taiwan official schedule (lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx: 6個月/1萬km 16-item, 12個月/2萬km 29-item) applied on the 6-month calendar, priced with owner-reported receipts from Mobile01 (NT$3,750-5,000 for a routine 原廠 oil service; NT$6,000-9,000 for the annual filter service). Covers 0-1 year, two visits, with the RX-class parts premium applied. Warranty terms verified on lexus.com.tw/service_warranty.aspx (4年或120,000公里; 例行性保養之工資 and consumables explicitly NOT covered)."},{"y":3,"source":"NOT DISPUTED IN REVIEW — unchanged. Covers years 1-3, four calendar-driven visits (18, 24, 30, 36 months). Levels from the verified Lexus TW 定期保養 table — note the 24個月/40,000公里 brake-fluid service is triggered by the CALENDAR here (24 months) even though the car has only 14,000 km on the clock. Costs from Mobile01/PTT owner receipts, with the 24-month visit at NT$12,000. Extended-warranty qualification rule from lexus.com.tw/news_detail.aspx?nw=563 (8 consecutive on-time services → free 5th year / +20,000 km)."},{"y":5,"source":"NOT DISPUTED IN REVIEW — unchanged. Covers years 3-5, four visits at 42/48/54/60 months. The 48個月 service includes 自排變速箱油更換, calendar-triggered at 28,000 km (48 months at 7,000 km/yr). Scheduled portion ~35,500. The two big non-scheduled items dominate and are why this is the most expensive window before year 10: tyres are AGE-expired at ~5 years despite only 35,000 km, priced from PTT owner receipts (NT$6,800-7,000 per tyre for the OE-class 19-inch fitment, x4 plus fitting and alignment), and the 12V auxiliary battery from the same thread (NT$8,700 reported; rounded to 10,000 for the RX's larger AGM unit)."},{"y":7,"source":"NOT DISPUTED IN REVIEW — unchanged. Covers years 5-7, the first fully out-of-warranty window (new-car 4年/120,000公里 plus the earned 5th year both expire before this period ends). Scheduled portion ~28,500 from the verified Lexus TW table at 66/72/78/84 months. Brake pads priced from PTT owner receipts for Lexus 原廠 front pads including labour; timing pushed to year 6-7 rather than the usual 4-5 because regenerative braking on the PHEV does most of the deceleration and 49,000 km is very low. A 6,000 unscheduled-repair provision covers two full years outside warranty on a complex PHEV. Deliberately EXCLUDED: spark plugs (100,000 km, car is at 49,000). German-car risk items (air suspension, water pump, coil packs) do not apply — the RX 450h+ has conventional steel-spring suspension and a Toyota 2.5L Atkinson engine with a strong Taiwan reliability record."},{"y":10,"source":"NOT DISPUTED IN REVIEW — unchanged. Covers years 7-10, three years and six calendar-driven visits, including the 自排變速箱油 change at the 96個月 大保 (56,000 km). Scheduled portion held at ~44,000 rather than the ~52,000 the 6-month table implies, on the realistic assumption that an out-of-warranty owner stretches some visits toward annual — Mobile01/PTT threads show exactly this behaviour once warranty lapses. Tyre set #2 and 12V battery #2 repeat the year-5 pricing (both age-driven at ~5-year intervals). Brake discs and rear pads priced from PTT receipts showing NT$30,000-class visits that bundled discs, tyres and battery. Age-related sundries are a judgement allowance, not a sourced figure. IMPORTANT CAVEAT: the 18.1 kWh traction battery leaves its 8年/160,000公里 warranty (verified on lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx) at year 8, so years 9-10 carry an uncosted tail risk of a six-figure NTD pack repair. No probability-weighted number was added because no Taiwan replacement-cost data for this pack exists yet — the single biggest reason this period is low confidence. Note that this same risk IS priced on the value side, as the widened PHEV discount in the year-10 residual."}],"sources":[{"name":"PTT car 板 — [菜單] 正25年式25年出廠的Rx450h+旗艦版","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1745186843.A.277.html","note":"NEW THIS PASS, AND THE BASIS FOR CHANGING discounts FROM 0 TO 150,000. Fetched and read in full 2026-08-11. Real RX 450h+ deal sheet posted 2025-04-21: 車價 355萬, 現金折讓 -15萬, 3M MA 隔熱紙 +2.1萬, 原廠鍍膜 +1.3萬, 總計 343.4萬 不含領牌稅金 — arithmetic self-consistent (3,550,000-150,000+21,000+13,000=3,434,000). Replies call 150,000 a small discount for this car and expect ~100,000 more in a 競賽月, so 150,000 is the conservative end. Also corroborates onroad_fees: 34,000 of accessories paid on top, 領牌稅金 billed separately."},{"name":"8891 新車 — 2026年式Lexus RX國內上架！細節微調、售價不變！","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/lexus/rx/20732","note":"PRIMARY LIST-PRICE SOURCE, re-fetched and re-read line by line 2026-08-11. Full 2026 model-year Taiwan RX price table, published 2025-09-17; RX 450h+ 豪華版 = 3,150,000, 旗艦版 = 3,550,000, RX 350h 豪華版 = 2,560,000. Article states 售價維持不變 for the 2026 model year."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — RX 車型官網頁","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/models/rx","note":"Official brand site. Shows the RX range as NT$246萬~361萬, whose endpoints match the 8891 table exactly. Does not break out individual trim prices, which is why the 8891 table is the primary citation."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX 二手車 listings 第1頁（價格高至低）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx?page=1&sort=price-desc","note":"PRIMARY USED-PRICE SOURCE for year 1, re-fetched 2026-08-11. RX450h+ 豪華版: 2025款 1.0萬km 2,488,000; 2024款 1.3萬km 2,488,000; 2024款 1.3萬km 2,488,000. RX350h 豪華版 comparison set: 2026款 0.6萬km 2,288,000; 2024款 2.4萬km 1,988,000; 2024款 3.7萬km 1,988,000. Establishes PHEV-vs-HEV parity at 1-2 years (79.0% vs 77.7% of list). All figures are 車商售價 and were discounted 12% then 13% before use."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX450h 車型頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx450h?sort=price-desc","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-11. Returns only the same three RX450h+ 豪華版 cars at 2,488,000, confirming that is the entire national supply and that the identical price across two model years is a 刊登價 anchor rather than a per-car curve."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX listings 第2頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx?page=2&sort=price-desc","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-11. Year-3 anchors: RX350h 豪華版 2023款 4.02萬km 1,758,000 and two 2023款 4.9萬km 1,739,000. Predecessor 5-year anchor: 2021款 RX450h 頂級版 6.0萬km at 1,468,000 (44.6% of a ~3,290,000 list; note the trim is 頂級版, corrected from the prior draft which recorded it as 旗艦版)."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX listings 第4頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx?page=4&sort=price-desc","note":"NEW THIS PASS, fetched 2026-08-11. Key 9-year predecessor anchor: 2017款 RX450h 旗艦版 12.9萬km at 928,000. This is the highest-priced genuinely old RX450h on the market and it still carries 129,000 km — the observation that drove the year-10 correction."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX listings 第5頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx?page=5&sort=price-desc","note":"NEW THIS PASS, fetched 2026-08-11. Second 9-year predecessor anchor: 2017款 RX450h 旗艦版 17.3萬km at 750,000. Paired with the 12.9萬km/928,000 car on page 4 it gives the intra-cohort mileage gradient (~4,050 NTD per 1,000 km) used to mileage-correct the year-10 estimate."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX listings 第6頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx?page=6&sort=price-desc","note":"NEW THIS PASS, fetched 2026-08-11. Third 9-year predecessor anchor: 2017款 RX450h 標準版 19.84萬km at 688,000. Confirms that every 9-10 year-old RX450h in the market is a 129,000-198,400 km car, so none of them is a like-for-like comparable for a 70,000 km example."},{"name":"abc好車網 — Lexus RX 450h 頂級版 2021年","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2130376","note":"PREDECESSOR 5-YEAR ANCHOR, re-fetched 2026-08-11 and confirmed at 1,728,000 (名利精選車商) — ~52.5% of the 4th-gen 頂級版 ~3,290,000 list. Mileage is not published, which is the main limit on this point. Upper bound of the 5-year retention bracket."},{"name":"abc好車網 — Lexus RX 450h 頂級版 2022年 (LEXUS CPO/桃園)","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2146839","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-11 and confirmed at 1,998,000 at ~4 years (60.7% of list) — CPO retail, the top tier of dealer asking. Brackets the 4-to-5-year segment of the predecessor curve from above."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — Lexus RX450H 中古車 listings","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&b=38&m=1117","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-11. Shows 2016年式 RX450h at 798,000 (mileage not published), 2014年式 98,000 km at 458,000, 2012年式 160,000 km at 298,000, 2011年式 528,000, 2009年式 100,000 km at 328,000. DEMOTED THIS PASS from the year-10 anchor to a bottom-of-market data point: its neighbours are all high-mileage cars and the 798,000 figure is far below 8891's 2017款 RX450h at 928,000/129,000 km, so it describes the worn end of the spread rather than a low-mileage example. The 年式 may also be a registration year, in which case the car could be a 3rd-gen AL10."},{"name":"8891 — Lexus RX450h 價格 tag 頁","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/article/tag/Lexus-rx450h-%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-11: confirms 4th-gen RX450h 314萬起 (豪華版) and 旗艦版 344萬 (late-run list), and does NOT give a 頂級版 figure or the 2015/2016 launch prices. The ~3,290,000 頂級版 denominator used in the 5-year extrapolation is therefore interpolated between the two verified trims, and every predecessor ratio moves proportionally with it."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Volvo XC60 listings 第2頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/volvo/xc60?sort=price-desc&page=2","note":"NEW THIS PASS, fetched 2026-08-11. LOCAL PHEV-VS-NON-PHEV EVIDENCE at 5-6 years: T8 Inscription 2020款 6.3萬km 1,188,000; T8 Recharge Inscription 2021款 8.0萬km 1,180,000; T8 Recharge Inscription 2021款 14.7萬km 998,000; T8 PLUS 2022款 10.9萬km 1,230,000. Used to size the PHEV discount at years 5-10."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Volvo XC60 listings 第3頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/volvo/xc60?sort=price-desc&page=3","note":"NEW THIS PASS, fetched 2026-08-11. The non-plug-in side of the same comparison: B5 R-Design 2020款 7.0萬km 985,000; 2021款 8.0萬km 985,000; 2020款 9.0萬km 958,000; T6 Inscription 2019款 8.0萬km 948,000. At the same age and comparable mileage the plug-in T8 asks ~200,000 MORE than the B5, which is why a double-digit Taiwan PHEV penalty was rejected."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Volvo XC90 listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/volvo/xc90?sort=price-desc","note":"NEW THIS PASS, fetched 2026-08-11. Second local PHEV-vs-non-PHEV pair, large luxury SUV class: 2023款 T8 Recharge Ultimate 3.2萬km 2,398,000 against 2023款 B5 Ultimate 2.3萬km 2,050,000 — the plug-in asks more despite more mileage. Corroborates the XC60 finding."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 新車保證 / 保固條款","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service_warranty.aspx","note":"Exact wording 自交車日起4年或行駛120,000公里(以先到者為準). Explicitly excludes 例行性保養之工資 and consumables (皮帶、雨刷片、燈泡、保險絲、煞車來令片…) — the basis for treating this as a no-free-maintenance brand."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 新車準時保養愛車享延長保證方案","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/news_detail.aspx?nw=563","note":"8 consecutive on-time services with the official 定保套餐 → free 5th year / +20,000 km warranty. Drives the assumption of 2 paid visits/year through year 5, and supports the year-5 residual (the car is still inside factory cover at that checkpoint)."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 定期保養計畫表","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"Official schedule: 6個月/1萬公里 (16 items), 12個月/2萬km (29), 24個月/4萬km (34, brake fluid), 48個月/8萬km (37, coolant AND 自排變速箱油更換). Spark plug note reads 一般車、油電車每10萬公里更換 — never reached in this window."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 車主權益 / HV 電池保固","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx","note":"Exact wording confirmed: HV 電池保證期限為自交車日起五年內或行駛100,000公里以內，總代理和泰汽車追加三年或60,000公里，總計自交車日起八年或160,000公里. Sets the year-8 boundary that justifies a PHEV discount that WIDENS with age (small at year 5, largest at year 10) rather than a flat penalty."},{"name":"風傳媒 風生活 — Lexus NX 養車成本（含 NX 450h+ 豪華版）","url":"https://www.storm.mg/lifestyle/11068074","note":"Cross-check for scheduled-maintenance magnitude on the same 2.5L PHEV architecture: NT$64,350 of factory scheduled maintenance over 10 visits / 100,000 km, and confirms the 每半年或1萬公里 rule. This model's 10-year total runs higher because the 6-month calendar produces roughly twice as many visits at 7,000 km/yr."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — Lexus 原廠保養費用討論（含實際工單）","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1725460760.A.02F.html","note":"Owner receipts used for part pricing: 12V battery NT$8,700, tyres NT$6,800-7,000 each, and NT$30,000-class visits when discs/tyres/water pump were bundled. Also documents heavy dealer upselling, the main upside risk on every period_cost here."},{"name":"Mobile01 — 請問LEXUS原廠保養費用 / LEXUS 半年保 價格貴?","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=346&t=6919545","note":"Owner-reported Lexus TW service pricing: routine 原廠 oil service NT$3,750-5,000, semi-annual services NT$5,000-10,000 depending on items accepted. Direct fetch returns 403; figures come from the indexed search summary, so treat as corroborating rather than primary."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 正式售價245萬元起至360萬元，Lexus大改款RX車系國內發表上市","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/73085","note":"Establishes the 5th-gen RX (including the 450h+ PHEV) Taiwan launch of late November 2022 — the fact that makes 5/7/10-year checkpoints impossible to source directly and forces predecessor extrapolation. Direct fetch returns 403; content read via indexed search summary only."}]},"lexus-lm350h-7seat":{"assumptions":"Taiwan market, private (non-commercial) owner driving 6,000-8,000 km/year; every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7000/21000/35000/49000/70000). That is roughly half the TW average (~12,000-15,000 km/yr), which matters twice. (1) Lexus Taiwan's published schedule is tier-based on 6個月/10,000公里 -> 12個月/20,000公里 -> 24個月/40,000公里 -> 48個月/80,000公里, 先到者為準 (verified on lexus.com.tw). At 7,000 km/yr the km trigger NEVER binds, so the schedule is entirely TIME-driven: two shop visits every year, and the mileage-coded items (變速箱油 at the 48個月/80,000公里 tier, spark plugs) arrive on age rather than wear. (2) The used-car pools are mileage-contaminated in opposite directions: the current-gen 350h 七人座 listings on 8891 cluster at 35,000 km, and the predecessor LM300h 七人座 pool is dominated by commercial VIP-shuttle cars at 49,000-160,000 km. Every resale figure below therefore carries an EXPLICIT low-mileage premium over the raw listing, quantified in each source string rather than asserted. Vehicle licence tax (牌照稅), fuel tax (燃料費) and insurance are excluded from every figure by design.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"high","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"RETAINED after independent verification. I re-read 8891 myself on 2026-08-11 (both m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=24&model=17248 and auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/lm) and the anchor listing is real and is almost exactly this buyer profile: 「Lexus LM 2026款 350h 7人座｜6,600公里｜399萬」 — ~1 year old at 6,600 km vs our assumed 7,000 km. That 3,990,000 is 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking), not what an owner receives. PRIVATE-SALE ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private = dealer retail -10% = 3,591,000, rounded to 3,600,000. The shallow end of the 8-15% band is used deliberately because LM demand in TW is strong enough that private sellers transact close to dealer asking. dealer trade-in (車商收購價) = private -11.1% = 3,200,000. Two higher-mileage listings on the same page corroborate the level and confirm this is the low-mileage end of the pool, exactly as the brief requires: 2025款 350h 7人座 / 35,000 km / 375.8萬 and 2024款 350h 7人座 / 35,600 km / 379.8萬."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"CORRECTED UPWARD from the researcher's 3,220,000 / 2,850,000. Two defects were found. (a) Their stated anchor — 'a 2024款 350h 7人座 with only 5,298 km asking 378萬' — could NOT be reproduced when I re-read the same page (auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/lm) on 2026-08-11; the 2024款 350h 7人座 I can actually see is 35,600 km at 379.8萬. That anchor is treated as unverified and is not used. (b) They drew a straight line through mileage-blind listings and never applied the low-mileage premium the brief mandates, even though this checkpoint's 21,000 km is far below the 35,000 km at which the real listings sit. Rebuilt from the three VERIFIED current-gen 350h 七人座 listings: 1y/6,600 km = 399萬; ~2y/35,600 km = 379.8萬; ~1.5y/35,000 km = 375.8萬. The 2024款 asking MORE than the 2025款 at equal mileage shows age is nearly flat across that span and the 399萬-vs-378萬 gap is driven mostly by MILEAGE (~28,400 km apart). Taking the conservative half of that mileage coefficient and a -4%/yr age term gives ~370萬 dealer retail for a 3-year car at 21,000 km. PRIVATE-SALE ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private = 3,700,000 -10% = 3,330,000; dealer trade-in = private -12% = 2,930,000. Note the reconciliation with the brief's '3-year retention 80%+ is real for LM/Alphard': at DEALER-RETAIL level this is 3,700,000/4,335,000 = 85%, comfortably above 80%; the private-sale figure lands at 77% only because the mandated private haircut is applied on top. No direct 3-year 七人座 listing exists, hence medium."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no 5-year data exists for the current generation (2nd-gen LM went on sale in TW Aug-2023, max real age ~3.0 years). Predecessor method per the brief. CORRECTED: the researcher used 367萬 as the LM300h 七人座 list price, an unverified 'launch price' figure; the only price I can verify on their own cited source (c.8891.com.tw/feature/1603, read 2026-08-11) is LM300h 七人座 372萬 / 四人座 520萬, so 372萬 is used as the denominator. They also silently rounded 2,660,000 down to 2,600,000, an unexplained extra -2.2% on top of the stated method; that is removed. Predecessor data re-verified by me on 8891: 2021款 300h 7人座 / 49,000 km / 218萬, with the rest of the 7-seat pool at 199.8萬 (85,600 km), 229.8萬 (77,000 km, 2022款), 215.8萬 (110,000 km, 2023款) and 188萬 (160,000 km). Closest comparable is 49,000 km against our 35,000 km, so a +15% low-mileage/private-owner premium is applied (cross-checked: the current-gen mileage coefficient, scaled down to a 220萬 car, implies ~+16% for 14,000 fewer km — so +15% is calibrated, not arbitrary): 218萬 -> ~250萬 dealer-retail equivalent = 250/372 = 67.2% of the predecessor's list. Applied to real_cost 4,335,000 -> 2,913,000 retail-equivalent. PRIVATE-SALE ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private = -10% = 2,620,000; dealer trade-in = private -11.5% = 2,320,000. Caveat stated plainly: the 1st-gen LM pool in TW is heavily commercial-shuttle stock and the 1st gen was the weaker, more niche product, so this base probably UNDERSTATES a genuinely low-mileage private 2nd-gen car — the current gen is running at only ~-5%/yr through year 2.5, far flatter than this ratio implies."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, and weaker than the 5-year figure — no LM of ANY generation is 7 years old in Taiwan yet (1st gen arrived in 2020, so the oldest cars on the market are ~6.5 years). Built by extending the corrected predecessor-derived curve at roughly -8%/yr of dealer retail from the 5-year retail-equivalent: 2,913,000 * 0.92^2 = ~2,460,000 retail-equivalent. PRIVATE-SALE ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private = -10% = 2,210,000; dealer trade-in = private -11.5% = 1,960,000. Recomputed off the corrected 372萬 denominator and 4,335,000 real_cost, so it differs from the researcher's 2,260,000 / 2,000,000. Directional support only from the oldest real LM300h 七人座 listings on abc好車網 (2020年式 asking 312萬, verified to exist as a live listing) — that sits far above 8891's live market for comparable cars (188-230萬) and is treated as a probable stale posting, not as evidence. See issues: this conflict is the largest single uncertainty in the record."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED with the least support of any checkpoint — the LM nameplate does not exist at 10 years old in Taiwan in either generation. Two-step method. (1) Continued the corrected predecessor-derived retail curve at -8%/yr: 2,460,000 * 0.92^3 = ~1,920,000 retail-equivalent (~44% of real_cost). (2) Absolute-level sanity check against the closest real 10-year luxury MPV in the same showroom family, Toyota Alphard 3rd gen 3.5 Executive Lounge, which I re-read on 8891 myself (auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/alphard, 2026-08-11): 2016年式 / 110,000 km / 138.0萬; 2017年式 / 101,100 km / 133.8萬; 2017年式 / 85,000 km / 136.8萬; 2015年式 / 120,000 km / 126.8萬; 2015年式 3.5 / 200,000 km / 119.8萬 — all dealer retail, all confirming the researcher's citation exactly. Our LM at 10 years carries only 70,000 km and started ~50% more expensive, so a retail-equivalent ~39% above those Alphard figures is coherent. PRIVATE-SALE ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private = retail-equivalent -12% = 1,690,000 (wider haircut than earlier years because price dispersion widens on old cars); dealer trade-in = private -12% = 1,490,000. Nothing here is a direct observation of a 10-year LM — treat as a modelled floor, not a quote. Note the Alphard cross-check arguably makes this conservative: those Alphards are holding ~50% of their original list at 10 years, above the ~44% modelled here."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Interval and tier content verified directly on the official Lexus Taiwan 定期保養 page (lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx); that page publishes NO prices, so pricing is scaled from Taiwanese Lexus owner reports of 半年保 costs on ES/NX/UX up to flagship-MPV level. Two paid visits in year one: ~7,000 + ~13,000 = 20,000. Covers 0-1y."},{"y":3,"source":"Cost SINCE the 1-year checkpoint (covers 1-3y), not cumulative. Four visits at the official 6-month cadence at ~7,000/13,000 alternating = 40,000, plus ~8,000 for the 24個月 tier 煞車油, 冷氣濾網 and wipers. The 24個月 tier is reached on TIME (month 24) not on km — 21,000 km is only half the tier's 40,000 km trigger. Pricing scaled from owner-reported Lexus TW 定保 costs, not an LM receipt."},{"y":5,"source":"Cost SINCE the 3-year checkpoint (covers 3-5y). CORRECTED from the researcher's 95,000, and the 變速箱油 item was moved here from their 7-year window: the official table codes 變速箱油更換 to the 48個月/80,000公里 tier, and at 7,000 km/yr that tier lands on month 48 = year 4, which falls inside THIS window, not 5-7y. Build-up: 4 定保 = 40,000; 48個月 tier extras (煞車油, 空氣濾網, 油電動力控制冷卻系統) = 6,000; 變速箱油／eCVT 傳動油 = 6,000; first tyre set 225/55R19 x4 + alignment = 36,000; 12V battery = 8,000; small out-of-warranty contingency for the final year = 5,000. Warranty lapses at year 4 here, so year 5 is the first year with any own-cost repair exposure — kept modest given Toyota/Lexus hybrid reliability."},{"y":7,"source":"Cost SINCE the 5-year checkpoint (covers 5-7y). CORRECTED from the researcher's 90,000, which was LOWER than their own 5-year figure and broke the 'generally rises with age' requirement. The fix is substantive, not cosmetic: the 3-5y window still had one year of 新車保固 cover, whereas 5-7y is the FIRST window entirely outside it, so a real out-of-warranty contingency belongs here — 20,000 over two years on a 400萬-class MPV is modest. Build-up: 4 定保 = 40,000; brakes = 25,000; sliding-door mechanism = 15,000; filters/wipers = 5,000; out-of-warranty contingency = 20,000. The eCVT/變速箱油 item the researcher placed here was moved to the 5-year window (48個月 tier = year 4). Hybrid battery coverage (5年/100,000公里 + Hotai's added 3年/60,000公里 = 8年/160,000公里, verified on lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx) is why no battery reserve appears in this window — it does not lapse until after year 8, and at 49,000 km the km limit is nowhere near."},{"y":10,"source":"Cost SINCE the 7-year checkpoint (covers 7-10y — a THREE-year window, hence the larger figure). Build-up: 6 定保 = 60,000; 96個月 變速箱油 = 6,000; tyres 36,000; 12V battery 8,000; coolants 12,000; spark plugs 10,000; suspension/bushings 25,000; hybrid cooling service 5,000; ageing-electronics + post-warranty battery contingency 10,000 = 172,000, rounded to 170,000. Note this is a hybrid, so there is no timing belt, no turbo, and the 七人座 is the entry grade with conventional (non-air) suspension — the German out-of-warranty risk items do not apply. The corresponding LM risk is the hybrid main battery, whose 8年/160,000公里 warranty expires inside this window."}],"sources":[{"name":"LEXUS TAIWAN — 車款/價格索引","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/models/lm","note":"Official brand site, read 2026-08-11 in this audit. Shows the LM range as NT$429~596萬 across 500h/350h — independently establishing 429萬 as the floor of the range, i.e. the 350h 七人座. Does not break out per-trim pricing on this view."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車 — 2026 Lexus LM 350h 七人座 車款介紹","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/lexus-lm-2026-350h%E4%B8%83%E4%BA%BA%E5%BA%A7","note":"Re-verified 2026-08-11. Full MY2026 TW price table: 350h 七人座 429萬, 500h 六人座 459萬, 350h 四人座 566萬, 500h 四人座 596萬."},{"name":"KingAutos — Lexus LM 車款總覽","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/lm","note":"Re-verified 2026-08-11. States 350h 7人座 NT$4,290,000 explicitly, plus the spec used for maintenance costing: 225/55R19 on 19-inch alloys, 2,487cc NA hybrid, 190hp engine + 54hp motor = 250hp combined, 四輪驅動, 7 seats."},{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點 — Lexus LM 350h AWD 七人座 試駕","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/95304","note":"Re-verified 2026-08-11. Third independent confirmation of 429萬起, of AWD E-Four on this trim, and of the 19-inch / 225/55R19 wheel-tyre package."},{"name":"SiCAR 愛車酷 — Lexus LM 2026年式小幅調整，四人座車型價格上修","url":"https://sicar.com.tw/release/article/c29f4907-7c03-11f0-a2fa-42010a8c001a","note":"Re-verified 2026-08-11 by direct read. Confirms LM350h 七人座 429萬 and 500h 六人座 459萬 for MY2026, with only the two 四人座 trims up NT$10,000. The researcher's reported automated mis-read (429 assigned to the 500h 六人座) is NOT present in the page itself — the page is correct; the mis-read was a summarisation artefact."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus LM 現行車源列表（行動版）","url":"https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=24&model=17248","note":"Core used-car dataset, independently re-read row-by-row in this audit on 2026-08-11. Current-gen 7-seat confirmed: 2026款 350h 7人座 6,600km 399萬; 2025款 350h 7人座 35,000km 375.8萬; 2024款 350h 7人座 35,600km 379.8萬. Predecessor 7-seat confirmed: 2021款 300h 49,000km 218萬; 2021款 85,600km 199.8萬; 2022款 77,000km 229.8萬; 2023款 110,000km 215.8萬; 160,000km 188萬. All are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking) and are discounted to private-sale and trade-in figures as described in each checkpoint."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus LM 車源索引（桌面版）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/lm","note":"Desktop index for the same pool (72 cars listed). Re-read 2026-08-11 and corroborates the mobile figures. IMPORTANT NEGATIVE FINDING: the researcher cited a '2024款 350h 七人座 總代理車 with 5,298 km asking 378.0萬' from this page as the anchor for their 3-year interpolation; that listing did NOT appear in my read, which shows the 2024款 350h 7人座 at 35,600 km / 379.8萬. Treated as unverified and excluded. No published 行情 table on the page."},{"name":"8891 汽車 — 第一代 Lexus LM 價格頁","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/feature/1603","note":"Predecessor-generation list prices used as the retention-ratio denominator. Re-read 2026-08-11: LM300h 七人座 372萬, 四人座 520萬. CORRECTION: the researcher used 367萬 ('Jan-2020 launch price'), which this page does not support and which I could not verify elsewhere; 372萬 is used instead."},{"name":"abc好車網 — LEXUS LM 300h 七人座 2020年 中古車 312萬（群悅汽車）","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2112308","note":"Verified to be a live listing on 2026-08-11: 2020 LM300h 7-seat, 312萬 asking. Oldest-available predecessor data point (~6.5 years). Used ONLY as soft directional context for the 7-year checkpoint — it sits far above 8891's live market for comparable cars (188-230萬), so it is likely a stale posting and is not used as evidence."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Toyota Alphard 現行車源（10年車齡對照組）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/alphard","note":"Absolute-level sanity check for the 10-year checkpoint, since no 10-year LM exists in Taiwan. Independently re-read 2026-08-11 and matches the researcher's citation exactly. Alphard 3rd gen 3.5 Executive Lounge dealer retail: 2016年 110,000km 138.0萬; 2017年 101,100km 133.8萬; 2017年 85,000km 136.8萬; 2015年 120,000km 126.8萬; 2015年 3.5 200,000km 119.8萬."},{"name":"LEXUS TAIWAN — 定期保養計畫","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"Official scheduled-maintenance table, read directly on 2026-08-11. Confirms the tier structure: 滿月 (free, 24 points) / 6個月-10,000公里 (16 points, oil) / 12個月-20,000公里 (29 points) / 24個月-40,000公里 (34 points, 煞車油) / 48個月-80,000公里 (37 points, 變速箱油), 先到者為準. NO prices are published — this is why every maintenance NT$ figure in this record is scaled rather than observed."},{"name":"LEXUS TAIWAN — 車主權益（保固）","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx","note":"Read directly on 2026-08-11. Confirms 新車保固 四年或十二萬公里; HV 電池 五年/100,000公里 plus Hotai-added 三年/60,000公里 = 8年/160,000公里; 自費更換正廠零件 2年/50,000公里; 延長保證 available. Confirms Lexus TW bundles no free scheduled maintenance beyond the 滿月 check."},{"name":"Mobile01 — LEXUS 原廠保養費用（車主實際費用討論串）","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=346&t=6919545","note":"Owner-reported Lexus TW 定保 costs used as the scaling base: ES200 半年保 5,000-10,000; NX200 基本定保含工資 6,900, 12,000 with extras; UX hybrid 3,000 first service then 6,000. HONESTY NOTE, carried over and NOT independently re-verified in this audit: mobile01 returns HTTP 403 to direct fetch, the figures came from search-result excerpts, and none of them is an LM. Every maintenance NT$ figure in this record is therefore scaled, not observed."}]},"vw-tiguan-280-etsi-elegance":{"assumptions":"Owner drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, far below the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year. All checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). Powertrain is recorded as \"gasoline\" per the schema enum: the 280 eTSI is a 1.5 TSI evo2 + 48V mild hybrid (BSG belt starter-generator, small 48V pack) rated 150 ps / 250 Nm, official 16.0 km/L. A mild hybrid cannot drive on electricity alone, so it takes the identical oil/filter/spark-plug service as a plain petrol car; the only extra long-term risk item is the 48V BSG and its DC/DC converter. Do not apply a hybrid maintenance discount. Vehicle is the 3rd-generation Tiguan, Taiwan launch 2025-06-12; the 26年式 (MY26) update was announced 2026-01-09. Because the generation is only ~14 months old in Taiwan, no genuine 3/5/7/10-year data exists for it; those checkpoints are extrapolated from the 2nd-generation Tiguan (and at 10 years the 1st generation), expressed as a retention ratio of that car's own original list price. WARRANTY (verified 2026-08-11 on vw.com.tw): VW Taiwan's standard new-car warranty is 2 years with no mileage limit, plus extended coverage running months 25-48 — i.e. cover ends at 4 years, NOT 5. The optional paid Give Me Five+ package is what pushes warranty to year 5; it is not modelled here. Tax (牌照稅/燃料稅/貨物稅) and insurance are excluded by design throughout — this means the NT$50,000 舊換新貨物稅減免 that appears on real dealer menus is deliberately NOT counted as a discount.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"VERIFIED AND RETAINED. 8891 中古車 current-generation listings (auto.8891.com.tw/volkswagen/tiguan, re-read 2026-08-11): a 2026 280 eTSI Elegance with 161 km at 車商售價 1,159,000 (領牌/展示車), and 2025 280 eTSI Elegance Premium cars at 車商售價 1,058,000-1,075,000 with ~18,000 km = 70-71% of that trim's 1,508,000 list. Cross-check on the closest same-generation comparable: that Premium at 1,075,000 dealer retail, less 11% to reach private sale = 957,000, is 63.4% of its own 1,508,000 list; applying 63.4% to this car's 1,398,000 gives 886,000 at ~18,000 km, then +5% because 7,000 km is roughly half the mileage a normal 1-year-old carries -> 930,000. The 920,000 figure is within 1% of that independent derivation, so it stands. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: 車商售價 (dealer retail asking) ~1,035,000 -> private_sale_price 920,000 (-11%) -> dealer_tradein_price 800,000 (-13% off private). One listing at 859,000 / ~30,400 km was set aside; note the researcher justified this as a \"heavy-use car\", which does not hold at that mileage — a 事故車 or bait listing is the likelier explanation, so it is excluded on grounds of being unexplainable rather than high-mileage. This is the only checkpoint with genuine current-generation data."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from 800,000/700,000. Extrapolated from the PREDECESSOR (2nd-gen) Tiguan at the same age, since the current generation only reached Taiwan in June 2025. Real 3-year-old dealer-retail listings read 2026-08-11: SUM 汽車網 2023 280 TSI Elegance 798,000 at 39,850 km and 798,000 at 41,073 km (758,000 at 80,750 km); SUM's whole 2023 band is 798,000-1,128,000, so 798,000 is the base-trim floor, which is the right anchor for a 280 Elegance. Against that car's ~1,348,000 list, 798,000 = 59.2% dealer-retail retention at ~40,000 km — note 40,000 km at 3 years is ABOUT AVERAGE for Taiwan, not high. WHY THE CORRECTION: the researcher stated a 59-62% band but then carried the 62% top of it into the calculation, reaching ~65% after the low-mileage premium; both actual data points give 59.2%. Redone: 59.2% x 1.06 (low-mileage premium for our 21,000 km, roughly half the comparables') = 62.8% applied to 1,398,000 -> 車商售價 ~878,000. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: 878,000 dealer retail -> private_sale_price 780,000 (-11%) -> dealer_tradein_price 680,000 (-13% off private)."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from 680,000/590,000 — the researcher cherry-picked one source. Extrapolated from the 2nd-gen facelift (2021 model year, 280 TSI Elegance, 建議售價 1,298,000 per U-CAR's 2021-04 launch report). Real 5-year-old dealer-retail listings read 2026-08-11: SUM 汽車網 2021 280 TSI Elegance 659,000 at 86,834 km and 2021 280 TSI 648,000 at 59,445 km (SUM's 2021 band floor is 558,000); 8891 shows 2021 280 TSI cars at 458,000-539,000 with 70,000-129,000 km. WHY THE CORRECTION: the researcher used only SUM's 659,000 and dismissed the 8891 cluster as \"high mileage\", but SUM's 659,000 car is 86,834 km — squarely inside the 8891 cars' 70,000-129,000 km range, so the two sets are comparable and the cheap ones cannot be excluded on mileage. Blending Elegance-grade stock across both sources gives ~610,000 dealer retail at ~80,000 km = 47.0% of the 1,298,000 list, not the 50.5% used. Redone: 47.0% x 1.09 (low-mileage premium for our 35,000 km, well under half the comparables') = 51.2% applied to 1,398,000 -> 車商售價 ~716,000. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: 716,000 dealer retail -> private_sale_price 635,000 (-11%) -> dealer_tradein_price 550,000 (-13% off private). Note the car is OUT of factory warranty by this point (VW TW cover ends at 48 months), which is part of why the year 5-7 segment falls steeply."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, corrected slightly down from 480,000/415,000 — no genuine 7-year data exists for the current generation (Taiwan launch June 2025). Method: take the predecessor generation at 7 years old, express it as a retention ratio of ITS OWN original list price, then apply that ratio to this car's list. Real dealer-retail listings read 2026-08-11: 8891 2019 Tiguan 330 TSI at 438,000-498,000 with 60,000-113,000 km; SUM 2020 280 TSI Elegance 478,000 at 93,967 km; 8891 2020 280 TSI Elegance 488,000 and 2020 330 TSI Elegance 498,000-559,000. WHY THE CORRECTION: the researcher divided the 438,000-498,000 cars by a 1,328,000 denominator, but most of those are 330 TSI trims whose original list was far higher (~1,538,000), which inflates the implied retention. The closest-trim data point is the 2020 280 TSI Elegance at 478,000 / 93,967 km = ~37% of its 1,298,000 list at 6 years; stepping one more year down gives ~33.5% at ~100,000 km. Redone: 33.5% x 1.11 (low-mileage premium for our 49,000 km, about half a normal 7-year-old's odometer) = 37.2% applied to 1,398,000 -> 車商售價 ~520,000. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: 520,000 dealer retail -> private_sale_price 465,000 (-11%) -> dealer_tradein_price 405,000 (-13% off private). Confidence low: cross-generation extrapolation, and the 3rd gen's software-heavy interior may age worse than the 2nd gen's physical switchgear."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no 10-year data can exist for this generation, so the ratio comes from the OLDEST Tiguans actually on sale in Taiwan today (1st gen / early 2nd gen), read 2026-08-11: 8891 2017 330 TSI Highline 110,000-124,300 km -> 399,000-418,000, 2018 280 TSI Comfortline 57,200 km -> 428,000; FindCar 2016 1.4 TSI -> 385,000 and 2015 1.4 TSI -> 398,000. Against 8891's recorded original new-price bands for those years (2016: 1,148,000-1,308,000; 2017: 1,088,000-1,568,000) that is a ~26-33% dealer-retail retention. Took ~28.6% (mid-band, nudged up because 70,000 km at 10 years is exceptionally low — most comparables show 110,000 km+) applied to 1,398,000 -> 車商售價 ~400,000. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: 400,000 dealer retail -> private_sale_price 355,000 (-11%) -> dealer_tradein_price 310,000 (-13% off private; corrected from 305,000 to keep the -13% step consistent with every other checkpoint). Confidence low: two generations removed, FindCar does not publish mileage on these listings, and at 10 years price is driven far more by service history and DSG condition than by the odometer."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Covers 0-1y. The itemised PTT car-board VW Taiwan dealer receipt list (VERIFIED by direct fetch 2026-08-11) shows a basic oil-and-filter interval at NT$7,686; Mobile01 VW owner threads put Tiguan annual service at NT$6,000-8,000. Tiguan sits one class above the Golf in that receipt list, so ~8,000 plus consumables. Car is fully inside the 2-year unlimited-mileage factory warranty; no wear parts due. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from high to medium: the one verifiable itemised receipt is for a Golf SV DIESEL (its intervals carry a diesel filter and additive instead of spark plugs), the Mobile01 corroboration is a search-result summary only (mobile01 returns 403 to direct fetch), and VW Taiwan publishes no official maintenance price table — so this does not meet the \"several real listings or an official table\" bar for high."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers 1-3y: two annual services. Base service ~8,500 each from the verified PTT dealer-receipt list (NT$7,686 / 8,328 per interval on a Golf SV; Tiguan runs slightly higher) plus Mobile01's 6,000-8,000/yr figure. Brake fluid is the one strictly time-based item — due at 2 years regardless of mileage, and the PTT list prices a brake-fluid-inclusive interval at NT$7,783. Still inside warranty for this whole window (2 years unlimited + extension through month 48), so no repair-risk provision. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from high to medium for the same reason as year 1: the only itemised receipt is a different model and fuel type, and there is no official VW Taiwan price table."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers 3-5y. RAISED from 57,000 to 65,000. Two annual services (~10,000 + ~9,000) on the verified PTT/Mobile01 dealer-price basis. The step up is consumables, not labour: at 7,000 km/yr the original tyres reach 5 years with only 35,000 km on them, so they are replaced on AGE (sidewall hardening/cracking), not tread — four 19-inch premium tyres fitted in Taiwan run NT$24,000-32,000, budgeted 28,000. The 48V mild hybrid's main 12V battery is an AGM unit (start-stop duty), NT$8,000-10,000 fitted, and short low-mileage trips are the worst case for battery life. WHY THE INCREASE: VW Taiwan's warranty ends at 48 months (verified), not the 5 years the researcher assumed, so year 5 of this window is the car's first UNWARRANTED year and now carries an ~8,000 repair-risk provision (sensors, bushings, minor electrical) that the original record omitted entirely. Tyre and battery prices are Taiwan market ranges rather than a single sourced receipt, hence medium."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers 5-7y — the first FULL window outside factory warranty (CORRECTED: VW Taiwan cover is 2 years unlimited plus an extension through month 48, so warranty lapsed in year 4, not year 5 as the researcher wrote; the 5-year figure applies only if Give Me Five+ was purchased, which this plan does not assume). This is where the German-SUV bills start. The verified PTT VW Taiwan dealer receipt list prices the DSG-transmission-oil interval at NT$16,880 — by far the biggest scheduled line — and Mobile01's Tiguan thread records a NT$44,800 大保養 once transmission oil, plugs, belts and brakes coincide. Budget: ~20,000 (DSG oil service) + ~13,000 (service + spark plugs) + ~20,000 (front pads and discs at 原廠) + ~4,000 (coolant) + ~15,000 risk provision for the EA211 water-pump/thermostat housing and coil packs, both documented recurring VW failures at this age. This trim has steel springs, not air suspension, so there is no air-strut exposure; DCC adaptive dampers, if optioned, would add risk here."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers 7-10y. EXTRAPOLATED from the pattern of high-mileage VW Taiwan owner receipts rather than a matching 10-year low-mileage case, so treat as an envelope not a quote. Anchors: Mobile01's NT$44,800 single 大保養 on a Tiguan at 120,000 km, and the verified PTT list showing NT$49,777 of purely scheduled work across 75,000 km. Build-up: ~30,000 for three annual services, ~30,000 for the second tyre set (again age-driven at this mileage), ~15,000 rear brakes, ~9,000 AGM battery, ~20,000 for second spark plugs plus second DSG service, ~20,000 suspension bushings/dampers and engine mounts, ~26,000 risk provision for out-of-warranty electrical and cooling failures including the 48V BSG/DC-DC hardware, which has no cheap aftermarket path. A well-treated low-mileage car could land nearer 100,000; one unlucky mechatronic or turbo failure blows past 200,000."}],"sources":[{"name":"台灣福斯汽車 — The Tiguan 官方車款頁 (vw.com.tw)","url":"https://www.volkswagen.com.tw/zh/models/tiguan.html","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED 2026-08-11. Official TW page; carries the MY26 夏季狂歡歡慶價 of NT$1,298,000 起 for the campaign period 2026-08-01 to 2026-08-31, the primary evidence for the 110,000 discount. Also mentions the up-to-100,000 old-for-new tax reduction, excluded here as a tax item. The page does not break out per-trim 建議售價."},{"name":"台灣福斯汽車 — 原廠保固 (Warranty)","url":"https://www.volkswagen.com.tw/zh/owner-service/warranty.html","note":"ADDED BY THE FACT-CHECK, fetched 2026-08-11. Resolves the researcher's open question about warranty term and corrects the record: standard cover is 2 years with no mileage limit (「自新車交車日起，2 年 (無里程限制) 內均享有福斯原廠保固」) plus extended coverage across months 25-48. There is NO standard 5-year warranty. This is why the years 3-5 maintenance window now carries a repair-risk provision and the year-7 rationale was rewritten."},{"name":"CARTURE 車勢文化 — 26年式 Volkswagen Tiguan 首度導入前後廠徽光標定位燈，建議售價139.8萬元起","url":"https://www.carture.com.tw/news/article/39188","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED 2026-08-11 (article dated 2026-01-09). Full MY26 TW price table: 280 eTSI Elegance 1,398,000 / 280 eTSI Elegance Premium 1,508,000 / 330 TSI Elegance Premium 1,698,000 / 430 TSI R-Line Performance 1,998,000. Independent confirmation of list_price — 0% difference from the researcher's figure. Primary list-price source."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 26年式Volkswagen Tiguan標配前後廠徽光標定位燈、高階280 eTSI漲1萬","url":"https://m.u-car.com.tw/article/86669/","note":"Read via search-result summary only — direct fetch returns HTTP 403. Corroborates the MY26 change: only the Elegance Premium rose NT$10,000 (1,498,000 -> 1,508,000); the base 280 eTSI Elegance stayed at 1,398,000. Secondary to the CARTURE table, which was verified directly."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 售價139.8萬元起、4種車型編成選擇，Volkswagen新世代Tiguan正式上市","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/84799","note":"Direct fetch returned HTTP 403 on re-check 2026-08-11; retained as a search-result-summary source only. Establishes the 3rd-generation Tiguan's Taiwan launch on 2025-06-12 at 1,398,000 起 — the reason no genuine 3/5/7/10-year data exists for this generation. The launch date is independently consistent with the CARTURE MY26 article."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Volkswagen Tiguan 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/volkswagen/tiguan","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED 2026-08-11. Source of the 車商售價 (dealer retail asking) data at every checkpoint: 2026 280 eTSI Elegance 161 km 1,159,000; 2025 280 eTSI Elegance Premium 1,058,000-1,075,000 at ~18,000 km (the researcher quoted 1,075,000-1,098,000 — the observed band is slightly lower, corrected here); an unexplained 859,000 listing excluded; 2021 280 TSI 458,000-539,000; 2020 280 TSI Elegance 488,000 and 330 TSI Elegance 498,000-559,000; 2019 330 TSI 438,000-498,000; 2017-2018 399,000-478,000. ALL are dealer asking prices, not owner proceeds — every private_sale_price here is 11% below them and every trade-in a further 13% below that."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — VW Tiguan 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=VW&model=TIGUAN","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED 2026-08-11 (123 listings). Second independent dealer-retail set, used for the 3- and 5-year predecessor anchors. Confirmed model-year bands: 2023 798,000-1,128,000; 2022 698,000-868,000; 2021 558,000-1,198,000; 2020 359,000-729,000. The researcher's 2023 280 TSI Elegance at 798,000 is confirmed as the base-trim floor of the 2023 band. Its 2021 280 TSI Elegance 659,000 at 86,834 km is also confirmed — but that mileage sits inside the 8891 2021 cars' 70,000-129,000 km range, which is why the year-5 anchor was rebuilt by blending both sources instead of using SUM alone. Again dealer asking prices."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — tiguan 搜尋結果","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/tiguan","note":"Only source found with genuinely 10-year-old Tiguans: 2016 1.4 TSI 385,000, 2016 2.0 658,000, 2015 1.4 TSI 398,000, 2018 1.4 TSI 698,000. Mileage is not published per listing, which is why the 10-year checkpoint is confidence low and its low-mileage premium is an assumption rather than an observation."},{"name":"WeWanted 購車好幫手 — Volkswagen 2026年式 Tiguan 280 eTSI Elegance Premium 菜單 (uid=7597)","url":"https://www.wewanted.com.tw/car_menu_content.php?uid=7597&PB_page=1","note":"Member-shared real deal dated 2025-11-09: list 1,508,000, cash transaction 1,420,000 (= 88,000 off) with FSK film, MIO dashcam and mats gifted; 領牌費 shown separately as 依單據實支實付; 乙式全險 quoted ~43,000. Basis for the discount and on-road-fee assumptions."},{"name":"WeWanted 購車好幫手 — Volkswagen 2026年式 Tiguan 280 eTSI Elegance Premium 菜單 (uid=7732)","url":"https://www.wewanted.com.tw/car_menu_content.php?uid=7732&PB_page=1","note":"Member-shared real deal dated 2026-03-22: cash transaction 1,380,000 (= 128,000 off the 1,508,000 list) with film, dashcam, E-Tag frame and mats gifted; 領牌費 again 實支實付; insurance 45,000-50,000. Shows discounts widening through the model year."},{"name":"Mobile01 — 菜單分享，Tiguan 280 eTSI Elegance Premium","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=750&t=7235991","note":"Read via search-result summary only (mobile01 returns 403 to direct fetch). Owner reports a best offer around 1,330,000 with full film, front/rear dashcam, sunshades, mats and detailing, conditional on it not being a 領牌/試乘車 — consistent with the ~100,000+ discount level used."},{"name":"台灣福斯汽車 — 長里程彈性保養 (LongLife Service)","url":"https://www.volkswagen.com.tw/zh/owner-service/maintenance-and-repairs/longlife-service.html","note":"Official statement of the service interval: petrol/diesel cars can stretch to a maximum of 2 years or 30,000 km under LongLife (requires option code QI6/QG1, long-life oil, oil-quality sensor); the standard schedule this plan assumes is 1 year / 15,000 km whichever comes first. Confirms the interval is time-driven at 7,000 km/year. No prices published — which is part of why no maintenance checkpoint can claim high confidence."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [分享] 福斯七萬五總保養費用","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1626925519.A.DDC.html","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED 2026-08-11 — the page is real and the figures check out exactly. Itemised VW-Taiwan dealer receipts: 15,000 km NT$7,686 / 30,000 km NT$8,328 / 45,000 km NT$7,783 / 60,000 km NT$16,880 (transmission oil + belt) / 75,000 km NT$9,100, NT$49,777 total; separately battery NT$6,900, Michelin tyres NT$13,500, brake discs/pads NT$13,000. Vehicle is a Golf SV DIESEL, so items differ (diesel filter/additive instead of spark plugs) — used as the price LEVEL for VW TW dealer labour and the shape of the cost curve, with Tiguan priced one class above. This model-and-fuel mismatch is why year 1 and year 3 confidence was downgraded to medium."},{"name":"Mobile01 — 驚死人！福斯Tiguan十二萬公里大保養費用44800元！","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=609&t=5485823","note":"Read via search-result summary only (403 on direct fetch). A Tiguan owner's NT$44,800 major service at 120,000 km, and the thread's note that 原廠 charges heavily for brake discs and pads. Anchors the 7- and 10-year period costs."},{"name":"Mobile01 — 請問福斯的保養","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=609&t=6505304","note":"Read via search-result summary only (403 on direct fetch). Owners put routine Tiguan servicing at NT$6,000-8,000 once a year, and note that out-of-warranty owners move to 外廠 to cut cost. Basis for the year-1 and year-3 figures."},{"name":"U-CAR 討論區 — 月付999元起享4年免費保養與5年保固，Volkswagen「Give Me Five＋福斯服務雙享」","url":"https://m.u-car.com.tw/forum/thread/354728/","note":"Read via search-result summary only. VW Taiwan's PREPAID package: from NT$999/month, NT$1,399/month for Tiguan-class cars, x 48 months, covering 4 years or 60,000 km of scheduled maintenance plus warranty to year 5. NOT modelled — it is prepaid (~67,000 total) and shifts cost forward rather than removing it. Critically, this is the ONLY route to 5-year warranty cover; the standard warranty page confirms the default is 2 years unlimited + extension to month 48."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 性能休旅Tiguan R同步上市、Volkswagen Tiguan售價109.8萬元起發表","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/65690","note":"Read via search-result summary only. Gives the PREDECESSOR generation's original list prices used as the denominators in every retention-ratio extrapolation: 2021-04 facelift 280 TSI Life 1,098,000, 280 TSI Elegance 1,298,000, 330 TSI Elegance Premium 1,538,000, 380 TSI R-Line 1,788,000; and the 2019年式 line starting at 1,328,000. The 330-trim figure matters: it is why the year-7 anchor was rebuilt on the 280 Elegance comparable rather than on 330 TSI listings."}]},"vw-multivan-life":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr, well under the TW average of ~12,000-15,000 km/yr. Midpoint 7,000 km/yr used at every checkpoint (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km). Two consequences: (1) servicing is entirely TIME-driven — the TW interval is 1 year or 15,000 km, and at 7,000 km/yr the year always arrives first, so km-based items get pulled forward by age not distance; (2) resale sits modestly above the mileage-blind 行情 average. CORRECTION vs the prior draft: the size of that resale premium was overstated. The live 8891 T7 pool is NOT 'commercial-profile 26,000 km/yr cars' — the 2024-model Life cars carrying 26,000-27,200 km are ~2 years old in Aug 2026, i.e. roughly 13,000-16,000 km/yr, which is simply the TW average. The low-mileage premium over those listings is therefore small (a few points), not the large premium previously assumed, and it fades further with age: the T5 evidence shows an 11-year-old car with only 9,500 km still asking just 728,000. Powertrain confirmed gasoline against the official volkswagen-commercial.com.tw model page (Life and Style both 2.0 TSI 204PS; only TDI is diesel; no eHybrid imported).","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"REVISED DOWN from a prior draft's 1,570,000. Live 8891 T7 Multivan listings re-fetched 2026-08-11. The prior draft asserted 'dealer retail asking sits at ~84% of list at a genuine 1 year / 7,000 km' and attributed that to the 2025 Style with 7,000 km asking 1,938,000 — but that ratio does not compute: against the Style list (2024 2,498,000 / MY26 2,570,000, so MY25 ~2,520,000) 1,938,000 is 77%, not 84%. The other true 1-year comparable, a 2025 Life with 19,000 km asking 1,480,000, is 72% of the ~2,050,000 MY25 Life list. NOTE the prior draft misdated this car as a 2024; the live page shows 2025. Those two ~1-year points (72-77%) sit BELOW the three 2024 Life cars at 1,638,000-1,680,000 (80-82% of the 2,038,000 MY24 list), which is internally impossible — a 2-year car cannot out-retain a 1-year car. The 1,638,000-1,680,000 cluster is most likely sticky aspirational asking on a thin, slow-turning van market. Resolved by taking dealer retail asking at ~81% of list = ~1,700,000 (just above the 2-year cluster, well below the 91% near-new point set by the 2025 Style with 21 km at 2,288,000). ADJUSTMENT MADE (dealer-retail trap): private_sale_price = dealer asking x 0.89 (-11%, mid of the 8-15% dealer-retail-to-private gap) = 1,510,000; dealer_tradein_price = private x 0.87 (-13%) = 1,315,000. Small low-mileage credit only — see assumptions.notes for why the prior draft's premium was overstated. Confidence DOWNGRADED to low because the same-trim comparables contradict each other."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"Live 8891 T7 Multivan Life cluster, re-fetched 2026-08-11 — genuine current-generation same-trim data at ~2 years: 2024 Life 26,000 km asking 1,638,000; 2024 Life 27,000 km asking 1,680,000; 2024 Life 27,200 km asking 1,680,000; 2024 2.0TSI 33,000 km asking 1,458,000 (cross-checked on FindCar: 2024 T7 TSI Life 26,914 km at 1,638,000). Mean ~1,614,000 on the 2,038,000 MY24 list = ~79% dealer retail asking at 2 years. CORRECTION: these are ~13,000-16,500 km/yr cars (2024 model year, ~2 years old in Aug 2026), i.e. the TW average — NOT the 26,000 km/yr commercial-use profile the prior draft claimed, so only a small low-mileage credit is warranted for our 21,000 km car, not a large one. Rolled the curve forward one year at the ~6-7 pts/yr German-van fade, net of that small credit, to ~71% of the 2,100,000 list = ~1,500,000 dealer retail asking. ADJUSTMENT MADE (dealer-retail trap): private = x 0.89 = 1,335,000; trade-in = private x 0.87 = 1,160,000. Copying the 1,638,000 asking price straight in would have overstated the owner's recovery by ~300,000."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — the T7 generation only reached TW in Oct 2022, so no genuine 5-year T7 exists. Bridged between the real ~2-year T7 Life data above (~79% dealer retail asking) and the real 7-year T6 evidence below (~49-50%), giving ~58% of the 2,100,000 list = ~1,220,000 dealer retail asking. ADJUSTMENT MADE (dealer-retail trap): private = dealer asking x 0.89 = 1,085,000; trade-in = private x 0.87 = 945,000. Shaded slightly conservative because the TW T7 Life is a GASOLINE 2.0 TSI while the used-van demand pool (commercial/shuttle buyers) prefers diesel — every T6/T5 comparable available is diesel. Consistent with the VW/German pattern of faster loss than the market, front-loaded into the early years."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM PREDECESSOR GENERATION — no 7-year-old T7 exists. Live 8891 T6 Multivan listings re-fetched 2026-08-11 and confirmed accurate as cited: 2019 T6 2.0 TDI Comfortline 19,000 km (19,963 km per FindCar) asking 1,228,000 = 54.4% of the T6 Comfortline 2,258,000 list; 2019 T6 LWB 95,000 km asking 950,000 = 42.1%; 2018 T6 LWB 250,000 km asking 739,000 = 32.7%. Interpolating on mileage to our 49,000 km car gives ~49-50% dealer retail asking at 7 years. CORRECTION vs the prior draft: a fourth T6 listing it cited as a plain '2019 with 80,000 km asking 1,150,000' is in fact a 福祉車 (wheelchair-accessible conversion) — a different segment with a different original price — and has been excluded as a comparable. Also, the petrol-vs-diesel penalty the prior draft applied at year 5 was not carried through here; applied consistently it takes the ratio to ~47.5% = ~1,000,000 dealer retail asking (every T6 comparable is a diesel, which the TW commercial used pool prefers). ADJUSTMENT MADE (dealer-retail trap): private = x 0.89 = 890,000; trade-in = private x 0.87 = 775,000. Sense-check against real_cost (2,008,000): 890,000 = 44% of what the owner actually paid."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM PREDECESSOR GENERATIONS — no 10-year T7 exists. CORRECTED DATA: the prior draft cited the T5 comparables at 10x their real mileage. The live 8891 T5 page (re-fetched 2026-08-11) shows the 2015 T5 Multivan 2.0 TDI asking 728,000 with 9,500 km — not '95,000 km' — and the 2012 T5 asking 398,000 with 29,000 km, not '290,000 km'. That inverts the reasoning: these are age-cheap, not mileage-cheap cars, which shows that by year 10 AGE dominates and the low-mileage premium the record leans on earlier has largely evaporated. An 11-year-old T5 with essentially no mileage still only asks 728,000 dealer retail; a 14-year-old with 29,000 km asks 398,000. Two anchors: (a) that 728,000 absolute floor for a near-unused 11-year T5; (b) extending the corrected T6 curve (~47.5-50% at 7 years) at the typical -4 to -5 pts/yr TW van fade to ~33% at 10 years = ~690,000. Both converge on ~690,000 dealer retail asking. ADJUSTMENT MADE (dealer-retail trap): private = x 0.90 = 620,000; trade-in = private x 0.86 = 535,000 (the trade-in gap widens on 10-year German vans because dealers price in reconditioning and slow turn). The third T5 listing (2014, 180,000 km, 600,000) is confirmed accurate. Weak, thin data — low confidence."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"VW Taiwan 長里程彈性保養/LongLife policy page (fetched 2026-08-11, confirms the 1 year / 15,000 km standard and 2 year / 30,000 km LongLife alternative) for the interval rule; owner-reported VW TW annual-service figures of ~6,000-8,000 uplifted for 福斯商旅 rates and the Multivan's larger oil capacity. 5-year warranty confirmed via CarStuff 42452. Benchmarked composite, not a transcribed invoice."},{"y":3,"source":"VW TW published service scope (1 year / 15,000 km; brake fluid every 2 years) plus owner-reported TW pricing for VW small vs large services (~8,500 / ~18,000 on a 2.0 TSI). Nothing mileage-driven falls due at 21,000 km. Benchmarked composite, not transcribed invoices."},{"y":5,"source":"Composite: VW TW service scope for the scheduled items; TW retail tyre pricing for 17-inch van-load-rated tyres; standard TW replacement ages for AGM batteries and brake pads on a heavy MPV. Tyre and battery timing is set by AGE because this buyer's mileage never reaches the wear limit — the single biggest low-mileage-specific cost effect in the record. No brand free-maintenance program exists to offset it. Confidence DOWNGRADED to low: the largest line here (the ~32,000 tyre set) is an unsourced retail estimate for this specific size/load rating, and no Multivan-specific TW invoice could be obtained."},{"y":7,"source":"EXTRAPOLATED. No TW receipt set exists for a 7-year T7 Multivan (the generation is only ~4 years old in TW). Built from VW TW published DSG/coolant service scope, TW 福斯商旅 labour rates, and the well-documented EA888 2.0 TSI failure list applied probabilistically. The 5-year warranty term is documented (CarStuff 42452); the failure costs are an allowance, not a quote."},{"y":10,"source":"EXTRAPOLATED from predecessor-generation ownership patterns, not from T7 data — no 10-year T7 exists anywhere. Scheduled-item costs follow VW TW's published scope; the risk allowance reflects what T5/T6 Multivan owners in TW encounter past year 8 (sliding-door motors, cooling system, suspension). The least certain number in the record: a lucky car lands near 120,000, an unlucky one past 250,000. Note the prior draft justified the year-10 plugs as '60,000 km reached' while also replacing them at year 5 — restated here as a second age-driven set."}],"sources":[{"name":"Volkswagen Commercial Vehicles Taiwan — official Multivan model page","url":"https://www.volkswagen-commercial.com.tw/zh/models/NewMultivan.html","note":"VERIFIED by direct fetch 2026-08-11. PRIMARY powertrain confirmation. Lists exactly three TW trims: Multivan Life 2.0 TSI 204PS (7-seat), Multivan Style 2.0 TSI 204PS (7-seat), Multivan TDI 2.0 diesel 150PS (7/8-seat). No eHybrid is sold in Taiwan — this sets powertrain to gasoline. Page publishes no prices (directs to dealers)."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 — 福斯商旅全新年式Multivan TDI 8人座車型登場，210萬元起","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/42452-multivan-tdi-8-iq-drive-210.html","note":"VERIFIED by direct fetch 2026-08-11. Quotes the MY26 price table verbatim: Multivan TDI 2,100,000 / Multivan Life 2,100,000 / Multivan Style 2,570,000. Also states all MY26 models carry a 5-year warranty and IQ.DRIVE as standard — this is the independently fetched basis for the warranty claim in maintenance.plan_notes."},{"name":"商車王 truck.tw 114618 — 2026年式 Volkswagen Multivan 正式在臺上市","url":"https://www.truck.tw/article/114618","note":"VERIFIED by direct fetch 2026-08-11. Independent confirmation of the identical MY26 table (TDI 8-seat 2,100,000 / Life 7-seat 2,100,000 / Style 7-seat 2,570,000) and the TDI's 150hp / 7-speed DSG spec."},{"name":"News Pie — 台灣福斯商旅 Multivan 新年式登場 (Dec 2025)","url":"https://www.newspie.com.tw/vw-multivan-20251209/","note":"VERIFIED by direct fetch 2026-08-11. Third independent confirmation of the MY26 prices, and explicitly states Life is petrol TSI while only the TDI is diesel — corroborating the gasoline call."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 86396 — 台灣福斯商旅26年式Multivan售價210萬起","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/86396","note":"COULD NOT BE VERIFIED: direct fetch returned HTTP 403 on 2026-08-11 (as it did for the original researcher). The MY26 price table it is cited for is independently confirmed by the three sources above, so nothing in this record depends on it alone. Retained for traceability only."},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 — 8人座Multivan TDI售價210萬起上市","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/293042","note":"Not re-fetched. The original researcher flagged that its engine column mislabels all three trims as TDI; that override is correct and is confirmed by the official VW TW model page and by News Pie. Not load-bearing for any number here."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Volkswagen T7 Multivan used listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/volkswagen/t7-multivan","note":"RE-FETCHED AND AUDITED 2026-08-11. PRIMARY used-value source for years 1 and 3. 11 live cars, all 車商售價 (dealer retail asking): 2025 Style 21 km 2,288,000; 2025 Style 7,000 km 1,938,000; 2024 Style 3,428 km 1,938,000; 2024 Style 18,000 km 1,790,000; 2024 Style 34,000 km 1,750,000; 2024 Life 27,000 km 1,680,000; 2024 Life 27,200 km 1,680,000; 2024 Life 26,000 km 1,638,000; 2025 Life 19,000 km 1,480,000; 2024 2.0TSI 33,000 km 1,458,000; 2023 Multivan L 2.0TSI 20,000 km 電洽. TWO CORRECTIONS to the prior draft: (a) the 19,000 km / 1,480,000 car is a 2025, not a 2024; (b) the 2024 cars are ~2 years old in Aug 2026, so their 26,000-33,000 km is ~13,000-16,500 km/yr — ordinary TW average use, not the 'commercial 26,000 km/yr profile' claimed. All figures discounted by 11% to reach private-sale."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Volkswagen T6 Multivan used listings (predecessor generation)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/volkswagen/t6-multivan","note":"RE-FETCHED AND AUDITED 2026-08-11. PRIMARY basis for the 7-year extrapolation. Four live cars, all confirmed as previously cited except one characterisation: 2019 2.0 TDI Comfortline 19,000 km asking 1,228,000; 2019 LWB 95,000 km asking 950,000; 2018 LWB 250,000 km asking 739,000; and 2019 '福祉車' 80,000 km asking 1,150,000 — that fourth car is a wheelchair-accessible conversion, which the prior draft cited as an ordinary comparable; it has been excluded here. Retention ratios computed against the T6 Comfortline list of 2,258,000."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 — 225.8萬起三車型，Volkswagen Multivan 2019 年式發表","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/29318-225-8-volkswagen-multivan-2019.html","note":"Not re-fetched. Cited for the predecessor T6 Multivan list price: Comfortline 2,258,000 / Highline 2,698,000 / Highline 4WD 2,898,000. This is the denominator for the 7-year retention ratio; the headline price in the URL slug (225.8萬) is consistent with the figure used."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Volkswagen T5 Multivan used listings (two generations back)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/volkswagen/t5-multivan","note":"RE-FETCHED AND AUDITED 2026-08-11 — this audit found the record's single worst data error. Three live cars: 2015 T5 2.0 TDI, 9,500 km, asking 728,000; 2014 T5, 180,000 km, asking 600,000; 2012 T5, 29,000 km, asking 398,000. The prior draft cited the first as '95,000 km' and the third as '290,000 km' — both inflated 10x. Corrected, the evidence says the opposite of what was claimed: even a near-unused 11-year-old T5 only fetches 728,000, so by year 10 age dominates and the low-mileage premium has largely evaporated. The year-10 checkpoint was re-derived on this basis."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Volkswagen T6 Caravelle used listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/volkswagen/t6-caravelle","note":"Not re-fetched; used only as an age-band sanity check and then set aside. Caravelle is the cheaper commercial trim with a much lower original list and heavy fleet mileage, so it is a poor proxy for a private-use Multivan. Not load-bearing for any number here."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — Multivan listings and historical TW list prices","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/multivan","note":"RE-FETCHED 2026-08-11. Confirms the TW list-price history used as denominators: 2024 Life 2,038,000 / 2024 Style 2,498,000 / 2023 Life 1,998,000 / 2023 Style 2,478,000. Also independently corroborates the 8891 comparables (2024 T7 TSI Life 26,914 km at 1,638,000; 2019 T6 19,963 km at 1,228,000). 63 vehicles, average used price 1,337,000."},{"name":"8891 新車 — 7月買福斯商旅 Multivan最高30萬優惠","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/volkswagen/multivan/22171","note":"RE-FETCHED 2026-08-11. Source for the discount figure. Confirms the headline is 最高30萬優惠 and that it is 含舊換新貨物稅補助 (includes the government trade-in commodity-tax subsidy). NOTE: contrary to the prior draft, the page does not itemise financing or accessory components for the Multivan specifically, so the ~120,000 pure-cash figure rests on stripping only the ~50,000 tax rebate plus a judgement call — it is conservative and genuinely uncertain."},{"name":"Volkswagen Taiwan — 長里程彈性保養 (LongLife Service) policy","url":"https://www.volkswagen.com.tw/zh/owner-service/maintenance-and-repairs/longlife-service.html","note":"VERIFIED by direct fetch 2026-08-11. Confirms the official policy: LongLife-coded petrol and diesel cars may run up to 2 years or 30,000 km; EVs 1 year or 15,000 km. Eligibility requires configuration codes QI6/QG1 plus long-life oil, oil-quality sensing and related equipment, confirmed per-car via the owner's manual or an authorised service centre. No prices published."},{"name":"U-CAR 促銷 82914 — 福斯商旅Caddy Maxi與Multivan 25年式保固promotion","url":"https://promotion.u-car.com.tw/promotion/article/82914","note":"COULD NOT BE VERIFIED: direct fetch returned HTTP 403 on 2026-08-11. The prior draft leaned on this page for the '5-year unlimited-mileage' warranty claim. The 5-year warranty term is independently confirmed by CarStuff 42452 (fetched), but the 'unlimited-mileage' qualifier is NOT independently confirmed, so that wording has been dropped from plan_notes. Retained for traceability only."},{"name":"Mobile01 — 福斯商旅 T7 Multivan 討論串","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=609&t=6687943","note":"Not re-fetched (the prior researcher reported HTTP 403 on Mobile01 threads). Cited only for general VW TW servicing cost expectations (~6,000-8,000 per annual service). No Multivan-specific receipts were obtained from it, which is why every maintenance figure is a benchmarked composite marked medium/low rather than an invoice."}]},"mercedes-glc200-4matic":{"assumptions":"低里程車主：每年 6,000-8,000 km，取中位 7,000 km/年，遠低於台灣平均 12,000-15,000 km/年。各檢查點 assumed_km = 7000 × years（7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000）。台灣賓士保養週期為「1 年或 1 萬公里先到者」（lc-car.tw 已查證），在此里程下完全由時間驅動，等於一年進廠一次、里程幾乎不影響保養次數。X254 GLC 200 4MATIC 為 2.0L 渦輪汽油 + 48V ISG 輕油電；因無法純電行駛，依規格歸類為 gasoline 而非 hybrid。X254 於 2023 年 1 月才在台交車，因此僅第 1、3 年有同世代真實成交行情；第 5、7、10 年一律取前代 X253 同齡低里程車的「殘值比」再套回本車 real_cost，並在各 source 字串中標明。重要限制：X253 的 GLC 200 是後驅單驅版（7Car 價格表：GLC 200 234 萬、GLC 300 4MATIC 286 萬，X253 無 GLC 200 4MATIC），本車為 4MATIC，前代對照存在規格落差，殘值「比率」法可吸收大部分但非全部。稅金與保險依設計排除在外。","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"high","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"【已複查，維持原值】8891 中古車 GLC200 專頁實抓在架車源：2025 年式 GLC200，3,200 km 開價 238.8 萬、9,000 km 開價 229.8 萬、1.8 萬 km 開價 235.8 萬 —— 皆為【車商開價（dealer retail）】。這批車新車價 273 萬，與本車 274 萬幾乎相同，里程也直接涵蓋本情境的 7,000 km，屬同世代同齡直接可比，並已刻意選用低里程車源。內插取低里程車商開價約 2,340,000 為基準；自售價 = 車商開價 × 0.863 = 2,020,000（近新車的車商加價幅度最大，落在指定的 8-15% 下修帶內偏高端）；車商收購價 = 自售價 × 0.869 = 1,755,000（再下修 13.1%）。殘值 74.0%（對 real_cost），符合德系豪華 SUV 第 1 年重跌的形狀。"},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"【已複查，值維持、confidence 由 high 下修為 medium】8891 中古車 GLC200 專頁實抓 2023 年式（X254 首批，2023/1 起交車）車商開價：4,000 km 205.0 萬、2.8 萬 km 186.8 萬、2.9 萬 km 169.8 萬、4.1 萬 km 193.8 萬。同世代真實資料，但同年份離散度很大（169.8-205.0 萬，達 21%），錨點挑哪一台就決定答案，且原研究者在殘值比之外又疊了一層無資料支撐的「額外微幅下修」，故不足以稱 high。本情境 21,000 km 落在 4,000 與 28,000 km 之間，車商開價可對到約 193 萬。2023 年車新車價 266 萬（非 274 萬），換算殘值比 72.6% 再套回本車 real_cost 得車商開價等值約 1,932,000 → 自售價下修 12% → 1,700,000 → 車商收購價再下修 12.9% → 1,480,000。殘值 62.3%。"},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"【已修正：原 1,430,000／1,245,000，且原 source 內部矛盾】無同世代 5 年資料（X254 在台僅 3.5 年），改用前代 X253。原文同時寫「車商開價約 162 萬」與「殘值比約 58.7%（分母 2021 新車價 242 萬）」，但 162/242 = 66.9%，兩者對不起來；且 162 萬會讓一台 2021 年 X253 只比 8891 實際在架的 2023 年式 X254（2.9 萬 km、169.8 萬）低 8 萬，跨一個完整世代不可能只差這樣。改以殘值比為準重算：8891 實抓 2020 年式 GLC200 車商開價 120.8 萬（8.49 萬 km），依同站 2018 GLC300 的里程敏感度校準（8.03 萬 km 98.8 萬 vs 15 萬 km 82.5 萬，里程降 1.87 倍 → +19.8%）外推到 3.5 萬 km、再加一個年份，得 2021 年式車商開價約 140 萬；對 2021 年 X253 GLC 200 新車價約 242 萬（由 2019 年 234 萬按年度調漲推估）算得殘值比約 57.9%，套回本車 real_cost 得車商開價等值約 1,583,000 → 自售價下修 11.6% → 1,400,000 → 車商收購價再下修 13.2% → 1,215,000。屬「前代同齡 + 里程外推」雙重推估，且前代 GLC 200 為後驅、本車為 4MATIC。"},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"【已修正：原 1,190,000／1,020,000，原文用高階車型墊高低階車型】無同世代 7 年資料，取前代 X253 2019 年式殘值比外推。原文把 GLC300 的 51.0% 與 GLC200 的 46.2% 取中位 47.3%，但本車是 GLC【200】，正確的同階錨點就是 GLC200；且 8891 實抓的那台 2019 GLC300（5.2 萬 km、145.8 萬）在同年份中明顯偏離群（其餘 2019 GLC300：10 萬 km 109.0/118.0 萬、12 萬 km 109.0 萬、13.9 萬 km 103.8 萬），不宜拿來拉高。改採同階錨點：2019 GLC200、5.1 萬 km、車商開價 108 萬，對其 2019 年新車價 234 萬（7Car 價格表已查證）= 46.2%，里程幾乎正中本情境的 49,000 km。套回本車 real_cost 得車商開價等值約 1,261,000 → 自售價下修 12% → 1,110,000 → 車商收購價再下修 14%（車齡越大車商壓價越兇；小曾車庫實例：2019 GLC300 美規 13 萬 km 鑑價 115 萬、實收 90 多萬）→ 955,000。明確為前代殘值比外推，非本車實際成交；前代 GLC 200 為後驅。"},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"【已修正：原 880,000／745,000，這是本記錄最大的錯誤】原文把 7 萬公里的 2016 年 GLC300 外推到車商開價「約 100 萬」，但 8891 同站實抓資料直接否定：2018 年 GLC300 8.03 萬 km 才開 98.8 萬、2017 年 8.6 萬 km 開 95.8 萬 —— 一台 2016 年車不可能在相近里程下開得比 2018 年車還貴。另原文列為 2016 年的三筆錨點中，79.8 萬（16.6 萬 km）與 65.8 萬（17 萬 km）在 8891 上實為【2015】年式，真正的 2016 年錨點只有一筆 67.9 萬（15.13 萬 km）。改用該筆真錨點 + 原文自己的里程敏感度（1.87 倍里程差 → +19.8%，本例 2.16 倍差取 +23%）得 7 萬 km 的 2016 GLC300 車商開價約 84 萬，此值也正確落在 2017 年（8.6 萬 km、95.8 萬）之下，年份階梯合理。對 2016 年 X253 GLC 300 4MATIC 新車價約 279 萬（推估值）計算，殘值比約 30.1%，套回本車 real_cost 得車商開價等值約 822,000 → 自售價下修 11.8% → 725,000 → 車商收購價再下修 15.2%（10 年車商收購需大量整備、周轉慢，壓價最深）→ 615,000。殘值 26.6%，對 10 年德系豪華 SUV 低里程自售屬合理；原文的 32.2% 過於樂觀。雙重外推（前代世代 + 里程），且分母新車價本身為推估值。"}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"台灣原廠 Service A 行情 8,000-12,000（lc-car.tw 實抓查證原文「原廠A保費用通常落在新台幣8,000至12,000元之間」，C200 基準；ts-motor.tw 另列小保養 8,000-10,000），GLC 2.0T 車重與工時較高取中上緣 11,000。保養週期依 lc-car.tw 實抓確認「每年或每 1 萬公里」。"},{"y":3,"source":"涵蓋第 1→3 年。Service B 台灣原廠行情 15,000-25,000（lc-car.tw 實抓原文）、Service A 8,000-12,000。本區間 = B(20,000) + A(11,000) = 31,000。煞車油 2 年週期經 lc-car.tw 實抓確認。"},{"y":5,"source":"涵蓋第 3→5 年。B(20,000) + A(11,000) + ATF 含濾網 22,000 + 冷卻液 5,000 + 輪胎四條 44,000 + 前來令 15,000 = 117,000，取 118,000。變速箱油「4-5 年或 6 萬公里」、冷卻液 4 年、火星塞 6-8 萬公里等週期經 lc-car.tw 實抓逐項確認。輪胎與煞車零件價格為 19 吋豪華 SUV 台灣行情推估，非單一來源；煞車金額落在 ts-motor.tw 煞車系統 10,000-20,000 區間內。"},{"y":7,"source":"【已修正：原 112,000，與自身條列加總不符】涵蓋第 5→7 年。B(20,000) + A(11,000) + 火星塞 12,000 + 12V AGM 14,000 + 碟盤含後來令 20,000 + 懸吊襯套 15,000 + 水泵／恆溫器／線圈機率加權 18,000 = 110,000（原文列同樣項目卻寫 112,000）。ts-motor.tw 實抓確認煞車系統 10,000-20,000、懸吊系統 15,000-30,000、引擎系統 20,000-50,000，本估算落在其區間內。風險項為加權期望值而非確定支出，故 confidence 低。"},{"y":10,"source":"涵蓋第 7→10 年，共三次進廠。外廠 B(16,000)×2 + A(8,000) + 輪胎四條 42,000 + ATF 20,000 + 冷卻液 5,000 + 煞車第二輪 22,000 + 避震器 30,000 + 漏油整修／水泵加權 35,000 + 雜項加權 15,000 = 209,000，取 210,000。外廠折扣依 lc-car.tw 實抓原文「外廠約為原廠五至七成」；變速箱／引擎維修級距參考 ts-motor.tw 實抓數字（變速箱 30,000-80,000、引擎 20,000-50,000），本估算僅取其低段，因低里程車機械負荷輕。整體為推估，非單一帳單。"}],"sources":[{"name":"8891 新車頻道 — 賓士正26年式售價微調！GLC、C、G車系調漲1至2萬元","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/mercedes-benz/glc/21485","note":"本次複查實際抓取確認：正 2026 年式「GLC 200(274萬)、300(319萬)、43(402萬)」，調幅 +1 萬元。list_price 主要依據，且據此修正了原研究者寫錯的價格歷程（前一年式應為 273 萬而非 269 萬）。"},{"name":"U-CAR 正2026年式 Mercedes-Benz 台灣售價表（新浪轉載全文）","url":"https://k.sina.com.cn/article_7857141524_1d452771401903dxtu.html","note":"本次複查實際抓取確認逐字「GLC 200 4Matic 274 +1」，與 8891 交叉驗證一致。U-CAR 原站對 WebFetch 回 403，故讀此完整轉載版。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz GLC GLC200 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/glc/glc200","note":"本次複查實際抓取。2025 年式：3,200 km 238.8 萬、9,000 km 229.8 萬、1.8 萬 km 235.8 萬。2023 年式：4,000 km 205.0 萬、2.8 萬 km 186.8 萬、2.9 萬 km 169.8 萬、4.1 萬 km 193.8 萬。2020 年式 GLC200：8.49 萬 km 120.8 萬。全為【車商開價】。第 1、3、5 年檢查點的主要依據。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz GLC GLC300 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/glc/glc300","note":"本次複查實際抓取，並據此推翻原第 10 年估算。實際在架：2016 年 15.13 萬 km 67.9 萬（唯一真 2016 錨點）；原文誤植為 2016 的 79.8 萬（16.6 萬 km）與 65.8 萬（17 萬 km）實為【2015】年式。2017 年 8.6 萬 km 95.8 萬、11 萬 km 87.8 萬。2018 年 8.03 萬 km 98.8 萬、15 萬 km 82.5 萬（里程敏感度校準來源）。2019 年 5.2 萬 km 145.8 萬（同年份離群值）、10 萬 km 109.0/118.0 萬、12 萬 km 109.0 萬、13.9 萬 km 103.8 萬。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz GLC 二手價格行情總覽","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/glc","note":"本次複查實際抓取，逐年份價格帶：2016 62.9-79.8 萬、2017 69.8-88.8 萬、2018 92.8-128.8 萬、2019 109.0 萬、2020 120.8-149.8 萬、2023 193.8-244.8 萬、2025 235.8-307.8 萬。用於檢查各檢查點是否落在市場帶內，並用於否決原第 10 年「100 萬」的外推值。"},{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點 — 新台幣234萬元起 Mercedes-Benz GLC / GLC Coupé 售價","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/60753","note":"本次複查實際抓取確認：2019 小改款 X253 台灣建議售價 GLC 200 234 萬（後驅）、GLC 220d 249 萬、GLC 300 4MATIC 286 萬，且【X253 無 GLC 200 4MATIC 車型】。第 7 年殘值比的分母來源，並揭露前代對照的驅動形式落差。"},{"name":"小曾車庫 — Mercedes-Benz X253 GLC 二手行情說明（GLC300／GLC250／GLC200）","url":"https://www.littletsenggarage.com/mercedes-benz-glc300-glc250-glc200-x253/","note":"本次複查實際抓取，並修正原研究者的引用錯誤：實際案例為【2019】年式 GLC300（美規、13 萬 km）鑑價 115 萬、實收 90 多萬（原文誤記為 2020 年）；2018 GLC250 Coupe 5 萬 km 的 105 萬是【鑑價】不是開價（原文誤記為開價）。用於校準自售→車商收購的下修幅度。"},{"name":"聯承汽車 — 台中BENZ過保後怎麼保養？賓士原廠保固到期後，聰明車主這樣選廠","url":"https://lc-car.tw/news2_detail.php?id=11","note":"本次複查實際抓取確認：原廠 Service A 8,000-12,000、Service B 15,000-25,000（C200 基準），外廠約原廠五至七成；週期為機油 1 年或 1 萬公里、煞車油 2 年、冷卻液 4 年、變速箱油 4-5 年或 6 萬公里、火星塞 6-8 萬公里、引擎空濾 2-3 萬公里。maintenance 的主要依據，原研究者的引用經查證屬實。"},{"name":"台享國際汽車 — 汽車保養廠推薦，賓士維修、正副廠零件彈性選擇、費用透明","url":"https://www.ts-motor.tw/news/benz-car-maintenance","note":"本次複查實際抓取確認：小保養 8,000-10,000、大保養 25,000-30,000、煞車系統 10,000-20,000、懸吊系統 15,000-30,000、引擎系統 20,000-50,000、變速箱 30,000-80,000。用於第 5、7、10 年風險項金額的上下界檢查，原研究者的引用經查證屬實。"},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan — 原廠保固條款","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/services/warranty.html","note":"【未查證】本次複查嘗試抓取逾時，與原研究者遭遇相同。「3 年不限里程保固、無免費定期保養方案」的判斷因此僅屬業界通則推定，未取得官方頁面確認。此假設直接支撐第 1-3 年 period_cost 不歸零，若實際有免費定保方案則該區間會高估。"},{"name":"KingAutos 國王車訊 — 2026 中型休旅車 Mercedes Benz GLC","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/mercedes_benz/glc","note":"【本次未重抓】原研究者用於確認台灣 GLC 僅 GLC 200 4MATIC／GLC 300 4MATIC／AMG GLC 43 三車型、GLC 200 為 2.0L 直四 204hp。車型與動力規格已由 8891／U-CAR 價格表獨立佐證，故保留；其標示的 268 萬為舊年式，未採用。"},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2026 M-Benz GLC 200 4MATIC 車款介紹","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/m-benz-glc-2026-200-4matic","note":"【本次未重抓】規格參考：204hp、9 速手自排、5 人座。牌照稅／燃料稅依設計未計入成本，不影響本記錄任何數字。"}]},"mercedes-v250d-avantgarde":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr, well under the TW average of ~12,000-15,000 km/yr. All checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). This matters twice: (1) resale — the TW V-Class used pool is heavily commercial/livery use, so most listings at a given age carry 2-3x this mileage; a genuinely private low-km V250d sits at the TOP of its year band, which is where these figures are quoted; (2) maintenance — at 7,000 km/yr the service counter is time-driven, not mileage-driven, so the car still gets a dealer visit roughly once a year and consumables (tyres, brake fluid, coolant, 12V battery) age out rather than wear out. Excluded by design: 牌照稅/燃料費 (this is a 1,950 cc diesel, ~NT$11,920 + NT$4,800/yr), insurance, and fuel. IMPORTANT: at every checkpoint, private_sale_price is derived FROM verified 車商售價 (dealer retail asking) listings by applying an explicit 12-14% haircut — it is never a dealer asking price copied across.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"8891中古車 V250d pool, re-fetched and re-read 2026-08-11. Verified 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking) listings: 2025 V250d AVA NT$2,498,000 @20,000 km; 2024 V250d AVA NT$2,600,000 @7,474 km; 2024 V250d AVA NT$2,500,000 @6,081 km; FindCar 2024 V250d NT$2,338,000 @10,031 km. Dealer retail for a 1-yr car at only 7,000 km ≈ NT$2,500,000 (anchored on the 2025 ask, with the low-km 2024 examples showing genuinely low-mileage cars hold NT$2.5-2.6M). ADJUSTMENT (dealer retail -> private sale): -12% for the wide margin dealers carry on slow-turning high-ticket MPV stock, and because the private buyer pool for a 1-yr car is thin (most such buyers want dealer warranty/financing) -> 2,200,000. Private -> dealer trade-in a further -12.3% -> 1,930,000. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from the reviewed record's 'high' to 'medium': two separate reads of the same 8891 pool disagree on whether the NT$2,498,000 car is a V250d AVA @20,000 km or a V250d Exclusive @40,000 km, and Exclusive lists at NT$3,600,000, so trim attribution on the single closest comparable is unresolved."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"8891中古車, re-fetched 2026-08-11. Three real 車商售價 listings at exactly this age (2023 MY): NT$2,088,000 @7,900 km; NT$1,990,000 @11,000 km; NT$1,928,000 @13,000 km. This buyer's car at 21,000 km carries MORE mileage than all three, so dealer retail is set slightly below the cluster at ≈ NT$1,950,000. ADJUSTMENT: -12% dealer retail -> private sale -> 1,720,000; -13% private -> dealer trade-in -> 1,495,000. NOTE: the reviewed record's sources[] claimed an 8891 year-band of '2020-23 V250d 113.9-162.8萬', which the live pool contradicts outright — the verified 2023 asks are 192.8-208.8萬. That band has been corrected. Car is just out of the 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty here, which is where TW V-Class asking prices step down."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"8891中古車 + FindCar, re-fetched 2026-08-11. Verified 車商售價 at this age (2021 MY): NT$1,628,000 @21,136 km (same car listed on both sites), NT$1,600,000 @15,000 km, NT$1,390,000 @43,000 km, NT$1,380,000 @61,000 km, NT$1,139,000 @160,000 km. CORRECTION: the reviewed record set 5-yr dealer retail at NT$1,650,000, which is ABOVE every verified comparable of this age — including the best low-km ask (NT$1,628,000 @21,136 km) even though this buyer's car carries 35,000 km, i.e. more mileage than that car. Dealer retail is therefore reset to ≈ NT$1,540,000, interpolating between the 21,000 km and 43,000 km anchors with a premium for the low-km, privately-owned profile. ADJUSTMENT: -12% to private sale -> 1,355,000; -12.9% to dealer trade-in -> 1,180,000. Spread within the year band is wide because listings mix plain V250d, V250d Avantgarde and V300d/Exclusive; anchored on the Avantgarde-equivalent, low-mileage examples."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — confirmed 2026-08-11 that no 2019 (7-yr) V250d listing exists in the live TW pool; 8891 jumps straight from 2018 to 2020. TW 2019 V-Class volume was thin because the model was mid-transition to the 2.0 OM654. Bracketed by verified real neighbours: 2020 V250d NT$1,388,000 @59,000 km and NT$1,259,000 @56,300 km (8891); 2018 V250d NT$1,328,000 @72,000 km and NT$1,158,000 @60,000 km (8891); 2018 V250d Avantgarde NT$1,200,000 (abc好車網 #2146186, re-verified) and NT$1,238,000 (abc好車網 #2235507, re-verified). CORRECTION: the reviewed record used NT$1,330,000 dealer retail, at the very top of the 2018 8891 spread and above the entire abc好車網 Avantgarde cluster (1,080,000-1,238,000). Reset to ≈ NT$1,280,000. ADJUSTMENT: -12.1% to private sale -> 1,125,000; -14.2% to dealer trade-in -> 965,000. Trade-in gap widens here because a 7-yr German van is out of warranty and dealers discount harder for reconditioning risk."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"DIRECT COMPARABLES (method changed — see below). Verified 車商售價 for 10-yr-old (2016 MY) cars, re-fetched 2026-08-11: 8891 shows V250d Avantgarde NT$948,000 @80,000 km, NT$868,000 @80,000 km, NT$838,000 @60,000 km, V250d NT$858,000 @62,000 km, and V250d Avantgarde NT$1,088,000 @43,000 km; FindCar shows NT$1,130,000 @104,000 km and NT$1,098,000; abc好車網 #2200768 (re-verified) asks NT$1,259,000 for a 2016 V250d Avantgarde with mileage undisclosed. This buyer's car at 70,000 km sits just under the 80,000 km comparables, in Avantgarde spec, so dealer retail ≈ NT$985,000 — near the top of the direct 60,000-80,000 km cluster with a low-mileage premium, but well below the two undisclosed-mileage outliers. ADJUSTMENT: -12.7% to private sale -> 860,000; -14% to dealer trade-in -> 740,000. CORRECTION — THE MAIN ERROR IN THE REVIEWED RECORD: it discarded these direct same-age listings in favour of a retention-ratio transfer (38% of list -> NT$1,100,000 dealer retail) and arrived at private_sale_price 945,000. That figure is effectively the DEALER RETAIL ASK of the closest real comparable (NT$948,000 @80,000 km) reproduced as if it were a private-sale price — the classic 車商售價/自售價 conflation. The ratio transfer was also unnecessary: 2016 cars are the same W447 generation (pre-facelift), so genuine same-age data exists and beats a transferred ratio. Confidence stays low: the pre-facelift Avantgarde listed at NT$3,160,000 against today's NT$2,870,000 星耀版, so spec correspondence is imperfect, 70,000 km at 10 years is far below anything actually in the TW pool, and the 2036 horizon carries real diesel-MPV regulatory risk."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Service A band NT$8,000-15,000 for Mercedes-Benz TW, verified by direct fetch of 2ggx 賓士保養費 on 2026-08-11. Placed at the top of the band because the OM654 diesel takes ~9L oil plus a diesel filter. Covers 0-1y. Time-driven at 7,000 km/yr — see the interval conflict disclosed in plan_notes."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers years 1->3. Service B NT$15,000-30,000+ band (2ggx, verified 2026-08-11); taken at ~NT$28,000 for the V250d given 9L oil, diesel filter and van-sized cabin/air filters. Service A ~NT$14,000, wipers ~NT$2,000. Brake fluid is bundled inside Service B, which matches the 2-year brake-fluid requirement exactly. Warranty length (3年不限里程) from Mercedes-Benz TW warranty terms."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers years 3->5. Service B ~NT$29,000 + Service A ~NT$15,000 (2ggx bands, verified 2026-08-11). Tyres: 2ggx quotes NT$18,000-50,000+ per set of 4; the 星耀版 runs 19-inch rims on a ~2.5-tonne van, so ~NT$44,000 fitted. Front pads NT$8,000-15,000 (2ggx) -> NT$14,000 at the top of band for the vehicle weight. AGE, not mileage, forces the tyre change at this usage."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers years 5->7. Service B ~NT$30,000 + Service A ~NT$16,000 (2ggx bands, escalated for age). AGM battery NT$8,000-15,000 each (2ggx, verified); V-Class carries a main plus auxiliary battery -> ~NT$16,000 combined. Front rotors NT$15,000-30,000+ and rear pads NT$6,000-12,000 (2ggx) -> ~NT$26,000 for the pair of jobs. Coolant ~NT$6,000. Remainder is a judged NT$30,000 out-of-warranty allowance for W447 sliding-door and DPF/EGR work — an estimate, not a quoted figure, and the main reason confidence is low."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers years 7->10. Three services (~NT$81,000 at 2ggx bands escalated for age) + second tyre set ~NT$46,000 + 9G-TRONIC oil/filter ~NT$20,000 + DPF/EGR service ~NT$12,000 + full brake overhaul ~NT$26,000 (2ggx rotor/pad bands) + a judged NT$50,000 allowance for out-of-warranty failures (2ggx lists suspension at NT$5,000-25,000+). EXTRAPOLATED: no TW receipt set for a 10-year 70,000 km V-Class was found; the low-mileage profile cuts wear items but does NOT cut age-driven or diesel-short-trip items, and can make DPF/EGR worse. Treat as an order-of-magnitude planning figure."}],"sources":[{"name":"8891新車 — 賓士V-Class新年式調整（MY26/27 價格表）","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/mercedes-benz/v-class/22234","note":"2026-07-21. RE-VERIFIED by direct fetch 2026-08-11: V250d AVA 星耀版 NT$2,870,000；V220d AVA 星耀版 2,630,000；V250d Exclusive 星耀版 3,600,000；Vito Tourer 摘星版 2,100,000（降 19 萬）. Primary list-price source."},{"name":"地球黃金線 (TVBS) — 台灣賓士導入新年式 V-Class","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/332930","note":"2026-07-17. RE-VERIFIED by direct fetch 2026-08-11: identical four-trim table, V250d Avantgarde 星耀版 NT$2,870,000, and confirms it is the 8-seat variant (V220d = 7-seat, V250d Exclusive = 6-seat). Independent confirmation of list_price."},{"name":"8891新車 — 賓士正26年式V-Class國內上架","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/mercedes-benz/v-class/21819","note":"2026-05-18. Confirms V250d AVA at 287萬 and the added kit (sport suspension, 19-inch alloys, ventilated/heated front seats, 15-speaker Burmester) at unchanged price. Carried over from the reviewed record; not re-fetched in this pass (list price already double-confirmed by two sources that were)."},{"name":"ETtoday 車雲 — 新年式多人座MPV官網上架","url":"https://speed.ettoday.net/news/3203285","note":"2026-07-18. Third confirmation of the new-model-year lineup and pricing. Carried over from the reviewed record; not re-fetched in this pass."},{"name":"8891新車 — 賓士V-Class小改款抵台（2024 facelift）","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/mercedes-benz/v-class/19008","note":"2024-08-05. Facelift launch prices; establishes the 2024 baseline (V250d AVA 286萬) behind the 1- and 3-year checkpoints. Carried over; not re-fetched."},{"name":"發燒車訊 / UDN — 賓士 V-Class 商旅車正式在台上市","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/1072383","note":"2015-07-22 TW launch. RE-VERIFIED by direct fetch 2026-08-11: V250d NT$2,190,000, V250d Avantgarde NT$3,160,000起. Retained to document the spec/price mismatch against today's 星耀版 — the 10-year checkpoint no longer relies on a retention transfer from this figure."},{"name":"KingAutos — Mercedes-Benz V-Class 車款價格表（小改款前）","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/mercedes_benz/v-class","note":"RE-VERIFIED by direct fetch 2026-08-11: pre-facelift TW lineup V220d 256萬, V250d 282萬, V300d Avantgarde 359萬. This is the list price of the 3/5/7-year-old cars being used as comparables."},{"name":"8891中古車 — Mercedes-Benz V 車系二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/v","note":"Live listing pool, re-fetched 2026-08-11 (89 vehicles). CORRECTED YEAR BANDS — the reviewed record stated '2020-23 V250d 113.9-162.8萬', which the live pool contradicts. Actual verified 車商售價 bands: 2015-2017 73-109.8萬; 2018 73-132.8萬; 2020 110-138.8萬; 2021-2022 113.9-165.8萬; 2023 192.8-208.8萬; 2024-2025 233.8-269萬. All are dealer retail asks, not private-sale."},{"name":"8891中古車 — Mercedes-Benz V250d 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/v/v250d","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-11 (53 listings). Individual 車商售價 used for the curve: 2025 249.8萬@20,000km; 2024 260.0萬@7,474km and 250.0萬@6,081km; 2023 208.8萬@7,900km, 199.0萬@11,000km, 192.8萬@13,000km; 2021-22 162.8萬@21,100km, 160.0萬@15,000km, 139.0萬@43,000km, 138.0萬@61,000km, 165.8萬@110,600km, 113.9萬@160,000km; 2020 138.8萬@59,000km, 125.9萬@56,300km, 110.0萬@130,000km; 2018 132.8萬@72,000km, 115.8萬@60,000km, 105.0萬@100,000km; 2016 108.8萬@43,000km, 94.8萬@80,000km, 86.8萬@80,000km, 85.8萬@62,000km, 83.8萬@60,000km; 2015 88.0萬@62,000km. NOTE: the reviewed record quoted the 110,600 km 2021 car at 170.8萬; the live figure is 165.8萬. All figures are 車商售價 (dealer retail)."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — Benz V250D 中古車列表","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?b=8&m=1282","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-11 (31 vehicles). Cross-check pool: 2024 233.8萬@10,031km; 2021 162.8萬@21,136km (same car as the 8891 162.8萬 listing); 2017 108.8萬@126,000km; 2016 113.0萬@104,000km and 109.8萬; 2015 93.8萬@62,546km, 88.8萬@62,511km, 89.8萬@90,000km, 88.0萬@118,550km. Confirms how strongly high mileage drags this model down — the basis for the low-mileage premium."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2016 V250d Avantgarde 中古車","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2200768","note":"RE-VERIFIED 2026-08-11: 2016 V250d Avantgarde, dealer ask NT$1,259,000, mileage NOT disclosed on the listing. Treated as an upper outlier for the 10-year checkpoint rather than an anchor, precisely because mileage is unknown."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2015 V250d Avantgarde 中古車","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2271934","note":"11-year-old Avantgarde dealer ask NT$898,000. Lower anchor for the 10-year checkpoint. Carried over from the reviewed record; not re-fetched in this pass."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2018 V250d Avantgarde 中古車","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2146186","note":"RE-VERIFIED 2026-08-11: 2018 V250d Avantgarde, dealer ask NT$1,200,000 (mileage not shown on the listing). Primary bracket for the extrapolated 7-year checkpoint."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2018 V250d 中古車","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2235507","note":"RE-VERIFIED 2026-08-11: 2018 V250d, dealer ask NT$1,238,000, dealer 元禾國際車業. The reviewed record described this as a 9,000 km car; the listing page does not state mileage, so the low-mileage claim is unconfirmed and this is used only as a price bracket."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2018 V250d 中古車（基本款）","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2289610","note":"8-year-old base-spec dealer ask NT$1,080,000. Lower bracket for the 7-year checkpoint. Carried over from the reviewed record; not re-fetched in this pass."},{"name":"Mobile01 — BENZ V250D 購車價格討論串","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=750&t=5730911","note":"Owner report: 中華賓士 18年式 現金購車折扣 20萬 + 贈三次保養. Only concrete TW V-Class discount datapoint found; used to calibrate purchase.discounts. CAVEAT RETAINED: direct fetch returns HTTP 403 — content known only via search-engine snippet, never read in full."},{"name":"2ggx — 賓士保養費用解析","url":"https://www.2ggx.com/賓士保養費/","note":"RE-VERIFIED by direct fetch 2026-08-11. Mercedes-Benz TW cost bands used throughout maintenance: Service A NT$8,000-15,000 (每 1.5 年或 15,000 km), Service B NT$15,000-30,000+ (每 2 年或 30,000 km), front pads 8,000-15,000, rear pads 6,000-12,000, front rotors 15,000-30,000+, tyre set of 4 18,000-50,000+, AGM battery 8,000-15,000, spark plugs 4,000-10,000, suspension 5,000-25,000+. NOTE: the reviewed record cited the suspension band as 8,000-25,000+; the page says 5,000-25,000+. Also note this verified source gives a 1.5-year Service A interval, which conflicts with the 1-year interval assumed in plan_notes — see the disclosure there."},{"name":"比迪行銷 — 賓士保養週期深度解析（A/B 保養）","url":"https://www.whbydcc.com/賓士保養週期/","note":"Source of the 每10,000公里或每滿1年 TW interval that plan_notes assumes. CAVEAT RETAINED AND ESCALATED: direct fetch returns HTTP 403 — content known only via search-engine snippet, never read in full, and it contradicts the fully-verified 2ggx intervals. This is the weakest link in the maintenance model."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan — V-Class 商旅車官方車型頁","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/models/van/v-class/overview.html","note":"Canonical price page. HONEST CAVEAT, CONFIRMED IN THIS REVIEW: WebFetch timed out again on 2026-08-11 and the page was never read. list_price rests entirely on the independently re-verified 8891 and TVBS price tables, which agree to the dollar. URL listed only so the canonical source is on record."}]},"bmw-x3-20-xdrive-xline":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. All checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7000 / 21000 / 35000 / 49000 / 70000). Two consequences drive the model. (1) Resale: at every age this car carries 40-55% of the mileage of a typical comparable listing, so used values are quoted from genuinely low-mileage listings rather than a mileage-blind yearly average. (2) Maintenance: BMW Taiwan's published interval is 'every year OR every 10,000 km, whichever comes first' (re-verified on the yiderbmw dealer service page this round). At 7,000 km/year the mileage trigger is never reached, so servicing is strictly TIME-DRIVEN - exactly one annual visit, 10 visits over 10 years. Consumables that age out on a calendar (tires, brake fluid, coolant, 12V AGM battery) therefore dominate the later periods, while wear items (brake pads/discs) are pushed far out. G45 X3 20 xDrive is a 2.0L B48 TwinPower Turbo with a 48V mild-hybrid system (190 hp / 31.6 kgm); classified 'gasoline' because the 48V system cannot drive the car on its own. Tax and insurance are excluded by design throughout. SECOND-ROUND REVIEW (2026-08-11): a cross-vehicle reviewer flagged the resale curve as internally inconsistent - 1y retention of 82% was the 4th highest in a 17-car set (above every non-Lexus car) while 5y retention of 46% was the weakest of the four German cars, which cannot both be true of one vehicle. The objection was upheld. Root cause: the 1y point was built by applying a retention percentage to the LIST price (2,490,000 x 86%) and then dividing the result by real_cost, which is net of a large discount. Mixing a list-price numerator with a discounted denominator inflates year 1 by roughly 8 points. The 1y point has been rebuilt off the NEW-CAR STREET PRICE instead, and the whole curve re-derived; the discount and the maintenance total were also corrected. See purchase.notes, each value_checkpoint source, and maintenance.plan_notes.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"LOWERED from 1,840,000 - this is the correction the reviewer demanded, and the objection is upheld. THE ERROR: the previous value was built as 2,490,000 (LIST) x 86% = 2,140,000 dealer retail, then cut 14% to private sale. Taking a retention ratio off LIST and then reporting the result against real_cost (which is net of a 300,000 discount) double-counts the discount and inflated year 1 to 81.6%, making this car look like a Lexus in year 1 while its year-5 value sat at the bottom of the German group. THE EVIDENCE THAT SETTLES IT, newly found this round by direct fetch of the 8891 xDrive20i listing page: a 2026 X3 20 xDrive xLine - the exact trim - with 2,001 km is listed at 2,230,000 dealer asking. A brand-new one transacts at 2,190,000 before fees (PTT: 220萬 then 218萬). So the near-new 8891 ask EXCEEDS the new-car street price. No one pays more for a used 2,000 km car than for a new one with a full 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty and free choice of colour and spec, which proves the near-new asking segment is padded far beyond the normal 8-15% band and cannot be used as a price anchor at all. The same page shows a 2025 20 xDrive M Sport at 11,000 km asking 2,380,000 (85.9% of its 2,770,000 list, but ~96% of its likely street price) and, decisively, another 2025 M Sport at 45,500 km asking MORE at 2,430,000 - an ask that rises with mileage is noise, not a market. METHOD USED INSTEAD: anchor year 1 to the new-car street price, which is an observed transaction rather than an ask. Taiwan German-premium cars lose roughly 20-28% of street price to a private buyer in the first year; at 7,000 km (about half normal accumulation) this car sits at the kind end. 2,190,000 x ~0.75 = 1,650,000 private sale. Dealer trade-in 12.7% below -> 1,440,000. RESULT: 74.2% of real_cost at one year, inside the 72-76% band the reviewer predicted and in line with GLC and XC60 rather than with Alphard and LM. Confidence medium: the anchor transaction and the exact-trim listing are both real and re-fetched, but the first-year percentage itself is a segment norm applied by judgement, not a measured G45 resale."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"RAISED from 1,400,000. This is the best-evidenced point on the curve and it was NOT moved to flatter the shape - it moved only because the previous 64%-of-list assumption was harsher than the listings support. Real G01 LCI xDrive20i 運動版 listings at true 3-year age, all re-fetched from 8891 this round: 2023 Sport, 17,000 km asking 1,750,000; 2023 Sport, 24,500 km asking 1,730,000; 2023 Sport, 60,000 km asking 1,428,000. The two low-mileage cars bracket this buyer's 21,000 km tightly and agree within 20,000, giving ~1,740,000 dealer retail - the tightest cluster anywhere in this dataset. Against that generation's 2,470,000 list that is 70.4%. Applied at 67% to the xLine's 2,490,000, a 3-point haircut for the entry trim (Taiwan buyers pay up for M Sport, and xLine is the bottom of the G45 range whereas 運動版 was a mid trim) = ~1,668,000 DEALER RETAIL. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private sale 12% below dealer retail -> 1,470,000; dealer trade-in a further 12.2% below private -> 1,290,000. That is 66.1% of real_cost, so the 1y-to-3y fall is now 8 points over two years rather than the 20 points the reviewer flagged as the second steepest in the set. CAVEAT ON THE DENOMINATOR: the 2,470,000 original list for the 2022-2023 G01 LCI xDrive20i 運動版 comes from U-CAR, which returns HTTP 403 to direct fetch and could not be re-verified this round or last; if that figure is wrong the ratio moves with it. Confidence medium on the strength of three real same-trim listings, held back from high by the unverifiable denominator."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"RAISED slightly from 1,040,000, which is the reviewer's second question - whether 5y ~46% still holds once year 1 is fixed - answered as 'almost, but it was a point or two too harsh'. EXTRAPOLATED: the G45 is only ~20 months old, so no genuine 5-year data exists and none was invented. TWO HONEST READS THAT DISAGREE, both from listings re-fetched this round. (a) Pre-LCI cliff read: real 2021 G01 cars at true 5-year age ask 978,000 at 27,000 km (the same 金鑽-certified Kaohsiung car appears on both 8891 and SUM, so it is ONE data point, not two), 1,058,000 at 72,850 km, 988,000 at 96,000 km, 868,000 at 70,000 km. Against a ~2,330,000 list that is ~42%. This read is structurally apt - a 2026 G45 at 5 years old in 2031 will itself be a pre-facelift car of its generation, exactly as a 2021 G01 is today, since the G45 LCI is expected around 2028. (b) Smooth-decay read: the low-mileage asking sequence for this model family runs 2,230,000 (2026) -> 2,000,000 (2024) -> 1,740,000 (2023) -> 1,468,000 (2022) -> 978,000 (2021), i.e. year-on-year steps of -10%, -13%, -16%, then a -33% cliff. Continuing the smooth part instead of the cliff implies ~52%. WHY THE CLIFF READ IS DISCOUNTED RATHER THAN ADOPTED: the 2021 cars are 白金版 while the 2022 cars are 運動版, so that -33% step mixes a trim change into what looks like a facelift cliff, and I could not verify the 白金版 original list to separate the two. The pre-LCI G01 cohort was also depressed by 外匯車 grey-import supply that is specific to those years. Set at 49% of list = ~1,220,000 DEALER RETAIL, between the two reads. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private sale 12% below -> 1,080,000; dealer trade-in 13% below -> 940,000. That is 48.5% of real_cost, which puts this car at the bottom of the German group (GLC 51, XC60 49, V250d 49, Tiguan 48) but no longer detached from it - defensible because BMW Taiwan's ~12% new-car discount is the largest of the four, and heavy new-car discounting is precisely what suppresses used values. Low confidence: the two predecessor reads still differ by ~10 points and one of them is trim-contaminated."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"LOWERED from 850,000. EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor G01 at the same age, expressed as a retention ratio of ITS original list and re-applied to this car. Real 2019 G01 listings re-fetched from SUM this round: 81,376 km asking 928,000 and 130,167 km asking 788,000; the 2018 cohort (8 years) runs 678,000-858,000 at 100,000-156,000 km, with a 243,000 km outlier at 498,000. Every comparable carries 80,000-156,000 km against this buyer's 49,000 km, so a ~+10% low-mileage premium on the 81,376 km / 928,000 car gives ~1,020,000 dealer retail against a ~2,360,000 original list = ~43%, reduced to 38% for the xLine entry trim and because the mileage premium is a judgement rather than a measurement. 2,490,000 x 38% = ~946,000 DEALER RETAIL. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private sale 12% below -> 830,000; dealer trade-in a further 13.9% below -> 715,000 (the dealer spread widens with age because reconditioning is a larger share of a cheaper car). That is 37.3% of real_cost, an 11-point fall from year 5. IMPORTANT HONESTY NOTE, unchanged from the prior version and still true: the observed G01 curve is nearly FLAT between 5 and 7 years (2021 cars 868,000-1,058,000 vs 2019 cars 788,000-928,000) because the 2021s are themselves depressed by the facelift boundary. The modelled 5-to-7 slope is therefore imposed on the reasoning that the G45 will have absorbed its own pre-LCI discount by year 5, not measured from the predecessor. Low confidence."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"LOWERED from 550,000. EXTRAPOLATED from the F25 generation (two generations back) at true 10-year age, since neither the G45 nor the G01 is old enough. Real listings re-fetched this round: SUM 2016 F25 at 88,888 km asking 468,000, at 130,200 km 469,000, at 143,866 km 398,000, at 160,000 km 458,000; SUM 2017 F25 at 97,615 km 700,000 and 117,934 km 458,000; 8891 2017 cars at 29,000 km 648,000, 56,000 km 528,000, 100,000 km 458,000, 110,000 km 498,000; 2015 cars at 90,000-97,000 km 380,000-420,000. Interpolating the 10-year (2016) cohort to this buyer's exceptionally low 70,000 km gives ~510,000, against an F25 xDrive20i list of ~2,360,000 = ~22% retention. Set at a kinder 24% (~598,000 DEALER RETAIL) because the G45 is a far better-equipped generation and 70,000 km at 10 years is genuinely exceptional (average would be 120,000-150,000 km); held to 24% rather than higher because the G45's heavy electronics (curved display, BMW OS 9, 48V mild-hybrid system) carry materially more 10-year repair risk than an F25, and a 10-year-old car with a suspect 48V starter-generator is hard to sell at any price. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private sale 12% below -> 530,000; dealer trade-in a further 16% below -> 445,000 (widest spread of the curve, as trade-in bids on decade-old German cars are close to wholesale-auction money). That is 23.8% of real_cost. Low confidence: two-generations-removed extrapolation, and the F25 asking prices scatter widely at similar mileage."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Covers 0-1 year. RAISED from 8,000. BMW Taiwan's 每年或每一萬公里 interval and the 2+1 year unlimited-mileage warranty were both re-verified by direct fetch of the 台北依德 BMW service page this round. One visit only in this window, fully inside warranty, so no repair exposure. Oil + filter service priced at 9,000 rather than the previous 7,500: the Mobile01 band of 6,000-9,000 comes from threads about older, plainer 2.0 BMWs, and a 2026 B48 with a 48V mild-hybrid system serviced at a 汎德 dealer belongs at the top of that band, not the middle. Wipers 1,000. Sums to 10,000. CAVEAT: Mobile01 returns HTTP 403 to direct fetching and was not re-fetched this round either, so the servicing price band remains a secondary reading."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers years 1-3 only, not cumulative. RAISED from 23,000. Two annual services at 9,000 each = 18,000; brake fluid at the 2-year mark 4,000 (a calendar item explicitly called out in the Mobile01 X3 20i thread as 滿二年要換剎車油); cabin + air filters 5,000; wipers 1,000. Sums to 28,000. Still inside the 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty (re-verified on the 台北依德 page this round), so zero repair cost assumed. Cross-check: one Mobile01 owner reported 4 services over 2 years / 60,000 km totalling ~30,000 including spark plugs and brake fluid; this buyer needs only 2 services in the same span but at 2026 prices, so ~28,000 is consistent. Same Mobile01 403 caveat."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers years 3-5 only. RAISED from 52,000. Two annual services at 9,500 = 19,000; brake fluid 4,000; coolant 6,000; AGM 12V battery 18,000 - raised from 15,000 because a BMW AGM replacement is not just the battery: the car requires battery registration/coding to the power-management module, without which the new battery is chronically undercharged, and that is dealer labour. BMW AGM batteries typically last 4-6 years in Taiwan's heat regardless of mileage, and the Mobile01 X5 養車費用 thread documents an 原廠AGM電池 replacement as a named line item. Filters 5,000; out-of-warranty allowance 10,000 now that the 3-year warranty has lapsed. Sums to 62,000. No tires or brake pads yet - at 35,000 km the original tires still have tread and are only ~5 years old, just short of the age limit. Extrapolated risk pricing, not receipts."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers years 5-7 only - the first genuinely expensive window. RAISED from 135,000. Two annual services 20,000; the dominant item is TIRES at 60,000, raised from 50,000 because the G45 wears RUNFLATS as standard - genuine 19-inch runflats fitted in Taiwan run ~15,000 each against ~11,000-12,000 for a comparable conventional tire, and a runflat cannot be plug-repaired, so this is the single line where BMW is structurally dearer than the Mercedes/Audi/Volvo comparators. Replacement is triggered by the 5-6 year rubber age limit rather than wear: at 49,000 km the originals would still have tread, the classic low-mileage trap. Front pads + discs 34,000 (raised from 28,000 - BMW 原廠 discs on a 1,855 kg SUV are not a budget item); spark plugs 14,000 (Mobile01 t=6459834 lists 火星塞 as a named periodic item); brake fluid 4,000; filters 5,000; plus a 25,000 probability-weighted allowance for the well-known B48 electric water pump/thermostat failure or oil filter housing gasket leak, now fully out of warranty. Sums to 162,000. Air suspension risk is correctly NOT included - the xLine runs steel springs. Extrapolated risk pricing, not receipts."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers years 7-10 only, three annual visits. RAISED from 172,000. Services 3 x 10,500 = 31,500; brake fluid x2 8,500; filters 7,000; coolant 6,000; second AGM battery + coding 19,000 (the Mobile01 X5 養車費用 thread documents AGM replacement around the decade / 100,000 km mark); rear pads + discs 28,000 (rears finally due at 70,000 km); ignition coils 16,000; water pump + thermostat 38,000 if not already consumed in the prior window; and a 46,000 general allowance for VANOS solenoids, sensors, bushes/dampers and - the item that most distinguishes this car from a conventional German SUV - 48V mild-hybrid starter-generator exposure on a 10-year-old car, where the part is expensive and the labour is engine-adjacent. Sums to 200,000. No second tire set: the year-6 runflats reach year 10 with only ~28,000 km and ~4 years of age, falling due around year 11-12. Extrapolated risk pricing, not receipts - hence low confidence."}],"sources":[{"name":"Yahoo Autos TW - 2026 BMW X3 20 xDrive xLine 車款介紹","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-x3-2026-20-xdrive-xline","note":"PRIMARY price source. RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED in this second-round review: 建議售價 NT$2,490,000 for the exact trim, model year 2026; 1998cc turbo inline-4, 190 hp @4400rpm / 31.6 kgm @1500rpm, 8AT, 13.5 km/L combined (11.42 city / 15.01 highway)."},{"name":"KingAutos - 2025/2026 BMW X3 20 xDrive xLine 規格","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/spec/11421","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED in this second-round review. Independent confirmation of NT$2,490,000 for this exact trim, plus 4755x1920x1660mm, 2865mm wheelbase, 1855 kg kerb weight, 570-1700 L cargo, MacPherson front / multi-link rear. Note the page labels the powertrain 油電混合(HEV), which refers to the 48V mild-hybrid; the record classifies it 'gasoline' because the 48V system cannot move the car on its own."},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 - 大改BMW X3售價249萬起上市","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/229005","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED in this second-round review. Full G45 Taiwan lineup: 20 xDrive xLine 2,490,000 / 20 xDrive M Sport 2,770,000 / M50 xDrive 3,830,000; launched 2024-12-19, deliveries from Feb 2025. KEY NEGATIVE FINDING re-confirmed this round: no complimentary maintenance program is mentioned anywhere; the only bundled perk is lifetime free navigation map updates. This is the basis for treating scheduled servicing as fully paid."},{"name":"PTT car board - [菜單] BMW/正25/X3 (March 2026)","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1773543577.A.FE6.html","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED in this second-round review - real post, exactly this trim. 牌價 249萬, 實際成交 220萬 then negotiated to 218萬, pearl white, built July 2025, an inventory unit ~6 months old at sale. Included 行車記錄器/隔熱紙/ETag/交車禮; registration fees NOT included. DECISIVE DETAIL confirmed this round: commenters did NOT regard the deal as generous - they called it 'only about 9.7-10% off' and argued for 200萬 or below. That is why the modelled discount was raised to 300,000 rather than left below both observed transactions, and this post is also the anchor for the new-car street price (2,190,000) that the 1-year resale point is now built on."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW X3 xDrive20i 二手價格 (full listing set)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/x3/x3-xdrive20i","note":"PRIMARY used-value source and the most important fetch of this round - it returned a much fuller listing set (~40 cars) than the earlier audit saw. THE FINDING THAT DROVE THE 1-YEAR CORRECTION: a 2026 20 xDrive xLine - the exact trim - with 2,001 km listed at 2,230,000, i.e. ABOVE the 2,190,000 street price of a brand-new one, proving near-new asks in this segment are unachievable and unusable as anchors. Also newly seen: 2025 M Sport 45,500 km at 2,430,000 (a higher ask at higher mileage than the 11,000 km car at 2,380,000 - noise, not signal); 2023 Sport 17,000 km = 1,750,000; 2022 Sport 55,800 km = 1,520,000 and 55,000 km = 1,398,000; 2021 白金版 96,000 km = 988,000; 2020 83,700 km = 950,000 and 100,000 km = 809,000; 2018 106,300 km = 738,000 and 156,000 km = 679,000; 2017 56,000 km = 528,000, 110,000 km = 498,000; 2015 97,000 km = 380,000, 90,000 km = 388,000. All are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking) and were cut 12% to private sale, except at year 1 where the asking segment was rejected outright."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW X3 總覽 (272 listings)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/x3","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED this round. Confirms the same near-new set: 2026 xLine 2,001 km price-on-inquiry on this view, 2025 20 xDrive M Sport 11,000 km = 2,380,000, 2025 M50 6,000 km = 3,398,000, 2024 xDrive20i M Sport Platinum 29,300 km = 2,000,000, 2023 xDrive20i Sport 24,500 km = 1,730,000 and 60,000 km = 1,428,000, 2023 xDrive30i M Sport 37,000 km = 1,890,000 and 93,000 km = 1,680,000. The 2,230,000 figure for the 2026 xLine came from the xDrive20i sub-page above, which exposes the price this overview page hides."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - BMW X3 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=BMW&model=X3","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED this round (29 listings), independent of 8891. Used mainly for the 5-, 7- and 10-year points: 2021 G01 27,273 km = 978,000 (the same 金鑽-certified car 8891 also lists, so ONE data point not two), 2021 72,850 km = 1,058,000, 2022 G01 28,994 km = 1,468,000, 2020 95,564 km = 1,018,000, 2019 81,376 km = 928,000 and 130,167 km = 788,000, 2018 range 498,000-858,000 at 100,000-243,000 km, 2017 F25 97,615 km = 700,000 and 117,934 km = 458,000, 2016 F25 88,888 km = 468,000 / 130,200 km = 469,000 / 143,866 km = 398,000 / 160,000 km = 458,000, 2015 F25 112,496 km = 599,000, 2013 F25 123,332 km = 268,000."},{"name":"台北依德 BMW - 保修服務／延長保固方案","url":"https://yiderbmw.wordpress.com/bmw-service-extend/","note":"KEY maintenance source. RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED this round: (a) new-car warranty 2+1年不限里程 = 3 years unlimited mileage, (b) scheduled service interval 每年或每一萬公里 whichever comes first - which is what makes this buyer's servicing time-driven, and (c) the factory warranty can be extended 1 or 2 years if a 新車保固到期檢查 is done before the 36-month mark. Confirmed again this round that the page publishes NO prices (it directs readers to phone the dealer), so it supports the service SCHEDULE only, never the service COST. It is a dealer-affiliated WordPress blog, not an official 汎德 corporate page - a strong secondary source, not an official table."},{"name":"Mobile01 - 請教BMW X3 20i頭兩年的保養費用","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=275&t=6459834","note":"Owner-reported X3 20i servicing costs, the basis for years 1-5 unit pricing: basic 小保養 (原廠機油 + 濾芯 + 工資) ~6,000-7,000 rising to 7,000-9,000 per visit; 滿二年要換剎車油; 火星塞 named as a periodic item. This round the record prices services at the TOP of that band and above (9,000-10,500) because the thread concerns older, plainer 2.0 cars than a 2026 B48 with 48V. CAVEAT: mobile01 returns HTTP 403 to direct fetching and was NOT re-fetched this round either - read via search-result extracts only. A main reason years 5-10 maintenance is low confidence."},{"name":"Mobile01 - BMW 汽車每年的保養費?","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=275&t=7262216","note":"Cross-check on annual BMW servicing cost in Taiwan ('台灣2.0保養以前5000多慢慢漲價6000，現在7000'), plus one owner reporting 4 services over 2 years / 60,000 km totalling ~30,000 including spark plugs and brake fluid. Note the quoted trend is itself a record of steady price INCREASES, which is part of why the 2026-onward unit costs were raised this round. Same 403 caveat - not verifiable by direct fetch."},{"name":"Mobile01 - BMW X5 養車費用 (含10萬公里保養 + 原廠AGM電池)","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=275&t=6722409","note":"Used only to confirm that an 原廠 AGM 12V battery replacement is a real named line item on a long-term BMW ownership ledger around the decade / 100,000 km mark, supporting the battery entries in the 5- and 10-year windows. Larger model (X5) so absolute figures were not copied across. Same 403 caveat."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 - 建議售價229萬元，BMW X3 xDrive20i國內上市","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/41059","note":"Source of the predecessor G01 xDrive20i original list prices (2,290,000 at introduction, later 2,360,000 and 2,470,000 for the 2022 LCI xDrive20i 運動版). These are the DENOMINATORS for the retention ratios in the 3/5/7-year extrapolations, so they matter. CAVEAT, and it is a real weakness: U-CAR returned HTTP 403 on direct fetch again in this round, as in the previous audit, so these denominators remain unverified. The 3-year point is the one most exposed to this - it is stated as 70.4% of 2,470,000."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 - 新增xLine入門售價249至383萬，大改款BMW X3正式上市","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/82248","note":"Independent confirmation of the G45 Taiwan lineup and the 2,490,000 xLine entry trim. CAVEAT: returned HTTP 403 on direct fetch in this round too, so it is unverified here - but the identical lineup and pricing WERE verified via the TVBS, Yahoo Autos and KingAutos fetches, so no number depends on this URL alone."},{"name":"BMW Taiwan - BMW Service Inclusive 保養套裝","url":"https://www.bmw.com.tw/zh/topics/offers-and-services/personal-services/bmw-service-inclusive.html","note":"Official 汎德 page for the prepaid maintenance package, cited to establish that scheduled maintenance in Taiwan is PAID rather than bundled free with the car. CAVEAT: this page TIMED OUT on direct fetch in the original research, in the first audit, and again in this round (bmw.com.tw is heavily JS-rendered). The 'no complimentary scheduled maintenance' claim is however now independently supported by the TVBS launch report, which was fetched successfully and lists only free lifetime map updates as a bundled benefit - so this assumption is no longer resting on an unfetchable page alone."}]},"audi-q5":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr (~7,000 km/yr midpoint), roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/yr. Checkpoint mileage = 7,000 x years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). Two consequences drive the record: (1) at 7,000 km/yr any service interval of 10,000 km or more is TIME-triggered, so every service is one per year and wear parts (tyres, pads, fluids, battery) are replaced on AGE rather than wear; (2) resale is quoted against low-mileage listings, which sit above the mileage-blind 行情 average. Tax (牌照稅/燃料費) and insurance are excluded by design. DEPRECIATION CURVE — REBUILT THIS PASS after a cross-vehicle review flagged the curve as the steepest AND the lowest of 17 cars. Root cause found and fixed: the prior draft read only PAGE 1 of the 8891 Audi Q5 listing set and, within each year-cohort, anchored on the CHEAPEST row while describing it as 'the best anchor'. Page 2 (re-fetched this pass, https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q5?page=2) contains rows that directly refute three of those anchors: (a) the 2023 @ 6,100 km = 138.0 萬 car the prior draft rebuilt the whole 3-year checkpoint on is the CHEAPEST 2023 listing in the set despite having the LOWEST mileage, and sits 17.8 萬 BELOW a lower-spec 2023 享馭版 with more than double the mileage — an outlier-low signature, not an anchor; (b) the 2020 @ 34,000 km = 84.8 萬 row the prior draft used as a binding cap on the 5-year estimate is contradicted by a 2020 @ 27,000 km asking 98.8 萬, i.e. a lower-mileage car of the same year asking 14 萬 MORE; (c) a third current-generation listing (2025 @ 1,575 km = 239.0 萬) shows year-1 dealer-retail retention is ~86% of list, not the 82% the prior draft applied. The 8891 Audi Q5 population is extremely dispersed — 2021 cars at ~50,000 km span 95.8-116.8 萬 (a 21 萬 spread at identical age and mileage) — so single-row anchoring is invalid throughout and cohort centres are used instead. A separate, explicitly-sized +4% adjustment is applied at years 3/5/7 for SUPERSEDED-GENERATION BIAS: every B9 comparator on the market today is a run-out generation competing against a brand-new redesigned Q5 that launched Oct 2025, whereas this car will be MID-CYCLE at its own 3-5-7 year marks, which is the basis on which every peer vehicle in this comparison is priced. Net effect: 3y retention moves from 48.7% to 55.1% of real_cost and 10y from 17.8% to 22.5%, the largest single-segment drop falls from 23.3 points to 18.6 (group norm is 18.7-19.5), and the car is no longer the group floor at every checkpoint. It remains BELOW BMW X3 and Mercedes GLC at every point, because the observed Audi B9/B8 data genuinely does read softer than the Mercedes and BMW equivalents and because this is the FWD entry trim; the correction regresses toward the German cluster, it does not force a match. Caveat that dominates everything after year 1: this generation only went on sale in Taiwan on 2025-10-02, so it is under 1 year old today (2026-08-11). Only the year-1 checkpoint has current-generation evidence; years 3/5/7/10 are extrapolated from the predecessor (B9 Q5, 2018-2025 TW) and the generation before it (B8, for year 10), and are all marked low confidence. WARRANTY REMAINS UNVERIFIED: audi.com.tw was retried this pass via both WebFetch and curl with a desktop browser user-agent and returns HTTP 503 on every path. Audi Taiwan's long-published standard term is 3 years unlimited mileage, with 5-year cover normally sold as an extended-warranty product or run as a campaign, so the 3-5 year window may well be out of warranty. No warranty claim is treated as load-bearing anywhere in this record.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"RAISED from 1,700,000 / 1,480,000. The only checkpoint with genuine CURRENT-generation evidence, and the evidence base grew this pass. 8891 中古車 (auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q5) re-fetched 2026-08-11 across BOTH result pages now yields THREE new-generation cars, all TFSI quattro 150 kW S line 運動版 against that trim's 270 萬 MY2025 list: 2,360 km = 228.0 萬 (84.4%), 2,000 km = 228.0 萬 (84.4%), and — new this pass, from page 2, missed entirely by the prior draft — 1,575 km = 239.0 萬 (88.5%). Cohort mean ~231.7 萬 = 85.8% dealer-retail retention. The prior draft applied 82%, which is BELOW every single observed data point; that unexplained extra haircut is the error corrected here. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN (all listed figures are 車商售價, i.e. dealer RETAIL asking, never what an owner receives): take 84% of list rather than the observed 85.8%, a deliberate 1.8-point trim because our car carries 7,000 km against the comparables' 1,575-2,360 km — 84% x 240 萬 = 201.6 萬 dealer retail; trimmed 2% for the FWD entry variant = 197.6 萬; private sale = dealer retail MINUS 12% = 174 萬; dealer trade-in (車商收購) = private MINUS 12.9% = 151.5 萬. Low-mileage listings only, not the mileage-blind 行情. Cross-checked against Audi 奧迪嚴選 CPO (re-fetched: 2024 @ 7,113 km = 1,698,000; 2024 @ 13,619 km = 1,528,000; 2024 @ 16,636 km = 1,648,000), used only as an upper bound since CPO asks sit above ordinary 車商售價. Result is 73.7% of real_cost at one year, squarely inside the German-luxury cluster in this comparison (Mercedes GLC 74.0%, Volvo XC60 73.5%, Porsche Cayenne 75.3%)."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"RAISED from 1,150,000 / 1,000,000 — this was the review's main objection and it is upheld. EXTRAPOLATED from the direct predecessor (B9 Q5); the current generation is under 1 year old in Taiwan, so no real 3-year data exists for it. WHY THE PRIOR FIGURE WAS WRONG: it was rebuilt on a single row, 2023 @ 6,100 km = 138.0 萬 (40 TFSI quattro advanced 進化版), described as 'the single most relevant anchor'. Page 2 of the same 8891 result set, fetched this pass and never seen by the prior draft, shows that row is the CHEAPEST 2023 listing in the whole set despite carrying the LOWEST mileage, and that it sits 17.8 萬 BELOW a 2023 享馭版 with 13,600 km (155.8 萬) — a lower-spec car with more than double the mileage asking substantially more. The 2024 cohort settles the trim ordering in the opposite direction: 進化版 at 169.8 萬 (7,115 km), 167.8 萬 (16,000 km) and 164.8 萬 (16,700 km) versus 享馭版 at 145.0 萬 (9,900 km), i.e. 進化版 normally sits ~22 萬 ABOVE 享馭版. So the 138.0 萬 row is an outlier low, not an anchor. Compounding this, the prior draft 'interpolated' from that row to a 44,600 km car at 122.9 萬 — but the second car is a Technik 豪華版, a cheaper trim, so the interpolation charged a trim step to the mileage slope and manufactured an artificially steep curve. FULL 2023 COHORT re-read 2026-08-11 (車商售價): 進化版 @ 6,100 km = 138.0; 享馭版 @ 13,600 km = 155.8; Technik @ 44,600 and @ 44,800 km = 122.9; 享馭版 @ 49,000 km = 107.0; 享馭版 @ 61,000 km = 109.0; Technik @ 70,000 km = 118.9; Technik @ 76,000 km = 100.5 (萬). TWO INDEPENDENT ROUTES now agree: (a) the low-mileage 3-year band is 138.0-155.8 萬 centred ~147 萬 at 6,100-13,600 km, and our 21,000 km sits just above it → ~145 萬 dealer retail; (b) working DOWN from the tight 2024 進化版 cluster at ~167.5 萬, one further year at the segment's ~12%/yr → ~147 萬. Take 145 萬. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: 145 萬 x 1.04 for superseded-generation bias (every B9 comparator is a run-out generation competing against the brand-new Q5 launched Oct 2025, whereas this car is mid-cycle at its own 3-year mark — an explicitly sized judgement, not a measurement) = 151 萬; trimmed 2% for FWD = 148 萬 → private sale MINUS 12% = 130 萬 → dealer trade-in MINUS 13.1% = 113 萬. Gives 55.1% of real_cost, versus Volvo XC60 54.8% and Porsche Cayenne 56.0% in this comparison, and still 7 points below BMW X3 and Mercedes GLC (both ~62%) as the softer Audi data and FWD entry trim warrant."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"RAISED from 900,000 / 780,000. EXTRAPOLATED from predecessor-generation listings. WHY THE PRIOR FIGURE WAS WRONG: it leaned on a 2020 Q5 @ 34,000 km asking 84.8 萬 as the row that 'most constrains a low-mileage 5-year estimate'. Page 2, fetched this pass, contains a 2020 @ 27,000 km asking 98.8 萬 (45 TFSI quattro Active Plus) — a same-year car with 7,000 km LESS asking 14 萬 MORE. The 84.8 萬 row is therefore the low tail of a wide spread, not a cap, and the prior draft's whole 'mileage barely moves price' inference was drawn from the cheap edge of the distribution. FULL 5-YEAR COHORT re-read 2026-08-11 (2021 cars, 車商售價): @ 48,000 km = 95.8; @ 50,000 km = 106.8; @ 50,000 km = 116.8; @ 61,600 km = 97.9; @ 62,700 km = 97.9; @ 67,000 km = 95.8 (享馭版); @ 110,000 km = 87.5 (萬). Note the dispersion: three cars at essentially 48,000-50,000 km span 95.8-116.8 萬, a 21 萬 spread at identical age and mileage, which is why the cohort CENTRE (~106.5 萬 at ~50,000 km) is used rather than any single row. Our car has 35,000 km, i.e. ~15,000 km less than that centre → ~112 萬 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: 112 萬 x 1.04 superseded-generation bias = 116.5 萬; trimmed 2% for FWD = 114 萬 → private sale MINUS 12% = 101 萬 → dealer trade-in MINUS 13.4% = 87.5 萬. Gives 42.8% of real_cost, essentially level with Porsche Cayenne (43.5%) and below BMW X3 (46.1%) and Mercedes GLC (51.3%). This checkpoint may sit at or beyond the end of factory warranty depending on the unverified warranty term; no warranty-driven price support is assumed either way."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"RAISED from 670,000 / 580,000. EXTRAPOLATED — no genuine 7-year data exists for this generation. Two 2019 Q5 comparables were found across both pages, both 45 TFSI quattro Active Plus and both at 50,000 km, essentially matching this buyer's 49,000 km: 76.8 萬 and 69.8 萬 車商售價. The prior draft transferred the higher of the two almost directly and, because the mileage already matched, applied no adjustment at all. That single-row transfer is what this pass rejects, on a ladder-consistency test the prior draft never ran: the 2021 cohort centres ~106.5 萬 at ~50,000 km and a 2020 car at 27,000 km asks 98.8 萬, so a smooth age ladder through to a 2019 car at 50,000 km lands near 85-88 萬 — meaning BOTH observed 2019 rows sit below the ladder and are the low tail of the same dispersed population seen at every other age (2021 cars at one mileage span 21 萬). Ladder value ~87 萬 is used, with the two observed rows recorded as the low tail rather than as the estimate. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: 87 萬 x 1.04 superseded-generation bias = 90.5 萬; trimmed 2% for FWD = 88.7 萬 → private sale MINUS 12% = 79 萬 → dealer trade-in MINUS 13.9% = 68 萬. Gives 33.5% of real_cost. This is still the lowest 7-year figure in the 17-car comparison, ~2 points under Volkswagen Tiguan (35.4%), Porsche Cayenne (36.7%), Volvo XC60 (36.8%) and BMW X3 (37.7%) — retained deliberately, because the observed Audi B9 data really does read softer than the BMW and Mercedes equivalents at this age and the record should not be curve-fitted past what the evidence supports. Low confidence: cross-generation transfer plus an explicit smoothing judgement, not observed data for the car being priced."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"RAISED from 420,000 / 365,000 — the review's second specific objection (10y being the group floor at 17.8%, under Porsche 18.8% and Volvo 19.7%) and it is upheld. EXTRAPOLATED — no 10-year data can exist for a generation launched in Oct 2025, so this transfers older-generation (B8) prices. Real 8891 車商售價 re-read 2026-08-11 across both pages: 2016 @ 92,100 km = 43.8 萬; 2016 @ 150,000 km = 25.9 萬; 2017 (9 yrs) @ 104,300 km = 55.9 萬; 2017 @ 135,000 km = 49.6 萬 (35 TDI); 2015 @ 130,000 km = 23.8 / 28.8 / 37.8 萬. The 2016 pair gives a usable mileage slope of ~3.1 萬 per 10,000 km (17.9 萬 across 57,900 km); extending from 92,100 km down to our 70,000 km adds ~6.9 萬 → ~50.7 萬. WHAT THE PRIOR DRAFT MISSED: it credited only ~4 萬 for the same 22,100 km gap, and it never applied the low-mileage-at-high-age uplift that every peer record in this comparison applies at year 10 — 70,000 km on a 10-year-old car is genuinely exceptional against a 120,000-150,000 km norm, and the BMW X3 record lifts its F25-derived 20-21% retention to 25% for exactly this reason while the Volvo XC60 record lifts 16-17% to 19.5%. Applying the same house treatment here takes ~50.7 萬 to ~61 萬 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: 61 萬 trimmed 2% for FWD = 59.8 萬 → private sale MINUS 12% = 53 萬 → dealer trade-in MINUS 15.1% = 45 萬, the widest trade-in cut of any checkpoint because a 10-year-old German SUV needs heavy 整備 and turns over slowly. No superseded-generation uplift is applied here, since the B8 comparators are two generations back and the transfer is already the most speculative in the record. Gives 22.5% of real_cost, now above Porsche Cayenne (18.8%) and Volvo XC60 (19.7%) rather than below every car in the set. Low confidence and doubly so: cross-generation transfer from an older tech era, and at 10 years a German luxury SUV's value is dominated by condition and service history rather than age or mileage. Many TW dealers will simply decline to trade in a 10-year-old Audi at all, in which case 450,000 is optimistic."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Estimated from Audi Taiwan 原廠 小保養 pricing for a 2.0 TFSI (typically NT$7,000-9,000 per visit including oil, filter and shop materials); at 7,000 km/yr exactly one time-triggered service falls in this window. Year 1 is inside warranty under any reading of the term, so no repair allowance. Dealer-norm estimate; no owner receipt obtained (audi.com.tw 503, Mobile01 403). Not objected to by the review and carried over unchanged."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers years 1-3. Two time-triggered annual services at 原廠 rates (~8,000 for the lighter visit plus ~16,000 for the heavier third-year visit that adds air/cabin filters and the 2-year brake-fluid change), plus ~4,000 of wipers and alignment. Years 1-3 are inside warranty under any reading of the term, so no repair allowance. Audi TW dealer-norm estimates, not a fetched invoice. Not objected to by the review and carried over unchanged."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers years 3-5. Cost build-up at 原廠 rates: 2 x annual service plus the heavier year-5 visit carrying spark plugs, brake fluid and S tronic fluid ~37,000; front/rear pads ~15,000; four 235/55 R19 tyres ~38,000 (tyre size confirmed as standard on this trim in Audi Taiwan's MY2025 Q5 SUV 規格配備表 PDF); AGM battery ~12,000. This is the window where low mileage HURTS: tyres and pads are scrapped largely for age at 35,000 km, so the owner pays full price for parts they barely used. Confidence is low because whether this window is inside warranty depends on the unverified warranty term — if Audi Taiwan's standard is 3 years rather than 5, part of this window carries unscheduled-repair exposure that is not budgeted here. Dealer-norm estimates; no receipt-level source obtained. Not objected to by the review and carried over unchanged."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers years 5-7. EXTRAPOLATED out-of-warranty cost. Build-up at 專業修護廠 rates: 2 x annual service ~17,000, coolant ~4,500, rear discs plus pads ~12,000, sundries ~8,000, and a risk-weighted ~55,000 allowance for known EA888 failure points (water pump plus thermostat housing ~25,000-35,000 at an independent shop, ignition coils ~12,000-18,000) — probability-weighted, not certainties, which is the main reason for low confidence. Sits above the year-5 figure, as the first fully out-of-warranty window on a German luxury SUV should. No fetched receipt source (audi.com.tw 503, Mobile01 403); workshop-norm estimate. Not objected to by the review and carried over unchanged."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers years 7-10. EXTRAPOLATED, highest-uncertainty entry. Itemised build-up at 專業修護廠 rates: 3 x annual service ~22,500, four tyres ~36,000, AGM battery ~10,000, spark plugs ~6,000, four dampers ~32,000, oil-seepage repairs (valve-cover gasket, cam-adjuster solenoid) ~20,000, S tronic fluid ~14,000, front discs plus pads ~14,000 = ~154,500; 170,000 is that itemisation plus a stated ~10% contingency. Averages ~57,000/yr across this window against ~9,000 in year 1. A low-mileage car does NOT escape this: nearly every item is age-triggered. Independent-shop norms, no fetched receipt. Not objected to by the review and carried over unchanged."}],"sources":[{"name":"Audi Taiwan 官方 MY2025 Audi Q5 SUV 規格配備表 (PDF, 2025-10-02)","url":"https://media.audi.com/is/content/audi/country/tw/assets/models/q5/q5/my2025/MY2025%20Audi%20Q5%20SUV%20%E8%A6%8F%E6%A0%BC%E9%85%8D%E5%82%99%E8%A1%A8%2020251002.pdf","note":"PRIMARY official source. Confirms 建議售價 (萬元) 230 / 270 / 382.9; trims 'TFSI 150 kW advanced 進化版 (GUBAZG)' and 'TFSI quattro 150 kW S line 運動版 (GUBAZY)'; 驅動型式 前輪驅動 for the entry car vs quattro for the others; 235/55 R19 tyres. The document prints no warranty or scheduled-maintenance terms, so it cannot support and is not used for any warranty claim."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Audi Q5 二手價格行情及中古車買賣 (page 1)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q5","note":"PRIMARY used-car source, re-fetched row by row on 2026-08-11. ALL figures are 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking), each cut 12% to private sale and a further 13-15% to dealer trade-in. Rows used: 2025 new-gen S line @ 2,360 km and @ 2,000 km both = 228.0 萬; 2024 advanced 進化版 @ 16,700 km = 164.8 萬; 2023 advanced 進化版 @ 6,100 km = 138.0 萬 (shown by the page-2 rows to be the low outlier of its cohort, NOT the anchor the prior draft made it); 2023 Technik 豪華版 @ 44,600 / 44,800 km = 122.9 萬, @ 70,000 km = 118.9 萬, @ 76,000 km = 100.5 萬; 2023 享馭版 @ 61,000 km = 109.0 萬; 2022 45 TFSI advanced 進化版 @ 10,930 km = 122.9 萬; 2021 @ 48,000 km = 95.8 萬, @ 61,600 / 62,700 km = 97.9 萬, @ 110,000 km = 87.5 萬; 2020 S line Urban @ 34,000 km = 84.8 萬; 2019 Active Plus @ 50,000 km = 76.8 萬; 2017 @ 104,300 km = 55.9 萬; 2016 @ 92,100 km = 43.8 萬, @ 150,000 km = 25.9 萬; 2015 @ 130,000 km = 23.8-28.8 萬. Page 1 alone is what the prior draft used, and it is what produced the too-steep curve."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Audi Q5 二手車列表 第 2 頁 (page 2)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q5?page=2","note":"NEW THIS PASS and the single most important correction source — the prior draft never read it, and it refutes three of that draft's anchors. Rows used, all 車商售價: 2025 new-gen S line @ 1,575 km = 239.0 萬 (third current-generation data point, lifts year-1 dealer-retail retention to ~86% of list versus the 82% previously applied); 2024 advanced 進化版 @ 7,115 km = 169.8 萬 and @ 16,000 km = 167.8 萬 (with page 1's 164.8 萬 these form a tight ~167.5 萬 two-year cluster); 2024 享馭版 @ 9,900 km = 145.0 萬 (establishes that 進化版 normally sits ~22 萬 ABOVE 享馭版, which is what exposes page 1's 138.0 萬 進化版 row as an outlier low); 2023 享馭版 @ 13,600 km = 155.8 萬 (a lower-spec 3-year car with double the mileage asking 17.8 萬 MORE than that 138.0 萬 row); 2023 享馭版 @ 49,000 km = 107.0 萬; 2022 45 TFSI 享馭版 @ 55,000 km = 108.8 萬; 2022 Launch Edition @ 74,100 km = 109.8 萬; 2021 @ 50,000 km = 116.8 萬 and = 106.8 萬, @ 67,000 km = 95.8 萬 (a 21 萬 spread at identical age and mileage — the dispersion that makes single-row anchoring invalid); 2020 Active Plus @ 27,000 km = 98.8 萬 (a lower-mileage 2020 asking 14 萬 MORE than page 1's 84.8 萬 car, refuting the prior draft's 5-year 'cap'); 2019 Active Plus @ 50,000 km = 69.8 萬; 2017 35 TDI @ 135,000 km = 49.6 萬."},{"name":"TVBS Auto — Audi 2026年式配備升級！Level 2更完整 多款車系調漲10萬 (2026-07-16)","url":"https://news.tvbs.com.tw/cars/3259163","note":"Re-fetched and re-confirmed this pass. Source for the MY2026 adjustment behind list_price: '包含A5、A5 Avant、A6 Sportback e-tron、A6 Avant e-tron、Q5、Q5 Sportback等多數車型均較舊年式調漲10萬元', and 'Q5及Q5 Sportback另新增TFSI quattro 150kW進化版車型，開價分別為257萬元、268萬元'. Re-confirmed that it prints NO per-trim table naming the entry FWD model — so list_price remains a derived figure, not a quoted one."},{"name":"8891 新車 — 新一代奧迪Q5/Q5 Sportback、SQ5齊登台！8車型230萬起","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/audi/q5/20805","note":"Re-fetched this pass. Full Taiwan launch price table for all 8 variants (Q5 230/270, Sportback 241/281, SQ5 382.9/393.9, SQ5 Edition One 341.5/352.5) with launch date 2025-10-02, independently confirming the entry trim at 230 萬 and its FWD 2.0T + 48V mild-hybrid powertrain. Used as the 270 萬 denominator for the S line resale comparables."},{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點 — 全域之旅 劃世代 Audi Q5豪華休旅車系 淬鍊登場","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/113533","note":"Re-fetched this pass. Third independent confirmation of the same official launch table and of the entry trim being front-wheel drive. Explicitly checked for warranty and free-maintenance terms: it states none."},{"name":"KingAutos — 230萬元起！大改款Audi Q5 同級唯一前驅 全面48V輕油電","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/365453","note":"Re-fetched this pass. Confirms the 2025-10-02 Taiwan launch and the resale-relevant fact that this entry trim is 台灣奧迪首度引進前驅版本 — the basis for the ~2% FWD resale penalty applied at every checkpoint. Explicitly checked for previous-generation prices and warranty terms: it gives neither."},{"name":"Audi 奧迪嚴選中古車 (Audi Approved :plus) — Q5 listings","url":"https://approvedplus.audi.com.tw/listing/2921/q5","note":"Re-fetched this pass and confirmed: 2024 Q5 @ 7,113 km = 1,698,000; 2024 @ 13,619 km = 1,528,000; 2024 @ 16,636 km = 1,648,000; 2022 45 TFSI quattro advanced @ 3,147 km = 2,198,000 (已售出). Used only as an upper-bound cross-check, never as an anchor: CPO asking prices sit ABOVE ordinary 車商售價 because they bundle a warranty. Note the internal inconsistency — the 13,619 km car asks LESS than the 16,636 km car — another reason it is not used as a primary anchor."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan 保固 (新車保固條款) — UNVERIFIED, page unreachable","url":"https://www.audi.com.tw/zh/Audi_Service/regular-warranty/","note":"NOT a usable source. Retried again this pass via both WebFetch and curl with a desktop browser user-agent: HTTP 503 every time, as is every other audi.com.tw path. No warranty term is treated as load-bearing anywhere in this record; the maintenance curve assumes cover ends somewhere between year 3 and year 5 and budgets out-of-warranty risk from year 5."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 售價230萬元起，Audi Q5等多款車系發表","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/85828","note":"Listed for traceability only. U-CAR returns HTTP 403/404 to direct fetch (re-tested this pass with a desktop browser user-agent). It corroborates the 230 萬 entry price but adds nothing the three fetched outlets above do not already establish. Not relied on for any number."}]},"volvo-xc60-b5-plus":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, well below the TW average of 12,000-15,000 km. All checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). This matters twice. (1) Servicing: Volvo's interval is 10,000 km OR 12 months, whichever comes first — at 7,000 km/year the CLOCK always wins, so the car gets one time-driven service per year and never a mileage-driven one. Wear items are therefore age-limited, not km-limited: tyres age out (~5-6 years) long before 235/55 R19 rubber wears out (confirmed as the factory size for both Plus and Ultra in Volvo TW's own MY2026 spec sheet), and the 12V AGM battery dies on calendar life. (2) Resale: every live listing found on 8891/SUM at these ages carries 42,000-180,000 km, so market comps were adjusted UPWARD for the low-mileage premium before the dealer-retail -> private-sale haircut. The uplift was capped at about +20% because the observed TW mileage sensitivity is milder than intuition suggests: the same 2021 B5 R-Design sells at NT$1,300,000 @53,000 km and NT$1,059,000 @109,300 km, i.e. roughly 0.35-0.4% per 1,000 km, and trim/condition scatter (NT$728,000-999,000 inside the 2019 cohort alone) dominates mileage at higher ages. POWERTRAIN NOTE: the B5 is a 48V mild hybrid (MHEV, marketed in TW as 輕油電). It is recorded as \"gasoline\" deliberately — an MHEV cannot move on electric power alone and depreciates on the European-petrol curve, not the Toyota/Lexus full-hybrid curve, so classifying it as \"hybrid\" would wrongly import a strong-resale anchor. Exact trim matched — MY2026 XC60 B5 Plus AWD is a real TW SKU, no substitution needed. Tax (牌照稅/燃料費/貨物稅) and insurance are excluded by design throughout.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"CORRECTED UPWARD on review. The reviewed record described its anchor comp as '25年式 XC60 B5 (2025-registered), 11,704 km, NT$1,758,000' on SUM. I re-fetched the SUM XC60 listing page: the 11,704 km / NT$1,758,000 car exists and the mileage matches exactly, but SUM lists it as a **2024**, not a 2025 — i.e. a TWO-year-old car, not one. The original therefore applied only a +4% nudge where a full extra year of age was owed, biasing year 1 downward. Corrected chain: NT$1,758,000 車商售價 for a 2-year-old at 11,704 km, x1.08 for being one model year younger and x1.02 for 7,000 vs 11,704 km, and then held back to ~NT$1,880,000 rather than the arithmetic 1,937,000 because dealer ASKING prices overstate the market and 8891's own 2-year-old T8 Recharge Ultimate (top trim, list NT$2,990,000) asks only NT$1,950,000. Then -11% -> 自售價 1,675,000, then -13% -> 車商收購價 1,455,000. Implies ~73% of real_cost after year 1, which is a normal first-year hit for European premium in TW. Also corrected a transcription error carried in the original: the 8891 2024 T8 Ultimate comp is at 1,900 km, not 19,000 km. Confidence held at medium — this rests on a single dealer listing of unstated trim."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"VERIFIED, figure unchanged; attribution corrected. The reviewed record credited these comps to '8891 (三立汽車 Taipei / Tainan)'. They are in fact SUM listings — my SUM fetch returns 2023 @42,805 km NT$1,288,000 and 2023 @49,334 km NT$1,299,000, exactly the two prices and mileages quoted, so the DATA is real even though the site attribution was wrong. Independent 8891 corroboration: 2023 Ultimate B5 AWD @65,200 km NT$1,359,000. Caution noted: 8891 lists a 2023 Recharge T8 AWD Plus @51,100 km at NT$1,299,000, and the original appears to have conflated that PHEV with a B5 — a T8 depreciates from a much higher list, so it must not be used as a B5 comp; it is excluded here. Chain: comps mean ~NT$1,293,000 車商售價 at ~46,000 km, +8.8% for our 21,000 km (at the observed ~0.35%/1,000 km TW sensitivity) -> ~NT$1,400,000 dealer retail, then -11% -> 自售價 1,250,000, then -13% -> 車商收購價 1,090,000. Still inside Volvo TW's 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty at this point, which supports the price."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"CORRECTED UPWARD on review — the original double-discounted. It stripped an '8-10% SELEKT certification premium' off a NT$1,370,000 @31,000 km listing that appears in NEITHER my 8891 nor my SUM fetch (unverifiable), and THEN applied a further x0.94 R-Design->Plus trim scale, cutting the same car twice. Rebuilt from comps I could actually verify. 8891 2021 cars: B5 R-Design @53,000 km NT$1,300,000; B5 R-Design @109,300 km NT$1,059,000; B4 Momentum Plus @100,000 km NT$998,000. SUM 2021 cars: @80,691 km NT$1,188,000 (this one the original did cite correctly), @83,477 km NT$999,000, @92,567 km NT$1,288,000, @102,410 km NT$1,098,000, @109,457 km NT$989,000. The 8891 R-Design pair brackets the mileage sensitivity directly — NT$1,300,000 vs NT$1,059,000 across 56,300 km is ~0.4% per 1,000 km. Applying that to the ~NT$1,098,000 median at ~93,000 km gives +20% (capped) for our 35,000 km -> ~NT$1,318,000, less ~5% because the comp set skews R-Design/Inscription against our Plus -> ~NT$1,252,000 車商售價. Then -11% -> 自售價 1,115,000, -13% -> 車商收購價 970,000. ~49% of real_cost at 5 years. Supporting context: the 2021 XC60 B5 Momentum listed new at NT$2,390,000 (7Car), identical to today's B5 Plus, so this is a genuine like-for-like retention read rather than an inflation-adjusted guess."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"FIGURE RETAINED, SOURCING CORRECTED, CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED to low. The original's key anchor was 'a 2019 T5 R-Design NT$998,000 @46,000 km, near-exact mileage match'. That car is real but 8891 lists it as a **2020**, not a 2019 — the original built a 7-year checkpoint on a 6-year-old car, embedding one year too little depreciation. Rebuilt from genuine 2019 comps. SUM 2019 cars: @80,742 km NT$999,000, @84,395 km NT$799,000, @90,000 km NT$728,000, @108,047 km NT$980,000; 8891 2019 T5 Momentum @130,000 km NT$698,000. Two independent routes: (a) the 2019 cohort means ~NT$877,000 at ~91,000 km, +14.7% for our 49,000 km and -5% for trim mix -> ~NT$955,000 車商售價; (b) working DOWN from the mislabelled 2020 R-Design, NT$998,000 x0.92 for one more year x0.94 for R-Design->Plus -> ~NT$863,000. The two routes bracket ~NT$860,000-955,000, and the original's implied ~NT$940,000 sits inside that band — so despite the misattributed comp the number survives and I have not moved it. Chain from ~NT$945,000 車商售價: -11% -> 自售價 840,000, -13% -> 車商收購價 730,000. Confidence cut from medium to low for two reasons the original understated: the anchor comp was misdated, and the 2019 cohort scatters from NT$728,000 to NT$999,000 at nearly identical mileage, so trim and condition dominate — plus these are T5/T6 pure petrol, since the B5 48V mild hybrid only reached TW in MY2021. Now out of the 3-year factory warranty, which is the main reason the curve steepens here."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no genuine 10-year data exists for this generation, and this was already flagged honestly in the reviewed record. The current SPA XC60 launched in TW in 2017-2018, so a 2016 car is the PREDECESSOR first-generation XC60. Method per instruction: real gen-1 prices at ~10+ years old, verified in my own SUM fetch (2015 @152,213 km NT$328,000; 2015 @167,874 km NT$368,000; 2014 @180,203 km NT$288,000; 2014 @184,397 km NT$388,000; 2013 @199,000 km NT$268,000), expressed as a ratio of gen-1's own original list (~NT$2,090,000 for T5 R-Design) = ~16-17% dealer-retail retention at 150,000+ km. The original adjusted +25% for our 70,000 km; I regard that as too generous given the ~0.35-0.4%/1,000 km sensitivity measured on the gen-2 comps, which implies nearer +15% -> ~19.5% dealer retail -> ~17.4% private -> ~NT$397,000 against real_cost. Offsetting that, gen-2 demonstrably holds a flatter curve than gen-1 (49% at 5 years, 37% at 7 here). The two adjustments push in opposite directions and roughly cancel, so 450,000 is retained as the midpoint of a ~NT$400,000-500,000 honest range. dealer_tradein 385,000 is a further -14%; the trade-in spread narrows in absolute terms at this age because the dealer's fixed reconditioning cost dominates. Confidence LOW and explicitly so — this is an honest extrapolation, not a sourced figure."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Verified PTT car board itemised XC60 receipt: 10,000 km service NT$9,062 (NT$7,455 excluding the NT$1,607 of optional additives), inflated ~15% to 2026 rates. Only ONE service falls in year 1 because the 12-month clock, not the 10,000 km odometer, triggers it at 7,000 km. Unchanged on review."},{"y":3,"source":"Two annual time-driven services derived from the same verified PTT receipt (the year-2 visit is the fuller '20,000 km content' service at NT$11,543 -> ~NT$14,000 in 2026 money, because brake fluid at NT$756 is age-based every 2 years regardless of mileage; the year-3 visit is a minor at ~NT$11,000), plus consumables. Zero repair allowance — Volvo TW's 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty, re-confirmed on review, covers engine, transmission, suspension, brakes and electrics through this entire window. Unchanged on review."},{"y":5,"source":"Services ~NT$26,000 for two annual visits (verified PTT receipt basis, inflated to 2026). The step change comes from age-based consumables, which is the defining feature of a low-mileage car: at 7,000 km/year the tyres reach only 35,000 km but hit the 5-6 year rubber-ageing limit, so a full set of premium 235/55 R19 (size confirmed as factory fitment for Plus in Volvo TW's own MY2026 spec sheet; Michelin/Pirelli class, TW fitted ~NT$11,000/tyre) is unavoidable regardless of tread depth. Battery replacement is likewise calendar-driven. Warranty expiry at year 3 means the 4th-5th year 延長保固 must be bought separately or repairs are self-funded; a modest allowance is embedded here. Unchanged on review."},{"y":7,"source":"RAISED from 88,000 to 98,000 on review. The reviewed record had year 7 (88,000) coming in BELOW year 5 (92,000), which broke the requirement that period_cost generally rise with age; more substantively, its NT$35,000 out-of-warranty reserve across the 5-7 year window works out to only ~NT$17,500/year for a European premium SUV with no factory cover at all — the paid 延長保固 itself caps at year 5 / 100,000 km, so this window is fully self-funded. Any single one of a water pump, thermostat, coil pack set or suspension bush job runs NT$15,000-30,000 at a Volvo dealer, so the reserve is raised to NT$45,000 and the period total to NT$98,000. Two annual services (~NT$28,000) still come from the verified PTT receipt basis. Beyond that this remains an ESTIMATE, not a sourced quote: no 7-year receipt for a B5 mild hybrid can exist yet, since the B5 only reached TW in MY2021 and the oldest are ~5 years old. Exposure here is age and rubber/plastic degradation plus the B5-specific 48V belt-driven starter-generator, not mileage — 49,000 km is genuinely low."},{"y":10,"source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no 10-year data exists for this generation (TW gen-2 XC60 is only ~9 years old, and the B5 powertrain only 5). Built as: three annual services (~NT$43,000, verified PTT receipt basis inflated to 2026) + calendar-driven consumables that a low-mileage car still cannot avoid (second tyre set at the 5-year ageing limit after the year-5 set, second 12V AGM battery) + Geartronic 8 (Aisin) transmission fluid, the transmission confirmed in Volvo TW's own MY2026 spec sheet + a 3-year out-of-warranty repair allowance sized on the general Taiwanese experience of 8-10 year old European premium SUVs. The verified PTT receipt author's own comment that Volvo servicing is 'comparable to BMW' supports treating this as a German-premium-equivalent budget rather than a cheaper one. Treat as an order-of-magnitude budget, not a quote. Unchanged on review."}],"sources":[{"name":"Volvo Cars Taiwan — official MY2026 XC60 price & specification sheet (PDF)","url":"https://www.volvocartw.com/pdf/carsp/XC60.pdf","note":"PRIMARY price source, RE-VERIFIED BY ME. Fetched the PDF and decompressed its FlateDecode text streams directly rather than relying on a summariser (the summariser failed to read it). Raw text yields 'XC60, B5 AWD ... Plus : NT$2,390,000', 'Ultra : NT$2,690,000', 'XC60, T8 AWD plug in Hybrid ... Ultra : NT$2,990,000', version stamp '2026 03'. Also independently confirms: 235/55 R19 on both Plus and Ultra with 19-inch Black Diamond Cut wheels, Geartronic 8 transmission, eAWD, 1,969 cc / 250 hp with '+14hp Mild Hybrid', Euro 6e, and option code 117 HUD at NT$60,000. list_price confirmed with 0% deviation."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 — 2026年式 Volvo XC60 上市，限時「隨心入主方案」224萬元起","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/42774-volvo-xc60-2026-224.html","note":"RE-VERIFIED BY ME. Independently confirms all three MY26 list prices (B5 MHEV Plus AWD NT$2,390,000 / B5 MHEV Ultra AWD NT$2,690,000 / T8 PHEV Ultra AWD NT$2,990,000), the NT$2,240,000 隨心入主 promo for B5 Plus that anchors the 150,000 discount, the first-batch free HUD '價值新台幣 6 萬元', and the NT$100,000 舊換新 + 貨物稅減徵 incentive that is deliberately EXCLUDED as a tax item. Launch April 2026."},{"name":"8891 新車 — Volvo 八月購車攻略（2026年8月方案）","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/volvo/xc60/22311","note":"RE-VERIFIED BY ME, and it materially qualifies the discount. The live August 2026 XC60 package is a free HUD upgrade plus NT$1,200,000/40-period 0% finance — there is NO advertised cash discount. It does advise '放棄高額零利率換取純空車現金折扣', but that swap is worth only ~NT$70,000-90,000 of interest at market rates, so the 150,000 figure leans on the April launch price as an anchor, not on a live offer. Also confirms the reviewed record's claim that the 4th-year extended warranty and first-year insurance apply to V60/XC90 but NOT XC60, and confirms no free scheduled maintenance for any Volvo model this month."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Volvo XC60 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/volvo/xc60","note":"RE-FETCHED BY ME; several comps in the reviewed record were mis-transcribed from it. Actually visible (216 listings): 2024 Recharge Ultimate T8 AWD @1,900 km NT$1,950,000 (the reviewed record said 19,000 km — a 10x error); 2023 Ultimate B5 AWD @65,200 km NT$1,359,000; 2023 Recharge T8 AWD Plus @51,100 km NT$1,299,000 (the reviewed record read this PHEV as a B5); 2022 B4 Momentum @41,000 km NT$1,068,000; 2022 B5 R-Design @22,360 km NT$879,000; 2022.5 B4 Momentum @12,000 km NT$828,000; 2021 B5 R-Design @53,000 km NT$1,300,000; 2021 B5 R-Design @109,300 km NT$1,059,000; 2021 B4 Momentum Plus @100,000 km NT$998,000; 2020 B5 R-Design @115,300 km NT$909,000; 2020 T8 Inscription @63,000 km NT$1,188,000; 2020 T5 R-Design @46,000 km NT$998,000 (the reviewed record dated this 2019 and built its whole 7-year checkpoint on it); 2019 T5 Momentum @130,000 km NT$698,000. ALL are 車商售價 and were reduced ~11% to private-sale and a further ~13% to trade-in. The 2021 B5 R-Design pair also calibrates TW mileage sensitivity at ~0.4% per 1,000 km."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — VOLVO XC60 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=VOLVO&model=XC60","note":"RE-FETCHED BY ME; URL is valid and returns 34 listings. Critically, the year-1 anchor was misdated in the reviewed record: the 11,704 km / NT$1,758,000 car is listed as a **2024**, not a 25年式/2025 — which is why year 1 was corrected upward. Verified listings used: 2024 @11,704 km NT$1,758,000; 2023 @42,805 km NT$1,288,000; 2023 @49,334 km NT$1,299,000; 2023 @63,273 km NT$1,478,000; 2021 @80,691 km NT$1,188,000; 2021 @83,477 km NT$999,000; 2021 @92,567 km NT$1,288,000; 2021 @102,410 km NT$1,098,000; 2021 @109,457 km NT$989,000; 2019 @80,742 km NT$999,000; 2019 @84,395 km NT$799,000; 2019 @90,000 km NT$728,000; 2019 @108,047 km NT$980,000. Gen-1 data for the 10-year extrapolation: 2015 @152,213 km NT$328,000; 2015 @167,874 km NT$368,000; 2014 @180,203 km NT$288,000; 2014 @184,397 km NT$388,000; 2013 @199,000 km NT$268,000; 2011 @160,000 km NT$165,000."},{"name":"PTT car board — [心得] Volvo XC60 2萬KM保養分享","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1601563814.A.612.html","note":"PRIMARY maintenance source, RE-VERIFIED BY ME line by line. Real post, October 2020, vehicle is an XC60 **T6** (not a B5 — worth stating, since the record prices a B5). 10,000 km service NT$9,062 (labour NT$1,575, engine oil NT$4,998, oil filter NT$756, drain plug NT$126, plus NT$1,607 of optional additives). 20,000 km service NT$11,543 (labour NT$2,678, engine oil NT$4,998, oil filter NT$767, brake fluid NT$756, drain plug NT$126, cabin filter NT$800 self-installed, plus optionals). Confirms the 10,000 km / 12-month interval; the author explicitly rates the cost 'comparable to BMW'. Inflated ~15-20% for 2026. Note: the reviewed record quoted a cabin filter at ~NT$1,800; the receipt says NT$800 self-installed."},{"name":"Volvo 保固幾年？保固期、範圍與尊榮救援指南","url":"https://www.drivinginstruct.com/volvo%E4%BF%9D%E5%9B%BA%E5%B9%BE%E5%B9%B4%EF%BC%9F/","note":"RE-VERIFIED BY ME. Confirms the reviewed record's key negative finding: Volvo TW standard warranty is 3 YEARS UNLIMITED MILEAGE for private use, 3 years / 100,000 km for commercial — not 5 years. Coverage listed as engine, transmission, suspension, braking, steering, electrical, cooling, paint, rust and glass, with roadside assistance included and consumables (oil, filters, brake pads, wipers, tyres) excluded. No complimentary scheduled maintenance mentioned. This is a secondary/aggregator domain rather than Volvo TW itself, so it is corroborated by the 8891 August promo page, which likewise shows no free servicing and restricts the 4th-year warranty offer to V60/XC90."},{"name":"KingAutos — 《Volvo》推 Volvo 保養服務合約方案 5萬公里保養免擔憂","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/202008","note":"RE-VERIFIED BY ME — the URL resolves to the real article despite its unusual short numeric form. Confirms the second key negative finding: Volvo TW's maintenance program is the PREPAID, PAID 「VOLVO 保養服務合約」, bought as an add-on at time of new-car purchase, covering scheduled services within 50,000 km, with a 「VOLVO Plus」 tier adding consumables such as brake pads and battery. It is NOT free scheduled maintenance, so period_cost was correctly not reduced. Also documents that the contract transfers to the next owner on resale."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 雙動力3車型售價239萬至299萬，2度小改款Volvo XC60正式上市","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/87466","note":"Launch report, April 2026, corroborating the MY26 lineup and the 239萬-299萬 price span in its own headline. The reviewed record noted a failed direct fetch; I did not re-attempt it, since the official PDF and CarStuff already establish the prices as primary sources. Treated as corroboration only, not load-bearing."},{"name":"Volvo Cars Taiwan — 延長保固服務 (extended warranty)","url":"https://www.volvocars.com/tw/l/extendedwarranty/","note":"Official page for the PAID 4th-5th year extended warranty, purchasable only within 36 months of registration and under 100,000 km. The reviewed record reported HTTP 403 on direct fetch and captured terms via search summary; I did not re-verify it. Flagged as an unverified source — the load-bearing 3-year warranty finding does not depend on it, only the detail of the paid extension's purchase window does."},{"name":"PTT car board — [菜單] Volvo XC60 B5 Plus","url":"https://www.pttweb.cc/bbs/car/M.1733815571.A.973","note":"Real transaction sheet cited by the reviewed record for the exact trim, settling at NT$2,090,000 on the prior model year with replies citing 194萬/192萬. NOT re-verified by me (web search budget was exhausted and I prioritised the used-value and price sources). Treated as supporting colour only — the 150,000 discount stands on Volvo TW's own published 隨心入主 price of NT$2,240,000, which I did verify, so nothing load-bearing rests on this URL."},{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點 — 2021 年式 Volvo XC60 新台幣 215 萬元起正式上市","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/69569","note":"Historical list prices used in the 5-year retention sanity check: B4 Momentum NT$2,150,000 / B4 Momentum Plus NT$2,249,000 / B5 Momentum NT$2,390,000 / B5 R-Design NT$2,542,000. The 2021 B5 Momentum at NT$2,390,000 being identical to today's B5 Plus list makes the 5-year checkpoint a true like-for-like read. Not re-verified by me; used only as corroboration for the trim-scaling factor, not as a price source."}]},"porsche-cayenne-30t":{"assumptions":"Low-mileage owner: 6,000-8,000 km/year, roughly half the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year. All checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). Two consequences run through the record. (1) Resale: a mileage premium is applied ONLY where the comparable listing actually has more kilometres than our car. This is the main correction made to the reviewed draft — the previous version applied a low-mileage premium at every checkpoint, including year 1 and year 3, where the 8891 comps used (2025 Coupé at 6,391 km; 2023 non-Coupé at 20,000 km) already sat at essentially our car's mileage, so the premium was counted twice: once by picking the top of the comp band, again as an explicit percentage uplift. Premium is now applied at years 5 and 7 only (comps there run 63,000-70,000 km against our 35,000-49,000). (2) Maintenance: Porsche's service interval is 15,000 km OR 12 months, whichever comes first, and the manual defines three tiers (小保養 15,000km / 中保養 30,000km / 大保養 60,000km). At 7,000 km/year NONE of those mileage thresholds is reached inside 10 years, so the plan is entirely TIME-driven — but time-driven does NOT mean 'a cheap oil service every year', which is where the reviewed draft went wrong. The sub-items carry their own time clocks (brake fluid 2 years, 火星塞 and centre-diff oil 4 years) and Porsche Taiwan bundles them into a full 大保養 at the 4-year and 8-year marks regardless of odometer: a 2020 Cayenne Coupé at four years and just 26,500 km paid NT$70,000 for exactly that service. So this plan is eight annual oil services plus two 大保養. Consumables likewise age out rather than wear out: tyres are replaced on a ~5-6 year age limit, not on tread depth, and the AGM battery on a 4-6 year clock. Tax (牌照稅 ~11,230/yr for 2,995cc + 燃料費 ~6,180/yr) and insurance are EXCLUDED by design and appear nowhere in this record.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"REVISED DOWN from the draft's 3,350,000. 8891 中古車 (auto.8891.com.tw/porsche/cayenne, re-fetched by the previous review 2026-08-11) contains only ONE genuine 1-year comp: 2025年式 Cayenne Coupé 3.0T, 6,391 km, 車商售價 447.0萬 (a 2024年式 Coupé 31,900 km at 527.0萬 is a higher trim, and the 2024 Coupé 13,000 km at 429.8萬 is a 2-year car). No non-Coupé, no-option 1-year listing exists anywhere reachable. Derivation: 447.0萬 asking − Coupé body premium (~25萬, from the 2023 ladder where Coupé 391萬 vs Cayenne 369萬) − option content recovery (a typical Coupé carries 50-80萬 of options recovering only ~30-40%, so ~20萬 of the asking price) ⇒ ~400萬 車商售價 for an equivalently-aged no-option non-Coupé. That is an ASPIRATIONAL asking price on the slowest-selling Cayenne spec, so it is discounted to ~355萬 realistic 車商售價 (85% of list). RETAIL→PRIVATE ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: 355萬 × 0.90 = ~320萬 私人自售. NO low-mileage premium is applied here — the comp is at 6,391 km against our 7,000 km, so none is owed; the draft added +3% on top of an already-low-mileage comp, which is double-counting. dealer_tradein = 320萬 −11.9% ≈ 282萬. The 447.0萬 figure is a dealer ASKING price and was never used directly. Confidence LOW: one comp, wrong body style, and three stacked judgement adjustments. NOT re-opened by this maintenance-focused review — the reviewer raised no objection to resale."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"REVISED DOWN from the draft's 2,600,000 — the largest single resale correction and the best-anchored checkpoint in the record. 8891 中古車 (re-fetched 2026-08-11) has a near-perfect spec-and-mileage match: 2023年式 Cayenne 3.0T NON-Coupé, 20,000 km, 車商售價 248.0萬. Same body, same engine, 3 years old, and 20,000 km against our 21,000 km. Against that car's own 369萬 list that is 67.2% 車商售價 retention. The draft took 70% ('top of the band, because 21,000 km is roughly 60% of the typical 3-year odometer') — but the comp itself was ALREADY a 20,000 km car, so the top of the band was already the low-mileage case and the premium was counted twice. CORRECTED DERIVATION: start from the comp's actual 248.0萬 asking; uplift ~7% because our car is a 2026年式 sold against a 419萬 ladder rather than a 369萬 one (used markets absorb roughly half of a list-price increase at this age, not all of it) ⇒ ~265萬 車商售價. RETAIL→PRIVATE ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: 265萬 × 0.90 = 238.5萬 私人自售, rounded to 238萬. NO further low-mileage premium (comp already matches our odometer). dealer_tradein = 238萬 −13.0% ≈ 207萬. Cross-check: 金帝國際 1car.com.tw guide gives 0-3年 240-300萬 / 殘值 60-70%, but that is dealer marketing content and is mileage-blind; our 56.8%-of-list private figure sits correctly BELOW a dealer-retail band. The 248.0萬 asking price was NOT copied into private_sale_price. NOT re-opened by this maintenance-focused review."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"REVISED DOWN from the draft's 1,980,000. 8891 中古車 (re-fetched 2026-08-11), non-Coupé 3.0T: 2021年式, 70,000 km, 車商售價 168.8萬 (two separate listings at this exact price/mileage); 2020年式, 110,000 km, 136.0萬 and 148.8萬. Against the 339.8萬 list of that era the 5-year point is ~49.7% 車商售價 retention. HERE THE LOW-MILEAGE PREMIUM IS GENUINELY OWED — our car shows 35,000 km against the comps' 70,000 km, i.e. half. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: 168.8萬 asking + ~13% for halving the odometer ⇒ ~191萬; + ~8% for the newer 419萬 price ladder (half pass-through) ⇒ ~207萬 車商售價. RETAIL→PRIVATE ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: 207萬 × 0.895 ≈ 185萬 私人自售. dealer_tradein = 185萬 −13.0% ≈ 161萬. The draft reached 198萬 by applying a 53% retention to the full 419萬 list, which passes the entire list-price hike through to a 5-year-old car; that is too generous — a used buyer prices a 5-year Cayenne on absolute money and on the cars parked next to it, not on what a new one now costs. Secondary cross-check: 1car.com.tw guide gives 5年 150-200萬 / 殘值 40-50% (mileage-blind average of 60,000-80,000 km cars); our 185萬 private sits near the top of that band, which is where a 35,000 km car belongs. Year 5 is where the trade-in gap widens: the factory warranty is gone and dealers price in reconditioning plus their own warranty exposure. NOT re-opened by this maintenance-focused review."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"REVISED DOWN from the draft's 1,680,000, and confidence downgraded from medium to LOW. Genuine same-generation data exists — the E3 Cayenne launched in Taiwan Apr-2018, so 2019年式 cars are exactly 7 years old today — but the listings are extremely noisy. 8891 中古車 (re-fetched 2026-08-11), non-Coupé: 2019, 64,000 km, 162.8萬; 2019, 112,000 km, 122.8萬; 2019, 123,000 km, 182.8萬 (almost certainly a higher trim); 2018, 60,000 km, 139.8萬; 2018, 80,000 km, 178.0萬; 2018, 92,000 km, 129.8萬. Against the 339.8萬 list of that era these span roughly 36-52% retention with NO monotonic relationship to mileage, which means option content, trim and 原廠 service history dominate the spread and none of it is disclosed in the listings. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: take the best mileage-comparable genuine comp (2019, 64,000 km, 162.8萬), add ~6% for our lower 49,000 km ⇒ ~172萬; add ~8% for the newer price ladder (half pass-through) ⇒ ~187萬 車商售價; but haircut to ~175萬 because our car is a stripped no-option example and the spread above shows spec is worth more than mileage at this age. RETAIL→PRIVATE ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: 175萬 × 0.89 ≈ 156萬 私人自售. dealer_tradein = 156萬 −14.1% ≈ 134萬. The trade-in haircut widens again at 7 years — Taiwanese dealers are wary of out-of-warranty Cayennes and price in water-pump and suspension risk even on a low-mileage example, which the corrected maintenance plan now quantifies at NT$90,000 of expected out-of-warranty spend in this very window. Confidence is LOW because the comp band is ±16 percentage points wide and the record's own spec (no options) sits at the weak end of it. NOT re-opened by this maintenance-focused review."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no genuine 10-year data exists for this generation, and REVISED DOWN from the draft's 900,000. The E3 Cayenne only reached Taiwan in April 2018, so the oldest example is 8 years old; a 10-year figure cannot be observed. Method per the brief: take the PREDECESSOR generation (E2 / 958.2, sold in Taiwan to 2017) at 9-10 years, express it as a retention ratio of ITS original list, then apply that ratio to this car's real_cost. Predecessor evidence from 8891 中古車 (re-fetched 2026-08-11): 2017, 50,000 km, 車商售價 71.8萬; 2016, 137,600 km, 58.9萬; 2015, 120,000 km, 58.8萬; 2015, 80,000 km, 69.8萬. NOTE — the draft leaned on two higher E2 quotes (2017/61,000 km/88.0萬 and 2017/95,000 km/95.8萬, both from an 8891 page-2 fetch that could not be reproduced) while a LOWER-mileage 2017 asking only 71.8萬 sat on page 1 and went unused; that selective read is why the draft's 23% retention was too high. Against an E2 base list of roughly 330萬 (STILL UNVERIFIED — this remains the weakest link in the record) the verified comps imply 17.8% (2016, high km) to 21.8% (2017, 50,000 km) 車商售價 retention. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: 20% for a 10-year / 70,000 km car × real_cost 4,250,000 ≈ 85萬 車商售價; RETAIL→PRIVATE −10% ⇒ ~76.5萬, rounded up to 80萬 私人自售 for the low odometer. dealer_tradein = 80萬 −18.8% ≈ 65萬. The trade-in discount is deliberately steeper than the 12-14% used at earlier ages: at 10 years most Taiwanese dealers either refuse a Cayenne outright or lowball it hard, because a single suspension or turbo failure exceeds the whole car's margin — the corrected maintenance plan puts NT$180,000 of expected out-of-warranty risk in the 7-10 year window, which is the same fact seen from the dealer's side. Cross-check: 1car.com.tw guide gives 10年以上 = 80-120萬 / 殘值 20-30%, but that is a DEALER RETAIL band, so a private figure at 80萬 is consistent with sitting at its bottom edge. NOT re-opened by this maintenance-focused review."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"PTT car板 2024-10 實際工單 (本次覆核重新抓取成功並逐字確認): 「轉眼間車子也開一年了 來分享一下小保養費用 基本上這次只有換機油 沒有更換什麼零件 含工資約1萬6」，另一車主 NT$12,361；同帖確認保時捷原廠工資 NT$3,150/hr。TYAward 覆述同一量級：「含工資的總花費大約落在新台幣15,000元至16,000元之間」；UpToGo：「原廠小保養 1.6 萬起跳」。7,000 km 遠未達 15,000 km 里程門檻，故走 12 個月時間門檻，一年一次。涵蓋 0-1 年。本檢查點是全表唯一有第一手單筆發票直接對應的項目，覆核後維持 16,000 不變。"},{"y":3,"source":"PTT car板 2024-10 實際工單 (小保養 12,361-16,000) × 2 次。里程 21,000 km 全期未觸發 15,000 km 里程保養，仍為每年一次的時間制保養。與草稿的差異很小：由 55,000 上調為 58,000，因為煞車油與濾芯改用原廠工資 3,150/hr 計價 (草稿用的 6,000/8,000 是獨立保修廠的價位，與本表其餘部分假設原廠施工不一致)。涵蓋 1-3 年。本期沒有時間到期的大項，是全表最便宜的一段，這點草稿是對的。"},{"y":5,"source":"本期是本次覆核改動最大的地方 (草稿 140,000 → 208,000)，關鍵證據是一筆里程幾乎與本記錄相同的原廠工單: Mobile01 保時捷版 f=608 t=6928421 車主自述「我的2020年Cayenne Coupe 四年26500公里大保養費用，都按保時捷原廠的保養項目施工，費用是70000元」—— 四年、26,500 km (約 6,600 km/年) 正是本記錄的低里程用車型態，證明第4年即使里程只有兩萬多公里，原廠仍會做一次 70,000 元等級的大保養，而不是草稿假設的 18,000 元小保養。火星塞與中央差速器油 (4年/6萬km，本案4年先到) 與煞車油都含在這 70,000 內，故不再另列以免重複計算。煞車與輪胎改用原廠/N-spec 價位: carce.cc 實際成交顯示副廠來令片前 6,200+工資 800、後 4,500+工資 1,200 (不含碟盤)，Shopee 副廠碟盤前一組 10,000 後一組 9,000 —— 這個級距對應的是專修廠，不是原廠；原廠件加 3,150/hr 工資，一軸碟盤+來令片+感知線落在 48,000-55,000。輪胎尺寸經獨立確認為 255/55R19 (本車無選配、配 19 吋)，BigGo 台灣比價: Michelin Pilot Sport 4 SUV 255/55R19 每條 9,823、Latitude Sport 3 每條 9,992、Continental CSC5 SUV 每條 11,300 (網購通路價)；N-spec 原廠認證胎在輪胎行含安裝定位，四條約 52,000 + 定位 5,000。草稿的 36,000 一套明顯偏低。涵蓋 3-5 年。保固第4年結束，第5年起自費維修，但本期尚未編列故障準備金。"},{"y":7,"source":"草稿 160,000 → 235,000。三處上修: (a) 後軸煞車由 25,000 改為原廠件 48,000，理由同第5年檢查點 —— 1car 的 15,000-25,000 是專修廠價位，與本表假設的原廠施工不一致；(b) 電瓶取原廠 15,000-30,000 區間中段 25,000 (含編碼)，低里程短程用車反而更折壽；(c) 保固外風險準備金由 50,000 提高到 90,000。第 (c) 點的依據: TYAward 引用的統計顯示 Cayenne「需要大修的機率大約落在60.89左右」，且 5-10 年區間單一年度平均維護費用可達 US$3,827；台灣獨立保修廠公開的維修案例指出 E3 世代水幫浦漏水是低里程就會發生的通病，而原廠一次水幫浦連節溫器的工單本身就是 6-10 萬等級，50,000 的準備金連一次都不夠。本期第4年那種大保養不會重來 (4年週期落在第8年)，故只編列年度保養加時間到期項目。涵蓋 5-7 年。風險準備金是機率性估計、非已知帳單，因此 confidence 標 low。"},{"y":10,"source":"草稿 280,000 → 527,000，是全表金額最大的一段，兩個主因。(1) 第8年是第二次 4 年期原廠大保養 (依據同第5年檢查點的 Mobile01 t=6928421 工單 70,000，通膨後取 80,000)，草稿完全沒有編列這一筆，只放了三次小保養。(2) 變速箱油由 45,000 改為 100,000: PTT car板 同一帖車主明講「這剛開始而已，換變速箱油十幾萬你就知道」，同帖另有「保時捷只有大保養可能破十萬」—— 十幾萬取最保守下緣 100,000。這筆是本表最大的可裁撤項目: 原廠規格其實是 24萬km/16年，嚴格照規格可以整筆拿掉，10 年總額就從 1,044,000 降到 944,000，這點在 plan_notes 有明講。風險準備金由 90,000 提高到 180,000: 草稿「本車是鋼製彈簧、不能編氣壓懸吊」的推論本身正確 (1car 列氣壓懸吊每側 30,000-50,000，四角就是 12-20 萬)，但由此得出準備金應該更低並不成立 —— 傳統避震筒四支在原廠仍約 70,000，冷卻、正時、渦輪、電子的風險完全沒變，草稿等於把「不必花的那一項」誤讀成「整體風險變小」。第二套輪胎與第二顆電瓶依 5-6 年與 4-6 年的老化週期編列。涵蓋 7-10 年。屬推估非實帳，confidence low。"}],"sources":[{"name":"地球黃金線 TVBS — Cayenne Electric 雙動力發表，台灣報價419萬起與汽油版同價","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/289953","note":"PRIMARY price source. Re-fetched and re-read on 2026-08-11 (published 2025-11-20). Confirmed verbatim: 'Cayenne Electric與Cayenne Turbo Electric同步開出419萬元與769萬元建議售價' and '入門價格與現行燃油版Cayenne相同'. This fixes list_price = 4,190,000 for the current 2026年式 petrol base Cayenne."},{"name":"KingAutos — 2026 大型休旅車 Porsche Cayenne 共5車款詳細介紹","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/porsche/cayenne","note":"Confirms the warning: the page prints V6 369萬 / E-Hybrid 448萬 / S 532萬 / GTS 608萬 / Turbo 738萬, but its own model-year field reads 2024, so the price column is STALE 2024年式 data and was NOT used. Its engine spec (2,995cc turbo, 353hp) was used for the trim string. Recorded because it is a live contradiction a reviewer should know about."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Porsche Cayenne 二手價格行情 (all bodies)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/porsche/cayenne","note":"Fetched 2026-08-11 by the resale pass. Verified non-Coupé comps used for the corrected curve: 2023/20,000km/248.0萬; 2021/70,000km/168.8萬 (×2); 2020/110,000km/136.0萬 and 148.8萬; 2019/64,000km/162.8萬; 2019/112,000km/122.8萬; 2018/60,000km/139.8萬; 2018/80,000km/178.0萬; 2018/92,000km/129.8萬; 2017/50,000km/71.8萬; 2016/137,600km/58.9萬; 2015/120,000km/58.8萬; 2015/80,000km/69.8萬. Coupé comps: 2025/6,391km/447.0萬; 2024/13,000km/429.8萬; 2023/25,000km/325.8萬; 2023/31,000km/275.8萬. ALL are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking) — none were used directly as private_sale_price."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Porsche Cayenne (非 Coupe) 車型頁, page 2","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/porsche/cayenne/cayenne?page=2","note":"CAVEAT: the original draft cited 2017/61,000km/88.0萬 and 2017/95,000km/95.8萬 from this page, but the resale review could not reproduce that page-2 fetch, and page 1 carries a LOWER-mileage 2017 asking only 71.8萬. Because the draft's 10-year extrapolation rested on the higher unreproduced quotes while ignoring the cheaper verifiable one, the E2 retention ratio was cut from 23% to 20%. Treat page-2 figures as unverified."},{"name":"金帝國際 1car.com.tw — 2025凱燕二手購車指南：保時捷 Cayenne 二手價格、缺點與折舊率大公開","url":"https://1car.com.tw/2025%E5%87%B1%E7%87%95%E4%BA%8C%E6%89%8B%E8%B3%BC%E8%BB%8A%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%EF%BC%9A%E4%BF%9D%E6%99%82%E6%8D%B7cayenne%E4%BA%8C%E6%89%8B%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC%E3%80%81%E7%BC%BA%E9%BB%9E%E8%88%87%E6%8A%98/","note":"HONESTY NOTE FROM THIS PASS: 1car.com.tw could NOT be fetched this time (the domain is blocked by the fetch policy in this environment), so its content is carried forward from the previous pass rather than re-verified. Bands as previously recorded: 3年 240-300萬/60-70%; 5年 150-200萬/40-50%; 10年以上 約100萬/20-30%; 小保養 6,000-10,000; 大保養 20,000-40,000; 煞車皮+碟盤 15,000-25,000; 性能胎 30,000-50,000 一套四條; 氣壓懸吊每側 30,000-50,000. IMPORTANT REASSESSMENT: this pass concludes its MAINTENANCE bands are 專修廠/副廠 pricing, not 原廠 — they are irreconcilable with the PTT and Mobile01 原廠 receipts (小保養 6,000-10,000 vs an actual invoice of 16,000; 大保養 20,000-40,000 vs an actual 原廠 invoice of 70,000). Its maintenance figures are therefore NO LONGER used as the cost basis, only as the low-end/專修廠 bound. Its 氣壓懸吊 and 通病 lists remain useful and are still cited. Its resale bands are unaffected and still used as a secondary cross-check."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 — 售價369萬起，Porsche 中期改款 Cayenne 全車系上海車展首發、台灣同步開啟接單","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/37932-369-porsche-cayenne.html","note":"Cited by earlier passes as fetched; not independently re-fetched by this maintenance review. Supplies the 2023 facelift Taiwan price ladder (Cayenne 369萬 / E-Hybrid 448萬 / S 532萬 / Coupé 391萬) and the base engine spec (3.0 V6 turbo, 353PS / 500Nm). The 369萬 figure is the list-price denominator for the 3-year comp, and the Coupé-minus-Cayenne gap (22萬) is the body premium used in the year-1 derivation."},{"name":"udn 發燒車訊 — 王者凱燕登台！全新第三代 Porsche Cayenne 豪奢售價 339.8 萬起","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/3068237","note":"Cited by earlier passes as fetched; not independently re-fetched by this maintenance review. Establishes that the E3 generation launched in Taiwan 2018-04-03 at 339.8萬 for the base V6. Two uses: the list-price denominator for the 5- and 7-year retention ratios, and the proof that no genuine 10-year data can exist for this generation."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 售價調漲9~48萬區間，Porsche公佈2025年式Cayenne及Cayenne Coupé車系售價","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/78355","note":"HONESTY NOTE: direct fetch returns HTTP 403. Read only via search-engine summaries quoting the base Cayenne rising 369萬 → 409萬 for 2025年式. Used only as the intermediate step in the price history 339.8 → 369 → 409 → 419萬, which does not affect any published number. Secondary."},{"name":"PTT car板 — [閒聊] Porsche Cayenne Coupe 保養費用","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1729699069.A.F5D.html","note":"RE-FETCHED SUCCESSFULLY BY THIS MAINTENANCE REVIEW on 2026-08-11 (the previous pass had only cited it second-hand). Verbatim figures now read directly: 小保養 「基本上這次只有換機油 沒有更換什麼零件 含工資約1萬6」, another owner NT$12,361; Porsche Taiwan labour 「工資3150」/hr; 「保時捷只有大保養可能破十萬」; 「這剛開始而已，換變速箱油十幾萬你就知道」. The last two quotes existed in the draft's own source list but were never carried into any number — that omission is a large part of why the draft's 10-year total was too low. The 變速箱油 line is now priced at 100,000 (the conservative bottom of 十幾萬) instead of 45,000."},{"name":"Mobile01 保時捷版 — 保時捷 Cayenne Coupé 保固前四年一次大保養工單分享","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=608&t=7114355","note":"HONESTY NOTE: direct fetch still returns HTTP 403 for this pass too (r.jina.ai proxy also 403). Read only via search-engine snippets, which this pass did surface with more detail than the draft had: 「四年一次大保養工單分享。車子年份：快四年。車子里程：五萬公里我有被價格驚到，但想說在保固內還是在原廠做完這第一次的大保養」. Two things that matter for this record: the FIRST 大保養 lands at the 4-year mark, and the owner was shocked by the price. The 原廠工單 intervals relied on here came from the same snippets: 機油 15,000km 或 1年, 中央差速器 60,000km 或 4年, 變速箱油與其他差速器 240,000km 或 16年. The thread title ('保固前四年') is the sole basis for treating the Taiwan warranty as 4 years. Secondary confidence."},{"name":"Mobile01 保時捷版 — 『請益』Cayenne 油耗、保養費用","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=608&t=3903986","note":"HONESTY NOTE: read via search-engine summary only, not fetched (Mobile01 returns 403 throughout). Owner reports petrol Cayenne 小保養 約1萬元 and a 六萬公里大保養 約十萬台幣. Used as a sanity check on the year-7 and year-10 windows, not as a primary figure."},{"name":"Porsche Taiwan — Cayenne 車型頁","url":"https://www.porsche.com/taiwan/zh-tw/models/cayenne/","note":"HONESTY NOTE: fetched 2026-08-11 in an attempt to verify list_price against the brand's own Taiwan site. The page lists the Cayenne / Cayenne Coupé / Cayenne Electric / Cayenne Coupé Electric range but publishes NO 建議售價 in the fetched content, so it could not confirm or refute 419萬. The price therefore rests on TVBS quoting Porsche Taiwan, not on the official site."},{"name":"Porsche Taiwan — 保時捷保固和車輛資訊","url":"https://www.porsche.com/taiwan/zh-tw/accessoriesandservice/porscheservice/vehicleinformation/","note":"HONESTY NOTE: the page is JavaScript-rendered and returns no body text, so the official warranty terms could not be read directly. Search-engine summaries gave: new-vehicle warranty valid worldwide with no mileage limit, and Porsche Approved Warranty in 12/24/36-month plans (up to 15 years total, cars under 9 years old and 200,000 km, 111-point inspection required, transferable). The exact new-car warranty TERM (3 vs 4 years) is NOT confirmed from this primary source. Also checked this pass for a published 保養包 / prepaid maintenance price: none is listed."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — PORSCHE CAYENNE 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=PORSCHE&model=CAYENNE","note":"Cited by earlier passes as fetched; not independently re-fetched by this maintenance review. Cross-check on the 8891 curve: 47 Cayenne listed, 38.8萬 (2011, 270,648km) to 308.8萬 (2022 Coupé, 41,820km), bulk 150-250萬. Confirms the mid-life band but adds no new low-mileage data point. Also dealer-retail asking prices."},{"name":"8891 汽車 — 汽車領牌費多少？基本規費1250元、選牌再加2000元","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/feature/2442","note":"Read via search-engine summary. Government registration fees: 檢驗費450 + 號牌費600 + 行照費200 = 1,250; 選號費 +2,000; typical 代辦費 for a new car 1,000-1,500 (mainstream rate). Used to build the onroad_fees breakdown — the Porsche figure is far above this because it is dominated by 交車配件, not by government fees."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — [U-EV] 首波雙車型419萬與769萬，Porsche Cayenne Electric 正式發表","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/86236","note":"HONESTY NOTE: read via search-engine summary only, not fetched. Independent corroboration of the 419萬 entry price point and of the BEV Cayenne being priced level with the petrol car. Also establishes that the petrol Cayenne remains on sale in Taiwan in 2026 alongside the incoming Cayenne Electric."},{"name":"Mobile01 保時捷版 — 2020 Macan S 大保養費用? (討論串內含 Cayenne Coupe 四年 26,500km 原廠大保養工單)","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=608&t=6928421","note":"THE SINGLE MOST IMPORTANT NEW SOURCE OF THIS REVIEW, and the reason the 10-year total moved from 651,000 to 1,044,000. Direct fetch returns HTTP 403 (Mobile01 blocks this reviewer), so it was read via a search-engine snippet, which quotes an owner verbatim: 「我的2020年Cayenne Coupe 四年26500公里大保養費用，都按保時捷原廠的保養項目施工，費用是70000元」. Four years, 26,500 km — about 6,600 km/year, i.e. essentially this record's own 7,000 km/year profile — and the 原廠 4-year 大保養 still cost NT$70,000. This directly refutes the draft's core assumption that a low-mileage Cayenne only ever gets NT$16,000-18,000 oil services. Used as the anchor price for the year-4 service and, inflated to 80,000, for the year-8 repeat. Secondary confidence because it is a snippet, not a fetched page, and it is a Coupé rather than the base non-Coupé — but the 3.0T drivetrain and service schedule are identical."},{"name":"TYAward — Porsche Cayenne 好養嗎？養車成本與大修機率解析","url":"https://tyaward.com.tw/%E6%B1%BD%E6%A9%9F%E8%BB%8A-2/porsche-cayenne-%E5%A5%BD%E9%A4%8A%E5%97%8E/","note":"FETCHED SUCCESSFULLY BY THIS REVIEW 2026-08-11. Confirms the 原廠 小保養 level independently of PTT: 「含工資的總花費大約落在新台幣15,000元至16,000元之間」, and the labour rate: 「單一小時的工資往往突破3,000元」. Two figures used qualitatively rather than numerically: 「需要大修的機率大約落在60.89左右」 (major-repair probability ~61%, which is why the out-of-warranty allowances were raised rather than cut), and the year-band split 「前5年...多數低於2,000美元」 vs 「5年至第10年...單一年度的平均維護費用可能達到3,827美元」. Its headline 10-year figure 「約20,552美元左右（換算約為新台幣61.65萬元）」 is deliberately NOT used as a ceiling: it is a US-market dataset at US average mileage, and Taiwan adds import duty on parts to a higher base, so it understates Taiwan 原廠 cost. Recorded because it is the closest thing to a published 10-year total and a reader deserves to see that this record lands above it, on purpose."},{"name":"carce.cc 車勢汽車網 — Porsche Cayenne 維修保養實際成交價格","url":"https://www.carce.cc/price/385/Porsche/Cayenne","note":"FETCHED SUCCESSFULLY BY THIS REVIEW 2026-08-11. Real consumer transactions, Taipei, 2014 Cayenne: rear brake pads 副廠 4,500 parts + 1,200 labour = 5,700; front brake pads 副廠 6,200 + 800 = 7,000. PADS ONLY, no discs, aftermarket parts, independent shop. Used as the LOWER bound that proves 1car's 15,000-25,000 per-axle band is 專修廠 pricing rather than 原廠 — which is exactly the substitution error the draft made. Not used as the plan's cost basis, since this record services at 原廠 throughout."},{"name":"BigGo 台灣比價 — 255/55R19 輪胎價格","url":"https://biggo.com.tw/s/255%2F55R19/","note":"FETCHED SUCCESSFULLY BY THIS REVIEW 2026-08-11 to price the tyre line independently, because 255/55R19 is the OEM size for the 19-inch wheels this no-option Cayenne actually rides on. Per-tyre online-channel prices: Michelin PILOT SPORT 4 SUV 9,823; Michelin LATITUDE SPORT 3 9,992; Michelin PRIMACY 5 10,545; Continental CSC5 SUV 11,300; Michelin LATITUDE TOUR HP 6,400. A Porsche N-spec (N0/N1) set of four fitted, balanced and with new valves at a tyre shop is ~52,000, plus ~5,000 alignment — hence the 57,000 tyre line at years 5 and 10, replacing the draft's 36,000. Note these are discount online prices; buying the same tyres at 原廠 would be materially higher."},{"name":"Mobile01 保時捷版 — cayenne 保養 (原廠保養手冊里程級距)","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=608&t=2169439","note":"HONESTY NOTE: direct fetch blocked (Mobile01 returns 403 to this reviewer throughout); read via search-engine snippet only. Quotes the owner's manual: 「手冊裏寫小保養-15000km 中保養-30000km 大保養-60000km」. Used to establish that Porsche's schedule has THREE tiers of service, not one — the fact the draft missed. At 7,000 km/year none of these mileage thresholds is reached inside 10 years, which is precisely why the TIME clocks (and the 4-year 大保養 evidenced by t=6928421) govern instead."},{"name":"Carvigar 技術通報 — PORSCHE 原廠保養提醒級距 (PDF)","url":"http://www.carvigar.com.tw/service/PORSCHE/PORS201801.pdf","note":"HONESTY NOTE: direct fetch FAILED with an SSL/protocol error, so this was read via a search-engine snippet only: 「原廠設計為以下3種方式提醒：1.更換機油保養15000KM/或10000KM 2.中間保養30000KM 3.主保養60000KM」. An independent corroboration of the three-tier interval structure quoted in the Mobile01 manual thread. Not used for any price."},{"name":"UpToGo — 圓夢保時捷前必看! Porsche Cayenne 好養嗎","url":"https://uptogo.com.tw/%E6%B1%BD%E6%A9%9F%E8%BB%8A/porsche-cayenne-%E5%A5%BD%E9%A4%8A%E5%97%8E/","note":"HONESTY NOTE: direct fetch returns HTTP 403 and the r.jina.ai proxy hits a CAPTCHA wall; read via search-engine snippet only. Supplies 「原廠小保養 1.6 萬起跳」, a third independent confirmation of the NT$16,000 原廠 小保養 level alongside PTT and TYAward. Used as corroboration, not as a primary figure."},{"name":"比迪行銷 whbydcc — cayenne 好養嗎？從養車成本到日常維護","url":"https://www.whbydcc.com/cayenne%E5%A5%BD%E9%A4%8A%E5%97%8E/","note":"HONESTY NOTE: direct fetch returns HTTP 403 on both the raw and percent-encoded URL; read via search-engine snippet only. Supplies 「年度總計 (不含油資)：約新台幣 150,000 - 250,000 元或更高」 for annual Cayenne ownership cost excluding fuel. NOT used numerically, because that total plainly bundles 保險 and 稅金, which this record excludes by design, and it is written for a normal-mileage driver. Recorded only as a directional check that Cayenne running costs in Taiwan are a six-figure-per-year proposition rather than the NT$65,000/year average the draft's 651,000 implied."}]},"tesla-model-y":{"assumptions":"每年 6,000-8,000 公里，取中位 7,000 公里/年，遠低於台灣平均 12,000-15,000 公里。所有檢查點一律 7,000 × 年數（7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 公里）。兩個關鍵影響：(1) 原廠保養週期是「第 N 年或 N×20,000 公里，以先到者為準」，此里程下 10 年內永遠是年數先到，等於每 2 年一次主要回廠；(2) 中古市場同齡低里程車明顯高於均價，本表殘值一律錨定 8891 上同齡『最低里程段』實際刊登，再做車商開價→自售價的向下調整。台灣電動車現行免徵牌照稅與燃料費，但依設定，稅與保險一律不計入本表。","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"1 年錨點重估（reviewer 爭點之一，已下修）。台灣煥新版 2025-03-01 才開賣、實際交車自 2025 年中起，故 8891 全站目前只有 2 筆 2025 年領牌煥新版，且都是 RWD：1,850,000 / 9,000 公里與 1,850,000 / 14,000 公里（車齡約 1.1 年），對煥新版 RWD 新車實付 1,929,900 = 95.9% 車商開價。兩段調整：(1) 車型差 —— 本次以 2024 年領牌同齡樣本實測 LR 與 RWD 的落差：RWD 在 33,000-45,000 公里區間共 10 筆、中位數 1,553,000，對其原始實付 1,764,900 = 88.0%；同批唯一 LR 為 1,688,000 / 38,800 公里，對原始實付 2,137,900 = 79.0%，LR 低 9.0 個百分點。原研究者第 1 年只扣 5.5 點，實測不支持縮小，故 LR 第 1 年車商開價約 86.9%，含本案 7,000 公里的低里程加成取 88% × 2,329,900 ≈ 2,050,000。(2) 車商開價 → 個人自售 −14.2%：本次以 8891 listing 有無『實體車行』標記分群實測，2022 年份 LR 無車行標記者中位數 1,253,000 / 里程中位數 70,500 公里、有車行標記者 1,488,000 / 75,200 公里，在里程更低的情況下仍便宜 15.8%；一年車的價差最大（車商開價 1,850,000 幾乎貼著新車 1,899,900、達 97.4%，實務上不可能以此成交），故取區間上緣。得自售 1,760,000（實付價的 75.5%），再 −13.1% 到車商收購 1,530,000。原研究者給 1,870,000（80.3%），其 RWD→LR 只扣 5.5 點、開價→自售只扣 11.6%，兩處都比實測寬鬆。confidence 訂 low：直接同齡證據只有 2 筆、且是別的動力車型。"},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"8891 實抓（2026-08-11，本次覆核自行解析 6 頁共 120 筆去重物件）。本次取得官方售價異動全紀錄後，分母改用各年份的真實牌價而非估值：2023 年領牌 LR 的原始牌價為 211.99-212.79 萬（2023-02-03 降價後），實付約 2,157,900。該年份 8891 共 13 筆、車商開價 1,450,000-1,588,000、里程 66,000-135,000 公里（另 1 筆 1,998,000 / 100,000 公里為離群已剔除），最低里程者 1,558,000 / 66,000 公里 = 72.2% 車商開價（車齡約 3.0 年）。本案 3 年僅 21,000 公里，遠低於這批。以本次擬合的 LR 車商開價曲線（1.1 年 86.9%、2.1 年 79.0%、3.6 年 65.2%，近乎線性 −8.7 個百分點/年）取第 3 年 70.4%，加低里程加成 1.5 點得 71.9% × 2,329,900 ≈ 1,675,000 車商開價；車商開價 → 自售 −12.5% = 1,465,000，再 −12.6% 到車商收購 = 1,280,000。與原研究者的 1,480,000 只差 1%，代表這一格原本就大致正確，改動只是為了與重建後的曲線一致。confidence medium：樣本厚（2022+2023 兩個年份共 38 筆 LR）且分母已是官方牌價，但沒有任何一筆同齡物件的里程接近 21,000 公里，低里程段仍靠外推。"},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"5 年錨點重估（reviewer 爭點之二，本次改動最大的一格）。先更正一個事實錯誤：原研究者寫『最老實例是 2022 年領牌 = 4.3 年』，但台灣 Model Y 是 2022-09-23 才上市、U-CAR 事件簿明載『最快 12 月交車』，2022 年領牌車實際車齡約 3.6 年 —— 原本以為只需外推 0.7 年，實際要外推 1.4 年，這使原值系統性偏高。重建方式四步：(1) 唯一分母相同的對照組：2022 年領牌 LR 的原始牌價正是 229.99 萬（U-CAR 事件簿上市價），實付 2,329,900，與本車完全相同，不必做任何跨年式價格換算。該批 8891 實抓 25 筆，取里程 ≤70,000 公里者共 10 筆、中位數 1,518,000 = 65.2% 車商開價（3.6 年）。(2) 併同 1.1 年 86.9%、2.1 年 79.0%，LR 車商開價保值率在 1-3.6 年間近乎線性 −8.7 個百分點/年，外推第 5 年約 53.1%，加本案 35,000 公里的低里程加成取 55.0%。(3) 獨立交叉驗證：代理車 Model 3 Long Range 2021 年領牌（車齡 5.1 年，原始牌價 195.79 萬、實付約 1,982,900）8891 實抓 18 筆，取里程 ≤65,000 公里者中位數 1,039,000 = 52.4% 車商開價 —— 與上述外推的 53% 幾乎重合，兩條互不相關的路徑收斂。(4) 再扣 3% 的世代風險：本車已是煥新版，而現有 2022/2023 兩個年份的 LR 開價被壓在同一個 1,450,000-1,588,000 區間（差一整年車齡卻幾乎沒有價差），是改款把舊造型的曲線壓平的訊號；現有樣本反而是 2025 年改款漲價 19.2 萬的受惠方，本車到 2031 年將站在受害的一側。得車商開價約 1,244,000，自售 −12.4% = 1,090,000（實付價的 46.8%），再 −12.8% 到車商收購 = 950,000。第 4 年基本保固（4 年/80,000 公里）到期是這一段斜率特別陡的機制性原因，非統計雜訊。原研究者給 1,270,000（54.5%）。confidence low：台灣沒有滿 5 年的 Model Y，主證來自 3.6 年實測外推 + Model 3 同齡代理車。"},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"台灣沒有 7 年的 Model Y（2022-12 才開始交車），改用『前一世代同廠車』外推，明說是外推。代理車 Model 3 Long Range，原始牌價這次取得官方數字：2019-08-12 在台發表，SR+ 155.99 萬 / LR 186.99 萬 / Performance 214.99 萬（U-CAR 事件簿），故 2019 年領牌 LR 實付約 1,894,900。8891 實抓 2019 年領牌 Model 3 共 8 筆，其中 LR 4 筆：820,000 / 40,000 公里、858,000 / 116,000 公里、788,000 / 163,000 公里、788,000 / 164,000 公里（車齡約 7.1 年）。取里程 ≤120,000 公里者中位數 839,000 = 44.3% 車商開價 —— 原研究者只取單筆 820,000 並用 1,999,000 這個估值當分母得 41.0%，分母是猜的、分子是單點，本次改用官方牌價與中位數。Model Y 對 Model 3 的車格加成：以 2022 年份同齡對照，Model Y LR 低里程開價保值率 65.2%、Model 3 LR（2022 年領牌、原始牌價約 205 萬）低里程 1,288,000 / 28,000 公里 = 62.1%，差約 3 個百分點，比原研究者假設的 4 點略小。故第 7 年取 44.3 + 1.7（本案 49,000 公里遠低於代理車樣本的里程中位數）= 46.0%，再扣 5% 世代風險（理由同 5 年格）得 43.7% × 2,329,900 ≈ 1,018,000 車商開價，自售 −11.6% = 900,000，再 −12.8% 到車商收購 = 785,000。第 4 年基本保固已過、第 8 年電池與驅動單元保固將到期，是這段持續下滑的主因。原研究者給 950,000。"},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"台灣沒有任何 10 年的 Tesla 量產車樣本，全部外推，明說。代理車 8891 實抓（2026-08-11 本次獨立解析 Model S 13 筆、Model X 30 筆）：2018 年領牌 Model S 75D 998,000 / 66,000 公里（車齡 8.1 年）、2017 年領牌 75D 958,000 / 236,000 公里（9.1 年）。關鍵修正在分母：原研究者假設 Model S 75D 原始台灣售價約 3,900,000，本次查 U-CAR Model S 事件簿發現 2017-04-17 原廠已把 Model S 75 由 344.4 萬大砍 57.7 萬至 286.7 萬，75D（四驅版）約 306 萬、實付約 3,050,000，比原研究者的分母低了 85 萬。改用正確分母後，8.1 年低里程的實際車商開價保值率是 998,000 / 3,050,000 = 32.7%，而非原研究者算出的 25.6-28%。兩個方向相反的修正：Model S 是 300 萬級距旗艦、百分比保值率本就系統性低於中價位車（往上修）；但本車第 8 年電池與驅動單元保固（8 年/192,000 公里）到期後高壓電池全額自費，且 2026/07 台灣已發生 Model Y 高壓電池故障、原廠無現貨需等一個月且無代步車的實例（KingAutos 已證實），加上買在價格帶頂端（見 purchase.notes）與世代風險（同 5 年格）（往下修）。淨取 28.5% × 2,329,900 ≈ 664,000 車商開價，自售 −10.4% = 595,000（實付價的 25.5%），再 −12.6% 到車商收購 = 520,000。本案 10 年僅 70,000 公里，遠低於代理車樣本，低里程加成已含在上述比率內。原研究者給 620,000。"}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"CJay Tech 台灣特斯拉原廠保養價目表（頁面自載更新日 2026/6/26）Model Y 2025+ 欄，本次覆核已重新抓取（HTTP 200）並核對雨刷一對 NT$2,006 無誤；搭配同頁 Model Y 保養週期表第 1 年 / 20,000 公里列（雨刷 R、輪胎 C、蒸發器 C/A）。"},{"y":3,"source":"CJay Tech 台灣特斯拉原廠價目表（2026/6/26 版，Model Y 2025+ 欄）逐項相加，本次覆核已回原頁重新核對底盤 3,912 / 冷氣濾網 1,397 / HEPA 3,730 全部無誤（同表舊 Model Y 欄底盤為 2,318，可解釋舊車主帳單較低）。對照組為一位 2023 年式 Model Y LR 車主的實際帳單：40,000 公里 / 2 年保養實收 TWD 2,070（冷氣系統測試、前後懸架底盤扭力確認、前後交叉調胎），因其自行判斷不換濾網。本格取「照菜單走、雨刷自換」的中間值。"},{"y":5,"source":"CJay Tech 台灣特斯拉原廠價目表（2026/6/26 版，Model Y 2025+ 欄，煞車油 3,053 / 乾燥包 3,876 / 冷氣濾網 1,397 / 底盤 3,912 本次覆核已重新逐項核對）+ 同頁 Model Y 保養週期表第 4 年欄（冷氣濾網 R、冷氣乾燥包 C/R、煞車油 C/R、底盤扭力 A、散熱片 C/A）+ Model Y 車主手冊「煞車油健全情況檢查：每 4 年一次」。散熱片清潔與冷媒填充無公開定價，屬合理估算，故本格為 medium。"},{"y":7,"source":"CJay Tech 台灣特斯拉原廠價目表（2026/6/26 版，Model Y 2025+ 欄；底盤 3,912 / 冷氣濾網 1,397 / HEPA 3,730 / 16V 鋰電池 9,055 本次覆核已重新逐項核對）+ 同頁 Model Y 保養週期表第 6 年欄。輪胎價格區間來自 PChome 24h 255/45R19 四入組（前次稽核該站回 HTTP 429、本次未再重試，沿用該記錄值並維持本格較低信心）。16V 電池的更換時點（第 6 年）與卡鉗保養屬依台灣氣候的判斷，非原廠明列。"},{"y":10,"source":"CJay Tech 台灣特斯拉原廠價目表（2026/6/26 版，Model Y 2025+ 欄，煞車油 3,053 / 乾燥包 3,876 / 底盤 3,912 / 冷氣濾網 1,397 / HEPA 3,730 本次覆核已重新核對）+ 同頁 Model Y 保養週期表第 8 年欄逐項相加，另加三項備抵（半套胎、碟盤來令片、懸吊風險）。電池冷卻液更換單價（估 7,000）、碟盤/來令片（估 18,000）與懸吊備抵（估 15,000）在台灣特斯拉公開價目表上沒有列，屬合理估算而非報價，故本格為 low。NHTSA 前懸吊調查與 2026/07 電池缺料事件經 KingAutos 頁面確認存在。"}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — Tesla Model Y 事件簿（台灣官方售價異動全紀錄）","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/Tesla/Model%20Y/7089/event","note":"本次覆核新增，也是最關鍵的新證據（HTTP 200，2026-08-11 抓取）。逐筆列出台灣 Model Y 每一次官方調價：2022-09-23 上市 LR 229.99 萬 / Performance 259.99 萬；2023-02-03 LR 降 18 萬至 211.99 萬、Performance 降 22 萬至 237.99 萬；2023-05-02 齊漲 8 千、LR 至 212.79 萬；2023-11-01 新增 RWD 179.99 萬；2024-04-26 RWD 降 6.5 萬至 173.49 萬、LR 降 2 萬至 210.79 萬；2025-01-10 煥新版 LR Launch 244.99 萬開放預訂；2025-03-01 煥新版一般版 RWD 189.99 萬 / LR AWD 229.99 萬；2026-01-16 Performance 249.99 萬。這份紀錄讓每個年份的殘值分母改用真實牌價，取代原研究者的估值；也證實 2022 年領牌 LR 的原始牌價與本車今日售價同為 229.99 萬，成為全資料集中唯一分母完全相同的對照組。同頁另載明 2022-09-23 上市時『最快 12 月交車』，據此更正原研究者『最老實例 4.3 年』的錯誤（實為約 3.6 年）。"},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — Tesla Model Y 車款介紹與價格表","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/tesla/model%20y/7089/overall","note":"現行官方建議售價來源，本次覆核 2026-08-11 以 curl 抓取（HTTP 200）並解析車型表：RWD 189.99 萬 / Long Range AWD 229.99 萬 / Performance 249.99 萬。同頁沿革文字獨立佐證改款時序與 16.5 萬 / 19.2 萬漲幅、2025-10 LR 續航 603→641 公里、2026-01-16 Performance 上市、全車系升級 16 吋 QHD 螢幕。list_price 經此驗證正確。"},{"name":"Wayback Machine — U-CAR Tesla Model Y 歷代價格表快照","url":"http://web.archive.org/web/20221028132413/https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/tesla/model%20y/5411/overall","note":"本次覆核新增，用來獨立驗證事件簿的價格敘述。2022-10-28 快照（頁 id 5411）顯示 Long Range 229.99 萬 / Performance 259.99 萬；另抓 2023-12-05 快照（id 6113）與 2024-02-22 快照（id 6499）皆為 RWD 179.99 萬 / LR 212.79 萬 / Performance 238.79 萬；2024-06-21 快照（id 6636）為 173.49 / 210.79 / 236.79 萬；2025-02-18 快照（id 6835）為煥新版 Long Range Launch 244.99 萬。四個時點與事件簿完全一致，價格史可信。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Tesla Model Y 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/tesla/model-y","note":"殘值主資料源。本次覆核 2026-08-11 自行抓取 6 頁並解析出 120 筆去重物件（含年份／車型／車商開價／里程／有無實體車行標記）。關鍵實測：2025 年領牌煥新版僅 2 筆且都是 RWD，皆 1,850,000（9,000 / 14,000 公里）；2024 年領牌 RWD 47 筆（33,000-45,000 公里區間中位數 1,553,000）、LR 僅 1 筆 1,688,000 / 38,800 公里；2023 年領牌 LR 13 筆（最低里程 1,558,000 / 66,000 公里）；2022 年領牌 LR 25 筆（里程 ≤70,000 公里者 10 筆、中位數 1,518,000，最低里程 1,568,000 / 35,000 公里）。全部是車商『開價』非成交價。本次另用『實體車行』標記把 listing 分成車行與非車行兩群，實測 2022 年份 LR 非車行中位數 1,253,000（里程中位數 70,500 公里）比車行 1,488,000（75,200 公里）低 15.8%，據此把車商開價→自售的折讓訂在 −10.4%~−14.2%，再 −12.6%~−13.1% 到車商收購。"},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — Tesla Model 3 事件簿（代理車原始售價）","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/tesla/model%203/7036/event","note":"本次覆核新增。第 5 / 7 年外推所用代理車的原始牌價來源：2019-08-12 在台發表 SR+ 155.99 萬 / Long Range 186.99 萬 / Performance 214.99 萬；2020-03-06 全車系漲 5-6 萬；2021-06-12 LR 漲 2.8 萬至 195.79 萬；2022 年三度調漲（3/16 漲 8.3-11.2 萬、5/27 LR 再漲 8.2 萬、6/17 LR 再漲 4.31 萬至 219.7 萬、7/15 全車系再漲）；2024-01-10 改款 RWD 169.99 萬 / LR 199.99 萬。有了這些牌價，Model 3 的保值率才能用真實分母計算。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Tesla Model 3 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/tesla/model-3","note":"第 5 / 7 年外推的前一世代代理車。本次覆核自行抓取 5 頁、解析 113 筆。2021 年領牌 LR 18 筆，里程 ≤65,000 公里者中位數 1,039,000，對原始實付 1,982,900 = 52.4% 車商開價（車齡 5.1 年）—— 這是本表 5 年錨點的獨立交叉驗證。2019 年領牌 LR 4 筆（820,000 / 40,000 公里、858,000 / 116,000 公里、788,000 / 163,000 公里、788,000 / 164,000 公里），里程 ≤120,000 公里者中位數 839,000 對原始實付 1,894,900 = 44.3%（7.1 年），為 7 年錨點主證。另以 2022 年領牌 Model 3 LR（1,288,000 / 28,000 公里）與同年份 Model Y LR 對比，量出 Model Y 車格加成約 3 個百分點（原研究者假設 4 點）。"},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — Tesla Model S 事件簿（10 年外推代理車原始售價）","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/tesla/model%20s/6947/event","note":"本次覆核新增，用來修正 10 年格的分母。關鍵條目：2017-04-17 台灣 Tesla 取消 Model S 60/60D，並把 75 車型由 344.4 萬直接調降 57.7 萬至 286.7 萬；2019-03-22 取消標準里程版後改為 266.3 萬起。據此 2017-2018 年領牌的 Model S 75D 原始牌價約 306 萬、實付約 3,050,000，遠低於原研究者假設的 390 萬 —— 這是 10 年格保值率被誤算的根源。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Tesla Model S 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/tesla/model-s","note":"第 10 年外推的前一世代代理車，本次覆核已重新抓取解析 13 筆：2018 年領牌 75D 998,000 / 66,000 公里（8.1 年）、2017 年領牌 75D 958,000 / 236,000 公里（9.1 年）。配合修正後的分母 3,050,000，8.1 年低里程車商開價保值率為 32.7%。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Tesla Model X 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/tesla/model-x","note":"第 10 年外推的第二個代理點，本次覆核重新抓取解析 30 筆。誠實註記：原研究者引用的『2017 年領牌 1,260,000 / 87,000 公里』本次未再出現在在售清單中（最老為 2018 年領牌 75D 1,338,000 / 114,600 公里、2019 年領牌 100D 1,828,000 / 90,000 公里），該筆應已售出或下架，故 10 年格改以 Model S 為主證，Model X 僅作量級參考。"},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — TESLA MODEL Y 中古車搜尋","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TESLA/MODEL%20Y?v=4","note":"殘值交叉驗證來源。前次稽核記錄 2026-08-11 共 21 筆、2022-2024 年份、車商開價 1,398,000-1,598,000，與本次自行解析的 8891 分布一致。本次覆核未重新逐筆解析，採信為輔證而非主證。"},{"name":"CJay Tech — 特斯拉原廠保養多少錢？Tesla 保養項目、價格與週期懶人包","url":"https://cjay.cc/2023/02/tesla-service-fee/","note":"保養主資料源，本次覆核已重新抓取並逐項核對（HTTP 200）。頁面自載「此價目表更新於 2026/6/26」。Model Y 2025+ 欄實際值：底盤巡視與扭力檢查 3,912、冷氣濾網 1,397、冷氣乾燥包 3,876、煞車油 3,053、HEPA 濾網 3,730、雨刷一對 2,006、16V 鋰電池 9,055、馬達油與馬達油芯 6,268；技師工資 TWD 2,415/小時，已含工資、料件及 5% 營業稅；冷媒 R1234YF TWD 9.45/g、R134A TWD 0.53/g。本表引用的每一個單價都與原頁一致，無虛構；保養金額本次未更動。"},{"name":"CJay Tech — 特斯拉 Model Y 保養：4 萬公里保養項目、費用心得分享","url":"https://cjay.cc/2025/04/tesla-modely-service/","note":"車主實際帳單（非估算）：2023 年式 Model Y Long Range，40,000 公里 / 2 年原廠保養實收 TWD 2,070。帳單細節沿用前次稽核摘錄，本次未逐句重新核對。"},{"name":"KingAutos — Tesla Model Y 車款頁與相關新聞","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/tesla/model_y","note":"風險事件與促銷來源，本次覆核已重新抓取（HTTP 200）。頁面存在下列標題：「《Tesla》首次推出 油轉電補助3萬元」、「249.99萬起！Tesla Model Y Performance」、「Tesla Model Y 傳電池故障！原廠缺料需等待，車主維修恐耗時一個月」、「Tesla 約 120 萬輛電動車遭美國調查 前懸吊零件疑有安全疑慮」。該頁規格表仍掛改款前的 179.99 / 212.79 萬舊價，售價不採用。"},{"name":"PChome 24h — 255/45R19 輪胎（Model Y 原廠胎規）售價","url":"https://24h.pchome.com.tw/search/?q=255/45/19","note":"輪胎成本來源。誠實註記：前次稽核抓取時該站回 HTTP 429（速率限制），本次未再重試，沿用原記錄的四入組實價區間（南港 AS-3EV 約 24,800、馬牌 UX7 約 30,400-31,000、Bridgestone Alenza 001 約 32,600、米其林 PS5 約 35,800、Pirelli P Zero Elect 約 40,800），相關保養格信心維持 medium。"}]},"lexus-nx200-elite":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. Midpoint 7,000 km/year used at every checkpoint (assumed_km = 7000 * years). Two consequences drive this record: (1) resale is quoted from genuinely low-mileage listings, which sit above the mileage-blind year-average; (2) all servicing is TIME-driven, never mileage-driven — the Lexus TW interval is 6 months / 12 months whichever clock fires first, and at 7,000 km/yr the calendar always fires before the distance trigger, so the owner pays for 2 visits per year. Tires and the 12V battery are replaced on age, not wear. Tax and insurance are excluded by design. AUDIT NOTE: this record was re-audited against live sources on 2026-08-11; list price survived unchanged, but the resale curve was rebuilt after a trim misattribution and a powertrain-ordering violation were found.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"CORRECTED — the prior record's anchor contained a trim misattribution. It claimed an '8891 listing at 10,000 km asking 1,458,000' as a 菁英版 and interpolated it against a 1,399,000 point to reach 1,436,000. Reading auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/nx200 live today, 1,458,000 is attached to a 2025年式 豪華版 at 26,000 km (list 181萬), while 1,399,000 is the 2025年式 菁英版 at 16,000 km (list 171萬). Interpolating across two different trims is invalid and inflated the anchor. The only genuine same-trim comp is therefore 1,399,000 @ 16,000 km; FindCar's 2025 entry (1,469,000, fetched live) is a single higher listing and was down-weighted. Adding a modest ~2-3% low-mileage premium for this car's 7,000 km versus that comp's 16,000 km gives ~1,420,000 dealer RETAIL asking. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: that is a 車商售價, not what the owner receives — cut 12% to 自售價 = 1,250,000, then a further 12.4% to 車商收購價 = 1,095,000. Quoted from low-mileage listings specifically because this buyer's 7,000 km is well under the ~15,000 km a typical 1-year-old carries."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"CORRECTED — the prior record set the 3-year dealer-retail anchor at 1,300,000, which is ABOVE every 豪華版 listing it cited (1,258,000 / 1,268,000 / 1,278,000) and above the 2-year-old 菁英版 (1,238,000). That contradicts its own stated trim logic: a 菁英版 (list 171萬) must sit BELOW a 豪華版 (list 181萬) of the same age in absolute money. Live 8891 data today: 2024年式 菁英版 @30,000 km asking 1,238,000; 2023年式 菁英版 @60,000 km asking 1,248,000; 2023年式 豪華版 @30,000 km asking 1,268,000; 2023年式 豪華版 @25,000 km asking 1,358,000. FindCar 2023 band 1,238,000-1,358,000 (fetched live). A 3-year-old 菁英版 at only 21,000 km sits above the 2024 菁英版 @30,000 km on mileage but must stay under the same-age 豪華版 comps on trim: ~1,250,000 dealer RETAIL asking. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: -12% to 自售價 = 1,100,000, then -12.3% to 車商收購價 = 965,000. Confidence lowered from 'high' to 'medium' because 8891 asking prices for this cohort are visibly non-monotonic (a 3-year @60,000 km asks MORE than a 2-year @30,000 km), so the band is wide."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"Partly extrapolated: the current NX generation (AZ20) only launched in Taiwan around end-2021, so it is itself just ~4.7 years old and no true 5-year current-gen data point exists. Anchors: FindCar 2022年式 entry at 1,188,000 (fetched live) and a SUM 2022年式 豪華版 @30,307 km asking 1,239,000 — both ~4.5 years old and both higher trims, so a 5-year 菁英版 must sit below them on age AND trim; and a SUM 2021年式 (final 1st-gen) NX200 菁英版 @41,650 km asking 1,038,000, which is an older generation and therefore a floor. Placing this car between those bounds, with an upward nudge for its low 35,000 km, gives ~1,120,000 dealer RETAIL asking. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: -12% to 自售價 = 985,000, then -12.7% to 車商收購價 = 860,000. Retention lands at 57.6% of list, just under the NX350h hybrid sibling's 59.8%, which is the correct powertrain ordering."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED and CORRECTED DOWNWARD — no genuine 7-year data exists for this generation. The prior record produced 875,000 here, which retains 51.2% of list against the NX350h hybrid sibling's 46.0% — i.e. it had the GASOLINE car out-retaining the HYBRID, the wrong side of the Taiwan Lexus powertrain ordering. Two compounding causes. (1) Its predecessor arithmetic was self-contradictory: it read a low-mileage 1st-gen 2019年式 at ~992,000 against a 1,630,000 list, called that '58% retention' when 992,000/1,630,000 is actually 60.9%, then applied 58% to 1,710,000 and reported the same 992,000 — the ratio transfer and the absolute number cannot both hold. (2) It applied a flat -12% retail-to-private cut, which is calibrated for liquid 1-3 year stock. Real predecessor listings show asking prices going nearly FLAT between 5 and 7 years (2021年式 @41,650 km asking 1,038,000 vs 2019年式 @99,530 km asking 958,000, FindCar 2019 band 980,000-1,190,000), which is the signature of stale, sticky asking prices on illiquid old inventory, not of genuine value retention. Corrected approach: keep the predecessor listings as directional evidence but widen the retail-to-private spread to -15% for a 7-year-old car, and constrain the result to sit below the hybrid sibling. Result ~882,000 dealer RETAIL equivalent, -15% to 自售價 = 750,000, then -12.7% to 車商收購價 = 655,000. That is 43.9% of list, below the NX350h hybrid's 46.0% and above the RX350 gasoline's 42.3% — correct on both axes. Confidence low: the ratio transfer assumes the TNGA-K generation depreciates like its predecessor, which is unproven."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED and CORRECTED DOWNWARD — the weakest number in the record, and the prior version's largest error. It produced 690,000, retaining 40.4% of list: higher than EVERY other car in this batch at 10 years, including all the hybrids (NX350h 34.2%, ES300h 32.2%) and the gasoline RX350 (30.1%). Its route there was a silent 7-point upward bump, from the ~39% its own high-mileage listings implied to ~46%, justified only as a low-mileage premium — an 18% relative inflation layered on top of a ratio already transferred across a powertrain boundary (the NA NX200 did not exist in Taiwan in 2016; the only 10-year-old NX is the NX200t turbo). It also produced an internal contradiction: 787,000 dealer retail for a 10-year car exceeds the real 2017年式 (9-year) listing at 102,500 km asking 749,000. Corrected approach: real 10-year-old asking prices for the 1st-gen NX confirmed live on 8891 today run 659,000-759,000 (2015-2017 cohort, all at 150,000-177,500 km). A genuinely low-mileage 70,000 km example does earn a premium, but at 10 years condition and age dominate mileage and the premium compresses; and the retail-to-private spread on decade-old stock is at its widest because such listings sit unsold. Taking ~677,000 dealer RETAIL equivalent and cutting 18% gives 自售價 = 555,000, then -12.6% to 車商收購價 = 485,000. That is 32.5% of list, below the NX350h hybrid's 34.2% and above the RX350's 30.1% — correct on both axes. Confidence low: ratio transferred from a different powertrain at a different price point, and 10-year listings are thin and heavily condition-dependent. The U-CAR launch article that supplied the NX200t 195萬 denominator returned HTTP 403 today and could NOT be re-verified, which is a further reason this checkpoint no longer leans on that ratio."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Interval structure re-confirmed on the official Lexus Taiwan 保養計劃 page (lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx), fetched live today — including that the 1-month 24-item check is the only free service. Two paid visits in year 1 because the time trigger fires long before any distance trigger. Per-visit pricing estimated at the typical Lexus TW dealer rate for a 2.0 NA engine; Lexus TW publishes no price list, so these are estimates, not receipts. Dealers frequently absorb the first service as part of the delivery package (the verified 菜單 show large freebie bundles), so this may be an overestimate."},{"y":3,"source":"Official Lexus Taiwan 保養計劃 interval table (re-fetched live): 4 time-triggered visits across years 1-3 (2 minor at ~4,000, 2 annual at ~7,000), plus the 24個月 brake-fluid change at ~2,500. Still fully inside the 4年/12萬公里 warranty, so no repair allowance. Per-visit costs are dealer-rate estimates, not quoted receipts."},{"y":5,"source":"The 48個月/80,000km service falls here on the TIME trigger (year 4) even though the car has only ~28,000 km — this is the single biggest scheduled item and the reason this window costs far more than the previous one. Interval and content re-confirmed on the official Lexus Taiwan 保養計劃 page today, which lists 煞車油 + 變速箱油 + 燃油濾清器 at 48個月/80,000km. Tires are age-replaced: at 7,000 km/yr the OE 18-inch set still has tread at 35,000 km but the rubber is 5 years old; a fitted set of four runs ~28,000. 12V battery at ~4 years reflects short-trip low-mileage use, which is hard on batteries, and Lexus TW covers the battery only 3 years. Repairs still free under the 4年/12萬公里 warranty. Sits just above the NX350h sibling's 66,000 for the same window, which is consistent — same chassis, same consumables."},{"y":7,"source":"RAISED from 40,000 — the prior record under-provisioned the first fully out-of-warranty window. Warranty economics change here: Lexus Taiwan's basic cover is 4年/120,000km with a free extension to 5年/140,000km granted only if the owner services punctually every 6 months (official 保證方案 page). This buyer qualifies, but the extension still expires at year 5, so years 5-7 are the first years in which the owner pays for every repair. The prior record allowed only ~9,000 across two years for unscheduled work on a 5-to-7-year-old Lexus, against the NX350h sibling's 52,000 total for the identical window; the gasoline car's only structural saving over the hybrid is the absent HV inspection, which does not explain a 23% gap. Allowance raised to ~15,000, giving 46,000 — still below the hybrid, as it should be. Front pads at ~49,000 km of mostly city driving is the normal replacement point. No 48-month major service lands in this window (they fall at years 4 and 8). Costs are dealer-rate estimates, not receipts."},{"y":10,"source":"Three-year window, so 6 scheduled visits, plus the second 48個月/80,000km major service landing at year 8 on the time trigger (official Lexus Taiwan 保養計劃 interval table, re-fetched live today). Toyota/Lexus SLLC long-life coolant is first changed around 8 years, which falls here. Second tire set at year 10 follows the same age-based logic as the first. Brake discs and rear pads typically come due together once the fronts have been done. The 12,000 repair allowance reflects a 7-to-10-year-old car entirely outside warranty; it is an allowance, not a sourced figure. Matches the NX350h sibling's 120,000 for the same window, which is expected — by year 10 the hybrid's HV inspection is roughly offset by the gasoline car's spark plugs and richer wear items. Highest-uncertainty window in the record."}],"sources":[{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官方網站 — NX 車型頁","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/showroom/NX","note":"VERIFIED LIVE 2026-08-11. Manufacturer source. States the NX range as NT$171~284.5萬; NX200 菁英版 is the entry car, confirming the 1,710,000 list price. Does not break out per-trim prices, hence the TVBS cross-check."},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 — 2026 Lexus NX 規格配備","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/lexus/2026-lexus-nx","note":"VERIFIED LIVE 2026-08-11. Full 2026 NX Taiwan trim table: NX200 菁英版 171萬, NX200 豪華版 181萬, plus 350h/350/450h+ variants. This is the source that fixes 菁英版 as the BASE trim and gives the 豪華版 comparison list price used in the trim-ladder checks."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [菜單] LEXUS NX200 2026","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1773238741.A.2DD.html","note":"VERIFIED LIVE 2026-08-11. Real 2026年式 菁英版 deal sheet, posted 2026-03-11, 新北, cash: 空車價 157萬, total 159.6萬 including 2.6萬 self-paid 通風座椅, with a 10-item freebie pack. Its '實際約149.6萬' headline nets out a 舊換新 tax credit and was deliberately IGNORED because tax is excluded from this record by design."},{"name":"WeWanted 購車菜單 — Lexus 2026年式 NX200 菁英 171萬","url":"https://www.wewanted.com.tw/car_menu_content.php?uid=7600","note":"VERIFIED LIVE 2026-08-11. Second real 2026年式 菁英版 deal sheet: 成交價 1,550,000, explicitly 含配備 / 不含保險 / 不含規費 / 不含利息. The 含配備 qualifier is why the discount was cut from 150,000 to 130,000 — the headline price already absorbs the accessory pack."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus NX200 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/nx200","note":"VERIFIED LIVE 2026-08-11, 68 listings. Primary used-price source and the one that exposed the prior record's trim misattribution. Today's page: 2025 菁英版 @16,000km 1,399,000; 2025 豪華版 @26,000km 1,458,000 (the prior record wrongly called this a 菁英版 @10,000km); 2024 菁英版 @30,000km 1,238,000; 2023 豪華版 @30,000km 1,268,000; 2023 菁英版 @60,000km 1,248,000; 2023 豪華版 @25,000km 1,358,000; 2015-2017 cohort 659,000-759,000. All are 車商售價 and were discounted before use."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — Lexus NX200 中古車價格","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&b=38&m=1624","note":"VERIFIED LIVE 2026-08-11. Year-by-year asking ranges across 82 listings, site average 1,061,000: 2018 758,000-1,200,000; 2019 980,000-1,190,000; 2022 1,188,000; 2023 1,238,000-1,358,000; 2024 1,299,000; 2025 1,469,000. Used to sanity-check monotonicity and to bound the 5-year and 7-year extrapolations."},{"name":"abc好車網 — Lexus NX200 菁英Plus版 2019年","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2119303","note":"VERIFIED LIVE 2026-08-11. 7-year-old predecessor-generation listing, 2019 NX200 菁英Plus版, asking 1,160,000 (SUM大松汽車 台北). Treated as the optimistic upper bound of the 7-year band — abc好車網 runs consistently above 8891/SUM/FindCar for the same model year and was down-weighted accordingly."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官方 — 保養計劃","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"VERIFIED LIVE 2026-08-11. Official scheduled-maintenance table: free 新車1個月24項定檢 (the ONLY free service); then 6個月, 12個月/20,000km, 24個月/40,000km (煞車油), 48個月/80,000km (煞車油+變速箱油+燃油濾清器, 37項). Establishes that at 7,000 km/yr all servicing is time-triggered at 2 visits per year. No public price list is published, which is why per-visit costs are flagged as estimates."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官方 — 保證方案／延長保證","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx","note":"Warranty 4年/120,000km; free extension to 5年/140,000km conditional on servicing punctually every 6 months; battery 3 years. States maintenance is NOT included and must be purchased separately — this is why no free-maintenance credit is applied. Carried over from the prior record; not independently re-fetched in this audit (the 保養計劃 page was fetched instead and corroborates the no-free-maintenance conclusion)."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — LEXUS NX 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=NX","note":"NOT re-verified in this audit — carried over from the prior record and used only as directional cross-check. Claimed listings: 2022 豪華版 @30,307km 1,239,000; 2021 菁英版 @41,650km 1,038,000; 2019 @99,530km 958,000. The 2021 and 2019 points bound the 5- and 7-year extrapolations, which is part of why both carry medium/low confidence."},{"name":"KingAutos — 2026 Lexus NX 車款介紹","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/nx","note":"NOT re-verified in this audit. Cited by the prior record as a third confirmation of NT$1,710,000 plus specs (1,987cc NA, 173hp, CVT, FWD). The list price is independently confirmed by the two verified sources above, so nothing depends on this URL."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — Lexus NX 200t 195萬起上市","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/24947","note":"COULD NOT BE VERIFIED — returned HTTP 403 on 2026-08-11. The prior record used its claimed 195萬 NX200t launch price as the denominator for the entire 10-year retention ratio. Because that denominator is unverifiable AND the ratio crossed a powertrain boundary, the corrected 10-year checkpoint no longer relies on it; it is anchored instead on live 8891 asking prices for the 2015-2017 cohort and constrained by the batch's powertrain ordering."},{"name":"跟著左豪吃不胖 — LEXUS NX200 改版 新車價格配備","url":"https://permio1.com/lexus-nx200-new/","note":"NOT re-verified in this audit. Cited by the prior record for predecessor-era list prices of 163萬/173萬. Flagged as ambiguous: the same 163萬/173萬 pair appears attached both to the 1st-generation NX200 and to the 2nd-generation NX200 at its 2022 Taiwan launch, so the 7-year denominator is uncertain — another reason that checkpoint is 'low'."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [菜單] LEXUS NX200 2025年式 菁英版","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1749897061.A.246.html","note":"NOT re-verified in this audit. Prior model-year deal sheet claimed at 149萬 空車價 plus 4萬 self-paid accessories (新竹). Used only as directional support that the discount pattern is not a one-off; the two verified 2026年式 sheets carry the discount figure."},{"name":"8891 汽車 — Lexus NX 200 菜單：6車型成交價152.0-174.0萬","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/feature/5494","note":"HEADLINE ONLY — article body was not retrievable in either pass. Directional cross-check that real NX200 transaction prices run below list. Explicitly NOT used as a primary figure for the discount."}]},"lexus-nx200-luxury":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr; all checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000), roughly half the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/yr. Two consequences. (1) RESALE: every same-age NX200 on 8891/SUM carries more mileage than this car, so low-mileage listings were quoted deliberately. CORRECTED CALIBRATION: the prior version of this record claimed mileage sensitivity was near zero on young cars, citing a '2025年式 11,000 km NT$1,469,000 vs 2025年式 26,000 km NT$1,458,000' pair. Re-reading the 8891 board, those are NOT the same model year — the 1.1萬 km / NT$1,469,000 car is a 2026年式 and the 2.6萬 km / NT$1,458,000 car is a 2025年式, so the pair measures age, not mileage, and the 0.75% figure was an artefact. The genuine mileage evidence is the same-trim, same-year 2018年式 豪華版 triplet now visible across both boards: 55,000 km NT$899,000 (8891) vs 105,830 km NT$778,000 and 116,548 km NT$798,000 (SUM) — about +15% for 50,000-60,000 km less on an 8-year-old car. Mileage sensitivity is therefore modest when the car is young and becomes material with age, which is why the low-mileage premium applied here is small at years 1-3 and grows at years 7-10. (2) MAINTENANCE: the official Lexus TW interval table is 6個月/10,000km, 12個月/20,000km, 24個月/40,000km, 48個月/80,000km, 以先到者為準. CORRECTED STRUCTURAL READING: the prior version treated the expensive '4萬公里定保' as a DISTANCE trigger and pushed it out to year 5.7, and pushed the 8萬公里 items past year 10 entirely. That is wrong — at 7,000 km/yr the CALENDAR always fires first, so the 24個月 service lands at years 2, 4, 6, 8, 10 and the big 48個月 service lands at years 4 and 8 with only ~28,000 and ~56,000 km on the clock. This is a 2-paid-visits-per-year car (20 visits by year 10) and it reaches every major service on time, on the calendar. Tyres follow the same logic: 235/60R18 rubber is replaced on age at roughly years 5 and 10, not on the 70,000 km of tread the car actually wears out. Tax (牌照稅+燃料稅) and insurance are excluded by design and appear nowhere in this record.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"UNCHANGED IN VALUE, re-anchored on today's 8891 board with one label correction. Rows read live today for gen-2 豪華版: 2026年式 10,200 km NT$1,458,000 (Taoyuan), 2026年式 11,000 km NT$1,469,000 (Taichung), 2025年式 26,000 km NT$1,458,000 (Kaohsiung); the 菁英版 comparator is 2025年式 16,000 km NT$1,399,000 (Tainan). The prior record labelled the 11,000 km / NT$1,469,000 car a 2025年式; it is a 2026年式, which matters because it removes the supposed same-year mileage pair. Our car at 1 year old in Aug 2026 is a 2025年式, and the only genuine same-year 豪華版 row is NT$1,458,000 at 26,000 km. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: our car at 7,000 km sits above that on mileage but the young-car premium is small, so ~NT$1,470,000 dealer-retail asking, which also brackets neatly against the two 2026年式 rows. Applied -10% for dealer-retail → 自售價 = NT$1,325,000, unchanged. A 10% (rather than 12-15%) haircut is used at year 1 because the car still carries the balance of the 4yr/120,000 km factory warranty, which is the main thing a 車商 otherwise sells; the haircut widens with age below. dealer_tradein_price = a further -12.1% = NT$1,165,000, implying the dealer relists near NT$1,460,000 for a ~20% gross margin, consistent with the live asking prices above. Cross-trim check: the 菁英版 sibling sits at NT$1,250,000 private, so the 豪華版 is +6.0% in absolute money on a +5.8% list-price gap — correct ordering, with the retention RATIO already slightly lower (75.1% vs 77.6% of real_cost)."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"UNCHANGED — re-verified on today's 8891 board and not objected to by the reviewer. Live 2023年式 豪華版 rows (exactly 3 years old): 25,000 km NT$1,358,000 (New Taipei), 30,000 km NT$1,268,000 (Taichung), 56,000 km NT$1,278,000 (Taoyuan). SUM adds 2023年式 豪華版 48,760 km NT$1,378,000. The band is 1,268,000-1,378,000 with no clean mileage gradient — most of the spread is dealer/condition variance, which is why the earlier draft's use of only the cheapest, highest-mileage car was wrong. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: our car at 21,000 km is the lowest-mileage member of the cohort, so it belongs in the upper part of the band → ~NT$1,325,000 dealer-retail asking. Applied -11% dealer-retail → 自售價 = NT$1,180,000. dealer_tradein_price = -13.1% = NT$1,025,000. Several genuine same-trim, same-year listings underpin this; the retail→private conversion is my own adjustment, hence medium not high. Cross-trim check: 菁英版 sits at NT$1,100,000 private (68.3% of its real_cost) versus 66.9% here — ratio correctly lower on the higher trim."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"UNCHANGED — EXTRAPOLATED, and not objected to by the reviewer. No second-generation NX200 has reached 5 years: the gen-2 NX (AAZA20) was presented in Taiwan on 20 Dec 2021 and NX200 deliveries only began after Lunar New Year 2022, so the oldest real gen-2 NX200 is a 2022年式 at ~4 years. Real 4-year anchors re-confirmed today: SUM 2022年式 NX200 豪華版 30,307 km NT$1,239,000, SUM 2022年式 98,000 km NT$1,158,000, and 8891 2022年式 豪華版 90,000 km NT$1,158,000 — i.e. ~7% across 60,000-68,000 km at this age. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: the observed dealer-asking curve on genuine listings runs 3y ~NT$1,325,000 → 4y ~NT$1,239,000, a -6.5%/yr step; applying the same step for 4y→5y gives ~NT$1,158,000, less ~0.5% because our car at 35,000 km is slightly above the 30,307 km anchor → ~NT$1,152,000 dealer-retail equivalent. Applied -11% dealer-retail → 自售價 = NT$1,030,000. dealer_tradein_price = -14.1% = NT$885,000. Cross-trim check: 菁英版 sits at NT$985,000 private (61.2% of its real_cost) versus 58.4% here — ratio correctly lower on the higher trim. Confidence stays low because the 5-year point is one full year beyond any real listing."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"CORRECTED DOWNWARD from NT$850,000 in direct response to the cross-trim objection. The prior figure retained 48.2% of real_cost against the 菁英版 sibling's 46.6% — the higher trim out-retaining the base trim, which the Taiwan used market does not do without a scarcity story, and the NX200 豪華版 has none. Diagnosis of how it happened: the prior method took the single HIGHEST gen-1 comparable (8891 2018年式 豪華版 55,000 km NT$899,000, an 8-year-old car) and then added a full year of appreciation on top, reaching ~NT$958,000. That is the most generous possible reading of one listing. TWO METHODS, now bracketed. (a) Age transfer from the same-trim comp: NT$899,000 at 8 years, +~6%/yr for one year less age, +~0.5% for 49,000 vs 55,000 km → ~NT$953,000. (b) Trim-premium transfer from a genuine SAME-AGE comp: 8891 shows a 2019年式 NX200 菁英Plus at 50,000 km asking NT$838,000 — exactly 7 years old at almost exactly our mileage. The observed 豪華-over-菁英 premium in dealer asking runs 4-7% (2025年式 豪華 NT$1,458,000 vs 2025年式 菁英 NT$1,399,000 = +4.2%), so a same-age 豪華版 lands at ~NT$888,000. Method (a) implies a +13% trim gap over the 菁英Plus row, which is wider than anything the boards show, so it is over-generous; the two bracket NT$888,000-953,000 and ~NT$940,000 is taken, leaning to the same-trim comp. HAIRCUT WIDENED to -15% (from -12%): at 7 years the wider cohort's asking prices go nearly flat (2019年式 NX200 at 81,000 km and at 99,000 km both ask NT$798,000, and a 2019年式 at 42,000 km asks NT$680,000), which is the signature of stale, sticky asking prices on illiquid old inventory rather than real retained value. -15% of NT$940,000 → 自售價 = NT$800,000. dealer_tradein_price = -15% = NT$680,000; by year 7 dealers discount harder on out-of-warranty stock. RESULT: 45.3% of real_cost, below the 菁英版 sibling's 46.6%, while still +6.7% ahead in absolute money — the correct shape on both axes. Confidence low: this is a cross-generation transfer, and gen-2 will not be 7 years old until 2029."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"CORRECTED DOWNWARD from NT$620,000, same cross-trim objection: 35.1% of real_cost sat above the 菁英版 sibling's 34.5%. EXTRAPOLATED and the weakest point in the record. No NX200 of any generation is 10 years old in NA 2.0 form — the naturally-aspirated NX200 only arrived with the Oct-2017 gen-1 facelift — so the fallback is the gen-1 turbo sibling NX200t (launched Dec 2014 at 195萬起, CarStuff; note that article supports ONLY the headline, not a per-trim ladder, so no 豪華版-specific denominator exists and the ratio method is unreliable here). Real decade-old asking prices confirmed live on 8891 today: 2016年式 NX200T 150,000 km NT$758,000 (10y), 2017年式 NX200t 102,500 km NT$749,000 (9y), 2017年式 NX200t F Sport 138,000 km NT$699,000 (9y), 2015年式 NX200t 豪華版 168,600 km NT$659,000 (11y). The 10-year band is therefore ~NT$659,000-758,000, all at 150,000-177,500 km. Our car at 70,000 km does earn a low-mileage premium — the 8-year 豪華版 triplet (NT$899,000 @55,000 km vs NT$778,000 @105,830 km vs NT$798,000 @116,548 km) shows ~+15% for 50,000-60,000 km less — but at 10 years age and condition dominate mileage and the premium compresses, because a decade-old car needs the same calendar-driven work whatever the odometer says. Taking ~NT$714,000 dealer-retail equivalent (the 菁英版 record's ~NT$677,000 plus the same ~5.5% trim premium used at year 7) and cutting 18% — the widest retail-to-private spread in the record, because decade-old listings sit unsold — gives 自售價 = NT$585,000. dealer_tradein_price = -16.2% = NT$490,000; at 10 years many 車商 will only take the car as a lowball 抵價. RESULT: 33.1% of real_cost, below the 菁英版 sibling's 34.5% and the NX350h hybrid's 35.7%, above the NX350 F Sport's 30.2% — correct on both the trim and powertrain axes. Caveats stacked: different powertrain (turbo vs NA), different generation, no verifiable trim-level denominator, and a low-mileage adjustment that is judgement rather than data."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"RAISED from NT$8,000 to match the mechanically identical 菁英版 sibling. Interval structure re-confirmed today on the official Lexus Taiwan 保養計劃 page (lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx), including that the 1-month 24-item check is the only free service. Two paid visits in year 1 because the time trigger fires long before any distance trigger at 7,000 km/yr. WHY THE PRIOR NT$8,000 WAS TOO LOW: it priced BOTH visits as light 6-month services (~3,500 + ~4,500), but the 12-month service adds 空氣濾清器 and 冷氣濾網 on top of a 29-item inspection and costs materially more. The Mobile01 owner-receipt thread cited by the earlier draft actually supports this — its NT$8,436 receipt is for the 20,000 km-class service, which is the same content as the annual service, while its NT$4,100 receipt is the light one. Those two receipts sum to NT$12,536, so NT$11,000 sits slightly BELOW the receipt evidence, not above it. CAVEAT: that Mobile01 thread returns HTTP 403 to direct fetch (re-tested today), so its figures reach this record via search-result extraction only and could not be read in situ; the thread is also internally inconsistent, elsewhere quoting 首保 3,000-4,000 and 滿年保養 4,000-5,000. NT$11,000 is a deliberate middle. Dealers frequently absorb the first service inside the delivery package, so this may be an overestimate. Nothing else is due — the car is new, in warranty, and at 7,000 km."},{"y":3,"source":"Essentially unchanged (NT$26,000 → NT$25,000) and now aligned with the 菁英版 sibling, which is the correct answer for two trims sharing an engine and gearbox. Build-up from the official interval table: four time-triggered visits across years 1-3 — two light 6-month services at ~NT$4,000 and two annual services at ~NT$7,000 = NT$22,000 — plus the 24個月 service's brake-fluid change and air filter at ~NT$3,000. Note this is the correction that matters structurally: the 24個月 service arrives on the CALENDAR at year 2 with only ~14,000 km showing, not at 40,000 km. Still fully inside the 4年/120,000km warranty, so no repair allowance. Per-visit costs are dealer-rate estimates cross-checked against the Mobile01 receipts (same HTTP 403 caveat as year 1)."},{"y":5,"source":"CORRECTED UP from NT$36,000 — this window was where the prior version's misread interval table did the most damage, and it now matches the mechanically identical 菁英版 sibling exactly. THE FIX: the 48個月/80,000km major service lands here, at year 4, on the TIME trigger, with the car showing only ~28,000 km (official Lexus Taiwan 保養計劃 table, re-fetched today: 37項 including 變速箱油＋燃油濾清器＋水箱精檢查). The prior version treated 80,000km as the binding trigger and so never billed this service at all inside the 10-year horizon. Build-up: four time-triggered visits ≈ NT$4,000 + NT$7,000 + NT$4,000 + NT$7,000 = NT$22,000; the 48個月 major's extras (CVT fluid ~NT$9,000, fuel filter ~NT$2,000, brake fluid ~NT$2,500) = NT$13,500; 12V battery at ~year 4 ~NT$5,500, since Lexus TW covers the battery only 3 years and short-trip low-mileage use is hard on batteries; first set of four 235/60R18 tyres at ~year 5 ~NT$26,000, replaced on rubber age rather than tread — at 35,000 km the OE set still has usable tread but is five years old. Repairs are still free under the 4年/120,000km warranty, so no allowance is carried. Identical to the 菁英版 sibling's NT$67,000 for this window, which is the correct outcome: same engine, same CVT, same 18-inch 235/60R18 tyres, same service schedule. Per-visit and consumable prices are dealer-rate estimates, not quoted receipts."},{"y":7,"source":"CORRECTED DOWN from NT$81,000. The prior version parked the tyre replacement here on the argument that 46,000 km of tread was the trigger; the trigger at this mileage is rubber age, which lands the first set at ~year 5 (previous window) and the second at ~year 10, exactly as the 菁英版 sibling has it. It also placed the '4萬公里定保' here at year 5.7 on a distance reading, when the official table is 24個月/40,000km 以先到者為準 and the calendar version of that service already fell at years 2, 4 and 6. Rebuilt: four time-triggered visits ≈ NT$4,000 + NT$7,000 + NT$4,000 + NT$7,000 = NT$22,000; brake fluid on the 24-month cycle ~NT$2,500; front brake pads at ~49,000 km of mostly city driving ~NT$8,000; out-of-warranty allowance ~NT$14,500. Warranty economics change in this window: the basic 4年/120,000km cover and the earned free extension to 5年/140,000km (official 保證方案 page, re-verified today) have both expired by year 5, so this is the first window in which the owner pays for every repair. The allowance is NT$1,000 above the 菁英版 sibling's because the 豪華版 carries 電動尾門, 前座通風 blowers and 環景 cameras that the base trim does not — a small but real extra failure surface. Tyre, pad and allowance figures are estimates, not receipts — hence low."},{"y":10,"source":"CORRECTED UP from NT$86,000 — the prior figure was the single biggest reason this record's ten-year maintenance came out NT$32,000 below its own base-trim sibling. Two omissions restored. (1) The second 48個月/80,000km major service lands at year 8 on the CALENDAR with only ~56,000 km showing (official Lexus Taiwan 保養計劃 interval table, re-fetched today); the prior version read it as a distance trigger and pushed it past the horizon. (2) The second tyre set at ~year 10 was deleted on tread grounds; 235/60R18 rubber is replaced on age at this mileage, so it belongs here, exactly as in the 菁英版 sibling. Build-up: six scheduled visits across years 7-10 ≈ NT$33,000; the year-8 major's extras (CVT fluid NT$9,000, fuel filter NT$2,000, brake fluid NT$2,500) = NT$13,500; Toyota/Lexus SLLC long-life coolant first change at ~year 8 ~NT$4,000; second 12V battery ~NT$5,500; spark plugs on the age limit rather than the 100,000 km limit ~NT$5,000; second tyre set ~NT$28,000; rear pads plus front discs, which typically come due together once the fronts have been done, ~NT$18,000; ageing-repair allowance ~NT$16,000. That allowance is NT$3,000 above the 菁英版 sibling's for the 豪華版's extra powered equipment, and it remains the single largest source of error here — a decade-old NX200 with only 70,000 km is mechanically young, but rubber, seals and electronics age on the calendar. FULLY ESTIMATED: no 10-year data exists for this generation and none will until 2032. Order-of-magnitude planning number."}],"sources":[{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 保養計劃（定期保養間隔表）","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"VERIFIED BY THIS REVISION (fetched live). Official, and the source of the biggest correction in this record. Intervals read directly: 新車滿月保養 24項 (the only free service); 6個月/10,000km, 16項, 機油＋機油芯; 12個月/20,000km, 29項, 加空氣濾清器; 24個月/40,000km, 34項, 煞車油＋空氣濾清器; 48個月/80,000km, 37項, 變速箱油＋燃油濾清器＋水箱精. 以先到者為準. At 7,000 km/yr the calendar always fires first, so the 24個月 service lands at years 2/4/6/8/10 and the 48個月 major at years 4 and 8 — both inside the 10-year window. The prior version of this record read these as distance triggers and mis-scheduled the whole maintenance model."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 車輛保證服務說明","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx","note":"VERIFIED BY THIS REVISION (re-fetched live). Official warranty terms: 4 years / 120,000 km new-car warranty; battery 3 years unlimited mileage (free replacement in years 0-2, 50% contribution in years 2-3). Confirms NO free scheduled maintenance is bundled. Also describes the 準時保養延長保證: service punctually every 6 months and the warranty is extended free to year 5 / 140,000 km; miss one and the extension must be bought."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 新車準時保養愛車享延長保證方案","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/news_detail.aspx?nw=563&fn=1","note":"VERIFIED (carried forward from the prior audit). Dated 2023/12/29, applies to cars delivered from 2024/01/01. 準時連續 8 次定保 with 原廠機油 + 定保套餐, all before the 4yr/120,000 km warranty expires, earns a FREE extension of 1 year or 20,000 km (= 5yr/140,000 km). The 8-services-in-4-years requirement independently corroborates the 6-month service spacing used throughout this record."},{"name":"地球黃金線 (TVBS) — 2026 Lexus NX 規格配備／價格表","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/lexus/2026-lexus-nx","note":"VERIFIED BY THIS REVISION (re-fetched live). Two uses. (1) Price: NX200 菁英版 171萬 / NX200 豪華版 181萬 / NX350h 豪華版 207.5萬 / NX350h 頂級版 227.5萬 / NX350 Overtrail 234萬 / NX450h+ 豪華版 237.5萬 / NX350h 旗艦版 257.5萬 / NX350 F Sport 263萬 / NX450h+ F Sport 284.5萬. list_price NT$1,810,000 stands. (2) Spec: the 菁英版 and 豪華版 columns are IDENTICAL on engine, suspension, brakes and wheels/tyres — both 18-inch on 235/60R18. This is the evidence that the two trims' scheduled maintenance must cost the same, and it is why the prior NT$237,000 total was rejected."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — NX showroom","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/showroom/NX","note":"VERIFIED (carried forward). Official. Shows the NX band NT$171~284.5萬 and powertrains 450h+ / 350h / 350 / 200. No per-trim breakout, so it corroborates the band rather than the exact 豪華版 figure."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus NX200 二手行情與車源","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/nx200","note":"VERIFIED BY THIS REVISION (re-fetched live) and the main source for the resale ladder. Gen-2 豪華版 rows read today: 2026年式 10,200 km NT$1,458,000; 2026年式 11,000 km NT$1,469,000; 2025年式 26,000 km NT$1,458,000; 2023年式 25,000 km NT$1,358,000; 2023年式 30,000 km NT$1,268,000; 2023年式 56,000 km NT$1,278,000; 2022年式 90,000 km NT$1,158,000. Gen-2 菁英版 comparators: 2025年式 16,000 km NT$1,399,000; 2023年式 60,000 km NT$1,248,000. Gen-1 rows used for the 7- and 10-year extrapolations: 2018年式 NX200 豪華版 55,000 km NT$899,000; 2019年式 NX200 菁英Plus 50,000 km NT$838,000; 2019年式 NX200 81,000 km NT$798,000; 2019年式 NX200 99,000 km NT$798,000; 2017年式 NX200t 102,500 km NT$749,000; 2017年式 NX200t F Sport 138,000 km NT$699,000; 2016年式 NX200T 150,000 km NT$758,000; 2015年式 NX200t 豪華版 168,600 km NT$659,000. All are 車商售價 and were cut 10-18% before use. LABEL CORRECTION vs the prior version: the 11,000 km / NT$1,469,000 car is a 2026年式, not a 2025年式, so the supposed same-year mileage pair it used for calibration does not exist."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — LEXUS NX 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=NX","note":"VERIFIED BY THIS REVISION (re-fetched live), 81 listings, used as the independent cross-check and as the source of the mileage-sensitivity calibration. Same-trim, same-year 2018年式 NX200 豪華版 pair: 105,830 km NT$778,000 and 116,548 km NT$798,000 — which, set against 8891's 2018年式 豪華版 55,000 km NT$899,000, gives ~+15% for 50,000-60,000 km less on an 8-year-old car. Also corroborates the 4-year anchor (2022年式 豪華版 30,307 km NT$1,239,000, and 2022年式 98,000 km NT$1,158,000) and the 3-year band (2023年式 豪華版 48,760 km NT$1,378,000)."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 — 2代 Lexus NX 全車系正式發表（163萬起）","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/35488-3-6-163-lexus-nx.html","note":"VERIFIED (carried forward). Gen-2 launch prices: NX200 菁英版 163萬 / 豪華版 173萬 — a 6.1% new-price gap, which is the benchmark the 4-7% observed used-market trim premium is compressed against. DATE: the presentation was 20 Dec 2021 and NX200 deliveries began only after Lunar New Year 2022, so the oldest real gen-2 NX200 is a 2022年式 at ~4 years, which is what forces the 5/7/10-year extrapolations."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 — 195萬起，Lexus 全新 NX 200t 強勢上市","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/17035-195-lexus-nx-200t.html","note":"VERIFIED, WITH A SOURCING CAVEAT (carried forward). Supports only the Dec-2014 launch and the 195萬起 headline; it does NOT contain a per-trim ladder, so there is no verifiable 豪華版 denominator for the 10-year ratio method. That is why the 10-year point is built on a listing-level transfer plus a cross-trim consistency constraint rather than on a retention ratio, and why it stays low-confidence."},{"name":"KingAutos — Lexus NX 車款介紹（2024 年式陣容）","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/nx","note":"VERIFIED but RELABELLED (carried forward). Cited in an earlier draft as a '2026' price table; it is actually the 2024 lineup — it still lists NX250 豪華版 197.5萬 and NX250 頂級版 207.5萬, both deleted for 2026年式. It corroborates NX200 豪華版 181萬 and 菁英版 171萬, so the price cross-check survives, but it is not independent 2026 confirmation."},{"name":"8891 新車 — 2023年式 Lexus NX 養車成本","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/lexus/nx/15916","note":"VERIFIED BY THIS REVISION (re-fetched live), with a downgrade in how much weight it carries. It confirms qualitatively that '最入門的NX 200反而保養費用沒有比較便宜，4萬公里定保的費用是唯一突破萬元的' and that NX maintenance sits between European imports and domestic cars — but on re-reading it publishes NO per-interval NT$ figures. The prior version leaned on it to size a single expensive service at year 5.7; it cannot support that, and in any case the 4萬公里 content arrives on the 24-month calendar trigger long before 40,000 km at this mileage."},{"name":"風傳媒 — 台灣 Lexus 2026 新年式開賣，NX 動力精簡","url":"https://www.storm.mg/lifestyle/11061956","note":"VERIFIED (carried forward). Confirms the 2026年式 NX change: NX250 dropped, lineup compressed to 9 trims, prices NOT raised, band NT$171-284.5萬. Relevant because deleting the NX250 leaves NX200 as the only non-hybrid entry, mildly supporting NX200 used demand."},{"name":"8891 新車 — Lexus NX200 菜單彙整（6 車型成交價 152.0-174.0 萬）","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/feature/5494","note":"VERIFIED (carried forward). Aggregated real transaction prices across NX200 trims and model years, 152.0-174.0萬. Puts the 豪華版 near the top of that band and is the main evidence AGAINST a very large discount — it is why discounts were set at NT$80,000 rather than the NT$150,000+ the individual menus might suggest."},{"name":"Disp BBS car 板 — [菜單] NX200 26年式豪華特仕版","url":"https://disp.cc/b/Car/i8tc","note":"VERIFIED (carried forward). Real 2026 deal at NT$1,495,000, explicitly including 舊換新 5萬 + 貨物稅減徵 5萬 (government money requiring a scrapped old car) plus giveaways 環景／抬頭顯示器／電子後視鏡／ETag／全車隔熱紙／腳踏墊／油箱加滿. Backing the NT$100,000 of rebates out leaves ~NT$1,595,000 of buyer cash against a 181萬 list. Note this is the 豪華特仕版, not the plain 豪華版 being priced here."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [菜單] LEXUS NX200 豪華","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1770442937.A.D9D.html","note":"VERIFIED (carried forward). Real 2026 transaction: NT$1,660,000 for 豪華/LFA白, 不含保險與領牌稅金, paid 現金＋點數, with the 特仕包 (環景、電子後視鏡、智慧防護、鍍膜) and 通風座椅 SELF-PAID inside that total; 3M 隔熱紙 free. The buyer was replacing a SIX-year-old Altis, which fails the 10-year age test for 貨物稅減徵汰舊換新, so this is most likely a clean no-rebate price."},{"name":"Mobile01 — NX200 第二次進場保養，和各車友請益（車主工單）","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=346&t=6651461","note":"NOT DIRECTLY VERIFIABLE — re-tested today and it still returns HTTP 403 to direct fetch, so the receipts reach this record only via search-result extraction. Figures attributed to it: NT$4,100 @ 7,692 km, NT$8,436 @ 15,627 km, NT$8,456 @ 22,749 km, NT$14,167 @ 31,001 km, plus 首保 3,000-4,000 元 and 滿年保養 4,000-5,000 元 — note those last two conflict with the itemised receipts, which is a further reason to treat the thread as corroboration rather than as the primary model. Used here only to sanity-check per-visit pricing derived from the official interval table; no maintenance checkpoint is rated above medium."}]},"lexus-nx350h-premium":{"assumptions":"買家年行駛 6,000-8,000 km，遠低於台灣平均 12,000-15,000 km。各檢查點一律用 7,000 km/年推算里程（7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000）。此里程下 Lexus 的定期保養完全由時間主導（每 6 個月一次、一年進廠兩次，不是里程到才進廠），輪胎也是橡膠老化（5-6 年）而非磨耗到期。殘值方面，同年份低里程車在台灣中古市場高於不分里程的平均行情，本表在各檢查點都已加計低里程溢價並在 source 欄註明。稅金與保險依規格排除，不計入 purchase 或 maintenance。【fact-check 註】本車在 NX350h 三個等級中位於中段（豪華 2,075,000 / 頂級 2,275,000 / 旗艦 2,575,000，本車在 豪華→旗艦 之間約 40% 位置）。依台灣中古市場「配備等級溢價回收率低」的通則，頂級版的保值『比例』必須介於豪華版與旗艦版之間（豪華 > 頂級 > 旗艦），絕對成交價則反過來介於兩者之間。本表所有 value_checkpoints 都已同時對『相對牌價』與『相對 real_cost』兩個基準做過此區間檢查，兩個基準都成立。","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"【fact-check 上修：1,610,000 → 1,680,000】原值使頂級版的保值比例低於同車系更高階的旗艦版，違反等級階梯（詳見 assumptions.notes）。車商零售參考：abc好車網 2024 年式 350h頂級版 3,000 km 開價 1,988,000（https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2147794）、20,000 km 開價 2,068,000（https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2305374），但同賣家頁面另有 8,888,000 佔位價，判定開價偏高只作上界；8891 中古車 2025 年式 NX350h 約 10,000 km 開價 1,698,000（https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/nx，該筆等級標示不明確，可能為豪華版）作下界。取 1 年車、低里程車商零售 1,898,000（落在 1,698,000-1,988,000 之間），本車僅 7,000 km（市場同齡平均約 13,000 km）之低里程溢價已含在此數內。【車商零售→自售的調整，本表最關鍵的一步】private_sale = 車商零售 1,898,000 × 0.885 = 1,680,000，即自售價低於車商開價約 11.5%，落在規格要求的 8-15% 區間內；dealer_tradein = 自售 1,680,000 × 0.87 = 1,462,000，收購再低約 13%。兩段合計收購價低於車商零售約 23%，符合台灣業界『收購價低於零售行情 2~3 成』的通則（https://www.littletsenggarage.com/usedcarpricing/、https://www.twgc91.com/how-to-count-depreciation-price/）。等級階梯雙基準檢查：相對牌價 0.738（豪華版 0.764 > 本車 > 旗艦版 0.730）✓；相對 real_cost 0.796（豪華版 0.796 ≥ 本車 > 旗艦版 0.779）✓。"},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"【fact-check 上修：1,400,000 → 1,460,000，並將 confidence 由 high 降為 medium】原值同樣落在旗艦版保值比例之下，違反等級階梯。四筆 2023 年式 NX350h 頂級版車商開價：FindCar 24,410 km 1,458,000、28,108 km 1,650,000、109,695 km 1,388,000（https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/nx350h）；8891 桃園 49,000 km 1,518,000（https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/nx）。2023 年式頂級版新車牌價為 2,190,000（2024 年式才調漲約 80,000，https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/74010）。取低里程段（24k-28k km）中位約 1,554,000，再因本車僅 21,000 km（低於這批樣本、亦低於同齡市場平均約 39,000 km）加計約 +6% 低里程溢價，得車商零售 1,650,000。調整說明：private_sale = 1,650,000 × 0.885 = 1,460,000（自售低於車商開價 11.5%）；dealer_tradein = 1,460,000 × 0.87 = 1,270,000。降級理由：所引四筆開價來自 FindCar／8891 的『搜尋結果頁』URL，內容隨時間變動、無法逐筆回溯查證，fact-check 端因額度限制未能重新開啟複驗；且由車商開價推到自售價需經兩段無直接來源的係數，不符合『high = 多筆實際掛牌或官方表格』的標準，同批次其他 NX 等級在此檢查點也一律標 medium。等級階梯雙基準檢查：相對牌價 0.642（豪華版 0.665 > 本車 > 旗艦版 0.641）✓；相對 real_cost 0.692（豪華版 0.693 > 本車 > 旗艦版 0.684）✓。"},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"【fact-check 上修：1,255,000 → 1,295,000】等級階梯修正。現行世代（AZ20）台灣 2021 年底才上市，2026/08 時最老車齡約 4.6 年，故 5 年點是『以 2022 年式外插半年』。真實 2022 年式頂級版車商開價：FindCar 39,168 km 1,678,000、106,886 km 1,399,000、113,000 km 1,288,000（https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/nx350h）。2022 年式頂級版新車牌價 2,190,000。以低里程樣本（39,168 km）為錨、扣掉多半年車齡並把明顯偏高的開價作合理下修，取車商零售 1,463,000；本車 35,000 km 對比同齡市場平均約 65,000 km，低里程溢價（約 +8%）已含在此數內。調整說明：private_sale = 1,463,000 × 0.885 = 1,295,000（自售低於車商開價 11.5%）；dealer_tradein = 1,295,000 × 0.87 = 1,127,000。等級階梯雙基準檢查：相對牌價 0.569（豪華版 0.598 > 本車 > 旗艦版 0.559）✓；相對 real_cost 0.613（豪華版 0.623 > 本車 > 旗艦版 0.597）✓。"},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"【fact-check 下修：1,085,000 → 1,000,000。本表原始版本最嚴重的單點錯誤】原值使頂級版的保值比例（相對 real_cost 0.515）高於同車系更便宜的豪華版（0.480）與旗艦版（0.464），等級階梯完全反向；同時造成折舊曲線在 5→7 年只掉 0.081、7→10 年卻掉 0.183 的不自然轉折（同車系豪華版與旗艦版此兩段分別為 −0.143/−0.123 與 −0.133/−0.126）。現行世代沒有 7 年車，故依規格改用前代 NX300h（AZ10）2019 年式的真實行情換算保值率再套回本車 real_cost。前代新車牌價：NX300h 豪華版 1,890,000／頂級版 1,990,000／旗艦版 2,190,000（https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/24124、https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/16353-189-lexus-nx-300h.html）。7 年實車開價：8891 台北 2019 年 30,000 km 1,088,000、新北 2019 旗艦 90,000 km 1,038,000、新北 2019 豪華 110,000 km 1,198,000（https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/nx300、https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/nx）；東晴國際 2019 豪華版 77,000 km 1,188,000（https://dcauto.tw/product/2019年-lexus-nx300h豪華版/）。得前代 7 年不分里程車商零售保值率約 55%（相對原始牌價），因頂級版屬中上等級、配備溢價在中古市場被打折，再扣 2 個百分點至 53%；本車 49,000 km 對比同齡市場平均約 90,000 km，加約 +10% 低里程溢價 → 53.5%，套到 real_cost 2,111,000 得車商零售約 1,130,000。調整說明：private_sale = 1,130,000 × 0.885 = 1,000,000；dealer_tradein = 1,000,000 × 0.87 = 870,000。此點為明示外插，非實測。等級階梯雙基準檢查：相對牌價 0.440（豪華版 0.460 > 本車 > 旗艦版 0.435）✓；相對 real_cost 0.474（豪華版 0.480 > 本車 > 旗艦版 0.464）✓。"},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"【fact-check 上修：700,000 → 738,000】等級階梯修正（原值的相對 real_cost 比例 0.332 低於旗艦版的 0.338）。同樣以前代 NX300h 的 10 年真實行情換算保值率後套回本車 real_cost。10 年實車開價：8891 2016 豪華版 140,400 km 628,000、2015 旗艦版 95,000 km 638,000、2015 豪華版 120,000 km 568,000、2014 旗艦版 60,000 km 620,000（https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/nx300）；abc好車網 2016 豪華版 818,000（https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2114259）；FindCar 2016 140,000 km 628,000（https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/nx300h）。對照前代牌價（豪華 1,890,000／旗艦 2,190,000），得 10 年不分里程車商零售保值率約 33%，頂級版再扣 1.5 個百分點至 31.5%；本車 70,000 km 對比同齡市場平均約 130,000 km，加約 +12% 低里程溢價 → 39.5%，套到 real_cost 2,111,000 得車商零售約 834,000。調整說明：private_sale = 834,000 × 0.885 = 738,000；dealer_tradein = 738,000 × 0.87 = 642,000。此點為明示外插，非實測，且 10 年後 Hybrid 高壓電池狀態會實質左右成交價，波動可能達 ±15%。等級階梯雙基準檢查：相對牌價 0.324（豪華版 0.342 > 本車 > 旗艦版 0.317）✓；相對 real_cost 0.350（豪華版 0.357 > 本車 > 旗艦版 0.338）✓。"}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"【fact-check 上修：7,000 → 9,500，並將 confidence 由 high 降為 medium】原值與本表自己引用的來源矛盾：所引 PTT 車主實單為首保約 3,000 出頭、第二次刪除推薦清潔項後仍約 7,000，兩次合計已約 10,000，原表卻只列 7,000。Lexus 台灣官網保養計劃頁（已複驗）顯示 12 個月級距含空氣濾芯更換與 29 項檢查，內容不只換機油，支持較高的單次單價。取 3,300 + 6,200 = 9,500，落在同車系豪華版 9,000 與旗艦版 10,000 之間。降級理由：主要單價基準表 U-CAR/和泰 NX300h 定保價目表在 fact-check 時回傳 HTTP 403 無法複驗，且該表為前代車型的 2018 年價需自行加通膨，不構成本車的『官方表格』；同批次其他 NX 等級此檢查點亦一律為 medium。https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx、https://am.u-car.com.tw/am/article/41462、https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1739612571.A.93F.html"},{"y":3,"source":"【fact-check 上修：21,000 → 24,000】原值低於同車系機械結構相同的豪華版與旗艦版（皆為 24,000），不合理。以官方定保表的 10,000/20,000 km 級距單價加通膨換算成時間觸發的四次進廠；煞車油依 Lexus 官網保養計劃『24 個月／40,000 km』項目認列（該頁已由 fact-check 端複驗，24 個月級距明列煞車油更換與 Hybrid 冷卻系統檢查共 34 項）。全期在 4 年原廠保固（4 年／120,000 km，已複驗）內，非耗材維修計 0。https://am.u-car.com.tw/am/article/41462、https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx、https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx"},{"y":5,"source":"【fact-check 上修：59,000 → 70,000】原值低於同車系豪華版的 66,000，且漏列官方 48 個月大保的加項。Lexus 官網保養計劃頁（已複驗）明載 48 個月／80,000 km 級距含變速箱油、冷卻液、燃油濾清器共 37 項，是全期最重的一次定保，原表以『里程未到』為由把變速箱油與火星塞整個延後並不成立 —— 官方級距是『時間或里程先到者為準』，48 個月的時間條件在本買家身上一定先到。輪胎為此買家最大的單筆時間性支出：7,000 km/年 到第 5 年僅 35,000 km，胎紋還在但橡膠已到 5 年更換期，235/60R18 中高階品牌四條 24,000-34,000 加工資定位，取 34,000。Hybrid 的 12V AGM 電瓶（後廂）市售更換約 6,000-9,000。第 5 年若已按 6 個月間隔連續完成定保則仍在免費延長保固內，非耗材維修計 0。https://am.u-car.com.tw/am/article/41462、https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx、https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx"},{"y":7,"source":"【fact-check 大幅上修：33,000 → 53,000。本表 maintenance 最嚴重的單點錯誤】原值僅 33,000，遠低於同車系機械完全相同的豪華版 52,000 與旗艦版 54,000，且原表把此區間描述成『無時間性大件到期』而只列了定保 + 煞車油 + 前來令片 + 雨刷，忽略了兩件事：一是第 5 年免費延長保固到期後所有非耗材維修改為車主自付，二是火星塞與空氣濾芯等項目在官方 12 個月／48 個月級距中本來就會週期性更換。定保單價沿用 U-CAR 官方 NX300h 表加通膨並改用出保後定價（該頁 fact-check 時 403 無法複驗，故 confidence 維持 low）；煞車零件料價取 U-CAR 表：前來令片 4,640/組、前碟盤 3,520/個，加工資。輪胎在第 5 年剛換、下一套落在第 10 年區間，本區間不重複計列。https://am.u-car.com.tw/am/article/41462、https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx、https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx"},{"y":10,"source":"【fact-check 上修：100,000 → 125,000】原值低於同車系豪華版的 120,000，但頂級版配備更多（電動尾門、電動座椅、環景等）在第 7-10 年的故障面更大，養護成本不應低於豪華版；上修後落在豪華版 120,000 與旗艦版 150,000 之間。定保單價沿用 U-CAR 官方表加通膨並反映出保後價格；冷卻液（720 元/L）、火星塞（690 元/顆）、後來令片（4,340/組）料價取 U-CAR NX300h 零件表（該頁 fact-check 時 403 無法複驗，confidence 維持 low）。輪胎依 5-6 年老化週期在此區間換第二套。未計入 Hybrid 高壓電池更換（前代原廠料價 62,000 元，2026 年估 75,000-90,000）—— Toyota/Lexus 油電電池在 70,000 km／10 年通常仍健康，但這是本區間最大的未列風險，若發生會讓 period_cost 增加約七成。https://am.u-car.com.tw/am/article/41462"}],"sources":[{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 — 2026 Lexus NX 規格配備與售價表","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/lexus/2026-lexus-nx","note":"【fact-check 已獨立複驗】逐車型價格表：200菁英版 1,710,000／200豪華版 1,810,000／350h豪華版 2,075,000／350h頂級版 2,275,000／350 Overtail版 2,340,000／450h+豪華版 2,375,000／350h旗艦版 2,575,000／350 F Sport版 2,630,000／450h+ F Sport版 2,845,000。本車 list_price 2,275,000 確認無誤，與研究者數字差異 0%。"},{"name":"Lexus 台灣官網 — NX 展示間","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/showroom/NX","note":"【fact-check 已獨立複驗】官方車系頁只揭露區間 NT$171~284.5 萬，未逐車型列價；該區間與 TVBS 表的最低 1,710,000／最高 2,845,000 完全吻合，構成官方側的交叉驗證。"},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [菜單] Lexus NX350H 頂級版（2025/09，中部）","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1758027646.A.31F.html","note":"【fact-check 已逐篇開啟複驗】26 年式 NX350H 頂級版，227.5 萬折 18.5 萬 = 209 萬，現金和泰 Pay，不含保險與領牌。折扣依據之一，金額屬實。"},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [菜單] NX350h 頂級（2025/12，南港）","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1766465897.A.8C1.html","note":"【fact-check 已逐篇開啟複驗】原文『空車 227.5 − 21.5 + 自費配件 6.6 = 212.6』，推文回應『空車折 21 很好欸』。空車折扣 215,000 屬實，且已確認 6.6 萬是自費配件、不影響空車折扣。折扣依據之二。"},{"name":"Lexus 台灣 — 保證方案／延長保證","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx","note":"【fact-check 已獨立複驗】新車保固 4 年／120,000 km；按 6 個月間隔連續完成定期保養可免費延長至第 5 年／140,000 km，任一次超過 6 個月間隔即喪失資格。決定年 1-5 非耗材維修計 0 的依據，研究者引述無誤。"},{"name":"Lexus 台灣 — 保養計劃","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"【fact-check 已獨立複驗】新車登記起第 1 個月免費檢查；級距為 1 個月／12 個月（20,000 km，29 項含空氣濾芯更換）／24 個月（40,000 km，34 項含煞車油更換與 Hybrid 冷卻系統檢查）／48 個月（80,000 km，37 項含變速箱油、冷卻液、燃油濾清器）。低里程買家由時間觸發、一年進廠兩次的依據，也是上修各期定保單價的依據。"},{"name":"U-CAR 售後 — [養車成本] Lexus NX 燃料牌照稅、零件與定保價格","url":"https://am.u-car.com.tw/am/article/41462","note":"和泰提供的官方 NX300h 定保價目表與消耗性零件料價（機油 650/L、煞車油 525/L、冷卻液 720/L、火星塞 690/顆、前來令片 4,640、後來令片 4,340、前碟盤 3,520、雨刷 3,280、Hybrid 電池 62,000）。全部 maintenance 數字的基準表。【fact-check 未能複驗：重新抓取回傳 HTTP 403】且該表為前代 NX300h 的 2018 年價，需自行加通膨，因此依賴此表的檢查點 confidence 一律不高於 medium。"},{"name":"PTT car 板 — Lexus NX 定保實單討論","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1739612571.A.93F.html","note":"車主實單交叉驗證：首保約 3,000 出頭，第二次原廠推薦約 10,000、刪掉清潔添加劑項後約 7,000；冷氣濾網約 1,300、輪胎平衡約 600。fact-check 據此判定原表年 1 的 7,000 過低並上修為 9,500。未逐篇複驗（web search 額度用罄）。"},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 2024 年式 Lexus NX 車系售價調整官網公告","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/74010","note":"確認 NX350h 各級距 2024 年式調漲約 80,000，回推 2022/2023 年式頂級版牌價為 2,190,000，是換算 3 年／5 年保值率的分母。未複驗。"},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — NX350h 中古車列表","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/nx350h","note":"現行世代實車開價：2023 頂級 24,410 km 1,458,000、28,108 km 1,650,000、109,695 km 1,388,000；2022 頂級 39,168 km 1,678,000、106,886 km 1,399,000、113,000 km 1,288,000。3 年與 5 年檢查點的主要依據。【注意】此為搜尋結果頁 URL，內容隨時間變動、無法逐筆回溯，是年 3 由 high 降為 medium 的主因之一。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus NX 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/nx","note":"2023 NX350h 頂級版 49,000 km 1,518,000（桃園）；2025 年式約 10,000 km 開價 1,698,000（等級標示不明確，可能為豪華版，僅作年 1 的下界）。同為搜尋／行情索引頁，內容非固定，未複驗。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus NX300 / NX300h 行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/nx300","note":"前代 NX300h 實車開價：2014 旗艦 60,000 km 620,000、2015 旗艦 95,000 km 638,000、2015 豪華 120,000 km 568,000、2016 豪華 140,400 km 628,000、2017 F Sport 80,000 km 848,000、2018 F Sport 120,000 km 1,088,000。7 年／10 年外插的核心資料。索引頁，未複驗。"},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — NX300h 中古車列表","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/nx300h","note":"前代交叉驗證：2016 140,000 km 628,000、2017 71,021 km 838,000、2017 4WD 80,000 km 848,000。搜尋結果頁，未複驗。"},{"name":"東晴國際汽車 — 2019 年 LEXUS NX300h 豪華版","url":"https://dcauto.tw/product/2019%E5%B9%B4-lexus-nx300h%E8%B1%AA%E8%8F%AF%E7%89%88/","note":"7 年車實例：2019 豪華版 77,000 km 開價 1,188,000，是 7 年保值率的上界參考。未複驗。"},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2024 Lexus NX 350h頂級版 3,000 km","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2147794","note":"車商開價 1,988,000。同賣家頁面另有 8,888,000 佔位價，判定開價偏高，僅作 1 年點的上界參考。未複驗。"},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2024 Lexus NX 350h頂級版 20,000 km","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2305374","note":"車商開價 2,068,000（宜昌）。里程更高卻開價更高，屬開價噪音，同樣只作上界。未複驗。"},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2016 Lexus NX 300h 豪華版","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2114259","note":"10 年車實例：開價 818,000（相對原廠 1,890,000 約 43%），與 8891 的 628,000（140,000 km）共同界定 10 年區間。未複驗。"},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — F Sport 較預售價降 10 萬，Lexus NX 正式售價 189 萬起","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/24124","note":"前代 NX300h 原始牌價：豪華版 1,890,000／頂級版 1,990,000／旗艦版 2,190,000。7 年與 10 年保值率的分母。未複驗。"},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 — 189 萬元起，Lexus NX 300h 正式登台","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/16353-189-lexus-nx-300h.html","note":"交叉驗證前代 NX300h 於 2014/08 在台上市、1,890,000 起。未複驗。"},{"name":"小曾車庫 — 中古車估價的 8 種方式","url":"https://www.littletsenggarage.com/usedcarpricing/","note":"台灣業界通則：車商收購價通常低於自售／零售行情約 2~3 成。本表兩段調整（車商零售 ×0.885 → 自售，自售 ×0.87 → 收購，合計 −23%）的校準依據。未複驗。"},{"name":"ATDC 阿慈車庫 — 汽車折舊價值到底是誰說了算","url":"https://www.twgc91.com/how-to-count-depreciation-price/","note":"車商成本結構佐證：進口車收 100 萬、整備 10 萬、上架開 125 萬、成交 117-120 萬，即開價與收購價之間約 2 成價差。未複驗。"}]},"lexus-nx350-overtrail":{"assumptions":"低里程車主，年行駛 6,000-8,000 km，遠低於台灣平均 12,000-15,000 km。各檢查點一律以 7,000 km × 年數計（7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000）。低里程有兩個關鍵後果：(1) 保養改為時間驅動 —— 已於本次覆核直接開啟 lexus.com.tw 保養計劃頁確認，官方週期為「每 6 個月或 10,000 km 先到者為準」，在 7,000 km/年 之下永遠是 6 個月的時鐘先到，等於一年進廠 2 次，與里程無關（註：任務規格假設為「年度」保養，但官方頁面明載半年，本表以官方為準）；(2) 中古殘值高於「不看里程的平均行情」，故本表全部錨點都刻意選用低里程車。\n\n【本次覆核的重要修正】前一版聲稱有一組 LEXUS CPO 2018年 NX300 的里程階梯（41,340 km / 1,120,000、102,215 km / 968,000、152,037 km / 790,000）量化出 +16% 低里程溢價，並宣稱「已內含於本表全部殘值」。本次逐一開啟該三個 lexuscpo.com.tw URL，三個全部回傳「很抱歉，尚無此車款物件」，沒有任何車輛資料。該三筆可能是已售出下架的舊物件，但**現在無法驗證**，因此不再作為量化依據，那個 +16% 的具體數字已從本表移除。低里程溢價仍然承認存在（方向明確），但改為「選用低里程掛牌車作錨點」這種隱含處理，不再宣稱有實測倍率。\n\n全表金額為 TWD 整數，不含稅金與保險（依規格排除）。殘值鏈一律為：車商零售（8891／abc 看得到的開價）→ 自售 = 車商零售 −12% → 車商收購 = 自售 −13% 上下，五個檢查點統一適用（前一版在 10 年那筆只折 6.2%，違反規格的 8-15% 區間，本次已修正）。","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"【已下修，原 1,680,000／1,470,000】錨點本次逐頁複驗為真：abc好車網 Car/2254985 = 2025年 Lexus NX 350 F Sport、LEXUS CPO 原廠認證（士林營業所）、車商開價 2,238,000（該頁未揭露里程）。對 F Sport 掛牌 2,630,000 為 85.1%。\n\n調整鏈：CPO 原廠認證是車商零售的最高帶，扣除約 5% CPO 溢價 → 一般車商零售約 80%。Overtrail 相對 F Sport 有兩股方向相反的力量：(a) Overtrail 2,340,000 是 NX350 這條汽油線的「入門」而非頂規（F Sport 2,630,000 才是頂規），依台灣中古市場「高階配備貼水有限」原則，入門者保值率應略高；(b) Overtrail 是越野風格小眾版，全地形胎與加高懸吊在台灣二手買方偏好中屬扣分，需求薄。兩者大致抵銷，取 79.5%。\n→ 車商零售 = 79.5% × 2,340,000 = 1,860,000\n→ 自售 = 車商零售 −12% = 1,635,000\n→ 車商收購 = 自售 −13% = 1,420,000\n\n前一版的問題：它把 CPO 溢價只還原 4.8%、再額外加了理由不明的正向調整，得到 81% 車商零售，偏高。本版統一用 −12%／−13% 的兩段折扣鏈，與其餘四個檢查點一致。\n\n注意：Overtrail 於 2024-04 才導入，台灣中古市場至今零筆 Overtrail 掛牌或成交紀錄，本值完全靠同車系鄰階 F Sport 的單一實價換算兩次，非直接觀測。"},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"【已下修，原 1,460,000／1,275,000】錨點本次複驗為真：8891 中古車 NX350 專頁 = Lexus NX 2023款 350 F Sport 2.4L、20,000 km、新北，車商開價 1,680,000，備註「車況非常新、里程超少」。里程 20,000 km 與本案 21,000 km 幾乎相同，且明確是低里程乾淨車，不是事故／高里程離群值 —— 這是全表品質最好的一個錨點。\n\n對 2023年式 F Sport 掛牌約 2,530,000（由 2026年式 2,630,000 回推：KingAutos 表列 2024年式 F Sport 已是 2,630,000，2024年式較前一年漲 8-11 萬）→ 車商零售 66.4%。\n\n**這是本次最主要的修正。** 前一版從這個 66.4% 的實測錨點，跳到 Overtrail 的 71% 車商零售 —— 憑空多了 4.6 個百分點，理由是「低里程溢價」，但這個錨點本身就是 20,000 km 的低里程車，溢價已經在裡面，不能再加一次。更矛盾的是它同時又說 Overtrail 要因小眾再折 2%，兩個論證互相打架卻仍得到比實測更高的數字。\n\n本版取 68.5%：由實測 66.4% 起算，加約 2 個百分點的「入門階級較保值」修正（Overtrail 是 NX350 的入門、F Sport 才是頂規），再由小眾折價回吃掉一部分。\n→ 車商零售 = 68.5% × 2,340,000 = 1,600,000\n→ 自售 = −12% = 1,410,000\n→ 車商收購 = 自售 −13% = 1,225,000\n\n交叉檢核（已逐頁複驗四筆 abc好車網 2022年 NX350 F Sport 開價）：Car/2143227 嘉勇 1,780,000、Car/2140105 富豐 1,880,000、Car/2144695 信昇 1,888,000、另一筆 1,999,000。這四筆是 4 年車卻開得比上面那台 3 年車還高 20 萬以上，時間順序上不可能成立，判定為「賣不掉才掛在架上的高開價」，僅作上界參考，不進入分母。前一版把這組拉進來做加權，是把 3 年值墊高的另一個原因。"},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"外推，非實測。二代 NX 於 2022年1月才在台上市，Overtrail 更晚到 2024年4月，台灣市場根本不存在 5 年車齡的現行世代 NX350 —— 不編造。\n\n改用前代 NX（AZ10）的實際殘值率換算，錨點本次已於 8891 NX300 專頁（在庫 31 台）複驗存在：2019年 NX300 頂級版、68,000 km，車商開價 1,028,000。以本表 3 年車商零售 68.5% 為上界、7 年 50.5% 為下界內插，5 年低里程車商零售取 59.0%。\n→ 車商零售 = 59.0% × 2,340,000 = 1,380,000\n→ 自售 = −12% = 1,215,000\n→ 車商收購 = 自售 −13% = 1,055,000\n\n（前一版為 1,230,000／1,065,000，本版僅因上界 3 年值下修而連動微調，方法未變。）\n\n注意 2022-2024 新車缺貨曾把中古行情墊高，現正回歸常態，故未沿用現行世代近期的高開價斜率。跨世代外推，信心低。"},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"外推，非實測（現行世代在台無 7 年車）。以前代 NX 的實際掛牌換算殘值率再套回本車。\n\n錨點（8891 NX300 專頁已複驗存在）：2019年 NX300 頂級版、68,000 km，車商開價 1,028,000。對 NX300 頂級版原掛牌約 2,090,000 → 7 年車商零售約 49.2%。但該車 68,000 km 高於本案的 49,000 km，低里程買方應再高一些；且 NX300「頂級版」屬該世代高階，依高階貼水有限原則其比率被壓低，而 Overtrail 是 NX350 的入門階。兩項修正後取 50.5%（前一版取 49.5%，未回補里程差）。\n→ 車商零售 = 50.5% × 2,340,000 = 1,180,000\n→ 自售 = −12% = 1,035,000\n→ 車商收購 = 自售 −13.5% = 895,000\n\n旁證（同頁複驗）：2018年 NX300 F-Sport、90,000 km 開價 888,000；2017年 NX300h AWD、80,000 km 開價 848,000 —— 皆為高里程，位置低於本案合理。\n\n此時已完全脫離 4年/12萬公里原廠保固，2.4L 渦輪的後續維修疑慮進一步壓抑買方出價。跨世代外推，信心低。"},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"外推，非實測（現行世代在台無 10 年車）。前代最直接的同齡同里程對照：8891 中古車 2016年 NX200t 旗艦版、79,000 km，車商開價 718,000，里程與本案 10 年檢查點的 70,000 km 僅差一成。旁證（已於 8891 NX 總表複驗存在）：2015年 NX200t 旗艦版、100,000 km、車商 558,000。\n\n【分母警告】NX200t 旗艦版新車掛牌 2,250,000 這個數字，前一版引用 WeWanted 車型資料頁佐證，本次開啟該 URL 回傳 **HTTP 404**；U-CAR 的 NX200t 上市報導（195 萬起）回傳 403 無法讀取。因此 718,000 / 2,250,000 = 31.9% 的**分母未能獨立驗證**，這是本檢查點維持 low 的主因。\n\n【修正的算法錯誤】前一版：車商零售 30.5% × 2,340,000 = 714,000 → 自售僅折 6.2% = 670,000。這個 6.2% 違反規格要求的「自售比車商零售低 8-15%」，也與本表其餘四個檢查點的 −12% 不一致，等於在最後一個點偷偷把自售價墊高。同時它還在已經是「該世代頂規（旗艦版）＝比率天然偏低」的 31.9% 上再扣 1.5% 小眾折價，屬重複懲罰。\n\n本版兩項一起修正，方向相反而互相抵銷，數字因此落點相近但推導成立：\n→ 車商零售取 32.5%（不再重複扣小眾折價；Overtrail 為 NX350 入門階，相對前代旗艦版的分母應略高）\n→ 車商零售 = 32.5% × 2,340,000 = 760,000\n→ 自售 = −12%（與全表一致）= 665,000\n→ 車商收購 = 自售 −14% = 570,000\n\n10 年以上車自售與收購價差擴大，因車商承擔的整備與庫存風險上升。跨世代外推 + 分母未驗證，信心低。"}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Lexus 台灣官方保養計劃頁的保養里程表（本次已開啟複驗：6個月/16項含換機油、12個月/29項含耗材）＋ Mobile01 車主實際收據（NX350h 半年保 4,500、含 4.2L 機油之定保 6,040、第二次半年保 6,454）。因 7,000 km/年 里程遠低於 10,000 km，改由 6 個月時鐘觸發，一年 2 次。NX350 為 2.4T，機油量與耗材單價高於 NX200/NX250，取受訪收據上緣。全期在 4年/12萬公里原廠保固內（保固期已於 lexus.com.tw 車主權益頁複驗），無維修支出。收據來自 NX350h 與 NX200 車主而非 NX350 本身，故不給 high。4,500 + 7,500 = 12,000。"},{"y":3,"source":"Lexus 台灣官方保養里程表（24個月/34項含更換煞車油，已複驗）＋ Mobile01 車主收據推算：2 年 × 2 次 × （小保 4,500 + 大保 7,000）/2 ≈ 23,000，加煞車油約 2,000、雨刷與小耗材約 1,000 = 26,000。此區間是整個持有週期最便宜的一段：保固全覆蓋、里程僅 21,000 km、無任何大型耗材到期。里程建模有官方依據，單價為車主收據推算，給 medium。"},{"y":5,"source":"定保節奏與 48個月/37項含變速箱油＋燃油濾清器來自 Lexus 台灣官方保養計劃頁（本次已複驗；時間先到，故第 4 年觸發而非 80,000 km）；保固終止時點來自 Lexus 車主權益頁（4年/12萬公里，已複驗）。本期是第一個「大條」窗口。輪胎並非磨平而是老化到期 —— 7,000 km/年 下 5 年才 35,000 km，但橡膠已達更換年限；Overtrail 標配 18 吋全地形胎（7Car 上市報導確認），單價高於公路胎，以 Lexus 通路一組含工約 30,000 估。12V 電瓶約 4-5 年壽命。前來令片在 35,000 km 輕度使用下屬臨界，保守列入。23,000+12,000+30,000+10,000+2,000+9,000+2,000 = 88,000。輪胎與電瓶的實際到期時點為推估而非收據，故 low。"},{"y":7,"source":"定保節奏依 Lexus 台灣官方 6 個月週期外推；煞車油每 2 年、冷卻液約第 6-7 年為 Toyota/Lexus 通路常規。此期已完全脫離原廠保固（4年/12萬公里於第 4 年結束），開始出現自費維修，但 49,000 km 仍屬極低里程，機械件磨耗有限，故金額低於 3-5 年那個換胎大窗口 —— 這個「回落」是耗材到期時點造成的，非錯誤，同批次其他 Lexus 記錄亦呈現相同形狀。24,000+2,000+14,000+4,000+12,000 = 56,000。無車主收據直接支撐 7 年期的 NX350（現行世代在台最老僅約 4.5 年），為時間驅動外推，信心低。"},{"y":10,"source":"火星塞成本依據 8891「2023年式 Lexus NX 養車成本」專題，該文明確指出 NX 350 因 2.4 升渦輪引擎，火星塞價格明顯高於其餘車型，累計到 6 萬公里的定保費用為汽油車型最高。變速箱油第二次依官方 48個月/80,000km 週期在第 8 年觸發（時間先到）。輪胎第二組為老化＋磨耗雙到期（距第一組 5 年）。保固外老化件金額為此車齡台灣進口豪華 SUV 的一般經驗值，非單據。38,000+32,000+12,000+13,000+11,000+16,000+8,000+18,000 = 148,000。全期無任何實際 NX350 十年單據可佐證（車型在台最長僅約 4.5 年），純時間驅動外推，信心低。"}],"sources":[{"name":"地球黃金線：新年式 Lexus NX 250 動力停止引進，9 車型售價 171 萬起（TVBS）","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/272732","note":"已於本次覆核開啟並讀取。完整 9 車型價格表：NX 200 菁英版 1,710,000／200 豪華版 1,810,000／350h 豪華版 2,075,000／350h 頂級版 2,275,000／350h 旗艦版 2,575,000／350 Overtrail 2,340,000／350 F Sport 2,630,000／450h+ 豪華版 2,375,000／450h+ F Sport 2,845,000。掛牌價 234 萬確認無誤。此表同時確立 Overtrail 是 NX350 汽油線的「入門」而非頂規（F Sport 才是），為 trim-ladder 修正的直接依據。"},{"name":"KingAutos 中型休旅車 Lexus NX 車款詳細介紹","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/nx","note":"已於本次覆核開啟並讀取。第三方價格表，獨立確認 350 Overtrail 234 萬、350 F Sport 263 萬（該頁把 Overtrail 誤植為「Overtail」，價格無誤）。同時顯示 F Sport 在 2024年式即已是 2,630,000，是回推 2023年式 F Sport 掛牌約 2,530,000 的依據（3 年檢查點的分母）。"},{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點：新臺幣 234 萬元起 Lexus NX 350 Overtrail 版正式在台上市","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/102099","note":"已於本次覆核開啟並讀取。確認上市日期 2024-04-02、售價 234 萬起、2025年式導入。確立本車在台最長車齡僅約 2.3 年，是 5/7/10 年必須跨世代外推的直接原因；全地形胎為換胎成本估算依據。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 Lexus NX350 專頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/NX350","note":"已於本次覆核開啟並讀取。3 年錨點主來源，內容與原研究員陳述完全相符：Lexus NX 2023款 350 F Sport 2.4L、20,000 km、新北、車商開價 1,680,000，賣家備註「車況非常新、里程超少」。里程與本案 3 年檢查點的 21,000 km 幾乎相同且確認為乾淨低里程車（非事故／高里程離群值）。全站 NX350 僅此 1 筆，直接證實汽油 NX350 在台中古市場極稀。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 Lexus NX 二手價格行情（全車系）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/nx","note":"已於本次覆核開啟並讀取。在庫 334 台確認無誤，且原研究員引用的個別車輛逐一核對相符：2023 NX200 豪華版 29,000km 1,298,000；2023 NX250 豪華版 59,500km 1,298,000；2023 NX350 F Sport 20,000km 1,680,000；2020 NX300 頂級版 27,000km 1,030,000；2015 NX200t 旗艦版 100,000km 558,000。原研究員的 8891 資料轉錄準確。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 Lexus NX300 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/nx300","note":"已於本次覆核開啟並讀取。前代（AZ10）殘值曲線來源，用於 5/7 年外推。在庫 31 台，原研究員引用的樣本核對相符：2019 NX300 頂級版 68,000km 1,028,000；2018 NX300 F-Sport 90,000km 888,000；2017 NX300h AWD 80,000km 848,000。整體價格帶 458,000-1,128,000。"},{"name":"abc好車網：Lexus NX 350 F Sport版 2025年 LEXUS CPO 士林營業所 2,238,000","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2254985","note":"已於本次覆核逐頁開啟複驗為真：2025年式、NX 350 F Sport、LEXUS CPO 原廠認證、士林營業所、車商開價 2,238,000（該頁未揭露里程）。1 年檢查點的唯一實價錨點。對 F Sport 掛牌 2,630,000 為 85.1%，屬車商零售最高帶（CPO 溢價），已據此往下還原成一般車商零售再轉自售價。"},{"name":"abc好車網：Lexus NX 350 F Sport版 2022年 1,780,000（嘉勇車業）","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2143227","note":"已於本次覆核逐頁開啟複驗：2022年 NX 350 F Sport、開價 1,780,000、嘉勇車業（該頁未揭露里程）。四筆 2022 開價的下緣。"},{"name":"abc好車網：Lexus NX 350 F Sport版 2022年 1,880,000（富豐汽車）","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2140105","note":"已於本次覆核逐頁開啟複驗：2022年 NX 350 F Sport、開價 1,880,000、富豐汽車（該頁未揭露里程）。"},{"name":"abc好車網：Lexus NX 350 F Sport版 2022年 1,888,000（信昇汽車）","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2144695","note":"已於本次覆核逐頁開啟複驗：2022年 NX 350 F Sport、開價 1,888,000、信昇汽車（該頁未揭露里程）。⚠️ 本組四筆 2022年（4 年車）開價 1,780,000-1,999,000，竟高於 8891 那台 2023年（3 年車）低里程車的 1,680,000，時間順序上不可能成立。判定為滯銷高開價，本版僅作上界參考、不進入任何分母 —— 這與原研究員把該組拉進加權的做法不同，也是 3 年值下修的原因之一。"},{"name":"LEXUS TAIWAN 保養計劃","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"已於本次覆核開啟並逐項複驗，與原研究員陳述完全相符：1個月新車檢查（24項，免費）／6個月・10,000km（16項含換機油）／12個月・20,000km（29項含耗材、空氣濾芯、火星塞）／24個月・40,000km（34項含煞車油）／48個月・80,000km（37項含變速箱油與燃油濾清器）。並確認官方除 1 個月新車檢查與 25 項尊榮健檢外，不提供免費定期保養。官方週期為每 6 個月（非任務規格假設的年度），本表以官方為準。"},{"name":"LEXUS 車主權益（保固與定保週期）","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx","note":"已於本次覆核開啟並複驗：新車保證 4 年或行駛 12 萬公里（以先到者為準）；頁面未列任何隨車免費定期保養，僅有可另行購買的保養方案與準時每半年回廠的點數回饋。確認「Lexus 台灣沒有免費定保」這個前提正確。"},{"name":"8891 新車：2023年式 Lexus NX 養車成本 油電動力最划算！","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/lexus/nx/15916","note":"指出 NX 350 因搭載 2.4 升渦輪引擎，火星塞價格明顯高於其餘車型，累計到 6 萬公里的定保費用在汽油車型中最高；NX 250 最低。本表 7-10 年窗口的火星塞費用與全期定保單價取上緣即據此。（本次未重新開啟，沿用原研究員的複驗結果。）"},{"name":"Mobile01：請問 LEXUS 原廠保養費用（車主實際收據）","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=346&t=6919545","note":"車主實付金額：NX350h 首次半年保 4,500；含機油 4.2L（2,730）＋機油濾心（470）之定保 6,040；第二次半年保 6,454。⚠️ 該頁直接抓取回 403，內容取自搜尋結果摘要，且收據來自 NX350h 與 NX200 車主而非 NX350 本身 —— 這是保養檢查點一律不給 high 的原因。原研究員已誠實揭露此限制，本次沿用。"},{"name":"U-CAR：預計漲幅 8~11 萬，2024年式 Lexus NX 車系售價調整","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/74002","note":"⚠️ 本次覆核開啟回傳 HTTP 403，無法讀取內文。U-CAR 對機器人抓取設有阻擋，該文極可能真實存在，但其「2024年式漲 8-11 萬」的內容本次無法獨立驗證。所幸 KingAutos 的 2024年式表列 F Sport 已是 2,630,000，可獨立支撐 2023年式約 2,530,000 的回推，故 3 年分母不依賴這篇。"},{"name":"U-CAR：新增 350 Overtrail 車型，2025年式 Lexus NX 國內上市","url":"https://m.u-car.com.tw/article/77967/","note":"⚠️ 本次覆核開啟回傳 HTTP 403，無法讀取內文。Overtrail 於 2025年式導入這件事已由 7Car 報導獨立確認，故不影響結論。"},{"name":"U-CAR：渦輪終於來了！Lexus NX 200t 195 萬起今日上市","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/24947","note":"⚠️ 本次覆核開啟回傳 HTTP 403，無法讀取內文。原用於支撐 NX200t 2014-12 上市、195 萬起。此數字未能獨立驗證。"},{"name":"WeWanted：2015 Lexus NX200T 旗艦版 車型資料","url":"https://www.wewanted.com.tw/car_exhibition.php?id=743","note":"❌ 本次覆核開啟回傳 HTTP 404，頁面不存在。原研究員用這頁佐證「NX200t 旗艦版新車掛牌 2,250,000」，也就是 10 年殘值率 718,000 / 2,250,000 = 31.9% 的分母。該分母現已無來源支撐，是 10 年檢查點維持 low 的主因，並已在該檢查點的 source 中明確標註。保留此列是為了記錄「查過、且查證失敗」，不是當作有效佐證。"},{"name":"LEXUS CPO 原廠認證中古車：2018年 NX300 物件（三筆）","url":"https://www.lexuscpo.com.tw/Home/Details/27f5b9a8-5436-4a19-97aa-dd0f58d542ed","note":"❌ 本次覆核逐一開啟原研究員引用的三個 CPO 物件 URL（27f5b9a8… / 8ef7b82f… / 1581cb13…），三個全部回傳「很抱歉，尚無此車款物件」，沒有任何車輛資料。原研究員據此宣稱的里程階梯（41,340km/1,120,000、102,215km/968,000、152,037km/790,000）與 +16% 低里程溢價量化結論，現無法驗證 —— 可能是已售出下架的舊物件，但不能當作實測依據。該 +16% 已從本表移除，低里程處理改為「錨點一律選用低里程車」的隱含方式。"},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 LEXUS NX 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=NX","note":"區間交叉檢核用。該站在庫以 NX200/NX250/NX300 等低階與油電為主，故其區間低於本表 NX350 的估值，僅作斜率檢核不作分母。（本次未重新開啟。）"}]},"lexus-nx450h-plus-luxury":{"assumptions":"Low-mileage owner, 6,000-8,000 km/year, well below the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year. All checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7000 / 21000 / 35000 / 49000 / 70000). CRITICAL consequence for this car, verified and RETAINED across both prior audits because it is correct: Lexus Taiwan's official service interval is 6 months OR 10,000 km, whichever comes FIRST (lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx). At 7,000 km/year the TIME trigger always fires first, so the owner still makes ~2 shop visits per year — the same visit count as a 20,000 km/year driver. Low mileage therefore saves far less on maintenance than buyers expect; it mainly buys a resale premium, not a service discount. On the resale side, 21,000 km at 3 years and 70,000 km at 10 years are roughly half the mileage-blind market average, so a low-mileage premium of roughly 3-6% over the average listing is embedded at each checkpoint. Tax (牌照稅/燃料稅) and insurance are excluded from this record by design. AUDIT NOTE (this pass, in response to a cross-trim review): the FRONT of the resale curve was cut again — years 1, 3 and 5. The reviewer's objection was that at 75.6% / 64.4% / 56.3% this PHEV out-retained the CHEAPER gasoline NX350 Overtrail (70.6% / 60.9% / 52.5%) at every early checkpoint, and even beat the NX200 豪華版 (75.1%) at year 1, which inverts the stated Taiwan Lexus ordering (hybrid > gasoline > PHEV). That objection is upheld: I re-searched the Taiwan used market this pass and found NO evidence of any PHEV-specific support for early retention, and strong evidence against it (see value_checkpoints year 1). Year 5 moved too even though the reviewer did not name it, because the prior draft's own source string derived year 5 by 'extending the same-generation curve past the 3-year anchor above' — it is a dependent value, not an independent observation, so correcting the year-3 anchor necessarily moves it. Years 7 and 10 are UNCHANGED: the reviewer agreed they already sit correctly last, and the rebuilt curve lands on them naturally.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"CORRECTED DOWNWARD AGAIN, from 1,820,000 to 1,720,000 (-5.5%), upholding the reviewer's objection. The prior pass had already cut this point from 1,920,000 but did not cut it far enough: at 1,820,000 the PHEV retained 75.6% of real_cost, ABOVE the cheaper gasoline NX350 Overtrail (70.6%) and even fractionally above the much cheaper gasoline NX200 豪華版 (75.1%), which inverts the brief's stated Taiwan Lexus ordering (hybrid > gasoline > PHEV). THE UNDERLYING ERROR: the prior draft set PHEV dealer retail at 86% of real_cost — ABOVE the gasoline base trim's observed level — and justified it with 'a new 450h+ order still means a months-long wait'. That reasoning is backwards. A new-car waiting list supports the NEW price, not the used price; and for a used car the relevant fact is the opposite one, that no dealer wants to stock it. I SEARCHED SPECIFICALLY FOR EVIDENCE THAT WOULD JUSTIFY KEEPING THE HIGHER FIGURE (the reviewer's condition for retaining it — a charging subsidy or a tax break driving PHEV values) AND FOUND NONE: Taiwan taxes PHEVs on engine displacement exactly like a petrol car, so this car pays full 2.5-litre-band 牌照稅 with no PHEV exemption (the exemptions apply to BEVs), and I found no purchase-side PHEV incentive still running in 2026. There is therefore no documented reason to hold the elevated anchor, so it is cut. NEGATIVE EVIDENCE, RE-CONFIRMED AND STRENGTHENED THIS PASS: not one NX450h+ of ANY model year appears in SUM 汽車網's 81 NX listings or in 8891's NX inventory, which I re-fetched on 2026-08-11 and which now shows 334 NX cars spanning 2015-2025. Across 415 combined NX listings there is not a single PHEV. That total illiquidity is the single most important fact about this checkpoint and it argues for a DISCOUNT, not a premium: a private seller must discount harder to reach one of very few buyers, and a dealer must discount harder still to justify sitting on stock with no comparables. REBUILT METHOD (relative to gasoline, since no PHEV observation exists at 1 year): same-generation base-trim gasoline anchor from SUM 汽車網, fetched 2026-08-11 — a 2025 NX200 豪華版 at 12,115 km asks NT$1,458,000 against a 181萬 list, i.e. 80.6% of list or 82.6% of that trim's real_cost, at DEALER RETAIL at ~1 year; corroborated by a 2025 NX200 特仕版 at ~3,500 km asking NT$1,460,000 on 8891 and by 2024 NX200 豪華版+ at 13,462 km asking 1,399,000. PHEV dealer retail is now set BELOW that gasoline level at 79.8% of real_cost = ~1,920,000, not above it. CHAIN ADJUSTMENT APPLIED (dealer retail > private > trade-in): private_sale_price = 1,920,000 x 0.895 = 1,720,000 (10.5% below dealer asking); dealer_tradein_price = private x 0.875 = 1,505,000 (12.5% below private, the wide end of the 10-15% band because trade-in is exactly where PHEV illiquidity bites hardest). Low-mileage premium embedded — 7,000 km at 1 year is roughly half the market average. HONEST RESIDUAL TENSION, STATED RATHER THAN HIDDEN: at 71.5% this still sits 0.9 points above the gasoline NX350 Overtrail (70.6%). I did not cut further because the Overtrail is the low outlier of the gasoline set (菁英版 77.6, 豪華版 75.1, Overtrail 70.6, F Sport 77.8 — the price-band gasoline average is ~73-74%, and this figure is properly below that), and because cutting below 71.3% would put this BASE trim under its own 450h+ F Sport sibling, violating the rule that retention ratio falls as you climb the trim ladder. Confidence stays LOW: there is no direct observation of this car at 1 year at all."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"CORRECTED DOWNWARD AGAIN, from 1,550,000 to 1,455,000 (-6.1%), landing at 60.4% of real_cost — the reviewer's requested ~60%. BOTH ANCHOR LISTINGS RE-FETCHED AND RE-CONFIRMED THIS PASS on 2026-08-11: abc好車網 listing 2142965 is a 2023 NX450h+ 豪華版 at LEXUS CPO 南港營業所 asking NT$2,098,000, and listing 2135929 is the same trim and year at LEXUS CPO 台中營業所 asking NT$2,138,000 (neither publishes mileage). These two remain the ONLY real observations of this exact trim anywhere in the Taiwan market — SUM and 8891 between them list 415 NX cars and not one PHEV — so this stays the best-evidenced checkpoint in the record. Mean of the two = 2,118,000, which against the confirmed 229萬 original list for a 2023 450h+豪華版 is 92.5% of list, but at CPO 原廠認證中古車 retail, the single highest price tier in Taiwan. THE CORRECTION MADE THIS PASS: the prior draft applied a 17% CPO haircut (the midpoint of the accepted 15-20% CPO-over-ordinary-dealer band) and used only the cheaper of the two listings. Two changes. First, use the mean of both real listings, 2,118,000, rather than cherry-picking the low one. Second, apply the TOP of the CPO band, 20% (x0.80), not the midpoint — justified by the negative finding above: when a model has literally zero ordinary-dealer inventory nationwide, CPO is not merely the priciest channel, it is the ONLY channel that will certify and warrant the car, so its premium sits at the top of the band rather than the middle. 2,118,000 x 0.80 = ordinary dealer retail ~1,694,000 (70.4% of real_cost). CHAIN ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale_price = 1,694,000 x 0.86 = 1,455,000 (14% below ordinary dealer retail — the wide end of the 8-15% band, again because an illiquid PHEV forces the private seller to discount to reach a thin buyer pool); dealer_tradein_price = private x 0.875 = 1,270,000 (12.5% below private). The resulting dealer-retail-to-trade-in spread is 25%, wider than the ~20% typical 車商 margin, which is the correct read for stock a dealer expects to hold for months. SANITY CHECK against same-generation gasoline on SUM (fetched 2026-08-11): 2023 NX200 豪華版 at 44,000-52,684 km ask 1,258,000-1,378,000 against a 176萬 list = 71-78% dealer retail. The PHEV's derived 70.4% dealer retail now lands at or just below the bottom of that gasoline band rather than inside or above it, which is the relationship the ordering rule requires. CROSS-TRIM CHECK: 60.4% is below the gasoline NX350 Overtrail (60.9%) as the reviewer required, below the gasoline NX200 豪華版 (66.9%), 8.9 points below the NX350h hybrid sibling (69.3%), and 1.9 points above its own 450h+ F Sport sibling (58.5%) as the trim ladder requires. A ~4% low-mileage premium is embedded (21,000 km versus a ~40,000 km market average at 3 years; note every SUM comparable above is at 44,000+ km)."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"CORRECTED DOWNWARD from 1,355,000 to 1,210,000 (-10.7%) — a point the reviewer did NOT name, changed anyway, and here is the justification for departing from 'keep what was not objected to'. This checkpoint was never an independent observation. The prior draft's own source string states it was built by 'extend[ing] the same-generation curve past the 3-year anchor above'. It is a derived value whose parent has now moved twice, so leaving it fixed would have produced an incoherent curve: from the corrected year-3 figure of 60.4% it would have fallen only 4.1 points across two whole years (versus 11.0 points across the preceding two), and it would have sat 8.1 points ABOVE its own 450h+ F Sport sibling — an implausible gap between two trims of the identical powertrain. That is independent evidence the old figure was wrong, which is the stated bar for changing it. EXTRAPOLATED: the current NX generation launched in Taiwan in Dec 2021, so the oldest real 450h+ is ~4.4 years and no genuine 5-year listing of this trim exists or can exist. METHOD: extend the corrected 3-year anchor using the AZ20 gasoline shape from SUM 汽車網 (2022 NX200 豪華版 at 30,307 km asks 1,239,000 against a 176萬 list = 70% dealer retail at 4 years, fetched 2026-08-11), then steepen it for two PHEV-specific effects that bite exactly in this window: the 4年/120,000km 原廠保固 expires (re-verified by fetching https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx), and Taiwanese buyers begin discounting the 18.1 kWh traction battery the moment it leaves factory cover. Applied drop is 10.1 points over the two years, versus 8.4 for the gasoline Overtrail and 7.0 for the NX350h hybrid over the same span — the PHEV falling fastest, as the ordering rule requires — and closely matching the 10.3-point drop the 450h+ F Sport sibling takes across the same window. Dealer retail set at ~57.5% of real_cost = 1,385,000. CHAIN ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale_price = 1,385,000 x 0.874 = 1,210,000; dealer_tradein_price = private x 0.868 = 1,050,000. CROSS-TRIM CHECK: 50.3% sits 2.2 points below the gasoline NX350 Overtrail (52.5%), 8.1 below the gasoline NX200 豪華版 (58.4%), 12.0 below the NX350h hybrid sibling (62.3%), and 2.1 above its own F Sport sibling (48.2%). Low-mileage premium embedded (35,000 km versus a ~65,000 km average at 5 years). Confidence low because this is beyond the oldest observable car of this generation."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"UNCHANGED at 1,000,000 (41.5% of real_cost) — and the reviewer's specific query about it, the absolute-money inversion against the cheaper Overtrail, was checked and answered rather than patched away. First, the figure is independently re-confirmed by the rebuilt curve: falling 8.7 points from the corrected 5-year point lands on 41.7%, essentially exactly where this checkpoint already sat, so the corrections upstream did not disturb it. The reviewer's own read that the back half was already correct is upheld. ON THE ABSOLUTE INVERSION (this car 1,000,000 versus the cheaper gasoline NX350 Overtrail 1,035,000): CHECKED, and it is the intended consequence of the mandated ordering, not an arithmetic defect. The two cars differ in real_cost by only 92,000 (2,407,000 versus 2,315,000, a 3.8% gap). For this PHEV to match the Overtrail in absolute money it would have to retain 43.0% against the Overtrail's 44.7% — a PHEV penalty of just 1.7 points at precisely the age where traction-battery anxiety peaks and the car is years out of warranty, and it would simultaneously push this base trim 3.3 points above its own 450h+ F Sport sibling (39.7%). Both consequences are worse errors than the inversion itself. The honest description is that the two curves CROSS between years 3 and 5 and stay crossed: the PHEV starts ahead in absolute money because it cost more new (+85,000 at year 1, +45,000 at year 3), and from mid-life the battery-anxiety penalty overtakes its 92,000 price advantage (-5,000 at year 5, -35,000 at year 7, -3,000 at year 10). A more expensive car being worth less in absolute terms once out of warranty is exactly what 'gasoline > PHEV' means when the price gap is under 4%. EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION — no 7-year-old NX450h+ can exist (this generation is 4.6 years old and the previous AZ10 NX had no PHEV at all). Real 7-year AZ10 anchors from SUM 汽車網 (fetched 2026-08-11): 2019 NX300 at 99,530 km asks NT$958,000; 2019 NX300 AWD F Sport at 86,546 km asks NT$1,088,000; 2018 NX300 頂級版 at 115,779 km asks NT$828,000. Against reconstructed AZ10 list prices (NX300 豪華版 ~163萬, 頂級版 ~180萬, F Sport ~208萬) that is ~52-59% of original at DEALER RETAIL at 87,000-116,000 km, adjusting up to ~61% for our 49,000 km; converting to private (x ~0.88) gives ~54% private retention for a GASOLINE NX at 7 years, against which this PHEV's 41.5% carries a ~12-point powertrain penalty. CHAIN: implied dealer retail ~1,140,000; private 1,000,000; dealer_tradein_price = private x 0.87 = 870,000. Rationale for the wide penalty: a 7-year-old, fully out-of-warranty plug-in hybrid is materially harder to sell in Taiwan than a gasoline NX — a small buyer pool, traction-battery replacement fear, no PHEV tax relief, and the complete absence of used PHEV inventory documented at year 1. Explicitly extrapolated, not observed."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"UNCHANGED — audited across both passes and agreed by the reviewer to sit correctly last. At 27.5% of real_cost it is below the NX350h hybrid sibling (35.7%), the gasoline NX200 豪華版 (35.1%) and the gasoline NX350 Overtrail (28.7%), and above its own 450h+ F Sport sibling (25.0%) as the trim ladder requires. The rebuilt curve also lands here naturally: the 14.0-point fall from the 7-year point across three years matches the 14.7-point fall the F Sport sibling takes over the same span. EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION — same method as the 7-year point; no 10-year NX450h+ exists or can exist. Real 10-12 year AZ10 anchors: a 2016 NX200t 尊貴版 at 79,000 km asks NT$718,000 and 2014 NX300h examples ask NT$638,000 at 95,000 km (旗艦版) and NT$458,000 at 280,000 km, from 8891 中古車, whose NX inventory I re-fetched on 2026-08-11 and which now shows 334 NX listings with 2015-2017 NX200t cars at 558,000-688,000 — consistent with these anchors. Against reconstructed original lists (NX200t 尊貴版 ~199萬, 旗艦版 227萬, NX300h 旗艦版 ~235萬) that is ~36% of original at 10 years and ~27% at 12 years, at DEALER RETAIL and at high mileage. Adjusting up for our 70,000 km (roughly half the average 10-year car) gives ~40% for a gasoline NX. PHEV PENALTY APPLIED: cut ~8 points to 32%, the widest penalty of any checkpoint, because at 10 years the traction battery is far past any warranty and a pack replacement would cost more than the car is worth. 32% x 2,407,000 = 770,000 dealer retail. CHAIN ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private = x 0.86 = 662,000; trade-in = private x 0.84 = 556,000 (spreads widened at this age, as is normal for cheap old stock). Explicitly extrapolated, not observed."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"UNCHANGED in this pass (revised from 14,000 in the prior audit). Two paid visits in year 1 (the 1個月 first check is free). Build-up, which sums exactly: PTT NX200 low-mileage receipts for the same two visits = 4,394 + 9,406 = 13,800 at ~7,000 km/yr (https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1732168522.A.98C.html); trimmed ~15% to ~11,700 because that poster explicitly accepted every dealer recommendation ('沒刪單') and is an upper bound; then uplifted 10% for PHEV content = ~12,900, booked as 13,000. The 10% uplift comes from 風傳媒's own table (NX450h+ 64,350 vs NX350h 58,350), not from the wrong NX200 comparator. Interval structure per the official table at https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx."},{"y":3,"source":"UNCHANGED in this pass (revised down from 42,000 in the prior audit). Four visits across years 1-3, one of them the 24-month 34-item service that adds brake fluid. Build-up, which sums exactly: ~7,300 average per visit x 4 = ~29,000 scheduled at real-world dealer billing, + 10% PHEV content uplift = ~32,000. The prior 42,000 came from extending the PTT poster's 1.5-year and 2-year receipts (8,122 and 15,230) at face value and applying the erroneous 20% uplift — but those two receipts are precisely the ones inflated by '沒刪單' upsell acceptance, and the 15,230 visit is a one-off 24-month major, not a repeatable per-visit rate. Cross-check: cumulative years 0-3 is 45,000 against 風傳媒's 64,350 for years 0-5, a ratio consistent with the 48-month major falling in the later window. Still fully in warranty, so no repair cost is included."},{"y":5,"source":"UNCHANGED in this pass (revised down from 88,000 in the prior audit, where the itemisation was also made to reconcile). The step-up window: the heaviest scheduled service (48個月) plus the first age-driven consumables. Build-up, summing exactly to 78,000: scheduled portion 39,000 (four visits including the 48-month 37-item major with transmission fluid and coolant, per https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx, scaled from 風傳媒's NT$64,350 5-year figure with the corrected 10% PHEV uplift) + first tyre set 30,000 fitted (four 235/60R18, replaced on AGE at 35,000 km — tread is nowhere near worn) + 12V AGM auxiliary battery 9,000. Cumulative years 0-5 = 123,000, i.e. ~1.9x 風傳媒's schedule-only 64,350, with the excess fully explained by the 30,000 tyre set and the 9,000 battery that its table excludes. Warranty runs out inside this window at year 4, free-extendable to year 5 only with an unbroken 6-month service record, so no out-of-warranty repair cost lands here yet."},{"y":7,"source":"UNCHANGED in this pass (revised down from 82,000 in the prior audit, where the itemisation was also made to reconcile). First fully out-of-warranty window (cover ends at year 5/140,000 km at the latest, https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx), so scheduled work now carries owner-paid repairs on top. Build-up, summing exactly to 62,000: scheduled 34,000 (four visits, post-warranty rates) + front pads and discs 12,000 (landing here rather than earlier because regenerative braking on a PHEV means the friction brakes have done very little work in 49,000 km) + coolant 6,000 covering both the engine circuit and the separate inverter/HV cooling loop the official table flags for hybrids ('動力控制冷卻系統是否洩漏') + PHEV 高壓系統點檢 and miscellaneous out-of-warranty repairs 10,000. The dip versus the year-5 window is real and expected, not an error: the year-5 window absorbs the tyre set and the 12V battery, neither of which recurs here. The repair and HV-inspection lines are my own estimates, not quoted figures — no published Lexus TW price list covers post-warranty PHEV servicing, hence low confidence."},{"y":10,"source":"UNCHANGED in this pass (revised down from 165,000 in the prior audit, which closed a 21,000 itemisation gap). Longest window (3 years, ~6 visits) and the most expensive. Build-up, summing exactly to 142,000: scheduled 54,000 (six visits including the 96個月/8年 major) + second tyre set 32,000 (age again, not tread) + rear pads and discs 14,000 + second 12V AGM 9,000 + PHEV traction-battery health testing and degradation contingency 18,000 + general out-of-warranty repairs on a decade-old car 15,000. The battery line is a contingency for testing and partial remediation ONLY — a full 18.1 kWh pack replacement would cost more than the car's residual value at this age (private_sale_price here is 662,000) and in practice triggers a sale rather than a repair, so it is deliberately NOT included. Entirely estimated from the official service structure plus general Taiwan Lexus dealer rates; no owner receipts for a 10-year-old NX450h+ exist because the model is only 4.6 years old in Taiwan. Low confidence by construction."}],"sources":[{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官網 — NX 車型價格","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/models/nx/price","note":"NEW IN THIS AUDIT, fetched 2026-08-11. The manufacturer's own NX page publishes 'NX NT$171~284.5萬' with powertrains '450h+ / 350h / 350 / 200'. It does not break out per-trim prices, but it pins BOTH endpoints of the TVBS table to Lexus Taiwan itself and confirms the 450h+ is still in the 2026 lineup — which is why list_price is treated as manufacturer-confirmed rather than media-sourced."},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 — 2026 Lexus NX 規格配備與售價表","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/lexus/2026-lexus-nx","note":"PRIMARY per-trim price verification, RE-FETCHED AGAIN IN THIS AUDIT on 2026-08-11 and unchanged. Full 2026 NX trim/price table: 200菁英版 171萬 / 200豪華版 181萬 / 350h豪華版 207.5萬 / 350h頂級版 227.5萬 / 350 Overtrail版 234萬 / 450h+豪華版 237.5萬 / 350h旗艦版 257.5萬 / 350 F Sport版 263萬 / 450h+ F Sport版 284.5萬. Confirms list_price = 2,375,000, confirms NX250 is absent from the 2026 lineup, and confirms 豪華版 is the BASE 450h+ trim. Also supplies the same-price-band gasoline comparators (Overtrail 234萬, F Sport 263萬) used in the cross-trim ordering checks."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — Lexus NX 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=NX","note":"RE-FETCHED IN THIS AUDIT on 2026-08-11: 81 listings with year, trim, mileage and price. Supplied the same-generation gasoline curve used to rebuild the 1/3/5-year points (2025 NX200 豪華版 @12,115km = 1,458,000; 2024 NX200 豪華版+ @13,462km = 1,399,000; 2024 NX200 豪華版 @26,646km = 1,338,000; 2023 NX200 豪華版 @44,000-52,684km = 1,258,000-1,378,000; 2022 NX200 豪華版 @30,307km = 1,239,000) and the 7-year AZ10 points (2019 NX300 @99,530km = 958,000; 2019 NX300 AWD F Sport @86,546km = 1,088,000; 2018 NX300 頂級版 @115,779km = 828,000). KEY NEGATIVE FINDING, RE-CONFIRMED: not one NX450h+ appears among the 81 listings."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — Lexus NX, 年份新到舊排序","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=NX&sortby=year_desc","note":"NEW IN THIS AUDIT, fetched 2026-08-11. Sorting SUM's NX inventory newest-first was done specifically to hunt for a ~1-year-old 450h+ to anchor the year-1 checkpoint directly. The newest cars on the platform are a 2025 NX200 @12,115km at 1,458,000 and four 2024 cars (NX200 @13,462km 1,399,000, @26,646km 1,338,000, @29,372km 1,430,000; NX350 @21,289km 1,938,000). NO 450h+ of any year. This is the search that establishes there is no direct year-1 observation to be had."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus NX 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/nx","note":"RE-FETCHED IN THIS AUDIT on 2026-08-11 and the inventory has GROWN since the prior pass — now 334 NX listings spanning model years 2015-2025 (2025 NX200 特仕版 @~3,500km = 1,460,000; 2023 NX200 @~29,000km = 1,298,000; 2023 NX350 F Sport @~20,000km = 1,680,000; 2022 NX200 = 1,018,000-1,200,000; 2020 NX300 @~80,000km = 908,000; 2019 NX200/300 = 758,000-868,000; 2016-2017 NX200t = 558,000-688,000). KEY NEGATIVE FINDING, RE-CONFIRMED ON A LARGER SAMPLE: still no NX450h+ anywhere in the inventory. Across SUM (81) and 8891 (334) — 415 NX listings — there is not a single PHEV. This is the strongest single justification for placing the PHEV last in the retention ordering, for cutting the year-1 and year-3 anchors in this pass, and for the low confidence at years 1, 5, 7 and 10."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2023 NX450h+豪華版 (2代), LEXUS CPO 南港營業所","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2142965","note":"RE-FETCHED IN THIS AUDIT on 2026-08-11 and still live: 2023 Lexus NX 450h+ 豪華版, LEXUS CPO 原廠認證中古車, 南港營業所, asking NT$2,098,000, mileage not published. Primary 3-year anchor, and one of only TWO observations of this exact trim in the entire Taiwan market. This is CPO RETAIL, the highest price tier in the Taiwan chain — see the year-3 checkpoint for the two-stage haircut (20% CPO-to-ordinary-dealer, then 14% to private) applied to reach a private-sale figure."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2023 NX450h+豪華版, LEXUS CPO 台中營業所","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2135929","note":"RE-FETCHED IN THIS AUDIT on 2026-08-11 (the prior pass only carried it over) and confirmed live: 2023 Lexus NX 450h+ 豪華版, LEXUS CPO 台中營業所, asking NT$2,138,000, mileage not published. The second of the only two real observations of this trim. This pass uses the MEAN of the two listings (2,118,000) as the year-3 anchor rather than cherry-picking the cheaper one, which is part of why the year-3 figure moved."},{"name":"KingAutos 國王車訊 — 2022 Lexus NX 450h+ 豪華版 單一車款","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/spec/9591","note":"Returns '2022 Lexus NX 450h+ 豪華版, 定價 229 萬元'. Confirms the launch list price of this exact trim — the denominator for the 3-year retention calculation on 2023 cars. Verified by direct fetch in the prior audit; not re-fetched this pass, as this pass's changes rest on the CPO listings and the negative inventory finding rather than on the launch price."},{"name":"LEXUS CPO 認證中古車 官網","url":"https://www.lexuscpo.com.tw/","note":"NEW IN THIS AUDIT, fetched 2026-08-11 — and reported here as an HONEST NULL RESULT. Because CPO is the only channel with observable 450h+ stock, I went to the official CPO portal to look for a newer (1-2 year old) 450h+ that would anchor the year-1 checkpoint directly. The homepage exposes NX only as a category and does not render its inventory to a fetch; no per-car year/mileage/price data could be extracted. Nothing in this record depends on it. Recorded so the next reviewer does not assume this avenue was untried."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2022 NX450h+ F Sport, 車商 東威汽車","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2013718","note":"Confirmed real in the prior audit: 2022 Lexus NX 450h+ F Sport版, 東威汽車, asking NT$2,398,000; mileage and listing date not published. REMAINS DEMOTED to a weak upper bound only and is NOT used to set any figure — it is an F Sport asking price and cannot set a 豪華版 value. Not re-fetched this pass. Retained in the source list only to document that the year-1 figure is deliberately NOT built on it."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus NX300 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/nx300","note":"Predecessor-generation (AZ10) data for the 7- and 10-year extrapolation: 2019 NX300 頂級版 @68,000km = 1,028,000; 2014 NX300h 旗艦版 @95,000km = 638,000. Carried over from earlier passes and not re-fetched; the equivalent SUM and 8891 NX points above were verified directly this pass and agree."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官網 — 保養計劃","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"OFFICIAL service schedule. 6個月/10,000km whichever first, with 24/16/29/34/37-item inspections at 1個月, 6個月, 12個月, 24個月, 48個月; hybrid-specific power-control cooling checks. Establishes that this owner's interval is time-driven. No prices published. Verified by direct fetch in the prior audit; the maintenance block is unchanged this pass."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官網 — 保證方案 / 延長保證","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx","note":"OFFICIAL warranty terms. 原廠保固 4年/120,000km; FREE extension to 第5年/140,000km conditional on never missing a 6-month service; 12V 電池 3 years (free replacement within 2 years, 50% pro-rata years 2-3); tyres 3 years pro-rata; free towing 4年/120,000km; 防鏽 3 years, 車身穿孔 6 years, 排放系統 5年/120,000km. Explicitly confirms there is NO complimentary scheduled-maintenance programme, and publishes NO traction-battery-specific term — the absence that drives the year-5 resale step-down and the year 7/10 maintenance contingencies."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官網 — 服務特色","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/features.aspx","note":"Free annual 25-item safety inspection. Carried over; the absence of a free scheduled-maintenance programme was independently confirmed on warranty.aspx."},{"name":"風傳媒 — Lexus NX 全車系養車成本分析","url":"https://www.storm.mg/lifestyle/11068074","note":"KEY maintenance anchor. 原廠定期保養 for 5年/10萬公里 over 10 visits: NX200 53,670 / NX350h 58,350 / NX350 63,190 / NX450h+ 64,350. Establishes the like-for-like PHEV premium over the NX350h hybrid as 64,350/58,350 = 10.3%, NOT the ~20% an earlier draft applied by comparing against the cheaper NX200. Also the source of the 牌照稅+燃料稅 ~22,400/year reference figure that is deliberately EXCLUDED from real_cost."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — Lexus NX200 兩年保養分享","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1732168522.A.98C.html","note":"Real owner receipts at almost exactly this buyer's mileage (~14,000 km over 2 years): 首保 0 / 0.5年 4,394 / 1年 9,406 / 1.5年 8,122 / 2年 15,230 = NT$37,152. Owner states '沒刪單' (accepted every recommendation), so treated as an UPPER bound and trimmed ~15% rather than used at face value."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 — 2024 年式 Lexus NX 售價調整","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/37629-8-11-2024-lexus-nx-nx350h.html","note":"HONESTY FLAG, STILL UNVERIFIED ACROSS ALL PASSES: seen only in a search-result snippet; never fetched by any pass, including this one. It reportedly reconciles the 229萬 launch price with today's 237.5萬 via an 8-11萬 increase at the 2024 model year. Nothing in this record depends on it — both endpoints (229萬 from KingAutos and 237.5萬 from TVBS, now also corroborated by lexus.com.tw's published range) are confirmed by pages that WERE fetched."}]},"lexus-nx350h-flagship":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, roughly half the Taiwan average (~12,000-15,000 km/yr). All checkpoints use 7,000 km/year (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km). Two consequences drive the model: (1) Every used-value figure is quoted against LOW-MILEAGE listings, not the mileage-blind average — on findcar a 2022 NX350h with 39,168 km asks NT$1,678,000 while a 2022 with 113,000 km asks NT$1,288,000, a ~30% spread at identical age. (2) Lexus TW servicing is every 6 months OR 10,000 km — re-verified on lexus.com.tw during this fact-check, so the brief's generic 'annual interval' hint does NOT apply to Lexus Taiwan. At 7,000 km/yr the 6-month clock always binds first, so maintenance is purely time-driven: 2 shop visits per year regardless of distance, and consumables that age out (tires, brake fluid, coolant, 12V battery) dominate over consumables that wear out (pads, discs). Tax and insurance are excluded by design. Current generation is AZ20, on sale in Taiwan since Jan 2022, so it is only ~4.5 years old — years 7 and 10 are extrapolated from the predecessor AZ10 NX300h, not observed. FACT-CHECK NOTE: value_checkpoints at years 1, 3 and 7 were revised DOWN from the researcher's figures; see each source string.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"REVISED DOWN by the fact-check from NT$1,950,000. The researcher assumed a 1-year dealer-retail asking price of NT$2,190,000 (85% of list). That fails two sanity checks: (a) it sits only NT$185,000 below a REAL verified new-car transaction price of NT$2,375,000 (list 2,575,000 less the confirmed 220,000 菜單 discount), so a used buyer would simply buy new; (b) it is 27% above the only genuine 1-year listing on findcar — a 2025 NX350h with 39,000 km asking NT$1,728,000 (車商售價). Rebuilt: starting from that NT$1,728,000 dealer ask and crediting the mileage gap (7,000 vs 39,000 km) plus the 旗艦版 trim step over the lower-trim comparator gives a dealer retail asking price of ~NT$2,110,000 (82% of list). ADJUSTMENT APPLIED (dealer-retail trap): private sale = dealer retail x 0.89 (11% below asking, mid of the 8-15% band) = NT$1,878,000, rounded to NT$1,880,000; dealer trade-in = private x 0.87 = NT$1,635,000. Cross-check: a NT$1,880,000 private sale against a NT$2,375,000 real transaction price is a 20.8% first-year hit, correctly steeper than the 350h豪華版 sibling's 18.9% because the trim premium is the first thing the used market discards."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"REVISED DOWN by the fact-check from NT$1,700,000, and confidence downgraded from 'high' to 'medium'. THE DEALER-RETAIL TRAP: the researcher's NT$1,700,000 was labelled a PRIVATE price, yet it sat ABOVE the highest dealer RETAIL asking price for any current-generation NX350h I could verify on findcar (NT$1,728,000 for a 1-year-old 2025 car; NT$1,678,000 for the 2022 頂級版 with 39,168 km). A private-sale figure for a 3-year-old car cannot sit at the top of the dealer-retail band for cars younger than it. Rebuilt from verified low-mileage comparables, all fetched live: 2022 NX350h 頂級版 39,168 km asking NT$1,678,000 (on a 2022 頂級版 list of NT$2,190,000 = 76.6% dealer-ask retention at ~4.3 years); 2023 NX350h 28,108 km asking NT$1,650,000; 2023 NX350h 24,410 km asking NT$1,458,000 (the price gap between these two 2023 cars despite the LOWER-mileage one being cheaper is what identifies them as 頂級版 and 豪華版 respectively). Deliberately EXCLUDED the high-mileage listings (2023 @ 109,695 km / NT$1,388,000; 2022 @ 106,886 km / NT$1,399,000; 2022 @ 113,000 km / NT$1,288,000) because they misrepresent this low-mileage buyer. A 3-year 旗艦版 with only 21,000 km therefore asks ~NT$1,855,000 dealer retail (72% of list — deliberately BELOW the 頂級版's ~75% ask retention, per the trim-ladder rule). ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private = x0.89 = NT$1,650,000; trade-in = x0.87 = NT$1,435,000. Confidence is 'medium' not 'high' because NOT ONE of these comparables is a 旗艦版 — trims were inferred from price, and the single genuine 旗艦版 used listing found (SAVE 認證車 2024, 26,305 km) had its price withheld once sold."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"One year beyond the oldest current-generation cars on the market (AZ20 launched Taiwan Jan 2022, so the oldest observable is ~4.5 years), hence a short extrapolation rather than a direct observation. Trend line from the 3-year comparables plus the verified 4.3-year 2022 頂級版 @ 39,168 km (NT$1,678,000 asking) puts 旗艦版 dealer retail at ~63% of list = NT$1,622,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED (dealer-retail trap): private = x0.89 = NT$1,440,000; trade-in = x0.87 = NT$1,255,000. Retained unchanged from the researcher — it is the one mid-curve figure that survived cross-checking, and with years 1 and 3 corrected downward the curve is now smooth (year 1->3 = -12.2%, year 3->5 = -12.7%) rather than kinked. Note the Lexus TW factory warranty is 4 years/120,000 km (5th year free only if every 6-month service was kept, re-verified on lexus.com.tw), so warranty expiry lands inside this window and genuinely accelerates depreciation."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"REVISED DOWN by the fact-check from NT$1,160,000. EXTRAPOLATED — no genuine 7-year data exists for the current AZ20 generation. Method (per the brief): take the predecessor AZ10 Lexus NX300h (same hybrid concept, same segment, Taiwan 2014-2021), whose 旗艦版 launched at NT$2,160,000 per the CarNews official price table of 25 Aug 2014 which I fetched and confirmed (豪華版 1,890,000 / 頂級版 1,990,000 / 旗艦版 2,160,000 / 全景天窗旗艦版 2,190,000 / F Sport 2,050,000). Verified current findcar NX300h listings at comparable age and LOW mileage: 2017 @ 71,021 km asking NT$838,000 and 2017 @ 80,000 km AWD asking NT$848,000 — that is 38.8% and 39.3% of the NT$2,160,000 旗艦版 list at 9 years, NOT the '~42%' the researcher stated (a denominator error on their part, corrected here). Interpolating that curve back to 7 years gives ~52% of original list as dealer-retail retention; x0.89 = 46.3% private-sale retention; applied to this car's real_cost of NT$2,413,000 -> NT$1,117,000, rounded to NT$1,120,000. WHY THE RESEARCHER'S FIGURE WAS WRONG: their own arithmetic produced NT$1,120,000 and they then 'nudged' it to NT$1,160,000 to credit the low 49,000 km — but the predecessor comparables driving the 52% were THEMSELVES the low-mileage subset (71,000-80,000 km against a fleet averaging 110,000-140,000 km), so the low-mileage premium was already priced in and the nudge double-counted it. The nudge also narrowed the retention gap versus the 350h豪華版 sibling to 1.0 point, contradicting the rule that a trim premium erodes with age. Trade-in = x0.87 = NT$975,000."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no 10-year data exists for the current generation. Same predecessor method: AZ10 NX300h 旗艦版, original list NT$2,160,000 (CarNews Aug 2014 table, fetched and confirmed). Verified current findcar listings at 10-12 years: 2016 @ 140,000 km asking NT$628,000 (29.1% of list); 2015 @ 130,000 km asking NT$618,000 (28.6%); 2014 @ 110,000 km asking NT$648,000 (30.0%); and critically 2017 @ 71,021 km asking NT$838,000 (38.8% at 9 years). Our buyer's 10-year car carries only 70,000 km, so that last low-mileage point — same mileage, one year younger — is the right anchor, not the high-mileage cluster: dealer-retail retention ~38% of original list. x0.89 = 33.8% private-sale retention; applied to real_cost NT$2,413,000 -> NT$815,000. Trade-in = x0.87 = NT$710,000. Retained unchanged from the researcher: I re-derived it and the method and arithmetic both hold, and it is the one extrapolated point genuinely pinned by a low-mileage predecessor comparable. Caveat: most predecessor comparables are high-mileage, so the low-mileage uplift rests on a single listing."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Lexus TW official 保養計劃 item lists for the 6-month and 12-month services, re-verified live during this fact-check; 2 paid visits in year 1 because the 6-month clock binds at 7,000 km/yr. Labour/parts pricing estimated at Lexus TW dealer rates (~NT$3,500 minor + ~NT$6,500 annual) — schedule sourced, prices not."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers months 12-36 = 4 scheduled visits under the confirmed Lexus TW 6-month interval. The 24-month service is the first one carrying brake fluid and the hybrid cooling-system inspection. Still fully inside the 4-year factory warranty, so no repair allowance included. Prices estimated."},{"y":5,"source":"The expensive window. Two drivers: (1) the 48-month major service adds transmission fluid and fuel filter, and carries the 24-month-cycle brake fluid; (2) tires age out. At 35,000 km over 5 years the tread is nowhere near worn, but 5-6-year-old rubber must be replaced on safety grounds — a set of four 235/50R20 tires for the 旗艦版 runs ~NT$48,000 in Taiwan, roughly half this period's total. Tire size is now CONFIRMED 20-inch on the KingAutos spec table (the researcher had flagged it as an assumption), so this figure is no longer speculative. 12V auxiliary battery also reaches end of life. This is also the period in which the 4-year warranty (or free 5th-year extension) runs out. FACT-CHECK NOTE: the researcher's item list labelled brake fluid as a '60 個月循環' item, which contradicts the official 24-month cycle in plan_notes; corrected to the 48-month service. Prices estimated."},{"y":7,"source":"REVISED UP by the fact-check from NT$49,000. The researcher's figure sat BELOW the 350h豪華版 sibling record's NT$52,000 for the identical window, which is impossible: this trim runs 20-inch wheels and correspondingly larger brake hardware, shares the same powertrain and the same 6-month service schedule, and every other period in this record correctly sits above the sibling (year 1: 10,000 vs 9,000; year 5: 96,000 vs 66,000; year 10: 150,000 vs 120,000). Year 7 was the lone inversion; NT$54,000 restores the ordering. First period fully outside factory warranty, so a repair allowance (~NT$8,000) is included. Brake pads last unusually long because regenerative braking does most of the deceleration work — at 49,000 km the fronts are only now due, and 20-inch-car front pads cost more than the base trim's. Coolant (both engine and hybrid inverter circuits) reaches its age limit here. No tire spend: the year-5 set is only 2 years old. Prices estimated."},{"y":10,"source":"Three-year window with 6 scheduled visits, so the highest period cost. Second full 20-inch tire set (~NT$50,000 with alignment) again driven by age, not tread — tire size confirmed 235/50R20 by this fact-check. Adds rear pads, front discs, a second 12V battery, and a meaningful out-of-warranty allowance (~NT$25,000) for suspension bushings, water pump and perished rubber on a 10-year-old car. EXCLUDED: hybrid traction battery replacement — covered to 8 years and very unlikely to fail at 70,000 km, but it is the largest uncosted tail risk in this window. Prices estimated, no owner receipts obtained."}],"sources":[{"name":"TVBS 汽車 — 2026 Lexus NX 規格配備／價格表","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/lexus/2026-lexus-nx","note":"FETCHED AND CONFIRMED LIVE by the fact-check. Full 2026 NX table: 200菁英 1,710,000 / 200豪華 1,810,000 / 350h豪華 2,075,000 / 350h頂級 2,275,000 / 350 Overtrail 2,340,000 / 450h+豪華 2,375,000 / 350h旗艦 2,575,000 / 350 F Sport 2,630,000 / 450h+ F Sport 2,845,000. Confirms list_price NT$2,575,000."},{"name":"KingAutos — 2026 Lexus NX 車款總覽／規格表","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/nx","note":"FETCHED AND CONFIRMED LIVE. Independent second confirmation of NX350h 旗艦版 at 257.5萬. Also the source that RESOLVED the researcher's open question on wheel size: 350h旗艦版 and 350h頂級版 both run 20-inch 235/50R20, while 350h豪華版 runs 18-inch 235/60R18. Combined output 243hp across all 350h trims."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — NX showroom（官方價格區間）","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/showroom/nx","note":"Official manufacturer page. Publishes the NX lineup range NT$171~284.5萬 across 200 / 350 / 350h / 450h+ powertrains, which brackets the NT$2,575,000 旗艦版 figure. Trim-level prices are loaded dynamically and were not directly readable, so this corroborates the range rather than the individual trim."},{"name":"KingAutos — 2022 Lexus NX 350h 旗艦版 規格","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/spec/9589","note":"FETCHED AND CONFIRMED. Predecessor-year list price for the SAME trim: 2022 NX350h 旗艦版 = NT$2,490,000 (249萬). Used to sanity-check observed retention on the oldest current-generation cars."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [菜單] NX350H旗艦（2025-10, 南港）","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1759933934.A.BA1.html","note":"FETCHED AND CONFIRMED LIVE — this is a real, dated transaction, not a paraphrase. 2025 NX350H 旗艦 星熠黑, list 257.5萬, discount 22萬, self-paid accessories 3.2萬 (FSK 隔熱紙 + 前後行車記錄器含 ETC), out the door 238.7萬, ordered 2025-10-03 at 南港 branch, paid cash via 和泰Pay. Free items: 交車美容, 滿油, 鑰匙皮套 x2, 牌框, ETC 安裝, 防水腳踏墊, 防水後廂墊. Primary evidence that Lexus discounting on this trim is material, not token."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [菜單] Lexus NX350H 頂級版（2025-09, 中部）","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1758027646.A.31F.html","note":"26年式 頂級版: NT$2,275,000 list, NT$185,000 discount, NT$2,090,000 final, excluding insurance/plates/tax. Poster reports northern dealers quoting NT$225,000 off the 25年式. Corroborates the discount level on the current model year for an adjacent trim."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [菜單] LEXUS NX350H 旗艦（2024-11, 台中）","url":"https://www.pttweb.cc/bbs/car/M.1732178115.A.4C9","note":"Earlier 旗艦版 transaction: contract NT$2,425,000 (~NT$150,000 off), plus an optioned electric running board excluded from this record. Shows the discount widening over the generation's life (150,000 in 2024 -> 220,000 in 2025)."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — NX350h 中古車列表","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/nx350h","note":"FETCHED AND CONFIRMED LIVE; every listing the researcher cited is really there. The key used-value source because it publishes MILEAGE per listing. 8 listings, average NT$1,498,000. Low-mileage set used: 2022 39,168 km / 1,678,000; 2023 28,108 km / 1,650,000; 2023 24,410 km / 1,458,000; 2025 39,000 km / 1,728,000. High-mileage set deliberately excluded: 2023 109,695 km / 1,388,000; 2022 106,886 km / 1,399,000; 2022 113,000 km / 1,288,000. All are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking), reduced 11% to reach private sale. NOTE: the NT$1,728,000 top-of-book figure is what exposed the researcher's 3-year private price of NT$1,700,000 as a mislabelled dealer-retail number."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — NX300h 中古車列表（前代 AZ10）","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/nx300h","note":"Predecessor-generation curve for the years 7 and 10 extrapolation. Age/mileage points used: 2017 71,021 km / 838,000; 2017 80,000 km AWD / 848,000; 2016 140,000 km / 628,000; 2015 130,000 km / 618,000; 2014 110,000 km / 648,000. Against the NT$2,160,000 旗艦版 list these are 38.8% / 39.3% / 29.1% / 28.6% / 30.0% — the researcher's '~42% at 9 years' was a denominator slip, corrected in the year-7 source string."},{"name":"CarNews — NX300h 正式售價（前代原始價格表）","url":"https://www.carnews.com/article/info/afca1927-4b09-11e8-8ee2-42010af00004/","note":"FETCHED AND CONFIRMED LIVE. Official Taiwan launch prices for the predecessor AZ10 NX300h, 25 Aug 2014: 豪華版 1,890,000 / 頂級版 1,990,000 / 旗艦版 2,160,000 / 全景天窗旗艦版 2,190,000 / F Sport 2,050,000 / AWD F Sport 2,160,000 / AWD F Sport 全景天窗 2,190,000. The denominator for the predecessor retention ratios."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus NX 行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/nx","note":"FETCHED AND CONFIRMED LIVE (not a 404). 334 NX listings. Cross-check on the current-generation band and the price ladder by year. Sample verified: 2023 NX350 F Sport 2萬km / 1,680,000; 2023 NX200 豪華版 2.9萬km / 1,298,000; 2024 NX250 頂級版 4萬km / 1,338,000; 2020 NX300 頂級版 2.7萬km / 1,030,000."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — Lexus NX 中古車","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=NX","note":"Third-source sanity check on the overall NX used band (81 listings, NT$798,000-1,930,000) and on how steeply price falls with mileage."},{"name":"SAVE 認證車聯盟 — 2024 NX350H 旗艦版（已售出）","url":"https://www.isave.com.tw/car.aspx?cid=328745","note":"FETCHED AND CONFIRMED LIVE. A genuine 旗艦版 used listing: 2024 NX350H 旗艦版, 26,305 km, white, 2500cc hybrid, LSS 3.0 + panoramic sunroof, dealer 億昇汽車 (Taichung), status 已售出. Confirms low-mileage examples of this exact trim reach the market and sell, but the price was withheld once sold — which is precisely why the year-3 confidence is capped at 'medium'."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 保養計劃（official scheduled-maintenance table）","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"FETCHED AND CONFIRMED LIVE. Authoritative source for the maintenance SCHEDULE: 1個月 / 6個月-10,000km / 12個月-20,000km / 24個月-40,000km / 48個月-80,000km, whichever comes first. Confirms the interval is 6-month, not annual. Original parts carry a 2-year/50,000 km warranty; hybrids receive dedicated cooling-system checks. No NT$ prices are published — costs in this record are estimates, not quotes from this page."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 保證方案／延長保證","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx","note":"FETCHED AND CONFIRMED LIVE. Base warranty '自交車日起 4 年或行駛 120,000 公里（以先到者為準）'. Free 5th-year / 140,000 km extension conditional on never missing a 6-month service: '若曾有 1 次超過半年未回廠定保，即失去免費延保資格'. Confirms there is NO free scheduled-maintenance programme — only paid maintenance plans and points schemes are offered."},{"name":"8891 汽車 — 2022 Lexus NX350h 價格專題","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/feature/1883","note":"2022 NX350h launch pricing for the lower trims (豪華版 NT$1,990,000 / 頂級版 NT$2,190,000). The NT$2,190,000 頂級版 figure is the denominator for the best-anchored used data point in the record (2022 頂級版, 39,168 km, asking NT$1,678,000 = 76.6% dealer-ask retention at ~4.3 years)."}]},"lexus-nx350-fsport":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. All checkpoints use the midpoint 7,000 km/year, so assumed_km = 7000 x years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). This is materially below-average mileage, so used-car values are quoted from low-mileage listings rather than mileage-blind averages, and maintenance is driven by the TIME leg of Lexus TW's '10,000 km or 6 months' interval, not the distance leg.\n\nVehicle is the 2.4L turbo AWD gasoline F Sport (Toyota T24A-FTS, 8AT) - not a hybrid. Displacement is 2393cc per cars.tvbs.com.tw's 2026 NX spec table, which also gives 2487cc to the 350h hybrid (that 2487cc is the A25A 2.5L used by the NX250 and 350h). kingautos.net/spec/9590 states '2487 cc' for the 2.4 turbo and is wrong on that field; trust it for price/power/wheels only. At 2393cc the NX350 sits in Taiwan's 1801-2400cc 牌照稅 bracket, the SAME bracket as the NX200 (1987cc) and the predecessor NX300 (1998cc). Tax is excluded from this model by design, and no tax-bracket resale penalty is applied.\n\nWHEEL/TYRE FITMENT - VERIFIED AND MATERIAL. The same TVBS spec table gives the 350 F Sport版 235/50R20, while the 350 Overtrail版 and the 200菁英版 both run 235/60R18. kingautos spec 9590 independently confirms '20 吋鋁圈' with 235/50 front and rear on the 2022 F Sport. This is the single verified reason this trim's maintenance runs above its mechanical twin, the Overtrail, and it is now costed explicitly rather than asserted.\n\nTRIM-LADDER BASIS - READ BEFORE COMPARING RATIOS. This trim is modelled with a 180,000 discount (backed by a real dated PTT menu) while the Overtrail is modelled with only 60,000. real_cost therefore sits 150,000 below where a like-for-like comparison would put it, which mechanically inflates every retention ratio expressed against real_cost. On the correct like-for-like LIST basis this record retains LESS than the Overtrail at all five checkpoints (67.7/57.2/48.9/40.1/27.2 percent of list, versus the Overtrail's 69.9/60.3/51.9/44.2/28.4), which is the ladder behaviour the brief requires of a top trim. Against real_cost it now also sits at or below the Overtrail at every checkpoint except year 1 and year 10, where it is level within roughly one point. Absolute prices exceed the Overtrail at all five checkpoints.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"REVISED DOWN from 1,930,000 / 1,690,000 in response to the cross-trim review, which correctly found the old 77.8% of real_cost to be a ladder inversion: it equalled the cheapest trim in the line (NX200 菁英版, 77.6%) and exceeded the cheaper Overtrail (70.6%), with no stated reason.\n\nWHAT CHANGED IN THE EVIDENCE: the prior draft rested on a SINGLE listing, the abc好車網 CPO car. This pass walked five pages of the 8891 NX inventory (334 listings) and recovered a proper current-generation age ladder for this exact trim, all 車商售價 (dealer retail asking):\n  - 1 yr, 2025 F Sport, LEXUS CPO 士林營業所, mileage not disclosed: 2,238,000 (abc好車網 2254985, re-confirmed live)\n  - 2 yr, 2024 F Sport, 21,000 km, 高雄: 1,938,000 (8891 - this also independently confirms the figure previously credited only to SUM汽車網, so that cross-check is now first-hand)\n  - 3 yr, 2023 F Sport, 20,000 km, 新北: 1,680,000 (8891)\nThe abc好車網 2024 F Sport at 2,330,000 with undisclosed mileage stays EXCLUDED: it sits above the newer 2025 CPO car and above the mileage-disclosed 2024 car by nearly 400,000, which is not credible.\n\nMETHOD. The CPO asking price is the highest band in the Taiwanese market - main-dealer overhead plus 原廠認證 warranty and 整備 - and a private seller cannot offer CPO at all, so it needs a deeper haircut than an ordinary 車商 car. Stripping roughly 8% of CPO premium from 2,238,000 gives ~2,060,000 non-CPO dealer retail. Cross-check from the other direction: the real 2-year, 21,000 km car asks 1,938,000; one year younger and 14,000 km lower is worth roughly +120,000 to +180,000, giving 2,058,000-2,118,000. The two routes agree, so dealer retail for a 1-year, 7,000 km car is set at 2,100,000.\nADJUSTMENT APPLIED (the dealer-retail trap): private sale = 2,100,000 x 0.85 = ~1,785,000, set at 1,780,000, i.e. 15% below non-CPO dealer retail and 20.5% below the observed CPO asking price. 15% is the DEEP end of the prescribed 8-15% band and that is deliberate: at the 2,000,000 level the private-buyer pool is thin, buyers at this price overwhelmingly want CPO or a dealer warranty, and a private seller must concede the full band to move the car. The haircut narrows with age across this record (15/14/12/12/12) because the private-versus-dealer gap compresses once the car is cheap enough that dealer margin is thin.\ndealer_tradein_price 1,550,000 is a further 12.9% below private sale.\nLADDER CHECK: 71.8% of real_cost, versus Overtrail 70.6% - level within about one point, and the residual is the discount artifact described in assumptions.notes (on a list basis this trim is 67.7% versus the Overtrail's 69.9%, correctly lower). Confidence stays medium: three real listings now, but the CPO anchor's mileage is still undisclosed."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"REVISED DOWN from 1,530,000 / 1,340,000, a small change flowing from the curve-shape correction rather than from new contrary evidence. Still the best-anchored point in the record.\n\nANCHOR (re-verified first-hand on 8891中古車 this pass): 2023 NX350 F Sport版 2.4L, 2万 km (20,000 km, against our 21,000 km assumption), 新北市, dealer retail asking 1,680,000, listing note '車況非常新 很少開南部 北部通勤 里程超少'. A near-exact mileage match on the identical trim, and explicitly a low-mileage clean car rather than a damaged or high-mileage outlier.\nSECOND ANCHOR (new this pass): 2024 NX350 F Sport, 21,000 km, 高雄市, dealer retail 1,938,000 on 8891 - a 2-year car at exactly our assumed mileage, which brackets the 3-year point from above.\n\nMETHOD. The 2023 car launched at 2,490,000 (kingautos spec 9590, re-verified: 2,490,000, 279hp, AWD, 8AT, 20吋 235/50). 1,680,000 / 2,490,000 = 67.5% of list at 3 years for a 20,000 km car. Our car lists at 2,630,000. Ratio applied at 66.5% rather than the measured 67.5%, shaded down one point because 2022-2024 new-car shortage lifted current used asking prices and is now unwinding - the same caveat the Overtrail record raises, applied consistently here.\n  dealer retail = 0.665 x 2,630,000 = ~1,749,000\n  private sale = 1,749,000 x 0.86 = ~1,504,000, set at 1,505,000 (14% below dealer retail, inside the 8-15% band)\n  dealer_tradein_price 1,310,000 = 13.0% below private sale\nSANITY CHECK against the second anchor: our 3-year dealer retail of 1,749,000 sits 189,000 below the real 2-year car's 1,938,000, which in turn sits 258,000 below the real 3-year-to-2-year step observed between the 2023 and 2024 listings. The per-year step is tapering in the right direction.\nLADDER CHECK: 60.7% of real_cost versus Overtrail 60.9% - correctly at or just below the cheaper trim. On a list basis 57.2% versus the Overtrail's 60.3%, comfortably lower, as a top trim should be.\nCORRECTION vs prior draft: the old figure was reached by taking the same 1,680,000 and cutting only 8.9%, the shallow end of the band, which combined with the inflated year-1 number to produce the 16-point 1-to-3 collapse the reviewer flagged. Using the deep end of the band here is consistent with the year-1 treatment and with the thin private market for a 1,500,000+ cash car."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"REVISED UP from 1,180,000 / 1,020,000. The reviewer was right that the old figure produced an absolute inversion: 1,180,000 was BELOW the cheaper Overtrail's 1,215,000, which cannot be true of the same car in a higher trim.\n\nEXTRAPOLATED - no genuine current-generation data exists at this age. The current NX (AZ20) went on sale in Taiwan in January 2022 (pre-sale November 2021), so a 5-year-old car today would be a 2021, i.e. the PREDECESSOR generation (AZ10 NX300). Not fabricated, and confidence is low accordingly.\n\nPREDECESSOR EVIDENCE re-verified first-hand on 8891 this pass, all dealer retail asking:\n  - 2020 NX300 F Sport (6 yr), 75,000 km, 台南: 1,158,000  <- like-for-like trim\n  - 2020 NX300 豪華版 (6 yr), 36,000 km, 台北: 1,152,000   <- near-exact mileage match to our 35,000 km\n  - 2020 NX300 頂級版 (6 yr), 27,000 km, 台北: 1,030,000\n  - 2019 NX300 豪華版 (7 yr), 11,100 km, 高雄: 1,098,000\n  - 2020 NX300 豪華版 (6 yr), 120,000 km, 台南: 898,000\nAgainst the NX300 F Sport's original Taiwan list of roughly 2,280,000, the like-for-like car sits at 50.8% of list at 6 years and 75,000 km. Our checkpoint is one year YOUNGER and at less than half that mileage, which on the observed mileage sensitivity of this model is worth roughly +10 points of ratio combined.\n\nMETHOD. Rather than lean on that single cross-generation denominator (which could not be verified first-hand - see the confidence note), the ratio is set by interpolating this record's own list-basis dealer-retail curve between the two points that ARE anchored on real current-generation and near-generation listings: 66.5% at year 3 and 45.6% at year 7. The linear midpoint is 56.1%; taken at 55.5%, shaded down for the unwinding 2022-2024 shortage premium. The predecessor evidence above independently supports 56-60%, so 55.5% is the conservative end of what the data allows.\n  dealer retail = 0.555 x 2,630,000 = ~1,460,000\n  private sale = 1,460,000 x 0.88 = ~1,285,000 (12% below dealer retail, inside the 8-15% band)\n  dealer_tradein_price 1,110,000 = 13.6% below private sale\nCROSS-CHECK: 1,460,000 dealer retail for a 5-year, 35,000 km NX350 F Sport against the real 6-year, 75,000 km NX300 F Sport at 1,158,000 is +26%. The components: one year younger (~+8%), 40,000 km less on a market that pays for low mileage (~+8%), and a newer generation listing 350,000 higher (~+8-10% carry-through at this age). That adds up, so the figure is not stretched.\nLADDER CHECK: 51.8% of real_cost versus Overtrail 52.5% - correctly below. Absolute 1,285,000 versus Overtrail 1,215,000 - correctly above. On a list basis 48.9% versus 51.9%. All three orderings now hold.\nConfidence low: cross-generation extrapolation, and the NX300 F Sport's original list price could not be confirmed first-hand this pass (kingautos' NX300 page returns HTTP 404, u-car returns HTTP 403, and the web-search budget was exhausted)."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"REVISED UP from 990,000 / 850,000. The reviewer was right that 990,000 was below the cheaper Overtrail's 1,035,000, an absolute inversion.\n\nEXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor generation - no current-generation NX350 exists at 7 years old in Taiwan. Benchmark is the like-for-like predecessor NX300 F Sport (2.0T AWD, original Taiwan list ~2,280,000).\n\nNEW AND MUCH BETTER ANCHOR, found on 8891 this pass. The prior draft's best 7-year comparator was an 80,000 km car, nearly double our assumed mileage. This pass recovered a clean NX300 F Sport mileage ladder at the same model year, all dealer retail asking:\n  - 2018 NX300 F Sport (8 yr), 48,000 km, 高雄: 938,000   <- essentially our exact mileage (49,000 km)\n  - 2018 NX300 F Sport (8 yr), 100,000 km, 台中: 858,000\n  - 2018 NX300 F Sport (8 yr), 200,000 km, 高雄: 798,000\n  - 2020 NX300 F Sport (6 yr), 75,000 km, 台南: 1,158,000\nThose three 2018 cars form a monotone, internally consistent mileage curve, which is what makes the 48,000 km / 938,000 point trustworthy as the low-mileage end rather than a lucky outlier.\n\nMETHOD. Expressed as retention of the NX300 F Sport's ~2,280,000 list: 41.1% at 8 years and 48,000 km, and 50.8% at 6 years and 75,000 km. Our checkpoint sits between them in age (7 years) and at the LOW end on mileage (49,000 km), so linear interpolation to 7 years gives roughly 46%, with our lower mileage arguing for the top of that. Taken at 45.6%.\n  dealer retail = 0.456 x 2,630,000 = ~1,200,000\n  private sale = 1,200,000 x 0.88 = ~1,056,000, set at 1,055,000 (12% below dealer retail)\n  dealer_tradein_price 905,000 = 14.2% below private sale; the private/trade-in gap widens with age because dealers discount harder for stock that moves slowly.\nHONEST NOTE ON SPREAD. A second, more conservative route - taking the 938,000 anchor in absolute terms, adding ~10% for one year less age, then ~8% for the newer generation's higher list - lands at ~1,115,000 dealer retail and ~980,000 private. The ratio route used above lands at 1,200,000 / 1,055,000. The gap between the two routes is about 8%, and it exists because the ratio route assumes used prices scale fully with list price across generations while the absolute route assumes they barely do; reality is between. The ratio route is used because every other checkpoint in this record and across this trim line is built the same way, and switching methods at one checkpoint is what produced the inconsistent curve in the first place. This spread is the main reason confidence stays low.\nLADDER CHECK: 42.5% of real_cost versus Overtrail 44.7% - correctly below. Absolute 1,055,000 versus Overtrail 1,035,000 - correctly above. On a list basis 40.1% versus 44.2%.\nNo tax-bracket penalty is applied. The prior draft at one stage pushed this checkpoint down on the false premise that the NX350 is 2487cc and sits one 牌照稅 bracket above the NX300; it is 2393cc and sits in the SAME bracket. That correction stands.\nConfidence low: cross-generation extrapolation with an unverified denominator and an 8% method spread."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"REVISED DOWN from 750,000 / 640,000. Not objected to directly, but the old 30.2% of real_cost sat ABOVE the cheaper Overtrail's 28.7%, the same ladder inversion the reviewer flagged at year 1, and the old value was left stranded by the year-7 revision.\n\nEXTRAPOLATED - genuinely no current-generation data can exist at this age. Benchmark is the NX200t (2015-2017, 2.0T), whose original Taiwan list prices were 2,110,000 (FWD F Sport), 2,220,000 (AWD F Sport) and 2,250,000 (全景 AWD F Sport) at the December 2014 launch.\n\nEVIDENCE re-verified first-hand on 8891 this pass, all dealer retail asking:\n  - 2016 NX200t 旗艦版 (10 yr), 79,000 km: 718,000   <- closest mileage match to our 70,000 km\n  - 2016 NX200t F Sport (10 yr), 138,000 km, 高雄: 699,000\n  - 2016 NX200t 豪華版 (10 yr), 63,000 km, 台南: 729,000\n  - 2017 NX200t AWD F Sport (9 yr), 130,000 km, 高雄: 838,000\n  - 2017 NX200t F Sport (9 yr), 129,800 km, 台北: 679,000\n  - 2015 NX200t AWD F Sport (11 yr), 190,000 km, 台中: 638,000\nBy this age the market has largely stopped paying for either trim or mileage - the 63,000 km, 79,000 km and 138,000 km cars all sit within 30,000 of each other, and the two 2017 F Sports at nearly identical mileage differ by 159,000. Prices are dominated by condition and by how long the dealer has been sitting on the car.\n\nMETHOD. The 79,000 km / 718,000 車 on a 2,250,000 list gives 31.9% of list, and it is the only comparator within 10,000 km of our checkpoint. Applied at 31.0% rather than 31.9%, one point lower per the trim-ladder rule (the comparator is that generation's 旗艦版; equipment grade is not paid for at 10 years, and a top trim's ratio should sit at or below a cheaper one's).\n  dealer retail = 0.310 x 2,630,000 = ~815,000\n  private sale = 815,000 x 0.88 = ~717,000, set at 715,000 (12% below dealer retail)\n  dealer_tradein_price 610,000 = 14.7% below private sale; at this age many dealers will simply decline the car, so this remains the weakest number in the record.\nLADDER CHECK: 28.8% of real_cost versus Overtrail 28.7% - level, with the residual being the discount artifact rather than a real difference. Absolute 715,000 versus Overtrail 665,000 - correctly above. On a list basis 27.2% versus the Overtrail's 28.4%, correctly lower.\nDENOMINATOR WARNING: the 2,250,000 and 2,220,000 NX200t launch prices come from a U-CAR launch article that returns HTTP 403 to direct fetch, and the web-search budget for this session is exhausted, so they could not be re-read first-hand. That unverified denominator, plus the cross-generation extrapolation, is why confidence is low."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"REVISED DOWN from 15,000. The prior draft priced the same two visits at 5,000 and 9,000 while the Overtrail record - identical engine, identical service scopes, same official table - prices them at 4,500 and 7,500. There is no mechanical reason for this trim to pay more for an oil service, and the 20-inch fitment does not affect a 6-month or 12-month scheduled visit. Rates aligned to the Overtrail. Two paid visits in year one because the 6-month TIME leg fires long before the 10,000 km distance leg. Fully inside the 4-year / 120,000 km factory warranty, so zero repair allowance. Arithmetic: 4,500 + 7,500 + 500 = 12,500. Rates are typical Lexus Taiwan dealer pricing for a 2.4 turbo taking ~5.5L of low-viscosity synthetic, NOT sourced receipts - Mobile01 returns HTTP 403."},{"y":3,"source":"REVISED DOWN from 35,000. Covers the 1-to-3 year window only (not cumulative). The prior draft charged 28,000 for four visits plus a separate 3,000 for air and cabin filters - but those filters are already inside the 29-item annual scope, so they were double-counted, and the per-visit rate was above the Overtrail's for the identical service. Rebuilt at Overtrail-consistent rates. The 40,000 km / 24 months scope fires on its TIME leg at 24 months even though the car has only ~14,000 km on it, pulling brake fluid forward; transmission oil from that same scope is deferred to the 3-to-5 window since the car is nowhere near the distance trigger. The one genuine F Sport line here is the alignment: low-profile 20-inch tyres are more alignment-sensitive and irregular wear on them is expensive to fix, so one extra 4-wheel alignment is carried that the 18-inch trims do not need. Still inside the 4-year / 120,000 km factory warranty, so no repair allowance. Arithmetic: 9,200 + 15,400 + 2,000 + 1,800 = 28,400. Confidence low: every labour rate is an unsourced build-up and the window rests on a judgement call about which parts of the 24-month scope to defer. No receipts were obtainable."},{"y":5,"source":"REVISED DOWN from 105,000, and this is the window where the F Sport genuinely does cost more than its siblings. Three cost clusters land together: the 48-month time-triggered major service, the first tyre set, and the 12V battery. THE TYRE LINE IS NOW SOURCED, not assumed - PChome 24h retail for 235/50R20 was checked first-hand: Michelin Primacy 5 Energy at 45,600 for four (11,400 each), GRIPMAX at 6,650 each, PRINX at 5,700 each. A premium OE-grade set at ~9,900 per tyre plus ~500 per corner fitting and balancing gives ~41,600. The Overtrail's 235/60R18 equivalent runs ~30,000, so the verified fitment difference is worth ~+11,600 in this window - which is essentially the entire gap between this figure and the Overtrail's 88,000. At 7,000 km/year the tread at 35,000 km is still legal; the owner replaces a barely-worn set because 20-inch premium rubber hardens and cracks at 5-6 years. WARRANTY CORRECTION: the prior draft charged a small out-of-warranty allowance here on the basis that cover ends at year 4. lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx states a FREE extension to the 5th year / 140,000 km for owners who keep every scheduled visit on time at authorised dealers, which this model assumes; the whole window is therefore covered and the allowance is removed. Arithmetic: 24,000 + 13,000 + 41,600 + 9,500 + 9,500 + 2,000 = 99,600. Everything except the tyre line is an estimate from the official interval table at Overtrail-consistent rates - no receipts were obtainable."},{"y":7,"source":"REVISED UP slightly from 55,000, the only window that moved upward. Covers the 5-to-7 year window only. Deliberately LOWER than the previous window because the tyres and 12V battery were just done at year 5 - that dip is a real consequence of the age-driven tyre cycle at 7,000 km/year, not an arithmetic slip. This is the FIRST window fully outside cover: the base warranty runs 4 years / 120,000 km and the free extension takes it to the 5th year / 140,000 km, both confirmed on lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx, so protection lapses at the start of this window rather than midway through the last one. The repair allowance stays modest because a 49,000 km Lexus is still mechanically young. The brake line is ~1,500 above the Overtrail's equivalent because 20-inch wheels carry more unsprung mass and use larger, costlier pads and discs than the 18-inch trims. Iridium spark plugs on the 2.4T are deferred to the 7-to-10 window since they run to roughly 100,000 km or 8+ years and neither trigger has fired. No high-voltage or hybrid-battery cost applies to this gasoline trim. Arithmetic: 25,000 + 6,000 + 13,500 + 4,000 + 12,000 = 60,500. Estimated from the official interval table at Overtrail-consistent rates, not from receipts - Mobile01 returns HTTP 403."},{"y":10,"source":"REVISED DOWN from 180,000. Covers the 7-to-10 year window - three years wide, so naturally the largest figure, and it stacks a second tyre set against the 8-year major service. The prior draft carried a 35,000 repair allowance where the Overtrail - same engine, same turbo, same transmission, same age - carries 18,000; there is no mechanical reason for the F Sport to need nearly twice the repair budget of the identical drivetrain, so the allowance is brought to 19,500, marginally above the Overtrail's for the harsher ride and faster bush wear that come with 20-inch wheels and the F Sport suspension tune. The genuine premium in this window remains the tyres: ~45,000 for a second 235/50R20 set against the Overtrail's ~32,000 for 18-inch, the fitment difference being confirmed on the TVBS spec table and the price level on PChome 24h retail. The low 70,000 km total genuinely reduces mechanical risk versus an average-mileage example at the same age, which is why the allowance stays moderate for a decade-old turbocharged car. This trim carries NO high-voltage inspection cost - that burden falls on the 350h and 450h+ siblings. Arithmetic: 39,000 + 45,000 + 13,500 + 12,000 + 11,000 + 16,500 + 19,500 = 156,500. All figures except the tyre line are estimates from the official interval table at Overtrail-consistent rates; no owner receipts for this generation were obtainable (Mobile01 returns HTTP 403)."}],"sources":[{"name":"地球黃金線 (TVBS) - 2026 Lexus NX 規格配備","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/lexus/2026-lexus-nx","note":"VERIFIED FIRST-HAND, twice. Price confirmation: 350 F Sport版 = 2,630,000. Displacement: 350 F Sport版 2393cc / 279hp@6000rpm, 350h 2487cc / 190hp, 200菁英版 1987cc - this disproves the 2487cc claim and the tax-bracket penalty once built on it. NEW THIS PASS and decisive for the maintenance rebuild: the TYRE column gives 350 F Sport版 235/50R20 while 350 Overtrail版 and 200菁英版 both run 235/60R18, and 450h+ F Sport版 also runs 235/50R20. This is the verified basis for the F Sport maintenance premium."},{"name":"KingAutos - 2026 中型休旅車 Lexus NX 共11車款","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/nx","note":"VERIFIED FIRST-HAND, re-fetched this pass. Independent second confirmation of 2,630,000 for the 350 F Sport版, with the complete 11-trim 2026 table running 1,710,000 (200菁英版) to 2,845,000 (450h+ F Sport版), and 350 Overtrail版 at 2,340,000. Used to place the F Sport at the top of the gasoline ladder and to fix the Overtrail comparison."},{"name":"LEXUS TAIWAN 官方網站 - NX 車型頁","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/showroom/NX","note":"Official site. Publishes only the range NT$171~284.5萬 with no per-trim breakdown, which brackets 2,630,000 consistently but does not itself confirm the trim price. Not re-fetched this pass; the two price tables above were sufficient."},{"name":"KingAutos - 2022 Lexus NX 350 F Sport 規格","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/spec/9590","note":"VERIFIED FIRST-HAND, re-fetched this pass, AND CONTAINS ONE KNOWN ERROR. Correctly gives the 2022 launch list price 2,490,000, 279hp@6000rpm, 43.8 kgm, AWD, 8速手自排, and - newly used this pass - '20 吋鋁圈' with 235/50 front and rear, which independently corroborates the TVBS tyre spec. It states displacement '2487 cc', which is wrong for the 2.4 turbo. Trust this page for price, power and wheels, NOT for displacement; use the TVBS spec table (2393cc) instead. The 2,490,000 figure is the denominator for the year-3 retention ratio."},{"name":"PTT car 板 - [菜單] Lexus NX350 Fsport","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1762343970.A.687.html","note":"VERIFIED FIRST-HAND in the previous pass. Real dated purchase menu (posted 2025-11-05): 26年式 NX350 F Sport, 263萬 - 30萬 = 233萬 cash, excluding tax and registration, with a full accessory list. The page attributes the 30萬 to 和泰Pay points redemption, and a comment states L-brand high-end models need an insurance purchase plus points redemption to reach that depth - which is why discounts is set to 180,000 rather than 300,000. Not re-fetched this pass; the purchase block was not challenged by the review."},{"name":"PTT Web mirror - same NX350 F Sport 菜單 thread with comments","url":"https://www.pttweb.cc/bbs/car/M.1762343970.A.687","note":"Mirror of the same thread, retained for its reply text. NOT re-fetched - the ptt.cc original carried the comment content, so this entry is secondary."},{"name":"8891中古車 - Lexus NX 二手行情 (main listing pages, walked to page 5)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/nx","note":"VERIFIED FIRST-HAND and the single most important source in this record. 334 NX listings; pages 1 through 5 were walked this pass, which is how the ladder inversions were diagnosed and fixed. CURRENT-GENERATION NX350 F Sport age ladder recovered: 2024, 21,000 km, 高雄, 1,938,000; 2023, 20,000 km, 新北, 1,680,000 ('車況非常新 里程超少'). PREDECESSOR NX300 F Sport mileage ladder recovered: 2018 / 48,000 km / 938,000 (高雄), 2018 / 100,000 km / 858,000 (台中), 2018 / 200,000 km / 798,000 (高雄), 2020 / 75,000 km / 1,158,000 (台南). Other NX300 comparators: 2020 豪華版 36,000 km 1,152,000, 2020 頂級版 27,000 km 1,030,000, 2019 豪華版 11,100 km 1,098,000, 2020 豪華版 120,000 km 898,000. NX200t comparators: 2016 旗艦版 79,000 km 718,000, 2016 F Sport 138,000 km 699,000, 2016 豪華版 63,000 km 729,000, 2017 AWD F Sport 130,000 km 838,000, 2017 F Sport 129,800 km 679,000, 2015 AWD F Sport 190,000 km 638,000. ALL are 車商售價 dealer retail asking prices and were cut 12-15% to reach private sale."},{"name":"8891中古車 - Lexus NX350 model page","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/NX350","note":"VERIFIED FIRST-HAND this pass. Confirms that the 2023 NX350 F Sport版 2.4L, 20,000 km, 新北市 at 1,680,000 is the ONLY NX350 on this dedicated model page - i.e. current-generation NX350 supply in the Taiwanese used market is genuinely thin, which is why the year-1 and year-3 points lean on the wider NX inventory pages and why neither is rated better than medium confidence."},{"name":"8891中古車 - Lexus NX300 model page","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/NX300","note":"VERIFIED FIRST-HAND this pass. Predecessor-generation cross-check; confirmed the 2020 NX300 頂級版 27,000 km at 1,030,000 and the 2023 NX350 F Sport 20,000 km at 1,680,000 appearing consistently across pages."},{"name":"abc好車網 - 2025 Lexus NX 350 F Sport版 (LEXUS CPO 士林營業所)","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2254985","note":"VERIFIED FIRST-HAND, re-confirmed live this pass at 2,238,000. 2025 NX350 F Sport, LEXUS CPO 士林營業所, mileage not disclosed. CPO is the highest-priced channel in Taiwan and a private seller cannot offer it at all, so roughly 8% of CPO premium is stripped before the dealer-retail-to-private-sale haircut. No longer the sole basis of the 1-year checkpoint - the 8891 2024 and 2023 F Sport listings now bracket it."},{"name":"abc好車網 - 2024 LEXUS NX350 F Sport (2代), 高昇汽車","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2208096","note":"VERIFIED FIRST-HAND, re-confirmed live this pass at 2,330,000, 2024年, mileage not disclosed. EXCLUDED from every checkpoint. It sits above the newer 2025 CPO car at 2,238,000 AND nearly 400,000 above the mileage-disclosed 2024 car on 8891 at 1,938,000; both comparisons make it implausible as a market level rather than a sticky asking price."},{"name":"PChome 24h - 235/50R20 輪胎售價","url":"https://24h.pchome.com.tw/search/?q=235%2F50R20","note":"ADDED BY THIS PASS, VERIFIED FIRST-HAND. Real Taiwan retail for the F Sport's confirmed tyre size: MICHELIN Primacy 5 Energy 235/50R20 at 45,600 for four (11,400 each); GRIPMAX SureGrip Pro Sport at 6,650 each; PRINX XNEX SPORT EV at 5,700 each. This is the only sourced price in the entire maintenance section and it is what converts the '20-inch premium' from an assertion into a costed line: ~41,600 for a premium OE-grade set fitted at year 5 and ~45,000 at year 10."},{"name":"LEXUS TAIWAN 官方 - 保養計劃 (scheduled maintenance plan)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"VERIFIED FIRST-HAND, re-fetched this pass. Official interval table and the backbone of the maintenance model: 每 10,000 公里或 6 個月, with scopes at 1 month (24 items), 10,000 km / 6 months (16), 20,000 km / 12 months (29), 40,000 km / 24 months incl. brake fluid (34), 80,000 km / 48 months incl. coolant, transmission oil and fuel filter (37). Confirms the 1-month new-car service is FREE. Publishes NO prices and describes no ongoing complimentary scheduled-maintenance programme."},{"name":"LEXUS TAIWAN 官方 - 保證方案 (new car warranty)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx","note":"VERIFIED FIRST-HAND, re-fetched this pass, and it moved money. Base warranty 4 years or 120,000 km whichever comes first; 3-year paint/surface rust; 6-year rust perforation; 3-year 12V battery (free replacement to year 2, 50% to year 3); 3-year tyre manufacturing-defect cover; 4-year free towing. CRUCIALLY it also states a FREE extension to the 5th year / 140,000 km for owners who complete every scheduled visit on time (within 6 months) at authorised Lexus dealers, plus a paid extension option for cars under 48 months / 120,000 km. This is what removed the out-of-warranty allowance from the 3-to-5 window and made 5-to-7 the first uncovered window."},{"name":"LEXUS TAIWAN - 車主服務 (owner service) landing page","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/ownerservice","note":"VERIFIED FIRST-HAND in the previous pass, recorded as a NEGATIVE result. Checked specifically for a free scheduled-maintenance programme; exposes only navigation links (保證方案/延長保證, 保養計劃, 服務特色, 和泰點數, 零件與服務) with no figures. This is why maintenance beyond the free 1-month check is modelled as fully self-paid."},{"name":"SUM汽車網 - LEXUS NX 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=NX","note":"Second used-car platform carried from the prior draft for its 2024 NX350 F Sport, 21,289 km, 高雄市, 1,938,000 dealer retail. NOT re-fetched this pass - but that exact car was independently confirmed first-hand on 8891 (2024 NX350 F Sport, 21,000 km, 高雄, 1,938,000), so the data point is now first-hand and load-bearing for the year-1 and year-3 checkpoints."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 - Lexus 大改款 NX 車系國內正式發表","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/68870","note":"Generation-dating source: current NX (AZ20) pre-sold in Taiwan 16 Nov 2021 and launched Jan 2022, with NX350 offered as a single F Sport trim at 2,490,000 and an Overtrail added April 2024. Establishes that NO current-generation car can be 5, 7 or 10 years old today, forcing the predecessor extrapolation at those three checkpoints. NOT read first-hand - u-car.com.tw returns HTTP 403 to WebFetch and the search budget is exhausted. The 2,490,000 launch price is independently corroborated by kingautos spec 9590, which was fetched."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 - Lexus NX 200t 195萬起上市 (predecessor launch pricing)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/24947","note":"Predecessor original list prices used as the year-10 denominator: NX200t F Sport 2,110,000, AWD F Sport 2,220,000, 全景AWD F Sport 2,250,000, launched Dec 2014. NOT read first-hand - direct WebFetch returns HTTP 403 and the search budget is exhausted. This unverified denominator is a stated reason the year-10 checkpoint stays 'low' confidence."},{"name":"Mobile01 - Lexus 車主保養收據討論串 (attempted, FAILED)","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=741&t=6685459","note":"RECORDED AS A NEGATIVE RESULT, attempted again this pass. Mobile01 returns HTTP 403 Forbidden to direct fetch, and the session's web-search budget (200/200) is exhausted, so no owner-receipt route could be attempted by any path. This is why every maintenance labour rate is an unsourced build-up benchmarked against the Overtrail record rather than a sourced receipt, and why years 3 through 10 are all 'low' confidence."}]},"lexus-nx450h-plus-fsport":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. All checkpoints use the midpoint of 7,000 km/year, so assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). Two consequences drive this record. (1) Resale: the car is a genuine low-mileage example at every age, so it should sell above the mileage-blind average, and every used-price data point below was mileage-adjusted upward toward the low-km end of its listing band. (2) Maintenance: Lexus Taiwan's published service interval is 6 months OR 10,000 km, whichever comes first — VERIFIED directly against lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx, which lists 1 month (24-item), 6 months/10,000 km (16-item), 12 months/20,000 km (29-item), 24 months/40,000 km (34-item) and 48 months/80,000 km (37-item). At 7,000 km/year this owner is therefore entirely TIME-driven: ~20 workshop visits over 10 years for only 70,000 km, versus the 7 visits the mileage table alone would imply. Time-driven servicing costs materially MORE than the official per-100,000-km figure suggests, and this is reflected in the maintenance numbers. A PHEV amplifies this: short low-mileage trips run mostly in EV mode, so the engine accumulates very few hours but oil, brake fluid, coolant and the 12V AGM battery still degrade on the calendar. IMPORTANT FOR THIS TRIM: low mileage also means tyres and brake discs are replaced on AGE, not on wear — which is exactly why the F Sport's 20-inch fitment, not its engine, is what separates its maintenance bill from the 450h+ 豪華版's. Tax and insurance are excluded from this record by design. Home-charger (wallbox) installation, typically NT$30,000-60,000 for a PHEV owner, is also excluded — it is not one of the 領牌/代辦/配件 categories.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"UNCHANGED IN THIS REVIEW ROUND — the reviewer explicitly accepted the resale curve (71/59/48/40/25% of real_cost) as correctly the weakest in the NX line, and no new resale evidence was sought or found. EXTRAPOLATED from a single cross-trim, cross-powertrain anchor; confidence low, because no NX450h+ F Sport listing of any age exists in Taiwan and the only anchor is a different trim with a different powertrain. Anchor: SUM 汽車網 lists a 2025 NX200 with 12,115 km at NT$1,458,000 DEALER RETAIL asking against a NT$1,710,000 list = 85.3% dealer retail at ~1 year. Two downward adjustments reach the 450h+ F Sport: (a) top-trim penalty — the F Sport equipment premium over a 350h is largely not paid for by used buyers; (b) PHEV penalty — in the Taiwanese Lexus market retention runs hybrid > gasoline > PHEV, because most buyers live in apartments without home charging, so a used PHEV is bought as a heavy, complex hybrid with none of the charging benefit. Combined ~7 points, giving dealer retail at ~78.5% of list = NT$2,233,000. ADJUSTMENT TO PRIVATE SALE (the critical step): took 10% off that dealer-retail ASKING price to reach the private-sale figure of NT$2,010,000 — dealer retail includes warranty, reconditioning and dealer margin that a private seller cannot charge for. Held to the low end of the 8-15% haircut band at year 1 because a nearly-new, in-warranty, 7,000 km car is the easiest kind of private sale to make. Trade-in NT$1,760,000 is a further 12.4% below private sale. Low-mileage premium already included: 7,000 km is exceptional at 1 year. Arithmetic chain re-checked (2,845,000 x 0.785 = 2,233,000; x 0.90 = 2,010,000); private_sale_price is NOT a copied dealer asking price."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"UNCHANGED IN THIS REVIEW ROUND — resale was explicitly not re-opened. Best-evidenced checkpoint: two real Taiwan data sets bracket it from opposite sides. UPPER BOUND: abccar.com.tw lists two 2023 NX450h+ 豪華版 cars in the official LEXUS CPO network at NT$2,138,000 (Taichung) and NT$2,098,000 (Nangang); the Taichung listing was fetched and VERIFIED as a genuine 2023 NX 450h+ 豪華版 CPO listing at NT$2,138,000. But CPO asking prices are the highest band in the market — they carry an extended-warranty premium, are low-mileage lease/demo returns, and routinely sit unsold for months, so they are an asking-price ceiling and not a realisable private-sale price. LOWER BOUND: 8891 中古車 lists a 2023 NX350 F Sport with 20,000 km at NT$1,680,000 dealer retail, roughly 65.9% of its ~NT$2,550,000 2023 list — a direct, same-generation, same-F-Sport-trim, near-identical-mileage comparable. Base-trim cross-check: 8891 shows a 2023 NX200 at 29,000 km asking NT$1,298,000 = 75.9% dealer retail, confirming the F Sport ratio sits well BELOW the base trim's, exactly as the trim-ladder rule requires. I placed the 450h+ F Sport at ~64.4% dealer retail (NT$1,833,000), which sits BELOW the gasoline NX350 F Sport's 65.9% — the right side of the hybrid > gasoline > PHEV ordering; only the ABSOLUTE price is higher (NT$1,833,000 vs NT$1,680,000), because the car cost far more new. ADJUSTMENT TO PRIVATE SALE: took 10% off that dealer retail to reach NT$1,650,000. Trade-in NT$1,435,000 is a further 13.0% below private sale. Low-mileage premium applied: 21,000 km is roughly half what comparables of this age show."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"UNCHANGED IN THIS REVIEW ROUND — resale was explicitly not re-opened. EXPLICITLY EXTRAPOLATED — no genuine 5-year data exists. The current NX generation (AZ20) reached Taiwan in late 2021 and the NX450h+ only arrived mid-2022, so the oldest NX450h+ F Sport in Taiwan is about 3-4 years old. Method as instructed: took the PREDECESSOR generation's real used prices at this age, converted them to a retention ratio of that car's own original list price, then applied that ratio to this car's price. Predecessor data from 8891 中古車: a 2020 NX300 with 80,000 km asks NT$908,000 dealer retail against a ~NT$1,920,000 list = 47% at 6 years. Mileage-adjusting upward (our car has 35,000 km at 5 years, not 80,000 at 6) and interpolating back to 5 years gives ~55-57% dealer retail for a mid-trim gasoline predecessor. Then subtracted the top-trim penalty and the PHEV penalty — the latter reinforced here because at 5 years a used PHEV buyer starts pricing in high-voltage battery risk even though Hotai's coverage still runs to 8 years — landing at ~53.5% dealer retail (NT$1,522,000). ADJUSTMENT TO PRIVATE SALE: took 10.6% off dealer retail to reach NT$1,360,000. Trade-in NT$1,180,000 is a further 13.2% below. Chain verified (2,845,000 x 0.535 = 1,522,000; x 0.894 = 1,360,000). Confidence low because the ratio is transplanted from a gasoline predecessor, not observed on this car."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"UNCHANGED IN THIS REVIEW ROUND — resale was explicitly not re-opened. EXPLICITLY EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor generation — no 7-year data can exist for a model launched in Taiwan in 2022. Predecessor anchors from 8891 中古車, chosen because their mileage nearly matches our buyer's 49,000 km: a 2018 NX300 with 48,000 km asks NT$938,000 dealer retail against a NT$1,920,000 2018 list (carstuff.com.tw facelift price list) = 48.9% at 8 years at almost exactly our mileage. A 2017 NX300 F Sport with 90,000 km asks NT$908,000 against a NT$2,150,000 list = 42% — and the gap between that 42% and the 豪華版's 48.9% is direct observed evidence that the F Sport trim retains a LOWER ratio than the base trim in this exact model line, which is why the penalty was applied rather than assumed. Interpolating the 豪華版 ratio back from 8 to 7 years gives ~53%, minus the F Sport penalty (~6 points, per the observed 2017 gap) and a PHEV penalty (~3 points, since Hotai's 8-year HV battery coverage expires within a year of this checkpoint on the calendar) = ~44% dealer retail (NT$1,251,000). ADJUSTMENT TO PRIVATE SALE: took 10.5% off dealer retail to reach NT$1,120,000. Trade-in NT$970,000 is a further 13.4% below — the trade-in gap widens with age because dealers price in reconditioning and PHEV resale risk. Chain verified (2,845,000 x 0.44 = 1,252,000; x 0.895 = 1,120,000). Low-mileage premium is significant here: 49,000 km at 7 years is roughly half the market norm."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"UNCHANGED IN THIS REVIEW ROUND — resale was explicitly not re-opened; the reviewer confirmed the 25% of real_cost landing point is correctly the worst in the NX line. This checkpoint had already been corrected in an earlier round: the original researcher derived ~27.5% dealer retail, then wrote 'NT$782,000... reconciled to NT$867,000 dealer retail' with no stated basis and took 10% off that invented NT$867,000, so the published 'private sale' was numerically the DEALER RETAIL figure their own method produced — the classic dealer-retail trap. That step is withdrawn and the stated method applied as written. EXPLICITLY EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor generation — the most uncertain checkpoint in this record. Predecessor anchors from 8891 中古車, all first-generation NX: a 2016 NX200t with 79,000 km asks NT$718,000 at the top of its NT$558,000-718,000 band, against a NT$1,950,000 2015 list (u-car launch price list) = 36.8% dealer retail at 10 years at close to our 70,000 km; a 2017 NX200t with 110,000 km asks NT$668,000 = 34% at 9 years but at far higher mileage; a 2015 NX200t with 100,000 km asks NT$558,000 = 28.6% at 11 years. Taking the mileage-matched 2016 car's 36.8%, applying the F Sport top-trim penalty (~5 points, per the observed 2017 F Sport vs 豪華版 gap) and a LARGER PHEV penalty than at earlier checkpoints (~5 points) gives ~27.5% dealer retail = NT$782,000. ADJUSTMENT TO PRIVATE SALE: 10% off that dealer-retail asking price = NT$704,000. Trade-in NT$600,000 is a further 14.7% below private sale, the widest gap in the table, because dealers are the most exposed to battery risk. Sanity check against the predecessor: our 10-year PHEV flagship at NT$704,000 private sits above a 10-year base NX200t's implied ~NT$646,000 private in ABSOLUTE terms (it cost far more new) while retaining a far lower RATIO (25.0% of real_cost vs 36.8% for the base car) — internally consistent with both the trim-ladder and powertrain rules. The enlarged PHEV penalty is the key judgement: by year 10 the Hotai HV battery coverage (5yr/100,000 km plus the 3yr/60,000 km extension = 8 years/160,000 km, per lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx) has expired on TIME, since 70,000 km is nowhere near the km cap. A 10-year-old PHEV with an out-of-coverage traction pack is a hard private sale in Taiwan — buyers discount heavily against a potential NT$300,000+ pack replacement, and many simply refuse the car. Confidence low: transplanted ratio, gasoline predecessor, plus a battery-risk adjustment that is judgement rather than observation."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"RAISED from NT$9,500 to NT$13,000, now set EQUAL to the NX450h+ 豪華版 record. Basis: 風傳媒's Lexus NX 養車成本 table, re-fetched and read in this round, prices 'NX 450h+ Luxury' and 'NX 450h+ F Sport' at the SAME NT$64,350 for 10 services / 100,000 km — scheduled servicing on the Lexus TW menu is set by powertrain, not equipment grade, so the F Sport cannot be cheaper to service than the 豪華版. The old NT$9,500 came from a different and uncited unit-cost basis and was the single largest contributor to the impossible direction the reviewer flagged. Build-up, identical to the sibling record: two paid visits in year 1 (the 1-month check is free), priced off PTT NX200 low-mileage receipts at the same ~7,000 km/year profile (4,394 + 9,406 = 13,800), trimmed ~15% to ~11,700 because that poster accepted every dealer recommendation and is an upper bound, then uplifted 10% for PHEV content (風傳媒's own NX350h 58,350 -> NX450h+ 64,350 ratio) = ~12,900, booked 13,000. Interval structure from the official lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx table (6 months OR 10,000 km, whichever first). Medium: official schedule, real receipts for a lower trim, no NX450h+ receipt."},{"y":3,"source":"RAISED from NT$23,000 to NT$32,000, again set EQUAL to the NX450h+ 豪華版 record for the same reason: 風傳媒's table gives the two PHEV trims the identical NT$64,350 scheduled bill, so there is no basis for pricing the F Sport's routine visits below its cheaper sibling's. Covers years 1-3 only (not cumulative). Four visits on the official 6-month clock, one of them the 24-month 34-item service that adds brake fluid. Build-up: ~NT$7,300 average per visit at real-world dealer billing x 4 = ~NT$29,000, + 10% PHEV content uplift = ~NT$32,000. Brake fluid is the clean illustration of the time-driven model — hygroscopic, so replaced on the 24-month schedule even though the car has covered only 21,000 km against a 40,000 km trigger. Cross-check: cumulative years 0-3 is NT$45,000 against 風傳媒's NT$64,350 for a full 100,000 km / 10 services, consistent with the 48-month major falling in the next window. Medium, same basis as year 1."},{"y":5,"source":"RAISED from NT$78,000 to NT$95,000 and re-itemised so the components sum exactly (39,000 + 47,000 + 9,000 = 95,000). This is the window where the F Sport premium first lands, and it is now sized from verified prices rather than asserted. TYRE SIZE VERIFIED: the 2026 cars.tvbs.com.tw NX spec table was re-fetched and its 輪胎規格 row read trim by trim — 450h+ F Sport版 = 235/50R20 while 450h+豪華版 = 235/60R18, so the two PHEV trims genuinely differ by two rim sizes. TYRE PRICE VERIFIED: PChome 24h currently lists 235/50R20 MICHELIN PRIMACY 5 Energy at NT$45,600 for four (NT$11,400 each), against 235/60R18 MICHELIN PRIMACY 5 at NT$20,155 for four (NT$5,039 each) — a NT$25,445 per-set gap inside one tyre line. Booked at NT$47,000 (retail set plus fitting, balancing and alignment), i.e. +NT$17,000 over the sibling's NT$30,000, which is deliberately less than the full retail gap because the sibling's figure is a Lexus-channel price and this one is independent-channel. Replacement is AGE-driven, not wear-driven: 35,000 km leaves plenty of tread, but 5-year-old rubber is replaced on safety grounds, so the low-mileage buyer gets no relief from this line at all. Scheduled portion NT$39,000 held identical to the 豪華版 per the 風傳媒 equal-pricing finding, covering four visits including the 48-month 37-item major. 12V AGM NT$9,000 — a PHEV-specific part (AGM rather than flooded) that short EV-mode trips are hard on, 4-6 year life. Medium: tyre size and tyre price are directly verified, scheduled costs are receipt-derived for a lower trim."},{"y":7,"source":"RAISED from NT$55,000 to NT$63,000, itemisation summing exactly (34,000 + 13,000 + 6,000 + 10,000 = 63,000). Scheduled portion NT$34,000 set equal to the 450h+ 豪華版's per the 風傳媒 equal-pricing finding; the old NT$26,000 figure understated it. Brakes: the reviewer argued the F Sport carries a brake-consumable premium, and I only partly accept it. Both the 2026 TVBS spec table and the KingAutos NX table list 前後碟煞 for every NX trim with no rotor or caliper differentiation, and no Taiwan source shows F Sport-specific brake hardware on the AZ20 NX — so the front pad-and-disc line is the 豪華版's NT$12,000 plus a token NT$1,000 for the 20-inch package and F Sport pad spec, not a hardware premium. The job lands here rather than earlier because regenerative braking means the friction brakes have done very little work in 49,000 km; what forces the change is disc corrosion and pitting from underuse in Taiwan's humidity, a well-documented low-mileage hybrid problem. Coolant covers both the engine circuit and the separate inverter/HV loop that the official table flags for hybrids. The car is out of the 4-year warranty here while HV battery cover still runs to year 8, so a dedicated high-voltage inspection line appears. Low: the repair, HV-inspection and brake lines are estimates, not quoted figures — no published Lexus TW price list covers post-warranty PHEV servicing. Note this window is LOWER than years 3-5 by design: the tyre set and 12V battery fall in that earlier window and do not recur here."},{"y":10,"source":"RAISED from NT$145,000 to NT$160,000, itemisation summing exactly (54,000 + 49,000 + 15,000 + 9,000 + 18,000 + 15,000 = 160,000). Longest window (3 years, ~6 visits on the verified 6-month clock) and the most expensive. Scheduled portion NT$54,000 set equal to the 450h+ 豪華版's per the 風傳媒 equal-pricing finding. Second 235/50R20 set at NT$49,000 versus the sibling's NT$32,000 for 235/60R18 — the same verified PChome price gap as at year 5, allowing for inflation, and again triggered by rubber age rather than tread at 70,000 km. Rear pads and discs NT$15,000 = the 豪華版's NT$14,000 plus the same token NT$1,000 for the 20-inch package (no evidence of larger F Sport brake hardware, see the year-7 note). Second 12V AGM NT$9,000. The traction battery is the dominant uncertainty: Hotai's cover (5yr/100,000 km plus the 3yr/60,000 km extension) expires on TIME at year 8 with the car at only ~56,000 km, so the NT$18,000 line is health testing and partial remediation ONLY. A full pack replacement is deliberately NOT baked in — it is not a probable event on Toyota/Lexus hardware at 70,000 km, and at this age it would cost more than the car's residual value (private_sale_price NT$704,000), so in practice it triggers a sale rather than a repair. If the pack does fail the figure rises by NT$300,000 or more, the single largest tail risk in this record. Low confidence by construction: no receipts for a 10-year-old NX450h+ can exist, since the model is only about 4 years old in Taiwan."}],"sources":[{"name":"風傳媒 風生活 — Lexus NX 養車成本完整解析","url":"https://www.storm.mg/lifestyle/11068074","note":"RE-FETCHED AND RE-READ IN THIS ROUND — the decisive source for the maintenance correction. Scheduled servicing over 10 services / 100,000 km (每半年或每行駛1萬公里): NX200 53,670; NX350h 58,350; NX350 Overtrail 63,190 and NX350 F Sport 63,190; NX450h+ Luxury 64,350 and NX450h+ F Sport 64,350. TWO FINDINGS: (1) the two 450h+ trims are priced IDENTICALLY, exactly as the two NX350 trims are — Lexus TW scheduled servicing is priced by powertrain, not equipment grade, so the F Sport's scheduled cost was set equal to the 豪華版's at every checkpoint; (2) the 450h+ (64,350) is dearer to service than the gasoline NX350 F Sport (63,190), confirming the PHEV must not be modelled as the cheaper car. The article states the table is 僅供參考 and that it covers scheduled consumables only — tyres, brake friction parts and the 12V battery are NOT in it, which is where the F Sport's real premium lives."},{"name":"地球黃金線 (TVBS) — 2026 Lexus NX 規格配備價格表","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/lexus/2026-lexus-nx","note":"RE-FETCHED IN THIS ROUND for the 輪胎規格 row specifically. Tyre size per trim: 200菁英版 235/60R18, 200豪華版 235/60R18, 350h豪華版 235/60R18, 350h頂級版 235/50R20, 350 Overtail版 235/60R18, 450h+豪華版 235/60R18, 350h旗艦版 235/50R20, 350 F Sport版 235/50R20, 450h+ F Sport版 235/50R20. This is the direct evidence that the two PHEV trims differ by two rim sizes and is the basis of the whole maintenance delta. The same table lists 前後碟煞 for every trim with NO rotor or caliper differentiation, which is why no F Sport brake-hardware premium was applied. Also the primary list-price confirmation: 9-trim lineup topping out at 450h+ F Sport版 NT$2,845,000, with no 450h+ 旗艦版 in Taiwan."},{"name":"PChome 24h 購物 — 235/50R20 輪胎售價 (F Sport 配胎尺寸)","url":"https://24h.pchome.com.tw/search/?q=235/50R20","note":"FETCHED IN THIS ROUND. Live Taiwan retail for the F Sport's OE size: MICHELIN PRIMACY 5 Energy NT$45,600 for four (NT$11,400 each); GRIPMAX SureGrip Pro Sport NT$26,600 for four (NT$6,650 each); PRINX XNEX SPORT EV NT$22,800 for four (NT$5,700 each). Most listings bundle fitting. The Michelin figure is the like-for-like anchor for the NT$47,000 / NT$49,000 tyre sets booked at years 5 and 10, since an OE-grade premium tyre is the realistic choice on a NT$2.8M Lexus."},{"name":"PChome 24h 購物 — 235/60R18 輪胎售價 (450h+ 豪華版 配胎尺寸)","url":"https://24h.pchome.com.tw/search/?q=235/60R18","note":"FETCHED IN THIS ROUND as the comparison leg. Same market, same day: MICHELIN PRIMACY 5 NT$20,155 for four (NT$5,039 each); MICHELIN PILOT SPORT 4 SUV NT$21,357 for four; NANKANG SP-9 NT$18,000 for four; VREDESTEIN ULTRAC+ NT$19,950 for four including fitting and alignment. Within the same Michelin Primacy 5 line the 20-inch set costs NT$25,445 MORE than the 18-inch set — the hard number behind the +NT$17,000 per set booked for this trim, which is therefore the conservative end of the evidence."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官網 — 定期保養計畫","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"VERIFIED (fetched 2026-08-11). Official service schedule: 1 month (24-item, complimentary), 6 months/10,000 km (16-item), 12 months/20,000 km (29-item), 24 months/40,000 km (34-item, brake fluid + transmission fluid), 48 months/80,000 km (37-item, coolant + fuel filter), whichever comes first. Basis for the time-driven servicing model: ~20 visits in 10 years at 7,000 km/year. Confirms only the 1-month visit is free."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官網 — 車主權益 / 保固條款","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx","note":"VERIFIED (fetched 2026-08-11). New-car warranty 4 years/120,000 km whichever first; HV battery 5yr/100,000 km factory plus Hotai extension 3yr/60,000 km = 8yr/160,000 km; Elite Rewards 1.5% points rebate. Both caps bind on TIME at this mileage. Confirms NO free scheduled maintenance beyond the 1-month inspection."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官網 — NX Showroom","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/showroom/NX","note":"VERIFIED (fetched 2026-08-11). Official source. States the NX range as NT$171~284.5萬; the upper bound is exactly NT$2,845,000 and the lower bound exactly matches the NX200菁英版, reconciling end to end with the TVBS table. Re-fetched in this round for wheel/tyre data but the showroom page carries no spec table — it points to a downloadable 型錄 — so the tyre sizes come from TVBS instead."},{"name":"KingAutos 國王車訊 — Lexus NX 全車系","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/nx","note":"FETCHED IN THIS ROUND (it had been unverified before). Corroborates the price ladder including 450h+ F Sport版 284.5萬, 350 F Sport版 263萬 and 450h+豪華版 237.5萬, and likewise shows 前後碟煞 for all trims with no F Sport brake differentiation. CAVEAT: it is a multi-model-year hub page — it lists 11 trims including 250豪華版/250頂級版 that are not in the 2026 table — and the tyre size it returned for 450h+豪華版 (20-inch) conflicts with the 2026-specific TVBS row (235/60R18). The TVBS row is used, because its 9-trim lineup matches the official showroom price band exactly and it is the 2026 table."},{"name":"tiresize.com — Lexus NX 450h+ F Sport tyre specification","url":"https://tiresize.com/tires/Lexus/NX/2023/450h+-F-Sport/","note":"VERIFIED (fetched 2026-08-11). Independent second confirmation that Lexus equips the NX 450h+ F Sport with 235/50R20, agreeing with the TVBS 2026 row."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2023 Lexus NX 450h+ 豪華版 (LEXUS CPO 台中)","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2135929","note":"VERIFIED (fetched 2026-08-11). Genuine 2023 Lexus NX 450h+ 豪華版 CPO listing in Taichung asking NT$2,138,000. Rare direct NX450h+ used data point. Treated as an asking-price CEILING, not a realisable private-sale price. Not re-examined in this round (resale untouched)."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [菜單] Lexus NX-450H+ (2024/11)","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1731849837.A.485.html","note":"VERIFIED (fetched 2026-08-11). Real transaction sheet, NX450h+ 豪華版: 現金折 NT$140,000, final NT$2,235,000. Explicitly records 是否含領牌稅金：否 and 是否含保險：否, confirming on-road fees are additive to the quoted cash price. Year-end clearance on the volume trim."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — NX200 低里程車主保養單據 (7,000 km/年)","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1732168522.A.98C.html","note":"Owner receipts at almost exactly this buyer's mileage profile: 首保 0 / 0.5年 4,394 / 1年 9,406 / 1.5年 8,122 / 2年 15,230, with the poster stating he accepted every dealer recommendation (沒刪單). Used as the UPPER bound for per-visit scheduled cost, trimmed ~15% for an owner who declines upsells and then uplifted 10% for PHEV content per the 風傳媒 NX350h-to-NX450h+ ratio. This is the same basis the NX450h+ 豪華版 record uses, which is what makes the two PHEV trims' scheduled figures directly comparable. Cited from the sibling record; not independently re-fetched in this round."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus NX 二手車行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/nx","note":"Core used-price data (all DEALER RETAIL asking prices, adjusted down 10-10.6% for private sale). The index URL is real but individual listings rotate and are not separately addressable, so the specific cars quoted could not be re-verified. Current gen: 2023 NX350 F Sport 20,000 km NT$1,680,000; 2023 NX200 29,000 km NT$1,298,000. Predecessor gen: 2020 NX300 80,000 km NT$908,000; 2018 NX300 48,000 km NT$938,000; 2017 NX300 F Sport 90,000 km NT$908,000; 2016 NX200t 79,000 km NT$558,000-718,000; 2015 NX200t 100,000 km NT$558,000."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — Lexus NX 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=NX","note":"Second used-market source. Not re-verified; listings rotate. Key 1-year anchor: 2025 NX200 12,115 km NT$1,458,000 dealer retail. Also 2024 NX200 豪華版 26,646 km NT$1,338,000; 2023 NX200 豪華版 48,760 km NT$1,378,000; 2022 NX200 豪華版 30,307 km NT$1,239,000."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2023 Lexus NX 450h+ 豪華版 (LEXUS CPO 南港)","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2142965","note":"Second NX450h+ CPO listing, asking NT$2,098,000 at 3 years. Not individually re-verified, but the sibling Taichung listing on the same site WAS verified, corroborating the CPO ceiling band of NT$2.10-2.14M."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 — 小改款 Lexus NX 全車系正式發表 (152萬起)","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/23948-152-lexus-nx.html","note":"Predecessor-generation Taiwan price list used as the denominator for 7- and 10-year retention ratios: NX300 豪華版 NT$1,920,000, NX300 F SPORT NT$2,150,000, NX300 旗艦版 NT$2,330,000, NX300h F SPORT NT$2,490,000. Not re-verified."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — Lexus NX 200t 195萬起上市","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/24947","note":"First-generation NX Taiwan launch prices (NX200t 豪華版 NT$1,950,000 up to 全景旗艦 NT$2,250,000). Denominator for the 10-year retention ratio. Not re-verified."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 2024年式 Lexus NX 車系售價調整 (漲幅8~11萬)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/74010","note":"COULD NOT BE VERIFIED — fetch returns HTTP 403. Cited to establish that 2024 model-year NX prices rose NT$80,000-110,000, hence a 2023 450h+ 豪華版 list of ~NT$2,290,000 used as the CPO retention denominator. Treat that denominator as unconfirmed; it affects only the 3-year CPO ceiling commentary, not any published number."},{"name":"8891 新車 — 2023年式 Lexus NX 養車成本","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/lexus/nx/15916","note":"Cross-check on maintenance costs by powertrain. Not re-verified; the primary maintenance anchor is the re-read 風傳媒 table."},{"name":"8891 汽車 — Lexus NX 2024 價格","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/feature/1043","note":"Cited as confirming the 2024 450h+ band of NT$2,375,000 (豪華版) to NT$2,845,000 (F Sport版), i.e. the F Sport price has been stable since the 2024 model year. Not re-verified."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [菜單] NX450h+ (2024/06)","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1719193052.A.C49.html","note":"Second transaction sheet, NX450h+ 豪華版: 現金折 NT$45,000, final NT$2,330,000. Lower bound of the observed discount range. Not re-verified; the Nov 2024 sibling sheet WAS verified."},{"name":"KingAutos — Lexus NX450h+ 273萬 試駕報導","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/341198","note":"Records the NX450h+ top-trim launch price of ~NT$2,730,000 in Taiwan, corroborating the pre-2024 price level. Not re-verified."}]},"lexus-rx350-premium":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. Checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). Two consequences run through the record. (1) Resale: every used listing found sits at or above normal mileage for its age (the 2023 RX350 頂級版 on 8891 shows 42,000 km at 3 years = ~14,000 km/yr), so an explicit low-mileage uplift is applied to the observed DEALER ASKING price before converting down to a private-sale figure — roughly +5% at year 3, +7% at year 5, +9% at year 7, +16% at year 10. (2) Maintenance: Lexus Taiwan's published interval is '每 6 個月或 10,000 公里，以先到者為準' (verified on lexus.com.tw 保養計劃 2026-08-11). At 7,000 km/yr the buyer NEVER reaches the 10,000 km trigger, so servicing is purely TIME-driven at 2 dealer visits per year — note this is semi-annual, not annual: the official page governs, and skipping a visit forfeits the free 5th-year warranty extension. Late-life cost is therefore dominated by age-perishing consumables (tyres, 12V battery, coolant, brake fluid, rubber bushings) rather than by mileage wear.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"Anchored on 準新車 supply and bounded above by the new-car transaction price. Dealer retail for a 1-year 頂級版 is put at ~2,280,000: it cannot go higher because a brand-new one transacts at 2,380,000 車價 after the verified 30萬 discount, but it is supported above the usual 1-year level by the long factory delivery wait (菜單 quotes 交車 9月底, verified), which makes immediate-delivery near-new cars scarce. DEALER-ASK ADJUSTMENT: cut 13% from that dealer asking level to reach private sale 1,980,000, then a further 12% to dealer trade-in 1,740,000. The buyer's 7,000 km is well under the ~14,000 km a 1-year car normally shows, which is why the figure holds at the top of the near-new band. AUDIT NOTE: this is the most optimistic point on the curve — it implies a year-2 dealer-ask retention of ~79.8% of list, only ~1 point under the (unverified) 豪華版 datapoint, so the trim ladder is tight here. Kept because it is internally consistent with the verified year-3 anchor and hard-capped by the new-car transaction price, but it is the number most exposed if delivery waits shorten."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"Best-evidenced point in the record. I RE-FETCHED https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/RX350 on 2026-08-11 and personally confirmed: 2023 RX350 頂級版, 42,000 km, dealer asking 1,898,000 (東威, 台北) — exactly 3 years old, exact trim. Also present and confirmed: 2024 旗艦版 31,200 km asking 2,198,000 and 2024 F Sport 39,900 km asking 2,198,000. NOT FOUND on re-fetch: the '2024 頂級版 32,000 km 1,998,000' corroborator the original record cited (listings rotate, so this is unverified rather than disproven). ADJUSTMENTS, in order: (a) 1,898,000 is 車商售價 (dealer retail ask), NOT what an owner receives; (b) the buyer's 21,000 km is half the listed car's 42,000 km, so the equivalent dealer-retail level for a low-mileage example is raised ~5% to ~1,990,000; (c) cut 13.5% to reach private sale 1,720,000 — that is 9.4% below the actually-observed 1,898,000 ask, inside the brief's 8-15% band; (d) cut a further 12% to dealer trade-in 1,510,000. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED high→medium in audit: it rests on ONE verified listing of the exact trim, and the private-sale figure itself is modelled, not observed. 'Several real listings' is not met."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — the current RX generation only launched in Taiwan in late 2022, so no genuine 5-year current-gen car exists in August 2026. Method per brief: take the PREDECESSOR gasoline RX at this age (2021 RX300 頂級版, original list 2,440,000), express its real used price as a retention ratio of its OWN original list, then apply that ratio to this car's real_cost. Observed predecessor level ~1,468,000 dealer retail → 1,468,000/2,440,000 = 60.2%; raised ~7% for the buyer's 35,000 km against the ~65,000 km a typical 5-year car carries → ~64% dealer-retail retention; converted to private sale at −13.5% → ~55.5%; shaded UP ~2 points because the 2.4T 5th-gen RX is a materially stronger used proposition than the widely-criticised 2.0T RX300, and shaded DOWN for the trim-ladder effect (the 268萬 頂級版 retains a lower percentage than the 244萬 reference car). Net ~59% × real_cost 2,421,000 → 1,430,000; trade-in a further 12.6% below. AUDIT CAVEAT: the 2,440,000 denominator comes from a U-CAR article that returns HTTP 403 and could NOT be page-verified — see sources[]. Confidence correctly 'low'."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no 7-year current-gen car exists. Predecessor: 2019 RX300 頂級版, original list 2,440,000. I re-fetched https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx300 on 2026-08-11 and confirmed a 2019 RX300 F Sport asking 1,088,000 at 119,000 km; the other RX300 listings the original record cited were not present on re-fetch (inventory rotates). Took ~1,280,000 dealer retail at ~85,000 km as the typical 頂級版 case = 52.5% of its original list; raised ~9% for the buyer's 49,000 km versus that 85,000 km → ~57% dealer retail; converted to private sale at −13.5% → ~49%; shaded down ~1 point for the trim-ladder effect since the target car listed 24萬 above the reference car. Net ~47.9% × real_cost 2,421,000 → 1,160,000. Trade-in a further 12.9% below — a deliberately wider spread than at year 1 because dealers discount older stock harder. AUDIT CAVEAT: the 2,440,000 denominator is from a 403-blocked U-CAR page and is NOT page-verified. Confidence correctly 'low'."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no 10-year current-gen car exists. Predecessor: 2016 RX200t 頂級版 (4th-gen launch trim, original list 2,390,000). I VERIFIED https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1959676 on 2026-08-11: a real 2016 RX200t 頂級版 asking 788,000. REVISED DOWN IN AUDIT from the original record's 890,000. The original took ~920,000 as the typical dealer-retail case, above the only 10-year 頂級版 listing I could actually verify (788,000); its 1,165,000 companion listing was not re-verified. I therefore used a more conservative ~870,000 typical dealer retail = 36.4% of the 2,390,000 original list; applied a +16% low-mileage uplift (trimmed from the original's +18% — the buyer's 70,000 km at 10 years is genuinely exceptional, under half a normal odometer, but +18% was the largest uplift on the curve and rested on the weakest evidence) → ~42.2% dealer retail; converted to private sale at −13.5% → ~36.5%; shaded down ~1 point for the trim-ladder effect, which bites hardest at extreme age as expensive equipment grades converge toward the base car's money. Net ~35.5% × real_cost 2,421,000 → 860,000. Trade-in a further 13.4% below (745,000) — the widest spread on the curve, since a 10-year-old car is marginal trade-in stock. AUDIT CAVEAT: the 2,390,000 denominator is from a U-CAR page that returns HTTP 403 and is NOT page-verified."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Interval and stages from Lexus TW 保養計劃 (https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx), fetched and verified 2026-08-11. Two time-driven visits in year 1 because 7,000 km never reaches the 10,000 km trigger. Costs modelled at Lexus TW dealer rates; the 1-month check is complimentary (officially confirmed). Fully inside the 4yr/120,000km factory warranty, so no repair spend assumed."},{"y":3,"source":"Cost since the year-1 checkpoint (1-3y window): 4 time-driven visits over 2 years at the 每6個月 interval, alternating ~5,500 minor and ~10,000-11,000 major, plus wipers. Interval structure from the verified Lexus TW 保養計劃; the 24個月/40,000km stage is reached on TIME at only 21,000 km. Still inside factory warranty, so no unplanned repair cost included."},{"y":5,"source":"Cost since year 3 (3-5y window). REVISED DOWN IN AUDIT from 100,000 — the original placed a full 46,000 tyre set at exactly year 5, but at 7,000 km/yr the car has only 35,000 km here and usable tread remains, so the set is moved to year 6 (see the 5-7y checkpoint and plan_notes). What genuinely falls due in this window is 4 scheduled visits plus the first age-driven consumables: front pads at 35,000 km of gentle use, and the 12V battery, whose 3-5 year life is consistent with Lexus TW's own 3-year battery warranty (verified). Year 5 is the last year of cover under the free 年5/14萬km warranty extension, which the buyer earns by having made every 6-month visit."},{"y":7,"source":"Cost since year 5 (5-7y window). REVISED UP IN AUDIT from 52,000 — this window now carries the first tyre set, moved here from year 5. Justification is physical, not cosmetic: at 7,000 km/yr the set reaches ~42,000 km at year 6, which is where a 20-inch premium tyre is genuinely finished on BOTH counts (tread near its limit and rubber 6 years old); replacing at year 5 / 35,000 km was early. This is also the first window entirely OUTSIDE warranty — the free extension expires at year 5 / 140,000 km — so a modest self-funded repair allowance is included. Service count and interval from the verified Lexus TW 保養計劃; warranty end from the verified 保證方案 (https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx)."},{"y":10,"source":"Cost since year 7 (7-10y window, 3 years — the longest period, and out of warranty throughout, which is why it is the largest). REVISED IN AUDIT from 160,000. NO tyre set is booked here: with the first set fitted at year 6, the second falls due around year 11 and lands OUTSIDE the 10-year horizon (at year 10 that set is 4 years old with only ~28,000 km on it). The out-of-warranty ageing allowance is raised to 30,000 in compensation, since at 70,000 km nothing is worn out by mileage and essentially all risk here is calendar-driven. STATED BOUNDARY ASSUMPTION: if the owner replaces tyres at the 10-year mark instead of year 11, add ~48,000 to this figure — that single timing call is the largest swing factor in the maintenance table. Genuinely uncertain: no owner receipts obtained, so this is a build-up from Lexus TW parts and labour norms, not observed data."}],"sources":[{"name":"8891 新車頻道 — 2026年式 Lexus RX 國內上架，售價不變","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/lexus/rx/20732","note":"PRIMARY price source. RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED BY AUDIT 2026-08-11. Full 2026 RX Taiwan lineup, 10 trims: RX350 豪華版 246萬 / 頂級版 268萬 / 旗艦版 295萬 / F Sport 295萬; RX350h 256萬 / 278萬 / 305萬; RX450h+ 315萬 / 355萬; RX500h F Sport Performance 361萬. Confirms 售價維持不變 vs prior model year. list_price of 2,680,000 confirmed at 0% deviation."},{"name":"PTT car 板 菜單 — LEXUS RX350 頂級版 (Oct 2025)","url":"https://www.pttweb.cc/bbs/car/M.1760578592.A.CFE","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED BY AUDIT 2026-08-11. Real deal sheet: '268W-30W(折扣)', 成交總價 242.1萬, 代辦領牌 實報實銷, 交車 9月底. real_cost reproduces the 242.1萬 exactly. CAVEAT surfaced in audit: this is a 2025年式 car built June 2025, so part of the 30萬 is old-stock clearance rather than a standing incentive."},{"name":"PTT car 板 菜單 — RX350 頂級版 (Oct 2025)","url":"https://www.pttweb.cc/bbs/car/M.1761380792.A.FF6","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED BY AUDIT 2026-08-11. Second independent deal, and the decisive one: explicitly a 2026年式 頂級版 (white), 牌價 268萬 → 成交 238萬, i.e. ~300,000 discount on a CURRENT-model-year car. This is what makes the discount defensible against the brief's 'Lexus discounts little' instruction."},{"name":"PTT car 板 菜單 — Lexus RX350 汽油頂級 25年產26年式 (Jan 2026)","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1768195382.A.B1F.html","note":"Third deal, cited by the original researcher: 268萬 − 31萬 = 237萬 車價. NOT re-fetched in audit — treat as supporting, not load-bearing. Note it is a '25年產26年式' car, so it carries the same old-stock caveat."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX350 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/RX350","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED BY AUDIT 2026-08-11. Confirmed present: 2023 RX350 頂級版 42,000 km asking 1,898,000 (the year-3 anchor, exact trim); 2024 旗艦版 31,200 km asking 2,198,000; 2024 F Sport 39,900 km asking 2,198,000. NOT PRESENT on re-fetch: the '2024 頂級版 32,000 km 1,998,000' and '2024 豪華版 1,988,000' datapoints the original record relied on for its trim-ladder proof — unverified rather than disproven, since inventory rotates. All figures are 車商售價 (dealer retail ask) and were adjusted down before use."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX300 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx300","note":"Predecessor-generation gasoline RX, used for the year-5 and year-7 extrapolations. RE-FETCHED BY AUDIT 2026-08-11: only the 2019 RX300 F Sport at 1,088,000 / 119,000 km was still confirmable. The other RX300 listings the original record cited (2020 豪華版 1,238,000; 2020 F Sport 1,328,000; 2021 F Sport 1,398,000) were not present on re-fetch — inventory on this page is now thin, which is itself a reason the tail is 'low' confidence."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — Lexus RX300 中古車價格","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&b=38&m=1512","note":"Larger RX300 sample cited by the original researcher for the year-5/year-7 curve (53 cars, 平均車價 1,263,000; 2019 cars 1,180,000-1,350,000 at 61,503-92,000 km). NOT re-fetched in audit — treat as supporting only."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2016 Lexus RX200t 頂級版 中古車 78.8萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1959676","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED BY AUDIT 2026-08-11: genuine 2016 Lexus RX200t 頂級版 asking 788,000. This is the ONLY 10-year 頂級版 datapoint I could confirm, and it is why the year-10 figure was revised DOWN from 890,000 to 860,000 — the original record's '~920,000 typical' sat above the only verifiable listing."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2016 Lexus RX200t 頂級版 中古車 116.5萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1483218","note":"Same trim and year at the high end, cited by the original researcher. NOT re-verified in audit; given less weight than the 788,000 listing above when setting the year-10 typical level."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 第四代 Lexus RX 車系國內正式發表，入門售價219萬起","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/27742","note":"Source for the year-10 reference car's original list (2016 RX200t 豪華版 219萬 / 頂級版 239萬 / 旗艦版 259萬). AUDIT RESULT: direct fetch returns HTTP 403 — I could NOT page-verify it either. The original record described only the 2019 article as 403; in fact BOTH U-CAR articles are unfetchable. The 219萬 entry price appears in the article title, but the per-trim split remains unverified, and 2,390,000 is the denominator for the year-10 checkpoint."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 小改款 Lexus RX 車系 227萬起開賣","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/48918","note":"Source for the year-5/year-7 reference car's original list (2019 facelift RX300 豪華版 227萬 / 頂級版 244萬 / 旗艦版 and F Sport 264萬). AUDIT RESULT: direct fetch returns HTTP 403, confirming the original record's own caveat. The 227萬 entry price appears in the article title, but 2,440,000 — the denominator for TWO checkpoints — is not page-verified."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 保證方案 / 延長保證","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx","note":"OFFICIAL. RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED BY AUDIT 2026-08-11. New-car warranty 4 years / 120,000 km; free extension to 第5年 / 14萬公里 conditional on punctual semi-annual servicing, forfeited by missing even one visit; battery 3 years; tyres 3 years; paint/rust 3 years; body perforation 6 years. CRITICALLY, it states free scheduled maintenance is NOT included and must be purchased separately — this confirms the original record's judgement not to model any free-servicing programme, converting an open question into a settled fact."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 保養計劃","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"OFFICIAL. RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED BY AUDIT 2026-08-11. Service interval 每6個月或10,000公里以先到者為準, stages at 1個月 (complimentary new-car check), 6個月, 12個月/20,000km, 24個月/40,000km, 48個月/80,000km. Establishes that at 7,000 km/yr servicing is TIME-driven at 2 visits per year — semi-annual, not the annual cadence the brief assumes. Publishes NO per-service prices, which is why every maintenance money figure is modelled and capped at medium confidence."},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 — 2026 Lexus RX 規格配備","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/lexus/2026-lexus-rx","note":"Cited by the original researcher to confirm 頂級版 exists as a distinct 2026 RX350 trim between 豪華版 and 旗艦版. NOT re-fetched in audit; the trim's existence and price are independently confirmed by the 8891 lineup table above, so nothing load-bearing rests on this entry."}]},"lexus-rx350-flagship":{"assumptions":"Low-mileage owner: 6,000-8,000 km/year vs the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year. All checkpoints use the midpoint 7,000 km/year (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km). At this rate the car is TIME-limited, not distance-limited: it never reaches the 120,000 km cap of Lexus TW's 4-year/120,000 km warranty within 10 years, and servicing is driven by the 6-month calendar interval rather than the 10,000 km one. Consequence for resale: at every checkpoint this car sits far below the mileage-blind market average for its age, so listings quoted below were deliberately selected from the low-mileage end and a low-mileage premium was applied. MATERIAL CORRECTION THIS PASS — the previous draft's central claim about years 7 and 10 rested on a UNIT MISREAD. It stated that a 2019 RX300 F Sport asking NT$1,088,000 had '11,900 km' and concluded from that supposedly low-mileage car that no low-mileage premium was supportable at year 7. The 8891 listing actually reads 11.9萬 km = 119,000 km (re-fetched twice from two 8891 URLs on 2026-08-11 and confirmed as 11.9萬). That car is HIGH mileage, roughly 2.4x this owner's 49,000 km at the same age, so it is a FLOOR for the year-7 estimate, not a ceiling. The evidence for a low-mileage premium is in fact direct: the 8891 2020 band runs NT$1,120,000-1,238,000, and the one genuinely low-mileage 2020 car on the page — a 300 豪華版, the BASE trim, at 2.2萬 km = 22,000 km, tagged 低里程認證車 — asks NT$1,238,000, i.e. exactly the TOP of its year band despite being the cheapest trim. Low-mileage cars in this market sit at or above the band top; they do not sit below it. Years 7 and 10 have been re-derived on that basis and both rose. Consequence for cost: consumables are replaced on AGE not wear — the 235/50R21 tires age out around year 6 with tread to spare, and the 12V battery dies on calendar time. Tax, insurance and fuel are excluded by design.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"UNCHANGED this pass — not contested by the reviewer, and re-checked against the live 8891 page without finding contrary evidence. Genuine 5th-gen data. abc好車網 lists a 2025MY RX 350 旗艦版 (gasoline) at 車商售價 NT$2,480,000 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2294103); the listing does NOT disclose mileage, which remains the main weakness here. Cross-checked on 8891 中古車, re-fetched 2026-08-11, where a 2024MY (2-year) RX350 旗艦版 at 3.12萬 km = 31,200 km asks NT$2,198,000 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx); back-extrapolating one year at the normal ~11% year-2 gap lands on ~NT$2,450,000-2,490,000, so the abc figure is corroborated rather than platform-inflated. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: took NT$2,480,000 as dealer RETAIL for a 1-year 7,000 km car, then -12% to reach the PRIVATE-SALE figure NT$2,180,000, then a further -13% to reach dealer trade-in NT$1,900,000. No asking price was copied into private_sale_price."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"UNCHANGED this pass — not contested by the reviewer, and the underlying listings were re-fetched 2026-08-11 and still stand. Genuine 3-year (2023MY) 5th-gen data, all 車商售價: 8891 中古車 shows a 2023 RX350 頂級版 at 4.2萬 km = 42,000 km asking NT$1,898,000 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx), with the 2023 band running NT$1,628,000-2,288,000; SUM 汽車網 shows a 2023 RX350 gasoline at 77,210 km asking NT$1,688,000 (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=RX). abc好車網's 2023 旗艦版 AWD at NT$2,658,000 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2107403) was rejected as stale/aspirational. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: from the 頂級版 data point, uplift for 旗艦版 equipment at only HALF the new-price gap (+5%, not the full +10.1% of 2,950,000 vs 2,680,000) because Taiwan's used market recovers little of the equipment premium, giving ~NT$1,993,000; then +4% low-mileage premium for 21,000 km vs 42,000 km, giving ~NT$2,070,000 dealer retail. CEILING CHECK: NT$2,070,000 sits 5.8% below the real 2-year 旗艦版 asking NT$2,198,000, a credible one-model-year gap. Then -12% to NT$1,820,000 private sale and a further -13% to NT$1,580,000 dealer trade-in."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"UNCHANGED this pass — not contested by the reviewer. EXTRAPOLATED from the PREDECESSOR generation: the 5th-gen RX only reached Taiwan in early 2023, so no genuine 5-year car exists. Proxy is the 4th-gen RX300 2.0T gasoline at 2021MY (5 years old today), 旗艦版 list ~NT$2,710,000 after the 2019 facelift's NT$30,000 rise (https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/48918). Observed: the 8891 2021 band runs NT$1,438,000-1,498,000 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx), Lexus CPO 2021 RX300 at 80,725 km asks NT$1,458,000 (https://www.lexuscpo.com.tw/Home/Details/e065285e-359e-4828-8d20-631a86f8e819), SUM 2021 RX300 at 69,000 km asks NT$1,428,000. RETENTION RATIO derived against the proxy's OWN list: band top 1,498,000 / 2,710,000 = 55.3% at ~70,000 km, lifted ~3 points for this car's 35,000 km, = ~58.6%. Applied to real_cost 2,982,000 = ~NT$1,750,000 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: -12% to NT$1,540,000 private sale, a further -13% to NT$1,340,000 dealer trade-in. Explicit cross-generation extrapolation, not observed 5th-gen data."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"RAISED from the previous draft's NT$1,100,000 after finding a UNIT MISREAD in the evidence that drove that figure down. EXTRAPOLATED from the PREDECESSOR generation — no genuine 7-year 5th-gen car exists. Proxy is the 4th-gen RX300 at 2019MY (7 years old today), 旗艦版 list NT$2,680,000 (https://c.8891.com.tw/article/tag/Lexus-RX-%E6%97%97%E8%89%A6%E7%89%88, re-fetched 2026-08-11 and still stating 268萬; a tag page, so a weak citation). THE CORRECTION: the previous draft cited 'a low-mileage 2019 RX300 F Sport at 11,900 km asks NT$1,088,000' and concluded that a genuinely low-mileage car sits BELOW the band top, so no low-mileage premium was applied. The listing was re-fetched twice this pass from two separate 8891 URLs (https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx and https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/RX300) and both render it as 11.9萬 km = 119,000 km, not 11,900 km. That car is a HIGH-mileage example asking NT$1,088,000 near the top of the NT$840,000-1,148,000 2019 band — it is a FLOOR for this checkpoint, not a ceiling, and the argument against a low-mileage premium collapses with it. POSITIVE EVIDENCE FOR THE PREMIUM: on the same page a 2020 RX300 豪華版 — the cheapest trim — at 2.2萬 km = 22,000 km, tagged 原鈑件、低里程認證車, asks NT$1,238,000, which is exactly the TOP of the NT$1,120,000-1,238,000 2020 band, and 1,238,000 / 2,270,000 list = 54.5% retention at 6 years for a low-mileage BASE trim. RETENTION RATIO derived: a 49,000 km 2019 旗艦版 sits at or just above its mileage-blind band top of NT$1,148,000; estimated NT$1,270,000 dealer retail = 47.4% of its own NT$2,680,000 list, a ~7-point step down from the 6-year low-mileage observation above. Applied to real_cost 2,982,000 = ~NT$1,413,000 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: -12% to NT$1,240,000 private sale, a further -13% to NT$1,080,000 dealer trade-in. CROSS-TRIM CHECKS: NT$1,240,000 now exceeds the cheaper 頂級版's NT$1,160,000 in absolute NT$ as the price ladder requires, while the retention ratio 41.6% stays BELOW 頂級版's 47.9% per the trim rule, and it stays below the equally-priced F Sport's NT$1,250,000 because F Sport carries genuine used-market scarcity demand that the comfort-oriented 旗艦版 does not. Explicit cross-generation extrapolation."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"RAISED from the previous draft's NT$860,000, for the same reason as year 7: the previous draft applied no low-mileage premium at the long horizons, a stance that rested on the 119,000 km listing misread as 11,900 km. EXTRAPOLATED from the PREDECESSOR generation — no genuine 10-year 5th-gen car exists. Proxy is the 4th-gen RX200t at 2016MY (10 years old today), 旗艦版 launch list NT$2,590,000 — re-fetched and CONFIRMED directly this pass on 7Car, which states 售價259萬 for the 旗艦版 test car and that RX200t came in 豪華/頂級/旗艦 three grades (https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/26825); WeWanted corroborates (https://www.wewanted.com.tw/car_exhibition.php?id=1322). Observed on 8891, re-fetched 2026-08-11: the 2016 band runs NT$699,000-858,000 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx); abc好車網 lists a 2016 RX200t 頂級版 at NT$788,000 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1959676). WHY A PREMIUM APPLIES HERE: that band is mileage-blind and at ten years old the typical Taiwanese RX shows 150,000-200,000 km, versus this owner's 70,000 km — the widest mileage gap of any checkpoint. The 2020 low-mileage observation above establishes that low-mileage cars price at or above their year-band top, so the band top is a floor, not a ceiling. RETENTION RATIO derived: band top 858,000 lifted ~10% for the mileage advantage = ~NT$940,000, and 940,000 / 2,590,000 = 36.3% of the proxy's own list (the flagship trim penalty is already embedded because the proxy is itself a flagship). Applied to real_cost 2,982,000 = ~NT$1,068,000 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: -12% to NT$940,000 private sale, a further -13% to NT$815,000 dealer trade-in. CROSS-TRIM CHECKS: NT$940,000 now exceeds the cheaper 頂級版's NT$860,000 in absolute NT$, while the retention ratio 31.5% stays BELOW 頂級版's 35.5% and below F Sport's 36.9%, so the trim ladder holds on both the absolute and the percentage test. The share of the NT$561,000 new-price gap over 頂級版 that is recovered at resale now declines monotonically across the tail (year 5 19.6%, year 7 15.0%, year 10 14.3%), which is the expected shape. Extrapolated across generations AND across engines (2.0T predecessor vs 2.4T subject), hence low confidence."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"LOWERED from the previous draft's NT$14,000 to converge with the sibling 頂級版 record's NT$13,000. The two cars share the identical 2.4L turbo engine, the identical 6-month service cadence and the identical 定保套餐, so a NT$1,000 year-one gap between them had no basis — the previous draft had nudged rates up for 'the RX's larger engine' relative to NX/UX/ES receipts, but 頂級版 is the same RX. Intervals and the free 1-month service re-fetched and confirmed 2026-08-11 (https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx). Per-visit cost from Taiwanese owner reports where a routine 定保 runs ~NT$5,000-8,000 on a Lexus SUV (https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1725460760.A.02F.html, https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=346&t=6424776&p=3). Two paid visits in year 1; the 4-year/120,000 km warranty absorbs everything else."},{"y":3,"source":"LOWERED from NT$37,000 to NT$34,000, matching the 頂級版 record. Two corrections: the per-visit rate is aligned with 頂級版 as at year 1, and the previous draft double-counted — it charged 4 visits at NT$28,000 and then added 煞車油 NT$2,500, 引擎空氣濾芯＋冷氣濾網 NT$3,000 and 輪胎調位/定位 NT$2,000 as separate lines, when those items are exactly what the 24個月·40,000km 定保套餐 contains and are already inside the visit price. Four 6-month visits across months 18-36; interval structure from the verified https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx, visit pricing from the owner receipts at https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1725460760.A.02F.html. Still fully inside the 4-year/120,000 km warranty, so no repair contingency. At 21,000 km the car has not reached the 40,000 km mileage trigger, so mileage-driven items are excluded."},{"y":5,"source":"LOWERED from NT$60,000 to NT$57,000 and re-itemised onto the same basis as the 頂級版 record, plus the AWD line that genuinely distinguishes this trim. Battery price is a real PTT owner receipt: NT$8,700 on a Lexus, re-fetched and confirmed this pass (https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1725460760.A.02F.html). The previous draft's separate 冷卻液 NT$4,000, 煞車油 NT$2,500 and 雜項 NT$3,000 lines are folded back into the 大保養 visits that contain them, and its unexplained NT$6,000 'repair contingency' is dropped as premature — the 4-year/120,000 km warranty (https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx) plus the free 1-year extension earned via the 準時保養 programme covers most of this window. AWD rear-diff oil at NT$3,500 is added: the KingAutos spec table lists 旗艦版 as AWD against 頂級版's FWD (https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/rx). No tires here — at 35,000 km the original set has tread remaining and is only 5 years old."},{"y":7,"source":"THE LARGEST CORRECTION IN THE RECORD, DOWN from NT$130,000 to NT$98,000, and the reviewer's maintenance objection is answered here. Three changes. (1) The tire-size premium is withdrawn: re-fetching the KingAutos 2026 spec table (https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/rx) shows 頂級版 also runs 21吋 235/50R21, so this trim has no larger wheel than the cheaper sibling and the previous draft's contrast with 豪華版's 235/60R19 was comparing against the wrong trim. (2) The tire set is repriced from NT$52,000 to NT$44,000 plus NT$3,000 alignment, agreeing with the F Sport record for the identical part; the PTT thread's NT$6,800 tires are 225/60/18 (re-confirmed this pass, https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1725460760.A.02F.html) and remain correctly excluded as a direct quote, so this is a scaled estimate and the reason confidence stays low. (3) The previous draft's 火星塞 NT$9,000 is removed from this window — spark plugs on the 2.4T fall in the 7-10y window where the 頂級版 record places them, and charging them at year 7 AND leaving the 7-10y total unchanged inflated the pair. 前煞車碟盤 is likewise deferred to the 7-10y window; only the rear pads fall due here. The NT$18,000 blanket 'out-of-warranty contingency' is cut to NT$4,000 of named consumables. Brake pricing from the same PTT receipt thread (碟盤與來令片 per axle); visit rates from https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=346&t=6424776&p=3. Fully out of warranty in this window."},{"y":10,"source":"LOWERED from NT$138,000 to NT$132,000, converging with the 頂級版 record's NT$132,000 for the same window. EXTRAPOLATED. Six 6-month visits over the 3-year window at the Mobile01/PTT 定保 rates, plus age-driven replacements; spark plugs and the front discs now sit here rather than at year 7. The PTT receipt thread shows a real Lexus owner reporting ~NT$30,000 in a single visit once tires, battery, brake discs and coolant pump fell due together, which anchors the scale of the 老化件備抵 line (https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1725460760.A.02F.html); the same thread also shows the opposite tail, owners paying NT$3,254 at 90,000 km, so this line is a provision and not an observed bill. NO second tire set is budgeted: with the first set replaced around year 6, the second reaches its age limit around year 11-12, outside this window — at year 10 the tires are ~4 years old with ~28,000 km on them. No 5th-gen RX has reached 10 years anywhere, so the failure mix is inferred from 4th-gen RX and general Lexus SUV experience rather than observed for this 2.4T powertrain, which is newer and less proven in Taiwan than the V6 it replaced."}],"sources":[{"name":"8891 新車 — 2026年式Lexus RX國內上架！細節微調、售價不變","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/lexus/rx/20732","note":"PRIMARY price source. RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED 2026-08-11. Full 2026MY 10-trim Taiwan table returned in full this pass: 350豪華版 2,460,000 / 350頂級版 2,680,000 / 350旗艦版 2,950,000 / 350 F Sport 2,950,000 / 350h豪華版 2,560,000 / 350h頂級版 2,780,000 / 350h旗艦版 3,050,000 / 450h+豪華版 3,150,000 / 450h+旗艦版 3,550,000 / 500h F Sport Performance 3,610,000. 售價維持不變 versus 2025MY."},{"name":"KingAutos — 2026 Lexus RX 共10車款詳細介紹","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/rx","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED 2026-08-11, and the decisive source for the maintenance correction. Confirms NT$2,950,000 for 350旗艦版 and the 2,393cc turbocharged inline-4 (279 hp, 8AT). Per-trim wheel/tire and driveline: 豪華版 19吋 235/60R19 FWD; 頂級版 21吋 235/50R21 FWD; 旗艦版 21吋 235/50R21 AWD; F Sport 21吋 235/50R21 AWD. Brakes are 前後碟煞 on every trim with no differentiation. This kills the previous draft's tire-size justification for a maintenance premium over 頂級版 — the two share the identical tire — and leaves the AWD driveline as the only physical cost difference."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官方 RX showroom","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/showroom/RX","note":"Official site publishes only the NT$246萬~361萬 lineup range, no per-trim table; brackets the 2,950,000 figure but cannot confirm it alone."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX 全車系年份行情與車源","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED 2026-08-11; the single most important source for this revision. Live 車商售價 with mileage: 2024 RX350 旗艦版 3.12萬 km NT$2,198,000; 2023 RX350 頂級版 4.2萬 km NT$1,898,000; 2022 RX300 F Sport 12.3萬 km NT$1,398,000; 2020 RX300 豪華版 2.2萬 km NT$1,238,000 (原鈑件、低里程認證車); 2020 RX300 F Sport 10.1萬 km NT$1,328,000; 2019 RX300 F Sport 11.9萬 km NT$1,088,000. Year bands: 2024 NT$182.8-268.8萬, 2023 NT$162.8-228.8萬, 2021 NT$143.8-149.8萬, 2020 NT$112.0-123.8萬, 2019 NT$84.0-114.8萬, 2016 NT$69.9-85.8萬. CRITICAL: the 2019 F Sport is 11.9萬 km = 119,000 km, which the previous draft read as 11,900 km and used to argue against any low-mileage premium at years 7 and 10. Conversely the 2020 豪華版 at 22,000 km asks exactly the top of its year band, which is the positive evidence that low-mileage cars price at or above the band top."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX300 車源（4代預測基準）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/RX300","note":"FETCHED 2026-08-11 as an independent second read of the same listings, specifically to check the disputed mileage. Renders the 2019 RX300 F Sport as 11.9萬 km / 108.8萬 and the 2020 300 豪華版 as 2.2萬 km / 123.8萬 (低里程認證車), confirming the 119,000 km reading on a second URL rather than a single page render."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX350 二手行情與車源","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/RX350","note":"5th-gen RX350 used listings, source of the 2-year 旗艦版 ceiling test (2024MY, 31,200 km, NT$2,198,000) that governs the year-3 checkpoint. Dealer RETAIL, discounted before use."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — LEXUS RX 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=RX","note":"Cross-platform check: 2023 RX350 gasoline 77,210 km NT$1,688,000; 2021 RX300 69,000 km NT$1,428,000; 2020 RX300 100,000 km NT$1,198,000. Carried over from the previous draft; not independently re-fetched this pass (web-search budget exhausted)."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2025 LEXUS RX 350 旗艦版","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2294103","note":"2025MY, 旗艦版, gasoline, dealer asking NT$2,480,000. Primary anchor for the year-1 checkpoint. MILEAGE IS NOT DISCLOSED in the listing — the main weakness of the year-1 figure. Carried over from the previous draft."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2023 LEXUS RX350 旗艦版 (5代) AWD","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2107403","note":"3-year 旗艦版 asking NT$2,658,000 with no mileage stated. Treated as a stale/aspirational asking price and NOT used as the year-3 anchor. Also secondary confirmation that 旗艦版 is the AWD trim."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2016 LEXUS RX 200t 頂級版","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1959676","note":"10-year-old predecessor data point, dealer asking NT$788,000, used as a sanity check in the year-10 retention-ratio derivation. Mileage-blind and a 頂級版 rather than 旗艦版, so it sits below the band top used for the low-mileage subject."},{"name":"LEXUS CPO — 2021 RX 300 認證中古車","url":"https://www.lexuscpo.com.tw/Home/Details/e065285e-359e-4828-8d20-631a86f8e819","note":"Official certified pre-owned: 2021 RX300, 80,725 km, NT$1,458,000. CPO carries a certification premium over ordinary dealer retail, so it was treated as an upper bound for the year-5 derivation. Consistent with the 8891 2021 band of NT$143.8-149.8萬."},{"name":"8891 — Lexus RX 300旗艦版售價268萬","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/article/tag/Lexus-RX-%E6%97%97%E8%89%A6%E7%89%88","note":"RE-FETCHED 2026-08-11 and still states NT$2,680,000 for the RX300 旗艦版, the denominator for the year-7 retention ratio. CAVEAT: it is a tag/listing page rather than a dated article, its contents can drift, and it returns no other trim prices — treat as a weak citation."},{"name":"U-CAR — 小改款Lexus RX車系227萬起開賣（售價調漲3萬）","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/48918","note":"Dates the 4th-gen facelift and its NT$30,000 price rise; the 227萬起 entry price is the 豪華版 list used as the denominator in the 2020 low-mileage retention check (1,238,000 / 2,270,000 = 54.5% at 6 years), and the facelift rise sets the 2021MY RX300 旗艦版 list at ~NT$2,710,000 for the year-5 denominator. ATTEMPTED RE-FETCH THIS PASS AND THE SERVER RETURNED HTTP 403 — the figures are carried over from the previous draft's successful fetch and could not be re-confirmed today."},{"name":"7Car — Lexus RX200t 旗艦版","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/26825","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED 2026-08-11: states 售價259萬 for the RX200t 旗艦版 test car and that RX200t was sold in 豪華/頂級/旗艦 three grades, with the wider RX lineup spanning 219萬-329萬. NT$2,590,000 is the denominator for the year-10 retention ratio. The previous draft used a 2,590,000-2,620,000 range and applied the top; this pass uses the directly confirmed 2,590,000."},{"name":"WeWanted — 2016 Lexus RX200t 旗艦版 規格與售價","url":"https://www.wewanted.com.tw/car_exhibition.php?id=1322","note":"Secondary confirmation of the 2016 RX200t 旗艦版 original list price used in the year-10 extrapolation. Carried over; not independently re-fetched this pass."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官方 — 定期保養計畫","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED 2026-08-11. Official intervals 1個月(24項) / 6個月·10,000km(16項) / 12個月·20,000km(29項) / 24個月·40,000km(34項) / 48個月·80,000km(37項); the 1-month check is the only free item; a 25項尊榮安檢 is included in each paid visit. Confirms NO free routine-maintenance programme exists beyond the first month."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官方 — 車主權益／保固","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx","note":"New-car warranty is 4 years / 120,000 km, whichever comes first — never mileage-limited for this 7,000 km/year owner. Self-paid OEM parts carry a separate 2-year / 50,000 km guarantee. Verified in the previous pass; not re-fetched today."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官方 — 新車準時保養愛車享延長保證方案","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/news_detail.aspx?nw=563&fn=1","note":"For vehicles delivered from 2024-01-01: 8 consecutive on-time 定保 using 原廠機油及定保套餐 earn a free 1-year / 20,000 km warranty extension applied before the original 4-year/120,000 km cover expires; owners who miss a visit may buy the extension from NT$25,900. This is a WARRANTY extension, not free servicing. Verified in the previous pass; not re-fetched today."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — Lexus原廠保養是不是被灌水（實際收據）","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1725460760.A.02F.html","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED 2026-08-11. Real owner receipts anchoring consumable costs: 12V battery NT$8,700; a ~NT$30,000 single visit when several items fell due together; and the opposite tail, NT$11,537 at 80,000 km, NT$3,254 at 90,000 km, under NT$5,000 at 120,000 km — which is why the year-10 老化件 line is treated as a provision, not an expected bill. TIRE CAVEAT CONFIRMED: the Yokohama AE61 tires quoted at NT$6,800 each (outside shops NT$18,000-20,000 per set) are 225/60/18, NOT the RX 旗艦版's 235/50R21, so they are used only to scale the 21-inch estimate and never as a direct quote."},{"name":"Mobile01 — LEXUS養車與維修費","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=346&t=6424776&p=3","note":"Owner-reported Lexus TW 定保 pricing: first service ~NT$3,000, routine 6-month/10,000 km ~NT$5,000-8,000, 20,000 km 大保 ~NT$14,000. Basis for the per-visit rates. ATTEMPTED RE-FETCH THIS PASS AND THE SERVER RETURNED HTTP 403 — figures carried over from the previous draft's successful fetch."}]},"lexus-rx350-fsport":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, well under the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year. All checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). This matters twice. (1) Resale: the live 8891 comparables for this generation carry 31,000-42,000 km at 2-3 years and the predecessor-generation cars at 5-10 years carry 100,000-184,000 km, i.e. roughly double this car's mileage at the same age, so the mileage-blind market average understates what this car is worth. A low-km premium is applied and stated per checkpoint. At the 10-year point that premium is now built into the anchor rather than applied on top: a 2016 RX 2.0 at 76,792 km was found live on SUM today, which is within 10% of this car's 70,000 km at year 10, so no separate premium is layered on. NOTE: an earlier draft of this record misread 8891 mileages written in 萬 units (3.99萬 km read as 3,990 km instead of 39,900 km) and therefore believed its comparables were already ultra-low-mileage; the comparables are in fact normal-mileage cars, which is what justifies the premium. (2) Maintenance: at 7,000 km/year the car never reaches a mileage-triggered service, so servicing is purely TIME-driven — but the Lexus Taiwan official schedule is 6 months / 10,000 km, not 1 year. An earlier draft claimed an annual manual interval on the authority of a PTT thread and dismissed the 6-month visit as a dealer upsell; the official Lexus TW maintenance-plan page it cited lists 1 month, then 6 months/10,000 km, 12 months/20,000 km, 24 months/40,000 km, 48 months/80,000 km. At 7,000 km/year the 6-month TIME trigger fires twice a year, so two visits per year are costed: one main service plus one lighter half-year service. Consumables are age-driven as much as wear-driven, but the 235/50R21 set is now placed ONCE at ~year 6 (42,000 km, where tread is genuinely near its limit AND the rubber is 6 years old) rather than twice at years 5 and 10 — the second set then falls at ~year 12, outside this horizon. Tax and insurance are excluded by design.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"REBUILT — an earlier draft's anchor was a misattributed listing. It claimed 'a 2025 RX350 at 1,900 km listed at NT$2,480,000'. Re-fetching https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/RX350 today shows no 2025 RX350 at all; the listing it describes is a 2024 RX500h F Sport Performance at 1.9萬 km (19,000 km) asking NT$2,688,000 — a different model with a NT$3,610,000 list price. That anchor is discarded. Rebuilt instead by interpolating above the one verified same-trim point, re-confirmed live today: 2024 RX350 F Sport, 3.99萬 km (39,900 km), NT$2,198,000 車商售價 = 74.5% of list at 2 years. Taiwan luxury-SUV dealer retail at 1 year runs ~83-85% of list mileage-blind; this car's 7,000 km against a typical ~15,000 km 1-year-old adds ~2 points, giving dealer retail ~NT$2,470,000 (83.7% of list). ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: dealer retail 2,470,000 less 9% = 2,250,000 private sale (tight spread — a 1-year-old in-warranty Lexus is fast-moving inventory), then a further 10% = 2,025,000 dealer trade-in. Not a raw dealer asking price. Confidence stays low because no 1-year-old RX350 is actually observable on the board today; this point is interpolated, not seen."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"Genuine current-generation data, re-fetched and mileage-corrected today from https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/RX350: 2024 RX350 F Sport, 3.99萬 km = 39,900 km, NT$2,198,000 車商售價 (2 years old, 74.5% of list); 2024 RX350 旗艦版, 3.12萬 km = 31,200 km, NT$2,198,000; 2023 RX350 頂級版, 4.2萬 km = 42,000 km, NT$1,898,000 (3 years old, 70.8% of that trim's NT$2,680,000 list). All three re-confirmed live on today's re-check. The 2024 F Sport point is independently corroborated by an abc好車網 dealer listing at the identical NT$2,198,000 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2260595). IMPORTANT CORRECTION carried forward: an earlier draft read these mileages as 3,990 / 3,120 / 4,200 km — a 10x error from misreading 萬 — and so wrongly treated them as ultra-low-mileage cars. They are normal-mileage cars at 31,000-42,000 km, which is what makes a genuine low-km premium available to this 21,000 km car. Mileage-blind 3-year F Sport dealer retail set at 68.5% of list (just below the 頂級版's observed 70.8%, per the trim-ladder rule) = 2,020,000; low-km premium of +6% for 21,000 km against the ~42,000 km observed comparables gives NT$2,150,000 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: 2,150,000 less 11% = 1,915,000 private sale; less a further 12% = 1,685,000 dealer trade-in."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor generation — the 5th-gen RX only launched in Taiwan in November 2022, so no genuine 5-year-old example of this car exists. Method: took the 4th-gen RX F Sport (list NT$2,610,000 per U-CAR; see caveat) and found its real 5-year-old trade on SUM 汽車網 (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=RX): a 2021 RX300 F-Sport at 27,277 km asking NT$1,599,000, i.e. a 61.3% retention ratio at 5 years on a comparably low-mileage car. Shaded down to ~58% to reflect (a) faster percentage decay on a more expensive car and (b) the trim-ladder effect, giving NT$1,715,000 dealer-retail-equivalent for this car. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: less 11% = 1,525,000 private sale; less a further 12% = 1,340,000 dealer trade-in. Ratio applied to this car's real_cost basis. RE-CHECK 2026-08-11: today's SUM fetch returned a partial slice of the 63 listings that did not include the 27,277 km car, so that specific anchor could not be re-confirmed this pass. What today's slice DID show for 5-year-old F Sport variants corroborates the level rather than contradicting it: 2021 RX F-Sport, 106,856 km, NT$1,530,000 (村信汽車, 高雄) and 2021 RX F-Sport, 123,000 km, NT$1,398,000 (賜海汽車, 台中). The NT$1,715,000 dealer-retail-equivalent used here is +12% over the 106,856 km car, which is a reasonable low-mileage premium for a 35,000 km car against a 107,000 km one. The point is left unchanged. CAVEAT: the NT$2,610,000 predecessor list price could not be re-verified — U-CAR (https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/32062) returned HTTP 403 again today, so the denominator of this ratio rests on an unconfirmed secondary figure. Explicitly extrapolated, not observed."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor generation; no genuine 7-year-old 5th-gen RX exists. Predecessor evidence VERIFIED LIVE today on 8891 中古車 RX300 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx300): 2019 RX300 F Sport 2.0L, 11.9萬 km = 119,000 km, NT$1,088,000 = 41.7% of its NT$2,610,000 list at 7 years. That car carries 119,000 km against this buyer's 49,000 km at 7 years, so a +22% low-mileage premium is applied multiplicatively to the 41.7% observation, giving ~50.9% for a low-km 7-year F Sport, then shaded to ~48% for this pricier top trim = NT$1,420,000 dealer-retail-equivalent. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: less 12% = 1,250,000 private sale; less a further 13% = 1,085,000 dealer trade-in. Wider spreads than at year 1 because older cars carry more condition risk and sell slower. CAVEAT CORRECTED THIS PASS: a previous draft said the supporting points (2020 RX300 F Sport 101,000 km NT$1,328,000; 2020 RX300 豪華版 22,000 km NT$1,238,000; 2022 RX300 F Sport 123,000 km NT$1,398,000) were not on the board and could not be confirmed. They ARE on the board today — all three re-fetched live from the same 8891 RX300 page — so that caveat was wrong and is withdrawn. They now do real work in the year-10 derivation below. Confidence stays low because the NT$2,610,000 denominator is still unverified (U-CAR 403). Explicitly extrapolated, not observed."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"RE-SOURCED TODAY in response to the cross-trim review, which flagged the prior NT$1,090,000 (37% of real_cost) as a flattening tail — only a 5-point retention drop from year 7 against 8-12 points for every other RX trim — and as a ladder inversion above the base 頂級版. BOTH OBJECTIONS ARE ACCEPTED; the prior 42.5%-of-list derivation is discarded, and NO F Sport scarcity argument is claimed. NEW EVIDENCE, all fetched live today. (1) Genuine 10-year-old cars ARE observable, which the prior draft did not use: SUM 汽車網 (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=RX) lists a 2016 RX 2.0L at 76,792 km asking NT$838,000 (上藝汽車, 新北) and a 2016 RX 2.0L at 136,914 km asking NT$798,000 (冠立汽車, 台南); 8891 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx200t) lists a 2016 RX200t 頂級版 at 183,800 km asking NT$699,000 (杰運高雄). The 76,792 km car is the best-matched 10-year comparable in the whole dataset — this buyer reaches year 10 at 70,000 km — so the low-mileage premium is INSIDE the anchor and is deliberately not applied a second time (the prior draft's incoherent '+18% on a 42.7% average' step is gone). Those three cars also measure the low-mileage premium directly: 838,000 vs 699,000 = +19.9% for 76,792 km against 183,800 km. (2) DECAY FACTOR MEASURED, NOT ASSUMED. Matched-mileage pair: 2016 RX 2.0 at 136,914 km NT$798,000 against the 2019 RX300 F Sport at 119,000 km NT$1,088,000 = 73.3% over three years. Low-mileage pair: the 2016 car at 76,792 km NT$838,000 against the 2020 RX300 豪華版 at 22,000 km NT$1,238,000 (8891) = 67.7% over four years, i.e. 90.9%/year, i.e. 75.1% over three years. The two agree closely; 75.1% is used. (3) TRIM-LADDER RULE CONFIRMED, NOT EXEMPTED. At 6 years the 2020 RX300 F Sport (101,000 km, NT$1,328,000) is 50.9% of its NT$2,610,000 list while the 2020 RX300 豪華版 (22,000 km, NT$1,238,000) is 56.5% of its NT$2,190,000 list — the cheaper trim retains the higher ratio even while carrying a fifth of the mileage. There is no observable F Sport scarcity premium in ratio terms, so none is written in. DERIVATION: year-7 dealer-retail-equivalent NT$1,420,000 x 75.1% = NT$1,066,000, rounded to NT$1,065,000 dealer-retail-equivalent at year 10. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: less 13% = NT$930,000 private sale (this is the private figure, not a dealer asking price); less a further 14% = NT$800,000 dealer trade-in. Widest spreads of any checkpoint — 10-year cars sit on dealer lots longest. RESULT AND CHECKS: 31.5% of real_cost, a 10.8-point fall from the year-7 42.3%, inside the 8-12 point band the rest of the line shows, and below the base 頂級版's ~35.5% so the ladder inversion is resolved. It sits ~2.7 points above the 旗艦版 at the same NT$2,950,000 list; the stated reason is that F Sport is the only RX350 gasoline trim with AWD (verified today on https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/lexus/2026-lexus-rx — 豪華版/頂級版/旗艦版 are all FWD), and an AWD RX is the more sought-after used car in Taiwan, which is the same reason this record already sits above 旗艦版 at year 7. CAVEAT: the 4th-gen list prices remain the unverified link — U-CAR (https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/27742 and /32062) returned HTTP 403 again today. That only affects the ratio cross-check, not the main derivation, which now runs on observed price-to-price decay rather than on a list-price denominator. Still extrapolated across generations and no 10-year-old RX F Sport exists in any generation (the 4th-gen F Sport arrived for 2017, so the oldest is 9 years), hence low confidence."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Cadence from the Lexus TW maintenance-plan page (https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx) — the 1-month free inspection and the 6-month / 10,000 km interval, so two time-triggered visits in this window at 7,000 km/year. Warranty term from https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx. Prices from owner-reported figures on the PTT/disp.cc Lexus maintenance-cost thread (https://disp.cc/b/Car/fJfl): NT$4,000-5,000 for a main service, NT$2,600 for a light half-year service, taken at the upper end here because this is a 2.4L turbo AWD car serviced at a Lexus dealer. Items sum to exactly 13,000."},{"y":3,"source":"Four time-triggered visits in this 2-year window at the official 6-month cadence (https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx). Owner-reported prices from https://disp.cc/b/Car/fJfl: NT$4,000-5,000 routine main service, NT$2,600 light half-year service, and a 20,000 km-class major service around NT$14,000 — the 24-month visit here is priced below that NT$14,000 because the throttle/injector clean in that report is a dealer add-on this model declines. Warranty coverage per https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx. Items sum to exactly 34,000."},{"y":5,"source":"Visit count from the official 6-month cadence (https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx), priced off the owner-reported base (https://disp.cc/b/Car/fJfl) with normal inflation. Warranty-extension condition per https://www.lexus.com.tw/news_detail.aspx?nw=563&fn=1. Front pads are placed here rather than later because this is the heavier AWD trim (F Sport is the only AWD RX350 gasoline variant — https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/lexus/2026-lexus-rx); pad and battery timing are age/mileage estimates for this low-mileage duty cycle, not sourced receipts, hence low confidence. Items sum to exactly 58,000."},{"y":7,"source":"TYRES — the dominant line and now the best-sourced one. Size 235/50R21 on 21-inch rims confirmed for this trim on both the TVBS 2026 RX spec table (https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/lexus/2026-lexus-rx) and the KingAutos 2026 RX page (https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/rx); both also show 頂級版 and 旗艦版 on the same size, so this is NOT where the F Sport premium comes from. A real Taiwan retail quote was fetched today: DUNLOP SPORT MAXX LUX 235/50/21, set of four fitted, NT$31,968 at 車麗屋 via PChome 24h (https://24h.pchome.com.tw/search/?q=235%2F50R21) — the market floor. NT$48,000 is booked for an OE-grade premium replacement (~NT$10,000-11,000 per corner) plus alignment, balancing and TPMS service; honest range NT$32,000-52,000. Timing is year 6, where 42,000 km on a heavy AWD SUV puts tread near its limit at the same time the rubber ages out. DRIVELINE — the rear diff and transfer-case service follows directly from this trim being the only AWD RX350 gasoline variant (TVBS spec table above; the 8891 listing text for used cars of this trim also reads '4WD'). Service labour extrapolated from owner-reported Lexus figures including a NT$3,800 required service at 70,000 km (https://disp.cc/b/Car/fJfl) at the official 6-month cadence. The NT$12,000 repair allowance is a judgement estimate for a car just out of its 4-year warranty, not a sourced figure. Items sum to exactly 122,000."},{"y":10,"source":"Longest and most uncertain window — 3 years wide and entirely out of warranty. Visit count from the official 6-month cadence (https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx), priced off owner-reported Lexus Taiwan figures (https://disp.cc/b/Car/fJfl) with inflation. Spark plug, coolant, battery and brake timing are standard Toyota/Lexus long-life intervals applied on an age basis for this low-mileage car. The AWD driveline lines follow from the verified AWD-only status of this trim (https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/lexus/2026-lexus-rx). The NT$42,000 ageing allowance is a judgement estimate for a 7-10 year old AWD Lexus SUV, not a sourced receipt, and it is the single largest uncertainty in the record. STATED BOUNDARY ASSUMPTION: no second tyre set is booked, because the set fitted at year 6 is 4 years old with ~28,000 km at year 10; an owner who replaces strictly on a 5-year rubber rule instead would add roughly NT$48,000 to this window. Items sum to exactly 151,000. Extrapolated, not observed."}],"sources":[{"name":"8891 新車頻道 — 2026年式Lexus RX國內上架！細節微調、售價不變！","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/lexus/rx/20732","note":"VERIFIED TODAY (re-fetched this pass). Primary list-price check. Full 2026 RX price table: RX350 豪華版 2,460,000 / 頂級版 2,680,000 / 旗艦版 2,950,000 / F Sport 2,950,000; RX350h 2,560,000-3,050,000; RX450h+ 3,150,000-3,550,000; RX500h F Sport Performance 3,610,000. States 售價維持不變. Confirms NT$2,950,000. Carries no trim-by-trim hardware detail, which is why the TVBS spec table below was added."},{"name":"KingAutos — 2026 Lexus RX 車系介紹與規格","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/rx","note":"VERIFIED TODAY (re-fetched this pass). Second price table confirming 350 F Sport版 at NT$2,950,000 (350 豪華版 2,450,000 / 頂級版 2,670,000 / 旗艦版 2,950,000 — NT$10,000 apart from 8891 on the lower trims, identical on F Sport). Also the spec basis for the maintenance model: 235/50R21 on 21-inch rims, 2,393cc turbo four, 279hp, 8AT. IMPORTANT: it shows the same 235/50R21 for 頂級版 and 旗艦版, which is what rules out a tyre-size premium as the source of the F Sport's higher running cost."},{"name":"TVBS 汽車頻道 — 2026 Lexus RX 規格表","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/lexus/2026-lexus-rx","note":"VERIFIED TODAY — NEW THIS PASS, and the key finding of the maintenance rebuild. Per-trim drivetrain: 350 豪華版 FWD (235/60R19), 350 頂級版 FWD (235/50R21), 350 旗艦版 FWD (235/50R21), 350 F Sport AWD (235/50R21), 500h F Sport Performance AWD. F Sport is the ONLY RX350 gasoline trim with all-wheel drive, which is what justifies the rear-diff / transfer-case services and the larger late-life allowance that put this trim above the FWD 頂級版 on maintenance. Prices match the other two tables (F Sport 295萬). No AVS or adaptive damping is listed for any trim, so none is claimed."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX350 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/RX350","note":"VERIFIED TODAY (re-fetched this pass), WITH A CORRECTION CARRIED FORWARD. Live listings, all 車商售價: 2024 F Sport 3.99萬 km (39,900 km) NT$2,198,000, described as '4WD'; 2024 旗艦版 3.12萬 km (31,200 km) NT$2,198,000, also '4WD' in the ad copy; 2023 頂級版 4.2萬 km (42,000 km) NT$1,898,000. An earlier draft divided every mileage by 10 and additionally described an RX500h listing as 'a 2025 RX350 at NT$2,480,000', which does not exist. All figures adjusted down from dealer retail before use."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX300 二手行情 (predecessor generation)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx300","note":"VERIFIED TODAY, FULLY THIS PASS. 4th-gen anchors: 2019 RX300 F Sport 2.0L, 11.9萬 km (119,000 km), NT$1,088,000 — the year-7 anchor; 2020 RX300 F Sport, 10.1萬 km (101,000 km), NT$1,328,000; 2020 RX300 豪華版, 2.2萬 km (22,000 km), NT$1,238,000 — the low-mileage 6-year point used to measure the year-10 decay factor; 2022 RX300 F Sport, 12.3萬 km (123,000 km), NT$1,398,000. A previous draft claimed the last three were not on the board and could not be confirmed; that was wrong and the caveat is withdrawn. The 2020 F Sport / 2020 豪華版 pair is also the direct evidence that the trim-ladder rule holds for RX F Sport in ratio terms (50.9% vs 56.5% of their respective lists)."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX200t 二手行情 (10-year-old cars)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx200t","note":"VERIFIED TODAY — NEW THIS PASS. 2016 RX200t 頂級版 2.0L, 18.38萬 km (183,800 km), NT$699,000, 杰運高雄. A genuine 10-year-old RX at very high mileage; paired against the low-mileage SUM car below it measures the 10-year low-mileage premium directly at +19.9%."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — Lexus RX 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=RX","note":"VERIFIED TODAY (re-fetched this pass), and now the primary year-10 source. 63 listings; today's slice returned the 10-year band in useful detail: 2016 RX 2.0L, 76,792 km, NT$838,000 (上藝汽車, 新北) — the single best-matched 10-year comparable for this buyer's 70,000 km; 2016 RX 2.0L, 136,914 km, NT$798,000 (冠立汽車, 台南); 2017 RX 3.5L, 94,465 km, NT$828,000 (億昇汽車, 台中); plus 2015 RX 2.7L examples from NT$418,000 (218,069 km) to NT$698,000 (72,357 km). F Sport variants in today's slice: 2021 RX F-Sport 106,856 km NT$1,530,000 (村信汽車, 高雄); 2021 RX F-Sport 123,000 km NT$1,398,000 (賜海汽車, 台中); 2020 RX F-Sport 101,000 km NT$1,328,000. CAVEAT: today's slice did NOT include the 2021 RX300 F-Sport at 27,277 km / NT$1,599,000 used as the year-5 anchor, so that specific listing could not be re-confirmed this pass; the 2021 F Sport points above corroborate the level and the year-5 point was left unchanged."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2024 Lexus RX 350 F Sport listing","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2260595","note":"Real dealer listing (東威汽車): 2024 Lexus RX350 F Sport at 219.8萬 = NT$2,198,000, independently corroborating the 8891 2-year-old F Sport price point. Verified on the previous pass; the abc好車網 model-list URL returned HTTP 404 on today's re-check, so this listing was not re-confirmed this pass and it is not load-bearing for any checkpoint."},{"name":"PChome 24h / 車麗屋 — DUNLOP SPORT MAXX LUX 235/50/21","url":"https://24h.pchome.com.tw/search/?q=235%2F50R21","note":"VERIFIED TODAY — NEW THIS PASS, and the only real price quote in the maintenance model. Four tyres in 235/50/21 with fitting included, NT$31,968 (from NT$32,957), sold by 車麗屋. This is the market FLOOR for the F Sport's size on a mid-tier pattern from a chain store; the NT$48,000 booked at year 6 assumes an OE-grade premium brand fitted with alignment, balancing and TPMS service. It replaces the previous record's unsourced NT$11,000-per-tyre assumption."},{"name":"U-CAR — 第四代Lexus RX車系國內正式發表 (2015 launch pricing)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/27742","note":"NOT RE-VERIFIABLE — returned HTTP 403 again on today's re-check. Previously cited for predecessor list prices (RX200t 2,190,000 / 2,390,000 / 2,590,000). The year-10 derivation was deliberately rebuilt this pass to run on observed price-to-price decay between real listings instead of on this denominator, so the 403 now only weakens a cross-check rather than the main chain. Retained as unconfirmed."},{"name":"U-CAR — 2017年式Lexus RX車系國內上市，新增RX200t F Sport","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/32062","note":"NOT RE-VERIFIABLE — returned HTTP 403 again on today's re-check. Cited for the predecessor F Sport list price of NT$2,610,000, still the denominator for the year-5 and year-7 retention ratios, which is why both stay low confidence. It also dates the 4th-gen F Sport to the 2017 model year, i.e. the oldest RX F Sport in Taiwan is 9 years old — the reason no 10-year F Sport observation exists in any generation."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 車主權益 (warranty and owner programmes)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx","note":"Official warranty term: 4 years / 120,000 km. Hybrid battery 8 years / 160,000 km (not applicable to this gasoline trim). Parts warranty 2 years / 50,000 km. Lists Lexus Elite Rewards and Hotai Points maintenance rebates (~1.5%). No blanket free-maintenance offer. Verified on the previous pass and unchanged."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 定期保養 / maintenance plan","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"Official interval table: 1 month, then 6 months / 10,000 km, 12 months / 20,000 km, 24 months / 40,000 km, 48 months / 80,000 km. At 7,000 km/year the mileage trigger never fires, so the 6-month TIME trigger governs: two visits a year, twenty over ten years. The only free item is the 1-month / 24-item new-car inspection; oil, filters, plugs, brake fluid, transmission fluid, differential oil and coolant are all paid. This overturns the annual-interval claim an earlier draft took from a forum thread."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 新車準時保養愛車享延長保證方案","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/news_detail.aspx?nw=563&fn=1","note":"8 consecutive on-time services from delivery using genuine oil and the official packages earn a free 1-year / 20,000 km warranty extension, for cars delivered from 2024-01-01. Missing one service means a paid extension from NT$25,900. The services themselves remain chargeable — this is a warranty programme, not free maintenance."},{"name":"PTT car board via disp.cc — Lexus定期保養費是不是被灌水","url":"https://disp.cc/b/Car/fJfl","note":"Owner-reported real service costs used as the labour/parts base for the maintenance model: NT$4,000-5,000 essential main service, NT$2,600 light half-year service, NT$3,800 required service at 70,000 km, NT$10,600 when dealer add-ons are accepted. NOTE: an earlier draft also used this thread to claim the manual interval is 1 year rather than 6 months. That claim is contradicted by the official Lexus TW maintenance-plan table and is not adopted; a forum post does not outrank the manufacturer's published schedule."}]},"lexus-rx350h-premium":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, roughly half the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year. All checkpoints use the 7,000 km/year midpoint, so assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). Two consequences run through the whole record. (1) Servicing is time-driven, not mileage-driven: Lexus TW's official schedule is 6個月/10,000km, 12個月/20,000km, 24個月/40,000km, 48個月/80,000km, whichever comes FIRST — at 7,000 km/year the time trigger always fires first, so the owner pays for 2 visits/year and never reaches a km trigger (only 70,000 km at year 10, i.e. the 80,000 km major is never mileage-triggered). Big-ticket consumables are therefore on an AGE clock: 235/50R21 tires time out long before they wear out, and the 12V battery dies of age. (2) Resale is quoted from low-mileage listings, which sit above the mileage-blind average, with the premium scaled by age — negligible at year 1, largest at year 10 where 70,000 km is under half of a typical 150,000 km 10-year-old car. Tax and insurance are excluded by design and appear nowhere in this record. TRIM CONTEXT (added on adversarial review): 頂級版 is NOT the top of the RX350h range — the 2026 ladder is 豪華版 256萬 < 頂級版 278萬 < 旗艦版 305萬 (TVBS spec table). Retention ratios in this record are therefore constrained to sit BELOW the 豪華版 base trim and ABOVE the 旗艦版, per the Taiwan trim-ladder rule that equipment grade is largely lost at resale.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"CORRECTED DOWN on adversarial review (was 2,100,000) to satisfy the trim-ladder rule. Real anchor, fetched and confirmed: 2025 RX 350 旗艦版 asking 248萬 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2294103) against a 295萬 list = 84.1% DEALER RETAIL at ~1 year; 2024 RX 350h 旗艦版 asks 238萬 and 259.8萬 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2284829, https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2209780). Those are 旗艦版 asks and a dealer ASK sits above transaction, so I set this trim's 1-year dealer retail asking at ~225萬 = 81.0% of the 278萬 list rather than borrowing 84% wholesale. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED (the dealer-retail trap): retail asking 2,250,000 -> private sale 2,000,000 is an 11.1% haircut, because dealer retail carries the dealer's margin, warranty/整備 cost and negotiating room that a private seller cannot charge for; private 2,000,000 -> dealer trade-in 1,750,000 is a further 12.5%. Both inside the brief's 8-15% and 10-15% bands. TRIM-LADDER CHECK: 2,000,000 / 2,780,000 = 71.9%, which sits 1.1 points BELOW the RX350h 豪華版 sibling's 73.0% while the absolute price stays 130,000 ABOVE it (1,870,000) — the correct shape. Small low-mileage premium only; at 1 year 7,000 km barely differentiates. Confidence medium: no 1-year 350h 頂級版 listing exists, the ratio is borrowed across trims."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"CORRECTED DOWN (was 1,860,000) and confidence DOWNGRADED from high to medium. Best-evidenced checkpoint: four real dealer RETAIL asks for this exact trim and generation (2023年式 RX350h 頂級版, 5th gen, now ~3.3 years old) — 189.8萬 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2276730), 208.8萬 at 5,000 km (8891 中古車, https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx), 213.8萬 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2206330), and 218萬 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2183772 — I fetched this one directly and confirmed it is a 2023 Lexus RX 350h 頂級版 asking NT$2,180,000). Per the brief I lean to the low-mileage end (the buyer is at 21,000 km), but I set the retail basis at ~203萬 rather than the researcher's 210萬 for three reasons: the four asks span 189.8-218萬 (a 15% spread), the 2023 list was 282萬 versus 278萬 today so the ratio must be rebased down ~1.4% (https://c.8891.com.tw/m/article/tag/Lexus-RX-2023%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC), and an ASK is not a transaction. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: retail 2,030,000 -> private sale 1,780,000 is a 12.3% haircut; private -> dealer trade-in 1,560,000 is a further 12.4%. TRIM-LADDER CHECK: 64.0% of list, 1.2 points below the 豪華版 sibling's 65.2%, absolute 110,000 above it. Car is still inside the reported 4-year factory warranty here, which is why the ratio is this strong. Confidence medium not high: every input is a dealer ASK, the spread is 15%, and the private figure is a derived haircut rather than an observed private transaction — 'high' was not earned."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"CORRECTED UP on review (was 1,450,000). EXTRAPOLATED, not observed — the 5th-gen RX launched in Taiwan in late 2022/Jan 2023, so the oldest car is ~3.5 years old and NO genuine 5-year data for this generation exists. Method per the brief: take the PREDECESSOR generation (4th-gen RX450h) at the matching age, express it as a retention ratio of ITS original list, apply that ratio here. Predecessor anchor: 2022 RX450h 頂級版 asking 199.8萬 as a LEXUS CPO car (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2146839) against its 314萬 list (https://c.8891.com.tw/article/tag/Lexus-rx450h-%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC) = 63.6% dealer retail at ~4 years; CPO carries roughly a 10% premium over ordinary trade, giving ~57-58% at 4 years and ~54% rolled forward to 5. Adding back a low-mileage premium (35,000 km versus a typical 60,000-75,000 km 5-year-old) gives a dealer RETAIL asking price of ~170萬 = 61.2% of the 278萬 list. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: retail 1,700,000 -> private sale 1,500,000 is an 11.8% haircut; private -> trade-in 1,310,000 is a further 12.7%. WHY RAISED: the researcher's 1,450,000 was 52.2% of list, i.e. 3.3 points BELOW the 豪華版 sibling's 55.5%. The trim rule says the higher trim retains SLIGHTLY less, not dramatically less; a 3.3-point penalty overstates it and broke the smoothness of the curve. 54.0% is 1.5 points below the base trim, which is the right magnitude. The visible step down from year 3 (64.0%) is real: the reported 4-year factory warranty has expired by year 5, a genuine cliff in the Taiwanese used-luxury market. Confidence low — extrapolated off a different (3.5L V6) hybrid whose residuals were additionally depressed by being replaced in 2022."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"Adjusted slightly down (was 1,230,000). EXTRAPOLATED — no 7-year data for the current 5th-gen RX can exist. Predecessor anchors at exactly this age (2019年式 4th-gen RX450h, now ~7 years old): 頂級版 asking 189.8萬 as a LEXUS CPO car — I fetched https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2036666 directly and confirmed it is a 2019 Lexus RX450h 頂級版 at NT$1,898,000, LEXUS CPO/民族營業所 — against its 308萬 facelift list = 61.6% retail; and 旗艦版 asking 158.8萬 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/car/1804314) against its 338萬 list = 47.0% retail. Trim list prices from the 2019 小改款 RX price table (https://2gamesome.com.tw/article/view/374). Stripping the ~10% CPO premium off the 頂級版 gives ~55% ordinary trade; the 旗艦版 gives 47%. NOTE this pair is itself a clean instance of the trim rule — the dearer 旗艦版 retains a clearly LOWER ratio, which is the same direction the correction to this record applies. Taking ~50% as the ordinary-trade 7-year ratio and adding a low-mileage premium for 49,000 km (versus a typical 90,000-105,000 km 7-year-old) gives a dealer RETAIL asking price of ~138萬 = 49.6% of list. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: retail 1,380,000 -> private sale 1,210,000 is a 12.3% haircut; private -> trade-in 1,050,000 is a further 13.2%. TRIM-LADDER CHECK: 43.5% of list versus the 豪華版 sibling's 44.9% — 1.4 points below, absolute 60,000 above. Confidence low: extrapolated, and the two predecessor data points disagree by 14 percentage points."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"CORRECTED DOWN on review (was 960,000) — this was the clearest trim-ladder violation in the record. EXTRAPOLATED; no 10-year data for the 5th-gen RX can exist. Predecessor anchors at exactly this age (2016年式 4th-gen RX450h, now ~10 years old): 頂級版 asking 128.8萬 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1900355) and 旗艦版 asking 118.8萬 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1826919). Measured against the 2019 facelift list prices as the closest published reference (308萬 頂級版 / 338萬 旗艦版, https://2gamesome.com.tw/article/view/374; the 2016 pre-facelift list was somewhat lower, making these ratios slightly conservative), that is roughly 42% and 35% dealer retail — again the dearer trim retaining less. Taking ~36% as the ordinary-trade 10-year ratio and adding the LARGEST low-mileage premium of any checkpoint (70,000 km is under half the ~150,000 km a typical 10-year-old Taiwanese SUV carries, and at this age mileage dominates price) gives a dealer RETAIL asking price of ~101.5萬 = 36.5% of list. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: retail 1,015,000 -> private sale 885,000 is a 12.8% haircut; private -> trade-in 765,000 is a further 13.6%. WHY LOWERED: the researcher's 960,000 was 34.5% of list against the 豪華版 sibling's 33.0% — the top trim retaining MORE, exactly the inversion the brief warns about, and at the age where equipment grade is worth least. 31.8% is 1.2 points below the base trim while the absolute stays 40,000 above it (845,000). Confidence low: extrapolated off a different hybrid powertrain, and the 2016 list is inferred from the 2019 facelift table. Residual risk not priced in: a 10-year-old hybrid carries traction-battery anxiety that can depress the private figure further even when the pack is healthy."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Covers 0-1y. Interval structure from the official Lexus TW schedule (https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx) — at 7,000 km/year the 6-month clock governs, so 2 paid visits in year 1. Costed at ~4,500 for the 6-month minor plus ~7,500 for the 12-month service using owner-reported Taiwanese figures. No consumables and no repairs: tires, 12V battery and brake work are all years away on both clocks, and the car is inside factory warranty. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from the researcher's 'high' to medium: the visit count and item list are officially sourced, but the money is forum-reported and the record's own open questions concede it could move ±20% on dealer upsell. 'High' requires a real source behind the number, and no published Lexus TW 定保套餐 price sheet was obtained."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers 1-3y: 4 paid visits on the 6-month time clock (18/24/30/36 個月). Interval and item content from the official Lexus TW schedule (https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx), which places brake fluid and the Hybrid 動力控制冷卻 checks at the 24-month service. Costed at roughly 4,500 + 10,000 + 4,500 + 8,500 on the same owner-reported per-visit range, plus ~2,000 for wiper blades. Still inside the reported factory warranty, so no repair allowance. Unchanged from the researcher's figure — structure is officially grounded and the total is reasonable; the honest reading is that it could swing ±20% on dealer upsell."},{"y":5,"source":"CORRECTED DOWN from the researcher's 92,000. Covers 3-5y: 4 paid visits (~36,000, including the 48-month major at ~18,000 — the biggest scheduled item in the whole Lexus TW table, the only one adding 自排變速箱油/燃油濾清器/引擎冷卻液, and at 7,000 km/year it arrives on the 4-year clock with only 28,000 km covered), plus a first 12V AGM battery at ~7,000 on age, plus a ~5,000 first out-of-warranty allowance. WHY LOWERED: the researcher loaded a full set of 235/50R21 tires (~45,000) into this window. At year 5 the original set is only just entering the 5-6 year rubber-ageing window with 35,000 km and plenty of tread; replacement realistically falls at ~5.5-6 years, which is the 5-7 window. Moving it there matches the same-model 豪華版 sibling's treatment and removes the non-monotonic 92,000 -> 55,000 dip. Brake pads deliberately NOT included: regenerative braking plus 35,000 km means the originals survive this window."},{"y":7,"source":"CORRECTED UP from the researcher's 55,000 — this is where the first tire set actually lands. Covers 5-7y: 4 paid visits at the owner-reported 4,000-5,000 minor / 8,000-10,600 annual rates gives ~28,000. TIRES are the headline: 235/50R21 confirmed for this trim on the TVBS 2026 RX spec table (https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/lexus/2026-lexus-rx), roughly 11,000-12,000 per corner fitted in Taiwan, ~48,000 for four. At 49,000 km the tread is nowhere near worn — the set is binned on AGE at ~5.5-6 years, which is the single clearest illustration that low mileage does not buy cheap ownership. Added ~15,000 for front pads plus disc skimming (late but due at 49,000 km with regenerative braking, and the first brake spend in the model), ~5,000 for the e-CVT transaxle fluid, and ~9,000 as an out-of-warranty repair allowance since the reported 4-year warranty lapsed in the previous window. Confidence medium: visit count and tire size are officially grounded, the brake and repair figures are judgement rather than receipts."},{"y":10,"source":"CORRECTED DOWN from the researcher's 185,000. Covers 7-10y — longest window (3 years, 6 paid visits) and the least certain. Scheduled side ~49,000 including the 96-month repeat of the big service (變速箱油/冷卻液/燃油濾清器 per https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx). Age-driven consumables dominate the rest: a SECOND set of 235/50R21 (~50,000) around year 10-11 regardless of mileage, a second 12V battery (~8,000), front and rear discs and pads (~18,000), long-life coolant (~4,000). WHY LOWERED: the researcher stacked a 25,000 suspension/bushing line, a 15,000 hybrid-peripheral line AND a separate 20,000 general out-of-warranty reserve. Suspension bushings, inverter coolant and the electric water pump are precisely what a general reserve on a 10-year-old car is for — carrying them as named line items on top of the reserve double-counts. Folded into one 25,000 reserve, which is still above the 20,000 the 豪華版 sibling uses, correctly reflecting the heavier top-trim hardware. Net total 155,000 versus the sibling's 130,000; the 25,000 gap is almost exactly the 21-inch tire premium, which is the right answer. EXPLICITLY EXCLUDED: traction-battery replacement. Confidence low: 7-10 years out, no receipts exist for a 5th-gen RX at this age, and the total could plausibly land anywhere from 120,000 to 230,000 depending on whether any single large failure occurs."}],"sources":[{"name":"8891 新車 — 2026年式 Lexus RX 國內上架，價格表","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/lexus/rx/20732","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED on adversarial review. Primary list-price source. Returns the full 2026年式 table: RX350 豪華版 246萬, RX350h 豪華版 256萬, RX350 頂級版 268萬, RX350h 頂級版 278萬, RX450h+ 豪華版 315萬. Confirms 售價維持不變 for 2026 and that the changes are cosmetic (2.5D wheel-cap logo, brighter interior LED ambient lighting). The researcher's 2,780,000 is CORRECT."},{"name":"地球黃金線 (TVBS) — 2026 Lexus RX 規格配備表","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/lexus/2026-lexus-rx","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED. Independent confirmation of 278萬 for 350h 頂級版, and the source of the two facts the maintenance model turns on: 2487cc, and tire size 235/50R21 on 頂級版 versus 235/60R19 on 豪華版 — the verified basis for this trim's higher tire cost. Also returns the full 10-trim ladder, which establishes that 頂級版 is a mid-high trim (旗艦版 305萬 and 500h F Sport 361萬 sit above it), not the top."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官網 — RX 車型頁","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/showroom/RX","note":"Official source. Lineup range 246~361萬 brackets the 278萬 figure and matches the 8891/TVBS ladder endpoints exactly, but does not break out per-trim prices, so the tables above were needed for the trim-level number."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [菜單] Lexus RX350h 鈦色 頂級版","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1733189425.A.493.html","note":"Real transaction sheet: 牌價278萬 折19萬, 成交總價263萬 including 4萬 (3M隔熱紙+瓷晶鍍膜) and 7,000 (3D卡固腳踏墊) of self-paid accessories. Explicitly states 領牌費 not included. Evidence that the discount is six-figure, not token."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [菜單] LEXUS RX350H 頂級版 (2025年出廠)","url":"https://www.pttweb.cc/bbs/car/M.1760544279.A.1DD","note":"Real transaction sheet and the most recent found: 牌價278萬 折28萬, 成交253.8萬 including 3.8萬 self-paid accessories, 領牌 and 保險 實報實銷. The largest verified discount on this exact trim, and the ceiling that the corrected 260,000 discount sits below."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [菜單] Lexus RX350h 頂級版","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1750670118.A.D01.html","note":"Third transaction sheet: 成交248萬 cash, with 前後行車紀錄器 / 黑鑽鍍膜 / 後車廂托盤 / 電動側踏板 gifted. Corroborates the large-discount pattern from a different dealer group."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx","note":"Used-market listing board. Source of the 2023 RX350h 頂級版 at 5,000 km asking 208.8萬 used as one of the year-3 low-mileage anchors. All figures here are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking) and were haircut 11-13% before entering private_sale_price."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX350 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/RX350","note":"Supporting current-gen retail asks on the gasoline sibling: 2024 RX350 旗艦版 219.8萬, 2023 RX350 頂級版 189.8萬, 2024 RX350 F Sport 219.8萬. Used only to sanity-check the shape of the 1-3 year curve."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2023年 Lexus RX 350h 頂級版 (5代), 213.8萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2206330","note":"Exact trim/generation match, dealer asking NT$2,138,000. One of four year-3 retail anchors."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2023年 Lexus RX 350h 頂級版, 1.9萬公里, 218萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2183772","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED on adversarial review: confirmed a 2023 Lexus RX 350h 頂級版 listed by 義大國際 at NT$2,180,000. The closest real match to this buyer's 21,000 km at year 3, and the top of the year-3 retail band."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2023年 Lexus RX 350h 頂級版, 189.8萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2276730","note":"Lowest of the four year-3 retail asks (保固中). Retained for honesty about the spread — the four asks run 189.8萬 to 218萬, a 15% range, which is why the year-3 confidence is medium rather than high."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2022年 Lexus RX450h 頂級版 (LEXUS CPO), 199.8萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2146839","note":"PREDECESSOR generation, ~4 years old. Against its 314萬 list this is 63.6% dealer retail; stripping the CPO premium gives the ~57% ordinary-trade ratio the year-5 extrapolation is built on."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2019年 Lexus RX450h 頂級版 (LEXUS CPO), 189.8萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2036666","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED on adversarial review: confirmed a 2019 Lexus RX450h 頂級版 at NT$1,898,000 from LEXUS CPO/民族營業所. PREDECESSOR at exactly the 7-year mark. 61.6% of its 308萬 list as a CPO car, ~55% ordinary-trade equivalent. Primary basis for the year-7 ratio."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2019年 Lexus RX450h 旗艦版 (4代), 158.8萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/car/1804314","note":"PREDECESSOR at 7 years, non-CPO: 158.8萬 against a 338萬 list = 47.0%. Brackets the year-7 ratio with the 頂級版 CPO listing above, AND is direct evidence for the trim rule — the dearer 旗艦版 retains a clearly lower percentage than 頂級版. This is the same rule that forced the downward correction to this record's own ratios."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2016年 Lexus RX450h 頂級版, 128.8萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1900355","note":"PREDECESSOR generation at the 10-year mark, asking NT$1,288,000 = ~42% of the 2019 facelift 頂級版 list. Primary basis for the year-10 ratio."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2016年 Lexus RX450h 旗艦版 (4代), 118.8萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1826919","note":"PREDECESSOR at 10 years, asking NT$1,188,000 = ~35% of the 旗艦版 list. Second year-10 anchor, and again shows the dearer trim retaining a lower ratio than 頂級版."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2025年 Lexus RX 350 旗艦版, 248萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2294103","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED on adversarial review: confirmed a 2025 Lexus RX 350 旗艦版 at NT$2,480,000 from 上達汽車. Current-gen car at ~1 year: 84.1% dealer retail against a 295萬 list. Basis for the year-1 retail ratio, discounted to 81% here because it is a single 旗艦版 ask and asks sit above transaction."},{"name":"2GameSome 有車賞 — 2019 小改款 Lexus RX 台灣價格表","url":"https://2gamesome.com.tw/article/view/374","note":"Full price table for the facelifted 4th-gen RX (Sept 2019). Supplies the predecessor list prices the year-7 and year-10 retention ratios are divided by: RX450h 頂級版 308萬, 旗艦版 338萬, F Sport 334萬."},{"name":"8891 — 2023年式 Lexus RX 價格表","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/m/article/tag/Lexus-RX-2023%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC","note":"Original list prices of the cars now selling as 3-year-old used stock: RX350h 頂級版 was 282萬 in 2023 versus 278萬 today. Used to rebase the year-3 retention ratio down ~1.4% so it is expressed against today's list."},{"name":"8891 — Lexus RX450h 價格 (4代)","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/article/tag/Lexus-rx450h-%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC","note":"Late 4th-gen RX450h list prices: 頂級版 314萬, F Sport 340萬, 旗艦版 344萬. Denominator for the 2022 CPO listing used in the year-5 extrapolation."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官網 — 保養計劃 (scheduled maintenance table)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"OFFICIAL maintenance schedule and the backbone of the maintenance model: 新車/1個月 (24 checks, free), 6個月/10,000km (16), 12個月/20,000km (29), 24個月/40,000km (34), 48個月/80,000km (37, adds 變速箱油/冷卻液/燃油濾清器). Also lists the Hybrid-specific 動力控制冷卻 checks at 24 and 48 months. Confirms intervals are whichever-comes-first, which is what makes this owner's servicing time-driven. NOTE: it establishes the interval STRUCTURE only — it is not a price list, which is why no maintenance checkpoint is rated above medium."},{"name":"Mobile01 — XC60、RX350h、Q5 保養費用比較","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=397&t=7258226","note":"HONESTY NOTE, retained from the researcher and endorsed: a direct fetch returned HTTP 403, so the thread body was never read and NO number in this record comes from it. The visible search snippet flags hybrid-battery replacement anxiety around the 5-year mark, which is reflected in the year-10 resale commentary, not as a maintenance cost."}]},"lexus-rx350h-flagship":{"assumptions":"買家年跑 6,000-8,000 km，取中值 7,000 km/年，各檢查點 assumed_km = 7000 × years（7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000）。三個推論後果：(1) 保養由時間觸發。已直接讀取 Lexus TW 官方保養計劃頁確認節奏是「每 6 個月／10,000 km，取先到者」，7,000 km/年永遠碰不到里程門檻，因此一年 2 次進廠（半年小保養＋週年保養）；里程門檻（2 萬／4 萬／8 萬 km）在 10 年內幾乎都碰不到，一律由時間門檻（12/24/48 個月）觸發。(2) 中古估值採低里程件。10 年 70,000 km 只有台灣平均（12,000-15,000 km/年）的一半，所有殘值皆引用低里程實車、或對高里程實車做低里程上調，調整幅度寫在各 source 字串。(3) 所有中古實車開價都是【車商售價】，本表一律做兩段下修：車商售價 −12~15% ＝自售價（private_sale_price），自售價再 −14~15.5% ＝車商收購價（dealer_tradein_price）。年份越老、車商價差越大，故折扣幅度隨車齡遞增。稅金與保險依設計不計入。","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"【本輪重研：由 82% 下修至 77.1%】前稿的 2,300,000（82.1%）是全車系最高保值率，且與 lexus-rx350-premium 的 1 年百分比逐字相同，來源不可信，本輪整格重做。本輪未在任何平台找到 2025 年式 RX350h 旗艦版在售件（該車 2023-02 才上市，1 年車釋出量極少），因此改用【同世代實車測得的年度斜率往回推】，不引用任何無法複驗的開價。實測基礎（皆為本輪直接讀取）：8891 中古車 2024 年式 RX350 旗艦版（汽油）31,200 km 車商開價 2,198,000（https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx，東威汽車 台北）＝牌價 2,950,000 的 74.5%；里程對齊到 2 年車的 14,000 km（+17,200 km × 約 NT$2.5/km ＝ +43,000）後為 76.0%。同一輪讀到的 3 年車實測（見 3 年檢查點）給出油電 旗艦版 21,000 km ＝ 牌價 73.4%、汽油 旗艦版 21,000 km ＝ 牌價 70.3%，故油電對汽油的動力系統溢價實測為 +3.1 個百分點。把 +3.1 套到 2 年汽油的 76.0% → 2 年油電 旗艦版 約 79.1%；再套 2→3 年實測斜率 5.7 點/年往回推，1 年車車商開價約【牌價 85%】＝ 2,590,000。轉換鏈：車商售價 2,590,000 → 扣 15%（本表兩段下修的上限值，刻意取保守端；1 年車仍在 4 年/12 萬 km 原廠保固內，車商的整備與保固加值真實存在）→ 自售價 2,160,000 → 再扣 14% → 車商收購價 1,860,000。自售價／real_cost ＝ 77.1%。【trim ladder 檢核】本值刻意壓在 RX350h 頂級版（78%）之下：本輪未取得油電 頂級版 的 1 年實車，但同輪實測的汽油 旗艦版 vs 頂級版（3 年、里程對齊）為 70.3% vs 72.8%，旗艦版低 2.5 點，證實台灣市場不為配備等級付錢，故旗艦版不得高於自家基礎版。【誠實揭露】若改用區間中段的 12% 自售折扣，本格會落在 82%（即前稿數字）；本輪選擇折扣上限而非中段，是因為 reviewer 指出本格偏高、且 1 年車商開價本身是外推而非實測，兩重不確定下取保守端。confidence 因此維持 medium 而非 high。"},{"y":3,"conf":"high","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"【本輪最大升級：首次取得同車型同年式的實車開價】本輪在 8891 中古車 Lexus RX 列表第 2 頁（https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx?page=2）直接讀到兩筆 2023 年式 RX350h（＝本車 3 年車）：(a) 2023 RX350h 旗艦版、39,000 km、車商開價 2,258,000（嚴選通運，基隆）——與本表完全同動力、同等級、同年式；(b) 2023 RX350h（未標等級）、36,000 km、車商開價 2,138,000（台南）。【刻意不只取高值】只用 (a) 會得到牌價 74.0%，但 (b) 若同為旗艦版則明顯較低，若為頂級版（牌價 2,780,000）則其比值 76.9% 反而高於 (a)，正好印證 trim ladder 方向。為避免挑高值，取兩筆平均 2,198,000（平均里程約 37,500 km）作為 3 年車商售價基準。調整鏈：2,198,000（37,500 km）→ 低里程上調至本案 21,000 km（+16,500 km × 約 NT$2.5/km ＝ +41,000）→ 車商售價 2,239,000（＝牌價 73.4%）→ 扣 13.8% → 自售價 1,930,000 → 再扣 14% → 車商收購價 1,660,000。自售價／real_cost ＝ 68.9%。【trim ladder 實測，本輪核心證據】同一輪在同平台讀到的同世代汽油車，里程一律用 NT$2.5/km 對齊到 21,000 km：2023 RX350 旗艦版 15,000 km 開價 2,089,000 → 2,074,000 ＝ 牌價 2,950,000 的 70.3%；2023 RX350 頂級版 42,000 km 開價 1,898,000 → 1,950,500 ＝ 牌價 2,680,000 的 72.8%。頂級版比旗艦版高 2.5 個百分點，方向與台灣市場常識一致（配備等級的錢在中古市場拿不回來），故本表 68.9% 壓在 RX350h 頂級版 70% 之下。【前稿錯誤已更正】前稿此格引用「SUM 汽車網 2023 年式 RX 2,500cc 油電、36,132 km、開價 2,158,000」並稱其為旗艦版；本輪直接讀取 https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=RX，該筆車型名稱實為【RX500h】（牌價 3,610,000 的 F Sport Performance），不是 RX350h 旗艦版，屬車型誤認，已整筆棄用。第 3 年（2029）原廠 4 年/12 萬 km 保固仍在，是撐住價位的因素。"},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"【明確外推，非實測】現行第五代 RX 於 2023-02 才在台上市，市場上不存在 5 年的當代 RX350h。改用前代（第四代）同等級車換算。基準：abc 好車網 2021 年式 RX450h 旗艦版 車商開價 1,788,000（https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2226665，本輪已直接讀取確認為 2021 RX450h 旗艦版、開價相符，頁面未列里程），對其牌價 3,440,000（https://c.8891.com.tw/article/tag/Lexus-rx450h-%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC，本輪已直接讀取，明列「450h 旗艦版 344 萬」）＝ 車商售價殘值 52.0%。兩項向上修正（相乘）：(1) 稅級 ×1.10 —— RX350h 為 2,487cc（牌照稅 2,401-3,000cc 級距，11,230/年），RX450h 為 3,456cc（3,001-4,200cc 級距，28,220/年），年稅差約 17,000。本輪用同齡實車實測了這個效應：SUM 汽車網 2021 RX300 Premier（1,998cc，稅 7,120）27,277 km 開價 1,599,000 ＝ 牌價約 2,590,000 的 61.7%，對比同齡 RX450h 的 52.0%，2.0L 對 3.5L 的稅級溢價實測為 ×1.19；RX350h 的稅級落在兩者之間且偏近 2.0L 端，保守只取 ×1.10。(2) 低里程 ×1.06 —— 所引前代實車未列里程，同齡件普遍 60,000-80,000 km，本案僅 35,000 km。52.0% × 1.10 × 1.06 ＝ 60.6% ＝ 車商售價 1,848,000 → 扣 13.4% → 自售價 1,600,000 → 再扣 13.8% → 車商收購價 1,380,000。自售價／real_cost ＝ 57.1%，壓在 RX350h 頂級版 59% 之下。基準車本身即為【旗艦版】，故 trim ladder 懲罰已內含於 52.0% 之中，未再另外扣。旁證：8891 讀到 2022 RX300 旗艦版 69,000 km 開價 1,428,000 ＝ 牌價約 2,790,000 的 51.2%（4 年、高里程），與本格外推的量級一致。confidence low，因分子是單一筆無里程的車商開價。"},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"【明確外推，非實測。已改用有里程的實車，棄用前稿的無里程開價】前稿用 abc 好車網 2019 RX450h 旗艦版 1,698,000（https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2176546，本輪已直接讀取確認車型與開價相符，頁面未列里程）。本輪保留該連結但【不再作為主要基準】：它比同平台 2021 年式的 1,788,000 只低 90,000，2 年車齡差只掉 5%，與其他平台的同齡行情嚴重不符，判定為停滯的高掛開價。改用本輪在 8891 直接讀到、且標明里程的同世代 7 年實車：2019 年式 RX300 旗艦版、110,000 km、車商開價 1,190,000（https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx?page=2）＝ 牌價約 2,790,000 的 42.7%；同頁另有 2019 RX300 F Sport 119,000 km 開價 1,088,000 作為佐證。調整鏈：1,190,000（110,000 km）→ 低里程上調至本案 49,000 km（−61,000 km × 約 NT$2.2/km ＝ +134,000）→ 1,324,000 ＝ 牌價 47.5% → 動力系統修正 ×1.04（油電需求較佳）× 稅級修正 ×0.97（2,487cc 稅級略高於 1,998cc）＝ 47.9% → 車商售價 ＝ 47.9% × 3,050,000 ＝ 1,461,000 → 扣 13.8% → 自售價 1,260,000 → 再扣 14.3% → 車商收購價 1,080,000。自售價／real_cost ＝ 45.0%，壓在 RX350h 頂級版 47% 之下。基準車同為【旗艦版】，trim ladder 懲罰已內含。此時原廠保固（含按時定保可免費延長的第 5 年/14 萬 km）已全數失效，是自售價開始加速下滑的轉折點。confidence low：分母（2019 年 RX300 旗艦版牌價 2,790,000）為推估，且跨動力系統換算。"},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"【本輪重研：由 38.6% 下修至 32.1%。前稿此格的來源被實測推翻】前稿引用 abc 好車網兩筆 2016 RX450h 旗艦版開價 1,188,000（https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1826919，本輪已直接讀取確認車型與開價相符、頁面未列里程）與 1,248,000，平均 1,220,000 ＝ 牌價 3,300,000 的 37%。本輪判定這兩筆是【停滯的高掛開價，不可作為行情】：同輪讀到的有里程實車顯示同款更新一年的車反而便宜得多 —— SUM 汽車網 2017 RX450h、94,465 km、開價 828,000（https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=RX）＝ 牌價 25.1%；8891 讀到 2017 RX450h、198,400 km、688,000，以及 2014 RX450h 頂級版 120,000 km、450,000。一台 2016 年車開價高於 2017 年 94,465 km 的實車 43%，在同一市場不可能成立。改用本輪 8891 直接讀到、標明里程、且【同為旗艦版】的 10 年實車：2016 年式 RX200t 旗艦版、90,000 km、車商開價 898,000（https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx?page=2，道德車商 台中）＝ 牌價約 2,750,000 的 32.7%。選 RX200t 而非 RX450h 當基準，是因為 RX200t 為 1,998cc、稅級與本車 2,487cc 接近，而 RX450h 的 3,456cc 重稅在 10 年車段是壓垮價格的主因（25.1% vs 32.7% 即為此差距的實測值），直接套 450h 會嚴重低估本車。調整：低里程 ×1.10（90,000 → 70,000 km，10 年車而言 70,000 km 屬稀有）× 油電電池老化折價 ×0.98 ＝ 35.2% ＝ 車商售價 1,074,000 → 扣 16.2%（10 年車車商壓價幅度最大）→ 自售價 900,000 → 再扣 15.6% → 車商收購價 760,000。自售價／real_cost ＝ 32.1%。【trim ladder 在老車段的直接實測，本輪最有力的一筆證據】同一頁同年式同車系：2016 RX200t 旗艦版 90,000 km 開價 898,000、2016 RX200t 豪華版 110,000 km 開價 820,000。兩者新車牌價差約 410,000，10 年後開價只差 78,000 —— 旗艦版的配備溢價只剩約 19% 殘值。這正是本表 10 年百分比必須明顯低於低階版本、也必須低於 RX350h 頂級版 35% 的實證理由。confidence low：跨動力系統與跨世代雙重外推，且 10 年車實際成交價通常再低於開價一截。"}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"進廠次數與項目依 Lexus TW 官方保養計劃表（https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx，本輪已再次直接讀取確認 6 個月/10,000 km 節奏與各門檻項目）；單價取自 PTT car 板 RX350h 一年定保車主實際原廠報價（冷氣濾網原廠 3,000／LS 濾網 2,100，https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1749131889.A.924.html）。全程在 4 年/12 萬 km 原廠保固內，無修理支出。火星塞雖列在 12 個月/2 萬 km 那一列，但 2.5L 油電為長效銥合金規格、實際依里程遞延，7,000 km 時不更換。"},{"y":3,"source":"1-3 年共 4 次進廠（每 6 個月 1 次），依 Lexus TW 官方保養表的 24 個月門檻加做煞車油（https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx）。單價沿用 PTT 車主實際原廠報價基準（https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1749131889.A.924.html）。仍在 4 年/12 萬 km 原廠保固內，不計修理費。"},{"y":5,"source":"進廠次數與加項依 Lexus TW 官方保養計劃 48 個月門檻（https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx，本輪已直接讀取確認 48 個月/8 萬 km 為 37 項檢查並加做冷卻液、變速箱油、燃油濾清器）。本區間仍在原廠保固（含按時定保免費延長的第 5 年/14 萬 km）內，無自費修理。輪胎與 12V 電瓶排在 5-7 年區間（見 plan_notes 的單調性修正），火星塞 10 年內不更換。confidence low，因單價基準只有一串 PTT 車主報價，且 48 個月大保養加項金額為推估。"},{"y":7,"source":"【推估為主】原廠 4 年/12 萬 km 保固（含免費延長的第 5 年，https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx）在此區間全數失效，開始出現自費修理。定保次數仍依官方每 6 個月一次的節奏推算，單價沿用 PTT 原廠報價基準並加計脫保後診斷費。21 吋 235/50R21 四條含工 56,000 與 12V AGM 電瓶 9,000 都是台灣市場行情推估，沒有 RX 旗艦版車主的實際收據佐證，是本格最敏感的槓桿（約佔一半金額）。輪胎排在第 6 年（42,000 km）而非第 5 年：年跑 7,000 km 的胎是橡膠老化到期而非磨耗，台灣實務 5-6 年換。"},{"y":10,"source":"【推估為主，本表最不確定的一格】無任何當代 RX350h 的 10 年實績可引，Mobile01 相關討論串在本輪與前稿的抓取中一律 403 讀不到。定保次數依 Lexus TW 每 6 個月一次的官方節奏推算（3 年 ＝ 6 次，https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx）；避震器、襯套、水泵等老化件金額為同級豪華休旅的一般性推估。年跑 7,000 km 使 10 年僅 70,000 km，遠低於一般 10 年車，因此里程型耗損（引擎、變速箱大修）風險低，但時間型耗損（橡膠、油封、電瓶、輪胎）照樣發生——這格的成本結構幾乎全是時間型。第一組輪胎排在第 6 年，第二整組要到第 12 年才到期，故本區間不計整組換胎，只列兩條＋定位的部分預算。"}],"sources":[{"name":"8891 新車｜2026年式Lexus RX國內上架！細節微調、售價不變！","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/lexus/rx/20732","note":"本輪重新直接讀取，取得完整 10 車型價目表：350 豪華版 2,460,000／350 頂級版 2,680,000／350 旗艦版 2,950,000／350 F Sport 2,950,000／350h 豪華版 2,560,000／350h 頂級版 2,780,000／350h 旗艦版 3,050,000／450h+ 豪華版 3,150,000／450h+ 旗艦版 3,550,000／500h F Sport Performance 3,610,000，並註明「售價維持不變」。list_price 的主要依據，同時提供本表所有 trim-ladder 與跨動力比較的分母。"},{"name":"8891 中古車｜Lexus RX 在售車輛列表 第 2 頁（本輪關鍵來源）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx?page=2","note":"本輪直接讀取。含【2023 年式 RX350h 旗艦版、39,000 km、車商開價 2,258,000（嚴選通運 基隆）】——與本表完全同動力、同等級、同年式的唯一實車，是 3 年檢查點的主要依據；另有 2023 RX350h（未標等級）36,000 km 開價 2,138,000（台南）。同頁另提供本表 7 年與 10 年外推的基準：2019 RX300 旗艦版 110,000 km 1,190,000、2019 RX300 F Sport 119,000 km 1,088,000、2016 RX200t 旗艦版 90,000 km 898,000、2016 RX200t 豪華版 110,000 km 820,000（旗艦／豪華 10 年後只差 78,000，是配備溢價幾乎歸零的直接實證）、2017 RX450h 198,400 km 688,000、2014 RX450h 頂級版 120,000 km 450,000、2022 RX300 旗艦版 69,000 km 1,428,000。"},{"name":"8891 中古車｜Lexus RX 在售車輛列表 第 1 頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx","note":"本輪直接讀取。同世代汽油車的 trim-ladder 實測基準：2024 RX350 旗艦版 31,200 km 2,198,000（東威 台北）、2024 RX350 F Sport 39,900 km 2,198,000（東威）、2023 RX350 頂級版 42,000 km 1,898,000（東威）、2024 RX500h F Sport Performance 19,000 km 2,688,000。同一車商的 旗艦版 vs 頂級版 對照是 1 年與 3 年檢查點斜率的來源。註：此頁為動態搜尋結果、非固定 listing，內容每次讀取可能不同；前稿宣稱在此頁看到 2025 年式 RX350h 旗艦版 2,628,000／2,600,000，本輪與上一輪 fact-check 均未再出現，故本表不引用該兩筆。"},{"name":"SUM 汽車網｜Lexus RX 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=RX","note":"本輪直接讀取，共 63 筆。【更正前稿的車型誤認】前稿把此頁的「2023 年式 2,500cc 油電、36,132 km、開價 2,158,000（台南）」當成 RX350h 旗艦版並用來撐 3 年檢查點；本輪確認該筆車型名稱實為【RX500h】（牌價 3,610,000），不是 RX350h 旗艦版，已整筆棄用。本輪實際採用的是：2021 RX300 Premier 27,277 km 1,599,000（5 年檢查點的稅級修正實測）、2017 RX450h 94,465 km 828,000（推翻前稿 10 年開價的關鍵對照）、2024 RX350 21,000 km 1,858,000、2023 RX350 77,210 km 1,688,000、2012 RX450h 129,417 km 289,000。"},{"name":"PTT car 板｜[菜單] Lexus RX350h 旗艦版","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1762008000.A.D51.html","note":"本輪重新直接讀取，頁面存在且內容相符。2026 年式、白、南部、2025-11 發文：「成交價格(總價)：305 - 29 + 2（自費配備）」＝交車約 2,780,000；文中提及業務原本要 +3 萬配備費、最後只收 +2 萬。discounts 與 onroad_fees 的主要依據。"},{"name":"abc 好車網｜2021 Lexus RX450h 旗艦版（前代第四代）","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2226665","note":"本輪直接讀取確認：2021 RX450h 旗艦版，開價 1,788,000（元翔汽車），頁面未列里程。5 年檢查點的前代外推基準。限制：無里程，故低里程修正只能用同齡件的一般里程區間推估。"},{"name":"abc 好車網｜2019 Lexus RX450h 旗艦版（前代第四代）","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2176546","note":"本輪直接讀取確認：2019 RX450h 旗艦版，開價 1,698,000，頁面未列里程。【本輪降級為僅供參考，不作為 7 年基準】它比同平台 2021 年式的 1,788,000 只低 90,000（2 年車齡差僅 5%），與 8891／SUM 上有里程的同齡實車嚴重不符，判定為停滯的高掛開價。7 年檢查點改用 8891 的 2019 RX300 旗艦版 110,000 km 1,190,000。"},{"name":"abc 好車網｜2016 Lexus RX450h 旗艦版（前代第四代）","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1826919","note":"本輪直接讀取確認：2016 RX450h 旗艦版，開價 1,188,000（元禾國際），頁面未列里程。【本輪判定為不可用的高掛開價，已從 10 年檢查點的基準中移除】理由：SUM 上 2017 年式 RX450h、94,465 km 只開 828,000，8891 上 2017 RX450h 198,400 km 開 688,000；一台更舊一年的車開價高出 43% 在同一市場不成立。保留此連結是為了說明前稿 10 年 39% 的來源為何被推翻。"},{"name":"8891｜Lexus RX450h 價格（前代牌價）","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/article/tag/Lexus-rx450h-%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC","note":"本輪重新直接讀取，確認頁面明列「Lexus rx450h 價格 314 萬起，450h 旗艦版 344 萬」。5 年檢查點殘值率外推的分母。限制未變：這是第四代末期（約 2021-2022）的牌價；2016／2019 年的官方原始價目表仍查不到，故 7 年與 10 年檢查點已改用有牌價可推的 RX300／RX200t 作基準，以降低分母不確定性。"},{"name":"Lexus 台灣官網｜保養計劃","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"本輪重新直接讀取，確認官方節奏為「每 6 個月／10,000 km，取先到者」與各門檻項目（1 個月免費 24 項檢查、6 個月 16 項＋機油濾清器、12 個月 29 項、24 個月 34 項、48 個月 37 項），且明文只有第 1 個月檢查免費、沒有全車系免費定期保養方案。maintenance 全表的結構依據，也證實本表對任務『annual』預設的修正是對的。"},{"name":"Lexus 台灣官網｜保證方案／保固條款","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx","note":"承自上一輪 fact-check（該輪已直接讀取），本輪未再複驗。新車 4 年/12 萬 km 基本保固；按時每 6 個月定保、一次未漏可免費延長至第 5 年/14 萬 km；6 年車身鏽穿、3 年電瓶、3 年輪胎、5 年/12 萬 km 排污。決定 0-5 年幾乎無修理支出、第 6 年起自費修理出現，也是 3 年檢查點價位仍被保固撐住的依據。"},{"name":"PTT car 板｜[問題] Lexus RX350h 一年定保","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1749131889.A.924.html","note":"承自上一輪 fact-check（該輪已直接讀取），本輪未再複驗。車主實際原廠報價：冷氣濾網原廠 3,000、LS 濾網 2,100 一片、副廠冷氣濾網 800；推文共識是保留機油、刪掉煞車卡鉗清潔等選配項，並強調「固定保養四年會自動多一年保固」。maintenance 單價的唯一實測依據。"},{"name":"KingAutos｜2026 Lexus RX 共 10 車款詳細介紹與價格","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/rx","note":"承自上一輪 fact-check（該輪已直接讀取並確認 350h 旗艦版 3,050,000），本輪未再複驗。list_price 的第二來源；本輪 8891 價目表已逐字取得完整 10 車型，故不依賴此頁。"}]},"lexus-rx450h-plus-flagship":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year; all checkpoints use the 7,000 km/year midpoint (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km). That is roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year, with two consequences baked into this record. (1) Resale: a 10-year-old car with 70,000 km is genuinely rare in Taiwan, so every private_sale_price is quoted against low-mileage listings and carries roughly a 3-4 point retention premium over the mileage-blind 行情 average at the 5/7/10-year points. (2) Maintenance: servicing is entirely TIME-driven — the mileage trigger is never reached first at 7,000 km/year — so consumables that age out (tires, brake fluid, 12V battery, coolant) dominate over consumables that wear out (brake pads, which regenerative braking on a PHEV stretches further). Note on cadence: Lexus TW's official 保養計劃 milestone table advances every 6 months / 10,000 km (首半年/1萬 16項, 12個月/2萬 29項, 24個月/4萬 34項, 48個月/8萬 37項), which implies 2 visits/year, and the 準時保養 extended-warranty programme requires 8 consecutive 定保 — 4 years at that cadence. But the separate 保養知識 page gives engine oil as 6個月/5,000km (severe use) OR 1年/10,000km (normal use), which would put a 7,000 km/year owner on an ANNUAL schedule. This record costs the 2-visits-per-year path because that is what earns the free warranty extension; an owner who services annually instead would spend materially less on routine service. Tax and insurance are excluded by design.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, REVISED DOWN BY THIS AUDIT (was NT$2,590,000). No 2025 RX 450h+ 旗艦版 has reached the Taiwanese used market in volume as of 2026-08. Live anchors re-pulled from 8891 中古車 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx) on 2026-08-11: 2024 RX 500h F Sport 19,000 km asking NT$2,688,000 = 74.5% of its NT$3,610,000 list; 2024 RX 350 F Sport 39,900 km asking NT$2,198,000 = 74.5% of its NT$2,950,000 list; the same page also shows 2024 RX 350 stock from NT$1,998,000, i.e. ~81% of the NT$2,460,000 豪華版 list — a live demonstration that base trims retain a HIGHER ratio than top trims. Extrapolating the top-trim shape back gives ~82% of list at 1 year on dealer retail. WHY REVISED: the original applied no powertrain penalty at all here — it declined to ADD a low-mileage premium but left the PHEV retaining exactly what the hybrid (500h) and gasoline (350 F Sport) anchors imply, which contradicts the hybrid > gasoline > PHEV ordering it asserted in its own note. A genuine ~3-point PHEV cut is now applied: 82% - 3 = ~79% of list dealer retail = ~NT$2,805,000; less 11% (dealer retail → 自售) = NT$2,500,000 (70.3% of real_cost). No low-mileage premium at year 1, where the new-car/plate premium collapse dominates. dealer_tradein_price set 12% below private sale. A 2024 RX 450h+ 豪華版 Lexus CPO listing at NT$3,258,000 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2182083, re-verified live) was found but DISCARDED: at 103% of its NT$3,150,000 list it is a nearly-new demo/stock unit, not a depreciation data point."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"REVISED DOWN BY THIS AUDIT (was NT$2,170,000) — this was the record's main error. The original back-solved to 68.7% of list on dealer retail (2,170,000 / 0.89 / 3,550,000), which is EQUAL to the 2023 RX 350h 豪華版 (hybrid, BASE trim, 40,200 km, NT$1,758,000 / NT$2,560,000 list) and ABOVE the gasoline TOP trim: live 8891 stock on 2026-08-11 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx) shows 2023 RX 350 asking NT$1,680,000-1,898,000, so a 2023 RX 350 旗艦版 sits near 1,898,000 / 2,950,000 = 64.3%. A PHEV top trim cannot out-retain both a hybrid base trim and a gasoline top trim — that violates the trim-ladder rule and the hybrid > gasoline > PHEV ordering simultaneously. ROOT CAUSE: the CPO-to-ordinary-dealer discount was taken at only 10%. Lexus 原廠認證 carries certification, an extended warranty and full dealer margin; 12-18% over ordinary 車商售價 is realistic. REVISED CHAIN, from the same-trim anchor (2023 RX 450h+ 旗艦版, 10,918 km, CPO asking NT$2,798,000 = 78.8% of list): less 15% CPO premium → ~NT$2,378,000 = 67.0% ordinary dealer retail at 10,918 km; less ~2 points for our 21,000 km → ~65%; a further small PHEV/旗艦 cut nets ~64.5% dealer retail, i.e. just below the gasoline 旗艦版's 64.3% once our low-mileage advantage is credited back; less 11% for 自售 → NT$2,040,000 (57.4% of real_cost). SOURCE CAVEAT: the CPO listing URL (https://www.lexuscpo.com.tw/Home/Details/c6243396-697d-4669-91fc-5578fe4b5945) now returns 「很抱歉，尚無此車款物件」 — the unit has sold or delisted, so its figures can no longer be re-verified. Confidence is held at medium only because the live 2023 RX 350/350h same-generation listings independently corroborate the level. dealer_tradein_price 12.7% below private sale."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the PREDECESSOR generation, UNCHANGED by this audit — a 5-year-old 5th-gen RX 450h+ cannot exist (Taiwan launch November 2022). Predecessor: 4th-gen Lexus RX450h 旗艦版, original list NT$3,440,000, confirmed live (https://c.8891.com.tw/article/tag/Lexus-rx450h-%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC, which gives RX450h NT$3,140,000 / 旗艦版 NT$3,440,000). Its 5-year-old (2021) listings: NT$1,788,000 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2226665, re-verified live as a 2021 RX 450h 旗艦版 at 元翔汽車) and NT$1,598,000 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2176582), both 車商售價, averaging NT$1,693,000 = 49.2% retention of that car's original list. ADJUSTMENT: less ~11% for 自售 → ~43.8%; plus ~4 points low-mileage premium (35,000 km at 5 years is well under the Taiwan norm of 60,000-75,000) → ~47.8%; less ~1.5 points for the PHEV-vs-hybrid and 旗艦-vs-豪華 penalties → 46.7% of real_cost NT$3,555,000 = NT$1,660,000. The PHEV penalty is deliberately SMALL here because the HV traction battery is still inside its 8-year/160,000 km warranty at this age. dealer_tradein_price 14.5% below private sale — the dealer/private gap widens with age."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the PREDECESSOR generation, UNCHANGED by this audit. 4th-gen RX450h 旗艦版 (original list NT$3,440,000) 7-year-old (2019) listings: NT$1,588,000 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/car/1804314) and NT$1,698,000 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2176546), averaging NT$1,643,000 = 47.8% of that car's list. That is implausibly FLAT against the 5-year point (49.2%), so those asks were treated as stale or unusually low-mileage outliers rather than used at face value; the dealer-retail curve was interpolated between the 5-year anchor (49%) and the 10-year anchor (35%) → ~42% dealer retail at 7 years. ADJUSTMENT: less ~11% for 自售 → ~37%; plus ~4 points low-mileage premium → ~41% for the hybrid predecessor; cut to 37.4% for the PHEV. At 7 years the 4-year (or 5-year, if the 準時保養 extension was earned) bumper-to-bumper warranty is long gone and Taiwanese buyers start pricing in on-board-charger, inverter-coolant and charging-port risk, even while the traction battery itself is still covered to 8 years. Applied to real_cost NT$3,555,000 → NT$1,330,000. dealer_tradein_price 16.5% below private sale."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the PREDECESSOR generation, UNCHANGED by this audit. 4th-gen RX450h 旗艦版 (original list NT$3,440,000) 10-year-old (2016) listings: NT$1,188,000 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1826919, re-verified live as a 2016 RX 450h 旗艦版 at 元禾國際-威廉認證車庫) and NT$1,248,000 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/car/1591329), averaging NT$1,218,000 = 35.4% of that car's list, 車商售價. ADJUSTMENT: less ~11% for 自售 → ~31.5%; plus ~4 points low-mileage premium (70,000 km on a 10-year-old car is genuinely scarce in Taiwan) → ~33% retention for the HYBRID predecessor. Cut hard to 25.3% for the PHEV — the largest powertrain adjustment in the record. By year 10 the 8-year/160,000 km HV battery cover (5年/100,000km 原廠 + 3年/60,000km 和泰追加, verified at https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx) has expired, and the Taiwanese used market discounts an out-of-warranty plug-in traction battery, on-board charger and inverter far more aggressively than a conventional hybrid's; buyers price in a possible six-figure battery bill. The 旗艦 equipment set (AVS 電子懸吊, 21吋鋁圈, 14吋觸控螢幕, 電子門把, 電子後視鏡) compounds this: at 10 years it reads as repair liability, not value, which is exactly why the top trim's retention RATIO sits below what 豪華版 would hold. Applied to real_cost NT$3,555,000 → NT$900,000. dealer_tradein_price 20% below private sale — dealers barely want a 10-year-old PHEV and bid accordingly."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Interval and inspection scope from Lexus Taiwan official pages, both re-verified live: 保養計劃 milestone table (https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx) gives 滿月 24項, 首半年/1萬 16項, 12個月/2萬 29項; 保養知識 (https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-maintenance.aspx) gives the oil and fluid intervals. Neither page publishes 定保套餐 PRICES, so per-visit cost is calibrated to owner-reported Mobile01 figures for the same service network — RX300 一萬公里定保套餐 ~NT$5,607 and NX300 ~NT$8,000 (https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=346&t=6405905 and https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=346&t=6919545; retrieved via search snippets only, Mobile01 blocks direct fetch with HTTP 403). The 450h+ is a 2.5L Atkinson PHEV whose engine runs far less than a pure gasoline RX, so oil-service content is comparable to or slightly below the RX300 figure. 2 visits/year because 7,000 km never reaches the mileage trigger."},{"y":3,"source":"Same official milestone table; the 24-month visit is the 34-項 major and is where brake fluid falls due on the 2-year clock (mileage would not trigger it until 40,000 km, which this buyer reaches only around year 6). Costed as 2 minor visits at ~NT$4,500, one 36-month visit at ~NT$8,000 and one 24-month major at ~NT$11,000. Per-visit pricing rests on the Mobile01 owner reports noted at the 1-year checkpoint, which are for RX300/NX300 rather than the 450h+ — that model mismatch is why this is not rated higher. No wear parts due: regenerative braking on a PHEV plus only 21,000 km means brake pads are essentially untouched."},{"y":5,"source":"Service portion (~NT$29,000) from the official 6-month milestone cadence and the 48個月/8萬公里 37-項 scope. TIRES are the dominant line and are ESTIMATED, not quoted: the 旗艦版 runs 21-inch wheels on 235/50R21, independently re-confirmed for both 450h+ trims on KingAutos' RX spec page (https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/rx) — this replaces the researcher's only cite for the wheel size, a Lexus CPO listing that has since delisted. Premium 21-inch SUV tires in Taiwan run roughly NT$13,000-16,000 each fitted; a set plus alignment is taken at NT$60,000. At 7,000 km/year tread is nowhere near worn at 35,000 km — replacement is driven by rubber aging at 5-6 years, the correct trigger for this buyer. 12V AGM battery at NT$9,000 reflects the PHEV's larger auxiliary battery; the official pages publish no 12V interval, so 5 years is a practice-based assumption. Brake pads deliberately NOT included: regen braking plus 35,000 km leaves plenty of pad. Low confidence because no Taiwanese 21-inch tire quote or Lexus PHEV 12V battery invoice was located directly."},{"y":7,"source":"Service portion from the official milestone cadence (brake fluid recurs on the 2-year clock at the 72-month visit). All wear and PHEV items are ESTIMATED. Brake pads: taken as front-only at ~NT$12,000 because regenerative braking on the 450h+ substantially extends pad life — at 49,000 km a conventional RX would be on its second set. Coolant: the official 保養知識 page puts Super LLC at 80,000 km with first change at 160,000 km, so at 49,000 km this is an AGE-driven change, not a mileage-driven one; the RX450h+ also carries a separate inverter/HV cooling loop on top of engine coolant, so the flush is dearer than a gasoline RX. The PHEV high-voltage inspection is the extra later-period cost: the 4-year (or 5-year extended) bumper-to-bumper warranty has expired by now, so charging-system and high-voltage diagnostics become owner-paid, even though the traction battery itself is still inside its 8-year/160,000 km cover (https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx). No tire cost — the year-5 set is only 2 years old. period_cost falls versus the year-5 window purely because the tire cycle lands at years 5 and 10, not because servicing gets cheaper."},{"y":10,"source":"Wholly ESTIMATED — the least certain line in the record. Routine service extrapolated from the official 6-month milestone cadence. Second tire set again driven by rubber aging (the year-5 set reaches 5 years around year 10) rather than tread, with modest cost inflation. REVISED BY THIS AUDIT: the researcher's NT$8,000 spark-plug line has been REMOVED and period_cost reduced from NT$178,000 to NT$170,000. Lexus TW's official guidance (https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-maintenance.aspx) is 100,000 km for iridium/platinum plugs and 50,000 km only for standard type; an RX450h+ runs iridium, so at 70,000 km the plugs are not due — the researcher cited a '50,000-100,000 km 區間' that conflates the two plug types. The PHEV-specific escalation is concentrated here for a concrete reason: the HV traction-battery warranty runs 8 years / 160,000 km (5年/100,000km 原廠 + 3年/60,000km 和泰追加), so from roughly year 8 the owner carries traction-battery, on-board-charger and HV-coolant risk unprotected; NT$15,000 across three years covers diagnostics and minor HV service but explicitly does NOT reserve for an actual battery replacement, which is treated as six-figure tail risk rather than expected cost. The AVS/suspension allowance reflects that 旗艦版 uses 電子可變懸吊, whose dampers are a known 10-year expense on Lexus SUVs. Total 10-year maintenance across all periods is NT$361,000 (~NT$36,000/year), high for the mileage but consistent with a NT$3.55m PHEV on 21-inch wheels serviced twice a year on a time-driven schedule."}],"sources":[{"name":"8891 新車頻道 — 2026年式Lexus RX國內上架！細節微調、售價不變","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/lexus/rx/20732","note":"PRIMARY price source, re-fetched and confirmed by this audit on 2026-08-11. Full 2026 RX price table across all 10 trims; RX 450h+ 旗艦版 NT$3,550,000, RX 450h+ 豪華版 NT$3,150,000, lineup NT$2,460,000-3,610,000. States 2026 pricing is unchanged from 2025."},{"name":"KingAutos — Lexus RX 車型與規格","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/rx","note":"Independent price cross-check (355萬 旗艦版 / 315萬 豪華版, 0% variance) AND the replacement source for the 21-inch wheel claim: gives 21吋鋁圈 with 235/50R21 tires for both 450h+ trims, plus the 旗艦版-exclusive equipment (360度環景, 自動停車輔助, 後座通風加熱, 前6後6 停車雷達, Mark Levinson 21 喇叭)."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX 二手行情與在售車輛","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx","note":"Re-pulled live by this audit on 2026-08-11. Same-generation dealer-retail anchors: 2024 RX 500h F Sport 19,000 km NT$2,688,000 (74.5% of list); 2024 RX 350 stock NT$1,998,000-2,198,000; 2023 RX 350 stock NT$1,680,000-1,898,000; 2023 RX 350h 豪華版 40,200 km NT$1,758,000. All 車商售價. The 2024 RX 350 spread is the live evidence that BASE trims retain a higher ratio (~81%) than TOP trims (~74.5%) at the same age — the basis for revising the year-3 figure down."},{"name":"Lexus CPO Taiwan — 2023 RX 450h+ 旗艦版, 10,918 km, NT$2,798,000","url":"https://www.lexuscpo.com.tw/Home/Details/c6243396-697d-4669-91fc-5578fe4b5945","note":"STALE LINK as of 2026-08-11: now returns 「很抱歉，尚無此車款物件」, so the listing has sold or delisted and its figures cannot be re-verified. Retained because the researcher clearly quoted real content from it and it was the only same-trim, same-generation anchor. Used only after a corrected 15% CPO-premium discount (the researcher used 10%, which is what produced the inflated year-3 value)."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2021 Lexus RX 450h 旗艦版, NT$1,788,000 (元翔汽車)","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2226665","note":"Predecessor-generation 5-year anchor, re-verified live by this audit: confirmed as a 2021 RX 450h 旗艦版 at 元翔汽車, NT$1,788,000 dealer retail."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2021 LEXUS RX450h 旗艦版 (4代), NT$1,598,000 (元禾國際車業)","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2176582","note":"Second predecessor-generation 5-year anchor; averaged with the above to give ~49.2% retention at 5 years on dealer retail."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2019 LEXUS RX450h 旗艦版 (4代), NT$1,588,000","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/car/1804314","note":"Predecessor 7-year listing. Treated as an outlier (implausibly flat vs the 5-year point) and NOT used at face value; the 7-year figure was interpolated between the 5- and 10-year anchors instead."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2019 Lexus RX 450h 旗艦版, NT$1,698,000 (東威汽車)","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2176546","note":"Second predecessor 7-year listing; same outlier treatment as above."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2016 LEXUS RX450h 旗艦版 (4代), NT$1,188,000 (元禾國際-威廉認證車庫)","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1826919","note":"Predecessor-generation 10-year anchor, re-verified live by this audit: confirmed as a 2016 RX 450h 旗艦版, NT$1,188,000 dealer retail."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2016 LEXUS RX450h 旗艦版 (4代), NT$1,248,000 (凌志禾/元禾汽車)","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/car/1591329","note":"Second predecessor 10-year anchor; averaged with the above to give ~35.4% retention at 10 years on dealer retail for the HYBRID predecessor, before the PHEV cut."},{"name":"8891 — Lexus RX450h 價格（4代原廠售價）","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/article/tag/Lexus-rx450h-%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC","note":"Re-verified live by this audit: original Taiwan list of the PREDECESSOR 4th-gen RX450h is NT$3,140,000 and 旗艦版 NT$3,440,000. NT$3,440,000 is the denominator for every predecessor-based retention ratio in the 5/7/10-year checkpoints."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2024 Lexus RX 450h＋豪華版 CPO, NT$3,258,000 (南港營業所)","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2182083","note":"Re-verified live by this audit (LEXUS CPO/南港營業所, NT$3,258,000). DELIBERATELY DISCARDED as a depreciation anchor: at 103% of its NT$3,150,000 list it is a nearly-new demo/stock unit, not a used-market price. Recorded so the exclusion is auditable."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官網 — 車主權益／保固條款","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx","note":"Re-verified live by this audit. New-car warranty 4 years / 120,000 km; genuine parts 2 years / 50,000 km; HV battery 5年/100,000km 原廠 + 3年/60,000km 和泰 = 8 years / 160,000 km; BEV battery 8年/160,000km at 70% capacity. Free owner benefits are the annual safety inspection, roadside assistance, loan cars and pickup/delivery — explicitly NO free scheduled maintenance. Drives both the maintenance escalation timing and the year-10 PHEV resale cut."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官網 — 保養知識","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-maintenance.aspx","note":"Re-verified live by this audit, and it CORRECTS the researcher. It does NOT state 「每6個月或10,000公里，以先到者為準」; it gives engine oil/filter as 6個月/5,000km (severe use) or 1年/10,000km (normal use), air filter 20,000-40,000 km, brake fluid 40,000 km or 2 years, spark plugs 100,000 km for iridium/platinum and 50,000 km for standard type, Super LLC coolant 80,000 km with first change at 160,000 km, and no published 12V battery interval."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官網 — 保養計劃（定保項目表）","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"Re-verified live by this audit; this is the real source of the 6-month cadence. Milestones: 滿月保養 24項, 首半年/1萬公里 16項, 12個月/2萬公里 29項, 24個月/4萬公里 34項, 48個月/8萬公里 37項. Confirms the page publishes NO 定保套餐 prices — the gap that forces the cost figures onto owner reports."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官網 — 新車準時保養愛車享延長保證方案","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/news_detail.aspx?nw=563&fn=1","note":"Re-verified live by this audit. For vehicles delivered on or after 2024-01-01, 8 consecutive on-time 定保 with 原廠機油 + 定保套餐 earns a free +1 year / +20,000 km warranty extension; bought separately it starts at NT$25,900 (UX-level; higher for RX). At 2 visits/year this buyer completes the 8 visits at exactly the 4-year mark."},{"name":"Mobile01 — RX300 一萬保養工單 (owner receipts)","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=346&t=6405905","note":"Owner-reported 定保套餐 cost of ~NT$5,607 for an RX at the 10,000 km service — the calibration point for per-visit maintenance cost. Retrieved via search-result snippet only; direct fetch returns HTTP 403. Different model (RX300, gasoline) from the subject car."},{"name":"Mobile01 — 請問LEXUS原廠保養費用","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=346&t=6919545","note":"Owner discussion giving NX300 ~NT$8,000 and UX250h ~NT$6,000 per service, and confirming that 和泰 requires 半年或一萬公里 returns to qualify for the extended-warranty benefit. Retrieved via search-result snippet only; direct fetch returns HTTP 403."}]},"lexus-rx500h-fsport-performance":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr; all checkpoints use the 7,000 km/yr midpoint (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km), roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/yr. Two consequences. (a) Used values carry an explicit low-mileage premium over the mileage-blind market average, growing from +2% at year 1 to +12% at year 10 as the mileage gap widens; the premium is kept deliberately small in years 1-3 because the live anchor listings are themselves low-mileage cars and double-counting there is the easy mistake. (b) Servicing is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven. Lexus TW's published table offers two engine-oil lines for normal use — 6 個月或 5,000km AND 一年或 10,000km — and at 7,000 km/yr the annual/10,000 km line is the applicable one, so this model books ONE paid service per year for all 10 years. Lexus TW's nominal 定保 cadence is every 6 months (whichever comes first), and the free +1 year/20,000 km warranty extension requires 8 consecutive 定保 inside the 4-year window, i.e. semi-annual servicing; an owner on the annual cadence modelled here does NOT qualify, so warranty is assumed to end at 4 years, not 5. That trade-off is priced explicitly rather than assumed away. Tax (牌照稅 NT$11,230 + 燃料稅 NT$6,180 per year) and insurance are excluded by design and appear nowhere in this record. Depreciation figures are quoted as PRIVATE SALE proceeds to the owner, not dealer asking prices.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"REVISED DOWN by this audit from NT$2,790,000. Live Taiwanese DEALER RETAIL asks, both re-fetched and confirmed real during this audit: 8891 中古車 lists a 2024 RX500h F Sport Performance at NT$2,688,000 with 19,000 km disclosed (東威, Taipei — verified the highest-priced RX on the whole 8891 used RX page), and abc好車網 lists a 2024 car at NT$3,058,000 with mileage NOT disclosed, from the SAME dealer 東威汽車. The researcher averaged those two into a NT$2,870,000 two-year retail midpoint. That over-weights the unverifiable ask: when one dealer simultaneously lists two same-model-year cars 370,000 apart, the one with disclosed mileage is the transactable signal and the other is an aspirational ask. Re-anchoring on the mileage-disclosed car: NT$2,688,000 retail, +2% for our lower mileage (14,000 km at 2 years vs 19,000) = ~NT$2,742,000 dealer retail at 2 years; private sale = -12% = ~NT$2,410,000 at 2 years; step back one year at ~11% = NT$2,700,000. ADJUSTMENT MADE: this is a PRIVATE figure roughly 12-13% below the corresponding 1-year dealer retail ask (~NT$3,090,000), and dealer trade-in is a further 12% below private (NT$2,380,000). No dealer asking price is copied across anywhere in this record. CPO listings (NT$3,220,000-3,350,000) were excluded as the ceiling of the chain — 原廠認證 plus warranty adds 8-15% over independent retail and those asks are demonstrably not transacting."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"Lightly revised from NT$2,240,000 for curve smoothness. Same verified anchor as year 1: the 8891 2024 RX500h F Sport at NT$2,688,000 / 19,000 km implies ~NT$2,410,000 private at 2 years. Carrying that forward at ~9.5%/yr gives NT$2,210,000 at 3 years, i.e. ~61% of list. Cross-check: the 8891 used RX page shows 2023-2024 RX stock generally clustering at NT$1,800,000-2,300,000, and this trim should sit at the very top of that band — NT$2,210,000 does. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private is ~12% below the implied 3-year dealer retail of ~NT$2,510,000; dealer trade-in a further 13% below private (NT$1,920,000). The 19,000 km anchor car is itself already a low-mileage listing, so the low-mileage premium applied on top is deliberately modest (+4%) to avoid double-counting. UNRESOLVED: two Lexus CPO listings for 2023 cars carry asks of NT$3,298,000 and NT$3,350,000. The researcher inferred from abc好車網 listing-ID ordering that these are stale postings from when the cars were ~1 year old. This audit re-fetched listing 2164207 and confirmed the car and price are real but could NOT confirm the posting date or whether it is still active. If those asks are current, the 3-year curve would be materially higher than modelled — this is the single largest open risk in the near-term figures and is why confidence is medium, not high."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — the 5th-gen RX only reached Taiwan in late 2022, so no genuine 5-year-old RX500h exists and none was invented. Value unchanged from the researcher at NT$1,830,000, but the derivation was rebuilt because theirs contained two errors that happened to cancel. ERROR 1 (inflating): they took the predecessor 4th-gen RX450h 旗艦版 5-year point (abc好車網 2021 car at NT$1,788,000 against a NT$3,440,000 list = 52% retention) and manually smoothed it UP to 57%, arguing the 2021 cars are depressed run-out stock. Their own cross-check contradicts that: a 2022 RX450h 頂級版 at Lexus CPO 桃園 asks NT$1,998,000 against a NT$3,140,000 list = 63.6% at 4 years, and stripping the 8-15% CPO premium gives ~56-59% independent retail at 4 years, which makes a raw 52% at 5 years exactly right rather than too low. The +5pt smoothing is not supported. ERROR 2 (deflating): they then applied an ADDITIONAL -3pt top-trim penalty on top of the predecessor ratio — but RX450h 旗艦版 WAS the range-topping trim of the 4th-gen RX at NT$3,440,000, so its retention already embeds top-trim depreciation. That penalty is double-counted. Rebuilt: raw 52% retention, minus 1pt only for the 2.4T turbo-hybrid being an unproven powertrain in Taiwan versus the predecessor's naturally-aspirated Toyota HSD, = 51% applied to this car's list = NT$1,841,000 dealer retail, plus a +7% low-mileage premium (35,000 km vs a typical ~65,000 km 5-year car) = ~NT$1,970,000 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private sale 12.5% below dealer retail = NT$1,724,000 on the pure predecessor basis; blended with the smooth curve carried forward from the verified year-1/year-3 anchors (NT$1,880,000) to land at NT$1,830,000. Dealer trade-in a further 14% below private (NT$1,570,000)."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor generation — no 7-year-old 5th-gen RX exists. REVISED UP from NT$1,500,000 after removing the double-counted trim penalty described in the year-5 note. Real 4th-gen RX450h 旗艦版 (original list NT$3,440,000, the range-topping trim) at 7 years old on abc好車網: NT$1,698,000 (東威汽車) and NT$1,588,000, midpoint ~NT$1,643,000 = 47.8% retention of original list. Because that benchmark is itself a top trim, its ratio already carries the top-trim effect; the researcher's extra -4pt penalty double-counted it. Rebuilt: 47.8% minus 2pt for genuine used-buyer caution about an out-of-warranty 2.4T turbo-hybrid versus the proven HSD system = 45.8%, applied to this car's list = NT$1,653,000 dealer retail, plus a +9% low-mileage premium (49,000 km vs a typical ~95,000 km 7-year car) = ~NT$1,802,000 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private sale 13% below dealer retail (NT$1,570,000 on the pure predecessor basis, blended to NT$1,530,000 against the smooth curve); dealer trade-in a further 15% below private (NT$1,300,000) — the trade-in spread widens with age because dealers price in reconditioning risk on out-of-warranty luxury SUVs, and 21-inch wheels and AVS dampers are exactly the reconditioning items they discount for."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor generation — no 10-year-old 5th-gen RX exists. REVISED UP from NT$1,110,000, again by removing the double-counted top-trim penalty. Real 4th-gen RX450h at 10 years old (2016 cars) on abc好車網, healthy-condition band: NT$1,188,000 (旗艦版, 元禾國際), NT$1,248,000 (旗艦版, 元禾汽車), NT$1,288,000 (頂級版, 東威汽車); midpoint ~NT$1,241,000 against a NT$3,440,000 original list = 36.1% retention. The band is wide — high-mileage and 法拍 cars appear at NT$798,000-998,000 — so the healthy-condition cluster was used, not the raw minimum. Rebuilt: 36.1% minus 2pt for a decade-old first-generation turbo-hybrid with an AVS adaptive-damper F Sport chassis being a harder sell than a plain RX450h = 34.1%, applied to this car's list = NT$1,231,000 dealer retail, plus a +12% low-mileage premium (70,000 km vs a typical ~140,000 km 10-year car — the single largest mileage advantage in the table) = ~NT$1,379,000 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private sale 13% below dealer retail = NT$1,200,000; smooth-curve carry-forward from year 7 at ~8.5%/yr gives NT$1,172,000; adopted NT$1,170,000. Dealer trade-in a further 15% below private (NT$990,000). Genuinely uncertain: a decade of Taiwanese demand for a first-generation turbo-hybrid Lexus is unknowable today, and the hybrid battery is out of its 8-year warranty for the last two years of this window."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Lexus TW 保養知識 official table, fetched during this audit: normal-use engine oil and filter at '一年或 10,000km', the applicable line at 7,000 km/yr. One paid visit, not the researcher's two. Per-visit cost scaled from owner-reported Lexus TW figures (NX300 ~NT$8,000, UX250h ~NT$6,000 per basic service) up to the RX500h's larger 2.4T hybrid engine and greater oil capacity. The researcher's claim that the first service is free was removed — the 車主權益 page does not state it."},{"y":3,"source":"Two annual visits derived from the official 一年或 10,000km interval, priced off owner-reported Lexus Taiwan service tickets; brake fluid interval (2 years / 40,000 km) and engine air filter (20,000-40,000 km) taken from the official 保養知識 table fetched during this audit. Still fully under warranty, so no unscheduled repair allowance. No tyres, brakes or battery due — regenerative braking on a Lexus hybrid means pads routinely last well past 21,000 km."},{"y":5,"source":"Servicing extrapolated from the same annual cadence. Tyres are the dominant line and are TIME-driven at this mileage: 35,000 km would not wear out a tyre, but 5-year-old rubber in Taiwan's climate is unsafe and unsellable, and the F Sport Performance's 21-inch wheels command premium pricing — a genuine cost penalty of this trim over the 19-inch RX350h. AUDIT CHANGE: the researcher priced the set at NT$56,000 (NT$14,000/corner, top of the range); NT$12,000/corner fitted is the central Taiwan price for 235/50R21 Michelin/Bridgestone, so the set is NT$48,000. Brake pads deliberately NOT included: Lexus hybrid regenerative braking routinely takes pads past 70,000 km. 12V battery timing (4-5 years) is an assumption, not a sourced figure — hence low confidence."},{"y":7,"source":"Extrapolated. Warranty expired at 4 years under the annual-service cadence modelled here, so labour and parts are fully at the owner's cost and per-visit prices step up accordingly. Spark plugs are NOT included — the official 100,000 km interval is not reached until well past year 10 at 7,000 km/yr. The brake-pad line is a judgement call on when regenerative braking finally hands enough work to the friction brakes; the contingency is an allowance, not a sourced quote. This window is deliberately LOWER than the year 3-5 window because the age-driven tyre set falls in that earlier window — a lumpy consumable, not a declining cost curve."},{"y":10,"source":"Extrapolated; the least certain row in the record. Coolant timing from the Toyota/Lexus SLLC long-life schedule; tyre replacement is again age-driven, not wear-driven. The contingency is deliberately restrained given Lexus's genuinely strong reliability record and the fact that 70,000 km is very low stress for a 10-year-old car, but it is NOT zero — the F Sport Performance's AVS adaptive dampers are a known high-cost failure item on ageing Lexus SUVs and are unique to this trim. Note the hybrid battery is covered to 8 years / 160,000 km, so it expires on TIME in year 8 and any pack failure in years 8-10 falls entirely outside this allowance. No high-voltage inspection surcharge is applied — that penalty belongs to the PHEV RX450h+ trims, not this HEV."}],"sources":[{"name":"8891 新車 — 2026年式Lexus RX國內上架！細節微調、售價不變！","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/lexus/rx/20732","note":"PRIMARY list-price source, RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED BY THIS AUDIT. Full 10-trim 2026 table returned: RX 350 Luxury 2,460,000 through RX 500h F Sport Performance 3,610,000, 售價維持不變. Confirms the researcher's figure exactly."},{"name":"LEXUS Taiwan 官網 RX 車型館","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/showroom/RX","note":"Official site, RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED BY THIS AUDIT. States the RX range as NT$246~361萬 across 350 / 350h / 450h+ / 500h; the 361萬 ceiling is this trim. Second independent confirmation of list price."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx","note":"KEY USED ANCHOR, RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED BY THIS AUDIT. Exactly one live RX500h listing: 2024 RX 500h F Sport Performance, 19,000 km disclosed, dealer retail NT$2,688,000, 東威, Taipei — the highest-priced RX on the entire page. Wider page context: 2023-2024 RX stock clusters at NT$1,800,000-2,300,000. This mileage-disclosed listing is the spine of the year-1 and year-3 figures."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2024 Lexus RX 500h F Sport Performance, 東威汽車","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2294081","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED BY THIS AUDIT: real listing, 2024, NT$3,058,000, dealer 東威汽車 — the SAME dealer as the 8891 NT$2,688,000 car. Mileage is NOT disclosed. Because one dealer lists two same-year cars 370,000 apart, this ask was down-weighted rather than averaged in, which is why the year-1 figure was revised down."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2024 Lexus RX 500h F Sport Performance, LEXUS CPO 台南營業所","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2236737","note":"Lexus CPO retail NT$3,220,000. CPO sits at the very top of the price chain (certification + warranty, 8-15% over independent retail) and was treated as a ceiling, never as market value."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2023 Lexus RX 500h F Sport Performance, LEXUS CPO 士林營業所","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2164207","note":"RE-FETCHED BY THIS AUDIT: the car and the NT$3,298,000 CPO ask are real, but the page exposes NO posting date and NO mileage, so the researcher's inference that it is a stale ~1-year-old posting could NOT be confirmed. Flagged as the largest open risk to the year-3 figure."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2023 Lexus RX 500h F Sport Performance, LEXUS CPO 民族營業所","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2082452","note":"CPO retail NT$3,350,000, older posting inferred from listing-ID ordering. Same treatment — a near-new CPO ceiling, not a year-3 data point."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2021 LEXUS RX450h 旗艦版 (4代), 元翔汽車","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2226665","note":"PREDECESSOR 5-year data point: NT$1,788,000 dealer retail = 52% of its NT$3,440,000 original list. Used at its RAW 52% by this audit; the researcher's upward smoothing to 57% was reversed."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2019 Lexus RX 450h 旗艦版, 東威汽車","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2176546","note":"PREDECESSOR 7-year data point: NT$1,698,000 dealer retail."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2019 LEXUS RX450h 旗艦版 (4代)","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1804314","note":"PREDECESSOR 7-year data point: NT$1,588,000 dealer retail. Midpoint with the above = 47.8% retention, basis of the year-7 extrapolation."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2016 LEXUS RX450h 旗艦版 (4代), 元禾國際","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1826919","note":"PREDECESSOR 10-year data point: NT$1,188,000 dealer retail."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2016 LEXUS RX450h 旗艦版 (4代), 元禾汽車","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/car/1591329","note":"PREDECESSOR 10-year data point: NT$1,248,000 dealer retail."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2016 Lexus RX 450h 頂級版, 東威汽車","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1900355","note":"PREDECESSOR 10-year data point: NT$1,288,000. These three form the healthy-condition cluster (~36.1% retention) used for year 10; distressed/高里程 cars at NT$798,000-998,000 were excluded as unrepresentative."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2022 Lexus RX 450h 頂級版, LEXUS CPO 桃園營業所","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2146839","note":"PREDECESSOR 4-year CPO cross-check: NT$1,998,000 against a NT$3,140,000 list = 63.6%. THIS AUDIT USED IT AS EVIDENCE AGAINST the researcher's year-5 smoothing: stripping the CPO premium gives ~56-59% at 4 years, which makes a raw 52% at 5 years consistent, not anomalously low."},{"name":"8891 汽車 — Lexus RX450h 價格（第四代原廠售價）","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/article/tag/Lexus-rx450h-%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC","note":"Source of the predecessor's ORIGINAL list prices: RX450h from NT$3,140,000, 旗艦版 NT$3,440,000. Required to turn the used listings above into retention ratios. Note 旗艦版 was the RANGE-TOPPING 4th-gen trim, which is why applying a further top-trim penalty to its ratio double-counts."},{"name":"LEXUS Taiwan — 車主權益（保固條款）","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED BY THIS AUDIT. Confirms 4 years/120,000 km vehicle warranty, hybrid battery 5yr/100,000km + 3yr/60,000km from 和泰 = 8yr/160,000km, parts 2yr/50,000km. DISCONFIRMS the researcher's 'free first oil-and-filter service within 6 months' claim — the page describes Lexus Elite Rewards tiered benefits for returning 每半年, not a free service."},{"name":"LEXUS Taiwan — 保養知識（定期保養間隔）","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-maintenance.aspx","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED BY THIS AUDIT, and the basis of this record's main correction. The official normal-use engine-oil line reads '6 個月或 5,000km；一年或 10,000km' — BOTH intervals, and at 7,000 km/yr the annual/10,000 km option applies. The researcher quoted only the 6-month line and doubled the visit count. Also confirms brake fluid 2 years/40,000 km, engine air filter 20,000-40,000 km, spark plugs 100,000 km (iridium)."},{"name":"LEXUS Taiwan — 新車準時保養愛車享延長保證方案","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/news_detail.aspx?nw=563&fn=1","note":"RE-FETCHED AND VERIFIED BY THIS AUDIT. The programme is REAL: 8 consecutive on-time 定保 before the 4-year/120,000 km warranty expires earns a free +1 year/20,000 km extension; buying it outright starts at NT$25,900 (UX entry pricing). CORRECTION: the page states the programme began 2024-01-01, NOT the 2026-01-01 the researcher wrote. Also note 8 定保 in 4 years implies semi-annual servicing, so the annual cadence modelled here forgoes the extension."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus RX450h 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rx450h","note":"Cross-check on the wider RX used curve. HONESTY NOTE carried over from the researcher: no RX450h-specific listings were live at the time of checking, so this contributed context only, not a data point."},{"name":"Yahoo奇摩汽車 — 2026 Lexus RX 500h F Sport Performance 車款介紹","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/lexus-rx-2026-500h-f-sport-performance","note":"Trim spec page; source of the annual 牌照稅 NT$11,230 and 燃料稅 NT$6,180 figures, both EXCLUDED from this record by design."},{"name":"KingAutos — 2026 大型休旅車 Lexus RX 共10車款詳細介紹","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/rx","note":"Researcher's third list-price confirmation (500h F Sport Performance NT$3.61M). Not independently re-fetched by this audit — the 8891 table and lexus.com.tw were sufficient to confirm the figure."},{"name":"ETtoday 車雲 — 台灣新LEXUS RX休旅開賣，價格沒漲價","url":"https://speed.ettoday.net/news/3035467","note":"Researcher's 2025-09-18 launch report for the 2026 model year, range 246~361萬 unchanged. Not independently re-fetched by this audit."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 第四代Lexus RX車系國內正式發表","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/27742","note":"Predecessor-generation launch pricing context. HONESTY NOTE carried over: the page returns HTTP 403 to direct fetch, so only a search summary was ever readable. Used for corroboration of the 4th-gen price level, never as a primary figure."}]},"lexus-es300h-premium":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. Every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). Two consequences drive the model. (1) RESALE: at 3-10 years this car carries roughly HALF the mileage of the ES listings actually on 8891/SUM today (those run 39,000-190,000 km), so it sits at the TOP of its year band, not the average. This audit found the prior draft claimed a low-mileage premium but did not actually price one in — its 3y/5y values implied our 28,000 km car at 4 years would be worth LESS than a real 39,000 km 2022 ES300h 豪華版 asking NT$1,288,000 against a HIGHER list price. The mid-life checkpoints were raised to remove that contradiction. (2) MAINTENANCE: at 7,000 km/year the car never reaches the 10,000 km oil interval inside a year, so servicing is purely TIME-driven. Lexus TW's official table gives 一年或10,000km for normal use and 6個月或5,000km for heavy use; the plan assumes 2 visits/year, which is also what the 延長保證 (8 consecutive on-time 定保) benefit requires. Consumables age out rather than wear out: tires are replaced on rubber age (~every 5-6 years) not tread. Tax and insurance are excluded by design.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — the 8th-gen ES launched 2026-04-28, so it is ~4 months old and NO used listing of this generation exists at any age. Estimated dealer retail (車商售價) NT$1,700,000 = 86.3% of list, normal for a 1-year-old Lexus ES with 7,000 km against thin used supply and a brand-new generation. Chain applied explicitly: retail NT$1,700,000 → private sale (自售) = retail less 10% = NT$1,530,000 → dealer trade-in (車商收購) = private less 12% = NT$1,345,000. No dealer asking price was copied into private_sale_price. RAISED from the prior draft's NT$1,500,000 only to restore a decelerating depreciation curve (the prior ladder lost ~12.5 points of list in each of the 1-3y and 3-5y windows, which is flat rather than front-loaded). The prior draft's 1-year anchor — an '8891 2024 ES300h 旗艦版, 5,000 km, NT$1,698,000' — could NOT be reproduced on auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/es during this audit, so it is not relied on. Confidence downgraded to low accordingly. 7,000 km is negligible at 1 year, so no separate low-mileage premium applied here."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from 7th-gen ES retention, RAISED from the prior draft (NT$1,200,000). Real 8891 anchor verified this audit: 2022 ES300h 豪華版, 39,000 km, dealer retail NT$1,288,000 against a NT$2,030,000 list = 63.4% at 4 years. Our car reaches 4 years with 28,000 km against a list of NT$1,970,000 — lower mileage and a lower denominator — so it cannot be worth LESS in absolute dealer retail than that comparable, which is exactly what the prior ladder implied (it interpolated to ~NT$1,208,000 at 4y). Corrected: dealer retail at 3y = NT$1,400,000 (71.1% of list), which interpolates to ~NT$1,265,000 at 4y, i.e. still slightly BELOW the NT$1,288,000 comparable to preserve the top-trim haircut. Chain: retail NT$1,400,000 → private sale less 10.5% = NT$1,250,000 → dealer trade-in less 12% = NT$1,100,000. Held deliberately conservative because 頂級版 is the TOP 300h trim and the NT$200,000 of equipment over the 豪華版 (HUD, 64-colour ambient, 360 camera, ventilated seats, soft-close doors) is largely not paid for at resale — the used market pays for 'ES300h', not the grade."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, RAISED from the prior draft (NT$955,000). Real 8891 listings verified this audit (Aug 2026): 2022 ES300h 豪華版, 39,000 km, NT$1,288,000 / NT$2,030,000 = 63.4% at 4y; 2020 ES300h 豪華版, 70,000 km, NT$828,000 at 6y; 2020 ES300h 旗艦版, 109,000 km, NT$1,088,000 at 6y. The prior draft interpolated straight through the NT$828,000 car, but that listing is the bottom of its band and is contradicted by the SAME-year 旗艦版 asking NT$260,000 more, and by verified SUM listings of the cheaper ES200 petrol (2020, 41,020 km, NT$958,000 against a ~NT$1,770,000 list = 54.1%) — a gasoline ES should not out-retain a hybrid ES. Corrected 6y absolute band therefore ~NT$960,000-1,050,000 for a 42,000 km car. Dealer retail at 5y set to NT$1,130,000 (57.4% of list), which sits between the 4y and 6y anchors after normalising mileage down to our 35,000 km. Chain: retail NT$1,130,000 → private sale less 11% = NT$1,005,000 → dealer trade-in less 13% = NT$875,000."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the PREDECESSOR (7th) generation — the 8th gen cannot have 7-year data. Real 8891 anchors verified this audit: 2019 ES300h 旗艦版, 89,700 km, dealer retail NT$1,069,000 (against a ~NT$2,350,000 launch list, ratio ~45.5%) at 7 years; 2020 ES300h 旗艦版, 109,000 km, NT$1,088,000 at 6 years. Our car reaches 7 years with 49,000 km — roughly HALF the mileage of the 7-year comparable — so a mileage uplift applies, partly offset because 頂級版 sheds its equipment premium and because by 2033 this generation will have been facelifted and the ES500e BEV sibling will have moved the line's positioning. Net dealer retail ratio used: 47.2% of list = NT$930,000, RAISED from the prior draft's NT$865,000, which sat below the retention of a comparable carrying 40,000 km more. Chain: retail NT$930,000 → private sale less 12% = NT$820,000 → dealer trade-in less 14.5% = NT$700,000. Explicitly extrapolated, not observed."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the 6th-generation ES300h (XV60), the only ES hybrid old enough to give genuine 10-year data. Real listings verified this audit: 8891 2017 ES300h 頂級Navi版, 125,100 km, NT$639,000 (9 years); 8891 2017 ES300h 頂級版, 124,800 km, NT$639,000; abc好車網 2016 ES300h 旗艦版 NT$886,000 (mileage NOT disclosed on the page — this is the weakest input); 8891 2013 ES300h 豪華版, 94,500 km, NT$419,000 (13 years). Against 6th-gen list prices of roughly NT$2,000,000-2,280,000 that is ~28-31% retention at 9 years for cars carrying 125,000 km. Our car reaches 10 years with only 70,000 km, far below every comparable, so the upper part of that band applies: dealer retail ratio 34.5% of list = NT$680,000, RAISED from the prior draft's NT$630,000. Chain: retail NT$680,000 → private sale less 13.5% = NT$590,000 → dealer trade-in less 15.5% = NT$500,000. Two deliberate caps kept: the hybrid battery warranty (8y/160,000 km) has expired on TIME by then and Taiwanese buyers discount for that regardless of actual reliability; and the 6th-gen original list prices remain UNVERIFIED against an official table (the prior draft's NT$2,280,000 estimate for the 2016 旗艦版 could not be confirmed). Confidence low and honestly so."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Interval and programme detail from lexus.com.tw/owners-maintenance.aspx and lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx (free 滿月保養, no free scheduled-maintenance programme, no published prices). Per-visit cost from owner receipts, uplifted from the PIXNET UX250h invoice of NT$3,400 (owner-supplied oil, smaller car) to ~NT$4,500 and ~NT$5,500 for a dealer-supplied-oil ES300h, plus a cabin filter ~NT$1,200 = NT$11,000 for year 0-1. Nothing wears out at 7,000 km; this is purely the cost of staying on the 定保 schedule to keep the extended-warranty entitlement."},{"y":3,"source":"Cost SINCE the 1-year checkpoint (1y->3y window only, not cumulative). Built from the verified lexus.com.tw interval table: brake fluid 40,000km/2年 and the air filter both fall inside this window on TIME, not mileage. 4 visits at ~NT$5,000 = NT$20,000, brake fluid ~NT$2,500, engine air filter ~NT$1,800, two cabin filters ~NT$2,400, wipers ~NT$1,500 = NT$28,200, rounded to NT$28,000. Still warranty-covered, so zero repair allowance."},{"y":5,"source":"Cost SINCE the 3-year checkpoint (3y->5y window only). This is the first expensive window BECAUSE of the low mileage, not despite it: at 35,000 km the tires still have tread, but 5-year-old rubber on a NT$2m car is replaced on age — a fitted set of four premium 19in tires runs NT$32,000-40,000 in Taiwan, budgeted at NT$36,000. Build-up: 4 visits at ~NT$5,200 = NT$20,800; tires NT$36,000; 12V auxiliary battery NT$9,000; brake fluid NT$2,500; air + cabin filters NT$3,500; alignment NT$2,000; first post-warranty repair allowance NT$3,000 = NT$76,800, rounded to NT$77,000. Brake pads NOT included — regenerative braking plus 35,000 km means the original pads are nowhere near done. Warranty end (四年或十二萬公里, lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx) is time-triggered here because the mileage clock never gets close."},{"y":7,"source":"Cost SINCE the 5-year checkpoint (5y->7y window only). Build-up: 4 visits at ~NT$5,500 = NT$22,000; front pads + disc skim and partial rear NT$16,000; coolant first change NT$4,500; brake fluid NT$2,600; filters NT$4,000; transaxle fluid inspection NT$2,000; out-of-warranty wear allowance NT$8,000 = NT$59,100, rounded to NT$59,000. Spark plugs deliberately NOT included — the verified lexus.com.tw table gives 100,000km for iridium/platinum plugs and the car is only at 49,000 km. Coolant and brake fluid are both pulled in by the TIME half of their interval, never the mileage half. Hybrid battery still inside the 八年/160,000公里 Lexus + 和泰 combined warranty, so no HV allowance. This window is LOWER than the 3-5y window purely because the age-driven tire replacement landed at year 5; per-year spend still rises. Confidence low: brake and wear timing at this mileage varies widely, and this is 7 years ahead of any receipt that can be verified today."},{"y":10,"source":"Cost SINCE the 7-year checkpoint (7y->10y window, three years not two — the largest window and the largest number). Build-up: 6 visits at ~NT$5,800 = NT$34,800; second tire set NT$40,000; brake fluid x2 NT$5,600; spark plugs NT$6,000; second 12V battery NT$10,000; coolant NT$5,000; rear discs and pads NT$10,000; HV cooling clean and inspection NT$4,000; ageing/wear repair allowance NT$25,000 = NT$140,400, rounded to NT$140,000. NOTE the plug correction: the verified lexus.com.tw interval for iridium/platinum plugs is 100,000km, which this car never reaches inside 10 years, so the plugs are budgeted as an AGE-driven change, not a mileage-driven one. The hybrid battery warranty (5年/100,000km Lexus + 3年/60,000km 和泰 = 8年/160,000km) lapses on TIME during this window while the car sits at only 70,000 km, so HV inspection becomes an owner cost — but pack REPLACEMENT is not budgeted, as explained in plan_notes. Confidence low: a three-year window a decade out, priced in 2026 NT$ with no inflation adjustment and no verifiable receipt for a generation that is four months old."}],"sources":[{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官網 — 大改款 ES 上市新聞稿（新車價格表）","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/news_detail.aspx?nw=753","note":"PRIMARY, fetched and verified in this audit. Page returns 建議售價 ES 300h 豪華版 177 萬元 / ES 300h 頂級版 197 萬元 / ES 500e 頂級版 205 萬元 / ES 500e 旗艦版 250 萬元, and 自即日起正式上市 dated 2026/04/28. The NT$1,970,000 list price is CORRECT — no change."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官網 — 保養知識（定期保養里程與項目表）","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-maintenance.aspx","note":"Fetched and verified. Official intervals: engine oil + filter 6個月或5,000km (heavy use) / 一年或10,000km (normal use); brake fluid 40,000km/2年; coolant LLC 40,000km/2年, Super LLC 80,000【160,000km】; spark plugs 100,000km iridium-platinum or 50,000km standard. This is what makes the plan time-driven at 7,000 km/year, and it is why spark plugs are treated as age-driven rather than mileage-driven at year 10."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官網 — 車主權益（保固條款）","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/owners-warranty.aspx","note":"Fetched and verified. 新車保固 四年或行駛十二萬公里（以先到者為準）; hybrid 動力電池 五年或100,000公里 plus 和泰 追加三年或60,000公里 = 八年或160,000公里; 更換零件 兩年或50,000公里; BEV battery 8年/160,000km with 70% capacity floor. Confirms both warranties lapse on TIME for this low-mileage buyer."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官網 — 定期保養服務內容（滿月保養／25項尊榮安檢）","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"Fetched and verified. Confirms the free 滿月保養 (first month from registration, 24 inspection points) and the 25項尊榮安檢 at every visit, and confirms there is NO free ongoing scheduled-maintenance programme and NO published price list — hence owner receipts were used for costing."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — 2026 Lexus ALL NEW ES300h 豪華版 實際成交菜單","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1777728977.A.063.html","note":"Fetched and read VERBATIM in this audit. The menu line is 牌價 177萬 - 優惠 9.7萬 = 167.3萬, with nine 贈送配備 listed SEPARATELY (油加滿, 新車美容, E-TAG申辦, 鑰匙皮套 x2, 行李箱防水墊, 全車防水腳踏墊, Lexus 雨傘/帽子, MIO 960WD, 全車F系列冰鑽). The price explicitly excludes 貨物稅 5+5萬 (汰舊換新) and 領牌費. This CONTRADICTS the prior draft's claim that the NT$97,000 was mostly accessory value, and is the basis for raising the cash discount and cutting onroad_fees."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus ES 二手車行情與實車 listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/es","note":"MAIN used-price source, fetched and verified (dealer 車商 RETAIL asking prices — every listing on the page is a 車商 listing, adjusted down for private sale). ES300h listings confirmed Aug 2026: 2022 豪華版 3.9萬km NT$1,288,000; 2020 旗艦版 10.9萬km NT$1,088,000; 2020 豪華版 7萬km NT$828,000; 2019 旗艦版 8.97萬km NT$1,069,000; 2017 頂級版 12.48萬km NT$639,000; 2017 頂級Navi版 12.51萬km NT$639,000; 2013 豪華版 9.45萬km NT$419,000. NOT reproduced on this page and therefore NOT relied on: the prior draft's '2024 旗艦版 5,000 km NT$1,698,000' and '2016 旗艦版 190,000 km NT$485,000'. Every verified listing carries far higher mileage than this buyer's trajectory."},{"name":"ETtoday 車雲 — 台灣新年式 Lexus ES 官網上架（7代最終年式價格表）","url":"https://speed.ettoday.net/news/3032250","note":"Fetched and verified. Full outgoing 7th-gen table: ES200 豪華版 NT$1,770,000 / ES200 頂級版 NT$1,950,000 / ES300h 豪華版 NT$2,030,000 / ES250 F Sport NT$2,180,000 / ES300h F Sport NT$2,200,000 / ES300h 旗艦版 NT$2,490,000. Confirms the NT$1,770,000 and NT$1,950,000 are ES200 petrol, not ES300h — the denominator trap the retention ratios depend on."},{"name":"地球黃金線 TVBS — 大改款 ES 預售價與改款前價格對照","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/312783","note":"Fetched and verified. Pre-sale prices 180萬 / 200萬 / 210萬 / 255萬 for ES300h 豪華版, ES300h 頂級版, ES500e 頂級版, ES500e 旗艦版 — confirming the 頂級版 was cut NT$30,000 from pre-sale to the NT$1,970,000 launch price. It also states both new ES300h trims undercut the outgoing ENTRY ES300h 豪華版 at NT$2,030,000. CORRECTION to the prior draft's wording: the outgoing TOP ES300h was the 旗艦版 at NT$2,490,000, not a 頂級版; the outgoing generation had no ES300h 頂級版."},{"name":"KingAutos — 2024 Lexus ES 300h 旗艦版 規格與售價","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/spec/11333","note":"Fetched and verified. Confirms the outgoing ES300h 旗艦版 list price of 249 萬元, the denominator behind the 6-7 year retention anchors."},{"name":"KingAutos — Lexus ES 車系總覽（世代編成、排氣量對照）","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/es","note":"Fetched and verified. Lists the 7th-gen lineup (200 豪華 177萬 / 200 頂級 195萬 / 300h 豪華 203萬 / 250 F Sport 218萬 / 300h F Sport 220萬 / 300h 旗艦 249萬) plus the preceding generation (200 豪華 173萬 / 200 頂級 191萬 / 300h 尊爵 221萬), and displacement span 1,987~2,487cc. Used for the pre-facelift denominators and to confirm the new 300h is the 1,987cc unit."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — Lexus ES 中古車 listings","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=ES","note":"Fetched and verified — and the prior draft MISREAD it. The visible listings are ES200 and ES250 PETROL cars, not ES300h: 2019 ES200 68,614km NT$938,000; 2020 ES200 73,134km NT$878,000; 2020 ES200 41,020km NT$958,000; 2023 ES250 88,657km NT$1,198,000; 2019 ES250 118,435km NT$798,000; 2022 ES200 62,000km NT$1,188,000; 2021 ES200 78,926km NT$1,098,000; 2018 ES200 64,102km NT$798,000; 2020 ES200 57,000km NT$928,000 (58 total). Against ES200's ~NT$1,730,000-1,770,000 list these imply ~54% at 6 years for a 41,000 km petrol car — used here as a FLOOR check on the hybrid rather than as a same-powertrain comparable, since gasoline should not out-retain hybrid."},{"name":"痞客邦 熊言狗語 — Lexus 原廠定保實際發票","url":"https://hhu70.pixnet.net/blog/post/70007296","note":"Fetched and verified — and RE-LABELLED. The invoice is for a **Lexus UX250h at 15,000 km**, not an ES, total NT$3,400, and the owner SUPPLIED THEIR OWN Costco Mobil 0W20 oil; the author notes another owner paid NT$1,900 for the same job. It is a valid dispersion datapoint but understates a dealer-supplied-oil ES300h visit, which is why per-visit costs here were raised ~15% over the prior draft."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 6代 Lexus ES300h 旗艦版 2016 年 listing","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/car/1482531","note":"Fetched and verified to exist: 2016 Lexus ES 300h 旗艦版, asking NT$886,000, dealer 一馬車行, MILEAGE NOT DISCLOSED on the page — which is exactly why the 10-year checkpoint is confidence 'low'. Used only as the low-mileage end of the 10-year band against 8891's 2017 頂級Navi at 125,100 km / NT$639,000."}]},"lexus-es500e-premium":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year; all checkpoints use the 7,000 km/year midpoint (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km), roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. Three consequences drive the model. (1) Servicing is time-driven: Lexus TW's maintenance-plan page publishes 6 months/10,000 km, 12 months/20,000 km, 24 months/40,000 km and 48 months/80,000 km, and the BEV page repeats 每半年或 1 萬公里, so the 6-month clock always fires first and the car sees 2 visits a year, ~20 scheduled visits over 10 years for only 70,000 km. NOTE the brief assumed an annual interval; the official Lexus TW schedule is 6-monthly and the official source is used. (2) Every km cap in the warranty structure is unreachable. NEW FINDING THIS PASS, verified first-hand at https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx: beyond the standard 4年/120,000公里 vehicle warranty there is a FREE extension to 第5年/140,000公里, granted automatically to owners who return for every scheduled service within the 6-month window ('如您每次均以半年內準時回廠實施定保，即享第 5 年 / 14 萬公里之免費延長保證'); one late service forfeits it. This buyer services on time by construction, so the vehicle warranty runs to YEAR 5, not year 4 — the prior draft understated coverage by a full year. The 8年/160,000公里 battery warranty likewise expires on its YEAR clock at year 8, and that year-8 date is a hard value cliff sitting between the year-7 and year-10 checkpoints. (3) Consumables age out rather than wear out: tires are replaced on a ~5-6 year rubber-ageing schedule (~35,000 km), not on tread depth; brake friction material lasts exceptionally long because a BEV brakes regeneratively; and BOTH official coolant intervals (heater coolant first at 160,000 km, power-control-unit coolant first at 240,000 km) are never reached inside 10 years. Low mileage is a genuine resale asset, and the comparables quoted below were deliberately chosen at low mileage (the anchor UX300e ran 8,750 km/yr; the 7-year BEV comparables are a 35,000 km I-Pace and the low-odometer ES200 examples in each model year). CORRECTED FROM AN EARLIER DRAFT: a 3年免費保養 (3-year complimentary scheduled maintenance) BEV package was assumed and is disproven — see maintenance.plan_notes.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no used ES500e exists in Taiwan at any price (launched 2026-04-28, 3.5 months ago). REVISED THIS PASS in response to the reviewer's round-number challenge. The prior figure of 1,460,000 was exactly 70.02% of real_cost, and the chain that produced it (80% of list, then minus 11%) was built from stacked round percentages — a genuine fitting artifact, and the reviewer was right to flag it. The number is now re-derived as an output of the curve rather than a target: the verified year-4 Lexus BEV anchor is 52.3% dealer retail (UX300e, see year 5, re-fetched live today), and a front-loaded BEV curve landing on that anchor passes through ~79% at year 1, ~68% at year 2, ~59% at year 3 — the shape the prior draft's own narrative described but did not actually apply. Year-1 dealer retail 79% of 2,050,000 = 1,619,500; private sale 11% below that dealer asking price = 1,441,355, quoted 1,441,000 (69.11% of real_cost). Dealer trade-in a further 12.7% below private at 1,258,000. The private figure is NOT a dealer asking price. Two verified liquidity facts justify a hard year-1 markdown: SUM lists ZERO used Lexus RZ nationwide, and Lexus TW has withdrawn the UX300e in favour of a hybrid-only UX (https://www.lexus.com.tw/models/ux/price now shows 300h only), so used Lexus BEVs barely trade and a one-year-old car must undercut a still-orderable new one heavily. 7,000 km puts this at the strong end of the year-1 range — functionally as-new. Cross-trim check (sibling read at 2026-08-12 00:38; see the year-7 note — the 旗艦版 record is being edited concurrently and its figures move): 旗艦版 1,700,000 sits 18.0% above this car in absolute money and 2.05 points below it in retention ratio. The ratio direction is correct — the used market pays for model and powertrain far more than for equipment grade — though the absolute gap is currently wider than the 8-15% seen elsewhere in the pair, which is a property of the sibling's latest revision rather than of this figure. Confidence low: pure model, no transaction data."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED with a real-data sanity check. REVISED THIS PASS for the same round-number reason as year 1, and because the prior draft contained a direct internal contradiction the reviewer's challenge exposed: its own prose said the curve 'passes through roughly 59% at year 3', but its arithmetic then used 61% — the 2-point difference is precisely what pushed the answer onto the round 53% of real_cost (1,110,000 = 53.24%). Corrected to the curve's own stated 59%: year-3 dealer retail 59% of 2,050,000 = 1,209,500, private sale 11% below at 1,076,455, quoted 1,076,000 (51.61% of real_cost), dealer trade-in 13.5% below private at 931,000. Real low-mileage GASOLINE comparables (SUM, 2023 ES200 at 3 years): 23,088 km asking 1,198,000; 33,947 km 1,179,000; 48,227 km 1,168,000 — against a ~1,700,000 original list that is ~70% dealer-retail retention for a gasoline ES at year 3, so this BEV at 59% dealer retail carries an 11-point powertrain penalty against its own model line, consistent with the ~11 points measured at year 5 and the ~13 points at year 7. Still inside the vehicle warranty at this point (now known to run to year 5, not year 4 — see assumptions), which supports the price. Cross-trim check (sibling read at 2026-08-12 00:38): 旗艦版 1,265,000 sits 17.6% above in absolute money and 1.71 points below in ratio — correct direction, same concurrency caveat as year 1. Confidence low: interpolated between a modelled year-1 and a single real year-4 BEV listing."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"BEST-ANCHORED CHECKPOINT — re-fetched live TODAY and left unchanged. https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/LEXUS/UX returns 26 listings, of which exactly ONE is a BEV: a 2022 Lexus UX300e, 35,000 km, asking NT$888,000 DEALER RETAIL at ~4 years old. That is identical to this checkpoint's assumed_km and works out at 8,750 km/yr, close to this buyer's low-mileage profile, so it IS a low-mileage comparable. Denominator confirmed: the original UX300e sold at NT$1,699,000 and the larger 72.82 kWh battery version did not arrive in Taiwan until 2023 at NT$1,899,000, so a 2022 car is the 1,699,000 variant. 888,000 / 1,699,000 = 52.3% dealer-retail retention at year 4. CORROBORATED THIS PASS by two further UX300e asking prices found off-platform — 998,000 (8891, Kaier EV, Taipei) and an 858,000 site average — giving a year-4 cluster of roughly 50.5-58.7% and putting the 888,000 anchor at the conservative end of it. HYBRID CONTROL, restated honestly: the same SUM page carries a 2022 UX250h at 839,000 (44,000 km) and five 2021 UX250h between 858,000 and 998,000. The prior draft's '6-point measured BEV penalty' remains NOT measurable, because the UX250h list-price denominator varies by trim across model years and cannot be pinned; at a 1,700,000 denominator the year-4 hybrid retains 49.4%, i.e. BELOW the BEV, which is the opposite sign. This curve is therefore anchored on the UX300e's verified 52.3% and cross-checked against the GASOLINE ES (same model line, verified denominators), not on the fragile UX hybrid differential. Extending the BEV curve to year 5 gives ~48.8% dealer retail (~1,000,000) against ~59-60% for a gasoline ES of the same age — an 11-point powertrain penalty. Private sale quoted 9% BELOW dealer retail at 910,000 (43.65% of real_cost) and trade-in 14.3% below private at 780,000. The private figure is NOT the 888,000 asking price copied across. Supporting the price and NEW this pass: the free 第5年/140,000公里 extended warranty (https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx) means an on-time-serviced car is still IN warranty at this checkpoint rather than one year out of it. Liquidity caveat widening the spread: SUM listed ZERO used Lexus RZ. Confidence medium: one directly comparable real BEV listing at near-identical age and mileage, denominator independently confirmed, now corroborated by two more asking prices."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"MATERIALLY CORRECTED THIS PASS — this was the reviewer's main objection and the objection is upheld. The prior 630,000 was 30.2% of real_cost, the only integer breakpoint in the line, and it broke the curve (5y→7y lost 14 points against 9 for 3y→5y and 11 for 7y→10y) while putting this base trim BELOW the 旗艦版 in retention ratio (30.2% vs 33.5%) and blowing the absolute gap between the two trims out to 35% when every other checkpoint sits at 8-15%. Rebuilt from REAL 7-year-old BEV transactions rather than interpolation, exactly as asked. Two 2019 BEVs with VERIFIED original Taiwan list prices are on sale in Taiwan today: (a) Nissan Leaf, launched 2019-09-25 at NT$1,490,000, dealer asking 499,000 on 8891 = 33.5% dealer-retail retention at 7 years (a private Carousell example at 80,000 km asks 388,000 = 26.0%, but that is a high-mileage car); (b) Jaguar I-Pace EV400 S, launched 2019-10-08 at NT$3,330,000, a 2019/12 car with just 35,000 km asking 958,000 = 28.8% dealer retail at 7 years — the closest analogue by price class and by mileage profile. For contrast, a 2019 Tesla Model S asks 1,788,000, but its original list could not be verified so it is excluded from the ratio work. Those two verified points bracket the BEV floor at 29-34% of list. This car must sit clearly ABOVE that floor: the gasoline Lexus ES holds ~54% dealer retail at the same age (verified 2019 ES200 listings at 896,000 with 73,280 km and 938,000 with 68,614 km against a ~1,670,000 launch list), Lexus/Hotai runs the strongest service network in Taiwan, and neither Nissan nor Jaguar carries that franchise strength. Landing: 40.8% dealer retail = ~837,000, which is 7 points above the Leaf, 12 above the I-Pace and 13 below the same-brand gasoline ES — a powertrain penalty that widens from ~11 points at year 5 to ~13 at year 7 as the year-8 battery cliff approaches, which is the correct direction. Private sale 11% below dealer retail = 745,000 (35.73% of real_cost); trade-in 14.5% below private at 637,000. UPPER BOUND REJECTED AND STATED: if the BEV decayed from year 4 to year 7 at the same rate as the UX250h hybrid it would reach ~44.9% dealer retail (~820,000 private), but that ignores the verified facts that Lexus TW has withdrawn its only BEV from sale and that zero used RZ exist nationwide. CURVE-SHAPE CHECK, the reviewer's second test: the retention ratio now falls 69.11 / 51.61 / 43.65 / 35.73 / 19.18, i.e. 8.75, 3.98, 3.96 and 5.52 points per year across the four windows — a smooth deceleration through the middle of the curve, with the single acceleration deferred to the 7-10 window where the year-8 battery-warranty expiry actually sits. The prior figure inverted that shape by crushing the middle, which is what the reviewer identified. CROSS-TRIM CHECK — UNRESOLVED, FLAGGED FOR THE BATCH OWNER: the reviewer's core test was that this trim must out-retain the 旗艦版 in ratio, and it now does at all five checkpoints. However, the 旗艦版 record was independently rewritten at 2026-08-12 00:35, WHILE this re-audit was in progress, and moved its own year-7 the opposite way — from 850,000 down to 655,000 (25.84% of its real_cost) — apparently because its reviewer showed it the same inversion from the other side and it corrected by lowering rather than by raising this record. The two records therefore crossed over: at year 7 this trim's 745,000 now exceeds the 旗艦版's 655,000 in ABSOLUTE money, which is impossible for a cheaper trim of the same car and must be reconciled by whoever owns both files. This record does not chase that number, for three stated reasons. (1) The sibling's new year-7 is internally unsound on its own curve: its decay runs 8.58, 5.52, 6.51 then 3.02 points per year, i.e. accelerating INTO year 7 and then collapsing across the year-8 battery cliff — backwards, and the same crushed-middle defect this record was told to fix. (2) Its implied 29.4% dealer retail puts a Lexus BEV at the same retention as the 2019 Jaguar I-Pace (28.8%), which ignores the gap between Hotai's service network and Jaguar's in Taiwan. (3) This figure is derived from real transactions with verified denominators, which is what the review explicitly asked for, rather than from the sibling. If the pair is reconciled by moving the 旗艦版 back onto a smooth curve through its own year-5 (985,000) and year-10 (425,000), its year-7 lands near 850,000-900,000 and the 8-15% absolute gap is restored without touching this record. Confidence low: extrapolated across both generation AND powertrain; no Lexus BEV in Taiwan has yet reached 7 years (the UX300e arrived around September 2021, so the oldest is under 6), and no such data point was invented."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM PREDECESSOR GENERATION, weakest checkpoint in the record — reviewed twice and left unchanged. There is no 10-year-old BEV market in Taiwan for any Lexus, so this is a modelled figure, stated as such. Predecessor anchor: a 2016 ES200 with 51,000 km (low mileage, the closest match to this buyer's 70,000 km) asks 688,000 dealer retail, while a 2016 ES200 with 169,000 km asks 638,000 — the low-mileage premium is real but modest at this age. Against a ~1,600,000-era list that is ~43% dealer-retail retention, implying ~38% private for a 10-year-old GASOLINE ES. The BEV figure is set far below that at 19.18% of real_cost (400,000 private) for one specific, dateable reason: the 8年/160,000公里 battery warranty (https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/bev.aspx) expires on its YEAR clock at year 8 because the km cap is unreachable at 7,000 km/yr, so this checkpoint sits two years PAST the warranty cliff. Once an out-of-warranty HV battery's replacement cost approaches the car's value, Taiwanese buyers price that tail risk aggressively. The 2019 Jaguar I-Pace evidence now supports this shape independently: a premium BEV was already down to 28.8% of list at year 7, so a 22% dealer-retail figure at year 10 is not an outlier. Dealer retail equivalent ~455,000; private quoted 12.1% below; trade-in 15% below private at 340,000 — the widest gap in the table, because dealers bid hard on out-of-battery-warranty BEVs they may struggle to retail. Cross-trim check (sibling read at 2026-08-12 00:38): 旗艦版 425,000 is 6.2% above in absolute money and 2.42 points below in ratio. The ratio direction is correct — equipment grade is worth almost nothing at this age — but the absolute gap has fallen just under the 8% floor seen elsewhere in the pair because the sibling lowered its year-10 from 460,000 to 425,000 during this re-audit; see the year-7 note. Confidence low: no observable market, generation AND powertrain both extrapolated."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"REDUCED from 11,000. The prior build-up billed a wheel alignment (1,500) and 2,500 of 'sundry consumables' in the first year of a 7,000 km car; neither is due, and stripping them is most of the reduction. What remains is two time-driven visits — the 6-month EV inspection and the 12-month service with a cabin filter — at full retail, since the only free service is the 1-month 滿月保養 (https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx). A BEV visit is materially cheaper than the hybrid sibling's because there is no engine oil or oil filter; the ES300h 頂級版 record books 11,000 for the same window precisely because both of its visits include an oil service. Year-1 scheduled content is identical between the two BEV trims — there is no tire, brake or suspension work in the first year to separate them — so the two BEV records should agree here; the 旗艦版 sibling read 6,000 earlier in this session and 11,000 at 2026-08-12 00:38, and that pair needs reconciling by the batch owner. Build-up from published intervals and typical Taiwan premium-brand labour rates, not a quoted price or an owner receipt. Confidence low: the interval structure is official, but no Lexus TW BEV service price list or owner receipt was reachable."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers the 1-3 year window only (not cumulative). REDUCED from 30,000, which carried 3,000 of alignment and 4,100 of unexplained 'sundries' on a car that has covered 21,000 km and needs neither, and priced four inspection visits at 14,000 when a BEV visit involves no oil service. Rebuilt line by line at full retail against the official interval table (https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx) and the official BEV consumable list (https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/bev.aspx), which for this period contains only cabin filter and brake fluid. Engine-specific content — spark plugs, engine air filter, transmission fluid, fuel filter — is excluded as not applicable to a BEV, and that exclusion is the whole of the 12,000 gap to the ES300h hybrid sibling's 28,000 for the same window. Scheduled content is identical between the two BEV trims until the first tire set falls due, so this window should match the 旗艦版 exactly; it read 16,000 earlier in this session and 30,000 at 2026-08-12 00:38, another pair for the batch owner to reconcile. Build-up, not a quoted price. Confidence low for the same reason as year 1."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers the 3-5 year window only. REDUCED from 88,000. Two corrections. FIRST AND LARGEST, the tire line: the 頂級版 wheel spec is now confirmed as 235/55R19 (7Car; the 旗艦版 takes 235/45R21), and the prior draft's own note conceded the size 'could not be confirmed' while budgeting 50,000 for the set — close to 21-inch money. Real Taiwan retail for a premium 235/55R19 set of four is 29,031-30,600 (Michelin Pilot Sport 5 Energy 29,031, Michelin Latitude Tour HP 30,194, Continental UX7 30,600, https://biggo.com.tw/s/235%2F55R19/; a single Michelin Pilot Sport 4 SUV in this size retails around 7,000), so 34,000 fitted with alignment is a fair dealer-channel figure and 50,000 was not. SECOND, warranty coverage: the free extension to 第5年/140,000公里 for on-time servicing (https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx, read this pass) means this window is still fully covered, so unlike the prior draft it carries no out-of-warranty repair allowance — year 6 is the first self-funded year. Tire replacement is age-driven not wear-driven: at 35,000 km the tread is fine but 5-year-old rubber on a ~2.2-tonne BEV should be replaced. The result sits below the 旗艦版 for this window (read as 76,000 earlier in this session and 88,000 at 2026-08-12 00:38) and the mechanism is the tire set alone: ~34,000 for a fitted 19-inch set against ~52,000 for the flagship's 21-inch set, priced from the same retail source. That is the direction the reviewer asked for, and it now rests on a confirmed wheel spec and a published price rather than on an assumption. Build-up from official intervals and real retail tire prices; no owner receipts were reachable, so confidence low."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers the 5-7 year window only. REDUCED from 62,000, and one line deleted outright: the prior draft billed 8,000 for 動力電池／逆變器冷卻液更換 at year 7, but the official BEV consumable list sets the first heater-coolant change at 160,000 km and the first power-control-unit coolant change at 240,000 km (https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/bev.aspx). This car is at 49,000 km. Neither is due, and neither will be due before year 10 — that was a straight error, not a judgement call. The prior draft also billed a separate 6,000 for HV inspection; the same page states battery state of health is measured with diagnostic equipment at every scheduled visit, and the 8年/160,000公里 battery warranty is still live at year 7, so it is not separately chargeable here. Added instead is the item a Taiwanese BEV actually needs at this age: a disc-and-pad refurbishment at 26,000. Brake FRICTION material is barely worn — regenerative braking means first pad replacement typically falls far beyond 49,000 km — but low annual use in a humid climate corrodes discs, which is why the work happens on age rather than wear. This is the first window fully outside the vehicle warranty (which now runs to year 5), hence the 12,000 unscheduled-repair allowance. Sits below the 旗艦版 for this window (read as 80,000 earlier in this session and 65,000 at 2026-08-12 00:38): the smaller brake package behind 19-inch wheels accounts for roughly 8,000 of the difference and a smaller out-of-warranty allowance on a car without AVS adaptive dampers for most of the rest. Also below the ES300h hybrid's 59,000, correctly — the hybrid additionally pays for engine oil at four visits, an engine air filter, coolant and transaxle-fluid inspection. Extrapolated build-up: no Taiwan Lexus BEV has yet reached 7 years, so no owner receipts exist at this age."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers the 7-10 year window only. REDUCED from 150,000. Three drivers. (1) The second tire set is a 19-inch set at ~36,000, not the 52,000 the prior draft carried; the 旗艦版's second 21-inch set legitimately costs ~54,000 (11,200-12,200 per tire, https://biggo.com.tw/s/245%2F40R21/). (2) Suspension refurbishment is budgeted at 22,000 rather than the flagship's 30,000, because this trim runs conventional dampers while AVS adaptive damping is 旗艦版-exclusive — replacement adaptive dampers are the expensive part. (3) Coolant is now a small 6,000 time-based allowance rather than a scheduled change, because at 70,000 km neither official interval (160,000 km heater coolant, 240,000 km power-control-unit coolant) has been reached even once in ten years. The dominant EVENT is unchanged: the 8年/160,000公里 battery warranty expires on its YEAR clock at year 8 because the km cap is unreachable at 7,000 km/yr, so the last two years of this window carry uninsured HV-battery risk and a standalone battery health check becomes billable for the first time. IMPORTANT SCOPE NOTE, retained: this figure deliberately EXCLUDES any HV battery replacement or module repair — that is a catastrophic-risk item running into the hundreds of thousands, not a maintenance line, and averaging it in would misrepresent the expected cost; it is instead reflected in the depressed year-10 resale figures. Sits well below the 旗艦版 for this window (read as 150,000 earlier in this session and 195,000 at 2026-08-12 00:38), driven by ~18,000 on the second tire set plus ~8,000 on dampers, and 22,000 below the ES300h hybrid's 140,000, which additionally pays for spark plugs, engine oil across six visits, an engine air filter and hybrid transaxle service. Extrapolated — no 10-year-old Lexus BEV exists anywhere in Taiwan, so this has no observational basis and is a modelled build-up only."}],"sources":[{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — warranty and extended-warranty page (保固保證)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx","note":"NEW AND LOAD-BEARING THIS PASS, fetched live. Standard vehicle warranty 4 年或行駛 120,000 公里. Decisive finding: a FREE extension to 第 5 年 / 14 萬公里 is granted to owners who return for every scheduled service within the 6-month window — '如您每次均以半年內準時回廠實施定保，即享第 5 年 / 14 萬公里之免費延長保證' — and is forfeited by a single late service. The prior draft had the vehicle warranty ending at year 4, understating coverage by a year; this moves the first fully self-funded year from 5 to 6 and removes the repair allowance from the 3-5 year maintenance window."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — BEV ownership and service page (電動車專區)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/bev.aspx","note":"PRIMARY warranty and consumable source. Battery warranty 8 年或行駛 160,000 公里 to at least 70% capacity; vehicle warranty 4 年或 120,000 公里; service interval 每半年或 1 萬公里; battery state of health measured with diagnostic equipment at every visit. BEV consumables are limited to cabin filter, brake fluid (every 2 years or 40,000 km), heater coolant (first change 160,000 km) and power-control-unit coolant (first change 240,000 km) — the two coolant thresholds are what disprove the prior draft's year-7 coolant charge at 49,000 km. NEGATIVE FINDING: no free-maintenance programme is described."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — scheduled maintenance plan table","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"Publishes five stages: new-car/1-month (24 items, FREE), 6 months/10,000 km (16 items), 12 months/20,000 km (29 items), 24 months/40,000 km (34 items), 48 months/80,000 km (37 items). DECISIVE NEGATIVE FINDING: the 1-month new-car service is the only free one and no prepaid or complimentary package is described — this is what disproves the 3年免費保養 assumption an earlier draft carried. Engine-specific content (spark plugs, air filter, ATF, fuel filter) excluded as not applicable to a BEV."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — Lexus UX used listings (the single real Lexus BEV data point)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/LEXUS/UX","note":"MOST LOAD-BEARING RESIDUAL SOURCE, re-fetched LIVE this pass. 26 listings, of which exactly one is a BEV: 2022 UX300e, 35,000 km, dealer asking NT$888,000 — near-identical in age and mileage to the year-5 checkpoint, and 888,000/1,699,000 = 52.3% dealer-retail retention at year 4. Hybrid controls on the same page: 2022 UX250h 839,000 (44,000 km); five 2021 UX250h between 858,000 and 998,000; four 2019 UX250h between 688,000 and 758,000. Those hybrid ratios are NOT used quantitatively because the UX250h list-price denominator varies by trim across model years and could not be pinned."},{"name":"BigGo 比價 — 235/55R19 tire retail prices (this trim's fitment)","url":"https://biggo.com.tw/s/235%2F55R19/","note":"NEW THIS PASS, fetched live. Premium touring sets of four: Michelin Pilot Sport 5 Energy 29,031; Michelin Latitude Tour HP 30,194; Continental UX7 30,600. Per-tire mid-range brands: Bridgestone AL01 5,500, Yokohama V61 5,600; a Michelin Pilot Sport 4 SUV in this size retails around 7,000. This is the evidence that reprices the year-5 and year-10 tire lines from 50,000/52,000 down to 34,000/36,000 fitted, and it is the main reason this trim's 10-year maintenance now falls below the 旗艦版's."},{"name":"BigGo 比價 — 21-inch tire retail prices (the 旗艦版 fitment, for contrast)","url":"https://biggo.com.tw/s/245%2F40R21/","note":"NEW THIS PASS, fetched live. Bridgestone ALENZA 001 11,200-12,200 per tire; Continental SC7 11,200 per tire — roughly 60% more per tire than the 19-inch equivalents above, so a fitted set runs ~52,000-54,000 against ~34,000. Quantifies why the 旗艦版 must carry higher maintenance than this trim, which is the reviewer's point 4."},{"name":"DuckDuckGo aggregated results — ES500e trim wheel and tire specification","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=Lexus+ES500e+%E9%A0%82%E7%B4%9A%E7%89%88+235%2F55R19+%E6%97%97%E8%89%A6%E7%89%88+235%2F45R21+%E8%A6%8F%E6%A0%BC%E8%A1%A8+%E8%BB%8A%E9%87%8D+AVS+%E9%81%BF%E9%9C%87","note":"Search-results aggregation (WebSearch budget exhausted; the U-CAR spec page https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/lexus/es%20electric/7179/spec returned HTTP 403 to automated fetch and was NOT used directly). Establishes via 7Car that the ES500e 頂級版 runs 19-inch wheels in 235/55R19 with aero wheel covers while the 旗艦版 runs 21-inch in 235/45R21. Resolves the prior draft's stated open question ('the ES500e 頂級版 wheel size could not be confirmed')."},{"name":"DuckDuckGo aggregated results — 2019 BEV used asking prices in Taiwan","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=2019+%E5%B9%B4%E5%BC%8F+%E9%9B%BB%E5%8B%95%E8%BB%8A+%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%A4%E8%BB%8A+%E8%A1%8C%E6%83%85+Nissan+Leaf+%E4%BA%8C%E6%89%8B+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+%E8%90%AC","note":"NEW THIS PASS. The real 7-year-old BEV data the reviewer asked for. 2019 Nissan Leaf on 8891 (Taichung) asking NT$499,000 dealer retail; a private Carousell 2019 Leaf with 80,000 km asking NT$388,000. Used with the verified 1,490,000 launch price to give 33.5% dealer-retail retention at 7 years for a mass-market BEV."},{"name":"DuckDuckGo aggregated results — Nissan Leaf Taiwan launch price","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=Nissan+Leaf+2019+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+149.9%E8%90%AC+%E9%9B%BB%E5%8B%95%E8%BB%8A+%E5%BB%BA%E8%AD%B0%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9","note":"NEW THIS PASS. Confirms the denominator for the Leaf comparable: Yulon Nissan launched the Leaf (ZE1) in Taiwan on 2019-09-25 at NT$1,490,000 (U-CAR and Yahoo Motors both quote 149 萬)."},{"name":"DuckDuckGo aggregated results — Jaguar I-Pace used prices and Taiwan launch price","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=Jaguar+I-Pace+EV400+S+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+2019+%E5%BB%BA%E8%AD%B0%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+%E8%90%AC%E5%85%83","note":"NEW THIS PASS and the closest 7-year premium-BEV analogue by price class. Taiwan launch 2019-10-08 at NT$3,330,000 (EV400 S) and NT$3,770,000 (EV400 HSE). A 2019/12 EV400 S with only 35,000 km is asking NT$958,000 on ONLYEV (Taoyuan) = 28.8% dealer-retail retention at 7 years. A FindCar listing at 168萬 for a 2019 car with 39,846 km was discarded as inconsistent with that site's own contaminated 100萬-500萬 range for the model year."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — Tesla used listings (BEV decay-shape cross-check)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TESLA","note":"NEW THIS PASS, fetched live: 50 listings. Nearest usable points are 2020 Model 3 at 938,000 (75,407 km), 898,000 (105,222 km) and 738,000 (126,000 km) — a 6-year-old premium BEV holding well above the Leaf and I-Pace. Used only as an upper reference on BEV decay, not in the ratio arithmetic, because Tesla's Taiwan list prices were repeatedly cut between 2020 and 2026 and the original denominator is therefore unstable."},{"name":"DuckDuckGo aggregated results — 2018-2019 Tesla Model S Taiwan used prices","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=Tesla+Model+S+2018+2019+%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%A4%E8%BB%8A+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+%E8%90%AC+8891+%E4%BA%8C%E6%89%8B","note":"NEW THIS PASS. 2019 Model S asking NT$1,788,000 and a 2018 Model S 75D asking NT$1,388,000, both on 8891. Quoted for context only and EXCLUDED from the ratio work: the original Taiwan list prices of those cars could not be verified, so no retention percentage was computed from them."},{"name":"DuckDuckGo aggregated results — BEV versus petrol/hybrid maintenance cost in Taiwan","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=%E9%9B%BB%E5%8B%95%E8%BB%8A+%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A+%E8%B2%BB%E7%94%A8+%E6%AF%94+%E6%B2%B9%E9%9B%BB+%E4%BE%BF%E5%AE%9C+Lexus+UX300e+%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A+%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC+Mobile01","note":"NEW THIS PASS, supporting the direction of the maintenance correction. Taiwanese write-ups put BEV scheduled maintenance 30-50% below a comparable petrol car (one quotes ~NT$18,000 versus ~NT$42,000 cumulative over three years; another NT$10,000-15,000 saved per year). The 18.4% discount to the ES300h hybrid modelled here is deliberately more conservative than that range, since a hybrid already shares the regenerative-braking advantage. NEGATIVE FINDING: no Lexus UX300e owner receipts were retrievable — Mobile01 owner-billing threads return 403 to automated fetch — which is why every maintenance checkpoint is confidence low."},{"name":"DuckDuckGo aggregated results — 235/55R19 tire retail price cross-check","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=235%2F55R19+%E8%BC%AA%E8%83%8E+%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E6%8F%9B%E8%83%8E+%E5%9B%9B%E6%A2%9D+%E5%90%AB%E5%B7%A5","note":"NEW THIS PASS. Independent corroboration of the BigGo pricing: Lee Tire lists the Michelin Pilot Sport 4 SUV in 235/55R19 at NT$7,000 per tire (page updated 2026-07-23)."},{"name":"DuckDuckGo aggregated results — Lexus UX300e used asking prices","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=Lexus+UX300e+2022+%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%A4+%E8%A1%8C%E6%83%85+%E9%9B%BB%E5%8B%95%E8%BB%8A+%E6%AE%98%E5%80%BC+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E4%BA%8C%E6%89%8B+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+%E8%90%AC","note":"NEW THIS PASS. Corroborates the year-5 anchor from outside SUM: a 2022 UX300e asking NT$998,000 on 8891 (Kaier EV, Taipei) and a site-average of NT$858,000 on FindCar. Together with SUM's 888,000 this gives a year-4 cluster of roughly 50.5-58.7% of the 1,699,000 list, placing the 888,000 anchor at the conservative end."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — Lexus ES used listings (predecessor-generation curve)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/LEXUS/ES","note":"REAL dealer-retail listings for the gasoline predecessor, used as the same-model-line control against which the BEV powertrain penalty is measured (~11 points at year 5, ~13 at year 7). Low-mileage examples: 2023 ES200 23,088 km 1,198,000; 2023 ES200 33,947 km 1,179,000; 2023 ES200 48,227 km 1,168,000; 2020 ES200 41,020 km 958,000; 2019 ES200 68,614 km 938,000; 2019 ES200 73,280 km 896,000; 2016 ES200 51,000 km 688,000 (vs 2016 ES200 169,000 km 638,000). All are 車商售價 and were discounted before use. DISCLOSURE: carried forward from the prior pass and NOT re-fetched today; the SUM Lexus UX page WAS re-fetched and matched its prior reading exactly, which is the basis for trusting this one."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — Lexus RZ used listings (liquidity signal)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/LEXUS/RZ","note":"共 0 筆 — zero used Lexus RZ in the country. Evidence that used Lexus BEVs are thinly traded; supports the wider dealer-retail-to-private-sale spread and the reduced year-1 figure. Carried forward from the prior pass, not re-fetched today."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — UX price page","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/models/ux/price","note":"UX is now offered as 300h hybrid only at NT$149.9~171.9萬 and the UX300e BEV has been WITHDRAWN from the Taiwan lineup. Two uses: context for weak BEV residuals (Lexus TW no longer sells the only BEV it has residual history for), and evidence that the UX line's list prices sit near 1,500,000-1,720,000, which is why any single UX250h denominator is unreliable. Carried forward from the prior pass."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — official 8th-gen ES launch and price table","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/news_detail.aspx?nw=753","note":"PRIMARY price source: ES300h 豪華版 1,770,000 / ES300h 頂級版 1,970,000 / ES500e 頂級版 2,050,000 / ES500e 旗艦版 2,500,000, launch 2026-04-28. Confirms list_price 2,050,000. Carried forward from the prior pass and NOT re-opened today (WebSearch budget exhausted); corroborated sideways by the sibling records in this batch quoting the identical table."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — ES model price page","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/models/es/price","note":"ES line quoted as NT$177~250萬 with 500e / 300h powertrains; bracket endpoints match the official table exactly. Carried forward from the prior pass, not re-opened today."},{"name":"DuckDuckGo aggregated results — UX300e Taiwan pricing and battery-upgrade timing","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=Lexus+UX300e+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+169.9%E8%90%AC+189%E8%90%AC+%E5%A4%A7%E9%9B%BB%E6%B1%A0+2022+2023+%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82","note":"Establishes the denominator for the load-bearing year-5 anchor: UX300e launched at NT$1,699,000 and the larger 72.82 kWh battery version did not arrive until 2023 at NT$1,899,000, so the 2022 comparable is the 1,699,000 variant. Carried forward from the prior pass."},{"name":"DuckDuckGo aggregated results — ES500e launch incentives","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=Lexus+ES500e+%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82+%E8%B3%BC%E8%BB%8A%E7%A6%AE+%E5%85%85%E9%9B%BB+%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB+%E5%89%8D100%E4%BD%8D+%E5%84%AA%E6%83%A0","note":"Establishes the ACTUAL ES500e launch incentive: one year of unlimited-mileage free charging (ES無限暢充禮遇) for the FIRST 100 BUYERS only. No home charger, no free maintenance, no warranty extension. Carried forward from the prior pass."}]},"lexus-es500e-flagship":{"assumptions":"買家年行駛 6,000-8,000 km，遠低於台灣平均 12,000-15,000 km。各檢查點一律採 assumed_km = 7000 × years（7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000）。保養節奏由時間驅動而非里程驅動：官方電動車專區本次重新擷取確認節點為「每半年或 1 萬公里」，本案每年只跑 7,000 km，半年時鐘永遠先到，因此每年回廠 2 次、10 年約 20 次（https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/bev.aspx）。官方以里程觸發的加熱器冷卻液（首次 16 萬公里、之後每 8 萬公里）與動力控制單元冷卻液（首次 24 萬公里、之後每 8 萬公里）在 10 年 7 萬公里內都不會到期。低里程同時代表二手售價可高於「不看里程」的行情均值，因此殘值一律引用低里程掛牌並在 source 說明。稅金與保險依規格排除。\n\n本次覆核（第三輪）處理的是 cross-trim reviewer 對本筆與同車系 ES500e 頂級版（lexus-es500e-premium）之間階梯不一致的四項指摘，四項全部成立、全部已改：(1) 原 7 年 34% 高於頂級版 30%，違反「高階款保值率略低」且無理由 → 已下修至 25.8%；(2) 原曲線 5y→7y 只掉 7 點、7y→10y 掉 16 點，中段平、尾段崩 → 已重建為單調減速的斜率；(3) 原 1 年 62% 比頂級版低 7.7 個百分點，幅度過大 → 已收斂至 2.9 個百分點，且該幅度改為由實測配備級距差推得；(4) 原 10 年保養合計 328,000 反而「低於」頂級版的 341,000，與旗艦版多出的 21 吋胎與 AVS 矛盾 → 已重建為 389,000，並逐項標出多出來的錢是哪兩項。方法論上最重要的改動：本筆不再獨立猜一組數字，而是以同車系 ES500e 頂級版的曲線為基準，疊加一個「實測得到的配備級距差」，使兩筆記錄同形、僅差一個級距懲罰。","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"本次覆核上修（原 1,580,000 / 1,385,000）。Reviewer 指原值比同動力入門版（ES500e 頂級版，70.0%）低 7.7 個百分點、幅度偏大，像整組獨立猜測而非同一車系的階梯——此指摘成立。修正方式是把「級距懲罰」從猜測改成實測。\n\n級距懲罰的實測來源（本次覆核在 8891 https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/es 重新擷取，同年式、同動力、同為低里程的乾淨配對）：2025 年式 ES300h 旗艦版 3.0 萬與 3.1 萬公里，兩筆車商售價皆為 1,888,000；2025 年式 ES300h 豪華版 2.0 萬公里 1,588,000。分母採 2021-10 小改款表（旗艦版 2,390,000 / 豪華版 1,930,000）並套用已獨立驗證的牌價漂移 +3.2%（漂移證據見下段）→ 旗艦版 ≒ 2,467,000、豪華版 ≒ 1,992,000。得車商零售保值率：旗艦版 1,888,000/2,467,000 = 76.5%、豪華版 1,588,000/1,992,000 = 79.7%。**同年式同動力下，頂規比入門版低 3.2 個百分點**——這就是本車 1 年點該用的級距差，而不是原研究的 7.7 個百分點。\n\n牌價漂移 +3.2% 的獨立驗證（本次覆核在 SUM https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/LEXUS/ES 取得）：一筆 2022 年式 ES200 頂級版 62,000 公里掛牌 1,188,000，**該筆自行載明「新車價 1,950,000」**，對照 2021-10 價目表的 ES200 頂級版 1,890,000，實際牌價高出 3.2%。這是掛牌方自報的原廠售價，比前次覆核用車名字串推估更硬。\n\n本車數字的推導鏈（全部以車商零售 % of list 為共同基準，再走規格要求的價格鏈）：同車系 ES500e 頂級版該筆記錄的 1 年車商零售等值為 1,640,000 / 2,050,000 = 80.0%；扣 3.4 個百分點級距懲罰得旗艦版 76.6% × 2,500,000 = 1,915,000 車商零售 → 自售 −11%（8-15% 中段）= 1,700,000 → 車商收購再 −12.6%（10-15% 內）= 1,485,000。**1,700,000 是自售價，不是任何掛牌價。** 對 real_cost 的保值率 67.1%，比頂級版的 70.0% 低 2.9 個百分點，與實測的 3.2 個百分點級距差同量級。絕對金額 1,700,000 高於頂級版的 1,460,000（符合「高階款絕對售價較高、比率較低」）。7,000 公里遠低於上述 2-3 萬公里的掛牌樣本，低里程溢價已藉「取級距差下緣 3.4 而非更寬」保守處理。confidence low：ES500e 全台無任何中古在售（2026-04-28 上市），本點是模型值，唯一硬的部分是級距差。"},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"本次覆核上修（原 1,205,000 / 1,055,000），與 1 年點同一原因：級距懲罰改用實測值後全曲線平移。方法一致——同車系 ES500e 頂級版 3 年車商零售等值 1,250,000 / 2,050,000 = 60.8%，扣 4.0 個百分點級距懲罰得 56.8% × 2,500,000 = 1,420,000 車商零售 → 自售 −11% = 1,265,000 → 車商收購再 −13.4% = 1,095,000。級距懲罰在 3 年放大到 4.0 個百分點（1 年為 3.4），理由是旗艦版多出的 450,000 配備（Mark Levinson、大鋁圈、AVS、PVM、HUD）在中古市場的回收率隨車齡遞減，見下方「配備回收率」交叉檢查。\n\n本次覆核重新擷取的 3 年期實際掛牌（8891，2023 年式，全部為低里程）：ES250 F Sport 2.8 萬公里 1,398,000；SUM 上 2023 年式 ES200 三筆 23,088 / 33,947 / 48,227 公里分別為 1,198,000 / 1,179,000 / 1,168,000。以 ES250 F Sport 分母 2,080,000 × 1.032 ≒ 2,147,000 計，車商零售保值率 65.1%；ES200 以 1,710,000 × 1.032 ≒ 1,765,000 計約 66-68%。本車推得的 56.8% 明顯低於這些汽油／油電同齡車，差額即純電折價，方向正確。\n\n配備回收率交叉檢查（本次覆核新增的一致性測試，用來確保曲線不是硬湊的）：旗艦版比頂級版貴 450,000，本記錄各點自售價減去頂級版自售價，即為市場願意為那 450,000 配備回收的金額 —— 1 年 240,000（53%）、3 年 155,000（34%）、5 年 75,000（17%）、7 年 25,000（6%）、10 年 25,000（6%）。單調遞減至 6% 觸底，符合規格所述「旗艦套件的加價在中古市場大部分收不回來」，且永不為負（絕對售價恆高於頂級版）。confidence low：無任何 ES500e 中古成交，介於模型化的 1 年與 5 年 UX300e 實例之間。"},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"全曲線錨定最硬的一點，本次覆核下修（原 1,030,000 / 900,000）。台灣唯一可用的 Lexus 純電中古實例本次已重新擷取確認：SUM https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/LEXUS/UX 上一筆 **2022 Lexus UX300e、35,000 公里、車商售價 888,000**。這筆的里程與本檢查點的 assumed_km 完全相同（35,000），且年均 8,750 公里同屬低里程族群，是同國、同品牌、同純電動力下最接近的真實比較對象。UX300e 原始牌價 1,699,000（72.82 kWh 大電池版 2023 年才進台灣、售價 1,899,000，故 2022 年式必為 1,699,000 版本）→ 888,000 / 1,699,000 = **52.3% 車商零售保值率 @ 4 年**。\n\n同期油電對照（本次覆核同頁取得）：2022 UX250h 44,000 公里 839,000。此點顯示 4 年時純電與油電的保值率差距其實不大，因此本記錄不在 1-5 年段編列重手純電折價，重手折價集中在 7-10 年的電池保證懸崖（見該兩點）。\n\n本車數字推導：同車系 ES500e 頂級版 5 年車商零售等值 1,000,000 / 2,050,000 = 48.8%，扣 4.6 個百分點級距懲罰得 44.2% × 2,500,000 = 1,105,000 車商零售 → 自售 −11% = 985,000 → 車商收購再 −14.2% = 845,000。旁證：8891 上 2020 年式 ES300h 旗艦版 8 萬公里 1,188,000（6 年車，分母 2,390,000 → 49.7%），本車 5 年推得 44.2% 低於同齡油電旗艦版，方向正確。此期間仍受「準時定保 → 免費第 5 年 / 14 萬公里延長保證」覆蓋（官方原文本次已重新確認，見 maintenance），保固完整支撐售價。confidence medium：有一筆里程完全相同的真實純電掛牌，且分母獨立可考；扣分處在於仍需跨車型（UX→ES）與跨級距兩層外推。"},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"本次覆核**大幅下修**（原 850,000 / 745,000）。Reviewer 指原值 33.5% 高於同車系入門版 ES500e 頂級版的 30.2%，違反「高階款保值率略低」且未附反超理由——指摘成立，且本次重查未找到任何反超理由（旗艦版專屬的 Mark Levinson、AVS、21 吋鋁圈在台灣中古市場不但不加價，AVS 與大鋁圈反而因維修成本被殺價；本車 2026 年式產量亦非稀少，發表會即公布預接單近 1,000 張、年販目標 3,000 台）。因此改為下修至頂級版之下。\n\n7 年點的真實掛牌錨（8891 本次逐筆重新擷取，現行世代無 7 年車，改用前代第 7 代 ES 的真實行情推算保值率再套回本車，屬明示外推）：2019 年式 ES300h 旗艦版 8.94 萬公里 1,069,000、8.97 萬公里 1,069,000、10.9 萬公里 1,088,000、11 萬公里 1,039,000；分母 2,350,000（2018-10 上市價）→ 車商零售 44.2-46.3%。**級距對照改用分母已本次獨立驗證的一組**（https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/26460-167-200-lexus-es200-250.html 本次成功擷取並逐字確認 ES250 頂級版 1,990,000、旗艦版 2,190,000）：2018 年式 ES250 旗艦版 6.72 萬公里 939,000 → 42.9%；2018 年式 ES250 頂級版 5.21 萬公里 898,000（SUM）→ 45.1%。**同年式、同動力、旗艦版里程還高 15,000 公里的情況下，旗艦版仍比頂級版低 2.2 個百分點**，若拉到同里程差距更大。這是本記錄 7 年級距懲罰取 5.2 個百分點的實證基礎（取比 2.2 更寬，因為本車的級距價差 450,000 遠大於 ES250 兩級距的 200,000）。\n\n推導：ES500e 頂級版 7 年車商零售等值 715,000 / 2,050,000 = 34.9%，扣 5.2 個百分點得 29.7% × 2,500,000 = 742,500 車商零售 → 自售 −11.8% = 655,000 → 車商收購再 −15.3% = 555,000。對 real_cost 保值率 25.8%，**低於頂級版的 30.2%**，反超問題消除。5→7 年的斜率（−13.0 個百分點 / 2 年）刻意大於 3→5 年（−11.0 / 2 年），理由是第 8 年 / 16 萬公里的動力電池保證在本案以「年」到期（7,000 km/年永遠碰不到 16 萬公里上限），市場提前一到兩年把電池風險折進價格——這與同車系頂級版該筆的處理方式相同，兩筆記錄因此同形。誠實註記：以上皆為**車商掛牌價（asking）非成交價**，台灣無公開成交價資料庫；成交價一般再低於掛牌，本記錄已透過「掛牌 → 自售 −11.8% → 收購 −15.3%」的價格鏈把這段吃掉。confidence low：跨世代與跨動力兩層外推。"},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-11","source":"本次覆核下修（原 460,000 / 400,000），並修正前次覆核的兩處事實錯誤。**最有價值的發現**：8891 上確實存在一筆里程與車齡都幾乎正中本檢查點的真實掛牌——**2016 年式 ES300h 旗艦版、6 萬公里、車商售價 628,000**（本次重新擷取確認）。前次覆核把它記成「2015 年式、六筆」，兩點都錯：它是 2016 年式（2026 年正好 10 年車）、且是單筆，不是六筆。修正後這筆的價值反而更高，因為它是**同為 10 年車、同為旗艦版、同為低里程（60,000 vs 本案 70,000）**的直接對照。分母 2,270,000（2015-09 小改款 ES300h 旗艦版）→ **628,000 / 2,270,000 = 27.7% 車商零售保值率**。高里程對照：同年式 19 萬公里僅 485,000 = 21.4%，2015 年式 13 萬公里 618,000 = 27.2%，顯示低里程在此車齡仍有明顯溢價。\n\n10 年級距懲罰的實測（8891，同年式同動力，本次擷取）：2016 年式 ES200 頂級版 9 萬公里 658,000（分母 1,790,000）= 36.8%；2016 年式 ES200 旗艦版 8 萬公里 608,000（分母 1,990,000）= 30.6%。**旗艦版比頂級版低 6.2 個百分點，且里程還更低。** 這是全曲線最大的級距差，證實「配備溢價到 10 年幾乎完全歸零、甚至因維修顧慮轉為負值」。\n\n推導：ES500e 頂級版 10 年車商零售等值 455,000 / 2,050,000 = 22.2%，扣級距懲罰後取 19.2% × 2,500,000 = 480,000 車商零售 → 自售 −11.5% = 425,000 → 車商收購再 −15.3% = 360,000。對 real_cost 保值率 16.8%，低於頂級版的 19.2%；絕對金額 425,000 仍高於頂級版的 400,000（10 年時兩級距的絕對價幾乎收斂，與上述 ES200 實測配對一致，該配對的旗艦版絕對價甚至已略低於頂級版）。純電對油電的折價在此為 19.2/27.7 = 0.69 倍，與 7 年點的 0.65 倍同量級——刻意不讓折價在 7 年後繼續複利加深，因為純電懲罰在第 8 年電池保證到期時已一次反映完畢。\n\n斜率檢查（回應 reviewer 對「先寫好 10y 再回填中間」的質疑）：本曲線對 real_cost 的保值率為 67.1 → 49.9 → 38.9 → 25.8 → 16.8，年化跌幅 −8.6 / −5.5 / −6.5 / −3.0。尾段年化跌幅最小、無崩塌；5→7 的小幅加速有具名成因（電池保證懸崖）而非平滑誤差。與同車系 ES500e 頂級版（70.0 → 53.2 → 43.6 → 30.2 → 19.2）逐段比較，兩者形狀幾乎重合、僅差級距懲罰，這正是同一車系兩個級距該有的關係。confidence low：台灣不存在 10 年車齡的豪華純電房車二手市場，跨世代與跨動力兩層外推；下檔風險最大，若屆時電池需更換，實際可能遠低於此數。誠實註記：分母 2,270,000 與 1,790,000 / 1,990,000 來自 2015-09 U-CAR 價目表，**本次覆核 u-car.com.tw 全站回 403，該分母未能重新驗證**，屬沿用前次覆核結果。"}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"涵蓋 0-1 年。**本次覆核由 6,000 上修至 11,000，並與同車系 ES500e 頂級版完全對齊**——兩車同動力、同官方保養表，第 1 年沒有任何旗艦版專屬耗材到期（原廠胎在保、12V 電瓶在保），因此保養成本本來就應該相同；原記錄的 6,000 低於頂級版的 11,000 是不一致，而非旗艦版比較便宜。組成（全額自費，官方免費項目僅限交車後 1 個月的滿月保養，見 https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx）：6 個月 EV 定保工資約 2,000、12 個月定保含冷氣濾網與雨刷約 5,000、配平與四輪定位約 1,500、零星耗材約 2,500。節奏依官方「每半年或 1 萬公里」，7,000 km/年 → 年 2 次（https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/bev.aspx）。純電車第 1 年無機油、無機油濾芯、無火星塞、無空氣濾芯，金額本就極低。全期在 4 年 / 12 萬公里保證內，計畫外維修 0。依公開間隔表與台灣豪華品牌工資水準組建，非報價單或車主收據。"},{"y":3,"source":"涵蓋 1-3 年（非累計）。**本次覆核由 16,000 上修至 30,000，同樣與 ES500e 頂級版對齊**——理由同第 1 年：此區間仍無任何旗艦版專屬項目到期（21 吋原廠胎在保固內且未到 5-6 年老化門檻），兩車應該一致。組成：四次回廠工資約 14,000（兩次半年輕檢 + 兩次年度定保）、第 24 個月煞車油約 3,500（官方每 2 年或 4 萬公里，本案由時間觸發）、冷氣濾網 ×2 約 3,000、雨刷 ×2 約 2,400、定位與對調約 3,000、零星約 4,100。官方保養表中屬引擎的項目（火星塞、空氣濾芯、變速箱油、燃油濾清器）依規則排除，BEV 不適用。全期仍在 4 年 / 12 萬公里保證內，計畫外維修 0。兩種冷卻液依官方里程規則（16 萬 / 24 萬公里）遠未到期。金額為依項目量推估，非實際帳單。"},{"y":5,"source":"涵蓋 3-5 年。此區間的主成本是第一套輪胎，也是旗艦版與頂級版第一次分岔。組成：四次全額自費回廠約 15,000、21 吋胎四條含工與定位 48,000、12V AGM 電瓶 9,000、煞車油 3,500、冷氣濾網／雨刷／定位約 8,400、零星約 4,100。**輪胎價格為本次覆核實際查得的完工價**：235/45 R21 每條 10,550-12,664（Michelin Pilot Sport 5 Energy / Pilot Sport EV / PS4 SUV，https://biggo.com.tw/s/235%2F45R21/），四條 45,600 + 定位 2,500 ≒ 48,000；同一查價基礎下頂級版的 235/55 R19 四條完工價組合僅 29,031-30,600（https://biggo.com.tw/s/235%2F55R19/），加定位約 32,000 —— **旗艦版此次換胎多付 16,000，這是 reviewer 要求寫明的大輪圈成本理由。** 更換時點為時間驅動而非磨耗驅動：35,000 公里胎紋尚足，但 2,235 kg 四驅車的 5 年份橡膠已老化，且原廠輪胎保證僅 3 年（https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx）。12V 電瓶官方保證亦僅 3 年，台灣氣候下 3-5 年更換為常態。本區間仍受「準時定保 → 免費第 5 年 / 14 萬公里延長保證」覆蓋（官方原文本次已重新確認），故不編列保固外維修。輪胎與電瓶時點為判斷值。跨記錄註記：同車系 ES500e 頂級版該筆把 19 吋整組列 50,000，高於本次查得的 29,031-30,600 完工價；若兩筆改用同一查價基礎，兩者會一起下修，但 21 吋較 19 吋多 16,000 的差額不變。"},{"y":7,"source":"涵蓋 5-7 年。**本次覆核由 80,000 下修至 65,000。** 原 80,000 內含「前後碟盤與來令片整修 34,000」與「保固外預備 20,000」，兩者都提前且偏重：純電車靠動能回收，49,000 公里時來令片才第一次更換、碟盤尚不需整套換（碟盤鏽蝕整修移到 7-10 年，與頂級版該筆一致）；且免費延長保證覆蓋到第 5 年，第 6-7 年才是第一段無保固期間，兩年編 8,000 預備金較合理。組成：四次回廠約 15,000、前來令片 16,000、煞車油 3,500、HV 系統健檢 6,000（保固內含於定保、保固外開始計費，項目依 https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/bev.aspx 的電動車專屬檢查）、AVS 保固外診斷預備 3,000、濾網／雨刷／定位約 5,000、保固外零星預備 8,000、零星 8,500。與同車系 ES500e 頂級版（62,000）相差 3,000，差額全部來自 AVS —— 此區間輪胎未到期，兩車其餘項目相同。兩種冷卻液依官方里程規則仍未到期。金額為推估，無收據佐證。"},{"y":10,"source":"涵蓋 7-10 年，全期無任何原廠保證。**本次覆核由 150,000 上修至 195,000**，上修的 45,000 全部可指名：第二套 21 吋胎相對 19 吋多 17,000、AVS 相對一般避震整理多 30,000（另有 2,000 為六次回廠與零星項目的重新編列）。組成：六次回廠約 22,000、第二套 21 吋胎含工與定位 50,000（同 BigGo 完工價基礎，較第一套微增反映三年價格漂移；同基礎 19 吋約 33,000）、AVS 整修 55,000、全車碟盤與來令片 34,000、12V 電瓶 9,000、熱泵空調與冷媒 10,000、電池健康度檢測與保固外維修預備 15,000。**AVS 為旗艦版專屬**，本次已由官方新聞稿 https://www.lexus.com.tw/news_detail.aspx?nw=753 獨立確認頂級版無此配備；AVS 為電子控制阻尼單元，10 年車齡整修遠貴於一般避震器，故較頂級版該筆的 25,000 編至 55,000。冷卻液依官方里程規則（加熱器 16 萬公里、動力控制單元 24 萬公里）在 7 萬公里仍不到期，未編列。**重要範圍註記：本欄刻意不含動力電池更換。** 8 年 / 16 萬公里電池保證在本案以「年」到期（7,000 km/年碰不到里程上限），第 8-10 年電池衰退全由車主自負；74.69 kWh 電池組的更換費用是數十萬等級的災難性風險項目，不屬於保養科目，這是本模型最大的下檔風險，也是 10 年殘值 confidence 為 low 的同一個成因。全數為推估，無車主收據佐證。"}],"sources":[{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 官方新聞稿：全新世代 ES 上市（四車型正式售價表）","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/news_detail.aspx?nw=753","note":"本次覆核成功重新擷取。牌價一手來源，逐字確認：ES 300h 豪華版 1,770,000 / 頂級版 1,970,000、ES 500e 頂級版 2,050,000 / 旗艦版 2,500,000。同頁確認 **AVS 可變阻尼避震系統為旗艦版專屬**（頂級版無），這是保養段 7 年 +3,000 與 10 年 +30,000 的唯一依據，且不依賴本次無法存取的 U-CAR 規格表。"},{"name":"8891 中古車：Lexus ES 在售清單","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/es","note":"殘值主資料源，本次覆核重新擷取三頁共 308 筆在售車。本記錄使用且已逐筆核對的資料點：**級距差實測** 2025 旗艦版 1,888,000 @3.0/3.1 萬 km 對 2025 豪華版 1,588,000 @2.0 萬 km；2016 ES200 頂級版 658,000 @9 萬 km 對 2016 ES200 旗艦版 608,000 @8 萬 km。**7 年錨** 2019 ES300h 旗艦版 1,069,000 @8.94/8.97 萬 km、1,088,000 @10.9 萬 km、1,039,000 @11 萬 km；2018 ES250 旗艦版 939,000 @6.72 萬 km。**10 年錨** 2016 ES300h 旗艦版 628,000 @6 萬 km（低里程，最貼近本案 7 萬 km）、485,000 @19 萬 km。**修正前次覆核**：該筆 628,000 為 2016 年式單筆，前次記為「2015 年式、六筆」，年份與筆數皆誤。另 2020 ES300h 旗艦版 1,188,000 @8 萬 km 用於 5 年點旁證。"},{"name":"SUM 汽車網：Lexus ES 中古車搜尋","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/LEXUS/ES","note":"第二來源交叉驗證，本次覆核重新擷取。關鍵證據：一筆 2022 年式 ES200 頂級版 62,000 km 掛牌 1,188,000，**該筆自行載明「新車價 1,950,000」**，對照 2021-10 價目表的 ES200 頂級版 1,890,000，證實 Lexus TW 在 2021 之後牌價上漲約 +3.2%——這是掛牌方自報的原廠售價，用於修正 1 年與 3 年檢查點的原價分母。另提供 2018 ES250 頂級版 898,000 @52,058 km（用於 7-8 年級距對照）與 2023 ES200 低里程三筆 1,198,000 / 1,179,000 / 1,168,000（3 年點旁證）。"},{"name":"SUM 汽車網：Lexus UX 中古車搜尋（UX300e 純電錨點）","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/LEXUS/UX","note":"5 年檢查點的核心錨，本次覆核重新擷取確認：**2022 Lexus UX300e、35,000 公里、車商售價 888,000** —— 里程與本記錄 5 年點的 assumed_km 完全相同，是台灣唯一可用的 Lexus 純電中古實例。分母 1,699,000（72.82 kWh 大電池版 2023 年才引進、售價 1,899,000）→ 52.3% 車商零售保值率 @4 年。同頁油電對照 2022 UX250h 44,000 km 839,000，顯示 4 年時純電與油電差距不大，據此本記錄不在 1-5 年段編列重手純電折價。"},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 售後服務：電動車專區","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/bev.aspx","note":"純電保養規則與保證條件一手來源，本次覆核逐字重新確認：定保節點「每半年或 1 萬公里」；消耗品僅冷氣濾網、煞車油（每 2 年或 4 萬公里）、加熱器冷卻液（首次 16 萬公里、之後每 8 萬公里）、動力控制單元冷卻液（首次 24 萬公里、之後每 8 萬公里）；每次回廠以檢診設備檢測動力電池健康度；新車保證 3 年 / 10 萬公里原廠 + 1 年 / 2 萬公里總代理＝合計 4 年 / 12 萬公里；動力電池保證 8 年 / 16 萬公里且容量不低於 70%。"},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 售後服務：保證方案／延長保證","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx","note":"本次覆核重新確認：準時（每半年內）回廠定保者即享**第 5 年 / 14 萬公里之免費延長保證**，漏一次即喪失資格、僅能自費購買。本模型假設車主準時回廠，故保固實際覆蓋至第 5 年、第 6 年起才無保證——這決定了保固外預備金編在 5-7 年而非 3-5 年。同頁確認 12V 電瓶保證 3 年（第 1-2 年免費更換、第 2-3 年折半）、輪胎保證 3 年，用於 5 年點的電瓶與輪胎更換時點。"},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 售後服務：保養計劃（各階段保養項目）","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"本次覆核重新確認：唯一免費項目為新車登記後 1 個月的「滿月保養」（24 項檢查），該頁**未描述任何多年份免費或預付定期保養套餐**。這是 1 年與 3 年兩期改以全額自費計、並與 ES500e 頂級版對齊為 11,000 / 30,000 的依據。同頁的階段表含火星塞、變速箱油、燃油濾清器等引擎項目，依 BEV 規則排除。"},{"name":"BigGo 比價：235/45R21 輪胎（旗艦版原廠胎規格）","url":"https://biggo.com.tw/s/235%2F45R21/","note":"本次覆核重新擷取。旗艦版 21 吋胎的實際完工價：Michelin Pilot Sport 4 SUV MO 11,748、Pilot Sport EV 11,388、Pilot Sport 5 Energy 10,550-12,474（皆為單條完工價）。四條約 45,600、加定位約 48,000，是 3-5 年與 7-10 年兩個保養區間的主要成本。"},{"name":"BigGo 比價：235/55R19 輪胎（頂級版原廠胎規格，級距差對照）","url":"https://biggo.com.tw/s/235%2F55R19/","note":"**本次覆核新增**，用來把「大輪圈多花多少錢」量化，直接回應 reviewer 對保養差異的質疑。同一查價基礎下 19 吋四條完工價組合：Michelin Pilot Sport 5 Energy（電動車專用）29,031、Pilot Sport 4 SUV 29,419、Continental UX7 30,600、Michelin Latitude Tour HP 30,194。加定位約 32,000，**較 21 吋便宜 16,000/組**，10 年兩套共 34,000——這是本記錄保養高於 ES500e 頂級版的兩個成因之一。"},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事：167萬起四車型，Lexus ES200/250 第七代大改款上市","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/26460-167-200-lexus-es200-250.html","note":"本次覆核成功重新擷取並逐字確認第 7 代汽油車型原價：ES200 豪華版 1,670,000 / 頂級版 1,850,000、ES250 頂級版 1,990,000 / 旗艦版 2,190,000。**這是 7 年點級距對照唯一分母已本次獨立驗證的一組**：2018 ES250 旗艦版 939,000 @6.72 萬 km = 42.9% 對 2018 ES250 頂級版 898,000 @5.21 萬 km = 45.1%，同年式同動力下旗艦版低 2.2 個百分點（且里程更高），證實級距懲罰方向。"},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan 車款頁：ES 售價區間","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/models/es/price","note":"本次覆核擷取，顯示 ES「NT$177~250萬，500e / 300h」，區間上緣與旗艦版 2,500,000 相符，為牌價的第二個官方確認點。該頁不含分級距規格明細（無輪圈尺寸、無 AVS 標示）。"},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞：正式售價189萬起，Lexus 新一代 ES 300h 國內發表（2018-10-02）","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/43743","note":"第 7 代 ES300h 原價（豪華版 1,890,000 / 尊榮版 2,130,000 / 旗艦版 2,350,000），用於 7 年檢查點 2019 年式 ES300h 旗艦版的分母。**誠實註記：本次覆核 u-car.com.tw 全站回 403，此分母未能重新驗證，屬沿用前次覆核結果。** 為降低對它的依賴，7 年點的級距對照已改用分母本次已獨立驗證的 ES250 配對（見 CarStuff 來源）。"},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞：新車售價169萬起、7款車型設定，Lexus 小改款 ES 車系國內正式發表（2015-09-08）","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/27297","note":"第 6 代小改款原價（ES200 豪華版 1,690,000 / 頂級版 1,790,000 / 頂級Navi版 1,890,000 / 旗艦版 1,990,000；ES300h 豪華版 1,930,000 / 頂級Navi版 2,190,000 / 旗艦版 2,270,000），用於 10 年檢查點的分母與級距差計算。**誠實註記：本次覆核 u-car.com.tw 回 403，未能重新驗證，屬沿用前次覆核結果。**"},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞：正式售價171萬起、車型配備提升，Lexus 小改款 ES 車系國內發表（2021-10）","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/68147","note":"第 7 代小改款價格表（ES200 豪華版 1,710,000 / 頂級版 1,890,000、ES250 F Sport 2,080,000、ES300h 豪華版 1,930,000 / 尊榮版 2,170,000 / 旗艦版 2,390,000），用於 1、3、5 年檢查點的分母基準（再套 +3.2% 牌價漂移）。**誠實註記：本次覆核 u-car.com.tw 回 403，未能重新驗證，屬沿用前次覆核結果**；但其中 ES200 頂級版 1,890,000 已由 SUM 掛牌自報的「新車價 1,950,000」間接佐證漂移幅度。"},{"name":"U-CAR 新車規格：Lexus ES Electric 規格表","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/lexus/es%20electric/7179/spec","note":"前次覆核由此取得旗艦版 235/45 R21、頂級版 235/55 R19、車重 2,235 kg、電池總容量 74.69 kWh。**誠實註記：本次覆核此頁回 403，輪胎尺寸未能重新驗證，屬沿用。** 若旗艦版實際非 21 吋，保養段的輪胎差額 34,000 需重算；AVS 的 33,000 不受影響（已由官方新聞稿獨立確認）。"},{"name":"KingAutos 國王車訊：Lexus 延長保固方案售價與資格","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/353009","note":"自費延長保固（4 年 12 萬公里延至 5 年 14 萬公里）建議售價 40,600。**本次覆核未重新擷取，屬沿用**；但同一制度的存在與免費取得條件已由官方 https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx 本次逐字確認，本記錄的保固覆蓋期判定不依賴此來源。"},{"name":"8891 中古車：Lexus RZ 在售清單（純電流動性證據）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/rz","note":"純電折價的流動性證據：全台僅 2 筆 Lexus RZ 在售且皆標「電洽」不公開價，台灣沒有任何 Lexus 純電車的公開中古掛牌價。**本次覆核未重新擷取，屬沿用前次結果**；同車系 ES500e 頂級版該筆記錄在 SUM 上獨立驗證 RZ 為 0 筆，方向一致。這是純電折價係數只能以判斷值處理、5-10 年 confidence 壓低的原因。"},{"name":"8891 中古車：M-Benz EQE 在售清單（豪華純電房車旁證）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqe","note":"同齡豪華純電房車的方向性旁證：2023 年份 EQE 300 3.2 萬公里車商售價 1,500,000、7.5 萬公里 1,590,000；2022 年份 EQE V295 4.05 萬公里 1,556,000，車商零售落在原價 5 成多，與本記錄 3 年點推得的水位同量級。**本次覆核未重新擷取，屬沿用前次結果**，且僅作方向性參考、不用於校準係數。"}]},"toyota-rav4-hybrid":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, far below the TW average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year. Midpoint 7,000 km/year used at every checkpoint (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km). Two consequences drive this record. (1) Servicing is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven: verified on Toyota TW's own owner page, T30 is 'every 6 months or 10,000 km', T50 'every odd year or every 40,000 km starting at 20,000 km', T60 'every even year or every 40,000 km starting at 40,000 km'. At 7,000 km/year the calendar clock binds at essentially every visit, so the owner still makes 2 dealer visits per year. CORRECTION vs the prior draft, which claimed the mileage triggers are 'never reached': the T50 ladder starts at 20,000 km and repeats at 60,000 km, both of which this owner DOES pass (year 3 and ~year 8.5). It changes nothing about the visit count, because the odd-year clock lands first or at the same time, but the earlier statement was factually wrong and is corrected here. Consumables that age out rather than wear out (tires, 12V battery, brake fluid, coolant) dominate; wear items (pads, discs) are pushed far out, helped further by hybrid regenerative braking. (2) At every age this car carries roughly half the mileage of the average listing, so it should transact above the mileage-blind market average; low-mileage comparables were selected deliberately and named in each source string. Not a BEV, so no home-charger cost applies and no BEV-specific treatment (price cuts, battery-health discounting, faster tire wear) is relevant. Tax (牌照稅/燃料稅) and insurance are excluded by design, as are fuel and parking.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"SUM 汽車網 RAV4 油電 listings, INDEPENDENTLY RE-FETCHED by this fact-check on 2026-08-12 (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=4&brand=TOYOTA&model=RAV4&q=油電); all 23 listings the prior draft cited were found verbatim on the live page, so no fabrication. Low-mileage near-new comparables: 2025 @12,884 km asking NT$1,059,000; 2026 @9,778 km asking NT$1,198,000. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN (the dealer-retail trap, handled explicitly): both are 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asks) on the outgoing XA50 旗艦, whose list was ~NT$1,260,000-1,300,000, so ~81-84% of list at dealer retail at 1 year with low mileage. Applied 83% to this car's NT$1,170,000 list = ~NT$971,000 dealer retail equivalent; then -10% to reach 自售價 (private sale) = NT$870,000; then a further -13% to reach 車商收購價 (dealer trade-in) = NT$760,000. Verified by the fact-check as a genuine private-sale figure, not a copied dealer ask. Only 7,000 km supports the top of the range, and the launch-period order backlog on the new generation props up year-1 values because buyers pay to skip the wait."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"SUM 汽車網 listings re-fetched 2026-08-12 (same URL). Comparables confirmed present on the live page: 2024 @38,525 km asking NT$938,000 (2 yr); 2023 @34,906 km asking NT$919,000 (3 yr, 4WD 特仕). ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: these are dealer RETAIL asks. Against XA50 旗艦 list of ~NT$1,260,000-1,330,000 they imply ~69-74% of list, interpolating to ~70% at 3 years; our car's 21,000 km is well under these comparables' ~35,000 km, so +1-2 pts gives 72%. 0.72 x NT$1,170,000 = ~NT$842,000 dealer retail equivalent; -12% for private sale = NT$740,000; -13% again for dealer trade-in = NT$645,000. FACT-CHECK NOTE: 72% sits at the OPTIMISTIC end of the 69-74% band the real listings support; it is retained rather than trimmed because the mileage advantage is genuine and large, but a reader should treat this checkpoint as the top of a range, not a midpoint. Still inside the 4-year vehicle warranty here, which supports the price."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN by this fact-check (was NT$670,000 / NT$585,000). SUM 汽車網 listings re-fetched 2026-08-12 (same URL). Verified comparables: 2021 @38,000 km asking NT$750,000 (the closest low-mileage match, and closest on mileage to our 35,000 km); 2022 @16,649 km asking NT$799,000 (4 yr, the single lowest-mileage older car in the pool). ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: these are dealer RETAIL asks. Against the XA50 旗艦 list of NT$1,200,000 — a figure CONFIRMED from a real 2022 PTT deal sheet re-read during this fact-check — the 2021 @38,000 km implies 62.5% of list at 5 years and the 2022 @16,649 km implies 66.6% at 4 years. The prior draft applied 65% at 5 years, which is above what its own cited comparable supports; corrected to 63%. 0.63 x NT$1,170,000 = ~NT$737,000 dealer retail equivalent; -11% private sale = NT$655,000; -13% dealer trade-in = NT$570,000. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED to low: the SUM result table exposes only year/mileage/price, so the TRIM of the 2021 @38,000 km car could not be confirmed. If it is a 旗艦 (list 1,200,000) the ratio is 62.5% as used; if it is a lower 尊爵-class grade (list ~1,100,000) the ratio would be ~68% and this checkpoint would be roughly NT$50,000 too low. The adjustment is deliberately modest because that ambiguity cuts both ways."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the PREDECESSOR generation — the current generation only went on sale in Taiwan in mid-2026, so no genuine 7-year data for it can exist, and none is invented here. Real XA50 RAV4 Hybrid listings re-verified on the live SUM page 2026-08-12: 2019 @71,269 km asking NT$660,000; 2019 @128,461 km asking NT$688,000; 2019 @131,971 km asking NT$628,000 (a 2019 @126,509 km at NT$868,000 discarded as an outlier). FACT-CHECK NOTE: the prior draft also cited a '2019 @50,879 km asking NT$698,000' which does NOT appear on the 油電 query page; it presumably came from the separate HYBRID query and could not be re-verified here, so this checkpoint now rests on the 2019 @71,269 km at NT$660,000, which IS verified. Smoothing to a lower-mileage 7-year example (ours has 49,000 km) gives ~NT$685,000 dealer RETAIL. Expressed as a retention ratio of that car's original list (~NT$1,180,000 for the 2019 XA50 Hybrid 旗艦, itself INFERRED by interpolating the confirmed 2022 figure of NT$1,200,000 backwards) that is ~58%. Applying it to this car's list gives ~NT$682,000 dealer retail equivalent; -12% private sale = NT$600,000; -13% dealer trade-in = NT$520,000. Confidence LOW: cross-generation extrapolation resting on an inferred historical list price. Note the 5-to-7-year stretch is deliberately flat, which the real data supports — TW used prices plateau in the 5-8 year band before falling away near 10 years."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN by this fact-check (was NT$425,000 / NT$365,000). EXTRAPOLATED from the generation BEFORE last (XA40 RAV4 HYBRID 尊爵版 — usefully the identical trim name). Real listings re-verified on the live SUM pages 2026-08-12: 2016 @90,155 km asking NT$439,000 (10 yr); 2016 @190,533 km asking NT$368,000; 2017 @52,727 km asking NT$478,000 (9 yr, low mileage); 2017 @95,000 km asking NT$488,000; 2017 @121,420 km asking NT$438,000; 2017 @127,096 km asking NT$448,000. A 10-year car at 70,000 km sits between the verified 2016 @90,155 km (NT$439,000) and the 2017 @52,727 km (NT$478,000), i.e. ~NT$455,000-470,000 dealer RETAIL in today's money. The prior draft's ratio route (41% of an ASSUMED ~NT$1,100,000 XA40 list, applied to NT$1,170,000) produced NT$480,000 dealer retail equivalent, which is 3-5% above what the direct comparables support; the two methods are split here at ~NT$470,000. -11.5% private sale = NT$415,000; -13% dealer trade-in = NT$360,000. Confidence LOW: two-generation extrapolation, and the XA40 Hybrid 尊爵 list price could NOT be verified from any primary source (no web-search budget remained; U-CAR and 8891 were unreachable in the prior pass). Two offsetting effects were considered and left to cancel: modern hybrids should hold up better than XA40-era ones (hybrid-battery fear has faded and the battery is warranted 8 years/160,000 km), but this car's higher list price depreciates proportionally harder in Taiwan."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"REVISED UP by this fact-check (was NT$4,000). Interval structure from the official Toyota TW maintenance table (https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx), re-verified 2026-08-12. The prior draft counted only ONE paid T30 in year 1, which contradicts its own plan_notes and its own year-3 figure: it asserts 2 paid dealer visits every year and then bills the 1-3y window at NT$24,000 for 4 visits (NT$12,000/yr), while billing year 1 at NT$4,000. On the official time-driven schedule year 1 contains a free 1,000 km check, a T30 at 6 months (~NT$3,000) and a T50 at 12 months (~NT$6,000), plus ~NT$1,000 of consumables = ~NT$10,000. Time-driven — at 7,000 km the 10,000 km trigger is not reached. Fully inside the 4-year vehicle warranty, so zero repair risk. Prices estimated at typical 和泰 dealer rates; Toyota TW does not publish them."},{"y":3,"source":"Official interval table, re-verified 2026-08-12; unchanged by the fact-check. 2 visits/year x 2 years = 4 visits = NT$3,000 + NT$13,000 (year 2, T30 + T60) + NT$3,000 + NT$6,000 (year 3, T30 + T50) less overlap = ~NT$22,000, plus ~NT$2,000 sundries. Prices estimated at typical 和泰 dealer rates (Toyota TW does not publish them). Entire window inside the 4-year vehicle warranty, so no repair allowance is included. No tires or brakes yet — 21,000 km is far too low for wear and the tires are not yet old enough to age out. Note this window does pass the T50 20,000 km marker, but the odd-year clock lands at the same visit so it adds no cost."},{"y":5,"source":"Official interval table for the servicing, re-verified 2026-08-12; unchanged by the fact-check. Consumables timed by AGE not mileage, which is the defining feature of this low-mileage profile. Tires: a 17-inch RAV4 fitment in TW runs ~NT$18,000-24,000 for a mid-range set of four; NT$22,000 assumed — a 5-year-old tire is replaced on age regardless of tread depth. Hybrid 12V auxiliary battery typically lasts 4-6 years, ~NT$5,000-8,000. The 4-year vehicle warranty expires inside this window and the 5-year hybrid-system warranty expires at its end, so a small residual risk sits here; no explicit contingency was added because the exposure is only a few months. Prices estimated, not from receipts."},{"y":7,"source":"REVISED UP by this fact-check (was NT$42,000). The prior draft's figure BROKE MONOTONICITY — it billed the 5-7 year window (NT$42,000) BELOW the 3-5 year window (NT$50,000), even though 5-7 is the first window sitting fully OUTSIDE the 4-year vehicle warranty and, from year 5, outside the 5-year HYBRID system warranty. An out-of-warranty window costing less than an in-warranty one is not credible. The contingency is raised from NT$13,000 to NT$20,000, which is where a 6-7 year old TW SUV realistically lands once 避震器 (~NT$16,000-20,000 for four corners) enter the picture, and NT$4,000 of ordinary sundries is made explicit. Servicing base from the official interval table, re-verified 2026-08-12. The allowance is still kept moderate because RAV4 hybrids are mechanically durable, the car has only 49,000 km, and the traction battery is still covered to year 8. Brake pads at ~49,000 km are late by combustion standards; hybrid regen genuinely defers them. Prices estimated at typical dealer rates, not from receipts."},{"y":10,"source":"Adjusted slightly by this fact-check (was NT$105,000) so the servicing base matches the corrected two-visits-per-year structure: years 8, 9 and 10 cost ~NT$13,000 + NT$9,000 + NT$13,000 = NT$35,000, not NT$33,000. Official interval table re-verified 2026-08-12, plus an ageing-vehicle allowance. Longest window (3 years) so the servicing base is larger. The HYBRID traction battery is warranted 8 years/160,000 km and this owner reaches only 70,000 km, so it is covered through year 8 and NO battery replacement is budgeted — but years 8-10 are uncovered, and a traction-battery failure would be a NT$150,000-250,000 event, which is the single largest tail risk in this record and is deliberately NOT averaged into the number. The NT$27,000 contingency covers ordinary out-of-warranty ageing only. Prices estimated at typical dealer rates, not from receipts. Confidence low."}],"sources":[{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — RAV4 official spec & price page","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/RAV4/spec.aspx","note":"PRIMARY, and INDEPENDENTLY RE-FETCHED TWICE during this fact-check on 2026-08-12 (once for prices, once for grade-level drivetrain and wheel detail). Confirms HYBRID 尊爵 NT$1,170,000 — the scout and the prior fact-checker were both correct, 0% deviation. Full hybrid lineup 豪華 1,040,000 / 尊爵 1,170,000 / 尊爵+ 1,220,000 / 旗艦 1,300,000, PHEV 1,490,000. Also confirms 尊爵 = 前輪傳動 + Auto LSD, 2,487 c.c., 17吋五幅式鋁圈 (vs 18-inch on 尊爵+/旗艦 and 20-inch E-Four on PHEV), the page date of 2026/06/15 applying to cars produced from June 2026 onward, and the warranty terms: vehicle 4yr/120,000 km, HYBRID system 5yr/120,000 km, HYBRID battery 8yr/160,000 km for 2019 model year and newer."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — RAV4 showroom landing page","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/RAV4/","note":"Establishes that this is an all-new generation on sale in Taiwan only ~2 months as of 2026-08-12, corroborated by the spec page's own 2026/06/15 date and 'produced from June 2026 onward' note. This is the key fact behind the low discount and the total absence of a current-generation used market."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — 愛車養護與保證 (official scheduled maintenance)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx","note":"PRIMARY, RE-FETCHED during this fact-check 2026-08-12. Source for maintenance intervals: T30 every 6 months or 10,000 km; T50 every odd year or every 40,000 km STARTING AT 20,000 km; T60 every even year or every 40,000 km STARTING AT 40,000 km. Item allocation confirmed: T50 carries air filter, spark plugs, brake fluid and coolant; T60 carries fuel filter and engine coolant. Both details correct errors in the prior draft. The page explicitly does NOT publish prices, directing owners to service centres — hence every money figure in maintenance is an estimate."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — 車主權益 / warranty page","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_warranty.aspx","note":"Checked for warranty detail in the prior pass; published only a generic parts-and-labour note and did not carry the hybrid battery terms. The authoritative warranty figures used in this record come from the spec page instead, which was re-verified here."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — used RAV4 油電 (hybrid) listings","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=4&brand=TOYOTA&model=RAV4&q=%E6%B2%B9%E9%9B%BB","note":"MAIN depreciation source, INDEPENDENTLY RE-FETCHED during this fact-check on 2026-08-12. All 23 listings the prior draft cited were found verbatim on the live page — no invented listings. Verified anchors used here: 2026 @9,778 km NT$1,198,000; 2025 @12,884 km NT$1,059,000; 2024 @38,525 km NT$938,000; 2023 @34,906 km NT$919,000; 2022 @16,649 km NT$799,000; 2021 @38,000 km NT$750,000; 2020 @64,365 km NT$768,000; 2019 @71,269 km NT$660,000; 2017 @52,727 km NT$478,000; 2016 @90,155 km NT$439,000. All are 車商售價 (dealer retail asks) and were adjusted down to private-sale and trade-in levels. The result table exposes only year/mileage/price, NOT trim — which is the main residual uncertainty in the 5-year checkpoint."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — used RAV4 尊爵 listings","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=4&brand=TOYOTA&model=RAV4&q=%E5%B0%8A%E7%88%B5","note":"Source for the 10-year extrapolation: XA40-generation 油電尊爵版 cars, the identical trim name two generations back. Cited by the prior draft; the overlapping listings (2016 @90,155 km NT$439,000; 2016 @190,533 km NT$368,000; 2017 @52,727 km NT$478,000; 2017 @121,420 km NT$438,000) all reappear on the 油電 query page that this fact-check re-fetched directly, so the data is corroborated even though this specific query was not re-run."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — used RAV4 HYBRID listings","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=4&brand=TOYOTA&model=RAV4&q=HYBRID","note":"Second hybrid query used by the prior draft as a cross-check. NOT re-verified by this fact-check. One comparable it supplied — a 2019 @50,879 km at NT$698,000 — does not appear on the 油電 query page, so the 7-year checkpoint was re-grounded on the 2019 @71,269 km at NT$660,000, which is verified."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — all used RAV4 listings","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TOYOTA/RAV4?v=4","note":"Broader listing pool (mostly 2.0 gasoline XA50). Used only as a sanity check on the overall RAV4 depreciation shape and on how strongly the TW market prices mileage; not used directly for the hybrid numbers."},{"name":"PTT car board — 2022 RAV4 HYBRID 2.5 旗艦 菜單 (real deal sheet)","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1651408506.A.72C.html","note":"INDEPENDENTLY RE-OPENED during this fact-check 2026-08-12 and confirmed genuine: 2022 RAV4 HYBRID 2.5 旗艦 (月岩綠), 空車價 NT$1,200,000, final NT$1,155,000 including NT$5,000 of accessories, i.e. ~NT$50,000 off. Doubly load-bearing: it is the early-cycle discount datapoint justifying the NT$20,000 discount on a launch-quarter new generation, AND it is the only CONFIRMED XA50 旗艦 list price (NT$1,200,000), which anchors the 5-year and 7-year retention ratios."},{"name":"PTT car board — 2024 RAV4 HYBRID 旗艦 菜單 (real deal sheet)","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1718875518.A.4FF.html","note":"Cited by the prior draft: list NT$1,260,000, discount NT$160,000, final NT$1,160,000. Establishes the previous generation's late-cycle list price and Toyota TW's discount ceiling at run-out. Not re-opened by this fact-check (the 2022 sheet was re-opened instead, as it carries more weight); treated as secondary."},{"name":"PTT car board — 2020年式 RAV4 2.0 旗艦 菜單 (real deal sheet)","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1574145059.A.55D.html","note":"Cited by the prior draft: list NT$1,206,000, final NT$1,066,000 (NT$140,000 off), 領牌 NT$4,000. Source for the 領牌/代辦 component of onroad_fees. Not re-opened by this fact-check; treated as secondary."},{"name":"PTT car board — 2021 RAV4 2.0 汽油旗艦 菜單 (real deal sheet)","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1626281812.A.22A.html","note":"Cited by the prior draft: list NT$1,090,000, discount NT$110,000, plus NT$24,000 of self-paid accessories. Cross-check on the discount range and on the typical size of the TW accessory pack folded into onroad_fees. Not re-opened by this fact-check; treated as secondary."}]},"toyota-rav4-phev":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year; all checkpoints use 7,000 km/year (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km). That is roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year, so every used-value figure here is taken from LOW-MILEAGE comparables rather than the mileage-blind average, and each source string says so. Toyota Taiwan's service interval is 'every 6 months or 10,000 km, whichever comes first' (verified on the Toyota TW Guidebook), so at 7,000 km/year this owner is entirely TIME-driven: 2 paid services per year regardless of distance. Low mileage therefore lifts resale value but does NOT reduce scheduled maintenance cost. PHEV-specific: with 135 km of EV range against roughly 19 km/day of driving, the engine accumulates very few hours, yet oil changes stay calendar-driven. HOME CHARGER EXCLUDED: a Taiwan home AC charger install runs roughly NT$20,000-40,000 and in an apartment needs 管委會 approval, which is often refused. That is a real ownership cost but it is not maintenance, so it is deliberately absent from maintenance.checkpoints. Note this cuts both ways on resale: unlike a BEV, a used RAV4 PHEV runs perfectly well on petrol alone, so a buyer without charger access loses the running-cost benefit but not the use of the car. Tax (牌照稅/燃料稅) and insurance are excluded by design throughout.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - no RAV4 PHEV and no 6th-gen RAV4 exists in the Taiwan used pool (SUM 汽車網, 235 RAV4 listings across 3 pages read, zero PHEV, zero 6th-gen). CORRECTED DOWNWARD from a prior estimate of 1,240,000. Best available anchor is a RAV4 HYBRID rather than the gasoline 2.0 used previously: SUM lists a 2025 RAV4 油電旗艦特仕版, 12,884 km, dealer asking NT$1,059,000 against a 1,300,000 Hybrid Flagship list = 81.5% dealer-RETAIL retention at about 1 year, low mileage. Applying the dealer-retail to private markdown of ~10% gives ~73.5% private for the hybrid. I hold the PHEV at the same ~73.5% of its own list: the allocation-limited launch premium and RAV4 brand strength (Taiwan's best-selling SUV, real waiting lists) offset the immediate erosion of the 190,000 PHEV premium over the Hybrid Flagship. 1,490,000 x 73.5% = 1,095,000. Dealer trade-in a further 12.8% below = 955,000. The prior 1,240,000 (83% of list) was rejected because it implied the PHEV out-retains the cheaper plain RAV4 Hybrid, which no Taiwan evidence supports."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from low-mileage RAV4 HYBRID comps on SUM 汽車網: a 2023 RAV4 油電旗艦 4WD 特仕版, 34,906 km, dealer asking NT$919,000, and a 2024 RAV4 旗艦, 20,896 km, dealer asking NT$959,000. Against a ~1,300,000 Hybrid Flagship list these are ~70.7% dealer-RETAIL at 3 years and ~73.8% at 2 years. Applying the ~10% dealer-retail to private markdown gives ~63.6% private at 3 years for the hybrid. I deduct ~3.5 points for the PHEV, reflecting erosion of the 190,000 plug-in premium among buyers who cannot install a charger, giving ~60.4% -> 1,490,000 x 60.4% = 900,000. Dealer trade-in 12.8% below = 785,000. Still inside both warranties (HV system 5 years / 120,000 km, drive battery 8 years / 160,000 km), which supports the price. CORRECTED DOWNWARD from 1,000,000."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from XA50 low-mileage comps on SUM 汽車網: a 2021 RAV4 2500cc hybrid, 77,957 km, dealer asking NT$768,000, and a 2021 gasoline trim, 29,736 km, asking NT$719,000. Against a ~1,210,000 XA50 hybrid list the 2021 hybrid is ~63.5% dealer retail at 5 years but at 2.2x this buyer's mileage; adding a low-mileage premium of roughly 8% lifts it to ~68% dealer retail, and the ~10% private markdown gives ~61% private for a low-mileage hybrid. I deduct ~9 points for the PHEV to ~51.7% -> 1,490,000 x 51.7% = 770,000. Dealer trade-in 13.0% below = 670,000. The PHEV deduction widens here because the HV system warranty (5 years / 120,000 km) expires on TIME at exactly this checkpoint for a low-mileage owner, while the drive-battery warranty still has 3 years to run; buyers price that split. CORRECTED DOWNWARD from 830,000."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED via PREDECESSOR-GENERATION RATIO - no 7-year data can exist for a generation launched in 2026. Predecessor = XA40 RAV4 (Taiwan 2013-2018). Real SUM listings: 2018 with 98,677 km asking NT$498,000 and 2018 with 103,893 km asking NT$518,000, against a ~889,000 original list = ~56% dealer-RETAIL retention at 8 years, but at roughly double this buyer's 49,000 km. Adding a ~12% low-mileage premium and interpolating back to 7 years gives ~65% dealer retail; the ~10% private markdown gives ~58% of that car's original list. Applied to THIS car's list of 1,490,000 that implies ~865,000 on a petrol-equivalent basis. I then apply a 26% PHEV and price-band deduction -> 640,000 (43.0% of list). The deduction covers three things: the HV system warranty expired at year 5, the drive battery warranty is in its final year, and a 1,490,000 car converges toward the same absolute used-price band as cheaper rivals at this age. This replaces a prior 20% penalty applied on top of an already-optimistic base; the net effect is a modest downward correction from 700,000. Explicitly extrapolated, not observed."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED via PREDECESSOR-GENERATION RATIO. Best real anchor on SUM 汽車網: a 2015 XA40 RAV4, 78,000 km, dealer asking NT$358,000 - an unusually close mileage match, since this buyer reaches 70,000 km at year 10 and that car is 11 years old with 78,000 km. Against a ~849,000 original list that is ~42% dealer-RETAIL retention; interpolating back to 10 years gives ~46% dealer retail, and the ~10% private markdown gives ~41% of that car's original list, i.e. about 322,000 in absolute private-sale money. Applying the 41% ratio to this car's list of 1,490,000 gives ~611,000 on a petrol-equivalent basis; I then deduct 28% for the PHEV and price-band effects -> 440,000 (29.5% of list). Cross-check on absolute money: 440,000 is about 37% above the XA40 comp's implied private price, which is the right order for a much newer-generation, better-equipped AWD car. The deduction reflects the 8-year / 160,000 km drive-battery warranty having expired two years earlier and a 22.7 kWh pack costing far more to replace than a conventional hybrid pack. I deliberately did NOT use the prior 30% penalty stacked on an optimistic base; the corrected figure is slightly ABOVE the prior 430,000 because the base was rebuilt on hybrid rather than gasoline comps. Explicitly extrapolated, not observed."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Toyota TW Guidebook (https://www.toyota.com.tw/Guidebook/) - I re-verified this page directly and it confirms the 6-month / 10,000 km interval, the free 滿月檢查, the 首半年定保工資免費 labour waiver, and the 1 year / 20,000 km genuine-parts warranty. Cost built from that official interval structure plus typical Taiwan Toyota dealer pricing for a 2.5L hybrid on 0W-16 synthetic (about NT$3,000 for a minor service, NT$5,000 for a major one); the free first-service labour is what holds year 1 down to about 7,000. Toyota Taiwan publishes no per-item price list, so the money figure is inferred, not sourced."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers years 1-3 = 4 time-driven services at the official 6-month interval (Toyota TW Guidebook, verified), with no free labour remaining. Brake fluid is hygroscopic and replaced on a roughly 2-year schedule irrespective of mileage. All items remain inside the 5 year / 120,000 km HV system warranty and the 1 year / 20,000 km parts warranty, so no repair provision is included. Money figures are typical Taiwan dealer pricing, not receipts."},{"y":5,"source":"Years 3-5, dominated by two age-driven consumables unrelated to mileage. The original tyres reach 5 years old and are replaced on age with plenty of tread left (235/55R19, about NT$7,000 each fitted), and the 12V auxiliary battery typically fails at 4-5 years. The 12V is a genuine PHEV weak point: it is not the traction battery, it is a conventional small battery that boots the system, it is NOT covered by the 8-year traction-battery warranty, and it strands the car when it dies. Brake pads are deliberately excluded here because regenerative braking means 35,000 km of PHEV driving barely touches the friction material. Typical Taiwan dealer and tyre-shop pricing, not receipts."},{"y":7,"source":"Years 5-7, the first window carrying genuine out-of-warranty exposure. The HYBRID system warranty (5 years / 120,000 km, verified on the official Toyota TW RAV4 showroom page) expires on TIME at year 5 for this low-mileage owner; the 120,000 km limb is irrelevant at 49,000 km. From here, inverter water pump, DC-DC converter and HV sensor faults are billed to the owner, so a roughly 10,000 risk provision is included. The drive battery itself remains covered to year 8. Front pads appear here rather than earlier, on time and heat-cycling rather than wear. Extrapolated risk provisioning, not an observed repair cost, hence low confidence."},{"y":10,"source":"Years 7-10, the longest window at 3 years and by far the most expensive. Three things stack: (1) a SECOND full tyre set on age at about year 10, since the year-5 set also times out long before 70,000 km wears it; (2) Toyota's roughly 10-year service items landing together - coolant on BOTH the engine and the inverter loop, since a PHEV has two cooling circuits, which is why this line is larger than on a combustion car, plus spark plugs replaced on time despite very few engine hours, brake discs, and perished suspension bushings; (3) the 8 year / 160,000 km DRIVE-BATTERY WARRANTY expiring at year 8, mid-window. That last point is the single largest uncertainty in this record: I provision only about 20,000 for degradation-related module work and HV ancillaries, NOT for a pack replacement, which would plausibly cost NT$300,000-500,000 and exceed the car's projected value at that age. Anyone using this table should treat years 8-10 as carrying a low-probability, very-high-severity tail risk deliberately not averaged into this number. Extrapolated from Toyota's published interval and warranty structure plus predecessor-generation service patterns; no 10-year RAV4 PHEV exists anywhere in Taiwan to observe."}],"sources":[{"name":"Toyota Taiwan - RAV4 official spec page","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/RAV4/spec.aspx","note":"PRIMARY price verification, re-fetched independently by this fact-check on 2026-08-12. Confirms PHEV 4WD at NT$1,490,000 and the Hybrid lineup (豪華 1,040,000 / 尊爵 1,170,000 / 尊爵+ 1,220,000 / 旗艦 1,300,000). Also confirms 2.5L, 189 ps engine, 329 ps combined, E-Four, 22.7 kWh, 135 km EV range - the spec identifying this as the 6th-gen XA60."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan - RAV4 price page","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/RAV4/price.aspx","note":"Independent second confirmation of NT$1,490,000 for the PHEV 4WD, fetched separately from the spec page. Two agreeing official sources are why purchase price is the only high-confidence number in this record."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan - RAV4 showroom","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/RAV4/index.aspx","note":"Re-verified. Source of the warranty terms driving the 5y/7y/10y maintenance windows: HYBRID system (battery, converter, control modules, motor) 5 years / 120,000 km; HYBRID battery 8 years / 160,000 km for MY2019 onward. Confirms NO complimentary scheduled-maintenance programme, and shows finance incentives (200,000 / 20 instalments at 0%, 300,000 / 30 instalments at 1.88%) rather than cash discounting."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan - 車主服務指南 (Owner Service Guide)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/Guidebook/","note":"Re-verified. Source of the official service interval: every 6 months or 10,000 km, whichever comes first - the fact that makes this buyer time-driven rather than mileage-driven. Also confirms the free 滿月檢查, the 首半年定保工資免費 labour waiver, and the 1 year / 20,000 km genuine-parts warranty."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - Toyota RAV4 used listings (page 1)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TOYOTA/RAV4","note":"Used-market evidence, 235 RAV4 listings total, re-fetched by this fact-check. Confirms ZERO PHEV and ZERO 6th-gen cars in the Taiwan used pool. Low-mileage anchor verified here: 2021 with 29,736 km asking 719,000. All prices are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking) and were marked down ~10% before use as private-sale figures."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - Toyota RAV4 used listings (page 2)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TOYOTA/RAV4?page=2","note":"Source of the PREDECESSOR-GENERATION (XA40) anchors used for the 7- and 10-year extrapolation, all re-verified by this fact-check: 2015 with 78,000 km asking 358,000; 2018 with 98,677 km asking 498,000; 2018 with 103,893 km asking 518,000."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - Toyota RAV4 used listings (page 3)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TOYOTA/RAV4?page=3","note":"NEW SOURCE added by this fact-check, and the basis for the downward correction of the year-1 to year-5 values. Supplies low-mileage RAV4 HYBRID comparables that the prior research missed by anchoring on gasoline 2.0 cars: 2025 油電旗艦特仕版 12,884 km asking 1,059,000; 2024 旗艦 20,896 km asking 959,000; 2023 油電旗艦 4WD 特仕版 34,906 km asking 919,000; 2021 2500cc hybrid 77,957 km asking 768,000. A hybrid is a far closer analogue to a PHEV than a gasoline 2.0."}]},"toyota-camry-gasoline":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr; all checkpoints use 7,000 km/yr (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km) — roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/yr, so every used value here is a LOW-MILEAGE quote, not a mileage-blind average. Two consequences run through the model. (1) Resale: at 5 years this car shows 35,000 km while typical same-age TW listings show 60,000-110,000 km, so it sits at the top of its year's price band; low-mileage listings were used as anchors wherever they existed. (2) Maintenance: Toyota TW's interval is 10,000 km OR 6 months, whichever comes first, so at 7,000 km/yr the 6-month clock always fires first and servicing is time-driven — about 2 visits/year regardless of distance. Cost per km is therefore high (~NT$2.6/km) even though annual spend is moderate: you pay per visit, not per kilometre. Tax (牌照稅/燃料費), insurance and fuel are EXCLUDED by design (official economy is 16.3 km/L). Generation caveat driving the confidence ratings: the current Camry launched in Taiwan in July 2024 and is only ~2 years old, so genuine same-generation resale data exists only for years 1-2. Years 3, 5, 7 and 10 are extrapolated from predecessor generations, as stated in each checkpoint. METHOD NOTE (changed by fact-check): retention ratios derived from used price ÷ ORIGINAL LIST price are now applied to list_price (1,109,000), not to real_cost (1,114,000). real_cost includes on-road fees and a dealer accessory pack, which have essentially no resale value, so applying a list-derived ratio to real_cost overstates residuals.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"high","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"GENUINE same-generation, same-trim data, RE-VERIFIED by this fact-check. I fetched auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/camry?price=500000_1000000 myself and confirmed the listing the original researcher cited: a 2026款 汽油旗艦 2.0L with ~7,000 km asking NT$968,000 — an almost exact match for this buyer's spec and mileage. Second anchor added by this fact-check (the original record missed it): a 2024 汽油旗艦 2.0L with 16,300 km asking NT$899,000, seen on three separate fetches of the 8891 Camry listings — same trim, same generation, 2 years old, 81.1% of list. The two points define the car's own early curve (87.3% at yr1, 81.1% at yr2). CORRECTION: the original record's second corroborator, a '2025 油電旗艦 with 10,000 km at NT$1,098,000', did NOT appear in any of my fetches (the closest hybrid listings were a 2023 Hybrid尊爵 at 22,000 km / NT$788,000 and a 2024 油電尊爵 at NT$900,000); it has been dropped. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: NT$968,000 is a DEALER RETAIL asking price (車商售價), not what an owner receives. Took 11% off for private sale (968,000 -> 861,000) and a further 13% for dealer trade-in (861,000 -> 749,000). Confidence stays high because the primary anchor is an observed listing of exactly this trim at exactly this mileage."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, but now from two methods that agree (the original record used only one, and mis-adjusted it). Method A — the car's own curve: verified same-trim listings give 87.3% of list at 1 year (2026 汽油旗艦, 7,000 km, NT$968,000) and 81.1% at 2 years (2024 汽油旗艦, 16,300 km, NT$899,000); continuing at ~-5.5pp/yr gives ~75.6% at year 3. Method B — predecessor ratio: a 2023 汽油尊爵 2.0L with 14,600 km asking NT$790,000 against a NT$1,029,000 list = 76.8% low-mileage dealer-asking retention at 3 years (listing re-verified by me on page 2 of the 8891 Camry results). The two converge on ~76%. CORRECTION vs the original record: it used 74%, shaving ~1-2pp because '旗艦 is the top trim and option content retains a lower percentage'. That contradicts its own finding that 和泰 delisted the 汽油豪華, leaving 汽油旗艦 as the ONLY gasoline trim and the entry Camry — the top-trim penalty does not apply and has been removed. Ratio is applied to list_price (1,109,000), not real_cost. 0.76 x 1,109,000 = NT$843,000 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: -11.5% to private sale (843,000 -> 746,000), then -13% to dealer trade-in (746,000 -> 649,000). Higher-mileage 2023 listings in the same set (80,000 km / NT$658,000 and 120,000 km / NT$588,000) confirm this buyer's low mileage sits at the top of the band."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor generation at 5 years. Real 8891 listings for the 2021 Camry 汽油豪華 2.0L, all re-verified by me on page 2 of the Camry results: 59,000 km asking NT$578,000, 90,000 km asking NT$588,000, 107,800 km asking NT$509,000. Against a NT$929,000 list these are 62.2%, 63.3% and 54.8% — note the 59,000/90,000 km pair is internally inconsistent (the higher-mileage car asks more), which is why this checkpoint stays low confidence. Extrapolating along the mileage gradient (~1.5pp per 10,000 km) from the 59,000 km point down to this buyer's 35,000 km gives ~65.8%. Independent cross-check: a 2022 汽油豪華 2.0L with 64,000 km asking NT$628,000 = 67.6% at 4 years, which mileage-adjusts to ~73% at 28,000 km, and 73% at yr4 -> 66% at yr5 is a sensible -7pp step. Settled on 66%. CORRECTIONS vs the original record: (a) it used 64% after taking ~1pp off for '旗艦 being the top trim' — removed, since 汽油旗艦 is now the entry gasoline Camry; (b) the ratio is applied to list_price (1,109,000), not real_cost. 0.66 x 1,109,000 = NT$732,000 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: -12% to private sale (732,000 -> 644,000), then -13.5% to dealer trade-in (644,000 -> 557,000). CONFIDENCE FIX: the original record's field said 'low' while its own source text argued 'medium' — resolved to low, which is correct: this rests on a mileage-gradient extrapolation from an internally inconsistent trio, it crosses a generation boundary, and the NT$929,000 denominator comes from a page that returns HTTP 403 and could not be read directly by either researcher."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED across a generation boundary, and the two available anchors DISAGREE badly — stated openly rather than papered over. Anchor A (observed, pessimistic): the only real low-mileage 7-year-old Camrys on 8891 are a 2019 豪華 2.5L with ~20,000 km asking NT$388,000 and, one year older, a 2017 豪華 with 54,000 km asking NT$358,000. Against a NT$939,000 list (Yahoo 2016 Camry 2.0豪華 trim page, which I fetched and confirmed at NT$939,000) that is ~41% at 7 years, and the near-flatness between the 7- and 9-year points suggests those older cars have reached their floor. Higher-mileage 2019 cars (110,000-180,000 km at NT$268,000-438,000) sit well below. Anchor B (trajectory, optimistic): continuing from the year-5 figure of 66% at the ~7pp/yr typical of a Toyota sedan in years 5-7 gives ~52%. The honest range is therefore roughly 41-52%; I took 48%, slightly above midpoint because this car is a fresh, higher-priced imported model rather than an old locally-assembled design at the end of its run. CORRECTION vs the original record: it took 50% and justified the optimistic pick by asserting that the predecessor generation was 日本進口 so 'its import positioning matches ours'. I could not verify that claim from any source I could fetch, and it is inconsistent with the record's own year-5 basis, which uses that same predecessor as an ordinary depreciation trajectory — claiming an import premium on top double-counts. The unverifiable claim has been removed and the ratio trimmed to 48%. Also removed: the original record's supporting 'NT$558,000 2019 listing', which its own author admitted was never fetched and whose trim was unconfirmed — an unread single listing should not prop up a number. Ratio applied to list_price. 0.48 x 1,109,000 = NT$532,000 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: -12.5% to private sale (532,000 -> 466,000), then -14% to dealer trade-in (466,000 -> 401,000). Low confidence: this is extrapolation across a generation boundary with anchors ~11pp apart, not observation."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the oldest Camry generation still trading in Taiwan — the only one old enough to supply a 10-year point. Real 8891 listings: a 2017 Camry 豪華 with 54,000 km asking NT$358,000 (re-verified by me in the main Camry listing) = 38.1% of a NT$939,000 list at 9 years, and a 2016 豪華 2.0L with 159,000 km asking NT$258,000 = 27.5% at 10 years. Reconciling for a 10-year-old car at this buyer's 70,000 km: the high-mileage 2016 car adjusted up for ~89,000 fewer km gives ~34.5%; the low-mileage 2017 car stepped down one year and slightly for extra km gives ~34%. Both converge on ~34-35%; I used 34.5%. The NT$939,000 denominator is the one figure in this chain I verified directly — I fetched the Yahoo 汽車機車 2016 Camry 2.0豪華 trim page and it returns 93.9萬. CORRECTION vs the original record: ratio applied to list_price (1,109,000) rather than real_cost, and set to 34.5% rather than 33% to match the two converging observations. 0.345 x 1,109,000 = NT$383,000 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: -13% to private sale (383,000 -> 333,000), then -15% to dealer trade-in (333,000 -> 283,000) — the private/trade-in spread widens on older cars because dealer reconditioning is a bigger share of a cheap car's value. Low confidence: no 10-year data exists for this generation and none can, so this is a ratio transplanted from a two-generations-older, locally-assembled car."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Toyota TW T30 package price (NT$2,270 on a 1.5L small-car basis, verified by direct fetch of the TyAward breakdown) scaled ~1.7x for a Camry 2.0's larger oil capacity, calibrated against a reported owner work order of NT$4,906 for a 20,000 km Camry 2.0 service. Two paid time-triggered visits at ~NT$3,600 each = ~NT$7,200, less the free 1,000 km check. CORRECTION vs the original record: it stated NT$6,000 while its own source text described two paid visits at ~NT$3,600 (~NT$7,200); raised to NT$7,000 to match its own basis. Routine, well-documented pricing."},{"y":3,"source":"4 routine visits at ~NT$3,700 (Toyota TW T30/T50 package prices verified on TyAward, scaled to a Camry 2.0) = ~NT$14,800, plus brake fluid ~NT$1,800 (fluid NT$380/L per Toyota TW parts pricing plus flush labour) and ~NT$1,500 of filters and wipers. CORRECTION vs the original record: it stated NT$17,000 while its own itemisation sums to ~NT$18,100; raised to NT$18,000. The car reaches only 21,000 km here, so the 20,000 km T50 is the single mileage-triggered service in the window."},{"y":5,"source":"The most expensive window before year 10, driven almost entirely by CALENDAR items rather than wear. At 35,000 km the original tires still have legal tread, but 5-year-old rubber on a heavy sedan in Taiwan's heat and humidity should be replaced — a set of 4 quality 18-inch tires fitted runs ~NT$24,000. The 12V battery also dies on age at 4-5 years regardless of distance (~NT$4,500 for a Camry-size unit; Toyota TW quotes NT$2,000-2,800 for small cars, verified on TyAward). Brake pads are NOT included: at 35,000 km of gentle low-mileage use they are not yet worn. 4 routine visits ~NT$15,200 plus brake fluid ~NT$1,800 gives ~NT$45,500, rounded to NT$45,000. This window costing more than the 5-7y one is correct, not an arithmetic slip — it is a direct consequence of low mileage pushing consumables onto calendar triggers."},{"y":7,"source":"4 routine visits ~NT$15,600, plus the 40,000 km T60 major upgrade (+~NT$3,000; Toyota TW lists T60 at NT$3,970 for a small car, verified on TyAward, more on a Camry), brake fluid ~NT$1,800, first front brake pad set ~NT$5,000 fitted (Toyota TW front pads NT$2,070 parts on a small car, more on a Camry, plus labour), and a NT$4,000 allowance for the first out-of-warranty niggles. No tires here — the year-5 set is only 2 years old. Cheaper than the 3-5y window purely because no tire or battery replacement falls in it. CORRECTION vs the original record: it described the T60 as 'transmission fluid + air filter'; the verified TyAward table lists T60 as T30 items plus air filter, brake fluid and coolant. Item list corrected; cost unchanged."},{"y":10,"source":"The largest window and the least certain. 6 routine visits ~NT$24,000 (a 3-year span, so 6 semi-annual services) including the 60,000 km T50 major; second tire set ~NT$25,000 on the same 5-year age rule that triggered the first; second battery ~NT$4,500; coolant ~NT$3,000 (Toyota TW quotes NT$220/L and nominally first changes at 160,000 km, but it is universally done on age by year 10); spark plugs ~NT$3,500 (Toyota TW long-life plugs NT$560/unit on a small car, more for Camry iridium — replaced on age since 100,000 km is never reached); rear pads and front discs ~NT$8,000; brake fluid twice ~NT$3,600. The NT$15,000 out-of-warranty allowance is a judgement call, not a quote: a 10-year-old Camry with only 70,000 km is mechanically young but its rubber, dampers and accessories have aged on the calendar. CORRECTION vs the original record: it stated NT$84,000 while its own itemisation sums to ~NT$86,600; raised to NT$86,000. 10-year total across all windows ~NT$185,000 (~NT$18,500/yr, ~NT$2.6/km)."}],"sources":[{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — Camry official spec & price page","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/CAMRY/spec.aspx","note":"PRIMARY. Fetched and read directly by this fact-check. Independently confirms 汽油旗艦 NT$1,109,000, HYBRID尊爵 NT$1,129,000, HYBRID旗艦 NT$1,250,000, and 1,987cc / 171ps / 16.3 km/L. List price verified correct."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — Camry model landing page","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/CAMRY/","note":"Fetched and read directly by this fact-check. Confirms 1,987cc / 171ps / 16.3 km/L for the gasoline trim and 日本進口 (imported from Japan)."},{"name":"TVBS Cars — sub-million Camry trim delisted","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/335700","note":"Fetched and read directly by this fact-check. Dated 2026-08-04. Confirms the NT$985,000 汽油豪華 was removed from the official site, leaving three trims at 110.9 / 112.9 / 125萬 and making 汽油旗艦 the entry Camry. This is the basis for removing the 'top trim retains less' penalty at years 3 and 5."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Toyota Camry used listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/camry","note":"Fetched and read directly by this fact-check (multiple passes). 341 live listings. Source of the 2024 汽油旗艦 2.0L / 16,300 km / NT$899,000 anchor — same trim and generation at 2 years old — which the original record missed and which now underpins the year-3 curve. All prices here are 車商售價 (dealer retail) and were adjusted down 11-13% for private sale and a further 13-15% for dealer trade-in."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Camry listings, page 2","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/camry?page=2","note":"Fetched and read directly by this fact-check. Re-verified several listings the original record cited that were absent from page 1: 2023 汽油尊爵 2.0L / 14,600 km / NT$790,000 (year-3 anchor), 2021 汽油豪華 2.0L at 59,000 km / NT$578,000 and 90,000 km / NT$588,000 and 107,800 km / NT$509,000 (year-5 anchors), 2022 汽油豪華 / 64,000 km / NT$628,000 and 2022 汽油頂級尊爵 / 57,000 km / NT$718,000."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Camry listings filtered NT$500,000-1,000,000","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/camry?price=500000_1000000","note":"Fetched and read directly by this fact-check. Confirms the year-1 anchor: 2026款 汽油旗艦 2.0L with ~7,000 km at NT$968,000. The original record's other year-1 corroborator (a 2025 油電旗艦 at NT$1,098,000) did NOT appear here and has been dropped."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Camry listings, older model years","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/camry?year=2019_2021","note":"Fetched by this fact-check. Supplied the older low-mileage points behind years 7 and 10: 2019 豪華 2.5L / ~20,000 km / NT$388,000, 2019 豪華 2.0L / 110,000-180,000 km / NT$268,000, 2019 汽油旗艦版 2.5L / 110,000 km / NT$438,000, 2017 豪華 / 54,000 km / NT$358,000. CAVEAT: 8891 appears to ignore this year filter — the response mixed in listings well outside the range, so treat it as an unfiltered read of the same catalogue."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2016 Camry 2.0 豪華 trim page","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/toyota-camry-2016-2-.-0豪華","note":"Fetched and read directly by this fact-check. Returns 93.9萬 — confirms the NT$939,000 original list price used as the denominator for the year-7 and year-10 retention ratios. This is the only predecessor-generation list price I could verify first-hand."},{"name":"U-CAR News — current-generation Camry Taiwan launch","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/78741","note":"UNVERIFIED. Cited by the original researcher for the 2024-07-04 launch date and launch prices (汽油豪華 98.5萬, 汽油旗艦 110.9萬, 油電尊爵 112.9萬, 油電旗艦 125萬). Direct fetch returns HTTP 403 and neither researcher read the page. The prices it supposedly gives are independently corroborated by the Toyota TW spec page and the TVBS article, so the price content is safe; the exact launch DATE is not independently confirmed."},{"name":"U-CAR — predecessor-generation Camry Taiwan price table","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/65188","note":"UNVERIFIED — I re-attempted this fetch and it returns HTTP 403. Source of the 汽油豪華 NT$929,000 and 汽油尊爵 NT$1,029,000 denominators behind the year-3 and year-5 ratios; neither researcher could read it. I also could not find a substitute (my WebSearch budget was exhausted, and guessed Yahoo trim-page slugs for 2019/2021 Camry both returned 404). This is the single weakest link in the year-3 and year-5 figures and is the main reason year 5 is rated low."},{"name":"TyAward — Toyota Taiwan factory maintenance cost breakdown","url":"https://tyaward.com.tw/汽機車-2/toyota原廠保養要多少錢/","note":"Fetched and read directly by this fact-check. Independently confirms every maintenance figure used: interval 10,000 km or 6 months; T30 NT$2,270, T50 NT$2,900 (20,000 km), T60 NT$3,970 (40,000 km, covering air filter + brake fluid + coolant); full-synthetic oil NT$440/L, oil filter NT$220, long-life plugs NT$560, brake fluid NT$380/L (40,000 km or 2 years), coolant NT$220/L, front pads NT$2,070, rear pads NT$1,440, battery NT$2,000-2,800. Quoted for a 1.5L small car — scaled ~1.7x for a Camry 2.0."},{"name":"Mobile01 — Camry 2.0 20,000 km service work order","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=264&t=6537452","note":"UNVERIFIED. Reported owner receipt of NT$4,906 for a 20,000 km routine service on a Camry 2.0, used to calibrate the ~1.7x Camry-vs-small-car scaling. Direct fetch returns HTTP 403; the figure came from a search-result extract and was not read on the page by either researcher. The scaling it supports is load-bearing for every maintenance checkpoint, so treat the maintenance totals as ±20%."}]},"toyota-camry-hybrid":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr; every checkpoint uses the 7,000 km/yr midpoint (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km), roughly half the TW average of 12,000-15,000 km/yr. Two consequences shape the model. (1) Maintenance is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven. Toyota TW's published interval is 每半年或1萬公里以先到者為準, so the 6-month clock always fires first (10,000 km would not bind until ~17 months). Verified on toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx: T30 每半年或1萬公里, T50 每單數年實施 或 2萬公里起每4萬公里, T60 每雙數年實施 或 4萬公里起每4萬公里. Note the T60 TIME trigger (每雙數年 = every even year) - at 7,000 km/yr the 40,000 km trigger is nearly irrelevant, so the real cadence is a T30 plus an annual T50 (odd years) or T60 (even years), i.e. two dealer visits per year for ten years. Tires, brake fluid, coolant and the 12V battery age out before they wear out. (2) Resale sits above the mileage-blind average: at 5 years this car has ~35,000 km where a typical TW Camry has ~65,000 km, so low-mileage listings were used as the anchor. Tax (牌照稅/燃料稅) and insurance (強制險/任意險) are excluded by design and appear nowhere. No home charger applies - this is a self-charging hybrid that never plugs in. Warranty facts verified on toyota.com.tw/owner_guarantee.aspx?ishybrid=Y: whole vehicle 3年/100,000km plus a 和泰 top-up of 1年/20,000km = 4年/120,000km; hybrid battery 5年/100,000km plus 和泰 3年/60,000km = 8年/160,000km, for 2019MY onward. At 7,000 km/yr BOTH expire on TIME, not km - out of vehicle warranty from year 4 at ~28,000 km, and out of battery warranty from year 8 at ~56,000 km. The buyer gets no benefit from the generous km caps.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - the XV80 launched in TW Q4 2024, so there is almost no 1-year-old used stock. Anchored on the newest real comp found on SUM 汽車網: a 2024 CAMRY 旗艦版 with 10,175 km asking NT$899,000 車商售價 (dealer retail), i.e. a 2-year-old, essentially unused car. Stepping back one year gives ~NT$965,000 dealer retail for a 1-year-old hybrid 尊爵 at 7,000 km (85% of the NT$1,129,000 list). This is a deliberate CORRECTION of a prior estimate that put dealer retail at ~NT$1,030,000: that is 91% of list, only ~5% below what a buyer pays for a brand-new car net of the NT$40,000 discount, which no TW buyer would accept, and it is irreconcilable with the verified NT$899,000 two-year-old comp. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN, all from dealer retail: NT$965,000 dealer retail less 9% = NT$880,000 private sale (自售價; the tight end of the 8-15% band because a near-new low-mileage Toyota is easy to sell privately), then less ~10% = NT$790,000 dealer trade-in (車商收購價). The buyer also immediately loses the NT$35,000 of accessories and 代辦 that carry no resale value."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Extrapolated from real 3-year-old (2023MY) Camry listings verified on SUM 汽車網 today, all 車商售價 dealer retail: 2023 尊爵版 5,206 km asking NT$789,000; 2023 標準版 6,683 km asking NT$818,000; 2023 39,800 km asking NT$768,000. Cross-checked against 4-year-old (2022MY) cars at NT$735,000-758,000 (30,000-58,900 km) and a 2022 Camry Hybrid at 86,488 km asking NT$678,000. Our car sits at 21,000 km and is a hybrid, which carries a premium over the gasoline cars that dominate this age band, so ~NT$820,000 dealer retail is the anchor - at the top of the observed 3-year range but not above it. NOTE: a prior estimate used NT$860,000, citing '2023 油電尊爵 50,000 km 79.8萬' and '2023 油電尊爵 69,215 km 72.8萬'; neither appears in SUM's dedicated CAMRY HYBRID cut (23 cars, newest is 2021MY), so those comps could not be re-verified and the anchor was lowered to the listings that could. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: NT$820,000 dealer retail less 10% = NT$740,000 private sale, then less 12% = NT$650,000 dealer trade-in."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Extrapolated from a dense set of real 5-year-old (2021MY) XV70 Camry Hybrid listings re-verified on SUM today, all 車商售價 dealer retail: 尊爵 43,000 km NT$668,000; 尊爵 54,006 km NT$649,000; 63,339 km NT$698,000; 86,080 km NT$648,000; 87,409 km NT$718,000; and one 43,297 km NT$818,000 that reads as a 旗艦 or an aspirational outlier. The 尊爵-badged low-mileage cars cluster at NT$649,000-668,000. Our car has 35,000 km, below every comp, so a modest low-mileage uplift gives ~NT$710,000 dealer retail. This CORRECTS a prior anchor of NT$740,000, which sat above the entire 尊爵 cluster and implicitly leaned on the NT$818,000 outlier the same note claimed to exclude. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: NT$710,000 dealer retail less 11% = NT$630,000 private sale, then less 13% = NT$550,000 dealer trade-in. The 4年/120,000km vehicle warranty has already expired on time by this point, which is priced into the predecessor listings. Cross-generation extrapolation (XV70 standing in for XV80), but the same-age sample is dense."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor XV70 generation - no XV80 data can exist at this age. Real listings verified on SUM, all 車商售價: 2019 油電旗艦 82,464 km asking NT$698,000 (sum.com.tw/carinfo-766547.php, confirmed 2.5 hybrid 旗艦 on the detail page); 2018 hybrid 90,094 km asking NT$598,000; 2020 尊爵 hybrid 101,485 km asking NT$598,000 and 134,580 km asking NT$558,000. The NT$698,000 comp is the single highest in the 6-8 year band and is a 旗艦, so using it raw overstates a 尊爵. Bracketing instead: a 7-year 尊爵 at typical ~95,000 km sits near NT$600,000; our car at 49,000 km earns a low-mileage uplift, giving ~NT$630,000 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: NT$630,000 dealer retail less 12% = NT$555,000 private sale, then less 14% = NT$480,000 dealer trade-in; both gaps widen with age because dealers demand more margin on older stock. The hybrid battery warranty (8年/160,000km) is still live throughout this window, which supports the value here."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the XV50 generation, the only Camry Hybrid actually trading at 10+ years in TW. Real 車商售價 listings verified on SUM: 2017 hybrid 122,000 km NT$326,000 (sum.com.tw/carinfo-767302.php); 2015 hybrid 128,673 km NT$288,000; 2015 hybrid 160,000 km NT$288,000; 2014 hybrid 147,023 km NT$288,000. Gasoline cars of the same vintage give the low-mileage signal: 2015 66,159 km NT$368,000 versus 2015 at 153,655-192,899 km at NT$268,000-298,000, i.e. roughly a 25% premium for less than half the mileage - a real premium, though smaller than at years 3-5, and one that does not compress to ~10% as a prior estimate claimed on the strength of a single listing that could not be re-verified. Applying ~25% to a ~NT$320,000 high-mileage baseline, plus the hybrid premium over these gasoline comps, gives ~NT$400,000 dealer retail. Retention cross-check: the XV50 Hybrid launched in TW Feb 2012 at NT$1,069,000 (G) / NT$1,199,000 (V) / NT$1,399,000 (Q) per zh.wikipedia; NT$400,000 against the NT$1,199,000 mid-trim is ~33%, and 33% of this car's real_cost of NT$1,124,000 is ~NT$375,000-400,000, consistent. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: NT$400,000 dealer retail less 13% = NT$350,000 private sale, then less 17% = NT$290,000 dealer trade-in. The steep fall from year 7 is partly real - the hybrid battery warranty expires at year 8 on TIME with only ~56,000 km on the car, and TW buyers discount post-warranty hybrids - and partly a generation artefact, since the XV50 was a weaker car than the XV70/XV80. Hence low confidence."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Built from Toyota TW's official T30/T50 item list and the Guidebook statement (verified) that 滿月檢查 is free (凡TOYOTA新車車主，皆享滿月檢查免費優惠) and 首半年定保工資免費. Two chargeable touches in year 1: the 6-month service at parts cost only (~NT$1,300) and the year-1 T50 (~NT$4,500). Spark plugs are nominally a T50 item but no dealer replaces iridium plugs at 7,000 km, so they are excluded here and carried to the year-7 window. Fully inside the 4年/120,000km warranty, so zero repair risk. Prices are market estimates - Toyota TW publishes none."},{"y":3,"source":"Cost SINCE year 1, covering 7,000-21,000 km. On the corrected time-driven cadence this window contains a year-2 T60 (~NT$6,000, which is where brake fluid, coolant and fuel filter are actually done), a year-3 T50 (~NT$4,500) and two T30 half-year services (~NT$5,500 combined), plus wipers and a cabin filter (~NT$1,500). Still fully inside the 4-year vehicle warranty, so no repair provision is needed. Tires are not yet due - at 21,000 km they are far from worn and only 3 years old, below the 5-6 year age threshold TW shops use. Market-rate estimate against the officially sourced item lists; no published Toyota TW prices exist."},{"y":5,"source":"Cost SINCE year 3, covering 21,000-35,000 km. Scheduled work is a year-4 T60 (~NT$6,000), a year-5 T50 (~NT$4,500) and two T30s (~NT$5,500). The one age-driven consumable that lands here is the 12V auxiliary battery at ~NT$6,000 - hybrid Camrys use an AGM/EFB unit with a typical 3-5 year TW life, and it dies on calendar age regardless of km. Tires are deliberately NOT in this window: fitted new at delivery, they come out on the 5-6 year rubber-age rule at about year 5.5, which falls in the 5-7 window. Brake pads are also carried forward - regenerative braking on this hybrid routinely stretches front pads to 60,000-80,000 km. The 4年/120,000km vehicle warranty expires early in this period, on time at ~28,000 km, but no repair provision is added yet as failures are rare at this age."},{"y":7,"source":"Cost SINCE year 5, covering 35,000-49,000 km, and the first period fully outside the 4-year vehicle warranty. Scheduled work: year-6 T60 (~NT$6,000), year-7 T50 (~NT$4,500), two T30s (~NT$5,500). The first tire set goes at about year 5.5 on rubber age at ~NT$24,000 for four - the OE set has covered under 40,000 km with plenty of tread left, but Taiwan's heat and humidity make the 5-6 year rule non-negotiable. Wheel/tire size is taken as the 尊爵's OE fitment; if the 尊爵 runs 17-inch rather than 18-inch this line is NT$4,000-6,000 lower. Iridium spark plugs finally get done at the year-7 T50 (~NT$4,500 for four plus labour), deferred from earlier T50s because 7,000 km/yr never justified them. Front brake pads now due at ~NT$6,000 - late by combustion standards, which is the regen-braking benefit showing up. Plus an NT$8,000 out-of-warranty risk provision for the items that actually fail on 6-7 year old TW hybrids: the electric water pump, engine mounts and suspension bushings. Hybrid battery remains under its 8年/160,000km warranty throughout, so no battery provision here. Market-rate estimate; Toyota TW publishes no prices."},{"y":10,"source":"Cost SINCE year 7, covering 49,000-70,000 km - the most expensive window, driven by age rather than use. Scheduled work over three years on the corrected cadence: two T60s at years 8 and 10 (~NT$12,000), a year-9 T50 (~NT$4,500) and three T30s (~NT$8,250), about NT$25,000 total. Second 12V battery ~NT$6,500. Tires carry only a partial NT$12,000 provision, not a full set: the first set went on at about year 5.5, so the second is not due until roughly year 11, just outside the window - a prior version of this record booked a full second set here and over-provisioned. Two risk provisions carry the rest: (a) NT$8,000 for hybrid-battery exposure - the 8年/160,000km warranty lapses on TIME at year 8 while the car sits at only ~56,000 km, and although Toyota packs in TW routinely exceed 15 years, a 和泰 replacement runs roughly NT$80,000-150,000 (independent rebuilds NT$40,000-60,000), so an expected value at a low single-digit failure probability is the honest booking, neither a full pack nor zero; (b) NT$18,000 for general 高齡車 out-of-warranty items - electric A/C compressor, suspension, radiator, belts. Ten-year total is ~NT$174,000, about NT$17,400/yr, high per km precisely because time-driven costs do not amortise over 7,000 km/yr."}],"sources":[{"name":"Toyota Taiwan - CAMRY 規格配備表 (official list price)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/CAMRY/spec.aspx","note":"Primary price verification, independently re-fetched 2026-08-12: 汽油旗艦 1,109,000 / HYBRID尊爵 1,129,000 / HYBRID旗艦 1,250,000. Also confirms 2,487cc, 186ps, 25.3 km/l, E-CVT, 全新第五代 SELF-CHARGING HYBRID. Spec edition CAMRY 202407 A版, page updated 2025/04/01."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan - CAMRY showroom","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/CAMRY/","note":"Confirms the three-trim lineup and 2024/06月起生產 applicability, identifying the car as the XV80 rather than the XV70."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan - 愛車養護與保證 (official maintenance schedule)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx","note":"Verified intervals: T30 每半年或1萬公里; T50 每單數年實施 或 2萬公里起每4萬公里; T60 每雙數年實施 或 4萬公里起每4萬公里. The T60 每雙數年 time trigger is the fact that corrects the prior maintenance model. Explicitly publishes no prices and directs customers to a service centre."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan - 油電車新車保證條款","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_guarantee.aspx?ishybrid=Y","note":"Verified: vehicle warranty 3年/100,000km plus 和泰 1年/20,000km = 4年/120,000km. Hybrid battery 5年/100,000km plus 和泰 3年/60,000km = 8年/160,000km, for 2019MY onward."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan - 車主服務指南 Guidebook","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/Guidebook/","note":"Verified: 凡TOYOTA新車車主，皆享滿月檢查免費優惠 and 皆享首半年定保工資免費優惠, plus 建議愛車每半年或1萬公里回廠進行定期保養. Basis for the year-1 maintenance figure."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - Toyota Camry used listings (173 cars, page 1)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TOYOTA/CAMRY","note":"Main used-price source, re-fetched 2026-08-12. Real 車商售價 dealer asking prices. Key anchors used: 2024 旗艦版 10,175 km NT$899,000; 2023 尊爵版 5,206 km NT$789,000; 2023 標準版 6,683 km NT$818,000; 2022 尊爵版 33,924 km NT$758,000; 2021 尊爵版 59,240 km NT$578,000. All stepped down to private sale and trade-in, never used raw."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - Toyota Camry used listings (page 2)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TOYOTA/CAMRY?page=2","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-12 for the hybrid and 10-year cuts: 2023 39,800 km NT$768,000; 2022 Camry Hybrid 86,488 km NT$678,000; 2021 Camry Hybrid 43,000 km NT$668,000, 63,339 km NT$698,000, 86,080 km NT$648,000; 2018 80,305 km NT$488,000; 2015 66,159 km NT$368,000 versus 2015 at 153,655-192,899 km at NT$268,000-298,000 (the low-mileage-premium signal used at year 10)."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - Camry Hybrid filtered listings (23 cars)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TOYOTA/CAMRY%20HYBRID","note":"Hybrid-only cut, re-fetched 2026-08-12. Newest entry is 2021MY - there is no 2022-2024 hybrid stock in this cut, which is why the year-1 and year-3 anchors lean on the general Camry search. Dense 2021 (5-year) cluster: 尊爵 43,000 km NT$668,000, 尊爵 54,006 km NT$649,000, 63,339 km NT$698,000, 86,080 km NT$648,000, 87,409 km NT$718,000, plus a NT$818,000 outlier at 43,297 km."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - 2019 Camry Hybrid 旗艦 detail page","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carinfo-766547.php","note":"Re-verified: 2019 Camry 2.5 Hybrid 旗艦, 82,464 km, NT$698,000 車商售價, 油電混合 confirmed on the detail page. Used as the upper bracket for the year-7 checkpoint, not as the anchor, because it is a 旗艦 and the highest comp in its age band."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - 2017 Camry Hybrid detail page","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carinfo-767302.php","note":"Re-verified: 2017 Camry, 122,000 km, NT$326,000 車商售價, 油電車 confirmed. XV50 generation, used in the year-10 extrapolation."},{"name":"維基百科 - Toyota Camry (Taiwan launch history and prices)","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toyota_Camry","note":"Verified: XV50 Camry Hybrid launched in Taiwan 2012-02-16 at G版 NT$1,069,000 / V版 NT$1,199,000 / Q版 NT$1,399,000, and 和泰 confirmed the XV80 for Q4 2024 at its 2024 新春記者會. The V版 NT$1,199,000 is the denominator for the year-10 retention ratio. No TW launch price for the XV70 is given on this page."},{"name":"TOYOTA 認證中古車 (Toyota CPO Taiwan)","url":"https://www.toyotacpo.com.tw/","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-12 as a cross-check on the top of the retail band: 2020 CAMRY 2.5 at 51,311 km listed NT$588,000, 2021 CAMRY 2.0G at 82,058 km listed NT$688,000, both 現正優惠中. Certified retail sits at or above ordinary dealer retail, which supports treating every listed price as well above what an owner actually receives."}]},"toyota-crown-hybrid":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. All checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years. Two consequences run through every number. (1) Resale: at every age this car carries about half the mileage of the typical 8891 listing, so it sits above the mileage-blind average. Where a low-mileage comparable existed I used it; where the only comparables were high-mileage (all the predecessor-generation Camry Hybrid points at years 7 and 10) I applied an explicit low-mileage uplift and said so. Note the genuine finding that the 2023 貴族版 asking prices on 8891 are identical (NT$1,150,000) at 23,000, 40,000 and 47,000 km, which reads as stale dealer pricing rather than a real mileage-blind market, so the uplift at year 3 is deliberately small. (2) Maintenance: Toyota Taiwan's published interval is 每半年或1萬公里 (every 6 months or 10,000 km, whichever comes first). At 7,000 km/year the 6-month clock always fires first (~3,500 km per interval), so servicing is entirely TIME-driven, never mileage-driven, and over the full 10 years the car reaches only 70,000 km without ever triggering a single mileage-based interval. The same logic makes tyres age out (rubber hardening at ~5-6 years) rather than wear out. This is a self-charging hybrid with no plug, so there is no home-charger installation cost at all — the issue does not arise. Tax (牌照稅/燃料費), insurance and fuel are excluded from this record by design.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REBUILT — the previous pass's anchor for this checkpoint does not exist. It cited '8891: a 2025 貴族版, white, Taipei, with exactly 7,000 km at 車商售價 NT$1,358,000, an exact mileage match'. I re-fetched auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/crown: the board carries 17 listings, and NONE is a 2025 貴族版 (every 2025 car is a 皇家版; all four 貴族版 listings are 2023 or 2024), and NO listing anywhere on the board asks NT$1,358,000. That comparable is fabricated and has been discarded. Honest replacement, since no 1-year-old 貴族版 is on the market at all: (a) same-generation 皇家版 at ~1 year gives asking retention against its NT$2,100,000 list — 2025 皇家版 at 4,800 km asks NT$1,788,000 (85.1%) and at 9,800 km asks NT$1,698,000 (80.9%); interpolating to this buyer's 7,000 km gives ~83%, which on the 貴族版's NT$1,570,000 list implies ~NT$1,305,000 dealer asking. (b) Upper bound check from the real 貴族版 board: the 2024 貴族版 at 31,000 km asks NT$1,168,000 (74.4% at ~2 years), so a 1-year low-mileage car must sit meaningfully above that; NT$1,305,000 does. DEALER-RETAIL ADJUSTMENT: NT$1,305,000 is 車商售價. private_sale_price = 1,305,000 x 0.89 = ~1,160,000 (11% below dealer asking, mid-range of the normal 8-15% gap). dealer_tradein_price = 1,160,000 x 0.885 = ~1,025,000 (a further 11.5% below private). Confidence medium, not high: derived from same-generation 皇家版 listings and one 2-year 貴族版 point, with no direct 1-year 貴族版 comparable in existence."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REBUILT — the previous pass derived every year-3 number from 'a Taipei listing at NT$1,210,000', which does not exist. Re-fetching auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/crown confirms the 貴族版 asking cluster it also cited (2023 貴族版 at 23,000 km, 40,000 km and 47,000 km, all NT$1,150,000 — these ARE real), but the highest 貴族版 asking price anywhere on the board is NT$1,168,000 (2024, 31,000 km), and no 貴族版 asks NT$1,210,000. CORRECTED BASIS: for a 21,000 km 2023 貴族版 I take dealer asking at NT$1,160,000 — the observed 23,000 km car already asks NT$1,150,000 and the mileage-blind cluster leaves almost no room for a low-mileage premium, with the 2-year NT$1,168,000 point capping it from above. DEALER-RETAIL ADJUSTMENT: private_sale_price = 1,160,000 x 0.89 = ~1,030,000; dealer_tradein_price = 1,030,000 x 0.885 = ~910,000. CROSS-CHECK: Carbook (carbook.tw/cars/toyota-crown/region/taipei) publishes both ends of the chain for Taipei — 建議成交約 115萬 and 車行收購約 100萬. My NT$910,000 trade-in is 9% under Carbook's NT$1,000,000; Carbook's acquisition figure is a seller-facing headline that skews optimistic and is quoted across mixed trims (its per-year medians — 2025: 179萬, 2024: 160萬, 2023: 149萬 — are clearly dominated by the NT$210萬 皇家版), so a single-digit gap below it is where the 貴族版 belongs. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from high to medium: the previous 'high' rested on a 4% agreement with Carbook that was itself computed off the fabricated NT$1,210,000, only four 貴族版 cars exist on the entire board, and the identical NT$1,150,000 at 23k/40k/47k km is stale dealer pricing rather than a genuine market signal."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no genuine 5-year data can exist. This Crown generation launched in Taiwan in March 2023, so the oldest car on the market is 3 years old. Method: predecessor generation = Toyota Camry 2.5 Hybrid, the model the Crown replaced in Toyota Taiwan's large-sedan slot, list prices verified at 8th-gen Taiwan launch (2018-11) of 尊爵 NT$1,179,000 and 旗艦 NT$1,399,000. Real 8891 listings (auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/camry-hybrid) give the Camry Hybrid 尊爵 asking curve against its NT$1,179,000 list: 2021 油電尊爵版 at 40,000 km asks NT$668,000 = 56.7% at 5 years. That comparable's mileage (40,000 km) is very close to this buyer's 35,000 km, so almost no low-mileage adjustment is warranted — I lift it only to ~58%. CROWN OUTPERFORMANCE FACTOR CORRECTED: the previous pass used 1.22, computed as observed Crown 3-year retention 77% over an interpolated Camry 63%. Both inputs were wrong — the 77% came from the fabricated NT$1,210,000, and the real observed Crown 3-year asking retention is 1,150,000/1,570,000 = 73.2%, while the Camry Hybrid's own 3-year point is 2023 尊爵款 at 45,000 km asking NT$798,000 = 67.7%, not 63%. The correct factor is 73.2/67.7 = 1.08, not 1.22. Tapered to ~1.06 here. So 58% x 1.06 = ~61.5% asking retention. DENOMINATOR CORRECTED: applied to list_price (1,570,000), not real_cost — the predecessor ratios are fractions of the predecessor's LIST price, so applying them to a real_cost that includes on-road fees was an inconsistent denominator. 1,570,000 x 0.615 = ~965,000 dealer asking; private = x0.89 = ~860,000; trade-in = x0.885 = ~760,000. Confidence low: extrapolated from a different model."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no 7-year data can exist for a generation launched in 2023, and none was invented. Same predecessor method on Camry 2.5 Hybrid 尊爵 (list NT$1,179,000), from real 8891 listings: 2019 尊爵 at 140,000 km asks NT$498,000 = 42.2% at 7 years (this specific listing was re-verified and is genuinely on the board). That car carries nearly 3x this buyer's 49,000 km. Mileage sensitivity measured on the board's own 2020 尊爵 pair — 130,000 km asks NT$628,000 vs 172,000 km asks NT$568,000, i.e. ~10% for 42,000 km — but used-car mileage curves flatten at the low end, so rather than extrapolating that slope linearly I lift 42.2% to a deliberately conservative ~50% for a 49,000 km example. Crown outperformance factor tapered to ~1.05 (down from the corrected 1.08 measured at year 3, not the previous pass's inflated 1.22), giving ~52.5% asking retention. Applied to list_price 1,570,000 (not real_cost) = ~824,000 dealer asking; private = x0.89 = ~730,000; trade-in = x0.885 = ~645,000. WARRANTY NOTE, CORRECTED: Toyota TW's hybrid traction-battery cover is 8 years / 160,000 km (with a ≥70% capacity condition), so at year 7 the car is still inside it — that is part of why the curve has not broken here, and it is precisely what disappears before the 10-year checkpoint. Confidence low."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, and the weakest point in this record. No 10-year data for this generation is possible. Basis: the oldest Toyota hybrid sedans actually trading in Taiwan, read off 8891. The band is genuinely wide — a 2016 Camry Hybrid 經典款 at 130,000 km asks NT$238,000 (~19% of its ~NT$1,260,000 list, a base trim at extreme mileage), while a 2017 Camry Hybrid 旗艦款 at 100,000 km asks NT$478,000 (~38% of a ~NT$1,270,000 list, top trim at 9 years). Several 2016 旗艦 entries asking NT$120,000-128,000 were DISCARDED as obvious down-payment teasers rather than full prices. This buyer's car at 70,000 km and a high trim belongs toward the upper end of that band, so I take ~35% and add only a ~1.03 Crown uplift (by 10 years the scarcity premium has washed out and price is driven by condition, not badge), giving ~36% asking retention. Applied to list_price 1,570,000 = ~565,000 dealer asking; private = x0.89 = ~500,000; trade-in = x0.885 = ~440,000. The steep year-7 to year-10 fall (private NT$730,000 -> NT$500,000, -31% over 3 years) is deliberate and matches what the Camry Hybrid data actually shows: Taiwan buyers discount aging hybrids hard once the 8-year / 160,000 km traction-battery warranty has lapsed, because a replacement is a five-figure risk with no cover behind it. Treat this as a reasoned floor estimate, not a market quote."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Toyota Taiwan owner maintenance programme (toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx), re-fetched directly: confirms 每半年或1萬公里 intervals and states 新車車主可享滿月免費檢查服務及首半年（或1萬公里）免費檢查服務. Only the 12-month T50 is chargeable in this window. Per-visit cost from the published Toyota 原廠 service band. Whole window inside the 4-year / 120,000 km warranty."},{"y":3,"source":"Toyota Taiwan interval table (toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx). Recounted on the corrected T50-odd-year / T60-even-year structure: 4 visits in this 24-month window, of which 2 are T30 and 2 are annual majors — the previous pass had 3 T30 + 1 major. All triggered by the time clock, never by mileage (the car reaches only 21,000 km). Whole window inside the 4-year / 120,000 km new-car warranty, so no repair allowance is carried."},{"y":5,"source":"Toyota Taiwan interval table for the scheduled work (4 visits: 2 T30 + 2 annual majors). Tyre size 225/55R19 on 19-inch rims confirmed for the 貴族版 (the 皇家版 runs 21s); pricing from normal Taiwan retail for 19-inch premium touring tyres at ~NT$7,000-8,000 each fitted. The tyre line is the single biggest item here and is the clearest low-mileage effect in the whole record: at 35,000 km the original tyres have plenty of tread left, but 5-year-old rubber is hardened and should be changed on age. WARRANTY, CORRECTED: cover is 4 years / 120,000 km (3yr/100,000km factory + 1yr/20,000km 和泰), not 3 years, so the first half of this window (months 36-48) is still covered and only months 48-60 are at the owner's risk — the previous pass had this window fully uncovered. Nothing significant is expected at this age and mileage regardless."},{"y":7,"source":"Toyota Taiwan interval table for the scheduled portion (4 visits: 2 T30 + 2 annual majors — the previous pass counted 5 visits in this 24-month window, which the 6-month interval does not allow). The rest is an estimated allowance and is the reason confidence is low. Brake pads arrive late by design: regenerative braking on a Toyota hybrid routinely takes pads well past 60,000-80,000 km, so at 49,000 km they are changed as much for age, rust and pad-material degradation as for wear. This is the first window fully outside the 4-year / 120,000 km new-car warranty, so an out-of-warranty allowance is carried; the hybrid traction battery is still covered (8 years / 160,000 km) throughout, so no battery risk is priced here. period_cost now exceeds the year-5 window, correcting a previous fall with age (61,000 -> 60,000)."},{"y":10,"source":"Toyota Taiwan interval table for the scheduled portion only (6 visits in this 36-month window: 3 T30 + 3 annual majors — the previous pass counted 8, and also billed iridium spark plugs as a separate NT$6,000 line while stating the T50/T60 package already includes spark plugs, a double-count now folded into the 108-month T50). Everything else is an explicit estimate, hence low confidence. The traction-battery line deserves scrutiny: Toyota TW covers it 8 years / 160,000 km at ≥70% capacity, so cover lapses partway through this window while the car is at only ~56,000 km. A replacement at 和泰 runs roughly NT$120,000-200,000, but the probability of needing one by 70,000 km is genuinely low — Toyota HEV packs commonly run 15+ years — so I carry a probability-weighted ~NT$20,000 (about 12% of a ~NT$165,000 job) rather than either ignoring the exposure or booking a full replacement the car probably will not need. Both the failure probability and the replacement cost are reasoned, not sourced. The second tyre set is again age-driven, not wear-driven. This period is by far the most expensive of the five and is where an honest low-mileage model still has to admit that calendar age, not the odometer, is doing the damage."}],"sources":[{"name":"Toyota Taiwan official showroom — CROWN","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/CROWN/","note":"PRIMARY, re-fetched directly in this verification pass. Confirms 貴族版 2.5 Hybrid System 建議售價 NT$1,570,000 (186 ps/6,000 rpm, 2,487 cc, 22.4 km/L) and 皇家版 2.4T Hybrid NT$2,100,000 (272 ps, 2,393 cc, 15.6 km/L); catalogue updated 2025/05/23, specs applicable to vehicles produced from 2025/04. The scout price is CORRECT and unchanged."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — 愛車養護與保證 (owner maintenance)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx","note":"PRIMARY, re-fetched directly. Source of the maintenance skeleton and of a STRUCTURAL CORRECTION: interval is 每半年或1萬公里回廠進行定期保養; T30 = oil/filter + 30+ checks; T50 = 每單數年 (odd years) or every 40,000 km from 20,000 km, adding air filter, spark plugs, brake fluid, coolant, fuel filter; T60 = 每雙數年 (even years) or every 40,000 km from 40,000 km. T50 and T60 alternating means a larger service EVERY year, not every two years as the previous pass modelled. Also confirms 新車車主可享滿月免費檢查服務及首半年（或1萬公里）免費檢查服務."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — 保固說明 (warranty)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/5th-warranty/","note":"PRIMARY, re-fetched directly, and source of a CORRECTION. New-car warranty is 3年內或行駛100,000公里以內 from the factory, with 和泰汽車 adding 1 year / 20,000 km for a total of 4 years / 120,000 km — the previous pass stated a flat 3 years and wrongly treated the 3-5 year maintenance window as the first uncovered period. Hybrid traction battery: 自交車日起8年或160,000公里以內, maintaining at least 70% capacity — this part of the previous pass was correct."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Toyota Crown listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/crown","note":"PRIMARY, re-fetched directly, and the source of the two biggest corrections. The board carries 17 live listings. CONFIRMED REAL: 2023 貴族版 at 2.3萬公里, 4萬公里 and 4.7萬公里 all asking NT$1,150,000; 2024 貴族版 at 3.1萬公里 asking NT$1,168,000 (the highest 貴族版 asking on the board); 2025 皇家版 at 4,800 km asking NT$1,788,000 and at 9,800 km asking NT$1,698,000. NOT PRESENT, contrary to the previous pass: there is NO 2025 貴族版 listing of any kind, NO listing at NT$1,358,000, and NO 貴族版 listing at NT$1,210,000. Those two prices anchored the entire year-1 and year-3 checkpoints and have been discarded. All figures here are 車商售價 and are adjusted down before use."},{"name":"Carbook — Toyota Crown 行情 (Taipei)","url":"https://carbook.tw/cars/toyota-crown/region/taipei","note":"PRIMARY, re-fetched directly. Publishes both sides of the chain: 建議成交 115萬 and 車行收購 100萬, with a market listing range of 145萬-179萬. Per-year medians 2025: 179萬 (2 units), 2024: 160萬 (3 units), 2023: 149萬 (3 units) — the page states NO trim breakdown, so these medians are mixed-trim and dominated by the NT$210萬 皇家版, which is why they are used only as a directional cross-check on the year-3 trade-in and never as a 貴族版 price."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Toyota Camry Hybrid listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/camry-hybrid","note":"PRIMARY, re-fetched directly. The predecessor-generation basis for years 5, 7 and 10. RE-VERIFIED AND USED: 2023 尊爵款 4.5萬公里 NT$798,000; 2021 油電尊爵版 4萬公里 NT$668,000; 2020 Hybrid尊爵 13萬公里 NT$628,000; 2020 Hybrid尊爵 17.2萬公里 NT$568,000; 2019 尊爵 14萬公里 NT$498,000; 2017 旗艦款 10萬公里 NT$478,000; 2016 經典款 13萬公里 NT$238,000. TWO OF THE PREVIOUS PASS'S COMPARABLES ARE NOT ON THE BOARD: '2021 Hybrid 旗艦 60,000 km NT$690,000' (the real 2021 entry is a 尊爵 at 40,000 km for NT$668,000) and '2020 Hybrid 尊爵 115,400 km NT$579,000' (the real 2020 entries are at 130,000 km and 172,000 km). Several 2016 旗艦款 entries asking NT$120,000-128,000 are down-payment teasers, not full prices, and were discarded."},{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點 / U-CAR — Camry 8th-gen Taiwan launch pricing (via search snippet)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/","note":"Camry 8th gen launched in Taiwan 2018-11 with Hybrid 尊爵 at NT$1,179,000 and Hybrid 旗艦 at NT$1,399,000 (petrol base NT$1,069,000). These list prices are the denominators for every predecessor retention ratio at years 5, 7 and 10, and I re-confirmed them independently in this pass via a search snippet quoting 7Car 小七車觀點, which agrees exactly with the previous pass. HONESTY NOTE: I could not open a specific article URL, so only the domain root is recorded rather than a URL I did not load. The figures are corroborated; the URL is not a citation of a page I read."},{"name":"FindCar — Toyota Crown 貴族版","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/Toyota%20Crown%20%E8%B2%B4%E6%97%8F%E7%89%88","note":"PRIMARY, re-fetched directly, and MISQUOTED by the previous pass. The page shows 3 units (not 4) at an average used price of NT$1,238,000 (not NT$1,244,000), against a new-car reference of NT$1,570,000 for both the 2023 and 2024 model years — an independent confirmation of the list price. The only itemised listing is a 2022-build 貴族版 at 45,114 km asking NT$1,238,000 (元禾汽車旗艦館, New Taipei), which is an outlier well above the 8891 cluster and is used only as an upper sanity bound, not as a primary figure."},{"name":"Toyota Crown 貴族版 tyre specification (via search snippet)","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=Toyota+Crown+%E8%B2%B4%E6%97%8F%E7%89%88+%E8%BC%AA%E8%83%8E%E5%B0%BA%E5%AF%B8+225%2F55R19+%E8%A6%8F%E6%A0%BC","note":"Confirms the 貴族版 runs 225/55R19 on 19-inch rims while the 皇家版 runs 21-inch — the previous pass's tyre assumption was correct, and it underpins the ~NT$29,000-30,000 per-set cost in the year-5 and year-10 maintenance windows. Read via search-result snippets; this is the search URL actually fetched, not a content page."},{"name":"8891 新車菜單分享 — Crown 2025 貴族版","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/menu/toyota/crown/share/18009","note":"COULD NOT BE VERIFIED. The previous pass cited this page for a 成交價 of NT$1,545,000 (Taipei, ordered 2025-03-05), the sole basis for the NT$25,000 discount. I re-fetched it: the page returns only the title 'Toyota Crown 2025款 貴族版' and renders none of the transaction detail — no 成交價, no list price, no discount, no accessories, no city, no order date. The original figure came from a search snippet, and I could not reproduce it. The discount is retained as a reasoned convention with its sourcing claim downgraded in purchase.notes."},{"name":"Mobile01 — Crown 貴族版 buyer thread","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=750&t=6973384","note":"COULD NOT BE VERIFIED. Cited by the previous pass for a 1.5% cash discount (~NT$23,550) after quoting 5-6 sales reps. Mobile01 returns 403 to direct fetch, so this was snippet-only in the original pass and remains unverified here. Not treated as independent corroboration of the discount."},{"name":"findplate.tw — 2025 新車領牌流程與費用明細","url":"https://findplate.tw/article/2025%E6%9C%80%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B0%E8%BB%8A%E8%BB%8A%E7%89%8C%E7%94%B3%E8%AB%8B%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E8%88%87%E8%B2%BB%E7%94%A8%E6%98%8E%E7%B4%B0.html","note":"Taiwan new-car 規費 breakdown: 檢驗費 NT$450 + 號牌費 NT$600 + 行照費 NT$200, plus 代辦手續費 NT$1,000-3,000. Basis for the 領牌 + 代辦 component of onroad_fees. Snippet-level source carried over from the previous pass; not independently re-fetched, and the accessory component of onroad_fees is a convention rather than a quote from this page."},{"name":"tyaward / littletsenggarage — 汽車過戶費用","url":"https://tyaward.com.tw/","note":"Used-car transfer costs: 行照費 NT$200 + 檢驗費 NT$450, with most transfers settling under NT$2,000 all-in including an agent. Basis for the selling_costs 過戶費 line. HONESTY NOTE: domain root only — the previous pass recorded no deep URL because it did not load one, and I did not re-fetch it either. Weak sourcing, but the line item is small and uncontroversial."}]},"toyota-prius-phev":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, well under the TW average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year; every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). This is BELOW Toyota TW's 10,000 km service trigger, so the maintenance plan is entirely TIME-driven (every 6 months) — low mileage does not cut the number of workshop visits, only the wear items. Used values deliberately quote LOW-MILEAGE listings. The size of that effect is visible directly within a single model year on 8891: a 2025 MY at 14,000 km asks NT$1,168,000 while a 2025 MY at 50,000 km asks NT$988,000 — a ~15% spread for 36,000 extra km, both dealer retail. (A previous version of this record compared a 2024 car against a 2025 car and mis-stated that spread; the same-year comparison above is the correct one.) EXCLUDED by design and in no number here: 牌照稅, 燃料費, all insurance (強制險 and 任意險), fuel and electricity. ALSO EXCLUDED but a real ownership cost: a home AC charger. The Prius PHEV has 97 km of EV range and only pays off if charged at home; a dedicated 220V circuit plus a wall unit runs roughly NT$30,000-60,000 in Taiwan, more if a 社區大樓 management committee requires an electrical review or a separate meter. That is a one-off installation, not maintenance, so it is out of maintenance.checkpoints. Buyers in apartments without an assigned parking space may not be able to install one at all, which changes the whole economics of a PHEV over a plain hybrid. Government 汰舊換新 貨物稅減免 (up to NT$100,000, conditional on scrapping a 10+ year old vehicle) is a tax rebate and is excluded from purchase.discounts.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"8891 中古車 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/prius-phev), re-read directly on 2026-08-12. The live listing set contains a genuine PRIVATE-SALE anchor that the previous version of this record mislabelled as a dealer car: a 2025 MY at 12,000 km asking NT$1,099,000 marked 自售 / 車商勿擾. Same page, dealer retail on a 2025 MY at 14,000 km is NT$1,168,000 — so the observed private-vs-dealer-retail asking spread on this exact model is ~6%. METHOD: took the real private ask NT$1,099,000, trim-scaled to 旗艦 by the list ratio 1,299,000/1,379,000 = 0.942 (trim of the listing is not stated; 鉑金 assumed, which is the conservative direction) giving ~NT$1,035,000, then less ~5% for ask-to-transaction = ~NT$983,000, rounded to NT$980,000. This is a private-sale figure derived from a private-sale listing, not a dealer ask. dealer_tradein = private less 12.8% = NT$855,000. Cross-check: our buyer's 7,000 km is roughly half the listings' mileage, which supports the figure, but a 2027 MY facelift landing within months of delivery pulls the other way, so no low-mileage premium was added."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"8891 中古車 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/prius-phev), oldest genuine 5th-gen cars available — TW launch was 2024-04-24, so the oldest is ~2.3 years old: 2024 MY at 11,500 km, dealer retail ask NT$1,088,000 = 78.9% of the 鉑金 NT$1,379,000 list. METHOD: trim-scaled to 旗艦 (x0.942) = ~NT$1,025,000 dealer retail at 2.3 years; less 10% to private = ~NT$922,000; then decayed 2.3 -> 3.0 years at the ~8-10%/yr typical of years 2-4 = ~NT$860,000; then pulled down to NT$820,000 as a sanity check against the PREDECESSOR 4th-gen Prius PHV at a true 3 years, whose real low-mileage listings sit far lower (2023 MY at 2,300 km asks NT$748,000 dealer retail, 2023 MY at 70,000 km asks NT$660,000, against a ~NT$1,259,000 list — https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/prius-phv). NOTE: the previous version of this record cited that 2,300 km car as '23,000 km', a 10x mileage error that made an ultra-low-mileage outlier look like a typical 3-year car. Corrected here. The 5th gen is clearly holding better than the 4th gen, but not by the full margin the near-new listings alone imply. All 8891 figures are 車商售價 dealer retail unless stated; converted down as described."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no 5th-gen Prius PHEV is 5 years old anywhere in Taiwan (launched 2024-04-24), so this is not observed. Method: took the PREDECESSOR 4th-gen Prius PHV's real used price at that exact age and expressed it as a retention ratio of its own original list. 8891 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/prius-phv): 2021 MY at 46,000 km, dealer retail ask NT$695,000 against its NT$1,259,000 list = 55.2% at 5 years. The 2021 PHV list price of NT$1,259,000 is verified (https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/32500-tss-2-0-toyota-prius-prius-phv-2021-114-9-125-9.html, which states the PHV was cut by NT$120,000 to NT$1,259,000 that year). The 5th gen is running ~15-20 points ahead of the 4th gen at the 1-3 year points; assuming that advantage narrows to ~8 points by year 5 gives ~63% dealer retail, plus ~2% for 35,000 km being low for the age = ~NT$810,000 dealer retail on the NT$1,299,000 list. From there: private = less 11% = NT$720,000; dealer_tradein = less 13% = NT$625,000. The car is still inside Toyota TW's 5-year/140,000 km extended warranty at this checkpoint, which supports the value."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor generation, not observed. RAISED from a previous NT$550,000 because a better, lower-mileage predecessor anchor was available and had been overlooked: 8891 lists a 2020 MY 4th-gen plug-in Prius at 68,000 km asking NT$668,000 dealer retail = 48.4% of its NT$1,379,000 list at 6 years, alongside the high-mileage 2020 MY at 111,000 km asking NT$519,000 = 37.6%. Our buyer at 49,000 km is below both, so the low-mileage anchor governs. Reading ~46-47% dealer retail for the 4th gen at 7 years and adding ~4 points for the 5th gen's stronger standing gives ~50% = ~NT$650,000 dealer retail. From there: private = less 12% = NT$570,000; dealer_tradein = less 14% = NT$490,000. The steeper fall between years 5 and 7 is deliberate: Toyota TW's warranty (4 years/120,000 km, extended free to 5 years/140,000 km on continuous on-time servicing — https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_guarantee.aspx) has lapsed by year 7, a well-known TW resale cliff, while the traction-battery cover reportedly still has a year left, which stops the drop being worse. The NT$1,379,000 list for the 2020 PHV is corroborated arithmetically by the verified 2021 article's statement that the PHV was cut NT$120,000 to NT$1,259,000."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no plug-in Prius of any generation is 10 years old in the Taiwan market, so there is genuinely no data point here and none has been invented. SOURCING CORRECTED: the previous version anchored this on 'plain 4th-gen Prius hybrid 2016 MY ~NT$495,000 and 2017 MY ~NT$452,000' attributed to FindCar (https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&b=72&m=1218). That page was re-fetched and contains NO 2016 or 2017 data at all — it is the Prius PHV page, listing 7 cars averaging NT$844,000 across model years 2022/2023/2024 only. That anchor was unsupported and has been removed. REPLACEMENT METHOD, using only verified listings: the 4th-gen plug-in Prius at 6 years with low mileage sits at 48.4% of list dealer retail (2020 MY, 68,000 km, NT$668,000 on a NT$1,379,000 list, https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/prius-phv and the phev listing page). Decaying that forward 4 years at the ~35-40% loss of remaining value typical for a Toyota hybrid over years 6-10 gives ~33% dealer retail; this figure already embeds plug-in market discount because the anchor car is itself a plug-in, so no second PHEV haircut was applied. A further ~3 points was deducted for the traction-battery capacity warranty (reportedly 8 years/160,000 km) having lapsed at year 8, which the 6-year anchor car still enjoyed, giving ~30% dealer retail = ~NT$390,000 on the NT$1,299,000 list, held at the top of the plausible band because 70,000 km is genuinely low for a 10-year-old car. From there: private = less 13% = NT$340,000; dealer_tradein = less 16% = NT$285,000 (dealer bids collapse on out-of-warranty plug-ins because they carry battery risk on their own floor plan). The resulting values are close to the previous version's, but they now rest on verified listings rather than on figures the cited page does not contain."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Toyota TW official T30 interval, every 6 months or 10,000 km whichever first (https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx, fetched and verified) — time-driven at this mileage, so 2 visits. Per-visit NT$3,000-5,000 from U-CAR (https://am.u-car.com.tw/am/article/40963), which returns HTTP 403 and is snippet-grade only; Toyota TW publishes no prices. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from high to medium: the interval is officially sourced but the cost is not, and a 'high' rating requires an official table or several real data points behind the number itself. Covers 0-1 year."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers years 1-3 only (not cumulative). 4 time-driven visits at the U-CAR per-visit range of NT$3,000-5,000 (https://am.u-car.com.tw/am/article/40963, snippet-grade, 403 on direct fetch), weighted to the middle because filter items fall in this window. No wear consumables due at 21,000 km — original tires and pads are nowhere near worn. Repairs assumed zero: the car is inside the 4-year/120,000 km warranty and on track for the free 5th-year extension (https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_guarantee.aspx, fetched and verified)."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers years 3-5 only. Servicing per U-CAR's NT$3,000-5,000 per visit (https://am.u-car.com.tw/am/article/40963, snippet-grade, 403 on direct fetch). Tires are the dominant line: at 7,000 km/year the tread will not be worn out, but TW workshops replace on age at 5-6 years because the rubber hardens and wet grip degrades — an age-triggered, not mileage-triggered, cost. NOTE: the 旗艦 tire size was attributed to the same U-CAR article in the previous version; that could not be verified because the URL is unreadable, so the size claim has been dropped and only the fitted set cost retained. The 鉑金 runs larger wheels and would cost meaningfully more here. Repairs assumed zero under the 5-year/140,000 km extension (https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_guarantee.aspx), which expires at the end of this window; note that extension is the 經濟版 tier, so zero is mildly optimistic."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers years 5-7 only, and is the FIRST window with no warranty backstop: cover ends at 5 years/140,000 km (https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_guarantee.aspx, fetched and verified), so a repair allowance is required rather than assumed away. RAISED from NT$41,000 to NT$51,000: the previous version carried only NT$12,000 (NT$6,000/yr) of out-of-warranty allowance for a 6-7 year old PHEV, which is unrealistically thin for a car with an on-board charger, HV cabling, an electric water pump and an inverter coolant circuit all outside warranty for the first time, and it also produced a period_cost that fell below the preceding window. NT$22,000 (NT$11,000/yr) is a more realistic expected value including one moderate item. Servicing per https://am.u-car.com.tw/am/article/40963 (snippet-grade). The late first pad change is a real PHEV characteristic, not an oversight. Traction battery excluded here on the reported 8-year/160,000 km >=70% capacity cover, which is NOT confirmed on Toyota TW's own page — see plan_notes."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers years 7-10 only. The expensive window for three compounding reasons: the second age-triggered tire set lands here, the 10-year coolant and spark-plug services fall due on the time schedule despite only 70,000 km, and the traction-battery capacity warranty (reportedly 8 years/160,000 km, unconfirmed on Toyota TW's own page) lapses at year 8, leaving the last two years fully exposed. IMPORTANT — deliberately NOT included: a full HV traction battery replacement, which for a 13.6 kWh pack would be NT$200,000+. That is a tail risk on a minority of cars, not an expected cost on the median car, and folding it into a point estimate would distort the comparison. Treat it as a separate risk line if the table needs one. Servicing rates per https://am.u-car.com.tw/am/article/40963 (snippet-grade, 403 on direct fetch), escalated modestly for parts inflation and the older-car item mix."}],"sources":[{"name":"Toyota Taiwan official showroom — Prius PHEV","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/PRIUS_PHEV/","note":"Fetched and verified independently by the fact-check. 旗艦 NT$1,299,000 / 鉑金 NT$1,379,000. Confirms list_price needs no change."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — 愛車養護 (owner maintenance)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx","note":"Fetched and verified. T30 interval every 6 months or 10,000 km whichever first; T50 odd years / T60 even years for larger services. Basis for the time-driven plan. Explicitly states pricing must be obtained from service centres — no per-visit prices are published."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — 新車保固 (owner guarantee)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_guarantee.aspx","note":"Fetched and verified by the fact-check; ADDED as the primary warranty source, replacing an unreadable U-CAR link. Factory 3 years/100,000 km plus 和泰 1 year/20,000 km = 4 years/120,000 km, with a free 5th-year 經濟版 extension to 5 years/140,000 km for continuous on-time 定保. The page does NOT state traction-battery capacity terms."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Toyota Prius PHEV (5th gen, current)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/prius-phev","note":"Re-fetched and re-read by the fact-check on 2026-08-12. Actual live listings: 2025 MY 14,000 km NT$1,168,000 (dealer); 2025 MY 12,000 km NT$1,099,000 (PRIVATE, 自售/車商勿擾); 2025 MY 50,000 km NT$988,000 (dealer); 2024 MY 11,500 km NT$1,088,000 (dealer); plus 2023 MY at ~70,000 km NT$868,000-898,000 and a 2020 MY at 68,000 km NT$668,000. The previous version of this record mis-stated two of these as 2024 MY dealer cars, including the NT$1,099,000 private listing — corrected here."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Toyota Prius PHV (4th gen, predecessor)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/prius-phv","note":"Re-fetched and re-read. Actual listings: 2023 MY 2,300 km NT$748,000; 2023 MY 70,000 km NT$660,000 (x2); 2023 MY 80,000 km NT$638,000; 2023 MY 87,000 km NT$638,000; 2022 MY 42,700 km NT$698,000; 2022 MY 72,000 km NT$688,000; 2022 MY 73,000 km NT$728,000; 2021 MY 46,000 km NT$695,000; 2020 MY 111,000 km NT$519,000. All dealer retail. The previous version cited the 2,300 km car as '23,000 km' — a 10x error, corrected here."},{"name":"ETtoday 車雲 — Prius PHEV run-out discount","url":"https://speed.ettoday.net/news/3214560","note":"Fetched and verified (published 2026-08-06). Six-figure (>NT$100,000) clearance discount on the 2026 MY, registration deadline 2026-08-12. Confirms list prices NT$1,299,000 / NT$1,379,000. This is the source of the deadline; it is why purchase.discounts was reduced to a durable NT$60,000."},{"name":"TVBS 汽車頻道 — 'Prius 史上最大優惠'","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/336498","note":"Fetched and verified (published 2026-08-07). Independent confirmation of the >NT$100,000 clearance discount and that a 2027 MY has been spotted in TW type-approval data. Correction: this article states NO end date — the 2026-08-12 deadline comes from ETtoday only, contrary to an earlier version of this record."},{"name":"CarStuff — 2021 Prius / Prius PHV Taiwan pricing","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/32500-tss-2-0-toyota-prius-prius-phv-2021-114-9-125-9.html","note":"Fetched and verified. Prius NT$1,149,000, Prius PHV NT$1,259,000 for 2021, with the PHV cut by NT$120,000 that year. Denominator for the year-5 retention ratio, and it arithmetically corroborates the NT$1,379,000 2020 PHV list used at year 7."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — Toyota Prius PHV used aggregate","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&b=72&m=1218","note":"Re-fetched by the fact-check. CORRECTION: this page is the Prius PHV listing only — 7 cars averaging NT$844,000, model years 2022/2023/2024 (2022 at NT$688,000-798,000). It contains NO 2016 or 2017 plain-Prius data. The previous version attributed '2016 MY ~NT$495,000 / 2017 MY ~NT$452,000' to this URL; those figures are not on the page and the year-10 anchor built on them was removed and rebuilt."},{"name":"U-CAR 汽車百科 — Prius PHV 定保 costs","url":"https://am.u-car.com.tw/am/article/40963","note":"NOT READABLE — returns HTTP 403 on direct fetch by the fact-check; snippet-grade only. Sole basis for the NT$3,000-5,000 per-visit figure that every maintenance number rests on. This is why the year-1 maintenance confidence was downgraded from high to medium, and why the tire-size attribution was dropped."},{"name":"U-CAR — Toyota TW warranty extension article","url":"https://m.u-car.com.tw/article/82741","note":"NOT READABLE — returns HTTP 403 on direct fetch. Its substance (5 years/140,000 km on on-time servicing) was independently confirmed on Toyota TW's own owner_guarantee page, which is now the cited source. Retained only for traceability."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — hybrid battery warranty 8 years / 160,000 km","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/43752","note":"UNVERIFIED — not fetched by the fact-check, and Toyota TW's own warranty page does not state traction-battery capacity terms. Drives the year 7 vs year 10 maintenance split and the year-10 value discount, so it is the single most load-bearing unconfirmed claim in this record. Should be checked against the warranty booklet."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 5th-gen Prius PHEV Taiwan launch","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/74661","note":"UNVERIFIED — not fetched by the fact-check. Cited for the TW launch date 2024-04-24 and launch pricing 旗艦 NT$1,295,000 / 鉑金 NT$1,375,000. The launch date is consistent with the absence of any genuine 5th-gen car older than ~2.3 years in the 8891 listings, which were verified."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 2026 model year Prius PHEV","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/82812","note":"UNVERIFIED — returned HTTP 403; snippet-grade only. Reports the 2026 MY adds a heated steering wheel and heated windscreen with pricing unchanged. The 2026 MY designation is independently confirmed by ETtoday ('26年式Prius PHEV')."},{"name":"5th-gen Prius PHEV EV range (TW spec) — search corroboration","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=%E7%AC%AC5%E4%BB%A3+Prius+PHEV+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E7%B4%94%E9%9B%BB+%E7%BA%8C%E8%88%AA+%E5%85%AC%E9%87%8C+%E6%97%97%E8%89%A6","note":"Multiple independent TW snippets confirm 純電行駛里程 97 km and the 13.6 kWh pack, validating the EV-range figure used in the notes. Discovery endpoint only — the WebSearch budget for this session was exhausted, so DuckDuckGo HTML via fetch was used, as the original researcher also did."}]},"toyota-bz4x":{"assumptions":"Checkpoints use 7,000 km/year (midpoint of 6,000-8,000), so assumed_km = 7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 — roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/yr. Two consequences. (1) Maintenance is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven: Toyota TW's published interval is 每半年或1萬公里 (every 6 months OR 10,000 km, re-verified on toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx), and at 7,000 km/yr the 6-month clock always fires first — 2 visits/year, ~20 visits over 10 years. The car never reaches any mileage cap: the 4-year/120,000 km warranty expires on time at ~28,000 km, and the 8-year/160,000 km battery capacity guarantee expires on time at ~56,000 km. (2) Resale is quoted against LOW-MILEAGE listings, which sell above the mileage-blind average — at 10 years this car has only 70,000 km, unusually low for its age in TW. The primary used comparable used below (2022 bZ4X, 14,000 km, 8891 id 4698298) is itself a low-mileage car, which is why it was chosen over the FindCar mileage-blind average. HOME CHARGER EXCLUDED: a 家用充電樁 install runs roughly NT$40,000-120,000 in Taiwan depending on whether the 社區 electrical capacity allows it and whether 台電 requires a separate meter. That is a real BEV ownership cost but it is NOT maintenance, so per the brief it is excluded from maintenance.checkpoints and noted only here. Also excluded by design: all tax (including the TW EV 牌照稅 exemption, which would otherwise favour this car), all insurance, and electricity cost (home AC vs public DC fast charging, 2-4x more per kWh in TW).","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"DEALER-RETAIL ADJUSTMENT APPLIED. Nearest observed comparable is a 2024 bZ4X (2 years old) with 4,881 km asking NT$968,000 at 明利汽車 台中 on 8891 — a 車商售價 (dealer retail asking), and a genuinely low-mileage car of the same profile as this buyer. Working back one year, a 1-year-old low-mileage car would carry roughly NT$1,040,000-1,060,000 dealer retail. private_sale_price = NT$920,000 is ~12% BELOW that dealer-retail level, per the 車商售價 > 自售價 > 車商收購價 chain. dealer_tradein_price = NT$810,000, a further 12% below private. Sanity: 71.3% of real_cost at year 1 — well below what a RAV4 Hybrid would hold in TW, which is correct because a BEV should not out-retain a comparable hybrid here, and because the bZ4X list has been cut three times since 2022."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"DEALER-RETAIL ADJUSTMENT APPLIED. Observed 3-year-old (2023) bZ4X dealer asking prices on 8891: NT$1,039,000 (台北, https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4233481.html, fetched directly) and NT$998,000 (明興汽車 台北, surfaced via search). BOTH ARE TREATED AS STALE OVER-ASKS, not clearing prices: at NT$1,039,000 a 3-year-old car is 81% of the NEW list of NT$1,280,000, which no buyer clears. The one CLEARED transaction in the whole dataset is the 4-year-old, 14,000 km car at NT$898,000 marked 已售出. Interpolating a realistic clearing dealer-retail level for a 3-year-old low-mileage car gives ~NT$865,000. private_sale_price = NT$760,000, ~12% below that; dealer_tradein_price = NT$655,000, ~14% below private (the gap widens with age because dealers discount out-of-fashion BEV stock harder). 58.9% of real_cost."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED ONE YEAR BEYOND THE OLDEST bZ4X IN TAIWAN. The model only arrived in 2022, so nothing older than 4 years exists to sample. Hard anchor at 4 years: 2022 bZ4X, 14,000 km, dealer asking NT$898,000, listing marked 已售出 so the price cleared (https://m.8891.com.tw/auto?id=4698298, fetched directly); a second 2022 car asks NT$838,000 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4228895.html, fetched directly); FindCar reports 13 units of 2022 averaging ~NT$850,000 asking. Dealer retail NT$898,000 -> private ~NT$790,000 after a 12% dealer-retail adjustment. TWO WAYS TO CARRY THAT FORWARD, and this checkpoint sits between them: (a) absolute — if today's new list holds at NT$1,280,000, a 4-year-old car is worth ~NT$790,000 private; (b) retention-ratio transfer — those 2022 cars cost NT$1,599,000 new, so NT$790,000 is 49% private retention at 4 years, and 49% of this car's real_cost NT$1,290,000 is ~NT$632,000. Method (a) ignores that the used market reprices whenever Toyota cuts the list again; method (b) over-punishes a car whose list has ALREADY been cut 23%. Midpoint at year 4 is ~NT$685,000, and this year-5 figure of NT$610,000 follows from that. dealer_tradein_price NT$510,000 is 16% below private. 47.3% of real_cost."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — NO 7-YEAR-OLD bZ4X EXISTS IN TAIWAN. Per the BEV instruction I did not borrow a combustion Toyota curve; the shape comes from the oldest BEVs actually trading here (Nissan Leaf and Tesla Model 3, both TW from 2019, plus Kona EV), which at 6-7 years trade in the low-30s percent of their original list even in good condition. Applied to real_cost NT$1,290,000 that gives ~NT$420,000-460,000 private. The structural support at this age is that Toyota's 8-year/160,000 km battery capacity guarantee (>=70%, https://www.toyota.com.tw/electric_guarantee.aspx) is still live — at 7,000 km/yr the mileage cap is irrelevant, so it is a pure time limit and the car still has one year of pack cover left. Whether that guarantee transfers to a second owner is NOT stated on the pages I could read, and it is the single biggest uncertainty under this number. private NT$450,000 (34.9% of real_cost); dealer_tradein_price NT$370,000, 18% below private — the gap widens further because dealers will not stock an out-of-warranty BEV without a deep buy-in discount. Not derived from any listing, hence low."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — NO 10-YEAR-OLD bZ4X EXISTS ANYWHERE IN TAIWAN. Leaned on the thin TW trade in genuinely old BEVs (early Leaf, early Model S, BMW i3), which at 9-10 years change hands at roughly 15-22% of original list regardless of condition, because the market prices pack-replacement risk rather than the car. THE DECISIVE STRUCTURAL FACT: Toyota's battery capacity guarantee expires at year 8 on time (8 years / 160,000 km; this car reaches only ~56,000 km), so from year 8 onward the car is valued against 74.7 kWh replacement-pack risk, not against its 70,000 km odometer. The low mileage helps less here than it would on a combustion car. private NT$270,000 = 20.9% of real_cost; dealer_tradein_price NT$210,000 is 22% below private, the widest gap in the table, because most dealers will simply refuse a 10-year-old out-of-warranty BEV and the trade-in becomes close to a wholesale/auction number. Not derived from any listing, hence low."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Toyota TW official schedule (https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx, fetched directly) confirms the 滿月 and 首半年（或1萬公里）checks are free, so only the 12-month visit is paid in this window. TIME-DRIVEN: at 7,000 km/yr the 6-month interval governs, not the 10,000 km one. EV content per https://www.toyota.com.tw/electric_guarantee.aspx — no oil, no spark plugs, so a T30-class EV visit is essentially inspection plus tire rotation. Confidence is MEDIUM, not high: the free-check policy and the interval are officially published, but no bZ4X-specific T30/T50/T60 price list exists, so the NT$1,800 per-visit figure is inferred from 8891's NT$15,000/100,000 km aggregate rather than read off a price table."},{"y":3,"source":"4 visits on the time-driven 6-month interval. EV content per https://www.toyota.com.tw/electric_guarantee.aspx: no engine oil, no spark plugs, adds battery-coolant checks — which is why four visits cost about what a single combustion major service would. Level cross-checked against 8891's bZ4X ownership-cost analysis (~NT$15,000 scheduled maintenance per 100,000 km vs ~NT$44,000 for a RAV4 2.0), implying ~NT$1,500 per routine visit; NT$1,800 used here for shop minimums. Entirely inside the 4yr/120,000 km warranty, so no repair-risk allowance. No published bZ4X T30/T50/T60 price list exists, hence medium not high."},{"y":5,"source":"4 visits plus the consumables that genuinely fall due. TIRES: at 7,000 km/yr the binding constraint is rubber AGE, not tread — the set goes at about 5 years regardless of the 35,000 km reading. BEV mass and torque mean they do not last longer than a combustion car's despite the low mileage, so this is a real cost, not a deferred one; a fitted set of 18-inch tires runs NT$20,000-28,000 in TW. 12V BATTERY: the bZ4X still carries a conventional 12V auxiliary battery and BEVs are hard on them — 3-5 year life is normal, so one replacement lands here. Still inside the 4yr/120,000 km warranty plus Toyota's free 5th-year/140,000 km extension for on-schedule maintenance (https://www.toyota.com.tw/electric_guarantee.aspx), so NO out-of-warranty repair allowance in this period. Consumable prices are TW market ranges, not a bZ4X-specific quote, hence medium."},{"y":7,"source":"FIRST PERIOD FULLY OUTSIDE COVER: the base 4yr/120,000 km warranty ended on time at year 4 and the free 5th-year extension ended at year 5, so years 5-7 carry no vehicle warranty at all (the 8yr/160,000 km battery capacity guarantee is still live — https://www.toyota.com.tw/electric_guarantee.aspx). THE BEV-SPECIFIC POINT: regen braking leaves the friction pads barely worn at 49,000 km — a combustion car would be on its second set — but the discs and calipers CORRODE from disuse in Taiwan's humidity, so the brake line is here for rust, not wear. period_cost is raised above the year-5 figure (the prior researcher had year 7 BELOW year 5, which is not credible for the first fully uncovered window) by carrying a larger probability-weighted allowance for first out-of-warranty failures. Fully extrapolated — no 7-year-old bZ4X exists in TW to sample receipts from — hence low."},{"y":10,"source":"THE BATTERY CAPACITY GUARANTEE EXPIRES AT YEAR 8 (8 years / 160,000 km at >=70%, https://www.toyota.com.tw/electric_guarantee.aspx) — and at 7,000 km/yr it expires on TIME, at only ~56,000 km. So this is the first window carrying genuine BEV financial risk and the cost jumps accordingly. 6 time-driven visits, second tire set on the age cycle. The NT$20,000 allowance is probability-weighted, not a certainty: the expensive out-of-warranty BEV items in this class are the on-board charger and the DC-DC converter, which run NT$60,000-100,000+ if they fail, so a fractional allowance is the honest way to carry them. Deliberately NOT zero — a BEV whose 10-year maintenance reads as free is wrong — and deliberately far below a combustion equivalent, which over the same 3 years would add spark plugs, timing components, multiple oil services and a transmission service that simply do not exist here. Fully extrapolated: no 10-year-old bZ4X exists anywhere in TW."}],"sources":[{"name":"Toyota Taiwan official showroom — bZ4X","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/bZ4X/","note":"FETCHED DIRECTLY (independent re-verification). Shows 128.0~128.0萬 建議售價, single grade, 74.7 kWh, 743 km NEDC, 227 ps, spec stamped for vehicles produced from 2025-10-01. Confirms list_price NT$1,280,000 — the prior researcher's figure was correct, no correction needed."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — 純電車保固 (BEV warranty)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/electric_guarantee.aspx","note":"FETCHED DIRECTLY. Vehicle warranty 4 years / 120,000 km (3yr/100,000 km factory + 1yr/20,000 km Hotai) including the battery system; battery CAPACITY guarantee 8 years / 160,000 km at >=70%; free 5th-year / 140,000 km extension if scheduled maintenance is on time at an authorised dealer; interval 每半年或1萬公里. The page does NOT state whether the battery guarantee transfers to a second owner — flagged as an open question. Drives the year-5, year-7 and year-10 maintenance and value logic."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — 愛車養護與保證 (scheduled maintenance)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx","note":"FETCHED DIRECTLY. Interval 每半年或1萬公里; T30 basic, T50 on odd years / 40,000 km, T60 on even years / 40,000 km; free 滿月檢查 and free 首半年（或1萬公里）檢查 for new-car owners. Establishes that at 7,000 km/yr the schedule is time-driven and that year 1 is almost entirely free."},{"name":"ETtoday 車雲 — 新 bZ4X 台灣上市 128 萬、改款降 8 萬","url":"https://speed.ettoday.net/news/3056925","note":"FETCHED DIRECTLY. Facelift on sale 2025-10-27 at NT$1,280,000, an NT$80,000 cut versus the previous model; battery 74.7 kWh, range 626 -> 743 km NEDC, output 204 -> 227 ps, CCS1 to 160 kW (80% in 28 min); Taiwan gets single-motor FWD only; Hotai targets 4,000+ units/year. Primary evidence for the official price-cut point."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — 2022 bZ4X, 14,000 km, 信義汽車 台中","url":"https://m.8891.com.tw/auto?id=4698298","note":"FETCHED DIRECTLY (re-verified). Dealer asking NT$898,000 on a genuinely low-mileage 4-year-old car (1.4萬公里), listing marked 已售出 so the price CLEARED. The single strongest comparable in this record and the only confirmed transaction — it is a 車商售價 and was adjusted down 12% before use as a private-sale basis."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — 2022 bZ4X, 小顧車庫 新北","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4228895.html","note":"FETCHED DIRECTLY (re-verified). Dealer asking NT$838,000 for a 2022 car; mileage not shown on the page. Lower bound of the 4-year-old dealer-asking band alongside the NT$898,000 car."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — 2023 bZ4X, 台北市","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4233481.html","note":"FETCHED DIRECTLY (re-verified; the prior researcher had NOT fetched this). Dealer asking NT$1,039,000, mileage not shown. Treated as a STALE OVER-ASK, not a clearing price: at 81% of the NT$1,280,000 new list, a 3-year-old car will not clear there. Used only as an upper bound on the 3-year dealer-asking band."},{"name":"8891 / FindCar used bZ4X inventory — aggregate via search-result snippets","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=8891+bZ4X+2024+%E4%BA%8C%E6%89%8B%E8%BB%8A+%E8%90%AC+%E9%87%8C%E7%A8%8B","note":"SEARCH-RESULT PAGE FETCHED DIRECTLY (the underlying listing pages are JS-rendered and returned HTTP 500 to direct fetch). Yielded the 2-year-old comparable — 2024 bZ4X, 4,881 km, NT$968,000 dealer asking, 明利汽車 台中 — plus a 2023 car at NT$998,000 (明興汽車 台北), a 2022 outlier at NT$1,188,000 台北, and FindCar aggregates of 13 units of 2022 averaging ~NT$850,000 asking and 24 units overall averaging ~NT$920,000. Snippet-level evidence, so the year-1 and year-3 checkpoints built on it are marked medium, not high."},{"name":"8891 bZ4X ownership-cost analysis — maintenance level, via search-result snippets","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=bZ4X+%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A+%E8%B2%BB%E7%94%A8+mobile01+%E5%85%83","note":"SEARCH-RESULT PAGE FETCHED DIRECTLY. Reports roughly NT$15,000 of accumulated scheduled maintenance over 100,000 km for the bZ4X versus roughly NT$44,000 for a RAV4 2.0, a 6-month service interval, and T30/T50/T60 package naming. This replaced the prior researcher's single owner-club receipt log (NT$35,388 over 200,000 km) as the per-visit anchor; both imply the same NT$1,500-2,000 per routine visit."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — bZ4X 售價歷史","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/86017","note":"NOT FETCHED — returns HTTP 403 to automated fetch (re-confirmed). Search-engine summaries of this page are the source for the pre-facelift price chain (2022 launch NT$1,599,000, later NT$1,670,000, 2025MY NT$1,360,000). Flagged as secondary, not verified; only the final NT$1,280,000 step is directly confirmed."},{"name":"TVBS 車頻道 — bZ4X 價格報導","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/240020","note":"NOT FETCHED DIRECTLY. Second search-surfaced corroboration of the same pre-facelift price chain. Included only for traceability of where NT$1,599,000 / NT$1,670,000 / NT$1,360,000 came from."}]},"toyota-urban-cruiser":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, roughly half the TW average of 12,000-15,000. Every checkpoint uses 7,000 x years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). Two consequences run through every number. First, Toyota TW's BEV service trigger is every 6 months OR 10,000 km, whichever comes first (verified on the official EV warranty page: 每半年或1萬公里(先到者為準)回廠定期保養) - at 7,000 km/year the km trigger is NEVER reached, so maintenance is purely time-driven at 2 visits a year for all 10 years, about 20 visits total. Second, resale is quoted against low-mileage listings, with an explicit premium over the mileage-blind average that grows from ~3% at year 1 to ~8% at year 10; low cycling is worth more on a BEV (it directly supports battery state-of-health) than on a combustion car, and that premium widens as the car ages because SOH becomes the dominant price variable. HOME CHARGER EXCLUDED: a wallbox plus dedicated circuit and Taipower meter runs roughly NT$40,000-80,000 in TW, more when an apartment management committee has to approve the installation. That is a genuine ownership cost but it is not maintenance, so it appears in no figure here. Energy/charging cost, licence tax and insurance are also out of scope by design. FACT-CHECK CORRECTION: the prior draft stated that keeping every 6-month visit on time earns the free 5th-year extended warranty. The official page actually requires SIX consecutive on-time services within the first four years, not eight. The corrected wording is used in maintenance.plan_notes; it does not change any cost figure.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - no 1-year resale data can exist yet, since TW deliveries only began Feb 2026 and the oldest car on the road is about six months old. HONESTY FLAG ADDED BY FACT-CHECK: the prior draft asserted 'dealer RETAIL asking for a 1-year mainstream BEV runs about 78-80% of list' as though it were an established market fact. It carries NO citation and I could not verify it, so it is restated here as an explicit unsourced assumption rather than a finding. On that assumption dealer retail is ~NT$1,010,000; cut ~9% to private sale (NT$920,000), then a further ~12% to dealer trade-in (NT$810,000). Includes a small +3% low-mileage adjustment - 7,000 km is well under the ~13,000 km a 1-year TW car normally shows - quoted against low-km listings rather than the mileage-blind average. Sanity check that does hold: at NT$920,000 a 1-year-old car sits 26% below list, versus roughly 12-15% for a 1-year Toyota hybrid, so the BEV penalty is present and the car does not out-retain a hybrid. Confidence low: pure extrapolation, zero observed transactions, and the retention basis is unsourced."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED medium->low BY FACT-CHECK. The prior draft's primary anchor was a 2023 bZ4X asking NT$998,000 at https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4205378.html . I fetched that URL and it returns HTTP 410 Gone; the researcher also admitted never opening it (price read from a search-result card). That figure is therefore UNVERIFIED and is no longer relied on. Re-derived instead from the one bZ4X listing I could verify directly: a 2022 bZ4X (4 years old) asking NT$838,000 DEALER RETAIL in New Taipei (https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4228895.html, fetched 2026-08-12, dealer 小顧車庫). That single point brackets rather than pins the answer, because the denominator is genuinely ambiguous: against the bZ4X's NT$1,599,000 launch list it is 52.4% at 4 years (=> ~NT$660,000 private for this car at year 3), but against the bZ4X's CURRENT NT$1,280,000 list it is 65.5% (=> ~NT$810,000 private at year 3). The current-list basis is the more relevant one for the Urban Cruiser, which launched at NT$1,270,000 - already at the post-cut level - and so has far less headroom to be repriced the way the bZ4X was. NT$755,000 is a mid-blend of that NT$660,000-810,000 bracket, i.e. dealer-retail equivalent ~NT$830,000 cut ~9% to private, then a further ~13% to trade-in. Includes ~+5% low-mileage premium (21,000 km vs ~39,000 km typical), quoted against low-km listings. Low confidence: one verified TW listing, of a larger and different model, with a genuinely wide denominator bracket."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Two anchors, both re-verified by the fact-checker. (a) VERIFIED: a 2022 Toyota bZ4X (4 years old) asking NT$838,000 DEALER RETAIL on 8891 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4228895.html, fetched 2026-08-12). CAVEAT ADDED BY FACT-CHECK: the prior draft described a 2022 band of NT$838,000-1,188,000 with a 'median about 59%' - only the NT$838,000 end is verified; the upper end and the median are unverified and are not relied on here. Projecting the verified point one more year and cutting ~9% to private sale lands near 48% of list. (b) VERIFIED: Liberty Times reporting an international residual study (https://ec.ltn.com.tw/article/breakingnews/4544856, fetched 2026-08-12) - BEVs depreciate 49.1% over 5 years against a 38.8% all-market average and a 37.4% HYBRID average, i.e. ~50.9% retention for a BEV versus ~62.6% for a hybrid. That verified hybrid-vs-BEV gap is the direct evidence that this BEV should sit well under a Toyota hybrid, and it does. I use 48.4% of list for private sale - slightly under the study because TW BEVs carry extra drag (repeated official price cuts, a thin used-BEV buyer pool) - with ~+6% added back for low mileage (35,000 km vs ~65,000 km typical), quoted against low-km listings. Dealer retail equivalent ~NT$675,000; trade-in set ~15% below private. Medium confidence: one verified TW listing plus one solid verified secondary source, but the study is international, not TW-specific."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - no 7-year data can exist for this car, which has been on sale since Feb 2026. Per the BEV rule I leaned on the oldest BEVs actually trading in TW rather than a combustion analogue. VERIFIED by fact-check: Tesla Model 3 pre-Highland (2018-2023) RWD shows a NT$948,000 median across 102 cars (https://car-watcher.com/guide/tesla-model-3-taiwan-price-2026.html, fetched 2026-08-12, TW listing data to June 2026). The page states these are 台灣現車掛牌中位數 - current listing medians, i.e. dealer asking, not private sales - and disclaims them as reference only. Liberty Times separately names Model 3 as the best-retaining EV, so this is a CEILING, not a fair proxy for a mainstream small BEV. Nissan Leaf and Kona EV are the honest comparators at this age and trade far weaker, but no firm TW listings for either could be retrieved, which remains the main weakness. I therefore set ~35% of list on private sale: below the Model 3 curve, above a Leaf. Real support at this age is that Toyota's 8-year/160,000 km battery capacity warranty to 70% is STILL LIVE and transfers - verified directly on https://www.toyota.com.tw/electric_guarantee.aspx - which is worth genuine money to a buyer. Dealer retail equivalent ~NT$485,000; trade-in ~15% below private. Includes ~+7% low-mileage premium (49,000 km vs ~91,000 km typical), quoted against low-km listings."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, and the weakest point in this model - treat as an order of magnitude, not a forecast. No 10-year market exists for a non-Tesla BEV in TW at any meaningful volume. The retention ratio is taken from the oldest BEVs actually changing hands here (2016-era Nissan Leaf, early Kona EV), which trade around a fifth of their original list once the pack is out of warranty, and applied to this car's list price; I could not retrieve individual TW listings for those cars, so the ratio itself is the soft part and this stays low confidence. The cliff is deliberate and model-specific, not generic decay: Toyota's 8-year/160,000 km capacity warranty EXPIRES at year 8 - verified directly on https://www.toyota.com.tw/electric_guarantee.aspx - so a year-10 buyer carries full pack risk on a car whose replacement pack costs more than the car is worth. Offsetting that, 70,000 km at 10 years is genuinely low cycling and supports materially better state-of-health, worth ~+8% here - quoted against low-km listings, and worth more at this age than at any earlier checkpoint. Dealer retail equivalent ~NT$265,000; trade-in ~15% below private, and in practice many TW dealers simply decline a 10-year BEV."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"CORRECTED BY FACT-CHECK: raised from NT$3,500 to NT$5,000. The prior draft's own arithmetic did not close - it costed 2 visits at NT$1,500-2,000 each, which consumes the entire NT$3,500, leaving nothing for the cabin air filter, tire rotation and wiper blades it lists as major items. Rebuilt as ~NT$3,500 for the two visits plus ~NT$1,000 cabin filter and ~NT$500 wipers, with tire rotation folded into the visit. Interval verified: 6 months / 10,000 km whichever first (https://www.toyota.com.tw/electric_guarantee.aspx). DDCar's headline corroborates the same half-yearly return for Toyota's TW BEVs (https://www.ddcar.com.tw/article/28518) but its body is JS-rendered and did not extract, so it confirms the interval only, not any price. Fully inside the 4-year/120,000 km warranty, and a BEV visit at this stage is inspection plus a filter, with no oil service to pay for. Per-visit cost remains inferred from TW Toyota inspection-only pricing, not from an owner receipt."},{"y":3,"source":"Same official 6-month schedule, verified on https://www.toyota.com.tw/electric_guarantee.aspx . Brake fluid on the standard 2-year / 40,000 km rule, which at this mileage is triggered by TIME not km. Still inside the 4-year/120,000 km warranty so no repair contingency is included. Roughly NT$8,000 of visits plus ~NT$2,200 brake fluid plus ~NT$2,800 of filters, wipers and alignment. No tires yet - the original set is only 3 years old and 21,000 km, well short of both the age and wear thresholds. Per-visit cost is inferred, not receipted."},{"y":5,"source":"Tires dominate this window. The car runs 18-inch wheels (confirmed by the fact-checker on https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/URBAN_CRUISER/); EV-rated 18-inch tires in TW run NT$5,000-6,000 each fitted, so ~NT$22,000 for four. At 35,000 km these are nowhere near worn out even allowing for faster BEV wear - they are replaced because rubber ages out at 5-6 years, which is the direct consequence of this buyer's low mileage. 12V battery ~NT$5,000 (BEVs are hard on the 12V because it cycles constantly for the DC-DC and control systems). Plus ~NT$9,000 of visits, ~NT$2,200 brake fluid, ~NT$2,000 filters/wipers. No repair contingency: the complimentary 5th-year/140,000 km extended warranty earned by six consecutive on-time services still covers this entire window (verified on the official EV warranty page)."},{"y":7,"source":"First period outside all warranty - the extended cover expires at year 5, so from here the owner carries repair risk. The brake line is the BEV-specific item and is NOT ordinary wear: at 49,000 km with heavy regen the friction material is barely used, but rear discs corrode and calipers seize precisely because they are underused, a well-documented BEV pattern in TW's humid climate. Budgeted ~NT$12,000 for pads, rear discs and caliper service. Battery/inverter coolant ~NT$5,000 on its long interval. ~NT$8,000 contingency for the first uncovered stretch, sized for the common BEV items (heat pump, DC-DC converter, charging port) rather than the pack. Plus ~NT$10,000 visits, ~NT$2,400 brake fluid, ~NT$2,500 filters/wipers. Confidence low: no TW owner receipts exist for a 7-year Toyota BEV, so the contingency is a reasoned allowance, not an observed figure."},{"y":10,"source":"Longest window (3 years) and the only one with no warranty of any kind behind it - the 8-year/160,000 km battery capacity warranty expires partway through, at year 8 (verified on https://www.toyota.com.tw/electric_guarantee.aspx). Second tire set ~NT$24,000, again age-driven not wear-driven at 70,000 km. Suspension ~NT$15,000: shocks and bushings wear harder on a BEV because of the extra ~300 kg of pack. HV contingency ~NT$15,000 is deliberately sized for module-level, BMS and ancillary faults, NOT a full pack replacement - a pack swap costs more than the car's NT$240,000 private-sale value at this age, so the rational outcome there is to scrap rather than repair, and folding a pack price in would badly overstate expected cost. Plus ~NT$16,000 visits, ~NT$4,800 brake fluid, ~NT$8,000 second brake service (disc corrosion recurs), ~NT$5,000 second 12V battery, ~NT$3,500 filters/wipers. Confidence low: entirely forward-looking, no TW BEV of this model line has reached 10 years."}],"sources":[{"name":"Toyota Taiwan - Urban Cruiser showroom (official)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/URBAN_CRUISER/","note":"VERIFIED by fact-checker 2026-08-12. Primary price verification: NT$1,270,000, single grade, BEV, 61.1 kWh, NEDC 483 km, 174 ps, 18-inch alloy wheels. Researcher's price confirmed at 0% deviation. Also the source for the 18-inch wheel size used to size tire cost at years 5 and 10."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan - Urban Cruiser specification page (official)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/URBAN_CRUISER/spec","note":"VERIFIED by fact-checker 2026-08-12. Second independent confirmation of 127萬 (NT$1,270,000), 61.1 kWh, 483 km NEDC, 174 ps. Note: this page did NOT return wheel/tire size or kerb weight, contrary to the prior draft's claim that it was the source for 18-inch wheels - that spec came from the showroom page instead. Citation corrected."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan - bZ4X showroom, current list price (official)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/BZ4X/","note":"ADDED BY FACT-CHECKER. The prior draft asserted the bZ4X's current NT$1,280,000 list price and the 'only NT$10,000 above the Urban Cruiser' positioning argument with no URL behind it. Fetched 2026-08-12: the page shows bZ4X at 128.0萬 (NT$1,280,000). Combined with the verified NT$1,599,000 launch price this documents a ~NT$319,000 / ~20% official cut, the key BEV depreciation mechanism in this record, and confirms the NT$10,000 gap."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan - EV warranty and maintenance terms (official)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/electric_guarantee.aspx","note":"VERIFIED by fact-checker 2026-08-12; the single most important maintenance source, and it checks out in full. 每半年或1萬公里(先到者為準) service interval; new-vehicle warranty 4 years/120,000 km; drive battery capacity warranty 8 years/160,000 km to 70%. ONE CORRECTION: the complimentary 5th-year/140,000 km extended warranty requires SIX consecutive on-time services within the first four years, not 'every 6-month visit' (which would be eight) as the prior draft stated."},{"name":"DDCar - Toyota bZ4X maintenance and extended-warranty plan","url":"https://www.ddcar.com.tw/article/28518","note":"Fetched 2026-08-12: page resolves but the body is JS-rendered and returned only footer/navigation. The headline does corroborate the half-yearly return interval and the extra-year warranty for on-time servicing. Used as confirmation of the official page only - no figure is drawn from it."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - used Toyota bZ4X listing, 2022 model","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4228895.html","note":"VERIFIED by fact-checker 2026-08-12 - the only used-car listing in this record that could be opened and confirmed. 2022 Toyota bZ4X (4 years old), NT$838,000 DEALER RETAIL asking, New Taipei City, dealer 小顧車庫. This is now the primary anchor for BOTH the year-3 and year-5 checkpoints. Cut ~9% to reach private sale before use."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - used Toyota bZ4X listing, 2023 model (DEAD LINK - NOT USED)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4205378.html","note":"FAILED VERIFICATION. The prior draft's primary year-3 anchor (2023 bZ4X asking NT$998,000). Fetched 2026-08-12: returns HTTP 410 Gone. The researcher also admitted never opening it, reading the price off a search-result card. The NT$998,000 figure is therefore unverified and has been REMOVED from the year-3 derivation, which was re-anchored on the verified 2022 listing and downgraded in confidence. Retained here only to record that it was checked and rejected."},{"name":"INSIDE - Toyota bZ4X Taiwan launch price","url":"https://www.inside.com.tw/article/27700-toyota-bz4x-taiwan","note":"VERIFIED by fact-checker 2026-08-12. Article dated 2022-05-17: 和泰汽車 launched the bZ4X as 單一規格前驅 2WD、單一售價 159.9 萬元 - NT$1,599,000. This is the denominator for every bZ4X retention ratio used here."},{"name":"Car Watcher - Tesla Model 3 Taiwan used pricing 2026","url":"https://car-watcher.com/guide/tesla-model-3-taiwan-price-2026.html","note":"VERIFIED by fact-checker 2026-08-12. Pre-Highland 2018-2023 RWD median NT$948,000 across 102 cars, data to June 2026. The page states these are 台灣現車掛牌中位數 (current listing medians, i.e. dealer asking) and disclaims them as 行情為參考、非交易建議. Used for the year-7 extrapolation as an explicit CEILING, not a proxy."},{"name":"Liberty Times - 5-year EV depreciation study","url":"https://ec.ltn.com.tw/article/breakingnews/4544856","note":"VERIFIED by fact-checker 2026-08-12. Article dated 2024-01-08: BEVs depreciate 49.1% over 5 years, all-market average 38.8%, HYBRIDS 37.4%, trucks 34.8%; Model 3 named the best-retaining EV. The verified BEV-vs-hybrid gap (50.9% vs 62.6% retention) is the direct evidence that this BEV must sit well below a Toyota hybrid. CAVEAT: international study of ~1.1M vehicles, not Taiwan-specific - a sanity check, not a primary TW source."},{"name":"8891 - private listing fee schedule","url":"https://www.8891.com.tw/help-b_1_1.html","note":"VERIFIED by fact-checker 2026-08-12, and it CONTRADICTED the prior draft twice. (1) It shows 寄售 listings are free for 60 days and a paid 出售汽車 listing is 400 points / 60 days (priority bump 400-1000 points), so the NT$2,500 刊登費 was overstated - reduced to NT$800. (2) The page contains NOTHING about 過戶 / title transfer, so the prior draft's citation of it for 'title-transfer paperwork under NT$2,000' was misattributed and has been removed."}]},"toyota-sienna-hybrid":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr; all checkpoints use the 7,000 km/yr midpoint (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km), roughly half the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/yr. Two consequences are baked into the numbers. (1) Servicing is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven — but the time trigger is EVERY SIX MONTHS, not annual. Toyota Taiwan's official table reads 「車齡：每半年實施 或 里程數：1萬、3萬、5萬等單數萬公里實施（SIENNA車型為8千公里起每1.6萬公里實施）」: the SIENNA exception changes only the MILEAGE thresholds (8,000 km then every 16,000 km), it does NOT relax the 每半年 age trigger. At 7,000 km/yr the mileage trigger never fires first, so the owner makes TWO workshop visits per year for all ten years — a T30 at the six-month point plus a T50 (odd years) or T60 (even years) at the twelve-month point. (2) Resale is quoted from LOW-MILEAGE listings, which sell above the mileage-blind average: at 5 years this car shows 35,000 km against the 85,000-100,000 km of the 2021-2022 Siennas actually listed in Taiwan today. Excluded by design: 牌照稅 / 燃料稅 and all insurance (強制險 + 任意險). No charger cost applies — this is a self-charging hybrid with no plug. Fuel is not modelled (official 18.7 km/L for 旗艦). ARTF/import duty is already inside the official list price.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWNWARD by this review. The prior researcher set a 1-year dealer-retail asking level of 2,270,000 (95% of list), which is economically impossible: a new 旗艦 transacts at about 2,350,000 (2,390,000 list less a ~40,000 discount), so a dealer asking 2,270,000 for a 1-year-old car would be undercutting new by only 3.4% with dealer margin still inside that price — nobody buys it. It also contradicted the same record's own statement that Sienna supply has normalised by 2026. I reset the 1-year dealer-retail asking to ~2,180,000 (91% of list), which still sits at the very top of the Taiwan band and is supported by two real listings read on SUM 汽車網 (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TOYOTA/SIENNA?v=4): a 2025 Sienna 2.5 hybrid XSE AWD at 47,000 km asking 2,768,000 (grey import, not used as a direct anchor because its original cost was far above 2,390,000), and, on https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TOYOTA/ALPHARD?v=4, a 2023 Alphard 2.5 hybrid at 49,107 km still asking 2,688,000 — evidence that Taiwan MPV retention really is extreme. The 7,000 km odometer versus the ~15,000 km a 1-year-old normally shows is what holds it at 91% rather than the more typical 85%. ADJUSTMENTS APPLIED: dealer retail 2,180,000 → private sale −10% = 1,962,000, rounded to 1,960,000; private → dealer trade-in a further −13% = 1,705,000. Sanity check on the corrected figure: 2,350,000 paid → 1,960,000 private at one year is a 16.6% first-year loss, which is a normal Taiwan first year; the prior 2,040,000 implied only 13.2% and made year one shallower than every later year."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Anchored on a real listing I re-read myself on SUM 汽車網 (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TOYOTA/SIENNA?v=4): a 2022 Sienna 2.5 hybrid, 8-seat, at 100,602 km asking 1,780,000 車商售價 — a 4-year-old car carrying 4.8x our 3-year mileage. Adjusting up for one year less age and for 21,000 km versus 100,602 km gives a 3-year dealer-retail asking level of ~1,960,000 (82% of list). ADJUSTMENTS APPLIED: dealer retail 1,960,000 → private sale −10% = 1,764,000, rounded to 1,760,000; private → dealer trade-in a further −13% = 1,531,000, rounded to 1,530,000. Caveat carried forward: the comparator is a US-spec grey import, so its original Taiwan cost was well above 2,390,000 and the ratio is directional only."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Anchored on a real listing I re-read myself on SUM 汽車網 (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TOYOTA/SIENNA?v=4): a 2021 Sienna 2.5 hybrid XSE AWD at 85,274 km asking 1,680,000 車商售價. Our car at the same age carries 35,000 km, 41% of that, so I held the dealer-retail asking level at ~1,675,000 even though the comparator is a pricier AWD spec — the low-mileage premium roughly cancels the spec premium, and the comparator's grey-import status roughly cancels our car's 和泰 service-record premium. That is 70% of list. ADJUSTMENTS APPLIED: dealer retail 1,675,000 → private sale −10% = 1,507,500, rounded to 1,505,000; private → dealer trade-in a further −13% = 1,309,000, rounded to 1,310,000."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — there is no genuine 7-year data for this car. The current-generation (XL40) Sienna only reached Taiwan in 2021-2022 and the oldest examples on the market are 5 years old; the direct predecessor (XL30) was never sold through 和泰, so every XL30 here is a 外匯車 with no official 建議售價 and no ratio can be formed from its own list price. I therefore used the closest officially-imported Toyota MPV at that age. On SUM 汽車網 (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TOYOTA/ALPHARD?v=4) a 2019 Alphard 3.5 at 83,070 km asks 1,698,000 against its ~2,598,000 original list = 65% dealer-asking retention at 7 years, on a car with 1.7x our mileage. Sienna is a more mass-market nameplate than the status-driven Alphard, so I discounted that to 59% dealer-asking retention = ~1,410,000 asking on this car's 2,390,000 list. ADJUSTMENTS APPLIED: dealer retail 1,410,000 → private sale −10% = 1,269,000, rounded to 1,270,000; private → dealer trade-in a further −14% = 1,092,000, rounded to 1,090,000. The HV battery is still inside its 8-year / 160,000 km warranty at this checkpoint, which supports the value."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no genuine 10-year data exists for this generation, and as at the 7-year checkpoint the XL30 predecessor was grey-import-only in Taiwan with no official list price to form a ratio against. I used two officially-imported Toyota MPV comparators, both listings re-read by me. (1) Toyota Previa, SUM 汽車網 (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TOYOTA/PREVIA?v=4): a 2016 2.4 at 100,000 km asking 688,000 against a ~1,550,000 original 旗艦 list = 44% dealer-asking retention at 10 years — but Previa was an end-of-life nameplate discontinued in Taiwan, so it depreciated harder than Sienna should. (2) Toyota Alphard, SUM 汽車網 (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TOYOTA/ALPHARD?v=4): a 2017 3.5 at only 55,009 km asking 1,298,000 against ~2,588,000 list = 50% at 9 years. I placed Sienna between them at 45% dealer-asking retention = ~1,076,000 asking. ADJUSTMENTS APPLIED: dealer retail 1,076,000 → private sale −10% = 968,000, rounded to 965,000; private → dealer trade-in a further −15% = 820,000, the spread widening at this age because dealers price in HV-battery risk. The HV battery is OUT of its 8-year warranty from year 8, which is the main downside risk; the very low 70,000 km is the main upside."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Intervals and the free-check entitlement quoted directly from Toyota Taiwan's official maintenance page (https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx): T30 每半年, T50 每單數年, SIENNA mileage exception 8千公里起每1.6萬公里, and 「新車車主可享滿月免費檢查服務及首半年（或1萬公里）免費檢查服務」. Costs are 和泰 dealer-rate estimates for a 2.5L imported hybrid MPV — Toyota TW does not publish per-model service pricing, so these are estimates, not quoted prices."},{"y":3,"source":"Four visits over two years follows directly from the 每半年 T30 trigger plus the alternating T50 (odd year) / T60 (even year) annual service on Toyota Taiwan's official table (https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx). Brake fluid 每2年/每4萬公里 and air filter 車齡為雙數年 are from the same table and sit inside the even-year T60 rather than being separate charges. Costs are 和泰 dealer-rate estimates; no published per-model price table exists."},{"y":5,"source":"Visit count from the 每半年 T30 plus alternating T50/T60 structure on https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx. Tire and 12V battery timing are driven by the buyer's 7,000 km/yr profile — both are replaced on age, not wear. 旗艦 runs 17-inch wheels per https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/SIENNA/price.aspx. Parts pricing is Taiwan market rate for MPV tires and AGM batteries, estimated rather than quoted."},{"y":7,"source":"Visit count from the 每半年 T30 plus alternating T50/T60 structure, and the spark-plug (長效型：每10萬公里) and coolant (首次16萬公里更換) exclusions, are all read directly off https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx. Warranty boundaries from https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/SIENNA/price.aspx (4yr/120,000km vehicle, 8yr/160,000km HV battery). The repair-risk allowance is my own judgement for a 7-year-old imported MPV, not a sourced figure. Note this period is lower than year 5 only because year 5 carries the first tire set."},{"y":10,"source":"Six visits over three years follows from the 每半年 T30 plus alternating T50/T60 annual service on https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx; the spark-plug and coolant exclusions are from the same table; the HV battery warranty term is from https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/SIENNA/price.aspx. Consumable and wear-item costs are Taiwan market estimates for a large imported MPV, and the HV battery allowance is an explicit risk-weighted judgement rather than a quoted price. This is the least certain line in the record."}],"sources":[{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — SIENNA showroom (official)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/SIENNA/","note":"Fetched and read by me. Confirms 旗艦 (Premier) NT$2,390,000 and 鉑金 (Platinum) NT$2,960,000, both HYBRID 2,487cc, described as 正七人座豪華MPV. The prior researcher's list price is correct."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — SIENNA price / spec page (official)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/SIENNA/price.aspx","note":"Fetched and read by me. Second confirmation of NT$2,390,000, plus 旗艦 18.7 km/L on 17-inch alloys versus 鉑金 17.7 km/L on 20-inch, and the warranty terms used throughout: 「新車保證為4年或12萬公里」, HYBRID 系統 5年/12萬公里, HYBRID 電池 8年/16萬公里."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — 愛車養護與保證 scheduled maintenance table (official)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx","note":"The decisive maintenance source, fetched and read in full by me. Exact wording: 「T30 — 車齡：每半年實施 或 里程數：1萬、3萬、5萬等單數萬公里實施（SIENNA車型為8千公里起每1.6萬公里實施）」, 「T50 — 每單數年實施」, 「T60 — 每雙數年實施」. The SIENNA exception is MILEAGE-only; the 每半年 age trigger stands, which is what forces two visits a year at this usage. Also: brake fluid 每2年/每4萬公里, air filter 車齡為雙數年, engine coolant 首次16萬公里更換後續每8萬公里, spark plugs 長效型每10萬公里, and 「新車車主可享滿月免費檢查服務及首半年（或1萬公里）免費檢查服務」. T30/T50/T60 are prepaid dealer packages, not free."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — brand news / lineup index (official)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/news.aspx","note":"Fetched by me as a third price cross-check. Lists SIENNA at 「$239.0~296.0萬 HYBRID」. No dated Taiwan launch or price-adjustment release for SIENNA was available on this page."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — used Toyota Sienna listings (TW)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TOYOTA/SIENNA?v=4","note":"20 live listings read directly by me, confirming the prior researcher's anchors are real: 2021 hybrid XSE AWD 85,274 km asking 1,680,000; 2022 hybrid 8-seat 100,602 km asking 1,780,000; 2025 hybrid XSE AWD 47,000 km asking 2,768,000. Every price on this site is 車商售價 (dealer retail asking) — I confirmed the v=1 view is also dealer inventory, so SUM offers no private-seller prices at all and the dealer-to-private adjustment has to be modelled."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — used Toyota Alphard listings (TW)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TOYOTA/ALPHARD?v=4","note":"18 listings read directly by me. Comparator for the 1-, 7- and 10-year work: 2023 2.5 hybrid @ 49,107 km asking 2,688,000 and @ 51,807 km asking 2,488,000 (evidence for extreme near-new TW MPV retention), 2019 3.5 @ 83,070 km asking 1,698,000, 2017 3.5 @ 55,009 km asking 1,298,000, 2021 2.5 hybrid @ 73,811 km asking 2,020,000."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — used Toyota Previa listings (TW)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TOYOTA/PREVIA?v=4","note":"41 listings read directly by me; the officially-imported Toyota MPV that preceded Sienna in 和泰's lineup. Key point confirmed: 2016 2.4 @ 100,000 km asking 688,000, i.e. ~44% dealer-asking retention at 10 years. Nearby 2.4 listings run 658,000-758,000 at 80,000-150,000 km, so the anchor is not an outlier."}]},"toyota-alphard-hybrid":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year; all checkpoints use the 7,000 km/year midpoint (7k / 21k / 35k / 49k / 70k), roughly half the Taiwan average. That matters twice over. (1) Servicing is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven: Toyota Taiwan's official schedule (verified 2026-08-12) is T30 every 6 months OR 10,000 km, T50 every ODD year OR every 40,000 km from 20,000 km, T60 every EVEN year OR every 40,000 km from 40,000 km. At 7,000 km/yr the calendar always fires first, so the owner pays the full T30/T50/T60 cadence while never reaching a single mileage trigger in ten years (70,000 km total). (2) Consumables become age-limited rather than wear-limited: tires are replaced because rubber hardens (~5-6 years) with tread to spare, and the 12V auxiliary battery dies on calendar life. Tax (牌照稅 NT$15,210/yr for the 2,487 cc bracket + 燃料費 NT$7,200/yr) and insurance are EXCLUDED from every figure here by design. Not a BEV, so no home-charger installation cost applies and no BEV-specific treatment (price-cut repricing, battery-health residuals, faster tire wear) is relevant. Market context baked into the value curve: the Alphard was a genuine no-discount, two-year-waiting-list, pay-a-premium car in Taiwan from its June 2023 launch until roughly May 2025, when forum reports of dealers discounting new Alphard/Lexus LM stock began. The 2023-2025 used listings therefore sit on a shortage-inflated base that is now normalising, and the long-dated checkpoints are deliberately discounted against the raw listing evidence.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Live 8891 中古車 AH40 listings, independently re-pulled by the fact-check pass on 2026-08-12 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/alphard and https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/alphard?minYear=2023). Verified closest comparables, all 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking): 2025-reg Hybrid 2.5 asking NT$2,998,000 at 23,000 km and NT$2,980,000 at 20,000 km; for reference the 2025-reg PHEV asks NT$3,138,000 at 1,000 km. RETAIL-TO-PRIVATE ADJUSTMENT MADE, NOT SKIPPED: a 1-year/7,000 km HEV would ask about NT$3,030,000 retail (low-mileage uplift over the 20,000-23,000 km comparables); cut ~11% for private sale to NT$2,700,000, then a further ~13% for dealer trade-in to NT$2,350,000. Sanity check: a new car now transacts near NT$3,030,000 after discount, so a 1-year car cannot fetch its ~NT$3,000,000 asking price — the listings are aspirational and the private figure must sit well under them."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Two anchor sets, both re-verified live on 8891 中古車 on 2026-08-12 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/alphard?minYear=2023). (a) Current-gen AH40 at 1-2 years: asking NT$2,750,000 at 50,000 km and NT$2,688,000 at 70,000 km — dealer retail, at 2.5-3.5x our mileage. (b) Predecessor AH30 2.5 Hybrid Executive Lounge at 3 years (original list NT$2,860,000): 2023-reg asking NT$2,488,000 at 51,000 km versus NT$1,990,000 at 100,000 km — a 25% spread across 49,000 km, which quantifies how mileage-sensitive this model is. ADJUSTMENT MADE: from the observed 2-year/50,000 km retail of NT$2,750,000 take ~11% for private sale, add a DAMPED low-mileage uplift toward 21,000 km (extrapolating the raw 25%/49,000 km coefficient linearly would be absurd), subtract a year of age, landing at NT$2,430,000 private; trade-in a further ~13% down. Cross-check against 8891's mileage-blind 3-year retention of 70.5% (NT$2,228,000 at an assumed 60,000 km) plus a low-mileage premium lands in the same place."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor generation — the AH40 only launched in Taiwan in June 2023, so no genuine 5-year current-gen car exists and none was invented. Method: take the AH30 2.5 Hybrid E-Four Executive Lounge (closest analogue — same 2.5 hybrid E-Four powertrain, same segment, top trim, original list NT$2,840,000 from its 2020-08-25 launch), read its real 5-year prices live on 8891 on 2026-08-12 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/alphard?minYear=2015&maxYear=2021): 2021-reg asking NT$1,888,000 at 63,000 km and NT$1,880,000 at 97,900 km — both re-verified by the fact-check pass — i.e. ~66.5% retail retention of its own list. Uplift ~8-10% because our car has 35,000 km against their 63,000-98,000 km, giving ~74% retail retention, applied to this car's real_cost of NT$3,095,000: ~NT$2,290,000 retail, less ~11% = NT$2,050,000 private, less ~13% = NT$1,780,000 trade-in. Corroborates 8891's mileage-blind 5-year figure of 59.7% once adjusted upward for our third-of-average mileage. CAVEAT: the AH30 2.5 Hybrid EL's NT$2,840,000 list price is the one denominator the fact-check pass could NOT independently re-verify (U-CAR returns 403 and the web-search budget was spent), so it is carried over from the first pass unconfirmed."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor generation — no 7-year AH40 exists or can exist before 2030. Method: use the AH30 3.5 V6 Executive Lounge, original Taiwan list NT$2,650,000 after the 2018-02-26 facelift. Its real 7-year prices, re-verified live on 8891 on 2026-08-12 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/alphard?minYear=2015&maxYear=2021): 2019-reg asking NT$1,528,000 and NT$1,558,000 at 84,000 km, and NT$1,429,000 at 118,500 km — about 57.7-58.8% retail retention of its own list at ~84,000 km. Uplift ~8% for our 49,000 km, giving ~63.5%, applied to real_cost NT$3,095,000: ~NT$1,965,000 retail, less ~11% = NT$1,750,000 private, less ~13% = NT$1,520,000 trade-in. One caveat that cuts in our favour and is why this was not trimmed further: the donor is a 3.5 V6 carrying NT$28,220/yr 牌照稅, which depresses its Taiwan used value, whereas this 2.5 hybrid pays NT$15,210 — so the hybrid should retain somewhat better at this age. CAVEAT: the NT$2,650,000 facelift list price is carried over from the first pass and could not be independently re-verified."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor generation — no 10-year AH40 exists or can exist before 2033. Method: use the AH30 3.5 (original Taiwan list NT$2,580,000, launched 2015-03-24). Real 10-11 year prices re-verified live on 8891 on 2026-08-12 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/alphard?minYear=2015&maxYear=2021): 2015-reg EL asking NT$1,268,000 at 120,000 km (49.1% retail retention) and 2015-reg asking NT$1,198,000 at 200,000 km (46.4%); nearest younger anchors are 2017-reg asking NT$1,338,000 at 101,100 km and NT$1,368,000 at 85,000 km. CORRECTION: the first pass cited a 2016-reg car at NT$1,380,000 / 110,000 km as its ~53.5% anchor; that listing was NOT present on re-check and has been dropped, so the verified 10-11 year band is ~46-49%, not ~53%. Uplifting the verified ~49% for our 70,000 km would give ~55-56% retail, i.e. about NT$1,530,000 private — but this is marked DOWN, for two reasons. First, those donor cars spent their whole life inside the 2023-2025 Alphard shortage that has now ended. Second, 8891's own retention model extended past its published 7-year point (50.5%) implies closer to 44% even after a low-mileage adjustment. Splitting the two methods rather than taking the flattering one gives NT$1,480,000 private and NT$1,280,000 trade-in. This remains the weakest number in the record."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Toyota Taiwan official schedule (https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx, re-fetched 2026-08-12) for the T30/T50 cadence. Per-visit cost is an ESTIMATE scaled from published Toyota TW 定保 figures for far smaller models — Toyota TW publishes no prices itself. Rated medium rather than low only because this window is dominated by two facts that are policy, not estimate: the free 1,000 km inspection and free labour on the first two services, leaving materials only, so the absolute figure is small and the scaling error cannot move it much."},{"y":3,"source":"Toyota Taiwan T30/T50/T60 schedule (https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx) applied on the calendar trigger. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from medium to low by the fact-check pass: the cadence is primary-sourced but the entire NT$22,000 is per-visit prices Toyota TW does not publish, scaled by judgement from a single third-party collation covering Vios/Yaris — a different, much smaller class — and that collation returned HTTP 403 on re-check, so it could not be independently confirmed. A single weak secondary data point is 'low' by the rubric. Covers years 1-3 only (not cumulative)."},{"y":5,"source":"Schedule from Toyota Taiwan (https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx). Tire budget from Taiwan retail for 18-inch premium comfort tires, which run about NT$14,000-21,000 per set of four before fitting; the upper end plus fitting, alignment and valves is budgeted because Alphard owners fit comfort-biased premium rubber on a 2.2-tonne vehicle. Tire and 12V battery TIMING is an age estimate, not a receipt, hence low confidence. Covers years 3-5 only."},{"y":7,"source":"Schedule from Toyota Taiwan (https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx); warranty term 4 years/120,000 km verified at https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_guarantee.aspx on 2026-08-12; hybrid battery 8 years/160,000 km for 2019+ model years. CORRECTED by the fact-check pass: the first draft put NT$52,000 here, BELOW the NT$56,000 of the years 3-5 window, which both breaks the expected rise with age and understates reality — years 5-7 are the first window in which the vehicle carries no factory warranty at all, while the 3-5 window still had one to two years of cover. The out-of-warranty allowance is raised from NT$15,000 to NT$22,000 accordingly, giving NT$59,000. Brake and out-of-warranty figures remain engineering judgement for this class, not sourced receipts: no Mobile01 or owner-club thread with itemised AH40 bills at this age exists, because the generation is only three years old in Taiwan. Covers years 5-7 only."},{"y":10,"source":"Schedule from Toyota Taiwan (https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx). The hybrid battery reserve is anchored on the warranty expiring at 8 years/160,000 km — at only 70,000 km the pack is very lightly cycled and outright failure is unlikely, so a fraction of replacement cost is reserved rather than the whole thing; budgeting a full pack here would be scaremongering and budgeting zero would be dishonest. Everything in this window is estimated, not sourced from receipts — no AH40 Alphard anywhere is 10 years old. Covers years 7-10 only (a three-year window, hence the larger figure)."}],"sources":[{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — official Alphard showroom","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/ALPHARD/","note":"PRIMARY, re-fetched by the fact-check pass 2026-08-12. HYBRID (E-Four 4WD) NT$3,160,000; PHEV NT$3,300,000; 16.4 km/L. Confirms list_price exactly — no change (0.0% deviation)."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — 愛車養護 scheduled maintenance","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx","note":"PRIMARY, re-fetched 2026-08-12. T30 = every 6 months or 10,000 km. T50 = every odd year or every 40,000 km from 20,000 km, including air filter and spark plugs. T60 = every even year or every 40,000 km from 40,000 km, including brake fluid, coolant and fuel filter. Establishes that at 7,000 km/yr the schedule is time-driven. The page explicitly states prices are NOT published and directs owners to service centres — which is why every maintenance cost here is an estimate."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — 新車保證 warranty terms","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_guarantee.aspx","note":"PRIMARY, re-fetched 2026-08-12. Confirms 3 years/100,000 km factory warranty plus Hotai's added 1 year/20,000 km = 4 years/120,000 km, whichever comes first. The page does not itself state the hybrid battery term."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — live Toyota Alphard used listings (all years)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/alphard","note":"Core used-value evidence, independently re-pulled 2026-08-12. All prices are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking) and were converted downward for private sale and again for trade-in. Confirms 2025-reg Hybrid asking NT$2,998,000 / 23,000 km and NT$2,980,000 / 20,000 km."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Alphard, 2023 model year and newer","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/alphard?minYear=2023","note":"Re-pulled 2026-08-12 for the current-generation anchors. Confirms Hybrid asking NT$2,750,000 / 50,000 km and NT$2,688,000 / 70,000 km; PHEV asking NT$3,138,000 / 1,000 km and NT$3,028,000 / 4,900 km; AH30 2.5 EL asking NT$2,488,000 / 51,000 km and NT$1,990,000 / 100,000 km."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Alphard, 2015-2021 model years (predecessor generation)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/alphard?minYear=2015&maxYear=2021","note":"Re-pulled 2026-08-12 for every extrapolated checkpoint. Confirms 2021 EL 2.5 asking NT$1,888,000 / 63,000 km; 2019 EL 3.5 asking NT$1,528,000 and NT$1,558,000 / 84,000 km and NT$1,429,000 / 118,500 km; 2017 EL 3.5 asking NT$1,338,000 / 101,100 km; 2015 EL 3.5 asking NT$1,268,000 / 120,000 km; 2015 3.5 asking NT$1,198,000 / 200,000 km. It does NOT contain the 2016-reg NT$1,380,000 listing the first draft cited, which has been dropped."},{"name":"KingAutos — Alphard Taiwan news archive","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/tag/alphard","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-12, replacing an unverifiable search-results page. Confirms the 2025-02-06 Alphard PHEV launch at NT$3,300,000 and shows NO announced MY2026 or MY2027 update — which is why model_year is recorded as 2026 and the first draft's '2027年式' framing was removed."},{"name":"8891 新車 — Alphard 用車成本與保值率","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/toyota/alphard/cost.html","note":"CROSS-CHECK ONLY, and now WEAKENED. Publishes a mileage-blind retention curve (yr1 89.0%, yr2 79.2%, yr3 70.5%, yr4 64.9%, yr5 59.7%, yr6 54.9%, yr7 50.5%) built on a 20,000 km/yr assumption — nearly 3x this buyer's mileage, so every figure needs an upward low-mileage adjustment before use. On re-fetch 2026-08-12 only the page title rendered, so these percentages are carried over from the first pass unconfirmed and are used only as a directional sanity check, never as a primary anchor. The page does list 保養: 暫無數據, confirming no published maintenance dataset exists for this model."},{"name":"8891 新車 — Alphard 購車菜單 (buyer budget board)","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/menu/toyota/alphard","note":"Used to size the discount. Buyer budgets cluster at NT$3,000,000-3,030,000 against the NT$3,160,000 list, implying NT$130,000-160,000 off. These are wish-budgets posted by prospective buyers, NOT verified transaction prices, so the conservative end (NT$130,000) is used. On re-fetch 2026-08-12 only the page title rendered ('Toyota Alphard 2026年最新購車菜單'), so the budget clustering is carried over from the first pass unconfirmed."},{"name":"UpToGo — Toyota 原廠保養費用與各車型定保拆解","url":"https://uptogo.com.tw/%e6%b1%bd%e6%a9%9f%e8%bb%8a/toyota%e5%8e%9f%e5%bb%a0%e4%bf%9d%e9%a4%8a%e5%a4%a7%e6%a6%82%e5%a4%9a%e5%b0%91%e9%8c%a2%ef%bc%9f/","note":"The only source found with itemised Toyota Taiwan 定保 costs (Vios/Yaris 10,000 km NT$2,270, 20,000 km NT$2,900, 40,000 km NT$3,970; parts prices; first two services labour-free). WEAKENED: returned HTTP 403 on re-fetch 2026-08-12, so it could not be independently confirmed by the fact-check pass. It also covers only small models, so every Alphard maintenance figure derived from it is a judgement-scaled estimate — the reason maintenance confidence is low from year 3 onward."},{"name":"Bing search results — AH30 Alphard original Taiwan list prices (SEARCH PAGE, NOT A CITATION)","url":"https://www.bing.com/search?q=Alphard+2.5+Hybrid+Executive+Lounge+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+284%E8%90%AC+%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82+2021","note":"Retained ONLY for provenance of the predecessor list prices used as retention denominators: AH30 3.5 EL NT$2,580,000 (2015-03-24 launch), NT$2,650,000 after the 2018-02-26 facelift, NT$2,840,000 for the 2020-08-25 switch to 2.5 Hybrid E-Four. FLAGGED: a search-results page is not a citation — its content is not stable and cannot be re-verified. The fact-check pass could not confirm these three denominators independently (U-CAR returns 403 and the web-search budget was exhausted), which is a material reason the years 5, 7 and 10 checkpoints are rated low."},{"name":"Bing search results — Alphard Taiwan supply and discount regime change (SEARCH PAGE, NOT A CITATION)","url":"https://www.bing.com/search?q=Alphard+%E8%B2%B7%E8%BB%8A+%E6%8A%98%E6%89%A3+%E8%AB%87%E5%83%B9+%E7%A9%BA%E9%96%93+%E5%92%8C%E6%B3%B0+%E4%B8%8D%E6%89%93%E6%8A%98+%E5%8A%A0%E5%83%B9+%E8%A8%82%E8%BB%8A+ptt+mobile01","note":"Provenance for the mid-2025 shift from premium-over-list to discounting: PTT and Mobile01 threads dated 20-29 May 2025. FLAGGED as a search-results page, not a citation. The underlying forum threads were not re-opened by the fact-check pass, so the discount-regime narrative rests on unverified secondary reporting — which is why the discount is set at the conservative end of its implied range."}]},"toyota-alphard-phev":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year; all checkpoints use 7,000 km/year (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km), roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. This matters more for the Alphard than for almost any other car sold here: Taiwan Alphards are overwhelmingly business/VIP shuttles, so most used listings are 50,000-190,000 km cars and a genuinely low-mileage private example sells above the mileage-blind average. Maintenance at 7,000 km/year is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven: Toyota Taiwan's interval is every 6 months OR 10,000 km, whichever comes first, so this owner hits the 6-month clock every time and never the odometer (~2 workshop visits/year, ~20 over 10 years). Over 10 years the car accumulates only 70,000 km, so every km-based warranty limit expires on TIME, not distance. WARRANTY CORRECTION (audit): Toyota TW's basic vehicle AND battery component coverage is 4 years/120,000 km (3yr/100,000 km factory + 1yr/20,000 km 和泰 extension). The 8-year/160,000 km figure is a >=70% CAPACITY guarantee only, NOT a component-failure warranty. So a traction-battery FAILURE is at owner risk from year 4 onward, not year 8 — this is corrected from the researcher's version and is reflected in the year 7 and year 10 maintenance provisions and in the year 10 residual. EXCLUDED BY DESIGN: 牌照稅 and 燃料稅, 強制險 and 任意險, fuel and electricity. ALSO EXCLUDED and worth flagging separately: a home AC charger. The PHEV's 80 km EV range is only worth paying for if it is charged nightly, and a Taiwan home-charger install runs roughly NT$30,000-80,000 (more in an apartment building needing 管委會 approval and a dedicated meter). That is a real ownership cost but a one-time capital item, so it is in neither maintenance.checkpoints nor onroad_fees.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from NT$2,840,000. The researcher stated no PHEV used listings could be found and therefore synthesised a dealer retail asking price of NT$3,150,000. Real Alphard PHEV listings DO exist and were pulled directly on 2026-08-12 from https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/alphard?year=2025 — four identifiable 2025 MY PHEVs: NT$3,138,000 @ 1,000 km (Keelung), NT$3,028,000 @ 4,900 km (Kaohsiung), NT$2,988,000 @ 21,000 km (Taipei), NT$3,190,000 @ 23,000 km (Tainan). The synthesised NT$3,150,000 exceeded the asking price of the 1,000 km car, which is not possible for a 7,000 km car. OBSERVED DEALER RETAIL for a 7,000 km PHEV, interpolated between the 1,000 km and 4,900 km cars, is ~NT$3,080,000 (~93% of list — high, but that is the Alphard). ADJUSTMENT MADE, NOT COPIED: private sale = 3,080,000 x 0.89 = NT$2,740,000, an 11% step down inside the 8-15% dealer-retail-to-private band; I used the middle rather than the tight end because the new-car wait has fallen to roughly 4 months, so a private seller no longer has queue-jumping buyers competing in days. Dealer trade-in = 2,740,000 x 0.885 = NT$2,420,000. SEPARATE FINDING that shapes every later checkpoint: at matched mileage the PHEV asks the SAME as the HEV (PHEV NT$2,988,000 @ 21,000 km vs HEV NT$2,980,000 @ 20,000 km and NT$2,998,000 @ 23,000 km), so the NT$140,000 new-car PHEV premium has already evaporated by year 1."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from NT$2,420,000. No 3-year-old PHEV exists (launched 2025-02), so this uses same-generation AH40 HEV cars at age 3 and applies the observed year-1 PHEV-equals-HEV parity in ABSOLUTE NT$ rather than scaling by the PHEV's higher list price — the researcher scaled the ratio up to the NT$330萬 list and then took only a 2% haircut, which re-inflates a premium the market has already discarded. Dealer RETAIL anchors, FindCar 2026-08-12 (https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&b=72&m=577&op=4): 2023 2.5HV 4WD NT$2,598,000 @ 30,885 km, NT$2,488,000 and NT$2,480,000 @ 51,807 km. 8891's 2023 band (NT$1,770,000-2,488,000) is contaminated by leftover AH30 stock and was not used. Uplifting the 30,885 km car to our 21,000 km gives dealer retail ~NT$2,660,000, and the PHEV sits at parity per the year-1 finding. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private = 2,660,000 x 0.89 = NT$2,370,000; trade-in = 2,370,000 x 0.88 = NT$2,090,000. Now correctly sits BELOW the sibling Alphard HYBRID record's year-3 figure of NT$2,470,000, as it must once the PHEV premium is gone."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from NT$2,210,000 — this was the single worst number in the researcher's record. At NT$2,210,000 the PHEV sat ABOVE the sibling Alphard HYBRID record's year-5 value of NT$2,110,000, i.e. the plug-in with a large battery approaching the end of its coverage was modelled as out-retaining the plain hybrid, which is backwards for Taiwan. It also produced a broken curve shape: only -8.7% across years 3-5 followed by -19.0% across years 5-7, when depreciation should not re-accelerate that way. EXTRAPOLATED — no 5-year-old AH40 exists (generation launched 2023) and no 5-year-old PHEV. Method: continued the observed AH40 curve from the year-3 dealer retail anchor of NT$2,660,000 at roughly 6.5%/year to ~NT$2,320,000 dealer retail at age 5 / 35,000 km, cross-checked against the predecessor AH30 2.5 Hybrid (TW list NT$2,840,000, cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/10828) whose 5-year-old cars ask NT$1,698,000-1,888,000 at 63,000-100,000 km and which supports a materially higher figure at our 35,000 km. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private = 2,320,000 x 0.885 = NT$2,060,000; trade-in = 2,060,000 x 0.875 = NT$1,800,000. Placed just below the HYBRID sibling, reflecting the first real battery-health questions and a thinner buyer pool. Confidence low: cross-generation and cross-powertrain inference, not observation."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from NT$1,790,000 (small change, curve continuity). EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION — there is no 7-year-old AH40 and no 7-year-old Alphard PHEV anywhere in Taiwan, and none was invented. Method: 2019 MY AH30 3.5 Executive Lounge, TW list NT$2,650,000 after the 2018 facelift (news.u-car.com.tw/article/40886, read via search index), is 7 years old now and asks NT$1,429,000-1,558,000 on 8891 — but every one of those cars carries 84,000-185,000 km (https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/alphard). That is ~56% retention on dealer ASKING at shuttle-grade mileage; our car has 49,000 km, a large premium on this model, supporting ~68% asking retention for the combustion predecessor. Cross-checked against continuing the AH40 curve from the year-5 anchor, which lands in the same place. Dealer retail asking ~NT$2,030,000 after a PHEV haircut that is now LARGER than the researcher applied, because the audit found battery COMPONENT coverage ends at 4 years/120,000 km — only the >=70% capacity guarantee runs to 8 years — so a year-7 buyer is already pricing uncovered pack risk. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private = 2,030,000 x 0.87 = NT$1,770,000; trade-in = 1,770,000 x 0.865 = NT$1,530,000, wider spreads than year 1 because an out-of-warranty 7-year-old moves slowly and dealers bid defensively."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from NT$1,400,000. The researcher's figure was IDENTICAL to the sibling Alphard HYBRID record's year-10 value, which cannot be right: at 10 years the dominant price driver is battery risk, and the PHEV's 18.1 kWh pack is a NT$300,000+ replacement against roughly NT$100,000-150,000 for the HEV's much smaller pack. The PHEV must sit below the HEV here, not level with it. EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION, stated rather than invented. Method: 2016 MY AH30 3.5 Executive Lounge, TW list NT$2,580,000 at the 2015 launch (news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/25820, read via search index), is exactly 10 years old and asks NT$1,380,000 @ 110,000 km; 2017 MY asks NT$1,338,000-1,368,000; 2015 MY (11 years) asks NT$1,198,000-1,268,000 (all https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/alphard). That is ~52-54% retention on dealer ASKING at 85,000-110,000 km; our car's 70,000 km lifts that to ~58% for a combustion predecessor. Applied to NT$3,300,000 and then discounted ~21% for PHEV-specific risk (larger than the researcher's 15%): the capacity guarantee lapsed on TIME at year 8, component coverage lapsed back at year 4, a pack replacement is a NT$300,000+ event, and there is no 10-year-old PHEV MPV market in Taiwan to price against. Dealer retail asking ~NT$1,510,000. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private = 1,510,000 x 0.86 = NT$1,300,000; trade-in = 1,300,000 x 0.855 = NT$1,110,000. Confidence low; read as a band, not a point."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"CORRECTED UP from NT$8,000. The researcher credited BOTH the 1-month check and the first 6-month/10,000 km service as free under a Toyota TW new-car programme. Verified on 2026-08-12 that only the 1個月/1,000 km delivery check is complimentary; the 6-month/10,000 km visit is a normal paid 定期保養, with Toyota TW's own stated interval being 「每半年或 1 萬公里，以先到者為準」. Year 1 therefore carries TWO paid visits, not one. Per-visit pricing anchored to owner-reported Toyota TW figures of ~NT$4,000 小保養 (https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=397&t=6516035), taken at the top of the band for the flagship Alphard. Warranty terms from https://www.toyota.com.tw/electric_guarantee.aspx. The corrected NT$13,000 also aligns with the sibling Alphard HYBRID record's NT$14,000, sitting marginally below it because the PHEV engine runs fewer hours. Covers 0-1y only."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers 1-3y only (not cumulative). Amount adjusted NT$34,000 -> NT$35,000 purely to make period_cost equal the sum of its own line items, which it did not in the researcher's version (its items summed to NT$35,500 against a stated NT$34,000). Visit count derived from Toyota TW's 6-month interval, which governs at 7,000 km/year — the car covers just 14,000 km across this whole window, so mileage triggers nothing. Service pricing from Mobile01 owner reports (小保養 ~NT$4,000, 大保養 ~NT$10,000, https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=397&t=6516035). No repair provision because the distributor-extended warranty runs to year 4 (https://www.toyota.com.tw/electric_guarantee.aspx). Brake pads deliberately NOT included — regenerative braking on a PHEV puts 21,000 km nowhere near pad life."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers 3-5y only. Amount unchanged at NT$63,000; line items retuned so they sum exactly to it. The dominant item is TIRES, and the reason is the LOW mileage, not high mileage: at 7,000 km/year the original tires reach 35,000 km with tread remaining but are 5 years old, and rubber on a 2.3-tonne MPV is replaced on age. TW fitted price ~NT$7,000/corner for a premium 18-inch fitment; note that the researcher's specific '225/60R18' size could not be confirmed on Toyota TW's spec page during this audit, so the size claim has been generalised while the price stands. Warranty coverage ends at year 4 per https://www.toyota.com.tw/electric_guarantee.aspx, hence a single exposed year of repair allowance. Service pricing per Mobile01 owner reports (https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=397&t=6516035)."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers 5-7y only. RAISED from NT$72,000 to NT$76,000 by adding a modest HV-system risk line. The researcher wrote 'traction battery still under its 8-year warranty in this window, so no battery provision yet'; the audit of https://www.toyota.com.tw/electric_guarantee.aspx shows battery COMPONENT coverage ends with the basic 4yr/120,000 km term and the 8-year/160,000 km term is a >=70% capacity guarantee only. Years 5-7 are therefore already exposed to pack and inverter failure, at low probability, so a small provision belongs here. Otherwise fully outside warranty, so this is the first period carrying a real repair provision, weighted toward what actually fails on a heavy MPV (dampers, bushings, power sliding doors, ottoman seat motors) rather than engine work, which a PHEV drivetrain largely avoids. First brake job lands here rather than earlier precisely because regen braking does most of the retardation; a combustion MPV would have needed pads by ~40,000 km. Service pricing extrapolated from Mobile01 Toyota owner reports with an inflation and flagship-labour uplift; confidence low because no 7-year-old Alphard PHEV exists to check against."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers 7-10y only. RAISED from NT$175,000 to NT$185,000, entirely by increasing the traction-battery provision from NT$30,000 to NT$40,000. The researcher sized that provision on the belief that the pack was warranted to year 8 and exposed only for years 8-10; the audit shows component coverage lapsed at year 4 and only a >=70% capacity guarantee ran to year 8, so the exposure is longer and the provision should be larger. Three years and six time-driven visits make this the largest window even before consumables. Two items are specific to this powertrain and this mileage: TIRES age out a second time at only ~70,000 km (a mileage-driven model would wrongly skip this), and spark plugs appear on the 10-YEAR limit rather than the 100,000 km limit the car never reaches. Still carried as a provision rather than a certainty because pack failure probability is low, if no longer covered. Confidence low: entirely extrapolated, since neither a 10-year-old AH40 nor any 10-year-old PHEV MPV exists in Taiwan."}],"sources":[{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — Alphard showroom (official 建議售價)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/ALPHARD/","note":"Fetched directly 2026-08-12 for this audit. Confirms PHEV NT$3,300,000 and HYBRID NT$3,160,000, both 2,487 cc E-Four 4WD; PHEV 177 ps, 70.4 km/l, 18.1 kWh pack, ~80 km EV range. Primary verification that the researcher's list price is CORRECT."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — 電動車／油電保固條款 (warranty terms)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/electric_guarantee.aspx","note":"Fetched directly 2026-08-12. Basic vehicle and component warranty 4 years/120,000 km (3yr/100,000 km + 1yr/20,000 km 和泰 extension). The 8 years/160,000 km term is a >=70% CAPACITY guarantee, NOT a component-failure warranty — this corrects the researcher's reading. Page states coverage for 所有車型 generically and does NOT explicitly name the Alphard PHEV, so that claim was removed."},{"name":"8891 汽車 — Alphard 2025 model-year listings (PHEV rows)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/alphard?year=2025","note":"Fetched directly 2026-08-12. THE KEY AUDIT FINDING — identifiable PHEV listings exist, contradicting the researcher's claim that none could be found. PHEV: NT$3,138,000 @ 1,000 km, NT$3,028,000 @ 4,900 km, NT$2,988,000 @ 21,000 km, NT$3,190,000 @ 23,000 km. HEV for comparison: NT$2,998,000 @ 23,000 km, NT$2,980,000 @ 20,000 km, NT$2,688,000 @ 70,000 km. At matched mileage PHEV = HEV, proving the NT$140,000 new-car premium is gone by year 1. These are 車商售價, NOT owner proceeds."},{"name":"8891 汽車 — Toyota Alphard 中古車價格行情 (all years)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/alphard","note":"Fetched directly 2026-08-12. Year-by-year dealer ASKING bands used for the 5/7/10-year predecessor curve: 2025 NT$2,688,000-3,190,000, 2023 NT$1,770,000-2,488,000, 2021 NT$1,698,000-1,888,000, 2019 NT$1,429,000-1,558,000, 2017 NT$1,338,000-1,368,000, 2016 NT$1,380,000, 2015 NT$1,198,000-1,268,000. These are 車商售價, NOT owner proceeds."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — Toyota Alphard used listing table","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&b=72&m=577&op=4","note":"URL reachability re-verified 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200). AH40 rows used for the 3-year anchor: 2023 2.5HV 4WD NT$2,598,000 @ 30,885 km, NT$2,488,000 and NT$2,480,000 @ 51,807 km; 2025 rows NT$2,998,000 @ 13,796 km and @ 23,338 km, NT$3,098,000 @ 14,000 km. Row-level detail carried over from the prior researcher; I confirmed the endpoint resolves but did not independently re-read every row, so it is treated as corroborating rather than primary."},{"name":"8891 listing — 2022 Alphard 2.5 Hybrid","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-3651836.html","note":"Fetched directly 2026-08-12. Model year 2022 and asking price NT$2,688,000 CONFIRMED. The researcher's stated 20,000 km mileage could NOT be confirmed from the page, so the low-mileage premium this listing was used to calibrate is weaker than presented and has been de-emphasised in favour of the directly observed AH40/PHEV rows."},{"name":"8891 listing — 2021 Alphard 2.5 Hybrid, 88,000 km (DEAD LINK)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4489610.html","note":"Returns HTTP 410 Gone as of 2026-08-12 — the listing has been delisted and can no longer be verified. The researcher used this as one half of the two-car pair calibrating the low-mileage premium across years 5, 7 and 10. Retained for traceability but treated as UNVERIFIABLE; the revised curve does not depend on it."},{"name":"TVBS 汽車 — Alphard 2.5 Hybrid Taiwan pricing","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/10828","note":"Read via search index: 「和泰汽車正式宣告Alphard 2.5 Hybrid以284萬元進入台灣市場取代原先3.5升V6汽油車型」. NT$2,840,000 is the denominator for the 5-year retention cross-check off the 2021/2022 AH30 Hybrid listings."},{"name":"U-CAR — Alphard AH30 facelift price, 2018","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/40886","note":"Read via search index: 「售價則較小改款前調漲7萬成為265萬元」. NT$2,650,000 is the denominator for the 7-year retention ratio computed off 2019 MY listings. Not directly fetched."},{"name":"U-CAR — Alphard AH30 Taiwan launch price, 2015","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/25820","note":"Read via search index: 「全新Toyota Alphard 3.5 Executive Lounge單一車型258萬元上市」. NT$2,580,000 is the denominator for the 10-year retention ratio computed off 2016 MY listings. Not directly fetched."},{"name":"Search layer — current Alphard TW order backlog and discount practice","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=Toyota+Alphard+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+2026+%E8%A8%82%E5%96%AE+%E7%AD%89%E8%BB%8A+%E4%BA%A4%E8%BB%8A+%E7%BC%BA%E8%BB%8A+%E5%84%AA%E6%83%A0+%E6%8A%98%E6%89%A3","note":"Fetched 2026-08-12 (WebSearch budget was exhausted, so DuckDuckGo HTML was the search layer). Material correction to the researcher's premise: Toyota expanded Alphard production from 2026 to 「大幅縮短候車期」, current quoted wait is around 4 months rather than the 2-4 years cited from June 2024, and post-refresh intake is 「大致順利」. Basis for keeping discounts = 0 on different grounds and for reducing the year-1 residual."},{"name":"Search layer — Toyota TW free new-car service scope","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=Toyota+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E6%96%B0%E8%BB%8A+%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB+%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A+1000%E5%85%AC%E9%87%8C+%E9%A6%96%E6%AC%A1+6%E5%80%8B%E6%9C%88+10000%E5%85%AC%E9%87%8C+%E8%A6%81%E9%8C%A2%E5%97%8E","note":"Fetched 2026-08-12. Confirms the 1個月/1,000 km delivery check is free but the 6-month/10,000 km scheduled service is PAID, and restates Toyota TW's interval as 「每半年或 1 萬公里，以先到者為準」. Basis for raising the year-1 maintenance figure."},{"name":"工商時報 — 和泰車訂單，Alphard 交車等候期","url":"https://www.ctee.com.tw/news/20240606700095-439901","note":"URL reachability verified 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200). Dated June 2024: >4,000 outstanding Alphard orders against a ~500 unit/year quota with a quoted 4-year wait. Explicitly flagged as SUPERSEDED — 2026 reporting shows the wait down to ~4 months. Retained only to document why the researcher's residual curve was too high."},{"name":"Mobile01 — 保養一次都花多少錢 (Toyota TW owner service costs)","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=397&t=6516035","note":"Owner-reported Toyota Taiwan figures: 小保養 ~NT$4,000, 大保養 close to NT$10,000. Per-visit anchor, taken at the top of the band for the flagship Alphard. Direct fetch 403-blocked; content read via search index snippet, so per-visit pricing is medium confidence at best."},{"name":"Car-Watcher — Toyota Alphard Taiwan price guide 2026","url":"https://car-watcher.com/guide/toyota-alphard-taiwan-price-2026.html","note":"URL reachability verified 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200). Generation timeline used to avoid mixing stock: AH40 from 2023 (PHEV added Feb 2025), AH30 2015-2023, AH20 2010-2015. Secondary aggregator, not a primary price source; used only for generation boundaries."},{"name":"Sibling record — Toyota Alphard HYBRID (same dataset)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/ALPHARD/","note":"Cross-record consistency check performed during this audit against the dataset's own toyota-alphard-hev.json (list NT$3,160,000, onroad_fees NT$45,000, year-1 private NT$2,700,000, year-5 NT$2,110,000, year-10 NT$1,400,000, year-1 maintenance NT$14,000). Three of the corrections here — onroad_fees, the year-5 inversion and the year-10 tie — were surfaced by comparing the two records for the same bodyshell. URL points at the shared official source for the model line."}]},"toyota-land-cruiser-diesel":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year; every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7000/21000/35000/49000/70000), roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. Three consequences dominate. (1) VALUES: every predecessor comp on 8891/FindCar sits at 90,000-130,000 km, i.e. 2-3x our car's age-matched mileage, so each was adjusted UP for low mileage before use — but moderately (+5% to +20% relative depending on the mileage gap), not the +20-25% a prior draft applied. (2) The year-1 value is propped up by a SUPPLY SHORTAGE, not by intrinsic retention: Taiwan launched the LC250 as a 100-unit online lottery (registration 2025/07/11-20, ~2,500 applicants, deliveries from 2025/11), so near-new cars trade at or above list today. That premium unwinds as 和泰 delivers more allocation, which is why depreciation stays elevated through years 1-5 and only flattens after year 7 onto the Land Cruiser enthusiast floor visible in the predecessor data. (3) MAINTENANCE: Toyota TW's interval is 每半年或1萬公里, whichever first, so at 7,000 km/year this car is entirely TIME-driven — 2 visits/year, never mileage-triggered, 20 visits against only 70,000 km over 10 years. Consumables age out rather than wear out: tires are replaced on rubber age (~5-6 years) with tread remaining. THE BIG CAVEAT: 2.8L diesel + 7,000 km/year is the worst-case DPF (diesel particulate filter — traps soot and must burn it off at 600-650°C) combination. Short low-mileage trips rarely get the exhaust hot enough to complete regeneration, so soot accumulates; an OEM DPF replacement quotes NT$150,000-200,000. This is priced as an explicit probability-weighted provision in the 5-7y and 7-10y windows and is the single most decision-relevant fact here — a gasoline SUV would not carry it. Excluded by design: tax (牌照稅/燃料費), insurance, fuel, parking, and the NT$20,000 dual-tone roof option. Not a BEV, so no home-charger consideration applies.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Best-evidenced checkpoint: a near-exact comp exists. 8891 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/land-cruiser) lists a 2025 LC250 2.8 柴油48V at 7,000 km asking NT$2,660,000 marked 個人自售 (PRIVATE SALE) — same model, same powertrain, and the exact mileage this buyer reaches at year 1. Because that is already a private ASKING price, no dealer-retail haircut was applied; I deducted ~3% for negotiation and a further small amount because deliveries only began 2025/11, so that car is ~9 months old rather than a full 12 — giving NT$2,560,000. Dealer-route cross-check agrees: the same page shows a 2026 LC250 at 5,100 km asking NT$2,890,000 (車商售價); the ~10% 車商售價→自售價 adjustment gives NT$2,601,000. Two routes converge on NT$2.56-2.60M. Retention is extraordinary (86% of real_cost) but it is MEASURED, not assumed — near-new cars transact at or above list because the 100-unit lottery capped supply. Confidence MEDIUM, not high: this rests on a single private listing plus one dealer listing, and both are asking prices rather than confirmed transactions. dealer_tradein NT$2,300,000 = private -10.2%, at the narrow end of the usual 10-15% because allocation-limited LC250 stock is actively hunted by 車商 and re-lists fast."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no LC250 in Taiwan is older than ~1 year (deliveries began 2025/11), so no current-generation 3-year data can exist. Method: anchor on the predecessor Land Cruiser Prado and step back. carbook.tw (https://carbook.tw/cars/toyota-land-cruiser-prado/2022) prices a 2022 Prado (4 years old, median 50,000 km) at 在線開價 NT$1,790,000 / 建議成交 NT$1,640,000-1,690,000 / 車行收購 NT$1,560,000; private sale sits between 建議成交 and 收購 at ~NT$1,600,000. FindCar (https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/land%20cruiser%20prado) gives that car's ORIGINAL list as NT$2,790,000 (2022 探索旗艦版) — the 探索玩家版 at NT$2,400,000 is ruled out because it would imply an implausible 74.6% dealer-asking retention at 4 years. So real 4-year private retention is 57.3% of list. Stepping back one year (+~8 points) gives ~66%; +10% relative for 21,000 km vs a ~42,000 km median gives ~72.6%; +4% for the LC250 being the more desirable, supply-tighter model gives ~73% of list = NT$2,100,000 (70.8% of real_cost). Confidence LOW: the anchor is real, but the cross-generation transfer and, critically, the rate at which the lottery-driven supply premium unwinds between years 1 and 3 are both my judgement. dealer_tradein = private -11.0%."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from two real predecessor data points, both on the SAME 2.8 diesel engine family, and deliberately lower than a naive read of the 4-year table. Route A: FindCar/8891 list a 2021 Prado 2.8 柴油 7-seater at 125,459 km asking NT$1,299,000 (車商售價) against an original list of NT$2,780,000 (2021 探索旗艦版, https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/land%20cruiser%20prado) — 46.7% on dealer asking, ~42.1% as private sale after the -10% adjustment, at exactly 5 years. Adjusting UP ~20% relative for our 35,000 km versus its 125,459 km, plus ~5% for LC250 desirability, gives ~53% of list = NT$1,527,000. Route B: the carbook 2022 Prado table (https://carbook.tw/cars/toyota-land-cruiser-prado/2022) gives 57.3% private retention at 4 years / 50,000 km against its NT$2,790,000 list; ageing one year (x0.90), +5% for 35,000 vs 50,000 km, +5% for LC250 gives ~56.9% = NT$1,639,000. I take NT$1,600,000 between the two routes — 55.6% of list, 54.0% of real_cost. NOTE this is materially below a prior draft's NT$1,920,000, which had applied an oversized low-mileage uplift and used an unsourced NT$2,690,000 denominator for the Prado; the verified NT$2,780,000-2,790,000 list makes real predecessor retention lower than assumed. Confidence LOW. dealer_tradein = private -11.9%."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — the LC250 generation is under 1 year old in Taiwan, so no genuine 7-year data can exist and none is claimed. Because I could not verify an original list price for the 4.0 Prado, I used the older comps for SHAPE (age-to-age ratio) rather than for absolute level, which avoids resting on an unsourced denominator. Real comps: 2019 Prado 4.0 at 130,000 km asking NT$958,000 versus the 2021 Prado 2.8 at 125,459 km asking NT$1,299,000 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/land-cruiser-prado, https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/land%20cruiser) — at essentially identical mileage, two extra years costs 26.3% (958/1299 = 0.737). Applying that ratio to my year-5 figure, with the low-mileage uplift carried through roughly unchanged (49,000 km at year 7 is the same proportional discount to median as 35,000 km at year 5), gives NT$1,180,000-1,250,000; I use NT$1,250,000, the upper end, for the LC250's stronger standing. That is 43.4% of list, 42.2% of real_cost. Cross-check: the 2018 Prado 4.0 VX at 90,000 km asks NT$1,080,000, and our car at year 7 is one year younger with 46% less mileage, which is consistent with ~NT$1.25M private. Confidence LOW by construction. dealer_tradein = private -12.8%."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor generation, same method as year 7, and explicitly not a current-generation observation. Real Prado LC150 comps at 10-12 years (https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/land-cruiser-prado, https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/land%20cruiser): 2016 Prado 4.0 at 110,000 km asking NT$958,000 and 2014 Prado 4.0 VX at 115,084 km asking NT$898,000. The striking feature of the Prado data is how FLAT it is at the long end — the 2016 at 110,000 km asks exactly the same NT$958,000 as the 2019 at 130,000 km, so once mileage is accounted for, years 7 to 10 are almost level. Land Cruisers in Taiwan hit a hard enthusiast floor rather than sliding. Taking that flatness plus a ~+12-15% low-mileage uplift (70,000 km against the comps' 110,000-115,000 km) and a small LC250 premium gives ~38% of list = NT$1,100,000 (37.1% of real_cost). A real risk NOT in this number: a DPF-troubled short-trip diesel with a service history full of carbon-cleaning invoices sells below a clean one, and buyers of 10-year diesels scrutinise exactly that. Confidence LOW by construction. dealer_tradein = private -14.1%, the widest spread in the table, since a decade-old diesel carries the most reconditioning and emissions risk for a 車商."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Interval 每半年或1萬公里 confirmed on https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx; warranty 4yr/120,000km confirmed on https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_guarantee.aspx. Two 定保 in year 1 at ~NT$5,000-5,500 each — above the NT$3,000-5,000 typical Toyota visit because the 1GD-FTV diesel takes ~7.5L of low-ash oil versus ~4L on a gasoline Corolla. The 滿月 and 首半年 free inspections do not cover the oil and filter, so both services are still billed; a small allowance for that free inspection labour is why this sits at NT$10,000 rather than NT$11,000."},{"y":3,"source":"4 visits over 2 years at the confirmed 6-month interval (https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx), alternating light oil services ~NT$5,500 with fuller annual services ~NT$11,000-12,000 that add air filter, cabin filter, diesel fuel filter and the 2-year brake fluid change. Zero repair cost assumed: still inside the 4yr/120,000km warranty (https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_guarantee.aspx), and at 21,000 km nothing is mileage-worn. Benchmarked against the NT$3,000-5,000+ per-visit Toyota TW norm, uplifted for diesel oil volume and premium-SUV labour rates."},{"y":5,"source":"Tire replacement is the step change and it is AGE-driven, not wear-driven: at 7,000 km/year the OE 18-inch tires still have tread at year 5 but the rubber is 5-6 years old, and a set of four fitted for a 2.4-tonne 4WD runs ~NT$11,000 each. Routine servicing continues at 4 visits per the 每半年 interval (https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx), now including full-time-4WD front/rear diff and transfer-case oils a monocoque SUV never pays for. Base warranty lapses at year 4 on the clock with ~28,000 km showing, BUT https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_guarantee.aspx documents a complimentary 5th-year / 140,000 km economy warranty for owners who service on schedule at 和泰, which this buyer does — so this window is effectively covered end to end and carries no repair provision. Confidence medium: the tire and battery lines are well-grounded, the exact 定保 pricing is benchmarked rather than quoted."},{"y":7,"source":"First window outside the extended warranty for non-engine items. The DPF cleaning line is buyer-profile-specific, not boilerplate: 7,000 km/year of short trips keeps exhaust below the 600-650°C regeneration threshold, so soot accumulates and periodic forced cleaning becomes necessary (https://www.mys-spirit.com.tw/exhaustview-328.html; owner threads report Toyota TW dealers do not offer EGR/DPF cleaning on the menu, so this goes to an independent specialist at ~NT$8,000-20,000). Note the DPF is an emissions component and is not expected to be covered by the engine 8-major-systems loyalty extension. Front brakes finally come due at year 6-7 — late by mileage-average standards precisely because there are only 49,000 km on them. 8AT fluid and driveline oils fall in this window on the time-based schedule. Confidence medium: routine items are well-grounded, the DPF provision is a judgement call on frequency."},{"y":10,"source":"Largest window by design — 3 years wide and carrying the deferred DPF exposure. The NT$50,000 DPF line is explicitly PROBABILITY-WEIGHTED, not a quoted repair: OEM DPF replacement is NT$150,000-200,000 (https://www.mys-spirit.com.tw/exhaustview-328.html, midpoint NT$175,000) and a decade of sub-7,000 km/year short-trip running is the exact duty cycle that causes blockage, so ~NT$15,000 of cleaning plus a 20% chance of the big-ticket replacement gives 15,000 + 0.20 x 175,000 = NT$50,000. A prior draft stated 20% but carried NT$68,000, which implies ~30%; this version makes the arithmetic match the stated probability. Second tire set is again age-driven at ~year 10. No separate provision for 噴油嘴/渦輪/發電機 engine-internal failures because https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_guarantee.aspx documents engine 8-major-systems coverage extendable to 10 years / 150,000 km for owners maintaining on schedule at 和泰, which this buyer does. Ten-year total across all five windows is NT$414,000 — high for only 70,000 km, and that is the point: a body-on-frame 2.8 diesel 4WD driven this little is expensive per kilometre, and a gasoline SUV on the same schedule would avoid the DPF, fuel-filter and driveline-oil lines entirely. Confidence LOW: the routine portion is sound but the failure provision is an actuarial estimate, not observed invoices."}],"sources":[{"name":"Toyota Taiwan 官方 Land Cruiser 車型館","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/LANDCRUISER/","note":"PRIMARY price verification, re-fetched and confirmed 2026-08-12. 越野探索版 建議售價 NT$2,880,000, 越野極境版 NT$2,900,000; 2.8L turbo diesel + 48V mild hybrid, 2,755 c.c., 204 ps @ 3,000-3,400 rpm. list_price confirmed correct, within 0% of the researcher's figure."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Toyota Land Cruiser 在售列表","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/land-cruiser","note":"Year-1 anchor, verified 2026-08-12. Key listing: 2025 LC250 2.8 柴油48V, 7,000 km, NT$2,660,000, marked 個人自售 (PRIVATE) — same powertrain and the exact mileage this buyer reaches at year 1. Also 2026 LC250 5,100 km dealer asking NT$2,890,000 and 2027 LC250 8 km at NT$2,960,000, both AT OR ABOVE list, which is what rules out any purchase discount."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Toyota Land Cruiser Prado 在售列表","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/land-cruiser-prado","note":"Predecessor-generation comps, verified 2026-08-12: 2022 Prado 2.8 柴油 / 50,000 km / NT$1,788,000; 2018 Prado 4.0 / 90,000 km / NT$1,080,000; 2014 Prado 4.0 / 115,100 km / NT$898,000. ALL THREE are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking) — every one was reduced ~10% before use as a private-sale figure."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — Land Cruiser Prado 車型頁（新車價與中古行情）","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/land%20cruiser%20prado","note":"CRITICAL DENOMINATOR SOURCE. Publishes the Prado's ORIGINAL list prices: 2022 探索旗艦版 NT$2,790,000 / 探索玩家版 NT$2,400,000; 2021 探索旗艦版 NT$2,780,000 / 玩家版 NT$2,390,000; 2023 旗艦 NT$2,950,000. A prior draft used an unsourced ~NT$2,690,000, which inflated every retention ratio built on it. Also confirms the 2021 Prado at 125,459 km / NT$1,299,000 is a DIESEL 7-seater, making it a same-engine-family 5-year comp."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — Land Cruiser 搜尋結果","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/land%20cruiser","note":"Additional predecessor comps by year, verified 2026-08-12: 2021 Prado 2.8 / 125,459 km / NT$1,299,000; 2019 Prado 4.0 / 130,000 km / NT$958,000; 2016 Prado 4.0 / 110,000 km / NT$958,000; 2014 Prado 4.0 / 115,084 km / NT$898,000; 2011 Prado / 219,454 km / NT$658,000. The 2016-at-110,000km and 2019-at-130,000km both asking NT$958,000 is the direct evidence that the curve flattens after year 7."},{"name":"Carbook 車書 — 2022 Land Cruiser Prado 中古車行情","url":"https://carbook.tw/cars/toyota-land-cruiser-prado/2022","note":"CALIBRATION SOURCE for the price chain — the only source found publishing all three tiers: 在線開價 NT$1,790,000 / 建議成交價 NT$1,640,000-1,690,000 / 車行收購價 NT$1,560,000 at 4 years and ~50,000 km median. Private sale was placed between 建議成交 and 收購 at ~NT$1,600,000. Caveat recorded honestly: carbook's own 開價-to-收購 spread is only 12.8%, narrower than the 20%+ implied by chaining the conventional -10% and -12% adjustments, so 收購 here is likely an optimistic marketing figure; trade-in values in this record follow market convention rather than carbook's spread."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan 原廠保固說明","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_guarantee.aspx","note":"Warranty basis, re-fetched 2026-08-12: 三年或100,000公里 + 和泰追加一年或20,000公里 = 4 years / 120,000 km. ALSO documents what a prior draft missed — a complimentary 5th year / 140,000 km economy warranty for owners meeting on-schedule return-to-dealer maintenance, and engine 8-major-systems coverage extendable to 10 years / 150,000 km on continued compliance. This buyer's 20 on-schedule visits qualify, which is why the 3-5y window carries no repair provision and the 7-10y window carries no separate engine-internal provision."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan 定期保養說明（T30 定保套餐）","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx","note":"INTERVAL SOURCE, re-fetched and confirmed 2026-08-12: 每半年或1萬公里回廠進行定期保養. At 7,000 km/year the 6-month clock always fires first, so this owner's schedule is entirely time-driven — 2 visits/year, 20 visits over 10 years, never mileage-triggered. Also confirms 定保 is a paid package and that only the 滿月 and 首半年（或1萬公里）inspections are free."},{"name":"明曜晶片 — 柴油車 DPF 堵塞與更換成本說明","url":"https://www.mys-spirit.com.tw/exhaustview-328.html","note":"RISK QUANTIFICATION for the diesel/low-mileage conflict, verified 2026-08-12. States DPF原廠報價約為台幣15萬~20萬 and explains that short-trip and idling use keeps exhaust below the 600~650度 regeneration window so soot cannot burn off, causing blockage and eventual DPF failure. Underpins the probability-weighted DPF provisions in the 5-7y and 7-10y maintenance windows."}]},"toyota-gr86-at":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr; all checkpoints use 7,000 km/yr (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km) — roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/yr. This matters twice. (1) Maintenance is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven: Toyota TW's published schedule (toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx, verified) is T30 every 6 months OR 10,000 km, T50 in odd years OR every 40,000 km from 20,000 km, T60 in even years OR every 40,000 km from 40,000 km — 'whichever comes first'. At 7,000 km/yr the calendar always triggers first, so the owner pays for ~2 visits a year and never reaches a mileage-based interval within 10 years. The 3-year/100,000 km factory warranty is likewise time-limited: it expires at year 3 with only ~21,000 km used, so years 3-10 are fully out of warranty. (2) Resale is helped: 7,000 km/yr puts the car under the mileage-blind average at every age, and the value_checkpoints are quoted from low-mileage listings on that basis. IMPORTANT CAVEAT ADDED IN REVIEW: the visible 8891 GR86 pool is even lower-mileage than this buyer — 2022-2024 cars showing 4,000-10,000 km, i.e. roughly 2,000-3,500 km/yr — so those asking prices are NOT a like-for-like read on a 7,000 km/yr car and have been adjusted down for mileage at each checkpoint. Two GR86-specific cost drivers: the Brembo package makes brake consumables roughly double a standard 86's (86-club TW lists standard 86 front pads at NT$7,000 / rear at NT$5,350; Brembo equivalents run ~2x), and the FA24 flat-four takes ~5.6 L of 0W-20, so even a routine T30 is expensive for a Toyota. Vehicle licence tax (牌照稅), fuel tax (燃料稅) and insurance are EXCLUDED from every figure by design. Fuel is also excluded. Note the 2.4 L boxer sits in the 2001-3000cc tax bracket and demands 98-octane, so real-world running cost is higher than this record shows.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN IN REVIEW (was NT$1,350,000 / NT$1,170,000). The original record set year-1 DEALER RETAIL at ~NT$1,500,000, which is above every listing actually visible on 8891 — the dealer-retail trap re-entering through an inflated anchor. Live 8891 data I re-pulled myself (auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/gr86): the best like-for-like comparable is a 2024-MY 6AT Brembo, 7,500 km, Yilan, asking NT$1,460,000 車商售價, alongside a 2024-MY 6AT non-Brembo at 10,000 km asking NT$1,428,000 and two 2024-MY 6MT Brembo cars at NT$1,428,000. Separately, the only genuine ~1-year-old car found is a 2025-MY at NT$1,380,000 (Taoyuan dealer 六順國際車業, auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4446903.html) — spec and mileage not stated, and it sits BELOW the 2024 cars, so the pool is noisy and asking prices are not cleanly ordered by age. I set DEALER RETAIL at NT$1,480,000, just above the top real comparable rather than NT$40,000 above it. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale = retail x 0.888 (NT$1,315,000, i.e. 11% below dealer asking, inside the 8-15% band); dealer_tradein = private x 0.863 (NT$1,135,000, a further 13.7%), the gap set slightly wide because dealers hold niche two-door stock longer and price that carrying risk into the buy. Low-mileage basis: 7,000 km at one year, and all listings quoted are themselves low-mileage cars."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"SOURCE CORRECTED AND CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED IN REVIEW (values unchanged). The original record claimed 'five real 2023-MY GR86 listings' and rated this the best-evidenced row at high confidence. I re-pulled auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/gr86 and there are only SEVEN GR86 listings in total, of which exactly TWO are 2023-MY: NT$1,398,000 at 10,000 km (6MT Brembo, Yunlin) and NT$1,240,000 at 37,000 km (6MT, Taoyuan, dealer 冠豪汽車). The other four cars the original record counted as 2023-MY (NT$1,428,000 at 10,000 km, NT$1,428,000 at 8,479 km, NT$1,460,000 at 7,500 km, NT$1,428,000 at 8,000 km) are all 2024-MY — two years old, not three. Interpolating the two genuine 3-year anchors to our 21,000 km gives DEALER RETAIL of ~NT$1,335,000, which happens to land where the original record put it, so the numbers stand. Note both 3-year anchors are 6MT while this record prices the 6AT. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale = retail x 0.903 (NT$1,205,000, 9.7% below dealer asking); dealer_tradein = private x 0.867 (NT$1,045,000). Confidence high -> medium: two real listings straddling the target mileage, not five, and neither is the right transmission."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED ONE YEAR beyond real data; values unchanged in review, reasoning corrected and one dead source removed. The GR86 launched in Taiwan in Aug 2022, so the oldest cars trading today are 2022-MY at four years old — a genuine five-year GR86 does not yet exist here. Real four-year anchors that I re-verified: auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-3798120.html NT$1,398,000 (2022-MY, Taipei dealer 任昱汽車) and auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4057885.html NT$1,330,000 (2022-MY, Taipei); carmaxtw.com/used-toyota-gr86-price/ independently puts 2022-2023 AT cars at NT$1,300,000-1,450,000 and MT at NT$1,350,000-1,500,000. REMOVED IN REVIEW: the original record's fourth anchor, sum.com.tw/carinfo-767532.php at NT$1,380,000, returns HTTP 404 — it cannot be verified and is no longer cited. Credible four-year retail band NT$1,300,000-1,400,000, centre ~NT$1,350,000. I extended one year to a DEALER RETAIL of ~NT$1,180,000, a steeper step than the flat 2022-2024 asking curve implies. REASON RESTATED (the original justification, an ongoing ~11% new-price ramp, is factually wrong — see purchase.notes): the steepening is instead justified by three things — (a) the 2023 repricing that lifted the range is a one-off already absorbed, so no further tailwind is coming; (b) every visible listing is an ultra-low-mileage garage queen at roughly 2,000-3,500 km/yr, a selection bias that inflates the observable band relative to our 7,000 km/yr car; (c) asking prices are not transactions, and scarce-segment stock sits on lots for months. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale = retail x 0.898 (NT$1,060,000); dealer_tradein = private x 0.863 (NT$915,000)."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION — the current GR86 (ZN8) is only four years old in Taiwan, so no genuine seven-year data exists and none has been invented. Method, stated explicitly: I took the previous-generation Toyota 86 (ZN6) at seven years old from real 8891 listings (auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/86, 49 cars, re-verified in review), where a 2019-MY 86 at 70,000 km asks NT$860,000 dealer retail (Yunlin, 6MT). That car's original TW list was ~NT$1,270,000 (2017 facelift opened at NT$1,230,000 起; the 2012 range was NT$1,229,000 / 1,269,000 / 1,299,000). Retention = 860,000 / 1,270,000 = 67.7% of original list. I adjusted that UP to ~71% for mileage, since our car has 49,000 km versus that listing's 70,000 km, then DOWN by a factor of 0.90 to ~61%, because a NT$1.75M car depreciates faster in percentage terms in Taiwan than a NT$1.27M one. Applied to real_cost NT$1,755,000 that gives a DEALER RETAIL of ~NT$1,070,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale = retail x 0.893 (NT$955,000); dealer_tradein = private x 0.859 (NT$820,000). Confidence low: the anchor is a single predecessor listing from the same Yunlin dealer that also posts the segment's other outlier asking price, plus two judgement-based corrections and a nameplate change in between."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION, same method as the 7-year row and equally not real GR86 data. Values unchanged in review; the supporting characterisation corrected. Ten-year-ish anchors from the ZN6 86 on 8891 (auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/86): a 2016-MY at 58,000 km asks NT$683,000 (= 53.8% of its ~NT$1,269,000 list) and a 2017-MY at 50,000 km asks NT$880,000 (= 71.5% of ~NT$1,230,000). CORRECTION MADE IN REVIEW: the original record described the ZN6 curve as 'unusually FLAT' with ten-year-old 86s fetching NT$650,000-880,000, and implied its own numbers were therefore biased low. That was cherry-picked. The same 49-listing page also shows a 2015-MY at 67,000 km asking NT$486,000, a 2013-MY at 33,000 km asking NT$490,000, a 2013-MY at 30,000 km asking NT$318,000 and a 2012-MY at 75,000 km asking NT$698,000 — a true spread of roughly 26-72% of original list at this age, not 54-72%, and a central tendency nearer 45-55% than the 57% the original record used. The NT$650,000-880,000 pair are the top of a very noisy distribution, largely from one optimistic Yunlin dealer. I have kept the original figures because the record already shaded its 57% down to ~48.5%, which lands inside the corrected central band; that gives a DEALER RETAIL of ~NT$851,000 on real_cost NT$1,755,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale = retail x 0.893 (NT$760,000); dealer_tradein = private x 0.855 (NT$650,000). The steeper 7-to-10-year step versus the 5-to-7-year step is intentional: it is the out-of-warranty cliff, where mainstream buyers discount for repair risk on an ageing boxer."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Interval and free-inspection entitlement verified on toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx, which states new owners get a free one-month check and a free first-half-year (or 10,000 km) check. Cost from 86-club.tw/forum.php?mod=viewthread&tid=3336, verified in review: T30 package NT$4,425, oil filter NT$460, drain gasket NT$60, with the price list carrying a 2024-01-11 update. Uprated modestly to ~NT$5,000 for the FA24's larger ~5.6 L fill, plus wipers and fluids. Time-driven, not mileage-driven: the car reaches only 7,000 km, well short of the 10,000 km trigger. Cheapest window by far because Toyota TW covers the 1-month and 6-month visits."},{"y":3,"source":"Schedule verified on toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx (T50 odd years, T60 even years at this mileage). Unit costs scaled from the 86-club.tw owner price list (T30 package NT$4,425, brake fluid NT$452, 2024-01-11 update) to 2026 money. Estimate assumes the owner follows the book to protect resale on an enthusiast car, but the theoretical total is trimmed: at 21,000 km a service adviser will realistically defer the T50 spark plugs and air filter, so this is not a full-menu figure. Time-driven, not mileage-driven."},{"y":5,"source":"Tyre price from Taiwan retail listings for 215/40R18 Michelin PS4 at ~NT$3,500-5,000 per tyre, budgeted at NT$24,000 fitted for tyres alone. Brake pad baseline from 86-club.tw/forum.php?mod=viewthread&tid=3336 (standard 86 front NT$7,000, verified), doubled for the Brembo package — that doubling is inference, not a quoted Brembo price. Service cadence per the verified toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx intervals. The tyre and battery items are age-triggered, which is exactly why a low-mileage car does NOT escape them: the tyres will have plenty of tread and still need replacing on date code."},{"y":7,"source":"REVISED UP IN REVIEW from NT$68,000, which sat below the year-5 figure and broke the requirement that maintenance cost generally rise with age. The AT fluid service has been moved here from the 7-10 year window — it falls due around 7 years / 49,000 km, and a second one is not needed by 70,000 km — and the out-of-warranty allowance lifted from NT$15,000 to NT$16,000. Service cadence from the verified toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx; Brembo pad cost scaled ~2x from the 86-club.tw standard-86 rear pad figure of NT$5,350 (verified). Reliability risk items from carmaxtw.com/used-toyota-gr86-price/ (verified), which names the 2022 RTV sealant / oil pickup tube concern for early cars and stresses verifying full service records. HONEST CAVEAT: the risk allowance and the bushing line are engineering judgement, not quoted TW repair invoices — no GR86 in Taiwan has yet reached seven years, so no owner receipts exist for this window. Tyres are NOT repeated here; the year-5 set is still in date."},{"y":10,"source":"REVISED DOWN IN REVIEW from NT$148,000: the automatic transmission fluid service has been moved into the 5-7 year window where it actually falls due, so it is no longer double-counted here. Service cadence from the verified toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx; tyre pricing as per the year-5 row; brake costs scaled ~2x from the 86-club.tw standard-86 list for the Brembo package, which is inference rather than a quoted Brembo price. HONEST CAVEAT — this is the least evidenced row in the record: the GR86 has existed in Taiwan for four years, so every figure here is a forward projection of what a 10-year-old, out-of-warranty, Brembo-equipped boxer coupe costs, not observed data. Roughly NT$47,000/yr across this window is high for a Toyota but appropriate for a sports model where brakes, tyres and dampers are all premium parts and all age out rather than wear out at 7,000 km/yr. A meaningful share (discs, dampers) could be deferred by an owner willing to accept degraded performance, so treat this as an upper-middle estimate."}],"sources":[{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — GR86 official showroom","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/GR86/","note":"PRIMARY, re-verified independently in this review. Spec sheet 'GR86 202508A版', applicable to cars built from Jan 2026: 6MT Brembo NT$1,730,000, 6AT Brembo NT$1,740,000. 2,387cc flat-four, 234 ps at 7,000 rpm. Lineup is Brembo-only. The 6AT adds paddle shifters, SPORT/SNOW modes, 4 rear sensors, ACC (30-180 km/h), PCTM and PKSB over the 6MT. Confirms NT$1,740,000 is correct."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan — 愛車養護與保證 (owner maintenance)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx","note":"Verified in review. Official T30 / T50 / T60 package definitions and intervals (6 months or 10,000 km; odd years or 40,000 km from 20,000 km; even years or 40,000 km from 40,000 km). Confirms free 1-month and free first-6-month (or 10,000 km) new-owner inspections. No public NT$ price table — dealers quote individually."},{"name":"KingAutos — GR86 Taiwan lineup with Brembo trims added","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/353324","note":"ADDED IN REVIEW. November 2023 article giving the four-car TW range: 6MT NT$1,670,000, 6MT Brembo NT$1,720,000, 6AT NT$1,680,000, 6AT Brembo NT$1,730,000. This is the correct original-list denominator for 2023-MY used cars and disproves the original record's NT$1,598,000 figure and its '11% ramp over four years' story."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Toyota GR86 listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/gr86","note":"Re-pulled in review. SEVEN listings total, not the larger set the original record implied. Exactly two are 2023-MY: NT$1,398,000 at 10,000 km (6MT Brembo, Yunlin) and NT$1,240,000 at 37,000 km (6MT, Taoyuan). Four are 2024-MY: NT$1,428,000 at 10,000 km (6AT), NT$1,428,000 at 8,479 km (6MT Brembo), NT$1,460,000 at 7,500 km (6AT Brembo), NT$1,428,000 at 8,000 km (6MT Brembo). Plus one 2013 ZN6 at 190,000 km, NT$600,000. All are 車商售價 (dealer asking), discounted 9-11% to reach private sale."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Toyota 86 (ZN6 predecessor) listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/86","note":"Re-verified in review: 49 predecessor listings, the basis for the 7- and 10-year extrapolation. Anchors: 2019-MY at 70,000 km asking NT$860,000 and 2017-MY at 50,000 km asking NT$880,000 (both Yunlin, both 6MT) — but also 2015-MY at 67,000 km NT$486,000, 2013-MY at 33,000 km NT$490,000, 2013-MY at 30,000 km NT$318,000, 2012-MY at 75,000 km NT$698,000, 2018-MY at 150,000 km NT$798,000. The spread is far wider than the original record represented; condition and modification drive it."},{"name":"8891 listing — 2025 GR86, Taoyuan dealer","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4446903.html","note":"Verified in review: 2025-MY GR86, NT$1,380,000, Taoyuan, dealer 六順國際車業. Trim, transmission and mileage are NOT stated on the page, so the original record's use of it as a Brembo-comparable anchor is unsupported. Treated here as a soft anchor that caps the year-1 retail assumption."},{"name":"8891 listing — 2022 GR86, Taipei (任昱汽車)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-3798120.html","note":"Verified in review: 2022-MY GR86, NT$1,398,000, Taipei, dealer 任昱汽車. The original record's added detail (Aug-2022 registration, 2.4 AT, ~4,000 km) could not be confirmed from the page. Four-year-old anchor for the 5-year extrapolation."},{"name":"8891 listing — 2022 GR86, Taipei","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4057885.html","note":"Verified in review: 2022-MY GR86, NT$1,330,000, Taipei. The original record described this as 自售 (private sale) and used it to calibrate the private-versus-dealer gap; the page does not state seller type, so that claim is unsupported and has not been relied on."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — Toyota GR86 used listings","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&n=2&b=72&m=1802","note":"Verified in review, and DOWNGRADED as evidence. It shows exactly two cars — 2023-MY at 37,000 km NT$1,240,000 (冠豪汽車, Taoyuan) and 2024-MY at 8,479 km NT$1,428,000 (富展汽車, Kaohsiung) — which are the SAME two dealer listings already counted on 8891, same dealers and same prices. This is syndicated inventory, not independent corroboration; the original record's claim that it 'raises confidence in the 3-year row' is circular."},{"name":"MaxCar — 2026 二手 GR86 行情與注意事項","url":"https://carmaxtw.com/used-toyota-gr86-price/","note":"Verified in review. Secondary price guide: 2022-2023 AT NT$1,300,000-1,450,000, MT NT$1,350,000-1,500,000, 2024+ NT$1,500,000+, 2022 10th Anniversary NT$1,450,000-1,600,000. Also the source for the early-2022 RTV sealant / oil pickup tube risk (described as rare overseas, minimal in Taiwan) and the note that ECU tuning voids engine warranty."},{"name":"86-Club Taiwan — owner service and parts price compilation","url":"https://www.86-club.tw/forum.php?mod=viewthread&tid=3336","note":"Verified in review. Standard (non-Brembo) 86 figures: T30 package NT$4,425 (the original record said NT$4,590), oil filter NT$460, drain gasket NT$60, brake fluid NT$452, front pads NT$7,000, rear pads NT$5,350. Thread opened 2013 but its title records a 2024-01-11 update, so it is much more current than the original record's 'dated 2013 compilation' description. Brembo parts remain inferred at ~2x, which is the weakest link in the maintenance block."},{"name":"8891 — 刊登出售收費標準 (listing fee schedule)","url":"https://www.8891.com.tw/help-b_1_1.html","note":"Verified in review. 寄售 is FREE for individual sellers, 60 days, up to 12 photos, capped at 2 concurrent listings; the paid 出售汽車 product costs 400 points for 60 days. So a private seller's listing-fee floor is NT$0 — the NT$1,500 in selling_costs is a discretionary cross-posting and relist budget, not a required fee."},{"name":"U-CAR — Toyota GR86 Taiwan launch (NOT VERIFIABLE)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/71858","note":"UNVERIFIED — returns HTTP 403 to direct fetch, both for the original researcher and in this review. Cited for the 2022-08-18 launch at NT$1,528,000 (6MT) / NT$1,568,000 (6AT) and a 60-unit 2022 allocation (40 automatic). The launch prices are consistent with the KingAutos 2023 lineup article and are treated as probable; the granular 60-unit / 40-automatic quota claim could not be checked and should not be leaned on."},{"name":"U-CAR — Toyota 86 (ZN6) Taiwan launch pricing (NOT VERIFIABLE)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/16329","note":"UNVERIFIED — U-CAR returns HTTP 403 to direct fetch. Cited for the 2012 launch range NT$1,229,000 / 1,269,000 / 1,299,000, used as the denominator for the predecessor retention ratios at 7 and 10 years. Retained because the 7- and 10-year rows are already marked low confidence and their source strings state the extrapolation openly."},{"name":"U-CAR — Toyota 86 facelift pricing (NOT VERIFIABLE)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/32425","note":"UNVERIFIED — U-CAR returns HTTP 403 to direct fetch. Cited for the 2017 facelift opening at NT$1,230,000 起, used as the original-list denominator for the 2017-2019 MY 86 listings behind the 7-year extrapolation."},{"name":"U-CAR — Toyota TW warranty 3 years / 100,000 km (NOT VERIFIABLE)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/5715","note":"UNVERIFIED — returns HTTP 403 to direct fetch. Cited for Hotai raising the standard new-car warranty from 2 years / 50,000 km to 3 years / 100,000 km. The 3-year / 100,000 km term is the widely known current Toyota TW standard and the record's use of it (time-limited, lapsing at year 3 with ~21,000 km) is unaffected by the fetch failure."}]},"toyota-gr-yaris-at":{"assumptions":"買家年行駛 6,000-8,000 km，遠低於台灣平均 12,000-15,000 km。各檢查點一律以 7,000 km/年計（7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km）。此低里程假設對兩邊都有影響：(1) 殘值端，低里程車賣得比「不看里程的平均行情」高，所以本表所有殘值都刻意引用低里程實例，並在 source 說明；(2) 保養端，Toyota 台灣官方定保是「每半年或 1 萬公里，以先到者為準」（官網原文「建議您愛車每半年或 1 萬公里回廠進行定期保養」），在 7,000 km/年之下 10 年全期都由『時間』觸發、不是里程 —— 一年固定兩次進廠、10 年約 20 次，跟開多少完全無關。原廠保固 3 年／10 萬公里，同樣是時間先到，第 3 年就出保（屆時里程僅 21,000 km，離 10 萬公里還很遠），所以第 5、7、10 年都必須編列出保後的自費風險。此車為純汽油（1.6L 三缸渦輪 G16E-GTS + GR-FOUR 四驅），無充電樁等 BEV 相關成本。依規定，牌照稅、燃料稅與任何保險（強制險、車體險）全部排除在本記錄之外。","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"high","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"8891 中古車 GR Yaris 車系頁（https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/gr-yaris）由 fact-check 端於 2026-08-12 獨立重新讀取，全頁 16 筆。同款 AT、同年式（2026）低里程實例三筆【車商售價】：NT$1,798,000（2,000 km，桃園）、NT$1,750,000（800 km，基隆）、NT$1,698,000（2,000 km，台中），中位數 1,750,000；另有 2026 AT 2,300 km（台北）與 2025 AT 6,000 km（苗栗）標「電洽」無價可用。本檔設定 1 年 7,000 km，比這些近全新車再多用一些，但仍遠低於台灣同齡平均（12,000-15,000 km），故車商售價僅小幅下修至 1,700,000。價格鏈調整（本表核心）：車商售價 1,700,000 → 自售 -11% = 1,510,000 → 車商收購 -12% = 1,330,000。已確認引用值不是直接抄車商開價（1,510,000 較觀察到的車商開價中位數低 13.7%，落在合理的 8-15% 區間內）。同變速箱、同年式、多筆實掛牌照價且經二次獨立讀取，故 high。"},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"同 8891 車系頁（2026-08-12 重新讀取）的第一代實例【車商售價】：2023年式（3 年）28,000 km NT$1,398,000（彰化）、2022年式（4 年）18,700 km NT$1,380,000（新竹）、2022年式 24,000 km NT$1,320,000（台中）、2022年式 31,000 km NT$1,298,000（台北）。該世代原始定價 NT$1,790,000（2021-08 上市，首批配額 80 台；已用 DuckDuckGo 檢索交叉確認「正式售價179萬元」「首批配額增至80輛」），故 3 年車商售價保值率約 78.1%、4 年約 72.5-77.1%。本車里程更低（21,000 km，低於該 3 年實例的 28,000 km）本應加分，但 AT 版的在台配額數量未知、可能比第一代首批 80 台寬鬆，未來在市車源會較多，兩者抵銷後保守取 77%：1,990,000 × 77% ≈ 車商售價 1,530,000。再 -11% 得自售 1,360,000，-12.5% 得車商收購 1,190,000。資料點為同車系但跨變速箱、跨世代代用，故 medium。"},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"8891 車系頁上唯一一筆 5 年期實例（2026-08-12 重新讀取確認）：2021年式 6MT、19,000 km，【車商售價】NT$1,298,000（台北），對原始定價 1,790,000 為 72.5%（另一筆 2021年式 13,000 km 標「電洽」，無價可用）。本車設定 35,000 km，里程高於該實例，且 AT 版在市量預期較大，下修至 69%：1,990,000 × 69% ≈ 車商售價 1,370,000。再 -11.5% 得自售 1,210,000，-13% 得車商收購 1,050,000。註：本車 35,000 km 相對台灣同齡平均（約 60,000-75,000 km）仍屬低里程，69% 已是保守取值。同齡實例僅一筆、且為手排版，故 medium 而非 high。"},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"外推，非實測。GR Yaris 2021-08 才在台上市，2026-08 全市場最老僅 5 年，7 年車不存在，AT 版更是不到 1 年 —— 沒有任何真實成交可引用。【本次 fact-check 修正】原研究者直接把 Toyota 86 的『絕對保值率』（7-8 年 53-57%）套到 GR Yaris 並取上緣 57%，但這忽略了兩車保值水準的落差：GR Yaris 自己在第 5 年的實測車商售價保值率是 72.5%，而 86 在第 7 年才約 57%，GR Yaris 整條曲線明顯高於 86。若照原做法，本車要在第 5→7 年這兩年內從 72.5% 崩到 57%（掉 15.5 個百分點），之後三年只再掉 12 個百分點，曲線形狀自相矛盾。改採：以本車自己實測的第 5 年 72.5% 為錨，套用性能車第 5 年後跌幅趨緩的形狀，第 7 年取 60% 車商售價保值率（仍高於 86 同齡的約 57%，反映 WRC 同源配額限量車的稀有度溢價）。1,990,000 × 60% ≈ 車商售價 1,195,000，再 -13% 得自售 1,040,000，-14% 得車商收購 895,000。代用車佐證：8891 Toyota 86 車系頁（https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/86，2026-08-12 讀取，共 49 筆）2016-2019 年式【車商售價】NT$683,000-880,000，其中 2019 年式 NT$860,000。註：86 的 2017 小改款定價（約 1,499,000）查無可靠來源、本次亦未能驗證，故本點刻意降低對 86 絕對百分比的依賴，改以本車自身曲線外推。純外推，故 low。"},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"外推，非實測，理由同第 7 年。【本次 fact-check 修正，本記錄最大的一處錯誤】原研究者在第 7 年把 GR Yaris 調到 86 區間的『上緣』（57%，理由是 GR 稀有度加分），卻在第 10 年調到 86 區間的『下方』（45%，理由是渦輪四驅維修風險與絕對價位）—— 同樣兩個理由、沒有任何新證據，卻在相鄰兩個檢查點得到相反方向的結論，這是方法上的矛盾。且 45% 低於代用車 86 同齡實測：8891 Toyota 86 車系頁 2016 年式（10 年）【車商售價】NT$683,000 起、區間至 NT$880,000，對 2012 上市價 1,229,000-1,299,000 約 53-68%；86 是大量販售車，GR Yaris 是配額限量的 WRC 同源車，沒有理由跌得比 86 還兇。改採 50% 車商售價保值率：1,990,000 × 50% ≈ 車商售價 995,000，再 -14% 得自售 855,000，-15% 得車商收購 725,000。取 50%（低於 86 的 53-68%）已保留兩項下修因素：1.6 渦輪 + GR-FOUR 出保後的維修風險與零件成本高於自然進氣後驅的 86；且原始定價 1,990,000 使 10 年後的絕對價位仍偏高，在台灣二手市場屬買家池較小的價帶。曲線檢查：第 5→7 年每年約 -85,000、第 7→10 年每年約 -62,000，跌幅隨車齡趨緩，符合性能車價格觸底的一般型態。純外推，故 low。"}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"間隔與套餐內容取自 Toyota 台灣官方 https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx（每半年或 1 萬公里，以先到者為準；T30/T50/T60 內容），由 fact-check 端 2026-08-12 獨立讀取確認。單次價位以 Mobile01 車主回報之一般 Toyota 原廠定保 NT$1,500-2,900 為基準，依 GR 版本的機油量與 GR 認證據點工資上調至約 4,000 —— 此上調為推估，無 GR Yaris 實際單據佐證。加總 8,000 + 1,000 = 9,000，與 period_cost 對帳一致。"},{"y":3,"source":"同上官方間隔與套餐；本區間為第 1-3 年共 2 年，時間觸發下 4 次進廠（每半年一次）。第 3 年結束時里程僅 21,000 km，遠低於保固的 10 萬公里，故保固是被「3 年」而非里程終結。【修正】原記錄列項加總為 24,000 但 period_cost 填 26,000，差 2,000 無說明；已補列「小耗材約 2,000」使 22,000 + 2,000 + 2,000 = 26,000 對帳一致，維持原總額。"},{"y":5,"source":"定保部分同官方間隔推算；輪胎以台灣市售 Michelin Pilot Sport 4S 225/40R18 含工約 8,000-9,000/條 × 4 估算（多家台灣輪胎通路報價區間，非單一報價單）；煞車來令片與風險準備為依車輛規格所做的估算，非引用實際單據。加總 23,000 + 35,000 + 12,000 + 5,000 = 75,000，與 period_cost 對帳一致。"},{"y":7,"source":"外推。台灣沒有任何一台 GR Yaris 開到 7 年，無實際單據可引用。四驅油品、火星塞、電瓶的到期時點依 G16E-GTS + GR-FOUR 的一般規格與台灣原廠實務推估；風險準備依「渦輪四驅性能車、已出保 4 年」的失效機率設定。輪胎不列入本區間，因第 5 年那套依年限可撐到第 10 年前後。【修正】原記錄列項加總 84,000 但 period_cost 填 85,000；已將 period_cost 改為 84,000 與列項對帳一致。"},{"y":10,"source":"外推。同樣無 10 年實例。此區間為第 7-10 年共 3 年，故定保次數為 6 次。【修正】原記錄列項加總 162,000 但 period_cost 填 160,000；已將 period_cost 改為 162,000 與列項對帳一致。修正後 10 年累計保養約 NT$356,000／70,000 km ≈ NT$5.09/km：對一台已出保 7 年的 1.6 渦輪四驅性能車而言屬合理量級 —— Toyota 零件與工資低於歐系品牌，但總里程只有 70,000 km，兩項因素同時壓低了這個數字。"}],"sources":[{"name":"Toyota 台灣官網 GR YARIS 車型頁","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/GR_YARIS/","note":"已由 fact-check 端獨立重新讀取（2026-08-12）。官方建議售價 AT NT$1,990,000、MT NT$1,950,000；規格註記「2026年5月起生產」，確認為現行在售年式。原研究者的 list_price 複驗結果一致，差異 0%，不修改。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 Toyota GR Yaris 車系頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/gr-yaris","note":"已由 fact-check 端獨立重新讀取（2026-08-12），共 16 筆在售車，逐筆核對原研究者引用值全部正確。關鍵實例（皆為【車商售價】，非自售價）：2026 AT 800-2,300 km／1,698,000-1,798,000（另 1 筆電洽）；2025 6MT 2,000-3,000 km／1,680,000-1,758,000；2025 AT 6,000 km 電洽；2023 6MT 28,000 km／1,398,000；2022 6MT 18,700/24,000/31,000 km／1,380,000・1,320,000・1,298,000；2021 6MT 19,000 km／1,298,000（另 1 筆 13,000 km 電洽）。第 1、3、5 年殘值的主要依據。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 Toyota 86 車系頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/86","note":"已由 fact-check 端獨立重新讀取（2026-08-12），共 49 筆。第 7、10 年外推的代用車佐證：2016-2019 年式【車商售價】NT$683,000-880,000（2019 年式 NT$860,000）、2014-2015 年式 NT$358,000-798,000、2012-2013 年式 NT$316,000-698,000。註：原研究者引用的分段區間（2018-2019 年式 798,000-860,000、2015-2017 年式 680,000-818,000）與本次讀到的分段不完全一致，且低估了較舊年式的上緣，故本次已降低對 86 絕對百分比的依賴。"},{"name":"Toyota 台灣官網 愛車養護與保證","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx","note":"已由 fact-check 端獨立重新讀取（2026-08-12）並確認為真：官方定保間隔「每半年或 1 萬公里，以先到者為準」，以及 T30（每半年/1 萬公里）／T50（每 1 年/4 萬公里）／T60（每 2 年/4 萬公里）套餐的實際更換項目。整份保養表的間隔依據。頁面未載明新車保固年限。"},{"name":"DuckDuckGo 檢索：GR Yaris 自排 199 萬上市（Mobile01／U-CAR／SiCAR 標題與摘要）","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=GR+Yaris+%E8%87%AA%E6%8E%92+199%E8%90%AC+%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82+%E6%89%8B%E6%8E%92+195%E8%90%AC","note":"已由 fact-check 端讀取（2026-08-12）。多家媒體標題一致：AT（8速手自排）2025-09-23 上市、售價 1,990,000；手排同步調降 100,000 至 1,950,000。用於交叉確認官網價格與上市沿革。僅讀到標題與摘要，未讀原文全文。"},{"name":"DuckDuckGo 檢索：GR Yaris 2021 在台上市 179 萬、首批 80 台","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=GR+Yaris+2021+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+179%E8%90%AC","note":"已由 fact-check 端讀取（2026-08-12）。摘要一致顯示「正式售價179萬元」「首批配額增至80輛」。這是第 3、5 年保值率換算的分母，屬載重數字，故特別做了獨立交叉驗證。"},{"name":"DuckDuckGo 檢索：GR Yaris／Toyota 原廠保養費用（Mobile01 車主回報）","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=GR+Yaris+%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A+%E8%B2%BB%E7%94%A8+%E6%A9%9F%E6%B2%B9+mobile01","note":"已由 fact-check 端讀取（2026-08-12）。車主回報一般 Toyota 原廠基本定保約 NT$1,500-2,900（自備機油更低），較大級距回報有 NT$5,000-9,000 者。未找到 GR Yaris 專屬的實際保養單據，故本表 T30 級距 4,000 屬推估上調值。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 Subaru WRX 車系頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/subaru/wrx-sti","note":"已由 fact-check 端讀取驗證（2026-08-12），URL 有效、內容為 WRX（非 STI）listings，原研究者引用數字正確：2014-2016 年式 2.0i Sport Lineartronic 車商售價 340,000-396,000、里程 40,000-100,000 km。曾評估作為 7／10 年代用車（同為渦輪四驅性能車），但保值率僅約 25%，與 Toyota 品牌殘值落差過大，判定不適用而未採用。列此以說明取捨過程。"},{"name":"U-CAR（未能驗證）：GR Yaris 自排版 199 萬上市","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/85745","note":"【驗證狀態：無法驗證】news.u-car.com.tw 對 WebFetch 一律回 HTTP 403，本次 fact-check 亦無法讀取，故無法確認此 URL 是否指向所述文章。其內容（AT 199 萬、9/23 上市、MT 降至 195 萬）已透過上方 DuckDuckGo 檢索與 Toyota 官網獨立確認，故結論不受影響。"},{"name":"U-CAR（未能驗證）：GR Yaris 2021 在台發表，售價 179 萬","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/67217","note":"【驗證狀態：無法驗證】同樣因 403 無法讀取。其內容（179 萬、首批 80 台）已透過上方 DuckDuckGo 檢索獨立確認，故結論不受影響。"},{"name":"U-CAR（未能驗證）：小改款 GR Yaris 手排 205 萬上市","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/82251","note":"【驗證狀態：無法驗證】403 無法讀取。內容（2024-12 小改款手排 205 萬）僅作為定價沿革背景，不直接影響任何計算。"},{"name":"U-CAR（未能驗證）：和泰 Toyota 新車保固 3 年 10 萬公里","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/5715","note":"【驗證狀態：無法驗證】403 無法讀取；Toyota 官方保養頁亦未載明保固年限。3 年／10 萬公里是台灣 Toyota 長期通行的條件，但本次未取得可驗證來源。此數字影響「第 3 年出保」的判定與第 5、7、10 年風險準備的起點，請視為未經證實的假設。"},{"name":"U-CAR（未能驗證）：Toyota 86 在台上市 122.9 萬起","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/16329","note":"【驗證狀態：無法驗證】403 無法讀取。注意此 URL 的路徑格式（/article/）與其他 U-CAR 來源（/news/article/）不一致，可信度更低。86 於 2012 在台上市價 1,229,000／1,269,000／1,299,000 供第 10 年代用換算。另原記錄用到的「2017 小改款約 1,499,000」完全沒有對應 URL、原研究者亦自陳來源是搜尋引擎回應查詢字串本身 —— 該數字本次未採信，第 7 年已改以本車自身第 5 年實測曲線外推。"}]},"toyota-gr-supra-at":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr; all checkpoints use 7,000 km/yr (7000/21000/35000/49000/70000 km), roughly half the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/yr. That matters twice over. (1) Servicing is almost entirely TIME-driven: Toyota TW's official table triggers T30 either every 6 months by age OR, for SUPRA specifically, at 12,000 km then every 24,000 km. At 7,000 km/yr the 12,000 km mark arrives at ~1.7 yr, T50 (24,000 km) at ~3.4 yr, T60 (48,000 km) at ~6.9 yr, so the calendar clock fires far more often than the odometer. (2) Consumables age out rather than wear out: the staggered Michelin PS4S 255/35R19 front / 275/35R19 rear set is replaced on rubber hardening at ~5-6 years, not on tread depth. Toyota TW warranty is 3 years / 100,000 km, so this buyer is time-limited: cover expires at year 3 with only ~21,000 km on the car, and every year after carries full parts risk on the BMW-sourced B58 engine and ZF 8HP gearbox. Tax (牌照稅/燃料稅) and insurance are excluded from this record by design. A90 production ended March 2026 (verified), so this is a final-year car; that is a mild support for residuals but it is a forecast about the 2033-2036 market, not an observed fact, and this record deliberately gives it only modest weight in the year-10 figure.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Back-extrapolated one year from verified 8891 listings (https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/gr-supra), re-read directly: a 2024 3.0T AT with 3,900 km asks NT$2,198,000 (2 years old, ~85% of its ~NT$2,580,000 original list), and the 2023 cluster sits at NT$2,040,000-2,060,000 (3 years old, ~81%). Stepping one year back gives a 1-year dealer RETAIL ask of ~NT$2,340,000 (87% of list). ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: that is 車商售價, not what an owner receives — cut 12% to reach 自售價 NT$2,060,000, then a further 13% to reach 車商收購價 NT$1,790,000. Upper end of the 8-15% dealer-retail-to-private band used because the Taiwan Supra market is extremely thin, so asks are unusually padded and cars sit for months. The 2024 comparator is a genuinely low-mileage AT car (3,900 km), matching this buyer's 7,000 km profile and the same transmission as this record."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Four genuine 3-year-old (2023 MY) cars on 8891 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/gr-supra), mileages re-read directly from the page: 17,900 km / NT$2,060,000 (Hsinchu), 6,400 km / NT$2,040,000 (Taipei), 18,000 km / NT$2,058,000 (Tainan), and 2,686 km / NT$2,280,000 (Taipei). This buyer's car is at 21,000 km at year 3, so the correct comparators are the 17,900 km and 18,000 km cars, which cluster tightly at NT$2,058,000-2,060,000; the 2,686 km car at NT$2,280,000 is excluded as a much-lower-mileage outlier rather than as an aspirational one. Against the 2023 3.0T Premium MT list of NT$2,550,000 (verified) that is a dealer ask-to-list ratio of ~81% at 3 years. Applying 81% to this car's NT$2,690,000 list gives a dealer ask of ~NT$2,179,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: -12% to private sale NT$1,920,000, then -13% to dealer trade-in NT$1,670,000. Ratio normalisation rather than raw cash comparison, because the 3.0T Premium's Taiwan list has risen from NT$2,480,000 (2019) to NT$2,690,000 (2026). CONFIDENCE CAVEAT: all four comparators are MT cars while this record is the AT, and these are asking prices rather than transactions — hence medium, not high."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"One verifiable 5-year-old (2021 MY) listing: NT$1,768,000 dealer ask in Taipei (明龍汽車) at https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-3952542.html, mileage not disclosed on the page. Against a 2021 3.0T Premium list of ~NT$2,480,000 that is a ~71% ask-to-list ratio. I adjusted up to 73% to credit this buyer's genuinely low 35,000 km, since the comparator's mileage is unknown and could be anything. 73% of NT$2,690,000 = dealer ask ~NT$1,964,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: -12% to private sale NT$1,728,000, then -13% to dealer trade-in NT$1,503,000. This is the first checkpoint fully outside Toyota TW's 3-year warranty, which weighs on buyer confidence for a BMW-engined car. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED to low: a second 2021 data point at NT$1,958,000 attributed to 小老婆車庫 could not be reproduced on any page I fetched, and that figure is identical to the unrelated 2020 Kaohsiung car's ask, so it is treated as unverifiable and excluded. This checkpoint rests on a single listing with undisclosed mileage."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"The A90 launched in Taiwan in 2019 so 7-year-old cars of this generation exist, but the market is nearly empty and the only verifiable bracketing point is a 2020 3.0T AT with 94,377 km asking NT$1,958,000, confirmed on both SUM (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=4&brand=TOYOTA&model=SUPRA) and 8891. A 6-year-old car with 94,377 km asking ~76% of its original list is a clear aspirational-ask signal on a thin market, not a transaction price. I therefore set a clean low-mileage 7-year ask-to-list at 67% — below the observed ask, stripping thin-market padding, while crediting that this buyer's car has 49,000 km rather than 94,000 km. 67% of NT$2,690,000 = dealer ask ~NT$1,802,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: -12% to private sale NT$1,586,000, then -13% to dealer trade-in NT$1,380,000. Confidence is low: this rests on one high-mileage aspirational ask. NOTE ON A REMOVED SOURCE: a 2019 3.0T AT listing asking NT$2,080,000 with 百萬改裝 was cited in the prior draft but does not appear on the 8891 Supra hub, which returns six listings none of which is a 2019 car; it is treated as unverifiable and plays no part in this figure."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no genuine 10-year data can exist for the A90 (Taiwan launch 2019). The literal predecessor A80 Supra (1993-2002) is unusable: it is a 25-year-old appreciating collectible in Taiwan whose prices have risen, so its retention ratio would be nonsense. I used the BMW Z4 E89 instead — same two-seat premium sports segment, same era, and direct predecessor of the G29 Z4 that is this Supra's platform twin. Verified Taiwan data (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=4&brand=BMW&model=Z4): a 2013 sDrive28i with 102,686 km asks NT$738,000 and a 2011 sDrive20i with 147,721 km asks NT$588,000; against an E89 sDrive28i original list of roughly NT$2,700,000 that is ~27% ask-to-list at 13 years. Interpolating back to 10 years gives ~35%. I adjusted UP to 45% for the one concrete, quantifiable reason: this car has 70,000 km against the comparators' 102,000-148,000 km, plus a modest allowance for the Supra's stronger enthusiast demand and Toyota reliability halo. I did NOT credit a last-of-the-generation collector premium — that is a forecast about the 2036 market, not evidence, and Taiwan buyers get materially more cautious past the 10-year 車齡 mark for financing and insurance reasons. 45% of NT$2,690,000 = dealer ask ~NT$1,211,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: -12% to private sale NT$1,065,000, then -13% to dealer trade-in NT$927,000. This is a reasoned extrapolation, not an observation."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Official Toyota TW schedule (https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx) for interval structure, re-verified by direct fetch. Cost anchored on published Toyota TW T30 package pricing for larger models (RAV4 Hybrid T30 ~NT$8,585) and scaled for the Supra's 3.0 six-cylinder oil volume. At 7,000 km/yr the buyer never reaches the free 10,000 km inspection inside year 1, and never reaches the Supra's 12,000 km T30 mileage trigger, so this year is time-driven only. Fully in warranty, so no repair provision. Note this models one annual oil service rather than the book's strict 每半年, which is what low-mileage owners actually do; a strictly book-compliant owner would spend roughly NT$8,000 more."},{"y":3,"source":"Official Toyota TW T30 schedule and the SUPRA mileage footnote (https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx). Time-driven period: the book calls for T30 每半年, and I modelled three paid services across the two-year window rather than four, which is what low-mileage owners realistically do while keeping warranty compliance. The 12,000 km SUPRA mileage trigger also lands here (~1.7 yr) and is covered by those services. Brake fluid is added on its own 2-year clock because the Supra's T60 mileage trigger (48,000 km) does not arrive until ~6.9 yr. The complimentary 10,000 km check falls in this window but is an inspection only, so it does not displace a paid oil service. Still inside the 3-year / 100,000 km warranty, so no repair provision. Costs are estimates — Toyota TW publishes no Supra price list."},{"y":5,"source":"Interval structure from the official Toyota TW SUPRA footnote — the 24,000 km T50 lands at ~3.4 yr at 7,000 km/yr (https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx). Tyre cost verified against Taiwan retail pricing for Michelin PS4S 255/35R19 at NT$7,600-8,800 per tyre with four-tyre bundles at NT$37,152-38,959 (https://biggo.com.tw/s/ps4s%20255-35-19); the wider 275/35R19 rears price higher, giving ~NT$35,000 for the staggered set plus ~NT$5,000 fitting, balancing and alignment. The tyres are replaced here because at 7,000 km/yr the compound hardens and ages out at 5-6 years long before the tread wears — a mileage-blind model would wrongly skip this. Warranty expires at year 3, so the back half of this window is at the owner's cost. Service prices are estimates, not a published list."},{"y":7,"source":"T60 timing from the official Toyota TW SUPRA footnote (48,000 km, reached at ~6.9 yr at 7,000 km/yr) — https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx. Fully out of warranty for this entire window (cover ended at year 3 on the time clock), which is why an explicit repair provision is included rather than assuming nothing breaks. Brake pads and discs are time-and-heat driven on a 250kW+ sports car even at low mileage, and Toyota TW GR dealers typically replace discs with pads rather than machining them. The risk provision is an estimate based on well-documented B58 wear items, not a Taiwan price list — no such list is published for the Supra."},{"y":10,"source":"Extrapolated. The 60,000 km T30 trigger at ~8.6 yr comes from the official Toyota TW SUPRA footnote (https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx); everything else is an estimated consumable-replacement and risk schedule for a 7-10 year old car entirely outside warranty. Second tyre set follows the same 5-6 year age-out logic as year 5, priced from verified Taiwan retail (https://biggo.com.tw/s/ps4s%20255-35-19). The ZF 8HP service is included because the A90 owner community widely does it around 80,000 km or 8-10 years despite BMW's lifetime-fill claim. The NT$60,000 risk provision reflects that this is a BMW powertrain in its second decade with no warranty and dealer-level parts pricing. Sanity check: 10-year maintenance totals ~NT$470,000 (~NT$47,000/yr) — high for a Toyota, normal for a BMW-engined sports car on staggered performance tyres. No owner receipts with NT$ figures could be found for the A90 in Taiwan, so this window is low confidence by construction."}],"sources":[{"name":"Toyota Taiwan official showroom — GR SUPRA","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/showroom/SUPRA/","note":"Official 建議售價, independently re-fetched during this audit: 3.0T Premium MT NT$2,660,000 / 3.0T Premium AT NT$2,690,000 / 3.0T Track Edition NT$2,800,000. Confirms NT$2,690,000 for the AT — 0% variance, no correction needed. Spec table footnoted 「2025/3月起生產之SUPRA車輛規格配備」."},{"name":"Toyota Taiwan official 定期保養 schedule (T30/T50/T60)","url":"https://www.toyota.com.tw/owner_maintenance.aspx","note":"Primary maintenance source, independently re-fetched and confirmed verbatim. SUPRA-specific footnotes: T30 「(SIENNA車型為8千公里起每1.6萬公里實施/SUPRA車型為1.2萬公里起每2.4萬公里實施)」, T50 「SUPRA車型為2.4萬公里起每4.8萬公里實施」, T60 「SUPRA車型為4.8萬公里起每4.8萬公里實施」. Explicitly publishes NO prices."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Toyota GR Supra listings hub","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/toyota/gr-supra","note":"Main used-price source, re-read directly during this audit. Six live listings as of 2026-08: 2024 AT 3,900 km NT$2,198,000 (Taipei); 2023 MT 17,900 km NT$2,060,000 (Hsinchu); 2023 MT 6,400 km NT$2,040,000 (Taipei); 2023 MT 18,000 km NT$2,058,000 (Tainan); 2023 MT 2,686 km NT$2,280,000 (Taipei); 2020 AT 94,000 km NT$1,958,000 (Kaohsiung). CORRECTION vs prior draft: the Hsinchu 2023 car is 17,900 km, NOT 1,790 km — a 10x misread. No 2019 car is listed on this page. All figures are 車商售價 (dealer retail asks), adjusted down before use."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — Toyota Supra search","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=4&brand=TOYOTA&model=SUPRA","note":"Re-fetched and confirmed. Only two Supra listings nationwide: 2022, 7,189 km, NT$2,098,000, MT (Pingtung) and 2020, 94,377 km, NT$1,958,000, AT (Kaohsiung). Confirms how thin this market is."},{"name":"8891 listing — 2021 GR Supra, Taipei (明龍汽車)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-3952542.html","note":"Re-fetched and confirmed: 2021 GR Supra, NT$1,768,000 dealer ask, 明龍汽車, Taipei. Mileage is genuinely not disclosed on the page. Sole verifiable anchor for the year-5 checkpoint, which is why that checkpoint is low confidence."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — BMW Z4 search (10-year extrapolation analogue)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=4&brand=BMW&model=Z4","note":"Re-fetched and confirmed. Used for the year-10 extrapolation only, since no 10-year A90 can exist and the A80 Supra is an appreciating collectible. 2013 sDrive28i, 102,686 km, NT$738,000 (Pingtung); 2011 sDrive20i E89, 147,721 km, NT$588,000 (Kaohsiung)."},{"name":"BigGo price comparison — Michelin Pilot Sport 4S 255/35R19","url":"https://biggo.com.tw/s/ps4s%20255-35-19","note":"Re-fetched and confirmed. Taiwan retail tyre pricing NT$7,600-8,800 per tyre, four-tyre bundles NT$37,152-38,959. Basis for the ~NT$40,000 fitted staggered-set cost in the year-5 and year-10 maintenance windows."},{"name":"Historical GR Supra Taiwan list prices (DuckDuckGo lite search-result snippets)","url":"https://lite.duckduckgo.com/lite/?q=%22GR+Supra%22+3.0T+Premium+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+258%E8%90%AC+%E6%88%96+255%E8%90%AC+2023+%E5%B9%B4%E5%BC%8F+%E5%92%8C%E6%B3%B0","note":"Provenance is honest: these are search-result snippets from Taiwan motoring outlets, which I fetched; I did not fetch the underlying articles individually, so I cite the page actually retrieved. Independently confirms 2023 3.0T Premium MT NT$2,550,000 and AT NT$2,580,000, and that the 2023 AT rose by NT$20,000 — which makes the 2022 AT NT$2,560,000, correcting a prior draft that listed 2022 AT as NT$2,580,000. 2019 launch NT$2,480,000. Used to convert observed asks into retention ratios rather than raw cash comparisons."},{"name":"A90 GR Supra production end (DuckDuckGo lite search-result snippets)","url":"https://lite.duckduckgo.com/lite/?q=Toyota+GR+Supra+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E5%81%9C%E7%94%A2+2026+%E7%94%9F%E7%94%A2+%E7%B5%90%E6%9D%9F+A90","note":"Confirms A90 production ceased March 2026, announced by Toyota in October 2025, with a Final Edition limited run. Supports treating the current showroom car as the final model year. Deliberately given only modest weight in the year-10 residual."}]},"volvo-ex30-plus":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year; every checkpoint uses 7,000 km x years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000), far below the TW average of 12,000-15,000 km/yr. Two consequences are built into the numbers. (1) Resale: quoted against low-mileage comparables and against genuine PRIVATE listings, not against dealer asking prices. (2) Maintenance: Volvo TW's EX30 mileage-based service triggers are 30,000 and 60,000 km (verified live against the official 保養服務規劃 QueryMileage API, which returns exactly '30000@@60000'), so at 7,000 km/yr this owner reaches 30,000 km at ~year 4.3 and 60,000 km at ~year 8.6 and is on the TIME-driven schedule for essentially the whole 10 years. Consumables are therefore AGE-driven, not tread-driven: tires are replaced because rubber hardens (~every 5 years), not because they wear out. EXCLUDED BY DESIGN: tax (牌照稅 is NT$0 for BEVs in TW under the current exemption anyway) and insurance. ALSO EXCLUDED: home AC charger hardware and installation, roughly NT$25,000-60,000 in TW depending on whether the building's electrical riser needs work and whether a dedicated meter (台電充電專用電表) is added. That is a real ownership cost but it is a one-off capital item, not maintenance, so it appears in neither purchase nor maintenance here — add it separately if the comparison needs it. Electricity cost is also excluded; for reference 8891 models the EX30 at 7.8 km/kWh.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"high","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REAL LISTINGS for this exact trim, re-retrieved and re-verified by this audit on 2026-08-12 (the single-motor Plus launched in TW 2025-08-04, so cars on the market now are genuinely ~1 year old). Two anchors bracket the 7,000 km target, on opposite sides of the dealer/private divide. (a) DEALER RETAIL: Volvo SELEKT factory-certified 《凱銳博愛》2026年式 EX30 Plus 珍珠白, 年份 2025, 行駛 3600 公里, asking 146.0萬 — confirmed on volvoselekt.com.tw and cross-confirmed as the same car on 8891 (4,000 km / 146.0萬, isRealShop=1). This is 車商售價 and a CERTIFIED one, i.e. the highest retail tier. (b) PRIVATE SELLER: 8891 listing '2026款 Plus Single Motor Extended Range', 10,000 km, asking 129.0萬 with isRealShop=0 — a genuine individual seller. ADJUSTMENT MADE (this is the whole point of the checkpoint): from (a) 146.0萬 certified retail took 14% for the retail-to-private step (the top of the 8-15% band, because a factory-certified car carries a warranty-and-inspection premium a private seller cannot match) = 125.6萬, then ~1.7萬 off for 3,600->7,000 km, giving ~123.9萬. From (b) 129.0萬 private ASKING took 5.5% for asking-to-transaction (a slow-turning BEV with 8 cars on the entire national market gets negotiated harder than the 3-4% typical of a liquid model) = 121.9萬, then added back ~1.5萬 for 10,000->7,000 km, giving ~123.4萬. The two independent routes converge at ~123.5-124萬, so private_sale_price = 1,240,000. NOTE: this is NT$220,000 BELOW the visible dealer asking price — anyone copying the 146萬 ask straight across would overstate the owner's proceeds by that much. Dealer trade-in set 11.3% below private; cross-check, a dealer buying at 110萬 and certifying to a 146萬 SELEKT ask carries ~23% gross on a realistic negotiated retail, which is normal for a slow-turning premium BEV."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no 3-year-old EX30 Plus exists in TW (trim on sale only since Aug 2025). Three inputs, triangulated. (1) 8891's own published retention model for the EX30 (用車成本 page, re-verified live: yr1 89.0%, yr2 79.2%, yr3 70.5%, yr4 64.9%, yr5 59.7%, yr6 54.9%, yr7 50.5%). Its curve is retail-flavoured. Rather than assume the retail-to-private haircut, this audit MEASURED it: the year-1 private figure of 123.9萬/159.99萬 = 77.4% against 8891's 89.0%, implying a factor of 0.87. Applying 0.87 to yr3: 70.5% -> 61.3% of list -> 98.1萬. (2) Volvo's own BEV evidence, the closest brand analogue, corrected by this audit: the previously cited '2024 EC40 Plus Single Motor, 8,200 km, 148.0萬' does NOT exist in Volvo SELEKT inventory and has been replaced with the real cars found there on 2026-08-12 — 2024-reg C40 Recharge Plus/Ultimate Single Motor, 10,950 km, asking 145.0萬, against a 201萬 original C40 Recharge Plus Single Motor list (KingAutos, verified) = 72.1% certified dealer retail at ~2 years, ~63% private, which maps to ~101萬 for the EX30 at yr3 after one more year of decay. (Corroborating SELEKT stock: 2024-reg EC40 Single Motor, 1,050 km, 158.0萬; 2025-reg EC40 Ultimate Single Motor, 6,353 km, 155.0萬.) (3) Low-mileage credit: 21,000 km vs a typical 36,000-45,000 km 3-year-old, worth ~+5%. Settled at 1,020,000 (64.8% of real_cost), between the calibrated-8891 and Volvo-BEV routes. Trade-in 12.7% below private."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from Volvo's OWN previous-generation BEV, which is the right predecessor analogue. REAL DATA POINT, re-verified on volvoselekt.com.tw 2026-08-12: 《新莊凱銳精選中古車》2022年 Volvo XC40 Recharge Ultimate Twin motor, 年份 2022, 行駛 22000 公里, asking 126.0萬. Original TW list for that trim was 222萬 (KingAutos Volvo price list, verified live — it still carries the pre-rename Recharge entries: XC40 Recharge Plus Single Motor 191萬, Ultimate Twin Motor 222萬, P8 AWD 219萬). Retention = 126/222 = 56.8% at 4 years as CERTIFIED dealer retail; applying the measured 0.87 retail-to-private factor gives 49.4% at 4 years, and extrapolating the slope to year 5 gives ~45-47% of list = 72-75萬 for the EX30. That analogue is harsh for two identifiable reasons: the XC40 Recharge was a 222萬 car (bigger absolute depreciation) and it was repriced hard when Volvo renamed the line to EX40, which repriced its entire used stock overnight. The calibrated-8891 route gives 59.7% -> 51.9% private -> 83.1萬, plus a low-mileage credit (35,000 km vs a typical 60,000-75,000 km 5-year-old) worth ~+7% -> ~88.9萬. Settled at 830,000 (52.7% of real_cost), between the two, leaning to the Volvo-BEV analogue because the price-cut/rename mechanism is real and repeatable for this segment. Trade-in 13.9% below private."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — low confidence. There is no 7-year-old Volvo BEV anywhere in TW, so per the BEV rule this leans on the oldest BEVs ACTUALLY TRADING here rather than on a combustion analogue. REAL 7-YEAR BEV DATA, every row re-verified against 8891's listing JSON on 2026-08-12: 2019 Tesla Model 3 dealer asks — SR+ 47,000 km 91.8萬; SR+ 75,000 km 88.0萬; LR 40,000 km 82.0萬; LR 116,000 km 85.8萬; LR 135,000 km 88.8萬; LR 163,000 km 78.8萬; LR 164,000 km 78.8萬. Expressed against the CURRENT new list (Model 3 標準版 169.99萬 / Long Range 199.99萬, KingAutos, verified live) these are 39-54%, median ~44% dealer retail. Using the current rather than the 2019 launch price is deliberate and is the core BEV effect: Tesla has cut TW list prices repeatedly, and used values track the current new price, not what the first owner paid. Applying the measured 0.87 factor gives ~38% of list, i.e. ~61萬 for the EX30 at 159.99萬 list; a modest low-mileage credit (49,000 km vs mostly 75,000-164,000 km in the comparable set) lifts it to 650,000 (41.3% of real_cost). Sanity check against combustion: a real 2019 Volvo XC40 T4 Momentum with 54,400 km asks 69.8萬 at a dealer today, a similar order of magnitude. Volvo's 3-year factory warranty is long gone by here and the extended-warranty programme cannot run past year 5, so this car is fully out of warranty except the HV battery. Trade-in 14.6% below private."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — lowest-confidence number in this record, and the widest band. A genuine 10-year TW BEV market does not exist yet: the oldest BEVs trading here in volume are 2017-2019 cars. OLDEST REAL BEV DATA FOUND, verified on 8891 2026-08-12: 2017 Tesla Model S 75D, 236,000 km, dealer asking 95.8萬 — 32.5% of the current 294.99萬 Model S list (KingAutos, verified), at 9 years but with very high mileage; also 2018 Model S 75D, 66,000 km, 99.8萬. Against these a large low-mileage credit was applied (our car is at 70,000 km) and a large battery-risk debit, landing at 380,000 = 24.1% of real_cost, 23.8% of list. The debit is the dominant term and is BEV-specific: Volvo's HV battery warranty runs 8 years globally, so it EXPIRES inside this window (~year 8), and a TW buyer of a 10-year-old EX30 is buying an out-of-warranty 69 kWh NCM pack whose replacement cost is a large fraction of the whole car's value. Volvo TW's purchasable extended warranty cannot help: its seven covered systems are a combustion-shaped list (引擎系統, 燃油系統, 變速箱, 電路, 煞車, 懸吊, 空調) with no traction-battery item, and it cannot extend past year 5 regardless. That is also why depreciation was NOT allowed to decelerate here the way a combustion car's does — the yr7->yr10 rate (~NT$90,000/yr) is held flat rather than tapering, because the warranty cliff at year 8 offsets the usual flattening. Treat this as a planning figure with a plausible range of roughly NT$280,000-480,000: if TW develops a healthy independent BEV battery-service trade by 2036 the number lands high, and if it does not, a 10-year-old EX30 could be close to unsaleable privately. Trade-in 15.8% below private (spread widened with age; dealers discount old BEVs hardest)."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Volvo TW 保養服務規劃 official pricing API for EX30 (2025 model year), re-queried live by this audit on 2026-08-12, which returns NT$0 for every scheduled line item under the 4年/8萬公里 free programme. Only the genuinely out-of-pocket extras are counted: 擋風玻璃清洗劑 NT$315 (the API's own price) and one tire rotation ~NT$1,200 (rotation does not appear in the covered item list). Effectively free year — this is what the official table actually returns, not an optimistic guess."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers the 1-3 year window, entirely inside Volvo TW's 4yr/80,000km free BEV programme, so both annual services are NT$0. Paid items are the ones the official API prices as chargeable plus non-covered consumables: one time-based brake fluid change at NT$1,732 (API-verified: 煞車油更換 labour NT$860 + 煞車油 NT$872 — the tool triggers it at the 30,000 km service but 2-3 years is the standard time interval and comes first at this mileage), two rotations ~NT$2,000, one alignment ~NT$1,200, fluids ~NT$600."},{"y":5,"source":"The step-change window: Volvo TW's free programme expires at year 4, so year 4's service is still NT$0 but year 5's is paid (~NT$5,500 for a dealer annual inspection with cabin filter and wipers, which were free until now). Tires dominate: at 35,000 km the tread is barely touched, but 5-year-old rubber is replaced on AGE. CORRECTED BY THIS AUDIT — the EX30 Plus runs 19-inch wheels, not 18: 8891's official trim spec table lists 輪圈規格 as 18吋 for the Core and 19吋 for the Plus and Ultra. Four premium 19-inch EV-rated tires (235/45R19 class, e.g. Michelin Pilot Sport EV / Pirelli P Zero Elect) run ~NT$8,000 fitted in TW = NT$32,000, not the ~NT$26,000 an 18-inch car would pay; BEV-rated tires carry a premium and wear faster than the combustion equivalent. Plus brake fluid NT$1,732 (the 30,000 km service lands ~year 4.3, just outside the free window — see plan_notes), alignment ~NT$1,500, and a first 12V battery ~NT$5,500 (AGM, dealer-fitted; BEV 12V batteries typically fail at 4-6 years and immobilise the car)."},{"y":7,"source":"First fully unprotected window: the 3-year factory warranty and the year-4/5 extended warranty are both exhausted (Volvo TW sells no cover past year 5), so every repair is now the owner's. Two paid annual services ~NT$11,000. Front pads ~NT$7,000 — note the reason, since it is BEV-specific and counterintuitive: with one-pedal regenerative driving the friction pads on an EX30 would easily survive past 100,000 km on wear alone, but a low-mileage car in Taiwan's humidity corrodes and seizes its pads and caliper slides from DISUSE, which is what actually forces the job. Coolant ~NT$6,000 (Volvo long-life, first change typically 6-8 years; the EX30 has both HV battery and drivetrain circuits). Brake fluid NT$1,732 plus filters and wipers ~NT$2,500. NT$6,000 risk allowance for the usual out-of-warranty small failures at this age (sensors, suspension bushings, A/C). NOTE ON SHAPE: this bucket is lower than the year-5 bucket, which is deliberate and not an error — the first tire set, the first 12V battery and the end of free servicing all land inside years 3-5, while years 5-7 carry no lumpy consumable. On a per-year basis the trend still rises across the record (NT$1,500 / 2,750 / 23,000 / 17,000 / 31,333 per year)."},{"y":10,"source":"Three-year window and the most expensive by far, for structural reasons rather than mileage. Second tire set at ~year 10, five years after the first and again on age not tread — 19-inch, ~NT$32,000 + NT$1,500 alignment (see the year-5 note on the corrected wheel size). Brake discs and rear pads ~NT$14,000 — on a 70,000 km car the discs are replaced because they have corroded and pitted, not because they are worn thin. Three paid services ~NT$17,000, second 12V battery ~NT$5,500, brake fluid ~NT$3,500, plus the 60,000 km service items (電動馬達齒輪油 reduction-gear oil, 齒輪箱油塞墊片組, 補胎劑) which the API shows Volvo covering free at year 4 but which are chargeable here at ~year 8.6. The NT$18,000 risk allowance is the honest weak point: Volvo's HV battery warranty runs 8 years and expires inside this window, and from year 8 the owner carries pack, on-board-charger, inverter, A/C compressor and control-module risk with no manufacturer backstop — Volvo TW's extended warranty is no help even if it could run this long, since its covered-systems list contains no traction-battery item. NT$18,000 covers ordinary failures only — it does NOT provision for a pack replacement, which would be a six-figure event and is better treated as the tail risk already priced into the year-10 resale figure."}],"sources":[{"name":"8891 新車 — Volvo EX30 綜述 (official TW trim prices and spec table)","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/m/kindsum/18689","note":"PRIMARY PRICE VERIFICATION, re-fetched and re-parsed by this audit 2026-08-12. Embedded trim JSON returns modelName/price pairs: Core Single Motor Extended Range 139.9, Plus Single Motor Extended Range 159.99, Ultra Twin Motor Performance 174.99 (萬). Scout's NT$1,599,900 confirmed. The same JSON's 輪圈規格 entries are the source of the wheel-size correction: 18吋 on the Core, 19吋 on the Plus and Ultra."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — Volvo EX30 車款介紹 (lineup and TW launch dates)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/volvo/ex30/6973/overall","note":"Lineup and model history: the single-motor Core/Plus trims launched in TW 2025-08-04 (Ultra came first, Feb 2025), 69 kWh NCM pack, 272 hp RWD, 595 km NEDC. Page fetched 2026-08-12 but is client-rendered, so the price table did not appear in the static HTML this audit retrieved — the price claim rests on 8891 and KingAutos instead, both of which were read directly."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Volvo EX30 used listings","url":"https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=48&model=18689","note":"THE YEAR-1 EVIDENCE, re-verified 2026-08-12 from the page's embedded listing JSON. All 8 EX30 listings on the TW market. Critically includes both a dealer-retail Plus (4,000 km / 146.0萬, isRealShop=1) and a genuine PRIVATE-SELLER Plus (10,000 km / 129.0萬, isRealShop=0), which let the dealer-retail-to-private gap be measured rather than assumed. Also Core 7,271 km / 119.8萬 and four Ultras (3,000 km 158.0萬; 11,200 km 152.0萬; 22,000 km 142.0萬; 25,000 km 142.8萬)."},{"name":"Volvo SELEKT 原廠認證中古車 (official certified pre-owned)","url":"https://www.volvoselekt.com.tw/list.php","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-12 (pages 1 and 2). Confirms the 146.0萬 EX30 Plus (年份2025, 3,600 km) is a factory-CERTIFIED retail car. Also the year-5 analogue: 《新莊凱銳精選中古車》2022年 XC40 Recharge Ultimate Twin motor, 22,000 km, 126.0萬. CORRECTION LOGGED: the earlier draft cited a '2024 EC40 Plus Single Motor, 8,200 km, 148.0萬' that does not exist in this inventory; the real Volvo BEV comparables here are 2024-reg C40 Recharge Single Motor 10,950 km 145.0萬, 2024-reg EC40 Single Motor 1,050 km 158.0萬, and 2025-reg EC40 Ultimate Single Motor 6,353 km 155.0萬."},{"name":"Volvo TW 保養服務規劃 — official Maintenance Service Plan tool and pricing API","url":"https://volvomsp.volvocartw.com/MaintenanceService/","note":"THE MAINTENANCE SOURCE, independently re-queried by this audit 2026-08-12 via its NameWebService.asmx endpoints. States verbatim '台灣市場Volvo電動車享有4年或8萬公里免費保養專案'. QueryMileage returns '30000@@60000' for the EX30. QueryData returns NT$0 against every scheduled item at both intervals and prices the only chargeable ones: 煞車油更換 NT$860 labour + 煞車油 NT$872, 擋風玻璃清洗劑 NT$315, optional A/C packages NT$1,910 and NT$3,031. CAVEAT the record carries: QueryType lists only 'EX30, Twin motor' — the single-motor Plus is not yet loaded, so the schedule is read off the Twin Motor entry."},{"name":"Volvo TW 延長保固服務 (extended warranty terms)","url":"https://www.volvocars.com/tw/l/extendedwarranty/","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-12 with a full browser header set (the site 403s a bare curl). Establishes the warranty runway: years 4-5 purchasable within 30 months / 100,000 km of registration, year-5 top-up needs 車齡 48 個月內且里程 < 15 萬公里, nothing beyond year 5. The 3-year factory term is INFERRED from this, not stated on the page. Two facts this audit added: '延長保固方案可隨車輛轉讓' — the cover transfers with the car, which supports resale; and the seven covered systems are combustion-shaped (引擎, 燃油, 變速箱, 電路, 煞車, 懸吊, 空調) with NO traction-battery item. Footer also confirms '建議售價已含電動車貨物稅減免'."},{"name":"Volvo Cars Taiwan — 8 月購車方案 (August 2026 offers)","url":"https://www.volvocartw.com/monthly-offers","note":"The discount evidence, re-fetched 2026-08-12. EX30 offer reads '本月入主享 0 頭款及 超低月付 NT$15,000 起 優惠專案' — financing, not a published cash discount. Confirms the asymmetry: XC40/XC60/XC90/V60 carry '再享政府貨物稅減徵及汰舊換新 最高 NT$100,000 補助' while EX30/EC40/EX40 do not, so a BEV buyer cannot stack that rebate."},{"name":"8891 用車成本 — Volvo EX30 ownership cost and retention model","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/m/cost/car?b=48&k=18689","note":"8891's published retention curve for the EX30, re-read live 2026-08-12 from the page's retainRates elements: yr1 89.0%, yr2 79.2%, yr3 70.5%, yr4 64.9%, yr5 59.7%, yr6 54.9%, yr7 50.5%. Used as an UPPER BOUND only — it is retail-flavoured, so it was rescaled by a 0.87 factor measured against this record's own year-1 private figure rather than an assumed haircut. Also the source of the 7.8 km/kWh efficiency figure."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Tesla listings sorted oldest-first","url":"https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=12873&sort=year-asc","note":"THE 7- AND 10-YEAR BEV ANCHOR, since no Volvo BEV is that old in TW. Every row re-verified from the listing JSON 2026-08-12: seven 2019 Model 3 dealer asks (78.8-91.8萬 across 40,000-164,000 km), 2017 Model S 75D 236,000 km 95.8萬, 2018 Model S 75D 66,000 km 99.8萬."},{"name":"KingAutos — Tesla TW current price list","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/tesla","note":"Current TW list prices verified live 2026-08-12: Model 3 標準版 169.99萬 / Long Range 199.99萬 / Performance 233.79萬; Model S 標準版 294.99萬 / Plaid 344.99萬. Used as the denominator for the Tesla retention ratios. Using CURRENT rather than launch list is deliberate — it captures Tesla's repeated TW price cuts, which reprice used stock overnight."},{"name":"KingAutos — Volvo TW price list incl. legacy Recharge trims","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/volvo","note":"Verified live 2026-08-12. Source of the original XC40 Recharge list prices (Plus Single Motor 191萬, Ultimate Twin Motor 222萬, P8 AWD 219萬) and C40 Recharge (Plus Single Motor 201萬, Ultimate Twin Motor 232萬) used as denominators for the Volvo BEV retention ratios at years 3 and 5. Also confirms EX30 Ultra 174.99萬."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Volvo listings sorted oldest-first","url":"https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=48&sort=year-asc","note":"Volvo combustion depreciation reference used only as a sanity check on the year-7 figure: 2019 XC40 T4 Momentum, 54,400 km, dealer asking 69.8萬. Cited from the scout's pass; this audit did not independently re-pull this specific row, so it carries less weight than the Tesla set above."}]},"volvo-ex40-plus-single-motor":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year; every checkpoint uses 7,000 km/year (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km), roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. All used values are therefore quoted from LOW-MILEAGE listings and all servicing is on the TIME clock, not the mileage clock: Volvo Taiwan's service tool defines EX40 BEV mileage checkpoints only at 30,000 km and 60,000 km, so this owner reaches the 30,000 km item only around year 4-5 and the 60,000 km item near year 9 - the annual/biennial time interval is what actually binds. EXCLUDED BY DESIGN: 牌照稅, 貨物稅 and all insurance. Taiwan grants BEVs a 使用牌照稅 exemption and the list price already embeds the 貨物稅 reduction per Volvo's own footnote; the exact statutory end-date of the 牌照稅 exemption is NOT asserted here because it could not be verified in this pass, and it changes no number in this record since tax is out of scope either way. ALSO EXCLUDED and deliberately not counted as maintenance: home AC charger supply + installation, roughly NT$30,000-80,000 in Taiwan depending on the building's panel and cable run (Volvo TW has periodically offered a half-price 家用充電樁 with BEV purchase). Electricity and public DC charging are running costs, not maintenance, and are also out of scope. The high-voltage battery warranty is ASSUMED to be Volvo's global 8 years / 160,000 km - it could not be confirmed on any reachable Volvo TW page - and that assumption is load-bearing for both the year-7 value (warranty still live) and the year-10 collapse (warranty gone).","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED IN FACT-CHECK. Anchored on the best SAME-MODEL listing actually visible on VOLVO SELEKT (https://www.volvoselekt.com.tw/list.php, re-read 2026-08-12): 2025年式 EX40 Ultra Twin Motor, 37,914 km, certified asking NT$1,570,000 = 83% of the current 2026MY Ultra list of NT$1,890,000. Supporting low-mileage certified asking on the sister car: 2025年式 EC40 Plus Single Motor 806 km NT$1,590,000 and 6,353 km NT$1,550,000. NOTE: the previous version of this record cited a '2025年式 EX40 Ultra 15,994 km NT$1,580,000' listing that is NOT on the page today; it has been replaced with the verified 37,914 km listing. METHOD AND ADJUSTMENT STATED: I take certified dealer asking for a 1-year / 7,000 km EX40 Plus at approx 82% of current list = NT$1,385,000 (the verified comparable is 83% at 5x this mileage, so a 7,000 km car sits at least there), then cut 12% to reach PRIVATE SALE NT$1,220,000, and a further 14% to dealer trade-in NT$1,050,000. These are 車商售價 converted down - they were NOT copied across. Held below a naive curve because Volvo TW cut this car's list price three times in four months, which reprices existing used stock overnight."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Anchored on the closest real mileage match available and re-verified on the live page: VOLVO SELEKT 2022年 XC40 Recharge Ultimate Twin Motor, 22,000 km, certified asking NT$1,260,000 (https://www.volvoselekt.com.tw/list.php, read 2026-08-12) - approx 56% of its original list at 4 years and almost exactly this buyer's mileage profile. The XC40 Recharge is the direct PREDECESSOR of the EX40 (same CMA platform; the EX40 is the renamed XC40 Recharge), so this is a predecessor-generation retention ratio applied to this car's real_cost, which is the correct method for an age this car's generation has not reached. Interpolating with the 1-year point gives approx 62% certified asking at 3 years -> NT$1,050,000, less 12% to PRIVATE SALE NT$920,000, less 14% to trade-in NT$790,000. ADJUSTMENT STATED: certified retail asking converted down to private-sale and trade-in, never copied across. Cross-check: this puts the 4-year private figure at approx 49% of cost, matching the 22,000 km XC40 Recharge anchor converted to private sale (approx 50%)."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor generation. Built from the Volvo Selekt certified curve above (approx 82% at 1yr, 56% at 4yr on the 22,000 km XC40 Recharge) continued to approx 49-50% certified asking at 5 years, then reduced 12% to PRIVATE SALE and a further 15% to trade-in. Sense-checked against SUM 汽車網 Tesla listings (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TESLA?v=4, read 2026-08-12), where 2021-2022 Model 3s sit in the NT$1,128,000-1,158,000 dealer-asking band - but Tesla is the most liquid BEV in Taiwan and an illiquid Volvo BEV should sit below it. Confidence low: no genuine 5-year EX40 / XC40 Recharge low-mileage transaction data exists in Taiwan yet."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, not observed - Taiwan has no 7-year market for this generation (the XC40 Recharge only arrived in 2021). SOURCE FIGURE CORRECTED IN FACT-CHECK: the previous version cited a 2020 Model 3 at 126,000 km asking NT$898,000; SUM 汽車網 (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TESLA?v=4, re-read 2026-08-12) actually shows that car - a 2020 Model 3 Standard Range Plus, 126,000 km - asking NT$738,000, and the record's own sources list contradicted its own checkpoint on this point. Corrected anchor: NT$738,000 on an original list of approx NT$1,599,000 = approx 46% of original list at 6 years as DEALER RETAIL, i.e. approx 40% converted to private sale, at 2.5x this buyer's mileage. Method: the oldest BEVs genuinely trading in Taiwan are 2019-2021 Teslas; I take approx 40% certified asking at 7 years / 49,000 km for the EX40 - below the Tesla ratio because Volvo BEVs are far less liquid and this is an orphaned CMA-platform car, above where mileage alone would put it because 49,000 km is very low - then -13% to PRIVATE SALE NT$580,000 and -17% to trade-in NT$480,000. The assumed 8-year HV battery warranty is still live at year 7 (buyers pay for that) but expires within 12 months, which caps the price. Confidence low."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, explicitly - Taiwan has NO 10-year BEV market at all. The oldest volume BEVs here are 2019-2020 Model 3s, so nothing 10 years old trades; SUM 汽車網 (read 2026-08-12) returned zero Model S listings, confirming there is no 10-year BEV benchmark to use. Method: 10-year European premium compact SUVs in Taiwan (2016 X1 / GLA class) retain roughly 22-28% of original list privately; I discount that by about 35% for BEV-specific risk because the assumed 8-year HV battery warranty has expired and a 69 kWh pack replacement would exceed the car's value. That gives approx 18% of cost = NT$300,000 private, less approx 23% to trade-in NT$230,000. Additional drag priced in: TVBS 2026-08-05 (https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/335732, verified in this pass) reports the EX50 arrives autumn 2027 on the new SPA3 800V platform at a materially LOWER price, and Volvo 40-series H1 2026 sales down more than one third YoY - leaving this car an orphaned CMA-platform model. Confidence low - a reasoned extrapolation, not a sourced figure."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Volvo Taiwan 保養服務規劃 (https://volvomsp.volvocartw.com/MaintenanceService/) - the '4年或8萬公里免費保養專案' statement was re-verified live on 2026-08-12. The itemised NT$0 lines for 'EX40, Single motor' come from that site's internal pricing endpoint and are NOT reproducible from the public page, which states fees depend on in-person inspection; confidence therefore MEDIUM, downgraded from high in this fact-check. The NT$685 sundries line was added so the itemisation reconciles to period_cost, which it did not in the previous version (NT$315 itemised against NT$1,000)."},{"y":3,"source":"Same official Volvo TW 保養服務規劃 service - 煞車油更換 and 擋風玻璃清洗劑 appear under 建議檢查後更換項目 at real prices while all base items are zero-rated. Still fully inside the 4-year free-maintenance window, which is the verified part of this claim. Confidence MEDIUM, downgraded from high in this fact-check: the per-item pricing is not reproducible from the public page, and the 冷氣散熱器清潔 line is an ELECTIVE item the owner may decline, so it is a judgement call rather than a scheduled cost."},{"y":5,"source":"Tyre, 12V battery and inspection costs are Taiwan market estimates; the Volvo part/labour numbers are taken from the official 保養服務規劃 service (XC40 B3 2025 dataset, which exposes real prices: 保養工資 860, 附加檢查 215, 傳動檢查 430, 空調濾芯 215+2,741, 前雨刷 2,174, 後雨刷 945, 補胎劑 2,762, 煞車油 645+872). This window is where the free programme runs out, which is why cost jumps hard. Items sum to approx NT$57,400, rounded to NT$56,000."},{"y":7,"source":"Volvo TW official part/labour prices for the recurring items; coolant, brake overhaul and the risk allowance are estimates. CAVEAT ADDED IN FACT-CHECK: the warranty boundary (extended warranty purchasable only for years 4-5, before 30 months / 100,000 km) is taken from https://www.volvocars.com/tw/l/extendedwarranty/, which returns HTTP 403 to direct fetch and could NOT be independently re-verified in this pass - the year-6 risk cliff therefore rests on an unverified claim. Items sum to approx NT$37,300."},{"y":10,"source":"EXTRAPOLATED. No Taiwan owner has yet run a Volvo BEV to 10 years (the XC40 Recharge only arrived in 2021), so this window has no receipts behind it. Built from Volvo TW official item prices for the recurring lines plus Taiwan market rates for tyres, suspension and brakes, with an explicit out-of-warranty risk allowance. Sanity check: NT$216,000 total over 10 years / 70,000 km = approx NT$21,600/yr, roughly 40% below what a combustion XC40 would cost over the same period (no oil, filters, plugs, DCT fluid) — genuinely low, but definitely not zero, and tyres are the single largest line."}],"sources":[{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 2026-03-05 — 2026年式 40 Series 售價（價格主要依據）","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/309226","note":"PRIMARY price evidence, independently fetched and confirmed in this fact-check. 2026MY launch: EX40 Plus Single Motor NT$1,690,000, EX40 Ultra Twin Motor NT$1,890,000, EC40 Plus NT$1,790,000, EC40 Ultra NT$1,990,000. Entry price cut a further NT$50,000 versus the January figure."},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 2026-01-07 — 新年式再調價","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/298660","note":"Verified in this pass. Second repricing: EX40 Plus NT$1,740,000, Ultra NT$1,890,000; EC40 Plus NT$1,840,000, Ultra NT$1,990,000. Key evidence for the BEV price-cut narrative that suppresses used values."},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 2025-11-19 — 2026年式 EX40/EC40 首度公布售價","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/289608","note":"Verified in this pass. First repricing: EX40 Plus NT$1,790,000, Ultra NT$1,990,000, i.e. NT$120,000 / NT$230,000 below the 2025MY."},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 2024-11-25 — EX40/EC40 上市 191 萬起","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/225100","note":"Verified in this pass. 2025MY baseline: EX40 Recharge Plus Single Motor NT$1,910,000, EX40 Recharge Ultimate Twin Motor NT$2,220,000, EC40 Plus NT$2,010,000, EC40 Ultimate Twin NT$2,320,000. FACT-CHECK CORRECTION: the 2025MY top trim is named 'Ultimate Twin Motor', not 'Ultra Twin Motor' as the previous version stated; prices were correct."},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 2026-08-05 — EX50 將接棒 EX40（2027）","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/335732","note":"Verified in this pass. Successor confirmed: EX50 arrives autumn 2027 on the SPA3 800V platform at a materially lower price (approx USD 40,000 vs the EX40's USD 56,545), production from spring 2027 in Kosice. Also reports Volvo 40-series H1 2026 sales down more than one third YoY and the EX40's CMA platform nearly 10 years old. Direct negative pressure on years 5-10 residuals."},{"name":"Volvo Cars Taiwan — 保養服務規劃（官方保養費用查詢）","url":"https://volvomsp.volvocartw.com/MaintenanceService/","note":"PRIMARY maintenance source, re-verified live 2026-08-12: the page does state '台灣市場Volvo電動車享有4年或8萬公里免費保養專案'. IMPORTANT CAVEAT FOUND IN FACT-CHECK: the public page does NOT publish itemised per-model pricing - it says fees depend on in-person inspection. The NT$0 EX40 line items and the XC40 B3 2025 rate card come from the site's internal pricing endpoint and are not reproducible publicly, which is why the year 1 and year 3 maintenance checkpoints were downgraded from 'high' to 'medium'."},{"name":"VOLVO SELEKT 原廠認證中古車（車商售價）","url":"https://www.volvoselekt.com.tw/list.php","note":"Used-value anchors, re-read 2026-08-12 (146 certified cars listed). CONFIRMED on the live page: 2025年式 EX40 Ultra Twin Motor 37,914 km NT$1,570,000; 2025年式 EC40 Plus Single Motor 806 km NT$1,590,000; 2025年式 EC40 Recharge Plus Single Motor 6,353 km NT$1,550,000; 2022年 XC40 Recharge Ultimate Twin Motor 22,000 km NT$1,260,000; 2026 EX30 Plus 3,600 km NT$1,460,000. NOT FOUND on the live page and therefore removed from the year-1 reasoning: the '15,994 km NT$1,580,000' and '25,955 km NT$1,498,000' EX40 Ultra listings cited in the previous version. All of these are 車商售價 - converted down to private-sale and trade-in, never copied across."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — Tesla 中古車行情（最老的實際流通 BEV）","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TESLA?v=4","note":"Re-read 2026-08-12, 50 Tesla listings. FACT-CHECK CORRECTION: the 2020 Model 3 Standard Range Plus at 126,000 km asks NT$738,000, NOT NT$898,000 as the previous version's year-7 checkpoint claimed (that checkpoint also contradicted this record's own source list). 2020 Model 3s span roughly NT$738,000-1,128,000. ZERO Model S listings, confirming there is no genuine 10-year BEV market in Taiwan."},{"name":"Volvo Cars Taiwan — 8 月購車方案","url":"https://www.volvocartw.com/monthly-offers/","note":"Verified in this pass. The August 2026 EX40 offer is finance-only - 月付 NT$19,888 / 72 期 - with no cash discount published, which is why purchase.discounts is explicitly flagged as an estimate."},{"name":"Volvo Cars Taiwan — EX40 線上訂製（官方配置器）","url":"https://www.volvocars.com/tw/build/ex40-electric/","note":"NOT INDEPENDENTLY RE-VERIFIED: this host returns HTTP 403 to direct fetch (Akamai). Cited by the prior researcher as returning EX40 Plus NT$1,690,000 / Ultra NT$1,890,000 for MY2026. The same figures were confirmed from TVBS instead, so the list price stands, but this URL is not the evidence for it."},{"name":"Volvo Cars Taiwan — VOLVO 延長保固服務","url":"https://www.volvocars.com/tw/l/extendedwarranty/","note":"NOT INDEPENDENTLY RE-VERIFIED: HTTP 403 to direct fetch. Cited for the claim that extended warranty covers years 4-5 only and must be bought before 30 months / 100,000 km, which defines the year-6 risk cliff used in the 7y and 10y maintenance windows. Treat that boundary as unconfirmed."},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 2025-10-09 — EX40/EC40 促銷降價逾 40 萬","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/282476","note":"NOT RE-VERIFIED in this pass (not fetched). Cited by the prior researcher for the October 2025 clearance of 2025MY EX40 Ultra at NT$1,799,000 against a NT$2,220,000 list. The price-cut narrative does not depend on it - four other TVBS price articles were independently confirmed."}]},"volvo-ec40-plus-single-motor":{"assumptions":"一年 6,000-8,000 公里，取中位 7,000 公里/年，遠低於台灣平均 12,000-15,000 公里。所有檢查點 assumed_km = 7,000 × 年數（7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000）。此里程下保養是「時間驅動」不是「里程驅動」：官方免費保養專案上限 4 年或 8 萬公里，本車 10 年只跑 7 萬公里，永遠碰不到里程上限，所以免費保養以「4 年」到期。低里程在中古市場有加分，殘值一律取同齡車源的上緣並註明。家用充電樁（壁掛充電器＋拉線工程，台灣行情約 30,000-60,000 元）是持有成本但不算保養，未計入 maintenance。稅（貨物稅、牌照稅、燃料費）與保險依設定一律排除。殘值以 real_cost 1,785,000 為分母表述，並以「現行新車牌價 1,790,000」為市場天花板參考 —— 二手價不可能貼近新車價。","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"已修正前手數字（原 1,380,000 過高）。本人於 2026/8/12 curl https://auto.8891.com.tw/volvo 取得頁內 JSON，確認 EC40 在售 6 筆、車商開價區間 1,480,000-1,680,000（與前手陳述一致，資料屬實）。但這批是 600-8,200 公里的近全新展示／領牌車，且原始牌價為 201 萬的 2025 年式，其開價由車商成本反推而非市場成交，屬「準新車」區隔，不能當一般 1 年車主用車的行情。修正依據：現行新車牌價 1,790,000 是二手價的天花板，前手數字等於 real_cost 的 77%，屬 Toyota 等級保值率，與「Volvo BEV 在台需求薄、車系汰換快、且 9 個月內官方降價 22 萬」矛盾。改以車商開價約 1,340,000（新車牌價 75%，較同齡 ICE Volvo 低約 7 個百分點作為 BEV 折讓）為起點，自售價 = 車商開價 −14% → 1,150,000；車商收購價 = 自售價 −14% → 990,000。低里程（7,000 公里）已取上緣。"},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"已修正（原 970,000 過高）。用前身同款車 C40 Recharge（Volvo 2024/2 更名 EC40，機械同款）。本人 curl 8891 Volvo 頁確認 C40 Recharge 在售 14 筆、車商開價 1,172,000-1,580,000（與前手陳述一致）。同時抓到本人自行擷取的 Volvo ICE 對照：XC60 2023 款 Ultimate B5（3 年、65,200 公里）車商開價 1,359,000，對原始牌價約 230 萬 = 59% 車商開價保值率。以「BEV 較同齡 ICE 低約 9 個百分點」推得 EC40 第 3 年車商開價約新車牌價 50%（約 900,000），自售價 = −12% → 790,000，車商收購價 = −14% → 680,000。分母用現行 179 萬牌價而非舊 201 萬，因為新車已降價，中古價被壓過一輪。低里程 21,000 公里已取上緣。屬跨代推導，故降為 low。"},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"外推，已修正（原 800,000 過高）。台灣同平台最老純電 Volvo 僅 4 年（2022 年 XC40 Recharge）。本人 curl 8891 確認 XC40 Recharge 在售 14 筆、車商開價 968,000-1,398,000。關鍵對照組是同價位的 ICE 手足：本人自 8891 Volvo 頁逐筆擷取到 XC40 2021 款 B5 R-Design（5 年、99,900 公里）車商開價 759,000，對原始牌價約 195 萬 = 39% 車商開價保值率。本車第 5 年僅 35,000 公里，里程遠低於該車源，但 BEV 折讓（電池年限疑慮、車系汰換、原廠反覆調價）抵銷之，故取車商開價約新車牌價 38.5%（約 690,000）；自售價 = −13% → 600,000，車商收購價 = −15% → 510,000。第 5 年原廠 3 年保固已過、8 年電池保固仍在。"},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"外推，已修正（原 620,000 過高）。台灣沒有 7 年車齡的 EC40 / C40 Recharge（車系 2022 年才進台灣），依規定改用台灣真正在交易的最老 BEV 與同廠 ICE 曲線。本人 curl https://auto.8891.com.tw/tesla 與 https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw 確認兩頁存在且有老 BEV 車源可查。同廠 ICE 錨點（本人自 8891 Volvo 頁逐筆擷取）：XC90 2019 款 T5 Momentum（7 年、117,500 公里）車商開價 879,000，對原始牌價約 289 萬 = 30%；XC60 2018 款 T6 R-Design（8 年、71,900 公里，低里程）開價 899,000，對約 269 萬 = 33%。Volvo BEV 在第 7 年須再折讓：保外高壓系統維修昂貴、二手接手意願低。取車商開價約新車牌價 27%（約 483,000），自售價 = −13% → 420,000，車商收購價 = −15% → 355,000。第 7 年 8 年電池保固仍在，是撐住此價位的主因。"},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"外推，本表最不確定的一格，已修正（原 380,000 過高）。台灣完全沒有 10 年車齡的 Volvo 純電車可查。同廠 ICE 錨點（本人自 8891 Volvo 頁逐筆擷取）：XC90 2016 款 D5 Momentum（10 年、214,900 公里）車商開價 559,000，對原始牌價約 300 萬 = 18.6%；XC60 2015 款 T5 R-Design（11 年、162,000 公里）開價 258,000，對約 220 萬 = 11.7%；XC60 2014 款 D4 旗艦版（12 年、216,900 公里）開價 239,000。老 BEV 落點參考 8891 BMW 頁的 i3（台灣唯一 8-11 年量產 BEV）。本車第 10 年只跑 7 萬公里可往上修，但第 8 年起 8 年／16 萬公里高壓電池保固到期是 BEV 特有的殘值斷崖（電池模組、DC-DC、車載充電器全數落入自付，單項維修可能超過車價），兩相抵銷後取車商開價約新車牌價 18%（約 322,000）；自售價 = −13% → 280,000，車商收購價 = −18% → 230,000（老 BEV 車商收購折讓更深，因流通性差）。"}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"免費保養專案由本人 curl https://volvomsp.volvocartw.com/MaintenanceService/ 驗證，頁面明載「台灣市場Volvo電動車享有4年或8萬公里免費保養專案」。但 2,000 元本身是雜項自估、非官方數字，故 confidence 由前手的 high 下修為 medium（有官方依據的是「免費」這件事，不是這個金額）。"},{"y":3,"source":"免費保養範圍經本人驗證於官方保養服務規劃頁；該頁本身即區分「基礎保養」與「建議檢查後更換項目（依實際需求）」兩類，煞車油屬後者、需自費，此分類為官方頁面結構所確認。惟煞車油與四輪定位的逐項金額為市場行情自估，未取得逐筆官方報價，故 confidence 由前手的 high 下修為 medium。"},{"y":5,"source":"輪胎規格（前 235/50R19、後 255/45R19）與整備重量 1,986 公斤由本人解析官方規格配備表 PDF https://www.volvocartw.com/pdf/carsp/ec40.pdf 內容串流逐字確認，前後異尺寸屬實、確實無法對調延壽。免費保養期間由官方保養服務規劃頁確認。四條 19 吋高階胎含工 34,000 元為台灣市場行情推估，未取得逐筆報價，是本格最弱的一環。"},{"y":7,"source":"推估。官方保養服務規劃頁只涵蓋免費期，查無「免費保養結束後」的自費價目（本人已實際開啟該頁確認其為查詢式介面，無公開的保外價目表）。金額由下而上加總：兩次自費定期保養＋耗材＋碟盤＋12V 電瓶＋風險金，工資水準參考同級豪華進口車行情。輪胎在第 5 年已換，本期不重複計。無實收據佐證，confidence low。"},{"y":10,"source":"推估，無官方或實收據來源。台灣目前沒有任何 10 年車齡的 Volvo 純電車可查實際保養支出。由下而上加總：三次自費定期保養＋一套輪胎＋一組碟盤來令片＋耗材＋3 年份保固外風險金。風險金水準參考市面延長保固每年約 5-7.5 萬元的定價再大幅打折（延保含保險利潤，實際期望維修支出低於保費）。全期 10 年保養合計 251,500 元，年均 25,150 元。confidence low。"}],"sources":[{"name":"VOLVO EC40 官方規格配備表 PDF（本人 curl 驗證，HTTP 200）","url":"https://www.volvocartw.com/pdf/carsp/ec40.pdf","note":"本次價格複核的第一手來源。解析 PDF 內容串流逐字取得：EC40 Plus, Single motor NT$1,790,000；EC40 Ultra, Twin motor NT$1,990,000；輪胎前 235/50R19、後 255/45R19（前後異尺寸）；整備重量 1,986 kg（Ultra Twin 為 2,136 kg）。輪胎與車重是保養估算的依據。"},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 - Volvo 公布 2026 年式 40 Series 售價（2026/3/5，本人 curl 驗證，HTTP 200）","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/309226","note":"第三方價格交叉驗證，內文明列「EC40 Plus Single motor 179萬元 / EC40 Ultra Twin Motor 199萬元」，並確認 EX40 169/189 萬、XC40 Plus B3 接單價 175.6 萬。同頁記載 2025/11 與 2026/1 兩度降價後入門價再降 5 萬，是官方連續調價的直接證據。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Volvo 品牌頁（本人 curl 驗證，HTTP 200，2026/8/12 擷取）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/volvo","note":"殘值主要依據。頁內 JSON 確認在售筆數與車商開價區間：EC40 6 筆 1,480,000-1,680,000；C40 Recharge 14 筆 1,172,000-1,580,000；XC40 Recharge 14 筆 968,000-1,398,000。同頁逐筆擷取 40 筆 Volvo ICE 車源作為保值率對照組，其中 XC40 2021 B5 R-Design（5 年/99,900km）759,000、XC60 2023 Ultimate B5（3 年/65,200km）1,359,000、XC60 2018 T6 R-Design（8 年/71,900km）899,000、XC90 2019 T5（7 年/117,500km）879,000、XC90 2016 D5（10 年/214,900km）559,000。全部為車商開價，已逐格下修為自售價與車商收購價。"},{"name":"Volvo Cars Taiwan - 保養服務規劃（本人 curl 驗證，HTTP 200）","url":"https://volvomsp.volvocartw.com/MaintenanceService/","note":"免費保養方案的官方原文出處，頁面註記逐字為「台灣市場Volvo電動車享有4年或8萬公里免費保養專案」與「4年8萬公里免費保養專案，必須依照指定保養間隔或里程執行」。同頁區分「基礎保養」與「建議檢查後更換項目（依實際需求）」，煞車油屬後者需自費。惟該頁為查詢式介面，未公開保外自費價目表，故第 7、10 年為推估。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Tesla 品牌頁（本人 curl 驗證，HTTP 200）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/tesla","note":"台灣真正有 7-9 年車齡在交易的 BEV 車源，作為第 7 年外推時「老 BEV 是否還有市場」的存在性佐證。Tesla 多次官方調價使其原始牌價分母浮動，故僅當範圍參考，未直接換算成 EC40 的保值比。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 品牌頁（本人 curl 驗證，HTTP 200）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw","note":"BMW i3 是台灣唯一有 8-11 年車齡的量產 BEV，作為第 10 年檢查點的絕對值落點參考。其台灣原始牌價找不到可靠來源，故未換算成殘值比率，削弱 10 年那格的推導強度。"},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 - 新年式 EX40/EC40 最高降 23 萬（2025/11/19，URL 可達，HTTP 200）","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/289608","note":"官方降價紀錄的第二來源：2026 年式相較 2025 年式單馬達降 12 萬、雙馬達降 23 萬。BEV 官方調價重新定價中古庫存的佐證。本次僅驗證 URL 可達，未逐句核對內文。"},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 - Volvo 公布新年式 EX40 及 EC40 售價（URL 可達，HTTP 200）","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/86217","note":"同一波降價的第三來源，交叉驗證降價幅度與車型編成。本次僅驗證 URL 可達，未逐句核對內文。"},{"name":"U-CAR Find your car - Volvo EC40 車款介紹（URL 可達，HTTP 200）","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/volvo/ec40/7130/overall","note":"確認 Volvo 於 2024/2 將 C40 Recharge 更名 EC40，故 C40 Recharge 中古行情可直接當前代殘值依據。本次僅驗證 URL 可達，未逐句核對內文。"},{"name":"Volvo Cars Taiwan - 每月購車方案（URL 可達，HTTP 200）","url":"https://www.volvocartw.com/monthly-offers/","note":"折扣金額判斷的參考：當期方案以分期補貼為主而非現金折讓，且「政府貨物稅減徵及汰舊換新」補助掛在燃油車型，純電 EC40 吃不到（純電車本來就免貨物稅）。本次僅驗證 URL 可達，未逐句核對內文。"},{"name":"Volvo Cars 台灣 - EC40 車款頁（未能驗證，對本地 client 回 HTTP 403）","url":"https://www.volvocars.com/tw/cars/ec40-electric/","note":"誠實揭露：volvocars.com/tw 全站對本次連線回 403，本人無法讀取內容，因此不作為價格或規格依據。價格改以官方 volvocartw.com 規格 PDF ＋ TVBS 報導雙來源確認。前手宣稱此站配置器顯示「動力僅有 Single Motor」，與官方 PDF 及 TVBS 同列 Ultra Twin motor 相矛盾，該敘述已刪除。"}]},"volvo-ex90-plus-single-motor":{"assumptions":"Low-mileage owner: 6,000-8,000 km/year vs the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year. Every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km). This matters two ways for a BEV. (1) Resale: at 10 years the car has only 70,000 km, so battery cycle count is very low (roughly 150 full-pack equivalents on the 92 kWh pack) and state-of-health should still be high; low-mileage cars sell above the mileage-blind average, so all quoted comps were chosen from low-mileage listings and the mileage adjustment is stated in each source string. (2) Maintenance: Volvo Taiwan's own service planner lists the EX40 BEV service interval as 30,000 km / 60,000 km (vs every 10,000 km for the combustion XC90 B5). At 7,000 km/year, 30,000 km takes ~4.3 years, so servicing is TIME-driven (roughly every 2 years), never mileage-driven, for this owner's whole ownership period. EXCLUDED from all figures by design: 牌照稅, 燃料費 and insurance. ALSO EXCLUDED from maintenance (but still a real ownership cost): a home AC charger install. Volvo Taiwan bundles a wallbox with some EV campaigns, but the electrical work in a Taiwanese apartment/管委會 building typically runs NT$30,000-60,000 (more if a dedicated meter and riser are needed). Treat that as a one-off setup cost, not maintenance. Spec basis for consumables, all re-verified against the U-CAR spec sheet on 2026-08-12: 電池總容量 92kwh (the twins are 106kwh), 最大綜效馬力 333, 7 seats, 5,037 mm long, DC charging 310 kW, and a STAGGERED 20-inch tyre fitment (輪胎尺寸 255/50 R20 front, 後輪尺寸 285/45 R20 rear). Staggered means front and rear tyres cannot be rotated between axles, so they wear unevenly and the whole set is replaced at once - a real cost driver on a ~2.6-tonne EV. The 800V architecture and 350 kW peak DC figure quoted in press coverage are the Twin Motor numbers; this single-motor car is 310 kW on the same 800V architecture.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN by this review from a previous 2,150,000. No used EX90 exists in Taiwan - the car is still in pre-order - so this is bracketed from real low-mileage Volvo BEV listings on VOLVO SELEKT 原廠認證中古車 (volvoselekt.com.tw/list.php), every one of which was re-retrieved and confirmed verbatim on 2026-08-12: 2026年式 EX30 Core Single Motor, 7,271 km, asking 119.8萬 against a 139.9萬 list = 86%; 2026年式 EX30 Plus, 3,600 km, asking 146.0萬 against 159.99萬 = 91%; 2025年式 EC40 Plus Single motor, 806 km, asking 159.0萬 against a 179萬 list = 89%. Those are 車商售價 on 原廠認證 stock, i.e. the very top of the retail range, and they are small BEVs with the broadest buyer pool in Taiwan. A 299萬 7-seat BEV flagship that has not yet launched has a far thinner pool, so the near-new band is shaded down to a DEALER RETAIL asking of about 229.5萬 at 1 year / 7,000 km (76.8% of list) rather than the ~82% a straight read of the EX30/EC40 comps would give. WHY THE REVISION: the earlier 2,150,000 put year-1 retention at 71.9% of list, ABOVE the comparable Volvo mild-hybrid XC60 B5 Plus at 70.1%. In Taiwan a BEV should not out-retain a comparable hybrid of the same brand, and Volvo's BEVs are the weaker half of its range; on top of that this car's list price is itself an unsettled 預售價, which year-one used buyers discount. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale_price = retail 229.5萬 x 0.88 (12% below asking, mid of the usual 8-15% gap) = 2,020,000 = 67.6% of list. dealer_tradein_price = private x 0.87 (a further 13% down) = 1,760,000. The 7,000 km reading is a genuine premium here - a 1-year-old EX90 at average TW mileage would show ~13,000 km."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN by this review from a previous 1,700,000. Anchored on the closest real Volvo BEV comps at similar age on VOLVO SELEKT (volvoselekt.com.tw/list.php), all re-confirmed verbatim 2026-08-12: 2024 C40 Ultimate Twin motor, 33,058 km, asking 155.0萬 against its ~222萬 original list = 70% at roughly 2 years; 2025年式 EX40 Ultra Twin motor, 37,914 km, asking 157.0萬 against 222萬 original = 71%; and the single most useful point, 2022 XC40 Recharge Ultimate Twin motor with only 22,000 km, asking 126.0萬 against 222萬 = 57% DEALER RETAIL at roughly 4 years on a mileage almost identical to this owner's profile. Interpolating those to 3 years and adding back for the low 21,000 km gives ~57.4% of list as DEALER RETAIL, i.e. about 171.6萬. WHY THE REVISION: the earlier 1,700,000 was 56.9% of list, ABOVE the comparable Volvo XC60 B5 Plus mild-hybrid at 52.3%; a Volvo BEV flagship should sit below, not above, its mild-hybrid sibling in Taiwan. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: those are 車商售價; private_sale_price = 171.6萬 x 0.88 = 1,510,000 = 50.5% of list; dealer_tradein_price = private x 0.87 = 1,315,000. Cross-check: the real 4-year XC40 Recharge comp at 22,000 km works out to a private figure of ~110.9萬 = 50% of its original list, and this curve passes through ~46% at year 4 - deliberately a few points below that comp, because the XC40 point is a certified dealer asking price at the top of the range on a cheaper, broader-market car. BEV-specific downward pressure already baked in: Volvo Taiwan cut this exact class of car's list by 15% mid-generation (XC40 Recharge Ultimate Twin 222萬 per KingAutos, versus the identical EX40 Ultra Twin at 189萬 per U-CAR today, both verified) and ran the outgoing XC40 Recharge out at 23萬 off. Any repeat on the EX90 would reprice the entire used stock overnight."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - no 5-year-old Volvo BEV of this class exists in Taiwan. Reviewed and left unchanged. Two real curves were used, both re-confirmed on VOLVO SELEKT 2026-08-12. BEV curve: the 2022 XC40 Recharge Ultimate Twin motor (22,000 km, 126.0萬 on a 222萬 original list = 57% dealer retail at 4 years); continuing that slope one more year lands near 50%. Large-luxury-SUV curve from the predecessor XC90: 22/23年式 XC90 B5 Momentum, 30,095 km, Selekt 148.0萬 and 2022 XC90 B5 R-Design AWD, 39,000 km, Selekt 166.0萬 (both ~4 years, ~52-55% of their original list, against a current XC90 range of 295.6-377.6萬 per U-CAR), versus 2020 XC90 B5 Momentum with 96,400 km at 109.9萬 on 8891 (auto.8891.com.tw/volvo) - showing how hard mileage bites. Blending, and adding a low-mileage premium for 35,000 km, gives ~47% of list as DEALER RETAIL = about 140萬. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale_price = 140萬 x 0.88 = 1,240,000 = 41.5% of list; dealer_tradein_price = private x 0.87 = 1,075,000. This already sits below the comparable Volvo XC60 B5 Plus mild-hybrid at the same age (46.7%), which is the correct ordering for a Taiwan BEV. Low confidence because the dominant variable is not wear but whether Volvo Taiwan cuts the EX90's list price in the interim, as it demonstrably did to the XC40 Recharge/EX40."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION, NOT INVENTED - there is no 7-year-old EX90 anywhere and no 7-year-old luxury BEV market in Taiwan at all. Reviewed and left unchanged. Method: take the real used prices of the predecessor large 7-seat Volvo SUV (XC90 gen 2) at that age, express as a retention ratio of ITS original list, then apply to this car. Real listings re-confirmed 2026-08-12: 2018 XC90 T5 Momentum, 54,500 km, VOLVO SELEKT asking 98.0萬 - roughly 37% of its ~265萬 original list at 8 years; and 2017 XC90 T5, 127,900 km, 8891 asking 70.9萬 at 9 years (far lower on triple the mileage). Interpolating the low-mileage XC90 line back to 7 years gives ~41% dealer retail. BEV PENALTY APPLIED, ~20% relative: at year 7 the 8-year/160,000 km HV battery warranty is about to expire and Taiwanese buyers price that transfer risk in heavily; the oldest BEVs actually trading here (2017-2018 Tesla Model S/X, Nissan Leaf, Kona EV) sit well below their combustion analogues at the same age, which is the correct reference class rather than a combustion car. 41% x 0.80 = ~33% of list = about 99萬 DEALER RETAIL. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale_price = 99萬 x 0.88 = 880,000 = 29.4% of list; dealer_tradein_price = private x 0.87 = 765,000. Partially offset upward by this owner's 49,000 km, roughly half what a 7-year TW car normally shows. Sits below the comparable Volvo XC60 mild-hybrid (35.1%), as it should."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION - explicitly not a real EX90 data point. Value reviewed and left unchanged; the arithmetic in the previous version of this string was internally inconsistent (it quoted both 52萬 and 57萬 as the dealer-retail figure) and is restated cleanly here. Predecessor XC90 gen 2 at 10-11 years, real listing on 8891 (auto.8891.com.tw/volvo): 2016 XC90 D5 Momentum (5-seat), 214,900 km, dealer asking 55.9萬 - about 19% of its original list, but on catastrophic mileage. Mileage-correcting that to this owner's 70,000 km (using the same-model spread visible between the 2017 T5 at 127,900 km / 70.9萬 and the 2018 T5 at 54,500 km / 98.0萬) lifts the 10-year XC90 ratio to roughly 28% dealer retail. BEV PENALTY APPLIED, ~0.62 relative, larger at 10 years than at 7 for three reasons: the HV battery warranty (8yr/160,000 km) has expired outright so the buyer carries full pack risk on a 92 kWh 800V pack whose replacement would exceed the car's residual value; the EX90 is a software-defined vehicle (dual NVIDIA Orin at 254 TOPS, Google built-in, per U-CAR) whose OTA support horizon at 10 years is unknown; and Volvo Taiwan has a proven record of cutting BEV list prices mid-generation, each cut resetting used values. Benchmarked against what actually trades here at that age - 2014-2016 Leaf, 2016-2017 Model S/X - which sit at roughly 15-22% of original list. 28% x 0.62 = ~17.4% of list, i.e. about 52萬, then nudged up to ~57萬 DEALER RETAIL for the genuinely low 70,000 km (only ~150 full-pack cycles, so state-of-health should still be strong, and that is the first thing a 10-year BEV buyer checks). ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale_price = 57萬 x 0.88 = 500,000 = 16.7% of list; dealer_tradein_price = private x 0.87 = 430,000. Low confidence and it deserves it: this is the single least knowable number in the record."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Volvo Cars Taiwan official maintenance planner, volvomsp.volvocartw.com/MaintenanceService/, retrieved and read by this review on 2026-08-12: the 4年或8萬公里免費保養專案 footnote is confirmed verbatim, and the BEV service-interval query for EX40 Single motor returns only 30,000/60,000 km with every basic-maintenance line at NT$0. At 7,000 km in year one, nothing is even due. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from high to medium by this review: the free programme, the interval and the NT$0 line items are officially sourced, but the NT$2,000 itself is not a planner line - it is 擋風玻璃清洗劑 NT$315 (official) plus a discretionary alignment check, i.e. judgement, so 'high' overstated it."},{"y":3,"source":"All priced line-by-line from the official Volvo Cars Taiwan planner (volvomsp.volvocartw.com/MaintenanceService/, confirmed live 2026-08-12), EX40 Single motor query. Time-driven, not mileage-driven: the owner is at 21,000 km, well short of the 30,000 km trigger, and still inside the 4-year free window. Confidence is medium rather than high because the A/C-clean and alignment lines are discretionary judgement, not fixed schedule items."},{"y":5,"source":"Structure and unit prices from the official Volvo Cars Taiwan planner (volvomsp.volvocartw.com/MaintenanceService/) for the free-programme boundary and the fluid/labour rates; tyre spec re-verified for this review on the U-CAR EX90 spec sheet (newcar.u-car.com.tw/volvo/ex90/7219/spec), which reads 輪胎尺寸 255/50 R20 and 後輪尺寸 285/45 R20 - a genuinely staggered fitment - priced at Taiwan retail for premium EV-rated rubber in those sizes. This window is dominated by the tyre set, which at 7,000 km/year is replaced because the rubber has aged out, not because the tread is gone. Low confidence: tyre pricing and the exact year the 12V battery dies are both estimates, and no EX90 has reached 5 years anywhere."},{"y":7,"source":"EXTRAPOLATED. Service labour and fluid rates from the official Volvo Cars Taiwan planner (volvomsp.volvocartw.com/MaintenanceService/); the brake-corrosion pattern and the out-of-warranty provision are judgement applied to a 7-year, 2.6-tonne luxury EV in Taiwan, not sourced line items. RAISED BY THIS REVIEW from NT$54,000: the previous figure dipped far below the year-5 window and priced out-of-warranty work at NT$15,000, which is unrealistically light for Volvo genuine parts and dealer labour on a 300萬-class car whose vehicle warranty has lapsed. Note what is deliberately ABSENT versus a combustion XC90 in the same window: no oil services (7 of them at ~NT$12,600 each on the official XC90 B5 schedule), no fuel filter, no air filter, no spark plugs, no timing components. The HV battery is still inside its 8-year/160,000 km warranty for this entire window, so no pack risk is priced here."},{"y":10,"source":"EXTRAPOLATED, and the least certain number in the record. Reviewed and left unchanged. Service and fluid rates from the official Volvo Cars Taiwan planner (volvomsp.volvocartw.com/MaintenanceService/); everything else is judgement applied to a 10-year out-of-warranty luxury EV. The step up from year 7 is driven by the HV battery warranty expiring at year 8 - from that point the owner carries the risk on the high-voltage peripherals. DELIBERATELY EXCLUDED: replacement of the 92 kWh pack itself. At 70,000 km (~150 full-pack-equivalent cycles) failure probability is low, and were it to happen the cost would exceed the car's residual value, so averaging it into a period cost would distort the model rather than inform it - flagged here instead."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - Volvo EX90 車款介紹（車型與售價）","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/volvo/ex90/7219/overall","note":"Primary list-price verification, re-retrieved 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200). Price table reads Plus Single Motor 299萬 / Ultra Twin Motor 359萬 / Ultra Twin Motor Performance 383萬, all 純電動. Body text confirms 國際富豪汽車 signalled a Q4 2026 domestic launch in an October 2025 release and opened the domestic pre-sale on 2026-06-11 at 299萬 起 to 389萬; also documents dual NVIDIA Orin at 254 TOPS and Google built-in."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - Volvo EX90 規格表","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/volvo/ex90/7219/spec","note":"Re-retrieved 2026-08-12. Source for the staggered tyre fitment used in the maintenance model: 輪胎尺寸 255/50 R20 with 後輪尺寸 285/45 R20 on the base wheel (21\" and 22\" offered on higher trims). Also confirms the single-motor spec used throughout: 電池總容量 92kwh (vs 106kwh on both twins), 最大綜效馬力 333, 7 seats, 5,037 mm long / 2,985 mm wheelbase, DC 充電最大功率 310kW, 雙A臂 front and 多連桿 rear suspension. Note it does NOT state whether air suspension is fitted."},{"name":"UDN 發燒車訊 - 純電旗艦 VOLVO EX90 預售正式啟動 首波接單299萬元起 (2026-06-12)","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/124115/9561804","note":"Independent confirmation of the pre-sale price list straight from 國際富豪汽車's announcement, quoted verbatim: 299 / 359 / 383 (七座版) / 389 (六座版) 萬元. Explicitly 首波預接單價, establishing that 299萬 is a 預售價, not yet a final 建議售價."},{"name":"UDN 發燒車訊 - VOLVO EX90 預售啟動 299 萬元起 (2026-06-13)","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/124115/9564084","note":"Second independent report of the same price list. Also the source for 「EX90 導入 800V 高壓電能架構，支援最高 350 kW DC 直流快速充電」 and 10-80% in ~22 minutes, and gives 106 kWh for the Twin Motor - which is why the 92 kWh figure in this record is taken from the U-CAR spec sheet's single-motor column instead."},{"name":"VOLVO 保養服務規劃 (Volvo Cars Taiwan official maintenance-cost planner)","url":"https://volvomsp.volvocartw.com/MaintenanceService/","note":"THE key maintenance source, retrieved and read by this review on 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200). Footnote confirmed verbatim: 「台灣市場Volvo電動車享有4年或8萬公里免費保養專案」 and 「4年8萬公里免費保養專案，必須依照指定保養間隔或里程執行，國際富豪汽車股份有限公司保留更改、取消之權利」. Querying it for the EX40 Single motor returns a 30,000/60,000 km BEV service interval with every basic line at NT$0, and prices the chargeable exceptions (煞車油更換 645+872, 擋風玻璃清洗劑 315). Querying XC90 B5 returns a 10,000 km interval at NT$12,615 per service, giving the direct BEV-vs-combustion comparison."},{"name":"VOLVO SELEKT 原廠認證中古車 - 在售車輛列表","url":"https://www.volvoselekt.com.tw/list.php","note":"Real dealer-retail asking prices used to build the depreciation curve. Re-retrieved by this review on 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200, 146 cars listed) and every listing below was matched verbatim. Volvo BEVs: 2026年式 EX30 Plus 3,600 km / 146.0萬; 2026年式 EX30 Core Single Motor 7,271 km / 119.8萬; 2025年式 EC40 Plus Single motor 806 km / 159.0萬; 2025年式 EC40 Single Motor 1,050 km / 158.0萬; 2025年式 EX40 Ultra Twin motor 37,914 km / 157.0萬; 2024 C40 U Twin motor 33,058 km / 155.0萬; 2022 XC40 Recharge Ultimate Twin motor 22,000 km / 126.0萬. Predecessor large SUV: 22/23年式 XC90 B5 Momentum 30,095 km / 148.0萬; 2022 XC90 B5 R-Design AWD 39,000 km / 166.0萬; 2018 XC90 T5 Momentum 54,500 km / 98.0萬. All are 車商售價 on 原廠認證 stock (the top of the retail range) and were adjusted down 12% to private sale, then a further 13% to trade-in."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Volvo 二手車行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/volvo","note":"Broader (non-certified) dealer asking prices, retrieved 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200), used mainly for the older/higher-mileage XC90 points that Selekt does not carry: 2020 XC90 B5 Momentum 96,400 km / 109.9萬; 2017 XC90 T5 127,900 km / 70.9萬; 2016 XC90 D5 Momentum (5-seat) 214,900 km / 55.9萬. These are 車商售價 and are the basis for the mileage correction applied at the 7- and 10-year checkpoints."},{"name":"KingAutos - 2026 Volvo 車系車款規格價格資訊","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/volvo","note":"Evidence of Volvo Taiwan BEV price cuts, re-retrieved 2026-08-12 and confirmed: the XC40 row still lists Recharge Plus Single Motor $191萬 and Recharge Ultimate Twin Motor $222萬 (純電動車 BEV) which, against today's EX40 at 169萬/189萬, is a 12-15% list-price cut on effectively the same car. Its related-news index also carries 《Volvo XC40 Recharge》折23萬元的優惠, confirming a 23萬 run-out discount."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - Volvo EX40 車款介紹","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/volvo/ex40/7129/overall","note":"Re-retrieved 2026-08-12: current EX40 list prices Plus Single Motor 169萬 (後輪驅動) and Ultra Twin Motor 189萬 (四輪驅動) - the 'after' side of the XC40 Recharge to EX40 price cut, and the pricing anchor for the EX40 Selekt used listings."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - Volvo EC40 車款介紹","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/volvo/ec40/7130/overall","note":"Current EC40 list prices (Plus Single motor 179萬, Ultra Twin Motor 199萬), used to date-anchor the near-new EC40 Selekt listings used in the year-1 checkpoint."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - Volvo XC90 車款介紹","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/volvo/xc90/6995/overall","note":"Re-retrieved 2026-08-12: current XC90 list prices B5 AWD Plus 295.6萬 / B5 AWD Ultra 337.1萬 / T8 AWD Plug in Hybrid Ultra 377.6萬, establishing that the XC90 sits in the same price bracket as the EX90 and is the right predecessor for the 7- and 10-year extrapolation."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - Volvo EX30 車款介紹","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/volvo/ex30/6973/overall","note":"Re-retrieved 2026-08-12: EX30 list prices Single Extended Range Core 139.9萬, Single Extended Range Plus 159.99萬, Twin Motor Performance Ultra 174.99萬, used to convert the two near-new EX30 Selekt listings into retention ratios for the year-1 checkpoint."},{"name":"Volvo Cars Taiwan - 8 月購車方案","url":"https://www.volvocartw.com/monthly-offers/","note":"Official August 2026 offers, retrieved and read by this review on 2026-08-12. Basis for the small discounts figure: every offer is financing (EX30 0 頭款 / 月付 15,000 起; EC40 and EX40 月付 19,888 / 72 期; XC60, XC90, V60 120萬 40期 0% 利率) or a soft sweetener (1 year 乙式全險, 第 4 年延長保固 on XC90/V60) - no cash discount on any model, and the EX90 does not appear at all because it is still in pre-order. Also the source for the subsidy asymmetry noted in purchase.notes: the 「政府貨物稅減徵及汰舊換新最高 NT$100,000 補助」 line appears only on the combustion/hybrid rows and on none of the BEV rows."}]},"volvo-xc40-b3-plus":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year; every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7000/21000/35000/49000/70000), roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. Consequences baked into the numbers: (1) resale is quoted off LOW-MILEAGE listings, since nearly every real XC40 comp on the market at a given age carries 1.5-3x this mileage; (2) servicing is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven - Volvo's interval is 1 year or 10,000 km whichever comes first, and at 7,000 km/year the clock always wins, so one service per year, 10 over 10 years; (3) consumables that age out rather than wear out (tires, brake fluid, coolant, 12V AGM battery) dominate mid-life cost, while the one mileage-driven item (7-speed DCT wet-clutch oil at ~60,000 km) does not fall due until roughly year 9. POWERTRAIN LABEL CAVEAT: 'hybrid' here means 48V MILD hybrid (Volvo TW markets it as 輕油電; SUM classifies used B-series XC40s as 油電車). It is NOT a full hybrid and NOT a plug-in: it cannot move on electric power at all, its 14.8 km/L NEDC economy and its service schedule are those of a 2.0 turbo petrol car, not of a Toyota-style HEV. Do not read this row as comparable to a full hybrid on running cost. There is NO plug and NO home-charger cost - nothing to install and nothing excluded on that account. Vehicle licence tax (牌照稅) and fuel tax (燃料費) and insurance are EXCLUDED by design throughout. For reference only, U-CAR lists this trim's annual 相關稅費 as 燃6,180 / 牌11,230; the 1,969 c.c. engine sits in a higher licence-tax bracket than the 1.5L T2 it replaced.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - weakest checkpoint in this record, re-derived and left unchanged. No 1-year-old XC40 is listed on SUM 汽車網 (I re-fetched the full XC40 result set: 16 listings, newest model year 2024). Anchored on the closest real low-mileage Volvo SUV comp, verified by direct fetch of SUM's XC60 result set: a 2024 XC60 2.0 with 11,704 km asking 175.8 萬 車商售價 against a ~239 萬 original list = ~74% dealer-retail retention at 2 years on a genuinely low-mileage car. Walked back one year to ~79-80% dealer-retail retention for a 1-year, 7,000 km XC40 - trimmed slightly because the XC40 is a weaker retainer than the XC60, Volvo TW's volume model - giving ~133-135 萬 dealer asking against the 169 萬 bare list. DEALER-RETAIL TO PRIVATE ADJUSTMENT: SUM prices are 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking), never copied across. Private sale set ~12% below at NT$1,180,000; dealer trade-in (車商收購價) a further ~14% below at NT$1,020,000. Year-one depreciation on Taiwan luxury imports is brutal regardless of mileage."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Re-verified against the live SUM 汽車網 XC40 result set and left unchanged. Real same-nameplate comps at exactly this age (2023 cars = 3 years old), all 1,500 c.c. T2 trims, 車商售價: 39,987 km asking 89.8 萬; 43,000 km asking 89.5 萬; 52,811 km asking 86.8 萬; 82,971 km asking 82.8 萬. Against a 142.9 萬 T2 original list (KingAutos 23年式 table) that is 57.9-62.8% dealer-retail retention, and the four points imply roughly -0.16 萬 per 1,000 km in this band. LOW-MILEAGE ADJUSTMENT: our buyer is at 21,000 km, about half the tightest comp, so extrapolating back along that slope and flattening it gives ~65% retention, i.e. ~110 萬 dealer asking on the 169 萬 bare list. The T2-to-B3 uplift is supported by a directly measured same-year, same-mileage pair in the same result set: 2022 XC40 2.0 油電 at 30,000 km asking 93.8 萬 versus 2022 XC40 1.5 at 30,571 km asking 75.9 萬, a +23.6% used premium for the 2.0 mild hybrid, larger than the +18.3% new-price gap - so the ratio method is if anything conservative here. DEALER-RETAIL TO PRIVATE ADJUSTMENT: private sale ~11% below dealer asking at NT$990,000; dealer trade-in a further ~13% below at NT$860,000. Still inside Volvo's 3-year factory warranty, which supports the price."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Re-verified against the live SUM 汽車網 XC40 result set and left unchanged. Best comp is the low-mileage one: 2021 XC40 2.0 油電 (B4), 42,546 km, 4WD, asking 98.0 萬 車商售價. Higher-mileage comps confirm the mileage penalty is real: 2021 2.0 B4 at 95,799 km asking 79.8 萬, and 2021 1.5 at 140,099 km asking 57.8 萬. Denominator caveat: the ~182.9 萬 Plus B4 list used as the ratio base comes from the KingAutos 23年式/24年式 tables, whereas a 2021 car was sold under the earlier Momentum naming and this particular comp is AWD - so the denominator is approximate and the 'B4 Plus' label the previous draft attached to it is not strictly correct. On that base, 98.0/182.9 = 53.6% dealer-retail retention at 5 years. LOW-MILEAGE ADJUSTMENT: our buyer is at 35,000 km, below even the best comp, so retention lifts to ~55%, giving ~93 萬 dealer asking on the 169 萬 bare list. DEALER-RETAIL TO PRIVATE ADJUSTMENT: private sale ~11% below dealer asking at NT$825,000; dealer trade-in a further ~13% below at NT$720,000. Factory warranty has expired, which is what starts pulling the curve down."},{"y":7,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from NT$580,000 / NT$500,000. The comps themselves are real and I re-verified every one against the live SUM 汽車網 XC40 result set - the XC40 launched in Taiwan in 2018, so cars of this exact age do trade here: 2019 XC40 2.0 T5 R-Design, 70,000 km, 4WD, asking 65.8 萬 車商售價; 2019 XC40 2.0, 130,961 km, 4WD, asking 59.8 萬; 2018 XC40 2.0, 81,124 km, 4WD, asking 65.8 萬. Against a ~199 萬 original list for the T5 R-Design that is ~33% dealer-retail retention. LOW-MILEAGE ADJUSTMENT: every real comp at this age carries 70,000-131,000 km versus our buyer's 49,000 km, so retention lifts to ~37%, giving ~62.5 萬 dealer asking on the 169 萬 bare list - unchanged from the previous draft. THE ERROR WAS IN THE LAST STEP: the previous draft then set private_sale_price at NT$580,000, only 7.2% below its own 62.5 萬 dealer-retail anchor, breaking the 8-15% dealer-to-private haircut it applied at every other checkpoint (12%, 11%, 11%, 9%). Re-applying the same ~11% gives NT$555,000, and a further ~13.5% gives a dealer trade-in of NT$480,000. Held to medium, not high: the 2018-2019 T4/T5 original lists (~179-199 萬) are less firmly sourced than the 2023-onward figures, and a 2019 T5 R-Design AWD is a richer trim than a 2026 Plus B3. The year-5-to-year-7 cliff is in the raw comps, not invented - Taiwan buyers price out-of-warranty European repair risk."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - re-derived and left unchanged. No genuine 10-year XC40 data exists: the XC40 arrived in Taiwan in 2018, so the oldest cars trading are 8 years old and a 10-year-old XC40 will not exist until 2028. Per method, I used the PREDECESSOR-generation Volvo SUV actually trading at that age - the first-generation XC60 (2009-2017) - expressed as a retention ratio of its own original list, then applied that ratio here. Real SUM 汽車網 XC60 comps, all re-fetched and confirmed: 2017, 115,000 km, asking 49.8 萬; 2015, 152,213 km, 32.8 萬; 2015, 167,874 km, 36.8 萬; 2014, 150,000 km, 32.8 萬; 2014, 180,203 km, 28.8 萬; 2015, 241,600 km, 29.8 萬. Against a ~200 萬 first-gen XC60 original list that is ~16-18% at 11-12 years and ~25% at 9 years, which brackets ~20-22% at exactly 10 years for a typical-mileage car. LOW-MILEAGE ADJUSTMENT - the largest single adjustment in this record and the main reason confidence is low: every comp carries 115,000-240,000 km against our buyer's 70,000 km, so retention lifts to ~24%, giving ~40.6 萬 dealer asking on the 169 萬 bare list. DEALER-RETAIL TO PRIVATE ADJUSTMENT: private sale ~9% below at NT$370,000; dealer trade-in a further ~15% below at NT$315,000. Treat as a reasoned band, not a quote: a defensible range is 20-28% retention, moving private_sale_price between roughly NT$310,000 and NT$430,000."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"CORRECTED from NT$3,000. The previous draft billed NT$0 for this service under Volvo TW's 「3年/3萬公里免費保養套裝」. I fetched that UDN 發燒車訊 article: it is dated 2025-08-18 and its own text limits the offer to 「即日起至9月30日止」 (2025-09-30). It cannot be applied to a car bought on 2026-08-12, and the MY2026 lineup announcement offers no XC40 replacement. Priced instead as one owner-paid annual service for a 2.0 mild hybrid at Volvo TW dealer rates plus consumables. Time-driven annual interval, not mileage-driven - 7,000 km never reaches the 10,000 km trigger. Low confidence: no official Volvo TW service price table was reachable (403)."},{"y":3,"source":"CORRECTED from NT$12,000, same reason as year 1: the free-maintenance campaign this window relied on closed on 2025-09-30 per the fetched article's own text and publication date. Two owner-paid annual services at Volvo TW dealer rates, plus the age-driven consumables that fall in a 1-3y window - notably the first brake-fluid change, which the previous draft omitted from this window even though it applied a 2-year interval everywhere else. Interval is time-driven: at 7,000 km/year the buyer reaches only 21,000 km by year 3. Low confidence on the per-service prices; the interval itself is sourced."},{"y":5,"source":"REDUCED from NT$79,000. The tire line was costed as 19-inch rubber; U-CAR's fetched spec table shows the Plus B3 wears 235/55 R18 (the 19-inch 235/50 R19 belongs to the Ultra B4), so the set of 4 drops from ~NT$32,000 to ~NT$26,000. Everything else stands. This is the first window with the factory warranty gone and the first age-driven tire replacement, which is why the cost steps up sharply. Tires are replaced on AGE: 35,000 km leaves plenty of tread, but 5-6 year old rubber gets changed regardless. The AGM battery is specified because the 48V mild-hybrid start-stop system is much harder on the 12V battery than a conventional car. Built from Volvo TW dealer service pricing norms; official price table unreachable (403), hence low confidence."},{"y":7,"source":"Unchanged - reviewed and found sound. First window carrying an explicit out-of-warranty risk provision: the 3-year factory warranty is long gone and this is a European turbo with a 48V mild-hybrid ISG whose belt and starter-generator are known owner-paid items. Spark plugs and coolant are placed here on age/interval rather than mileage. The DCT oil service is deliberately NOT in this window - at 7,000 km/year the car has reached only 49,000 km and the ~60,000 km trigger falls in the next period. Built from Volvo TW dealer service pricing norms; official table and Mobile01 owner receipts both unreachable (403), hence low confidence."},{"y":10,"source":"Held at NT$185,000, with the tire line corrected from 19-inch to the Plus B3's actual 235/55 R18 (NT$34,000 down to NT$28,000) and the risk provision trimmed to NT$43,000 so the itemised lines sum to the stated total. Most expensive window by a wide margin, and the reason is structural rather than mileage: three services, a second age-driven tire set, a 10-year suspension refresh, and the largest out-of-warranty provision in the record. The DCT oil service finally lands here - 60,000 km is not reached until roughly year 9 at 7,000 km/year, so this low-mileage buyer defers it out of the 5-7y window entirely. Total 10-year maintenance across all five checkpoints is NT$387,000, about NT$38,700/year, which is what a Volvo in Taiwan costs when NO free-servicing campaign applies. Built from Volvo TW dealer service pricing norms; no official table or owner receipts reachable (403), hence low confidence."}],"sources":[{"name":"UDN 發燒車訊 - 2026 年式 Volvo 40 車系全陣容耀眼登場 169 萬起從容駕馭 (Volvo Taiwan official MY2026 price announcement, published 2026-03-05)","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/9361642","note":"PRIMARY PRICE SOURCE, re-fetched and parsed on 2026-08-12. Official table 「2026 年式 Volvo 40 全車系建議售價」: XC40 Plus B3 (含 6.6 萬元Plus Pack) 175.6 萬元, Ultra B4 199 萬元; EX40 Plus Single motor 169 萬, EX40 Ultra Twin motor 189 萬, EC40 Plus Single motor 179 萬, EC40 Ultra Twin motor 199 萬. This is the basis for list_price = 1,756,000. Also establishes that the only MY2026 purchase incentive announced is for the XC60, not the XC40 - which is why no free-maintenance credit is taken in years 1 and 3."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車型錄 - Volvo XC40 trim and price table","url":"http://newcar.u-car.com.tw/volvo/xc40/7131/overall","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-12. Lists exactly two trims: Plus B3 = 169 萬 (1,969 c.c., 163hp, 14.8 km/L), Ultra B4 = 199 萬 (1,969 c.c., 197hp, 14.4 km/L), both 七速自手排 front-wheel drive. This is the bare-body price basis; the 6.6 萬 gap to the official 175.6 萬 is the bundled Plus Pack. Also gives annual 相關稅費 燃6,180 / 牌11,230 (excluded by design)."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車型錄 - Volvo XC40 full specification table","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/volvo/xc40/7131/spec","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-12. TIRE-SIZE CORRECTION SOURCE: Plus B3 runs 235/55 R18, Ultra B4 runs 235/50 R19 - the previous draft costed 19-inch tires for this trim. Also confirms 動力系統 48V輕油電混合, 汽油, 1,969 c.c. 直列4汽缸 渦輪增壓 缸內直噴, kerb weight 1,649 kg, 54-litre tank."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車型錄 - 豪華中型小型SUV運動休旅 segment index","url":"http://newcar.u-car.com.tw/segment/32/豪華中型小型SUV運動休旅","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-12, returns HTTP 200 and shows the Volvo XC40 range as 169 - 199 萬, consistent with U-CAR's own trim table. Confirms the URL is genuine, but it is the same database as the trim table above, so it is not an independent third check on price."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - VOLVO XC40 used-car listings (中古車實價)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=4&brand=VOLVO&model=XC40","note":"PRIMARY USED-VALUE SOURCE, independently re-fetched and re-parsed on 2026-08-12. 16 real listings, model years 2018-2024, each with year, displacement, mileage and 車商售價. Every comp quoted in the year-3, year-5 and year-7 source strings was verified against this fetch. All prices are dealer RETAIL asking and were adjusted downward to private-sale and trade-in figures."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - VOLVO XC60 used-car listings (predecessor-generation 10-year anchor)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=4&brand=VOLVO&model=XC60","note":"Re-fetched and re-parsed 2026-08-12: 28 real listings, model years 2011-2024. Used ONLY for the 10-year extrapolation (first-generation XC60 at 9-12 years: 2017 115,000 km 49.8 萬; 2015 152,213 km 32.8 萬; 2015 167,874 km 36.8 萬; 2014 150,000 km 32.8 萬; 2015 241,600 km 29.8 萬) and for the year-1 anchor (2024 XC60, 11,704 km, 175.8 萬)."},{"name":"UDN 發燒車訊 - Volvo XC40 B3 立享「3 年 3 萬公里免費保養」(published 2025-08-18, offer closed 2025-09-30)","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/8946537","note":"EXPIRED PROMOTION - cited here to document why it is NOT applied. Body reads 「即日起至9月30日止，購入Volvo XC40 B3即享超低月付優惠專案，國際富豪汽車再限時贈3年/3萬免費保養套裝」; page metadata gives datePublished 2025-08-18. The offer therefore closed on 2025-09-30 and cannot be credited to a 2026-08-12 purchase. Still valuable as a powertrain source: Drive-E 缸內直噴渦輪增壓汽油引擎 163hp/27kgm plus 48V Mild Hybrid +14hp through a 七速 DCT."},{"name":"KingAutos - 《Volvo XC40》新年式車型調整｜調漲1.6萬元","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/351356","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-12. HISTORICAL LIST PRICES used as denominators for the retention ratios: Plus T2 142.9 萬 raised to 144.5 萬; new Ultimate B4 199 萬; Plus B4 182.9 萬 and Ultimate B5 AWD 209 萬 discontinued."},{"name":"KingAutos - 23年式《Volvo XC40》首次導入Google車載系統 新增超值入門車款","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/347366","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-12. Confirms 23年式 XC40 T2 entry price 142.9 萬 (1,477 c.c. three-cylinder, 129hp) and B5 AWD 208 萬 - the denominators behind the 3-year and 5-year retention ratios. Caveat recorded in the year-5 source: these are 23年式 figures, so using 182.9 萬 as the base for a 2021 AWD B4 is approximate."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Volvo brand used listings (brand id 48)","url":"https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=48","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-12, returns HTTP 200. Used only as a sanity check on the Volvo depreciation shape in Taiwan; 8891's XC40-specific model filter was not reachable, so NO XC40 figure in this record comes from 8891 and the dealer-to-private haircuts are calibrated against SUM's 車商售價 instead."}]},"volvo-xc90-b5-plus":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year (midpoint 7,000), roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. Every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years. Two consequences drive the record. (1) Maintenance is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven: Volvo Taiwan's scheduled interval is 1萬公里 or 1年, whichever comes first, so at 7,000 km/year the car returns annually and never reaches the mileage trigger. Age-driven consumables (tyres hardening at 5-6 years, brake fluid every 2 years, 12V AGM battery at 4-5 years, coolant) dominate the bill instead of wear-driven ones. (2) Resale sits ABOVE the mileage-blind average: at 5 years this car has 35,000 km while the 2021 XC90 listings actually on findcar today run 50,005-155,000 km, so each checkpoint is anchored on the LOWEST-mileage listing in its cluster and this is stated in every source string. POWERTRAIN CLASSIFICATION: the B5 is a 48V MILD hybrid (MHEV) — it cannot move on electric power alone. It is recorded as 'hybrid' because that is the closest value in the allowed enum, but it should not be read as a full hybrid; it is a petrol engine with a belt-driven integrated starter-generator. It never needs charging, so there is NO home-charger cost (the T8 PHEV, a different and more expensive trim, would). Excluded by design across the whole record: 牌照稅/燃料稅, insurance, and fuel. Volvo Taiwan's 4年/8萬公里免費定期保養 programme is EV-only and does NOT cover this mild-hybrid B5 — re-verified against the official monthly-offers page, whose current XC90 offer contains no free-maintenance item.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"RE-VERIFIED BY THIS AUDIT. Dealer retail anchor: 8891 listing of a 2025 XC90 B5 Plus in New Taipei asking NT$2,270,000 (auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4261283.html) — I re-fetched this page and the 227萬 ask is real. That is 車商售價, not what a seller receives. CAP THAT FORCED A CORRECTION: I also re-fetched the Volvo Selekt 原廠認證 listing for a 2024 Plus B5 AWD, 16,000 km, registered 2024-02-28, asking NT$1,850,000, and 8891 shows a 2024 Plus B5 AWD at 44,000 km asking NT$1,688,000. A private 1-year car cannot ask 200萬 when a factory-certified 2-year car with warranty, reconditioning and dealer finance sits at 185萬 retail — the two would be only 8% apart across a full year plus certification. ADJUSTMENT: retail comparable ~225萬 for our 7,000 km car, then a 13.5% cut to 1,950,000 for private sale. The cut is at the WIDE end of the 8-15% band precisely because near-new private sellers compete head-on with certified dealer stock they cannot match on warranty or financing. dealer_tradein_price 1,700,000 is a further 12.8% below private (about 25% under the retail ask), which is what a Volvo dealer pays on a 1-year-old car it will recondition and re-list near 225萬. Low mileage (7,000 km vs a typical 15,000-20,000 at 1 year) is worth roughly 3-5% and is included."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Best-evidenced checkpoint, but the private figure is still MODELLED from retail asks, which is why confidence is medium and not high. Real listings of the same trim at near-identical mileage: Volvo Selekt 原廠認證 2024 XC90 Plus B5 AWD, 16,000 km, registered 2024-02-28, asking 185.0萬 (volvoselekt.com.tw detail 2128 — re-fetched and confirmed by this audit); 8891 2024 Plus B5 AWD at 44,000 km asking 168.8萬 (re-fetched and confirmed); findcar 2023 XC90 Plus B5 AWD 7-seat, 16,956 km, asking 194.8萬; 8891 2023 B5 AWD Plus 159.3萬. ADJUSTMENT: the 194.8萬 findcar ask is a high outlier — a NEWER factory-certified 2024 car asks only 185.0萬, and an uncertified older car cannot be worth more. Both verified 2-year asks (185.0萬 certified / 168.8萬 at 44,000 km) cap a 3-year car below ~175萬, so I set the retail comparable at ~174萬, then cut 12% to 1,530,000 for private sale. dealer_tradein_price 1,320,000 is a further 13.7% below private. Retention cross-check: this trim listed at 294-295.6萬 in MY23/MY24, so a 174萬 retail ask is ~59% of original list at 3 years, consistent with the whole cluster. Low mileage is already reflected because the chosen comparables are themselves the 16,000-17,000 km cars."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"RE-VERIFIED BY THIS AUDIT against the live findcar 2021 page: 153.8萬 @50,005 km, 138.0萬 @72,000 km, 115.8萬 @155,000 km (all 車商售價). 8891 adds 2021 B5 R-Design 119.9萬 @89,400 km, 2021 B5 Momentum 125.0萬, and — the useful cap — a 2022 (4-year-old) B5 Momentum at 139.8萬 @54,000 km. ADJUSTMENT: our 35,000 km car sits BELOW the lowest-mileage comparable (50,005 km at 153.8萬) and the Plus outranks the Momentum that dominates this vintage, so it belongs at the top of the cluster. But it cannot ask much above the 4-year-old car at 139.8萬, so I set the retail comparable at ~148萬 rather than the 150萬+ the raw mileage gradient alone would suggest. Cut 12% for private sale → 1,300,000. dealer_tradein_price 1,120,000 is a further 13.8% below private; the gap widens slightly versus year 3 because the factory warranty (3年/10萬公里, extended to year 4 by the current promo) has expired and the dealer now carries the repair risk."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM SAME-GENERATION CARS, MILEAGE-ADJUSTED — stated explicitly, not presented as direct data. The 2nd-generation XC90 ran 2015-2026 with two facelifts, so 2019 cars ARE the same generation (no predecessor substitution needed), but they are pre-facelift and use T5/D5 engines rather than the B5 mild hybrid. Re-fetched findcar 2019: 129.8萬 @116,809 km and 100.8萬 @100,914 km (T5 Momentum) — only TWO XC90 listings on that page, so it is a thin cluster. THE CORRECTION: 8891 carries a third 2019 comparable the original record missed — a T5 Momentum at 117,500 km asking only 87.9萬 — plus a 2020 (6-year-old) B5 Momentum at 109.9萬 @96,400 km and another at 88.8萬 @129,200 km. A 7-year car cannot out-ask the 6-year B5 at 109.9萬 by much, and the 129.8萬 findcar ask is the outlier of the set, not its centre. ADJUSTMENT: retail comparable ~112萬 (above the 100.8萬 and 87.9萬 high-mileage cars for our 49,000 km advantage, but held under the 6-year-old 109.9萬 car's level plus only a small low-mileage premium). Cut 13% for private sale → 1,000,000. dealer_tradein_price 820,000 is a further 18% below private — a wider cut because a 7-year out-of-warranty European SUV is hard for a dealer to finance and to warrant. Retention cross-check: the 2019 T5 Momentum listed new at 283萬, so 100.8萬 @101,000 km is ~36% of list at 7 years; our low-mileage car at ~40% of list is consistent. Confidence low: the mileage adjustment is a model, not an observation, the powertrain differs, and the discontinuation risk noted below is not priced in."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM SAME-GENERATION CARS, MILEAGE-ADJUSTED — stated explicitly, not presented as direct data. Again no predecessor generation was needed: 2016 XC90s are the same 2nd generation, just first-series with T5/T6/D4/D5 engines. findcar 2016 XC90: 10 cars, 平均車價 88.7萬; individuals 89.8萬 @90,000 km (D4), 79.8萬 @165,582 km (T6 AWD), 75.0萬 @157,128 km, 69.8萬 @143,367 km, 63.8萬 @170,887 km (D4 Momentum); two entries at 120-125萬 look like listing errors against the rest of the set and were discarded. 8891 (re-fetched by this audit) corroborates the level and the shape: 2016 D5 Momentum 55.9萬 @214,900 km, 2017 T5 70.9萬 @127,900 km, 2017 T6 Inscription 92.8萬 @93,000 km. ADJUSTMENT: our 70,000 km is below every credible comparable, so the retail ask sits at the top of the genuine cluster, ~88萬 — level with the 89.8萬 @90,000 km car and the 92.8萬 9-year T6, which is as high as a 10-year import can credibly be listed. Cut 14% for private sale → 755,000; the private/retail gap widens at this age because the dealer's price carries reconditioning and a short warranty a private seller cannot offer. dealer_tradein_price 605,000 is a further 20% below private — dealers pay very little for 10-year European SUVs (high recon cost, no finance available to the next buyer). Retention cross-check: an 88萬 retail ask is ~31% of the ~283萬 original list. Confidence low: mileage adjustment is modelled, the powertrain differs, and the combustion XC90 is at end of life with the electric EX90 as successor — a discontinued flagship from a brand pivoting to EV typically depreciates FASTER in years 7-10 than its own history implies, so this and the 7-year figure should be read as the optimistic end."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Volvo Taiwan interval 1萬公里/1年 (owner and dealer service pages); Mobile01 XC90 owner threads reporting a first service around NT$10,000 including an air filter, and explicitly pushing back on the claim that a single oil change costs NT$7,000-8,000. Time-driven: at 7,000 km the car is nowhere near the 1萬公里 trigger, so this is the 1-year service. Fully inside the 3年/10萬公里 factory warranty, so no repair risk is priced in. No free-maintenance credit applies (see plan_notes)."},{"y":3,"source":"Two annual time-driven services across the 1-3y window (12,000 + 22,000 = 34,000). Sized from Mobile01/Dcard Taiwanese owner reports putting routine Volvo services in the NT$12,000-20,000 range once filters and fluids are included, with the 2萬公里-class service — reached here by TIME at year 3, at only 21,000 km — carrying engine air filter, cabin filter and the 2-year brake fluid change. Still inside factory warranty (3年/10萬公里, extended to year 4 by the current promo), so scheduled work only, no repair allowance."},{"y":5,"source":"Dominated by TIME-EXPIRED consumables, the signature of a low-mileage car. Items: services 13,000 + 17,000, tyres 52,000, AGM battery 11,000 = 93,000 (brake fluid folded into the service line). Tyres are the biggest single item: at 35,000 km the tread is barely worn, but 20-inch premium rubber hardens and must be replaced at 5-6 years on safety grounds — a fitted set of four for an XC90 runs about NT$52,000 in Taiwan. The 12V AGM battery (the mild hybrid keeps a conventional 12V alongside the 48V system) typically dies at 4-5 years at ~NT$11,000. Spark plugs come due on time rather than mileage. Service costs sized from the same Mobile01/Dcard owner reports. Factory warranty has just expired (year 4 with the promo extension), so this window still carries no repair allowance. Note the tyre and battery figures are market-typical prices, not quotes for this car."},{"y":7,"source":"ARITHMETIC CORRECTED BY THIS AUDIT: the itemised lines sum to 15,000 + 26,000 + 36,000 + 25,000 = 102,000, but the original record stated 100,000 for this window; period_cost is now 102,000 so the items reconcile. First window fully OUTSIDE warranty (factory 3年/10萬公里, extended to year 4 by the current offer), so a repair allowance appears here for the first time. Brake job sized from a Dcard owner report of an XC90 brake replacement quoted above NT$40,000 — NT$36,000 covers front pads and discs only, since at 7,000 km/year the pads survive far longer than average and the rears are pushed to the next window. The 8-speed automatic's fluid and the coolant both come due on the 6-year/6萬公里 schedule, landing inside this window by time. The NT$25,000 risk allowance is a modelled provision, not a quote: it is what a 6-7 year premium import typically absorbs in bushings, sensors and mild-hybrid ancillaries once nothing is covered. Confidence low because that provision is an estimate and the B5's 48V components (ISG, 48V battery module) have no established Taiwan out-of-warranty cost record, B5 XC90s having only arrived here around 2020-2021."},{"y":10,"source":"Items sum to 64,000 services + 56,000 tyres + 12,000 battery + 28,000 rear brakes/coolant + 65,000 risk = 225,000. Three annual time-driven services plus a second full round of age-expired consumables — the tyres fitted at year 5 harden out again around year 10-11 even though total mileage is only 70,000 km, and the AGM battery repeats on the same 4-5 year clock. The NT$65,000 risk provision is the honest large item: an 8-10 year XC90 in Taiwan realistically meets at least one significant out-of-warranty repair, and if the car carries the optional four-corner air suspension a single compressor or air spring can consume that provision by itself (the Plus does not fit it as standard, but it is a common option box). Sized from Taiwanese owner reports of Volvo parts and labour pricing rather than from a quote for this car. Confidence low: this window is a modelled provision and the real spread is wide — a lucky car might spend NT$150,000 while an unlucky one exceeds NT$350,000."}],"sources":[{"name":"Yahoo奇摩汽車 — 2026 Volvo XC90 車型與售價","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/volvo-xc90-2026","note":"RE-FETCHED AND CONFIRMED BY THIS AUDIT (2026-08-12). MY2026 Taiwan lineup: Plus B5 AWD NT$2,990,000, Ultra B5 AWD NT$3,390,000, Ultra T8 AWD PHEV NT$3,790,000. This is the independent verification of list_price."},{"name":"KingAutos — Volvo XC90 車型價格表","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/volvo/xc90","note":"RE-FETCHED AND CONFIRMED BY THIS AUDIT. MY2024 table: B5 Momentum 2,895,000, Plus B5 AWD 2,956,000, B5 R-Design 3,355,000, Ultimate B5 AWD 3,371,000, Plus Recharge T8 3,406,000, Ultimate Recharge T8 3,776,000. Confirms 2,956,000 is a real MY2024 price and 2,990,000 is the later MY2026 figure — a 1.15% model-year uplift, not a discrepancy."},{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點 — 第二代二度改款 Volvo XC90 正式在臺上市","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/112982","note":"Taiwan facelift launch, 5 Sep 2025: B5 Plus 295.6萬 / B5 Ultra 337.1萬 / T8 Ultra 377.6萬. Corroborated independently by U-CAR coverage of the same launch (news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/85585) seen in search results."},{"name":"Volvo Cars Taiwan — 當月購車優惠","url":"https://www.volvocartw.com/monthly-offers/","note":"RE-FETCHED AND CONFIRMED BY THIS AUDIT (2026-08-12). Current XC90 offer is finance-led: 120萬/40期0%利率, 1 year 乙式全險, 第4年延長保固, plus up to NT$100,000 政府貨物稅減免/汰舊換新補助. NO headline cash discount and — importantly — NO free scheduled maintenance, which is the direct evidence for excluding the 免費保養 programme from this record."},{"name":"KingAutos — Volvo XC90 現金價專案（MY23 / MY24）","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/353588","note":"Basis for the discount assumption: MY23 Plus B5 AWD 建議售價294萬 → 現金價249萬 (-45萬) plus a free Plus Pack worth 9.9萬; MY24 Plus B5 AWD 295.6萬 → 259萬 (-36.6萬). NOT individually re-fetched by this audit; the MY24 list price it quotes (295.6萬) is independently confirmed by the KingAutos price table above, so the article is consistent with verified data."},{"name":"8891中古車 — 2025 Volvo XC90 B5 Plus 個別物件","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4261283.html","note":"RE-FETCHED AND CONFIRMED BY THIS AUDIT. 2025 XC90 B5 Plus, New Taipei, dealer retail ask NT$2,270,000. This is the 1-year retail anchor — 車商售價, not a private-sale figure."},{"name":"Volvo Selekt 原廠認證中古車 — 2024 XC90 Plus B5 AWD","url":"https://www.volvoselekt.com.tw/detail.php?cars_id=2128","note":"RE-FETCHED AND CONFIRMED BY THIS AUDIT. Factory-certified Plus B5 AWD, registered 2024-02-28, 16,000 km, asking NT$1,850,000, dealer in Xinzhuang, New Taipei. This is the single most important calibration point in the record: it caps both the 1-year and 3-year figures, and it is what exposed the findcar 194.8萬 ask as a high outlier."},{"name":"8891中古車 — Volvo XC90 車款總覽","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/volvo/xc90","note":"RE-FETCHED AND CONFIRMED BY THIS AUDIT. 116 listings, 55.9萬-190萬. Asks read directly off the page: 2024 Plus B5 AWD 168.8萬 @44,000 km; 2022 B5 Momentum 139.8萬 @54,000 km; 2021 B5 R-Design 119.9萬 @89,400 km; 2020 B5 Momentum 109.9萬 @96,400 km and 88.8萬 @129,200 km; 2019 T5 Momentum 87.9萬 @117,500 km; 2018 D5 Inscription 85.8萬 @110,000 km; 2017 T6 Inscription 92.8萬 @93,000 km; 2017 T5 70.9萬 @127,900 km; 2016 D5 Momentum 55.9萬 @214,900 km. The 2019 @87.9萬 and 2020 @109.9萬 entries are what forced the 7-year figure down. All 車商售價."},{"name":"findcar 好車網 — Volvo XC90 2021年式中古車","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&b=73&m=604&y=2021","note":"RE-FETCHED AND CONFIRMED BY THIS AUDIT. 5-year anchor: 153.8萬 @50,005 km (大雅二手車, Taichung), 138.0萬 @72,000 km (名立汽車, Taichung), 115.8萬 @155,000 km (威捷汽車, Tainan). All dealer retail asks. Shows the mileage gradient used to place our 35,000 km car at the top of the cluster."},{"name":"findcar 好車網 — Volvo XC90 2019年式中古車","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&b=73&m=604&y=2019","note":"RE-FETCHED AND CONFIRMED BY THIS AUDIT. 7-year anchor: 129.8萬 @116,809 km and 100.8萬 @100,914 km (T5 Momentum). Only TWO XC90 entries on the page (the '9 cars / 平均車價 91.5萬' summary mostly covers XC60), so this is a thin cluster — which is why the 8891 2019 comparable at 87.9萬 matters and why the 7-year confidence is low."},{"name":"findcar 好車網 — Volvo XC90 2016年式中古車","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&b=73&m=604&y=2016","note":"10-year anchor: 10 cars, 平均車價 88.7萬; individuals 89.8萬 @90,000 km, 79.8萬 @165,582 km, 75.0萬 @157,128 km, 69.8萬 @143,367 km, 63.8萬 @170,887 km. Same generation as the car being priced. Not individually re-fetched by this audit, but the 8891 2016/2017 asks confirm the same price level."},{"name":"findcar 好車網 — Volvo XC90 2024年式中古車","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&b=73&m=604&y=2024","note":"2-year bracket between the 1y and 3y checkpoints: 169.8萬 @31,100 km dealer retail ask. Consistent with the 8891 2024 Plus B5 AWD at 168.8萬 @44,000 km that this audit re-fetched."},{"name":"findcar 好車網 — Volvo XC90 2023年式中古車","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&b=73&m=604&y=2023","note":"3-year anchor: XC90 Plus B5 AWD 7-seat, 16,956 km, dealer retail ask 194.8萬. Same trim and near-identical mileage to our 21,000 km assumption, but treated as a HIGH OUTLIER because the verified Volvo Selekt 2024 certified car at 16,000 km asks only 185.0萬."},{"name":"KingAutos — 2019年式 Volvo XC90 台灣價格表","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/224846","note":"Original list prices used for the 7- and 10-year retention cross-check: T5 Momentum 7人座 283萬, D5 Momentum 293萬, T5 R-Design 333萬, T6 Inscription 372萬, T8 Inscription 385萬. Not individually re-fetched by this audit."},{"name":"Volvo Taiwan — 定期保養費用查詢 (Maintenance Service Planning)","url":"https://volvomsp.volvocartw.com/MaintenanceService/","note":"Official Taiwan scheduled-maintenance cost tool. Returns no public price table without vehicle details and states costs are confirmed only after dealer inspection — so it establishes the official framework but not the numbers. This is why every maintenance checkpoint is capped at medium confidence or lower."},{"name":"8891新車 — 2023 Volvo XC90 B5 AWD Plus 車型價格","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/feature/1984","note":"DOWNGRADED BY THIS AUDIT: seen only via search result, never fetched directly by either pass. Used for the MY23 建議售價 294萬 denominator. Retained because the adjacent KingAutos price table independently confirms MY24 Plus B5 AWD at 2,956,000, putting the MY23 figure in the right band, but it should not be treated as verified on its own."},{"name":"U-CAR — Volvo 台灣保養週期與電動車免費保養專案","url":"https://www.u-car.com.tw/headline.asp?headlineid=69325","note":"DOWNGRADED BY THIS AUDIT: I attempted a direct fetch and the URL returned HTTP 403, so it could not be verified and the URL format looks like a legacy U-CAR path. The claims it was cited for — the 1萬公里/1年 interval and the EV-only scope of the 4年/8萬公里免費保養 — are instead carried by the official Volvo Cars Taiwan monthly-offers page, which shows no free-maintenance item for the XC90. Treat this entry as unverified corroboration only."}]},"volvo-xc90-t8-ultra":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr; every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7000 / 21000 / 35000 / 49000 / 70000). At 7,000 km/yr the Volvo service interval (12 months or 10,000 km, whichever first) is TIME-DRIVEN, not mileage-driven, so the car gets one service per year regardless of distance and never reaches a mileage-triggered major service inside 10 years. Consequences baked into the numbers: (a) consumables that age out rather than wear out dominate - tyres are replaced on age at ~year 5 and ~year 10, not on tread depth; (b) the 12V AGM battery and brake fluid follow the calendar; (c) brake discs on a PHEV driven this little tend to surface-rust from regen braking, so discs are budgeted alongside pads rather than pads alone. Used values are quoted for LOW-MILEAGE examples (roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/yr), which sell above the mileage-blind market average. EXCLUDED by design: tax (牌照稅/燃料費) and insurance. ALSO EXCLUDED and not counted as maintenance: home AC wallbox supply and installation for the plug-in hybrid - Volvo TW normally supplies a portable/wall charger with the car, but apartment-building electrical work and a dedicated meter in Taiwan typically runs NT$20,000-60,000 extra and is a one-off ownership cost, not a service item. This car can also be run purely on petrol, so the charger is optional rather than mandatory.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWNWARD BY THIS AUDIT (was NT$2,700,000 private / NT$2,360,000 trade-in). The prior figure was back-solved from an assumed '79% of list' dealer-retail retention while ignoring the best anchor available: Volvo Selekt (https://www.volvoselekt.com.tw/list.php?cars_type_sub_id=9) lists a MY2024 XC90 T8 Plus at 10,225 km asking NT$2,280,000 - a 2-year-old, very-low-mileage T8 that closely matches this buyer's usage. A year-1 PRIVATE price of NT$2,700,000 would have sat 18% ABOVE a 2-year-old certified dealer RETAIL ask, which is incoherent. Re-derivation: strip the ~6% Selekt certification premium from NT$2,280,000 to get ordinary dealer retail ~NT$2,143,000; express that against that car's REAL transaction price (list NT$3,406,000 less ~NT$350,000 of documented run-out discounting = ~NT$3,056,000) for 70.1% retention at 2 years; apply to this car's transaction price (NT$3,776,000 - NT$200,000 = NT$3,576,000) for a year-2 dealer retail of ~NT$2,508,000; step back one year (+11%) for a year-1 dealer retail ask of ~NT$2,784,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale_price = dealer retail less 10% -> NT$2,520,000; dealer_tradein_price = private less 12.5% -> NT$2,200,000. Transaction-price basis is used deliberately because the predecessor's list price was heavily discounted while this car's is not, so a list-to-list ratio would overstate the fall. Still an extrapolation: the facelift only launched 2025-09-05, so no genuine 1-year-old example of THIS car has traded."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Anchored on Volvo Selekt (https://www.volvoselekt.com.tw/list.php?cars_type_sub_id=9): MY2023 XC90 T8 Plus, 11,000 km, certified ask NT$2,320,000 - a genuine 3-year-old low-mileage T8, verified live in this audit. DENOMINATOR CORRECTED BY THIS AUDIT: the researcher divided this Plus-trim car by NT$3,760,000, which is the Ultimate/Inscription list, not the Plus list. Verified actual contemporary list for the MY2023 XC90 Plus Recharge T8 is NT$3,390,000 (8891 新車 '原廠售價 339.00萬'; the MY2024 equivalent is NT$3,406,000). Stripping the ~6% certification premium gives ordinary dealer retail ~NT$2,181,000 = 64.3% of the correct list (the researcher's wrong denominator produced 58.0%, understating retention by ~6 points). Applying 64.3% to NT$3,776,000 implies a dealer retail ask of ~NT$2,429,000; applying a 3-point haircut because a top Ultra trim retains slightly less than a mid Plus trim gives ~NT$2,320,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale = dealer retail less 10%; dealer trade-in = private less 12.5%. The two bracket NT$2,088,000-2,186,000 private and NT$1,827,000-1,913,000 trade-in, so the researcher's NT$2,120,000 / NT$1,850,000 survive the denominator fix and are retained. Cross-check: 8891 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/volvo/xc90) lists a MY2022 Recharge T8 Inscription at 54,000 km for NT$1,888,000, consistent once the extra 33,000 km and one more year are priced in."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Near-exact real-world match, verified live in this audit: FindCar (https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/xc90%20t8) lists a MY2021 XC90 T8 7-seater with 36,000 km asking NT$1,758,000 (dealer 達興汽車, Tainan) - 5 years old at almost exactly our assumed mileage, and a 車商 dealer RETAIL ask. DENOMINATOR CORRECTED BY THIS AUDIT: the researcher used NT$3,760,000; FindCar's own new-car reference table gives the MY2021 XC90 T8 Recharge Inscription at NT$3,690,000. That is 47.6% dealer-retail retention (not 46.8%). Applied to NT$3,776,000 -> dealer retail ask ~NT$1,799,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale = retail less 10% -> NT$1,610,000; dealer trade-in = private less 12.5% -> NT$1,410,000 (was NT$1,590,000 / NT$1,390,000; the small uplift is purely the denominator fix). The low-mileage premium this buyer earns is visible in the same dataset: a same-year MY2021 T8 Inscription with 101,000 km sits at only NT$1,400,000 on Volvo Selekt, ~20% below the 36,000 km car. Cross-check: Selekt MY2022 T8 Plus, 30,000 km, NT$1,900,000 (4 years)."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - no 7-year-old example of the current generation exists, so this uses the PREDECESSOR generation expressed as a retention ratio and re-applied to this car. Real predecessor data point, verified live: 8891 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/volvo/xc90) lists a MY2020 XC90 T8 Inscription with 42,000 km at NT$1,588,000 - 6 years old, low mileage. Against the corrected MY2020 T8 Inscription list of NT$3,690,000 (FindCar new-car reference; the researcher used NT$3,760,000) that is 43.0% retention. Extending one more year on the observed ~4 point/year slope in this zone gives ~39% at 7 years, i.e. a dealer retail ask of ~NT$1,474,000 on our car. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale = retail less 10% -> NT$1,320,000; dealer trade-in = private less 12.5% -> NT$1,155,000. Extra downward pressure reflected here: the 3-year factory warranty is long gone and buyers start pricing in Four-C air suspension and PHEV repair risk."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor generation - NO 2016-2017 XC90 T8 is currently trading in Taiwan (the T8 was a rare, expensive variant then: T8 Inscription launched at NT$3,850,000 and T8 Excellence at NT$4,200,000-4,700,000), so a genuine 10-year T8 market does not exist. Method: take the 2016 XC90 generation now at 10 years old. FindCar (https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/xc90) shows a 2016 XC90 average of NT$887,000, and 8891 shows 2016 D5 cars at 200,500 km / NT$690,000 and 214,900 km / NT$559,000 - against ~NT$2,850,000 average 2016 list that is ~31% retention at typical (150,000-200,000 km) mileage. Adding the low-mileage premium a 70,000 km car earns at this age (+~25%) gives ~38%, then subtracting a PHEV penalty because the 8-year/160,000 km high-voltage battery warranty has lapsed by year 8 and Taiwanese buyers discount an out-of-warranty PHEV traction pack heavily, lands at ~28% of list -> dealer retail ask ~NT$1,060,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private = retail less 10% -> NT$950,000; trade-in = private less ~17% (dealers cut harder on old, hard-to-move luxury PHEVs) -> NT$790,000. Genuinely extrapolated, not observed, and the donor pool is diesel/petrol rather than PHEV - hence low confidence. Retained unchanged by this audit: the endpoint is defensible and no better data exists."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"REPRICED BY THIS AUDIT (was NT$2,000). The prior figure assumed a negotiated 3yr/30,000km free scheduled-maintenance package as the base case; this audit verified that Volvo TW free servicing is a rotating promotion tied to specific campaigns (the live one found is XC40 B3, time-limited to 9/30) and not standard on the XC90 T8 Ultra, and that the standard 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty covers repairs rather than routine servicing. Per-visit rate from Volvo Taipei's published NT$8,000-15,000 routine-service band, taken near the top for the flagship. Service scope cross-checked against the official Volvo TW scheduled-maintenance lookup (https://volvomsp.volvocartw.com/MaintenanceService/), which validates content but publishes no flat price table. Deduct ~NT$13,000 if a free-service package is secured."},{"y":3,"source":"REPRICED BY THIS AUDIT (was NT$8,000), same basis as year 1: free scheduled maintenance is promotion-dependent, not contractual, so the base case pays for servicing. At 7,000 km/yr cumulative mileage reaches only 21,000 km, so both visits are time-triggered annual services rather than mileage-triggered majors. Rate band from Volvo Taipei's published NT$8,000-15,000 per visit; scope validated against the official TW lookup (https://volvomsp.volvocartw.com/MaintenanceService/). Deduct ~NT$25,000 if a 3yr/30,000km package is secured."},{"y":5,"source":"Per-visit rate from Volvo Taipei's published NT$8,000-15,000 routine-service band (taken at the top for the XC90 flagship) and the official TW lookup (https://volvomsp.volvocartw.com/MaintenanceService/). Tyre pricing from Taiwan 21-inch premium tyre retail data (275/40R21 premium fitment runs ~NT$13,000-16,000 per corner). 12V battery replacement on the XC90 T8 requires BMS registration after fitting, a known Taiwanese specialist service. This is the first period with NO warranty and NO possible free-servicing package, which is why cost jumps sharply versus the previous window. Retained unchanged by this audit."},{"y":7,"source":"EXTRAPOLATED risk-weighted estimate, not a quoted table. Grounded in Taiwanese owner reports of Volvo out-of-warranty costs (an XC60 owner reported ~NT$20,000 for a 40,000 km service and a further ~NT$20,000 for brake pads, via Dcard car forum; Mobile01 thread 6989636 discusses XC90 80,000 km servicing and post-warranty independent-shop options). The air-suspension line is an expected-value allowance rather than a certainty, and is flagged as such - Four-C is standard equipment on the Ultra trim so the exposure is real. Retained unchanged by this audit."},{"y":10,"source":"EXTRAPOLATED risk-weighted estimate for an out-of-warranty European PHEV flagship, not a quoted table. Two structural facts drive it: (1) the 8-year/160,000 km high-voltage battery warranty expires at year 8, mid-window, so years 8-10 carry uninsured traction-battery exposure; (2) Four-C air suspension is standard on Ultra and its failure rate climbs sharply after year 8. Grounded in Taiwanese owner cost reports (Mobile01 thread 6989636 on XC90 post-warranty servicing; Dcard reports of NT$40,000+ single visits on out-of-warranty Volvos) and in the fact that PHEV traction-pack work in Taiwan requires specialist BMS calibration. The NT$30,000 HV line is the weakest number in the record - it is a probability weight on a repair no Taiwanese quote was found for. Total 10-year maintenance across all five windows is NT$593,000, heavily back-loaded. Retained unchanged by this audit apart from the total."}],"sources":[{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點 - XC90 second-facelift Taiwan launch and pricing","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/112982","note":"Fetched directly and RE-VERIFIED in this audit. Confirms 2025-09-05 Taiwan launch of the second-facelift XC90 with three trims: B5 Plus NT$2,956,000 / B5 Ultra NT$3,371,000 / T8 Ultra NT$3,776,000. Also confirms 455 hp combined, 83 km EV range, FSD dampers on Plus and Four-C air suspension on Ultra. Primary list-price source."},{"name":"Cross-outlet confirmation of the NT$3,776,000 list price","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=Volvo+XC90+T8+AWD+Plug-in+Hybrid+Ultra+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+377.6%E8%90%AC","note":"Search-index sweep run by this audit as an independent price check, since direct WebSearch budget was exhausted. Six outlets agree on NT$3,776,000 for the T8 AWD Plug-in Hybrid Ultra: 8891 新車 ('原廠售價 377.60萬'), U-CAR ('295.6萬、337.1萬以及377.6萬元'), TVBS Cars, King Autos, CARNEWS and 7Car. This is what settles the scout-vs-researcher price dispute in the researcher's favour."},{"name":"Volvo Selekt Taiwan - certified pre-owned XC90 listings","url":"https://www.volvoselekt.com.tw/list.php?cars_type_sub_id=9","note":"Fetched directly and RE-VERIFIED live in this audit; 20 listings, of which 5 are T8. Confirmed data points: MY2024 T8 Plus 10,225 km NT$2,280,000; MY2023 T8 Plus 11,000 km NT$2,320,000; MY2022 T8 Plus 30,000 km NT$1,900,000; MY2021 T8 Inscription 101,000 km NT$1,400,000. All exist exactly as the researcher described. The MY2024 car at 10,225 km is the single best low-mileage anchor in the whole dataset and is what this audit used to correct the year-1 checkpoint. These are factory-certified RETAIL asks - shaded ~6% before being treated as ordinary dealer retail, then cut again for retail-to-private and private-to-trade-in."},{"name":"FindCar - used Volvo XC90 T8 listings and new-car reference prices","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/xc90%20t8","note":"Fetched directly and RE-VERIFIED live. Confirms the 5-year anchor: MY2021 XC90 T8 7-seater, 36,000 km, NT$1,758,000, dealer 達興汽車 (Tainan). Note the page's 'average used price' is also NT$1,758,000 because this is the only used T8 with a published price on the page (n=1) - so the individual listing and the average are the same number by construction, not by conflation. CRITICALLY, this page also carries the new-car reference table that corrected three denominators in this audit: MY2024 Ultimate Recharge T8 NT$3,776,000, MY2024 Plus Recharge T8 NT$3,406,000, MY2023 Ultimate Recharge T8 NT$3,760,000, MY2023 Plus Recharge T8 NT$3,390,000, MY2021 T8 Recharge Inscription NT$3,690,000, MY2020 T8 Inscription NT$3,690,000."},{"name":"FindCar - used Volvo XC90 (all variants) listings","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/xc90","note":"120 listings, used average NT$1,012,000. Supplied the 10-year predecessor anchors: 2016 XC90 average NT$887,000, with individual 2015-2020 cars at NT$588,000-1,380,000, all at 90,000-181,000 km. Used to derive the mileage-blind 10-year retention ratio before applying the low-mileage premium."},{"name":"8891 汽車 - used Volvo XC90 listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/volvo/xc90","note":"Fetched directly and RE-VERIFIED live in this audit; 116 listings. Confirmed T8 data points: MY2022 Recharge T8 Inscription 54,000 km NT$1,888,000, and MY2020 T8 Inscription 42,000 km NT$1,588,000 - the latter is the anchor for the 7-year extrapolation. Also 2016 D5 cars at 200,500 km NT$690,000 and 214,900 km NT$559,000 for the 10-year floor. All figures here are 車商售價 (dealer retail asks), adjusted downward before use."},{"name":"8891 新車 - predecessor XC90 T8 Plus list price (denominator correction)","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=Volvo+XC90+T8+Plus+Recharge+2023+2024+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+339%E8%90%AC+340.6%E8%90%AC+Ultimate","note":"Search-index confirmation run by this audit. Gives MY2023 XC90 Plus Recharge T8 at '原廠售價 339.00萬' and MY2024 at '340.6 萬 新車參考價'. This is what proves the researcher's 3-year and 5-year retention ratios used the wrong denominator - they divided Plus-trim used cars by the Ultimate-trim list price of NT$3,760,000."},{"name":"Volvo Cars Taiwan - official scheduled maintenance cost lookup","url":"https://volvomsp.volvocartw.com/MaintenanceService/","note":"Official TW tool covering basic maintenance items, post-inspection replacement parts and detailing, selectable by model year and service mileage. It does not publish a flat price table (it states costs are confirmed only after inspection), so it validated the SCOPE of each service rather than the exact NT$ figure."},{"name":"Volvo TW free-maintenance promotion evidence (base-case correction)","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=Volvo+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A+%E4%B8%89%E5%B9%B4+%E4%B8%8D%E9%99%90%E9%87%8C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BF%9D%E5%9B%BA+%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A","note":"Search-index sweep run by this audit. The only free-servicing offers findable are time-limited campaigns - the live one is 'Volvo XC40 B3 ... 限時贈 3 年/3 萬免費保養套裝' expiring 9/30, an entry-model volume push. No standard free scheduled maintenance is documented for Volvo TW, and none is attached to the XC90 T8 Ultra. This is the evidence that forced repricing maintenance years 1 and 3 away from the researcher's near-zero base case."},{"name":"8891 新車 - Volvo TW warranty terms","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/volvo/xc60/21916","note":"Read via the search index. Confirms Volvo Taiwan's standard new-car cover is '新車基本三年不限里程保固' (3 years, unlimited mileage). A warranty covers repairs, not routine servicing - which is why the annual services in years 1-3 are now priced as out-of-pocket in the base case."},{"name":"dacota.tw - VOLVO Plus prepaid maintenance contract","url":"https://dacota.tw/blog/post/volvo-plus","note":"Describes Volvo TW's 5-year/5-service prepaid contract covering oil, consumables and labour, transferable to a new owner. Not assumed in the numbers, but documented in plan_notes as an option that would flatten the year-5 and year-7 costs."},{"name":"8891 新車 - original 2016 XC90 T8 Taiwan launch prices","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/volvo/xc90/4725","note":"Read via the search index. XC90 T8 Inscription 7-seat launched in Taiwan at NT$3,850,000 (companion article 4465 gives T8 Excellence 4-seat at NT$4,700,000, Taipei Auto Show, 2016-12-23). Used as the denominator for the 10-year predecessor retention ratio."},{"name":"TVBS Cars - XC90 pre-sale pricing and Volvo TW discount evidence","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/277027","note":"Read via the search index. Two uses: the facelift's pre-sale price of NT$3,866,000 for T8 Ultra (cut to NT$3,776,000 at launch), and a documented discount data point - 2024 XC90 Ultimate B5 AWD list NT$3,371,000 offered at NT$3,040,000, a NT$331,000 cut. Basis for treating Volvo TW as a genuinely discounting brand and for the ~NT$350,000 run-out discount assumed on the predecessor when converting its list price to a transaction price."},{"name":"Mobile01 - XC90 80,000 km maintenance thread","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=339&t=6989636","note":"Direct fetch returns HTTP 403; content available only as search-index snippets. Discusses XC90 80,000 km service scope and owners moving to independent shops after warranty expiry. Used qualitatively to shape the year-7 and year-10 item lists, NOT as a source of specific NT$ figures - which is part of why those two checkpoints are marked low confidence."},{"name":"Volvo Cars Taiwan configurator (scout's price source)","url":"https://www.volvocars.com/tw/build/","note":"COULD NOT VERIFY - returns HTTP 403 to automated fetches, for the researcher and for this audit. This is where the scout's NT$3,790,000 came from. Listed for traceability; overridden by the NT$3,776,000 confirmed across six dated outlets."}]},"volvo-v60-b4-plus":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year; every checkpoint uses 7,000 km x years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000), roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. Consequences: (a) all used-value figures are anchored on genuinely low-mileage Taiwanese listings and carry a low-mileage premium over the mileage-blind market average, and (b) Volvo's service schedule (1 year or 10,000 km, whichever comes first) is TIME-driven for this buyer, so the car sees one calendar-triggered annual service at only ~7,000 km and cost-per-km is high even though cost-per-year looks normal. B4 is a 48V mild hybrid (2.0T petrol + integrated starter-generator), NOT a plug-in, so there is no home-charger cost and no charging infrastructure to account for; Taiwan listings label it 油電, which is why powertrain is recorded as hybrid rather than gasoline. The plug-in V60 is the T8 (Plus T8 2,406,000 / Ultra T8 2,776,000). Vehicle licence tax (牌照稅), fuel tax (燃料費), insurance and fuel are excluded from this record by design. CORRECTED ASSUMPTION: the previous draft assumed a Volvo Taiwan 3年/3萬公里免費保養 package covered this car and set years 1 and 3 to near zero. Volvo Taiwan's own current promotions page lists free scheduled maintenance ONLY for pure-electric models (4年/8萬公里免費保養); the V60 line gets at most an extended-warranty bonus on the Recharge T8, and nothing on the Plus B4. Years 1 and 3 are therefore priced as fully PAID annual services. Out-of-warranty risk allowances start in the 3-5y window because the factory warranty is 3 years / unlimited km.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"high","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from 1,350,000. Direct anchor found this pass: Volvo Selekt Taiwan currently lists two 2025 V60 B4 Plus cars — 4,135 km and 10,945 km — both at NT$1,498,000 (volvoselekt.com.tw/list.php?cars_type_sub_id=5). That is our exact car at ~1 year and comparable mileage, at CERTIFIED dealer retail, the top rung of the price chain. The previous draft's assumed dealer retail of ~1,520,000 was above the real certified asking price, and its 1,350,000 'private' figure was only ~10% under certified retail, i.e. it was still a dealer-level number. Selekt premium measured from the same page against ordinary dealer retail: 2024 B4 Ultimate at Selekt 1,580,000 (11,578 km) / 1,598,000 (23,804 km) versus 1,458,000 for a 19,000 km 2024 B4 Ultimate on 8891 = ~8-9% certification premium. So ordinary dealer retail for a 1-year 7,000 km Plus B4 ~ 1,380,000 (small low-mileage premium applied, 7,000 km vs the 10,945 km comparable). ADJUSTMENT MADE: private_sale_price 1,230,000 is ~11% below that ordinary dealer retail; dealer_tradein_price 1,060,000 is a further ~14% below the private figure. No dealer or Selekt asking price was copied through."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Re-derived independently and landed on the same figures as the previous draft, so left unchanged. Anchors read first-hand: 8891 中古車 shows 2023 V60 B3 Plus at 1,089,000-1,190,000 with 20,000-32,400 km (auto.8891.com.tw/volvo/v60), and Volvo Selekt lists a 2023 V60 B3P with 28,189 km at 1,250,000. B4 carries roughly a 5% premium over B3, and 21,000 km is at the low end of that mileage band, giving an ordinary dealer RETAIL level of ~1,220,000 for a 3-year 21,000 km Plus B4 (the Selekt 1,250,000 B3 car implies ~1,145,000 ordinary retail for a B3, consistent). A typical 3-year-old TW car shows 36,000-45,000 km, so the low-mileage premium here is real. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private_sale_price 1,070,000 is ~12% below dealer retail; dealer_tradein_price 930,000 is a further ~13% below the private figure."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Anchors read first-hand on 8891 中古車: 2021 V60 B4 Momentum at 998,000 with 30,000 km (a genuine 5-year-old at genuinely low mileage — the closest single comparable), 2022 V60 B4 Plus 油電 at 959,000 with 40,000 km, and 2022 B4 Momentum at 928,000-1,029,000 with 40,000-51,000 km. Volvo Selekt cross-check: 2022 V60 B4 Plus, 24,000 km, 1,080,000 certified, implying ~995,000 ordinary retail. Converging on ordinary dealer RETAIL ~990,000 for a 5-year 35,000 km Plus B4. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private_sale_price 870,000 is ~12% below dealer retail; dealer_tradein_price 750,000 is a further ~14% below the private figure. Trade-in is where Volvo's mid-pack Taiwan residuals bite — dealers discount European wagons on intake because they are slow-turning stock."},{"y":7,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from 750,000. The previous draft's 7-year anchor was a claimed 2019 V60 T4 Momentum asking 858,000; 8891's live V60 中古車行情 read this pass shows 2019 T4 Momentum actually asking 628,000-679,000 with 86,600-130,000 km, plus a 2019 T6 Inscription at 798,000 with 70,000 km (auto.8891.com.tw/volvo/v60). The old figure therefore priced a PRIVATE sale above what dealers are asking at retail for the same age. Real 7-year-old cars of this generation do exist (2nd-gen V60 launched in Taiwan 2019), but they are T4/T6 petrol, not B4 mild hybrid (B4 arrived ~2021). Our car earns a genuine premium for 49,000 km versus the 87,000-130,000 km comparables and for the better-equipped Plus trim, so ordinary dealer RETAIL is taken at ~800,000 — above every listed 2019 T4 but at the T6 Inscription level. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private_sale_price 700,000 is ~12% below that dealer retail; dealer_tradein_price 600,000 is a further ~14% below the private figure, the spread widening with age because dealers price reconditioning risk into out-of-warranty European stock."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXPLICITLY EXTRAPOLATED — no genuine 10-year data exists for this generation, which launched in Taiwan in 2019, and CORRECTED DOWN from 570,000. Method: take the PREDECESSOR generation (1st-gen V60, 2011-2018) at 10+ years today. The previous draft used only FindCar's 2015 V60 asks (588,000-602,000) and derived a 32.5% retention ratio; 8891's larger sample read this pass is materially harsher — 2013-2017 V60 T5 R-Design asking 240,000-309,000 with 80,000-170,000 km — and FindCar's own tail agrees (2013 V60 at 298,000 with 170,000 km, 2012 at 458,000 with 180,000 km). Blending both sources for a ~10-year 1st-gen V60 at a typical ~120,000 km gives ~380,000 dealer retail against a ~1,850,000 original list = ~20.5% retention, not 32.5%. Applying 20.5% to this car's real_cost of 1,825,000 gives ~374,000, then ~+30% for 70,000 km versus the predecessor sample's ~120,000+ km gives ordinary dealer RETAIL ~490,000. Curve cross-check: 800,000 dealer retail at 7 years falling to ~490,000 at 10 years is ~-15%/yr, consistent with the observed cliff on decade-old European wagons here. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private_sale_price 450,000 is ~8% below dealer retail (the private/dealer gap narrows at this age because dealer margin on a cheap old car is thin); dealer_tradein_price 380,000 is a further ~16% below — at 10 years many dealers will only take the car as a wholesale/auction unit. Confidence low: the ratio is transplanted from an older, mechanically different car (no 48V system), and the mild-hybrid electrical hardware is an unpriced residual risk at this age."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"CORRECTED UP from 2,000. Volvo Taiwan's promotions page shows free scheduled maintenance only on pure-electric models, not on the B4 mild hybrid, so the first annual service is out of pocket. Cost taken as a Volvo TW dealer 小保養 (oil + filter + inspection) at the low end of the owner-receipt range, since only ~7,000 km have accumulated and the service is calendar-triggered. Confidence downgraded from 'high' to 'medium': no official Volvo TW price table could be retrieved, so this rests on owner-reported dealer pricing."},{"y":3,"source":"CORRECTED UP from 6,000 for the same reason as year 1 — no free-maintenance package covering the V60 Plus B4 could be evidenced on Volvo Taiwan's promotions page or anywhere else. Two paid annual services plus a 2-year brake fluid change and consumables. Still inside the 3-year factory warranty, so no repair-risk allowance is carried in this window. Costs scaled down from the ~NT$20,000-30,000 owner receipts for 35,000-40,000 km services, because at 21,000 km these are the lighter calendar-driven visits. Confidence downgraded from 'high' to 'medium': owner-reported pricing only, no official table."},{"y":5,"source":"Mobile01 / Dcard Taiwanese owner receipts (V60 B4 40,000 km service quoted ~NT$30,000; a 35,000 km service described as expensive; an XC60 40,000 km visit at ~NT$20,000 before brakes) plus Taiwan premium tyre retail pricing. This is the window where costs jump, because the 3-year factory warranty expires at year 3 and the age-driven consumables (tyres, 12V battery) all land here. The tyre line is driven purely by rubber age — a 12,000 km/year driver would have worn these out anyway, so this buyer gets no tyre saving from low mileage. Unchanged from the previous draft; independently re-checked and found sound."},{"y":7,"source":"Owner receipts (Dcard: XC60 at 40,000 km, ~NT$20,000 routine service pushed past NT$40,000 once brake discs were replaced — the brake line here is the same failure mode; Mobile01: V60 B4 40,000 km service quoted ~NT$30,000). Warranty expired four years earlier, so the risk allowance is real exposure, not padding. Volvo dealer brake parts in Taiwan are notably expensive versus Japanese brands. Unchanged from the previous draft; independently re-checked and found sound."},{"y":10,"source":"Extrapolated from the same Mobile01/Dcard owner-receipt cost base, escalated for age. The risk allowance is the dominant uncertainty and the largest single line — a decade-old Volvo in Taiwan can run well under this if nothing major fails, or far over it if the 48V hardware or the A/C compressor goes. No Taiwanese owner has yet run a 2nd-gen V60 B4 to 10 years (the generation launched here in 2019 and the B4 engine only arrived ~2021), so no real 7-10y receipt set exists for this exact powertrain."}],"sources":[{"name":"Volvo Taipei dealer blog — V60 Taiwan price list","url":"https://blog.volvo.taipei/article_532.html","note":"Fetched and read directly. States 'Plus B4：建議售價為新台幣1,950,000元', with Plus T8 AWD PHEV at 2,406,000 and Ultra T8 AWD PHEV at 2,776,000. Confirms list_price and confirms the Plus B4 is the entry, non-plug-in trim."},{"name":"TVBS Cars — Volvo Taiwan January 2026 promotion round-up","url":"https://news.tvbs.com.tw/cars/3094407","note":"Fetched and read directly this pass (the previous draft cited it without first-hand verification). States 'V60 Plus B4原價195萬，優惠價來到179萬'. Independent confirmation of the 1,950,000 list price and the published 160,000 promo gap. The 30.6-30.8萬 discounts on the same page are for XC90 Plus B5 and XC60 Ultra B5, not the V60."},{"name":"8891 新車 — V60 B4 Plus deal sheet (菜單)","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/menu/volvo/v60/share/17582","note":"Real signed deal sheet: 'Volvo V60最新成交價格175萬，2024-12-26下訂'. Evidence that actual transacted prices run below the published 179萬 promo; 8891's V60 菜單 feature also cites transactions down to 168萬. Basis for raising discounts from 160,000 to 180,000."},{"name":"Volvo Selekt Taiwan — certified pre-owned listings","url":"https://www.volvoselekt.com.tw/list.php?cars_type_sub_id=5","note":"Fetched and read directly. THE decisive anchor for the 1-year checkpoint: 2025 V60 B4 Plus 4,135 km @ 1,498,000 and 2025 V60 B4 Plus 10,945 km @ 1,498,000 — our exact car, one year old, certified dealer retail. Also 2024 B4 Ultimate 11,578 km @ 1,580,000 and 23,804 km @ 1,598,000, 2024 B3 Plus 24,597 km @ 1,198,000, 2023 B3P 28,189 km @ 1,250,000, 2022 B4 Plus 24,000 km @ 1,080,000. All certified retail; stepped down ~8-9% to ordinary dealer retail, then again to private sale and trade-in."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Volvo V60 used listings and 行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/volvo/v60","note":"Fetched and read directly. Ordinary dealer retail asking prices by year: 2024 B4 Ultimate 1,458,000 @ 19,000 km; 2023 B3 Plus 1,089,000-1,190,000 @ 20,000-32,400 km; 2022 B4 Plus 油電 959,000 @ 40,000 km and B4 Momentum 928,000-1,029,000 @ 40,000-51,000 km; 2021 B4 Momentum 998,000 @ 30,000 km; 2019 T4 Momentum 628,000-679,000 @ 86,600-130,000 km and T6 Inscription 798,000 @ 70,000 km; 2013-2017 T5 R-Design 240,000-309,000. The 2019 band is what forced the 7-year checkpoint down; the 2013-2017 band is what forced the 10-year checkpoint down. All are 車商售價 and were stepped down before use."},{"name":"FindCar 好車網 — Volvo V60 used listings","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&b=73&m=601","note":"Fetched and read directly. 73 live V60 listings, site average 760,000. Predecessor-generation tail used for the 10-year extrapolation: 2015 V60 @ 588,000; 2013 V60 170,000 km @ 298,000; 2012 V60 180,000 km @ 458,000; 2016 V60 Cross Country 157,000 km @ 318,000. Noisy dataset (it also lists a 2019 car at 1,900,000, clearly a mis-tagged variant), so it was blended with the 8891 band rather than used alone — the previous draft's 32.5% retention ratio came from taking FindCar's 2015 asks in isolation."},{"name":"Volvo Sales Taiwan — 優惠專區 (current promotions)","url":"https://www.volvosales.com.tw/%E5%84%AA%E6%83%A0%E5%B0%88%E5%8D%80","note":"Fetched and read directly. Free scheduled maintenance is offered only on pure-electric models ('不限款式純電車型 - 4年/8萬公里延長保固 - 4年/8萬公里免費保養'). The only V60 entries are 2-year extended-warranty bonuses on V60 Recharge Plus T8 and Recharge Ultimate T8. Nothing covers the V60 Plus B4. This is the evidence that overturned the previous draft's free-maintenance assumption and repriced the year-1 and year-3 maintenance windows."},{"name":"Volvo Taiwan warranty terms explainer","url":"https://www.drivinginstruct.com/volvo%E4%BF%9D%E5%9B%BA%E5%B9%BE%E5%B9%B4%EF%BC%9F/","note":"Fetched and read directly. '非純電車輛享有 3 年不限里程的保固' — 3 years / unlimited mileage on non-BEV passenger cars, with consumables (oil, filters, brake pads, wipers, tyres) excluded. Confirms the previous draft's warranty premise and fixes year 4 as the start of out-of-warranty risk. The same page describes no complimentary scheduled-maintenance programme."},{"name":"Mobile01 — V60 B4 40,000 km service cost thread","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=339&t=7012076","note":"Reached via search-result snippet, not a direct page fetch. Thread title '第一次 volvo V60 B4 4萬公里保養希望大家能提供心得'; dealer quoted '大約3萬元' (~NT$30,000). Closest owner receipt to this exact car and the main cost basis for the paid maintenance windows."},{"name":"Dcard — Volvo 保養維護是不是偏貴 (XC60 owner receipt)","url":"https://www.dcard.tw/f/car/p/259693147","note":"Reached via search-result snippet, not a direct page fetch. 'XC60剛跑4萬，去保養說保養要2萬，然後煞車盤吃溝也得換所以一共要4萬多' — ~NT$20,000 for a 40,000 km service rising past NT$40,000 once brake discs were replaced. Basis for the routine-service and brake lines in the 5-7y window."},{"name":"Dcard — Volvo 保養 (35,000 km service)","url":"https://www.dcard.tw/f/car/p/254031130","note":"Reached via search-result snippet, not a direct page fetch. Owner reports the 35,000 km service as expensive (~NT$35,000 scale). Supports the year-5 major-service line."},{"name":"KingAutos — Volvo V60 Taiwan lineup","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/volvo/v60","note":"Fetched and read directly. Used only to confirm the V60 is still on sale in Taiwan and that the current 年式 is 2026; its price table mixes older trim generations (B4 Momentum, B5 R-Design, Recharge Inscription) and was NOT used for any price in this record."}]},"volvo-v60-t8-plus":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr; all checkpoints use the 7,000 km/yr midpoint (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km), roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/yr. This matters twice. First, Volvo TW's service interval is 1 year OR 10,000 km whichever comes first, so at 7,000 km/yr servicing is entirely TIME-driven: one visit per year, and mileage-triggered items (spark plugs, 8AT fluid, nominally around 60,000 km) do not arrive until roughly year 8 in calendar time. Second, at 10 years the car shows only 70,000 km, exceptional for a TW used car, so the used values here sit ABOVE mileage-blind averages -- and the comparables I anchored on are mostly HIGHER-mileage cars, so the adjustment is upward and is stated per checkpoint. THIS IS A PHEV, NOT A BEV: it keeps a 1,969 cc combustion engine, an 8-speed Geartronic automatic, spark plugs, engine oil and coolant, so its maintenance curve is legitimately combustion-shaped PLUS high-voltage battery exposure. A BEV-style near-zero maintenance curve would be wrong here. Spec confirmed from Volvo TW's own MY26 price/spec sheet: 455 hp combined, 88 km EV range, 18.8 kWh pack, 2,018 kg kerb weight (285 kg heavier than the B4), 235/40 R19 tyres -- the weight and the 19-inch rubber are why tyre and suspension costs run pessimistic. HOME CHARGER EXCLUDED: with 88 km of EV range at 7,000 km/yr this car runs almost entirely on electricity if charged at home. A home AC charging point in Taiwan costs roughly NT$30,000-80,000 installed and depends on 管委會 approval and the meter run; older 公寓 without a dedicated space may not be able to install at all. That is a genuine ownership cost but it is NOT maintenance, so it is excluded from the maintenance checkpoints by design. Taxes (牌照稅/燃料稅, reduced for PHEVs in TW) and insurance are excluded by design throughout.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED -- no genuine 1-year-old V60 T8 listing exists in TW (the MY26 T8 Ultra has only just begun delivering). Interpolated between the real transaction price of a new car (2,610,000 for the car itself after the 180,000 discount) and the year-3 estimate below. The steep first-year drop is characteristic of TW premium PHEVs: a buyer of a 1-year-old car is competing against a new one that is itself discounted 6-8%, and must be compensated for the lost new-car warranty. 1,900,000 is 68.1% of list / 71.6% of real_cost. This is a PRIVATE figure, not a dealer asking price -- a 車商 would list the same car around 2,150,000-2,250,000. dealer_tradein set 14.2% below private, the normal 收購 spread on a nearly-new premium car where reconditioning risk is low but capital cost is high. Low-mileage premium applies (7,000 km is very low for a 1-yr car). REBASED: the prior record's 1,850,000 was a percentage of a real_cost NT$374,000 too low."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"INTERPOLATED between the year-1 estimate and the year-5/6 real anchor, with a sanity check against 4-year gasoline V60 dealer stock I fetched myself from 8891 today: 2022 V60 B4 Momentum, 40,400 km, dealer asking 1,029,000, and 2022 V60 B4 Plus, 40,000 km, dealer asking 959,000. Against the 2023 B4 Plus list of 1,940,000 (FindCar) that is ~53% DEALER RETAIL at 4 years, so ~46-47% private after the standard 12% channel cut. The T8 sits on a much higher base (2,790,000) and expensive halo trims retain a LOWER percentage than cheap ones, so I used 52% of list at year 3 = 1,450,000 (54.6% of real_cost) rather than carrying the B4's percentage across. Low-mileage premium is embedded: 21,000 km at 3 years is roughly half what the B4 comparables show per year. dealer_tradein set 14.1% below private. I deliberately did NOT use the Volvo Selekt 認證 CPO listings the prior record leaned on -- I could not fetch that page to verify them, and CPO retail is the most expensive rung of the ladder, two channel steps above a private sale."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"ANCHORED ON A REAL, T8-SPECIFIC LISTING that I fetched myself: FindCar shows a 2020 Volvo V60 T8 Recharge Inscription, 50,465 km, at 鴻齊汽車 (Kaohsiung) asking NT$1,188,000. That car is 6 years old and is a DEALER asking price. Its original list was 2,690,000 (FindCar's own new-price table: 2021 V60 T8 Recharge Inscription 269萬), giving 44.2% dealer retail at 6 years. ADJUSTMENT MADE: cut 12% to reach a private sale figure (1,045,000 = 38.9% private retention), scaled to this car's higher list (x 2,790/2,690 = 1,084,000 at year 6 / 50,465 km), then stepped BACK one year to year 5 (~+8%) and added a low-mileage premium for 35,000 km against the comparable's 50,465 km, then trimmed slightly because an asking price is not a transaction price. Result 1,200,000 = 43.0% of list / 45.2% of real_cost. Cross-check on the gasoline side, also fetched by me: 2021 V60 B5 R-Design, 84,600 km, dealer 899,000 against a 2,272,000 list = 39.6% dealer retail at 5 years, but at 2.4x this buyer's mileage. NOTE ON THE DISCARDED ANCHOR: the prior record's key year-5 source was a Facebook Marketplace private listing at 1,268,000 for a 2021 T8 with 39,000 km. I could not verify it (FB requires authentication) and it is implausible on its face -- it is HIGHER than the real 鴻齊 dealer asking of 1,188,000 for a car only one year older, which would invert the dealer-retail > private ordering. Dropped. dealer_tradein set 15.0% below private."},{"y":7,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CURRENT-GENERATION DATA, and materially higher than the prior record's 680,000. The gen-2 V60 launched in TW in 2019, so a 2019 car is exactly 7 years old. Two independent routes agree. (a) From the real T8 anchor: the 2020 T8 Recharge Inscription at 50,465 km implies ~1,084,000 private at year 6 on this car's list basis; stepping down one year (~9%) and applying no mileage premium (our 49,000 km is level with that car's 50,465 km) gives ~985,000, which I trimmed to 930,000 for the approaching high-voltage battery warranty limit. (b) From 7-year gasoline V60 dealer stock I fetched from 8891 today: 2019 T6 Inscription, 70,000 km, dealer 798,000; 2019 T4 Momentum, 86,600 km, 679,000; 2019 T4 Momentum, 130,000 km, 628,000. The T6 Inscription converts to roughly 700,000 private, and our car carries a 30% mileage advantage over it (49,000 vs 70,000 km), which reliably commands a premium at this age. 930,000 = 33.3% of list / 35.0% of real_cost. I REMOVED the prior record's year-5-to-year-7 cliff (1,120,000 -> 680,000, a 39% two-year fall): it rested on treating the 2019 T6 as a plug-in hybrid with a 2,750,000 list, but the gen-2 V60 T6 sold in TW in 2019 was the twin-charged GASOLINE AWD, not a PHEV (the T8 Recharge did not reach TW until MY21/22), so the denominator was inflated and the retention ratio artificially depressed. The real 2020 T8 at 1,188,000 dealer sits between the two checkpoints and directly refutes a 680,000 private at year 7. dealer_tradein set 16.1% below private -- the spread widens with age as reconditioning risk rises."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED -- stated explicitly, because no genuine 10-year data exists for the current V60 (gen 2 launched in TW in 2019, so the oldest is 7 years) and none at all for a 10-year-old V60 T8 anywhere in the TW market. Method: carried the gen-2 curve forward from the year-7 figure using the depreciation slope European premium wagons show between years 7 and 10 in TW (a further 40-45% loss), then applied two opposing adjustments -- UP for the exceptional 70,000 km (a 10-year TW car normally shows 120,000-150,000 km), DOWN for PHEV-specific risk, since the 8-year/160,000 km high-voltage battery warranty has expired on time by year 10 and TW buyers discount an out-of-warranty hybrid pack heavily. Net 540,000 = 19.4% of list / 20.3% of real_cost, which lines up with the 19.7% of real_cost carried at year 10 in the sibling Volvo XC60 record. I did NOT reuse the prior record's gen-1 route (2016 V60 D4 at ~300,000 dealer asking over an unsourced ~1,750,000 original list): its denominator was admittedly an estimate and its comparator was a diesel wagon, so the ratio it produced was two guesses multiplied together. Being explicitly extrapolated is fine; resting on an unverifiable denominator is not. dealer_tradein set 21.3% below private -- the widest spread of any checkpoint, because at 10 years most 車商 do not want an out-of-warranty European PHEV and will only take it at a wholesale/auction number."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Covers 0-1 yr only. One time-driven annual service, benchmarked to the reported TW Volvo invoice of NT$11,543 for a scheduled service (oil 4,998, filters, labour). Modelled as PAID -- I verified on Volvo TW's 優惠專區 that the 4-year free-maintenance programme covers 純電車型 (pure EV) only and that PHEVs like the V60 Recharge T8 receive only a two-year extended warranty. If a dealer bundles the first services into the deal this falls to near zero."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers 1-3 yr only (two annual visits, not cumulative). Year 2 approx 12,000 including the time-based brake fluid change; year 3 approx 14,000 with air and cabin filters added. Consistent with the reported 20,000 km TW invoice of NT$11,543 plus filter items. Still time-driven, not mileage-driven, at 21,000 km total."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers 3-5 yr only. Build-up: 2 annual services approx 26,000; tyres approx 38,000 (four 235/40 R19 premium-fit tyres, size confirmed from Volvo TW's MY26 spec sheet, replaced at 5 years on rubber age -- at 35,000 km the tread is nowhere near gone, which is exactly what low annual mileage does to you); front pads and discs approx 15,000 (later than a combustion car thanks to regenerative braking, but the car weighs 2,018 kg); 12V AGM battery approx 10,000 (a known T8 weak point -- it supports the start-stop and hybrid systems and typically dies at 4-5 years); fluids approx 6,000. Factory warranty lapses at year 3 (year 5 if the two-year PHEV extension was secured), but every item in this window is a consumable that no warranty covers either way. Tyre and 12V costs are well-established TW market rates; the timing within the window is the uncertain part."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers 5-7 yr only. Build-up: 2 annual services approx 28,000 (creeping up as more items get inspected); spark plugs approx 9,000; 8AT transmission fluid approx 15,000 (the MY26 spec sheet confirms the T8 uses the Geartronic 8-speed torque-converter automatic, not the B4's 7-speed DCT); rear pads and discs approx 14,000; brake fluid and coolant approx 7,000; out-of-warranty risk allowance approx 30,000 for suspension bushings and dampers at 6-7 years plus the T8's known electric coolant pump and A/C compressor exposure. Anchored to the reported TW figures of a 40,000 km service at NT$20,000 rising past NT$60,000 with brake work, and a 60,000 km service quoted near NT$50,000. Note the mileage-triggered items (plugs, gearbox fluid) arrive here on TIME, not km -- at 49,000 km they are early by the book but due by the calendar."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers 7-10 yr only -- a 3-year window, hence the larger figure. Build-up: 3 annual services approx 45,000; second tyre set approx 40,000 (the first set went in at year 5, so age forces another around year 10); second 12V AGM approx 11,000; brakes and fluids approx 20,000; out-of-warranty risk allowance approx 84,000. That last line is the honest uncertainty: the high-voltage battery warranty (8 years / 160,000 km) lapses on the TIME limit during this window even though the car is barely 44% of the way to the km limit. Volvo permits MODULE-level replacement rather than whole-pack replacement, which caps the downside -- a module job runs roughly NT$60,000-120,000 against a full pack -- so the allowance is risk-weighted (a fraction of a module job's cost times its probability) rather than assuming certain failure. It also absorbs water pump, A/C compressor and engine mount exposure at this age. RAISED from the prior record's 185,000: that sat BELOW the 210,000 carried by the sibling gasoline XC60 record over the same window, which is backwards -- a PHEV carries everything the gasoline car carries PLUS an expiring high-voltage pack. A car that never needs battery work comes in well under 200,000; one that needs a module exceeds it."}],"sources":[{"name":"Volvo Cars Taiwan — MY26 V60 官方價格/規格表 (PDF)","url":"https://www.volvocartw.com/pdf/carsp/V60.pdf","note":"PRIMARY, fetched and text-extracted by me, not a snippet. Raw stream: 'MY26 ... V60, B4 | V60, T8 AWD Plug in Hybrid | Plus NT$1,990,000 | Ultra NT$2,090,000 | Ultra NT$2,790,000'. Equipment table columns read 'V60 Plus, B4' / 'V60 Ultra, B4' / 'V60 Ultra, T8 AWD Plug in Hybrid' — proving the T8 is Ultra-only in MY26 and no Plus T8 exists. Version stamp '2025 12'. Also the source for 455 hp combined, 88 km EV range, 18.8 kWh, 2,018 kg, 235/40 R19, Geartronic 8AT, eAWD."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — Volvo V60 新車價格表 (by model year)","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=0&b=73&m=601","note":"Fetched by me. Historical TW list prices that expose the stale figure: 2024 V60 Plus Recharge T8 240.6萬 and Ultimate Recharge T8 277.6萬; 2023 Plus Recharge T8 239萬 and Ultimate Recharge T8 276萬; 2021 B5 R-Design 227.2萬 and T8 Recharge Inscription 269萬. Confirms 2,406,000 was the 2024 Plus T8, now discontinued, and supplies the 2,690,000 and 2,272,000 denominators used for retention ratios."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — volvo v60 t8 中古行情","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/volvo%20v60%20t8","note":"Fetched by me. THE key T8-specific used anchor: 2020 V60 T8 Recharge Inscription, 50,465 km, 鴻齊汽車 (Kaohsiung), asking NT$1,188,000 — a DEALER price, cut 12% to reach private. Note the '中古車均價 118.8萬' shown on this page is this single car, not a mixed-age average; the prior record mis-described it as an aggregate cross-check."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Volvo 車系總覽 (V60 dealer listings)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/volvo","note":"Fetched by me. All seven V60 listings are 車商 (dealer) asking prices, none private: 2022 B4 Plus 40,000 km 95.9萬; 2022 B4 Momentum 40,400 km 102.9萬; 2021 B4 Momentum 90,000 km 74.9萬; 2021 B5 R-Design 84,600 km 89.9萬; 2019 T6 Inscription 70,000 km 79.8萬; 2019 T4 Momentum 86,600 km 67.9萬; 2019 T4 Momentum 130,000 km 62.8萬. Every one was cut 12% before being used as a private figure. Note how mileage-heavy the open market is versus this buyer."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — 2021 V60 (Volvo 新凱原廠認證)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-3465340.html","note":"Fetched by me. Dealer RETAIL asking NT$1,790,000, Volvo 新凱認證車. Mileage and exact trim were not exposed on the page, so this is used only as a certified-retail CEILING and was NOT converted into any private_sale_price. 認證 CPO retail is two channel steps above a private sale."},{"name":"Volvo Sales 台灣 — 優惠專區 (免費保養/延長保固 eligibility)","url":"https://www.volvosales.com.tw/%E5%84%AA%E6%83%A0%E5%B0%88%E5%8D%80","note":"Fetched by me. Confirms the 4年/8萬公里免費保養 + 4年/8萬公里延長保固 package is restricted to 純電車型 (pure EV). Plug-in hybrids — V60 Recharge T8, XC60 Recharge T8, XC90 — receive only a bonus 二年延長保固. This is why years 1-3 are modelled as PAID maintenance."},{"name":"Volvo Taipei 官方部落格 — V60 價格 (2025-02-11, SUPERSEDED)","url":"https://blog.volvo.taipei/article_532.html","note":"Fetched by me and retained as evidence of the error, NOT as a live price. Dated 2025-02-11, it quotes 'Plus B4 1,950,000 / Plus T8 AWD Plug-in Hybrid 2,406,000 / Ultra T8 AWD Plug-in Hybrid 2,776,000'. That is the MY25 range. The MY26 sheet deletes the Plus T8 entirely and moves the surviving T8 Ultra to 2,790,000."},{"name":"Mobile01 汽車討論區 — Volvo 保養費用 (UNVERIFIED, inherited)","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/","note":"HONEST CAVEAT: the owner-invoice figures underpinning the maintenance costs (20,000 km service NT$11,543 itemised as oil 4,998 / brake fluid 756 / air filter 800 / drain plug 126; a 60,000 km service quoted near NT$50,000) are inherited from the prior researcher, who captured them from search snippets without thread URLs. I did NOT independently verify them. Forum root given rather than a fabricated deep link. Treat the figures as plausible and the citation as imprecise."},{"name":"Dcard 汽車板 — Volvo 保養費用 (UNVERIFIED, inherited)","url":"https://www.dcard.tw/f/car","note":"HONEST CAVEAT: same situation as Mobile01 — a 40,000 km service around NT$20,000 rising past NT$60,000 with brake pads. Inherited, not verified by me, forum root only, deliberately not fabricated into a deep link."}]},"tesla-model-3-long-range-rwd":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr, far below the TW average of ~12,000-15,000 km/yr. All checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 x years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). Consequences: (1) every Tesla maintenance item except tire rotation is TIME-driven at this mileage - the manual's 40,000 km suspension-torque trigger takes 5.7 years to arrive and the car finishes 10 years at only 70,000 km, so the mileage grid never binds; (2) the car never reaches the battery warranty's km cap (192,000 km for Long Range), so only the 8-year clock ever binds; (3) used-value quotes are taken from LOW-MILEAGE 8891 listings, not from the mileage-blind average - at 5 years this car has 35,000 km where a typical TW Model 3 of that age shows 60,000-120,000 km. EXCLUDED from this record by design: license tax and insurance (per spec), and home AC charger installation - a TW wall connector plus electrical work runs roughly NT$40,000-80,000 depending on panel distance and whether the building's management committee approves; it is a real ownership cost but a one-off capital item, not maintenance, so it appears in neither purchase.onroad_fees nor maintenance. Public Supercharger-only ownership is viable but raises running cost; energy cost is out of scope here.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"8891 中古車 live listings (https://auto.8891.com.tw/tesla/model-3), re-harvested and re-parsed independently on 2026-08-12: 141 cars on site, 129 unique rows extracted across nine sort orders, 126 with a numeric price. REVISED DOWN from the prior draft (was 1,364,000). No 1-year-old example of THIS trim exists - it launched 2026-01, so the oldest is ~7 months - and the entire year-1 anchor is one predecessor-trim car: a 2025 後輪驅動 with 13,000 km asking 1,538,000 against its 1,699,900 list. A 2024 RWD with only 8,052 km asks 1,528,000, i.e. near-new RWD dealer asks cluster flat at 1,528,000-1,538,000 regardless of 2024 vs 2025 - evidence that the ask is set by the segment, not by age. I set the 1-year dealer ask at 1,489,000 (85.1% of list) rather than the prior 1,550,000, because a 1-year-old car competes head-on with a new one at 1,749,900 AND with the confirmed zero-tariff repricing path that electrify.tw computes at ~1,532,900 for this same trim. ADJUSTMENT MADE: 8891 numbers are 車商售價 (dealer retail asks); private_sale = dealer ask x 0.88 (12% below dealer retail) and dealer_tradein = private x 0.86 (a further 14% down), so trade-in is ~0.76 x dealer ask, consistent with the TW norm of 車商收購 at 75-80% of 車商售價. Lands at 73.5% of real_cost, just under a TW Tesla dealer's own published residual table (piopro.com.tw: 75% at 1 year of list). Confidence LOWERED to low: a single predecessor-trim listing is not a cluster."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN materially from the prior draft (was 1,206,000 - the single largest correction in this record). Real low-mileage clusters re-verified on 8891 on 2026-08-12: 2024 後輪驅動 at 2 years asking 1,528,000-1,530,000 with 8,052-37,600 km against a 1,699,900 list (~90%); 2022 後輪驅動 at 4 years asking 1,288,000 with 32,000 km, 1,208,000 with 33,000 km against a 1,754,900 list (~69-73%). The prior draft interpolated these as PERCENTAGES OF LIST and landed at 78% (dealer ask 1,370,000), which produced a private figure retaining 67.7% of real_cost - higher than the Toyota RAV4 Hybrid record in this same table (61.9%) and level with a gasoline Camry (67.0%). A Tesla out-retaining a Toyota hybrid in Taiwan is not credible, and the percentage-of-list method is itself biased upward here: the 8891 data shows used Model 3 asks CONVERGING TO AN ABSOLUTE BAND at a given age irrespective of original price - at 4 years the 2022 RWD (1,754,900 list) and the 2022 Long Range AWD (2,234,000 list) both ask ~1,288,000, i.e. 73% and 58% of their respective lists. Applying a percentage to a HIGHER list therefore overstates a more expensive car. I set the 3-year dealer ask at 1,240,000 (70.9% of list), just under today's observed 4-year absolute band, because the documented repricing risk lands inside this window: 能源署 filings show a Model 3 Standard projected at 1,350,000-1,530,000, and zero tariff could cut this trim's own list to ~1,532,900. A 3-year-old car cannot retail near a brand-new cheaper Tesla. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private_sale = dealer ask x 0.88, dealer_tradein = private x 0.86. Lands at 61.2% of real_cost (62.3% of list), matching the piopro.com.tw dealer residual table (61% at 3 years). Low-mileage throughout: at 21,000 km this car is well under the 60,000-90,000 km typical of a 3-year-old TW Model 3."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN from the prior draft (was 924,000). 8891 2021 Model 3 listings at exactly 5 years old, low-mileage subset, re-verified 2026-08-12: Standard Range Plus asking 958,000 @ 50,000 km, 900,000 @ 50,000 km, 908,000 @ 96,000 km against a 1,654,900 list (~54-58%); Long Range asking 1,258,000 @ 34,000 km and 1,208,000 @ 43,000 km against a 1,972,900 list (61-64%). Our car is the ENTRY trim on the RWD/entry track, so the SR+ track is the right comparator, and the prior draft's 60% of list sat above what that track actually shows. I used a dealer ask of 960,000 (54.9% of list). ADJUSTMENT MADE: private_sale = dealer ask x 0.88, dealer_tradein = private x 0.86. Lands at 47.4% of real_cost (48.3% of list), essentially on the piopro.com.tw dealer table (49% at 5 years), below the RAV4 Hybrid record (54.8%) as a BEV should be, and in line with the sibling Tesla Model Y (46.8%) and Toyota bZ4X (47.3%) records. Note the 2021 sample is genuinely noisy (same year and trim spans 758,000 to 1,258,000) because 2021 Q3 is the TW TPC-to-CCS2 charge-connector split, worth 50,000-100,000 at appraisal, and because FSD (+100,000-150,000) / EAP (+50,000-80,000) ride with some cars. Our car will not carry the connector penalty, but an equivalent obsolescence step (HW4 compute, future connector or FSD-tier gating) is the most likely cause of it landing below this figure."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the PREDECESSOR GENERATION and revised down from the prior draft (was 748,000). The current Highland Model 3 launched in TW only in January 2024, so no 7-year-old example of this generation exists. Used the pre-facelift 2019 Model 3, genuinely 7 years old in TW (deliveries began September 2019). 8891 listings re-verified 2026-08-12: Long Range 820,000 @ 40,000 km (against a 1,869,900 list = 44%), 858,000 @ 116,000 km, 888,000 @ 135,000 km, 788,000 @ 163,000-164,000 km; Standard Range Plus 918,000 @ 47,000 km (against a 1,559,900 list = 59%), 880,000 @ 75,000 km, 750,000 @ 129,000 km; Performance 968,000 @ 141,000 km. The striking and reproducible pattern is that 7-year-old Model 3 asks converge into an absolute 750,000-968,000 band almost regardless of original trim price or mileage - a battery-age floor effect, not proportional decay. I used a dealer ask of 780,000, inside that band and toward its lower half because the entry trim sits there. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private_sale = dealer ask x 0.88, dealer_tradein = private x 0.86. Lands at 38.5% of real_cost, in line with the sibling Model Y record (38.6%) and above the bZ4X (34.9%), which Model 3 liquidity justifies. Value here is still supported by the battery and drive-unit warranty (8 years; at 49,000 km the 192,000 km cap is nowhere near binding), which transfers to the buyer - that support disappears one year later."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED and revised down from the prior draft (was 510,000). No 10-year-old Model 3 exists anywhere (first global deliveries 2017, TW September 2019), so per instruction this leans on the oldest BEVs actually trading in Taiwan rather than a combustion analogue. Best available: Tesla Model S on 8891 - a 2018 75D with 66,000 km asking 998,000 against its 3,336,000 list = 29.9% at 8 years, and a 2017 75D with 236,000 km asking 958,000 against its 3,309,000 list = 29.0% at 9 years. The prior draft applied a dealer ask of 33% of list at TEN years, which is ABOVE the 29-30% those comps show at EIGHT and NINE years - a 10-year-old car cannot out-retain a 9-year-old one, so that was corrected. I used a dealer ask of 480,000 (27.4% of list), continuing the observed decay one step past the Model S comps while staying above a pure floor because a mainstream Model 3 is far more liquid than a large Model S and 70,000 km at 10 years is exceptionally low. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private_sale = dealer ask x 0.88, dealer_tradein = private x 0.86. Lands at 23.7% of real_cost, between the Toyota bZ4X (20.9%) and sibling Model Y (25.5%) records. The decisive factor is that from year 8 the battery and drive-unit warranty has EXPIRED (the 192,000 km cap never binds at this mileage), so the buyer carries full pack risk - a Model 3 pack replacement in TW runs into the hundreds of thousands, which is why old TW BEVs trade on an absolute floor rather than a retention percentage. Explicitly extrapolated, not observed."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Tesla TW official self-pay price list, Model 3 (2023+) column effective 2024-11-06, reproduced at wuangus.cc/tesla-model-3-service and re-verified line-by-line in the fetched HTML on 2026-08-12. No scheduled service falls due in year 1: the manual's first time-based items are brake fluid at 2 years and cabin air filter at 3 years, and the mileage grid is 5.7 years away at 7,000 km/yr. Car is fully inside the 4-year/80,000 km basic warranty."},{"y":3,"source":"Priced item-by-item from the Tesla TW self-pay list (Model 3 2023+ column, 2024-11-06) at wuangus.cc/tesla-model-3-service, and validated against a real TW owner's invoice for exactly this periodic visit — tires/pressure check, chassis torque, A/C system test, cabin filter, brake fluid — which came to 6,673 (vocus.cc/article/65006227fd89780001f31c1f, string '6673' confirmed present in the fetched page on 2026-08-12). Time-driven: the 2-year brake-fluid and 3-year cabin-filter clocks trigger in this window, not mileage."},{"y":5,"source":"REVISED DOWN from the prior draft (was 41,000). The prior draft billed a 冷氣乾燥包 3,711 plus refrigerant ~1,300 and a 冷氣濾網 1,397 in this window on the basis of a '4-year desiccant / 2-year cabin filter' schedule; the cited source actually says A/C 乾燥劑袋 6 年 and 車廂空氣濾清器 每 3 年, so neither falls due here — the desiccant moves to the 5-7 window and the filter to years 3, 6 and 9. Remaining items priced from the Tesla TW self-pay list (wuangus.cc/tesla-model-3-service). Tire set priced from TW retail and specialist quotes: four 235/45R18 EV tires retail 18,600 (Nexen) to 21,100 (Michelin Primacy 5, install included), and Tesla specialist shops quote 15,000-30,000 per set including labour and alignment (spacet-lab.com/services/tesla-tire). Tires are the single biggest line and a genuinely BEV-specific cost. Basic warranty (4 yr / 80,000 km) lapses inside this window, hence the first unscheduled-repair allowance."},{"y":7,"source":"REVISED UP from the prior draft (was 33,000, which sat BELOW the 5-year period and broke the expected rise with age). Two corrections: the 6-year A/C desiccant now correctly lands here rather than at year 4, and the out-of-warranty allowance was raised from 12,000 to 18,000 — the prior figure was implausibly thin for a two-year window lying entirely outside the 4-year/80,000 km basic warranty. 16V lithium low-voltage battery price 9,417 and all scheduled items from the Tesla TW self-pay list, Model 3 (2023+) column (wuangus.cc/tesla-model-3-service), re-verified in the fetched HTML on 2026-08-12. The allowance is a judgement call, not a quote: all non-pack faults are self-paid here, while the 8-year battery and drive-unit warranty is still live (its 192,000 km cap is irrelevant at 49,000 km) — that live pack cover is why this period is still smaller than the next. Brake pads and discs are deliberately NOT here: with regenerative braking at 49,000 km they are barely worn, and the corrosion-driven job is budgeted in the 7-10 window instead."},{"y":10,"source":"REVISED DOWN from the prior draft (was 100,000). Two schedule corrections: the prior draft billed a second 冷氣乾燥包 here on a 4-year interval (the real interval is 6 years, so only one falls in 10 years) and a 6,000 battery-coolant change justified by an unreachable 160,000 km trigger — but the same source states 電池冷卻液 在大多數情況下，在車輛使用壽命期間都無需更換, so that line was removed outright. Scheduled items priced from the Tesla TW self-pay list, Model 3 (2023+) column (wuangus.cc/tesla-model-3-service); tire set from the TW retail/specialist range cited at the 5-year checkpoint. The dominant line — the 35,000 out-of-warranty allowance — is an explicit estimate, not a quote: from year 8 the battery and drive-unit warranty has expired and nothing on the car is covered. It is probability-weighted for the realistic failures of an 8-10 year old TW Tesla (A/C compressor, suspension, door handles, MCU/screen, 16V system, HV contactor), and deliberately does NOT price a full pack replacement, which would be a several-hundred-thousand event. Treat this period as the least certain number in the record."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - Tesla Model 3 車款介紹","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/tesla/model%203/7036/overall","note":"PRIMARY list-price source, re-fetched 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200). Spec table: 'Model 3 Long Rage RWD 174.99' / 'Model 3 Performance 233.79'; header '2 車型 174.99 - 233.79 萬'; body text confirms the 2026 change making Long Range RWD the entry trim (WLTP 711 km, NCA pack, 250 kW charging)."},{"name":"electrify.tw - Model 3 長程後驅版在台開賣","url":"https://electrify.tw/model3-long-range-rwd-taiwan/","note":"Independent list-price confirmation, re-fetched 2026-08-12: headline '特斯拉 Model 3 長程後驅版在台開賣！售價 174.99 萬、續航 711 公里'."},{"name":"electrify.tw - Model 3 Standard 登台準備？零關稅有望低至 135 萬","url":"https://electrify.tw/model-3-standard-taiwan/","note":"MATERIAL RESIDUAL RISK, now priced into the value curve rather than left as prose. Dated 2026-05-16, re-fetched 2026-08-12. 經濟部能源署 115 年 4 月 filings list a Tesla-TW-submitted variant 'Model 3 HBMRB' (256 hp, 1,848 kg, 661 km WLTC, issued 2026-04-16), very likely the Model 3 Standard, projected at 1,530,000 and possibly 1,350,000. Crucially it also states that under the confirmed zero tariff THIS trim's own price could fall from 1,749,900 to about 1,532,900 — a documented ~12% list-cut path on the exact car being modelled."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Tesla Model 3 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/tesla/model-3","note":"PRIMARY used-value source. Independently re-harvested 2026-08-12: 141 cars on site, 129 unique rows parsed from the server-rendered HTML across nine sort orders, 126 with numeric prices. These are 車商售價 (dealer retail asks), discounted to private-sale and trade-in. Key low-mileage comparables, all re-verified in the raw HTML: 2025 RWD 1,538,000 @13,000 km; 2024 RWD 1,528,000 @8,052 km, 1,530,000 @20,000 km, 1,528,000 @37,600 km; 2022 RWD 1,288,000 @32,000 km and 1,208,000 @33,000 km; 2021 LR 1,258,000 @34,000 km; 2021 SR+ 958,000 @50,000 km; 2019 LR 820,000 @40,000 km; 2019 SR+ 918,000 @47,000 km. Also the source of the absolute-band convergence finding at 4 and 7 years."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Model 3 個人自售篩選","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/tesla/model-3?personal=1","note":"Private-seller (個人自售) filter, re-verified 2026-08-12: exactly 3 of 141 Model 3 listings are private — 900,000 (2021 LR, 120,000 km), 1,198,000 (2022 LR, 112,000 km) and 1,180,000 (2022 RWD, 71,000 km). Their asks sit inside the dealer-ask band, which is the evidence that a private ASK cannot be used as a private TRANSACTION price without discounting."},{"name":"Angus 電科技 - Tesla 全車系保養項目與原廠自費價目表","url":"https://wuangus.cc/tesla-model-3-service/","note":"PRIMARY maintenance source, re-fetched and each figure string-matched in the HTML on 2026-08-12. Reproduces Tesla TW's official self-pay list effective 2024-11-06 (Model 3 2023+ column: 冷氣系統測試 290, 底盤扭力確認 2,029, 冷氣濾網 1,397, 冷氣乾燥包 3,711, 煞車油 2,764, 雨刷一對 1,796, 16V 電瓶 9,417). ALSO the source of three interval corrections applied to this record: 車廂空氣濾清器 每 3 年 (not 2), A/C 乾燥劑袋 6 年 (not 4), and 電池冷卻液 在大多數情況下，在車輛使用壽命期間都無需更換. Confirms 煞車油 每 2 年, 輪胎換位 每 10,000 公里, 雨刷片 每年, and the battery warranty split: base Model 3 8 年/160,000 公里 vs Model 3 Long Range and Performance 8 年/192,000 公里, ≥70% capacity — which resolves the prior draft's open question in favour of 192,000 km for this trim."},{"name":"vocus - 特斯拉車輛保養項目費用分享","url":"https://vocus.cc/article/65006227fd89780001f31c1f","note":"Real TW owner receipt used to validate the modelled periodic service: tires/pressure check + chassis torque + A/C system test + cabin filter + brake fluid = 6,673. The figure was confirmed present in the fetched page on 2026-08-12."},{"name":"SPACE T LAB - Tesla 電動車專用輪胎服務","url":"https://spacet-lab.com/services/tesla-tire/","note":"TW Tesla-specialist tire service (four-tire pricing includes labour, balancing and four-wheel alignment), used to sanity-check the 23,000-24,000 per-set figure against TW retail sets at 18,600-21,100 for 235/45R18."},{"name":"電洽 PioPro 鑫總汽車 - 特斯拉二手行情大揭密","url":"https://piopro.com.tw/article/show/79451880271716329501","note":"TW used-car dealer's published Tesla appraisal guide (2026-04-21), used as a cross-check rather than a price source. Its Model 3 residual table (1 yr 75%, 3 yr 61%, 5 yr 49% of list) is what the prior draft claimed to be 'bracketed' by but in fact sat 3-8 points ABOVE at every point; the corrected curve now matches it. Its appraisal adjustments explain the spread inside a single model year: FSD +100,000-150,000, EAP +50,000-80,000, CCS2 vs pre-2021-Q3 TPC connector 50,000-100,000, battery SOH above 90% +50,000-100,000 / below 80% -100,000-200,000. Its own quoted buy-in cases read as marketing and sit above the dealer RETAIL asks visible on 8891, so they were not used."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - Tesla 車系總覽（歷年售價）","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/make/tesla","note":"Source of the TW list-price history behind every retention ratio: 2019 SR+ 1,559,900 / LR 1,869,900 / P 2,149,900; 2020 1,609,900/1,929,900/2,209,900; 2021 1,654,900/1,972,900/2,224,900; 2022 1,754,900/2,234,000/2,468,900; 2024-2025 1,699,900/1,999,900/2,337,900 — the evidence that Tesla TW cut the Long Range list price by 234,100 between 2022 and 2024, and the denominators for the 2019/2021/2022 comparables."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - 2026 Tesla Model 3 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/tesla-model-3-2026","note":"Independent confirmation that exactly two 2026 trims are on sale in TW — Long Range後輪驅動 1,749,900 and Performance 2,337,900 — i.e. no Model 3 Standard is on sale as of 2026-08-12."},{"name":"自由時報 汽車頻道 - Model 3 後驅版台灣開賣","url":"https://auto.ltn.com.tw/news/30567","note":"2026-01-09 launch report: Tesla opened TW orders for Model 3 Long Range RWD, WLTP 711 km, 售價 174.99 萬元. Third independent price confirmation."},{"name":"INSIDE - Tesla Model 3 LR 正式登台","url":"https://www.inside.com.tw/article/40467-tesla-model-3-lr-taiwan","note":"2026-01-10, states 根據 Tesla 官網 建議售價 NT$1,749,900, WLTP 711 km. Fourth independent price confirmation (cites the official site, which returns 403 to automated fetching)."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Tesla Model S 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/tesla/model-s","note":"Basis for the 10-year extrapolation, since no 10-year-old Model 3 exists. Oldest TW BEVs actually trading: 2018 Model S 75D 998,000 @66,000 km (8 years, 29.9% of a 3,336,000 list) and 2017 75D 958,000 @236,000 km (9 years, 29.0% of a 3,309,000 list)."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - 2018 Tesla Model S 售價","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/tesla-model-s-2018","note":"Original list price for the 10-year extrapolation base: 2018 Model S 75D = 3,336,000 (2017 75D = 3,309,000 on the 2017 page), giving ~30% retention at 8-9 years for an out-of-warranty TW BEV."},{"name":"U-CAR - Tesla 臺灣新車與電池保固期限","url":"https://aigc.u-car.com.tw/answer/tesla-28888318","note":"TW warranty terms: 4 years / 80,000 km 新車保固, battery and drive unit 8 years. Sets the year-4 and year-8 cliffs that shape the maintenance schedule and the 7- and 10-year values."},{"name":"台新社 Taiwan News Wire - Tesla 台灣回應電池故障","url":"https://newswire.com.tw/news/20260729-tesla-taiwan-battery-fault-compensation","note":"2026-07-29. Tesla Taiwan's response to battery fault codes on certain vehicles: inspection and battery replacement under warranty, expanded loaner fleet, and a statement that 原廠換購價格不因車型年份或電池更換而減損. Treated as a directional signal only, not a price input: the outlet is AI-edited and the claim is the manufacturer's own. URL confirmed live (HTTP 200) on 2026-08-12."},{"name":"GoOptions - 2026 新車領牌費用明細","url":"https://gooptions.cc/%E9%A0%98%E7%89%8C%E8%B2%BB%E5%A4%A7%E6%A6%82%E5%A4%9A%E5%B0%91%EF%BC%9F/","note":"TW registration fee breakdown used for onroad_fees: 政府固定規費 1,250 (號牌費 600 + 行照費 200 + 檢驗費 450), 代辦手續費 800-1,500, 自選車牌 2,000 optional, 動產擔保設定費 3,500 for financed cars. License tax and fuel fee are itemised there but excluded from this record by design."},{"name":"8891 - 個人賣車技巧／刊登收費","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/18339","note":"Private-seller listing fee, re-verified 2026-08-12 by direct fetch: '個人刊登1筆需要400台幣，可持續曝光60天'. Basis for the 刊登費 line in selling_costs."}]},"tesla-model-y-rwd":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr, roughly half the TW average of 12,000-15,000. Every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years. At this mileage the Model Y is entirely TIME-driven, not km-driven: Tesla has no fixed scheduled-service interval, and the items that do exist (cabin/HEPA filter every 2-3 yr, brake fluid every 2 yr, A/C desiccant bag every 6 yr) are all calendar-based. Tires are replaced on rubber age (~5-6 yr), not tread depth - 35,000 km at year 5 would not wear out a set, so the first set is budgeted at year 6 and the second at year 10. The battery and drive-unit warranty (8 years / 160,000 km for the RWD; the Long Range carries 192,000 km, visible in TW used listings advertising 電池保固19.2萬公里) is bounded by the TIME limit at this mileage, never the km limit, so it expires at year 8 and year 10 is fully out of warranty. HOME CHARGER IS EXCLUDED from every number here: a TW home installation (Tesla Wall Connector plus a dedicated 220V circuit, meter work, and building-management approval) runs about NT$30,000-80,000 depending on the parking space, and it is a one-off ownership cost, not maintenance. Also excluded by design: all tax (貨物稅, 牌照稅, 燃料費) and all insurance. Electricity/charging cost is not modelled here either. Spec basis re-verified against the U-CAR spec table on 2026-08-12: 60 kWh total / 57.5 kWh usable pack, 1,928 kg kerb weight, 279 hp, 0-100 km/h 5.9 s, WLTP 517 km, 255/45 R19 tires front AND rear - the tire size drives the replacement cost below.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"No 1-year-old facelift RWD exists yet (TW facelift on sale 2025-03), so this is interpolated between new (NT$1,899,900) and the youngest real listings. Independently re-pulled 好車網 (https://www.hotcar.com.tw/UsedCarSell/CarFilter) on 2026-08-12 via its listing API: 115 live Tesla listings, of which 47 Model Y. The MY2024 Model Y RWD low-km cluster asks NT$1,498,000-1,638,000 at 9,750-27,655 km (median ~NT$1,558,000) against that car's NT$1,734,900 list - i.e. ~90% dealer ASKING at ~2.3 years. That asking level is not disciplined: the same dataset contains a MY2024 RWD at 42,628 km asking NT$1,830,000, which is 105% of its own original list, and the spread at comparable mileage runs 22%. I therefore use the observed data for curve SHAPE and set the LEVEL from the mature, liquid 5-7 year Tesla market (see the year-5 and year-7 checkpoints), landing at ~83% dealer asking for a 1-year-old low-km facelift RWD = ~NT$1,584,000, which already includes a low-mileage uplift for 7,000 km vs a typical ~13,000 km. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale set 11% BELOW that dealer asking price (mid of the 8-15% band) = NT$1,410,000; dealer trade-in a further 13% below the private figure = NT$1,225,000."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Real same-model, same-trim listings exist but are read down deliberately. 好車網 2026-08-12: MY2023 Model Y RWD asking NT$1,538,000 (37,283 km), NT$1,498,000 (39,847 km), NT$1,558,000 (42,556 km); MY2024 Model Y RWD asking NT$1,498,000-1,638,000 across 9,750-59,322 km. SUM汽車網 (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch?brand=TESLA&keyword=Model%20Y), independently re-parsed the same day, confirms the band: 2024 Model Y at NT$1,498,000 (38,022 km), NT$1,528,000 (38,000 km), NT$1,588,000 (47,138 km), NT$1,538,000 (11,617 km) - SUM does not print the trim on those cards, so trim attribution is inferred, not stated. Taken at face value those cars sit at 85-90% of their own original list. THREE REASONS THAT NUMBER IS NOT CARRIED FORWARD. (1) It is dealer ASKING on demonstrably undisciplined stock (one MY2024 RWD asks 105% of its own original list). (2) The anchors are only ~2.2-2.5 years old, not 3.0 - MY2023 RWD deliveries started after the 2023-11-01 TW launch - so reading them as 3-year data overstates by roughly half a year of depreciation. (3) Those cars enjoy a tailwind this buyer will not get: the 2025-03 facelift RAISED the RWD list from NT$1,734,900 to NT$1,899,900, lifting the entire used stock, and Tesla's TW history is of CUTS (2024-04 took the RWD down 6.5萬). I therefore set the level by interpolating the year-1 and year-5 points on the slope observed in the mature 5-7 year Tesla market: ~70% dealer asking = ~NT$1,326,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private = asking - 11% = NT$1,180,000; trade-in = private - 13% = NT$1,025,000. This is roughly NT$130,000 below the researcher's figure and is the single largest correction in this record."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor BEV - no 5-year-old facelift Model Y exists (TW launch 2025-03), and the Model Y line itself only reached Taiwan 2022-09. Base is the oldest Tesla trading in volume here, the MY2021 Model 3 (age ~5.1 yr), from the 47 live Model 3 listings pulled from 好車網 on 2026-08-12. Against U-CAR's verified original TW list prices (SR+ NT$1,609,900 after the 2020-03 raise; LR NT$1,957,900 after the 2021-06 raise): SR+ asks NT$938,000 at 84,746 km (58.3%), NT$958,000 at 89,086 km (59.5%), NT$908,000 at 96,187 km (56.4%); LR asks NT$1,138,000 at 64,773 km (58.1%), NT$998,000 at 105,131 km (51.0%), NT$838,000 at 122,038 km (42.8%). The directly relevant low-mileage analogue - a MY2021 Model 3 LR at 35,000 km, exactly this checkpoint's mileage - asks NT$1,258,000 = 64.3%. I set the Model Y RWD at ~57.4% dealer asking = ~NT$1,090,000: between the high-mileage median (~57%) and the low-mileage example (~64%), then haircut ~4 points because this car's NT$1,899,900 base is an elevated post-facelift list and because the Model Y Standard (see sources) threatens the RWD specifically. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private = asking - 11% = NT$970,000; trade-in = private - 13% = NT$844,000. Low confidence because the base is a different model."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - stated explicitly, not invented. There is no 7-year-old Model Y anywhere in Taiwan (TW launch 2022-09). The oldest BEV with a real TW market at this age is the MY2019 Model 3, launched TW 2019-08-12 at SR+ NT$1,559,900 / LR NT$1,869,900 / Performance NT$2,149,900 (verified from https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/tesla/model%203/7036/event on 2026-08-12). 好車網 MY2019 Model 3 listings (age ~7.1 yr): LR NT$938,000 at 79,299 km (50.2% of its own list), LR NT$858,000 at 116,212 km (45.9%), LR NT$888,000 at 135,044 km (47.5%), Performance NT$968,000 at 141,188 km (45.0%) - median ~47%, and note EVERY one is high mileage (79k-141k km, i.e. 11,000-20,000 km/yr). A low-mileage uplift for 49,000 km vs a typical ~110,000 km argues for roughly +8 points relative, which I then give back for this car's elevated post-facelift list base, landing at ~47% dealer asking = ~NT$893,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private = asking - 11% = NT$795,000; trade-in = private - 13% = NT$691,000. Symmetry check: today's 7-year-old Model 3s are still inside their own 8-year battery warranty, exactly as this car will be at year 7, so the warranty tailwind is comparable on both sides and the drop from year 5 is orderly rather than a cliff."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED WITH NO DIRECT DATA - there is no 10-year-old Tesla market in Taiwan at all. The oldest TW Teslas trading are MY2019 Model 3s at 7 years (好車網, 47 Model 3 listings pulled 2026-08-12, none older than MY2019), so the 7-to-10 segment is projected, not observed. Extending the Model 3-derived dealer-asking curve (~57% at 5 yr, ~47% at 7 yr as a share of that car's own original list) another three years, with the warranty cliff applied, gives ~31% dealer asking = ~NT$585,000, already inclusive of a low-mileage allowance for 70,000 km vs a typical ~130,000 km. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private = asking - 11% = NT$520,000; trade-in = private - 13% = NT$452,000. Two BEV-specific forces pull in OPPOSITE directions here and roughly offset: (a) the 8-year battery and drive-unit warranty has expired, and TW buyers discount an out-of-warranty EV hard because an out-of-pocket pack replacement is NT$400,000-700,000; (b) this trim uses the ~60 kWh BYD LFP pack, whose cycle life is far better than NMC, and at only 70,000 km it will have seen very few cycles, so a car that can show a good state-of-health readout will clear the top of this band. Confidence is low and should be read as such."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Tesla TW sells no scheduled-maintenance plan and specifies no first-year service; the only calendar item inside 12 months is consumables. Modelled TW figure, not a quoted invoice - tesla.com/zh_tw and Mobile01 both block datacenter IPs, so no receipt-level TW service pricing could be obtained."},{"y":3,"source":"Cost SINCE year 1 (1-3 yr window). Built from Tesla's published calendar intervals (cabin filter 2-3 yr, brake fluid 2 yr, rotation every 10,000 km) priced at TW service-centre rates. Modelled, not a quoted invoice."},{"y":5,"source":"Cost SINCE year 3 (3-5 yr window). CORRECTED vs the researcher, who put the first tire set at year 5 and produced a non-monotone plan (NT$68,000 at year 5 falling to NT$51,000 at year 7). At 7,000 km/yr a 5-year-old set has ~35,000 km on it and TW owners typically replace between year 5 and year 6; placing it at year 6 is both more realistic and restores a rising cost curve. Modelled, not a quoted invoice."},{"y":7,"source":"Cost SINCE year 5 (5-7 yr window). Tire pricing from current TW retail for 255/45 R19 EV-rated tires (NT$6,500-10,000 each plus fitting); size confirmed from the U-CAR spec table (https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/tesla/model%20y/7089/spec), which lists 255/45 R19 front AND rear for the RWD. Out-of-warranty risk is a probability-weighted allowance rather than an observed cost - no 7-year-old Model Y exists in Taiwan - informed by the fault pattern of MY2019-2020 Model 3s now at this age in the TW market. Modelled, not a quoted invoice."},{"y":10,"source":"Cost SINCE year 7 (7-10 yr window). Pure extrapolation - Taiwan has no 10-year-old Tesla market of any kind; the oldest TW Teslas trading are MY2019 Model 3s at 7 years. The out-of-warranty allowance is a probability-weighted estimate, not an observed figure. Modelled, not a quoted invoice."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - Tesla Model Y 車款介紹 (official TW list prices, all variants)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/tesla/model%20y/7089/overall","note":"PRIMARY PRICE SOURCE, independently re-fetched and parsed 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200). Header reads '3 車型 189.99 - 249.99 萬'. Confirms NT$1,899,900 for the RWD - no correction needed. Also records that the 2025-03 facelift replaced the pre-facelift RWD (173.49萬) and LR AWD (210.79萬) at 189.99萬 and 229.99萬, i.e. a 16.5% and 9.1% price INCREASE."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - Tesla Model Y 事件簿 (complete TW price-change timeline)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/tesla/model%20y/7089/event","note":"Re-fetched and parsed 2026-08-12. The evidence base for discounts = 0 and for BEV repricing risk. Verified entries: 2022-09-23 TW launch (LR 229.99萬 / Performance 259.99萬); 2023-11-01 RWD added at 179.99萬 with a ~60 kWh BYD LFP 磷酸鐵鋰刀片電池 and WLTP 438 km; 2024-04-26 CUT (RWD -6.5萬 to 173.49萬, LR/Performance -2萬 to 210.79萬/236.79萬); 2025-01 facelift preorder (LR AWD Launch Edition 244.99萬); 2025-10-01 update - this entry raises the MODEL 3 RWD to WLTP 534 km, and on the Model Y side raises only the Long Range AWD to 641 km; 2026-01-16 Performance at 249.99萬 with 全車系同步升級16吋螢幕."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - Tesla Model Y 規格表 (spec table: battery, weight, tire size, range)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/tesla/model%20y/7089/spec","note":"Re-fetched and parsed 2026-08-12. RWD後輪驅動 189.99萬; 車重 1,928 kg; 輪胎尺寸 255/45 R19 front and rear; 電池總容量 60 kWh, 可用電池容量 57.5 kWh, 電池種類 鋰離子電池; 最大綜效馬力 279 hp; 極速 201 km/h; 加速 5.9 秒 0-100 km/h; 純電行程 517 公里 (LR AWD 641, Performance 598). This is the source that contradicts the researcher's 534 km claim."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - Tesla Model 3 事件簿 (TW original list prices, 2019 onward)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/tesla/model%203/7036/event","note":"Re-fetched and parsed 2026-08-12. Supplies the original-list denominators for the 5/7/10-year extrapolation, all verified in the page text: TW launch 2019-08-12 at SR+ 155.99萬 / LR 186.99萬 / Performance 214.99萬; 2020-03-06 entry raised to 160.99萬; 2021-06-12 LR raised 192.99萬 -> 195.79萬. Needed to turn old Model 3 asking prices into retention ratios."},{"name":"好車網 (hotcar.com.tw) - live used listings, Tesla Model Y and Model 3","url":"https://www.hotcar.com.tw/UsedCarSell/CarFilter","note":"PRIMARY USED-VALUE SOURCE, independently re-pulled 2026-08-12 through the site's own listing API with brand=67 (TESLA特斯拉): 115 live Tesla listings, exactly 47 Model Y and 47 Model 3, each with model year, exact odometer and asking price. These are 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking), NOT what a seller receives - every private_sale_price here is set 11% below the modelled asking level and every trade-in a further 13% below that. Key rows: MY2024 Model Y RWD NT$1,498,000-1,638,000 at 9,750-59,322 km (plus one NT$1,830,000 outlier at 42,628 km, i.e. 105% of its own original list, which is why asking level is not trusted at face value); MY2023 Model Y RWD NT$1,498,000-1,558,000 at 37,283-42,556 km; MY2021 Model 3 NT$838,000-1,358,000 including a 35,000 km LR at NT$1,258,000; MY2019 Model 3 NT$858,000-968,000 at 79,299-141,188 km."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - used Tesla listings (independent cross-check)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch?brand=TESLA&keyword=Model%20Y","note":"Second, independent platform, re-fetched and parsed 2026-08-12. Verified rows: 2024 Model Y NT$1,498,000 (38,022 km), NT$1,528,000 (38,000 km), NT$1,538,000 (11,617 km), NT$1,588,000 (47,138 km); 2023 Model Y NT$1,398,000-1,598,000; 2022 Model Y NT$1,458,000-1,568,000; 2020 Model 3 NT$738,000-938,000. Caveat recorded because the researcher glossed it: SUM's cards do not print the trim, so any RWD/LR attribution on those rows is inferred. Many SUM cards show 金鑽 instead of a price, so the visible sample is self-selected."},{"name":"瘋先生 (mrmad.com.tw) - Tesla Model Y Standard: specs and TW price outlook","url":"https://mrmad.com.tw/tesla-model-y-standard-range-specs","note":"Re-fetched and read 2026-08-12 (article dated 2025-10-26). Documents the single largest threat to this trim's residual value. Tesla launched the Model Y Standard in North America at US$39,990 against the RWD's US$44,490, renaming the RWD to 'Premium' in the NA lineup; the article estimates a TW price of NT$1,680,000-1,750,000 if it lands here, with 15 specification deletions including no Autosteer, no HEPA filter, no panoramic roof, 69.5 kWh and 516 km EPA. As of 2026-08-12 U-CAR still lists only three TW variants, so Standard has NOT arrived - but if it does it undercuts the RWD by NT$150,000-220,000 and drags the whole used RWD stock down. This is trim-specific risk: it lands near the RWD's price point, not the Long Range's."}]},"tesla-model-s-awd":{"assumptions":"年行駛 6,000-8,000 km，遠低於台灣平均 12,000-15,000 km；各檢查點一律用中位數 7,000 km/年（7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km）。保養觸發方式（已對照官方週期表逐項確認，非一概而論）：「每 20,000 km／每 1 年」「每 40,000 km／每 2 年（大保養）」「每 8 年／160,000 km（電池冷卻液）」三組都寫明先到者為準，在 7,000 km/年下一律由時間先到；但「每 10,000 km」那一組（輪胎換位、車內空氣濾網、雨刷水）官方沒有給時間替代條件，所以它是純里程觸發，約每 1.43 年到期一次。換言之並非「所有項目都由時間觸發」。家用充電樁「不」計入 maintenance，也未計入 real_cost：Tesla 壁掛式連接器約 NT$13,500，台灣公寓大樓拉專線＋獨立電表＋管委會施工，實務落在 NT$40,000-80,000，屬另計的持有成本。稅金與保險依設計排除（電動車現行免徵貨物稅、免牌照稅與燃料費，但本表一律不列）。電費亦不在本表範圍。","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"外推，無真實樣本。2025/06 小改款車 2025 下半年才交車，ONLYEV 2026-08-12 全台 21 台 Model S 在售車源中沒有任何一台 1 年內的小改款車。可用的最近錨點是同世代車商開價：三台 2024/03 Model S LR（8,000-8,300 km、2.4 年）開 259.8/259.8/259.9 萬，以及 2024/10 Model S Plaid（14,000 km、1.8 年）開 268 萬＝其 339.99 萬列表價的 78.8%。由此推估 1 年期小改款 LR 車商開價約 275 萬。private_sale_price 2,430,000 為車商開價減 11.6%（車商開價→自售的正常價差），dealer_tradein_price 2,100,000 再減 13.6%。原研究者的 2,480,000 略微下修，理由是折舊必須前重後輕，原表 1→3 年僅跌 7.7% 而 3→5 年跌 21%，形狀不合理。須明講的風險：本段之所以看起來平緩，是因為 2025/06 列表價一次漲 30 萬把整批中古開價一起墊高，這是本表最大的單一下檔風險。"},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"本世代真實車商開價，但已扣除同儕比較後的樂觀成分。ONLYEV 2026-08-12 擷取的同齡本世代 Model S LR 車商開價：2023/05 開 258 萬（37,000 km、3.25 年）、2023/08 開 252 萬（40,000 km、3.0 年）、2023/11 開 239.8 萬（30,000 km、2.75 年），中位約 250 萬。注意這批開價彼此矛盾：里程最低（30,000 km）的 2023/11 反而開價最低，2023/12 Plaid 開 288 萬卻高於更新的 2024/10 Plaid 268 萬——21 台的市場沒有價格發現，開價是掛牌願望值而非成交值。同平台較厚的 Model Y LR 市場（78 台）同齡開價僅為其列表價的 65-69%，而 Model S 這批達 77.5-80%，差距明顯來自流動性不足與 2025/06 漲價墊高。故車商開價取 248 萬（低於 252-258 萬群集、高於 239.8 萬），本檢查點 21,000 km 低於同齡真實車（30,000-40,000 km）的加分已含在內。private_sale_price 2,180,000 為車商開價減 12.1%，dealer_tradein_price 1,880,000 再減 13.8%。"},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"內插，本世代在台灣尚無滿 5 年的車（2023/03 才重新開賣，最老的本世代車 3.4 年）。上錨點是本檢查表 3 年期；下錨點是前代 Raven（2019-2021 Long Range，2019/03/22 起列表價 266.3 萬，已於 U-CAR 45803 原文確認）的真實低里程車商開價：ONLYEV 2020/09 出廠 33,000 km 開 169.8 萬（5.9 年）、2020/06 出廠 33,000 km 開 163.8 萬（6.2 年）；同齡高里程明顯較低（92,000 km 為 158-160 萬、140,000 km 為 148.8 萬），本檢查點 35,000 km 屬低里程帶，取低里程曲線。兩種換算刻意並陳：用 Raven 對「自身列表價」的保值率（5.9 年 63.8%）外推到本車 324.99 萬得約 224 萬，用 Raven 開價對「今日列表價」的比值（169.8/324.99＝52.2%）得約 185 萬；前者會重複計入 2025 漲價效果，後者偏保守，取中央值 199 萬為車商開價。方法間 ±20% 的落差就是本點的不確定度。private_sale_price 1,750,000 為車商開價減 12.1%，dealer_tradein_price 1,500,000 再減 14.3%。"},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"前代外推，非本世代實價，confidence low。7 年期唯一的真實低里程樣本是更前一代 Model S 75D：ONLYEV 2019/02 出廠、39,000 km 車商開價 138 萬（7.5 年）；同代 2019/03、110,000 km 為 136.8 萬。此處刻意改用「對今日列表價的比值」而非原研究者推導的舊車原價：138/324.99＝42.5%。原研究者用的分母 NT$3,492,900 無法佐證——U-CAR 45555 原文只列降價「後」的 80D 2,834,000／100D 2,982,000／P100D 3,444,000 與 658,900-2,971,900 的降幅區間，全文未出現 75D 也未出現 3,492,900，且 U-CAR 45803 顯示 3/1 之後 Model S 入門其實是標準里程 245 萬，該推導不成立，已移除。本檢查點為 7.0 年、49,000 km（略新、里程略高於 138 萬那台），取車商開價 143 萬＝今日列表價的 44.0%。private_sale_price 1,250,000 為減 12.6%，dealer_tradein_price 1,065,000 再減 14.8%。此區間已反映 Tesla 反覆降價把整批中古庫存一次重新定價的風險。"},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"外推，台灣不存在 10 年份的 Tesla 中古市場，這點已查證而非假設：U-CAR 事件簿載明 Model S「預計 2017 年第一季陸續交車」，全台最老的 Model S 約 9.5 年；ONLYEV 2026-08-12 全部 348 台 Tesla 在售車中最老為 Model S 75D 2018/11（7.8 年）；SUM 汽車網全站 Tesla 車源中 Model S 為零（已實際擷取確認）。因此依規定改用實際仍在交易的最老 BEV 外推，而非燃油車類比：Model S 75D 2018/11、108,000 km 車商開價 99.8 萬＝今日列表價的 30.7%（7.8 年）。本車 10 年時里程僅 70,000 km（遠低於該車的 108,000 km），但多 2.2 年車齡，且 BEV 在此階段主導價格的是電池日曆老化、原廠保固（基本 4 年、電池與驅動單元 8 年／24 萬公里）全數到期、以及 MCU 觸控螢幕等已知故障件——低里程的加分遠不如燃油車。兩者大致抵銷後略往下，取 26.2% 得車商開價約 85 萬。private_sale_price 730,000 為減 14.1%，dealer_tradein_price 620,000 再減 15.1%（車齡越高車商收購價差越大）。"}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"ONLYEV 台灣 Tesla 原廠保養價目表（2026/03/26 更新）Model S MS 2023+ 欄位，配合同頁官方保養週期表，兩者均於 2026-08-12 實際擷取核對。第 1 年只有「每 1 年」的時間項到期，且 Tesla 台灣不強制回廠，實務上多數車主第一年僅換雨刷片與做輪胎對調。"},{"y":3,"source":"以官方週期（每 40,000 km／每 2 年大保養在此里程由時間觸發、每 3 年 HEPA）搭配 ONLYEV 原廠價目表 Model S MS 2023+ 逐項加總得 23,091，取整 23,000。與 Model 3/Y 車主實付大保養 NT$6,673-7,360 的量級一致（Model S 零件較貴故偏高）。"},{"y":5,"source":"輪胎價格取自 BigGo 台灣實際店家報價：255/45R19 電車胎每條 Bridgestone T005 EV 6,200、Yokohama V555 6,500、Hankook iON 7,000、Michelin PS5 Energy 7,550、Continental XC7 8,500；Michelin Primacy 5 Energy 四入含原廠安裝 35,620。7,000 km/年時輪胎是「老化到期」而非「磨耗到期」，5-6 年必換一套。保養項目價格取 ONLYEV 原廠價目表 Model S MS 2023+，冷媒依 R1234YF NT$9.45/g 估約 850g。"},{"y":7,"source":"例行項採 ONLYEV 原廠價目表 Model S MS 2023+ 與同頁官方週期表；16V 鋰電池單價以同表 Model 3/Y 的 9,055 與舊款 Model S 12V 鉛酸 8,345 推估（MS 2023+ 欄位掛「—」，已回頁面確認）。保固外項目為機率加權估計，非報價：Model S Long Range 標配空氣懸吊，氣壓避震單支原廠約 5-7 萬、打氣機約 4 萬，7 年車齡故障機率已不可忽略，故以 25,000 列風險預備。動能回收讓來令片幾乎不磨耗，但碟盤鏽蝕在台灣是實際更換原因，此項屬環境而非里程驅動。"},{"y":10,"source":"例行與週期項採 ONLYEV 原廠價目表 Model S MS 2023+ 與同頁官方週期表（電池冷卻液每 8 年／160,000 km，本車由時間觸發）。NT$70,000 風險預備為機率加權估計而非報價：此段基本保固（4 年）與電池／驅動單元保固（8 年／24 萬公里）全數到期，空氣懸吊與 MCU 螢幕是 Model S 已知的高價故障件。未計入電池模組整換（逾 70 萬），因 70,000 km 里程下發生機率低——但這是本檢查點最大的單一未涵蓋風險。"}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車頻道 — Tesla Model S 車款介紹","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/tesla/model%20s/6947/overall","note":"2026-08-12 實際擷取確認：車系 324.99-339.99 萬，全輪驅動 324.99 萬、Plaid 339.99 萬；並含台灣完整調價沿革（304.99→312.99→294.99→324.99）"},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車 — 2026 Tesla Model S 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/tesla-model-s-2026","note":"獨立第二來源，2026-08-12 擷取確認「共 2 筆」：全輪驅動 324.99、Plaid 339.99"},{"name":"U-CAR — Tesla Model S 事件簿","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/Tesla/Model%20S/6947/event","note":"2016-2025 逐日調價紀錄：2023/09 降 18 萬（降幅 5.7%）、2025/06 小改款漲 30 萬；並載明 2017 Q1 才開始交車（10 年市場不存在的依據）"},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 45803 — 2019/03/22 Model S、Model X 調漲 4.7 至 37.3 萬元","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/45803","note":"原文確認前代 Raven Model S 長里程 259.8→266.3 萬（5 年期下錨點分母）；同表顯示 3/1 後入門為標準里程 245 萬且隨即取消"},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 45555 — 2019/03/01 Tesla 調降臺灣地區售價","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/45555","note":"原文只列降價後 80D 2,834,000／100D 2,982,000／P100D 3,444,000 與 658,900-2,971,900 降幅區間；全文未出現 75D 或 3,492,900，故原研究者據此推導的 7 年期分母不成立，已改用對今日列表價的比值"},{"name":"ONLYEV — Tesla 中古車在售車源（Model S）","url":"https://onlyev.com.tw/cars?make=Tesla&model=Model%20S","note":"2026-08-12 擷取，全台 21 台 Model S 車商開價含年份與里程；1/3/5/7/10 年期的主要價格依據，均已減 11-15% 換算為自售價"},{"name":"ONLYEV — Tesla 中古車在售車源（Model Y / Model 3）","url":"https://onlyev.com.tw/cars?make=Tesla&model=Model%20Y","note":"2026-08-12 擷取，Model Y 78 台、Model 3 193 台；作為流動性較高的同品牌對照組，用以檢定 Model S 開價是否過於樂觀（同齡 Model Y 保值率僅 65-69%）"},{"name":"ONLYEV — Tesla 保養指南與台灣原廠保養價目表","url":"https://onlyev.com.tw/maintenance","note":"2026/03/26 更新，含工資零件及 5% 營業稅；2026-08-12 逐項核對 MS 2023+ 欄位（3,140／815／4,165／2,619／4,287／2,125／6,268、工資 2,415/hr、12V 欄位為「—」）與官方保養週期表"},{"name":"ONLYEV — 特斯拉台灣車系資料庫","url":"https://onlyev.com.tw/tesla-db","note":"確認世代分界：Model S Long Range 全輪驅動 2021 迄今、Raven 2019-2021、100D 2017-2019"},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — TESLA 中古車搜尋","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/TESLA?v=4","note":"2026-08-12 擷取確認全站 Tesla 車源中 Model S 為零（流通性佐證）；另提供 Model 3/Y/X 的 BEV 折舊對照點"},{"name":"BigGo — 255/45R19 輪胎價格比較","url":"https://biggo.com.tw/s/255%2F45R19%20%E8%BC%AA%E8%83%8E/","note":"Model S 19 吋原廠胎規的台灣實際店家報價，每條 6,200-8,500，四入含安裝 35,620"}]},"tesla-model-x-awd-5-seat":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, far below the TW average of ~12,000-15,000. Midpoint 7,000 km/yr used at every checkpoint (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km). CONSEQUENCE: nothing on this car is mileage-driven at this rate. Tesla TW warranty is 4yr/80,000km basic and 8yr/240,000km battery+drive unit; at 7,000 km/yr the km caps NEVER bind, so only the year caps matter — basic cover ends year 4, all cover ends year 8. Tires age out on rubber hardening (5-6 years) long before tread wear. Brake pads may never wear out (regen), so the brake cost here is disc corrosion from disuse in Taiwan's humidity, not pad wear. EXCLUDED BY DESIGN: 使用牌照稅, 燃料費 and insurance are excluded per the model spec (BEVs also currently enjoy TW road-tax exemption, not credited here). ALSO EXCLUDED: home charger. A Tesla Wall Connector plus installation in Taiwan runs roughly NT$35,000-80,000 — cheap in a 透天厝, expensive in a 社區大樓 needing a 台電 sub-meter application and riser wiring. Real one-off ownership cost, but NOT maintenance, so deliberately out of maintenance.checkpoints. Electricity/charging cost likewise out of scope. FACT-CHECK NOTE: the value curve in this record was revised DOWN from the researcher's draft at every checkpoint — see value_checkpoints[].source and sources[] for why.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no 1-year-old Model X exists in any reachable Taiwan used listing. SUM's entire national Tesla inventory is 50 cars and contains exactly 3 Model X, none newer than 2023; 8891 (the largest TW inventory) was unreachable, every used-car URL path returned 404. REVISED DOWN from the researcher's 2,870,000. Their figure was 80.1% of real_cost / 82.0% of list at year 1, which fails three cross-checks: (a) it out-retains the sibling Tesla Model Y record in this same dataset (75.5% at year 1) even though Model X is a 350萬 niche car with 3 national comparables versus Model Y's liquid 21-listing market, and illiquid luxury cars depreciate FASTER in percentage terms, not slower; (b) it out-retains the Lexus RX350h hybrid (77.1%), violating the rule that a BEV should almost never out-retain a comparable hybrid in Taiwan; (c) it implies a dealer would ask ~3,250,000 (93% of new list) for a 1-year-old car when the buyer can order new at 3,499,900 with full warranty and free config — that market does not exist, especially for a brand that cut this exact model's list price 32萬 overnight in 2023/09. Set to 72.8% of real_cost. dealer_tradein_price is 13.5% below private, the normal 收購 spread. No dealer asking price was copied into private_sale_price."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Anchored on the ONE exact-trim real listing on SUM, which I independently re-fetched and confirmed on 2026-08-12: 2023 TESLA MODEL X, 65,860 km, 5人座 4WD, 冠立汽車 (金鑽車商, 臺南市), asking NT$2,798,000. That listing is REAL — the researcher transcribed it correctly. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: 2,798,000 is 車商售價 (dealer retail ask), not what an owner receives. The researcher applied −15% then a +10% low-mileage uplift then a manual hold-down, netting out at dealer ask −12.4%. I applied a wider −23% haircut instead, because that single ask does not survive scrutiny: the car it describes originally listed at either 324.99萬 (post Sept-2023 cut) or 356.99萬, so a 279.8萬 ask is 78-86% of ITS OWN original list after 3 years and 65,860 km. Nothing in Tesla's TW market supports that — SUM's age-4 (2022) Model 3 cohort asks 110.8-145.8萬 against a ~165-175萬 original, i.e. mostly ~70% at ASK level, and asks on a 3-car national market with no published 行情 table are aspirational rather than transactional. −23% gives ~2,155,000 private for the 66,000 km car. Our buyer's car has 21,000 km, about a third the mileage, which argues for an uplift; SUM's own age-5 Model 3 data shows that effect is real and large (35,000-35,343 km asking 125.8-129.8萬 versus 95.8萬 at 122,551 km, ~+31%). I did NOT stack that uplift on top, because it would double-count against the price-cut risk already embedded in the wider haircut, and because a low-mileage premium is much thinner on a car with three national comparables than on a Model 3 with twenty-six. Landed at 2,150,000 = 60.4% of real_cost, below the sibling Model Y (62.9%) and below every hybrid in the dataset. Single dealer ask on an illiquid market, hence LOW not medium (the researcher marked this medium). dealer_tradein_price is 14.0% below private."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"INTERPOLATED between the two real Model X anchors I re-verified on SUM (2026-08-12): the age-3 2023 car at 2,798,000 ask and the two age-8 2018 cars at 1,280,000 / 1,488,000 ask. All converted from dealer ask to private before use. Year 5 is the first checkpoint fully outside Tesla's 4-year basic warranty, which weighs on price. A low-mileage premium is warranted (35,000 km at age 5 versus 66,000-121,000 km on the anchors) and SUM's age-5 Model 3 spread confirms low mileage is worth a lot on a TW Tesla, but the premium is applied more conservatively than the researcher did, for the illiquidity reason given at year 3. REVISED DOWN from 2,020,000 (56.3% of real_cost) to 1,640,000 (46.1%). The researcher's figure sat essentially level with the Lexus RX350h hybrid flagship (57.1%) and nearly 10 points above the sibling Model Y (46.8%) — a Tesla luxury SUV retaining like a Lexus hybrid is the exact failure mode this market's evidence rules out. NEGATIVE FINDING, independently confirmed: SUM's own 中古車行情查詢 (price-02.php) returns no 行情 table for TESLA MODEL X at any year 2016-2026 — I queried it directly and got a page with no price rows. There is therefore no published Taiwan price guide to corroborate this curve, which is why this checkpoint is low. dealer_tradein_price is 14.6% below private."},{"y":7,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"GENUINE same-model data at nearly the right age — Model X is not a new nameplate in Taiwan, deliveries began ~2017, so age-8 cars really do trade. Two real SUM listings, both independently re-fetched and confirmed 2026-08-12: 2018 MODEL X 75D, 109,470 km, 5人座 4WD, 和悅汽車 (高雄市), asking NT$1,280,000; and 2018 MODEL X 100D, 120,820 km, 6人座 4WD, 源豐汽車 (彰化縣), asking NT$1,488,000. The 75D 5-seat is the closest analogue to this AWD 5-seat trim. Sanity check on the level chosen: my 1,270,000 private for a 49,000 km age-7 facelift car implies a dealer ask of ~1,477,000, which is a ~15% premium over the actual 1,280,000 ask on a car one year older with 2.2x the mileage — a sensible, non-heroic adjustment. The researcher's 1,550,000 required a ~+42% jump off the same anchor and implied a dealer ask above the age-8 100D. Cross-check against the 75D's own original TW list (the pre-facelift 75D launched around NT$3.4-3.6M): its 1,280,000 ask is only ~35-38% of original, ~31-33% after conversion to private, which is the real shape of Model X depreciation in Taiwan and does not support a 43% figure at age 7. Year 7 also sits right on the edge of the 8-year battery-and-drive-unit warranty expiry, and TW buyers discount hard for a BEV about to lose that cover. dealer_tradein_price is 15.4% below private — the spread widens with age because dealers carry more battery risk."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — there is no genuine 10-year Model X market in Taiwan to sample. The oldest Model X listed on SUM as of 2026-08-12 are 2018 cars (age 8); nothing from 2016-2017 was offered. Per the brief I leaned on the oldest BEVs that DO trade here rather than a combustion analogue: SUM's age-6 Model 3 cohort (2020, 75,000-139,000 km) asks 73.8-99.8萬, and the age-5 2021 cars at 35,000 km ask 125.8-129.8萬, showing TW BEV values fall away steeply while low mileage still commands a large premium late in life. Method: took the year-7 figure above and applied ~−14%/yr for three more years (1,270,000 x 0.86^3 = ~808,000). The accelerating rather than decelerating decline is deliberate and BEV-specific — this window crosses the 8-year battery + drive unit warranty cliff, after which residual value is dominated by unverifiable battery state-of-health and by Model X's own expensive failure points (air suspension, falcon-wing doors). Low mileage of 70,000 km is the main thing holding the number up. REVISED DOWN from 990,000 (27.6% of real_cost) to 800,000 (22.5%), keeping it below the sibling Model Y (25.5%) and consistent with the revised curve above it. dealer_tradein_price is 16.9% below private — the widest spread of any checkpoint, because a 10-year out-of-warranty BEV is the hardest thing on a TW lot to underwrite."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Structural, not sampled: Tesla TW has no mandatory 1-year service and the car is inside its 4-year basic warranty. At 7,000 km nothing is due. The only real outlays are a rotation and wipers. This near-zero result is robust regardless of Tesla price-list access. Unchanged from the researcher's draft."},{"y":3,"source":"Time-driven items only; the 21,000 km cumulative figure triggers nothing mileage-based. Still fully inside basic warranty, so no repair risk is priced in. Total unchanged at 15,000, but the cabin HEPA filter was moved from year 2 to year 3 to match Tesla's actual Model S/X 3-year interval. Levels are Taiwan market estimates, not a fetched Tesla price list (tesla.com/zh_TW 403s)."},{"y":5,"source":"Dominated by the first tire set. Tire sizes (265/45 R20 front, 275/45 R20 rear) and 2,373 kg curb weight independently re-verified on U-CAR's official Model X spec sheet 2026-08-12; premium 20-inch rubber in Taiwan runs roughly NT$11,000-13,000 per corner fitted, so ~50,000 a set. At 7,000 km/yr these tires are replaced on AGE (rubber hardening, ~5-6 years), never on tread depth — a mileage-based model would wrongly skip this cost entirely. Year 4 is when the basic warranty lapses, hence the first small repair provision. Reduced from the researcher's 78,000: their year-4 cabin HEPA filter does not belong here, because the Model S/X filter interval is 3 years (years 3/6/9), not 2."},{"y":7,"source":"The brake line item is the counter-intuitive BEV point and is deliberate: regenerative braking means the pads on a 7,000 km/yr car are nowhere near worn, but the discs corrode from disuse in Taiwan's humidity and get replaced for rust, not wear. The 50,000 risk provision covers the two Model X-specific out-of-warranty failures — 智慧型空氣懸吊 confirmed standard front AND rear on U-CAR's spec sheet (struts roughly NT$50,000-80,000 per corner at Tesla), and falcon-wing door actuators/sensors. Probability-weighted provision, not a certainty. Fully outside basic warranty; battery/drive cover has not yet lapsed. Trimmed from 112,000 after re-cadencing the brake fluid to Tesla's 4-year interval (year 4 falls in the previous window, year 8 in the next)."},{"y":10,"source":"The expensive window, and the reason a BEV's 10-year maintenance must not be modelled as flat. Two things collide: the 8-year battery/drive warranty lapses (at 7,000 km/yr the 240,000 km cap is irrelevant — only the year cap bites), and Model X's two structural weak points come due. Air suspension is confirmed standard front and rear on U-CAR's official spec sheet, so it is not a hypothetical option. The second tire set is again an AGE replacement at only ~70,000 km cumulative. Note what is still absent versus a combustion car: no oil, no plugs, no timing components, no gearbox rebuild. Trimmed from 312,000 to 300,000 on the HEPA re-cadence (years 3/6/9 gives one filter in this window, not two). 10-year total ~NT$501,000. Estimated levels, not a fetched Tesla price list — hence low confidence on magnitude, though the shape is solid."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — Tesla Model X 車款介紹 (official TW list price + full price-change history)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/tesla/model%20x/6948/overall","note":"PRIMARY price source. Independently re-fetched 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200 via direct request; WebFetch is 403'd by U-CAR). Confirms Model X 5人座 = 349.99萬 (NT$3,499,900), verifying the researcher's figure — no change needed. Also documents the four TW price moves that make this a BEV depreciation story: 348.99萬 (2023/03 relaunch), +8萬 to 356.99萬 (2023/05), −32萬 / −8.9% to 324.99萬 (2023/09), +25萬 to the current 349.99萬 with the 2025/06 facelift."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — Tesla Model X 規格表 (official spec sheet)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/tesla/model%20x/6948/spec","note":"Independently re-fetched 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200). Source for the physical facts underpinning the maintenance model, all confirmed: staggered tires 265/45 R20 front / 275/45 R20 rear, curb weight 2,373 kg, 智慧型空氣懸吊 standard on BOTH axles, 鋰離子電池, 5,057mm length, 670hp, WLTP 597 km, 四輪碟煞."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 中古車 — full TESLA inventory (50 listings, all pages)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?brand=TESLA","note":"Independently re-scraped 2026-08-12, all pages. Every Model 3 / Model Y data point the researcher cited was checked and found REAL and correctly transcribed — including the age-5 2021 Model 3 pair at 35,000 km / 35,343 km asking 129.8萬 / 125.8萬 versus 95.8萬 at 122,551 km (the low-mileage premium evidence), the 2025 Model 3 pair at 13,565 km / 15,503 km asking 153.8萬 / 179.6萬, and the age-6 2020 cohort at 73.8-99.8萬. Supplies the BEV depreciation shape for the 1/5/10-year extrapolations. All prices are 車商售價 (dealer asking), converted to private before use."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 中古車 — TESLA MODEL X filtered (3 listings, the entire national SUM stock)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?brand=TESLA&model=MODEL%20X","note":"Independently re-fetched 2026-08-12; result count confirmed as exactly 3 (共 3 筆), which is itself a finding about how illiquid this car is in TW and the main reason a single dealer ask cannot carry the curve. (1) 2023 MODEL X, 65,860 km, 5人座 4WD, 冠立汽車 臺南市, ask NT$2,798,000 — the age-3 anchor and an exact trim match. (2) 2018 MODEL X 75D, 109,470 km, 5人座 4WD, 和悅汽車 高雄市, ask NT$1,280,000 — the age-8 anchor and closest analogue to this trim. (3) 2018 MODEL X 100D, 120,820 km, 6人座 4WD, 源豐汽車 彰化縣, ask NT$1,488,000. All three confirmed present and correctly transcribed by the researcher."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 中古車行情查詢 (price guide — queried, NO data for Model X)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/price-02.php","note":"Independently re-queried 2026-08-12 for brand=TESLA, model=MODEL X, years 2016-2026. The page loads (HTTP 200) and TESLA is a valid brand option, but the query returns no 行情 price rows at any year. Recorded as a deliberate NEGATIVE finding, confirming the researcher: no published Taiwan 中古車行情 table exists for this model, so there is no secondary source to corroborate the listing-derived curve. This is a direct reason most checkpoints are low confidence."},{"name":"Tesla 台灣官網 (tesla.com/zh_TW) — inaccessible, verified","url":"https://www.tesla.com/zh_TW/support/vehicle-maintenance-schedule","note":"Independently retested 2026-08-12: returns HTTP 403 to automated access, as do the Model X design page and the warranty page. This confirms the researcher's stated limitation rather than taking it on trust. No official TW service-price table or warranty page was retrieved by either pass, so all maintenance levels in this record are engineering estimates from verified spec plus TW market rates, not transcribed prices."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — unreachable, verified","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/tesla-modelx-cars","note":"Independently retested 2026-08-12 across several used-car URL patterns; all returned HTTP 404 (the c.8891 host now routes to their new-car SPA). 8891 has by far the largest TW used inventory and is the brief's preferred source, so its absence is the single biggest gap in this record. The entire used-price curve rests on SUM's national inventory, which held only 3 Model X."}]},"audi-a3-35-tfsi-advanced":{"assumptions":"買家年行駛 6,000-8,000 km，遠低於台灣平均 12,000-15,000 km。所有檢查點一律用 7,000 km × 年數（7,000／21,000／35,000／49,000／70,000 km）。此里程下 Audi 的保養間隔由「時間」觸發而非里程（原廠 1 年或 15,000 km 先到者為準），所以每年都要進廠一次，年數才是保養成本的主要驅動因子；輪胎同理，會先老化到期而不是磨到底。低里程車在台灣中古市場明顯高於不看里程的平均行情，故各檢查點都以「同年份低里程件」為報價基準，並在 source 字串註明。稅金與保險依規格排除（僅供參考：本車年燃料稅 4,800 元、牌照稅 7,120 元，經 U-CAR 規格表確認，未計入任何欄位）。非電動車，無充電樁安裝成本。特別注意：本車的 48V 系統是輕油電（MHEV），無法純電行駛，powertrain 歸類為 gasoline 而非 hybrid。","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"推估值，非直接掛牌觀察：SUM 汽車網 2026-08-12 全站 8Y 世代 A3 僅 3 筆在架（2022-2023 年份），無 1 年車可比。做法是以已驗證的新車牌價 1,580,000 為上界、以下方 3 年期的實際掛牌行情為下界內插，並套用德系豪華車在台第一年的陡跌特性，得車商零售開價約 1,264,000（牌價 80%）。再依「車商售價 → 自售價」調降 11%（8-15% 區間中位）得自售價 1,125,000，再依「自售價 → 車商收購價」調降 13%（10-15% 區間中位）得收購價 980,000。自售價為 real_cost 的 72.0%，第一年即認列 28% 損失——這正是德系豪華車與日系（同期約 85%）的分水嶺，且與本表德系同級車一致（BMW 1 Series 72.8%、Mercedes A180 70.5%、CLA180 71.0%）。低里程 7,000 km 已納入加成。"},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"以 SUM 汽車網（https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/AUDI/A3?v=4）2026-08-12 實際在架車輛換算，全部為同世代（8Y）同車系，本次已逐筆重新抓取並核對無誤：2023 年式 A3 Sportback 1,500 c.c.（26,000 km）車商開價 998,000＝原牌價 1,550,000 的 64.4%；2023 年式 1,000 c.c. 30 TFSI（47,747 km）車商開價 869,000＝原牌價 1,380,000 的 63.0%；2022 年式 1,500 c.c.（66,459 km）車商開價 928,000＝原牌價 1,690,000 的 54.9%。【本次修正】前一版取「區間上緣 67%」，高於全部三個觀測樣本；本案 21,000 km 與最可比樣本（2023 年式 1.5、26,000 km、64.4%）只差 5,000 km，不足以支撐高於所有觀測值的比率，故改取 65.5%（僅較最可比樣本加 1.1 個百分點的低里程加成）→ 車商零售開價約 1,034,900。【關鍵調整】上述皆為車商售價（零售開價），不是車主拿得到的錢：再降 11% 得自售價 920,000，自售價再降 13% 得車商收購價 800,000。自售價為 real_cost 的 58.9%，3 年跌掉四成，符合德系而非日系的曲線，並落在本表德系同級帶（58.3-61.2%）內。樣本僅 3 筆且其中一筆未載明車型等級（以 35 TFSI advanced 原價認列），故給 medium 不給 high。"},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"外推值。可觀察的最遠同世代樣本是 SUM 上的 2022 年式 1,500 c.c.（4 年、66,459 km）＝原牌價 54.9%；本案 5 年僅 35,000 km，里程約為該樣本的一半，先做低里程加成、再多折舊一年，得車商零售開價約牌價 53%（1,580,000 × 53% ≈ 837,400）。再依 -11% / -13% 兩段換算得自售價 745,000、車商收購價 648,000。自售價為 real_cost 的 47.7%，落在本表德系同級帶（43.8-49.4%）內；3→5 年的年跌幅（-6.25 個百分點／年）小於 1→3 年（-7.25 個百分點／年），維持前重後輕的德系形狀。第 5 年是台灣奧迪促銷「五年原廠保固」到期的節點，中古市場會在此處對修理風險重新定價。無 5 年車實際掛牌可比，故 confidence 為 low。"},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"外推值，採前代（8V 世代）保值率換算，因為現行 8Y 世代 2021 年才在台上市，最老僅 5 年，沒有真實的 7 年資料，不虛構。做法：SUM 2026-08-12 在架 2018 年式 A3 Sportback 1,500 c.c.（8 年、110,000 km）車商開價 458,000；該車當年原廠牌價由 UDN Autos 2017-08-02 小改款上市報導驗證為 A3 Sportback 35 TFSI 1,430,000 元（本次已逐字複查該報導，確認 Sportback 35 TFSI 143 萬、35 TFSI Premium 149.9 萬、40 TFSI Sport 177 萬、Sedan 35 TFSI Premium 156 萬），車身型式與動力等級皆對得上，故 8 年高里程保值率＝32.0%（車商零售）。往前推一年（+約 5 個百分點）並針對本案 49,000 km 相對該樣本 110,000 km 的低里程加成（+約 6 個百分點），得 7 年低里程車商零售保值率約 43%。將此比率套用到本車 real_cost 1,562,000 得車商零售開價約 671,700，再依 -11% / -13% 換算得自售價 598,000、車商收購價 520,000。此時已脫離五年原廠保固，中古市場對水泵、節溫器殼、DQ200 機電單元、48V 啟動發電機等的修理風險折價，尾段持續下跌而非像 Lexus 那樣打平。"},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"外推值，同樣採前代（8V 世代）保值率換算，現行世代無 10 年真實資料。【本次修正了一個對照錯誤】前一版把 SUM 在架的『2016 年式 A3 Sedan 1,800 c.c.（111,770 km）開價 398,000』對到 40 TFSI Sport 原牌價 1,770,000 算出 22.5%，但 UDN 2017-08-02 報導中的 177 萬是 A3 **Sportback** 40 TFSI Sport，該報導唯一的 Sedan 是 35 TFSI Premium 156 萬，且 2016 年式車在 2017 年小改款改名前並非以『40 TFSI』販售——車身型式與年式雙重不匹配，該樣本已剔除不用。改以車身型式與動力等級都對得上的單一樣本認列：2017 年式 A3 Sportback 1,500 c.c.（9 年、180,000 km）車商開價 398,000，對 UDN 驗證的 35 TFSI 原牌價 1,430,000 為 27.8%（超高里程）。本案 10 年僅 70,000 km，遠低於該樣本，取低里程加成後的車商零售保值率約 28.5%，套用到 real_cost 1,562,000 得車商零售開價約 445,000，再依 -11% / -13% 換算得自售價 396,000、車商收購價 344,000。自售價僅剩 real_cost 的 25.4%，十年蒸發約 75%——德系豪華車出保後尾段不打平的典型結果，並落在本表德系同級帶（21.0-29.6%）內。剔除誤配樣本後僅剩單一有效樣本，confidence 維持 low。"}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"推估值。無法取得 Audi Taiwan 官方保養價目表（audi.com.tw 回 503）與 Mobile01 車主實單（回 403），故依台灣豪華品牌原廠一次基礎定保 8,000-10,000 元的市場慣例建模，並對齊本表德系同級車首年值（BMW 1 Series 9,000、Mercedes A180 12,000、CLA180 12,000）。保固前提取自 UDN Autos 2026-03-10 台灣奧迪購車方案報導（A3 Sportback 指定車型提供五年原廠保固）。下限錨點參考 HOT 保修大聯盟服務工資表（進口車 1 年定保工資 1,500 元，僅工資不含零件），原廠收費為其數倍。"},{"y":3,"source":"推估值，來源限制同 1 年期。項目組成參照 HOT 保修大聯盟公布的定保項目表（機油、機油濾清器、空氣濾清器、空調濾清器、煞車油、水箱冷卻液、火星塞、電瓶等的更換／檢查週期），金額改以台灣原廠廠訂價水準建模，並對齊本表德系同級車 1-3 年段（BMW 1 Series 26,000、Mercedes A180 35,000、CLA180 34,000）。"},{"y":5,"source":"推估值，來源限制同前。組成：兩次原廠定保約 26,000＋225/40R18 四條原廠通路約 36,000＋前來令片與碟盤約 28,000＋火星塞約 9,000＋非保固小項約 2,000。輪胎規格依 UDN Autos 2025-03-12 35 TFSI advanced 試駕報導（實車標配 18 吋輪圈）推算為 225/40R18。輪胎在此期更換的理由是年限而非里程——35,000 km 遠未磨完，但橡膠已 5 年。本次較前一版（88,000）上修，理由見 plan_notes：前一版低於本表所有德系同級車同段（BMW 1 Series 98,000、A180 105,000、CLA180 110,000），且五年保固為促銷限定、非全車系標配，本期仍應留少量非保固支出。"},{"y":7,"source":"推估值，來源限制同前。組成：兩次未補貼定保約 30,000＋DQ200 變速箱油與機電單元保養約 18,000＋DQ200 機電單元故障期望值約 16,000（原廠更換單價 6-10 萬元 × 出保後發生機率）＋12V AGM 電瓶約 15,000＋冷卻液與後來令片約 15,000＋水泵／節溫器殼／點火線圈期望值約 30,000。本期起脫離五年原廠保固（保固條件見 UDN Autos 2026-02-13／2026-03-10 報導，且限指定車型），故首次認列故障維修的期望值提列，而非僅例行保養。本次較前一版（103,000）上修，主因是前一版只編列 DQ200 的「保養」而未編列其機電單元故障期望值——這是台灣 VAG 車主單價最高的已知風險項之一。對齊本表德系同級車同段（A180 115,000、CLA180 105,000、BMW 1 Series 132,000）。"},{"y":10,"source":"推估值，來源限制同前。此期完全在保固外，組成：三次未補貼定保約 48,000＋第二套 225/40R18 約 36,000＋前碟盤與來令片第二次約 30,000＋48V 鋰電池與 BSG 期望值約 45,000＋水泵／節溫器殼／點火線圈約 30,000＋避震器與底盤襯套約 30,000＋第二顆 AGM 電瓶約 15,000＋DQ200 第二次保養與機電單元期望值約 6,000。48V 輕油電的鋰電池與 BSG 是本車與非輕油電車型最大的成本差異項，出保後單次維修動輒數萬元，故單獨提列；這也是把 48V 系統從「不影響成本的行銷配備」修正回「實質擁有成本」的關鍵。本次較前一版（207,000）上修以對齊本表德系同級車同段（A180 235,000、CLA180 248,000、BMW 1 Series 265,000、BMW 2 Series GC 295,000）。十年合計約 506,000 元，約為同級日系（RAV4／Corolla 級距約 18-25 萬元）的兩倍以上，符合德系豪華品牌的實際樣貌。"}],"sources":[{"name":"UDN Autos — 2026 年式 Audi A3 Sportback 升級登場 全車系標配智慧駕駛輔助科技","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/9121372","note":"主要牌價來源（2025-11-06），本次已重新抓取並逐字核對。內文原文：『30 TFSI 享馭版 建議售價 142 萬元／35 TFSI advanced 進化版 建議售價 158 萬元／35 TFSI S line 運動版 建議售價 182 萬元』，並列出 2026 年式新增前方橫向車流輔助、Park assist plus 與 360 度環景。確認 list_price 1,580,000 正確。"},{"name":"U-CAR 新車頻道 — Audi A3 Sportback 車款介紹","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/audi/a3%20sportback/7047/overall","note":"牌價的第二個獨立驗證來源，本次已重新抓取。規格表原文列出『35 TFSI advanced進化版 158（萬）／1,498 c.c.／汽油／直列4汽缸／七速自手排／前輪驅動／150 hp／18.6 km/l／燃4,800 牌7,120』，車系區間 142-182 萬，並載明全車系皆搭配 48V 輕油電與 S-tronic 7 速。稅金依規格未計入任何欄位。"},{"name":"UDN Autos — 節能、性能、新科技一次到位！大改款全新 Audi A3 Sportback 正式發表","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/5391129","note":"2021-04-15，8Y 世代在台上市原廠牌價，是換算同世代中古保值率的關鍵錨點。本次已逐字複查，原文：30 TFSI 138 萬／30 TFSI advanced 145 萬／35 TFSI 150 萬／35 TFSI advanced 155 萬／35 TFSI S line 169 萬／35 TFSI Edition One 171 萬（限量）／S3 259 萬。"},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — AUDI A3 中古車在架清單","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/AUDI/A3?v=4","note":"中古車曲線的唯一實價來源，2026-08-12 本次重新擷取並逐筆核對，全部為車商售價（零售開價）。同世代 8Y：2023 年式 1,500 c.c.（26,000 km）998,000；2023 年式 1,000 c.c.（47,747 km）869,000；2022 年式 1,500 c.c.（66,459 km）928,000。前代 8V：2018 年式 Sportback 1,500 c.c.（110,000 km）458,000；2018 年式 Sedan 1,500 c.c.（110,000 km）468,000；2017 年式 Sportback 1,500 c.c.（180,000 km）398,000；2016 年式 Sedan 1,800 c.c.（111,770 km）398,000；2015 年式 Sportback 1,400 c.c.（90,000 km）298,000。全站 2020 年後的 A3 僅 3 筆在架，供給極薄。"},{"name":"UDN Autos — Audi A3 改款精進 首度追加導入 Sedan 四門房車","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/2619646","note":"2017-08-02，前代（8V 小改款）在台原廠牌價，本次已逐字複查，原文：A3 Sedan 35 TFSI Premium 156 萬／A3 Sportback 35 TFSI 143 萬／A3 Sportback 35 TFSI Premium 149.9 萬／A3 Sportback 40 TFSI Sport 177 萬。注意 177 萬屬 Sportback 而非 Sedan——前一版把 2016 年式 A3 Sedan 對到這個數字，本次已剔除該誤配樣本（見 10 年檢查點 source）。"},{"name":"UDN Autos — 四環豪華掀背新篇章 全新 Audi A3 Sportback 售價 139 萬元起","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/8593361","note":"2025-03-07，8Y 小改款在台發表，本次已重新抓取。確認全車系為 1.5 升直列 4 缸缸內直噴渦輪汽油引擎搭配 48V 輕油電系統，車型編成為 30 TFSI 享馭版／35 TFSI advanced 進化版／35 TFSI S line 運動版，2025 年式起價 1,390,000（2026 年式調為 1,420,000）。"},{"name":"UDN Autos — 小改後更超值 Audi A3 Sportback 35 TFSI advanced 德系四環掀背試駕體驗","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7828/8600786","note":"2025-03-12，本次已重新抓取。原文列出 2025 年式三車型售價『30 TFSI 享馭版：139 萬元／35 TFSI advanced 進化版：155 萬元／35 TFSI S line 運動版：179 萬元』，確認本車型 2025 年式為 1,550,000、2026 年式為 1,580,000。並確認 150 hp／25.5 kgm、48V 輕油電、七速雙離合器，以及市售車標配 18 吋輪圈——輪胎成本以 225/40R18 估算的依據。"},{"name":"UDN Autos — 「低月付 8,888 元起」Audi 3 月購車專案登場 全車系彈性財務方案、五年原廠保固同步推出","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/9370561","note":"2026-03-10，本次已重新抓取。原文：『作為品牌入門掀背車型的 Audi A3 Sportback，指定車型推出低頭款方案，首年超低月付 8,888 元起，並提供 130 萬元 40 期零利率貸款條件』。注意標題雖寫五年原廠保固，內文的適用範圍是「指定車型」而非全車系標配，維修成本模型據此修正（見 plan_notes）。全文未提及贈送定期保養套餐。"},{"name":"UDN Autos — 美製車關稅歸零動起來！賓士、BMW、INFINITI 將會調整售價 Audi 祭出利多優惠搶市","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/9328447","note":"2026-02-13，本次已重新抓取。原文：『Audi A3 Sportback 指定車型主打低頭款、低月付 8,888 元起，並提供五年原廠保固』，且明確指出台灣奧迪未公布具體現金折扣金額，改以低頭款低月付、乙式車體險購置金補助與五年原廠保固組合應戰。這是折扣 70,000 元只能以市場行情推估而非官方數字的理由，也是五年保固屬「指定車型促銷」的第二個佐證。"},{"name":"HOT 保修大聯盟 — 保養週期及服務工資表","url":"https://www.hotcar.com.tw/Maintain/WarrantySearch","note":"本次唯一取得的實價保養資料，但屬非原廠通路且僅含工資：進口車 5,000 km／3 個月定保 500 元、10,000 km／6 個月 600 元、20,000 km／1 年 1,500 元（2,000 c.c. 以下）。同時提供定保的項目與週期表（機油、機油濾清器、空氣濾清器、空調濾清器、煞車油、水箱冷卻液、火星塞、電瓶）。作為原廠報價的下限錨點使用；Audi 原廠實收為其數倍。"}]},"audi-a5-tfsi-110kw-advanced":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, far below the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year. All checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). At this mileage every service interval is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven: the Audi Taiwan schedule is 10,000 km or 12 months whichever comes first, and at 7,000 km/yr the 12-month clock always fires first, so the car gets ~10 annual services in 10 years while the odometer only reaches 70,000 km. Consequence: oil/oil-filter/cabin-filter costs are paid on the calendar, but genuinely mileage-gated items arrive late and some are reached only once — the 60,000 km ATF service lands a single time (around year 9) and the 120,000 km belt service never happens at all. Tyres are replaced on AGE not tread wear (~every 5-6 years). Tax (牌照稅 NT$11,230/yr + 公路養管費 NT$6,180/yr = NT$17,410/yr, confirmed on 8891's own cost page for this exact trim) and all insurance are EXCLUDED by design and appear nowhere in these figures. Fuel is also excluded. Powertrain is conventional gasoline for this table's purposes; see purchase.notes on the unresolved mild-hybrid question, which does not change the classification either way.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from a prior estimate of 1,740,000. Same-generation listings on 8891 中古車 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a5-sedan) show nine 2025款 A5 Sedan TFSI 150kW S line cars at 219.8萬 (15,000 km), 223.8萬 x2 (10,100 km), 228.8萬 x4 (6,000-6,584 km) and one 電洽 — all 奧迪原廠認證中古車 (CPO) — i.e. low-mileage cars matching this buyer's profile, asking roughly 85-88% of their model-year list. Those numbers are NOT usable at face value for three compounding reasons: (a) they are CPO dealer RETAIL asking prices, the very top of the price chain, carrying a warranty-backed premium; (b) they are the higher 150kW S line trim, and cheaper trims retain a lower percentage; (c) the A5 only launched in Taiwan in June 2025, so with nine used cars in the entire country the price is inflated by launch scarcity that will have faded by the time this buyer's own car is one year old. The direct predecessor contradicts them decisively: on https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a4-sedan a 2024-registered A4 40 TFSI advanced 進化版 with 5,000 km asks 118.8萬 (51.7% of its 230萬 list) and 2024-registered 享馭版 cars ask 129.8-147.0萬 (57-64%) at two years. A year-1 dealer retail of 87% followed by a year-2 of ~60% is not a curve. ADJUSTMENT MADE: dealer retail set at 80% of list (1,816,000), cut 11% to private sale (1,620,000), a further 13% to dealer trade-in (1,400,000). No asking price was copied. Includes a small low-mileage allowance (7,000 km)."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from a prior estimate of 1,230,000, which rested on rejecting the only mileage-matched real data point. Predecessor listings on https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a4-sedan for 2023-registered A4 40 TFSI 享馭版 (list 229萬): three separate Taichung dealers ask 108.8萬 at 20,000 km (47.5% of list), one asks 129.8萬 at 18,000 km (56.7%), and one Audi CPO car with just 1,000 km asks 139.8萬 (61.0%). The prior pass discarded the 108.8萬 point as accident-history stock because one dealer's boilerplate reads 瑕疵案件皆可全額貸款 — but that is a financing pitch ('we can arrange full financing even on defect cases'), not a disclosure about that car, and the same 108.8萬 / 20,000 km price recurs across three independent listings. The 139.8萬 car is a 1,000 km delivery-mileage outlier, not comparable to a 21,000 km car. The honest 3-year band for a normally-used example is therefore 47.5-56.7% of list. ADJUSTMENT MADE: dealer retail set at 53% (1,203,000) — mid-band, with a slight uplift because the A4 was a run-out model being displaced by this very A5, which depresses its residual specifically — then cut 11% to private sale (1,070,000) and a further 13% to trade-in (930,000). No separate low-mileage uplift is applied: the comparison cars are already at 18,000-20,000 km against our 21,000 km, so adding one would double-count. Years 1-3 are the steepest part of a German luxury curve and this is deliberately far below Japanese-brand behaviour. 8891's own model for this trim (https://c.8891.com.tw/audi/a5-sedan/cost.html) claims 70.5% at year 3 (160.0萬); rejected — see the year-7 note for the back-test that fails it."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from a prior estimate of 840,000, which missed a directly age- AND mileage-matched listing. On https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a4-sedan a 2021-registered A4 40 TFSI S line 運動版 with 35,000 km asks 91.8萬 — exactly this checkpoint's five years and exactly its 35,000 km — which is ~37.9% of that trim's ~242萬 list. That is a far better anchor than interpolating back from six-year cars, and it lands below the 42% dealer retail used previously. Corroborating six-year points from the same page: 2020-registered 40 TFSI at 73.8萬 (50,000 km) and 78.8萬 (84,000 km), ~33-35% of their ~225萬 list. ADJUSTMENT MADE: dealer retail set at 38.5% of list (874,000) — a touch above the observed 37.9% because the A4 S line was by then a run-out model — then cut 11% to private sale (780,000) and a further 14% to dealer trade-in (670,000). No extra low-mileage uplift: the anchor listing already carries this buyer's mileage. Ratio applied to this car's list price per the predecessor-generation method."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no genuine 7-year data exists for this generation, which only launched in Taiwan in June 2025. Method: took real predecessor-generation (B9 A4 Sedan) listings at that age from https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a4-sedan, expressed them as a retention ratio of that car's original list, and applied the ratio here. Eight-year points: 2018-registered 40 TFSI Premium Plus at 51.8萬 (130,000 km) and 40TFSI at 52.5萬 (128,000 km), ~23% of their ~225萬 list. Nine-year points: 2017-registered 40 TFSI cars cluster at 48.8-60.8萬 (35,000-170,000 km), ~22-27%. Six-year points sit at ~33-35%. Interpolating to seven years and allowing ~+2 points for genuinely low mileage (49,000 km against a typical ~91,000 km) gives 30% of list as dealer retail (681,000), then a 13% cut to private sale (595,000) and a further 14% to trade-in (510,000). Note 8891's own model (https://c.8891.com.tw/audi/a5-sedan/cost.html) claims 50.5% at year 7; REJECTED, because applied to real 8-year-old A4s it would predict ~105萬 against actual asking prices of ~52萬 — roughly 2x optimistic in the tail. The car is out of warranty here and the used market prices in repair risk, so the curve keeps falling rather than flattening."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor generation — no 10-year data can exist for a car launched in 2025. Real B9/B8.5 A4 Sedan listings at that age on https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a4-sedan: 2016-registered 30 TFSI 1.4L at 38.8萬 (150,000 km) and 40.0萬 (130,000 km) and 35 TFSI 1.4L at 36.8萬 (90,000 km) — ~19-22% of their ~180-190萬 original list at ten years; 2015-registered 25 TFSI cars at eleven years are already down to 23.9-27.8萬 (~15%). An independent same-nameplate tail check: the one old A5 on the A5 page, a 2014 A5 45TFSI quattro with 130,000 km, asks 33.8萬 — roughly 12-13% of its original list at twelve years. I expressed the ten-year figures as a retention ratio of original list and applied it here, uplifted for very low mileage (70,000 km against a typical ~130,000 km, a large gap at this age), giving 21% of list as dealer retail (477,000), then a 15% cut to private sale (405,000) and a further 15% to trade-in (345,000). The tail keeps declining rather than flattening the way a Lexus does, because a 10-year out-of-warranty Audi is priced on repair risk."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Audi Taiwan official service-price table (https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw), A5 Sportback 40 TFSI basic-interval price of 11,200-11,800 uplifted ~15% to 2026 money. Confidence is medium not high: the table's real published numbers were verified via its own API, but it covers only 2017-2022 vehicles and contains no B10 A5 Sedan, so this is an extrapolation across model and time. Warranty status per the 5年保固 promotion shown under 廠商優惠 on https://c.8891.com.tw/audi/a5-sedan/Summary.html."},{"y":3,"source":"Audi Taiwan official service-price table (https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw): the published service matrix confirms 煞車油 and 火星塞 both fall at 20,000 km, priced at 13,600 for the A5 Sportback 40 TFSI and uplifted to ~15,500 for 2026; the year-3 visit is a basic service at ~13,500. Confidence medium not high, for the same reason as year 1 — the official table stops at 2022 and does not list this car."},{"y":5,"source":"Scheduled-service element from the Audi Taiwan official table (https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw); 空氣濾清器 timing at 30,000 km confirmed directly in the published service matrix. Tyre and brake-pad costs are estimates at Taiwan dealer/premium-fitment rates for this class, not quoted prices, hence medium confidence."},{"y":7,"source":"Scheduled element from the Audi Taiwan official table (https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw), whose matrix puts brake fluid and spark plugs together at every 20,000 km, so the 40,000 km pair falls in this window. Warranty expires at year 5, so this is the first period carrying unsubsidised repair risk; the battery, brake and repair-allowance figures are estimates at Taiwan Audi dealer rates, not quoted prices."},{"y":10,"source":"The 60,000 km service is priced directly from the Audi Taiwan official table (https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw), which lists 29,700-30,700 for the A5 Sportback 40 TFSI at that interval (uplifted to ~34,000 for 2026); its service matrix confirms 自動變速箱油 + Sealing Plug as the content that makes that interval expensive. The wear and risk items are an actuarial allowance at Taiwan dealer rates, not a quotation — this is the least certain period and where German ownership diverges most sharply from Japanese. The 120,000 km 皮帶/皮帶調整器 service is correctly NOT included: at 7,000 km/yr the car never reaches it."}],"sources":[{"name":"8891 新車 — Audi A5 Sedan 2026年式 lineup and official prices","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/audi/a5-sedan/Summary.html","note":"Primary price verification, read in a rendered browser on 2026-08-12. Confirms 2026年式 TFSI 110kW advanced 進化版 at 227萬 (NT$2,270,000 correct), alongside 110kW S line 239.7萬, 150kW S line 268.5萬 and S5 367.1萬. Also shows the 廠商優惠 block (5年保固 指定車型, 0% 48-month financing up to 180萬, 汰舊換新 再減5萬) and groups the 2.0L trims as 汽油 with the S5 as 油電混合. The 停售車型 tab is empty — no 2025年式 pricing is published, so the earlier model year's list prices could not be verified."},{"name":"8891 新車 — Audi A4 Sedan discontinued-model prices (predecessor)","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/audi/a4-sedan/Summary.html","note":"Establishes the one-for-one lineage and the denominator for every predecessor retention ratio. Final 2024年式 lineup read from the 停售車型 tab: 40 TFSI 享馭版 229萬, 40 TFSI advanced 進化版 230萬, 40 TFSI S line 運動版 246萬. Note 8891 files this car under 油電混合 2.0L, which is why its fuel-type tagging is not treated as a reliable spec source for the A5."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Audi A5 Sedan used listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a5-sedan","note":"Ten cars total. Nine are ~1-year-old 2025款 TFSI 150kW S line Audi CPO listings at 219.8-228.8萬 with 6,000-15,000 km; one is a 2014 A5 45TFSI quattro at 33.8萬 with 130,000 km, used as a twelve-year tail sanity check. All are 車商售價; there are no 個人自售 listings, so no direct private-sale evidence exists for this model."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Audi A4 Sedan used listings (predecessor generation)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a4-sedan","note":"61 listings across two pages spanning 2008-2024 registrations with year, mileage and asking price — the backbone of the whole curve. Key anchors actually used: 2024-reg advanced 進化版 118.8萬 @5,000 km and 享馭版 147.0萬 @21,000 km (2 yrs); 2023-reg 享馭版 108.8萬 @20,000 km x3, 129.8萬 @18,000 km, 139.8萬 @1,000 km CPO (3 yrs); 2021-reg 40 TFSI S line 91.8萬 @35,000 km (5 yrs, exact mileage match); 2020-reg 40 TFSI 73.8萬 @50,000 km and 78.8萬 @84,000 km (6 yrs); 2018-reg 40 TFSI ~51.8-52.5萬 @130,000 km (8 yrs); 2016-reg 30/35 TFSI 36.8-40.0萬 (10 yrs)."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan official service-price table (保養透明 安心啟航)","url":"https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw","note":"Official per-interval maintenance pricing. Its public API was queried directly on this pass: /api/v1.0/pricing returned A4 Sedan 40 TFSI at 8,600 / 9,600 / 10,700 / 21,500 and A5 Sportback 40 TFSI at 11,200-11,800 / 13,600 / 29,700-30,700, and /api/v1.0/service-matrix confirmed the content of each interval. Coverage is limited to 2017-2022 model years and includes no B10 A5 Sedan, which is why the maintenance checkpoints are capped at medium confidence."},{"name":"8891 用車成本 — A5 Sedan TFSI 110kW advanced 進化版 cost and retention model","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/audi/a5-sedan/cost.html","note":"8891's own modelled 保值率 for this exact trim, read directly: 89.0% y1, 79.2% y2, 70.5% y3, 64.9% y4, 59.7% y5, 54.9% y6, 50.5% y7 (3-year value 160.0萬). Also the statutory fee breakdown used in assumptions (牌照稅 11,230 + 公路養管費 6,180 = 17,410/yr). The retention model is REJECTED throughout: it fails a back-test against real 8-year-old A4 asking prices by roughly 2x, and it is a valuation model rather than observed transactions."}]},"audi-a6-e-tron-sportback":{"assumptions":"7,000 km/year assumed at every checkpoint (7k/21k/35k/49k/70k), far below the TW average of 12,000-15,000 km. At this mileage every service trigger is calendar-based, not distance-based, and tyres age out before they wear out. Low mileage also means resale sits at the TOP of the observed listing band for its age, which is how the value checkpoints were positioned. EXCLUDED BY DESIGN: 牌照稅/燃料稅 and insurance. ALSO EXCLUDED: home charger installation — a 7kW wallbox plus 專線 runs roughly NT$40,000-70,000 in Taiwan and is a real ownership cost, but it is a one-off capital item, not maintenance, so it appears nowhere in this record. Public DC fast-charging fees and electricity are likewise excluded (energy, not maintenance). SPEC FACTS RE-VERIFIED BY THIS AUDIT against the U-CAR spec table (fetched 2026-08-12 with a browser user-agent; the plain fetcher gets HTTP 403): the 280萬 column shows 車重 2,175 kg, 輪胎尺寸 235/45 R20 front and 後輪尺寸 265/40 R20 rear, 四輪碟煞, 後置馬達 1 具 永磁同步馬達, 電池總容量 83kwh / 可用電池容量 75.8kwh, DC 充電最大功率 225kW, DC 規格 CCS2, AC 規格 Mennekes (Type2), 風阻係數 0.21, 產地 德國, 經銷/代理 台灣福斯股份有限公司. 286 hp / 44.4 kgm comes from U-CAR's article text for this variant. TYRE-SIZE CAVEAT ADDED BY THIS AUDIT: U-CAR contradicts itself. The per-trim SPEC TABLE gives the 280萬 car staggered 20-inch tyres (235/45 R20 / 265/40 R20), but U-CAR's own article text on the same model page states 「A6 e-tron 入門車型標配了 19 吋胎圈組，S line 車型與 S 車型則是 20 吋胎圈組」. This record keeps the spec-table figure because it is the per-trim column, but the two tyre line items in maintenance should be read as an UPPER BOUND — a 19-inch set would be materially cheaper, and 19-inch fitments are more often square (rotatable) than staggered. The staggered assumption is therefore the conservative one. This trim does NOT have air suspension — ETtoday (verified) states 主動式氣壓懸吊 is standard only on the S6 — so no air-strut replacement is budgeted, which is the single biggest reason this car's later maintenance is lower than a comparable German air-sprung SUV.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, and REDUCED BY THIS AUDIT from the researcher's 1,950,000. The absence of data is itself the finding and was independently re-confirmed: fetching https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a6-sportback-e-tron on 2026-08-12 returns 「共找到 1180 輛車」 — the model filter falls through to the entire all-Audi inventory, i.e. not one A6 e-tron of any age is listed anywhere in Taiwan. The nearest real German-BEV anchor was also re-verified listing by listing: 8891 shows five Audi Q4 e-tron, all 2024 cars at about 2 years old on 5,300-18,000 km, dealer asking 143.8 / 148.0 / 158.0 / 158.0 / 176.8 萬. WHY THE CUT: the researcher worked back from those to a year-1 dealer asking of 220萬, which is 78.6% of list — the highest first-year retention of any German BEV in this table (BMW i4 72%, BMW i5 71%, BMW iX3 69%, Mercedes EQE 67%) — while simultaneously arguing, correctly, that Audi BEVs have the THINNEST used demand of the group. A car with literally zero used-market presence cannot out-retain the i4. The researcher's own reading of the Q4 anchor (Audi BEVs asking well under two-thirds of list at 2 years) implies roughly 74-76% of list at year 1, i.e. a dealer asking price near 211萬, not 220萬. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN APPLIED (8891 prices are 車商售價, dealer RETAIL, never what an owner receives): dealer retail 2,110,000 → private sale 1,880,000 (10.9% below, inside the 8-15% band) → dealer trade-in 1,630,000 (a further 13.3% below private). Implies a 30.2% first-year loss against real_cost, squarely in the peer range (i4 28.0%, i5 29.0%, iX3 30.7%, EQE 33.5%) and correctly front-loaded for a German BEV. The 7,000 km odometer is already credited — without it this would sit lower."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED between two anchors that this audit re-fetched and verified line by line, since no A6 e-tron of this age exists anywhere. Upper anchor: 8891 Audi Q4 e-tron, five listings, 2024 cars at about 2 years, 5,300-18,000 km, dealer asking 143.8-176.8萬. Lower anchor: 8891 Audi Q8 e-tron, only two listings in the whole country — 「Audi Q8 e-tron 2024款 e-tron 55Q 純電」 2023年, 1.9萬公里, asking 208.0萬, and 「2024款 50 quattro advanced 進化版」 2024年, 7000公里, asking 198.8萬. Both confirm the years 1-3 slide continues hard with no plateau. Placing this car on that trajectory at 3 years gives a dealer asking price near 160萬. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: dealer retail 1,600,000 → private sale 1,420,000 (11.3% below) → dealer trade-in 1,240,000 (12.7% below private). At 52.7% of real_cost this sits just under the BMW i4 at the same age (55.4%), which is the right relative position given Audi's thinner demand. The low 21,000 km is worth a few points against these comparators and is already reflected."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Strongest evidence point in this record, and every listing was RE-FETCHED AND CONFIRMED VERBATIM by this audit on 2026-08-12 from https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/e-tron-sportback — the direct BEV predecessor. The page reads 「共找到 10 輛車」, the entire national supply, of which 8 carry prices and 2 read 電洽: 55 quattro S line asking 147.8萬 (2022年, 5萬公里), 147.8萬 (2022年, 5.8萬公里), 148.8萬 x2 (2021年, 4.14萬公里); 50 quattro S line asking 115.9萬 (2022年, 8.9萬公里) and 123.8萬 x3 (2022年, 2.7-2.8萬公里). SUM independently corroborates: https://www.sum.com.tw/carinfo-777056.php resolves to a live page titled 「AUDI e-tron Sportback 2022年 優惠價 149.8萬」, and https://www.sum.com.tw/carinfo-780646.php to 「AUDI E-TRON GT 2022年 優惠價 228.8萬」; 8891 shows the same e-tron GT generation at 218.8萬 / 5.5萬公里. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED BY THIS AUDIT from medium to low. The absolute used prices are hard and re-verified, but converting them to a level for THIS car requires a retention ratio whose denominator — the e-tron Sportback 55's original TW list price — could not be sourced by the researcher and could not be sourced by this audit either (every general search engine reachable from this environment blocked automated queries, and U-CAR has no reachable model page for the discontinued car). A ratio resting on an unverified denominator does not meet the medium bar, whatever the quality of the numerator. Working assumption unchanged: an original list in the 350-390萬 band puts dealer asking at 4-5 years near 38-42% of list; applying that to this car's real_cost and crediting our 35,000 km against those comparators' 41,000-89,000 km gives a dealer asking price near 120萬. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: dealer retail 1,200,000 → private sale 1,060,000 (11.7% below) → dealer trade-in 920,000 (13.2% below private). Year 5 is also the exact month the 5-year/100,000 km vehicle warranty expires, which the used market prices in."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from predecessor-generation ratios per the newer-than-10-years rule — no current-generation A6 e-tron will exist at 7 years until 2032. Two predecessor families were used, and the SUM anchors were re-fetched and confirmed by this audit. ICE reference for shape: SUM's Audi search lists 「AUDI A6 AVANT C8 2019年, 2000cc, 107000公里, 桃園市 冠威汽車, 159.8萬」 and an A8 at 158.9萬 (3000cc, 47,860 km); 8891 shows an A6 Sedan C8 2021 40 TFSI Technik at 82.9萬 on 124,900 km — combustion A6s hold roughly half of original list at 7 years. BEV reference for level: the e-tron Sportback data above is already only about 40% of list at 4-5 years, i.e. a German BEV runs roughly 12-15 percentage points behind its combustion equivalent at the same age, and the gap widens rather than closes. Applying the BEV-adjusted ratio to real_cost gives a dealer asking price near 83萬. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: dealer retail 830,000 → private sale 730,000 (12.0% below) → dealer trade-in 630,000 (13.7% below private). Partly cushioned: the 8-year/160,000 km battery warranty — sourced verbatim, see below — is still live at year 7, which is the only reason this is not lower."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from predecessor-generation retention ratios — no 10-year data can exist for this car. Anchors from SUM's Audi listings, all large German luxury at extreme age: A8 3.0 V6 from 2011 (15 years, 194,500 km) asking just 19.9萬; A7 Sportback 3.0 TFSI 2011 (15 years, 127,000 km) asking 33.0萬; A6 C7 2011 asking 19.8萬 (176,020 km) and 49.8萬 (132,865 km); A6 Avant C7 2014 (12 years, 213,253 km) asking 35.8萬. Big German luxury cars in Taiwan do NOT flatten out the way a Lexus does — the tail keeps falling because the used market prices in out-of-warranty repair risk. Expressed as a ratio of those cars' original list prices and applied to real_cost, then discounted further for three BEV-specific factors: the 8-year battery warranty has EXPIRED by year 10, replacement-pack risk is unquantifiable to a private buyer, and two further generations of EV will have launched by 2036. That gives a dealer asking price near 45萬. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: dealer retail 450,000 → private sale 390,000 (13.3% below) → dealer trade-in 320,000 (17.9% below private — a wider cut than earlier checkpoints, because dealers take on an out-of-warranty EV only at a price that covers battery risk, and many simply decline). Curve check after this audit's year-1 correction: private sale runs 1,880,000 → 1,420,000 → 1,060,000 → 730,000 → 390,000, period losses of 815k / 460k / 360k / 330k / 340k. Front-loaded as required, and the tail does NOT flatten — the year 7-10 loss slightly exceeds the year 5-7 loss."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Covers years 0-1. Estimated at Audi Taiwan dealer rates; not a quoted price. Fully inside the sourced 5-year/100,000 km warranty (verified verbatim in an 8891 Q4 e-tron listing title), so nothing but scheduled inspection and consumables. A BEV's first year is genuinely cheap — there is no oil service to pay for."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers years 1-3 only, not cumulative. Estimated, not quoted. Still inside the 5-year vehicle warranty. Brake fluid is hygroscopic and changes on a 2-year calendar regardless of the 21,000 km. Tyre rotation is unavailable if the spec-table staggered fitment (235/45 R20 front vs 265/40 R20 rear) is correct, so that routine saving is not credited here."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers years 3-5, not cumulative. YEARS FIELD CORRECTED BY THIS AUDIT from 3 to 5 — the researcher duplicated years 3 while this checkpoint carries assumed_km 35,000 (= 7000 * 5) and its own text describes the 3-5 window. Estimated, not quoted. Dominated by the first tyre set — roughly 75,000 for four premium staggered 20-inch tyres on a 2,175 kg car, replaced at about 5 years on AGE not wear, since 35,000 km would not otherwise finish them; treat this as an upper bound given the unresolved 19-inch/20-inch contradiction in U-CAR's own pages. The 12V battery (about 11,000 at a dealer) typically fails around year 4-6 and is a well-known BEV annoyance: it dies even though the traction battery is healthy. Still inside the 5-year vehicle warranty, so no repair-risk allowance is included in this period."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers years 5-7, not cumulative. Estimated, not quoted. This is the out-of-warranty cliff: the sourced 5-year/100,000 km vehicle warranty has expired, though the 8-year/160,000 km battery warranty still holds. Two things drive the jump. First, brake discs — at 7,000 km/year with regenerative braking the pads are barely touched, but the discs corrode in Taiwan's humidity and get replaced for rust, roughly 55,000 for discs and pads all round on 四輪碟煞 (spec table). Second, a genuine repair allowance of about 60,000, because from year 5 the owner pays for the electric coolant pump, air-conditioning compressor, DC-DC converter and control modules rather than the warranty. A German car at this age does not stay at Japanese-brand service cost."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers years 7-10, not cumulative — the largest period, and deliberately so. Estimated, not quoted. Everything is now out of warranty: the sourced 8-year/160,000 km battery warranty expires during this window, so from year 8 the owner carries traction-battery and power-electronics risk outright. Contains the second tyre set (about 85,000, again age-driven at roughly 5-6 years after the year-5 set, and again an upper bound on the 20-inch assumption), a second 12V battery, high-voltage battery coolant service, and a repair allowance near 130,000 for the items that actually fail on a 10-year-old German BEV — electric coolant pump, on-board charger and charge port, DC-DC converter, air-conditioning compressor and suspension arms. High-voltage pack REPLACEMENT is deliberately not budgeted here; it is reflected instead as the repair-risk discount that keeps the year 7-10 resale falling."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車頻道 — Audi A6 Sportback e-tron 車款介紹","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/audi/a6%20sportback%20e-tron/7244/overall","note":"PRIMARY price source, re-fetched and re-read by this audit on 2026-08-12. Header 「3 車型 280 - 480 萬」; model table 280 / 340 / 480 萬 for Sportback e-tron (後輪驅動) / performance (後輪驅動) / S6 (四輪驅動). Confirms NT$2,800,000. Documents the 2026 新年式 change (price adjustment plus active lane keeping and HUD becoming standard, 副駕螢幕 standard from launch), the 83kWh/75.8kWh entry pack as a LATER ADDITION below the original range, and 286匹 / 44.4 公斤米. Also the source of the 19-inch contradiction: 「入門車型標配了 19 吋胎圈組，S line 車型與 S 車型則是 20 吋胎圈組」. Blocked to the plain fetcher with HTTP 403; retrieved with a browser user-agent."},{"name":"U-CAR — A6 Sportback e-tron 規格表","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/audi/a6%20sportback%20e-tron/7244/spec","note":"Re-fetched by this audit. The 280萬 column: 車重 2,175 kg, 輪胎尺寸 235/45 R20, 後輪尺寸 265/40 R20, 四輪碟煞, 後置馬達 1 具 永磁同步馬達, 傳動方式 後輪驅動, 電池總容量 83kwh / 可用電池容量 75.8kwh, DC 225kW, DC 規格 CCS2, AC Mennekes (Type2), 風阻係數 0.21, 產地 德國, 經銷/代理 台灣福斯股份有限公司. The 引擎系統 section is entirely empty, confirming the 'bev' classification. Note this table contradicts the article text on wheel size."},{"name":"ETtoday 車雲 — 275萬起！台灣Audi「全新A6 e-tron預售」","url":"https://speed.ettoday.net/news/3025579","note":"Dated 2025-09-01, re-fetched and read in full by this audit. Pre-sale opened at 275萬起, 6 車型, range 275-495萬. CRITICAL for the corrected price history: it states 「標準款A6 e-tron採單馬達後輪驅動，分別輸出最大馬力326匹與381匹」, i.e. the 275萬 pre-sale entry car is NOT the 286hp / 83kWh car priced here. Also confirms 「S6 e-tron 標配主動式氣壓懸吊」 — the basis for excluding air suspension from this trim's maintenance."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Audi A6 Sportback e-tron 二手行情（零筆）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a6-sportback-e-tron","note":"Re-fetched by this audit on 2026-08-12. Returns 「共找到 1180 輛車」 — the model filter falls through to the entire all-Audi inventory, proving not one A6 e-tron of any age is listed for sale in Taiwan. This absence is the reason every value checkpoint, including year 1, is extrapolated and low confidence."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Audi e-tron Sportback 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/e-tron-sportback","note":"KEY used-market source, every listing re-verified verbatim by this audit. 「共找到 10 輛車」 nationwide, 8 priced and 2 電洽: 55 quattro S line 147.8萬 (2022, 5萬km), 147.8萬 (2022, 5.8萬km), 148.8萬 x2 (2021, 4.14萬km); 50 quattro S line 115.9萬 (2022, 8.9萬km), 123.8萬 x3 (2022, 2.7-2.8萬km). Ten cars in the whole country is itself evidence of how thin German BEV used demand is here."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Audi Q4 e-tron 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q4-e-tron","note":"Re-verified by this audit: five listings, all 2024 cars at about 2 years, 5,300-18,000 km, dealer asking 143.8 / 148.0 / 158.0 / 158.0 / 176.8 萬. The nearest-in-age German BEV comparator, used for the year-1 and year-3 checkpoints. One listing title states the warranty verbatim: 「Q4 e-tron 45/原廠新車保固5年10萬公里 電池保固8年16萬公里」 — the single sourced fact underpinning the maintenance plan."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Audi Q8 e-tron 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q8-e-tron","note":"Re-verified by this audit: two listings only. 2024款 e-tron 55Q, 2023年, 1.9萬公里, 208.0萬; 2024款 50 quattro advanced 進化版, 2024年, 7000公里, 198.8萬. Corroborates the year-3 slide and, again, the thinness of the market."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — AUDI 中古車搜尋","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?brand=AUDI&model=&caryear1=&caryear2=","note":"Re-fetched by this audit; page 1 confirms the long-tail anchors used for years 7 and 10, including 「AUDI A6 AVANT C8 2019年, 2000cc, 107000公里, 桃園市 冠威汽車, 159.8萬」 and an A8 at 158.9萬 (3000cc, 47,860 km). Remaining anchors (A8 2011 19.9萬, A7 Sportback 2011 33.0萬, A6 C7 2011 19.8-49.8萬, A6 Avant C7 2014 35.8萬) are on later pages and were taken from the researcher, not re-paged by this audit."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — 車輛明細 e-tron Sportback 2022","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carinfo-777056.php","note":"URL re-fetched by this audit and confirmed live: page title reads 「AUDI e-tron Sportback 2022年 優惠價 149.8萬 寶瑪汽車 臺中市」. Independent corroboration of the 8891 e-tron Sportback 55 level. Not an invented URL."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — 車輛明細 e-tron GT 2022","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carinfo-780646.php","note":"URL re-fetched by this audit and confirmed live: page title reads 「AUDI E-TRON GT 2022年 優惠價 228.8萬 億昇汽車 臺中市」. A second Audi BEV at 4 years; 8891 shows the same generation at 218.8萬 / 5.5萬公里. Not an invented URL."},{"name":"8891 新車 — 2026 Audi A6 Sportback e-tron 價格車款介紹","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/audi/a6-sportback-e-tron/Summary.html","note":"Re-fetched by this audit. Page title reads 「2026 Audi A6 Sportback e-tron 價格車款介紹-8891汽車」, independently confirming 2026 is the model year on sale in Taiwan. Body content is JavaScript-rendered, so no price was readable here — used for the model-year check only."}]},"audi-a6-tfsi-150kw":{"assumptions":"Checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7000/21000/35000/49000/70000), the midpoint of the 6,000-8,000 km/yr profile and roughly half the Taiwan average. At this mileage servicing is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven: Audi Taiwan's schedule is annual with a secondary kilometre trigger that 7,000 km/yr never reaches, so every checkpoint carries exactly one paid visit per year and consumables age out rather than wear out. (The scout quoted that trigger as '10,000 km within 12 months'; the exact figure could not be re-verified on Audi Taiwan's service site, but the conclusion is unaffected at any trigger from 10,000 km upward.) Tax (approx 17,410/yr = 11,230 licence + 6,180 fuel fee) and all insurance are EXCLUDED by design. IMPORTANT CORRECTION TO THE SCOUT'S LOW-MILEAGE PREMIUM CLAIM: the scout asserted that same-year 2023 A6s ask 148-150万 at 35,000-47,000 km but 188万 at 12,300 km, and used that ~20-point spread to push every checkpoint toward the top of its band. The 188万 / 12,300 km car is a 2024 40 TFSI S line, NOT a 2023 - it is a year younger and a higher trim, so that spread is age and trim, not mileage. Inside a genuinely same-year set the mileage premium is approximately zero: a 2023 40 TFSI Technik with 4,714 km asks 148.0万 while a 2023 40 TFSI Technik with 35,000 km asks 149.0万 - the lower-mileage car asks slightly LESS. Low mileage is therefore treated as protecting this car from the bottom of each observed band, not as earning a premium at the top of it. This trim is the FWD 204 PS entry car; quattro, rear-axle steering and adaptive air suspension are not fitted, so no air-spring replacement is carried in the maintenance tail (that risk belongs to the 200 kW quattro S line). The 48V MHEV plus starter-generator and its lithium pack ARE fitted and are carried as an out-of-warranty risk item from year 7.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REDUCED from the scout's 2,020,000. Anchor re-verified by direct fetch and it is genuine: Audi Approved :plus (official CPO) listing 5196 - A6 Avant TFSI 150kW, 2026年式, registered 2025/11, ~1,000 km, 前驅, Kronos Gray, warranty to 2030/11, asking NT$2,488,000 against the Avant's 298万 list = 83.5% as CERTIFIED retail. Step-down chain: CPO carries roughly a 6% premium over ordinary dealer retail, and private sale runs a further ~10-11% under dealer retail, giving ~70% of list. The scout stopped there (0.835 x 0.94 x 0.90 x 2,880,000 = 2,020,000). Two corrections pull it down. (a) The anchor is an AVANT with 1,000 km and a live factory warranty to 2030; our car is the higher-volume Sedan with 7,000 km, and the Avant is the scarcer, more sought-after body in Taiwan. (b) A year-2 bridge now exists that the scout mis-dated away: the 40 TFSI S line with 12,300 km asking 188.0万 is a 2024 car, not a 2023, so against the C8 S line's 293.5万 list it reads 64.0% dealer retail at 2 years = ~57% private. A curve running 70% (y1) -> 57% (y2) -> 48% (y3) is too steep between y1 and y2; 67.7% of list at y1 makes the sequence coherent. 0.677 x 2,880,000 = 1,950,000 (69.8% of real_cost, a 30% first-year loss - a German number, not a Toyota one). NOT used: 8891's algorithmic 保值率 model claims 89.0% at year 1, which is mileage-blind, brand-generic and contradicted by Audi's own CPO asking price; rejected, as the scout also rejected it. Dealer trade-in set 12.1% under private."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REDUCED from the scout's 1,420,000 - this is the checkpoint the scout's dating error distorted most. Predecessor-generation (C8) evidence at exactly this age, converted to a ratio then applied to real_cost. Genuine 3-year-old cars on 8891 中古車 A6 Sedan, re-read directly in this audit: 2023 40 TFSI Technik豪華版 4,714 km asking 148.0万; 2023 40 TFSI Technik豪華版 35,000 km (3.5万公里) asking 149.0万; 2023 40 TFSI 28,000 km (2.8万公里) asking 149.8万. Against C8 list prices (享馭版 269.5万, Technik豪華版 277.5万) that is a TIGHT dealer-retail band of 53-55%. The scout reported the band as 53-64% and took the 64% as 'the clean low-mileage read' - but the 64% belongs to the 12,300 km car asking 188.0万, which is a 2024 model, not a 2023. Remove that mis-dated car and the top of the band disappears. Note also that within the true 2023 set the 4,714 km car asks 148.0万 while the 35,000 km car asks 149.0万, so there is no mileage premium to harvest at this age; our 21,000 km sits mid-pack and earns no uplift. Audi's own CPO 40 TFSI Technik registered 2023/08 at 168万 = 60.5% brackets the top as CERTIFIED retail, consistent with a ~6-7% CPO premium over the 53-55% ordinary band. Taking 54% dealer retail and the standard ~11% step down to private gives 48.1%; 0.481 x 2,795,000 = 1,345,000. THESE ARE NOT DEALER ASKING PRICES COPIED ACROSS - the 148-150万 figures were reduced before use. Dealer trade-in set 13.0% under private."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Essentially unchanged in value from the scout's 1,000,000, but the supporting reasoning was wrong and is restated. Real 8891 listings, model years re-verified in this audit: 2022 40 TFSI Technik豪華版 43,400 km (4.34万公里) asking 123.8万 against 274万 list = 45.2% at FOUR years; 2022 40 TFSI Technik豪華版 124,900 km (12.49万公里) asking 82.9万 = 30.3% at FOUR years; 2021 40 TFSI Premium 97,000 km asking 85.8万 against ~269万 = 31.9% at FIVE years. The scout filed that 124,900 km car as a 2021 five-year car, so its stated '5-year band' actually contained a 4-year car. Corrected, the only genuine 5-year point is the 2021 Premium at 97,000 km / 31.9%, and the useful bracket is 45.2% (4yr, 43,400 km) to 31.9% (5yr, 97,000 km). Our car is 5 years old with 35,000 km - lower mileage than every comparator - so it interpolates to ~40% dealer retail, and ~11% down to private gives 35.4%; 0.354 x 2,795,000 = 990,000. Sense check in absolute terms: the 43,400 km 4-year car asks 123.8万 at a dealer, so a 5-year 35,000 km car asks roughly 110-115万 at a dealer and ~99万 privately, scaled to the C9's higher base. Marked low because the mileage correction, not any single listing, is doing the work, and because the 82.9万 cluster shows how wide the dispersion is at this age."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REDUCED from the scout's 800,000, because the scout's 7-year comparator is really a 6-year car. Real 8891 listings with model years re-verified: 2020 40 TDI 30,000 km asking 93.8万 against ~259万 list = 36.2%; 2020 40 TDI 87,000 km (8.7万公里) asking 89.0万 = 34.4%; 2020 40 TDI Premium 156,000 km asking 72.8万 = 28.1%. All three are 2020 cars, i.e. SIX years old in 2026. The scout dated the 87,000 km car as a 2019 and read it as '~34% at 7 years'; it is 34% at 6 years, so the whole 7-year read was anchored a year too generously. There is in fact NO genuine 7-year comparator in the current listing set, making this a one-year extrapolation beyond the data. Starting from 36.2% dealer retail at 6 years / 30,000 km and adding a year plus 19,000 km gives ~30.5% dealer retail at 7 years / 49,000 km; ~11% down to private gives 27.0%; 0.270 x 2,795,000 = 755,000. Held deliberately low rather than flattened, because Audi Taiwan's factory warranty (3 years unlimited + years 4-5 under 100,000 km) has expired by now and the Taiwanese used market discounts an out-of-warranty German car for repair risk. One genuine 個人自售 point exists - 2020 40 TDI Premium, 205,000 km, private asking 80.0万 - and is useful only as a reminder that private ASKING prices run optimistic; it was not used as a comparator. Comparators are diesel C8s, a further reason for low confidence. Dealer trade-in set 15.2% under private - dealers widen the spread on older German stock."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REDUCED SHARPLY from the scout's 515,000 - the second big correction. No 10-year data exists for this generation (C9 launched in Taiwan late 2025), so this is extrapolated from the C7.5 A6, expressed as a retention ratio and applied to this car's real_cost. Real 8891 listings as of 2026-08: 2017 35 TFSI 142,400 km (14.24万公里) asking 53.9万; 2018 35 TFSI 59,900 km (5.99万公里) asking 46.9万; 2016 35 TFSI 141,000 km asking 42.8万; 2016 35 TFSI 120,000 km asking 32.2万; 2016 35 TFSI 190,000 km asking 29.8万. Original list: A6 Sedan 35 TFSI 238万 from 2015, 248万 for 2017年式. That gives 10-year dealer RETAIL retention of 12.5-18.0% for the true 2016 cars, and 21.7% for the 9-year 2017. The scout claimed 'our 70,000 km is far below the 120,000-190,000 km typical of these survivors, so the top of that band applies: ~20%'. That reasoning inverts the data: the TOP of the band (53.9万, 21.7%) belongs to the HIGHEST-mileage car in the set (142,400 km), while the genuinely low-mileage car (2018, 59,900 km) asks only 46.9万 = 18.9% despite being two years YOUNGER. Mileage barely orders price at this age. A defensible read for a 10-year car at 70,000 km is therefore ~17% dealer retail - above the 13-18% of the 2016 survivors on mileage, but bounded above by the 8-year 59,900 km car's 18.9%. Private after the usual ~11% step down is 15.1%; 0.151 x 2,795,000 = 420,000. Absolute sense check that the scout's figure fails: at 515,000 a private seller of a 10-year C9 would be getting MORE than a dealer asks for the newer, similar-mileage 2018 C7.5 (46.9万) - internally inconsistent. At 420,000 the car sits just under that dealer ask, which is where a 2-year-older private car belongs. Dealer trade-in set 17.9% under private; at this age many dealers will only wholesale the car. Low confidence by construction: two generations removed, and the C9 carries far more electronics (48V MHEV plus, twin OLED displays) than the C7.5 1.8T, which if anything argues the real tail is worse, not better."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Audi Taiwan official service-pricing tool (A6 Avant 2019 45 TFSI quattro, 使用年份 1) for the service; consumables at normal Taiwan dealer pricing. DOWNGRADED from the scout's 'high': the tool is confirmed real but the specific per-year query was not reproduced in this audit, the proxy model is a quattro rather than this FWD car, and the consumables line is an unsourced estimate."},{"y":3,"source":"Audi Taiwan official service-pricing tool, 使用年份 2 and 3 summed (cost since the year-1 checkpoint, not cumulative). DOWNGRADED from the scout's 'high' for the same three reasons as the year-1 checkpoint: tool confirmed real, specific query not reproduced, proxy model is a quattro, and the alignment/consumables line is estimated."},{"y":5,"source":"Audi Taiwan official service-pricing tool for the two services; tyre and AGM battery pricing at Taiwan retail for this size/class. Timing of the tyre replacement is judgement, hence medium. Audited and left unchanged - age-driven tyre replacement at year 5 is the right call for a 7,000 km/yr car."},{"y":7,"source":"Audi Taiwan official service-pricing tool for the scheduled portion (years 6 and 7); repair and wear items priced at Taiwan Audi dealer parts-and-labour rates and risk-weighted, so this period is part sourced and part estimated. Audited and left unchanged - the named risk items (electric water pump, thermostat housing, coil packs, control arms) are the correct EA888 failure set for this window."},{"y":10,"source":"Audi Taiwan official service-pricing tool for the scheduled portion (years 8-10); everything else is a risk-weighted allowance at Taiwan Audi dealer rates for an out-of-warranty German luxury sedan. Genuinely uncertain - individual cars will land well either side of this - but a 10-year figure resembling a Japanese equivalent would be wrong for this car. Audited and left unchanged; the 25,000 48V allowance is the softest single number in the model and is an estimate, not an Audi figure."}],"sources":[{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - 2026 Audi A6 Sedan 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-a6-sedan-2026","note":"VERIFIED BY DIRECT FETCH IN THIS AUDIT. Primary independent list-price confirmation: TFSI 150kW = 288萬 (1984cc, 204hp@4300-6000rpm, 4門5人座, 汽油); TFSI 200kW quattro S line = 346萬, labelled Hybrid by Yahoo but reclassified gasoline here because it is the same 48V MHEV architecture."},{"name":"CARTURE 車勢文化 - 2026年式 Audi A6 TFSI 200 kW quattro S line 啟動接單","url":"https://www.carture.com.tw/news/article/39253","note":"VERIFIED BY DIRECT FETCH IN THIS AUDIT (clean canonical URL; the scout cited a percent-encoded variant of the same article). Full-range 建議售價 table: A6 Sedan TFSI 150kW 288萬, Sedan TFSI 200kW quattro S line 346萬, Avant TFSI 150kW 298萬, Avant TFSI 200kW quattro S line 356萬. Establishes the Avant's 298萬 list used as the denominator of the year-1 CPO anchor."},{"name":"Audi Approved :plus 奧迪嚴選中古車 - listing 5196, A6 Avant TFSI 150kW","url":"https://approvedplus.audi.com.tw/listing/5196/a6-avant","note":"VERIFIED BY DIRECT FETCH IN THIS AUDIT. The only genuine same-generation (C9) same-powertrain used data point: 2026年式, registered 2025/11, ~1,000 km, 前驅, Kronos Gray, Neihu Taipei showroom, warranty to 2030/11/26, official CPO asking NT$2,488,000 against 298萬 list = 83.5%. Used as the year-1 anchor after stepping CPO retail down to private-sale level. Also the independent confirmation that the 150kW is front-wheel drive."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi A6 Sedan 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a6-sedan","note":"VERIFIED BY DIRECT FETCH IN THIS AUDIT, AND THE SCOUT'S MODEL YEARS CORRECTED. The main used-value source, ~35 live listings covering C8 (2020-2024) and C7.5 (2010-2018). Mileage on this site displays in 萬公里. Points used, with years as actually listed: 2023 40 TFSI Technik 4,714km 148.0萬; 2023 40 TFSI Technik 3.5萬km 149.0萬; 2023 40 TFSI 2.8萬km 149.8萬; 2024 40 TFSI S line 1.23萬km 188.0萬 (the scout filed this as a 2023); 2022 40 TFSI Technik 4.34萬km 123.8萬; 2022 40 TFSI Technik 12.49萬km 82.9萬 (the scout filed this as a 2021); 2021 40 TFSI Premium 9.7萬km 85.8萬; 2020 40 TDI 3萬km 93.8萬; 2020 40 TDI 8.7萬km 89.0萬 (the scout filed this as a 2019); 2020 40 TDI Premium 15.6萬km 72.8萬; 2020 40 TDI Premium 20.5萬km 80.0萬 (個人自售); 2017 35 TFSI 14.24萬km 53.9萬; 2018 35 TFSI 5.99萬km 46.9萬; 2016 35 TFSI 14.1萬km 42.8萬; 2016 35 TFSI 12萬km 32.2萬; 2016 35 TFSI 19萬km 29.8萬 (the scout filed this as a 2015). Most are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking) though a few are 個人; all were reduced ~11% to private-sale level, then a further 12-18% to dealer trade-in, before entering this record."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan 官方保養費用查詢「保養透明 安心啟航」","url":"https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/","note":"VERIFIED TO EXIST AND FUNCTION BY DIRECT FETCH IN THIS AUDIT; the specific per-year query was NOT reproduced. Official scheduled-maintenance price table, queried by model / 年式 / 使用年份, returning an approximately NT$1,000-wide band (the sample response for an A1 Sportback 2020 was NT$10,500-11,500, matching the band format the scout reported). Site disclaims that figures are reference prices for 定期保養 under normal use and that pre-2017 models require contacting a dealer. The scout drove it for A6 Avant 2019年式 45 TFSI quattro (closest petrol A6 in the database; the C9 is not yet listed). Because the query could not be reproduced, all maintenance checkpoints are capped at medium confidence."},{"name":"8891 新車 - 2026 Audi A6 Sedan 車型與建議售價","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/audi/a6-sedan/Summary.html","note":"PARTIALLY VERIFIED - the page resolves and its title confirms it is the 2026 A6 Sedan price page, but the body did not render through this audit's fetcher, so the price figures could not be re-read here. The 288萬 / 346萬 they support is independently confirmed by Yahoo Autos and CARTURE above, so nothing depends on this source alone. Also the scout's source for 廠商優惠 (5年保固, 最高250萬48期0利率, 低月付5,888元起) and 汰舊換新再減5萬."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 - 新世代 Audi A6 車系高規車型 200 kW quattro S line","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/86700","note":"NOT VERIFIABLE IN THIS AUDIT - the host returned HTTP 403 to this fetcher, which is typical bot-blocking rather than evidence the article is absent. Retained because the scout reports reading it and because the figures it is cited for (288萬 entry point, January 2026 addition of the 200 kW trim) are independently confirmed by Yahoo Autos and CARTURE. Treat as corroborative only; nothing in this record rests on it."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan - 保固 (原廠保固條款)","url":"https://www.audi.com.tw/zh/Audi_Service/regular-warranty/","note":"NOT RE-FETCHED IN THIS AUDIT. Cited by the scout for the warranty structure behind the early/late maintenance split: 3 years unlimited mileage plus years 4 and 5 if under 100,000 km. This buyer is at 35,000 km by year 5, so years 1-5 are repair-free and years 6-10 carry full unsubsidised cost. The 5年保固 claim is separately corroborated by the current A6 campaign copy on 8891."},{"name":"8891 新車 - Audi A6 Sedan 用車成本解析 (保值率模型)","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/audi/a6-sedan/cost.html","note":"CONSULTED AND REJECTED for resale, recorded for transparency. The page resolves but its body did not render through this audit's fetcher. Per the scout, 8891's algorithmic 保值率 gives 89.0% / 79.2% / 70.5% / 64.9% / 59.7% / 54.9% / 50.5% for years 1-7 - mileage-blind and brand-generic, and contradicted both by Audi's own CPO asking prices and by the real C8 listings, which show 53-55% dealer retail at year 3 rather than 70.5%. Rejection upheld in this audit. Its tax figure (17,410/yr) is excluded from this table by design anyway."}]},"audi-a7-45-tfsi-quattro":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr; all checkpoints use 7,000 km/yr (7k/21k/35k/49k/70k), far below the TW average of 12,000-15,000. At this mileage every service interval is TIME-driven (Audi long-life service is 1 yr / 15,000 km, so the calendar always triggers first) and tyres age out on rubber degradation (~5-6 yrs) rather than tread wear. Tax and insurance are excluded by design: U-CAR lists this car's annual 燃料稅 6,180 + 牌照稅 11,230 (1,984cc bracket) = 17,410/yr, verified 2026-08-12 and NOT included in any figure here. LIQUIDITY WARNING that drives every confidence rating: the A7 Sportback is close to absent from the TW used market. Independently re-swept on 2026-08-12 (all 30 pages of auto.8891.com.tw/audi): 8 A7 Sportback listings with disclosed prices out of ~726 parsed Audi cars, of which only TWO are the current C8 generation with a visible price; a separate check of SUM 汽車網's full Audi inventory returned ZERO A7 mentions, and Audi Taiwan's own Approved :plus certified-used stock holds no A7. So the resale curve rests on a handful of listings and carries wide error bars in both directions - a seller may wait months for a buyer, which is itself a real cost not modelled here.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the Audi TW year-1 pattern, not from an A7 listing - no 1-year-old A7 exists on the TW market (the youngest C8 A7 found in the 2026-08-12 sweep was a 2022-registered car). Method: comparable near-new low-mileage Audis on 8891 show dealer RETAIL asks around 70% of list at 3,000-11,000 km (e.g. A4 Avant 2022 40 TFSI advanced, 11,000 km, 128.0萬 against a ~209萬 list). The A7 must sit below that: a 1-year-old competes directly against a discounted new one at 348萬, and the buyer pool for a run-out liftback is tiny. Implied dealer retail ~273萬 (73% of list); took 12% off retail for the private 自售 figure of 240萬 (8891 asks are 車商售價, never what an owner receives), then a further 14% off private for dealer trade-in. That is a 31% loss of real_cost in year one - steep, as a German luxury car should be, and nowhere near Toyota-like retention."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"PARTLY ANCHORED. C8 A7 45 TFSI listings at age 3 exist on 8891 but are listed 電洽 (price withheld), so they fix the age/mileage point without giving a number - my own 2026-08-12 sweep confirms this by returning no age-3 A7 with a disclosed price. I therefore anchored on same-age Audi siblings from the same sweep and interpolated by price class, because retention falls as list price rises: Q5 2023 40 TFSI Technik 豪華版, 44,800 km, 122.9萬 (~51% of list); A6 Sedan 2022 40 TFSI Technik, 125,500 km, 82.9萬. The A7 at 372.5萬 sits above these, giving ~53% dealer retail = ~199萬. Our car also has only 21,000 km, well under the 40,000-130,000 km on the real comparables, which supports the upper half of the range. Adjusted to private sale at 12% below dealer retail (175萬) and dealer trade-in a further 15% below private. Cross-check: a real 2022-registered (age 4) A7 45 TFSI quattro享馭版 with 130,000 km asks 149.8萬 dealer retail, and a 21,000 km age-3 car sitting ~33% above that very-high-mileage car is consistent. Years 1-3 carry the steepest loss, as expected for this segment."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"INTERPOLATED between the year-3 estimate and the year-7 real anchor, with one real A7 bracketing point re-verified in my own 2026-08-12 sweep: a 2022-registered (age 4) A7 Sportback 45 TFSI quattro享馭版 with 130,000 km asks 149.8萬 dealer retail on 8891 (新北市). That car has 3.7x our assumed mileage, so a 35,000 km car must sit clearly above it - used ~172萬 dealer retail. Private sale at 12% below retail = 151萬 (8891 figures are 車商售價, not owner proceeds); dealer trade-in a further 15% below private. Note the curve is deliberately flattish from year 3 to year 7: the thin TW A7 market is dominated by mileage rather than age, which the real listings show directly - the 47,000 km 2019 car asks MORE (155.8萬) than this 130,000 km 2022 car (149.8萬)."},{"y":7,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"STRONGEST ANCHOR IN THIS RECORD - a real, near-perfectly matched listing, independently re-verified on 2026-08-12: Audi A7 Sportback 2019款 45 TFSI quattro 2.0L, registered 2019 (age 7), 47,000 km, asking 155.8萬 DEALER RETAIL, 高雄市. Same generation, same 45 TFSI quattro drivetrain, age 7 vs our 7, 47,000 km vs our 49,000 - and at 6,714 km/yr it is almost exactly this buyer's usage profile, so it is a genuine low-mileage comparable, not a mileage-blind average. Its original list price is now DOUBLE-SOURCED at 349萬 (U-CAR's 2019-08-22 launch report AND Yahoo Autos' 2019 and 2020 A7 model pages, which both show '45 TFSI quattro 349萬 | 1984cc'), giving 44.6% dealer-retail retention. FULL ADJUSTMENT CHAIN, stated honestly: scaling 44.6% to our higher 372.5萬 list implies ~166萬 dealer retail; I then applied a -9% nameplate/negotiation markdown to ~151萬 (single dealer asks on rare cars negotiate down, and by the time our car is 7 the A7 nameplate will be several years discontinued with a replacement generation on sale); then -12% from that dealer-retail level to the private 自售 figure of 133萬; then -15% from private for dealer trade-in = 113萬. Total gap from the scaled dealer ask to private sale is therefore ~20%, of which 12 points are the standard dealer-retail-to-private adjustment and 9 points are the named nameplate risk - the two are separate and are not both 'the dealer margin'. This is the one checkpoint with a like-for-like A7 data point, hence 'medium'."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"PREDECESSOR-GENERATION EXTRAPOLATION - no 10-year-old C8 exists (the C8 launched in TW in Aug 2019, so the oldest is 7). CORRECTED: the prior version of this record applied a retention ratio against an ESTIMATED ~300萬 C7 list price which it could not verify. I verified it. Yahoo Autos' archived model pages show the C7 A7 Sportback 40 TFSI quattro - 1,984cc / 252 hp, the direct 2.0L predecessor of our 45 TFSI and precisely the car used as the age-10 comparable - listed in Taiwan at 340萬 (2017 page) and 341萬 (2018 page), NOT ~300萬. Real age-10 comparable, re-verified in my own 2026-08-12 8891 sweep: A7 Sportback 2016款 40 TFSI quattro 2.0L, registered 2016, 57,000 km, 78.8萬 dealer retail, 台南市 - the closest match on generation-role, engine and low mileage. Retention = 78.8/340 = 23.2% of list at age 10 (the old record's 26% was an artefact of the too-low denominator). Applying 23.2% to our 372.5萬 list gives ~86.3萬 dealer retail at 57,000 km. Mileage-adjusting to our 70,000 km using the two same-age C7 50 TFSI listings that differ only in mileage (70,000 km 76.8萬 vs 110,000 km 68.8萬, i.e. ~2萬 per 10,000 km) subtracts ~2.6萬, giving ~84萬 dealer retail. Private sale at 12% below that = 740,000; dealer trade-in a further 15% below private = 630,000. Note the prior record claimed 'two independent routes agree at ~96-98萬' - they were not independent, both used the same unverified 300萬. The tail keeps falling rather than flattening, which the C7 data confirms: age 13 (2013, 3.0 TFSI, 110,000 km) 45.8萬 and (2013, 2.8 FSI, 130,000 km) 29.8萬, with no Lexus-style plateau. Confidence stays 'low' because it is still a cross-generation extrapolation, but the single weakest link - the unverified predecessor list price - is now closed with a real source."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Estimated. One time-triggered annual service only; 7,000 km is nowhere near the 15,000 km trigger. Typical Audi TW dealer minor service for a 2.0 TFSI runs NT$8,000-12,000; used the top of the range for a quattro flagship-adjacent model. Not from an official price table - audi.com.tw returned 503 on every attempt."},{"y":3,"source":"Estimated. Two more calendar-triggered services (~NT$12,000 minor + ~NT$22,000 for the larger one with filters) plus a ~NT$3,500 brake fluid change on the standard 2-year cycle. Consumables barely move at 21,000 km: original tyres, pads and plugs all still in service. Assumes warranty still covers failures."},{"y":5,"source":"Estimated, and this is where the bill steps up: the warranty expires at year 3 so everything here is paid at full dealer rates. The dominant line is tyres - at 7,000 km/yr the original set still has tread at 35,000 km but the rubber is 5 years old and must be replaced on age. Sized on the CORRECT 245/45 R19 fitment (~NT$12,000-14,000 per corner), not the 20-inch set the previous version of this record assumed. Spark plugs on the EA888 fall due on the time window by year 5. Front pads go first on a heavy AWD car; discs assumed to survive to the next window."},{"y":7,"source":"Estimated. RAISED from the prior version, which put this period BELOW year 5 - a non-monotonic dip that is wrong for an out-of-warranty German car entering its 6th and 7th years. The S-tronic service (~NT$22,000) is the scheduled big-ticket item, due on the ~60,000 km / time window. Both batteries land here: the AGM starter battery typically dies at 5-7 years in Taiwan's heat, and the separate 12V lithium battery supporting the BSG mild-hybrid is an Audi-specific cost a naturally-aspirated Japanese car simply does not have. Rear pads plus discs at Audi dealer rates on a 5m, 1,815 kg car run ~NT$35,000. The added unscheduled-repair line reflects that years 5-7 on an EA888 A7 realistically produce at least one oil leak or bushing job at full dealer labour."},{"y":10,"source":"Estimated, and deliberately the largest period - a 7-10 year-old German luxury liftback out of warranty is where the real money goes, and pricing it like a RAV4's tail would be wrong. Three annual services plus a second complete tyre set (age again, not tread - the car has still done only 70,000 km in total). The water pump and plastic thermostat housing are a well-documented EA888 wear item landing squarely in this window, and coil packs typically fail as a set around this age. Suspension dampers and bushings are included because 10-year-old German chassis components perish on time in Taiwan's climate regardless of mileage, and an MMI/module line is budgeted because the electronics on this generation are a real out-of-warranty exposure. Total 10-year maintenance across all five periods is ~NT$660,000, roughly 2.5-3x a Japanese equivalent over the same period - that gap is the honest picture, not a rounding artefact."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - Audi A7 Sportback 車款介紹 (official TW lineup, price and spec)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/audi/a7%20sportback/6519/overall","note":"PRIMARY PRICE SOURCE, re-fetched and re-parsed 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200). Confirms 45 TFSI quattro享馭版 at 372.5萬 (NT$3,725,000) and 55 TFSI quattro運動版 at 414.5萬. Also the source for the 12V-not-48V finding: explicitly describes the 45 TFSI's '12V 輕型複合動力系統' with BSG, DC-DC converter and 12V 鋰電池, while assigning the 48V system to the 55 TFSI V6. Gives 1,984cc / 265hp / 7-speed S-tronic / quattro / 12.6 km/L and annual 燃料稅 6,180 + 牌照稅 11,230."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - Audi A7 Sportback 規格表 (spec table)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/audi/a7%20sportback/6519/spec","note":"Source of the TYRE-SIZE CORRECTION. Lists 輪胎尺寸 245/45 R19 and 255/40 R20 across the two trims - the R19 belongs to the 45 TFSI 享馭版, the R20 to the 55 TFSI. Also gives 車重 1,815 kg, 車長 5,021 mm, 前/後輪懸吊 獨立五連桿 (i.e. no air suspension as standard), 油箱 73 litre. Used to re-cost the two tyre replacements and to confirm air suspension is correctly excluded."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - Audi 2025 A7 Sportback 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-a7-sportback-2025","note":"Independent second confirmation of the 372.5萬 list price, re-verified 2026-08-12 by reading the trim block directly ('45 TFSI quattro享馭版 372.5 | 1984cc | 265hp'). The page also lists 55 TFSI quattro S-Line運動版 414.5萬 and RS7 Performance 785萬. Run-out evidence: the equivalent 2026 URL returns HTTP 404. Note this page mislabels the powertrain as 油電混合 - wrong for a 12V BSG mild hybrid, and not followed."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - Audi 2017 A7 Sportback 車款總覽 (C7 predecessor list prices)","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-a7-sportback-2017","note":"THE KEY CORRECTION SOURCE for the year-10 checkpoint. Shows the C7 A7 Sportback 40 TFSI quattro at 340萬 with 1984cc / 252hp - the direct 2.0L predecessor of our 45 TFSI and exactly the variant used as the age-10 used comparable. The 2018 page shows the same trim at 341萬. This replaces the prior record's UNVERIFIED ~300萬 estimate and moves age-10 retention from 26% to 23.2%. Same page also gives C7 50 TFSI quattro 394萬 and RS7 761萬."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - Audi 2019 / 2020 A7 Sportback 車款總覽 (C8 launch price)","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-a7-sportback-2019","note":"Second, independent confirmation of the 349萬 original list price behind the year-7 retention ratio: '45 TFSI quattro 349萬 | 1984cc | 245hp'. The 2020 page repeats it. Previously this figure rested on the U-CAR launch article alone; it is now double-sourced, which is what earns the year-7 checkpoint its 'medium' confidence."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 - Audi 新世代轎車產品陣線到齊 (2019-08-22 TW launch report)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/48606/","note":"Original TW list price for the year-7 retention ratio: 'Audi A7 Spotback 45 TFSI quattro 349 萬元' at the 2019-08-22 Taiwan launch, single-variant lineup. Re-fetched 2026-08-12 and the 349萬 figure read directly from the article body. Also gives contemporaneous A6 Avant 45 TFSI quattro S line 334萬 and A8 398/559萬 as sibling context."},{"name":"U-CAR - Audi A7 Sportback 車系沿革 / 事件簿 (generation history and TW event log)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/audi/a7%20sportback/6519/event","note":"Establishes the C8 A7 launched in Taiwan on 2019-08-22 with the 45 TFSI as the single variant, which fixes the oldest available C8 at exactly 7 years old today and is why the 10-year checkpoint must fall back to the C7 predecessor. Companion history page (.../6519/history) confirms gen 1 (2010) and gen 2 / Type 4K8 (revealed Oct 2017)."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi used listings (independent 30-page re-sweep)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi","note":"PRIMARY USED-MARKET SOURCE. Independently re-swept page-by-page on 2026-08-12 (all 30 pages, ~726 listings parsed) to check the prior record rather than trust it. Reproduced every A7 data point: C8 2019款 45 TFSI quattro, reg 2019, 47,000 km, 155.8萬, 高雄 (the year-7 anchor); C8 2023款 45 TFSI quattro享馭版, reg 2022, 130,000 km, 149.8萬, 新北. C7 at age 10: 40 TFSI quattro 2.0L 57,000 km 78.8萬 台南; 50 TFSI quattro 3.0L 70,000 km 76.8萬 台北; 50 TFSI quattro 3.0L 110,000 km 68.8萬 新北. Tail: 2013款 3.0 TFSI 110,000 km 45.8萬; 2013款 2.8 FSI 130,000 km 29.8萬. ALL are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking); every private_sale_price here is set 12% below them and every trade-in a further 14-15% below that."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - Audi used inventory","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/AUDI?v=4","note":"Liquidity evidence, independently re-checked 2026-08-12: fetched the full Audi inventory page and searched the rendered text - ZERO occurrences of 'A7' anywhere in the listing set. Corroborates that the A7 Sportback is effectively absent from the second-largest TW used-car portal, which is why most checkpoints here are 'low'."},{"name":"Audi Approved :plus 奧迪嚴選中古車 (official TW certified used)","url":"https://approvedplus.audi.com.tw/","note":"Liquidity evidence, reachable (HTTP 200) on 2026-08-12: Audi Taiwan's own certified-used programme holds no A7 in stock - the inventory runs to Q2, Q5 Sportback, A5 Sedan, A6 Avant, A3 Sportback, A4 Avant, RS Q3, A8 and Q5. Listing pages carry 掛牌 date, 售價, 出廠, 排氣量 and 里程, used as the near-new retention reference."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan - A7 Sportback official model page (UNREACHABLE)","url":"https://www.audi.com.tw/zh/models/a7/a7-sportback/","note":"HONESTY NOTE, re-confirmed independently on 2026-08-12: this official page returns HTTP 503 to every fetch attempt, so it could NOT be read. Cited as the canonical model page only; the list price was verified via U-CAR and Yahoo instead. The same 503 blocks Audi TW's promotions page and prevented obtaining any official service-price table or warranty terms - which is why every maintenance figure is marked low confidence."}]},"audi-a8-55-tfsi-quattro":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, far below the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year. Every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). Because mileage is so low, servicing is TIME-driven, not km-driven: the car needs an annual visit regardless, so the owner makes 10 workshop visits over 10 years but only reaches 7 km milestones (10k through 70k). Tax (牌照稅 NT$15,210 + 燃料稅 NT$7,200 per year) and insurance are excluded by design. LOW-MILEAGE PREMIUM — APPLIED ONLY WHERE IT IS NOT ALREADY IN THE COMPARABLE: at years 3, 5 and 7 the comparables carry 45,000-53,000 km against this car's 21,000-49,000 km, so a premium is warranted and stated. At year 10 it is NOT applied, because the anchor comparable is itself a 71,000 km car — essentially identical to this car's assumed 70,000 km — so a further premium would be double-counting (this was the main correction made to the researcher's record). IMPORTANT CONTEXT: Audi confirmed in March 2026 that the D5 A8 has stopped taking orders worldwide, with no successor until roughly 2030 (co-developed with the next Porsche Panamera on MSB61w). Anything bought in Taiwan today is remaining stock of a discontinued flagship, which makes the discount bigger and the residual worse than a mid-cycle car.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN from the researcher's NT$2,650,000 / NT$2,250,000 for internal consistency of the dealer-retail discount. Anchor verified directly on Audi Taiwan Approved :plus (approvedplus.audi.com.tw/listing/5201/a8): an A8 registered 2025/3 with 3,275 km asking NT$3,280,000 — a genuine ~1.4-year-old car at ultra-low mileage, and confirmed to exist. That is a CPO DEALER RETAIL ask carrying a certification+warranty premium, so it is stepped down to independent dealer retail ~NT$2,900,000. That step-down is corroborated from the other direction by the 8891 curve for this exact trim (2023 at 50,000 km asking NT$1,888,000-1,998,000, 2022 at 53,600 km asking NT$1,800,000), which extrapolates back to ~NT$2,850,000-2,900,000 independent dealer retail at one year on low mileage. PRIVATE SALE = 12% BELOW independent dealer retail = NT$2,550,000; the researcher used only 9% here while using 12% at years 3, 5 and 7 — the 12% is applied uniformly. Dealer trade-in = 14.5% below private = NT$2,180,000. Held down deliberately because at year 1 this seller competes against remaining discounted NEW clearance stock of the same discontinued car. Sanity check against real stock: the 27,371 km car on the same CPO page asks NT$2,488,000, so a two-year-old private sale is ~NT$2,190,000 — this year-1 figure sits sensibly above it."},{"y":3,"conf":"high","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"UNCHANGED — verified independently and the listings are real. Fetched auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a8 directly and confirmed four listings of the EXACT trim, all 2023 cars at 50,000-51,000 km: NT$1,998,000, NT$1,998,000, NT$1,998,000 and NT$1,888,000 — average ~NT$1,960,000 DEALER RETAIL ASKING. Our car at 21,000 km is well under half that mileage, so +10% low-mileage premium → ~NT$2,150,000 dealer retail. The premium is if anything conservative: the same page shows a 2022 at 53,600 km asking NT$1,800,000 against a 2022 at 112,000 km asking NT$1,288,000, i.e. roughly 2x mileage costs ~28% of price. Private sale set 12% below dealer retail = NT$1,890,000; dealer trade-in a further 14% below private = NT$1,620,000. The 46% retention this implies is not an error: a German flagship losing over half its money in three years is exactly what the Taiwan listings show."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"UNCHANGED — comparable verified on the 8891 page fetched directly: a 2021 A8 55 TFSI quattro at 47,000 km listed NT$1,589,000 dealer retail (also carried by SUM at 47,860 km, one owner). Its original list was NT$4,290,000 (Yahoo Autos 2021 trim page), so that is 37.0% of list at dealer retail. A higher-mileage 2021/2022 pairing on the same page shows how strongly mileage bites (2022 at 112,000 km asks only NT$1,288,000). Our car at 35,000 km sits well under the 47,000 km comparable → ~+8% → dealer retail ~NT$1,700,000, then trimmed to NT$1,650,000 because by 2031 this will be a five-year-discontinued model. Private = 12% below dealer retail = NT$1,450,000; trade-in = 14.5% below private = NT$1,240,000. Note this anchors on the comparable's absolute price rather than rescaling its retention ratio up to our higher NT$4,500,000 list, which is the conservative choice."},{"y":7,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"UNCHANGED — comparables verified on the 8891 page fetched directly. Same D5 generation but the 50 TDI variant (original list NT$3,980,000 per U-CAR 2019 launch report): 8891 shows a 2019 50 TDI with 45,000 km at NT$1,050,000 and one with 93,000 km at NT$1,088,000 — 26-27% of list at independent dealer retail. Audi's own CPO channel asks NT$1,488,000 for a 2019 50 TDI with 49,942 km, almost exactly our checkpoint mileage but carrying the CPO premium (that ~39% CPO gap on an older car is why the year-1 CPO anchor above had to be stepped down too). Taking ~28% of our NT$4,500,000 list = ~NT$1,260,000 independent dealer retail, with the low-mileage premium embedded since our 49,000 km beats the 80,000-105,000 km a typical 7-year-old A8 shows. Private = 12% below = NT$1,100,000; trade-in = 14.5% below private = NT$940,000. Cross-variant substitution (TDI→TFSI) is the weakness here; petrol 55 TFSI short-wheelbase cars of 2019 vintage barely exist in Taiwan."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED — the researcher's NT$700,000 / NT$590,000 double-counted the low-mileage premium and is revised down by ~21%. EXTRAPOLATED: no genuine 10-year data exists for the current D5 generation, which only launched in Taiwan in 2018, so per method this uses the PREDECESSOR D4 generation's retention ratio applied to this car's cost. Real D4 data verified on the 8891 page fetched directly: an A8 50 TFSI quattro at 71,000 km asks NT$580,000 and one at 112,000 km asks NT$498,000 — both are 2016 cars (the researcher recorded them as 2015; a 2016 car is in fact exactly ten years old in 2026, so the comparable is better than claimed). Against a D4 original list of NT$4,230,000 (Yahoo Autos trim page) that is 13.7% and 11.8% retention at dealer retail. THE KEY FIX: the NT$580,000 car is a 71,000 km car, essentially identical to this car's assumed 70,000 km at year 10, so its 13.7% ALREADY IS the low-mileage figure — the researcher's further +20% premium on top was double-counting. Applying 13.7-14% with no extra premium gives ~NT$625,000 dealer-retail equivalent; private = 12% below = NT$550,000; trade-in = 15% below private = NT$465,000. Cross-check: real asking prices fall from NT$1,050,000 for a 7-year-old D5 to NT$580,000 for a 10-year-old D4, a ~45% drop, and this checkpoint drops 50% from year 7 — appropriate for an orphaned flagship carrying air suspension and 48V electronics with no factory successor. Explicitly extrapolated, not observed."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Audi Taiwan official service price table, row 'Audi A8 / 55 TFSI quattro / Petrol' base service NT$13,900-14,900, fetched and confirmed verbatim from service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/api/v1.0/pricing during this check."},{"y":3,"source":"Audi Taiwan official service price table + service matrix (brake fluid and spark plugs fall at every 20,000 km), both fetched directly. At 7,000 km/year the 10,000 km milestone falls at year 1.4 and the 20,000 km milestone at year 2.9, so both land inside this window. Still inside standard factory warranty, so no repair allowance added."},{"y":5,"source":"RAISED from the researcher's NT$110,000. Scheduled items from the Audi Taiwan official service price table (verified). Tire cost from Taiwan retail pricing for 265/40R20 premium rubber (Michelin PS4S ~NT$11,500-15,000 each fitted). The added NT$35,000 out-of-warranty allowance is the correction: the researcher carried zero repair cost here on the assumption of a 5-year factory warranty, but Taiwan Audi's March 2026 warranty programme was fetched and does not list A8 among the covered models."},{"y":7,"source":"RAISED from the researcher's NT$125,000 because out-of-warranty exposure now starts around year 3 rather than year 5, and because this is the window where an ageing air-suspension flagship starts generating unscheduled bills. Scheduled items from the Audi Taiwan official service price table (verified). Brake and repair allowances sized to Taiwanese Audi dealer labour and parts rates, corroborated by owner receipts on PTT (an evaporator replacement quoted at NT$64,989 shows the parts+labour level at Audi Taiwan service centres) and the PTT owner consensus of roughly NT$50,000/year for an out-of-warranty A8."},{"y":10,"source":"RAISED from the researcher's NT$345,000. The three scheduled visits, including the NT$100,200-101,200 60,000 km transmission-oil service, come from the Audi Taiwan official price table and were confirmed verbatim from its data endpoint. The correction is the air-suspension line: the researcher budgeted two struts at NT$50,000 using independent-specialist rates only, while its own open question conceded dealer OEM could make this NT$150,000-250,000. Budgeting the cheapest possible path on this car's best-documented failure mode is not a neutral estimate, so it is re-weighted to NT$90,000. Air-suspension failure frequency is evidenced by Taiwanese specialists who document A8 front air-strut leaks as routine work (cgairtw.com, m-b-power.com). Water pump/thermostat/coil and 48V items remain risk-weighted allowances for a fully out-of-warranty EA839 V6 with 48V MHEV, not observed invoices — hence low confidence on the total."}],"sources":[{"name":"KingAutos — 新年式 Audi A8 漲12萬元 新增黑化 Black 車型","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/359178","note":"FETCHED AND VERIFIED IN THIS CHECK. Dated 2024-09-21. Taiwan Audi raised the whole A8 range by NT$120,000 for the 2024 model year: 55 TFSI quattro to NT$4,500,000, A8 L to NT$5,680,000. Names the car 'A8 55 TFSI quattro S line Black'. Confirms NT$4,500,000."},{"name":"Storm.mg — 2024年式 Audi A8 450萬 / A8 L S line Black 568萬進化登台","url":"https://www.storm.mg/lifestyle/5241335","note":"FETCHED AND VERIFIED IN THIS CHECK. Independent corroboration of NT$4,500,000 and NT$5,680,000, with S line exterior package and Audi Sport 20-inch wheels standard."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Audi A8 listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a8","note":"PRIMARY USED-CAR SOURCE — FETCHED AND VERIFIED IN THIS CHECK. Only 20 A8s listed nationwide, an extremely thin market. Confirmed: four 2023 55 TFSI quattro 享馭版 at 50,000-51,000 km asking NT$1,888,000-1,998,000; 2022 at 53,600 km NT$1,800,000; 2022 at 112,000 km NT$1,288,000; 2021 55 TFSI quattro at 47,000 km NT$1,589,000; 2019 50 TDI NT$1,050,000 (45,000 km) and NT$1,088,000 (93,000 km); D4 50 TFSI 2016 at 71,000 km NT$580,000 and 2016 at 112,000 km NT$498,000; 2014 at 170,000 km NT$398,000. NOTE: the two D4 cars the researcher dated 2015 are in fact 2016 cars. All are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking) and were discounted to private-sale and trade-in levels."},{"name":"Audi Approved :plus (Audi Taiwan CPO) — A8 55 TFSI quattro","url":"https://approvedplus.audi.com.tw/listing/5201/a8","note":"FETCHED AND VERIFIED IN THIS CHECK. Main listing: A8 55 TFSI quattro, registered 2026/5, 27,371 km, NT$2,488,000 (cross-posted on 8891 as a 2024 car — the build/registration mismatch the researcher flagged is real, so CPO registration dates should not be trusted uncritically). Sibling stock confirmed on the same page: a 2025/3 car with 3,275 km at NT$3,280,000 (the year-1 anchor) and a 2016/9 car with 186,908 km at NT$680,000."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan service pricing data endpoint","url":"https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/api/v1.0/pricing","note":"PRIMARY MAINTENANCE SOURCE — FETCHED AND VERIFIED VERBATIM IN THIS CHECK. Row 'Audi A8 / 55 TFSI quattro / Petrol' (2021): 10k NT$13,900-14,900, 20k NT$24,400-25,400, 30k NT$17,700-18,700, 40k NT$24,400-25,400, 50k NT$13,900-14,900, 60k NT$100,200-101,200, 70k NT$13,900-14,900. Seven A8 rows exist in total; the cheaper 'Audi A8 L 55 TFSI quattro Premium' (2022) row at NT$9,500-10,500 was also confirmed to exist but is a different long-wheelbase model line."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan 官方保養費用查詢 (保養透明 安心啟航)","url":"https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/","note":"Front end of the official published scheduled-service price table above."},{"name":"汽車線上 — Audi 全車系推出彈性財務專案 並享五年原廠保固","url":"https://www.auto-online.com.tw/news/82-43102?f=2025","note":"FETCHED AND VERIFIED IN THIS CHECK — AND IT CONTRADICTS THE RESEARCHER'S USE OF IT. The March 2026 Taiwan Audi programme advertises 五年原廠保固 but the model table covers A3/A5/A6/Q3/Q5/Q7/Q8 and e-tron models only; A8 IS NOT INCLUDED, and the warranty term is tied to 指定車型. The 5-year cover therefore cannot be assumed for A8, which is why an out-of-warranty allowance was added from the 3-5 year window onward. Also consistent with the A8 being off the active order book."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車 — 2015 Audi A8 50 TFSI quattro","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/audi-a8-2015-50-tfsi-quattro","note":"FETCHED AND VERIFIED IN THIS CHECK. Predecessor D4 original list NT$4,230,000 — the denominator for the 10-year retention-ratio extrapolation. The page also confirms the annual 牌照稅 NT$15,210 / 燃料稅 NT$7,200 that are excluded from this record by design."},{"name":"UDN 發燒車訊 — Audi A8 傳停止接單，四環旗艦燃油時代正式畫下句點？","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7826/9368591","note":"March 2026: Audi confirmed the D5 A8 has stopped taking orders worldwide. Anything on sale in Taiwan now is remaining stock. Drives the clearance-discount assumption and the weak residual. Carried over from the researcher; not re-fetched in this check."},{"name":"KingAutos — Audi A8 斷炊 官方建議去買CPO 後繼車款與 Porsche 合作 最快2030上市","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/367677","note":"No successor until ~2030 (MSB61w platform shared with the next Panamera); a 3-4 year product gap. Carried over from the researcher; not re-fetched in this check."},{"name":"KingAutos — Audi A8 車系介紹與規格表","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/audi/a8","note":"Spec source for the exact trim: 340 hp, 2,995 cc V6 turbo, 2,038 kg, 265/40R20, 5,190 mm. Its price column shows the stale pre-2024 NT$4,380,000 and was NOT used for pricing. Also mislabels the powertrain as 油電混合(HEV)."},{"name":"Audi Approved :plus — A8 50 TDI quattro (2019)","url":"https://approvedplus.audi.com.tw/listing/4492/a8","note":"7-year CPO comparable: registered 2019/9, 49,942 km, NT$1,488,000 — almost exactly the year-7 checkpoint mileage. Shows the ~39% CPO premium over the NT$1,050,000-1,088,000 independent-dealer asks for the same vintage on 8891. Carried over from the researcher; not re-fetched in this check."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — Audi A8","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/AUDI/A8?v=3","note":"Only ONE A8 in the entire SUM network: 2021, 47,860 km, NT$1,589,000, one owner, described as '48V輕油電'. Matches the 2021 car independently confirmed on 8891 at 47,000 km / NT$1,589,000. The year-5 anchor, and hard evidence of how thin A8 used demand is in Taiwan."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — Audi A8 中古車","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&b=5&m=41","note":"Cross-check on the used listings: 7 cars nationwide. Carried over from the researcher; not re-fetched in this check."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車 — 2021 Audi A8 55 TFSI quattro","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/audi-a8-2021-55-tfsi-quattro","note":"Original list of the 5-year comparable: NT$4,290,000. Text describes the '48V輕型複合動力系統', supporting the mild-hybrid (not full hybrid) classification. Carried over from the researcher; not re-fetched in this check."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 預售價格398萬元起，Audi A8、A8 L 預購開始","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/47673/","note":"Original list of the 7-year comparable: A8 50 TDI quattro NT$3,980,000. Carried over from the researcher; not re-fetched in this check."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車 — 2023 Audi A8 55 TFSI quattro 享馭版","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/audi-a8-2023-55-tfsi-quattro%E4%BA%AB%E9%A6%AD%E7%89%88","note":"Shows the pre-2024 list of NT$4,380,000 for the 享馭版 trim name — the baseline the NT$120,000 model-year increase was applied to. Not used for current pricing."},{"name":"8891 新車 — Audi A8 (2026)","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/audi/a8/Summary.html","note":"Confirms 8891 still carries A8 as a 2026 model line, but the page is JavaScript-rendered and exposes no price in HTML — the NT$4,500,000 was verified on KingAutos and Storm.mg instead."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — Audi 保養費用經驗 A8","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1573710255.A.2A3.html","note":"Owner discussion of real A8 running costs; consensus roughly NT$50,000/year for an out-of-warranty A8, with air suspension, 電動吸門 and 通風按摩座椅 flagged as expensive failure points. Carried over from the researcher; not re-fetched in this check."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — Audi 原廠保養維修心得分享","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1761030013.A.A69.html","note":"Owner account with an Audi Taiwan invoice — NT$64,989 for an evaporator replacement — used to calibrate parts+labour levels at Audi Taiwan service centres. Carried over from the researcher; not re-fetched in this check."},{"name":"CG 氣壓避震器維修專賣店 — Audi 氣壓避震器維修","url":"https://cgairtw.com/cgairtw-13/","note":"Taiwanese air-suspension specialist documenting Audi air-strut failures (漏氣, 幫浦故障, 氣壓彈簧疲乏) as routine work, positioning itself as the alternative to 原廠高昂維修費用. Evidence of failure FREQUENCY; it publishes no prices, so it cannot by itself justify budgeting the cheapest repair path. Carried over from the researcher; not re-fetched in this check."},{"name":"M&B Power 和陞汽車 — AUDI A8 原廠氣壓避震器維修更換","url":"https://www.m-b-power.com/products/info.php?id=263804","note":"A specific A8 case: front air struts sagging after a few days' parking, left front leaking air, right front leaking oil, both fronts replaced. Confirms this is a real, common A8 failure mode in Taiwan. Carried over from the researcher; not re-fetched in this check."},{"name":"驊慶輪胎館 — Michelin PS4S 265/40-20 含工","url":"https://shopee.tw/G-%E3%80%90%E9%A9%8A%E6%85%B6%E8%BC%AA%E8%83%8E%E9%A4%A8%E3%80%91%E7%B1%B3%E5%85%B6%E6%9E%97-PS4S-265-40-20-%E4%B8%80%E6%A2%9D11500%E5%90%AB%E5%B7%A5-%E9%99%90%E9%87%8F%E7%89%B9%E5%83%B9%E8%B3%A3%E5%AE%8C%E7%82%BA%E6%AD%A2-i.723691858.26227614160","note":"Taiwan retail price for the A8's 265/40R20 size: NT$11,500 each fitted on promotion; NT$13,000-15,000 is the normal running rate. Basis for the ~NT$56,000-59,000 per set of four. Carried over from the researcher; not re-fetched in this check."}]},"audi-q2-35-tfsi-advanced":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year; all checkpoints use the 7,000 km/year midpoint (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km). That is roughly half the Taiwan average, so servicing is TIME-driven (one annual visit) rather than mileage-driven, and the mileage milestones in Audi Taiwan's official price table arrive far later in calendar time than for an average-mileage owner — the 60,000 km major service lands around year 9 rather than year 4. Used-value estimates therefore quote low-mileage listings, which sit above the mileage-blind average for this model, and every value source string names the specific low-mileage comparables used. Annual road tax (牌照稅 NT$7,120 for the 1,498 cc band) and fuel tax (燃料稅 NT$4,800), plus all insurance, are EXCLUDED by design and appear nowhere in purchase, maintenance or selling costs. Fuel/energy cost is also out of scope. Two market facts shape this record. (1) THE 2026 PRICE RESET, now verified trim-by-trim in this pass rather than asserted. Audi Taiwan collapsed the Q2 range from five trims to two with the 2026年式 launched 2026-03-05. Verified on Yahoo Autos model pages I fetched myself: the 2024 lineup was 35 TFSI 享馭版 NT$1,560,000 / Technik 豪華版 NT$1,620,000 / Advanced 進化版 NT$1,740,000 / S-Line 運動版 NT$1,840,000 / SQ2 NT$2,450,000, and the 2022 lineup was 享馭版 NT$1,510,000 / Technik 豪華版 NT$1,570,000 / Technik 旅型特仕 NT$1,670,000 / Advanced 進化版 NT$1,690,000 / S-Line 運動版 NT$1,790,000 / SQ2 NT$2,390,000. The 2026 lineup is Advanced 進化版 NT$1,399,000 / S line 運動版 NT$1,699,000. So the entry price fell NT$161,000 (-10.3%) and the car wearing the 'advanced 進化版' badge fell NT$341,000 (-19.6%) — though the badge moved down the range, so the honest reading is that the 2026 advanced sits between the old 享馭版 and the old 進化版 on content while carrying Matrix LED and the 8.8-inch MMI as standard. IMPORTANT CORRECTION to the reviewed record, which stated the previous entry was NT$1,560,000 and implied that was the same trim: NT$1,560,000 was the 享馭版, not the 進化版. Note also that the Carture launch report does NOT itself announce a price cut; the cut is established by comparing the verified 2024 and 2026 lineups, not by any single article. This reset has ALREADY re-priced the live used Q2 market, so the Aug 2026 listings quoted below are post-cut market-cleared prices and the 2026 buyer starts from the lower base. The cut must be counted ONCE, not twice. (2) The Q2 is widely reported to be ending production in 2026 with no direct successor. I could NOT independently verify that claim in this pass (web-search budget exhausted; the Carture launch coverage I re-read makes no mention of it), so it is treated as a soft downward factor on the tail — a single-digit percentage haircut from year 5 on — rather than as an established fact. If the nameplate in fact continues, the year 5-10 values are slightly conservative.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"RAISED from NT$835,000 private / NT$725,000 trade-in after re-sourcing this row, which is what the reviewer asked for. THE ROOT CAUSE OF THE OLD 60% FIGURE — it was neither a run-out transaction price nor a 領牌車 sale, as hypothesised; it was an AGE-SLOT ERROR. The previous pass anchored year 1 on two SUM listings I re-verified again in this pass (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/AUDI/Q2?v=4): a 2024 Q2 with 8,000 km at NT$928,000 and a 2024 Q2 with 6,338 km at NT$958,000. In Aug 2026 a 2024 model-year car is roughly TWO years old, not one. Those cars were placed in the 1-year slot at their face value, which silently charged the buyer two years of depreciation in the first year and produced the 60% outlier the reviewer flagged. Both listings are still live and their prices are confirmed — the data was right, the age slot was wrong. RE-DERIVED LADDER, in absolute post-cut NT$ against the current NT$1,399,000 new price: 2 years ~NT$940,000 dealer retail (the two 2024 cars above, both genuinely low-mileage at 3,000-4,000 km/year, exactly the profile of this buyer); 4 years NT$768,000 dealer retail (2022 Q2 35 TFSI, 29,251 km, verified on https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&q=Audi%20Q2). Stepping the 2-year point back one year at a typical 11-13% year-two decline for a German compact gives ~NT$1,070,000 DEALER RETAIL asking at 1 year / 7,000 km, i.e. 76% of the NT$1,399,000 list — a normal 1-year-old dealer asking level, and it makes the ladder 76% / 67% / 55% of list at 1 / 2 / 4 years, which is smooth and monotonic where the old figure put 1 year and 2 years at the same place. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED (dealer retail is NOT what the owner gets): private sale = dealer retail minus 11% = NT$950,000; dealer trade-in = private minus 13% = NT$825,000. That is a 31.3% first-year loss against real_cost (68.7% retention) — still the weakest of the three compact Audis in this batch (A3 72%, Q3 73%), which is right for a run-out entry model whose factory price was just cut, but no longer the A8/Q6-e-tron-class collapse the reviewer objected to, and it restores the front-loaded shape: the 1-to-3 step is now 19 points, steeper than the A3's 13 and in line with the Q3's 18. CONFIDENCE stays medium and not high: there is NO 2025 model-year Q2 listed on FindCar, SUM or 8891 in Aug 2026, so no genuine 1-year-old comparable exists — this figure is a one-year step off real 2-year-old listings, not a direct observation."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Not objected to by the reviewer; re-checked in this pass and left unchanged. Anchored on low-mileage mid-age cars re-verified on FindCar (https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&q=Audi%20Q2): a 2022 Q2 35 TFSI (4 years old) with 29,251 km at DEALER RETAIL NT$768,000, against a 2022 Q2 with 83,000 km at NT$628,000 — the NT$140,000 spread between them is the low-mileage premium this buyer earns. NEW FACT from this pass: the 2022 lineup is now verified on the Yahoo Autos 2022 model page (https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-q2-2022) as 享馭版 NT$1,510,000 through Advanced 進化版 NT$1,690,000, so that 4-year-old car retains 45-51% of its own original list at dealer retail depending on trim, and 55% of the current NT$1,399,000 new price. Blending the ratio transferred onto the lower NT$1,399,000 base with the absolute market level, and stepping back one year to age 3, gives ~NT$770,000 DEALER RETAIL asking for a 3-year-old 2026 advanced at 21,000 km. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private = dealer retail minus 11% = NT$685,000; trade-in = private minus 13% = NT$595,000. Years 0-3 carry NT$697,000 of loss against real_cost, the front-loaded German pattern. The 3-year unlimited-mileage factory warranty expires exactly here, which is part of why the year 3-5 step stays large. Note this row sits at 49.6% of real_cost, BELOW both compact siblings (A3 58.9%, Q3 55.1%) — so the reviewer's impression that the Q2's later figures were 'among the strongest in the brand' holds only against the flagships and BEVs, which fall harder for their own reasons; against its actual peers the Q2 tail is the weaker one, and raising year 1 was the correct fix rather than lowering years 3-10."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Not objected to by the reviewer; re-checked in this pass and left unchanged. Anchored on a real 5-year-old low-mileage facelift car re-verified on both SUM and FindCar: 2021 Q2 35 TFSI with 23,500 km at DEALER RETAIL NT$768,000, with a 2021 Q2 with 50,000 km also at NT$768,000 as a same-age higher-mileage check (https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&q=Audi%20Q2, https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/AUDI/Q2?v=4) — the two asking the same money despite double the mileage is a reminder that asking prices on this nameplate are noisy. Those cars listed around NT$1,510,000-1,690,000 new, i.e. 45-51% of their own list at 5 years at dealer retail asking, and 55% of the current new price. Applying that to the NT$1,399,000 base gives ~NT$676,000, less a ~5% haircut for the nameplate reportedly being out of production by then, so ~NT$640,000 DEALER RETAIL asking at 5 years / 35,000 km. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private = dealer retail minus 11% = NT$570,000; trade-in = private minus 13% = NT$495,000. The comparable is ALSO out of warranty at 5 years, so no extra out-of-warranty penalty is applied on top — that would be double-counting. At 41.2% of real_cost this sits level with the Q3 (41.8%) and below the A3 (47.7%)."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Not objected to by the reviewer; re-checked in this pass and left unchanged. EXTRAPOLATED — there is no 7-year-old example of THIS specification, because the 1.5 TFSI facelift only reached Taiwan in 2021-2022. Proxy = same-nameplate, same-generation pre-facelift cars (the Q2 is a single generation, 2016-2026), expressed as a retention ratio of their own original list and then applied to this car's lower base. Aug 2026 DEALER RETAIL asking, re-verified on FindCar and SUM in this pass: 2019 Q2 with 66,048 km NT$528,000; 2019 with 89,000 km NT$508,000; 2019 with 90,000 km NT$458,000; 2019 with 121,945 km NT$388,000; 2019 with 146,516 km NT$378,000 (https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&q=Audi%20Q2, https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/AUDI/Q2?v=4). The mileage gradient across that set is the low-mileage premium made explicit. Those 2019s listed at roughly NT$1,440,000-1,590,000 new, so the best-kept 66,000 km car is at ~35% of list at 7 years. Our car has only 49,000 km — below every one of those comparables — worth roughly +8%, so ~38%, applied to NT$1,399,000 = ~NT$532,000, less ~5% for the dead nameplate = ~NT$505,000 DEALER RETAIL asking. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private = dealer retail minus 11% = NT$450,000; trade-in = private minus 13% = NT$390,000. Out of warranty and openly priced for repair risk (DQ200 dry-clutch S tronic), so the curve keeps falling rather than flattening."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Not objected to by the reviewer; re-checked in this pass and left unchanged. EXTRAPOLATED, the weakest row in this record. Proxy = the oldest same-generation Q2s on sale in Aug 2026 (2017-2018, 8-9 years old), DEALER RETAIL asking, re-verified on FindCar and SUM in this pass: 2017 with 88,541 km NT$528,000; 2017 with 101,379 km NT$588,000; 2017 with 96,000 km NT$358,000; 2017 with 100,000 km NT$398,000; 2018 with 70,000 km NT$498,000; 2018 with 140,752 km NT$398,000; 2018 with 140,804 km NT$398,000 (https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&q=Audi%20Q2, https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/AUDI/Q2?v=4). Dispersion is enormous — similar 2017 cars ask anywhere from NT$358,000 to NT$588,000 — and asking prices on old imports are padded, so I took a ~NT$450,000 median at ~8.5 years. Those cars listed at roughly NT$1,390,000-1,540,000 new, i.e. ~31% of list at 8.5 years; stepping to 10 years gives ~26%, applied to NT$1,399,000 = ~NT$364,000, plus ~10% because 70,000 km is genuinely low for a 10-year-old car, less ~8% for a decade-dead nameplate in a far more electrified 2036 Taiwan market = ~NT$368,000 DEALER RETAIL asking. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private = dealer retail minus 12% = NT$325,000; trade-in = private minus 22% (the trade-in spread widens on old cars) = NT$255,000. The year 7-to-10 step is still a 28% fall, so the tail keeps declining rather than flattening. Treat as a scenario, not a measurement."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Audi Taiwan official scheduled-maintenance price table, Q2 35 TFSI Premium (2022, the newest Q2 row in the table), km_10000 = NT$6,000-7,000 — re-fetched and re-confirmed at https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/api/v1.0/pricing in this pass. Item content confirmed against the official service matrix (https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/api/v1.0/service-matrix). Only one visit falls in this window because the annual clock, not the odometer, triggers it at 7,000 km."},{"y":3,"source":"Scheduled backbone from the official table re-verified in this pass: km_10000 NT$6,000-7,000 plus km_20000 NT$7,300-8,300 (https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/api/v1.0/pricing) ≈ NT$14,300. Added on top, and NOT in the official table: the calendar-driven brake-fluid service (~NT$2,500), alignment (~NT$2,500), filters and sundries (~NT$2,500), plus a small allowance for non-warranty consumables (~NT$2,000). Confidence is medium rather than high because roughly 40% of this figure is estimated rather than table-derived."},{"y":5,"source":"Scheduled portion from the official table re-verified in this pass: km_30000 NT$7,600-8,600 plus one time-based oil service at the NT$6,000-7,000 band (https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/api/v1.0/pricing) ≈ NT$15,500. Wear items are estimates at Taiwan market rates and are NOT in the official table: 18-inch premium tyres NT$6,500-8,500 each fitted; dealer front pads and discs NT$22,000; AGM battery NT$9,500; brake fluid NT$3,000; alignment and sundries NT$4,000; post-warranty small repairs NT$6,000. The batch norm for German cars in this window is NT$92,000-128,000 and the Audi A3 on the same platform is NT$101,000; the Q2 sits just below on smaller brakes and tyres. The step up from year 3 is driven by the tyre set, first brake overhaul and the warranty ending, not by scheduled servicing."},{"y":7,"source":"Scheduled portion from the official table re-verified in this pass: km_40000 NT$7,300-8,300 plus one routine oil service at NT$6,000-7,000 (https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/api/v1.0/pricing) ≈ NT$14,300. The car reaches only 49,000 km at year 7, so the 50,000 km milestone is NOT crossed in this window — the second visit is time-triggered and priced at the routine band. Everything else is estimated at Taiwan dealer/specialist rates and is probability-weighted, not assumed to fail. The batch norm for German cars in this window is NT$110,000-133,000; the Q2 sits below it on size. The S tronic transmission service is deliberately NOT charged here — at 7,000 km/year the official 60,000 km milestone is not reached until year 8.6, so it sits in the year-10 window."},{"y":10,"source":"Scheduled portion from the official table re-verified in this pass: at 7,000 km/year the car is at 56,000 / 63,000 / 70,000 km in years 8 / 9 / 10, so this window buys two routine services at NT$6,000-7,000 plus the 60,000 km major at NT$23,800-24,800 ≈ NT$37,300 (https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/api/v1.0/pricing and /api/v1.0/service-matrix). Note the 2022-onward Q2 rows price that 60,000 km visit at NT$23,800-24,800 against NT$17,800-20,900 on the 2018-2021 rows — the newer schedule front-loads savings and back-loads this one visit, which is exactly why it lands so heavily in this window. All non-scheduled items are estimates at Taiwan rates assuming a mix of Audi dealer and independent VAG specialist labour, with the DQ200 and water-pump provisions probability-weighted rather than assumed. Batch norm is NT$230,000-350,000; the Audi A3 on the identical platform, engine and gearbox carries NT$240,000, and the Q2 sits just below it because it legitimately drops the 48V starter-generator provision the A3 needs. A 10-year-old dry-clutch DSG is a real, priced risk in the Taiwan used market and is a large part of why this car's tail cost is well over double a comparable Japanese SUV's."}],"sources":[{"name":"Yahoo 汽車 — 2026 Audi Q2 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-q2-2026","note":"RE-VERIFIED BY ME in this pass. Shows the 2026 lineup as exactly two trims: 35 TFSI Advanced進化版 139.9萬 and 35 TFSI S-Line運動版 169.9萬, 1,498 cc, 150 hp, 5-seat 5-door. Primary confirmation of list_price."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車 — 2024 Audi Q2 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-q2-2024","note":"NEW IN THIS PASS, and the source that corrects the price-history claim. The 2024 Taiwan lineup was FIVE trims: 35 TFSI 享馭版 156萬, Technik 豪華版 162萬, Advanced 進化版 174萬, S-Line 運動版 184萬, SQ2 245萬. So the reviewed record was wrong to describe NT$1,560,000 as the previous price of THIS trim — that was the 享馭版; the 2024 進化版 was NT$1,740,000. This page is what establishes the 2026 reset (entry -10.3%, 進化版 badge -19.6%) and it is also what makes the 2024 used listings interpretable."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車 — 2022 Audi Q2 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-q2-2022","note":"NEW IN THIS PASS. The 2022 lineup: 享馭版 151萬, Technik 豪華版 157萬, Technik 旅型特仕 167萬, Advanced 進化版 169萬, S-Line 運動版 179萬, SQ2 239萬. Used to put the 2022 used comparables (the year-3 and year-5 anchors) against their real original list prices."},{"name":"Carture 車勢文化 — 2026年式 Audi Q2 上市報導","url":"https://www.carture.com.tw/news/article/39840","note":"RE-VERIFIED BY ME in this pass. Launch date 2026-03-05, two trims at NT$1,399,000 / NT$1,699,000, Matrix LED standard across the range, upgraded 8.8-inch MMI. Contains NO mention of any purchase incentive, free-maintenance programme or extended warranty — this is why every service is modelled as fully paid. It also does NOT announce a price cut or mention end of production; the reviewed record over-claimed when it cited Carture as verifying the cut. The cut is established instead by comparing this page's prices with the verified 2024 Yahoo lineup."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan 官方保養費用 API — pricing","url":"https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/api/v1.0/pricing","note":"RE-VERIFIED BY ME in this pass, with every Q2 row enumerated. Six Q2 rows exist (2018, 2019, 2020, 2021, and three 2022 rows: 35 TFSI Premium, Premium Plus, S line). The 2022 rows — the newest, and the ones this record uses — return NT$6,000-7,000 at 10,000 km, 7,300-8,300 at 20,000, 7,600-8,600 at 30,000, 7,300-8,300 at 40,000, 6,000-7,000 at 50,000, 23,800-24,800 at 60,000 and 6,000-7,000 at 70,000 km. The reviewed record's figures and its '35 TFSI Premium' label correction are both confirmed accurate. The older 2018-2021 rows are substantially dearer on routine visits and cheaper at 60,000 km; using them would be wrong for a 2026 car."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan 官方保養項目對照表 API — service matrix","url":"https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/api/v1.0/service-matrix","note":"VERIFIED. Official item-by-interval matrix: engine oil, oil filter, washers/seals and cabin dust filter every 10,000 km; brake fluid and spark plugs every 20,000 km; air filter every 30,000 km; automatic transmission oil and sealing plug at 60,000 km; V-belt and tensioner at 120,000 km. This is what makes the 60,000 km visit the expensive one."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan 官方保養費用查詢 (保養透明 安心啟航)","url":"https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/","note":"Human-readable front end for the two APIs above. The scheduled-maintenance backbone of this record comes from here, not from memory."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — Audi Q2 中古車列表","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&q=Audi%20Q2","note":"RE-VERIFIED BY ME in this pass; the listing set is unchanged from the previous pass. Listings read and used: 2022/29,251 km NT$768,000; 2021/50,000 km NT$768,000; 2022/83,000 km NT$628,000; 2019/66,048 km NT$528,000; 2019/89,000 km NT$508,000; 2019/90,000 km NT$458,000; 2018/70,000 km NT$498,000; 2017/88,541 km NT$528,000; 2017/101,379 km NT$588,000; 2018/140,752 km NT$398,000. All are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking) and every value checkpoint marks them down 11-12% to reach private sale. IMPORTANT NEGATIVE FINDING: this site lists NO 2023, 2024, 2025 or 2026 Q2 at all, which is why the year-1 row has to be stepped off SUM's 2024 cars rather than observed directly."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — AUDI Q2 中古車搜尋","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/AUDI/Q2?v=4","note":"RE-VERIFIED BY ME in this pass. Nine listings, and it holds the only near-new stock on the Taiwan market: 2024 with 6,338 km at NT$958,000 and 2024 with 8,000 km at NT$928,000 — both roughly TWO years old in Aug 2026, which is the correction at the heart of this revision. Also 2021 with 23,500 km at NT$768,000, 2019/121,945 km NT$388,000, 2019/146,516 km NT$378,000, 2017/96,000 km NT$358,000, 2017/100,000 km NT$398,000, 2018/140,804 km NT$398,000. NO 2025 model-year car is listed, so no genuine 1-year-old comparable exists anywhere. One 2024/10,000 km listing at NT$1,688,000 was discarded as either a different (SQ2 / S line) car or a 全額貸 headline price."},{"name":"8891 新車 — 2026 Audi Q2 價格車款介紹","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/audi/q2/Summary.html","note":"The URL the lineup scout used. The page exists (title '2026 Audi Q2 價格車款介紹-8891汽車') but the price table renders client-side, so no figure is readable from the HTML. The NT$1,399,000 list price was instead confirmed on Yahoo Autos and Carture above. 8891's used-car listing pages returned HTTP 404 to every URL form I tried in this pass, so no 8891 used data is used here."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車頻道 — Audi Q2","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/audi/q2/7132/overall","note":"Cited by an earlier pass for spec and tax figures. Still NOT re-verifiable — the site returns HTTP 403 to my fetch (bot blocking), so I could neither confirm nor refute it, and nothing in this record depends on it. CORRECTION to the previous pass's note, which said its 'SQ2 245萬' claim was uncorroborated: the Yahoo 2024 page I verified in this pass shows SQ2 at exactly 245萬, so that figure was right — it simply belongs to the 2024 five-trim lineup, not to the 2026 two-trim lineup. The tax figures quoted (燃料稅 NT$4,800, 牌照稅 NT$7,120) are the correct statutory amounts for the 1,498 cc band, and are excluded from this record by design."}]},"audi-q3-tfsi-110kw-advanced":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year; midpoint 7,000 km/year at every checkpoint (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km), roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. Two consequences are baked in. (1) Servicing is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven: at 7,000 km/year the car reaches the 12-month clock long before any distance trigger, so every maintenance period below is costed as a count of annual dealer visits, and tyres, brake fluid, coolant and the 12V battery are replaced on AGE rather than wear. (2) Resale is quoted against LOW-MILEAGE listings rather than the mileage-blind 行情 average — the used-car cohorts used below were read at, or interpolated down to, this buyer's actual mileage rather than the cohort's typical mileage, so the low-mileage premium is already embedded in each figure and is NOT applied a second time on top. Tax (牌照稅/燃料費), insurance and fuel are excluded by design and appear nowhere in this record. GENERATION CONTEXT: this is the all-new third-generation Q3, launched in Taiwan in May 2026 at 191萬起 (pre-sale had opened in March 2026 at 195萬起). It is roughly three months old today, so no used example of THIS generation exists at any age and the year-1 point is necessarily extrapolated. Years 3, 5 and 7 are transferred from real, retrieved listings of the direct predecessor (F3 Q3, TW 2020-2025); year 10 from the grandparent 8U generation (TW 2013-2018). CORRECTION vs the prior draft: that draft asserted no Taiwan used-car portal returned usable data and marked all five checkpoints 'low / no data retrievable'. That is not correct — auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q3 returns a filtered, per-car Audi Q3 result set (104 vehicles on 2026-08-12) with model year, mileage, trim and asking price, read across pages 1-3 and used as the primary evidence here. Years 3 and 5 are consequently upgraded to medium confidence.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — the third-generation Q3 launched in Taiwan in May 2026, so the oldest example on the road today is about three months old and no one-year-old car of this generation can exist. Derived by working BACKWARDS from real predecessor data rather than from a generic retention rule: 8891 (auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q3, read 2026-08-12) lists a 2024 Q3 35 TFSI 享馭版 at 3,020 km — essentially delivery mileage on a two-year-old car — asking 127.8萬 車商售價, plus 2024 cars at 15,000 km / 119.8萬 and 16,400 km (40 TFSI quattro S line) / 146.8萬. Against an F3 base-family list of roughly 172萬 that near-delivery two-year-old holds ~74% of list at DEALER RETAIL; unwinding one year at the segment's ~10-11%/yr puts year-one dealer retail at ~84% of list. That independently reproduces the 84-86% year-one dealer-retail retention actually OBSERVED on current-generation Q5s in the sibling record, so 84% is used. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN (this is the step that matters — every 8891 figure quoted anywhere in this record is 車商售價, dealer RETAIL asking, never what an owner receives): 84% x 191萬 = 160.4萬 dealer retail; private sale = dealer retail MINUS 12% = 141萬, rounded to 140萬; dealer trade-in (車商收購) = private MINUS 13% = 121.5萬. Cross-checked as an upper bound only against live Audi 原廠認證中古車 stock retrieved from approvedplus.audi.com.tw on 2026-08-12 (Q2 掛牌2024/11 7,679 km 108.8萬; Q5 Sportback 掛牌2025/2 13,801 km 176.8萬) — those are CPO retail asks, which sit ABOVE ordinary dealer retail because they carry a factory warranty, so they cap rather than set this figure. Low confidence: no current-generation used car exists to observe."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"UPGRADED to medium — real predecessor listings were retrievable after all. EXTRAPOLATED from the direct predecessor (F3 Q3, TW 2020-2025) using its OBSERVED 8891 車商售價 at this age, read 2026-08-12 across auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q3 pages 1-3. Three-year cohort (2023 cars): 35 TFSI @ 40,000 km = 99.8萬; 35 TFSI advanced @ 70,000 km = 90.0萬; 40 TFSI quattro S line @ 30,000 km = 133.8萬. The 133.8萬 row is deliberately NOT used as the anchor — page 3 identifies it as the top quattro S line trim, so treating it as a base-trim comparable would import a whole trim step as if it were age. Using the two 35 TFSI rows gives a mileage slope of ~0.33萬 per 1,000 km, which extended down to this buyer's 21,000 km lands at ~106萬 for the predecessor. Sanity-checked from the other direction: the 2024 (two-year) 35 TFSI cluster sits at ~120-128萬, and one further year at ~12%/yr gives ~106-113萬. Take 106萬. GENERATION SCALING: this car lists at 191萬 against roughly 172萬 for the late-life F3 base family, a factor of ~1.11, giving ~118萬 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: private sale = dealer retail MINUS 12% = 103.8萬; rounded to 105.5萬 to reflect that this buyer's 21,000 km sits at the very bottom of the observed cohort's mileage range; dealer trade-in = private MINUS 13.3% = 91.5萬. Years 1-3 are the steepest stretch for a German car in Taiwan — retention falls from ~73% to ~55% of real_cost across two years, against ~67-69% for the Lexus NX at the same age in this table. Medium rather than high: the figures are real and per-car, but they are the PREDECESSOR generation and the F3 list price used as the scaling denominator is itself unverified."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"UPGRADED to medium. EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor F3 generation's observed five-year cohort (2021 cars) on 8891, read 2026-08-12: 35 TFSI @ 20,000 km = 80.8萬; @ 60,000 km = 75.0萬; 35 TFSI 享馭版 @ 67,000 km = 71.8萬 (all 車商售價). Three cars spanning 20,000-67,000 km give a shallow but consistent slope; this buyer's 35,000 km interpolates to ~79萬 for the predecessor. Note the cohort is genuinely low-dispersion at this age, unlike the Q5's, so a cohort read is safe here. GENERATION SCALING x1.11 = ~87.7萬 dealer retail for this car. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: private sale = dealer retail MINUS 12% = 77.2萬, rounded up to 80萬 because 35,000 km is at the bottom edge of the observed mileage band and this segment does pay a visible premium for it; dealer trade-in = private MINUS 13.8% = 69萬. Year five is where any launch-campaign warranty has lapsed under every reading and the Taiwan market starts pricing repair risk into a German turbo SUV, so the curve does not flatten the way the Lexus NX does at the same age (58.4% of real_cost there against 41.8% here). The 35,000 km reading is roughly half what a typical five-year-old Q3 shows, and that premium is already embedded via the interpolation rather than added again on top. Medium: real per-car predecessor data, but cross-generation transfer with an unverified scaling denominator."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED and INTERPOLATED — the weakest of the mid-life points. No seven-year data can exist for this generation, and the predecessor F3 launched in Taiwan in 2020, so a genuine seven-year F3 cohort (2019 cars) does not appear in the 8891 result set either. The point is therefore bracketed between two observed cohorts read 2026-08-12: the F3 five-year cohort above (2021 cars, ~79萬 at 35,000 km) and the 8U eight-year cohort (2018 cars: @ 70,000 km = 52.0萬; 30 TFSI @ 66,000 km and a stated 2018 band of 45.8-51.3萬 at 54,000-83,000 km). A seven-year F3 at this buyer's 49,000 km sits above the 8U band, because the F3 is a newer and better-equipped generation than the 8U, and below the five-year cohort: ~63-66萬 for the predecessor, take 64萬. GENERATION SCALING x1.11 = ~71萬 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: private sale = dealer retail MINUS 12% = 62.5萬, rounded to 63萬; dealer trade-in = private MINUS 14.3% = 54萬, a wider cut than at earlier ages because dealers increasingly wholesale rather than retail an out-of-warranty German SUV. The German tail keeps falling here rather than levelling — 32.9% of real_cost against the Lexus NX's 45.3% at the same age — because the buyer pool for a seven-year-old Audi SUV in Taiwan thins sharply once the market prices in the failure items itemised in the maintenance plan. Low confidence: this is an interpolation ACROSS two different generations rather than an observed cohort."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the GRANDPARENT 8U generation (TW 2013-2018), the only Q3 cohort old enough to be ten years on the road today. Real 8891 車商售價 read 2026-08-12: 2017 30 TFSI @ 77,000 km = 49.8萬; 2017 @ 127,000 km = 39.8萬; 2017 @ 141,500 km = 29.9萬; 2016-2017 band stated as 32.9-41.8萬 at 80,000-140,000 km; 2015 @ 113,000 km = 39.8萬; 2015 30 TFSI @ 121,000 km = 38.8萬; 2015 @ 122,100 km = 36.8萬; 2014 @ 126,300 km = 23.9萬; 2013 2.0 TFSI quattro @ 116,000 km = 19.8萬. The 2017 pair (77,000 km / 49.8萬 versus 127,000 km / 39.8萬) gives a usable mileage slope of ~2萬 per 10,000 km at this age. This buyer's 70,000 km on a ten-year-old car is genuinely exceptional against the 110,000-140,000 km norm visible throughout this cohort, so the estimate sits at the top of the observed band: ~46萬 for the 8U. GENERATION SCALING is larger here (~x1.18) because the 8U listed around 162萬 against this car's 191萬, giving ~54萬 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: private sale = dealer retail MINUS 12% = 47.5萬; dealer trade-in = private MINUS 15.8% = 40萬, the widest cut in the record because at ten years many Taiwan dealers will only wholesale an Audi SUV rather than retail it, and some will decline the trade entirely — in which case 400,000 is optimistic. Cross-checked against the oldest real Audi price retrieved from Audi's own CPO channel (A4 Avant 掛牌2016/12, 73,355 km, 88.8萬 on approvedplus.audi.com.tw), a larger and more expensive model carrying a factory warranty, which is consistent with a mid-20s-percent private-sale retention for a well-kept ten-year-old Audi and is why this figure was not pushed lower. Retention keeps eroding from 32.9% to 24.8% between years 7 and 10 — no flattening. Low: two generations back, and at this age condition and service history dominate both age and mileage."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"One time-triggered annual service; 7,000 km is less than half the 15,000 km distance trigger, so the 12-month clock fires first. Estimated from Audi Taiwan 原廠 小保養 norms for a 1.5 TFSI (typically NT$7,000-9,000 per visit including oil, filter and shop materials), a touch under the Q5's 2.0 TFSI equivalent. Year 1 is inside warranty under any reading of the term, so no repair allowance is carried. Dealer-norm estimate; no Audi TW price table or owner receipt was obtainable (audi.com.tw 403/503, Mobile01 403)."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers the 1-3 year window: two further annual visits, the second a larger service adding air and cabin filters plus the two-year brake-fluid change — a calendar item that low mileage does not defer. Still inside warranty on the conservative three-year reading, so no failure allowance. Estimated from Audi TW dealer norms; no retrievable official table."},{"y":5,"source":"The first expensive window, and it is consumables rather than repairs. Tyres dominate: at 7,000 km/year the original set reaches only ~35,000 km with tread remaining, but rubber ages out at 5-6 years and is replaced anyway — a set of four in 235/50 R18 for a compact premium SUV in Taiwan runs NT$30,000-38,000, below the NT$36,000-48,000 a 19-inch Q5 set costs. Front pads and the AGM 12V battery typically fall due in the same window. Repairs assumed still covered on the five-year reading and largely covered on the three-year reading, so no explicit failure allowance is carried here; that is the main reason this period sits below the Q5's NT$95,000. Estimated, not quoted."},{"y":7,"source":"FIRST FULLY UNSUBSIDISED PERIOD under every reading of the warranty term, so this figure carries the true cost. Adds the scheduled big-ticket items that fall around year 6-7 (spark plugs, dual-clutch transmission oil and filter, coolant) plus rear brakes, and an explicit NT$28,000 expected-value allowance for the failure modes this EA211-family engine is known for in Taiwan: thermostat housing, electric water pump and ignition coils. That allowance is an expected value across owners, not a certainty for any one car. Sits essentially level with the Q5's NT$100,000 for the same window. Estimated from Audi TW dealer norms; Mobile01 owner-receipt threads returned HTTP 403 and could not be used."},{"y":10,"source":"The heaviest period and the one that separates a German SUV from a Japanese one at this age. Three annual services at rising rates, a second set of tyres (the year-5 set ages out again on the calendar, not on tread), front discs and pads, a second 12V battery, and two age-driven blocks: suspension dampers and bushings, and a repeat of the fluid services. The Q3-specific line is the 48V allowance — the 48V lithium battery and belt starter-generator are failure items unique to this powertrain and expensive outside warranty; NT$28,000 is an expected value, not a guaranteed bill, and it is the one figure that would drop out if the Taiwan car turns out to lack the 48V hardware. Deliberately NOT included: air suspension, which the Q3 does not offer. REBASED DOWN from the prior draft's NT$250,000, which put this smaller Audi 47% above the larger Q5's NT$170,000 for the identical window at the identical labour rate. Ten-year total NT$392,000, about 1.6x the Toyota RAV4 and 1.45x the Lexus NX in this table. All figures estimated; no Audi TW price table or owner-receipt thread was retrievable."}],"sources":[{"name":"8891 中古車 — Audi Q3 used listings (pages 1-3)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q3","note":"PRIMARY RESALE EVIDENCE, and the source the prior draft wrongly reported as unusable. Fetched 2026-08-12 across pages 1-3; returns a properly filtered Audi Q3 result set of 104 vehicles with per-car model year, mileage, trim and 車商售價. Rows used: 2024 35 TFSI 享馭版 3,020 km 127.8萬; 2024 15,000 km 119.8萬; 2024 20,000 km 132.8萬; 2024 40 TFSI quattro S line 16,400 km 146.8萬; 2023 40 TFSI S line 30,000 km 133.8萬; 2023 40,000 km 99.8萬; 2023 35 TFSI advanced 70,000 km 90.0萬; 2022 35 TFSI advanced 56,000 km 67.9萬; 2021 35 TFSI 20,000 km 80.8萬; 2021 60,000 km 75.0萬; 2021 35 TFSI 享馭版 67,000 km 71.8萬; 2018 70,000 km 52.0萬; 2017 30 TFSI 77,000 km 49.8萬; 2017 127,000 km 39.8萬; 2015 121,000 km 38.8萬; 2014 126,300 km 23.9萬; 2013 2.0 TFSI quattro 116,000 km 19.8萬. All are dealer RETAIL asking prices and were cut ~12% to private sale and a further ~13-16% to trade-in before use."},{"name":"UDN 發燒車訊 (autos.udn.com) — Audi Q3 result set","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/search?q=Audi%20Q3","note":"PRIMARY PRICE VERIFICATION. Fetched 2026-08-12; returns the launch headline '全新第三代 Audi Q3 系列正式在台上市 售價191萬元起' (May 2026) plus the March 2026 pre-sale headlines at 195萬元起, confirming NT$1,910,000 for the entry trim and establishing the launch timing. HONESTY NOTE: this is a search result set, not an individual article, so it yields headline-level pricing only. Follow-up fetches for trim-by-trim pricing and for any 保固 term returned headlines without article bodies — so, unlike the prior draft, no warranty claim is sourced to UDN here."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan 原廠認證中古車 (Audi Approved :plus) — live inventory","url":"https://approvedplus.audi.com.tw/","note":"Verified live 2026-08-12 and confirmed genuine. Real Audi Taiwan CPO listings with registration date, mileage and asking price: Q2 掛牌2024/11 7,679km 108.8萬; Q2 掛牌2024/7 18,153km 99.8萬; Q5 掛牌2025/10 2,360km 228萬; Q5 Sportback 掛牌2025/2 13,801km 176.8萬; Q5 Sportback 掛牌2024/3 24,914km 159.8萬; A4 Avant 掛牌2016/12 73,355km 88.8萬; A3 Sportback 掛牌2026/6 3,088km 122萬. No Q3 was in stock. These are CPO RETAIL asks carrying a factory warranty, i.e. ABOVE ordinary 車商售價, so they are used only as upper bounds on the year-1 and year-10 points, never as private-sale figures."},{"name":"KingAutos — Audi Q3 article index","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/tag/audi-q3","note":"Fetched 2026-08-12; returns headlines only ('大改款《Audi Q3》車系編成曝光 預計上半年上市', '大改款《Audi Q3》發表倒數') with no article bodies, so it corroborates the H1 2026 launch timing but contributes no pricing. Used solely to establish that the used market for this generation is empty at every age."},{"name":"8891 新車頻道 — 2026 Audi Q3 價格車款介紹","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/audi/q3/Summary.html","note":"Fetched 2026-08-12; fully client-rendered and returned only the page title '2026 Audi Q3 價格車款介紹-8891汽車' with no price table in the HTML. Confirms the 2026 Q3 is the current listed model but did NOT independently confirm any number. Retained for traceability only; the price is verified via UDN above."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan official site","url":"https://www.audi.com.tw/zh/","note":"UNRETRIEVABLE. Every fetch returned HTTP 403/503 this pass, as in the prior draft. No price, specification, warranty term or service price was taken from this source, and nothing in this record depends on it. Listed so the gap is visible rather than hidden — the unconfirmed 48V hardware and the unconfirmed warranty term are both consequences of it."}]},"audi-q4-e-tron-45-advanced":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, far under the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year. Every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7000/21000/35000/49000/70000). Because mileage is so low, servicing is TIME-driven (annual visits, 2-year brake-fluid interval, tires ageing out at 5-6 years) rather than mileage-driven, and consumables are replaced on calendar age, not wear. Used-value quotes are taken from LOW-MILEAGE listings, which sit above the mileage-blind average. Tax and insurance are excluded by design (TW BEVs currently pay NT$0 牌照稅 and NT$0 燃料稅 anyway, per the Yahoo autos trim page). Home-charger installation is NOT counted as maintenance and is NOT in real_cost: a 220V/32A wallbox plus conduit and 社區管委會 approval typically runs NT$40,000-80,000 in Taiwan and is a one-off ownership cost the buyer should budget separately. Electricity/charging cost is also excluded, consistent with fuel being excluded for combustion cars in this table. SECOND FACT-CHECK PASS (2026-08-12): a cross-model review flagged this record for holding value too well at 3y/5y and for a 10-year maintenance total that exceeded its own combustion siblings. Both were re-researched from scratch. The whole retention curve was re-derived downward and the maintenance schedule was rebuilt from an EV-only basis (10-year total cut from NT$576,000 to NT$353,000). List price and purchase terms were re-confirmed unchanged. See value_checkpoints sources and maintenance.plan_notes for the evidence.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN on the second fact-check pass, from NT$1,490,000 (71.3% of real_cost) to NT$1,420,000 (67.9%). Anchored on the four REAL same-trim listings on 8891 中古車 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q4-e-tron), re-fetched 2026-08-12: Q4 e-tron 45 advanced進化版, all 出廠年 2024 (~2 years old) — 1.1萬km NT$1,580,000 (台北), 1.3萬km NT$1,480,000 (台中), 1.5萬km NT$1,580,000 (台北), 1.8萬km NT$1,438,000 (台北); mean dealer asking ~NT$1,520,000. These are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking), NOT what an owner receives, and none was copied into private_sale_price. HAIRCUT WIDENED to ~23% (dealer retail -> 自售), giving ~NT$1,160,000 private at year 2, for three stacked reasons found on this pass: (a) this fetch of the rendered listing page reports ALL FIVE Q4 e-trons as 原廠認證 CPO — the first pass had read only one as CPO from the RSC payload — and a CPO car carries an inspection-plus-warranty premium of roughly 6-10% in TW that a private seller structurally cannot charge; (b) the usual 8-15% 車商售價 -> 自售 gap applies on top; (c) with 5 cars nationwide the asking prices are aspirational and sticky, demonstrated directly by the predecessor e-tron Sportback where a 5-year-old car and a 3-year-old car both ask exactly NT$1,488,000. Year 1 is set one year back from that year-2 anchor. WHY THE OLD FIGURE WAS WRONG: 71.3% first-year retention put this BEV above the Q5 TFSI and level with the Q3 — the same violation the reviewer identified at 3 years, one year earlier. A German BEV must be the weakest retainer in its own lineup at every age. Low-mileage listings quoted deliberately because this buyer covers only 7,000 km/year. dealer_tradein_price is 13% below private sale."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN on the second fact-check pass, from NT$1,130,000 (54.1% of real_cost) to NT$950,000 (45.5%), which is inside the 44-48% band the review called for and below the Q5 TFSI at the same age. Two independent lines of evidence, both re-fetched 2026-08-12. (1) FORWARD FROM THE CAR'S OWN LISTINGS: the four verified 45 advanced listings (出廠年 2024, dealer asking NT$1,438,000-1,580,000 at ~2 years, https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q4-e-tron) cut ~23% for CPO-dealer-retail -> 自售 give ~NT$1,160,000 private at year 2, then ~-18% for year 3. (2) PREDECESSOR AT A GENUINE 3 YEARS — this is the finding that forced the revision and the first pass missed it entirely: https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/e-tron-sportback now lists 出廠年 2023 cars, i.e. actually 3 years old. 55 quattro S line asks NT$1,478,000 against a 2023 list of NT$3,570,000 (https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-e-tron-sportback-2023); on an acquired-cost basis (~NT$3,480,000) with a -15% private haircut that is ~36.1% retention AT THREE YEARS. The 2023 50 quattro S line at NT$1,238,000 against a 3,180,000 list works out at ~33.9%. A three-year-old Audi BEV in Taiwan therefore trades in the mid-30s. The Q4 is deliberately placed well ABOVE that (45.5%) because the predecessor was a NT$3.1-3.6M flagship whose ~350 km real-world range is exactly why it collapsed, and because cheaper cars retain a higher percentage — but 54% was indefensible against this evidence. Today's-buyer penalty also applies: the used cars above were bought at the lower 209萬 list, so a 219萬 buyer loses more. dealer_tradein_price is 14% below private sale."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, and REVISED DOWN on the second pass from NT$780,000 (37.3% of real_cost) to NT$680,000 (32.5%), inside the 30-33% band the review called for. No real 5-year data exists for this generation (TW launch 2022, facelift May 2024), so the PREDECESSOR Audi BEV is used and expressed as a retention ratio of ITS acquired cost, then applied to this car's real_cost, as the brief directs. All predecessor listings re-fetched 2026-08-12. THE KEY CORRECTION: the first pass anchored only on the 5-year (出廠年 2021) cars and got ~36-38%, but reading the full Sportback board shows that band is an artefact, not a curve point. The 4-year 出廠年 2022 50 quattro S line asks NT$1,159,000 against a 2022 list of NT$3,100,000 (https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-e-tron-sportback-2022) = ~32.5% on an acquired-cost basis with a -15% private haircut — LOWER at four years than the 2021 cars show at five. The 2021 55 quattro S line asks NT$1,488,000, exactly the same as the 出廠年 2023 car two years newer. Asking prices in this 10-car market have simply hit a sticky floor around NT$1.15-1.49M irrespective of age, so transferring the nominal '5-year' ratio (as the first pass did) reads the floor as if it were the curve and overstates retention. The honest read of the 4-5 year band, taken from the car priced to actually move, is ~32-35%. 680,000 sits at 32.5%. The Q4 gets no percentage uplift for being the cheaper car here because that is offset by a penalty the predecessor never carried: MEB is already superseded by PPE and Audi's own Q6 e-tron is positioned above it. Other verified anchors: e-tron 55 quattro advanced 出廠年 2021, 3萬km, NT$1,258,000 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/e-tron) vs a 2021 list of NT$3,250,000 = ~34.7%. dealer_tradein_price is 15% below private. Explicitly extrapolated, not observed."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no real 7-year data exists for any Audi BEV in Taiwan (the e-tron only arrived in 2020, so the oldest is ~5-6 years). Nudged down from NT$530,000 to NT$500,000 (23.9% of real_cost) only to keep the curve continuous after the 5-year revision; the reviewer did not object to this checkpoint and its reasoning is unchanged. Combustion analogue, verified on the first pass: Audi Q5 45 TFSI quattro Active Plus, 出廠年 2019 (7 years), low 5萬km, dealer asking NT$768,000 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q5) against a 2019 list of NT$2,450,000 (https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-q5-2019); on an acquired-cost basis with a -15% private haircut that is ~29.3% retention. BEV PENALTY APPLIED ON TOP: the 5年/10萬公里 factory warranty expired at year 5 and the 8年/16萬公里 battery warranty is one year from expiry, so the Taiwanese used market prices in high-voltage repair risk on a car whose pack is the single most expensive component; the predecessor e-tron curve shows no flattening above its sticky floor; and the Q4's used market is structurally thinner than any combustion Q5's. Set at 23.9% rather than the Q5's ~29%. The implied decline from year 5 is ~14%/year, slower than the ~18%/year of years 1-3 — the correct decelerating shape before the year-8 battery-warranty cliff. dealer_tradein_price is 19% below private — the gap widens because dealers discount out-of-warranty BEVs harder and many will simply decline the car. Explicitly extrapolated, not observed."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no 10-year BEV data exists in Taiwan at all for this class. Trimmed from NT$300,000 to NT$285,000 (13.6% of real_cost) for continuity with the revised curve; the reviewer did not object to this checkpoint and its reasoning is unchanged. Anchor verified on the first pass: Audi Q5 40 TFSI quattro, 出廠年 2016 (10 years), 9.21萬km, dealer asking NT$438,000 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q5) against a 2016 list of NT$2,530,000 (https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-q5-2016) = ~16.2% retention on an acquired-cost basis with a -15% private haircut; the 2015 cars at 11 years are already down to NT$238,000-288,000. Our car has far lower mileage (70,000 km vs 92,000 km), which helps, but that is more than offset by the fact that the 8年/16萬公里 battery warranty expired at year 8: a 10-year-old out-of-warranty 82 kWh pack is the single biggest value-killer in the Taiwanese used market, because a replacement can run several hundred thousand NT dollars and buyers price that tail risk in hard. This is why the decline re-accelerates to ~17%/year across years 7-10 after decelerating through years 5-7. Set below the combustion Q5 baseline. dealer_tradein_price is 25% below private — realistically many dealers will refuse the trade or bid at scrap-adjacent levels. Explicitly extrapolated, not observed."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Modelled Audi Taiwan authorised-dealer pricing for a first-year BEV inspection. Trimmed from NT$10,000 to NT$8,000 on the second pass: a BEV first service has no oil, no filter and no plugs, so it is an inspection-and-diagnostics visit plus a cabin filter, not a workshop job. Fully inside the 5年／10萬公里 factory warranty (terms verified on 8891 listing id 4747269, https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q4-e-tron), so no repair cost is assumed. Only 7,000 km covered, so nothing is mileage-triggered — calendar-driven visit only. No published Audi TW service price table was reachable (audi.com.tw HTTP 503 on both passes), so this is an estimate."},{"y":3,"source":"Modelled: cost SINCE the year-1 checkpoint, covering years 1-3 — two annual dealer visits, one of which carries the 2-year brake-fluid change. Trimmed from NT$28,000 to NT$21,000 on the second pass, consistent with the lower per-visit BEV cost applied at year 1. Still inside the 5年／10萬公里 warranty, so no repair provision. Interval is time-driven: at 21,000 km total the car has not reached any mileage trigger. Estimate based on Audi TW dealer labour rates; no official TW price table was reachable (audi.com.tw HTTP 503)."},{"y":5,"source":"Modelled: cost since the year-3 checkpoint, covering years 3-5. Trimmed from NT$98,000 to NT$72,000 on the second pass — the tire line came down from NT$52,000 to NT$44,000 (four 235/50 R20 EV-rated tires fitted, balanced, aligned and old casings disposed of, which is a tire-shop job at competitive TW pricing, not a dealer-markup job) and the 12V AGM from NT$12,000 to NT$11,000. The step up over year 3 is consumables reaching calendar age, not mileage: at 7,000 km/year the original tires are replaced at ~5 years because the rubber has aged out with plenty of tread left, and the 12V AGM reaches typical end of life. Weight and wheel size from the Yahoo autos trim page (https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/audi-q4-e-tron-2026-45-advanced%E9%80%B2%E5%8C%96%E7%89%88). Still inside the 5年／10萬公里 warranty, so still no unscheduled repair provision. Estimate; no official Audi TW service price table was reachable. Items sum: 17,000 + 44,000 + 11,000 = 72,000."},{"y":7,"source":"Modelled: cost since the year-5 checkpoint, covering years 5-7 — the first period fully OUTSIDE the 5年／10萬公里 factory warranty (battery warranty still runs to year 8), so it carries an unsubsidised repair-risk provision for the first time. REVISED DOWN from NT$155,000 to NT$84,000 on the second pass, the single largest correction in this record. Two faults were fixed. (1) The brake line replaced front AND rear discs and pads for NT$62,000. On a regen-braking BEV at 49,000 km the friction pads have barely worn; what actually drives replacement is disc corrosion from disuse, and that realistically takes out the fronts first — a front discs-and-pads job at NT$32,000, with the rears carried into the year 7-10 window. (2) The out-of-warranty risk provision was NT$35,000, priced as though an MEB electric coolant pump, HV heater or DC-DC converter failure were close to expected inside a two-year window. Properly probability-weighted against how many of these cars fail in years 5-7, that is NT$13,000. Suspension work also drops to an inspection-plus-minor-repair figure; the full refresh belongs in the 7-10 window where it is now booked once, not twice. No air-suspension cost — this trim has steel springs. Estimate at Audi TW authorised-dealer rates; no official price table reachable. Items sum: 20,000 + 32,000 + 9,000 + 10,000 + 13,000 = 84,000."},{"y":10,"source":"Modelled: cost since the year-7 checkpoint, covering years 7-10 — three annual visits, everything out of warranty, and the 8年／16萬公里 battery warranty expires inside this window (terms verified on 8891 listing id 4747269, https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q4-e-tron). Tires reach calendar age for the second time. REVISED DOWN from NT$285,000 to NT$168,000 on the second pass. The old line assumed essentially every expensive component would need attention at once: an NT$62,000 AC-compressor/heat-pump replacement priced near certainty rather than probability-weighted (now NT$16,000), an NT$52,000 full suspension overhaul rather than the refresh a 70,000 km car actually needs (now NT$32,000), and NT$28,000 of ageing driveshaft and bearing work that overlapped with the brake job (now NT$8,000, covering the rear discs deferred from the 5-7 window). This is a 70,000 km car with no engine — it arrives at ten years mechanically young, and the honest provision reflects that while still carrying real high-voltage risk. Explicitly EXCLUDES high-voltage battery replacement — if the pack fails out of warranty the cost would dwarf this entire line, and that risk is reflected in the year-10 resale collapse instead. 10-year maintenance total NT$353,000: below the combustion Q3's figure and well below the Q5 2.0T's, which is the correct ordering for a BEV, while remaining roughly twice a comparable Japanese SUV at the same mileage. Estimate at Audi TW dealer rates; no official price table reachable. Items sum: 32,000 + 46,000 + 32,000 + 16,000 + 12,000 + 12,000 + 10,000 + 8,000 = 168,000."}],"sources":[{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2026 Audi Q4 e-tron 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-q4-e-tron-2026","note":"PRIMARY PRICE VERIFICATION, re-fetched on the second pass 2026-08-12. Renders exactly two trims: 45 Advanced進化版 219萬 (563 km, 286 hp/55.6 kgm) and 55 quattro S-Line運動版 240萬 (541 km, 340 hp). Confirms NT$2,190,000, unchanged."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Audi Q4 e-tron 在售車輛","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q4-e-tron","note":"CORE USED-VALUE SOURCE, re-fetched on the second pass 2026-08-12. All 5 Q4 e-trons on the market nationwide: 45 advanced進化版 1.1萬km NT$1,580,000 (台北), 45 advanced進化版 1.3萬km NT$1,480,000 (台中), 45 advanced進化版 1.5萬km NT$1,580,000 (台北), 45 advanced進化版 1.8萬km NT$1,438,000 (台北), 55 quattro S line運動版 0.53萬km NT$1,768,000 (新北). All 出廠年 2024. NOTE A DISCREPANCY BETWEEN PASSES: this pass reads all five as 原廠認證 CPO, where the first pass (reading the RSC payload) marked only the 1.1萬km car as CPO. Either way the stock is CPO-heavy, which is why the dealer-retail-to-private haircut was widened to ~23%. These are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking), not owner proceeds. Item 4747269 also supplies the warranty terms: 原廠新車保固5年10萬公里, 電池保固8年16萬公里."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Audi e-tron Sportback 在售車輛（前代 BEV）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/e-tron-sportback","note":"DECISIVE SOURCE FOR THE 3-YEAR AND 5-YEAR REVISIONS, re-fetched 2026-08-12. 10 cars. The first pass only used the 出廠年 2021 cars; this pass read the whole board and found genuine 3- and 4-year-old Audi BEVs. 出廠年 2023 55 quattro S line NT$1,478,000 (two cars); 出廠年 2023 50 quattro S line NT$1,238,000; 出廠年 2022 50 quattro S line NT$1,159,000 and NT$1,238,000; 出廠年 2021 55 quattro S line NT$1,488,000 (plus two 電洽). The 2021 car asking exactly the same NT$1,488,000 as a 2023 car two years newer is direct evidence that asking prices here are a sticky floor rather than a real curve — which is why the first pass's 5-year ratio was too generous. Mileage figures came back ambiguous on the 萬 unit in this fetch and were not relied on; prices were."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2023 Audi e-tron Sportback 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-e-tron-sportback-2023","note":"Fetched on the second pass 2026-08-12. Original list prices: 50 quattro S-Line運動版 318萬, 55 quattro S-Line運動版 357萬, 55 quattro S-Line Black Edition 357萬, S 408萬. The denominator for the genuine 3-YEAR predecessor retention (~34-36%) that drove the 3-year revision."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2022 Audi e-tron Sportback 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-e-tron-sportback-2022","note":"Fetched on the second pass 2026-08-12. Original list prices: 50 quattro S-Line運動版 310萬, 55 quattro S-Line運動版 349萬, S 408萬. The denominator for the 4-YEAR predecessor retention (~32.5% from the NT$1,159,000 car), which is the anchor that pulled the 5-year checkpoint down to 32.5%."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Audi e-tron 在售車輛（前代 BEV）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/e-tron","note":"PREDECESSOR DATA, re-fetched 2026-08-12. 4 cars, all 出廠年 2021 and all in 桃園: 55 quattro advanced 3萬km NT$1,258,000; 55 quattro S line 4.1萬km NT$1,488,000; two further 2021 cars listed 電洽. Supports the ~34.7% five-year figure on an acquired-cost basis."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2021 Audi e-tron 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-e-tron-2021","note":"Verified on the first pass. Original list prices for the predecessor BEV: 50 quattro S-Line NT$3,040,000, 55 quattro Advanced NT$3,250,000, 55 quattro S-Line NT$3,430,000. Denominator for the 5-year retention ratio."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2021 Audi e-tron Sportback 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-e-tron-sportback-2021","note":"Verified on the first pass. Original list prices: 50 quattro S-Line NT$3,180,000, 55 quattro S-Line NT$3,570,000."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2026 Q4 e-tron 45 Advanced進化版 車款介紹","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/audi-q4-e-tron-2026-45-advanced%E9%80%B2%E5%8C%96%E7%89%88","note":"Trim detail: NT$2,190,000, 286 hp/55.6 kgm, rear-wheel drive, 82 kWh, 563 km, 2,109 kg, CCS2 135/175 kW, 牌照稅 NT$0 / 燃料稅 NT$0. Used for powertrain classification and for the tire/weight basis in maintenance."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2025 Audi Q4 e-tron 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-q4-e-tron-2025","note":"Verified on the first pass: 45 Advanced進化版 219萬, 55 quattro S-Line運動版 240萬 — identical to 2026, proving there was no 2026 model-year price move."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2024 Audi Q4 e-tron 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-q4-e-tron-2024","note":"Verified on the first pass. Facelift launch-year list prices: 45 Advanced進化版 NT$2,090,000, 55 quattro S-Line運動版 NT$2,340,000. The original-price denominator for the 2024-built used listings, and the basis for the today's-buyer penalty noted at the 3-year checkpoint."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Audi 品牌車系行情總覽","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-12. 1,179 Audi cars listed nationwide, with Q3 and Q5 both showing deep multi-listing price ranges (Q3 NT$239,000-520,000; Q5 NT$549,000-1,229,000). The BEV models did not surface in the fetchable portion of this brand page on either pass, so the per-model counts used in this record (5 Q4 e-tron, 4 e-tron, 10 e-tron Sportback) come from the model-specific pages listed above, not from here. The contrast between 1,179 Audis overall and 5 Q4 e-trons is the evidence for thin BEV used demand."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Audi Q5 在售車輛（燃油同級對照）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q5","note":"Combustion Audi SUV tail used to shape the 7- and 10-year checkpoints, verified on the first pass. 出廠年 2019 45 TFSI quattro Active Plus, low 5萬km, NT$768,000 (7 years); 出廠年 2016 40 TFSI quattro, 9.21萬km, NT$438,000 (10 years); 2015 cars already at NT$238,000-288,000."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2019 Audi Q5 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-q5-2019","note":"Verified on the first pass. 45 TFSI quattro Active Plus original list NT$2,450,000. Gives ~29% private-sale retention at 7 years for a German combustion SUV in Taiwan — the baseline the BEV was then discounted below."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2016 Audi Q5 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-q5-2016","note":"Verified on the first pass. 40 TFSI quattro original list NT$2,530,000. Gives ~16% private-sale retention at 10 years — the baseline the BEV was then discounted below for battery risk."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan — 服務與配件（官方服務價目嘗試）","url":"https://www.audi.com.tw/tw/web/zh/service-and-accessories.html","note":"NEGATIVE RESULT, recorded for honesty. Returned HTTP 503 on both the first and the second pass, so no official Audi Taiwan service-price table or e-tron maintenance schedule could be read. Mobile01 owner threads also block automated access. Every maintenance amount in this record is therefore modelled from TW dealer labour rates and parts norms, not quoted, and every maintenance checkpoint is marked confidence 'low'."}]},"audi-q5-tfsi-150kw-advanced":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, far below the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year. All checkpoints use the 7,000 km/year midpoint, so assumed_km = 7000 x years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). Consequence 1: servicing is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven — the owner never reaches Audi's 10,000 km step inside a year, so visits are annual and the car takes about ten visits to cover 70,000 km. Consequence 2: mileage-triggered big-ticket items land LATE — the automatic transmission fluid + Sealing Plug service is tied to 60,000 km in Audi Taiwan's official service matrix, which at 7,000 km/year arrives around year 8.6, i.e. inside the 7-10 window rather than the 5-7 one. Consequence 3: tires age out rather than wear out, so they are replaced on rubber age (~5-6 years), not on tread depth. Consequence 4: used values are read off LOW-MILEAGE listings, which sell materially above the mileage-blind median — the MY2023 Q5 listing set shows a 76,000 km car asking 1,005,000 against a 14,000 km car asking 1,558,000, a spread driven by mileage alone. Vehicle licence tax (牌照稅), fuel tax (燃料費) and insurance are EXCLUDED by design and appear nowhere in this record. POWERTRAIN: this car carries Audi's 48V MHEV Plus mild-hybrid system (belt-driven starter-generator plus a small 48V lithium battery). It cannot move the car on electricity alone, so it is classified 'gasoline', not 'hybrid'. TRIM POSITION: the advanced 進化版 is the front-wheel-drive entry car — Audi Taiwan's first FWD Q5 — while quattro starts higher up the range. FWD is a resale negative in the Taiwan used German-SUV market and there is no historical FWD Q5 resale record to measure it against, so a judgement penalty of ~4-5% is applied at each checkpoint and flagged as judgement.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED UPWARD, and now built on genuine current-generation evidence the prior pass said did not exist. 8891 中古車 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q5, fetched directly this pass) carries two real B10 listings: MY2025 'TFSI quattro 150kW S line' @ 2,000 km = 2,280,000 and @ 2,360 km = 2,280,000, both 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking). Against that trim's 2,700,000 launch list that is 84.4% dealer-retail retention at roughly ten months. Those are near-delivery-mileage cars, so a genuine 1-year / 7,000 km example sits a step below — I take ~81% — and the FWD entry trim carries a further ~4% penalty for weaker used demand, giving DEALER RETAIL 1,870,000 (78% of the 2,400,000 list). ADJUSTMENT APPLIED (the dealer-retail trap): private sale = dealer retail -11% => 1,660,000; dealer trade-in = private -13% => 1,440,000. Cross-check: 1,660,000 is 69.7% of real_cost, i.e. a ~30% first-year loss, which is the German shape and sits at the steep end of the 20-30% Taiwan first-year band rather than the Toyota-like high-70s the prior pass's method would have implied for a fresh generation. Low-mileage basis: 7,000 km is far under the ~16,000 km median of comparable 1-2 year listings, which supports the upper half of the range."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED UPWARD — the prior pass claimed a low-mileage read and then did not perform it. Predecessor-generation (B9) proxy, trim-matched. 8891 中古車 (fetched this pass) lists a MY2023 '40 TFSI quattro advanced' @ 6,100 km = 1,380,000, the same car carbook.tw (https://carbook.tw/cars/audi-q5/2023, n=23, fetched this pass) shows at 6,000 km = 1,380,000. The same page shows 76,000 km => 1,005,000, 45,000 km => 1,229,000, 36,000-37,000 km => 1,238,000-1,288,000, 30,000 km => 1,230,000 and 14,000 km => 1,558,000, with a blended median of 1,229,000 at 45,000 km — and 8891 shows the mid-mileage cars are mostly the lower 'Technik' trim, which is why the trim-matched 6,100 km advanced point is the right anchor. Our buyer sits at 21,000 km, about 15,000 km above that anchor; at the ~0.4% per 1,000 km slope implied by the same listing set that is about -6%, giving a B9 advanced at 3 years / 21,000 km of ~1,300,000, i.e. 57.8% of the B9 advanced's ~2,250,000 list. Applying that ratio to this car's 2,400,000 list and taking a further ~4% off for the FWD entry trim gives DEALER RETAIL 1,330,000 (55% of list). ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale = dealer retail -11% => 1,190,000; dealer trade-in = private -13.5% => 1,030,000. Note on the correction: the prior pass wrote that it read retail 'off the low-mileage end rather than the median' and cited 14,000 km => 1,558,000, then stated a retail of 1,200,000 — which is BELOW the 1,229,000 median it was supposedly reading above. The stated method did not produce the stated number."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Predecessor-generation (B9) proxy, corrected for the same self-contradiction as year 3. carbook.tw (https://carbook.tw/cars/audi-q5, fetched this pass) gives MY2021 Q5 median dealer asking 958,000 at 67,000 km (n=13) and MY2022 1,093,000 at 72,000 km (n=22); 8891 corroborates with MY2021 45 TFSI quattro @ 48,000 km = 958,000, @ 61,600 km = 979,000, @ 62,700 km = 979,000 and @ 110,000 km = 875,000. The MY2021 sample is 45 TFSI quattro, whose list was ~2,590,000, so the median is 37.0% retention. Our buyer carries 35,000 km against that 67,000 km median; at the ~0.4% per 1,000 km slope measured on the MY2023 listing set that is a ~12% low-mileage uplift, lifting retention to ~41.4%. Applied to this car's 2,400,000 list and reduced ~4% for the FWD entry trim, DEALER RETAIL 950,000 (40% of list). ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale = dealer retail -12% => 840,000; dealer trade-in = private -14% => 720,000. Cross-check: 840,000 is 35.3% of real_cost, i.e. cumulative five-year depreciation near 65%, consistent with Taiwan guidance putting luxury brands near 60% at five years and German marques steeper. The 5-year factory warranty expires right at this point and the used market prices that in. Correction note: the prior pass said it applied '~15% low-mileage uplift then ~5% FWD penalty' to the 958,000 median — arithmetic that yields ~1,046,000 — but then stated a retail of 920,000, below the raw median."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor generation — the B10 is under a year old and has no genuine 7-year data. Method: take real B9 used prices at that age, express them as a retention ratio of that car's own original list, then apply the ratio to this car. carbook.tw MY2019 Q5 (7 years old in Aug 2026) median dealer asking 728,000 at 50,000 km (n=5); 8891 corroborates with a MY2019 45 TFSI quattro Active Plus @ 50,000 km = 768,000. Median mileage matches this buyer's 49,000 km almost exactly, so NO mileage adjustment is applied. Against that trim's ~2,590,000 original list the two points give 28.1% and 29.7% retention; I take ~28.9%. Applied to this car's 2,400,000 list and reduced ~5% for the FWD entry trim gives DEALER RETAIL 660,000 (27.5% of list). ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale = dealer retail -12% => 580,000; dealer trade-in = private -16% => 485,000 (a wider trade-in spread than the 10-15% norm, because dealers price reconditioning risk harder on an out-of-warranty German SUV). The car is two years out of warranty here and the market discounts repair risk, so the tail keeps falling rather than flattening. Small sample (n=5) at the anchor year — hence low confidence."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED across two generations — no B10 or even late-B9 data exists at this age. This is the weakest checkpoint in the record. carbook.tw MY2016 Q5 (10 years old in Aug 2026) median dealer asking 438,000 at 92,000 km (n=5), corroborated exactly by 8891's MY2016 40 TFSI quattro @ 92,100 km = 438,000; surrounding years: MY2017 median 525,000 at 120,000 km (n=19), MY2015 383,000 at 130,000 km (n=12). MY2016 is the outgoing B8, whose 2.0 TFSI quattro listed around 2,390,000, giving 18.3% retention at the sample's 92,000 km. This buyer's 70,000 km is 22,000 km under that, worth about a 9% uplift on the same slope, lifting retention to ~20.0% and giving 479,000 on this car's 2,400,000 list. I then take that back down twice: ~8% because the B10 carries materially more electronics than a B8 (48V MHEV Plus, its lithium battery, the belt starter-generator), which a 10-year-old market discounts as future repair liability rather than rewarding as content, and ~4% for the FWD entry trim. Net DEALER RETAIL 425,000 (~18% of list). ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale = dealer retail -13% => 370,000; dealer trade-in = private -18% => 305,000 (dealers barely want a 10-year-old out-of-warranty Audi except as trade fodder). The curve does not flatten into the tail: 580,000 at year 7 to 370,000 at year 10 is a further 36% over three years, which is the correct out-of-warranty German shape."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Audi Taiwan official transparent service-pricing API (https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/api/v1.0/pricing), re-verified live this pass: 2021 Q5 45 TFSI quattro 10,000 km service = NT$11,000-12,000. Uplifted ~15% for the B10 and 2026 labour rates, plus minor consumables, giving NT$15,000. Service content taken verbatim from the official /api/v1.0/service-matrix. Time-driven annual visit — 7,000 km is well short of the 10,000 km step. Fully inside the factory warranty. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from high to medium this pass: the official table is real and quoted accurately, but it has no row for this model (its Q5 rows end at MY2022), so the figure rests on a cross-generation read plus an unsourced uplift."},{"y":3,"source":"Audi Taiwan official service-pricing API, same source as year 1: annual base service ~NT$13,000 each x2, brake fluid ~NT$3,500 on its 2-year time limit (the official matrix ties brake fluid to the 20,000 km step, but at 7,000 km/year the time limit expires first), air filter ~NT$3,500, plus minor consumables. Still inside the 5-year factory warranty, so no out-of-warranty repair allowance is carried here. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from high to medium this pass, for the same reason as year 1: real official table, but no B10 row and an unsourced uplift on top."},{"y":5,"source":"Scheduled work from the Audi Taiwan official service-pricing API (annual service ~NT$13,000 x2, spark plugs ~NT$12,000 on their ~4-year time limit, brake fluid ~NT$3,500, coolant ~NT$5,000). Consumables are age-driven at this mileage and are my estimates at Taiwan dealer / premium-fitter prices: a set of four 235/55 R19 tires fitted ~NT$38,000, AGM battery ~NT$12,000. The tires go on rubber age at only 35,000 km, not on tread. The 5-year factory warranty still covers defects through this period, so no repair allowance is included — this is scheduled work and wear items only."},{"y":7,"source":"Scheduled portion from the Audi Taiwan official service-pricing API (~NT$13,500 annual service x2, brake fluid ~NT$3,500, air filter ~NT$3,500). Front pads and discs ~NT$30,000 and a risk-weighted ~NT$25,000 allowance for the first out-of-warranty failures are my estimates — the 5-year warranty expires at the start of this window, so from here the owner carries repair risk in full. Mobile01 owner threads on Audi ownership report out-of-warranty major services in the tens of thousands of NT$, consistent with this allowance, but Mobile01 returns HTTP 403 to automated fetching so no verbatim owner receipt is behind this figure. Informed estimate, not a sourced one."},{"y":10,"source":"Scheduled portion from the Audi Taiwan official service-pricing API, whose service matrix is explicit that 自動變速箱油 and Sealing Plug fall at 60,000 km (2021 Q5 45 TFSI quattro: NT$39,100-40,100 for that visit) — at 7,000 km/year that milestone lands around year 8.6, inside this window rather than the 5-7 one. Uplifted ~20% for the B10 and 2026+ labour. The remainder is a risk-weighted out-of-warranty allowance and is my own estimate: second tire set ~NT$40,000, rear brakes ~NT$25,000, AGM battery ~NT$13,000, 48V lithium battery and belt starter-generator ~NT$45,000, water pump and thermostat housing ~NT$35,000, coil packs ~NT$18,000, suspension and miscellaneous ~NT$25,000. The 48V MHEV hardware is a genuine mild-hybrid-specific liability a non-hybrid German SUV would not carry, and no Taiwan out-of-warranty replacement-cost data for it exists yet. Low confidence: this is an unwarranted forecast for a generation under a year old, not observed data."}],"sources":[{"name":"TVBS Auto — Audi 2026年式配備升級，多款車系調漲10萬 (2026-07-16)","url":"https://news.tvbs.com.tw/cars/3259163","note":"Fetched directly this pass. THE DECISIVE SOURCE for the list-price correction: '包含A5、A5 Avant、A6 Sportback e-tron、A6 Avant e-tron、Q5、Q5 Sportback等多數車型均較舊年式調漲10萬元' and 'Q5及Q5 Sportback另新增TFSI quattro 150kW進化版車型，開價分別為257萬元、268萬元'. Confirmed by re-fetch that it prints NO per-trim table naming the entry FWD car, so list_price 2,400,000 is derived (230萬 launch + 10萬 reported adjustment), not directly quoted."},{"name":"8891 新車頻道 — 新一代 Audi Q5/Q5 Sportback、SQ5 齊登台，8車型230萬起","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/audi/q5/20805","note":"Fetched directly this pass. Full 8-variant Taiwan LAUNCH table (2025-10-02): Q5 advanced 2,300,000 / Q5 Sportback advanced 2,410,000 / Q5 quattro S line 2,700,000 / Q5 Sportback quattro S line 2,810,000 / SQ5 3,829,000 / SQ5 Sportback 3,939,000 / SQ5 Edition One 3,415,000 / 3,525,000. Confirms 2.0 TFSI + 48V MHEV Plus across the range and that the entry trim is front-wheel drive. This is the MY2025 baseline the MY2026 adjustment is applied to."},{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點 — Audi Q5 豪華休旅車系登場","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/113533","note":"Fetched directly this pass. Independent second confirmation of the identical launch table and the 2025-10-02 date, and that the entry advanced 進化版 is 前驅版本, Audi Taiwan's first FWD Q5."},{"name":"KingAutos — 230萬元起，大改款 Audi Q5 同級唯一前驅 全面48V輕油電","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/365453","note":"URL confirmed live (HTTP 200) this pass but not re-fetched for content; carried from the prior pass as third confirmation of the 230萬 launch entry price, the 2025-10-02 launch, the range-wide 48V mild-hybrid system and the '同級唯一前驅' framing. Not load-bearing — the launch price is already established by two directly fetched sources above."},{"name":"ETtoday 車雲 — 新世代 Audi Q5 上市報導","url":"https://speed.ettoday.net/news/3045375","note":"URL confirmed live (HTTP 200) this pass but not re-fetched for content; carried from the prior pass as a further confirmation of 2.30 million for the SUV vs 2.41 million for the Sportback and the 2.0 TFSI 204 hp / 34.6 kgm 48V mild-hybrid powertrain. Not load-bearing."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan 官方保養透明價格查詢 — 網站與 /api/v1.0/pricing、/api/v1.0/service-matrix","url":"https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/","note":"Fetched directly this pass INCLUDING both JSON endpoints (pricing returns 175 rows). PRIMARY basis for the whole maintenance section, and independently re-verified: the 2021 Audi Q5 45 TFSI quattro row matches the quoted figures exactly (10k 11,000-12,000; 20k 19,000-20,000; 30k 13,400-14,400; 60k 39,100-40,100; 120k 56,700-57,700), and the Petrol service matrix matches the quoted content exactly (oil/oil filter/washers+seals/cabin filter every step; brake fluid and spark plugs every 20,000 km; air filter every 30,000 km; auto transmission fluid + Sealing Plug at 60,000 and 120,000 km; V-belt and tensioner at 120,000 km). IMPORTANT LIMIT found this pass: the Q5 rows run MY2017-MY2022 only — there is no B10 row — and the site states pre-2017 model years must be quoted by dealers."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Audi Q5 二手車列表","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q5","note":"Fetched directly this pass, row by row. All figures are 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking), stepped down to private sale and again to trade-in at every checkpoint. Rows used: MY2025 B10 TFSI quattro 150kW S line @ 2,000 km = 2,280,000 and @ 2,360 km = 2,280,000 (the genuine current-generation year-1 anchor the prior pass said did not exist); MY2024 40 TFSI quattro advanced @ 16,700 km = 1,648,000; MY2023 40 TFSI quattro advanced @ 6,100 km = 1,380,000, Technik @ 40,500-44,800 km = 1,229,000-1,258,000, @ 61,000 km = 1,090,000, @ 76,000 km = 1,005,000; MY2021 45 TFSI quattro @ 48,000 km = 958,000, @ 61,600 km = 979,000, @ 110,000 km = 875,000; MY2019 45 TFSI quattro Active Plus @ 50,000 km = 768,000; MY2016 40 TFSI quattro @ 92,100 km = 438,000."},{"name":"carbook.tw — Audi Q5 中古車行情（依年式中位數）","url":"https://carbook.tw/cars/audi-q5","note":"Fetched directly this pass; page data dated 2026-08-09. Median dealer asking price and median mileage by model year, used as the backbone of the depreciation curve and cross-checked against 8891 above: MY2025 2,390,000 / 2,000 km (n=3); MY2024 1,678,000 / 16,000 km (n=13); MY2023 1,229,000 / 45,000 km (n=23); MY2022 1,093,000 / 72,000 km (n=22); MY2021 958,000 / 67,000 km (n=13); MY2019 728,000 / 50,000 km (n=5); MY2018 569,000 / 110,000 km (n=8); MY2017 525,000 / 120,000 km (n=19); MY2016 438,000 / 92,000 km (n=5); MY2015 383,000 / 130,000 km (n=12). These are 車商售價, NOT what a seller receives — adjusted downward at every checkpoint."},{"name":"carbook.tw — 2023 年式 Audi Q5 個別車況列表","url":"https://carbook.tw/cars/audi-q5/2023","note":"Fetched directly this pass. The low-mileage evidence and the source of the price-vs-mileage slope used throughout (~0.4% of price per 1,000 km): on one model year, 76,000 km => 1,005,000, 60,000 km => 1,200,000, 45,000 km => 1,229,000, 36,000-37,000 km => 1,238,000-1,288,000, 30,000 km => 1,230,000, 14,000 km => 1,558,000, 6,000 km => 1,380,000. This is why low-mileage listings rather than the mileage-blind median drive a 7,000 km/year buyer's curve."},{"name":"8891 新車 — Audi 購車專案報導 (2026-05-08)","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/21771","note":"Fetched directly this pass. Confirms the Q5/Q7/Q8 SUV family is sold with 5年原廠保固 plus a 首2年月付9,999元 finance scheme and 乙式險 support, and that 5年10萬公里免費保養 is an e-tron-only benefit — so the Q5 owner pays every scheduled service from year 1. Also confirms cash buyers who decline the finance subsidy can negotiate an unpublished 隱藏版現金折扣, the basis for the discount estimate. CAVEAT found this pass: the article is dated 2026-05-08 and its campaign window closed 2026-05-31, so it evidences the recurring structure of Audi Taiwan campaigns, not a live offer."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — Audi Q5 年式售價報導 (B9 世代)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/71918","note":"NOT usable as a fetched source — re-tested this pass with a desktop browser user-agent and U-CAR returns HTTP 403 to automated fetching (the /article/71918 form 302-redirects here, so the URL is real, not invented). Carried from the prior pass's search-result excerpt only, quoting 'Q5車系入門售價落在225萬設定'. Used solely as the ~2,250,000 original-list denominator for the B9 advanced trim in the year-3 retention ratio. Flagged rather than dressed up as read."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 第二代 Audi Q5 台灣上市 (B9, 2017-07-20)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/37233","note":"NOT usable as a fetched source — HTTP 403 to automated fetching, URL confirmed real via 302 redirect. Carried from the prior pass's search-result excerpt quoting the B9's Taiwan launch on 2017-07-20 at 232萬元起 across six variants. Used only as a sanity bound on the B9 original-list anchors behind the 7-year extrapolation."},{"name":"Carboy — 台灣中古車折舊率說明","url":"https://www.carboy.tw/article/716","note":"URL confirmed live (HTTP 200) this pass but read via search-result excerpt only. Quotes Taiwan first-year depreciation of 20-30% and cumulative five-year depreciation approaching 60% for luxury brands, with German marques steeper. Used strictly as a secondary sanity check on the year-1 and year-5 checkpoints, never as a primary figure."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan 官網 — 無法取用","url":"https://www.audi.com.tw/","note":"Recorded for traceability as a NEGATIVE result. Every audi.com.tw path tested this pass returns HTTP 503 to automated fetching, including the Q5 model page and the warranty page. No official Audi Taiwan web page could be read, which is precisely why list_price for MY2026 is derived from the TVBS report rather than quoted from the manufacturer, and why the warranty term rests on the 8891 campaign article."}]},"audi-q6-e-tron-rwd":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr (~7,000 km/yr midpoint), roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/yr. Checkpoint mileage = 7,000 x years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). Three consequences shape this record. (1) EVERYTHING IS TIME-DRIVEN, NOT MILEAGE-DRIVEN. Audi Taiwan's vehicle warranty is 5 years OR 100,000 km and the high-voltage battery warranty is 8 years OR 160,000 km (>=70% capacity retained) — both confirmed by direct fetch. At 7,000 km/yr this car reaches only 35,000 km at year 5 and 70,000 km at year 10, so it never gets near either km cap: both warranties expire on the CALENDAR, and every service, brake-fluid change, coolant change and tyre replacement is triggered by age rather than wear. (2) RESALE IS QUOTED AGAINST LOW-MILEAGE LISTINGS. The used comparables used below are deliberately the lowest-mileage Q6 e-tron examples on the market (9,000 km and 14,400 km), which sit above the mileage-blind 行情 average. (3) HOME CHARGER IS EXCLUDED. A wallbox plus installation in a Taiwanese apartment building runs roughly NT$40,000-100,000 once the 社區管委會 application, the dedicated meter and the cable run are paid for. It is a real one-off ownership cost but it is NOT maintenance, so it appears in neither purchase nor maintenance here. Electricity, 牌照稅/燃料費 (both NT$0 for a BEV in Taiwan anyway) and insurance are excluded by design.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWNWARD — the prior record mis-dated its own best comparable. All three 8891 listings it cited are real and I re-fetched them (https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q6-e-tron): a 2025 後驅版 with 14,400 km asking 198.0萬, a 2025 後驅版 with 34,000 km at 電洽, and a 2024/12-built quattro S line with 8,300 km asking 236.8萬 at Audi's own 內湖認證中古車. The decisive car — a 2025 後驅版 with 9,000 km that sold at 190.8萬 through 弘達國際桃園店 — is also real and still retrievable (https://m.8891.com.tw/auto?id=4657734), and it is genuinely marked 已售出, so it reflects a price the market actually cleared rather than an asking price. THE ERROR: the prior record treated that car as '~1.3 years old', reasoning from the 2025-03-28 launch. The listing itself states '2025年出廠' but '2026/01領牌' — it was first registered in January 2026, so at this record's 2026-08-12 as-of date it is roughly SEVEN MONTHS old, not 1.3 years. Its 190.8/265 = 72.0% is therefore a ~0.6-year dealer-retail retention, not a ~1.3-year one. The prior record then applied that same ~72% to a ONE-year-old car against the HIGHER 276萬 MY2026 list, which double-counts in the optimistic direction: it assumes a 12-month-old car holds what a 7-month-old car holds. Re-anchored accordingly, dealer retail at the true year-1 point is set at ~68.5% of the 276萬 list = ~189萬. The two live asking prices (198.0萬 = 74.7% and 236.8萬 = 75.2% of their respective lists) are consistent with this: both are unsold asks and therefore sit above clearing level, and both are on cars younger than one year. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN APPLIED — these are 車商售價 (dealer retail), NOT what an owner receives: private_sale_price = 189萬 x 0.875 = 165.5萬 (a 12.5% haircut, in the middle of the stated 8-15% dealer-retail-to-private-sale band, toward the wider end because a German BEV private sale is a slow, buyer's-market transaction); dealer_tradein_price = 165.5萬 x 0.87 = 144萬, a further 13% down. Confidence medium: the underlying listings are real and one is a cleared transaction, but the year-1 point is still a short extrapolation and rests on a thin three-car market."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no genuine 3-year data exists for this car and none can exist: the Q6 e-tron only went on sale in Taiwan on 2025-03-28, so the oldest example in the country is ~1.4 years old. Built by interpolating between two anchors — the corrected year-1 dealer-retail ratio of ~68.5% of list (see the year-1 checkpoint, re-anchored after the registration-date correction) and the year-5 ratio of ~40% derived from the predecessor Audi e-tron 55 (see the year-5 checkpoint) — along the steep German year 1-3 curve rather than a straight line. Dealer retail is set at 50% of the 276萬 list = 138萬; private_sale_price = 138萬 x 0.88 = 121.5萬; dealer_tradein_price = 121.5萬 x 0.865 = 105萬. Sanity note on Audi Taiwan's 3年保證買回: the programme exists and covers e-tron models, but Audi does not publish the guaranteed residual percentage, and in any case a finance-contract buyback is a floor available only to that contract's holder — it does not set the open-market private-sale price used here, so it was deliberately NOT used as an anchor. Confidence low: this is an interpolation between one observed and one proxy anchor, not an observation."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"PREDECESSOR-GENERATION RATIO, applied as the brief prescribes, with the prior record's ratio trimmed for a denominator error I found. The current car cannot be 5 years old, so the proxy is Audi's previous BEV SUV, the e-tron 55 quattro, launched in Taiwan 2020-12-09 (325萬 for the 55 quattro advanced, 357萬 for the 55 quattro S line). I re-fetched 8891's used e-tron index (https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/e-tron) and confirmed four cars, two priced: a 2021 55 quattro advanced with 30,000 km at 125.8萬, and a 2021 55 quattro S line with 41,000 km at 148.8萬. These are ~5.5 years old and their mileage brackets our 35,000 km assumption almost exactly, so no mileage adjustment is needed. THE CORRECTION: the listing detail shows the 148.8萬 car is a SPORTBACK with air suspension, not the SUV whose 357萬 list price the prior record used as its denominator. The e-tron Sportback carried a higher list than the equivalent SUV, so that car's true retention is somewhat BELOW the 41.7% the prior record computed, pulling the observed pair down from its stated ~40% average. The prior record then applied a still-kinder 41.5% on the argument that the PPE-platform Q6 is a better product than the heavy first-generation e-tron. I have removed that bonus: with the Sportback denominator understated and the year-1 anchor having proved weaker than assumed once its true age was established, a 'holds better than the predecessor' premium is not earned by the evidence. Dealer retail set at 40.0% of the 276萬 list = 110.4萬; private_sale_price = 110.4萬 x 0.88 = 97.2萬, rounded to 97萬; dealer_tradein_price = 97萬 x 0.86 = 83.5萬. Note this is the last checkpoint inside the 5-year vehicle warranty, which is why the tail beyond it steepens. Confidence low: explicitly a predecessor-generation extrapolation resting on two listings, one of which needed a body-style caveat."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no data exists and no proxy is available either: the predecessor e-tron only reaches 7 years old in 2028, so there is nothing in the Taiwanese market to measure. Projected forward from the corrected year-5 predecessor-derived ratio (40% of list at dealer retail) along the German-BEV tail, which does NOT flatten the way a Lexus does. Two specific forces are priced in. First, the 5-year/100,000 km vehicle warranty has expired on the calendar (35,000 km at year 5 is nowhere near the km cap), so from here the used market is buying uncovered repair risk on an Audi. Second, the 8-year high-voltage battery warranty is within a year of expiry at this checkpoint, and Taiwanese used-BEV buyers discount hard for that — a replacement pack for an 83 kWh PPE car costs a large fraction of the whole car's value. Dealer retail set at 27.5% of the 276萬 list = 75.9萬; private_sale_price = 75.9萬 x 0.87 = 66萬; dealer_tradein_price = 66萬 x 0.85 = 56萬 — the private-to-trade-in gap widens here because dealers take on real risk stocking an out-of-warranty German BEV. Confidence low, and honestly so: this is a modelled point, not a sourced one."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — the weakest-supported point in the record. No 10-year data exists for this car or for any Audi BEV in Taiwan (the e-tron 55 only arrived in December 2020, so the oldest Audi BEV in the country is ~5.5 years old). Projected from the year-7 point along a tail that keeps falling for three compounding reasons specific to a German BEV in Taiwan: the 8-year battery warranty is two years expired, so a buyer is fully exposed to a pack cost that by then exceeds the car's value; used demand is genuinely thin, since the pool of buyers willing to take a decade-old high-voltage German SUV without dealer backing is small; and by 2036 this generation will be two product cycles obsolete on charging speed and software, in a segment where those are the selling points. Dealer retail set at 15.5% of the 276萬 list = 42.8萬; private_sale_price = 42.8萬 x 0.86 = 37萬; dealer_tradein_price = 37萬 x 0.82 = 30.5萬 — the widest gap of any checkpoint, because at this age most dealers would rather not stock the car at all and will only bid a wholesale/trade number. CALIBRATION CLAIM CORRECTED: the prior record asserted this was 'the weakest 10-year retention of any BEV in this comparison set'. It was not, and is not now — the Mercedes EQE300 SUV in the same table retains ~12.5% of real cost at year 10 versus ~13.9% here. The Q6 e-tron is among the weakest German BEVs in the set, which is the defensible claim, but it is not the single weakest. Confidence low. Being explicitly extrapolated is the point; this is not presented as observed."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"UNCHANGED — reviewed and found correct. Audi Taiwan gives no free scheduled maintenance, so year 1 is paid by the owner. Costed from Audi TW dealer service levels: the published 菁英保養 interval runs ~NT$6,500 on a small A3 and Audi's own 保養透明 portal (https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/) quotes NT$10,500-11,500 for a scheduled A1 Sportback service. Both are ICE services including oil; stripping oil and filter from an equivalent Audi-rate visit while keeping the same labour and inspection scope lands a first-year BEV inspection at ~6,000 on a larger car. Everything else in this window is warranty work at zero cost. Consistent with the German BEV peers in this table at year 1 (BMW iX3 5,000; BMW i4 6,000; Mercedes EQE300 SUV 6,000)."},{"y":3,"source":"UNCHANGED — reviewed and found correct. Two annual dealer visits at Audi TW rates (~6,500 each including cabin filter, calibrated from the 菁英保養 figure), plus the first brake-fluid change at ~4,500 — triggered by the 2-year time limit, not by the 21,000 km, which is trivial — plus wipers and alignment. No brake pads: at 21,000 km with regenerative braking doing nearly all the deceleration, the friction material is essentially untouched. No tyres yet either. Still inside the 5-year warranty, so no repair risk is carried. Sits correctly among the German BEV peers at this window (BMW iX3 17,000; Mercedes EQE300 SUV 19,000; BMW i4 22,000), and is materially higher than the Volvo BEVs in this table purely because Volvo bundles free servicing here and Audi does not."},{"y":5,"source":"RAISED 66,000 -> 86,000. The shape was right but two lines were under-priced and two were missing. TYRES were the main error: the prior build used ~9,000 per corner fitted for 20-inch rubber, which is below the Taiwanese market for premium EV-rated tyres in this size on a 2.2-tonne SUV (255/50R20-class EV-specific rubber runs nearer 11,000-12,000 a corner fitted and balanced), so four are budgeted at ~46,000 rather than 36,000 — replaced on AGE at year 5, since at 7,000 km/yr the tread is far from worn but five-year-old rubber on a heavy car is past its useful life. Rebuilt as: two annual services with cabin filters (~14,000), second brake-fluid change (~5,000), four 20-inch tyres (~46,000), 12V AGM battery with coding (~9,000 — EVs are unusually hard on the 12V because it wakes the whole high-voltage system), heat-pump A/C circuit service including refrigerant and desiccant (~5,000, omitted entirely from the prior build), and alignment, wipers and TPMS sensor batteries (~7,000). Brake pads are deliberately NOT included: with regen, 35,000 km leaves plenty of material. Still under warranty for defects, so no repair reserve is carried here. The corrected figure sits correctly among the German BEV peers at this window (Mercedes EQE300 SUV 78,000; BMW iX3 80,000; BMW i4 104,000). Confidence low because the tyre, 12V and A/C prices are class-typical Taiwanese figures rather than a fetched Audi TW quotation for this specific model."},{"y":7,"source":"RAISED 88,000 -> 132,000. The composition was right; the out-of-warranty reserve was not. This is the first window with no manufacturer cover at all, and the prior build carried only ~12,000 against high-voltage ancillary failure — a token amount when a DC-DC converter, an onboard charger or a heat-pump compressor at Audi parts prices is individually 60,000-150,000 fitted. These are precisely the components that fail on this class of car, and an expected-value reserve across two fully uncovered years has to be materially larger. Rebuilt as: two annual services at independent-specialist rates (~16,000), third brake-fluid change (~5,000), battery and power-electronics coolant on its age limit (~9,000), reduction-gearbox oil at roughly the 6-year mark (~7,000), filters/wipers/alignment (~9,000), pads all round plus front discs (~32,000 — the BEV-specific trap noted in plan_notes: regen means the pads survive 49,000 km easily, but the discs corrode from disuse in Taiwan's humidity and get condemned on surface condition rather than thickness), early control-arm and bushing work on a heavy EV (~12,000), and a ~42,000 reserve for genuine out-of-warranty exposure on high-voltage and thermal ancillaries. No air-suspension line — this trim has steel springs. The corrected figure sits correctly among the German BEV peers at this window (BMW i4 122,000; Mercedes EQE300 SUV 128,000; BMW iX3 136,000; BMW iX2 140,000). Confidence low: modelled from component-level Taiwanese pricing, not from a fetched Audi TW schedule or an owner receipt for this model, which cannot exist yet at this age."},{"y":10,"source":"RAISED 200,000 -> 265,000. Three years fully outside every warranty — the vehicle cover lapsed at year 5 and the 8-year battery cover lapses inside this window — so this period carries the entire unsubsidised cost, exactly as the brief requires. Two lines in the prior build were too low for the class. DAMPERS: four conventional units replaced on age were budgeted at ~38,000, which is below Audi-specialist pricing for a 2.2-tonne SUV where OEM dampers fitted run nearer 13,000-14,000 a corner, so ~55,000. HIGH-VOLTAGE RESERVE: the prior build carried ~25,000 for three post-battery-warranty years, which is not credible when a heat-pump compressor alone is 80,000-120,000 at Audi parts prices and module-level pack repair becomes a live possibility once cover lapses at year 8; raised to ~55,000 as an expected-value reserve. Rebuilt as: three annual services (~30,000), a second set of four 20-inch tyres on age (~50,000, allowing for price drift to 2036), second 12V battery (~10,000), two brake-fluid changes (~10,000), second coolant change (~9,000), four dampers (~55,000), lower arms and suspension bushings which a heavy EV reliably destroys (~24,000), a second brake service of rear discs and pads all round (~24,000), and a ~55,000 reserve for post-warranty high-voltage and thermal-system risk. Corrected 10-year maintenance across all windows is 509,000, which sits between the Mercedes EQE300 SUV (469,000) and the BMW i4 (519,000) / BMW iX3 (528,000) in this table — the right band for an Audi PPE SUV, and correctly far above any Japanese equivalent. Confidence low — this is a modelled projection for a car and a market where no 10-year German BEV data can yet exist."}],"sources":[{"name":"Yahoo Autos TW — MY2026 Audi price adjustment table (2026-07-17)","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/%E8%A3%9C%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%BB%E5%8B%95%E5%BC%8F%E8%BB%8A%E9%81%93%E7%B6%AD%E6%8C%81%E6%A9%9F%E8%83%BD%EF%BC%8Caudi-q6-e-tron%E3%80%81a6-e-tron-%E6%96%B0%E5%B9%B4%E5%BC%8F%E6%B7%BB%E6%96%B0%E9%85%8D%E5%82%99%E4%BD%86%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC%E4%B9%9F%E6%9C%89%E8%AA%BF%E6%BC%B2-040212205.html","note":"RE-FETCHED DIRECTLY ON THIS PASS. The decisive source for list_price and the single most important verification in this review. Prints the MY2026 table verbatim: 'Q6 e-tron：276 萬元 (調漲 11 萬元)', 'Q6 e-tron quattro S line 運動版：326 萬 (調漲 11 萬元)', 'Q6 Sportback e-tron：287 萬元 (調漲 11 萬元)'; increases pay for 主動式車道維持機能 and AR HUD. Confirms 2,760,000 is correct for the MY2026 SUV RWD. Caveat recorded: the SQ6 line in the same table ('326 萬 (降價 9 萬元)') is internally inconsistent and should not be relied on; it does not affect the Q6 e-tron 後驅版 figure."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — 2025 Q6 e-tron 後驅版, 9,000 km, sold at 190.8萬","url":"https://m.8891.com.tw/auto?id=4657734","note":"RE-FETCHED DIRECTLY ON THIS PASS. Verified real and genuinely marked 已售出 — a price the market actually cleared, dealer 弘達國際桃園店. CRITICAL CORRECTION FOUND HERE: the listing states '2025年出廠' but '2026/01領牌'. The car was first registered January 2026, so it is ~7 months old at this record's as-of date, NOT the ~1.3 years the prior record assumed. Its 190.8/265 = 72.0% is therefore a ~0.6-year dealer-retail retention, which forces the year-1 checkpoint materially lower."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — used Audi Q6 e-tron listing index","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q6-e-tron","note":"RE-FETCHED DIRECTLY ON THIS PASS. Confirms exactly three live cars, matching the prior record: 2025 後驅版 14,400 km asking 198.0萬 (Kaohsiung); 2025 後驅版 34,000 km 電洽 (Taoyuan); 2024/12-built quattro S line 8,300 km asking 236.8萬 at Audi's 內湖認證中古車 (Taipei). All are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking), and all are unsold, so they sit above clearing level; converted downward to private-sale and trade-in as documented in the year-1 checkpoint."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Audi 內湖認證中古車 Q6 e-tron listing","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4731860.html","note":"RE-FETCHED DIRECTLY ON THIS PASS. 2025 Q6 e-tron at Audi's own certified used operation, asking 236.8萬, Taipei. Cross-checks the quattro S line data point at the manufacturer-certified end of the market, where asking prices run highest. Page body is partly JS-rendered so mileage and registration month were taken from the index page rather than here."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — used Audi e-tron (predecessor generation) listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/e-tron","note":"RE-FETCHED DIRECTLY ON THIS PASS. The predecessor proxy underpinning the year-5 checkpoint. Four cars listed, two priced: 2021 55 quattro advanced 30,000 km at 125.8萬, and 2021 55 quattro S line 41,000 km at 148.8萬. Both ~5.5 years old with mileage bracketing our 35,000 km assumption. CORRECTION FOUND HERE: the 148.8萬 car is described as a SPORTBACK with air suspension, so the prior record's 357萬 SUV denominator understates its original list and overstates its retention — the reason the year-5 ratio was trimmed from 41.5% to 40.0%."},{"name":"Yahoo Autos TW — Audi Taiwan e-tron warranty terms","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/audi-e-tron-e-tron-062540322.html","note":"UPGRADED: the prior record could only see this as a search-result snippet; I FETCHED IT DIRECTLY on this pass and it confirms both figures the whole maintenance shape pivots on — '全車原廠 5 年或 10 萬公里原廠保固' and '8 年或 16 萬公里保固，在保固期間內維持 70% 以上電池效能'. This resolves the prior record's single most important open question."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan — official warranty page (保固)","url":"https://www.audi.com.tw/zh/Audi_Service/regular-warranty/","note":"NOT FETCHABLE — audi.com.tw returns HTTP 503 to automated fetches, confirmed again on this pass. The page exists and surfaces in search results as the canonical Audi Taiwan 保固 page; recorded for traceability only. The warranty terms used in this record rest on the directly-fetched Yahoo Autos page above, not on this URL."},{"name":"8891 新車 — Q6 e-tron launch and specification report","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/audi/q6-e-tron/19927","note":"CARRIED OVER from the prior record; not re-fetched on this pass. Source for the trim spec that drives maintenance: 20-inch alloys standard on the 後驅版, air suspension exclusive to the SQ6 (so NOT fitted here), 83 kWh battery, 252 hp single rear motor, 533 km WLTP, CCS2. Also records the 4萬 cut from the 269萬 pre-sale price at launch. The 533 km range and RWD single-motor configuration are independently corroborated by the sold 8891 listing above."},{"name":"INSIDE — Audi Q6 e-tron Taiwan launch report","url":"https://www.inside.com.tw/article/37995-audi-q6-e-tron-taiwan-luanch","note":"CARRIED OVER from the prior record; not re-fetched on this pass. Taiwan launch 2025-03-28 at 建議售價 265 萬元 for the single-motor RWD. Supplies the MY2025 baseline denominator (265萬) used for every used-car retention ratio at year 1."},{"name":"Mobile01 / TVBS / Yahoo — Q6 e-tron Taiwan pre-sale pricing (269萬)","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=606&t=7080523","note":"SEEN AS SEARCH-RESULT SNIPPET on this pass, not fetched directly. Multiple contemporaneous reports state the Q6 e-tron single-motor RWD pre-sale price as 269萬元 (also carried by cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/236052 and Yahoo Autos). Independently corroborates the 4萬 launch cut to 265萬 that the discount inference partly rests on."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan — 保養透明 published service pricing portal","url":"https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/","note":"CARRIED OVER; JS-rendered, so no e-tron-specific schedule could be extracted on either pass. Confirms the portal exists and corroborates Audi TW dealer labour level (an A1 Sportback scheduled service at NT$10,500-11,500). Used only to calibrate labour rates, never as a source for a Q6 e-tron service price."},{"name":"KingAutos — Audi Taiwan 菁英保養 / 尊榮保養 prepaid service plans","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/76316","note":"CARRIED OVER; seen as search-result snippet, not fetched directly on either pass. Reports ~NT$6,500 for the 菁英保養 interval and ~NT$10,000 for the 尊榮保養 interval on an A3, for cars aged 4-15 years. ICE figures including oil, used only to calibrate Audi Taiwan's dealer labour level for the BEV service costing — the weakest evidence in the maintenance build and the reason years 5/7/10 are all rated low confidence."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan — finance programme (48期0利率, 3年保證買回)","url":"https://www.audi.com.tw/zh/finance/finance-choice/","note":"NOT FETCHABLE (audi.com.tw returns 503). Carried over as the basis for the observation that Audi TW leads with financing and a 3-year guaranteed buyback rather than cash discounting. The guaranteed residual percentage is NOT published, so it was deliberately not used as a year-3 anchor. Treat the programme's existence as reported rather than verified."},{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點 — Q6 Sportback e-tron pricing (MY2025)","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/113304","note":"CARRIED OVER; seen as search-result snippet. '售價自 276 萬元起' for the Q6 SPORTBACK e-tron under MY2025. Retained because it documents the trap this record had to clear: 276萬 was the Sportback's price a year ago and only became the SUV RWD's price after the MY2026 +11萬 adjustment. The MY2026 Yahoo table (Sportback now 287萬) resolves it cleanly."}]},"audi-q7-45-tdi-quattro":{"assumptions":"買家年行駛 6,000-8,000 km，遠低於台灣平均 12,000-15,000 km。各檢查點一律以 7,000 km/年推算（7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km）。此里程下原廠保養間隔由「時間」而非「里程」觸發，Audi 一年一次的定期保養即使里程未到也必須做，否則保養紀錄會斷、影響保固與殘值。輪胎同理：Q7 標配 20/21 吋大胎，7,000 km/年跑不到磨耗極限，實際是橡膠老化（約 5-6 年）決定更換時機，本表把輪胎放在第 5 年與第 8-9 年兩次。低里程對殘值有正面影響，因此各檢查點都盡量比對低里程在架車而非里程盲平均——本次已在 8891 找到同車型同代的低里程實價樣本（2025 年式 45 TDI quattro 享馭版、30,100 km），是全表最重要的錨點。牌照稅、燃料稅、保險（強制險與任意險）依規格排除，不計入任何欄位。此車非電動車，無充電樁安裝成本問題。","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"同車型同代直接對照（本次覆核新增的關鍵樣本）：8891 中古車在架 2025 年式 Q7 45 TDI quattro 享馭版、30,100 km、車商售價 2,650,000（https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q7）。這是完全同 trim、同引擎、僅差一個年式的實價，比原本用 45 TFSI 代打可靠得多。輔助樣本（車商售價）：2025 年式 45 TFSI quattro 享馭版 1,200 km／2,880,000、2,660 km／2,688,000、2,000 km 與 8,000 km 各 2,598,000（https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q7?page=2 與第 1 頁）；Audi Approved Plus 原廠認證 2025 年式 2,662 km／2,598,000、2026 年式 8,215 km／2,598,000（https://approvedplus.audi.com.tw/listing/2513/q7，含認證與延長保固溢價，僅作上緣參考）。調整過程：以上全部是「車商售價」而非車主拿到的錢。本案 7,000 km 低於對照車的 30,100 km，低里程加價約 5-7%，得車商售價約 2,800,000；依 8891 車商售價→自售價的慣常差距下修 11.4% 得自售價 2,480,000；車商收購價再下修 14% 得 2,130,000。第 1 年帳面損失 960,000（占實付成本 27.9%），符合德系而非日系的折舊斜率。"},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"同引擎同代直接對照：8891 中古車在架 2023 年式 Q7 45 TDI quattro Technik 豪華版、40,000 km、車商售價 1,890,000（https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q7?page=2）。同頁另有 2023 年式 55 TFSI quattro 享馭版、46,800 km、車商售價 1,868,000（多筆重覆刊登），佐證 3 年 V6 Q7 的車商售價確實落在 1,870,000-1,890,000 這一帶，非單一樣本。調整過程：本案里程 21,000 km 約為對照車的一半，低里程加價約 5-8%，得車商售價約 2,000,000；下修 11% 得自售價 1,780,000；車商收購價再下修 14.6% 得 1,520,000。第 1→3 年再跌 28%，是德系車最陡的一段。註：對照車 Technik 豪華版的原始牌價未經一手來源證實，故本點不以保值率反推，而是直接用「同齡實價 + 里程調整 + 車商售價折讓」推導，避開牌價不確定性。"},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"無同年式（2021 年式）45 TDI 低里程在架車可直接對照，屬內插推估，信心 low。兩端錨點皆為同 4M 世代實價（車商售價）：上端是 2023 年式 45 TDI Technik、40,000 km／1,890,000；下端是 8891 在架 2021 年式 Q7 50 TDI quattro、137,000 km／1,280,000（https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q7）。下端那台雖同為 5 年車，但里程是本案的 3.9 倍，其 1,280,000 應視為同齡高里程車的地板價而非中位。調整過程：5 年、35,000 km 的合理車商售價取 1,480,000；下修 12.2% 得自售價 1,300,000；車商收購價再下修 15.4% 得 1,100,000。原廠 3 年保固此時已失效兩年，二手市場開始把修繕風險折進價格，故跌幅未收斂。"},{"y":7,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"同世代（4M）實價對照，車商售價：8891 在架 2018 年式 Q7 45 TDI quattro 七人座、90,000 km／895,000（https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q7）。同頁另有 2019 年式 55 TFSI quattro、14,000 km／1,800,000，是超低里程 7 年車，用來界定上緣（本案里程較高且為 45 TDI，不應貼到該價位）。本世代 2016 年即在台上市，7 年車有真實同世代同引擎資料，非跨代外推。調整過程：對照車為 8 年、90,000 km，本案為 7 年、49,000 km，年份少 1 年（約 +8-10%）且里程少 41,000 km（約 +15-20%），合計加價約 28%，得車商售價約 1,180,000；下修 13.6% 得自售價 1,020,000；車商收購價再下修 14.7% 得 870,000（老德系車商收購折扣比新車大，因整備與保固風險高）。"},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"同世代（4M）10 年對照，樣本離散度大，信心 low。最貼近本案里程的樣本是 SUM 汽車網 2017 年式 Q7 3.0L、71,244 km、車商售價 888,000（https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=AUDI&model=Q7）——本次覆核確認該車為 3.0 汽油（45 TFSI）七人座、非柴油。8891 同步有 2017 年式 45 TFSI quattro 七人座、71,200 km／888,000（極可能為同一台跨平台刊登）。同年份（2016）樣本：45 TDI quattro 七人座、177,400 km／599,000；45 TFSI quattro 七人座、100,000 km／699,000。上緣是 Audi Approved Plus 原廠認證 2016 年式 45 TDI quattro、82,127 km／1,380,000（https://approvedplus.audi.com.tw/listing/2513/q7），含認證與延長保固溢價，不能當一般成交行情。調整過程：以 71,244 km／888,000 那台為主錨（里程幾乎等同本案），本案年份再老 1 年（約 -10%），且柴油大型休旅在台接手面較窄、DPF 與氣壓避震修繕風險被定價，再折約 2%，得車商售價約 795,000；下修 12% 得自售價 700,000；車商收購價再下修 17% 得 580,000。10 年車保固全失效，尾段續跌而非像 Lexus 那樣打平。"}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Audi Taiwan 新車 3 年不限里程原廠保固為官網明載標準條件；「3 年／5 萬公里免費定期保養」出自 U-CAR 的 Audi 購車促銷專案（涵蓋 A3/A4/A5/Q7），屬期間限定優惠而非永久標配（檢索頁：https://lite.duckduckgo.com/lite/?q=Audi+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E6%96%B0%E8%BB%8A+%E4%BF%9D%E5%9B%BA+3%E5%B9%B4+%E4%B8%8D%E9%99%90%E9%87%8C%E7%A8%8B+%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A ，未取得官方條款頁全文）。年跑 7,000 km 遠低於 5 萬公里上限，故第 1 年定期保養工料可視為免費，僅剩非涵蓋耗材。金額由原估 4,000 上調至 8,000，反映免費保養方案未必到手、且冷氣濾網等小項通常不在涵蓋內。"},{"y":3,"source":"同上，依 3 年／5 萬公里免費定期保養專案推估；3 年累計 21,000 km 仍在里程涵蓋內。26,000 為非涵蓋自費小項推估（四輪定位約 4,000-6,000、雨刷片一組約 3,000、冷氣濾網一次約 2,500），非原廠報價單。金額由原估 18,000 上調，理由同第 1 年（方案不確定性 + 小項通常自費）。"},{"y":5,"source":"免費保養第 4 年起失效，本段起全額自費。單次保養以 Audi 官方保養價格查詢頁（https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/）之 A1 Sportback 2020 年式 10,500-11,500 元為基準——本次覆核確認該頁確實查不到 Q7 柴油表，只吐得出 A1——按 3.0 V6 柴油的油量、濾芯規格與柴油濾芯加項上調至 26,000/次。輪胎與電瓶為台灣市場零件行情推估，非原廠報價單，故信心設 low。"},{"y":7,"source":"保固已失效兩年，本段納入保固外維修風險。DPF、噴油嘴、變速箱油屬柴油大型休旅在此車齡的標準維護項目。金額為原廠廠價與台灣專修廠行情之推估組合，無 Q7 柴油實際單據支撐，信心 low。（原記錄引用的 Mobile01 討論串 https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=606&t=6033185 直接抓取回傳 403，本次覆核亦未能讀到內文，故不作為金額依據，僅保留於 sources 供追溯。）"},{"y":10,"source":"7-10 年為 Q7 高額故障集中期，本段以風險攤提方式計入而非「一定會壞」。氣壓避震（單支氣囊 60,000-80,000、壓縮機約 35,000）與 48V BAS 為 Audi V6 TDI 此車齡的已知風險項目；水幫浦、節溫器殼為 VAG 集團通病。全段屬風險加權推估，無 Q7 柴油實際單據支撐，信心 low。原記錄引用的 Mobile01 討論串（403，讀不到）與 PTT car 版首保單據（金額全在圖片內，純文字取不到）均未提供可用數字，本次覆核維持不採用。"}],"sources":[{"name":"8891 新車頻道 — 2026 年式 Audi Q7 上市價格新聞","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/audi/q7/20990","note":"主要價格來源，本次獨立覆核已重新抓取確認。完整列出 2026 年式 Q7 全車系牌價：45 TFSI quattro 享馭版 3,290,000、45 TDI quattro 享馭版 3,540,000、55 TFSI S line quattro 運動版 3,960,000、SQ7 5,660,000。"},{"name":"檢索頁 — 2026 Audi Q7 台灣售價交叉驗證","url":"https://lite.duckduckgo.com/lite/?q=2026+Audi+Q7+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+329%E8%90%AC+354%E8%90%AC+396%E8%90%AC+%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82","note":"檢索結果頁（非一手來源），用於交叉驗證。8891 新車、CarFun、自由時報 auto.ltn.com.tw、U-CAR 四家摘要一致報導「2026 年式 Q7 建議售價 329 萬元起」，與上方車系表入門價相符，可反證該車系表為真。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Audi Q7 在架車輛清單（第 1 頁）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q7","note":"殘值主要來源，本次覆核重新抓取全頁。關鍵新增樣本（原記錄漏用）：2025 年式 45 TDI quattro 享馭版、30,100 km／2,650,000，是唯一同 trim 同引擎的近新實價。其他採用樣本（皆為車商售價）：2023 年式 55 TFSI 享馭版 46,800 km／1,868,000；2021 年式 50 TDI quattro 137,000 km／1,280,000；2019 年式 55 TFSI quattro 14,000 km／1,800,000；2018 年式 45 TDI 七人座 90,000 km／895,000；2017 年式 45 TFSI 七人座 71,200 km／888,000；2016 年式 45 TDI 七人座 177,400 km／599,000；2016 年式 45 TFSI 七人座 100,000 km／699,000；2025 年式 45 TFSI 享馭版 2,000 km 與 8,000 km 各 2,598,000。全部為車商售價，已依規則往下調整為自售價與收購價。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Audi Q7 在架車輛清單（第 2 頁）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q7?page=2","note":"本次覆核重新抓取確認。採用樣本：2023 年式 45 TDI quattro Technik 豪華版 40,000 km／1,890,000（第 3 年主錨）；2025 年式 45 TFSI quattro 享馭版 1,200 km／2,880,000 與 2,660 km／2,688,000。"},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — AUDI Q7 中古車搜尋結果","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=AUDI&model=Q7","note":"跨平台交叉驗證，本次覆核重新抓取。採用 2017 年式 Q7 71,244 km／888,000 作為第 10 年主錨。更正：該車為 3.0L 汽油（45 TFSI）七人座，原記錄誤標為「3.0 柴油」。其餘為 2.0 汽油與 2012/2015 高里程樣本，未採用。"},{"name":"Audi Approved Plus 原廠認證中古車 — Q7 在架清單","url":"https://approvedplus.audi.com.tw/listing/2513/q7","note":"原廠認證車價格上緣參考，本次覆核重新抓取。2016 年式 45 TDI quattro 82,127 km／1,380,000、2024 年式 12,338 km／2,698,000、2026 年式 8,215 km／2,598,000、2025 年式 2,662 km／2,598,000。認證車含延長保固溢價，不等於一般成交價，僅用來界定行情帶上緣。"},{"name":"Audi Taiwan 官方保養價格查詢","url":"https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/","note":"保養金額的官方錨點。本次覆核確認該頁僅能查到 A1 Sportback 2020 年式單次保養 10,500-11,500 元，Q7 柴油專屬表確實查不到（頁面另註明 17 年式以前車款須洽經銷商）。以此為基準按 3.0 V6 柴油規格上調推估 Q7 單次年度保養 26,000-30,000 元。"},{"name":"檢索頁 — Audi Taiwan 保固與免費保養條件","url":"https://lite.duckduckgo.com/lite/?q=Audi+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E6%96%B0%E8%BB%8A+%E4%BF%9D%E5%9B%BA+3%E5%B9%B4+%E4%B8%8D%E9%99%90%E9%87%8C%E7%A8%8B+%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A","note":"檢索結果頁（非一手來源）。確認 audi.com.tw 明載「3 年不限里程原廠保固」與原廠零件 2 年不限里程保固；但「3 年／5 萬公里免費定期保養」是 U-CAR 上的期間限定促銷專案（涵蓋 A3/A4/A5/Q7），另有以「5 年原廠保固」為主打的較新專案，故免費保養非永久標配。未取得官方條款頁全文，第 1、3 年保養信心因此下修為 low。"},{"name":"Mobile01 — Audi Q7 保養／維修費用討論串（未能讀取）","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=606&t=6033185","note":"原記錄用其佐證後段高額維修量級。本次覆核確認該頁對 WebFetch 回傳 403、無法讀到任何內文，故本記錄不從此頁採用任何金額，僅列出以保留追溯。"}]},"audi-q7-45-tfsi-quattro":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, far below the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year. Every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). At this mileage the Audi service interval (12 months or 15,000 km, whichever comes first) is entirely TIME-driven: the car never reaches a mileage trigger inside a service year, so the number of services equals the number of years and low mileage does NOT skip services. Two consequences: tyres and the 12V battery age out rather than wear out, and the car stays well inside any mileage cap on the factory warranty (only 35,000 km at year 5). Verified spec (Yahoo 汽機車 2025/2026 spec pages, re-read 2026-08-12): 1,984 cc turbo inline-4, 265 hp, 8-speed auto, quattro, 285/45R20 tyres, 2,073 kg kerb weight, 五連桿 front and rear suspension, 前後碟煞, 7 seats. WARRANTY CAVEAT (corrected in this review): Audi Taiwan's STANDARD new-car warranty is 3 years unlimited mileage; the '5-year factory warranty' widely quoted for the 2026 Q7 is a period-limited purchase campaign (8891 新車頻道's 2026 Q7 launch article ties it to a promotional window), not a permanent standard term. The maintenance model therefore does NOT treat years 3-5 as risk-free. EXCLUDED BY DESIGN: 牌照稅 (NT$11,230/yr for 1,984 cc) and 燃料稅 (NT$6,180/yr), all insurance, and fuel — none appear in purchase, maintenance or selling_costs. Home-charger installation is not applicable (combustion car). Value figures are quoted against the NT$3,290,000 list price, the convention Taiwanese used-price guides use.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"VERIFIED IN THIS PASS on 8891 中古車 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/?key=Q7, read live 2026-08-12): a 2025款 Audi Q7 45 TFSI quattro 享馭版 2.0L — the EXACT trim — at 2,000 km asking NT$2,598,000. That is 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking), and it is an essentially-new low-mileage car, which is the right comp for this 7,000 km/yr buyer. Chain applied: dealer retail NT$2,598,000 -> minus 13.4% -> 自售價 NT$2,250,000 -> minus 13.3% -> 車商收購價 NT$1,950,000. LOWERED from the researcher's NT$2,300,000 / NT$2,000,000: their figure was anchored on an unverified NT$2,620,000 average across six claimed listings (only one of which I could reproduce), several of which they themselves noted were Audi Approved 原廠認證中古車 carrying a certification premium that a private seller cannot charge. Private = 68.4% of the NT$3,290,000 list — a German first-year number, not a Toyota one. Confidence downgraded from 'high' to 'medium': one exact-trim listing verified, not six."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTS A FACTUAL MISREAD. The researcher's anchor was '2023款 55 TFSI quattro 享馭版, 2022 registration (~4 yr), 46,800 km, asking NT$1,868,000'. The actual 8891 row (read live 2026-08-12) is 2023款 55 TFSI quattro 享馭版 3.0L, **4,680 km**, NT$1,868,000 — the mileage was inflated 10x and the age by a year. Recomputed: a 3-year-old, 4,680 km 享馭版 asking NT$1,868,000 against its NT$4,040,000 list = 46.2% retention on DEALER ASKING for an ultra-low-mileage car, i.e. an excellent comp for this buyer with no upward mileage nudge available. Secondary comp claimed by the researcher (2023款 45 TDI Technik豪華版, 40,000 km, asking NT$1,890,000 / NT$3,510,000 = 53.8%) did not appear on the pages I fetched and is treated as unconfirmed. Taking ~49.5% dealer asking for the entry 2.0T gives ~NT$1,628,000 retail -> minus 12.2% -> 自售價 NT$1,430,000 -> minus 13.3% -> 車商收購價 NT$1,240,000. Private = 43.5% of list — the steep German years 1-3 drop. LOWERED from NT$1,550,000 / NT$1,350,000, which after the mileage correction sat at essentially dealer-retail level."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no 5-year-old example of this exact 2.0T trim is on sale. Bracketed by two listings I verified on 8891 (2026-08-12): 2023款 55 TFSI quattro 享馭版, 4,680 km (3 yr), asking NT$1,868,000 / NT$4,040,000 list = 46.2%; and 2020款 50 TDI quattro, 137,000 km (6 yr), asking NT$1,280,000 / NT$3,690,000 list = 34.7%. Interpolating to 5 years gives ~38.5%, plus a premium for this buyer's 35,000 km versus the 137,000 km on the 6-year comp: ~40% dealer asking = ~NT$1,316,000 -> minus 12.6% -> 自售價 NT$1,140,000 -> minus 13.6% -> 車商收購價 NT$985,000. Private = 34.7% of list. Trimmed from NT$1,190,000 / NT$1,030,000 to stay coherent with the corrected year-3 anchor. Ratio transferred from V6 trims, hence low confidence."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED by retention ratio from same-generation (4M) 8891 listings I verified on 2026-08-12: 2018款 45 TDI quattro 7Seats (8 yr), 90,000 km, asking NT$895,000 / NT$3,720,000 list = 24.1%; 2017款 40 TFSI quattro Luxury 7Seats (9 yr), 130,000 km, asking NT$648,000 / ~NT$3,100,000 list = 20.9%; 2017款 40 TFSI Luxury 7Seats (9 yr), 90,000 km, asking NT$598,000 = 19.3%. A 7-year car at 49,000 km sits well above the 90,000-130,000 km norm of those comps, so ~30% dealer asking = ~NT$987,000 -> minus 11.9% -> 自售價 NT$870,000 -> minus 13.8% -> 車商收購價 NT$750,000. LOWERED from NT$950,000 / NT$830,000: the researcher's 33% leaned partly on a claimed 2019款 55 TFSI at 14,000 km asking NT$1,800,000 (48.5% at 7 years), which I could not reproduce and which is an implausible outlier — it has been dropped from the basis. The car is out of the standard 3-year warranty (and out of even the campaign 5-year warranty) well before this window, and the used market prices in that repair risk, so the curve keeps falling."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED by retention ratio from the direct PREDECESSOR 2.0-litre trim — the pre-facelift 4M Q7 40 TFSI quattro. 8891 rows verified live on 2026-08-12: 2016款 40 TFSI quattro Luxury 七人座 2.0L, 100,000 km (10 yr), asking NT$578,000 / NT$2,970,000 list = 19.5%; 2016款 45 TDI quattro 七人座 3.0L, 177,400 km (10 yr), asking NT$599,000 / ~NT$3,750,000 list = 16.0%; 2014款 35 TFSI quattro 3.0L, 131,200 km (12 yr), asking NT$279,000. This buyer's 70,000 km beats every comp, arguing for the top of the range: ~21.5% dealer asking = ~NT$707,000 -> minus 12.3% -> 自售價 NT$620,000 -> minus 12.9% -> 車商收購價 NT$540,000. Private = 18.8% of list, still falling from year 7 with no Lexus-style plateau. Trimmed from NT$650,000 / NT$570,000 for coherence with the corrected mid-curve."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Audi Taiwan scheduled-service tool, 使用年份 1 = NT$12,200-13,200 (midpoint NT$12,700), plus wipers and sundries at Taiwanese dealer rates (my estimate). RAISED from the researcher's NT$5,000, which assumed the buyer receives Audi Taiwan's campaign 五年或十萬公里內最多兩次免費基本保養 and netted almost the whole service out. That package is a period-limited promotion, not a standard term, so the base case now pays the service in full; a buyer who does land the campaign would see this period fall to roughly NT$3,000. Confidence downgraded from 'high' to 'medium' because the Q7 line of the official price tool could not be reproduced independently in this pass."},{"y":3,"source":"Audi Taiwan scheduled-service tool, 使用年份 2 (NT$14,300-15,300) and 使用年份 3 (NT$16,900-17,900), taken at midpoints and paid in full — the free-basic-service credit the researcher applied to year 2 is campaign-dependent and is no longer assumed. Wipers, alignment and TPMS calibration are my own estimate at Taiwanese Audi dealer rates. The car is inside the standard 3-year unlimited-mileage factory warranty for this entire window, so no repair allowance is added. RAISED from NT$27,000. Confidence downgraded from 'high' to 'medium' (official Q7 table not independently reproducible)."},{"y":5,"source":"Scheduled portion from the Audi Taiwan tool (使用年份 4 = NT$14,300-15,300, 使用年份 5 = NT$12,200-13,200). Tyre, brake-pad, AGM battery and sundry figures are my own estimates at Taiwanese Audi dealer prices for a 2,073 kg SUV on 285/45R20 rubber — not published figures. RAISED from NT$111,000 by adding a NT$15,000 risk-weighted out-of-warranty allowance: the researcher treated the 5-year/100,000 km cover as the official standard and so booked zero repair risk here, but Audi Taiwan's standard term is 3 years unlimited mileage and the 5-year cover is a campaign item that this buyer may not hold."},{"y":7,"source":"Scheduled portion from the Audi Taiwan tool: 使用年份 6 = NT$45,900-46,900 (the ATF / spark-plug / belt service) and 使用年份 7 = NT$12,200-13,200. The warranty has expired on any reading by this window, so the owner carries full repair risk; the NT$48,000 allowance and the brake and coolant lines are my own estimates, not quoted prices. RAISED modestly from NT$127,000 (allowance NT$35,000 -> NT$48,000) to include direct-injection carbon cleaning and PCV/valve-cover leaks, which are standard EA888 age items at Taiwanese dealer labour rates. Confidence stays 'medium' — the scheduled half rests on a table I could not reproduce, the rest is judgement."},{"y":10,"source":"Scheduled portion from the Audi Taiwan tool (使用年份 8 = NT$14,300-15,300, 使用年份 9 = NT$16,900-17,900, 使用年份 10 = NT$14,300-15,300). Everything else is my own estimate for an out-of-warranty German large SUV in Taiwan. RAISED from NT$273,000 (allowance NT$120,000 -> NT$147,000): the researcher excluded air-suspension cost outright on the grounds that the spec sheet says 五連桿, but that describes the linkage, not the spring medium, and the Q7's adaptive air suspension uses a five-link axle too — so a risk-weighted air-strut component is folded in rather than assumed to zero. Ten-year maintenance across all five periods now totals about NT$618,000, roughly 2.5-3x a comparable Japanese seven-seat SUV and sensibly below the 45 TDI V6 sibling's NT$874,000."}],"sources":[{"name":"Yahoo 汽機車 — 2026 Audi Q7 車型價格表","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-q7-2026","note":"Fetched 2026-08-12 in this review. Confirms 45 TFSI quattro享馭版 = 329萬 (汽油, 1,984 cc, 265 hp, 7 seats), 45 TDI quattro享馭版 354萬 (油電混合), 55 TFSII quattro S-Line運動版 396萬 (油電混合), SQ7 566萬. The 油電混合 tag on the two V6s is Taiwan's label for 48V MHEV; this 2.0T is tagged 汽油."},{"name":"8891 新車頻道 — 2026 年式 Audi Q7 上市新聞","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/audi/q7/20990","note":"Second independent list-price confirmation, fetched 2026-08-12. Full 2026 model-year table: 45 TFSI quattro 享馭版 3,290,000 / 45 TDI quattro 享馭版 3,540,000 / 55 TFSI S line quattro 運動版 3,960,000 / SQ7 5,660,000. ALSO the source of the warranty correction: the article ties the 五年原廠保固 to a promotional campaign window, not to standard coverage. Replaces the researcher's publisher-root CarFun citation."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽機車 — 2026 Q7 45 TFSI quattro享馭版 車款介紹","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/audi-q7-2026-45-tfsi-quattro%E4%BA%AB%E9%A6%AD%E7%89%88","note":"Trim page for the exact car, fetched 2026-08-12: 329萬, 1,984 cc turbo inline-4, 265 hp@5250-6350 rpm, 37.7 kgm, 8速手自排, quattro, 7 seats, 平均油耗 10.5 km/L. 牌照稅 NT$11,230 / 燃料稅 NT$6,180 — both excluded from this model by design."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽機車 — Q7 45 TFSI quattro享馭版 規格配備","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/audi-q7-2025-45-tfsi-quattro%E4%BA%AB%E9%A6%AD%E7%89%88/spec","note":"Cost-relevant hardware, fetched 2026-08-12: 輪胎尺碼 285/45R20, 車重 2,073 kg, 前後懸吊皆為 五連桿, 前後碟煞, 1,984 cc. NOTE: this page does NOT state the spring medium, so it does not establish that the trim runs steel rather than adaptive air suspension — the researcher's inference from 五連桿 is unsupported and the maintenance model now hedges instead."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Audi Q7 在售車輛清單","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/?key=Q7","note":"Source of every used data point, read live 2026-08-12 in this review. These are 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking); the chain applied is dealer retail -> about -12 to -13% -> 自售價 -> a further about -13% -> 車商收購價. Rows verified by me: 2025款 45 TFSI quattro 享馭版 2.0L @ 2,000 km asking 2,598,000; 2023款 55 TFSI quattro 享馭版 3.0L @ 4,680 km asking 1,868,000 (the researcher recorded this as 46,800 km and a 2022 registration — both wrong); 2020款 50 TDI quattro @ 137,000 km asking 1,280,000; 2018款 45 TDI quattro 7Seats @ 90,000 km asking 895,000; 2017款 40 TFSI quattro Luxury 7Seats @ 130,000 km asking 648,000 and @ 90,000 km asking 598,000; 2016款 40 TFSI quattro Luxury 七人座 @ 100,000 km asking 578,000; 2016款 45 TDI quattro 七人座 @ 177,400 km asking 599,000; 2014款 35 TFSI quattro @ 131,200 km asking 279,000."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽機車 — 歷年 Audi Q7 車型價格表（2016 / 2018 / 2019 / 2021 / 2023）","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-q7-2023","note":"Original list-price bases for the retention ratios (change the year in the URL to reach each table): 2016 40 TFSI quattro Luxury 七人座 297萬; 2017/2018 40 TFSI Luxury 七人座 ~310萬 and 45 TDI 七人座 372萬; 2020/2021 50 TDI quattro 七人座 369萬; 2023 55 TFSI quattro 享馭版 404萬. Cited at the 2023 permalink because that is the one table I opened directly; the other years are reached by URL substitution and are treated as secondary."},{"name":"8891 新車 — 2026 Audi Q7 價格車款介紹","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/audi/q7/Summary.html","note":"The original scout's price source. Fetched in this review but returned only the page title (client-side rendering), so it does not stand on its own; the NT$3,290,000 figure is instead confirmed by the Yahoo lineup table and the 8891 news article above."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan 官方 — 保固範圍","url":"https://www.audi.com.tw/zh/Audi_Service/regular-warranty/","note":"UNVERIFIED IN THIS PASS — audi.com.tw returned HTTP 503 on every attempt on 2026-08-12, so the researcher's claim that the OFFICIAL standard warranty is 五年／十萬公里 could not be confirmed. Two independent signals contradict it: 8891's 2026 Q7 launch article presents the 五年原廠保固 as a promotional campaign, and the parallel 45 TDI record states Audi Taiwan's website terms are 3 年不限里程 as standard. This record therefore models 3 years unlimited mileage as standard and treats the 5-year cover as campaign-dependent."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan 官方 — 保養費用查詢（保養透明 安心啟航）","url":"https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/","note":"Official Audi Taiwan scheduled-service price tool, and the backbone of every maintenance figure. PARTIALLY VERIFIED: the page exists and returns NT$1,000-wide ranges (its default view shows A1 Sportback 2020 at NT$10,500-11,500 for one scheduled service), but it renders client-side and I could not reproduce the researcher's Q7 / 45 TFSI quattro table (使用年份 1-10 = 12,200-13,200 / 14,300-15,300 / 16,900-17,900 / 14,300-15,300 / 12,200-13,200 / 45,900-46,900 / 12,200-13,200 / 14,300-15,300 / 16,900-17,900 / 14,300-15,300). Retained as the backbone because the magnitudes and the band format are consistent, but no maintenance checkpoint is rated 'high' as a result."},{"name":"Mobile01 — Audi Q7 的原廠保養費用討論串","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=606&t=6033185","note":"UNVERIFIED IN THIS PASS — mobile01.com returned HTTP 403 to the fetch on 2026-08-12, so the owner figures the researcher quoted (a 40 TFSI 30,000 km service just under NT$20,000, a 大保養 around NT$60,000, interval 每 12 個月或 15,000 公里) could not be re-read. Kept as a cited corroboration but given no independent weight in the numbers."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事（publisher root）— 第三代 Audi Q7 報導","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/","note":"UNVERIFIED AND DOWNWEIGHTED. The researcher used this to claim the third-generation Q7 opened for German orders in June 2026, which justified both the discount size and the falling tail. No article permalink was captured and I could not confirm the claim. The run-out framing is retained only as a soft argument; the depreciation curve here rests on the real 8891 comps listed above, not on this."}]},"audi-q8-55-tfsi-quattro-s-line":{"assumptions":"低里程車主：每年 6,000-8,000 km，取中位 7,000 km/年，遠低於台灣平均 12,000-15,000 km/年。各檢查點 assumed_km = 7000 x years（7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000）。Audi Taiwan 的定期保養為「1 年或 10,000-15,000 km 先到者」，在 7,000 km/年 下一律由「時間」觸發而非里程，等於一年進廠一次、里程幾乎不影響保養次數，但耗材（輪胎、電瓶、冷卻液、煞車油）同樣由年限而非磨耗決定。Q8 55 TFSI 為 3.0L V6 渦輪汽油（EA839, 340hp）搭配 48V MHEV 輕油電：皮帶式啟動發電機（BAS）+ 48V 鋰電池，只能做怠速熄火／滑行熄火與扭力輔助，無法純電行駛，故依規格歸類為 gasoline 而非 hybrid。變速箱為 8 速 tiptronic（ZF 8HP 液力變矩器自排），不是 S tronic 雙離合器。台灣 Q8 55 TFSI quattro S line 標配 adaptive air suspension（氣壓式懸吊）與 21 吋胎圈，這兩項是 7 年後養車成本遠高於日系同級的主因。2026 年式再新增標配抬頭顯示器與動態全輪轉向（後輪轉向），後者是額外的過保風險件。稅金（牌照稅、燃料稅）與保險依設計排除在外。低里程在殘值面是加分項，各檢查點均已相對於同齡但里程較高的實際掛牌車做向上校正，校正幅度寫在各 source 字串。","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"外推自同世代實際掛牌車，並已做車商售價→自售價折算。台灣 Q8 於 2021/03 上市，市場上沒有「1 年車」可直接觀察，故由後段實價往前推。硬資料為 8891 兩筆有明碼的同世代車商開價：2022 年掛牌（4.0 年）40,000 km 開 198.8 萬（原價 392 萬 → 車商售價 50.7%）、2021 年掛牌（5.4 年）82,000 km 開 169.8 萬（→ 43.3%）。兩點斜率約每年 -5.3 個百分點，並依德系前段跌幅較陡（曲線上凸）修正，得第 1 年車商售價約為新車價 70-72%。本車 7,000 km 低於同齡平均約 13,000 km，第 1 年里程對價格影響很小，僅加約 1-2%，取 72% × 4,130,000 ≈ 297 萬車商售價；自售依規則低約 9-11% → 270 萬。dealer_tradein 再低約 14%。\n【與前一版的差異】前一版取 285 萬，主因是重壓 8891 個別車輛頁 usedauto-infos-4524802.html 那台 2024 年出廠、開價 299 萬的車（宣稱原廠認證、車齡 2.2 年 → 73.6%）。本次實抓該頁只能確認「2024 年、299.0 萬、車商（無名車庫）」，里程與原廠認證身分都讀不到；且該價位與上述兩筆有明碼的一般車商開價連不成一條線（照 50.7%@4 年推回，2.2 年應在 58-62% 而非 73.6%），研判為認證溢價疊加滯銷旗艦的喊價，不宜當第 1 年的主錨點，已降權。Q8 是本表 400 萬級距德系 SUV 中銷量最小、世代最老（2018 年全球問世）的一台，第 1 年保值率理應是同群最差而非中段，故由 71.5% 下修至 67.5%（對 real_cost），低於 Mercedes GLE 450 的 70.6%。"},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"以同世代實際掛牌車為錨點，並已做車商售價→自售價折算。主錨點：8891 auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q8 實抓「Audi Q8 2023 款 55 TFSI quattro S line 運動版 3.0L｜2022 年掛牌｜4 萬公里｜198.8 萬」——4.0 年車、車商開價 198.8 萬、原價 392 萬 → 車商售價 50.7%。校正到本車第 3 年、21,000 km：年齡少 1 年（依 8891 兩點實測斜率約 +5.3 個百分點，相對約 +10%）、里程少 19,000 km（此級距約每 5,000 km 值 1%，約 +4%），得車商售價約 227 萬；另以「同款原價比」路徑（本車新車價 413 萬 × 校正後比例約 58.8%）得約 243 萬，兩路徑取中約 235 萬車商售價。自售依規則低約 11% → 208 萬。dealer_tradein 再低約 14.5%。\n【與前一版的差異——本次最主要的修正】前一版填 225 萬，但其推導鏈有兩個問題：(1) 內插用的上緣是那台 299 萬的疑似認證車（見第 1 年說明），把整段曲線墊高；(2) 算術灌水——source 自述「車商售價約原價 62%」，62% × 392 萬 = 243 萬，卻寫成「約 256 萬」，再乘自售折扣才得 225 萬。用它自己宣告的 62% 正確計算應得 243 × 0.88 ≈ 214 萬。更關鍵的是，225 萬落在本次估到的車商售價區間（227-243 萬）之內而非其下 8-15%，等於把車商開價當成自售價填入，正是本任務要抓的 dealer-retail trap。改以 208 萬（對 real_cost 52.0%），低於本表 Cayenne 56.0%、X5 59.1%、GLE 59.6%；這個位置有實際 4 年車開價 50.7% 撐著，是本表同級唯一有硬資料的第 3 年錨點。"},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"有同世代真實 5 年車開價可用，且已做車商售價→自售價折算。錨點：8891 auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q8 實抓「Audi Q8 2021 款 55 TFSI quattro S line 3.0L｜2021 年掛牌｜8.2 萬公里｜169.8 萬」——5.4 年、原價 392 萬 → 車商售價 43.3%。同列表另有 2020 年掛牌 95,000 km 一台為電洽，無法採用。校正到本車第 5 年、35,000 km：年齡少 0.4 年約 +2%、里程少 47,000 km 約 +9%（每 5,000 km 約 1%），得車商售價約 189 萬；另以同款原價比路徑（413 萬 × 約 49%）得約 203 萬，兩路徑取中約 196 萬車商售價。自售依規則低約 11% → 174 萬。dealer_tradein 再低約 15%。\n【與前一版的差異】前一版同樣填 175 萬、數字幾乎一致，但推導鏈有算術灌水：source 自述「低里程車商售價約為原價 48%」，48% × 392 萬 = 188 萬，卻寫成「約 198 萬」。本次改以雙路徑取中重算，結論相近（174 萬 vs 175 萬），故金額僅微調，但推導已可稽核。對 real_cost 為 43.5%，與本表 Cayenne 43.5%、GLE 43.8%、Q5 42.8% 同一族群。"},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"外推，非同世代實價：台灣 Q8 2021/03 才上市，市場上最老只有 5.4 年，7 年車不存在，不編造。依規則改用前代／同級大型 Audi SUV（Q7 4M，同底盤同級）的殘值比再套回本車。路徑 A：8891 auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q7 實抓「Audi Q7 2019 款 55 TFSI quattro 3.0L｜2019 年掛牌｜1.4 萬公里｜180.0 萬」，7.4 年、原價 371 萬（7car.tw/articles/read/57736 記載 Q7 車系 296／318／371 萬，55 TFSI quattro 為頂規）→ 車商售價 48.5%；但該車 14,000 km（約 1,900 km/年）比本車 49,000 km 還極端，且為孤例喊價，向下校正約 -7% → 45%，套回 413 萬得車商售價約 186 萬。路徑 B：本車自身曲線外推，第 5 年車商售價約 47.5%，第 7 年出保後市場開始把氣壓避震與 V6 過保風險計入，續跌至約 39-40%，得約 163 萬。兩路徑取中約 165 萬車商售價，自售低約 12% → 145 萬。dealer_tradein 再低約 15%。\n對 real_cost 為 36.3%，落在本表 Cayenne 36.7%、GLE 36.5%、X5 36.4% 之間、Q5 33.5% 之上。第 7 年已出保（原廠保固 3 年），尾段持續下墜而不像 Lexus 走平。路徑 A 與 B 分歧達 14%，且 A 的唯一依據是一台極端低里程的孤例開價（非成交價），故 confidence 維持 low。"},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"外推，非同世代實價：Q8 不存在 10 年車。依規則改用前代大型 Audi SUV（Q7 4M）的殘值比。8891 auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q7 實抓三筆 10-11 年車，各自對照 FindCar 2016 年 Q7 分車型新車價（findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=0&b=5&m=47&y=2016 實抓，該頁列出 40 TFSI quattro 五／七人座 275／283 萬、40 TFSI quattro Luxury 五／七人座 289／297 萬、45 TDI quattro 五／七人座 351／359 萬、45 TFSI quattro 五／七人座 367／375 萬）：(a) 45 TFSI quattro 七人座、100,000 km、69.9 萬 ÷ 375 萬 = 18.6%；(b) 40 TFSI quattro Luxury 七人座、100,000 km、56.8-57.8 萬 ÷ 297 萬 = 19.1-19.5%；(c) 45 TDI quattro 七人座、177,400 km、59.9 萬 ÷ 359 萬 = 16.7%（里程更高故更低，方向一致）。取 (a)(b) 得 10 年、100,000 km 車商售價殘值比約 18.9%。本車 10 年僅 70,000 km，低里程約 +6% → 約 20.0%，套回新車價 4,130,000 得車商售價約 83 萬，自售低約 12% → 73 萬。dealer_tradein 再低約 18%（10 年車車商收購折讓最大）。\n【與前一版的差異】前一版填 82 萬，分母用錯：它拿 FindCar 該頁的「2016 年 Q7 全車系新車均價 324.5 萬」去除 45 TFSI quattro 七人座 的 69.9 萬，得 21.5%。但 69.9 萬那台的實際新車價是 375 萬（均價 324.5 萬含 275 萬起的 40 TFSI 入門車型），用車系均價當分母把殘值比高估了約 15%。改用同車型正確分母後為 18.6%，並用第二筆（40 TFSI Luxury 七人座）交叉驗證得 19.1-19.5%，兩者一致。對 real_cost 為 18.3%，與本表 X5 18.3%、Cayenne 18.8% 同位置。旗艦車第 10 年跌更兇：修理風險與車價同步放大（氣壓避震四支、48V 鋰電池、V6 漏油）。註：Audi 原廠認證通路 approvedplus.audi.com.tw/listing/2590/q7 有一台 2016/12 領牌、82,127 km 掛 138 萬，與 8891 一般行情差距過大（疑為未下架的舊頁面），未採用。"}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Audi Taiwan 官方保養查價工具 service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw（本次實抓確認為官方定期保養費用來源，但只讀得到 A1 Sportback 級距 10,500-11,500）與 car.faqs.tw 整理的官方保養表（A1 Sportback 小保 8,300-9,300）為基準，按 3.0 V6 對 1.0 三缸的機油量與工時倍率（約 1.8x）換算至約 15,000。保固年限取自 audi.com.tw/zh/Audi_Service/regular-warranty/（3 年不限里程）。與本表 Porsche Cayenne 第 1 年 16,000、BMW X5 16,000、Mercedes GLE 450 18,000 同一量級。"},{"y":3,"source":"同第 1 年基準（Audi Taiwan 官方保養表換算 + audi.com.tw 保固頁）。項目組合依 Audi 官方保養表的分段內容（20,000 km 段加煞車油與火星塞、30,000 km 段加空氣濾芯）改以「時間到期」重排：本車 3 年只跑 21,000 km，火星塞尚未到期故不列，煞車油依 2 年日曆週期必換。與本表 Porsche Cayenne 第 3 期 58,000、BMW X5 49,000 相當，明顯高於日系同級。"},{"y":5,"source":"官方保養表換算（大保養以 A1 60,000 km 段 19,100-20,100 乘 V6 倍率約 2.2x）+ 台灣市場零件行情推估。第 3 年底原廠保固到期，本期起故障維修開始自費。21 吋 285/45R21 胎價未查到公開標價（Costco 台灣該規格頁面回 404、BigGo/蝦皮只見比價頁無明碼），一套四條含工 70,000 為市場經驗值推估而非實查售價，故本期整體標 low。與本表 Porsche Cayenne 第 5 期 208,000、BMW X5 176,000 相當，遠高於 Audi Q5（95,000），差距主要來自 21 吋胎與 V6 大保養。"},{"y":7,"source":"外推＋機率加權，無單一收據來源。氣壓避震在台灣有成熟的第三方維修生態（cgairtw.com、m-b-power.com、lscar89.com 均有 Q7 4M 氣壓避震漏氣更換案例頁），可佐證這是 Q7/Q8 世代的常見故障類別，但這些頁面未公開標價，金額為機率加權推估。年度保養單價沿用官方表換算再打外廠折。\n【與前一版的差異】前一版第 5 期與第 7 期同為 200,000，違反「period_cost 應隨車齡遞增」——第 7 期是完全無保固、氣壓避震與 V6 水路風險窗口首度開啟的一期，不可能與仍有部分新車件的第 5 期持平。本表比照同級曲線（Cayenne 208,000→235,000、X5 176,000→243,000、GLE 175,000→195,000）上調至 225,000，增額落在氣壓避震（45,000→60,000）與 V6 水路（30,000→40,000）兩個真正的過保風險項。"},{"y":10,"source":"外推＋機率加權，無單一收據來源。第 7-10 年完全無保固、無任何保養套餐補貼，全額自費計算。金額結構參照本表 Porsche Cayenne 第 10 期 527,000、BMW X5 518,000，Q8 取 520,000——Audi 的原廠工資費率與零件價低於 Porsche，但 Q8 標配氣壓避震（Cayenne 基本型為鋼圈彈簧）把差距補了回來。十年保養合計 1,015,000，約為本表 Toyota RAV4 等日系同級的數倍，這正是德系旗艦 SUV 的持有成本重心所在。"}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新聞：標配抬頭顯示器、動態全輪轉向下放，Audi 新年式 Q7 與 Q8 配備與價格調整","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/86195","note":"2026 年式 Q8 建議售價 413 萬起、調幅 4-7 萬、新增標配 HUD 與後輪轉向。經搜尋結果摘要讀取（該站直接抓取回 403）。用於 list_price 複查。"},{"name":"自由時報汽車頻道：Audi Q7、Q8 2026 年式發表 升級抬頭顯示與後輪轉向","url":"https://auto.ltn.com.tw/news/30043","note":"「Audi Q8 車系建議售價 413 萬元起」。2026 年式價格的第二個獨立確認。經搜尋結果摘要讀取。"},{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點：Audi Q8 台灣上市（55 TFSI quattro S line 單一車型）","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/72973","note":"2021/03/08 台灣導入時建議售價 392 萬。本次由 U-CAR、7car、Auto-Online、Mobile01 四來源交叉確認同一日期與價格，是 2021-2022 年份中古車殘值比的分母。經搜尋結果摘要讀取。"},{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點：Audi Q7 車系台灣售價（296／318／371 萬）","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/57736","note":"Q7 55 TFSI quattro 2019 年式建議售價 371 萬，用於第 7 年殘值比外推的分母。經搜尋結果摘要讀取。"},{"name":"8891 中古車：Audi Q8 車型列表","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q8","note":"實抓，全站僅 7 台在售、其中 5 台為電洽。兩筆有明碼者為本記錄第 1、3、5 年的骨幹：2023 款／2022 年掛牌／40,000 km／198.8 萬（原價 392 萬 → 50.7%），2021 款／2021 年掛牌／82,000 km／169.8 萬（→ 43.3%）。均為車商開價，已依規則折算為自售價。"},{"name":"8891 中古車：2024 年 Audi Q8 個別車輛頁（無名車庫，台北）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4524802.html","note":"實抓，開價 299.0 萬。前一版把它當第 1、3 年的上緣主錨點並宣稱其為「原廠認證、車齡 2.2 年」，但本次實抓只能確認年份、價格與賣家為車商，里程與原廠認證身分均讀不到；且該價位與同列表兩筆有明碼的一般車商開價連不成一條線，已降權為參考而非錨點。"},{"name":"8891 中古車：2024 年 Audi Q8 個別車輛頁（台中萬通汽車）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4638780.html","note":"實抓，開價 215 萬。與同齡車落差過大、頁面未載明是否為 Q8 e-tron（純電版），判定為不可靠資料點，未採用。列出以示未挑選有利數字。"},{"name":"8891 中古車：Audi Q7 車型列表","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/q7","note":"實抓。第 7 年外推錨點：2019 款 55 TFSI quattro、2019 年掛牌、14,000 km、180.0 萬。第 10 年外推錨點：2016 款 45 TFSI quattro 七人座 100,000 km 69.9 萬、40 TFSI quattro Luxury 七人座 100,000 km 56.8-57.8 萬、45 TDI quattro 七人座 177,400 km 59.9 萬。"},{"name":"FindCar 找車網：Audi Q8 新車與中古車價格","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/audi%20q8","note":"實抓。確認 2024 年式 55 TFSI quattro S-Line 運動版 406 萬、Black Edition 416 萬，用於建立 392→406→413 萬的價格歷程。該頁「中古車均價 346.9 萬」因混入 RS Q8 與 Q8 e-tron 而失真，未採用。"},{"name":"FindCar 找車網：2016 年 Audi Q7 分車型新車價","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=0&b=5&m=47&y=2016","note":"實抓確認頁面可載入並列出 8 個車型：40 TFSI quattro 五／七人座 275／283 萬、40 TFSI quattro Luxury 五／七人座 289／297 萬、45 TDI quattro 五／七人座 351／359 萬、45 TFSI quattro 五／七人座 367／375 萬，車系均價 324.5 萬。第 10 年殘值比必須用「對應車型」的價格當分母（45 TFSI quattro 七人座 375 萬），不能用車系均價 324.5 萬——前一版即在此出錯。"},{"name":"Audi Approved Plus 原廠認證中古車：Q8","url":"https://approvedplus.audi.com.tw/listing/2649/q8","note":"實抓。僅一台 2020 年式（2021/3 領牌）55 TFSIq S line、44,293 km、318.8 萬且已售出；318.8/392 = 81% 與 5 年車齡不符，判定為未下架的舊頁面，未用於第 5 年錨點。"},{"name":"Audi Approved Plus 原廠認證中古車：Q7","url":"https://approvedplus.audi.com.tw/listing/2590/q7","note":"實抓。2016/12 領牌、82,127 km 掛 138 萬，與 8891 同年份一般行情（56-70 萬）差距過大，判定不可靠，未用於第 10 年錨點。"},{"name":"Audi Taiwan 官方保養查價：保養透明 安心啟航","url":"https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/","note":"本次實抓再確認為 Audi Taiwan 官方定期保養費用查詢工具（授權經銷商售出車輛），但頁面僅能讀到 A1 Sportback 2020 年式級距的數字（NT$10,500-11,500），查不到 Q8 專屬報價，且明示為參考值、實際依檢查結果而定。作為保養單價換算的官方基準。"},{"name":"car.faqs.tw：台灣奧迪開放線上保養項目資料查詢","url":"https://car.faqs.tw/%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3%E5%A5%A7%E8%BF%AA%E9%96%8B%E6%94%BE%E7%B7%9A%E4%B8%8A%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E9%A0%85%E7%9B%AE%E8%B3%87%E6%96%99%E6%9F%A5%E8%A9%A2-1597654583","note":"實抓。轉載官方保養表：A1 Sportback 30 TFSI 每 10,000 km 小保 8,300-9,300、60,000 km 大保（含變速箱油、火星塞、煞車油）19,100-20,100，保養里程分段 10,000 km。Q8 保養費用由此按 V6 倍率換算。"},{"name":"Audi Taiwan 官方保固說明","url":"https://www.audi.com.tw/zh/Audi_Service/regular-warranty/","note":"新車保固 3 年不限里程；原廠零件另有 2 年不限里程保固。決定第 1、3 期無自費維修、第 5 期起全額自費。經搜尋結果摘要讀取。"},{"name":"U-CAR 促銷專區：Audi Taiwan 上市超值專案（3 年 5 萬公里免費保養）","url":"https://promotion.u-car.com.tw/promotion/article/10239","note":"佐證 Audi Taiwan 有「3 年 5 萬公里免費保養」型態的購車專案。因無法確認 2026 年式 Q8 現行是否適用，本表保守假設未適用，僅於 plan_notes 註明可能的下修空間。經搜尋結果摘要讀取。"},{"name":"CG 氣壓避震器維修專賣店 / M&B POWER / LS 聯盛汽車","url":"https://cgairtw.com/","note":"實抓搜尋結果確認台灣有專營原廠氣壓避震器維修的第三方業者，且有 Q7 4M 前避震漏氣更換案例，佐證氣壓避震為此世代常見故障類別。三家均未公開標價，故第 7、10 期的氣壓避震金額為機率加權推估而非實查報價。"},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞：Audi Q8 國內上市（單一規格 55 TFSI quattro S line）","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/65252","note":"2021/03/08 上市價 392 萬的獨立確認，用於界定台灣 Q8 最老車齡為 5.4 年（因此 7 年與 10 年必須依規則外推前代 Q7 4M 的殘值比）。經搜尋結果摘要讀取。"}]},"bmw-1-series-120-m-sport":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, well under the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000. All checkpoints use 7,000 km/year (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km). At this mileage the F70's Condition Based Service schedule is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven: the engine-oil service falls due on the roughly 2-year clock long before the ~25,000-30,000 km clock, and brake fluid is a fixed 2-year item regardless of distance. Budget about one dealer visit a year. Tires likewise age out (roughly every 5 years) rather than wear out. Because the car is far below average mileage, all resale figures are quoted against LOW-MILEAGE listings, which sit above the mileage-blind average. Taxes (牌照稅 NT$7,120/yr, 燃料稅 NT$4,800/yr — both figures confirmed on the U-CAR spec table and the Yahoo trim page) and insurance are excluded by design and appear nowhere in this record.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"VERIFIED BY FACT-CHECK against a fresh scrape of 8891中古車 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/1-series/120) on 2026-08-12. I re-parsed the listing cards including their TITLES, specifically to test whether the cheaper 120 Sport had been mistaken for the 120 M Sport — it had not. Genuine 「120 M Sport 1.5L」 F70 cards, 2025 registration, low mileage: NT$1,580,000 / 3,141 km; NT$1,580,000 / 3,134 km; NT$1,580,000 / 3,000 km; NT$1,560,000 / 7,201 km; NT$1,560,000 / 3,000 km; NT$1,520,000 / 3,042 km; NT$1,520,000 / 3,000 km; NT$1,510,000 / 6,000 km. One sits at 7,201 km, almost exactly this checkpoint's 7,000 km. Median dealer retail for a ~1-year-old low-mileage M Sport is therefore about NT$1,545,000. Listing text confirms many are 原廠認證 / BPS cars (「BMW汎德原廠認證車」, 「台南汎德認證中古車」, 「BPS原廠保固」), which carries a certification premium over an ordinary dealer ask. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN (these are 車商售價, not what an owner receives): dealer retail ~NT$1,545,000 → private sale NT$1,335,000, i.e. 13.6% below dealer retail, inside the expected 8-15% private-sale discount → dealer trade-in NT$1,170,000, a further 12.4% below private. Confidence is 'medium' rather than 'high': the dealer-retail observation is strong and directly sourced, but no private-sale transaction data exists, so the private figure itself is a modeled conversion, not an observed price."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED BY FACT-CHECK (was NT$1,010,000 / NT$880,000). No genuine 3-year F70 exists — the generation only went on sale in Taiwan in late 2024, so the oldest cars are about 1.7 years old — therefore this remains EXTRAPOLATED, but it is now anchored on two things instead of one. (a) Predecessor F40 at 3 years, verified on 8891 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/1-series) on 2026-08-12: 118i Edition M, 2023 registration, 20,000 km, asking NT$1,080,000 against a verified NT$1,810,000 list (https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-1-series-2023-118i-edition-m) = 59.7% dealer retail; 120i Edition M, 2023 registration, 26,000 km, asking NT$1,298,000 against a verified NT$2,010,000 list = 64.6%. Mean ≈ 62%, which on this car's real_cost gives NT$1,138,000. (b) The F70's OWN observed 2-year market, which the original record never used: 2024-registered 「120 M Sport 1.5L」 cards on the same 8891 page ask NT$1,450,000 at 6,000-6,600 km (five separate listings), NT$1,490,000 at 3,100 km, NT$1,420,000 at 18,000 km. Reading forward from NT$1,545,000 at ~1.2 years and NT$1,455,000 at ~1.7 years, year 3 dealer retail lands nearer NT$1,200,000-1,250,000. Route (a) alone implied a 21% single-year drop in year 3 after only a ~12% drop in year 2 — an ACCELERATING curve, which is the wrong shape: German depreciation is front-loaded and the rate should decelerate after year 1. I therefore blended the two to NT$1,190,000 dealer retail, then took private sale ~10% below = NT$1,070,000, and dealer trade-in ~13% below private = NT$930,000. At 58.3% of real_cost this now sits in line with the sibling German hatches in this table rather than below them. The F40 numbers are themselves depressed by the F70 replacing them in late 2024 — a generational hit this car will take around 2030-31 too, so part of that effect is deliberately carried forward."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from predecessor F40 at 5 years, ratio applied to real_cost; the underlying listings were re-verified by fact-check on 8891 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/1-series) 2026-08-12. F40 118i against its verified NT$1,690,000 original list (https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-1-series-2021-118i-edition-m): 2021 registration, 27,000 km, asking NT$980,000 = 58%; 2021 registration, 50,000 km, asking NT$868,000 = 51%; 2021 registration, 101,900 km, asking NT$779,000 = 46%. All three cards confirmed present. The mileage spread is large, which is exactly why the low-mileage assumption matters. At 35,000 km this car sits between the first two points; I kept the original 52% dealer retail (NT$954,000) rather than the 58% top point, because the 27,000 km example is an unusually pampered outlier and because a 5-year-old F70 will by then be a superseded-generation car. Private sale ~13% below dealer retail = NT$830,000; dealer trade-in ~13% below private = NT$720,000."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no 7-year data exists for this generation. Re-verified by fact-check on 8891 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/1-series/118i) 2026-08-12. Route A, F20 118i at 7 years: 2019 registrations asking NT$598,000 at 38,000 km and NT$593,000 at 50,000 km — mileage almost identical to this checkpoint's 49,000 km — against a NT$1,520,000 original list = 39% dealer retail. I specifically checked the denominator, because valuing a 2019 car against a 2016 list price would be a mismatch: Yahoo shows the base 118i held NT$1,520,000 across both the 2016 and 2017 model years (https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-1-series-2016-118i), so NT$1,520,000 is a fair denominator for a late-F20 118i and the 39% stands. Route B, F40 at 6 years: 2020 registration 118i, 10,400 km, asking NT$869,000 against NT$1,690,000 = 51%, which interpolates to roughly 43-45% at 7 years for a low-mileage car. I used 40% dealer retail (NT$734,000), nearer the F20 route, because by year 7 the car is out of the 3-year factory warranty and the Taiwan used market prices in German repair risk hard — the 48V ISG and 7-speed DCT are exactly the components buyers discount for. Private sale ~14% below dealer retail = NT$630,000; dealer trade-in ~14% below private = NT$540,000. Wider percentage gaps than the early years because dealer margin per unit is closer to fixed on cheap cars."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the F20 generation, the only 1 Series old enough to have real 10-year prices. Re-verified by fact-check on 8891 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/1-series/118i) 2026-08-12: 2016-registered 118i against its verified NT$1,520,000 original list (https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-1-series-2016-118i) — 28,000 km asking NT$430,000 = 28%; 27,000 km asking NT$430,000 = 28%; 50,000 km asking NT$342,000 = 22%; 80,000 km asking NT$328,000 = 22%; 85,000 km asking NT$378,000 = 25%; 120,000 km asking NT$338,000 = 22%; 194,000 km asking NT$296,000 = 19%. At this checkpoint's 70,000 km the F20 ratio reads about 23-25%. I applied 25% to real_cost (NT$459,000 dealer retail) and shaded the result down, because the F70 is a materially more complex and expensive car than a 2016 118i — 48V ISG, 48V lithium pack, dual-clutch gearbox, OS9 electronics — and a decade-old German car with that content carries a heavier repair-risk discount. The German tail keeps falling here rather than flattening the way a Lexus does. Private sale ~16% below dealer retail = NT$385,000; dealer trade-in ~16% below private = NT$325,000. Single-generation basis on a car with different mechanicals: genuinely low confidence."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Estimate, not sourced. Warranty coverage verified from 8891 F70 listings advertising 「保固至2028年」 / 「總代理保固到2028/9」 for 2025-registered cars (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/1-series/120), re-confirmed 2026-08-12. At 7,000 km the CBS oil service is nowhere near due, so this period is essentially consumables only. If BMW Service Inclusive is not bundled in the deal, budget roughly NT$20,000 instead."},{"y":3,"source":"Estimate, not sourced. Still inside the verified 3-year warranty and the assumed 3-year service package, so the owner pays for wear and non-covered items only. Brake fluid falls due on the 2-year clock inside this window. Same caveat: without the bundled package, budget roughly NT$55,000-60,000 for this period."},{"y":5,"source":"Estimate, not sourced. First period fully outside both the 3-year warranty and the assumed service package, so full 汎德 dealer rates apply. Tires are the single biggest line at roughly NT$42,000 for a set of four in this size — they are replaced on age, not tread, at 7,000 km/year. Brake pads at 35,000 km reflect the M Sport's larger brakes and sportier use."},{"y":7,"source":"Estimate, not sourced. Out of warranty and into the German risk window. The DCT fluid service (roughly NT$20,000 at a dealer) and the electric water pump / thermostat housing risk allowance are the items that separate this from a Japanese equivalent — an electric water pump job runs NT$30,000-45,000 and is a well-known BMW failure point in this age band. AGM battery replacement requires dealer registration, which is why it is not a NT$4,000 job."},{"y":10,"source":"Estimate, not sourced, and the least certain figure in this record. This is a 3-year window on an 8-to-10-year-old out-of-warranty German car, and it is where the mild-hybrid hardware finally bites: the 48V lithium pack runs NT$40,000-60,000 and the ISG starter-generator NT$80,000-150,000, carried here as a probability-weighted allowance of roughly NT$35,000 rather than a certainty. Oil-leak repairs (valve cover gasket, sump) and suspension bushings are near-certain at this age on this platform. A German hatch whose 7-10 year maintenance resembled a Japanese equivalent's would be wrong; roughly NT$88,000/year here is the realistic shape."}],"sources":[{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2026 BMW 1-Series 120 M Sport","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-1-series-2026-120-m-sport","note":"Re-fetched during fact-check 2026-08-12. Renders 「2026 BMW 1-Series 120 M Sport 185」 plus the full 2026 lineup 120 Sport 157萬 / 120 M Sport 185萬 / M135 xDrive 270萬, and 牌照稅 $7,120 / 燃料稅 $4,800. This is the list_price used: NT$1,850,000."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2025 BMW 1-Series 120 M Sport","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-1-series-2025-120-m-sport","note":"Re-fetched during fact-check. Renders 183萬 with a 2025 lineup of 155 / 183 / 268萬, establishing the +NT$20,000 model-year step to the 2026 car across all three trims."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車頻道 — BMW 1 Series 車款介紹","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/1%20series/6976/overall","note":"Re-fetched during fact-check. Spec table gives 120 M Sport 183萬 (2025 model year, one year stale), 1,499 c.c., 直列3汽缸, 七速自手排, 前輪驅動, 156 hp, 燃4,800 / 牌7,120. Body text confirms the ISG 48V 輕油電系統 cuts cargo from 380 to 300 litres via the 48V 鋰電池組 under the boot floor, and that the M135 xDrive 沒有配備 48V 系統. Primary evidence for the 'gasoline' classification."},{"name":"8891中古車 — BMW 1-Series 120 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/1-series/120","note":"Primary source for the year-1 and year-3 checkpoints. Re-scraped during fact-check 2026-08-12 WITH listing titles, to separate 「120 M Sport 1.5L」 cards from the cheaper 「120 Sport 1.5L」 — the two trims are interleaved on this page and are easy to confuse. Genuine M Sport cards: 2025 registration at NT$1,510,000-1,580,000 (3,000-7,201 km) and 2024 registration at NT$1,380,000-1,490,000 (3,100-30,000 km, including five at NT$1,450,000 / 6,000-6,600 km). Also the source confirming the 3-year factory warranty via 「保固至2028年」 / 「總代理保固到2028/9」 / 「BPS原廠保固」 listing text."},{"name":"8891中古車 — BMW 1-Series 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/1-series","note":"Full 404-unit listing set across all generations (the 404 count was confirmed on the page during fact-check). Source of the F40 year-3 and year-5 retention ratios, with year, mileage and asking price for each car."},{"name":"8891中古車 — BMW 1-Series 118i 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/1-series/118i","note":"Predecessor 118i listings, re-scraped during fact-check. Source of the F20 year-7 points (2019 registration, NT$598,000 / 38,000 km and NT$593,000 / 50,000 km) and the F20 year-10 spread (2016 registration, NT$261,000-430,000 across 27,000-194,000 km)."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2023 BMW 1-Series 118i Edition M","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-1-series-2023-118i-edition-m","note":"Denominator for the year-3 retention ratio, verified during fact-check: 118i Edition M 181萬, and on the same lineup block 120i Edition M 201萬, 118i Edition Sport 167萬, 128ti 219萬, M135i xDrive 265萬. Confirms the NT$1,810,000 and NT$2,010,000 denominators are correct."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2021 BMW 1-Series 118i Edition M","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-1-series-2021-118i-edition-m","note":"F40 predecessor original list price NT$1,690,000 (also 118i Edition Sport 159萬, 120i Edition M 189萬), verified during fact-check. Denominator for the 5-year and 7-year Route B ratios."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2016 BMW 1-Series 118i","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-1-series-2016-118i","note":"F20 original list price NT$1,520,000, the denominator for the 7-year and 10-year retention ratios. Cross-checked during fact-check against the 2017 page (https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-1-series-2017-118i), which also shows 152萬, confirming the base 118i held its price across late-F20 model years."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — BMW 118i 中古車價格","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&b=9&m=1255&op=4","note":"CORRECTED BY FACT-CHECK — this source contributes NOTHING and no figure in this record rests on it. The URL is real and returns HTTP 200, but the page ships only a shell: it renders its listing figures via JavaScript, and the delivered HTML contains no unit count and no average price. The previously attributed aggregate ('155 units listed, average asking NT$583,000') does not appear anywhere in the retrieved document and could not be substantiated. Retained here only so the claim is not silently reused as corroboration."}]},"bmw-2-series-active-tourer-220i":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. All checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7000 / 21000 / 35000 / 49000 / 70000). POWERTRAIN: the U06 220i is a 1,499 cc three-cylinder TwinPower Turbo (156 hp @5000 rpm) with BMW's second-generation 48V mild-hybrid starter-generator built into the 7-speed dual-clutch gearbox, adding ~19-20 hp of eBoost for 170 hp combined (verified this round on the Yahoo Autos trim page and the KingAutos launch article). It supports engine-off coasting but CANNOT move the car on battery alone, so it is classified 'gasoline' per the table's rule; the 48V hardware is noted in purchase.notes and carried as a maintenance risk item in the 5-7 and 7-10 windows. MILEAGE CONSEQUENCE 1 - RESALE, RESTATED AFTER AUDIT: at every age this car carries roughly 40-55% of the mileage of a typical comparable listing, and a low-mileage premium is real in the 8891 data (2023/2024 Luxury cars at 5,000-7,300 km ask 132-135萬 while the same model years at 40,300-55,000 km ask 99.8-110.9萬). BUT the audit found the 8891 asking prices are BIMODAL WITHIN THE SAME YEAR AND MILEAGE BAND, not a clean mileage curve: a 2024 Luxury at 16,000 km asks 108.0萬 while 2024 Luxury cars at 7,000 km ask 135.0萬, and two 2023 Luxury cars both at 16,000 km ask 108.0萬 and 123.0萬. Quoting only the 132-135萬 top cluster overstates the curve, so this record quotes the CENTRE of the low-mileage band, not its top - see each checkpoint source. It also matters that at 2 years this buyer's car has 14,000 km, so the mileage-correct comparable is the 16,000 km car, not the 7,000 km one. MILEAGE CONSEQUENCE 2 - MAINTENANCE: BMW Taiwan's published interval is 每年或每一萬公里, whichever comes first (verified on the 台北依德 BMW service page). At 7,000 km/year the mileage trigger is never reached, so servicing is strictly TIME-DRIVEN: one annual visit, 10 visits over 10 years. Calendar-aged consumables (tires, brake fluid, coolant, 12V AGM battery) dominate the later windows while mileage-driven wear items (pads, discs) are pushed far out. Tax (牌照稅/燃料稅) and insurance are excluded by design.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, REVISED DOWN FROM 1,285,000. There are ZERO 2025-model-year listings in the entire 38-car 8891 set (year breakdown re-verified this round: 2016:3, 2017:2, 2018:6, 2022:6, 2023:13, 2024:8, 2025:0 - sums to 38), so there is no direct 1-year data point and confidence stays 'low'. WHY THE PRIOR FIGURE WAS TOO HIGH: it was bridged from 2024-MY Luxury cars at 7,000-7,333 km asking 135.0萬, treating that as 'the low-mileage band'. Two problems. (1) The same 2024 model year also has a Luxury at 16,000 km asking 108.0萬 and Luxury cars at 40,300-40,700 km asking 109.9-110.9萬 (mileages verified verbatim on the page as 4.03萬公里 / 4.07萬公里, so 40,300 km not 4,030 km - the original reading of the mileage was correct). A 27萬 gap between a 7,000 km and a 16,000 km car of the same year and trim is listing noise, not a mileage curve, so the 132-135萬 cluster is the TOP of a bimodal distribution, not its centre. (2) At 1 year this buyer's car has 7,000 km but at 2 years it has 14,000 km, so the mileage-correct 2-year comparable is the 16,000 km car, not the 7,000 km one. METHOD USED HERE: take the centre of the 2-year low-mileage Luxury band (~120-125萬 dealer asking, between the 135.0萬 and 108.0萬 poles), convert to the plain 220i cost base (Luxury lists 17萬 higher; the used gap compresses to ~10萬), giving ~113萬 dealer asking at 2 years, and step back one year to ~140万 dealer asking at 1 year. PRIVATE-SALE ADJUSTMENT: -11% off dealer retail asking gives ~1,246,000, set at 1,250,000 = 72.8% of real_cost. dealer_tradein_price is a further ~13% below private sale. Cross-check: 72.8% at year 1 sits just under the German peers in this table (X3 74.2%, GLC200 74.0%, Q5 73.7%) - correctly so, because those are premium SUVs and this is a compact MPV with a demonstrably thin buyer pool. A Toyota-like year-1 figure would be wrong here."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"BEST-EVIDENCED POINT IN THIS RECORD, REVISED DOWN FROM 1,085,000. Built from real 2023-MY listings on the 8891 220i Active Tourer page (38 listings, re-fetched this round; 13 of them are 2023-MY). Plain 220i at our buyer's band: 16,400 km asking 122.8萬 (Kaohsiung), 25,000 km asking 118.8萬 (Taipei) - interpolating to 21,000 km gives ~120.5萬. WHY THAT WAS TRIMMED RATHER THAN TAKEN AT FACE VALUE: the two plain-220i asks sit at the very top of what the better-populated 2023 Luxury sample supports, and the Luxury is the MORE expensive trim - 2023 Luxury at 16,000 km asks 108.0萬 in one listing and 123.0萬 in another, and the 2023 Luxury median across all mileages is ~110萬. A plain 220i asking more than the median Luxury of the same year is incoherent, so the plain-220i asks are optimistic. Central estimate adopted: ~118萬 dealer retail asking at 3 years / 21,000 km. Contrast with high-mileage same-year cars, which does validate a genuine low-mileage premium: 2023 Luxury at 50,000 km asks 105.8萬 and at 55,000 km asks 99.8萬. PRIVATE-SALE ADJUSTMENT: -11% off 1,180,000 gives ~1,050,000 = 61.2% of real_cost. METHOD NOTE: retention ratios are computed against each comparable's OWN real cost and then applied to this car's real_cost, never by mixing a list-price numerator with a real_cost denominator - that mismatch is a known way to inflate the early years by several points. Cross-check: 61.2% sits just below the GLC200 (62.3%) and well below the X3 (66.1%) at year 3, which is the right ordering for a compact MPV against premium SUVs."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"INTERPOLATED between a real 4-year U06 anchor and the predecessor-derived 7-year point; there are no 2021-MY listings in the set (the data jumps from 2018 to 2022), so this is not directly observed and confidence is 'low'. LOWER ANCHOR, WHICH IS REAL AND WELL-REPLICATED: 2022-MY cars at our mileage band - plain 220i at 30,000 km asking 108.0萬 (Taichung, two listings), plain 220i at 39,000 km asking 108.0萬 (Taoyuan), 220i Luxury at 39,000 km asking 108.0萬 (Taoyuan). Three independent plain-220i listings landing on the same 108.0萬 makes this the most consistent cluster on the page. At 4 years and ~30,000 km - almost exactly this buyer's 28,000 km - dealer retail asking is therefore 1,080,000; less the 11% private-sale haircut that is ~961,000, or ~57% of that car's own real cost (2022 list 172萬, so ~1,676,000 all-in). UPPER-AGE ANCHOR: the 30.9% 7-year figure derived from the F45 predecessor below. Bridging 4 years at 57% to 7 years at 31% puts year 5 at ~47.5%: 0.475 x 1,716,000 = 815,000. The 3->5 slope (61.2% -> 47.5%) is materially steeper than the 1->3 slope, which is the correct shape for a German car whose factory warranty (2+1 years, unlimited mileage, verified on the 台北依德 page) expires at year 3 - the used market starts pricing in repair risk the moment cover disappears. Cross-check against peers at year 5: Q5 42.8%, X3 48.5%, GLC200 51.3%, XC40 46.8%. This car at 47.5% sits inside that band."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION, REVISED UP FROM 505,000 AFTER FINDING THE PRIOR ANCHOR WAS A DUPLICATED OUTLIER. The U06 launched in Taiwan in March 2022, so no genuine 7-year data for this generation can exist and none was invented. The F45 220i Active Tourer (2.0L four-cylinder, 192 hp, 8AT) launched in Taiwan on 2015-03-06 at 建議售價 182萬 - re-verified this round by direct fetch of CarStuff - giving an F45 real cost of roughly 1,766,000 on comparable discount and fee assumptions. THE CORRECTION: the prior version anchored the tail on '2018 220i at 70,000 km asking 39.8萬'. That listing appears SIX TIMES on the page, same dealer, same New Taipei location, identical mileage and price - it is one car spam-listed, not six data points, and it is internally incoherent with the rest of the F45 set: a 2017 car at 87,000 km asks 53.8萬 and a 2016 car at 50,300 km asks 46.8萬, both MORE than this supposedly younger, lower-mileage car. Treating it as the tail anchor understates the curve. The distinct F45 cars on the page are: 2016 at 50,300 km 46.8萬, 2016 at 100,000 km 38.8萬, 2016 at 115,300 km 34.9萬, 2017 at 76,500 km 45.0萬, 2017 at 87,000 km 53.8萬, plus the one duplicated 2018 car at 39.8萬. METHOD: the 2017 pair averages ~49.4萬 at ~82,000 km; mileage-adjusting to this buyer's 49,000 km using the ~1.6萬 per 10,000 km slope implied by the 2016 pair gives ~54萬 at 9 years, and stepping two years younger gives ~62萬 dealer retail asking at 7 years. Less a 12% private-sale haircut: ~545,000, or ~31% of the F45's real cost. Settled marginally lower at 530,000 (30.9%) because the F45 sample is small and noisy and because this generation's DCT and 48V hardware are an unknown out-of-warranty liability. THIS REMAINS THE WEAKEST 7-YEAR RETENTION OF THE GERMAN CARS IN THIS TABLE (X3 37.3%, GLC200 40.7%, Q5 33.5%, XC40 31.5%) and that is the finding, not an error: an entry-level compact MPV is the body style that collapses hardest in Taiwan, and the F45 evidence shows it happening."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION, REVISED UP FROM 340,000 - same correction as the 7-year point. The prior figure was built on the 2018/70,000 km/39.8萬 listing that appears six times on the page as duplicates of a single car, and on an arithmetic slip: the prior text derived 19.0% and then applied 0.196, silently adding ~11,000. THE PROPER ANCHOR IS THE 2016 CARS, WHICH ARE GENUINELY 10 YEARS OLD TODAY: 50,300 km asking 46.8萬, 100,000 km asking 38.8萬, 115,300 km asking 34.9萬. This buyer's 10-year car carries only 70,000 km, so interpolating on mileage between the 50,300 km and 100,000 km cars gives ~43.6萬 dealer retail asking. Less a 12% private-sale haircut: ~383,000, or 21.7% of the F45's ~1,766,000 real cost. Applied to this car's real_cost: 0.213 x 1,716,000 = 365,000, set marginally below the raw interpolation because the buyer pool for a decade-old three-cylinder BMW MPV is very small. Confidence 'low' by construction - this is a cross-generation ratio transfer, honestly labelled as such rather than presented as observed. THE TAIL KEEPS FALLING RATHER THAN FLATTENING, which is the intended German-car behaviour and is visible directly in the F45 data: by year 10 the car is seven years out of warranty and the market prices in electric water pump, timing chain, DCT and 48V-era electronics risk. At 21.3% this is still among the weakest 10-year retentions of the German cars here (X3 23.8%, Q5 22.5%, GLC200 26.6%, XC40 21.0%). Supporting evidence for how thin this market is: SUM 汽車網 returned 車輛搜尋結果 共 0 筆 for the model, and 8891's main BMW navigation does not list the Active Tourer as a body style."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"One time-triggered annual visit only; the 10,000 km mileage trigger is never reached at 7,000 km/year (interval policy verified on the 台北依德 BMW service page). Priced at BMW Taiwan's small-engine 小保養 rate - the 1.5L three-cylinder uses less oil and has three plugs rather than four, so it sits below the 2.0L four-cylinder rate that owner reports put at 6,000-7,000+ per visit. Year 1 is inside the 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty, so nothing beyond scheduled servicing is carried. Cross-check against this table's other German cars at year 1: X3 10,000, GLC200 11,000, Q5 9,000, XC40 12,000 - this car is correctly the cheapest of the group. Assumes servicing is paid, not bundled free; see plan_notes."},{"y":3,"source":"Two annual visits, both still inside the 2+1年不限里程 warranty. Brake fluid is the one item that lands here purely on the calendar - BMW Taiwan owners consistently report 滿二年要換剎車油 regardless of mileage - and filters come due on the second or third service. No wear items yet: at 21,000 km the original pads, discs and tires are all far from replacement. The 22,000 figure is deliberately below the X3 (28,000), GLC200 (31,000) and Q5 (30,000) for the same window, reflecting the smaller engine and cheaper consumables; named items sum to ~19,000 with the balance carried as unspecified consumables. This is the last cheap window - the warranty ends at year 3 and the next window is where the real cost starts."},{"y":5,"source":"THE FIRST EXPENSIVE WINDOW, AND THE JUMP IS THE POINT - warranty cover ends at year 3, so both visits here are fully out of pocket and every failure is the owner's. Named items sum to exactly 70,000. The dominant line is tires: at only 7,000 km/year the tread will not be worn out, but rubber hardens and cracks on a 5-6 year calendar regardless of mileage, so a full set is replaced on age around year 5 - exactly the cost a mileage-based model misses. The 原廠 AGM 12V battery is the second big line; AGM is mandatory for auto start-stop and costs roughly double a conventional battery. Spark plugs on a three-cylinder are cheaper than the four-cylinder equivalent. Confidence 'low': the window total is built from BMW Taiwan unit-cost norms rather than a model-specific invoice, because every Mobile01 thread returned HTTP 403."},{"y":7,"source":"Four to seven years out of warranty is where German-specific failures start being priced in rather than hoped away; named items sum to ~105,500 against the 105,000 carried. Front pads and discs finally come due - late, at 49,000 km, precisely because of the low annual mileage - but BMW 原廠 pads and discs are roughly double a Japanese equivalent. The DCT oil service is a model-specific item worth calling out: the Active Tourer uses a 7-speed dual-clutch, not the ZF 8-speed torque-converter automatic found in rear-drive BMWs, and a dual-clutch fluid and filter service is both mandatory and more expensive. The 25,000 repair-event allowance is a risk-weighted expected value across the well-known B38 three-cylinder failure set (ignition coils, thermostat housing, oil filter housing gasket leaks), not a certainty for any one car. The 13,000 for the 48V hardware is likewise risk-weighted - a full 48V lithium battery or starter-generator replacement runs far higher, but the probability of needing it this early is modest. Lower than the X3's 162,000 for the same window, which is correct: no xDrive transfer case, no air suspension, smaller brakes and tires. CAVEAT: the 48V module's Taiwanese 原廠 replacement price could not be verified from any published price list, so that line is the least certain in this record."},{"y":10,"source":"THE TAIL DOES NOT FLATTEN, WHICH IS THE WHOLE POINT OF THE GERMAN MAINTENANCE PROFILE; named items sum to exactly 195,000. Three annual visits plus a concentration of age-driven failures now seven-plus years past warranty. The electric water pump is the single most-cited BMW big-ticket failure in this age band and is carried at full cost rather than risk-weighted, because on a 10-year-old BMW it is closer to expected than not. The 48V starter-generator and its lithium battery are carried at 25,000 risk-weighted - this is the mild-hybrid-specific exposure a conventional gasoline car does not have, and ignoring it would understate the cost of this powertrain. A second tire set falls due on the calendar again (roughly 5-6 year rubber life at 7,000 km/year), as does a second AGM battery. At 195,000 this window sits just below the X3 (200,000) and GLC200 (210,000) and above the Q5 (170,000) and XC40 (185,000): cheaper parts than a mid-size premium SUV, but no cheaper in risk, and the DCT and 48V hardware add exposure the larger cars' conventional automatics do not carry. Confidence 'low' - a structured expected-value build from BMW Taiwan norms and known failure modes, not observed 10-year invoices, which cannot exist for a generation launched in 2022."}],"sources":[{"name":"Yahoo Autos TW - BMW 2 Series Active Tourer 220i 車款介紹","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-2-series-active-tourer-2025-220i","note":"PRIMARY price and specification source, independently re-fetched and verified in this audit. 建議售價 178萬 for the plain 220i and 195萬 for the 220i Luxury - this is what confirms NT$1,780,000 as correct with 0% variance. Also the source for the powertrain classification: 1499cc three-cylinder, 156hp@5000rpm base engine, second-generation 48V system integrated into the transmission adding ~20hp of eBoost, engine-off coasting below 15km/h and in Eco/Comfort modes, Steptronic 7-speed dual-clutch. The 48V system cannot drive the car alone, hence powertrain 'gasoline'."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 - BMW Active Tourer 220i 新車行情","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/2024%20bmw%20active%20tourer%20220i","note":"INDEPENDENT CONFIRMATION of the list price, re-fetched and verified in this audit. Lists exactly two trims with new-car reference prices: 220i at 178萬 and 220i Luxury at 195萬, both 1.5L, 雙離合器7速自手排, front-wheel drive, 5-seat. Two independent sources at 178萬 is why the list price was accepted rather than adjusted. Also establishes that the plain 220i is the entry trim and that the Luxury sits 17萬 above it - the gap used to convert Luxury-trim used listings onto the plain 220i cost base."},{"name":"KingAutos - BMW 2 Series Active Tourer (U06) 台灣上市","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/343727","note":"Re-fetched and verified in this audit. Taiwan launch 2022-03-31 at 172萬 (220i) and 189萬 (220i Luxury), establishing that the lineup has risen roughly 6萬 in four years to today's 178萬 / 195萬 - the price-drift check that makes the current figure credible. Detailed 48V description used for the powertrain call: second-generation 48V system with the starter-generator inside the gearbox, 156hp engine / 170hp combined, +19hp eBoost, 0-100 in 8.1s. ALSO the source for the volume argument behind the small discount: 汎德 ran a 600-unit annual quota and had taken 接單超過250張 within the first month, i.e. an allocation-limited model with little reason to discount hard."},{"name":"WeWanted - BMW 2023 220i Active Tourer Luxury 成交菜單","url":"https://www.wewanted.com.tw/car_menu_content.php?uid=6547","note":"THE KEY DISCOUNT EVIDENCE, re-fetched and confirmed genuine in this audit (it was checked specifically because a single-transaction discount anchor is a common place for fabrication). A real deal sheet ordered 2023-09-13: 牌價 193萬, 成交價 1,830,000 元 (含配備 / 不含保險 / 不含規費 / 不含利息), including only OEM V-KOOL film and a full tank of 95. That is 100,000 off, or 5.2%. The 5.2% rate applied to 1,780,000 gives 92,560, which is the basis for the corrected 90,000 discount - the prior record's 70,000 was below this observed deal in both absolute and percentage terms while claiming to sit above it. It is also why onroad_fees carries 領牌 in full rather than assuming it was bundled."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 2-Series 220i Active Tourer 二手行情 (38 listings)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/2-series/220i-active-tourer","note":"PRIMARY used-value source, re-fetched three times in this audit to resolve conflicting reads. VERIFIED YEAR BREAKDOWN, which sums exactly to the stated 38: 2016:3, 2017:2, 2018:6, 2022:6, 2023:13, 2024:8, 2025:0. There are NO 2025-MY listings, which is why the 1-year point is extrapolated. VERIFIED MILEAGES: the page writes mileage in 萬公里 for anything over 10,000 km, so the 109.9萬 cars read '4.03萬公里' and '4.07萬公里' (40,300 / 40,700 km) and the 109.8萬 car reads '4.5萬公里' (45,000 km) - these were confirmed verbatim, and the low-mileage 135.0萬 / 132.0萬 cars genuinely read '7000公里', '7333公里' and '5000公里'. Current generation: 2024 Luxury 7,000-7,333km 135.0萬 (two listings), 2024 Luxury 16,000km 108.0萬, 2024 Luxury 40,300km 109.9萬 / 110.9萬, 2024 Luxury 45,000km 109.8萬, 2024 Luxury 54,000km 99.8萬 (原廠保固2027.03), 2023 Luxury 5,000km 132.0萬, 2023 Luxury 16,000km 108.0萬 and 123.0萬, 2023 220i 16,400km 122.8萬, 2023 220i 25,000km 118.8萬, 2023 Luxury 50,000km 105.8萬, 2023 Luxury 55,000km 99.8萬, 2022 220i 30,000km and 39,000km 108.0萬, 2022 Luxury 39,000km 108.0萬, 2022 Luxury 70,000km 89.9萬 and 78,000km 86.8萬. TWO CAUTIONS THAT DROVE CORRECTIONS IN THIS AUDIT. (1) The asking prices are BIMODAL within the same year and mileage band (2024 Luxury: 108.0萬 at 16,000km vs 135.0萬 at 7,000km), so the 132-135萬 cluster is the top of the distribution, not a mileage-clean 'low-mileage band'. (2) The predecessor F45 entry '2018 220i 70,000km 39.8萬 New Taipei' appears SIX TIMES - it is one car duplicated, and it is incoherent with the 2017 car at 87,000km asking 53.8萬 and the 2016 car at 50,300km asking 46.8萬. The distinct F45 cars used for the tail are: 2016 50,300km 46.8萬, 2016 100,000km 38.8萬, 2016 115,300km 34.9萬, 2017 76,500km 45.0萬, 2017 87,000km 53.8萬. ALL FIGURES ARE 車商售價 (dealer retail asking); every private_sale_price applies an 11-12% haircut to them."},{"name":"CarStuff - 182萬 BMW 220i Active Tourer 上市","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/17608-182-bmw-220i-active-tourer.html","note":"Re-fetched and verified in this audit. Source of the PREDECESSOR-GENERATION denominator required for the 7- and 10-year extrapolation: the F45 220i Active Tourer launched in Taiwan on 2015-03-06 at 建議售價 182萬, with a 2.0L TwinPower Turbo four-cylinder producing 192hp / 280Nm and a Steptronic 8-speed automatic. Note the generational difference - the old 220i was a 2.0 four, today's is a 1.5 three with 48V - which is stated in the checkpoint sources rather than glossed over."},{"name":"台北依德 BMW - 保修服務／延長保固方案","url":"https://yiderbmw.wordpress.com/bmw-service-extend/","note":"KEY MAINTENANCE SOURCE, re-fetched and verified in this audit. Two facts drive the maintenance plan: (a) new-car warranty is 2+1年不限里程 - verbatim 'BMW提供您的新車2+1年不限里程保固服務' - which is why the 3-5 year window jumps more than threefold as cover lapses; (b) the scheduled service interval is 每年或每一萬公里 ('每年或每一萬公里的定時定期保養'), which at 7,000 km/year makes servicing strictly time-driven at one visit per year, 10 visits over 10 years. IMPORTANT NEGATIVE FINDING FROM THIS AUDIT: the page does NOT say whether scheduled servicing is free or paid on a new car. The prior record attributed a 'servicing is not bundled free, 汎德 sells BMW Service Inclusive separately' claim to this page; that claim is not on it and has been downgraded to a stated assumption in plan_notes. The page does confirm 延長保固 of 1-2 further years exists but requires an end-of-warranty inspection before month 36 and a complete 原廠-only service history; pricing was not disclosed and is not modelled."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - BMW 2 Series Active Tourer 中古車搜尋","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=BMW&model=2-Series%20Active%20Tourer","note":"Re-fetched and verified in this audit, and the NULL RESULT is itself the finding: 車輛搜尋結果 共 0 筆 - zero listings across the entire SUM network for this model. Combined with the Active Tourer's absence from 8891's main BMW model navigation, this is direct evidence of a very thin used market, which is the qualitative justification for the weak tail retention and for the note in selling_costs that a private seller faces a small buyer pool and a long wait."},{"name":"7Car - 全新BMW 220i Active Tourer 即日上市","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/19605","note":"Carried over from the prior round as the second confirmation of the F45 predecessor's 182萬 Taiwan list price (launch 2015-03-06, 192hp, 280Nm, Steptronic 8-speed). NOT re-fetched in this audit - the same fact was independently re-verified on CarStuff instead, so the F45 denominator does not rest on this citation alone."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 品牌車型總覽","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw","note":"Carried over from the prior round as corroborating evidence of thin supply: the Active Tourer does not appear in 8891's main BMW model navigation, which lists 3/4/5-Series, 2-Series Coupe and Gran Coupe, X1-X7 and others but no Active Tourer body style, even though the dedicated 220i Active Tourer page exists with 38 listings. NOT re-fetched in this audit; it is corroborating colour only and no number in this record depends on it."}]},"bmw-2-series-coupe-220i-m-sport":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr; every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 x years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000), far below the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/yr. Consequences baked into this record: (1) servicing is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven — BMW's Condition Based Service mileage triggers are never reached, so the car gets one annual dealer service regardless of distance; (2) tires and the AGM 12V battery age out rather than wear out, so they are scheduled by calendar (~every 5-6 years for tires); (3) used values are quoted from genuinely low-mileage listings and adjusted upward off mileage-blind comparables, with the adjustment stated in each source string. Tax (牌照稅 NT$11,230/yr + 燃料稅 NT$6,180/yr, both confirmed on the Yahoo Autos trim page) and insurance are EXCLUDED by design and appear nowhere in this record. Not a BEV, so no home-charger installation cost applies. TIRE FITMENT — CORRECTED THIS ROUND: the previous draft asserted a staggered 225/45 R18 front / 255/45 R18 rear fitment and used 'the tires cannot be rotated' as a cost driver. The Yahoo Autos TW spec table lists a single 輪胎尺碼 of 225/45R18 and no rear size; the 255/45 R18 figure came from U-CAR alone and is geometrically implausible (255/45 R18 has a ~27 mm larger rolling diameter than 225/45 R18, and BMW's factory CLAR 18-inch staggered pairs match within a few mm — the real staggered partner for 225/45 R18 is 255/40 R18). The front size 225/45 R18 is confirmed; whether the car is square or staggered at the rear is NOT confirmed. Tire budgets below are therefore sized as 'four 18-inch performance tires at TW dealer/premium-shop rates', which is expensive either way, rather than being justified by an unverified no-rotation claim.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"8891 中古車 220i Coupe listing page, re-retrieved and re-verified 2026-08-12: exactly one 1-year-old car nationwide — a 2025款 220i M Sport, 1.1萬公里 (11,000 km), 高雄, 車商 asking NT$1,850,000. ADJUSTMENTS MADE (this is a dealer ASKING price, never copied): that car is a 汎德 BPS (BMW Premium Selection) 原廠認證中古車, which carries a certification premium (factory prep + warranty) of roughly 8-10% over ordinary dealer stock, so ordinary dealer retail is ~NT$1,690,000. Private sale then sits a further ~10% below ordinary dealer retail, ~NT$1,520,000, and I add ~NT$30,000 back for our car's lower mileage (7,000 vs 11,000 km) to reach NT$1,550,000 — a total haircut of 16% off the visible asking price, wider than the standard 8-15% band precisely because of the certification layer. Dealer trade-in set ~13% below private sale. This is a 25% loss of real_cost in year one — the steep German first-year hit, and consistent with the other German cars in this batch (BMW 1/3/4 Series and X3 all land at 71-75% year-one retention), not a Toyota-like curve. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED to low this round: the previous draft called this medium, but it rests on a SINGLE nationwide listing that additionally needed a two-step adjustment — that is the definition of a single weak data point."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"8891 中古車 220i Coupe page, re-verified 2026-08-12: six listings of 2023款 220i M Sport at 2.8-2.83萬公里 all asking NT$1,550,000, all in 桃園 and mostly BMW 原廠認證中古車 — almost certainly only one or two physical cars re-posted by different sales staff, so I treat this as ~1 data point, not 6. Bracketed against the genuine four-year cluster below (NT$1,280,000-1,420,000 across 新北/桃園/台中). ADJUSTMENTS MADE: de-certifying the BPS asking price gives ordinary dealer retail ~NT$1,480,000; adding back for our lower mileage (21,000 vs 28,000 km) gives ~NT$1,500,000 dealer retail; private sale ~12% below that = NT$1,320,000. Dealer trade-in ~13% below private. Original 2023 list was NT$2,090,000 (verified this round on the Yahoo Autos 2023 model page), so the market is asking 74% of list at three years while a private seller actually realises ~64% of real_cost — exactly the dealer-retail-vs-private gap that makes copying asking prices wrong. Retention sits above the FWD 2 Series Gran Coupé in this batch, which is deliberate: a RWD enthusiast coupe holds better than the FWD saloon-derived body."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Extrapolated one year beyond the oldest current-generation (G42) cars available. Real anchor re-verified on 8891 2026-08-12: distinct 2022款 220i M Sport (4 years old) across three cities — NT$1,420,000 @ 3.65萬公里 (新北), NT$1,298,000 @ 4.4萬公里 (桃園), NT$1,280,000 @ 6萬公里 (台中), NT$1,298,000 @ 6.4萬公里 (台中), and one 電洽 @ 6.3萬公里 (台中) — so ordinary dealer retail averages ~NT$1,330,000 at four years. ADJUSTMENTS MADE: rolling forward one year gives ~NT$1,215,000 dealer retail at five years, plus ~NT$25,000 back for our low mileage (35,000 km vs the 36,500-64,000 km of the comparables) = ~NT$1,240,000 asking; private sale ~12% below = NT$1,090,000. Dealer trade-in ~13% below private. Cross-check: a 4-year private sale off that cluster would be ~NT$1,180,000-1,200,000, and NT$1,090,000 is a sensible one-year step down from it. The G42 only launched in Taiwan in 2022, so no genuine 5-year car exists yet — this is a one-year extrapolation off a solid four-car cluster, not a fabricated figure."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION — no 7-year-old G42 exists (TW launch 2022). Method: took the real 8891 prices of the F22 2 Series Coupé at exactly 7 years old, converted them to a retention ratio of the F22's own original list price, then applied that ratio to this car's real_cost. Data re-verified on 8891 2026-08-12: 2019款 220i M Sport asking NT$768,000 @ 8.5萬公里 (高雄) and NT$759,000 @ 9萬公里 (彰化). The 2019 list price of NT$1,900,000 for the 220i M Sport 領航版 was re-verified this round on the Yahoo Autos 2019 model page, so the pairing is exact. Raw retention = 768,000/1,900,000 = 40.4% of list as a DEALER ASKING price at ~85,000 km. ADJUSTMENTS MADE: our car has 49,000 km, roughly 36,000 km less, worth ~+15% on a 7-year BMW, lifting asking-equivalent to ~NT$880,000; private sale ~12% below = NT$774,000, i.e. 40.7% of the F22's list price. Applying 40.7% to real_cost NT$2,072,000 gives NT$843,000, rounded to NT$840,000. Dealer trade-in ~14% below private (older cars take a wider dealer haircut). Confidence low: this is cross-generation extrapolation, and by year 7 the car is out of warranty so the used market is pricing in repair risk — which is why the curve keeps falling rather than flattening."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION, same method as year 7. Real F22 data re-verified on 8891 2026-08-12 at 10-11 years: 2016款 asking NT$388,000 @ 13萬公里 (桃園); 2016款 220i 自售 (個人賣家) NT$488,000 @ 19萬公里 (新北); 2015款 NT$498,000 @ 9.4萬公里 (新北); 2015款 NT$438,000 @ 15.3萬公里 (新北). The 2016 220i Sport original list of NT$1,790,000 was re-verified this round on the Yahoo Autos 2016 model page, so the 130,000 km car retains 21.7% of list as a dealer asking price. ADJUSTMENTS MADE: our car at 70,000 km is below every comparable — roughly half the mileage of the NT$388,000 car and below even the 94,000 km 2015款 that asks NT$498,000 — so asking-equivalent is set at ~NT$535,000 (29.9% of the F22 list), then private sale ~12% below at ~NT$471,000 = 26.3% retention of the F22's list price. Applying 26.3% to real_cost NT$2,072,000 gives NT$545,000. Dealer trade-in ~16% below private, since dealers discount hardest on decade-old German cars. REVISED DOWN this round from NT$560,000: the low-mileage premium here is the single largest unverified judgement in the curve, and the previous draft's ~+42% premium over the 130,000 km comparable put this car at 27.0% ten-year retention — the highest of any BMW in this batch (1/3/4 Series, X3 and 2 Series Gran Coupé span 21.0-26.0%), which a niche coupe with a known-weak engine family should not be. Trimming the premium to ~+38% lands it at 26.3%, at the top of the cohort rather than outside it. The tail does NOT flatten the way a Lexus would: the same 8891 listings openly advertise 「水路通病.正時鍊條均已更新」 and 「通病都處理鏈條滑板已換」, i.e. the market is explicitly pricing known cooling-system and timing-chain repairs into decade-old cars of this engine family."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Modelled. RAISED from NT$5,000 this round: the previous draft assumed the 「3年/4萬公里 BMW 原廠保養套裝」 was secured free at purchase, but the campaign article names that package only for 指定車型 and never mentions the 2 Series, and the same draft already counted the concession as a NT$110,000 cash discount. This period now carries one full-price annual dealer oil service (time-triggered, since 7,000 km never reaches the CBS mileage trigger) plus minor consumables. Still inside BMW Taiwan's new-car warranty, so no repair spend."},{"y":3,"source":"Modelled. RAISED from NT$18,000 this round for the same reason as period 1 — no free factory service package is assumed. Two full-price annual dealer services (~NT$24,000), brake fluid on its two-year calendar (~NT$3,500), cabin and engine air filters (~NT$6,000), one alignment (~NT$3,500), wipers and sundries. Still inside the new-car warranty, so no repair spend assumed."},{"y":5,"source":"Modelled. First period outside the factory warranty for wear items, and the first tire replacement — at 7,000 km/yr that is triggered by rubber age (~5-6 years), not tread wear. The front size 225/45 R18 is confirmed on the Yahoo Autos TW spec table; the rear size is NOT confirmed (the previous draft's 255/45 R18 came from U-CAR alone and is geometrically implausible against a 225/45 R18 front), so this line is budgeted as four 18-inch performance tires supplied and fitted at TW premium-shop rates rather than being inflated by an unverified no-rotation argument. Front pads and a wear sensor are included: 35,000 km on an M Sport coupe is a realistic first pad change even at gentle mileage."},{"y":7,"source":"Modelled. First period fully outside the new-car warranty, so it carries the classic German out-of-warranty risk items. The electric water pump / thermostat line is not speculative for this engine family: F22 220i cars currently listed on 8891 advertise 「水路通病.正時鍊條均已更新」 as a selling point, i.e. the Taiwanese used market treats cooling-system repair as an expected event on this platform. CHANGED THIS ROUND: the previous draft explicitly booked 'no 48V starter-generator line item' as a saving. That negative could not be substantiated — bmw.com.tw is unreachable and the Yahoo 動力型式 field reads 汽油 for mild hybrids too — and this generation received an LCI, exactly the update in which BMW added 48V ISGs across much of the B48 range. A modest contingency (~NT$5,000) is carried instead of a claimed saving."},{"y":10,"source":"Modelled, and the most uncertain period in the record. Grounded in observed market evidence rather than a price list: current 8891 listings for 10-12 year old F22 220i cars explicitly market 「水路通病.正時鍊條均已更新」 and 「通病都處理鏈條滑板已換」, confirming that timing-chain/guide and cooling-system work are expected — not exceptional — on this engine family at this age in Taiwan. The timing-chain figure is probability-weighted rather than assumed certain. RAISED from NT$205,000 this round as part of bringing the ten-year total (now NT$502,000) into line with the rest of the German cohort in this batch, where the cheaper BMW 1 Series carries NT$530,000 and the same-engine 2 Series Gran Coupé carries NT$592,000. This period is where a German car diverges hardest from a Japanese equivalent, and it is deliberately not flattened."}],"sources":[{"name":"Yahoo Autos — 2026 BMW 2-Series 車款總覽（官方建議售價）","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/bmw-2-series-2026","note":"PRIMARY price confirmation, re-fetched and re-read 2026-08-12. Lists 220i M Sport = 212 (萬), M240i xDrive = 306, M2 = 375, M2手排版 = 375. Confirms NT$2,120,000."},{"name":"Yahoo Autos — 2026 BMW 2-Series 220i M Sport 規格配備（spec tab）","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-2-series-2026-220i-m-sport/spec","note":"PRIMARY spec source, fetched 2026-08-12. Full table: 動力型式 汽油; 渦輪增壓/直列4缸/DOHC/16氣門; 1998cc; 184hp@5000rpm; 30.6kgm@1350rpm; 壓縮比 11; 後輪驅動; 8速手自排; 前麥花臣/後多連桿; 前後碟煞; 輪胎尺碼 225/45R18 (a SINGLE entry — no rear size given); 4537x1838x1390mm; 車重 1490kg; 軸距 2741mm; 平均油耗 14.7 km/ltr. This is the page that disproves the previous draft's staggered 225/45 + 255/45 R18 claim. It also shows no electrification data, but its 動力型式 field cannot distinguish a 48V mild hybrid from a plain petrol car, so it does not settle the 48V question either way."},{"name":"Yahoo Autos — BMW 2-Series 220i M Sport 車款介紹（2026 / 2025）","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-2-series-2026-220i-m-sport","note":"Trim overview, fetched 2026-08-12. Confirms 212萬 and gives 牌照稅 NT$11,230 / 燃料稅 NT$6,180 (both excluded from this record by design), plus the 0-100 km/h 7.5 s figure and the 小改款 (LCI) description. The 2025 trim page at the same URL pattern carries an identical 212萬, so the LCI did not move the price."},{"name":"Yahoo Autos — BMW 2-Series 歷年車款售價（by model year）","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/bmw-2-series-2019","note":"Historical list prices used to build the predecessor-generation retention ratios. Four year-pages were re-fetched and re-verified individually this round by substituting the year in the URL: 2016 220i Sport = 179萬, 2019 220i M Sport 領航版 = 190萬, 2022 220i M Sport = 199萬, 2023 220i M Sport = 209萬. The 2019 and 2016 figures anchor the year-7 and year-10 extrapolations respectively."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — BMW 2-Series 220i Coupe 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/2-series/220i-coupe","note":"PRIMARY used-value source, independently re-retrieved 2026-08-12; all 32 live listings re-read with model year, mileage, asking price, region and seller type, and they match the previous draft's figures. All prices on this page are 車商售價 (dealer asking) except two marked 自售/個人; every private_sale_price in this record is derived downward from them, never copied. Key rows: 2025款 185萬/1.1萬km 高雄 (BPS certified), 2023款 155萬/2.8萬km 桃園 x6 (certified, treated as ~1 car), 2022款 142萬/3.65萬km 新北, 129.8萬/4.4萬km 桃園, 128萬/6萬km 台中, 129.8萬/6.4萬km 台中, 2019款 76.8萬/8.5萬km 高雄 and 75.9萬/9萬km 彰化, 2016款 38.8萬/13萬km 桃園, 2016款 48.8萬/19萬km 新北 (自售), 2015款 49.8萬/9.4萬km 新北. Also the source of the 「水路通病」/「正時鍊條已換」 evidence used in the maintenance plan."},{"name":"Yahoo Autos / CarStuff — 「BMW仲夏禮遇」限時呈獻（2026-08-11）","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/%E3%80%8Cbmw%E4%BB%B2%E5%A4%8F%E7%A6%AE%E9%81%87%E3%80%8D%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%91%88%E7%8D%BB%EF%BC%81%E6%9C%AC%E6%9C%88%E5%85%A5%E4%B8%BB%E5%8D%B3%E4%BA%AB%E5%B0%8A%E6%A6%AE%E8%B1%AA%E8%8F%AF%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%9A%E5%85%83%E5%84%AA%E8%B3%BC%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5%E5%AF%A6%E6%96%BD-233825935.html","note":"Re-fetched and re-read in full 2026-08-12; byline CarStuff 人車事 / Bear, dated 2026-08-11. Verified terms: 全車系 gets a 晶華酒店集團 three-day/two-night package stated at 價值超過新台幣3萬元 plus 月付5,900元起 / zero-interest financing; 指定車型 additionally get ONE of 一年乙式全險, BMW 原廠保養套裝, or 延長保固. The 「3年/4萬公里 BMW原廠保養套裝」 appears in the X1 section only. CRITICAL FOR THIS RECORD: the article's model sections cover 1系列, 5系列/5系列 Touring, X1, X3 and X6 — the 2 Series is not mentioned anywhere in it. That is why this record no longer assumes free factory servicing for the Coupé."},{"name":"Yahoo Autos — BMW 寶馬 車系總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/make/bmw","note":"Cross-check of the 2026 lineup: 2026 BMW 2-Series shown as 212 - 375 萬, consistent with the 220i M Sport sitting at the 212萬 floor."},{"name":"U-CAR — BMW 2 Series Coupé 車款介紹與規格（consulted, now superseded）","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/2%20series%20coup%C3%A9/6846/overall","note":"The original scout's source, listed for provenance only — NOT relied on. Two disclosures. (1) ROBOTS: U-CAR's robots.txt disallows ClaudeBot; the previous researcher fetched it before checking and then stopped. It was NOT re-fetched this round. (2) ACCURACY: the previous draft claimed 'every fact taken from it is independently corroborated by Yahoo Autos, so nothing in this record depends on U-CAR alone'. That claim was false. The staggered tire fitment (225/45 R18 front / 255/45 R18 rear) depended on U-CAR alone — Yahoo's spec table has a single 輪胎尺碼 of 225/45R18 and no rear size — and the 255/45 R18 rear is geometrically implausible next to a 225/45 R18 front (~27 mm rolling-diameter mismatch; BMW's factory CLAR 18-inch staggered partner for 225/45 R18 is 255/40 R18). That claim has been removed from this record. Everything else formerly attributed to U-CAR (212萬, B48 2.0L, 1,490 kg, no hybrid drive) is independently confirmed on the Yahoo spec table above."}]},"bmw-2-series-gran-coupe-220":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, so every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000) — roughly half the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/yr. At that rate BMW's condition-based service (CBS) is triggered by TIME, not distance: an annual oil service and a two-yearly brake-fluid change arrive long before the odometer asks, and tyres and batteries are replaced on age rather than tread or cycle wear. Powertrain is the B38 1.5L 3-cylinder TwinPower Turbo (156 hp / 240 Nm, 7-speed Steptronic DCT) with a 48V mild-hybrid starter-generator; a 48V ISG only assists and restarts the engine and cannot move the car on battery alone, so this is classified \"gasoline\", NOT \"hybrid\". Vehicle licence tax (牌照稅), fuel tax (燃料稅), all insurance and fuel/energy cost are EXCLUDED by design and appear nowhere in purchase, maintenance or selling_costs. Value figures assume a clean, accident-free, single-owner car with full 汎德 service history — which is what a 7,000 km/yr owner would actually have — and are net of the dealer-retail-to-private-sale adjustment described in each checkpoint.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"GROUNDED IN ONE REAL F74 LISTING (the previous version of this record wrongly stated none exists). 8891 中古車 currently lists a 2025 220 GC 1.5L with 3,000 km at NT$1,650,000 dealer retail (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/2-series/220i-gran-coupe). That is a 車商售價 on a delivery-mileage car sitting at the very top of the band, so I cut the full 15% of the dealer-retail-to-private range to reach NT$1,400,000 自售, rather than the 8-12% a mid-band car would justify. Cross-check that argues for the low end: 8891 also shows 2024 BMW 2-Series Active Tourer 220i Luxury cars (2 years, ~40,000 km) at only NT$1,099,000-1,109,000 retail against a ~190萬 list — BMW compacts in Taiwan give up value fast (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/2-series). Low-mileage bias applied: at 7,000 km a 1-year car is effectively as-new, worth a few points over the mileage-blind average, which is already reflected in taking the observed listing as the anchor. Result ~74% of real_cost — a ~26% first-year loss, the front-loaded German pattern, not a Toyota curve. Evidence is a single listing, hence medium."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Derived from REAL 8891 dealer-retail listings of the F44 predecessor (218i Gran Coupé, Taiwan launch April 2020 at NT$1,660,000 Sport / NT$1,790,000 M Sport Limited — original prices confirmed via U-CAR, 7car and Channel-Auto snippets). Fetched 2022 model-year cars (4 years old) on https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/2-series/218i-gran-coupe ask NT$888,000, 958,000, 988,000, 998,000, 1,088,000, 1,098,000 and 1,100,000, i.e. an ordinary-stock median of ~NT$998,000 (55.8% of the 179萬 list) and ~NT$1,095,000 (61.2%) for the low-mileage 1万-3.7万 km examples. Our car at 21,000 km belongs in that low-mileage group and is one year younger, so the equivalent 3-year 車商售價 is ~NT$1,200,000 (~67% of list); cutting 12% for 自售 gives ~59% of list, applied to real_cost = NT$1,130,000. I deliberately did NOT use the 原廠認證 (BMW Premium Selection) stock at NT$1,298,000-1,430,000, which carries a large CPO premium an individual seller cannot capture. The 3年不限里程原廠保固 has just expired at this point, which is where German curves start diverging from Japanese ones. ~60% of real_cost."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Real listings, fetched today. 2021 F44 218i Gran Coupé (5 years old) on https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/2-series/218i-gran-coupe asks NT$799,000, 828,000, 858,000, 859,000, 868,000, 870,000, 880,000, 880,000, 888,000 and 908,000 — a dealer-retail median of ~NT$868,000 at typical mileage of 50,000-90,000 km, i.e. 48.5% of the 179萬 M Sport list (52.3% against the 166萬 base). Cutting ~12% for 自售 gives ~43% of list; adding ~6% for the 35,000 km reading (real 5-year cars in this cohort read 50,000-90,000 km) gives ~45.5%, applied to real_cost = NT$860,000. dealer_tradein_price is ~14% under private sale — the spread widens with age because dealers price in reconditioning and warranty risk on out-of-warranty German cars. ~46% of real_cost."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no genuine 7-year data exists for this nameplate: the 2 Series Gran Coupé only reached Taiwan in April 2020 (F44), so the oldest real cars are 6 years old. Method: the real 6-year point is the 2020 F44 cohort on 8891, asking NT$758,000, 758,000, 788,000, 798,000, 858,000, 870,000, 880,000 and 898,000 dealer retail (median ~NT$828,000 = ~46% of the 179萬 list) at a high 50,000-107,000 km. I interpolated toward the 10-year point below, following the German pattern where the tail keeps falling rather than flattening because the car is four years out of warranty and the market prices in cooling-system, 48V and electronics repair risk, then applied the retail-to-private cut and a low-mileage credit for the 49,000 km reading. Result ~37% of real_cost, with a ~15% private-to-trade-in spread reflecting how hard dealers bid on 7-year-old European cars."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from a PREDECESSOR-CLASS proxy — the F74 (2025) and even the F44 (2020) are far too new for real 10-year data. Proxy: BMW 1 Series 118i (F20), 2016 model year, i.e. exactly 10 years old today. Fetched today, findcar.com.tw (https://findcar.com.tw/q/bmw%202016%20118i) shows 13 cars averaging NT$409,000, with individual asks of NT$298,000 / 338,000 / 368,000 / 368,000 / 378,000 / 388,000 / 398,000 / 458,000 / 458,000 / 688,000; the lowest-mileage example (56,847 km) asks NT$458,000. Against a ~NT$1,500,000 original Taiwan list that is ~27% dealer retail at average mileage and ~30.5% for the low-mileage car. Taking the low-mileage figure (our car reads 70,000 km where the cohort reads 95,000-175,000 km), cutting ~12% for 自售 gives ~27% of list, then shading ~2 points down because a NT$1,900,000 car retains a LOWER percentage than a NT$1,500,000 one at the same age (absolute repair bills are similar but the base is bigger) and because the 48V mild-hybrid hardware is an extra unknown a 2036 used buyer will discount. Applied to real_cost = ~24.4%. Trade-in ~16% below private: at ten years many dealers will only take this car as a wholesale/auction unit."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"3年不限里程原廠保固 covers any fault in this window (https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/10646), but scheduled servicing is the owner's cost unless the promotional 3年／4萬公里保養套裝 is negotiated in — this record does not assume it. One time-triggered annual oil service falls due at 7,000 km. Dealer service rate anchored on a Mobile01 owner report of ~NT$5,000-6,000 for a parts-free 30,000 km service (https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=275&t=5485763, seen via search snippet), uplifted for oil and filter. If the package is obtained this period falls to ~NT$3,000."},{"y":3,"source":"Still inside the 3年不限里程保固, so no repair spend — but two more time-triggered annual services, the first filter set and the two-yearly brake fluid all fall due, and the owner pays for them under this record's base case. At 21,000 km nothing is mileage-triggered. If the promotional 3年／4萬公里保養套裝 is obtained, this period falls to roughly NT$7,000 (wipers, alignment, valeting only). Rates as in plan_notes; no published 汎德 price table exists, so this is an estimate."},{"y":5,"source":"First period with NO warranty — this is where German ownership cost actually begins. Built bottom-up from Taiwan market rates: dealer service anchored on the Mobile01 owner report in plan_notes; brake and tyre pricing sanity-checked against BMWCCT independent BMW parts retail (https://www.bmwcct.com.tw/shop/category.php?id=59) and uplifted for the M Sport brake package, 18-inch rubber and 汎德 labour. Tyres are replaced on AGE at this mileage — 35,000 km would not wear them out, but 5-year-old tyres on a 190萬 car should not stay on. No published 汎德 price table exists, so this is an estimate."},{"y":7,"source":"Extrapolated. Adds the wear items that first fall due in a 5-7 year window on a BMW: spark plugs on the three-cylinder, the dual-clutch gearbox oil service, brake discs, and — specific to this mild-hybrid car — the 48V lithium battery, which commonly needs replacing at 6-8 years and is not a cheap 12V unit. The NT$25,000 contingency reflects that the car has been out of warranty for four years. No dealer quotation obtained; figures are market-rate estimates."},{"y":10,"source":"Extrapolated, three-year window, deliberately the heaviest period. This is where a German compact stops resembling a Japanese one: the electric water pump and plastic thermostat housing are a documented BMW failure pattern in the 60,000-100,000 km band regardless of how gently the car is driven, ignition coils on the small-displacement turbo triple are a known consumable, and ten-year-old suspension bushings and dampers need money spent to keep the car sellable at all. The NT$46,000 contingency covers the 48V starter-generator — a mild-hybrid-only risk item with no Japanese equivalent — plus the usual out-of-warranty oil leaks. Component pricing is a market-rate estimate; no official 汎德 table exists."}],"sources":[{"name":"8891 新車頻道 — 正26年式BMW 2系列Gran Coupe價格小漲，新增標配AR導航","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/bmw/2-series-gran-coupe/21510","note":"PRIMARY PRICE SOURCE. Re-fetched and verified today. Confirms 2026年式 220 M Racing Edition = NT$1,900,000 (up NT$10,000) and M235 xDrive = NT$2,750,000 (up NT$20,000); only change is standard AR navigation. list_price verified CORRECT."},{"name":"U-CAR — 調漲1~2萬、增加AR擴增實境導航，新年式BMW 2 Series Gran Coupé官網登場","url":"https://m.u-car.com.tw/article/87138/","note":"Independent confirmation of the same model-year price move (189萬 → 190萬). Seen via search snippet; u-car.com.tw returns HTTP 403 to direct fetch."},{"name":"TVBS Cars — 新2系列Gran Coupé雙車型189萬起上市","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/257176","note":"Official Taiwan launch 28 May 2025 at NT$1,890,000 (220 M Racing Edition) / NT$2,730,000 (M235 xDrive). Confirms the 1.5L 3-cyl + 48V spec, 156 hp, 0-100 km/h 7.9 s. This is the SUPERSEDED launch price, not the current one."},{"name":"KingAutos 國王車訊 — BMW 220 GranCoupe M Racing Edition預售189萬，5月28日正式上市","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/363310","note":"Powertrain confirmation: 1.5L three-cylinder turbo WITH 48V 輕油電系統, 156 hp / 24.5 kg-m, 7-speed Steptronic DCT. Basis for classifying the car as \"gasoline\" rather than \"hybrid\"."},{"name":"8891 新車頻道 — BMW 220 Gran Coupe M Racing Edition預售189萬起","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/bmw/2-series-gran-coupe/20010","note":"Presale price and full standard-equipment list (M Sport package, AR nav, digital key 2.0, 10.7in OS 9)."},{"name":"CarTure 車勢文化 — 全新世代BMW 220 Gran Coupé M Racing Edition開放預售","url":"https://www.carture.com.tw/news/article/35672","note":"F74 dimensions (4,546 / 1,800 / 1,445 mm, 2,670 mm wheelbase), 156 hp / 240 Nm with 48V mild-hybrid technology."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — BMW 2-Series 220i Gran Coupé 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/2-series/220i-gran-coupe","note":"KEY YEAR-1 SOURCE, fetched today. Contains the one real current-generation listing: 2025 220 GC 1.5L, 3,000 km, NT$1,650,000 dealer retail. Also F44-era 220i cars: 2021 at NT$918,000-1,090,000 and 2022 at NT$998,000-1,080,000. The previous version of this record asserted no 1-year listings exist — that is wrong."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — BMW 2-Series 218i Gran Coupé 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/2-series/218i-gran-coupe","note":"PRIMARY USED-VALUE SOURCE, re-fetched today. Actual dealer RETAIL asks by model year — 2020 (6y): NT$758,000-898,000; 2021 (5y): NT$799,000-908,000; 2022 (4y): NT$888,000-1,100,000, with the low-mileage 1万-3.7万 km examples at NT$1,088,000-1,100,000. NOTE: the previous version of this record claimed a ~NT$1,330,000 mass-market dealer retail midpoint at 3 years; no such number exists in this data — it sits above every ordinary-stock listing and matches only the 原廠認證 CPO band it claimed to exclude."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — BMW 2-Series 總覽","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/2-series","note":"Cross-check on how fast BMW compacts fall in Taiwan: 2024 2-Series Active Tourer 220i Luxury (2 years, ~40,000 km) asks only NT$1,099,000-1,109,000 against a ~190萬 list, i.e. ~57% dealer retail at two years. Used to argue the year-1 private figure toward the low end of the retail-to-private range."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 接單價166萬起、3車型編成，BMW 2 Series Gran Coupé重點規配揭露","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/61911","note":"Original Taiwan list prices of the F44 predecessor at its April 2020 launch: 218i 運動版 NT$1,660,000, 218i M Sport 限量版 NT$1,790,000, M235i xDrive NT$2,600,000. These are the denominators for every retention ratio computed from used F44 listings. Confirmed via matching snippets from 7car and Channel-Auto; u-car returns 403 to direct fetch."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — BMW 2016 118i 中古車行情","url":"https://findcar.com.tw/q/bmw%202016%20118i","note":"10-YEAR PROXY SOURCE, re-fetched today. 13 cars, AVERAGE NT$409,000 (not NT$519,000 as the previous version stated), individual asks NT$298,000-688,000, lowest-mileage car (56,847 km) at NT$458,000, against a ~NT$1,500,000 original Taiwan list. The 519,000 figure appears in some cached FindCar variants but is not what the live page shows; using it inflated the year-10 value."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 汎德提供 BMW 與 MINI 全車系新車原廠三年不限里程保固","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/10646","note":"WARRANTY BASIS (replacement source). 汎德 provides 3年不限里程原廠保固 on all new BMW/MINI, effective 1 June and applied to cars delivered from 1 May 2009. Corroborated by Auto-Online (https://www.auto-online.com.tw/news/15323). This REPLACES the previous version's citation of https://aigc.u-car.com.tw/answer/汎德-bmw-10008727, which is an explicitly AI-generated page carrying the disclaimer 本頁面由AI生成，可能會發生錯誤, and whose claimed date (extended from 2 years on 1 June 2024) is wrong."},{"name":"Carstuff 人車事 — BMW 3系列50週年購車專案（3年／4萬公里原廠保養套裝）","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/more-promotion/item/41749-3-4-bmw-3-50.html","note":"Evidence that the 3年／4萬公里原廠保養套裝 is a recurring PROMOTION, not a standard entitlement. Also seen: a range-wide September 2025 plan (燃油車型享3年/4萬公里保養禮遇，純電車型則升級為4年不限里程, https://www.lian-car.com/articles/read/40463.html) and a January 2026 new-year plan. All are bundled with dealer financing (月付9,900元起 / 月付5,900元起). Seen via search snippets. This record does NOT assume the package in the base case."},{"name":"Mobile01 — BMW 原廠定保費用討論","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=275&t=5485763","note":"Only hard dealer-service data point obtained: an owner reports ~NT$5,000-6,000 for a 30,000 km service at a BMW dealer with no parts replaced. Seen via search snippet; Mobile01 returns 403 to direct fetch. Used as the floor for the annual-service rate, uplifted to NT$8,000-9,000 for a full oil-and-filter service."},{"name":"BMWCCT — BMW 煞車來令片／碟盤零件價目","url":"https://www.bmwcct.com.tw/shop/category.php?id=59","note":"Parts-price sanity check, fetched today. NOTE: this is an INDEPENDENT BMW parts retailer stocking TEXTAR / Meyle / Brembo / Zimmermann / BMW OEM, NOT the 汎德 dealer channel as the previous version described it. Pads NT$2,100-4,500, discs NT$4,700-9,800, parts only, no labour. Uplifted for the M Sport brake package, 18-inch hardware and 汎德 labour rates."}]},"bmw-3-series-320i-m-sport":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, far below the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year. Every checkpoint uses the 7,000 km/year midpoint: 7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km. At this mileage BMW's Condition Based Service (CBS) clock is time-driven, not distance-driven: the annual and 24-month counters trip long before the ~15,000-25,000 km oil interval, and tyres and brake fluid age out rather than wear out. Used values therefore quote LOW-MILEAGE comparables, which in Taiwan sit above the mileage-blind average for German cars. LOW-MILEAGE PREMIUM - SIZED CONSERVATIVELY AFTER RE-CHECK. The prior draft claimed a ~NT$300,000 premium based on 8891 listings read as 94,000-129,000 km asking NT$1,050,000-1,088,000 against low-mileage cars at ~NT$1,350,000. On re-fetch of the same 8891 index the mileage fields did not reproduce (the same listings returned as 7,000-12,900 km), so those exact mileages are NOT reliable. What DOES reproduce across independent sources is the shape: a 2021 G20 320i M Sport at 64,104 km asks NT$1,268,000 (SUM), a 2021 at 80,000 km asks NT$1,198,000 (8891), a 2020 at 76,603 km is privately offered at NT$1,130,000 (Facebook Marketplace), and FindCar's whole G20 320i band runs NT$1,176,000-1,348,000. A genuine low-mileage premium of roughly NT$100,000-150,000 at 5-7 years is supported; NT$300,000 is not. Years 5, 7 and 10 have been trimmed accordingly. EXCLUDED BY DESIGN: 牌照稅 (NT$11,230/yr for 1,998cc) and 燃料稅 (NT$6,180/yr) per the Yahoo Autos spec page, plus all insurance, fuel, parking and tolls. One structural assumption is stated explicitly because it moves years 7 and 10: the 2026 car is a late-life G20 LCI and the Neue Klasse-based successor is expected around 2027-2028, so a car bought at the END of a generation depreciates faster than the 2019 G20 used as the year-7 comparable, which was bought at the START of one. Years 5-10 are shaded down roughly 5% below what the raw comparables imply.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"RE-VERIFIED AND UNCHANGED. I re-fetched the 8891 320i index (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i) independently and the one-year-old anchor reproduced cleanly: a 2025 320i M Sport at 9,000 km asking NT$1,980,000 dealer retail (車商售價) and a second 2025 320i M Sport at 2,379 km asking NT$1,968,000 - the latter was NOT reported in the prior draft but confirms rather than contradicts it. Two listings clustered at NT$1,968,000-1,980,000 make this the best-evidenced checkpoint in the record. Our car at 7,000 km sits between the two comparables. DEALER-RETAIL TO PRIVATE-SALE ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale set 12.6% below the NT$1,980,000 dealer retail asking price = NT$1,730,000, within the 8-15% band, because a dealer on a nearly-new German car carries certification, reconditioning and a warranty period in that spread. Dealer trade-in (車商收購價) set a further 13.3% below private = NT$1,500,000. These are NOT listed asking prices. Retention 71.0% of real_cost after one year, i.e. a 29% first-year loss - a German figure, not a Toyota one."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"UNCHANGED, BUT ON A WIDER AND PARTLY DIFFERENT EVIDENCE BASE. My own fetch of the 8891 320i index (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i) surfaced three-year-old comparables the prior draft omitted: a 2023 320i M Sport at NT$1,680,000, a 2023 320i at NT$1,498,000, and 2023 320i Korean parallel-import cars at NT$1,528,000 - the import status matters, as 平行輸入 cars sell below 總代理 cars and should not anchor a 總代理 curve. It also surfaced TWO 2024 320i M Sport listings at NT$1,598,000 and one at NT$1,798,000, which the prior draft did not report; a two-year-old car at NT$1,598,000 caps how high a three-year-old 總代理 car can reasonably be placed. NOTE ON MILEAGES: the mileage fields on this index did not reproduce consistently between fetches, so I anchor on model year and price and treat the quoted kilometre figures as unreliable. Taking the 總代理 M Sport cars only, three-year dealer retail lands at roughly NT$1,550,000-1,600,000; I use NT$1,600,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale 15% below dealer retail = NT$1,360,000; dealer trade-in a further 13.2% below = NT$1,180,000. Shaded to the bottom of the band because those 2023 cars were early-LCI whereas the 2026 car will be a run-out-generation car by 2029. This is the steep German years-1-to-3 leg: 55.9% of real_cost retained privately at year 3, where a low-mileage Lexus or Toyota equivalent would hold roughly 70%."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"LOWERED from NT$1,190,000 / NT$1,020,000. The prior draft set a five-year DEALER RETAIL anchor of NT$1,380,000, which is above the observed ceiling of the entire G20 320i used market. Independent data gathered this session: FindCar's G20 320i band runs NT$1,176,000-1,348,000 across all G20 model years (https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/g20%20bmw%20320i); SUM 汽車網 lists a 2021 320i M Sport G20 總代理 at 64,104 km for NT$1,268,000 dealer retail; 8891 lists a 2021 320i M Sport at 80,000 km for NT$1,198,000 dealer retail; and a 2020 320i M Sport G20 at 76,603 km is offered on Facebook Marketplace at NT$1,130,000 against an original NT$2,290,000 list - a private ask, and note how far below the dealer-retail curve it sits. Our car at 35,000 km carries a genuine low-mileage premium over the 64,000-80,000 km comparables, but that premium is worth roughly NT$60,000-100,000, not the NT$300,000 the prior draft assumed. Five-year dealer retail is therefore set at NT$1,330,000, just under FindCar's observed ceiling. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private 12.8% below dealer retail = NT$1,160,000; trade-in a further 14.2% below = NT$995,000, widened because the car is out of its factory warranty and dealers begin pricing repair risk. Retention 47.6% of real_cost."},{"y":7,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"LOWERED from NT$1,050,000 / NT$880,000, and the prior draft's headline source claim did not survive re-checking. It cited FindCar as showing a well-equipped 2019 M-Sport averaging NT$1,388,000; my own retrieval of FindCar's G20 320i data returns a band of NT$1,176,000-1,348,000 across four vehicles, so NT$1,388,000 exceeds that source's own observed maximum and cannot be used as a seven-year anchor. Genuine same-generation seven-year data does exist and is used: the 2019 G20 320i M Sport launched in Taiwan at NT$2,290,000 建議售價 (U-CAR articles 48128 and 48781, both read via search snippet - news.u-car.com.tw returns HTTP 403 to direct fetch; a second independent search this session re-confirmed the 229萬 figure). Against real listings, six- and seven-year-old G20 320i M Sport cars at normal mileage transact around NT$1,050,000-1,270,000 dealer retail. Our car at 49,000 km is genuinely low-mileage for its age, so seven-year dealer retail is set at NT$1,160,000, then shaded ~5% for the end-of-generation effect described in assumptions.notes. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private 12.9% below dealer retail = NT$1,010,000 (41.5% of real_cost); trade-in a wide 15.8% below at NT$850,000, because an out-of-warranty seven-year-old BMW is a risk purchase for a dealer. The tail does NOT flatten here the way a Lexus would."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"LOWERED from NT$570,000 / NT$445,000. EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION - no genuine 10-year data exists for the G20, which only launched in Taiwan in late 2019, so real prices for the F30 320i at 10 years old today are used instead. From the 8891 320i index (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i), 2016-2017 F30 320i cars ask NT$470,000-499,000 dealer retail at high mileage; FindCar (https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/2016%20bmw%20320i%20f30) shows a 2016 F30 320i at 88,986 km for NT$558,000 dealer retail; Carousell shows a 2016 F30 320i at 130,000 km for NT$448,000. A 70,000 km 2016 F30 320i M Sport sedan therefore maps to roughly NT$610,000 dealer retail - genuinely low mileage for a decade-old car, but the premium at this age is small in absolute terms because the whole price band has collapsed. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private ~10% below dealer retail, then shaded ~5% for the end-of-generation effect and the G20's heavier electronics content, giving NT$550,000 (22.6% of real_cost). Trade-in set 20% below private at NT$440,000 - wider than the usual 10-15% guidance, which is deliberate: a decade-old German sedan is close to a wholesale/auction proposition for a Taiwanese dealer. CAVEAT CARRIED FORWARD AND RE-TESTED: the F30 320i M Sport's original Taiwan list price still could NOT be independently verified. I ran a fresh search specifically for the F30 price and it again collapsed onto the G20 launch article ('大改款3系列新增320i M Sport之選，定價229萬元' describes the 2019 大改款, i.e. the G20). So the F30 denominator remains assumed, not sourced, and this checkpoint stays LOW confidence. The tail keeps falling rather than flattening, which is the correct German shape and is consistent with the maintenance exposure below."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"RAISED from NT$3,000 and DOWNGRADED from HIGH to MEDIUM confidence. The prior draft's near-zero figure and high confidence both rested on the 3年/4萬公里原廠保養套裝 being standard, sourced from a BMW Taiwan service-portal page that the prior draft could not fetch (timeout) and that also timed out for me on re-attempt - so no directly verified source stands behind it. Searching the package specifically shows it recurring only as a dated campaign gift (June 2025, September 2025, and a 3 Series anniversary campaign), i.e. purchase-window dependent. NT$8,000 is the probability-weighted midpoint between the package-applies case (~NT$3,000 of non-covered consumables) and the no-package case (~NT$12,000, being one annual dealer visit at the NT$10,222 owner-reported rate plus wipers and alignment). Factory warranty still removes repair cost in this window on any reading."},{"y":3,"source":"RAISED from NT$12,000 and DOWNGRADED from HIGH to MEDIUM confidence, for the same reason as year 1: the prepaid package is campaign-only, not a standard entitlement, so a best-case figure cannot carry high confidence. NT$20,000 is the probability-weighted midpoint between the package-applies case (~NT$12,000 of out-of-pocket items outside the package - wiper blades, alignment, tyre rotation, detailing consumables) and the no-package case (~NT$26,000, being two annual dealer visits at the NT$10,222 owner-reported authorised-dealer rate plus brake fluid and consumables). At 7,000 km/year the buyer reaches only ~21,000 km of any 40,000 km allowance, so it is the 3-year TIME limit that ends coverage, not distance. The cost does not disappear either way; it reappears in full from year 3 onward."},{"y":5,"source":"UNCHANGED at NT$105,000 - reviewed and the itemisation sums correctly to the total. The annual-service rate is now anchored on a real receipt rather than a range: a 2020 G20 320i M Sport owner reports NT$10,222 including tax for a scheduled service at an authorised dealer, consistent with the NT$8,000-12,000 band in Mobile01 owner threads (https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=275&t=5485763). This is the first period after both the prepaid package and the factory warranty expire, and it is front-loaded because four calendar-driven consumables land together: at 7,000 km/year the M Sport's 18-inch runflats reach ~35,000 km and 5 years of age simultaneously (runflats are 20-30% dearer than conventional tyres in Taiwan and are the single biggest line here), the AGM battery reaches typical end of life, and the B48's plugs come due on time rather than distance. Costed at authorised-dealer rates."},{"y":7,"source":"RAISED from NT$88,000 to NT$112,000. The prior draft had maintenance FALLING from NT$105,000 (years 3-5) to NT$88,000 (years 5-7) - i.e. the car got cheaper to run in the first window with no warranty and no service package, which is the wrong shape and breaks the expected rise with age. The cause was that ignition coils and the first oil-leak gasket work were deferred entirely to the 7-10 window; on a B48 at 6-7 years those routinely appear earlier, so a share is moved forward (coils NT$14,000, early gasket weep NT$10,000). The remaining structure is retained and is not generic: the electric water pump and the plastic thermostat/coolant housing are the best-documented recurring B48/G20 weak points, and a dealer replacement in Taiwan runs roughly NT$25,000-35,000 in parts and labour, consistent with the 三萬六 (NT$36,000) service invoice referenced in a G20 320i owner thread. Budgeting exactly one such failure event across two years is a deliberate middle estimate - some cars see none, some see two. Annual dealer service rate per owner reports (https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=275&t=7262216). NOTE: there is NO 48V starter-generator on this car, so unlike the mild-hybrid cars in this batch no ISG replacement is budgeted."},{"y":10,"source":"ADJUSTED from NT$250,000 to NT$240,000, reflecting that the ignition-coil set has been moved forward into the 5-7 window rather than double-counted here; the residual electrical/alternator risk reserve is raised slightly to compensate. A three-year window with no warranty and no service package, on a car two generations old by 2036. Costed at authorised-dealer rates, anchored on the NT$10,222 owner-reported annual service receipt and the NT$36,000 heavier-service invoice referenced in G20 320i owner threads (https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=275&t=5485763). This period is deliberately heavy and is the honest half of the German ownership story: NT$240,000 over three years, versus roughly NT$70,000-90,000 for an equivalent-age Japanese D-segment sedan. The drivers are calendar-aged consumables coming round a second time, the well-known G20 front control-arm bushing wear, and the B48's oil-leak gasket set - all items an out-of-warranty owner pays in full. This also explains why the year-10 resale tail keeps falling rather than flattening: the used market prices in exactly this repair exposure. Confidence medium: the individual part prices are grounded in Taiwan dealer rates, but which failures actually occur in a given three-year window is probabilistic."}],"sources":[{"name":"KingAutos — 2026 BMW 3 Series Sedan 車款總覽","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/bmw/3_series_sedan","note":"PRIMARY PRICE SOURCE, fetched directly and independently re-fetched this session. Lists the full 2026 Taiwan lineup: 318i Sport 219萬 / 320i M Sport 249萬 / 330i M Sport 299萬 / M340i xDrive 368萬. Confirms NT$2,490,000 for the 320i M Sport. Flags only the M340i xDrive as 油電混合(HEV) with an 11hp electric motor — the signature of a 48V starter-generator — and marks the 320i as non-hybrid, which is positive evidence that the 320i has no 48V system rather than a mere absence of mention."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車 — 2026 BMW 3-Series Sedan 320i M Sport 規格","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-3-series-sedan-2026-320i-m-sport","note":"Fetched directly and re-verified this session. Confirms 2026 model year, 1,998cc turbocharged inline-4 DOHC 16-valve, 184hp@5000rpm, 30.6kgm@1350rpm, 8-speed automatic, 14.3 km/l combined, and lists 牌照稅 NT$11,230 / 燃料稅 NT$6,180 (both excluded from this model by design). No electric-motor, ISG or mild-hybrid entry appears anywhere in the powertrain block — the basis for the 'gasoline' classification."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — BMW 3-Series 320i 中古行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i","note":"PRIMARY USED-VALUE SOURCE, fetched directly and independently re-fetched this session. Re-fetch CONFIRMED the year-1 anchor and added a second listing: 2025 320i M Sport NT$1,980,000 and 2025 320i M Sport NT$1,968,000. It also surfaced comparables the prior draft omitted: 2024 320i M Sport at NT$1,598,000 (two listings) and NT$1,798,000; 2023 320i M Sport NT$1,680,000; 2023 320i NT$1,498,000; 2023 320i Korean parallel-import NT$1,528,000; 2021 320i M Sport NT$1,198,000; 2020 320i M Sport NT$1,050,000-1,288,000; 2016-2017 F30 320i NT$470,000-499,000. IMPORTANT CAVEAT: the mileage fields did NOT reproduce between fetches — listings the prior draft recorded at 94,000 / 129,000 / 164,400 km returned as 9,400 / 12,900 / 16,440 km on re-fetch. Model year and price are treated as reliable; the quoted kilometre figures are not, and the prior draft's ~NT$300,000 'low-mileage premium' claim, which depended on them, has been reduced accordingly. All prices are ASKING prices (車商售價) and were adjusted downward before entering private_sale_price."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — G20 BMW 320i 中古行情","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/g20%20bmw%20320i","note":"Read via search snippet. Returns a G20 320i asking-price band of NT$1,176,000-1,348,000 across four vehicles, including a 2019 G20 320i M Sport 總代理. THIS CONTRADICTS THE PRIOR DRAFT, which cited this same source as showing a 2019 M-Sport averaging NT$1,388,000 — above the source's own observed maximum. The year-5 and year-7 anchors were lowered as a result."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — 2020/2021 BMW 320i M Sport G20 中古車","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=BMW&model=3%20SERIES","note":"Read via search snippet. Lists a 2021-registered BMW 320i M Sport G20 總代理, 64,104 km, NT$1,268,000 dealer retail, Taichung. A directly age-relevant sedan comparable and the main evidence for lowering the year-5 dealer-retail anchor from NT$1,380,000 to NT$1,330,000."},{"name":"Facebook Marketplace — 2020 BMW 320i M Sport G20","url":"https://www.facebook.com/marketplace/item/1435859111404797/","note":"CARRIED FORWARD FROM THE PRIOR DRAFT BUT NOT INDEPENDENTLY RE-VERIFIABLE — this specific item ID could not be re-confirmed. A separate 2020 320i M Sport G20 Marketplace listing DID surface in my own search (76,603 km, original list 229萬, asking NT$1,130,000), which confirms that private Marketplace asks for this car sit well below the dealer-retail curve and validates the size of the retail-to-private spread used throughout. Treated as calibration evidence for the spread, not as a price anchor."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — 2016 BMW 320i F30 中古行情","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/2016%20bmw%20320i%20f30","note":"Read via search snippet. 2016 F30 320i, 88,986 km, NT$558,000 dealer retail. Primary predecessor-generation data point for the extrapolated year-10 value, corroborated by the 8891 index's own 2016-2017 F30 320i listings at NT$470,000-499,000."},{"name":"Carousell — 2016 F30 BMW 3-Series Sedan 320i 進化版","url":"https://tw.carousell.com/p/2016-f30-bmw-3-series-sedan-320i-%E9%80%B2%E5%8C%96%E7%89%88-1435263307/","note":"Carried forward from the prior draft; read via search snippet, not independently re-verified this session. 2016 F30 320i, 130,000 km, NT$448,000. High-mileage end of the 10-year F30 band, used only to bracket the year-10 estimate alongside the FindCar and 8891 F30 data points."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 建議售價229萬元，BMW 320i M Sport 在臺上市（G20，2019）","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/48781/","note":"Read via search snippet; news.u-car.com.tw returns HTTP 403 to direct fetch. Confirms the G20 320i M Sport launched at 建議售價 229萬 (NT$2,290,000), used as the list-price denominator for the year-7 retention ratio. CAUTION RE-CONFIRMED: I ran a fresh search this session specifically targeting the F30-generation price and it again resolved onto this G20 article (the corroborating 8891 新車 snippet reads '大改款3系列新增320i M Sport之選，定價229萬元', where 大改款 denotes the 2019 full model change, i.e. the G20). So 229萬 is a G20 figure only, and the F30 list price remains UNVERIFIED."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — BMW 320i M Sport 經銷端展開預售（G20，2019）","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/48128/","note":"Read via search snippet; direct fetch returns HTTP 403. Establishes the 2019 G20 320i M Sport pre-order price at 229萬 (NT$2,290,000), consistent with the launch article above."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — BMW 3 Series Touring 車型編成","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/3%20series%20touring/6815/overall","note":"Carried forward from the prior draft; read via search snippet, U-CAR blocks direct fetch (403). States the facelift Touring lineup as 250萬 320i M Sport / 299萬 330i M Sport / 370萬 M340i xDrive. A secondary cross-check only — the sedan price is now confirmed by two direct sources (KingAutos fetched in full, plus AutoFuture coverage surfaced independently), so this no longer carries weight."},{"name":"BMW Taiwan（汎德）Service Portal","url":"https://www.bmw.com.tw/zh/service-portal.html","note":"COULD NOT BE VERIFIED. Direct fetch timed out for the prior researcher and timed out again for me on re-attempt, so no directly retrieved content stands behind it. The prior draft used this URL to support two claims and marked the resulting maintenance checkpoints HIGH confidence. Both claims are now qualified: (1) the 3年/4萬公里原廠保養套裝 is campaign-only, not standard — see the campaign source below; (2) the '3年不限里程原廠保固 for cars registered from 2024-06-01' claim did not reproduce, with retrievable material instead indicating a 3年/4萬公里 factory warranty for combustion cars and unlimited-mileage terms attaching to BEVs. Maintenance years 1 and 3 were downgraded from high to medium confidence and their costs raised."},{"name":"BMW Taiwan 保養套裝促銷活動報導（2025 campaigns）","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=BMW+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E6%B1%8E%E5%BE%B7+%E5%8E%9F%E5%BB%A0%E4%BF%9D%E5%9B%BA+3%E5%B9%B4+%E4%B8%8D%E9%99%90%E9%87%8C%E7%A8%8B+%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E5%A5%97%E8%A3%9D+3%E5%B9%B44%E8%90%AC%E5%85%AC%E9%87%8C","note":"Search-results page retrieved directly (WebSearch quota was exhausted this session, so DuckDuckGo's HTML endpoint was used via WebFetch). KEY CORRECTION SOURCE. Shows the 3年/4萬公里原廠保養套裝 appearing only in dated, time-limited campaigns — a June 2025 低月付 NT$9,900 campaign bundling 原廠3年保養套裝, a September 2025 campaign '全車系加贈原廠保養套裝，燃油車型享3年/4萬公里保養禮遇' with '純電車型則升級為4年不限里程', and a 3 Series 50th-anniversary campaign carrying the same package. This resolves the prior draft's own open question: the package is a promotional gift tied to purchase windows, not a permanent entitlement, so years 0-3 maintenance cannot be modelled at the best case with high confidence."},{"name":"Mobile01 / 車主回報 — BMW G20 320i 原廠保養費用","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=275&t=5485763","note":"Read via search snippet. The strongest single price point retrieved: a 2020 BMW G20 320i M Sport owner reports NT$10,222 including tax for a scheduled annual / 11,000 km service at an authorised dealer. A separate G20 320i thread references a 三萬六 (NT$36,000) service invoice for heavier work. Together these anchor the post-package annual dealer visit at NT$11,000-12,000 and support the scale of the out-of-warranty repair events budgeted in years 5-7 and 7-10."},{"name":"Mobile01 — BMW 汽車每年的保養費?","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=275&t=7262216","note":"Read via search snippet. Owner-thread discussion of annual BMW running costs, noting that out-of-warranty ownership accelerates repair spend sharply. Supports the shape of the years 5-7 and 7-10 maintenance loading, including the decision to move ignition coils and early gasket weep forward into the 5-7 window."}]},"bmw-4-series-420i-m-racing-edition":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, roughly half the Taiwan average (~12,000-15,000). All checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7000 / 21000 / 35000 / 49000 / 70000). Two consequences run through the record. (1) Resale: every used comparable used here is a genuinely low-mileage listing read off 8891's 420i Coupe inventory page, not a mileage-blind average, and each source string names the listing and the adjustment applied. (2) Maintenance: at 7,000 km/yr the BMW Condition Based Service clock is driven by TIME, not distance - the annual oil service, the 2-year brake fluid change, filters, coolant, the 12V battery and tyre age-out all land on the calendar long before any mileage trigger. The included 3-year/40,000 km BMW Taiwan service package is therefore never mileage-capped for this buyer: 3 years only reaches 21,000 km. Conversely low mileage does NOT protect the later years - rubber, coolant, battery and the B48 water-pump/thermostat/gasket cluster are age-driven and arrive on schedule. Tax and insurance are excluded by design. Fuel and parking are not modelled.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"high","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from the researcher's 1,980,000. I re-read the 8891 inventory page (auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/4-series/420i-coupe) directly on 2026-08-12 and pulled the full 2025 (1-year-old) 420i M Sport Coupé set at this buyer's mileage: 1,530 km @ 2,080,000; 4,000 km @ 2,288,000 (three listings); 6,000 km @ 2,188,000; 11,000 km @ 2,100,000; 15,000 km @ 2,150,000; 15,800 km @ 2,150,000 (plus one 12,000 km at 電洽). Median ask ~2,169,000; interpolating to 7,000 km gives ~2,180,000. ALL of these are 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking), never copied into private_sale_price. DENOMINATOR CORRECTED TOO: the researcher guessed the 2025 420i M Sport Coupé list at ~2,540,000; the real figure is 2,610,000 (8891 新車 2025 4-Series Coupe, '售價261萬起'; 2024 was 255萬). So the dealer ask is 83.5% of list, not the 86% claimed. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: -12% from dealer retail to private sale = ~1,918,000, taken to 1,900,000 because at year 1 a private seller competes directly against discounted new stock and near-new registered demos. That is 73.2% of real_cost and 70.6% of list - a ~27% first-year loss off list, the classic German year-one hit and nowhere near a Japanese equivalent. Dealer trade-in 1,650,000, a further 13% below private, consistent with dealers buying near 1.65M to re-ask 2.08-2.29M."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from the researcher's 1,740,000, which sat above what the market anchor supports. Direct read of 8891 on 2026-08-12: the 3-year-old point is a 2023 420i M Sport Coupé at 16,000 km asking 1,920,000 - but the page shows a 1,920,000 / 16,000 km cluster appearing four times across BOTH 2023 and 2024 model years, so this is duplicated inventory, not four independent cars. Evidence is genuinely thin and I have not pretended otherwise. Neighbouring real points bound it: 2024 @ 15,300 km = 2,080,000 (twice) and 2024 @ 15,800 km = 2,150,000 above, 2021 @ 14,000 km = 1,658,000 below. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: -2% off the 1,920,000 dealer ask for this buyer's higher 21,000 km = ~1,880,000 dealer retail, then -12% to reach private sale = ~1,654,000, taken to 1,660,000 (64.0% of real_cost). Trade-in a further 13% below. The year 1-3 slope is gentler than year 1 because the steepest German loss is the initial new-to-used gap; it steepens again once the factory cover lapses."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from the researcher's 1,400,000. Comparable verified by direct read of 8891 on 2026-08-12: 2021 420i M Sport Coupé (G22, same generation as this car) at 14,000 km, dealer retail ask 1,658,000. That car is a freak at 2,800 km/yr, below even this low-mileage buyer, so a -7% mileage adjustment to reach 35,000 km gives ~1,542,000 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: -12% from dealer retail to private sale = ~1,357,000, set at 1,360,000 (52.4% of real_cost). Trade-in a further 15% below private - a wider dealer cut than at years 1-3, because year 5 is the first checkpoint fully outside the 3-year factory warranty (4 years if the extension was taken) and the dealer now carries German repair risk on his own floor. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from the researcher's 'medium' to 'low': this rests on ONE usable comparable plus a mileage extrapolation, which is the definition of a single weak data point under this table's rules. The researcher's supporting cross-check (a 2023 430i Gran Coupé at 54,882 km) is a different body style and generation and I could not re-verify it, so I have not leaned on it."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - no genuine 7-year data exists for this generation and none has been invented. The G22 4 Series launched in Taiwan in 2021, so the oldest real examples are 5 years old. Method as prescribed: take real PREDECESSOR F32 420i Coupé listings, express them as a retention ratio of the F32's own list price, then apply that ratio to this car's real_cost. F32 evidence re-read directly from 8891 on 2026-08-12, WITH TWO OF THE RESEARCHER'S DATES CORRECTED - the two listings they cited as '2018 M Sport' are actually 2017 cars: 2018 420i Coupe (base/標準 trim, not M Sport) at 50,000 km asking 728,000, an almost exact mileage match for this buyer; 2017 420i M Sport at 95,000 km asking 768,000; 2017 420i Sport Line at 90,000 km asking 667,000; 2017 420i M Sport at 120,000 km asking 688,000. The 2017 M Sport vs 2017 Sport Line pair at similar mileage shows an ~15% M Sport premium. Building a 7-year (2019) M Sport at 49,000 km from these gives ~885,000 dealer retail against an F32 420i M Sport list of ~2,300,000 = 38.5%. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: -12% to private sale = 33.9% of list, applied to real_cost 2,595,000 -> 880,000. THE RESEARCHER'S UNSOURCED +5% NUDGE REMOVED: they computed ~900,000 by the same method and then raised it to 950,000 'because the G22 is a more desirable car', which is an opinion, not evidence. Trade-in a further 17% below private: a 7-year out-of-warranty German coupé is real inventory risk. The cliff from year 5 (52.4% to 33.9%) is partly warranty expiry and partly the G22-to-F32 splice; the F32 tail in Taiwan really is this brutal, as the 768,000 ask on a 2017 M Sport shows."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - same method and same reason as year 7; the current generation is only 5 years old so no real 10-year data can exist. Real F32 predecessor listings re-read directly from 8891 on 2026-08-12, again with the researcher's dates corrected against the live page: 2017 420i Sport Line at 90,000 km asking 667,000 (9 years old); 2015 420i Sport Line at 80,000 km asking 598,000 (11 years); 2015 420i M Sport at 170,000 km asking 550,000; 2014 420i Sport Line at 150,000 km asking 398,000 (the researcher logged this as 2015); 2014 420i M Sport at 157,000 km asking 528,000; 2014 420i Coupe at 120,000 km asking 488,000. Interpolating to a 10-year (2016) M Sport at this buyer's 70,000 km gives ~690,000 dealer retail. Against an F32 420i Coupé Sport Line list of 2,180,000 (M Sport ~2,300,000) that is 30.0% of list as a dealer ask. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: -13% to private sale = 26.1% of list, applied to real_cost 2,595,000 -> 675,000 (26.0%). Trade-in a further 18% below private - at ten years most dealers take a German car in at scrap-adjacent money because the repair exposure is uncapped. The tail keeps sliding (33.9% to 26.0%) rather than flattening, which is the defining difference from a Lexus at this age."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"BMW Taiwan (汎德) new-car terms re-verified this round via indexed dealer-network promotion pages: '3年／4萬公里原廠保養套裝' applies across the combustion lineup, alongside the 3-year warranty (some campaigns add 原廠第4年延長保固 and 一年乙式全險). At 7,000 km the CBS oil service triggers on the 12-month clock and sits fully inside the package, so out-of-pocket spend is limited to items the package never covers. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from the researcher's 'high' to 'medium': the package's existence is confirmed, but I could not open an official BMW Taiwan service price table, and the 5,000 residue is my estimate of what falls outside the package rather than a quoted figure."},{"y":3,"source":"Same BMW Taiwan 3年／4萬公里 package, confirmed this round. This buyer reaches only 21,000 km by year 3, roughly half the 40,000 km cap, so the package is never voided on mileage and covers every scheduled item in this window - the near-zero figure is a genuine contractual subsidy, not an optimistic guess. The 12,000 is the residue the package excludes across two years. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from 'high' to 'medium' for the same reason as year 1: the mechanism is solid, the residue is an estimate with no invoice or official table behind it."},{"y":5,"source":"First fully unsubsidised window - the factory package has ended and the warranty has lapsed (3yr, or 4yr if the extension was taken). Service labour and parts benchmarked to Mobile01 owner receipts for the same B48 engine in the G20 320i (routine invoice ~15,000; itemised brake pads 8,750, air filter 1,300). Tyre cost from current Taiwan pricing for staggered 19-inch runflats on M Sport rolling stock, which is where a large slice of this figure sits and where a Japanese equivalent on 17-inch non-runflats would spend roughly a third as much. Tyres and the 12V battery land here because at 7,000 km/yr both age out on the calendar around year 5 with tread and cranking capacity nominally left. Confidence medium: the item list and intervals are solid, individual quotes vary by workshop."},{"y":7,"source":"Fully out of warranty. The B48 water pump and thermostat are documented Taiwan-market common failures ('水泵浦漏水是常見的通病之一'), with local specialists recommending water pump, thermostat and oil filter housing be done together because the job requires removing the intake manifold, alternator and A/C compressor - hence a partial probability-weighted provision here and the full job at 7-10y rather than pretending it never happens. The M Racing Edition's uprated M brake kit costs more to refresh than standard discs. Transmission oil is BMW-'lifetime' but universally recommended by independents by this age. The previous version of this record carried a note here asserting that no 48V starter-generator need be budgeted; that claim was not independently verifiable and has been removed. Confidence low because the failure-timing weighting is judgement, not a quoted invoice."},{"y":10,"source":"Three-year window on a 7-to-10-year-old BMW with no factory cover of any kind. Item list assembled from documented B48 failure patterns in Taiwan (water pump, thermostat, oil filter housing and valve cover gasket leaks are the recognised cluster at this age) plus age-driven consumables that ignore the low 21,000 km covered in this window - the second tyre set, the second 12V battery, coolant and rubber suspension components all age out on the calendar. ~97,000/yr average. The electrical provision is deliberately worded to absorb a mild-hybrid starter-generator if the Taiwan 420i turns out to carry 48V, since the prior claim that it does not could not be confirmed. This is the half of the story that separates a German coupé from a Japanese one: a RAV4 over the same window would be a fraction of this. Confidence low - a risk-weighted composite, not quoted invoices, and actual spend swings widely on whether the gasket and pump cluster lands early or late."}],"sources":[{"name":"8891 中古車 — BMW 4 Series 420i Coupe 全部在售車輛","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/4-series/420i-coupe","note":"PRIMARY used-price source and the only page I read in full directly, on 2026-08-12. Supplied every comparable in this record with year, mileage and 車商售價: the 2025 one-year-old set (1,530 km/2,080,000; 4,000 km/2,288,000 x3; 6,000 km/2,188,000; 11,000 km/2,100,000; 15,000 and 15,800 km/2,150,000), the 2023-2024 1,920,000 @ 16,000 km duplicate cluster, the 2021 M Sport @ 14,000 km/1,658,000, and the F32 tail (2018 base @ 50,000/728,000; 2017 M Sport @ 95,000/768,000; 2017 Sport Line @ 90,000/667,000; 2017 M Sport @ 120,000/688,000; 2015 Sport Line @ 80,000/598,000; 2015 M Sport @ 170,000/550,000; 2014 M Sport @ 157,000/528,000; 2014 Sport Line @ 150,000/398,000; 2014 Coupe @ 120,000/488,000). All are dealer retail asks and were cut 12-13% to reach private sale."},{"name":"BMW Taiwan 汎德 — 新年式 4 Series 上市發表 / 新車保養與保固條款","url":"https://www.bmw.com.tw/","note":"Domain-level reference, not a specific page I could open - content read via search index. Two things confirmed here: the launch pricing '420i Coupé M Racing Edition 建議售價：269萬元 / 430i Coupé M Racing Edition 建議售價：322萬元', and the standard '3年／4萬公里原廠保養套裝' plus 3-year warranty (with 原廠第4年延長保固 and 一年乙式全險 on some campaigns) that drives the near-zero years 1 and 3 maintenance figures."},{"name":"8891 新車頻道 — 2025 / 2026 年式 BMW 4-Series Coupe 車型價格","url":"https://www.8891.com.tw/","note":"Domain-level reference; content read via search index. Source of the PRIOR-YEAR list prices that anchor the year-1 and year-3 retention denominators: 2025 420i Coupé '售價261萬起' (2,610,000) and 2024 '建議售價新台幣255萬元起' (2,550,000). This corrects the previous researcher's guessed ~2,540,000 for the 2025 car."},{"name":"UpToGo / CARLINK / TVBS — 新年式 BMW 4 Series 台灣售價報導","url":"https://www.carlink.com.tw/","note":"Independent corroboration of the 2,690,000 list price, read via search index: UpToGo 'BMW 4-Series Coupe（雙門跑車）420i M Racing Edition：新台幣 269 萬元起' and 'Gran Coupe 420i M Sport：新台幣 263 萬元起'; CARLINK '269萬元起、新年式BMW 4系列全車系鋒格升級'; TVBS/ETtoday '全車系建議售價自269萬元起'."},{"name":"Mobile01 — BMW G20 320i 保養工單討論 (same B48 engine)","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/","note":"Domain-level reference, inherited from the prior researcher and NOT re-verified by me this round - flagged as such rather than dropped, because the figures it supplies are only calibration anchors, not headline numbers. Claimed anchors: routine service invoice ~15,000; larger work order ~36,000 itemising brake pads 8,750 and air filter 1,300. Used to calibrate the years 5, 7 and 10 service line items."},{"name":"KingAutos 國王車訊 — BMW 4 Series F32 Taiwan pricing","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/","note":"Domain-level reference, inherited and NOT re-verified this round. Supplies the predecessor-generation list price used as the denominator for the year 7 and 10 retention ratios: F32 420i Coupe Sport Line = 2,180,000, M Sport ~2,300,000. Because both those checkpoints are already marked confidence 'low', the unverified denominator is inside the stated uncertainty rather than hidden by it."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — BMW 420i","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/BMW%20420i","note":"Secondary used-market cross-check. Its headline 'average price 1,580,000' for a 2021 420i Coupe is mileage-blind and generation-blind and was NOT used. The prior researcher quoted several individual FindCar listings and a 2023 430i Gran Coupé cross-check that I could not re-verify this round; those have been dropped from the reasoning rather than carried forward as if confirmed, and the year-3 and year-5 confidences were adjusted accordingly."}]},"bmw-5-series-520i-m-sport":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year; every checkpoint uses 7,000 km/year (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km), roughly half the Taiwan average. Servicing is therefore TIME-driven, not mileage-driven: BMW's CBS calls an annual oil service long before the ~10,000-15,000 km trigger, and brake fluid (2-year clock), coolant, tyres and the 12V AGM battery age out rather than wear out. Because the car is genuinely low-mileage, resale is quoted from low-mileage listings, which sit above the mileage-blind average - stated explicitly in each source string. Vehicle licence tax (NT$11,230/yr) and fuel tax (NT$6,180/yr) appear on U-CAR and Yahoo Autos but are EXCLUDED by design, as is all insurance (BMW's factory programme has bundled a free year of body insurance at times; deliberately NOT counted as a cash discount). Fuel is excluded too (official 14.5 km/L combined). No charging hardware applies: this is a combustion car with a 48V belt-starter-generator, not a plug-in.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN ~4% from the original submission. Re-scraped 8891中古車 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series/520i, 260 live listings, 122 rows read across 3 pages today). Real current-generation G60 520i M Sport listings, all 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking): 2025-reg at 9,000 km asking 238.0萬 (two listings, both BMW 原廠認證中古車 / BPS 原廠保固); 2025-reg at 20,000-21,000 km asking 229.8萬 (元禾國際車業, three listings); 2024-reg at 9,000-15,000 km asking 220.0-227.8萬; 2024-reg at 3,100 km asking 228.0萬. CORRECTION APPLIED: the original record anchored on the 238萬 BPS-certified cars and then took only a 10% haircut. BPS certification is a dealer product (extended factory warranty, certified inspection) that a private seller cannot offer, so it is stripped out first: ordinary dealer retail for a 1-year / 7,000 km car is ~232萬, and low mileage is already priced in versus the 20,000 km cars. Private sale then set 12.5% below ordinary dealer retail = NT$2,030,000, reflecting that a private seller offers no warranty, no financing and no 過戶 service, and competes against unregistered 韓規 parallel imports listed at 219.8萬. Dealer trade-in a further 13% below private = NT$1,760,000. Implies a ~31% loss in year one - the front-loaded German first-year hit, far worse than a Japanese equivalent."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN ~10% from the original submission. From the same 8891中古車 scrape: G60 520i M Sport registered 2023 (~2.6-2.7 yr old, the closest real analogue) at 28,000-29,900 km asking 198.8萬 (元禾國際車業, three consistent listings); at 26,100 km asking 212.0萬 (three listings, all BMW 原廠認證中古車 / BPS); at 19,000 km asking 218.0萬; at 3,000-3,100 km asking 218.0萬. Those cars carried a 296萬 list price. CORRECTION APPLIED, two steps the original missed. (1) Use the ordinary-dealer band (198.8萬) rather than the BPS-certified band (212-218萬), for the same reason as year 1. (2) Timing: today's 2.7-year-old G60 is still being priced as THE current model, whereas our car at year 3 will be a 2029 car facing a G60 replacement expected around 2030-31 - so today's 2.7-year band overstates what our car will fetch at the same age. Ordinary dealer retail at 3 years / 21,000 km therefore set at ~190萬, private sale 12.5% below = NT$1,660,000, dealer trade-in 13% below private = NT$1,440,000. Year 3 is also when the 3-year warranty lapses, which is where the curve starts to break."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, and REVISED DOWN ~8% from the original submission. No genuine 5-year data exists for the G60 (TW launch Dec 2023, oldest cars ~2.7 years), so the retention ratio was measured on the PREDECESSOR G30 at 5-6 years and applied to this car's list price. Real G30 observations today, all dealer retail asking: 2020-reg (6 yr) 520i M Sport 白金旗艦版 at 40,000 km asking 112.8萬 (天母汽車); 2020-reg 白金旗艦版 at 40,000 km asking 102.0萬 and at 53,000 km asking 108.8萬 (8891); 2021-reg (5 yr) at 82,519 km asking 126.8萬 and 2020-reg at 43,036 km asking 125.8萬 (SUM汽車網 - note SUM asking prices run systematically above 8891 for the same cars, so 8891 was weighted more heavily). Against a G30 520i M Sport list of roughly 283-291萬 that is ~40% retention at 6 years, interpolating to ~47% at 5 years. Applied to this car's 299萬 list: dealer retail ~140萬 for a low-mileage 35,000 km car. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale 13% below dealer retail = NT$1,220,000; trade-in 14% below private = NT$1,050,000. The steep 3-to-5-year fall is real - the warranty is gone and the G60 is due for replacement around 2030-31, so at year 5 this car is a just-superseded generation."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION, as instructed; broadly CONFIRMS the original submission (revised down ~1%). The G60 cannot be 7 years old, so the retention ratio was measured on the G30 520i at exactly that age against its own verified list price. Predecessor list re-verified today at NT$2,780,000 (Yahoo 汽車, https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-5-series-sedan-2019-520i-m-sport, reads '2019 BMW 5-Series Sedan 520i M Sport 278', 184 hp - the pre-48V car). Real 2019-registered listings on 8891 today (7 years old, dealer retail asking): 520i M Sport at 89,000 km asking 103.8萬 and 108.8萬, at 110,000 km asking 106.8萬, at 111,400 km asking 95.8萬; plain 520i at 41,500 km asking 97.8萬 and at 60,900 km asking 98.0萬; 白金旗艦版 at 87,000 km asking 98.0萬. Our car at 49,000 km is genuinely low-mileage for the age, so the M Sport dealer-retail comparable is ~105萬, i.e. 105/278 = 37.8% retention. Applied to this car's 299萬 list = dealer retail ~113萬. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private 15% below = NT$960,000; trade-in 15% below private = NT$815,000. HONEST CAVEAT: the list-price ratio lifts this above what a directly comparable G30 actually asks in absolute terms (~103萬), because the G60 cost more new. That premium may not survive to year 7 - a G60 carries far more electronics to fail - which is part of why this is marked low."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION, as instructed; broadly CONFIRMS the original submission (revised up ~2%). Measured on the F10 520i, list re-verified today at NT$2,550,000 (Yahoo 汽車, https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-5-series-sedan-2016-520i, reads '2016 BMW 5-Series Sedan 520i 255'). Real 2016-registered listings on 8891 today (10 years old, dealer retail asking), quoted from the LOW-MILEAGE end to match this buyer: 68,000 km asking 48.8萬 (the closest single analogue to our 70,000 km car); 81,100-81,200 km asking 52.0萬 (two 原廠認證 cars); 90,100 km asking 56.0萬 (four listings); 83,000 km asking 43.0萬; 99,800 km asking 46.9萬; SUM汽車網 shows a 2016 at 99,832 km asking 57.8萬. So dealer retail for a 70,000 km F10 lands at ~52萬 = 20.4% of its 255萬 list. Applied to this car's 299萬 list = ~61萬, cut to ~58萬 because a 10-year-old G60 carries materially more failure-prone electronics (48V pack, curved display, ID8.5) than an F10 does. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private 14% below dealer retail = NT$500,000; trade-in 18% below private = NT$410,000 (spreads widen at this age because dealer margin is proportionally larger and many buyers will not touch an out-of-warranty German car). ~17% of real_cost after 10 years - the tail keeps falling, with no Lexus-style flattening. Note the observed F10-to-G30 cliff between 2016-reg (43-56萬) and 2017-reg (66.8-85.8萬) cars is a GENERATION break, not a pure age effect, and our car will be on the wrong side of exactly such a break at year 10."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Dealer service pricing from 金融財子's BMW cost breakdown (https://tyaward.com.tw/汽機車-2/bmw保養大概多少錢/), re-read today, which cites owner work orders: first service 8,000-9,600, CBS interval about 10,000 km or 1 year. Only one service falls in this window because at 7,000 km/year the trigger is the annual timer, not mileage. Caveat: those work orders are 3/4/X1 Series, not 5 Series, so the 5 Series figure is likely at or slightly above the top of that band."},{"y":3,"source":"Same dealer pricing sources (second service 8,500-8,700, third 8,500-10,000 per 金融財子; brake fluid 2,500-4,500 and the explicit '每兩年更換一次，不論里程' rule per 比迪行銷's BMW price table). Still no repair line because failures remain covered by the 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty. Same caveat as year 1 on the provenance of the work orders."},{"y":5,"source":"Warranty expires at year 3, so this is the first period paying its own repairs. Item pricing from 比迪行銷's BMW 保養費用價格表 (https://www.whbydcc.com/bmw保養費用價格表/), re-read today and confirmed: AGM battery 8,000-15,000 with a stated 2-4 year life, pads per axle 4,000-8,000, brake fluid 2,500-4,500, alignment 1,500-3,500. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from medium to low relative to the original submission: that page discloses at its foot that it was AI-written ('本文由AI創作'), so it is a plausible aggregate rather than a verified dealer table."},{"y":7,"source":"Tyre cost from 比迪行銷's table (3,500-12,000+ per tyre, explicitly noting RFT runflat construction as the top of the range; a 19-inch staggered M-wheel set lands there). Spark plugs 4,000-10,000, discs per axle 8,000-20,000 from the same table. 金融財子 documents the >60,000 km / 3-5 year window as where BMW costs genuinely diverge, names 電動水幫浦/節溫器 and valve-cover oil seepage as signature ageing items, and states independents run 50-70% of dealer cost - which is why the routine service line drops here. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from medium to low for the same AI-authorship reason as year 5."},{"y":10,"source":"EXTRAPOLATED, and deliberately heavy. 金融財子 (https://tyaward.com.tw/汽機車-2/bmw保養大概多少錢/) explicitly names the post-warranty failure cluster that drives BMW's reputation - 電動水幫浦、節溫器（水龜）、水箱, quoting ~15,000 連工帶料 at an independent for the thermostat alone and more at a dealer; timing chain; valve-cover oil leaks; coil packs and sensors - and states a 60,000 km major service alone runs 20,000-35,000 at a dealer. 比迪行銷's table gives gearbox oil 12,000-25,000 and discs 8,000-20,000 per axle. Line items sum to exactly 244,000 (the original submission stated 240,000 against items summing to 244,000; corrected here). The 48V provision has no Taiwanese price list behind it at all - it is a reasoned allowance for a real exposure on this drivetrain, which is the main reason this checkpoint is low confidence."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - BMW 5 Series 車款介紹","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/5%20series/7073/overall","note":"Primary list-price verification, re-fetched 2026-08-12: spec table reads 520i M Sport 299萬 / 530i M Sport 339萬, 1,998 cc, 190 hp @4400-6500 rpm, 14.5 km/L, RWD, 8-speed. Documents the TW price history in its own text (296萬 at Dec 2023 launch, +3萬 to 299萬 with the 2026 model year in Dec 2025, adding 飾光水箱護罩, 動態迎賓光毯, ventilated front seats, B&W audio). Confirms the 19-inch M 935M wheels and that the 520i runs conventional M Sport suspension. Also lists annual 牌照稅 11,230 / 燃料稅 6,180, both excluded from this model."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - 2026 BMW 5-Series Sedan 520i M Sport","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-5-series-sedan-2026-520i-m-sport","note":"Second independent list-price confirmation, re-fetched 2026-08-12: '2026 BMW 5-Series Sedan 520i M Sport 299'. Its description text is the basis for the powertrain classification - it names '48V高效複合動力科技' paired with the TwinPower Turbo four and Steptronic eight-speed, i.e. a belt-driven mild hybrid that cannot run on battery alone. Full spec: 190 hp @4400 rpm, 31.6 kgm @1500 rpm, 14.5 km/L combined, 1998 cc, imported."},{"name":"8891 新車 - BMW 5-Series Sedan","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/m/kindsum/9509","note":"Third independent list-price confirmation, re-fetched 2026-08-12: '299-339萬'. Also the source for the discount inference - the owner-submitted 車主分享菜單價 is masked as '2?9.00萬' behind a login, which is why NT$120,000 is stated as an inference rather than a quote. The original submission additionally attributed specific factory incentives (贈1年乙式險, 0% interest on 180萬/48 months, expiry 2026-08-31) and a count of 63 菜單 to this page; none of that was visible on re-fetch, so those claims have been dropped from the record."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 5-Series 520i 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series/520i","note":"Main used-price evidence, re-scraped 2026-08-12 across three pages (260 live listings; 122 distinct rows read). Supplied every current-generation G60 anchor (2025-reg 9,000 km @ 238萬 BPS-certified; 2025-reg 20-21k km @ 229.8萬; 2024-reg 9-15k km @ 220-227.8萬; 2023-reg 26.1k km @ 212萬 BPS; 2023-reg 28-29.9k km @ 198.8萬) and the G30/F10 comparators for years 5, 7 and 10. All figures are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking) and were adjusted downward for private sale and again for trade-in. Also revealed the 韓規 unregistered parallel-import listings at 219.8-239.8萬 that cap 總代理 resale."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - BMW 5 SERIES 中古車搜尋","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=4&brand=BMW&model=5%20SERIES","note":"Second used-car marketplace, used only as a cross-check. Confirmed live and returning BMW 5 Series results on 2026-08-12; two of the original submission's citations were matched exactly on the first page (2024-reg at 15,000 km @ 227.8萬; 2020-reg at 30,000 km @ 121.8萬), along with 2021-reg at 82,519 km @ 126.8萬 and 2016-reg at 99,832 km @ 57.8萬. Several other SUM data points quoted in the original submission could not be located on the pages reachable without pagination, and SUM asking prices run systematically above 8891 for equivalent cars, so 8891 was weighted more heavily throughout."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - 2019 BMW 5-Series Sedan 520i M Sport","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-5-series-sedan-2019-520i-m-sport","note":"Predecessor-generation (G30) original list price, re-verified 2026-08-12 at NT$2,780,000 - the denominator for the 7-year retention ratio. Also confirms the pre-facelift 184 hp / 29.6 kgm spec, distinguishing it from the current 190 hp 48V car."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - 2016 BMW 5-Series Sedan 520i","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-5-series-sedan-2016-520i","note":"F10-generation original list price, re-verified 2026-08-12 at NT$2,550,000 - the denominator for the 10-year retention ratio. 184 hp, 1997 cc, 13.7 km/L."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 - 汎德宣佈 BMW 與 MINI 邁入新車三年不限里程保固服務","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/10646","note":"Source for BMW Taiwan's 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty from importer 汎德. IMPORTANT CAVEAT added during fact-checking: this article is dated 1 June 2009, i.e. it records when the policy was introduced, not that it still stands on today's terms. The policy is still the market standard, but this is weak evidence for 2026 and no primary 汎德 page could be reached (BMW.com.tw blocks automated access). It says nothing about scheduled servicing being included, which is consistent with - but not proof of - the assumption that 保養套餐 is a paid option."},{"name":"金融財子 - 揭密 BMW 保養大概多少錢與省錢撇步","url":"https://tyaward.com.tw/%E6%B1%BD%E6%A9%9F%E8%BB%8A-2/bmw%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E5%A4%A7%E6%A6%82%E5%A4%9A%E5%B0%91%E9%8C%A2/","note":"Re-read 2026-08-12 (article dated 2026-08-04). Maintenance costing from cited owner work orders: first three dealer services 8,000-9,600 / 8,500-8,700 / 8,500-10,000; CBS interval ~10,000 km or 1 year; 60,000 km major service 20,000-35,000; independents run 50-70% of dealer cost. Names the post-warranty failure cluster used to build years 7-10: valve-cover gasket oil leaks, timing chain, electric water pump and thermostat (~15,000 連工帶料 at an independent), and battery replacement requiring computer registration. Its own comparison table (BMW 6,000-9,500 vs Japanese 3,000-4,500 per in-warranty service; 20,000-35,000 vs 8,000-12,000 at 60,000 km) is the benchmark for the ~2.5x German premium. Caveat: the quoted work orders are 3/4/X1 Series owners, not 5 Series."},{"name":"比迪行銷 - BMW 保養費用價格表","url":"https://www.whbydcc.com/bmw%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E8%B2%BB%E7%94%A8%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC%E8%A1%A8/","note":"Re-read 2026-08-12 and every figure the original submission quoted was confirmed present: oil+filter 5,000-12,000; air filter 2,000-5,000; cabin filter 2,000-4,000; brake fluid 2,500-4,500 (explicitly every 2 years regardless of mileage); spark plugs 4,000-10,000; gearbox oil 12,000-25,000; pads per axle 4,000-8,000; discs per axle 8,000-20,000; AGM battery 8,000-15,000 with 2-4 year life; tyres 3,500-12,000+ each (RFT at the top); alignment 1,500-3,500; major service 15,000-50,000+. SOURCING WARNING: the page discloses at its foot that the article was written by AI ('本文由AI創作'). It is therefore an unverified aggregate, not a dealer price list, and the maintenance checkpoints that lean on it (years 5 and 7) were downgraded to low confidence."},{"name":"小曾車庫 - 中古車過戶費多少錢","url":"https://www.littletsenggarage.com/transfer-fees-dmv/","note":"Re-read 2026-08-12 and confirmed verbatim: 監理站過戶行照費 200, 牌照登記費 15, 驗車費 450 ('五年內的車不用'), 代辦費 1,000-2,000, whole transfer '兩千元以內' excluding 強制險 (~1,398, excluded here as insurance). Also states that these costs are conventionally borne by the buyer, which is noted as a caveat on the selling_costs line."}]},"bmw-7-series-735i-luxury":{"assumptions":"低里程車主：每年 6,000-8,000 km，取中位 7,000 km/年，遠低於台灣平均 12,000-15,000 km/年。各檢查點 assumed_km = 7000 × years（7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000）。\n\n保養節奏：本次查核獨立重抓台北依德 BMW（yiderbmw.wordpress.com/bmw-service-extend/）並逐字確認兩點——「於授權服務中心完成每年或每一萬公里的定時定期保養」與「BMW提供您的新車2+1年不限里程保固服務」。在 7,000 km/年 下永遠碰不到 1 萬公里觸發點，因此保養完全由時間驅動，10 年正好進廠 10 次、累積約 70,000 km。\n\n動力歸類：735i 為 3.0L 直列六缸渦輪（B58，2,998 c.c.、272 hp/5000 rpm）搭配 48V 輕油電（額外 18 hp）。48V 系統無法純電行駛，依本表規則歸為 gasoline 而非 hybrid（U-CAR 規格表本次獨立實抓，「汽油／直列6汽缸」逐字確認）。\n\n稅金與保險依設計排除在外（供參考：U-CAR 規格表列本車燃料稅 7,200 元/年、牌照稅 15,210 元/年，兩者皆未計入）。\n\n【查核新增的世代風險修正】G70 於 2022 年 12 月在台上市（U-CAR 內文確認），本車為 2026 年式 pre-LCI；G70 LCI 預期 2026-2027 年登場。原始記錄只在第 5 年才把「世代更替折價」計入，但那不成立——LCI 若在 2026-27 年登場，本車在自己的第 1-2 年就已經是 pre-LCI，折價會提前發生，不會等到第 5 年。前代 G11 的實價直接證明這個斷崖有多大：2019 年掛牌（LCI）730i 層峰旗艦版 50,000 km 開價 148.0 萬，2018 年掛牌（pre-LCI）730i Luxury 105,000 km 開價 85.8 萬，僅差一個年式、價差逾 40%（里程不同會放大，但方向與量級明確）。因此本次查核把第 1、3 年的殘值由「今天市場上還是現行世代的 G70 掛牌價」向下修正，理由與幅度寫在各 checkpoint 的 source。","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"【本次查核已下修】資料來源為 8891 中古車 G70 735i 實際掛牌（auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/7-series/735i，2026-08-12 獨立重抓，HTTP 200，解析出 n=14 筆，價格區間 10.8 萬~433.0 萬，與原始記錄描述一致）。近新車實際掛牌：2025 年掛牌 2025 款 735i Luxury / 3,000 km 開價 418.0 萬；2025 年掛牌 2026 款 735i Pure Excellence / 2,000 km 418.0 萬；2025 年掛牌 2026 款 735i M Edition / 3,000 km 433.0 萬；2024 年掛牌 2024 款 Luxury / 4,858 km 382.0 萬；2024 年掛牌 2025 款 Luxury / 4,000 km 382.0 萬。\n\n【修正 1：車商開價基準】原始記錄取 415 萬，等於幾乎照抄那筆唯一的 1 年 Luxury 開價 418.0 萬。該筆有兩個問題：(a) 它是該車齡唯一一筆 Luxury 樣本；(b) 它的開價與更高階的 Pure Excellence 完全相同（同為 418.0 萬），顯示屬偏高的個別喊價，而非級距行情。相對地，兩筆 2024 年掛牌 Luxury 在 382.0 萬完全一致（n=2 互相印證），是更可靠的錨點。取 1 年車商開價 408 萬（高於 2 年群聚的 382 萬、低於單筆偏高的 418 萬）。\n\n【修正 2：世代時點】今天的 1 年車仍是「現行世代」，本車滿 1 年時（2027）G70 LCI 預期已登場、本車已成 pre-LCI，故不能直接套用今天的行情，額外下修約 4%。\n\n【車商售價 → 自售價】408 萬為車商零售開價（dealer retail asking），非車主拿得到的錢。旗艦房車庫存周轉慢、車商單台押的利息與毛利高，取價差區間高端 -15%：408 萬 × 0.85 ≈ 347 萬，再套世代時點 -4% ≈ 333 萬，記為 3,330,000（real_cost 的 70.9%）。dealer_tradein_price 取自售價 85% = 2,830,000。confidence 由原始記錄的 high 下修為 medium：掛牌樣本雖真實且多筆，但 private_sale_price 本身從未被觀測到，是換算值，且已再疊加世代時點判斷。"},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"【本次查核已下修】8891 中古車 G70 735i Luxury 同世代同車型實際掛牌（auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/7-series/735i，2026-08-12 獨立重抓）。3 年車真實樣本：2023 年掛牌 735i Luxury / 44,000 km 318.8 萬、/ 53,000 km 318.8 萬、/ 76,000 km 279.8 萬（3 筆同價）；另 2022 年掛牌（約 3.7 年）735i Luxury / 24,000 km 299.8 萬。\n\n【車商開價基準】本車主第 3 年僅 21,000 km，遠低於 44,000-76,000 km 的市場樣本，享有低里程溢價。兩條路徑收斂：(a) 由 44,000 km 的 318.8 萬往下修里程，約 +3~5% → 約 330 萬；(b) 由 3.7 年 / 24,000 km 的 299.8 萬往回推 0.7 年（本世代觀察到的年跌幅約 45 萬/年）→ 約 331 萬。取車商開價 330 萬。註：原始記錄取 325 萬，方向正確但略保守，此處依實價上修。\n\n【修正：世代時點】此為對本記錄最實質的修正。原始記錄只在第 5 年才把世代更替折價計入，但本車 2026 年式為 pre-LCI、LCI 預期 2026-2027 登場，本車在第 3 年（2029）早已是上一世代，且次世代已在望。今天觀測到的 3 年行情屬「仍是現行世代」的 G70，直接套用會高估。前代 G11 的實價證明這個斷崖量級很大：2019 年掛牌（LCI）730i 層峰旗艦版 / 50,000 km 148.0 萬 vs 2018 年掛牌（pre-LCI）730i Luxury / 105,000 km 85.8 萬，僅差一個年式。故對第 3 年施加約 -8% 的 pre-LCI 折價。\n\n【換算】330 萬 × 0.86（車商售價 → 自售價，-14%）≈ 284 萬，再乘 pre-LCI 折價 0.92 ≈ 261 萬，記為 2,610,000（real_cost 的 55.6%）。dealer_tradein_price 取自售價 85% = 2,210,000。confidence 由 high 下修為 medium：掛牌樣本真實且有 4 筆同世代同車型，但最終數字已疊加兩層判斷（自售換算、pre-LCI 折價），不再是可直接讀出的觀測值。"},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"【外推，非同世代實價；查核後維持金額、調整 tradein】G70 於 2022 年 12 月才在台上市，市場上最老的同世代車僅約 3.7 年，第 5 年沒有同世代真實行情，依規則改用前代 G11（2016-2022）同齡低里程車的殘值比再套回本車 real_cost。前代實抓（auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/7-series/730i，2026-08-12 獨立重抓，HTTP 200，解析出 36 筆）：2022 年掛牌 730i 層峰旗艦版 / 13,000 km 199.0 萬（車齡 4 年、極低里程）；2021 年掛牌 730i 層峰旗艦版 / 99,000 km 143.0 萬（5 年、高里程）；2020 年掛牌 730i 層峰旗艦版 / 46,500 km 153.8 萬（6 年）。以本車主 35,000 km 的低里程條件內插，前代車齡 5 年的車商開價約 175 萬。\n\n前代 LCI（2019 年小改）730i 層峰旗艦版原始新車價採約 430 萬——此為估計值，本次查核未能找到可驗證的官方或媒體價格頁（U-CAR 僅保留現行 G70 規格頁，前代頁面查無），故此分母仍是本檢查點最大的不確定來源，敏感度見 open questions。前代第 5 年低里程殘值比 ≈ (175 萬 × 0.87 自售換算) / 430 萬 ≈ 35.4%。\n\n對照 G70 自身 1-3.7 年走勢外推約 46%，兩者差距主因是世代更替：今天的 G11 之所以殘值低，正因它已被 G70 取代，而本車在第 5 年（2031）同樣是上一世代（甚至已接近上兩世代）。加權後偏向前代比率，取 40.0% × 4,695,000 ≈ 1,880,000。dealer_tradein_price 由原始記錄的 83% 調整為 84% = 1,580,000，使其落在本表規定的「較自售價再低 10-15%」區間內。"},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"【外推，非同世代實價；查核後維持金額、上修 tradein】第 7 年同世代資料不存在，改用前代 G11 同齡低里程車殘值比。前代實抓（auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/7-series/730i，2026-08-12 獨立重抓並逐筆核對）：2019 年掛牌（車齡 7 年）730i 層峰旗艦版 / 50,000 km 開價 148.0 萬、/ 53,000 km 開價 146.8 萬——這兩筆的里程幾乎正好等於本車主第 7 年的 49,000 km，是全表匹配度最高的樣本，原始記錄引用無誤；同年份較高里程者：93,000-94,000 km 開價 128.0-128.8 萬、120,000 km 開價 118.0 萬。\n\n取車商開價 147 萬，以前代 LCI 車型原價約 430 萬（估計值，見第 5 年說明）計，自售換算 (147 萬 × 0.87) / 430 萬 ≈ 29.7%。套回本車 real_cost：29.8% × 4,695,000 ≈ 1,400,000。此時原廠 2+1 年不限里程保固早已結束（依德實抓確認），中古市場已把氣壓懸吊、後軸轉向等高價修繕風險折進價格，這是德系旗艦第 7 年之後續跌而非打平的結構性原因。dealer_tradein_price 由原始記錄的 81% 上修為 83% = 1,160,000：81% 已落在本表「較自售價再低 10-15%」的規定區間之外，屬過度折價。"},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"【外推，但錨定在真實的 10 年車實價上；查核後維持金額、上修 tradein】第 10 年同世代資料不存在，改用前代 G11 同齡低里程車殘值比。前代實抓（auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/7-series/730i，2026-08-12 獨立重抓並逐筆核對）：2016 年掛牌（車齡正好 10 年）730i 樣本 7 筆——55,000 km 79.8 萬、55,700 km 79.8 萬、122,000 km 72.8 萬、130,000 km 68.8 萬、139,000 km 68.8 萬、148,300 km 69.8 萬、170,000 km 75.8 萬。原始記錄引用完全正確。本車主第 10 年為 70,000 km，介於 55,000 與 122,000 km 之間，內插得車商開價約 76 萬。\n\n前代原始新車價在此有直接證據（本次查核已在原始 HTML 中逐字複驗）：同一批掛牌中一則 2016 款 730i 的車商標題自述「【新車價近 380 萬｜現在不用 80 萬入主】」，即 2016 款 730i 原價約 380 萬。故前代 10 年低里程殘值比 = (76 萬 × 0.87 自售換算) / 380 萬 ≈ 17.4%。套回本車：17.5% × 4,695,000 ≈ 820,000。\n\n此比率是本資料庫德系車中最低的（對照 Porsche Cayenne 18.8%、BMW X3 23.8%、Mercedes GLC 26.6%），符合大型旗艦房車的市場現實：買家極少、修繕風險最高、屆時已落後兩個世代。dealer_tradein_price 由原始記錄的 78% 上修為 81% = 660,000：78% 明顯超出本表「較自售價再低 10-15%」的規定區間。10 年車齡的 7 Series 多數車商確實不願收，但那反映在「收不收」而非把收購價再壓到 -22%。"}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"保養週期與保固範圍以台北依德 BMW（yiderbmw.wordpress.com/bmw-service-extend/）本次查核獨立實抓並逐字複驗：「每年或每一萬公里的定時定期保養」、「2+1年不限里程保固服務」。單次保養金額為依 7 Series 級距與 3.0L 六缸推估，非實際收據。"},{"y":3,"source":"涵蓋第 1→3 年區間。保養週期與 3 年保固已向台北依德實抓複驗；金額為級距推估。此區間刻意不含任何故障維修，因為原廠保固完整覆蓋。"},{"y":5,"source":"涵蓋第 3→5 年區間。本期起金額為風險加權判斷值，非收據。輪胎為 runflat 且 7 Series 用大尺寸，單價依台灣原廠胎行情推估；煞車尺寸依車重與級距推估。過保時點依台北依德實抓複驗的 2+1 年保固推算。Mobile01 車主收據來源本次查核抓取遭 HTTP 403，無法佐證。"},{"y":7,"source":"涵蓋第 5→7 年區間。全部為風險加權判斷值，非收據。項目選擇依 B58 引擎與 G70 標配氣壓懸吊的已知高齡故障型態；氣壓懸吊與後軸轉向為全車系標配一事已由 U-CAR 規格頁原始 HTML 逐字複驗（「全面標配 My Mode 行車體驗模式切換、電子懸吊系統、前後軸自動水平氣壓式懸吊系統與整合式後軸轉向系統」）。未假設車主購買延長保固，故本期為全額自費。"},{"y":10,"source":"涵蓋第 7→10 年區間。全部為風險加權判斷值，非收據，本期不確定性最高。【本次查核已由 508,000 上修為 578,000】：原始記錄把氣壓懸吊估在 120,000（僅 2 支 + 壓縮機），並把整合式後軸轉向與 48V 系統壓在籠統的 35,000 風險備抵裡。G70 為前後軸皆氣壓的四角系統，漏氣後常需連同閥體處理，故上修為 150,000；後軸轉向致動器與 48V 起動發電機都是應具名列出的高單價過保件，分別獨立編列 45,000 與 30,000。金額仍按外廠／副廠件而非原廠件計算，若堅持原廠件會再高出一倍以上。轉外廠比例的假設反映實務：10 年車齡的 7 Series 車主極少再回原廠做大修。Mobile01 車主收據本次查核抓取回傳 HTTP 403，無法取得任何真實維修單據佐證。"}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - BMW 7 Series 車型/規格與售價表","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/7%20series/6498/overall","note":"主要價格來源。本次查核獨立重抓（HTTP 200）並在原始 HTML 中逐格複驗價格表列：「735i Luxury｜493｜2,998｜汽油｜直列6汽缸｜八前速手自排｜後輪驅動｜272 hp/5000 rpm｜12.3 km/l｜燃7,200 / 牌15,210」，即 NT$4,930,000，確認原始記錄的 list_price 正確、無需修正。同頁內文另複驗：G70 於 2022 年 12 月導入台灣，初期三車型 488/595/638 萬後調升為 493/600/640 萬；735i 與 740i 皆搭載 48V 輕油電（額外 18 hp），735i 為 272 hp、740i 為 381 hp；7 Series 與 i7 全車系「全面標配 My Mode 行車體驗模式切換、電子懸吊系統、前後軸自動水平氣壓式懸吊系統與整合式後軸轉向系統」（maintenance 後期高額項目的直接依據）；迎賓自動車門為 740i Luxury 以上才有，本車不含。註：WebFetch 對本頁回 403，需帶瀏覽器 UA 直接抓取才取得內容。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 7-Series 735i 全部在售車況","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/7-series/735i","note":"第 1、3 年殘值的主要來源。本次查核獨立重抓（HTTP 200）並自行解析出 n=14 筆同世代同車型掛牌，價格區間 10.8 萬~433.0 萬，與原始記錄描述一致。近新車：2025 年掛牌 2025 款 735i Luxury/3,000 km 418.0 萬、2026 款 Pure Excellence/2,000 km 418.0 萬、2026 款 M Edition/3,000 km 433.0 萬。約 2 年：2024 年掛牌 2024 款 Luxury/4,858 km 382.0 萬、2025 款 Luxury/4,000 km 382.0 萬、2024 款 Msport/2,600 km 415.0 萬、2025 款 735i/3,000 km 389.8 萬。3 年：2023 年掛牌 Luxury/44,000 km 318.8 萬、/53,000 km 318.8 萬、/76,000 km 279.8 萬（3 筆）；2022 年掛牌 Luxury/24,000 km 299.8 萬。全部為車商零售開價，已依 -14% 至 -15% 換算為自售價、並再套 pre-LCI 世代折價後才寫入 private_sale_price。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 7-Series 730i 全部在售車況（前代 G11/G12）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/7-series/730i","note":"第 5、7、10 年外推的唯一實價基礎。本次查核獨立重抓（HTTP 200）並自行解析出 36 筆前代掛牌，逐筆核對原始記錄引用的樣本，全部屬實。關鍵樣本：2022 年掛牌（4 年）層峰旗艦版/13,000 km 199.0 萬；2021 年（5 年）層峰旗艦版/99,000 km 143.0 萬；2020 年（6 年）/46,500 km 153.8 萬；2019 年（7 年）層峰旗艦版/50,000 km 148.0 萬、/53,000 km 146.8 萬（里程與本車第 7 年的 49,000 km 幾乎完全吻合）；2018 年（8 年）Luxury/105,000 km 85.8 萬、/119,000 km 86.8 萬（此處出現 LCI 與 pre-LCI 的斷崖，是本次查核對第 1、3 年施加 pre-LCI 折價的實證依據）；2016 年（10 年）7 筆，55,000 km 79.8 萬 至 170,000 km 75.8 萬。前代原始新車價的直接證據也在此頁並已逐字複驗：一則 2016 款 730i 的車商掛牌副標自述「【新車價近 380 萬｜現在不用 80 萬入主】」，此即第 10 年殘值比 17.4% 的分母來源。註：前代 LCI（2019-2022）730i 層峰旗艦版的原始售價（本表採約 430 萬）在本頁沒有對應證據，仍是估計值。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 7-Series 740i 在售車況（同世代高階車型交叉驗證）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/7-series/740i","note":"本次查核新增並獨立實抓（HTTP 200，解析出 22 筆），用於確認 G70 的折舊節奏不是 735i 單一車型現象。2025 年掛牌 740i Luxury/3,000 km 497.0 萬、/10,000 km 428.8 萬；2024 年掛牌 740i Luxury/3,000-4,948 km 462.0-463.0 萬、740i Excellence/3,177 km 522.0 萬；2023 年掛牌 740i Luxury/9,995 km 418.0 萬、/10,000 km 399.0-418.0 萬、740i Excellence/6,000 km 468.0 萬、/32,000 km 388.0 萬、740i Luxury/69,000 km 349.8 萬。對 600 萬（740i Luxury）與 640 萬（Excellence）新車價，1 年車商開價約 83%、3 年低里程約 67-70%，與 735i 的觀察一致，佐證本表第 1、3 年的車商開價基準。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 7-Series 740Li 在售車況","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/7-series/740Li","note":"本次查核獨立實抓（HTTP 200，解析出 38 筆），作為長車身與更早世代的補充對照，確認 7 Series 車齡越大跌勢不打平、持續下探：2019 年掛牌 740Li 層峰旗艦版/88,000 km 160.0 萬、/130,000 km 148.0 萬、2019 款 740Li/110,000 km 129.8 萬；更早世代（2016-2017 年 740Li Luxury/730d）落在 79.8-93.0 萬。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 7-Series 全車系彙總頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/7series","note":"本次查核獨立實抓（HTTP 200）作為車型涵蓋度的交叉檢查。可驗證的部分：735i 在售 14 筆、價格區間 10.8 萬~433.0 萬，與直接解析 735i 分頁的結果完全一致。原始記錄在此頁另引用了 740i n=24、730i n=70、740Li n=80、750Li n=12 等筆數，本次查核在該頁的伺服器端 HTML 中無法定位這些彙總數字，故不採用、也不在任何計算中依賴它們。"},{"name":"台北依德 BMW - 保修服務／依德延長保固方案","url":"https://yiderbmw.wordpress.com/bmw-service-extend/","note":"maintenance 的關鍵制度來源。本次查核獨立重抓（HTTP 200）並逐字複驗：(a)「BMW提供您的新車2+1年不限里程保固服務；此外，所有 BMW 原廠非消耗性付費零件以及BMW原廠配件均不限里程」，即 3 年不限里程原廠保固；(b) 延長保固購買資格寫明「新車保固期(36個月內)結束前至BMW台北依德完成『新車保固到期檢查』」與「完整保養紀錄。(於授權服務中心完成每年或每一萬公里的定時定期保養)」，直接確認保養週期為「每年或每 1 萬公里先到者」——這是本表「7,000 km/年 下保養完全由時間驅動、10 年 10 次」的依據。因延長保固為加價購而非標配，本表第 5、7、10 年一律以全額自費計算。"}]},"bmw-i4-edrive40":{"assumptions":"買家年行駛 6,000-8,000 km，遠低於台灣平均 12,000-15,000 km。各檢查點一律用 7,000 x 年數（7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km）。因為里程極低，殘值採「同年份低里程車」而非里程盲的平均行情，保養則以「時間到期」而非「里程到期」為主軸（原廠 CBS 條件式保養在此里程下等同一年一次）。家用充電樁安裝（含電力申請與佈線，台灣行情約 NT$30,000-80,000）屬於擁車支出但不算保養，已刻意排除在 maintenance 之外；電費、稅金、保險亦全部排除。純電車在台使用牌照稅免徵至 2030/12/31，但依本表設計不計入。i4 eDrive40 為單馬達後驅、83.9 kWh 電池、340 hp、WLTP 600 km，屬純電（bev），非油電、非 48V。查核者註：殘值曲線已重建為德系前重式（year 1 一次跌 28%，其後年衰減約 12-14%，第 8 年高壓電池保固到期後尾段再加速到約 17%/年），取代原研究者「年衰減率隨車齡加速」的後重式曲線。","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"查核者獨立抓取並解析 8891 在售車列表（https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/i/i4-edrive40，2026-08-12，Next.js RSC payload，共 13 筆）。低里程實車車商開價：2025 年式 4,241 km 245.0 萬、2024 年式 3,500 km 243.0 萬、3,000 km 232.0 萬、5,900-5,978 km 228.0 萬 x3、9,000 km 218.0 萬。這些全部是「車商售價」且原始牌價為 275 萬（2024/09 小改款）。取真正低里程群的中位開價約 230 萬，套用 -15%（此級距週轉慢、庫存重複刊登，取 8-15% 帶的下緣）得自售約 195.5 萬，再對「本案是 2025/11 SiC 新年式、屆時將面對 Neue Klasse 新世代接手」做小幅前瞻下修，定 195 萬。車商收購 = 195 萬 x 0.867 ≈ 169 萬。修正說明：原研究者給 207 萬（對 real_cost 76.4%），屬豐田等級的保值率，非德系純電應有水準；同批德系純電對照組 year-1 落在 66-69%（EQE 66.5%、EQB 66.7%、EQA 69.1%），本案修正後為 72.0%，仍高於對照組以尊重 i4 確有實車支撐，但已脫離「高 70%」紅區。低里程已計入（一般 1 年車跑 12,000-15,000 km，本案僅 7,000 km）。"},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"錨點是查核者親自抓取驗證的唯一成交訊號：8891 個別車輛頁 https://m.8891.com.tw/auto?id=4331289，payload 確認 makeYear 2022、modelEnName eDrive40、里程 2.59 萬 km、開價 183.0 萬、狀態「已售出」、原始牌價 255.0 萬 → 4 年車車商開價保值率 71.8%。姊妹車交叉驗證（https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/i/i4-m50，查核者自行解析）：真正的 2022 年式（4 年車）M50 為 3-3.6 萬 km 開價 189.0-191.0 萬，對 310 萬牌價僅 61.0-61.6%。兩者平均約 66-67% 的 4 年車商開價保值率。扣除「2022-2026 期間 i4 新車牌價由 255 萬漲到 279 萬（+9.4%）把中古行情一起墊高」這個不會重演的順風（x0.906），再以 -13% 由車商開價轉自售，得 4 年自售約 147 萬。本檢查點為 3 年，故定自售 150 萬；車商收購 = 150 萬 x 0.867 ≈ 130 萬。修正說明：原研究者宣稱 M50 的 4 年保值率為 71.6-73.5%，實際上他拿的是 2023 年式（3 年車，222-228 萬）去對 4 年的 eDrive40，年份錯置；真正的 4 年 M50 是 61%，姊妹車證據其實是「反駁」而非支持原曲線。原值 165 萬因此下修至 150 萬。"},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"外推，無真實資料點：i4 台灣 2022 年才上市，市場上最老的只有 4 年車，5 年車尚不存在。以修正後的德系前重式曲線推進（year 1 -28.0%，其後穩定約 13%/年），自 3 年 150 萬推得 5 年自售 113 萬（對 real_cost 41.7%），車商收購 = 113 萬 x 0.854 ≈ 96.5 萬。理由：原廠 3 年不限里程保固（汎德，U-CAR news/article/10646）在第 3 年到期後，中古市場開始對德系純電的維修風險打折。同批對照組 year-5 為 34.8-43.5%（EQE 34.8%、EQB 42.6%、EQA 40.5%、EX40 43.5%），本案 41.7% 落在帶內。低里程（35,000 km，約一般車的一半）已給予正向調整。原研究者給 122 萬，因其 1-3 年曲線過於平緩而偏高，已隨整體曲線重建下修。"},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"外推自「前代德系純電」而非憑空捏造：現行 i4 沒有 7 年車，改用 BMW i3 這台台灣唯一有長期資料的德系純電做保值率代理。查核者親自抓取並解析 8891 在售 i3（https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/i/i3，共 4 筆）：2017 年式 REX 14 萬 km 開價 52.0 萬、2016 年式 REX 8.3 萬 km 59.8 萬、2016 年式 REX 9 萬 km 45.8 萬；i3 純電版原牌價 239 萬、REX 版 299 萬（U-CAR news/article/23587）。i3 在 9-10 年殘存約牌價的 15-20%。把 5 年與 10 年兩端沿修正後曲線內插得 7 年自售 84 萬（對 real_cost 31.0%），車商收購 = 84 萬 x 0.851 ≈ 71.5 萬。此時車齡 7 年、原廠保固早過、高壓電池 8 年保固僅剩 1 年，中古市場已在對修復風險定價。同批對照組 year-7 為 26.3-34.5%，本案落在帶內。"},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"外推自前代德系純電 BMW i3 的實際 10 年行情（查核者自行解析 8891，見上）：2016 年式 i3 REX（今年正好 10 年）開價 45.8-59.8 萬、里程 8.3-9.0 萬 km，對 REX 原牌價 299 萬為 15.3-20.0%。這些是車商開價，轉自售約 40-52 萬。i4 條件較佳（83.9 kWh、WLTP 600 km，2036 年仍屬堪用，不像 i3 的 22/33 kWh 那樣被續航淘汰；且本案 70,000 km 遠低於樣本 i3 的 8.3-14 萬 km），故取 48 萬（對 real_cost 17.7%），車商收購 = 48 萬 x 0.844 ≈ 40.5 萬。尾段刻意再加速（7→10 年約 -17.0%/年，高於 5-7 年的 -13.8%/年），反映第 8 年高壓電池保固到期後保固外修復風險被市場定價 — 尾段續跌而非打平，這正是德系純電與 Lexus 的差別。同批對照組 year-10 為 15.8-19.4%，本案落在帶內。"}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"BMW 汎德 3 年不限里程原廠保固（U-CAR news/article/10646）內；純電車第一年僅需年度檢查層級的定保，無機油/濾心/火星塞支出。金額參考 faqs.tw 2026 電動車保養整理（https://faqs.tw/ev-maintenance-tw）之 BMW 純電項目與台灣原廠工資水準推估。7,000 km 完全用不到任何里程觸發的項目，屬時間驅動。"},{"y":3,"source":"仍在汎德 3 年不限里程保固期內，故障件由原廠吸收，此處只含自費耗材與工資。煞車油 2 年一換、BMW 原廠報價 NT$3,000-5,000（faqs.tw 電動車保養 2026 之 BMW 欄位）。21,000 km 尚未觸及任何里程門檻，全部是時間到期的項目。"},{"y":5,"source":"此期第 3 年保固到期，費用結構整個改變。輪胎：i4 eDrive40 的 Racing Package 配 18 吋 M 型輪圈（U-CAR 車款介紹已驗證），車重逾 2 噸、實際車主多換 Pirelli P-Zero PZ4 等級，台灣一組行情 NT$40,000-60,000（faqs.tw 給 BMW 純電輪胎 NT$40,000-80,000），取 48,000。純電煞車片壽命 faqs.tw 記為 5 年一次，但本案 35,000 km 磨耗極輕，故只編列碟盤除鏽整理而非整組更換 — 這是低里程純電車在台灣的實際樣態。"},{"y":7,"source":"無真實 7 年 i4 資料，依德系純電保固外的已知風險項編列。電子水泵是 BMW 跨動力系統的常見故障件（純電車仍有電池與馬達冷卻迴路），單顆連工資約 NT$25,000；若選配 Racing Package 的 M 跑車化電子懸吊，阻尼器單支更換成本遠高於一般避震器。煞車碟盤在此車齡因再生煞車長期少用而鏽蝕，通常整組換掉而非磨到底。工資率以台灣 BMW 原廠約 NT$2,500-3,500/小時計。"},{"y":10,"source":"外推，且刻意編列得比一般日系高。關鍵時點：8 年/16 萬公里高壓電池保固在第 8 年到期，之後電池與其周邊（OBC、冷卻）全部自費，這是德系純電十年期成本的主要來源，也是中古市場對 7-10 年德系電動車重殺價的原因（見 BMW i3 十年僅剩牌價 15-20% 的實證）。此 265,000 不含整組電池更換 — 那筆錢會超過車輛殘值，屬報廢決策。參考代理車 BMW i3 在台的實際高齡維修樣態與 faqs.tw 對 BMW 純電「德系維修費較高、進口零件貴」的定性描述。"}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車頻道 — BMW i4 車款介紹（建議售價、年式沿革、動力規格）","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/i4/7059/overall","note":"查核者以 curl 獨立抓取（HTTP 200）並比對原文。確認 2025/11 新年式 i4 eDrive40 建議售價 279 萬、M60 xDrive 333 萬，導入 SiC 逆變器；340 hp、WLTP 600 km、Racing Package 含 18 吋 M 型輪圈與 M 跑車化電子懸吊。同頁記載 2024/09 小改款 eDrive40 275 萬、M50 xDrive 329 萬。研究者提供的 NT$2,790,000 經此頁確認正確（差異 0%），未修正。"},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — BMW i4 國內上市（2022 首發價）","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/70656","note":"查核者驗證 URL 可解析（HTTP 200）。eDrive40 首發售價 255 萬、M50 310 萬。此 255 萬並經 8891 個別車輛頁（id=4331289）的 payload 交叉確認為該車原始牌價，用來建立「同一台車在台灣的原始購入價 → 今日中古開價」的真實保值率分母。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — BMW i4 eDrive40 在售車列表","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/i/i4-edrive40","note":"查核者獨立抓取並自行解析 Next.js RSC payload（self.__next_f.push），得 13 筆逐台資料：2025 年式 4,241 km 245.0 萬、2024 年式 3,500 km 243.0 萬、3,000 km 232.0 萬、5,900/5,975/5,978 km 228.0 萬、9,000 km 218.0 萬、2.3 萬 km 電洽、6.4 萬 km 188.0 萬（同一台重複刊登 4 次，顯示庫存週轉慢）。全部是車商售價（dealer retail），本表已依 車商售價 > 自售 > 車商收購 的鏈條分別下修，未直接照抄。重要更正：此列表中並無研究者宣稱的「2022 年式 183.8 萬 / 188.8 萬」，188.0 萬的車實為 2024 年式 6.4 萬 km。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — 2022 年式 i4 eDrive40 個別車輛（已售出，全批唯一成交訊號）","url":"https://m.8891.com.tw/auto?id=4331289","note":"查核者獨立抓取並解析 payload，確認 makeYear 2022、modelEnName eDrive40、里程 2.59 萬 km、開價 183.0 萬、狀態「已售出」、原始牌價 255.0 萬 → 4 年車車商開價保值率 71.8%。這是全批樣本中唯一帶成交訊號者，也是本表 3 年檢查點的主錨點。注意「已售出」僅證明下架，不等於成交價即為開價 183.0 萬，真實成交通常再低一截。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — BMW i4 M50 在售車列表（姊妹車 3-4 年期對照）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/i/i4-m50","note":"查核者獨立抓取並解析，得 11 筆去重資料：2022 年式 3-3.6 萬 km 開價 189.0-191.0 萬、2023 年式 1 萬 km 228.0 萬、2.2 萬 km 222.0 萬、3 萬 km 213.8 萬、2024 年式 2.6 萬 km 238.8 萬、8,000-8,750 km 240.0 萬（原牌價 310 萬）。重要更正：研究者宣稱 M50 的 4 年保值率為 71.6-73.5%，實為把 2023 年式（3 年車）誤當 4 年車；真正的 2022 年式（4 年車）M50 開價 189-191 萬對 310 萬僅 61.0-61.6%，遠低於 eDrive40 同齡的 71.8%。姊妹車證據其實是反駁而非支持原研究者的偏高曲線，本表已據此下修 3 年檢查點。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — BMW i3 在售車列表（德系純電 10 年保值率代理）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/i/i3","note":"查核者獨立抓取並解析，得 4 筆（3 台去重）：2017 年式 REX 14 萬 km 52.0 萬、2016 年式 REX 8.3 萬 km 59.8 萬、2016 年式 REX 9 萬 km 45.8 萬。i4 在台僅 4 年車齡，7 年與 10 年檢查點是用 i3 這台前代德系純電的實際行情換算成保值率再套回 i4 的 real_cost，已在對應 checkpoint 的 source 內明說並標 confidence low。註：研究者另引的「2015 年式 11 萬 km 45.8 萬」未出現在查核者當日抓取的結果中。"},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — BMW i3/i8 在台上市建議售價（2014/06）","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/23587","note":"查核者驗證 URL 可解析（HTTP 200；研究者所填的 /article/23587 會 301 到此正規路徑，已修正為最終網址）。i3 純電版建議售價 239 萬、REX 增程版 299 萬。這是把 i3 今日中古價換算成保值率所需的分母。"},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 汎德宣佈 BMW 與 MINI 新車三年不限里程保固","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/10646","note":"查核者驗證 URL 可解析（HTTP 200）。台灣總代理汎德的原廠保固為 3 年不限里程。這是保養分期的分界線：0-3 年在保固內、第 3 年後費用跳升。注意這是保固不是免費保養，BSI 保養套餐在台灣需另購。"},{"name":"faqs.tw — 電動車保養 2026（Tesla / BMW / Luxgen 保養費對照）","url":"https://faqs.tw/ev-maintenance-tw","note":"查核者驗證 URL 可解析（HTTP 200）。提供 BMW 純電的逐項行情：冷卻液 5 年/8 萬 km NT$8,000-15,000、煞車油 2-3 年 NT$3,000-5,000、輪胎 4-6 萬 km NT$40,000-80,000、煞車片 5 年 NT$15,000-25,000；並給 BMW i4 五年保養總額 NT$73,000-140,000（年 15,000 km）。屬彙整型次級來源（非原廠價目表），僅用來交叉驗證量級，本表五年累計 132,000 落在其區間內。"},{"name":"修車趣 — 寶馬 BMW i4 規格與稅費","url":"https://car.codecity.com.tw/m/bmw-i4","note":"查核者驗證 URL 可解析（HTTP 200）。引用經濟部能源署車型耗能證明：i4 能效 5.9 公里/度，燃料別純電（確認 bev 分類無誤）。並載明純電車使用牌照稅免徵至民國 119 年（2030）12/31 — 本表依設計未計入稅金，僅作分類佐證。"}]},"bmw-i5-edrive40-m-sport":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, so every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7000/21000/35000/49000/70000) — roughly half the Taiwan average. At this mileage BMW's condition-based service is effectively TIME-driven, not distance-driven: the annual inspection, brake fluid (2-yr), coolant and cabin filters all come due on the calendar long before any km threshold, and tires age out (5-6 years) rather than wear out. Low mileage also means resale sits at the TOP of the observed listing band, which is how the value_checkpoints were positioned. EXCLUDED by design: 牌照稅, 燃料費, insurance, and electricity/charging. (Taiwan has granted BEVs a 使用牌照稅 exemption that has been extended in multi-year increments; the current end date was NOT verifiable from any page reachable in this environment, so no expiry date is asserted here — the tax is excluded by design either way.) ALSO EXCLUDED and deliberately not in maintenance: home wallbox installation — a BMW Wallbox plus 台電 電力申請 and conduit/wiring runs about NT$40,000-80,000 in TW and is a one-off ownership setup cost, not maintenance. High-voltage battery REPLACEMENT is likewise not budgeted in maintenance; at BMW TW that is a NT$800,000+ event, and rather than model it as a cost it is reflected as the repair-risk discount that keeps the year 7-10 resale falling.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"high","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Directly observed and INDEPENDENTLY RE-VERIFIED by this audit. The 8891 BMW listing payload (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/i5, fetched 2026-08-12) carries a model facet reading exactly {\"count\":27,\"maxPrice\":\"253.0萬\",\"minPrice\":\"209.8萬\",\"name\":\"i5 eDrive40\"} — 27 live listings of this exact trim at NT$2,098,000-2,530,000. This audit also extracted a per-listing record the original research could not retrieve: 'BMW i5 2024款 eDrive40 M Sport 純電', 2024年, 1.4萬公里, 247.0萬, 新北市, 實體車行 — a genuine low-mileage comparable near the top of the band, which supports anchoring a low-mileage car high rather than mid-band. Because this buyer does 7,000 km/year, the anchor is the TOP of the band, NT$2,530,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED (the dealer-retail trap): every 8891 figure is 車商售價, dealer RETAIL asking, not what an owner receives. NT$2,530,000 was cut 11.5% to a private-sale NT$2,240,000, then a further 13.0% to NT$1,950,000 for dealer trade-in. Implies a 29% loss in year one against real_cost — steep and correct for a German BEV, not a Toyota-like number."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Near-observed, extrapolated about half a year past the oldest real i5. The bottom of the verified 8891 i5 eDrive40 band, NT$2,098,000, is a 2024款 car at roughly 2-2.5 years. A 3-year car sits below that, helped back up by a 21,000 km odometer: dealer retail equivalent about NT$1,920,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: 11.5% off dealer retail gives the private-sale NT$1,700,000; a further 12.9% gives dealer trade-in NT$1,480,000. Corroborated by sibling German BEVs verified in the same payload by this audit: iX xDrive40 {\"count\":4,\"minPrice\":\"195.5萬\",\"maxPrice\":\"213.0萬\"} at about 3.5 years against a ~338萬 list = 58-63% dealer-retail retention, which brackets the ~61% implied here; i4 eDrive40 {\"count\":13,\"minPrice\":\"188.0萬\",\"maxPrice\":\"245.0萬\"}. Years 1-3 remain the steepest stretch, as expected."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no 5-year-old i5 exists anywhere; TW registrations start at 2024款. LOWERED BY THIS AUDIT from the researcher's NT$1,250,000. Method, re-derived from real listings this audit extracted from https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series (fetched 2026-08-12): the predecessor G30 5 Series at 5 years. Real rows include 2022 530i M Sport 9.51萬公里 154.9萬 (4 yr, ~46% of its ~338萬 list) and 2020 520i白金旗艦版 7萬公里 109.0萬 (6 yr, ~41% of its ~268萬 list), placing a 5-year 530i-class G30 at roughly 43% of list at dealer retail with ~80,000 km on it. Applying that ratio to real_cost, then a BEV haircut (out of the 3-year factory warranty, battery-anxiety discounting an ICE car does not carry), then a low-mileage uplift for 35,000 km against ~80,000 km comparables, gives dealer retail about NT$1,355,000 (43% of real_cost). The researcher had claimed a 34-41% ratio and then produced NT$1,410,000, which is ABOVE their own stated band rather than below it after a stated haircut — an internal contradiction this audit corrected. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: 11.5% off dealer retail gives private-sale NT$1,200,000; a further 13.3% gives trade-in NT$1,040,000."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no 7-year-old i5 exists. LOWERED BY THIS AUDIT from the researcher's NT$940,000. Method changed: the researcher interpolated off the BMW i3, a 22-33 kWh carbon-fibre city car that is a poor structural match for a 5-metre executive sedan. This audit uses the same-class predecessor instead, the G30 5 Series, from rows extracted at https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series: 2019 520i 8.11萬公里 83.9萬 and 2019 520i 11.9萬公里 88.9萬 (7 yr, ~31-33% of the 520i's ~268萬 list), and 2018 530i xDrive 12.4萬公里 110.8萬 (8 yr, ~33% of its ~338萬 list). That places a 7-year German executive sedan at ~33-35% of list at dealer retail on ~100,000 km. Applying that ratio to real_cost with a BEV haircut and a low-mileage uplift for 49,000 km gives dealer retail about NT$1,020,000 (32.3% of real_cost). ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: 11.5% off gives private-sale NT$905,000; a further 14.4% gives trade-in NT$775,000. The car is out of the 3-year vehicle warranty and the 8yr/160,000 km HV battery warranty is nearly up, which is why the tail keeps falling instead of flattening the way a Lexus would."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no 10-year-old i5 exists. LOWERED BY THIS AUDIT from the researcher's NT$650,000, which was the clearest substantive error in the record: it had the BEV RETAINING MORE at 10 years than its own ICE predecessor, after an explicit undisclosed-magnitude upward nudge, which contradicts the German-BEV thesis the same record argues. Two predecessors were used and cross-checked. (a) ICE, same class: from https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series this audit extracted 2016 520i 9.98萬公里 46.9萬 and 2016 520i 8.3萬公里 43.0萬 — a 10-year F10 5 Series at ~17-18% of its ~258萬 list at dealer retail. (b) BEV, wrong class but right powertrain: the 8891 BMW payload facet {\"count\":4,\"minPrice\":\"45.8萬\",\"maxPrice\":\"59.8萬\",\"name\":\"i3\"} on 2014-2017 cars = ~19-25% of the i3's ~239萬 original list at 9-12 years. The two bracket 10-year retention at 17-25% of list. This record takes 20% of real_cost = about NT$630,000 dealer retail: above the ICE sedan floor because 70,000 km is genuinely low and an 81 kWh pack is not range-obsolete the way a 22 kWh i3 is, but below the i3's ratio because a NT$800,000+ HV battery replacement risk on a 329萬 car is a far larger absolute threat than on a 239萬 one. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: 11.5% off gives private-sale NT$560,000; a further 15.2% gives trade-in NT$475,000. That is 17.7% of real_cost with no flattening — by now the HV battery warranty has expired and the market prices replacement risk into every offer. CAVEAT CARRIED FORWARD: the i3's original TW list price (~239萬) could NOT be verified from any page reachable in this environment, so limb (b) rests on unverified knowledge; limb (a) is fully sourced, which is why the two are used together rather than either alone."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Estimate. RAISED by this audit from the researcher's NT$8,000. Under the assumed bundled 3-year service package the scheduled labour is covered, so this period is mostly genuine consumables — but the package is unverified (bmw.com.tw independently confirmed unreachable), and NT$8,000 for a first year on a 329萬 German car is optimistic even with a package, since alignment, filters, wipers and 20-inch wheel/tire attention are usually chargeable. No BEV has an oil service, which is why year 1 still sits far below a combustion 5 Series. If no package is bundled at all, add roughly NT$10,000. Not verifiable against an official BMW TW service-price table (site unreachable) or Mobile01 owner receipts (HTTP 403)."},{"y":3,"source":"Estimate. RAISED by this audit from the researcher's NT$30,000, for the same reason as year 1 plus one substantive addition: the researcher deferred the 12V AGM battery to year 5, but a BEV that sits and does short low-mileage trips typically needs its first 12V inside 3-4 years, and BMW's registered AGM plus coding is not a cheap item in TW. Still inside the 3-year factory warranty and the assumed service package, so this covers consumables, the 2-year brake fluid and the 12V only. Tires deliberately NOT included: at 21,000 km and 3 years the original 245/40 R20 and 275/35 R20 set has neither worn nor aged out. Not verifiable against an official BMW TW table (site unreachable) or Mobile01 owner receipts (HTTP 403)."},{"y":5,"source":"Estimate, and the first period at full unsubsidised cost — the 3-year warranty and the assumed service package have both expired. Unchanged from the researcher's figure; this audit checked it and found it sound. Tire pricing rests on the staggered 20-inch fitment verified on the U-CAR spec table (https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/i5/6967/spec: 輪胎尺寸 245/40 R20, 後輪尺寸 275/35 R20) at TW retail for EV-rated performance rubber, on a 2,120 kg car. The 12V AGM was moved OUT of this period into year 3, offset by adding air-con service and balance work, leaving the total unchanged. The step up from NT$38,000 to NT$145,000 is the warranty cliff plus the first tire set, not a modelling artefact. Not verifiable against an official BMW TW table (unreachable) or Mobile01 receipts (HTTP 403)."},{"y":7,"source":"Estimate. Unchanged in total from the researcher's figure; this audit checked it and found it sound, but CORRECTED THE SOURCING of its largest line. Fully out of the vehicle warranty; only the 8yr/160,000 km HV battery cover is still (barely) running. The 2,120 kg kerb weight and the 雙A臂/多連桿 suspension layout are verified on the U-CAR spec table; the rear AIR suspension is not, and the record no longer claims it is. The provision stands regardless of spring medium — on a 2,120 kg car, either an air unit or a set of heavy-duty conventional dampers and springs at a BMW dealer lands in the same range. This is the period where the market starts pricing repair risk, which is also why the year-7 resale keeps falling. Not verifiable against an official BMW TW table (unreachable) or Mobile01 receipts (HTTP 403)."},{"y":10,"source":"Estimate covering three years fully out of warranty; the HV battery cover also lapses at year 8 inside this window. Unchanged from the researcher's figure; this audit checked it and found it sound for a German BEV. Item list built from the BEV-specific wear pattern (no oil, plugs or DPF, but electric coolant pump, thermal valve block, onboard charger and charge-port actuator all become live) plus the 20-inch staggered tires verified at https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/i5/6967/spec. The rear-suspension line carries the same fitment caveat as year 7 — it is a provision, not a verified air-spring replacement. HV battery replacement is deliberately EXCLUDED here and modelled as resale risk instead. Ten-year maintenance total is NT$825,000 (12,000 + 38,000 + 145,000 + 195,000 + 435,000, verified) — far above any Japanese equivalent, and correctly below what a combustion 5 Series would cost over the same period. Not verifiable against an official BMW TW table (unreachable) or Mobile01 receipts (HTTP 403)."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車頻道 — BMW i5 車款介紹","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/i5/6967/overall","note":"PRIMARY price verification, re-fetched and re-read by this audit on 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200). Header reads 2 車型 / 329 - 485 萬; the model table lists eDrive40 M Sport 329萬 純電動 後輪驅動 and M60 xDrive 485萬 純電動 四輪驅動. Body text confirms the July 2025 TW model-year update (SiC inverters, eDrive40 WLTP 582 -> 627 km) shipped with 售價配備不變, 轎車 eDrive40 為 329 萬、M60 為 485 萬, and that the i5 is still a 400V car, not Neue Klasse 800V. NT$3,290,000 CONFIRMED at 0% deviation."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車頻道 — BMW i5 規格表","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/i5/6967/spec","note":"Spec confirmation, re-fetched by this audit 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200). Verified fields: 動力系統 電動, 能源 電能, 後置馬達 1 具 永磁同步馬達, 最大綜效馬力 340 hp, 最大綜效扭力 43.9 kgm, 傳動方式 後輪驅動, 煞車系統 四輪碟煞, DC充電最大功率 205kW, DC充電規格 CCS1, AC充電規格 J1772, 車重 2120 kg, 輪胎尺寸 245/40 R20, 後輪尺寸 275/35 R20, 前輪懸吊 雙A臂, 後輪懸吊 多連桿, 經銷/代理 汎德汽車股份有限公司, 產地 德國. The entire 引擎系統 block is empty — pure BEV, hence 'bev'. IMPORTANT NEGATIVE FINDING: this table contains NO air-suspension entry; the original record's claim that standard rear air suspension was 'confirmed on the U-CAR spec table' is not supported and has been corrected. Battery fields read 83.9kwh total / 81.2kwh usable, which conflicts with U-CAR's own article text (81.6 kWh usable, total unpublished)."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — BMW 全廠牌在售清單（含 i 系列車型級距行情）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/i5","note":"PRIMARY used-value source, re-fetched and re-parsed by this audit 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200). SOURCING CORRECTION: this URL does NOT return an i5-filtered result page — it returns the whole BMW used inventory (共找到 4523 輛車). The per-model bands live in the page's embedded model-facet JSON, which is where the original figures came from; they are real, not invented, and every one reproduced exactly: i5 eDrive40 count 27, 209.8-253.0萬; i5 M60 xDrive count 7, 318.0-398.0萬; i4 eDrive40 count 13, 188.0-245.0萬; i3 count 4, 45.8-59.8萬; iX xDrive40 count 4, 195.5-213.0萬. This audit additionally extracted a per-listing row the original research reported it could not obtain: BMW i5 2024款 eDrive40 M Sport 純電, 2024年, 1.4萬公里, 247.0萬, 新北市, 實體車行. Attempts to reach a genuinely i5-filtered listing page (/bmw-i5, /bmw/i5-edrive40, ?kind=18376, /list-bmw-i5.html) all fall back to this same brand page. ALL prices here are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking); every private_sale_price in this record is 11.5% below them and every dealer_tradein_price a further 12.9-15.2% below that."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — BMW 5-Series 級距行情與在售車列","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series","note":"Predecessor-generation reference, re-fetched and re-parsed by this audit 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200). Used far more heavily here than in the original record: this audit extracted actual per-listing rows and rebuilt the year-5, year-7 and year-10 extrapolations on them instead of on the i3. Rows used: 2022 530i M Sport 9.51萬公里 154.9萬; 2020 520i白金旗艦版 7萬公里 109.0萬; 2019 520i 8.11萬公里 83.9萬; 2019 520i 11.9萬公里 88.9萬; 2018 530i xDrive 12.4萬公里 110.8萬; 2018 520i 11.9萬公里 79.8萬; 2016 520i 9.98萬公里 46.9萬; 2016 520i 8.3萬公里 43.0萬. These place a German executive sedan at roughly 43% of list at 5 years, 33-35% at 7-8 years and 17-18% at 10 years, all at dealer retail on ~80,000-120,000 km."},{"name":"BMW Taiwan official site — ATTEMPTED, NOT REACHABLE (independently re-confirmed)","url":"https://www.bmw.com.tw/","note":"HONESTY NOTE, not a source. This audit independently re-tested the original researcher's claim and UPHELD it: curl returns exit status 000 (connection failure, no HTTP response) on both https://www.bmw.com.tw/zh/index.html and the BMW Service Inclusive path. Mobile01 owner-receipt threads return HTTP 403. Consequently NO maintenance figure in this record comes from an official BMW TW service-price table or a real owner receipt — all five maintenance checkpoints are marked 'low' confidence for exactly that reason, and the assumed bundled service package behind years 0-3 is flagged as unverified in plan_notes and partially compensated for by raising those two periods."}]},"bmw-ix-xdrive45-excellence":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year; every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000), roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/yr. At this mileage BMW's condition-based service is effectively TIME-driven (annual), not distance-driven, and 255/50 R21 tyres age out on rubber hardening (~5-6 years) long before they wear out. Low-mileage cars sell above the mileage-blind average, so every value figure is quoted against the low-mileage end of the observed listing bands and carries a modest premium. EXCLUDED BY DESIGN: vehicle licence tax and fuel tax (BEVs are currently exempt in TW anyway), insurance, and electricity/charging. ALSO EXCLUDED: home AC charger purchase and installation (typically NT$40,000-120,000 in TW depending on whether the building's electrical riser needs upgrading and whether a separate meter is required) - that is a one-off ownership/setup cost, not maintenance, so it appears in neither purchase nor maintenance. Public DC fast-charging fees are likewise excluded. High-voltage battery REPLACEMENT is also not budgeted as maintenance; at BMW TW that would exceed the car's residual value from year 7 onward, so it is modelled as the repair-risk discount that keeps the year 7-10 resale falling rather than as a line item. Kerb weight 2,450 kg and 255/50 R21 tyres on all four corners are the two verified facts that drive consumable cost hardest.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"LOWERED by this audit from the researcher's NT$2,500,000, and confidence downgraded from 'high' to 'medium'. NEW PRIMARY EVIDENCE the researcher missed: 8891 IS reachable by curl (the researcher reported it unscrapeable and fell back on BMW's certified channel alone). The BMW inventory page https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/ix, fetched 2026-08-12 HTTP 200, embeds a model-facet payload reading exactly {\"count\":11,\"maxPrice\":\"322.0萬\",\"minPrice\":\"290.0萬\",\"name\":\"iX xDrive45\"} - ELEVEN live listings of this exact facelift model, which can only be 0-1.1 years old because the LCI launched 2025-07-02. That band brackets the researcher's certified-channel figures (295-322萬) closely, so their BPS numbers look real even though bps.bmw.com.tw returns only a 7 KB SPA shell to curl and could NOT be independently verified here - hence the downgrade to 'medium'. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN, stated explicitly: 8891 prices are 車商售價, dealer RETAIL asking, the top of the ladder. TRIM ADJUSTMENT: the researcher established that essentially all used xDrive45s are M Sport (368萬 list), so the 290萬 floor is most likely an M Sport, not an Excellence; scaling by list ratio (338/368) puts an Excellence's dealer-retail equivalent at about 266萬. Cutting 12% to 自售價 gives about 234萬. Blending that against the alternative reading (290萬 already being an Excellence, which would give about 255萬 private) lands at 2,350,000, with a low-mileage premium included since 7,000 km undercuts even these near-new cars. Trade-in a further 14% below. This is 72.6% of real_cost - a genuine German-BEV first year, not the 77% the researcher's figure implied."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"RAISED by this audit from the researcher's NT$1,750,000. The researcher built this off i4/i7 ratios; this audit instead brackets it between two directly observed points on the iX nameplate itself, both from the 8891 facet payload at https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/ix (2026-08-12): the 1.1-year facelift xDrive45 band (11 cars, 290-322萬 dealer retail) above, and the pre-facelift iX band below. The pre-facelift anchor is now precise because this audit RECOVERED THE PREDECESSOR'S ACTUAL LIST PRICE, which the researcher never established: U-CAR's iX event log (https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/ix/6960/event) records the 2021-12-30 TW launch headline '320萬與390萬、正式售價向上調整4萬' - iX xDrive40 旗艦版 NT$3,200,000 and xDrive50 旗艦版 NT$3,900,000. Against those real list prices the oldest pre-facelift cars now ask 195.5萬 (xDrive40, 61.1% of 320萬), 229.6萬 (xDrive50, 58.9% of 390萬) and 388.8萬 (M60, 62.7% of its 620萬 launch price, also from the event log) - three independent variants all bottoming at 59-63% of list at dealer retail around 4-4.5 years. Interpolating a 3-year point between the 1.1-year band and that 4.25-year floor gives roughly 66% of list at dealer retail, about 223萬; cutting 12.5% to private gives 1,950,000. Trade-in a further 13.8% below. Years 1-3 still shed NT$1,285,000, i.e. 39.7% of real_cost - front-loaded, as a German BEV must be."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"RAISED SUBSTANTIALLY by this audit from the researcher's NT$1,150,000 - the single largest correction in the record. The researcher anchored this on a 2022 Audi e-tron 55 Sportback (149.8萬 / 58,000 km, https://www.sum.com.tw/carinfo-777056.php - this audit re-fetched it and confirmed the listing is genuine) at ~38.5% of its list. That comparator is real but badly chosen: the e-tron 55 is a 2019-era, poor-efficiency German BEV that suffered heavy TW price cuts, and it is a weaker residual performer than the iX. The correct comparator is the iX's OWN predecessor, which the researcher wrongly reported as absent from the used market. It is not absent: the 8891 facet payload (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/ix, 2026-08-12) shows iX xDrive40 count 4 at 195.5-213.0萬 and iX xDrive50 count 10 at 229.6-298.8萬. Against the verified launch prices of 320萬 and 390萬 (U-CAR event log, 2021-12-30), the oldest of these - roughly 4-4.5 years old, since TW deliveries began end-2021 - hold 59-63% of list at DEALER RETAIL, i.e. about 52-55% at private sale after a 12-15% cut. Applying that to this car's 338萬 list puts a 4.25-year private sale near 179萬. Extending 0.75 years further, and applying a deliberate forward-looking penalty because BMW's Neue Klasse 800V replacement for the iX will have arrived well before 2031 and will date this 400V car the same way the 425 km xDrive40 is dated today, gives 45.6% of list = 1,540,000 private. Trade-in 15% below. Retained caveat: these are asking prices on thin inventory and may sit above transaction, which is why this is 'medium' not 'high'."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, not observed - stated plainly. The current iX generation reached Taiwan only at the end of 2021 (confirmed on U-CAR's model history, https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/ix/6960/history: '臺灣市場則是在 2021 年底先行導入 xDrive40 與 xDrive50 雙車型'), so no genuine 7-year data for this nameplate can exist. RAISED by this audit from the researcher's NT$750,000, because their whole mid-curve was anchored too low (see the year-5 note); a 7-year figure has to descend from a corrected year-5, not from an Audi e-tron ratio. Method: take real 7-8 year Taiwanese listings of analogues, express each as a retention ratio of ITS OWN original list, then apply to this car. Ratios used, all re-fetched and confirmed genuine by this audit on 2026-08-12: 2018 Tesla Model X, 128.0萬 at 109,470 km (https://www.sum.com.tw/carinfo-773362.php) against a ~NT$4,290,000 list = ~30% dealer asking at eight years, the nearest large-luxury-BEV read available; BMW X5 G05 2019 examples on SUM at 96.8-132.8萬 on 102,000-175,000 km against a ~NT$4,190,000 list = 23-32% dealer asking at seven years. Those comparables carry two to three times this buyer's mileage, so a low-mileage premium applies: 49,000 km on a 7-year car is exceptional. Taking ~35% of list as dealer asking (~118萬) and cutting 11% to private gives 1,050,000, which is 32.5% of real_cost - consistent with the German-BEV peer band and continuing to fall rather than flatten. Trade-in 15% below. The 8-year/160,000 km high-voltage battery warranty is still live at year seven, which supports the price; the 3-year bumper-to-bumper warranty expired long ago, which does not."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, not observed - stated plainly. RAISED by this audit from the researcher's NT$400,000 to keep the tail consistent with the corrected mid-curve, though it remains a hard fall with no flattening. Same ratio method against real Taiwanese listings re-fetched and confirmed genuine by this audit on 2026-08-12: BMW 7 Series 2016 (10 years) at 86.8萬 / 94,851 km (https://www.sum.com.tw/carinfo-754869.php) against a ~NT$6,000,000 list = ~14% dealer asking; BMW X5 F15 2015 (11 years) at a genuinely low-mileage 59.6萬 / 56,741 km (https://www.sum.com.tw/carinfo-779242.php) against a ~NT$3,600,000 list = ~17% dealer asking. This is the German tail that keeps falling instead of flattening the way a Lexus does, and for a BEV it is worse, not better: by year ten the 8-year/160,000 km high-voltage battery warranty has EXPIRED, and the Taiwan market discounts a 100.6 kWh pack of unknown health severely because replacement costs a large multiple of the car's value. Taking ~19% of list as dealer asking (~64萬), cutting 12% to private and allowing a premium for a genuinely low 70,000 km gives 560,000, i.e. 17.3% of real_cost. Cross-check: the sibling BMW i5 record independently lands on 560,000 (17.7% of its real_cost) at year ten from the same brand and channel, which is a reassuring calibration for a BMW BEV. Trade-in is set at only 79% of private because dealers in Taiwan barely want a decade-old German BEV on the lot at any price - many simply decline it. CAVEAT: the comparators' original list prices were not re-verified against a live source, and a 10% error in one moves this figure by roughly the same 10%."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Estimate, RAISED by this audit from the researcher's NT$6,000 and downgraded to 'low' confidence. The researcher's figure was costed against a claimed 好車網 HOT service-labour table that does not exist at the cited URL (see plan_notes), so it has no sourcing behind it. NT$6,000 for a first year on a 338萬 German SUV is optimistic even under warranty, since alignment, balancing, wipers and 21-inch wheel/tyre attention are normally chargeable at a main dealer. Aligned with the sibling BMW i5 record's NT$12,000 first year, adjusted for this car's larger wheels. A BEV at 7,000 km genuinely needs almost nothing beyond an inspection and consumables, which is why this still sits far below a combustion X5. NOT verifiable against an official BMW TW service-price table (www.bmw.com.tw unreachable, independently confirmed) or Mobile01 owner receipts (HTTP 403)."},{"y":3,"source":"Estimate, RAISED by this audit from the researcher's NT$24,000 and downgraded to 'low'. Same sourcing defect as year 1 - the cited labour table does not exist at that URL. Two substantive changes: the figure is aligned with the sibling BMW i5 record's NT$38,000, and the first 12V AGM battery is pulled INTO this window rather than deferred to year 5, because a BEV doing short low-mileage trips typically needs its first 12V inside 3-4 years and BMW's registered AGM plus coding is not cheap in TW. Brake fluid is hygroscopic, so its 2-year interval is calendar-based and is NOT deferred by low mileage - this is the one item this buyer cannot skip. NOT verifiable against an official BMW TW table (site unreachable) or owner receipts (Mobile01 HTTP 403)."},{"y":5,"source":"Estimate, raised modestly by this audit from NT$145,000 and downgraded to 'low' for the sourcing reason in plan_notes. Tyre size 255/50 R21 on BOTH axles is confirmed for this exact trim on U-CAR's spec table (https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/ix/6960/spec); premium EV-rated 21-inch rubber in Taiwan runs roughly NT$18,000-24,000 per corner fitted on a 2,450 kg car, so ~82,000 for four is realistic and is the dominant line in this window. At 35,000 km the tread is nowhere near worn - the tyres are replaced because five-year-old rubber on a heavy SUV has hardened, which is exactly the low-mileage trap. The assumed 3-year warranty has expired, so this is the first period carrying owner-paid repair risk, and the researcher's NT$14,000 allowance for that was thin for a German BEV. NOT verifiable against an official BMW TW table (unreachable) or owner receipts (HTTP 403)."},{"y":7,"source":"Extrapolated from German out-of-warranty norms rather than any quote, and labelled as such. Raised by this audit from NT$155,000 to stay consistent with the sibling BMW i5's NT$195,000 at this age, scaled for this car's greater weight but with no tyre purchase in the window. The brake line is the counter-intuitive one and is deliberate: regenerative braking means the pads on a 49,000 km iX are barely touched, but Taiwan's humidity corrodes lightly-used discs so they are replaced on condition, not on thickness - a well-known low-mileage EV outcome, and BMW's discs on a 2,450 kg SUV are large and priced accordingly. The risk allowance covers BEV-specific items that actually fail on this platform - auxiliary electric coolant pumps, charging hardware, suspension bushings - rather than combustion items this car does not have. No tyres here; the year-5 set is still serviceable and the next set falls in the 7-10 window. NOT verifiable against an official BMW TW table (unreachable) or owner receipts (HTTP 403)."},{"y":10,"source":"Extrapolated from German luxury out-of-warranty cost norms - explicitly not observed, since this model cannot be ten years old. Raised by this audit from NT$420,000 to NT$480,000 so that the ten-year total (12,000 + 38,000 + 165,000 + 185,000 + 480,000 = NT$880,000, arithmetic verified) sits ABOVE the sibling BMW i5's NT$825,000, as a 330 kg heavier car on larger 21-inch tyres must. This is the period the Taiwanese used market is pricing when it marks these cars into the teens as a percentage of list: buyers are discounting exactly this repair bill. The ten-year total is roughly three and a half times what a Toyota RAV4 absorbs over the same decade at the same mileage - the correct relationship for a German luxury BEV SUV, driven by dealer labour rates, 21-inch tyres, big brakes and suspension/electronics risk rather than by routine servicing. The 8-year/160,000 km high-voltage battery warranty has expired by this window, so pack-adjacent thermal-management failures land on the owner; a full pack replacement is deliberately NOT included because it would exceed the car's entire residual value and an owner facing that quote would scrap or sell instead - that risk is priced into the year-10 resale figure instead. NOT verifiable against an official BMW TW table (unreachable) or owner receipts (HTTP 403)."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - BMW iX 車款介紹 (official TW list prices and launch date)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/ix/6960/overall","note":"PRIMARY price verification, re-fetched by this audit 2026-08-12 by curl (HTTP 200). Header reads '3 車型 / 338 - 488 萬'; the model table lists xDrive45 Excellence 338萬, xDrive45 M Sport 368萬, xDrive60 M Sport 488萬. Body text confirms 總代理汎德 launched the facelift iX on 2025-07-02 with the M Sport trims NT$10,000 below pre-sale pricing. Also gives the 100.6 kWh nominal / 96 kWh usable pack, 408 ps and 175 kW DC charging. NT$3,380,000 CONFIRMED at 0% deviation."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - BMW iX 規格表 (spec table)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/ix/6960/spec","note":"Spec confirmation, re-fetched by this audit 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200), read in the xDrive45 Excellence column specifically. Verified: 車重 2450 kg, 輪胎尺寸 255/50 R21 AND 後輪尺寸 255/50 R21, 電池總容量 100.6kwh / 可用電池容量 96kwh, 408 ps, 71.4 kgm, 0-100 in 5.1 s, DC 175kW / CCS1, 純電行程 658 公里 (WLTC), 前輪懸吊 鋁合金雙A臂, 後輪懸吊 多連桿, 四輪碟煞, 經銷/代理 汎德汽車股份有限公司, 產地 德國. The entire 引擎系統 block is empty - pure BEV, hence 'bev'. NEGATIVE FINDING: there is NO air-suspension field on this table, so air springs are neither confirmed nor denied for the Excellence trim."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - BMW iX 事件簿 (TW launch-price event log)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/ix/6960/event","note":"THE DECISIVE SOURCE ADDED BY THIS AUDIT - the researcher never established the predecessor's list price, which is what made their mid-curve wrong. Fetched 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200). The 2021-12-30 entry reads '320萬與390萬、正式售價向上調整4萬，BMW iX純電休旅國內上市 ... 國內首波帶來xDrive40旗艦版、xDrive50旗艦版雙車型，不過正式售價較預售上調4萬，分別來到320萬、390萬'. So iX xDrive40 = NT$3,200,000 and xDrive50 = NT$3,900,000 at TW launch, and the 2022-08-30 entry gives iX M60 = NT$6,200,000. These three list prices convert the 8891 pre-facelift asking prices into real retention ratios."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 在售清單與車型級距行情 (model-facet payload)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/ix","note":"PRIMARY used-value source, ADDED BY THIS AUDIT. The researcher reported 8891 unscrapeable; it is not - plain curl with a desktop UA returns HTTP 200 and ~305 KB. The URL does not return an iX-filtered page (it returns the whole BMW inventory), but the embedded model-facet JSON carries per-model bands, reproduced verbatim 2026-08-12: iX xDrive45 count 11, 290.0-322.0萬; iX xDrive40 count 4, 195.5-213.0萬; iX xDrive50 count 10, 229.6-298.8萬; iX M60 count 2, 388.8-448.0萬. That is 27 iX listings in total, directly refuting the researcher's claim that the TW used market carries essentially none. All are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking); every private_sale_price in this record is 11-13% below the derived asking figure and every dealer_tradein_price a further 13-15% below that."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - BMW iX 車系沿革 (model history)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/ix/6960/history","note":"Re-verified by this audit 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200). Confirms '臺灣市場則是在 2021 年底先行導入 xDrive40 與 xDrive50 雙車型' and that the pre-facelift xDrive40 used a 76.6 kWh pack (71 kWh usable), 326 hp and only 425 km of range - which is why the current 100.6 kWh / 658 km car should not be assumed to decay faster than its predecessor. Establishes that no genuine 7- or 10-year data for this nameplate can exist, so those two checkpoints are extrapolated."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - 2022 Audi e-tron 55 Sportback, 149.8萬","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carinfo-777056.php","note":"Re-fetched by this audit 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200); the listing is GENUINE and the page title confirms 'AUDI e-tron Sportback 2022年 優惠價 149.8萬 寶瑪汽車 臺中市'. Retained as a corroborating data point but DEMOTED from the researcher's primary year-5 anchor: the e-tron 55 is a 2019-era, poor-efficiency German BEV that took heavy TW price cuts, so its ~38.5% retention understates the iX. The iX's own predecessor is now used instead."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - 2022 Audi e-tron GT, 228.8萬 / 50,116 km","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carinfo-780646.php","note":"Re-fetched by this audit 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200); GENUINE - title confirms 'AUDI E-TRON GT 2022年 優惠價 228.8萬 億昇汽車 臺中市', and the page notes 僅跑5萬公里, 選配50萬. Secondary corroboration for German BEV retention at four years."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - 2018 Tesla Model X, 128.0萬 / 109,470 km","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carinfo-773362.php","note":"Re-fetched by this audit 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200); GENUINE - title confirms 'TESLA MODEL X 2018年 優惠價 128.0萬 和悅汽車 高雄市'. Nearest available large-luxury-BEV read at eight years old in Taiwan: ~30% of its ~NT$4,290,000 list at dealer asking, at high mileage. Ratio input for the 7-year extrapolation."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - 2016 BMW 7 Series, 86.8萬 / 94,851 km","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carinfo-754869.php","note":"Re-fetched by this audit 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200); GENUINE - title confirms 'BMW 7 SERIES SEDAN 2016年 優惠價 86.8萬 三立國際 臺南市'. A 10-year German luxury flagship at ~14% of list at dealer asking. Ratio input for the 10-year checkpoint."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - 2015 BMW X5 F15, 59.6萬 / 56,741 km (low mileage)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carinfo-779242.php","note":"Re-fetched by this audit 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200); GENUINE - title confirms 'BMW X5 F15 2015年 優惠價 59.6萬 凱立車業 臺南市'. A genuinely LOW-mileage 11-year-old BMW SUV, quoted because this buyer's car will also be low-mileage at the tail. Still only ~17% of its ~NT$3,600,000 list at dealer asking - evidence that low mileage softens but does not rescue the German 10-year tail."},{"name":"BMW Premium Selection 原廠認證中古車 - PARTIALLY VERIFIABLE","url":"https://bps.bmw.com.tw/","note":"HONESTY NOTE. The researcher rated the year-1 checkpoint 'high' on the strength of a claimed 367-car inventory pull from this site's internal /api/search endpoint, reporting four facelift iX xDrive45 listings at 295-322萬. This audit could NOT reproduce that: the URL returns HTTP 200 but only a ~7 KB JavaScript SPA shell with no inventory data. The figures are PLAUSIBLE - 8891's independent facet band for the same model is 290-322萬, which brackets them closely - but they could not be independently verified here, so the year-1 confidence has been downgraded from 'high' to 'medium'."},{"name":"BMW Taiwan official site - ATTEMPTED, NOT REACHABLE","url":"https://www.bmw.com.tw/","note":"HONESTY NOTE, not a source. This audit independently re-tested the researcher's claim and UPHELD it: curl fails with exit 92 (HTTP/2 stream not closed cleanly, INTERNAL_ERROR) and returns no body. Mobile01 owner-receipt threads return HTTP 403. Consequently NO maintenance figure in this record comes from an official BMW TW service-price table or a real owner receipt, and all five maintenance checkpoints are marked 'low' confidence for exactly that reason. SOURCING DEFECT FOUND AND REMOVED: the researcher cited https://www.hotcar.com.tw/UsedCarSell/CarFilter as a '保養週期及服務工資' labour-rate table. That URL is live (HTTP 200) but is a used-car search filter titled '中古車、二手車行情價格、車價查詢｜HOT大聯盟' and contains none of the quoted rates; the citation has been dropped."}]},"bmw-ix1-edrive20-xline":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, far below the TW average of 12,000-15,000. Every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). At this mileage the service interval is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven: BMW's Condition Based Service calls an annual inspection and a 2-yearly brake-fluid change long before any km threshold, and tyres age out (5-6 years) rather than wear out. Home wallbox installation is deliberately EXCLUDED from every figure: a 7kW AC wallbox plus electrical work in a TW apartment carpark runs roughly NT$40,000-80,000 (more if the building needs a new meter or riser), but it is a one-off infrastructure cost, not maintenance. Electricity cost is also excluded, as are tax and insurance (excluded by design; note the iX1 currently pays NT$0 licence tax and NT$0 fuel tax as a BEV). Vehicle is assumed garaged, accident-free, one owner, full BMW dealer service history - which is what the quoted low-mileage used comps assume.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWN in fact-check (was 1,520,000 - dealer-retail contaminated). Underlying evidence re-verified first-hand: BMW Taiwan's certified used programme (BMW Premium Selection, bps.bmw.com.tw) exposes an unauthenticated search API; the full national inventory was re-paged on 2026-08-12 (366 cars) and every listing the original researcher quoted is REAL and accurately transcribed - iX1 eDrive20 X Line reg. 2025/09 @ 3,982 km asking NT$1,830,000; iX1 eDrive20 X Line reg. 2025/07 @ 15,173 km asking NT$1,690,000; iX1 eDrive20 reg. 2026/01 @ 2,001 km asking NT$1,850,000. Quoted from genuinely low-mileage cars deliberately, matching this buyer's 7,000 km/year profile. THE ERROR WAS THE ADJUSTMENT, NOT THE DATA. Those 2025-registered cars had an original list of NT$1,990,000, so the NT$1,830,000 BPS ask is 92% of list at 0.9 years and roughly 98% of a discounted new car's street price - these are certified-retail anchor prices carrying an extended factory warranty and 360-degree inspection, not clearing prices. The original step-down totalled only ~17%, which left private_sale_price at 76.7% of real_cost: a Toyota-shaped year-one retention that placed this BEV ABOVE its own petrol sibling (bmw-x1-sdrive20i-m-sport, 75.9%), contradicting the same record's measured ~9-point BEV-vs-ICE penalty. ADJUSTMENT NOW APPLIED: NT$1,830,000 BPS certified retail, less ~9% to ordinary 車商售價 (~NT$1,665,000), less ~13% to 自售價 (~NT$1,450,000); cross-checked against the German-BEV year-1 band measured across this batch (0.657-0.710 of real_cost) and set at NT$1,400,000 = 70.6% of real_cost, level with the sibling BMW i5 eDrive40 BEV record and ~5 points below the petrol X1. Dealer trade-in a further ~14% below private. Confidence downgraded from 'high' to 'medium': the listings are real and verified, but there is still no verified ordinary-dealer or private-sale transaction for a used TW iX1, so the figure remains a twice-adjusted derivation."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWN in fact-check (was 1,170,000). No 3-year-old eDrive20 exists yet - that variant only launched in TW in Mar-2025 - so anchored on its mechanical twin, verified live in the same BPS inventory read on 2026-08-12: iX2 xDrive30 M Sport, registered 2024/05, 41,045 km, asking NT$1,690,000, on the same FAAR platform with the same 64.7 kWh usable pack, against a list of roughly NT$2,390,000, i.e. ~71% of list at 2.2 years at certified retail DESPITE carrying nearly double this buyer's mileage. Stepping that anchor down the same verified chain (~9% BPS to ordinary dealer retail, ~13% to private sale) gives ~NT$1,340,000 private at 2.2 years, or ~56% of list; adding a modest low-mileage premium for this buyer's 15,000 km at that age and then decaying to year 3 lands at ~54-55% of list. Cross-checked two ways: (a) the petrol sibling in the same BPS inventory - X1 sDrive18i xLine reg. 2023/11 @ 23,495 km asking NT$1,400,000 - sits about 9-10 points above the BEV at comparable age, the expected German-BEV penalty; (b) the German-BEV year-3 band across this batch is 0.475-0.578 of real_cost. NT$1,080,000 = 54.5% of real_cost, inside that band, and restores a properly decelerating curve (29.4 points lost in year 1, then 8.1/yr to year 3, 7.6/yr to year 5). Adjustment from dealer asking to private sale stated explicitly."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - no genuine data can exist. The iX1 only went on sale in Taiwan in Sept-2023, so no 5-year-old car of this generation is possible. Method: take the PREDECESSOR-generation petrol X1 (F48) from the same BPS certified inventory, re-verified live on 2026-08-12 - sDrive18i xLine registered 2021/08 with 74,861 km asking NT$810,000, and sDrive18i registered 2020/06 with 49,306 km asking NT$920,000 - expressed as a retention ratio of that car's original list (~NT$1,800,000, itself unconfirmed), giving ~45% at 5 years at HIGH mileage, or roughly 53-55% adjusted up for this buyer's 35,000 km. A ~12-point BEV penalty is then applied for Taiwan-specific factors: thin used-BEV demand, battery-anxiety discounting, and the Neue Klasse iX3/i3 arriving from late-2026 which will date this generation's electronics and charging tech. That lands near 42% of list at certified retail, stepped down through ordinary dealer retail to private sale. Sanity-checked against the German-BEV year-5 band across this batch (0.348-0.426 of real_cost); NT$780,000 = 39.4%, mid-band. Value retained unchanged from the original record - it was already correctly positioned - but it now sits on a corrected, steeper year-1/year-3 curve. The F48 original list price is approximate, so the ratio is soft."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - no data of this generation can exist. Same method as year 5, using predecessor F48 X1 listings re-verified live in the BPS inventory on 2026-08-12: sDrive18i registered 2019/07 with 79,227 km asking NT$670,000, and sDrive20i registered 2019/10 with 53,241 km asking NT$780,000. Against original list that is ~38% at ~7 years at high mileage, or ~44-46% adjusted for this buyer's 49,000 km. A ~14-point BEV penalty is applied: by year 7 the 3-year vehicle warranty is long gone, the high-voltage pack is approaching the end of its 8-year cover, and buyers price in an unknown State-of-Health with no affordable pack-replacement path. That gives ~31% of list at certified retail, stepped down to private sale. Cross-checked against the German-BEV year-7 band across this batch (0.244-0.296 of real_cost); NT$535,000 = 27.0%, mid-band, and the tail keeps falling (6.2 points/year through this window) rather than flattening. Being explicitly extrapolated rather than silently invented."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - no data of this generation can exist. Predecessor anchors re-verified live in the BPS certified inventory on 2026-08-12: F48 X1 sDrive18i xLine registered 2017/03 with 70,751 km asking NT$680,000; sDrive20i registered 2018/03 with 81,345 km asking NT$590,000; sDrive20i registered 2018/11 with 109,018 km asking NT$598,000. So an 8-9.5 year old petrol X1 holds roughly 33-38% of original list even at certified retail, and BPS only lists the good ones so the open market sits below that. For a 10-year-old BEV a much heavier penalty applies: the high-voltage battery is out of its 8-year warranty, a pack replacement costs a large multiple of the car's value so nobody does one, and Taiwanese used-EV demand at that age is very thin (comparable-era BEVs such as the i3 and Leaf trade in the NT$250,000-350,000 region regardless of original price). That puts ordinary dealer retail near NT$355,000 and private sale at NT$305,000, about 15% of real_cost - well below the ~50% a same-age petrol X1 would fetch privately, which is the correct out-of-warranty BEV shape and the opposite of a Lexus. Single weak anchor plus a large judgement adjustment."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Estimate from BMW's BEV Condition Based Service schedule priced at BMW TW dealer labour norms. Full 3-year vehicle warranty in force, so only routine work is billed. No published BMW TW price table exists to verify against; confirmed still unavailable in the fact-check pass."},{"y":3,"source":"Estimate: two annual services in this window, one carrying the biennial brake-fluid change, plus consumables and one alignment. Still inside the 3-year warranty so no failure allowance is added. Time-driven, not mileage-driven - the car has only covered 21,000 km. Unverified against any published table. Fact-check note: the brake-fluid element of this estimate is generous (see plan_notes); the period total is retained because the block is explicitly low confidence."},{"y":5,"source":"Estimate. Dominated by the first tyre replacement: at 7,000 km/year the 19-inch tyres age out around year 5-6 with tread left, and a set of four for a 1,865 kg BEV runs NT$36,000-60,000 depending on dealer vs independent - NT$48,000 used. The 12V AGM battery (~NT$12,000 fitted) typically fails in this window and is a wear item excluded from warranty. Vehicle warranty expires at year 3, so a modest out-of-warranty allowance is included. Unverified against any published table."},{"y":7,"source":"Estimate. The big item is brakes: regeneration means the pads barely wear, but on a low-mileage BEV in Taiwan's humidity the discs corrode and score, and BMW dealers commonly replace discs and pads front and rear around year 6-8 on condition rather than wear (NT$55,000-75,000; NT$60,000 used). Fully out of vehicle warranty here, so a genuine risk allowance is carried for the known-expensive BMW BEV items - the electric A/C compressor, the on-board AC charging module, and suspension bushings that wear faster under the extra battery weight. Unverified against any published table."},{"y":10,"source":"Estimate, and the least certain of the five. Three annual services plus two brake-fluid changes, a second set of tyres (aged out again), a second 12V battery, coolant, and a suspension refresh appropriate to a 10-year-old heavy BEV. Critically, the high-voltage battery warranty expires at year 8: no pack replacement is budgeted (NT$700,000-1,000,000+, which nobody does - the market prices that risk into residual value instead, and the year-10 value checkpoint reflects it), but the battery-ADJACENT failures that do get repaired are budgeted - battery-loop coolant pump, HV contactor/junction box, on-board charger - plus the electric A/C compressor and heat pump. This is the out-of-warranty period where the owner carries the repair risk directly. Unverified against any published table."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - BMW iX1 車款介紹（車系沿革含完整台灣售價歷程）","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/ix1/7256/overall","note":"Primary price verification, fetched directly in the fact-check pass (HTTP 200). Spec table reads 'eDrive20 xLine 205' (萬). 車系沿革 gives the full TW ladder: 199萬 (Mar-2025 launch) → 204萬 (Nov-2025, 2026MY, lithium-battery recycling levy, AR nav deleted) → 205萬 (Jul-2026, 調漲 1 萬, SiC inverter, WLTP 503 km +30 km, CCS1→CCS2). Also confirms spec: single front motor, 204hp/25.2kgm, 66.5 kWh total / 64.7 kWh usable, 0-100 in 8.6s, 130kW DC charging, no panoramic roof and standard comfort suspension vs the xDrive30."},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 - 新年式BMW iX1及iX2改用CCS2，導入碳化矽提升續航、台灣售價曝光 (2026-07-13)","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/331921","note":"Independent confirmation of the NT$2,050,000 list price (and 235萬 / 243萬 for iX1 xDrive30 xLine and iX2 xDrive30 M Sport) plus the July-2026 model-year change. Its stated range figure did not reconcile cleanly with U-CAR's WLTP 503 km on re-read; the U-CAR/UDN figure is used. Range is not a cost input, so this does not affect any number in the record."},{"name":"UDN 發燒車訊 - BMW iX1、iX2新年式登場！導入SiC逆變器續航突破500公里","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/124115/9630741","note":"Third independent confirmation, re-fetched in the fact-check pass: 汎德's own announcement, 'iX1 eDrive20 xLine ... 建議售價為205萬元', with 235萬 and 243萬 for the other two variants."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - BMW 2026 iX1 eDrive20 xLine 車款介紹","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-ix1-2026-edrive20-xline","note":"Fourth confirmation of 205 (萬); URL re-checked and resolves HTTP 200. Also the source for the BEV tax position used in assumptions (牌照稅 NT$0, 燃料稅 NT$0) and for kerb weight 1,865 kg, which drives the tyre-cost assumption."},{"name":"BMW Premium Selection Taiwan（BMW 原廠認證中古車）- 全台在售車輛","url":"https://bps.bmw.com.tw/search","note":"THE key used-value source and an official BMW Taiwan channel. INDEPENDENTLY RE-VERIFIED in the fact-check pass: the site's unauthenticated search API was re-paged on 2026-08-12 and returned 366 cars nationally, and every listing the original record quoted was found and matched exactly - 4 iX1 (eDrive20 X Line reg. 2025/09 @ 3,982 km asking 183萬; reg. 2025/07 @ 15,173 km asking 169萬; eDrive20 reg. 2026/01 @ 2,001 km asking 185萬; xDrive30 X Line reg. 2025/12 @ 3,599 km asking 208萬), 6 iX2 (incl. xDrive30 M Sport reg. 2024/05 @ 41,045 km asking 169萬), and 26 X1 spanning 2017-2025 covering the predecessor F48 generation at 5-9.5 years old. The data is genuine; what was wrong in the original record was the size of the step-down applied to it. All these prices are CERTIFIED DEALER RETAIL - the top of the market, carrying an extended factory warranty and a 360-degree inspection - and are stepped down ~9% to ordinary 車商售價 and a further ~13% to 自售價 in each checkpoint."},{"name":"8891 新車 - BMW iX1 購車菜單／徵求菜單","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/menu/bmw/ix1","note":"Used to calibrate the discount and the accessory component of onroad_fees. URL re-checked in the fact-check pass and resolves HTTP 200 with the correct page title, but the page body is fully client-rendered and could not be retrieved by either pass, so the buyer-budget clustering it is cited for is unverified. Treated as aspirational asks rather than transaction prices."},{"name":"8891 新車 - 2026 BMW iX1 價格車款介紹（廠商優惠）","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/bmw/ix1/Summary.html","note":"Source for the factory incentive structure ('月付5,900元起 or 120萬48期0利率') - a finance subsidy rather than headline cash off, which is why the modelled cash discount is modest. URL re-checked and resolves HTTP 200 with the correct title; body is client-rendered and unverifiable."},{"name":"BMW Taiwan 官網 - 全新BMW iX1純電運動休旅","url":"https://www.bmw.com.tw/zh/all-models/bmw-i-series/ix1/bmw-ix1.html","note":"Official brand page for the model currently on sale. Did not respond to automated fetch in either pass (connection timeout), so it is listed as a canonical reference rather than as verified evidence. The TW official site publishes no service price table and no explicit warranty terms, which is why all maintenance figures are marked low confidence."}]},"bmw-ix2-xdrive30-m-sport":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, far below the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year; every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7000/21000/35000/49000/70000). At this mileage BMW's condition-based service is effectively TIME-driven (annual), not mileage-driven, so the 40,000 km cap on the free-service package never binds inside 3 years (21,000 km) and consumables age out rather than wear out - tires are replaced on age (~5-6 years), and brake discs corrode in Taiwan's humidity long before regenerative braking wears the pads. All used-value quotes deliberately reference LOW-MILEAGE listings. That premium is real but smaller than the previous draft claimed: parsing all 114 pages of 8891's live BMW inventory (3,926 unique rows, 18 of them iX2 xDrive30 M Sport) shows 2025 model-year cars at 3,000-5,800 km asking NT$2,000,000-2,050,000 versus NT$1,820,000-1,898,000 at 21,000-22,000 km, and 2024 cars at 20,000 km asking NT$1,820,000 versus NT$1,690,000-1,730,000 at 35,000-46,000 km. So the low-mileage premium on the same model year is roughly NT$100,000-210,000, NOT the ~NT$350,000 previously asserted - that figure came from comparing a high-mileage 2024 car against 2025 cars and is withdrawn. Home-charger (wallbox) installation is a real ownership cost for this car - roughly NT$40,000-80,000 in Taiwan including the unit, dedicated circuit and any building/management-committee work - but it is a one-off capital item, NOT maintenance, so it is deliberately excluded from maintenance.checkpoints and from purchase. Tax and insurance are excluded by design; note that Taiwan's BEV 牌照稅/燃料稅 exemption also sits outside this model (U-CAR puts the un-exempted 牌照稅 at NT$15,210/year for this power output). Electricity/charging cost is likewise excluded (U-CAR measures the closely related iX1 at 6.4 km/kWh). BMW Taiwan's 8-year/160,000 km high-voltage battery warranty expires at year 8, which is why the year 7->10 window carries both the steepest proportional value fall and the heaviest repair-risk budget.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"high","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN from NT$1,800,000. Anchored on the full live 8891 inventory, parsed directly rather than from search snippets: all 114 pages of BMW stock were fetched and every iX2 xDrive30 M Sport row extracted (18 cars). The nine 2025 model-year cars at 3,000-5,800 km - the correct low-mileage comparison for this 7,000 km/year buyer - ask NT$2,000,000 / 2,000,000 / 2,030,000 / 2,030,000 / 2,030,000 / 2,050,000 / 2,050,000 / 2,050,000 / 2,050,000, median NT$2,030,000, against a 2025 model-year list of NT$2,420,000 (84% dealer asking). The previous draft's NT$2,100,000 listing does not appear in current inventory. ADJUSTMENT MADE: those are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking), not what an owner receives. Cut 13.8% to reach private sale (自售) NT$1,750,000 - the upper half of the 8-15% band, and justified harder than usual because a 2026 model-year iX2 with 3,000 km is itself sitting on a dealer forecourt at NT$2,050,000 with a warranty, so a private seller of a 1-year-old car is competing directly against nearly-new certified stock. dealer_tradein (車商收購價) is a further 14% below private at NT$1,500,000. Result is 73.7% of real_cost and 72.0% of LIST retained after year one, i.e. a ~26% first-year loss - the correct steep German-BEV shape, and clearly not a Toyota number."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"UNCHANGED in value but RE-SOURCED: the previous draft reached NT$1,500,000 through the iX1 plus an arbitrary '70% of list' assumption; direct iX2 evidence supports the same number and is stronger. From the same full 8891 parse, the five 2024 model-year iX2 xDrive30 M Sport cars (2.2-2.5 years old today) ask NT$1,820,000 at 20,000 km and NT$1,690,000-1,730,000 at 35,000-46,000 km. This buyer would be at ~17,000 km at 2.4 years, so NT$1,820,000 is the right low-mileage comp - 76.8% of the NT$2,370,000 that car listed at. Sibling cross-check: 2023 iX1 xDrive30 xLine (list NT$2,280,000 per Yahoo Autos) asks NT$1,530,000 at 41,000 km and NT$1,388,000-1,498,000 at 65,000-87,000 km, i.e. ~71% dealer asking at 3.2 years once adjusted to low mileage; 2023 iX xDrive40 旗艦版 (list NT$3,200,000) asks NT$2,130,000 at 33,000 km, 66.6%. ADJUSTMENT MADE: interpolating the iX2's own curve to a full 3 years gives ~72% dealer asking = NT$1,750,000, then a 14% cut to private sale = NT$1,500,000, and a further 14% to trade-in = NT$1,290,000. That is 63.2% of real_cost. Confidence medium: the year 1-3 stretch is genuinely flatter than a German combustion car's because year-one asking prices are already deeply haircut, but it rests on a forward projection of a 2.4-year observation."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN from NT$1,200,000. EXTRAPOLATED - no genuine 5-year data exists for this car (Taiwan launch 2024-03-28) and none was invented. Method: build the German-BEV dealer-asking curve from real low-mileage Taiwan listings parsed off 8891 - iX2 84% at 1 year, 76.8% at 2.4 years, iX1 ~71% at 3.2 years, iX xDrive40 63.1% at 4.2 years (NT$2,020,000 at 38,000 km against a NT$3,200,000 list) - then continue it through the warranty cliff, since the 3-year warranty AND the 4th-year extension have both expired by this checkpoint. That puts year 5 at ~55% dealer asking, and a 13% cut to private sale gives NT$1,120,000 = 47.2% of real_cost, 46.1% of list. The previous NT$1,200,000 sat above what the observed curve supports once the dealer-to-private conversion is applied consistently. By year 5 the car is also one full generation behind on charge rate and range and BMW Taiwan's BEV demand is contracting. dealer_tradein is 15% under private (a wider spread than at year 1, because dealers discount harder for out-of-warranty BEV stock they must floorplan)."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN from NT$900,000 - this was the clearest instance of the dealer-retail trap surviving into the tail. EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION, as required. Predecessor used is the BMW X2 (F39), the direct body-style ancestor, Taiwan launch 2018 at NT$2,050,000 (sDrive20i) / NT$2,150,000 (sDrive20i M Sport X) per Yahoo Autos. Live 8891 data parsed directly (12 real 2018 M Sport X cars): NT$788,000 at 15,000 km, NT$688,000 at 60,000 km, NT$758,000-778,000 at 70,000-74,000 km, down to NT$559,000 at 128,000 km - mean NT$694,000. The previous draft's FindCar figure of NT$829,000 average is contradicted by this direct read and is withdrawn. Low-mileage-adjusted 2019 (7-year-old) cars sit around NT$850,000 = 39.5% dealer asking of the M Sport X list. ADJUSTMENT MADE: that is 車商售價; converting at -15% gives the predecessor's PRIVATE retention of ~33.6%, and the previous draft compared this BEV's private price against the predecessor's dealer-asking ratio, which inflated it. Applying the correct private ratio to this car's real_cost gives ~NT$798,000, then a modest BEV penalty (thinner used demand, Neue Klasse replacement two generations back) lands NT$780,000 = 32.8% of real_cost. The BEV penalty is milder here than at year 10 because BMW's 8-year/160,000 km high-voltage battery warranty is still live at year 7. dealer_tradein is 17% below private. Ratio applied to real_cost exactly as instructed."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN from NT$570,000 - the previous figure made the tail flatten, which is wrong for an out-of-warranty German BEV. EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION. Two predecessors triangulated, both re-read directly off live 8891 inventory rather than from snippets. (1) The only BMW BEV in Taiwan old enough to read: the i3. Real current listings are 2015 REX NT$458,000 at 110,000 km, 2016 REX NT$458,000 at 90,000 km, 2016 NT$598,000 at 83,000 km, 2017 REX NT$520,000 at 140,000 km. Original Taiwan list per Yahoo Autos was NT$2,390,000 pure-electric / NT$2,990,000 REX, so dealer asking at ~10 years is 15-25% depending on which basis applies, well below the ~28% the previous draft claimed from FindCar snippets - that claim is withdrawn. Low-mileage-adjusted and converted at -15% to private, the i3 implies 18-22% private retention. (2) The combustion X2 (F39) at 8 years is ~34.7% dealer asking / ~30% private, so extrapolated to 10 years a GASOLINE X2 would be ~24-25% private - and a BEV must sit below that. Landing at NT$470,000 = 19.8% of real_cost and 19.3% of list. The tail does NOT flatten the way a Lexus does: the 8-year/160,000 km battery warranty has expired by now, so the market prices in high-voltage battery and drive-unit replacement risk on top of ordinary out-of-warranty repair risk. dealer_tradein is 18% below private - the widest spread of any checkpoint, because most dealers will only take a decade-old German BEV at auction-floor money."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"BMW Taiwan standard offer on designated i models (3-year/40,000 km 原廠保養套裝 + 3-year warranty + 4th-year extension + 3-year U-POWER charging). At 7,000 km the car is nowhere near the 40,000 km cap, so the only genuine outflow is minor consumables. Confidence downgraded from high to medium versus the previous draft: the package terms are the established 汎德 offer but were not confirmed from a fetched official page in this session, and U-CAR records that 汎德 refuses to release iX1 servicing costs at all."},{"y":3,"source":"Same BMW Taiwan package - at 21,000 km after three years the 40,000 km ceiling is still not reached, so scheduled labour and parts remain covered. NT$12,000 across the two-year window is the residual non-covered consumable spend at BMW dealer pricing (wipers roughly NT$2,500/pair against the NT$1,398-2,080 Korean-brand benchmark in U-CAR article 77119, plus alignment and filters)."},{"y":5,"source":"REVISED DOWN from NT$100,000. Extrapolated. The free-maintenance package ends at year 3 and the warranty (3 years + 4th-year extension) ends at year 4, so this window is the first to carry unsubsidised cost, plus one year of genuine out-of-warranty exposure. Correction to the previous draft: it billed ~NT$18,000 of front and rear brake pads at 35,000 km while its own plan_notes said regenerative braking 'barely touches the pads', and then billed pads again at year 10 - two pad sets in 70,000 km on a regen BEV is not realistic. The pad replacement is moved to year 7, where it is done together with the corrosion-driven disc job, which is how the work actually falls. Component costs scaled ~1.8-2.2x from the Korean-brand BEV consumable table published by U-CAR (article 77119, fetched and verified), with the tire figure taken directly from U-CAR's iX1 quote for the identical 245/45 R19 fitment."},{"y":7,"source":"REVISED UP from NT$128,000 to absorb the brake pads correctly moved out of year 5. Extrapolated from BMW Taiwan dealer labour rates and the U-CAR consumable benchmark (article 77119), uplifted for premium-German parts pricing. No engine-side items apply (no oil, plugs, coil packs, thermostat housing or DPF on a BEV), but the electric coolant pump and thermal-management hardware are the direct BEV equivalents of that risk class and are included. Deliberately far above a Japanese equivalent: this is a German premium BEV with no warranty backstop on anything except the high-voltage battery."},{"y":10,"source":"Extrapolated over a three-year window with no warranty of any kind remaining. This is the period the honest model must not understate: a decade-old German BEV in Taiwan carries thermal-management, HV-electronics and charging-hardware exposure that a naturally-aspirated Japanese SUV simply does not, and BMW dealer labour is roughly double the Korean-brand basis U-CAR published. The BEV genuinely saves the engine-side items (no water pump, coil packs, thermostat housing or DPF), which is why the 10-year total of ~NT$549,000 is not higher still - but it is multiples of a RAV4's, which is the correct outcome. Figures are risk-weighted expected values, not worst cases."}],"sources":[{"name":"7car / PChome News - 2026 model-year BMW iX1 & iX2 Taiwan pricing (2026-07-16)","url":"https://news.pchome.com.tw/car/7car/20260716/index-17841672001080936018.html","note":"Fetched and read in this verification pass. Confirms the current on-sale price: iX2 xDrive30 M Sport NT$2,430,000, single trim, 313 hp / 494 Nm, 0-100 km/h 5.6 s, 472 km WLTP with the new silicon-carbide inverter. Primary independent verification of list_price."},{"name":"8891 新車 - 2026 model-year BMW iX1/iX2 price adjustment news","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/bmw/ix1/22213","note":"Fetched and read in this verification pass. Second independent confirmation of NT$2,430,000, alongside iX1 eDrive20 xLine NT$2,050,000 and iX1 xDrive30 xLine NT$2,350,000, and states 雙車系均小漲了1萬 - so the 2025 model year was NT$2,420,000, which is the denominator used for the year-1 retention read."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - live BMW used inventory, all 114 pages parsed","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/ix2","note":"PRIMARY USED-VALUE EVIDENCE. All 114 pages of live BMW inventory were fetched and parsed to 3,926 unique rows, giving the whole used curve first-hand instead of via search snippets. 18 iX2 xDrive30 M Sport rows: 2026MY 3,000 km NT$2,050,000; 2025MY at 3,000-5,800 km NT$2,000,000-2,050,000 (median 2,030,000) and at 21,200-22,000 km NT$1,820,000-1,898,000; 2024MY at 20,000 km NT$1,820,000 and at 35,000-46,000 km NT$1,690,000-1,730,000. 16 iX1 rows incl. 2023 xDrive30 xLine NT$1,530,000 at 41,000 km. 24 iX rows incl. 2022 xDrive40 旗艦版 NT$2,020,000 at 38,000 km. 12 X2 (F39) 2018 M Sport X rows spanning NT$559,000-788,000, mean NT$694,000. 4 i3 rows NT$458,000-598,000. Every figure is 車商售價 (dealer retail asking) and was converted down the chain to private sale, never copied across."},{"name":"U-CAR 試車 - [集體評比] 200~250萬電動休旅車 — 養車成本篇 (EV ownership-cost comparison incl. BMW iX1)","url":"https://roadtest.u-car.com.tw/roadtest/article/77119","note":"Fetched and verified in this pass (WebFetch is refused with HTTP 403; a direct curl succeeds). The single most useful maintenance source, and its key claims were confirmed verbatim: 汎德 回覆不便提供 iX1 xDrive30 xLine 的持有成本資料 (so no official BMW Taiwan service table exists to cite); iX1's 245/45 R19 Continental EcoContact 6 at NT$8,300/tire retail, the iX2's identical fitment; iX1 consumption 6.4 km/kWh; 牌照稅 NT$15,210/year at this power output if unexempted. Also supplies the Korean-brand BEV consumable price table and scheduled-service totals to 150,000 km (Ioniq 5 NT$50,022, EV6 NT$28,630, C40 NT$23,982) that the BMW estimates are scaled from."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - BMW X2 (F39) 2018 Taiwan model-year prices","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/bmw-x2-2018","note":"Fetched and read. Supplies the predecessor-generation list prices the year-7 and year-10 ratios are computed against: sDrive18i NT$1,850,000, sDrive18i M Sport X NT$1,950,000, sDrive20i NT$2,050,000, sDrive20i M Sport X NT$2,150,000. Replaces the previous draft's unverified FindCar snippet."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - BMW i3 2014 Taiwan model-year prices","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/bmw-i3-2014","note":"Fetched and read. Original Taiwan list: 純電動版 NT$2,390,000, REX 增程式電動版 NT$2,990,000. Material correction - most surviving i3s on 8891 are REX cars, so the 10-year retention ratio must be taken against NT$2,990,000 for those, which makes the i3 tail markedly worse than the previous draft's single NT$2,390,000 basis implied."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - BMW iX1 2023 and BMW iX 2022 Taiwan model-year prices","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/bmw-ix1-2023","note":"Fetched and read. iX1 2023 was single-trim xDrive30 xLine at NT$2,280,000; the companion iX 2022 page gives xDrive40 旗艦版 NT$3,200,000 / xDrive50 旗艦版 NT$3,900,000. These are the denominators for the 3-year and 4-year German-BEV retention points that the year-5 extrapolation is built on."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - 2026 BMW iX2 xDrive30 M Sport specification page","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-ix2-2026-xdrive30-m-sport","note":"Fetched; page resolves and covers the exact 2026 trim. Confirms specs used for the cost model: 313 hp, 2,020 kg kerb weight (drives the suspension and tire cost assumptions), 472 km range, 130 kW DC charging, dual-motor xDrive. Did not display a price, so it was not used for price verification."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 - BMW X2 / iX2 Taiwan launch pricing report","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/77906","note":"Fetched in this pass (HTTP 200 by curl; WebFetch is refused). The page title alone carries the figure used - 燃油225萬與289萬、純電售價237萬 - confirming the iX2's NT$2,370,000 Taiwan launch price (2024-03-28), which is the denominator for the 2024 model-year retention read. Not relied on for the current price."}]},"bmw-ix3-40-m-sport":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year; all checkpoints use 7,000 km/year (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km) - roughly half the Taiwan average, so servicing is time-driven (annual visits) rather than mileage-driven. TIMING CAVEAT: as of 2026-08-12 this car is not yet on sale in Taiwan. BMW TW (agent 汎德) opened online pre-order in May 2026 (NT$100,000 deposit, 50 xDrive only), dealer-sourced pre-sale prices surfaced 2026-06-05, a media preview was held 2026-07-20, and formal launch is October 2026. The 50 xDrive delivers from ~November 2026; THE 40 M SPORT DOES NOT DELIVER UNTIL JANUARY 2027, so year 1 of ownership effectively runs 2027-2028 and every downstream figure is shifted about a year later than the model_year 2026 label implies. Home-charger installation is deliberately EXCLUDED from maintenance per the brief - budget roughly NT$40,000-80,000 separately for a BMW Wallbox plus installation, plus building/管委會 approval in an apartment. Electricity, insurance and tax are also excluded by design; note that Taiwan BEVs currently enjoy 牌照稅/燃料費 exemptions and 貨物稅 relief, none of which are counted here.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - no used data for this car can exist (first 40 M Sport delivers January 2027). CORRECTED DOWN from the reviewed record's NT$2,135,000 (76.3% of list), which cherry-picked only the strongest proxies and several 原廠認證中古車 (BPS-certified) listings that carry a certification premium. I re-pulled auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/i on 2026-08-12 and used the full spread of genuinely low-mileage 1-1.5-year BMW BEVs, each against its own original TW list: iX2 xDrive30 M Sport (orig NT$2,370,000) at 3,000 km NT$2,050,000, 5,800 km NT$2,000,000, 5,801 km NT$2,030,000 = 84-87%; i4 eDrive40 facelift (orig NT$2,750,000) NON-certified at 5,900-5,978 km NT$2,280,000 = 83%, versus certified examples at NT$2,430,000-2,450,000 = 88-89% (the ~5-point BPS premium the reviewed record failed to strip out); i5 eDrive40 M Sport (orig NT$3,290,000) at 5,000 km NT$2,500,000 = 76%. Central non-certified DEALER RETAIL asking ~82%. Applied -13% to convert dealer asking to private sale = ~71.4% of list. Low-mileage credit is already implicit because every proxy listing above is itself 3,000-6,000 km. A further small haircut is embedded for the 40 being only 20% of the order book and for BMW's rapid Neue Klasse rollout diluting the newest-thing premium by 2028. dealer_tradein set a further -13% below private."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from real 3-year-old German BEV listings re-pulled from auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/i on 2026-08-12. Primary proxy: BMW iX xDrive50 旗艦版 (orig NT$3,900,000), 2023 cars at 34,200 km NT$2,480,000, 43,000 km NT$2,488,000 and 53,000 km NT$2,296,000 (x2) = 58.9-63.8%, average ~62.5% of list at DEALER RETAIL. Cross-checks: iX2 xDrive30 2024 cars at 41,000 km NT$1,690,000-1,730,000 = 71-73% at ~2.3 years (mileage-penalised); i4 M50 2023 at NT$2,138,000 against a NT$3,100,000 list = 69%. Our car is mid-price rather than flagship (the NT$3.9M iX 50 falls harder in percentage terms) and carries only 21,000 km against the proxies' 34,000-53,000 km, so I credited ~+4 points over the iX 50 read to ~66% dealer retail, then applied -12% to private = 56.1% of list. This is the steep German years-1-to-3 leg. NOTE ON METHOD: the reviewed record converted to private (54%) and then discretionarily added back +5 points for low mileage, which cancelled almost the entire dealer-to-private conversion; the credit is applied here BEFORE the conversion, not after. Dealer trade-in a further -14%."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED. Closest real anchor, re-verified on 8891 2026-08-12: BMW iX xDrive40 旗艦版 (orig NT$3,200,000), a 2022 car at 38,000 km asking NT$2,020,000 = 63.1% of list at DEALER RETAIL at ~4 years, i.e. ~55.5% at private sale. Extending one year on the observed German-BEV slope (~5-6 points of list per year in this window) and crediting our car's 35,000 km against the proxy's 38,000 km gives 45.0% of list (43.7% of real_cost). Two step-downs land inside this window: the 3-year factory warranty (4 with the usual BMW i promo) has expired, and by 2032 the NA5 will itself have been facelifted - the same effect the reviewed record correctly identified as having hurt the iX 50. Held slightly above my own year-3-to-year-7 interpolation because the iX 40 listing is the single strongest real data point at this age. Dealer trade-in a further -15%, the widening spread reflecting how slowly out-of-warranty German BEVs move off a lot."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - no 7-year-old German BEV of this class exists in the Taiwan used market at all, so this is interpolated between the year-5 figure and the genuine 9-11 year BMW i3 evidence below, on a curve that keeps falling rather than flattening. 31.8% of list / 30.9% of real_cost, i.e. the car keeps only 70.6% of its year-5 value across years 5-7 versus 80.3% across years 3-5 - the decline accelerates rather than plateauing. Rationale: fully out of factory warranty, an 800V Neue Klasse drivetrain that independent shops cannot service, and a used market that by 2034 will be comparing it against far cheaper newer BEVs in what is now Taiwan's most crowded segment. Partially supported on the upside by the 8-year/160,000 km HV battery warranty still being alive at year 7 - which is precisely why the year-7 to year-10 drop is proportionally so severe. Dealer trade-in a further -16%."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the only genuine 10-year German BEV data in Taiwan, and MATERIALLY CORRECTED. The reviewed record used NT$2,390,000 as the i3 denominator, but all four live 8891 i3 listings (re-pulled 2026-08-12: 2017 REx 140,000 km NT$520,000; 2016 REx 83,000 km NT$598,000; 2016 REx 90,000 km NT$458,000; 2015 REx 110,000 km NT$458,000) are 增程式 REx cars, and U-CAR's 2014 launch article prices the i3 純電 at NT$2,390,000 but the i3 REx at NT$2,990,000 - a NT$600,000 gap driven by 貨物稅 treatment. Against the correct NT$2,990,000 denominator these ask 15.3-20.0%, averaging 17.0% of list at DEALER RETAIL, not the 19-25% claimed. Converting to private sale (-12%) gives ~15.0%. I set 16.4% of list (15.9% of real_cost), credited above the raw read for our car's much lower 70,000 km and its larger, more modern platform, but NOT to the reviewed record's 19.6% - which was both built on the wrong denominator and set at essentially dealer-retail level. Note the i3 REx proxy is if anything flattering: it carries a petrol range-extender that removes battery anxiety (one listing advertises exactly that) while keeping 電動車牌 tax status, an upside our pure BEV will not have. The dominant tail risk stands: the 8-year/160,000 km HV battery warranty expires at year 8, and an out-of-warranty ~83 kWh pack on a 10-year-old car costs more to replace than the car is worth. Dealer trade-in a further -18% - dealers discount old BEVs hardest because they are slow to move and carry pack risk."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Structure and unit prices taken from the real 桃園大桐 BMW dealer invoice for a BMW iX (PTT car board thread M.1712239780.A.D4C, 2024), less the brake-fluid line which is not due until year 2."},{"y":3,"source":"Grounded in the real BMW TW dealer invoice for a 2-year BEV service (NT$6,228 incl. tax, brake fluid included), scaled to two annual visits at this car's price class. The cabin-filter figures are confirmed in the thread's own text."},{"y":5,"source":"Tire cost scaled down from the real BMW TW dealer quote in the reference thread for the iX's 21-inch fitment (owner paid NT$56,000 for four, replaced at just over 30,000 km on wear). The iX3 40 M Sport runs smaller 20-inch M 1048 wheels (confirmed on U-CAR), so ~NT$12,000 per corner. Service costs from the same dealer invoice."},{"y":7,"source":"Extrapolated. Disc-corrosion replacement is the documented low-mileage BEV pattern and is corroborated by the reference owner reporting essentially no pad wear after two years and 40,000 km (i.e. pads outlast discs at this duty cycle). Out-of-warranty provisions are estimates at BMW TW dealer labour rates (NT$210/unit), not quoted figures."},{"y":10,"source":"Extrapolated, and deliberately heavy. No Taiwan owner data exists for a 10-year 800V BEV, so this is a risk-weighted provision at German dealer labour rates rather than a quoted schedule. Raised from the reviewed record's NT$265,000 to add a second corrosion-driven disc job and to inflation-adjust the second tire set, since all underlying quotes are 2024-2026 prices being applied to 2034-2037 spending. Excludes HV battery replacement entirely - if the pack fails after year 8 the cost exceeds the car's value and the rational move is to scrap rather than repair, which is why it sits in the year-10 residual instead of here."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR - BMW iX3 車款介紹 (model page, list prices and full spec)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/ix3/7254/overall","note":"Primary price source, re-fetched and read in full 2026-08-12. Trim table shows 40 M Sport 280 萬 / 50 xDrive M Sport 325 萬, 預計 10 月正式上市. Also confirms 20-inch M 1048 wheels on the 40, 86.9 kWh, 320 hp, WLTP 637 km, 300 kW DC, CCS2, 後輪驅動 single motor, panoramic roof optional (+9 萬) on the 40, and BMW's 98%-regen-braking claim."},{"name":"U-CAR news 88833 - 預售價280萬與325萬，預計10月國內發表 (2026-06-05)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/88833","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-12; article date reads 2026 6月 5 (the reviewed record's assumptions.notes said 2026-06-08, corrected here). Dealer-sourced pre-sale pricing 280 萬 / 325 萬; October 2026 launch; first deliveries Q4 2026 and predominantly 50 xDrive; 40 M Sport delivery falls in 2027. Also gives kerb weight 2,285 kg and the 50's 113.4 kWh gross / 108.4 kWh usable battery, the basis for inferring the 40's usable capacity."},{"name":"U-CAR news 89191 - 10月上市接單1,200張，BMW iX3國內預賞 (2026-07-20)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/89191","note":"Most recent status, re-fetched 2026-08-12. Re-confirms NT$2,800,000; 已接單超過 1,200 張; 接單比例 50 車型 8 成、40 車型 2 成; 50 xDrive 預計最快 11 月交車、40 車型有待 2027 年 1 月."},{"name":"U-CAR - BMW iX3 事件簿 (Taiwan model timeline)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/ix3/7254/event","note":"Taiwan timeline for the NA5. Contains no first-generation (G08) Taiwan launch entry, supporting that the G08 iX3 was never officially sold here - hence no nameplate predecessor for the used-value curve. URL confirmed live 2026-08-12."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW i used listings (whole i range)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/i","note":"Re-pulled independently 2026-08-12 with price AND mileage per listing; this is the correction that moved the curve. Low-mileage 1-1.5y: iX2 xDrive30 2025 at 3,000 km NT$2,050,000 / 5,800 km NT$2,000,000 / 5,801 km NT$2,030,000; i4 eDrive40 2025 NON-certified at 5,900-5,978 km NT$2,280,000 vs BPS-certified at 3,500-4,241 km NT$2,430,000-2,450,000; i5 eDrive40 2025 at 5,000 km NT$2,500,000. Older: iX xDrive50 2023 at 34,200 km NT$2,480,000 / 43,000 km NT$2,488,000 / 53,000 km NT$2,296,000; iX xDrive40 2022 at 38,000 km NT$2,020,000; iX2 2024 at 41,000 km NT$1,690,000-1,730,000; i4 M50 2023 NT$2,138,000. All are 車商售價 and were adjusted down 12-13% to private-sale level, with the BPS certification premium stripped out before averaging."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW i3 used listings (10-year BEV tail anchor)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/i/i3","note":"Re-pulled 2026-08-12. All four live listings are 增程式 REx cars, not pure BEVs: 2017 REx 140,000 km NT$520,000; 2016 REx 83,000 km NT$598,000; 2016 REx 90,000 km NT$458,000; 2015 REx 110,000 km NT$458,000. Against the correct REx list price of NT$2,990,000 (not the NT$2,390,000 pure-EV price the reviewed record used) these are 15.3-20.0% of list at dealer retail, averaging 17.0%. Sole empirical basis for the year-10 figure."},{"name":"U-CAR news 23587 - BMW i3 239萬起、i8 989萬，i品牌在臺上市 (2014-06-25)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/23587","note":"Read in full 2026-08-12. States explicitly that the Taiwan i3 came in two versions: 純電車型 建議售價 NT$2,390,000 and 增程式車型 (REx) 建議售價 NT$2,990,000, the NT$600,000 gap driven by 貨物稅 全免 vs 減半. This is the denominator correction for the year-10 anchor - every surviving i3 on 8891 is the NT$2,990,000 REx."},{"name":"PTT car board - BMW iX xDrive40 two-year / 40,019 km dealer service record","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1712239780.A.D4C.html","note":"Re-fetched and read 2026-08-12. Thread title 'BMWiX4.0兩年四萬公里保養工單紀錄'. Text confirms: 40,019 km at two years; the dealer 冷氣濾網 line was deleted because the owner sourced the same German filter for NT$3,000 + NT$200 fitting; after two years '煞車皮也沒什麼磨損'; all four tires replaced at the dealer in the FIRST year for NT$56,000 after just over 30,000 km, worn to the wear bar; 大美容 ~NT$8,000 a time, 鍍膜 NT$18,000. The itemised invoice amounts (NT$5,931 / NT$6,228, NT$210 labour unit, 10 mm pad reading) are in attached imgur photos only and are used here as image-derived, not text-verified."},{"name":"U-CAR news 68986 - BMW iX 國內上市，320萬與390萬 (2021-12-30)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/68986","note":"Original TW list prices for the iX xDrive40 旗艦版 (NT$3,200,000) and xDrive50 旗艦版 (NT$3,900,000), used as the year-3 and year-5 retention denominators. URL confirmed live 2026-08-12; the price pairing matches the 旗艦版 trim names appearing on the 8891 listings. Headline-level verification only."},{"name":"U-CAR news 79512 - 小改款 i4 eDrive40 售價275萬起","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/79512","note":"Facelift i4 eDrive40 list price NT$2,750,000, the denominator for the 1-1.5 year retention proxy (correct for the 2024-2025 registered cars on 8891). Related-article headlines on the same page also show the facelift pre-sale was NT$2,770,000 - i.e. BMW TW cut NT$20,000 from pre-sale to list - and that the 2026 年式 moved to NT$2,790,000 (2025-11-21). This is the evidence that BMW TW's pre-sale-to-list move runs in both directions."},{"name":"U-CAR news 77906 - BMW iX2 建議售價，純電237萬","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/77906","note":"iX2 xDrive30 M Sport list price NT$2,370,000, denominator for the year-1 BEV SUV retention proxy. Verified 2026-08-12 via the headline '純電237萬、燃油225萬與289萬維持預售，大改款BMW X2與iX2國內上市' (2024-03-28)."},{"name":"U-CAR news 70656 - BMW i4 國內上市，255萬與310萬 (2022-05-26)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/70656","note":"Pre-facelift i4 eDrive40 NT$2,550,000 and i4 M50 NT$3,100,000; the M50 figure is the denominator for the 2023 i4 M50 cross-check at year 3. URL confirmed live 2026-08-12. Headline-level verification only."},{"name":"U-CAR news 75126 - BMW i5 eDrive40 與 M60 國內預售，329萬與485萬","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/75126","note":"i5 eDrive40 pricing NT$3,290,000, used as a secondary year-1 and year-3 retention proxy. URL confirmed live 2026-08-12. Headline-level verification only."},{"name":"CARTURE 車勢文化 - 「BMW i 榮耀共享」優購專案 (2025-01-10)","url":"https://www.carture.com.tw/news/article/34573-BMW%E9%9B%BB%E5%8B%95%E8%BB%8A%E9%8A%B7%E5%94%AE%E5%86%8D%E5%89%B5%E9%AB%98%E5%B3%B0%E7%A9%A9%E5%9D%90%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3%E5%86%A0%E8%BB%8D%E5%AF%B6%E5%BA%A7%EF%BC%8C%E3%80%8CBMW-i%E6%A6%AE%E8%80%80%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB%E3%80%8D%E5%84%AA%E8%B3%BC%E5%B0%88%E6%A1%88%E5%8D%B3%E5%88%BB%E5%95%9F%E5%8B%95%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E8%BB%8A%E5%9E%8B%E5%8F%AF%E4%BA%AB%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%983%E5%B9%B4%E4%B8%8D%E9%99%90%E9%87%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E5%85%85%E9%9B%BB","note":"URL confirmed live 2026-08-12. Documents how BMW Taiwan actually incentivises BEV buyers - 2-3 years of unlimited U-POWER charging plus 原廠第4年延長保固 on iX/i4/iX1 - rather than cutting list price. Basis for setting discounts to zero and for the extended-warranty assumption in plan_notes."}]},"bmw-x1-sdrive20i-m-sport":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr, roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/yr. Every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 x years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). Because of that, used values are quoted from LOW-MILEAGE listings rather than mileage-blind averages, and servicing is modelled as TIME-driven (annual) rather than distance-driven. Tax (牌照稅/燃料稅) and insurance are excluded by design and appear nowhere in this record. Fuel is also not modelled - only purchase, resale and maintenance. All figures are TWD. The car's 48V mild-hybrid system is a starter-generator that cannot propel the car on battery alone, so powertrain is 'gasoline'; it is not a full hybrid. No home-charger or energy costs apply (not a BEV/PHEV).","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Anchored on real near-new U11 DEALER ASKING prices: a factory-certified 2025 X1 sDrive18i xLine, 4,863 km, built 2024/09 registered 2025/03, asking NT$1,630,000 against its ~NT$1,960,000 new price = 83% of list at ~1.2 years; a second near-new 2025 18i (10 km, top spec) asking NT$1,690,000 (~86%). Scaling the 83% dealer-asking ratio onto this car's NT$2,200,000 list gives ~NT$1,826,000 dealer retail asking for a 7,000 km one-year example. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: dealer asking NT$1,826,000 less ~9% = NT$1,660,000 private sale; less a further ~13% = NT$1,440,000 dealer trade-in. Low-mileage listings quoted deliberately for this buyer profile. That is ~76% of real_cost at year 1, i.e. a ~24% first-year loss - the normal German-premium hit in Taiwan and deliberately NOT the ~85-88% a Toyota would hold. Raised NT$20,000 from the researcher's NT$1,640,000 to keep the annual-loss curve monotonically decaying once the year-3 error below was corrected; the change is within the noise of the underlying listings."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED UPWARD from the researcher's NT$1,310,000 - their figure was internally impossible. Real 2023-2024 U11 sDrive20i listings found: (a) 2023 sDrive20i xLine, 出廠 2023/01, 35,749 km, asking NT$1,450,000 as a genuine 自售 PRIVATE listing; (b) 2023 sDrive20i, 56,862 km (built 2023/01, reg 2023/04), DEALER asking NT$1,480,000; (c) 2024 sDrive20i, 16,427 km, BMW Premium Selection 原廠認證, DEALER asking NT$1,660,000. The researcher derived a dealer-retail asking price of NT$1,455,000 for a 21,000 km three-year car - BELOW the observed NT$1,480,000 dealer ask on a 56,862 km car of the same model year, and below the NT$1,450,000 PRIVATE ask on a 35,749 km car of the same model year. A lower-mileage car of the same vintage cannot be worth less, so that anchor is wrong. Corrected build-up: a 2023-vintage 20i with 21,000 km, non-certified, sits between (b) and (c) at ~NT$1,570,000 dealer retail asking; less ~10% = NT$1,420,000 private sale; less a further ~13% = NT$1,230,000 trade-in. Cross-check from the other direction: comp (a) is a real private ask at NT$1,450,000 for a car that is 0.4 yr older, 14,749 km higher and on a lower NT$2,120,000 list - after knocking ~4% off asking to reach a realised price and adjusting for age, mileage and trim, that route also lands ~NT$1,450,000-1,520,000. NT$1,420,000 is the conservative end of the converged range. ~65% of real_cost at year 3."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - no five-year-old U11 exists (this generation only launched in Taiwan 2023-02), so real PREDECESSOR F48 X1 used prices at this age were converted to a retention ratio against the F48's own original list and applied to this car. F48 evidence at 5-6 years old: a 2021 sDrive20i low-mileage top-spec asking NT$1,298,000; a 2020 sDrive20i (built 2019/10, reg 2020/04) 34,072 km BMW-certified asking NT$900,000; a 2020 at NT$1,030,000; a 2020 with 46,000 km asking NT$1,388,000 (high outlier, not anchored on); FindCar averages of NT$948,000 (2021) and NT$962,000 across 13 2020 cars. Average cars sit near NT$950,000 but our 35,000 km car is well under average mileage and belongs at the TOP of the band, so ~NT$1,290,000 dealer retail asking on an F48-equivalent basis (~62% of the F48's ~NT$2,090,000 list). Applied to this car: ~NT$1,310,000 dealer retail asking, less ~10% = NT$1,180,000 private sale, less a further ~14% = NT$1,010,000 trade-in. ~54% of real_cost. Set slightly below a pure ratio transfer because the U11's 1,499cc three-cylinder plus 48V drivetrain is less trusted in the Taiwan used market than the F48's 2.0-litre four - TW owner threads explicitly cite avoiding '48V 的維修機率' as a reason to buy the 18i over the 20i."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor F48 generation, same ratio-transfer method. Real F48 evidence at 7 years old (2019 model year): a 2019 F48 at a Taichung dealer asking NT$869,000, with TW dealer asking averages clustering ~NT$880,000 and clean low-mileage examples reaching ~NT$1,100,000, against a ~NT$1,970,000 F48 sDrive20i list - about 45% of original list on dealer asking for an average car, ~56% for a clean low-mileage one. Our 49,000 km car at 7 years is far below the typical 90,000-100,000 km, so the low-mileage end applies rather than the average: ~NT$1,070,000 implied dealer retail asking, less ~10% = NT$960,000 private sale, less a further ~16% = NT$810,000 trade-in. ~44% of real_cost. The researcher applied the BOTTOM of the F48 band (~40%) to a genuinely low-mileage car, which contradicts the low-mileage buyer profile; corrected to the low-mileage end but still below a pure ratio transfer, because by year 7 the car is outside BMW TW's warranty and outside any BSI package, and the used market prices in 48V starter-generator, electric water pump and 7-speed DCT risk on this drivetrain. The German tail keeps falling here instead of flattening the way a Lexus does."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor F48 generation. Real F48 evidence at 10 years old (2016 model year, sDrive20i): Taiwan dealer askings of NT$458,000, NT$578,000 (80,000 km), NT$599,000 and NT$718,000 for a well-kept example, against the F48's NT$1,890,000 launch list - roughly 30-38% of original list on DEALER ASKING for a decent car. A cross-generation valuation summary puts the whole F48 generation (2015-2022) at a ~NT$538,000 median and the E84 (2010-2015) at ~NT$288,000, consistent with that band. Applied ~33% of list on dealer asking for a 70,000 km ten-year car, which is well under average mileage: ~NT$722,000 implied dealer asking, less ~10% = NT$650,000 private sale, less a further ~18% = NT$530,000 trade-in. ~30% of real_cost. The private-to-trade-in percentage spread widens on cheap old cars because dealers need a roughly fixed absolute margin. The low-mileage credit is partly offset by the three-cylinder/48V repair-risk discount and the fact that a decade-old out-of-warranty BMW in Taiwan is priced on fear rather than condition."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"RAISED from the researcher's NT$6,000. Their figure assumed the BSI 3年/60,000公里 package covers the first service; BMW TW material advertises that package as a limited-time 加贈 promotion ('限時加贈3年/6萬公里BSI原廠保養套裝'), not 標配, so it cannot be assumed. Real TW owner invoices for a dealer oil service: NT$4,834 on a BMW 220i at 7,820 km, and ~NT$6,000 for oil + oil filter + labour reported by another owner; TW owner threads put in-warranty basic servicing 'under NT$10,000' a year. NT$12,000 is the midpoint between a BSI-covered year (~NT$4,000 of uncovered consumables) and a fully out-of-pocket 原廠 year (~NT$10,000-12,000 with wipers and alignment). Defects remain covered by the standard 3年不限里程 warranty either way."},{"y":3,"source":"RAISED from the researcher's NT$16,000, same reason as year 1 - the BSI package is a limited-time promotion, not standard equipment, so two years of servicing cannot be assumed free. Build-up at 原廠 rates: two annual services at ~NT$8,000 each = NT$16,000, brake fluid ~NT$3,500, wipers/alignment/consumables ~NT$5,000, A/C and minor checks ~NT$5,000, giving ~NT$29,500 fully out of pocket; NT$26,000 books a partial-BSI expectation. Service pricing anchored on real TW owner invoices (NT$4,834 oil-only, ~NT$6,000 oil + filter + labour) plus filters. Spark plugs are nominally a BSI item but at 21,000 km over three years they are nowhere near the ~60,000 km interval, so they fall into the 3-5 year window instead, on age. Mechanical defects are still warranty-covered in this window."},{"y":5,"source":"This is the first fully unsubsidised window - the 3年不限里程 warranty and any BSI package both expired at year 3, which is why the cost jumps by an order of magnitude. Tires: Taiwan retail for 225/55R18 runflat starts ~NT$4,222/tire for budget Hankook (~NT$16,888 fitted for four with free 3D alignment); the M Sport's 19-inch premium runflats (Bridgestone/Michelin/Pirelli) run NT$8,500-10,000 each, so ~NT$40,000 for four fitted and aligned. Brakes: a TW BMW dealer quote for front+rear pads is ~NT$26,000 (independents quote NT$13,000 OEM-equivalent or NT$7,000 Textar); front-only booked here. Annual service: NT$8,000/visit at dealer, extrapolated from reported NT$4,834-6,000 oil-only invoices plus filters. Battery and plug pricing from TW BMW parts/labour norms. Modelled expectation, not an observed invoice."},{"y":7,"source":"Extrapolated from Taiwan BMW out-of-warranty repair norms rather than from a published table - no official TW price list for these items is public. Item selection is grounded in the documented failure profile of the B38 three-cylinder and its cooling system: TW/JP owner discussions and repair sites cite the electric water pump (impeller damage causing poor cooling, seal ageing causing coolant leaks) and ignition coils as the recurring BMW items at this age. Dealer brake pricing anchored on the ~NT$26,000 front+rear pad quote reported by TW owners, with individual OEM front pad sets with sensor at NT$5,100-5,200 and discs at NT$2,700-4,300. Water pump and control arms are probability-weighted, not booked at full cost, because they do not fail on every car. Low confidence: these are modelled expectations for a car this age, not observed invoices for a 2026 U11 (which cannot exist yet)."},{"y":10,"source":"Extrapolated. Works out to ~NT$77,000/yr across the 7-10 window, the realistic shape for an out-of-warranty German premium SUV in Taiwan and deliberately far above what a RAV4 or CX-5 would cost over the same three years. The 48V starter-generator allowance is the item that most distinguishes this car from a plain-gasoline equivalent and is the reason Taiwanese buyers on owner forums openly choose the sDrive18i to avoid '48V 的維修機率'. Big-ticket risk items are probability-weighted rather than booked in full, so this is an expected value, not a worst case - a car that needs the ISG outright plus dampers could exceed NT$320,000 in this window, while a lucky one might come in near NT$150,000. No genuine 10-year data exists for this generation; this is a modelled figure built from TW BMW dealer labour and parts norms and the documented failure profile of the B38 + 48V drivetrain. The NT$60,000-90,000 ISG replacement range and the ~30% failure probability behind the NT$22,000 expected value are estimates, not sourced invoices - this is the single largest modelled item in the table."}],"sources":[{"name":"Yahoo Autos Taiwan - 2026 BMW X1 sDrive20i M Sport trim page","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-x1-2026-sdrive20i-m-sport","note":"Fetched and read in full. Confirms NT$2,200,000 建議售價, 1,499cc inline-3 turbo, 2nd-gen 48V mild hybrid with 20hp eBoost, 170hp combined, 24.5 kgm, 7-speed DCT, sDrive FWD, MY2026, and sDrive18i M Sport at NT$1,990,000. Primary source for both the price and the gasoline (not hybrid) classification."},{"name":"UDN 聯合新聞網 autos - 全新年式BMW X1 M SPORT豪華運動休旅 進化登場","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/9122502","note":"Fetched and read in full. Independent confirmation of X1 sDrive18i M Sport NT$1,990,000 / sDrive20i M Sport NT$2,200,000, and that 全車系皆標配 M Sport 套件. This replaces the researcher's cited BMW Taiwan press-release URL, which I could not fetch and could not confirm exists."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車頻道 - BMW X1 sDrive20i M Sport (original scout's source)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/x1/7049/overall","note":"The original scout's cited page. Direct fetch returned HTTP 403 (bot-blocked), so I did NOT read it. Its NT$2,200,000 figure was re-verified independently against Yahoo Autos and UDN, and it holds. Listed for traceability, not as a source I personally read."},{"name":"X1 M Sport Edition launch pricing, aggregated search","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=BMW+X1+sDrive20i+M+Sport+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+220%E8%90%AC+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+2026+%E5%BB%BA%E8%AD%B0%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9","note":"Real URL I fetched. Returns the BMW Taiwan announcement text quoted verbatim across CarFun, Lian-Car, U-CAR and TestLA: '導入X1 sDrive18i M Sport與X1 sDrive20i M Sport兩款車型，建議售價分別為新台幣199萬元與220萬元', plus the note that this is a NT$30,000 increase over the superseded xLine trims. Third independent confirmation of the list price."},{"name":"U11 Taiwan launch and model-year list prices, aggregated search","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=BMW+X1+U11+2023%E5%B9%B4+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+sDrive18i+sDrive20i+xLine+212%E8%90%AC+190%E8%90%AC","note":"Real URL I fetched. Establishes the denominators used to turn used listings into retention ratios: U11 launched TW 2023-02-23 at 18i xLine NT$1,900,000 / 20i xLine NT$2,120,000 / iX1 xDrive30 NT$2,220,000 ('建議售價依序為190萬、212萬、222萬不等，與預售價相同'), then 汎德 raised X1 prices NT$40,000 in Sept 2023 (20i xLine to NT$2,160,000)."},{"name":"Used-market pull - U11 X1 (2023-2025) listings, aggregated search","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=BMW+X1+U11+2023+2024+%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%A4%E8%BB%8A+sDrive20i+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+%E8%90%AC+8891+%E9%87%8C%E7%A8%8B","note":"Real URL I fetched. THE KEY EVIDENCE for the year-3 correction. Surfaced a genuine 自售 PRIVATE listing - '出廠：2023年1月 行使里程：35749 售價：145萬 自售' for a 2023 sDrive20i xLine - alongside a DEALER listing at NT$1,480,000 for a 2023 sDrive20i with 56,862 km (YD認證中古車), and a 2024 sDrive20i with 20,000 km at a dealer. Having a real private-sale figure and a real dealer figure for the same model year is what exposed the researcher's year-3 dealer-retail anchor as too low."},{"name":"Used-market pull - 2025 X1 near-new listings, aggregated search","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=BMW+X1+2025%E5%B9%B4+%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%A4%E8%BB%8A+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+%E8%90%AC+%E8%BC%89%E9%80%94%E8%BB%8A+%E5%B0%91%E8%B7%91","note":"Source of the year-1 anchor (carried over from the researcher, whose reading of it I accept): 2025 sDrive18i xLine U11, 4,863 km, reg 2025/03, dealer asking NT$1,630,000 against a stated NT$1,960,000 new price (83% of list, dealer asking); plus a 10 km 2025 18i at NT$1,690,000."},{"name":"Used-market pull - F48 X1 2018-2021 listings (5- and 7-year analog)","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=BMW+X1+2019%E5%B9%B4+2020%E5%B9%B4+F48+%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%A4%E8%BB%8A+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+%E8%90%AC+sDrive20i+%E9%87%8C%E7%A8%8B+8891","note":"Real URL I fetched. Basis for the year-5 and year-7 extrapolations: 2020 sDrive20i F48 (built 2019/10, reg 2020/04) 34,072 km BMW-certified at NT$900,000; a 2020 with 46,000 km at NT$1,388,000 (high outlier); a 13-car 2020 average of NT$962,000; a 2019 F48 at NT$869,000 (宏基汽車, Taichung). These confirm the researcher's ~NT$880,000 seven-year F48 anchor but show the five-year band is centred lower than they assumed."},{"name":"BMW X1 cross-generation used valuation, aggregated search","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=BMW+X1+%E4%B8%AD%E5%8F%A4%E8%BB%8A+%E8%A1%8C%E6%83%85+%E6%94%B6%E8%B3%BC%E5%83%B9+%E8%B3%A3%E8%BB%8A+%E6%8A%98%E8%88%8A+%E4%BA%8C%E6%89%8B+U11","note":"Real URL I fetched. Cross-generation medians used as a sanity check on the tail: '第 1 代 E84（2010-2015）中位約 28.8 萬、第 2 代 F48（2015-2022）約 53.8 萬、第 3 代 U11（2023 後）約 163 萬'; FindCar reports 167 BMW X1 used cars at a NT$636,000 average. All dealer/marketplace asking prices, not private or trade-in."},{"name":"BMW Taiwan warranty and BSI service package terms, aggregated search","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=BMW+%E6%B1%8E%E5%BE%B7+%E6%96%B0%E8%BB%8A+%E6%A8%99%E9%85%8D+3%E5%B9%B4%E4%B8%8D%E9%99%90%E9%87%8C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BF%9D%E5%9B%BA+BSI+%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A+3%E5%B9%B46%E8%90%AC%E5%85%AC%E9%87%8C+%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%A8%99%E9%85%8D","note":"Real URL I fetched. THE KEY EVIDENCE for the maintenance correction. BMW TW dealer material consistently frames the BSI package as a limited-time promotion, not standard equipment: '限時加贈3年/6萬公里BSI原廠保養套裝', '本月交車領牌更限時加贈', '全車系全面加贈BMW原廠3年保養套裝'. The repeated 限時 / 加贈 wording is why years 1 and 3 were raised off the researcher's near-zero BSI assumption."},{"name":"BMW Taiwan owner maintenance invoices, aggregated search","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=BMW+%E5%85%A9%E5%B9%B4%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1+%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A+%E8%B2%BB%E7%94%A8+%E5%8E%9F%E5%BB%A0+1%E8%90%AC+%E9%A4%8A%E8%BB%8A+%E4%B8%80%E5%B9%B4+%E8%B2%BB%E7%94%A8+%E5%85%83+%E8%B3%93%E5%A3%AB","note":"Carried over from the researcher. Actual TW owner invoices: NT$4,834 for a dealer oil service on a BMW 220i at 7,820 km; a Dcard owner at ~NT$6,000 for oil + oil filter + labour; general TW owner consensus that in-warranty basic servicing stays 'under NT$10,000' a year. Anchors the NT$8,000/visit dealer figure used in the post-warranty windows."},{"name":"BMW Taiwan brake and parts pricing, aggregated search","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=BMW+%E7%85%9E%E8%BB%8A%E4%BE%86%E4%BE%86%E7%89%87+%E6%9B%B4%E6%8F%9B+%E5%8E%9F%E5%BB%A0+%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC+%E5%85%83+X1+%E5%89%8D%E5%BE%8C+%E7%A2%9F%E7%9B%A4","note":"Carried over from the researcher. Dealer brake benchmark: 原廠 front+rear pads quoted ~NT$26,000, versus NT$13,000 OEM-equivalent or NT$7,000 Textar at independents; individual OEM front pad sets with sensor at NT$5,100-5,200 and discs at NT$2,700-4,300. Anchors the years-5/7/10 brake lines."},{"name":"Taiwan tire retail pricing for X1 sizes, aggregated search","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=BMW+X1+%E8%BC%AA%E8%83%8E+225%2F55R18+%E9%98%B2%E7%88%86%E8%83%8E+%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC+%E5%9B%9B%E6%A2%9D+%E5%85%83+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3","note":"Carried over from the researcher. Hankook 225/55R18 runflat at NT$4,222/tire (~NT$16,888 fitted for four, with free 3D alignment) sets the budget floor; the M Sport's 19-inch premium runflats sit at NT$8,500-10,000/tire, giving the ~NT$40,000-42,000 per-set figures used at years 5 and 10."},{"name":"Mobile01 / PTT - BMW X1 owner running-cost and 48V risk discussion","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=mobile01+BMW+X1+18i+20i+%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A+%E8%B2%BB%E7%94%A8+%E5%85%83+%E5%B9%B4%E5%BA%A6","note":"Carried over from the researcher. A TW X1 owner explicitly choosing the sDrive18i over the sDrive20i to avoid '48v的維修機率' - the qualitative basis for the 48V repair-risk discount applied at years 5/7/10 and for the ISG allowance in the year-10 window."},{"name":"B38 three-cylinder / 48V known failure items, aggregated search","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=BMW+X1+U11+%E4%B8%89%E7%BC%B8+48V+%E6%95%85%E9%9A%9C+%E7%B6%AD%E4%BF%AE+%E9%9B%BB%E5%AD%90%E6%B0%B4%E5%B9%AB%E6%B5%A6+%E9%BB%9E%E7%81%AB%E7%B7%9A%E5%9C%88+%E8%B2%BB%E7%94%A8","note":"Carried over from the researcher. Confirms the failure-item selection qualitatively (electric water pump impeller damage and seal ageing causing coolant leaks; ignition coils; three-cylinder vibration/noise concerns). It did NOT yield NT$ repair prices, so the amounts in the years-7 and years-10 windows are probability-weighted estimates, which is why both carry 'low' confidence."}]},"bmw-x2-sdrive20i-m-sport":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year; every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000), far below the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year. Because of this, used values are taken from LOW-MILEAGE listings rather than mileage-blind averages, and servicing is treated as time-driven (annual) rather than mileage-driven - the car never reaches BMW's mileage-based CBS intervals within a year. POWERTRAIN: the sDrive20i uses the B38 1.5L turbo 3-cylinder with a 48V ISG mild-hybrid system (156 hp engine + 19 hp ISG = 170 hp combined). It CANNOT move on battery alone, so it is classified 'gasoline', not 'hybrid'. Vehicle tax, insurance and fuel are excluded from every figure by design. All used figures start from dealer-retail asking prices observed on 8891 and are converted DOWN to private-sale and then trade-in level (see each value_checkpoints source string). Used supply of the current U10 generation in Taiwan is genuinely thin - a nationwide 8891 X2 search returns ~40 cars on the first page across both generations, of which 10 are U10 - so near-new asking prices are sticky rather than market-clearing, which is why a wide 12-13% haircut is applied to reach private-sale level.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"high","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REAL LISTINGS, current generation (U10), re-verified line by line by this fact-check against the live 8891 nationwide X2 listing (auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/x2). Seven 2025-registered sDrive20i M Sport cars are on sale at DEALER RETAIL asking prices of 183.8萬 (9,000 km), 183.8萬 (14,000 km), 186.0萬 (8,800 km), 188.8萬 (14,000 km), 189.8萬 (3,500 km), 190.0萬 (3,000 km) and 195.0萬 (3,273 km), plus two more at 電洽 (one a CPO 認證車). ADJUSTMENT MADE: the private-sale figure is set 13% BELOW a conservative 186.0萬 dealer-retail pick - not below the 188.8萬 median of those seven - giving NT$1,620,000; the 13% haircut is the wide end of the 8-15% band, justified by genuinely thin U10 demand and by the fact that asking prices on a ten-car nationwide market are sticky rather than market-clearing. Dealer trade-in is set a further 13% below private at NT$1,405,000. Do NOT read the 186萬 asking figure as owner proceeds. Mileage matched: our 7,000 km sits inside the observed 3,000-14,000 km band, so no mileage extrapolation was needed."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"INTERPOLATED between two verified anchors - no genuine 3-year U10 exists (the generation reached Taiwan in 2024). Anchor A (real, verified on 8891 today): a 2024-build sDrive20i M Sport with 9,000 km asks NT$1,728,000 dealer retail, i.e. 76.8% of the 225萬 it was sold at. Anchor B: the 5-year dealer-asking level of ~NT$1,050,000 derived below. A geometric decay between them is 0.847/year, putting 3-year DEALER ASKING at ~NT$1,460,000; that is shaded to ~NT$1,445,000 because German compact SUVs fall hardest in years 1-3. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private = 12% below dealer asking (NT$1,270,000); dealer trade-in = 13% below private (NT$1,105,000). CORRECTION TO PRIOR DRAFT: an earlier version put this point at NT$1,335,000, anchored on 8891's own list-anchored 持有3年預估折舊後價值 of 159.3萬. That produced a curve in which the car lost MORE per year between years 3 and 5 (NT$202,500/yr) than between years 1 and 3 (NT$142,500/yr) - i.e. depreciation accelerating with age, the opposite of the front-loaded German shape. 8891's residual model is anchored to list price and is not a market observation, so it was dropped as an anchor."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"PREDECESSOR-GENERATION RATIO TRANSFER (F39 X2, 2018-2023) - no 5-year U10 exists. All comparators re-verified on 8891 today. Real 5-year F39 dealer asking: 2021 sDrive18i Sport Edition 30,000 km NT$928,000; 60,000 km NT$888,000; 52,000 km NT$838,000; 80,200 km NT$798,000 - against its original TW list of NT$1,880,000 (Yahoo Autos 2021 X2 table, verified: 'sDrive18i Sport Edition 188'), i.e. 42-49% retention with the low-mileage 30,000 km car at 49.4%. The 18i is the cheap base trim and always retains a higher PERCENTAGE, so the 20i is priced off its own comparator: a 6-year 2020 sDrive20i M Sport 領航版 with 33,000 km asks NT$880,000 against its NT$2,180,000 list (Yahoo Autos 2020 X2 table, verified: 'sDrive20i M Sport領航版 218') = 40.4%. Interpolating that 20i point back one year to 5 years gives ~46% of list; applied to this car's NT$2,260,000 list that is ~NT$1,050,000 dealer retail asking. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private = 12% below (NT$925,000); dealer trade-in = 14% below private (NT$795,000). Our 35,000 km closely matches the 30,000-33,000 km comparators, so the low-mileage premium is already embedded. Confidence low because the ratio is transferred from the previous generation."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXPLICITLY EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor F39 X2 - no 7-year U10 exists and none can. All comparators re-verified on 8891 today. Real F39 asking prices: 2019 sDrive20i M Sport 100,000 km NT$789,000 and 2019 M Sport X 128,000 km NT$749,000, against a NT$2,150,000 original list (Yahoo Autos 2018 X2 table, verified: 'sDrive20i M Sport X 215') = 34.8-36.7%. IMPORTANT CORRECTION TO PRIOR DRAFT: the low-mileage premium in this age band is much weaker than first claimed. A 2018 M Sport X with only 15,000 km asks NT$788,000 while the same trim at 70,000 km asks NT$778,000 and at 80,000 km asks NT$688,000 - so 55,000 km of extra mileage is worth about NT$10,000, not the '+4 to +5 retention points' originally asserted. Old F39 asking prices cluster at NT$680,000-790,000 almost regardless of odometer. Applying ~38% of list (not 39%) to NT$2,260,000 gives ~NT$858,000 dealer retail asking at 7 years. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private = 12% below (NT$755,000); dealer trade-in = 15% below private (NT$640,000). Confidence low: ratio transferred from the previous generation, and the car is out of warranty here so the used market prices in repair risk - the German tail keeps falling rather than flattening."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXPLICITLY EXTRAPOLATED, CROSS-MODEL - no 10-year X2 of any generation exists (the F39 reached Taiwan in 2018, so the oldest X2 on the road today is ~8 years). Proxy: BMW X1 F48 (2016-2022), the closest BMW front-drive compact SUV on the same platform family, whose 2016 builds are exactly 10 years old now. Verified on SUM 汽車網 today: a 2016 F48 X1 2.0L with 76,690 km asks NT$478,000 (listing carinfo-641144, 君豪汽車, 高雄市), with a 101,150 km car in the same search, against a NT$1,970,000 original list (Yahoo Autos 2016 X1 table) = ~24-27%. Sanity-checked against the oldest real X2 data: 8-year 2018 F39 sDrive20i M Sport X cars ask NT$688,000-788,000 = 32-37% of their 215萬 list, so a further fall to ~26% by year 10 is consistent rather than assumed. Our buyer's 70,000 km is at or below every comparator, so the top of the band applies, shaded slightly down because the X2's coupe-SUV body has thinner used demand in Taiwan than the X1's. Ratio used ~26% of list = ~NT$586,000 dealer retail asking. ADJUSTMENT MADE: private = 13% below (NT$510,000); dealer trade-in = 16% below private (NT$430,000). Confidence low: this is a cross-model, cross-generation transfer, stated openly rather than invented."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"BMW Taiwan 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty plus the 贈3年/4萬公里原廠保養套裝 incentive listed under 廠商優惠 on 8891's BMW X2 model page and confirmed in the 'BMW仲夏禮遇' August 2026 campaign coverage verified on Yahoo Autos. Priced as a blend of the package-secured and package-not-secured cases rather than assuming the promotion is obtained; out-of-pocket residual estimated, not quoted."},{"y":3,"source":"Same package/warranty basis as year 1 (8891 X2 廠商優惠 + BMW TW 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty, campaign verified on Yahoo Autos August 2026). Priced as a blend rather than assuming the conditional promotion applies. This is the last period that benefits from any subsidy. Residual out-of-pocket estimated, not quoted."},{"y":5,"source":"Parts-and-labour build-up at BMW Taiwan dealer rates; no published TW price table was obtainable (see plan_notes). Tyre and battery pricing from typical TW retail for 225/50 R19 run-flats and AGM batteries. NOTE: an earlier draft cited a 'HOT 好車大聯盟 保養工資表' as a labour-rate floor; that URL was checked by this fact-check and is a used-car search page that publishes no labour rates, so the citation has been removed rather than repeated."},{"y":7,"source":"Parts-and-labour build-up at BMW Taiwan dealer rates; no published TW price table was obtainable (see plan_notes). Interval assumptions follow BMW CBS practice adapted to a time-driven, low-mileage profile. The DCT oil service and full disc replacement are the two items that make this period materially more expensive than a Japanese equivalent at the same age and mileage."},{"y":10,"source":"Parts-and-labour build-up at BMW Taiwan dealer rates for a fully out-of-warranty German premium SUV; no published TW price table was obtainable and no owner receipts could be retrieved (Mobile01 thread bodies return HTTP 403 via Akamai and web search was unavailable this session) - see plan_notes. Item selection follows the documented B38 / 48V ISG failure pattern rather than a generic schedule. This 3-year window carries the largest single share of lifetime maintenance, which is exactly the German out-of-warranty tail the model is meant to capture."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - BMW X2 車款介紹","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/x2/7060/overall","note":"Fetched and read directly by this fact-check. Body text confirms the December 2025 model-year change: 'X2 sDrive20i M Sport 調漲 1 萬、來到 226 萬'. Its own header still shows the stale '225 - 289 萬'. Also the primary source for the powertrain: 'sDrive20i 採代號 B38 的 1.5 升 TwinPower Turbo 直列 3 缸汽油渦輪引擎搭配 ISG 48V 輕油電系統，引擎本體具有 156 匹最大馬力、24.5 公斤米扭力', 7-speed Steptronic DCT, 19-inch 871M wheels."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - 2026 BMW X2 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/bmw-x2-2026","note":"Fetched directly. Independent confirmation of the list price: '共2筆 2026 BMW X2 226 - 289 ... sDrive20i M Sport 226'. Also the evidence for the powertrain mislabel warning - its spec line reads '1499cc | 156hp@4700rpm | 油電混合' for a car that cannot drive on battery alone."},{"name":"8891 新車 - BMW X2 價格車款介紹","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/photoModel-info.html?k=16789","note":"Reachable (HTTP 200) but served as a JS shell; only the title '2026 BMW X2 價格車款介紹-8891汽車' is extractable without a browser. Cited for the 廠商優惠 (120萬48期0利率, 贈3年/4萬公里保養套裝 指定年式車型) but NOT independently re-verified by this fact-check - the price and campaign claims are carried by U-CAR and Yahoo instead."},{"name":"8891 新車 - BMW X2 2026年式 用車成本解析","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/kind-cost/16789?myid=27558","note":"Reachable but a JS shell; title only ('BMW X2 2026年式用車成本解析'). Its 持有3年預估折舊後價值 estimate was DROPPED as an anchor for the 3-year checkpoint because it is a list-anchored model output, not a market observation, and it was pushing the 3-year value too high. Its 保養 field reportedly reads 暫無數據."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW X2 全部在售車輛 (canonical)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/x2","note":"PRIMARY used-value source, fully parsed by this fact-check (40 listings on page 1, both generations). Supplied: the U10 near-new band (2025 builds, 3,000-14,000 km, 183.8/183.8/186.0/188.8/189.8/190.0/195.0萬 plus two 電洽); the 2-year point (2024 build, 9,000 km, 172.8萬); the 5-year F39 points (2021 18i Sport Edition at 3萬 km 92.8萬, 6萬 km 88.8萬, 5.2萬 km 83.8萬, 8.02萬 km 79.8萬); the 6-year 20i cross-check (2020 sDrive20i M Sport 領航版, 3.3萬 km, 88.0萬); and the 7-8 year points (2019 20i M Sport 10萬 km 78.9萬, 2019 M Sport X 12.8萬 km 74.9萬, 2018 M Sport X 1.5萬 km 78.8萬 / 7萬 km 77.8萬 / 8萬 km 68.8萬). NOTE: the previously cited filter URL 'auto.8891.com.tw/?b=6&k=16789' just redirects here - k=16789 is the NEW-car model id and does not filter the used site to the U10 generation."},{"name":"8891 新車 - BMW X2 購車菜單/折價空間","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/menu/bmw/x2","note":"Reachable (HTTP 200) but JS-rendered. Buyer-side 菜單 requests for the 2026 sDrive20i M Sport showing budgets of 198.0萬 and 200.0萬 - used to sanity-check and reject as aspirational the discount level. Not independently re-verified in this pass."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - BMW X1 中古車搜尋","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?brand=BMW&model=X1","note":"Fetched and parsed. Used for the 10-year proxy: verified listing carinfo-641144 - 'BMW X1 F48 47.8萬 2016' with 76,690 km, 2000cc, 君豪汽車 高雄市 - plus a 101,150 km car in the same result set."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - BMW X2 中古車搜尋","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?brand=BMW&model=X2","note":"Fetched and parsed. Second used-car network; six F39 X2 listings including the 61,150 km car cited as an 8-year low-mileage data point. Corroborates 8891 rather than adding new price levels."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - 2018 BMW X2 價格表","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/bmw-x2-2018","note":"Fetched and verified: '共4筆 2018 BMW X2 185 - 215 ... sDrive18i 185 ... sDrive18i M Sport X 195 ... sDrive20i 205 ... sDrive20i M Sport X 215'. Denominator for the 7- and 8-year retention ratios."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - 2020 BMW X2 價格表","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/bmw-x2-2020","note":"Fetched and verified: '2020 BMW X2 188 - 292 ... sDrive18i領航版 188 ... sDrive20i M Sport領航版 218 ... M35i 292'. Denominator for the 6-year 20i low-mileage cross-check that sets the 5-year level."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - 2021 BMW X2 價格表","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/bmw-x2-2021","note":"Fetched and verified: '2021 BMW X2 188 - 218 ... sDrive18i Sport Edition 188 ... sDrive20i M Mesh Edition 218'. Denominator for the 5-year F39 checkpoint."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - 2016 BMW X1 價格表","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/bmw-x1-2016","note":"F48 X1 original list prices (sDrive18i 175萬, sDrive20i 197萬) - denominator for the 10-year cross-model proxy. Not independently re-verified in this pass; the 10-year point is low confidence for this reason among others."},{"name":"CarStuff via Yahoo - 「BMW仲夏禮遇」限時呈獻 (2026-08-11)","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/%E3%80%8Cbmw%E4%BB%B2%E5%A4%8F%E7%A6%AE%E9%81%87%E3%80%8D%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%91%88%E7%8D%BB%EF%BC%81%E6%9C%AC%E6%9C%88%E5%85%A5%E4%B8%BB%E5%8D%B3%E4%BA%AB%E5%B0%8A%E6%A6%AE%E8%B1%AA%E8%8F%AF%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%9A%E5%85%83%E5%84%AA%E8%B3%BC%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5%E5%AF%A6%E6%96%BD-233825935.html","note":"BMW Taiwan's live August 2026 campaign. Its presence and date (2026-08-10 / 2026-08-11) were confirmed via the Yahoo Autos X2 pages, which surface the article and its summary: 汎德 pays in kind - 晶華酒店集團三天兩夜專屬套裝行程 stated as 整體禮遇價值超過新台幣3萬元, plus 0% finance and a 3年/4萬公里 service package on designated model years - rather than cutting list price. Basis for the modest cash-discount assumption and for the conditional early-period maintenance treatment."},{"name":"KingAutos - 2026 BMW X2 規格價格","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/bmw/x2","note":"Spec cross-check: 225/50 R19 tyre size, M Sport wheels, front strut / rear multi-link, kerb weight ~1,570 kg - used to size tyre and brake replacement costs. Secondary; the tyre size is independently consistent with U-CAR's 19-inch 871M wheel note."}]},"bmw-x5-xdrive30d-m-sport":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, far below the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year. Every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). At this mileage BMW's CBS condition-based servicing is driven by the 12-month clock, not the mileage trigger, so the car takes roughly one service per year regardless of distance and the cost profile is dominated by items that age out (fluids, rubber, batteries, tyre sidewalls) rather than wear out. Used-value estimates are anchored on genuinely low-mileage listings, not on mileage-blind averages. Tax and insurance are EXCLUDED by design from every figure here; for reference only, U-CAR's spec table (re-fetched directly this round, HTTP 200) lists 牌照稅 15,210/yr and 燃料費 4,320/yr for this car — the 4,320 looked wrong at first glance but is correct, because Taiwan's 汽車燃料使用費 charges diesel vehicles on a much lower scale than petrol (the sibling 2,998cc petrol xDrive40i on the same U-CAR table is charged 7,200). POWERTRAIN CLASSIFICATION: U-CAR's spec table states 動力系統 48V輕油電混合 / 能源 柴油. The 48V ISG (Integrated Starter-Generator) mild-hybrid adds about 9kW on acceleration but cannot move the car on electricity alone, so this is NOT a 'hybrid'. The batch rule's literal wording maps 48V systems to 'gasoline', but that clause exists to stop MHEVs being called hybrids and is written around petrol MHEVs; calling a 2,993cc turbodiesel 'gasoline' would be factually false. Classified 'diesel', which is also the convention already used by the sibling record in this batch for the Mercedes GLE 300 d 4MATIC — another 48V diesel MHEV. The 48V hardware is documented in purchase.notes and carried as an explicit out-of-warranty risk item in the year-7 and year-10 maintenance windows. Low annual mileage is a specific negative for this diesel: short, cold, low-speed urban trips are the worst case for DPF (diesel particulate filter) regeneration, and that risk is priced into the later maintenance periods.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"LOWERED from the researcher's 2,620,000, and confidence downgraded from high to medium. The underlying 8891 crawl (192 unique BMW X5 listings after de-duplication, re-analysed independently this round from the cached crawl at /tmp/x5all.json) does support diesel comps at 車商售價 292.0萬 for 2025-registered 'X5 2025款 xDrive30d xLine 3.0L' at 3,800 km and 3,816 km, plus a '2025款 2025 30D' at 292.0萬/3,000 km. TWO PROBLEMS WITH LEANING ON THAT NUMBER. (1) All three are the same 292.0萬 price point and the researcher's own open_questions concede they are syndicated copies of probably one or two physical cars — so the diesel age-1 anchor is a single observation, not a cluster. (2) 292.0萬 against the xDrive30d xLine's verified 345萬 list is 84.6% retention on a one-year-old German diesel SUV, which is a Toyota-shaped number and reflects the well-known padding of the near-new asking segment. METHOD USED INSTEAD: anchor on the deeper petrol set. The same crawl holds five 2025-registered xDrive40i M Sport listings at 328.0/328.0/325.0/319.0/308.0萬 across 3,000-9,000 km; against that trim's 392萬 list those run 83.7% / 83.7% / 82.9% / 81.4% / 78.6%, median ~82.9%. Taking ~82% of list as the dealer RETAIL ask gives 3,540,000 * 0.82 = ~2,900,000. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: 車商售價 is what a dealer asks, not what an owner receives, so private_sale_price is set 12% BELOW that dealer ask = 2,550,000; dealer_tradein_price is a further 12.5% below the private figure = 2,230,000. Mileage needed no separate premium — the comps sit at 3,000-9,000 km against this buyer's 7,000 km. RESULT: 74.0% of real_cost, in line with the German cohort in this batch (GLC 74.0%, Q5 73.7%, X3 74.2%, Cayenne 75.3%) and a few points above the GLE 300 d's 70.6%, which is defensible given the X5's stronger class position and this buyer's very low mileage. Confidence medium, not high: the diesel anchor is one syndicated car, the working anchor is a different fuel and trim scaled across, and every figure is an ask rather than a transaction."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Essentially confirmed, nudged from 2,100,000 to 2,080,000, confidence downgraded high -> medium. This remains the best-evidenced point in the record and my independent re-analysis of the cached 8891 crawl reproduces it. Real comps at 2023 registration ('X5 2024款 xDrive30d xLine 3.0L', the direct predecessor trim): 車商售價 243.0萬 at 20,400 km and 243.0萬 at 20,500 km — essentially this buyer's exact 21,000 km. Bracketing comps on either side: 265.0萬 at 3,300 km and 239.0萬 at 52,000 km, so the 243.0萬 pair sits sensibly inside its own mileage bracket. Petrol cross-check from the same crawl: 2023-registered xDrive40i M Sport at 275.0萬/18,000 km. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: 243.0/345 = 70.4% dealer retail retention for the diesel; 275.0/392 = 70.2% for the petrol — two independent reads converging within 0.2 points, which is the tightest agreement anywhere in this dataset. Trimmed to 68% because 2023-registered cars are ~2.5-3.0 years old rather than a full 3.0 and because dealer asks are sticky: 3,540,000 * 0.68 = ~2,410,000 dealer RETAIL. private_sale_price set ~13.5% below that dealer ask = 2,080,000 (the extra half-point versus year 1 reflects that asks at this age have had longer to go stale). dealer_tradein_price a further 12.5% below = 1,820,000. That is 60.4% of real_cost, a 13.6-point fall from year 1 — front-loaded, as the German pattern requires, and close to the GLE 300 d's 59.4%. Confidence lowered to medium rather than high because the two 243.0萬 entries are very likely syndicated copies of one physical car, the comps are the xLine trim scaled up to M Sport 鉑金版, and asks are not transactions."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Confirmed at essentially the researcher's level (1,560,000 -> 1,550,000); the small move is arithmetic housekeeping after real_cost changed, not a disagreement. EXTRAPOLATED, because no 5-year-old xDrive30d exists in Taiwan — the pre-facelift G05 diesel sold here was the 4-cylinder xDrive25d — so this rests on two sibling anchors from the cached 8891 crawl. Anchor A (diesel, wrong engine size): 2021-registered xDrive25d 旗艦版 at 158.8萬/59,000 km and 豪華版 at 143.0萬/60,000 km; against the verified 305萬 list for the 2019/8 xDrive25d 旗艦版 that is ~52% dealer retail at 59,000 km. Anchor B (six-cylinder, the closer mechanical analogue to a 3.0 diesel): 2021-registered xDrive40i 旗艦版 at 168.0萬/92,000 km and 158.8萬/140,000 km, ~41% of an estimated ~408萬 list. LOW-MILEAGE ADJUSTMENT: every comp carries 59,000-140,000 km against this buyer's 35,000 km, and the same dataset sizes the premium directly — the 25d 旗艦版 asks 158.8萬 at 59,000 km but 136.8-139.0萬 at 97,000-100,200 km, i.e. +15-16% for ~40,000 fewer km. Applying that gradient lifts anchor A to ~57% and anchor B to ~49%; the two disagree materially, mostly because anchor A's 305萬 denominator is a 2019 figure applied to a 2021 car and is therefore probably too low. Blended and weighted toward the six-cylinder = ~50% dealer RETAIL -> 3,540,000 * 0.50 = ~1,770,000. private_sale_price 12.5% below = 1,550,000; dealer_tradein_price a further 13% below = 1,350,000. That is 45.0% of real_cost, mid-pack among the German cars in this batch. The 3-to-5 window is the steepest single stretch of the curve, and the mechanism is real rather than an artefact: the 3-year 原廠保固 expires inside it and the Taiwanese market applies a discrete out-of-warranty discount at that boundary, visible in the raw asks (age-3 30d 243萬, age-4 40i 210萬, age-5 comps 136.8-168萬)."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED; lowered slightly from 1,260,000 to hold the tail falling once real_cost changed. Same-generation G05 data does exist at this age — Taiwan launched the G05 in Dec 2018 — and my re-analysis of the cached crawl finds 28 unique listings at 2019 registration. But Taiwan dropped the xDrive30d after the 2019 first wave in favour of the xDrive25d, so NO 7-year-old 30d is on the market and the comps are the six-cylinder petrol 40i plus the 4-cylinder 25d. Best low-mileage comps: xDrive40i 旗艦版 159.0萬/60,800 km, xDrive40i M Sport 155.8萬/71,000 km, xDrive40i 旗艦版 148.0萬/63,000 km, with the high-mileage tail running 140.0萬/93,300 km, 129.8萬/102,000 km, 126.0萬/100,000 km and 122.8萬/139,700 km. Diesel anchor: xDrive25d 旗艦版 118.8萬 at 110,000-111,000 km. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: 159.0萬 adjusted up ~5% for this buyer's 49,000 km versus the comp's 60,800 km gives ~167萬, against an ESTIMATED ~398萬 list for the 2019 xDrive40i 旗艦版 = ~42%. That denominator is inferred from U-CAR's published 343萬-535萬 five-trim G05 launch range rather than verified, and it is the main reason this checkpoint is low confidence. Taken at ~41% dealer RETAIL: 3,540,000 * 0.41 = ~1,450,000 dealer ask. private_sale_price 14.5% below = 1,240,000; dealer_tradein_price a further 14% below = 1,065,000. The trade-in gap widens with age because dealers discount out-of-warranty German stock harder. Extra downward pressure specific to this car: at 7 years it is an out-of-warranty six-cylinder DIESEL, and the Taiwanese used market explicitly prices in DPF, injector and turbo risk — which is why the modelled figure sits below the raw 40i asks at comparable mileage rather than at them."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION, as the batch rules require — the current G05 is only ~8 years old in Taiwan, so no genuine 10-year current-generation data exists and none was invented. Method: take real 10-year-old F15 (2014-2018) asking prices, express them as a retention ratio of that car's original list, then apply the ratio to this car's real_cost. Predecessor comps at 2016 registration, exactly 10 years old, confirmed in my own re-analysis of the cached crawl: 'X5 2016款 xDrive30d 3.0L' — the SAME 3.0 six-cylinder diesel — at 車商售價 72.8萬/130,000 km; xDrive25d 65.8萬/97,000 km; xDrive35i 65.0萬/100,000 km. LOW-MILEAGE ADJUSTMENT: this buyer has 70,000 km, far below every comp. The 2017-registered cohort in the same dataset sizes the premium — 25d asks 76.8萬 at 80,000 km and 75.0萬 at 83,500 km versus 62.8萬 at 130,000-138,000 km, i.e. roughly +22% for ~50,000 fewer km. Against a ~326萬 original list for the F15 xDrive30d (a single weak secondary source, and a real contributor to the low confidence) the 72.8萬 comp is 22.3% at 130,000 km; the mileage gradient would carry that to ~28%, but it is deliberately held back to 25% because a 2036-vintage G05 carries far more failure-prone content than an F15 (48V ISG, DPF, electronic dampers, iDrive 8.5) and the tail on German luxury keeps falling rather than flattening the way a Lexus does. NOTE ON BASIS: the ratio is applied to real_cost (3,445,000) rather than to list, per the batch rule for predecessor extrapolation. 3,445,000 * 0.25 = ~861,000 dealer RETAIL -> private_sale_price 14% below = 740,000; dealer_tradein_price a further 14.5% below = 630,000. That is 21.5% of real_cost, a ~78.5% loss over ten years, appropriately in the lower half of the German group in this batch and with no flattening in the tail."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"RAISED from 8,000 and confidence downgraded from high to medium. The researcher priced this window at 8,000 on the basis that a bundled BSI 3年/6萬公里 package makes the annual service free; that claim rested on a Yahoo search-results URL, is contradicted by the sibling BMW record in this batch (which found from a direct dealer-page fetch that BMW Taiwan bundles no complimentary servicing), and could not be settled this round because bmw.com.tw timed out. Priced instead at real out-of-pocket cost: one annual six-cylinder diesel service at a main dealer ~13,000 (top of the Taiwanese 5,000-12,000 small-service band, because this is a 3.0 six with a diesel fuel filter rather than a four-cylinder), plus wipers and alignment ~3,000. Comparable to the Mercedes GLE 300 d's 18,000 in this batch. The 3-year unlimited-mileage factory warranty is real and retained, so nothing beyond scheduled work falls in this window. Estimate, not a quote."},{"y":3,"source":"RAISED from 12,000 and confidence downgraded from high to medium, for the same reason as year 1 — the free-BSI assumption is unverified and is not a safe default. Priced at real cost for the 1-3 year window: 2 annual dealer services at ~14,000 = 28,000, brake fluid at the 2-year interval 4,500, wipers/alignment/coolant top-up and miscellaneous ~11,500. Comparable to the Mercedes GLE 300 d's 48,000 for the same window in this batch. The full 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty is still live throughout, so this window is limited to scheduled work and consumables. If the buyer's deal does include a bundled BSI package, this window falls back toward 12,000. Estimate, not a quote."},{"y":5,"source":"RAISED from 155,000, driven entirely by the tyre line. Built from Taiwanese service-cost ranges (small service 5,000-12,000, major service from 15,000, independent specialist ~5,600-6,000; a six-cylinder diesel at a main dealer sits at the top of that band) and from retail tyre pricing for the 20-inch fitment (Michelin PS5 275/45R20 x4 around 37,400 and Continental UX7 x4 around 48,800 at online retail). The researcher used 70,000 per set while quoting the rear size as 315/35R20; U-CAR's spec page, re-fetched this round at HTTP 200, gives the correct rear as 305/40 R20 — an expensive low-volume size that cannot be rotated with the fronts, so all four go together. 80,000 fitted, balanced and aligned at a dealer is realistic, and would be higher again if BMW's runflat fitment applies, which is not priced in. Tyres are replaced on AGE here, not tread: five years old at only 35,000 km. Estimates, not quotes."},{"y":7,"source":"RAISED from 145,000. The researcher's figure came in BELOW the year-5 window, on the reasoning that the big consumable (tyres) falls outside it — but that produces a maintenance schedule that goes DOWN as an out-of-warranty German diesel ages, which is the wrong shape. Corrected so the schedule rises monotonically. This is the first window fully outside the factory warranty for its entire duration, and it is where the ZF 8HP service, rear brakes and suspension bushings all land, plus the first meaningful 48V ISG and DPF exposure on a car that has now spent seven years doing short urban trips. Built on the same Taiwanese service-cost basis as year 5, plus BMW brake parts pricing (X5-family front discs ~9,800 and rear discs ~8,200 as parts, with a dealer disc-and-pad job landing near 28,000-35,000 per axle including labour). No tyres in this window — the year-5 set is only 14,000 km and 2 years old. The 48V ISG and DPF lines are probability-weighted allowances, not certainties, which is why confidence is low. Estimates, not quotes."},{"y":10,"source":"RAISED from 420,000 — second tyre set repriced for the correct staggered 305/40 R20 rear, damper allowance raised, and the miscellaneous electrical line widened for a decade-old car carrying iDrive 8.5, a curved display and a 48V system. Extrapolated from Taiwanese BMW out-of-warranty repair cost ranges (major service 15,000 to 50,000+ depending on age and parts) applied across a three-year window and weighted for the known 8-10 year German failure set. NOT a measured figure: several lines are probability-weighted allowances for items that may or may not fail, which is why confidence is low. Direction is well supported — this window alone exceeds the entire ten-year maintenance bill of the Toyota Land Cruiser diesel in this batch (414,000), and the whole-car total of 858,000 sits just below the Mercedes GLE 300 d's 941,000, which is the right neighbourhood. UNPRICED RISK: if a given car carries optional air suspension rather than only the M electronic dampers, add roughly 80,000-150,000 to this window. Estimates, not quotes."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車頻道 — BMW X5 車款介紹／售價表","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/x5/7170/overall","note":"PRIMARY PRICE SOURCE, re-fetched directly by this audit (HTTP 200, 64 KB) rather than taken on trust. Confirms xDrive30d M Sport 鉑金版 at 354萬 and xDrive40i M Sport 鉑金版 at 399萬, 2,993cc 柴油 直列6汽缸, 286 hp/4000 rpm, 八前速手自排, 四輪驅動, 13.2 km/l, 燃料費 4,320 / 牌照稅 15,210. Body text confirms the 鉑金版 launched 2026-04 at 354萬, up 9萬 on the 345萬 xDrive30d xLine. Also confirms the M Sport pack content used in the maintenance model: 20 吋 M 星輻式 740M 型輪圈 and M 跑車化電子懸吊系統. The researcher's list price is verified CORRECT."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車頻道 — BMW X5 規格表 (spec)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/x5/7170/spec","note":"ADDED BY THIS AUDIT, fetched directly (HTTP 200). Two things it settles. (1) Powertrain: 動力系統 48V輕油電混合 / 能源 柴油 — a 48V mild-hybrid diesel, confirming the 'diesel' classification and ruling out 'hybrid'. (2) Tyres: 輪胎尺寸 275/45 R20 front, 後輪尺寸 305/40 R20 rear for the 30d (the 40i runs 275/40 R21 / 315/35 R21). This corrects the researcher's '275/45R20 315/35R20' and is the basis for repricing both tyre sets. Also gives 車重 2,220 kg, 軸距 2,975 mm, 前輪懸吊 鋁合金雙A臂 / 後輪懸吊 多連桿."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車頻道 — BMW X5 事件簿 (Taiwan launch/price history)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/x5/7170/event","note":"Source of the historical Taiwan list prices used as denominators for the retention ratios: 2018-12 G05 launched at 343萬-535萬 across five trims; 2019-08 xDrive25d 豪華版 289萬 and 旗艦版 305萬; 2023-08 facelift xDrive30d xLine 345萬 and xDrive40i M Sport 392萬. Carried over from the researcher; the 345萬 and 392萬 figures are independently corroborated by the 車款介紹 page above, which this audit did fetch. The 2019 xDrive40i 旗艦版 price is NOT stated on this page and remains an inference from the 343萬-535萬 range — see open questions."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車頻道 — BMW X5 車系沿革 (generation history)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/x5/7170/history","note":"Establishes the generation boundaries the predecessor extrapolation depends on: E70 2006-2013, F15 2013/9 (Taiwan 2014-2018), G05 2018/6 with Taiwan launch Dec 2018, facelift 2023. Also documents that the LCI 30d replaced Taiwan's previous 4-cylinder xDrive25d, which is why no 5- or 7-year-old xDrive30d exists in the Taiwanese used market. Carried over from the researcher, not independently re-fetched this round."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — used BMW X5 listings (full model search)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/autos?keyword=X5","note":"The underlying crawl (217 raw rows, 192 unique after de-duplicating title/price/km) was RE-ANALYSED INDEPENDENTLY by this audit from the researcher's cached extract, and every comp quoted in the checkpoint source strings was verified to exist in it with the stated price and mileage. Grouped by registration year it yields 9 unique listings at age 1, 12 at age 3, 10 at age 5, 28 at age 7 and 12 at age 10. All prices are 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking price) and were adjusted downward to private-sale and trade-in levels — see each checkpoint. The re-analysis also exposed the weakness the year-1 downgrade rests on: all three age-1 diesel entries share the identical 292.0萬 price and are almost certainly syndicated copies of one or two physical cars."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — used BMW X5 xDrive30d listings (diesel-specific)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/autos?keyword=xDrive30d","note":"The diesel-specific comp set within the same crawl. Supplies the year-1 entries (2025-reg 30d xLine at 292.0萬/3,800 km and 292.0萬/3,816 km, plus a 30D at 292.0萬/3,000 km), the year-3 anchor (2023-reg 30d xLine at 243.0萬/20,400 km and 243.0萬/20,500 km — almost exactly this buyer's mileage), and the year-10 predecessor anchor (2016-reg F15 xDrive30d at 72.8萬/130,000 km)."},{"name":"8891 listing — 2025 BMW X5 xDrive30d xLine, 292.0萬, 3,800 km","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4766170.html","note":"COULD NOT BE RE-VERIFIED THIS ROUND: 8891 returned HTTP 429 (rate limited) to this audit's fetch, so the URL is neither confirmed nor refuted. It is retained because a listing with exactly this price and mileage does appear in the crawl extract, but it is not treated as an independently checked citation, and the year-1 checkpoint no longer leans on it."},{"name":"8891 listing — 2016 BMW X5 xDrive30d (F15), 72.8萬, 130,000 km","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4753001.html","note":"Same status: HTTP 429 on re-fetch, so unverified as a URL, though a listing with exactly this price and mileage is present in the crawl extract. It is the single most important predecessor-generation comp — same 3.0 six-cylinder diesel, exactly 10 years old — and its ratio against the F15's ~326萬 original list drives the year-10 extrapolation."},{"name":"Yahoo Taiwan search results — BMW Taiwan warranty and BSI package terms","url":"https://tw.search.yahoo.com/search?p=BMW+%E5%8E%9F%E5%BB%A0%E4%BF%9D%E5%9B%BA+3%E5%B9%B4+%E4%B8%8D%E9%99%90%E9%87%8C%E7%A8%8B+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E6%B1%8E%E5%BE%B7+BSI+3%E5%B9%B46%E8%90%AC%E5%85%AC%E9%87%8C+%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E5%A5%97%E9%A4%90","note":"DOWNGRADED BY THIS AUDIT. This is a search-results page, not a primary document — it is a real URL but not a citable source, and its content is not stable. It is enough to support 原廠保固 3年不限里程 (extended from 2 years on 2024-06-01), which is widely and consistently reported. It is NOT enough to support the researcher's stronger claim that BSI 3年/6萬公里 is routinely bundled free with a new car, which the sibling BMW X3 record in this batch contradicts from a direct dealer-page fetch. The maintenance model no longer assumes free scheduled servicing in years 1-3."},{"name":"Yahoo Taiwan search results — BMW 6-cylinder service and out-of-warranty repair costs","url":"https://tw.search.yahoo.com/search?p=BMW+%E5%85%AD%E7%BC%B8+%E6%9F%B4%E6%B2%B9+%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A+%E8%B2%BB%E7%94%A8+%E5%8E%9F%E5%BB%A0+%E5%B7%A5%E5%B7%A5%E8%B3%87+%E8%AE%8A%E9%80%9F%E7%AE%B1%E6%B2%B9+%E6%B0%B4%E5%B9%AB%E6%B5%A6+%E6%81%86%E6%BA%AB%E5%99%A8+%E6%9B%B4%E6%8F%9B+%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC","note":"Also a search-results page rather than a primary document — treated as an aggregate of Taiwanese cost ranges, not a citation. Supplies the bands used to size the maintenance windows: small/oil service 5,000-12,000, major service from 15,000 rising past 50,000 with age, independent specialist basic service ~5,600-6,000, with transmission and differential fluid the expensive part of a major service. Every maintenance figure derived from it is labelled an estimate."},{"name":"Yahoo Taiwan search results — BMW X5 20-inch tyre and brake pricing","url":"https://tw.search.yahoo.com/search?p=BMW+X5+20%E5%90%8B+%E8%BC%AA%E8%83%8E+275%2F45R20+315%2F35R20+%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC+%E5%9B%9B%E9%A1%86+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E6%8F%9B%E8%83%8E+%E8%B2%BB%E7%94%A8","note":"Search-results page, treated as a retail price aggregate. Gives 275/45R20 retail pricing (Michelin PS5 x4 ~37,432, Michelin P4SUV x4 ~41,856, Continental UX7 x4 ~48,800) and BMW X5-family brake disc parts pricing (front ~9,800, rear ~8,200). Note that the query itself contains the wrong rear tyre size (315/35R20); U-CAR's spec page gives the correct rear as 305/40 R20, a more expensive size, which is part of why the tyre lines were raised."},{"name":"Sibling records in this batch (cross-vehicle consistency check)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/x5/7170/overall","note":"Not an external source — recorded for transparency about the reasoning, with the U-CAR URL used only as a placeholder because this is an internal cross-check rather than a citation. Two sibling records in the same dataset drove corrections here: the BMW X3 20 xDrive xLine record (documents a PTT 菜單 showing ~12% off list on a G45 X3, and a direct dealer-page finding that BMW Taiwan bundles no free scheduled servicing) and the Mercedes GLE 300 d 4MATIC record (the direct 343萬 German diesel-SUV rival, carrying a 150,000 discount, 70.6%/59.4%/47.1%/36.8%/22.4% retention and a 941,000 ten-year maintenance total). Those two calibrate the discount and the maintenance total in this record."}]},"bmw-x5-xdrive40i-m-sport":{"assumptions":"以 7,000 km/年為中值推算各檢查點里程（7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km），遠低於台灣平均 12,000-15,000 km/年。此里程下保養由「時間」而非「里程」驅動：BMW CBS 機油保養每年一次會先到期，煞車油每 2 年一次，輪胎因橡膠老化（約 5-6 年）而非磨耗到底而更換。動力歸類為 gasoline：U-CAR 車款頁確認本車為 B58 3.0 直列 6 缸渦輪 381hp，搭配整合於變速箱的 ISG 48V 輕油電（急加速時額外輸出 9kW/12hp、20.4kgm），無法純電行駛，故不是 hybrid；Yahoo 汽車資料庫將其標為「油電混合」屬分類誤植，本表不採用。稅金與保險（燃料稅 7,200 元/年、牌照稅 15,210 元/年、車體險）依設計一律排除，不計入本表任何欄位。保養金額假設全程回原廠（汎德授權服務廠）施作；改用專業外廠可下降約 30-40%，但會影響原廠保養紀錄與中古車行情。","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"high","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"本次覆核自行重抓 8891 中古車「X5 xDrive40i」在售車源（2026-08-12，共 63 筆去重，含年份／里程／車商售價）。1 年車（2025 年出廠、LCI xDrive40i M Sport，當時牌價 392 萬）實測 6 筆：328.0 萬@3,166km、328.0 萬@3,224km、325.0 萬@3,000km、319.0 萬@6,000km、308.0 萬@9,000km（另 1 筆@3,317km 電洽）。本買家 7,000 km 正好落在樣本區間內，無需外插：以 319.0萬@6,000km 與 308.0萬@9,000km 直接內插，車商開價約 316 萬（45 筆母體的 age+km 對數迴歸給 327 萬，但同齡樣本內插更可靠，因近新車對里程極度敏感——3,000km 到 9,000km 就掉 20 萬）。修正原研究者的兩個錯誤：(1) 他取的「中位數 325 萬」對應的是 3,000km 車而非買家的 7,000km；(2) 他只對車商開價下修 9.2%，低於 8-15% 區間，且未考慮這批低里程車源多為汎德 BPS 原廠認證中古車（含延長保固，開價本就含認證溢價），個人自售無法比照。改以車商開價 -13% 得自售價：316 萬×(399/392)×0.87 ≈ 282 萬，取 2,820,000（= real_cost 的 71.8%）。車商收購價再低 12% 得 2,480,000（車商買 248 萬、賣 316-322 萬，毛利約 27%，符合台灣豪華中古車行實務）。"},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"同一份 2026-08-12 自抓的 8891 車源。3 年車（2023 年出廠、LCI xDrive40i M Sport、牌價 392 萬）僅 2 筆：288.8 萬@4,900km、275.0 萬@18,000km，且兩筆皆為高雄汎德 BPS 原廠認證中古車，帶認證溢價。單靠這 2 筆內插會得到 272 萬（偏高），故改以 45 筆全樣本的對數迴歸（每年 -10.1%、每萬公里 -2.9%、殘差 sd 6.5%）在 3 年/21,000km 處給 254 萬，兩者取偏迴歸的折衷值 262 萬作為車商開價（= 牌價 66.8%）。自售價 = 車商開價 -13%（同樣因樣本含 BPS 認證溢價而取區間中段）得牌價的 58.1%，套用至本車 399 萬牌價得 2,320,000（= real_cost 的 59.1%）。車商收購價再低 12.5% 得 2,030,000。confidence 由原研究者的 high 下修為 medium：同齡樣本只有 2 筆，且兩筆同屬一家認證體系，不足以支撐 high。"},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"同一份 2026-08-12 自抓的 8891 車源。5 年車（2021 年出廠、小改款前 xDrive40i 旗艦版、牌價 377 萬）實測 168.0 萬@92,000km、158.8 萬@140,000km（另 1 筆@51,000km 電洽）；鄰近年份 2022 年 210.0 萬@64,000km、166.8 萬@100,000km，2020 年 148.8 萬@70,000km、151.8 萬@79,300km。全部樣本里程都遠高於本買家的 35,000 km，必須向低里程外插，故以 45 筆全樣本的對數迴歸（每年 -10.1%、每萬公里 -2.9%）在 5 年/35,000km 處求值得車商開價 197 萬，再與三組跨年份手算交叉檢核（由 2021 年 168萬@92,000km 回推約 194 萬、由 2020 年 150萬@70,000km 回推約 179 萬、由 2019 年 159萬@60,800km 回推約 191 萬）後取 195 萬（= 牌價 51.7%）。修正原研究者的 208 萬：該值幾乎等於實測的 4 年車 210萬@64,000km，等於說 5 年車與 4 年車同價，不合理；且他用的「每萬公里 3.5%」百分比係數在 57,000 km 的大幅外插下會系統性高估。自售價 = 車商開價 -13% 得牌價 45.0%，套用至 399 萬得 1,800,000（= real_cost 的 45.9%）。車商收購價再低 13% 得 1,570,000。confidence medium：同齡樣本真實但僅 2 筆有價，且需大幅低里程外插。"},{"y":7,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"同一份 2026-08-12 自抓的 8891 車源，7 年車（2019 年出廠、小改款前 G05 xDrive40i，豪華版牌價 343 萬／旗艦版 373 萬）是全表樣本最充足的一組，共 24 筆：最低里程有價者 159.0 萬@60,800km、148.0 萬@63,000km、155.8 萬@71,000km（M Sport）、139.8 萬@75,000km、140.0 萬@93,000km、137.0 萬@93,300km、128.0／126.0 萬@100,000km、122.8 萬@139,000km、99.0 萬@150,000km；另有數筆 15,000-35,000km 的 2019 年車標「電洽」未揭價。本買家 49,000 km 低於所有揭價樣本，以 45 筆全樣本對數迴歸在 7 年/49,000km 處得車商開價 152 萬，與由 159.0萬@60,800km 手動回推的 164 萬取折衷得 156 萬（= 旗艦版牌價 373 萬的 41.8%）。原研究者取 170 萬偏高，主因是他只用了 cohort 內開價最高的幾筆、且未處理樣本中混有牌價較低的豪華版。自售價 = 車商開價 -14%（車齡越大車商議價空間越寬）得牌價 35.9%，套用至 399 萬得 1,430,000（= real_cost 的 36.4%）。車商收購價再低 14% 得 1,230,000。此時已過 3 年原廠保固 4 年，中古市場明確把保外維修風險計入價格，故續跌而非打平。confidence medium：樣本量最充足，但仍須外插至低於觀測里程下緣。"},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"外插，非實測：現行 G05 世代 2018 年 12 月才在台上市（至今 7.7 年），沒有真實的 10 年車價可用，因此依規則改用前代 F15 的實際行情換算保留率再套回本車。本次覆核自抓 8891「BMW X5」全車系車源（2026-08-12，148 筆去重）確認 F15 的 10 年車實價：2016 年出廠 xDrive35i（3.0 直六汽油）65.0 萬@100,000km；同年份 xDrive25d 群組 65.8萬@97,000km、58.8萬@110,000km、55.0萬@116,400km、58.8萬@118,700km、53.8萬@150,000km、59.8萬@160,000km、48.0萬@168,000km，由此得 10 年車的里程係數約每 1,000 km 0.15 萬（遠比新車平緩）。將 65.0萬@100,000km 外插至 70,000 km（+30,000km）得車商開價約 70 萬，佔 F15 xDrive35i 原始牌價 332 萬的 21.1%。自售價 = 車商開價 -15%（10 年德系 SUV 車商接手意願低、議價空間最寬）得原始牌價的 17.9%，套用至本車 399 萬牌價得 715,000，取 720,000（= real_cost 的 18.3%）。車商收購價再低 16% 得 600,000。confidence low：世代不同、引擎不同（N55 vs B58），且 G05 LCI 的曲面螢幕、iDrive 8.5 與 48V ISG 電子複雜度遠高於 F15，保外風險溢價可能更重，18.3% 甚至可能仍偏樂觀；另 F15 的 332 萬原始牌價係沿用原研究者提供的 Yahoo 2016 資料庫數字，本次未能重新驗證。"}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"台灣 BMW 車主原廠定保費用經驗區間：原廠僅做最基礎保養（機油、機油芯、基本檢查）單次約 5,000-6,000 元；若不刪除原廠預設加項（各式添加劑、冷氣風箱清潔等），常規保養落在 8,500-9,500 元。X5 搭載 B58 直六、機油量約 7L，且 X5 為大型 SUV、原廠工資級距高於 3／X3 系列，故取 16,000 元（原研究者取 12,000，低於本表同級的 Mercedes GLE300d 18,000 與 Porsche Cayenne 16,000，對 399 萬車不合理）。保固期內故障維修免費，但定保不含在內（X5 不在汎德贈送保養套裝的車系名單）。註：費用區間來自二手彙整內容（UpToGo），該站有 Cloudflare 防護，本次與原研究者均未能讀取全文，僅取搜尋摘要。"},{"y":3,"source":"沿用同一組台灣車主原廠報價經驗：機油保養 2 次約 32,000（單次 16,000）；冷氣濾網＋空氣濾芯約 8,000（原廠冷氣濾網曾有 9,000 元的單品報價案例，此處取一般水準）；煞車油 5,000；雨刷與雜項 4,000。整段仍在 3 年不限里程保固內，故無故障維修支出。合計 49,000（原研究者 36,000；本表同級的 GLE300d 為 48,000、Cayenne 為 58,000）。"},{"y":5,"source":"輪胎：G05 X5 M Sport 為 20 吋 RFT，M Sport 常見前 275/45R20＋後 305/40R20 前後配，市售同規 RFT 單條約 15,000-20,000，整組 4 條含安裝定位取 72,000。煞車來令片：Mobile01 車主報價顯示外廠前後來令片＋感應線＋工資約 8,000，原廠件另有「前來令片報價破萬」的討論；X5 煞車尺寸大且為原廠件，前後含感應線取 36,000。火星塞 6 支含工資 16,000。機油保養 2 次 32,000、煞車油 5,000、冷卻液 7,000、濾網類 8,000。合計 176,000（原研究者 143,000）。註：Mobile01 對程式化擷取回應 403，本次與原研究者均未能讀取全文。"},{"y":7,"source":"本期已保外 2-4 年，是德系保外風險開始實際發生的區間。變速箱油雖然 BMW 宣稱終身免換，但台灣氣候與路況下普遍建議 6-8 萬公里或 5-6 年更換，連同分動箱與差速器油取 32,000。12V AGM 92Ah 電瓶含電腦註冊 17,000（Mobile01「BMW X5 養車費用」討論串車主的原廠 AGM 用 7 年 10 萬公里才因啟動遲滯更換，故置於第 5-7 年區間）。煞車碟盤在 2.2 噸級 SUV 約 5 萬公里到期，原廠前後碟盤＋第 2 組來令片取 58,000。B58／N55 世代公認高發的電子水泵浦與節溫器總成連工帶料 48,000（原研究者把它整包推到第 10 期，但這項在 7-10 萬公里／7-10 年就常見，置於本期更貼近實務）。氣門室蓋與機油濾清器座墊片滲油整修 26,000。機油保養 32,000、煞車油 5,000、冷卻液 7,000、濾網雜項 8,000、診斷工資 10,000。合計 243,000。修正原研究者的 134,000——該值低於其自己第 3-5 年的 143,000，違反支出隨車齡上升的常識，也遠低於本表 GLE300d 的 215,000 與 Cayenne 的 235,000。confidence low：多為機率性支出的期望值，且來源討論串本次未能讀取全文。"},{"y":10,"source":"外插提列，非單一報價：本期車齡 7-10 年、已保外 4-7 年，是 BMW 保外支出最集中的區間。輪胎第 2 組 76,000；機油保養 3 次 54,000；點火線圈 6 支＋第 2 次火星塞 42,000；M 跑車化電子懸吊（可變阻尼）避震器總成與懸吊連桿／襯套整理 135,000——這是本期最大單項，2.2 噸 SUV 的電子阻尼避震器單支原廠價高且 10 年幾乎必換，原研究者僅列 55,000 明顯偏低；48V ISG 啟動發電機與 48V 鋰電池為本車 LCI 才有的機構，保外更換單價高，風險提列 55,000；PCV 與其餘滲油點 32,000；iDrive 8.5／曲面螢幕、控制模組與感知器類電子故障提列 45,000（G05 LCI 電子含量遠高於前代，這類故障在保外期是實質支出）；冷氣壓縮機、水箱與傳動系統風險提列 48,000；煞車油 ×2、冷卻液、濾網類 31,000。合計 518,000，與本表 GLE300d 的 505,000、Cayenne 的 527,000 同級。confidence low：這些是機率性支出的期望值，個別車輛可能完全沒發生，也可能單一項目就超出本期估算；若該車選配氣壓懸吊，本期應再增加約 8-12 萬。"}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車頻道 — BMW X5 車款介紹（現行車型與售價）","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/x5/7170/overall","note":"本次覆核實際抓取並比對原文（HTTP 200）。確認建議售價 xDrive40i M Sport鉑金版 399 萬、xDrive30d M Sport鉑金版 354 萬，且全車系僅此 2 車型；確認 2026 年 4 月發表新年式鉑金版、xDrive40i 較前一新年式漲 7 萬（即前值 392 萬，為中古行情換算的牌價基準）；確認動力為 B58 3.0 直列 6 缸渦輪 381hp 搭配整合於變速箱的 ISG 48V 輕油電（急加速額外 9kW/12hp、20.4kgm）——這是判定 powertrain 為 gasoline 而非 hybrid 的關鍵依據；確認 M 跑車化電子懸吊為 M Sport 套件標配、非氣壓懸吊；並確認燃料稅 7,200／牌照稅 15,210（本表依設計排除）。"},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2026 BMW X5 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/bmw-x5-2026","note":"本次覆核實際抓取（HTTP 200）。售價 399 萬的第二個獨立確認來源（頁面列「共2筆 2026 BMW X5 354 - 399」）。註：該頁將 xDrive30d／xDrive40i 的動力型式標為「油電混合」，係 48V 輕油電被誤分類，本表不採用其分類。同頁新聞列表亦顯示 2026 年 8 月「BMW 仲夏禮遇」全車系贈晶華酒店三天兩夜、指定車款最高 180 萬 48 期 0 利率與「一年乙式全險或原廠保養套裝」，但未列車系明細。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — X5 xDrive40i 在售車源（含年份、里程、車商售價）","url":"https://www.8891.com.tw/usedauto-index.html?key=X5%20xDrive40i","note":"本表價值曲線的主要實證來源，本次覆核自行重抓 3 頁、解析出 63 筆去重車源（2026-08-12）。原研究者引用的樣本經逐筆比對確認為真實存在，未捏造。關鍵樣本：2025 年 328.0萬@3,166km、328.0萬@3,224km、325.0萬@3,000km、319.0萬@6,000km、308.0萬@9,000km；2023 年 288.8萬@4,900km、275.0萬@18,000km；2022 年 210.0萬@64,000km；2021 年 168.0萬@92,000km、158.8萬@140,000km；2020 年 148.8萬@70,000km；2019 年 159.0萬@60,800km、155.8萬@71,000km、140.0萬@93,000km、122.8萬@139,000km。所列皆為車商開價（多筆標示實體車行或汎德 BPS 原廠認證），本表已逐筆下修為自售價與車商收購價。另以其中 45 筆（1-8 年、排除 M40i）做 ln(price) ~ age + km 對數迴歸，得每年 -10.1%、每萬公里 -2.9%、殘差 sd 6.5%，作為低里程外插的依據。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — BMW X5 全車系在售車源（含前代 F15）","url":"https://www.8891.com.tw/usedauto-index.html?key=BMW%20X5","note":"本次覆核自行重抓 5 頁、解析出 148 筆去重車源（2026-08-12），用於第 10 年所需的 F15 資料。確認 2016 年出廠 xDrive35i 65.0 萬@100,000km（與原研究者引用一致）；同年份 xDrive25d 群組 65.8萬@97,000km、58.8萬@110,000km、55.0萬@116,400km、53.8萬@150,000km、48.0萬@168,000km，據此推得 10 年車的里程係數約每 1,000 km 0.15 萬。原研究者另引用的 2017 年式 xDrive35i 69.9萬@114,000km 與 64.9萬@106,000km 在本次抓取結果中未出現（可能已下架），故第 10 年僅採用可複驗的 2016 年式錨點。"},{"name":"8891 新車 — BMW 2026 年 7 月優惠方案彙整","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/bmw/x3/22145","note":"本次覆核實際抓取並比對原文（HTTP 200，發文日 2026-07-07）。汎德官方優惠級距的關鍵依據，原文逐條列出：「X5、X6 ◎月付9900元起or120萬48期0利率 ◎贈1年乙式險(指定年式車型)」、「X3 ◎月付5900元起or180萬48期0利率」、「5系列Sedan、7系列、X7 ◎月付9900元起or180萬48期0利率」、「X1、X2 ◎贈3年/4萬公里保養套裝」、「iX1、iX2、i4 ◎贈4年不限里程保養套裝(iX2指定年式車型)」。前者用於推算現金折讓 16 萬，後者確立「X5 自第 1 年起定保全額自費」這個對 maintenance 影響極大的前提。這是目前唯一有車系解析度的優惠來源。"},{"name":"Mobile01 — BMW X5 養車費用（含 10 萬公里保養費用與原廠 AGM 電池更換，f=275, t=6722409）","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=275&t=6722409","note":"未經本次覆核驗證：站方對程式化擷取回應 HTTP 403，原研究者與本次覆核均只取得搜尋摘要、未能讀取全文。採用其「原廠 AGM 電瓶用 7 年 10 萬公里才因啟動遲滯而更換」的實例作為第 7 期提列 12V 電瓶的依據，相關檢查點 confidence 已據此訂為 low。"},{"name":"Mobile01 — 來令片更換建議（討論串 f=275, t=6999758）","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=275&t=6999758","note":"未經本次覆核驗證：同樣因 403 僅取得搜尋摘要。車主報價：外廠前後來令片＋感應線＋工資約 8,000；另一討論串指原廠前來令片「報價破萬」。用於推算原廠件在 X5 上的煞車支出級距，第 5 期 confidence 為 medium 已反映此限制。"},{"name":"UpToGo — BMW 保養大概多少錢？真實養車開銷與維修解析","url":"https://uptogo.com.tw/%E6%B1%BD%E6%A9%9F%E8%BB%8A/%E8%BB%8A%E8%BC%9B%E7%B6%AD%E4%BF%AE%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A/bmw%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E5%A4%A7%E6%A6%82%E5%A4%9A%E5%B0%91%E9%8C%A2%EF%BC%9F","note":"未經本次覆核驗證：該站有 Cloudflare 防護，原研究者與本次覆核均只取得搜尋摘要。台灣 BMW 車主原廠定保費用區間：僅換機油、機油芯與基本檢查約 5,000-6,000/次；不刪除原廠預設加項則約 8,500-9,500/次。本表在此基礎上依 X5 的引擎機油量與大型 SUV 工資級距上調至 16,000/次，第 1、3 期 confidence 為 medium 已反映此限制。"},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2016 BMW X5 車款資料庫（前代 F15 牌價）","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/bmw-x5-2016","note":"未經本次覆核重新驗證（原研究者提供）。用途是取得前代 F15 的 2016 年式 xDrive35i 牌價 332 萬，作為第 10 年保留率換算的分母。第 10 年 confidence 已訂為 low，此未驗證的分母是原因之一。"},{"name":"U-CAR 新車頻道 — BMW X5 事件簿（歷年售價時間軸）","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/x5/7170/event","note":"未經本次覆核重新驗證（原研究者提供）。用途是取得第 5、7 年檢查點的歷史牌價基準：2018/12 G05 上市 xDrive40i 豪華版 343 萬／旗艦版 373 萬，2021 年式旗艦版 377 萬。本次已從 U-CAR 車款頁獨立確認 xDrive40i 前一新年式為 392 萬（399 減 7），但 2018-2021 各年式牌價未再驗證，相關檢查點 confidence 為 medium 已反映此限制。原研究者列出的其餘 U-CAR 連結（news/article/44564、news/article/10646）因無法在本次驗證、且其結論可由上述來源覆蓋，已自 sources 移除。"}]},"bmw-x6-xdrive40i-m-sport":{"assumptions":"Owner drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, roughly half the Taiwan average. Every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km). At this rate BMW's Condition Based Service clock is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven: the annual engine-oil service, the 2-yearly brake fluid and the 5-6 year tire age-out all fall due long before the mileage triggers, so maintenance barely scales down with the low mileage. Licence tax (牌照稅 15,210/yr for the 2,998 c.c. 2401-3000 bracket) and fuel tax (燃料稅 7,200/yr) are EXCLUDED by design, as is insurance. Full-body PPF (犀牛皮 — real PTT quotes on this exact car run 90,000-120,000) is an optional cosmetic purchase and is excluded from onroad_fees. Market caveat as of Aug 2026: the X6 is US-built (U-CAR spec sheet gives 產地 美國), so the unresolved US-tariff / 貨物稅 question is directly relevant — PTT threads show it simultaneously inflating new-car cash discounts and freezing buyers, which softens used BMW residuals. Both effects are reflected. FACT-CHECK NOTE: this record was rebuilt after adversarial review. The list price, the powertrain call and every used listing quoted by the original researcher were independently re-verified and found correct; the value curve and the maintenance schedule were both corrected upward/downward against the BMW X5 xDrive40i M Sport — the X6's mechanical twin (same B58, same 48V ISG, same ZF 8HP, same 汎德 dealer network) — which is priced in the same dataset.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no 1-year-old G06 X6 exists on the TW used market yet; the newest genuine listings found across HOT 好車大聯盟 and SUM are 2023 cars. REVISED DOWN from an earlier estimate of 2,880,000. Two anchors: (a) the achievable NET new price is ~3,780,000 (406萬 less the ~28萬 cash discount PTT buyers actually get), and (b) the year-3 anchor below. Implied dealer retail asking for a 1-year-old, 7,000 km car is ~3,070,000; private sale sits ~11% under dealer retail = 2,720,000; dealer trade-in a further ~13% under private = 2,360,000. That is a 29.6% first-year loss against real_cost — deliberately steeper than a Japanese equivalent, because a buyer can get a brand-new one with the full 3-year warranty for only about 1,150,000 more. Cross-checked against the BMW X5 xDrive40i M Sport in this same dataset (the X6's mechanical twin), which retains 71.8% of real_cost at year 1; the X6 is set slightly BELOW it at 70.4% because the coupe-SUV body has a materially thinner buyer pool in Taiwan. The 2026 tariff-cut speculation freezing the market makes a soft year-1 residual more likely, not less."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Anchored on real listings I pulled directly from HOT 好車大聯盟's filtered inventory API (brand=BMW, carType=X6 XDRIVE40I) and verified line by line: a 2023 X6 xDrive40i with 30,551 km at 車商售價 2,688,000. A second 2023/24 car at 3,580,000 (47,680 km) exists but is heavily accessorised ('全車精品改ID8') and still under factory warranty, so it is treated as an upper outlier rather than discarded silently — note it pulls the true market ABOVE the single low anchor, and the spread between the two 2023 cars (892,000) is the main reason this is medium and not high confidence. Our buyer is at 21,000 km, below the 30,551 km anchor, so dealer retail is nudged to ~2,710,000. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN APPLIED: these are 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking), never copied straight across — private sale ≈ 12% below dealer asking = 2,380,000; dealer trade-in ≈ 13.4% below private = 2,060,000. Cross-check cluster of 2022 cars (4 years old) from the same API: 2,038,000 @ 102,995 km, 2,080,000 @ 108,452 km, 2,090,000 @ 100,000 km, 2,090,000 @ 100,080 km, 2,180,000 @ 66,217 km, 2,350,000 @ 90,204 km, plus SUM 汽車網 showing a 2022 X6 G06 鉑金版 at 245.8萬."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Real 5-year-old cluster pulled from HOT 好車大聯盟's filtered API and individually verified: three 2021 X6 xDrive40i M Sport at 46,869 / 49,624 / 50,000 km asking 2,268,000 / 2,288,000 / 2,280,000 車商售價 (mean 2,278,667), plus a fourth 2021 M Sport on SUM 汽車網 at 188萬 which pulls the four-car mean down to ~2,179,000. Our buyer is at 35,000 km, under the ~48,800 km of the listed trio, so a modest low-mileage premium of ~+4% gives dealer retail ~2,265,000. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: private sale ≈ 15% under dealer asking = 1,920,000; dealer trade-in ≈ 14% under private = 1,650,000. The 15% (rather than 11%) private haircut and the resulting 49.7% retention are deliberately at the conservative end of the 8-15% band: by 2031 the G06 will have been replaced, and a superseded niche German shape drops faster than its SUV sibling. NOTE — the earlier version of this record quoted the 2021 X6's list price as 392萬; that figure is actually the 2023 LCI X5 xDrive40i M Sport's price per U-CAR's 事件簿 ('X5提供345萬xDrive30d xLine、392萬xDrive40i M Sport雙車型；X6則為399萬'). The 2021 X6 xDrive40i M Sport 鉑金版 listed at 398萬, so the observed retention is ~57% of list, not 58%."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the PREDECESSOR generation, because the G06 (TW launch Dec 2019) has no genuine 7-year data and none was fabricated. The F16 X6 xDrive35i's TW list price of 3,680,000 was independently re-verified on Yahoo 汽車機車's 2015 X6 page (xDrive30d 368萬, xDrive35i 368萬 / 2979cc / 306hp, M50d 542萬, xDrive50i 590萬, M 658萬). Real F16 xDrive35i listings today, pulled from HOT: a 2018 car (age 8) at 104,566 km asking 1,130,000 = 30.7% retention; 2017 cars (age 9) at 111,737 / 140,000 / 148,000 km asking 838,000 / 898,000 / 888,000 = 22.8-24.4%. Taking the age-8 30.7% ratio, correcting +8% for being a year younger and +18% for roughly half the mileage (49,000 vs 104,566 km) gives ~39% retention. Applied to this car's real_cost per instruction: 0.39 x 3,865,000 = ~1,507,000 dealer retail asking. CHAIN: private sale ≈ 12% under = 1,330,000; dealer trade-in ≈ 14% under private = 1,140,000. The +18% mileage premium is deliberately milder than the +25% used in the earlier draft — at seven years the value of a German SUV is set by out-of-warranty repair risk and thin demand more than by the odometer. Cross-check: the oldest G06 cars (2020, age 6) sit at 1,758,000 (150,716 km, HOT) and 192.8萬 (SUM), consistent with a 7-year low-mileage car asking ~1,500,000. The tail keeps falling rather than flattening — the 3-year warranty is long gone and the market prices in B58 electric-water-pump and 48V-ISG exposure."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the F16 / E71 predecessor generations against the F16 xDrive35i's verified 3,680,000 TW list. Real listings at age 10-11 pulled from HOT and SUM: 2016 xDrive35i, 178,554 km → 758,000 (20.6% retention); 2015 xDrive35i, 127,661 km → 638,000 (17.3%), 132,928 km → 688,000 (18.7%), 135,197 km → 850,000 (23.1%); 2015 F16 xDrive30d, 122,867 km → 688,000 (18.7%); E71 2013 xDrive35i, 153,697 km → 580,000 (15.8%); E71 2012 cars at 358,000-458,000. The mileage-blind age-10 mean is ~19-21% of list. REVISED DOWN from an earlier estimate of 960,000: that version applied a +35% low-mileage premium, which is too aggressive for a 10-year-old German SUV whose price is dominated by repair risk and thin demand, and which contradicted the record's own stated reasoning about a falling tail. A +19% premium on a 20% base gives ~23.8% of real_cost = ~920,000 dealer retail asking. CHAIN: private sale ≈ 13% under dealer asking = 760,000 (19.7% of real_cost); dealer trade-in ≈ 16% under private = 640,000 — the trade-in gap widens at this age because dealers discount hard for slow turn and repair exposure on an out-of-warranty German SUV. Sanity band: the BMW X5 xDrive40i M Sport in this dataset retains 18.3% of real_cost at year 10; the X6 sits just above it in percentage terms only because of its higher starting price, and the extra electronic complexity the G06 LCI carries (curved display, iDrive 8.5, 48V ISG) is shaded in."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Base case assumes the buyer does NOT hold a prepaid service package (see plan_notes — the package verified on PTT is a negotiated sweetener, not standard on the 406萬 鉑金版). Cost is one annual B58 oil service at 汎德 dealer rates plus consumables, aligned with the BMW X5 xDrive40i M Sport twin record (16,000) which shares the same engine, dealer network and service schedule. Failures are covered by the 3年不限里程新車保固. No official 汎德 service price table was reachable from this environment (bmw.com.tw does not route), so this is a dealer-rate estimate rather than a published quote."},{"y":3,"source":"Two further annual oil services plus the 2-yearly brake fluid and filter set, still inside the 3年不限里程原廠保固 so failures remain covered. Aligned with the X5 xDrive40i M Sport twin (49,000) and trimmed marginally. Note the staggered 21-inch fitment means front and rear tires cannot be rotated, which removes a cheap wear-levelling option available on the X5. Dealer-rate estimate, not a published table — bmw.com.tw was unreachable and Mobile01 owner-receipt threads returned HTTP 403 from this environment."},{"y":5,"source":"First period with neither package nor warranty. Tire line grounded in real TW retail: Michelin PS4 SUV 315/35R21 完工價 NT$12,132/條 from a live Yahoo 拍賣 retail search, with 275/40R21 at a comparable level; a staggered set plus alignment lands near 75,000 for OE-equivalent run-flat rubber (the OE Pirelli P Zero RFT fitment, confirmed on a real SUM X6 listing reading 'P-ZERO輪胎4條剛換', is dearer than the Michelin quoted). Remaining line items are a reasoned build-up from 汎德 dealer parts-and-labour norms calibrated against the X5 xDrive40i M Sport twin record (176,000), plus roughly 19,000 for the larger staggered 21-inch tire set. No published TW price table was reachable, so confidence is low."},{"y":7,"source":"Built item by item from TW BMW dealer parts-and-labour norms for the B58 / ZF 8HP combination on a 2,165 kg SUV, calibrated against the X5 xDrive40i M Sport twin record (243,000) and uplifted for the X6's larger brake package. No single published TW price table was reachable (bmw.com.tw does not route from this environment; Mobile01 owner-receipt threads return HTTP 403), so this is a reasoned build-up rather than a sourced quote and is marked low accordingly. Brake and transmission scope reflect that at 49,000 km the full brake set and the first ATF service both fall due on TIME rather than distance."},{"y":10,"source":"EXTRAPOLATED out-of-warranty window, built from the known B58 / G06 failure profile and calibrated against the X5 xDrive40i M Sport twin record (518,000), uplifted for the second staggered 21-inch tire set. No Taiwanese owner receipt thread was retrievable from this environment (Mobile01 and 8891 both block non-browser access), so confidence is low and the figure is stated as a risk-weighted allowance, not a quote. The 48V ISG line is a mild-hybrid-specific exposure: the starter-generator is integrated with the gearbox and a full unit replacement costs far more than the allowance shown, which is probability-weighted for a 10-year-old car. Suspension line assumes the M 跑車化電子懸吊 adaptive dampers; U-CAR's spec sheet lists 鋁合金雙A臂 front and 多連桿 rear with no air suspension for the TW xDrive40i, but if a rear self-levelling air system is in fact fitted, add ~90,000 for a pair of air springs."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — BMW X6 車款介紹 (現行售價 406 萬)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/x6/7171/overall","note":"Primary list-price verification, re-fetched and re-read during fact-check. Header reads '2 車型 406 - 565 萬'; body text '新年式 X6 則是提供 xDrive40i M Sport 鉑金版，售價為 406 萬元 (漲 7 萬元)，搭配原有的 M60i xDrive 車型'. Confirms 406萬 and that the 鉑金版 is NOT the only trim."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — BMW X6 規格表 (輪胎尺寸、車重、動力系統)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/x6/7171/spec","note":"Re-verified during fact-check: 車重 2,165 kg; 輪胎尺寸 275/40 R21 front, 後輪尺寸 315/35 R21; 引擎型號 B58, 381 hp/5200~6250 rpm, 53 kgm; 動力系統 '48V輕油電混合' with 能源 '汽油'; 電池總容量 0.44 kWh at 48V; 產地 美國. These drive the gasoline classification and the tire/brake maintenance lines."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — BMW X6 事件簿 (歷年台灣售價)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/BMW/X6/7171/event","note":"TW list-price history used to convert used listings into retention ratios: 2019/12 launch xDrive40i 365萬 / 40i M Sport 首發版 380萬 / M50i 560萬; 2023 LCI 'X5提供345萬xDrive30d xLine、392萬xDrive40i M Sport雙車型；X6則為399萬'. This page is the evidence that the 392萬 figure belongs to the X5, not the X6 — the correction applied to the year-5 checkpoint."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — BMW X6 相關報導 (新年式鉑金版 406 萬、2021 鉑金版 398 萬)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/BMW/X6/7171/articles","note":"Second confirmation of the 406萬 current price and of the July 2021 鉑金版 pricing at 373萬/398萬 — the correct denominator for the 5-year retention ratio."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2026 BMW X6 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/bmw-x6-2026","note":"Independent third-party confirmation of xDrive40i M Sport 鉑金版 at 406萬, 2998cc, 381hp. Note this page labels the powertrain 'Hybrid' — an example of the 48V mild-hybrid mislabel the classification rule guards against."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2015 BMW X6 (F16) 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/bmw-x6-2015","note":"Predecessor-generation list prices, independently re-verified during fact-check for the 7- and 10-year extrapolation: xDrive30d 368萬, xDrive35i 368萬 (2979cc / 306hp / 汽油), xDriveM50d 542萬, xDrive50i 590萬, X6 M 658萬."},{"name":"HOT 好車大聯盟 中古車搜尋 — BMW X6","url":"https://www.hotcar.com.tw/UsedCarSell/CarFilter?vKeyword=X6","note":"Main used-price source. During fact-check I re-pulled the listings myself through the site's filtered inventory API (brand=6 BMW, carType codes 192 X6 XDRIVE40I / 189 X6 XDRIVE35I / 218 X6 XDRIVE40D / 42 X6 / 234 X6 XDRIVE 30D) and recovered 36 unique X6 listings with exact year, odometer and 車商售價. Every figure quoted in the checkpoints was confirmed against this set, including the 2023 40i at 2,688,000 / 30,551 km, the 2021 trio at 2,268,000-2,288,000 / 46,869-50,000 km, the 2018 F16 35i at 1,130,000 / 104,566 km and the 2015-2016 F16 cluster. All are dealer RETAIL asking prices and were adjusted down to private-sale and trade-in in each checkpoint."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — BMW X6 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/price-01.php","note":"Second used-price source, cross-checking HOT. Confirmed during fact-check: a 2022 X6 G06 鉑金版 at 245.8萬 (listed as 油電車 — another instance of the 48V mislabel), a 2021 M Sport at 188萬 and 2020 cars at 192.8萬 / 239.8萬, plus F16 and E71 examples."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [心得] 下訂 BMW X6 40i","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1754661956.A.6A2.html","note":"Real buyer's account, re-read during fact-check. Verbatim: '台中報價從四月折扣15萬 七月折扣20萬 八月現在折扣25萬', '配件全折 我都不要 送前三年保養套餐'. Another poster computes '牌價399,折30=369'. Basis for the discount figure, and the evidence that the service package is a negotiated sweetener rather than standard equipment."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — Re: [心得] 下訂 BMW X6 40i (實際各地報價)","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1757687711.A.13B.html","note":"The hard numbers behind purchase.discounts, re-verified: 台北 -29萬 / 新北 -28萬 / 桃園 -24萬 / 台中 -24萬 on the 399萬 car, '只留3年/4萬保養套餐'. Also documents full-body PPF quotes of 9-12萬 on this exact car, which are excluded from onroad_fees."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [閒聊] 如果這個月交車 X6 是不是盤子？ (2026/3 鉑金版)","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1772783656.A.324.html","note":"March 2026 data point on the 鉑金版 itself: 牌價 399 萬再折 2X 萬, with other posters reporting more than 10% available. Also documents the tariff-uncertainty freeze depressing the whole TW market."},{"name":"Yahoo 拍賣 — 315/35R21 輪胎完工價","url":"https://tw.bid.yahoo.com/search/auction/product?p=315%2F35R21","note":"Real TW retail tire pricing for the rear OE size: Michelin Pilot Sport 4 SUV 315/35R21 111Y 完工價 NT$12,132/條. Anchors the ~75,000 staggered-set line in the year-5 maintenance period. This is a live retail search page rather than a fixed price list, so the figure is a snapshot."}]},"bmw-z4-m40i":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, far below the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year. Every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). At this mileage BMW's Condition Based Service mileage triggers are essentially never reached, so servicing is TIME-driven (annual oil service, 2-year brake fluid, ~4-year plugs, 5-6 year tires) rather than mileage-driven, which raises cost-per-km sharply versus an average-mileage owner. Tax and insurance are excluded from every figure by design: for reference only, this 2,998 c.c. car carries NT$15,210 牌照稅 + NT$7,200 燃料費 = NT$22,410/year (correct Taiwan brackets for 2,401-3,000 c.c.). That burden is NOT counted here but is a real drag on demand for older 3.0L examples and is one reason the 7- and 10-year tail is priced low. No home-charger cost applies (combustion car). Fuel is also excluded. Tires are treated as an age-limited item, not a mileage item: 19-inch staggered run-flats age out around 5-6 years at 7,000 km/year long before they wear out. LIQUIDITY IS THE DOMINANT UNCERTAINTY: there is not one current-generation G29 Z4 listed for sale in Taiwan on any platform checked, so every value checkpoint is an extrapolation and is marked low confidence.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"ESTIMATE, not a listing — REVISED DOWN by the fact-check pass from NT$2,680,000. Verified finding (I re-ran these queries myself): there is not one current-generation G29 Z4 listed for sale anywhere in Taiwan. SUM 汽車網 (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/BMW/Z4?v=4) returns exactly 2 cars nationwide, both previous-generation E89 (2013 and 2011); HOT 大聯盟 (https://www.hotcar.com.tw/UsedCarSell/CarFilter) returns 無符合條件之車輛. So no year-1 transaction data exists. WHY REVISED: the researcher benchmarked off Porsche CPO cars asking 82-88% of list, then stated TWO downward adjustments (BMW retains worse than Porsche; the Z4's buyer pool is 'very thin') but landed on 82% — the bottom of the Porsche band, i.e. no net adjustment was actually applied. Cross-checked against comparable German records in this same dataset, their figure put the Z4 at 73.7% of real_cost, only 1.6pp below a Porsche Cayenne (75.3%) and ABOVE a BMW 7-Series (70.9%), despite the Z4 being the least liquid car in the set. Dealers bid defensively on inventory they cannot turn, and a private seller with zero comparable listings has no price anchor to negotiate against — both push year 1 down. Corrected: implied dealer RETAIL asking ~NT$2,900,000 (78% of list); private sale set ~11.7% below that asking price per the 車商售價 > 自售價 > 車商收購價 chain; dealer trade-in a further ~13.5% below private. Low mileage (7,000 km) is priced in as a premium over a mileage-blind average."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"ESTIMATE, not a listing — revised down from NT$2,090,000 to keep the curve consistent with the corrected year-1 anchor. Same zero-inventory problem: SUM (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/BMW/Z4?v=4) returns no G29 at all, re-verified this session. Years 1-3 carry the steep German loss: retention falls from ~70% to ~55% of real_cost in two years, far steeper than a Japanese equivalent (the Toyota GR Supra record in this dataset, which shares this car's B58 engine and ZF8 gearbox, sits at 70.8% at year 3). Implied dealer retail asking ~NT$2,290,000 (61.6% of list); private sale set ~13.1% below that asking price, dealer trade-in a further ~14.6% below private. Convertibles are a smaller sub-market in Taiwan and discount harder than the equivalent coupe. Low-mileage adjustment applied."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"ESTIMATE, not a listing — revised down from NT$1,620,000 along the corrected curve. The car is now out of BMW Taiwan's 3-year new-car warranty and the market starts pricing repair risk on a 340 hp turbo I6. Implied dealer retail asking ~NT$1,780,000 (47.8% of list); private sale ~13.2% below that asking price, trade-in ~15.9% below private. Sanity-anchored against SUM's whole-market Z4 average of NT$663,000 (https://www.sum.com.tw/price-data.php?brand=BMW&model=Z4&year1=2006&year2=2026, re-verified this session), which covers only much older E89 cars and therefore sits well below this point as expected. Low-mileage adjustment applied."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"ESTIMATE by predecessor-generation extrapolation — no genuine 7-year data exists for the current G29 (TW launch May 2019, so the oldest cars are barely 7 years old and none are listed anywhere). Method, re-verified by the fact-check pass: the two real E89 listings on SUM (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/BMW/Z4?v=4) are a 2013 Z4 sDrive28i, 102,686 km, dealer asking NT$738,000 against a TW list of NT$3,090,000 = 23.9% retention at ~13 years, and a 2011 Z4 sDrive20i, 147,721 km, NT$588,000 against ~NT$2,720,000 = 21.6% at ~15 years. I independently re-fetched this page and both listings match the quoted year, mileage and price exactly. That decay curve was interpolated back to 7 years and applied to this car's list price. Implied dealer retail asking ~NT$1,400,000 (37.6% of list); private sale ~13.2% below asking, trade-in ~16.9% below private. No warranty, and the German tail keeps falling rather than flattening the way a Lexus would. Adjusted UP for the 49,000 km assumption versus the 100,000+ km E89 comparators. Revised down from NT$1,270,000 for curve consistency."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"ESTIMATE by predecessor-generation extrapolation, as the brief prescribes — the G29 is only 7 years old in Taiwan so no genuine 10-year data can exist. Ratio source, independently re-verified: 2013 BMW Z4 sDrive28i, original TW list NT$3,090,000, currently listed at 102,686 km for NT$738,000 dealer asking at ~13 years = 23.9% of original list (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/BMW/Z4?v=4). Adjusting that ratio for 10 years instead of 13 and for 70,000 km instead of 102,686 km gives ~27.8% of list at dealer asking, i.e. ~NT$1,035,000; private sale set ~14.0% below that asking price = NT$890,000, dealer trade-in a further ~18.5% below private. Cross-check: converting the real 13-year E89 point to a private-sale equivalent (23.9% x ~0.88 = ~21.0% of list) means this checkpoint sits only ~3.5pp above a car three years older with 47% more mileage — the tail is still declining, not flattening, which is the correct German shape. Trimmed below the raw 2.0L-derived ratio because the M40i is a 3.0L carrying NT$22,410/yr of TW road+fuel tax, which suppresses old-car demand, and heavier out-of-warranty repair fear than the four-cylinder comparator. Revised down from NT$940,000: at 25.9% of real_cost the researcher's figure matched a NT$2.69M 2.0L BMW 420i in this dataset, whereas the 3.0L/NT$4M-plus German cars in the same batch (7-Series 17.5%, Cayenne 18.8%) show that dearer, bigger-engined German cars fall further in percentage terms. Explicitly extrapolated, not observed."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Estimated from BMW Taiwan authorised-dealer pricing norms for a six-cylinder oil service (roughly NT$9,000-13,000 parts+labour). Not from a retrieved BMW TW price table — bmw.com.tw blocked automated access. Reviewed and left unchanged by the fact-check pass."},{"y":3,"source":"Estimated. Still inside the 3-year unlimited-mileage BMW TW warranty, so this covers scheduled servicing and consumables only. No official TW price table retrieved. Reviewed and left unchanged by the fact-check pass."},{"y":5,"source":"Estimated. Dominated by the first tire set (~NT$68,000 fitted for staggered 19-inch performance run-flats in TW) plus plugs (~NT$18,000), front pads (~NT$20,000) and the AGM battery (~NT$15,000) — all age-triggered at this mileage. Warranty has expired mid-period. Bottom-up itemisation totals ~NT$155,000, so the researcher's NT$150,000 is within estimate noise and is left unchanged. No official TW price table retrieved."},{"y":7,"source":"Estimated, fully out of warranty and unsubsidised. RAISED from the researcher's NT$148,000 to NT$168,000 by the fact-check pass: their figure sat BELOW the 3-5 year period (NT$150,000), which breaks the requirement that period cost generally rises with age, and it did not fit the itemised content. Bottom-up: 2 oil services ~NT$24,000 + ZF8 oil and filter ~NT$28,000 + front discs and pads ~NT$45,000 + coolant, diff oil and filters ~NT$20,000 + soft-top service ~NT$8,000 + probability-weighted B58 electric water pump / thermostat / oil filter housing gasket allowance ~NT$35,000 = ~NT$160,000-170,000. No official TW price table or owner receipt thread retrieved."},{"y":10,"source":"Estimated, three-year period with no warranty and full unsubsidised cost. The largest single lines are the second tire set (~NT$72,000), the electric water pump + thermostat job (~NT$45,000) and a probability-weighted M Sport adaptive damper allowance (~NT$40,000, since a single failed electronic damper runs NT$35,000-50,000 fitted). Reviewed and left unchanged by the fact-check pass — the itemisation supports the figure and it is properly far above the same-engine Toyota GR Supra's NT$208,000 for the same window. No official TW price table or owner receipt thread retrieved."}],"sources":[{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2025 BMW Z4 車款總覽 (list-price verification, re-fetched by fact-check)","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/bmw-z4-2025","note":"PRIMARY price source for the fact-check pass — I fetched this page myself and it returned the TW lineup as sDrive20i M Sport NT$3,050,000 (1,998 c.c., 197 hp@4500 rpm) and M40i NT$3,720,000 (2,998 c.c., 340 hp@5000 rpm), both 2門2人座, fuel type 汽油. Confirms NT$3,720,000 with 0% variance. Note the equivalent 2026 URL returns HTTP 404, so this 2025-labelled page is the live TW model entry."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — BMW Z4 車款介紹 (researcher's price source; 403 on re-fetch)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/z4/7078/overall","note":"Cited by the researcher as primary price verification, quoting 'Z4 M40i | 372 萬 | 2,998 c.c. | 汽油 | 直列6汽缸 | 八前速手自排 | 後輪驅動 | 340 hp/5000 rpm | 10.9 km/l | 燃7,200 / 牌15,210'. This URL returned HTTP 403 Forbidden to my own fetch so I could not re-open it. I did NOT treat it as invented: the quoted tax figures are the correct statutory TW brackets for 2,998 c.c. (牌照稅 NT$15,210, 燃料費 NT$7,200) and the spec matches Yahoo exactly. Retained but flagged as unverified on re-fetch; the price does not depend on it."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — live BMW Z4 used listings (only real Z4 transaction data in Taiwan; re-fetched by fact-check)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/BMW/Z4?v=4","note":"RE-VERIFIED INDEPENDENTLY — returns exactly 2 cars nationwide, both previous-generation E89 and both dealer RETAIL asking prices: (1) 2013 Z4 sDrive28i, 102,686 km, 屏東縣, NT$738,000; (2) 2011 Z4 sDrive20i E89, 147,721 km, 高雄市, NT$588,000. Year, mileage and price all match the researcher's quotation exactly. These two points anchor the 7- and 10-year extrapolation. No current-generation G29 Z4 is listed at all."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — Z4 中古車行情分佈 (price/year distribution; re-fetched by fact-check)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/price-data.php?brand=BMW&model=Z4&year1=2006&year2=2026","note":"RE-VERIFIED — whole-market Z4 average NT$663,000, distribution table showing only two occupied buckets (55-59萬 x1 in 2011, 70-74萬 x1 in 2013), matching the researcher's quotation. Independently confirms how thin the Taiwan Z4 used market is and that SUM holds no data for cars under about 10 years old."},{"name":"HOT 大聯盟 好車網 — used-car inventory search (re-fetched by fact-check)","url":"https://www.hotcar.com.tw/UsedCarSell/CarFilter","note":"RE-VERIFIED — the page loads and returns 無符合條件之車輛 (no matching vehicles) for Z4. Second independent confirmation that there is effectively no Z4 liquidity in Taiwan, which is why every value checkpoint is marked low confidence."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2013 BMW Z4 (predecessor E89 original TW list prices)","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/bmw-z4-2013","note":"Supplies the denominator for the 7- and 10-year retention-ratio extrapolation. E89 TW list prices: sDrive18i 245萬, sDrive20i 272萬, sDrive28i M Sport Package 309萬, sDrive35i 370萬, sDrive35is M Sports Package 454萬. Caveat added by the fact-check pass: the SUM listing is described only as '2013 Z4 sDrive28i', so using the 309萬 M Sport Package price as the denominator may overstate the original list and therefore understate retention slightly — a conservative bias in the 7- and 10-year figures."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 — 2016 BMW Z4 (late E89 TW price)","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/bmw-z4-2016","note":"Late-run E89 lineup narrowed to a single trim, sDrive20i at 282萬. Secondary check on the predecessor price base. Not re-fetched by the fact-check pass."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — BMW Z4 車系沿革 (generation history)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/z4/7078/history","note":"Establishes the generation boundaries used for the predecessor extrapolation: E89 (2009-2016, retractable hardtop) versus the current G29 (2018 world debut, Taiwan launch May 2019 by 汎德, fabric soft top, facelifted 2022 / TW April 2023). Not re-fetched by the fact-check pass — the U-CAR host returned 403 to my fetches this session."},{"name":"Cross-model calibration — peer records in this dataset (fact-check pass only)","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/bmw-z4-2025","note":"Not an external source: the fact-check pass calibrated the depreciation curve and maintenance level against already-completed records in the same batch (Toyota GR Supra, which shares this car's B58 engine and ZF8 gearbox; BMW 4-Series 420i; BMW 7-Series 735i; Porsche Cayenne). Their year-1 retention band vs real_cost is 70.9-76.0% and their 10-year band is 17.5-26.0%, which is what showed the researcher's year-1 and year-10 figures to be at the optimistic edge. URL field repeats the price source because this row documents an internal consistency check, not a web citation."}]},"mercedes-a180-hatchback":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, far below the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. All checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7000/21000/35000/49000/70000). At this mileage every Mercedes service interval is TIME-driven, not distance-driven: ASSYST PLUS calls the car in at 1 year or 10,000 km whichever comes first, so the owner pays for a full service every year while covering only ~7,000 km. Consumables therefore age out rather than wear out — tires are replaced on rubber age (~every 5-6 years), brake fluid every 2 years, coolant on schedule. Low mileage is a genuine resale advantage in Taiwan and the used comps quoted here are low-mileage listings, not mileage-blind averages. Tax (牌照稅/燃料稅) and insurance are excluded from every figure by design. Fuel is also excluded. The A 180 carries a 48V mild-hybrid belt starter-generator; it cannot move the car on electricity alone, so it is classified gasoline, not hybrid.\n\nPRICE-LADDER CORRECTION (fact-check pass): the W177 A 180's Taiwan list price has moved a great deal over the generation's life — launched at 1,600,000 (2018/2019), rose to roughly 1,770,000-1,810,000 by 2021, reached 1,840,000 as the 進化版, and was cut to 1,650,000 for the MY2026 摘星版. Per-model-year retention ratios therefore whipsaw and are misleading. Every used checkpoint below is instead built from the ABSOLUTE observed dealer-retail asking price at the matching age and mileage, then scaled by the ratio of this car's real_cost to that comp car's original list price. That scaling already embeds the effect of the 190,000 price cut, so no second 'price-cut haircut' is applied on top — doing so double-counts, which is one of the errors corrected in this pass.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"RE-CHECKED AND RETAINED. No 1-year-old comp exists (the 摘星版 is brand new), so this is anchored on the verified 2-year comps and extrapolated up. Verified 8891 dealer-retail asking: 2024 @3,000km 1,458,000, on a car that listed at 1,840,000 (79.2% dealer-retail retention at 2 years). Scaling that to this car's price position (1,645,000 / 1,840,000 = 0.894) gives ~1,270,000 dealer retail at age 2, hence ~1,350,000 dealer retail at age 1 — also sanity-capped by the fact that a brand-new car with full 3-year warranty sits at 1,650,000, so a 1-year-old cannot ask within ~15% of it. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: dealer retail ~1,350,000 -> private sale 1,160,000 (-14%, the private-vs-dealer-retail spread) -> dealer trade-in 1,010,000 (a further -12.9%). Independent recomputation landed at 1,180,000 / 1,025,000, within ~2% of the researcher's figures, so they are kept unchanged. That is a 29.5% loss against real_cost in year one — the steep German entry-luxury first-year hit, correctly nowhere near a Japanese retention curve. Low mileage (7,000 km) is already priced in as an uplift; a 15,000 km car would be ~5% lower."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED (+1%, and the underlying comp was wrong). The researcher cited '8891 2023 @29,000km asking 123.8萬'; the live listing is actually a 2023 at 2,900 km asking 1,238,000 — a 10x mileage misreading. Correct verified 3-year comps: 2023 @7,000km 1,390,000; 2023 @2,900km 1,238,000; 2023 @30,000km 1,215,000; 2023 @60,000km 1,088,000. Interpolating to our 21,000 km gives ~1,270,000 dealer retail on a car that listed at 1,840,000. Scaling to this car's price position (x0.894) gives ~1,135,000, then a further -4% for the fact that those asking prices are stale and have not yet repriced against a 1,650,000 new car, giving dealer retail ~1,090,000. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: dealer retail ~1,090,000 -> private sale 960,000 (-12%) -> dealer trade-in 825,000 (a further -14.1%). NOTE: the researcher applied a 'price-cut haircut' ON TOP of retention ratios already derived from 1,840,000 cars, which double-counts the 190,000 cut; that is corrected here by scaling once. Year 3 is also the moment the 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty expires, which the used market discounts immediately — and the verified listings show exactly that cliff between the 2023 and 2021 cohorts."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWNWARD BY 9% — THIS WAS THE RECORD'S LARGEST VALUATION ERROR. The researcher wrote off 8891's '2021 @30,000km asking 86.8萬' as an implausible low outlier and interpolated up to ~980,000 dealer retail. The live listings show he mismatched the rows: the 868,000 cars are 2021s at 88,000 km, while the genuine 2021 @30,000 km car asks 880,000. The full verified 2021 cluster is 868,000 / 880,000 / 938,000 — i.e. the whole cohort sits at 868,000-938,000 with no outlier to discard, so the interpolation to 980,000 was ~10% above the actual market. Correct method: take ~880,000 dealer retail for a 30,000 km 2021 on a car that listed at ~1,790,000, scale to this car's price position (1,645,000 / 1,790,000 = 0.919) giving ~810,000 dealer retail. A small upward allowance is applied because the 2021 comps are PRE-facelift while this car is a facelift model, landing dealer retail at ~825,000. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: dealer retail ~825,000 -> private sale 720,000 (-12.7%) -> dealer trade-in 620,000 (a further -13.9%). Now two years out of warranty, so buyers discount for repair exposure; the decline does not flatten the way a Lexus would."},{"y":7,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED DOWNWARD BY 5%, AND THE CITED COMP WAS THE WRONG MODEL YEAR. The researcher's 'best mileage-matched comp, 8891's 2019 @45,000km asking 79.8萬' is actually a 2020 at 45,000 km, not a 2019. The genuine 2019 listings are far higher-mileage and thinner: @130,000km 758,000 and @90,000km 598,000 — neither is mileage-matched to our 49,000 km car, so no clean 7-year comp exists. The firmest available anchor is therefore the 2020 @45,000km at 798,000, which is a 6-year-old car at almost exactly our mileage. Scaling that to this car's price position (1,645,000 / ~1,750,000 = 0.94) gives ~750,000 dealer retail at age 6, and stepping down one further year at ~9% gives ~685,000 dealer retail at age 7. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: dealer retail ~685,000 -> private sale 605,000 (-11.7%) -> dealer trade-in 515,000 (a further -14.9%; the dealer spread widens as cars age and retail risk rises). FindCar's 1,173,000 2019 average was rejected as contaminated by A 250 / AMG A 35 variants and used only as an upper bound. Also corrected: the researcher assumed a 2019 A 180 originally listed at ~1,720,000; the W177 A 180 actually launched in Taiwan at 1,600,000, which is why per-year retention ratios were abandoned in favour of absolute-price scaling."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED UPWARD BY 13% — the researcher's year 10 was too pessimistic because it used only the two cheapest, highest-mileage W176 listings. EXTRAPOLATED; NO GENUINE 10-YEAR DATA EXISTS for this generation, because the W177 only reached Taiwan in 2018/2019 and its oldest examples are 7-8 years old. Method as instructed: take the PREDECESSOR W176 generation (2013-2018) at 10 years of age. The researcher anchored on 438,000 and 488,000 asking prices, but those are 80,000-90,000 km cars (a Facebook 438,000 example is explicitly 實跑9萬公里), whereas our car has 70,000 km. The broader verified picture is higher: FindCar shows a 2016 A180 average of 586,000 across 11 units (2016 A-Class 600,000 across 22 units) and SUM lists a 2016 W176 A180 at 568,000. Taking ~530,000 dealer retail for a 70,000 km 10-year-old W176 against a ~1,630,000 original list gives ~32.5% dealer-retail retention. Applying that to this car's real_cost of 1,645,000 gives ~535,000, then a ~6% reduction because the W177 is materially more complex than the W176 — MBUX, the 48V lithium pack and the RSG starter-generator all add repair risk a decade out — giving dealer retail ~500,000. ADJUSTMENT CHAIN: dealer retail ~500,000 -> private sale 440,000 (-12%) -> dealer trade-in 360,000 (a wider -18.2% spread, normal for a decade-old German car a dealer may not want). The tail still falls hard: -27% from year 7 to year 10, about -10%/yr, steeper than the -8%/yr of years 5-7. Confidence is LOW by construction: this is honest cross-generation extrapolation, not observed W177 data."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan service structure plus owner-reported Service A pricing (~NT$10,000-13,000 for a four-cylinder A-Class at a main dealer). Only one service falls in this window because the interval is time-based. Nothing else is due on a one-year-old car. Retained unchanged in the fact-check pass; the figure is plausible but rests on estimate rather than a published table."},{"y":3,"source":"Two scheduled services in the window (years 2 and 3), priced from Taiwan dealer estimates — Service B commonly quoted at NT$16,000-25,000, Service A at NT$10,000-13,000. Brake fluid is included in the year-2 Service B because Mercedes specifies it every two years regardless of mileage. No brake pads or tires yet at 21,000 km and three years of rubber age. Retained unchanged; arithmetic re-checked (20,000 + 11,000 + ~4,000 consumables = 35,000)."},{"y":5,"source":"Warranty expires at year 3, so this is the first window carrying full repair exposure. Service costs from Taiwan dealer estimates; tire, brake and battery costs from Taiwan market prices for this size and class. The tire and battery replacements are age-driven, which is exactly what makes a low-mileage German car expensive per kilometre — the parts expire on the calendar whether or not the car is driven. Retained unchanged; itemised sum re-checked at ~107,000 against the stated 105,000, within rounding."},{"y":7,"source":"A heavier service cycle falls around this age, with transmission fluid, plugs and belts pushing a single dealer visit past NT$40,000. Tires are not repeated here because they were replaced at year 5 and next fall due around year 10-11. The risk budget is a probability-weighted allowance for the documented weak points of this engine and its 48V system, not a certainty — but at 4+ years out of warranty, budgeting zero for them would be dishonest. Retained unchanged; itemised sum re-checked at ~112,000 against the stated 115,000. NOTE: the original record attributed the 「費用可能突破 NT$ 40,000」 quote to a Mobile01 thread that is actually a test-drive review; that attribution has been dropped and the figure is now presented as a market estimate."},{"y":10,"source":"EXTRAPOLATED. No 10-year W177 ownership data exists — the generation is only 7-8 years old — so this window is built bottom-up from item-level Taiwan dealer and specialist price estimates and from the known failure profile of the M282 engine and the 48V mild-hybrid hardware, cross-checked against W176-generation owner reports at comparable age. Itemised sum re-checked at ~239,000 against the stated 235,000, within rounding. Confidence is LOW: the single largest line, the 48V RSG and battery pack, is a probability-weighted allowance rather than a scheduled item, and the actual outcome for any individual car will be either much lower (nothing fails) or much higher (the RSG and a water pump both go). Moving to an independent Mercedes specialist from year 8 would realistically cut this window by 30-40%."}],"sources":[{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan — official models / price page","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/models.html","note":"Official 建議售價 source. Direct fetch timed out repeatedly from this environment in both the research and the fact-check pass; the NT$1,650,000 figure was instead confirmed against six independent Taiwanese motoring outlets that all quote the official price."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 87632 — A 180降19萬元、GLA 35降20萬元，新年式A-Class及GLA售價","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/87632","note":"Primary price confirmation, re-verified in the fact-check pass. Quoted verbatim: 「售價大幅調降達19萬元來到165萬元」. U-CAR returns HTTP 403 to direct fetch from this environment, so this is a verbatim search-result snippet rather than a full page read."},{"name":"8891 新車頻道 21805 — A 180摘星版 配備與價格異動","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/mercedes-benz/a-class/21805","note":"Fetched and read in full in BOTH passes. Confirms the 1,650,000 price, the 1,840,000 to 1,650,000 cut, and the exact equipment changes: added 12支喇叭Burmester音響系統; deleted 多光束智慧型LED頭燈、全景式電動天窗、智慧空氣淨化系統."},{"name":"udn autos — Mercedes-Benz A 180 摘星版城市試駕","url":"https://autos.udn.com","note":"ADDED IN FACT-CHECK. Independently confirms both the price and the body style: 「以165萬元的建議售價融合靈活操控與數位科技」 under the headline 「豪華掀背還值得買嗎？」. This is the source that validates 摘星版 = hatchback, which the original record asserted without direct evidence. Surfaced as a search-result snippet; only the site root is recorded because the article's canonical path was not captured."},{"name":"壹蘋新聞網 — 賓士大降價! A-Class、GLA最高省20萬","url":"https://news.nextapple.com","note":"ADDED IN FACT-CHECK. Fourth independent confirmation of the cut: 「售價從原本 184 萬元下修至 165 萬元，一口氣便宜 19 萬元」. Snippet-level source; site root recorded because the article path was not captured."},{"name":"TVBS 汽車 321578 — 台灣賓士入門車系最高降價20萬","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/321578","note":"Corroborates the price cut and its market context: 「A 180售價下修至165萬元」. Snippet-level source."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz A180 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/a/a180","note":"PRIMARY USED-PRICE SOURCE. Fetched and read in full in the fact-check pass, and the comp table was RE-EXTRACTED because the researcher's quoted comps did not match the live listings. Verified listings (model year @ mileage -> asking price, all 車商售價 dealer retail): 2024 @3,000km 1,458,000; 2023 @7,000km 1,390,000; 2023 @2,900km 1,238,000; 2023 @30,000km 1,215,000; 2023 @60,000km 1,088,000; 2022 @20,000km 1,088,000; 2022 @64,000km 1,088,000; 2021 @30,000km 880,000; 2021 @81,000km 938,000; 2021 @88,000km 868,000 (x2); 2020 @45,000km 798,000; 2020 @30,000km 647,000; 2020 @90,000km 498,000; 2019 @130,000km 758,000; 2019 @90,000km 598,000."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — 賓士 A180 / A-Class 中古車行情","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw","note":"Aggregate averages only, used with caution; the recorded URL is the site root, not a specific query page, so treat it as a weak citation. Two figures were surfaced and used only as sanity bounds: a 2016 A180 average of 586,000 across 11 units (and a 2016 A-Class average of 600,000 across 22 units), which materially informed the year-10 W176 anchor; and a 2019 average of 1,173,000 across 22 units, which was REJECTED as contaminated by A 250 / AMG A 35 variants and used only as an upper bound."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — BENZ A-CLASS W176 A180 中古車","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw","note":"Cross-check only. A 2016 W176 A180 at 568,000 (Taichung dealer) was surfaced and supports the year-10 anchor. The researcher's cited 2023 W177 listing at 1,380,000 (carinfo-741613.php) could NOT be re-verified in this pass, so that specific listing has been dropped and is not used in any checkpoint."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 73732 — 小改款 A-Class 導入 48V 輕油電","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/73732","note":"Powertrain classification evidence. Quoted: 「小改款A-Class將48V輕油電動力科技導入車系中」. Confirms the system is a 48V mild hybrid, hence gasoline for this table."},{"name":"Mobile01 — 小改款 A180 / B180 48V 試駕","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=303&t=6776116","note":"POWERTRAIN SOURCE ONLY. Quoted: 「小改款A/B-Class導入了48V輕油電科技…搭載1.3升四缸渦輪增壓引擎」. NOTE: the original record cited this same thread URL a second time as its maintenance / Service A / Service B pricing source. That is a citation error — a test-drive thread is not a service-price source — so this entry is now scoped to the powertrain claim only."},{"name":"PChome 買車 — 入門賓士A180，保養要花多少錢？","url":"https://car.pchome.com.tw/expert_article_content.php?eaid=4648","note":"ADDED IN FACT-CHECK to replace the mis-cited Mobile01 maintenance reference. An A180-specific Taiwan ownership-cost article. Surfaced by search but the article body was not read, so no NT$ figure is claimed from it directly; it supports only the general shape of the maintenance model. Maintenance confidence stays capped at medium/low because of this."},{"name":"UpToGo — 賓士保養一次要多少錢？原廠與外廠維修清單與費用大解析","url":"https://uptogo.com.tw","note":"ADDED IN FACT-CHECK. Secondary source describing the Mercedes Service A (小保養) / Service B (大保養) structure and the 原廠 vs 外廠 cost gap that underpins the 'independent specialist saves 30-40%' note. Snippet-level only; no verbatim NT$ figures were retrieved, so it cannot lift maintenance confidence above medium."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan — 新車保固 (warranty)","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/services/warranty.html","note":"Warranty basis for the maintenance plan: 3 years unlimited mileage as standard, with an optional purchased extension covering years 4-6. Critically, this is a DEFECT warranty — it does not include scheduled servicing, which is paid out of pocket unless a 星徽保養套餐 prepaid plan is bought separately. Snippet-level source."}]},"mercedes-b180-progressive":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, far below the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year. Every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km), so this is a genuinely low-mileage example at every resale point. Low-mileage listings were quoted where they exist — the single best-matched comparator in the whole TW dataset is a 2020 W247 B 180 at 39,800 km (about 6,600 km/yr, almost exactly this buyer's rate) asking NT$868,000 on SUM in 2026-08. All value_checkpoints figures are what the OWNER receives (private sale) or is offered (dealer trade-in), never the 車商售價 dealer asking price seen on 8891/SUM/FindCar. Excluded by design: 使用牌照稅 NT$7,120/yr + 公路養管費(汽燃費) NT$4,800/yr = NT$11,920/yr (1,332 c.c. bracket; the two figures are printed directly on the U-CAR B-Class spec row as 燃4,800 / 牌7,120), and all insurance (強制險/任意險). Fuel is also excluded — this record covers purchase, depreciation, maintenance and selling costs only. Powertrain note: the facelift B 180 carries a 48V BSG mild-hybrid; it cannot move the car on battery alone, so it is classified gasoline, not hybrid — U-CAR's own spec table lists 燃料 = 汽油, even though several TW used-car listings label the car 油電車. No charger-installation cost applies. The car uses conventional steel-spring suspension — no air suspension — so that failure mode is deliberately absent from the maintenance plan.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"No 1-year-old (2025) B 180 進化版 listings exist in the TW used market yet, so this is stepped back from the nearest real data and is the least anchored point in the record. Real dealer ASKING price re-verified on SUM 汽車網 (2026-08, fetched and parsed directly): 2024 W247 B 180 @ 42,060 km = NT$1,099,000 against a 1,790,000 list, i.e. 61.4% dealer retail at 2 years — but at ~21,000 km/yr, roughly 3x this buyer's rate. A 1-year car at only 7,000 km sits above that; dealer retail is put at ~NT$1,420,000 (79% of list). private_sale_price = that dealer asking price MINUS 10% (NT$1,275,000), because 車商售價 includes the dealer's margin, warranty and reconditioning; dealer_tradein_price = a further 14% below private (NT$1,095,000). Year-1 loss is 27.4% of real_cost — the German entry-luxury pattern in Taiwan, not a Japanese one. RESIDUAL RISK, stated openly: the implied year-1 dealer retail of 79% of list sits 17.5 points above the observed year-2 point, which is a steep single-year step; if the run-out clearance on this discontinued model is heavy in late 2026, the true year-1 private price could land NT$50,000-80,000 lower."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Best-supported checkpoint. Real 3-year-old same-generation, same-facelift dealer ASKING prices independently re-verified 2026-08: SUM 汽車網 2023 W247 B 180 @ 43,000 km = NT$1,088,000 (confirmed by direct fetch and parse of the 34-listing result set); FindCar 找車網 (datalist q=B180) 2023 B 180 @ 43,696 km = NT$1,128,000. Median ~NT$1,088,000 against the 2023 facelift list of 1,770,000 = 61.5% dealer retail at ~43,000 km. This buyer's car has only 21,000 km, so a low-mileage premium lifts dealer retail to ~NT$1,160,000 (64% of the 1,800,000 list). private_sale_price = dealer asking minus 11% (NT$1,030,000); dealer_tradein_price = a further 14% below private (NT$885,000). Private sale is 58.7% of real_cost at 3 years — the steep years 1-3 German drop. Confidence DOWNGRADED from 'high' to 'medium' by this fact-check pass: the underlying figures are only two or three dealer ASKING listings, and the number actually recorded is the product of two modelled conversions (a low-mileage premium and a dealer-to-private haircut) for which no observed private-sale transaction data exists. Real asking prices do not make a modelled private price high-confidence."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN by this fact-check pass (was 860,000 / 735,000). No 2021 W247 listings surfaced, so this is bracketed between real neighbours. The key comparator — which the original pass missed — is SUM 汽車網 2020 W247 B 180 @ 39,800 km asking NT$868,000, verified by direct fetch: that is a 6-year-old car driven ~6,600 km/yr, i.e. almost exactly this buyer's usage profile, and it retains 50.8% of its ~1,710,000 original list as DEALER ASKING. Interpolating between the verified 3-year point (61.5% of list at 43,000 km) and that 6-year point (50.8% at 39,800 km) puts a 5-year car at ~55% of list; mileage is already comparable between those anchors so only a small low-mileage adjustment applies, giving dealer retail ~NT$950,000. private_sale_price = dealer asking minus 11% (NT$845,000); dealer_tradein_price = a further 15% below private (NT$720,000). Private sale = 48.1% of real_cost. Warranty expired at year 3, which the market now prices in. The revision also removes the flat spot in the depreciation rate that the original curve carried."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"MATERIALLY REVISED DOWN by this fact-check pass (was 765,000 / 650,000) — this was the record's main defect. Real 7-year-old same-generation dealer ASKING prices, independently re-verified 2026-08. SUM 汽車網: 2019 W247 B 180 @ 68,389 km = NT$838,000; @ 77,869 km = NT$898,000; @ 118,694 km = NT$738,000. FindCar: 2019 @ 80,000 km = NT$958,000; @ 75,381 km = NT$758,000; @ 153,000 km = NT$580,000. Median excluding the 153,000 km outlier is ~NT$838,000 at ~77,000 km, against the 2019 list of 1,630,000 = 51.4%. The original pass set dealer retail at NT$865,000 while claiming to apply two haircuts — but NT$865,000 sits ABOVE the observed median, so the stated haircuts never actually bit, and the resulting private price of NT$765,000 was only ~3% under real dealer ASKING prices. That is the dealer-retail trap. Corrected build: take the 51.4% mileage-typical retention, apply it to this car's 1,800,000 list (NT$925,000), add ~6% for 49,000 km versus the comparators' ~77,000 km (NT$980,000), then apply the haircuts the evidence genuinely demands — (a) these are 車商售價 asking prices on ageing stock, systematically optimistic versus what transacts; (b) today's 2019 asking prices are inflated by Taiwan's post-2021 used-price run-up, which cannot be assumed to persist to 2033; (c) by 2033 the W247 is an orphan, the line is dead with no successor, and the out-of-warranty 1.3 M282 plus 48V BSG carries repair-risk discounting that the pre-facelift 2019 car did not. Net dealer retail ~NT$810,000 (45% of list). private_sale_price = minus 11% (NT$720,000); dealer_tradein_price = a further 15% below private (NT$615,000). This also fixes the broken curve shape: the original ran -10.1%/yr, -8.6%/yr, then FLATTENED to -5.7%/yr across years 5-7 before re-accelerating to -13.2%/yr, which is not a real depreciation shape."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — the W247 launched in Taiwan in June 2019, so no genuine 10-year data for this generation exists and none was invented. Method: take the PREDECESSOR W246 B 180 (1.6 M270) at 10 years old today, express it as a retention ratio of its own original list price, then apply that ratio to this car's real_cost. Real 2016 W246 B 180 dealer ASKING prices re-verified on SUM 汽車網 by direct fetch, 2026-08: NT$438,000 @ 120,091 km, NT$438,000 @ 110,000 km, NT$458,000 @ 124,516 km — median ~NT$445,000 at ~118,000 km. (The original pass also cited NT$468,000 @ 132,886 km and NT$298,000 @ 178,634 km; neither was present in the live 34-listing result set on re-fetch, so only the three verified rows are relied on here. FindCar independently shows 2016 B 180 at NT$438,000 and NT$458,000, consistent.) W246 B 180 original TW list ~1,550,000 (泳輪汽車 records 'about 150 萬'; a SUM ad for a 2018 運動版 with AMG 套件 states 新車 168 萬). Adjusting the median up ~18% for our 70,000 km car gives ~NT$525,000 = ~34% dealer retail. Applied to this car's 1,800,000 list that yields ~NT$610,000, then haircut to ~NT$570,000 dealer retail because the M282 1.3 (Renault co-developed) has a weaker out-of-warranty reputation than the M270 1.6, the 48V BSG is an expensive orphan part, and the B-Class line is discontinued with no successor. private_sale_price = minus 12% (NT$500,000); dealer_tradein_price = a further 14% (NT$430,000). Private sale = 28.5% of real_cost. The tail keeps falling (-11.4%/yr between years 7 and 10) rather than flattening the way a Lexus does."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Interval and warranty: Mercedes-Benz Taiwan 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty; service interval 每 10,000 公里或每 1 年以先到者為準, re-verified in the 比迪行銷 text by direct fetch. Service A price band NT$8,000-15,000 from the same source, whose itemisation of a Mercedes A 保養 includes 機油與機油濾芯、胎壓胎紋、煞車系統、燈光雨刷電瓶、各項液體油位 and 行車電腦診斷. REVISED UP from NT$9,000 to NT$11,000 by this fact-check pass: NT$9,000 sat at the very bottom of the dealer band for a visit that is more than an oil-and-filter change, and it was below the equivalent first-year figure on the same-drivetrain A 180 and CLA 180 records."},{"y":3,"source":"Two annual visits at 比迪行銷 (whbydcc) Mercedes TW dealer rates, re-verified by direct fetch: Service A NT$8,000-15,000, Service B NT$15,000-30,000, brake fluid on a ~2-year cycle. Still inside the standard 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty, so no repair line. Mileage stays under 21,000 km, so nothing mileage-triggered (plugs, transmission fluid) falls due. REVISED UP from NT$31,000 to NT$33,000 for consistency with the same-drivetrain A 180 and CLA 180 records built on the identical dealer price table."},{"y":5,"source":"比迪行銷 賓士保養費用 TW component pricing, re-verified by direct fetch: tires NT$5,000-15,000 each (17-inch B-Class sits at the low end), brake pads 30,000-50,000 km with pads+discs NT$15,000-40,000, AGM battery NT$8,000-15,000 with a 2-4 year life. Tire replacement is age-driven not tread-driven at 7,000 km/year — stated explicitly because a mileage-only model would wrongly skip it. Warranty expiry at year 3 per the Mercedes-Benz Taiwan warranty terms. Unchanged by this fact-check pass."},{"y":7,"source":"Routine service pricing from 比迪行銷 (Service A/B bands re-verified; the source explicitly notes B 保養 cost can exceed NT$30,000 once 火星塞/變速箱油 are included, so plugs and coolant are folded into the year-6 B service). Risk-item costs from the same source's out-of-warranty component table (引擎腳/變速箱腳 NT$10,000-25,000; 水泵、節溫器(水龜)、水管 and 點火線圈 named as the classic post-warranty Mercedes failure cluster; 傳動軸、李子串等底盤零件 'from a few thousand to over ten thousand'). 賓士輔助電瓶 is documented as a recurring service item by 泳輪汽車. REVISED UP from NT$95,000 to NT$112,000 by this fact-check pass: the original figure was IDENTICAL to the year-5 period despite the car being two more years out of warranty, on a discontinued model whose orphan-parts risk the record's own plan_notes argue is rising — maintenance must generally rise with age, and it did not. Chassis-bushing and alignment work was added and the risk basket lifted accordingly. This is a probability-weighted expected value, not a quoted repair — no owner receipts for a 7-year-old W247 were found, hence the low confidence."},{"y":10,"source":"Component prices from 比迪行銷 賓士保養費用, re-verified by direct fetch (傳統避震器一組 NT$20,000-40,000、引擎腳/變速箱腳 NT$10,000-25,000、水泵/節溫器/水管 and 點火線圈 as the named post-warranty cluster、變速箱油 as a B-保養 cost escalator、AGM 電瓶 NT$8,000-15,000、輪胎 NT$5,000-15,000/條、煞車來令片+碟盤 NT$15,000-40,000/套). The 48V BSG line is a modelled expected value: no TW repair-price data for a belt-driven starter-generator on the M282 was found, and it becomes an orphan part once the B-Class line ends. Explicitly NO air suspension line — the source flags 氣壓式避震器 as a very expensive failure, but the B-Class uses steel springs — and NO DPF, since this is a petrol car. Extrapolated, not sourced from receipts. Unchanged by this fact-check pass."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車頻道 — Mercedes-Benz B-Class 車款介紹","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/mercedes-benz/b-class/6939/overall","note":"PRIMARY price verification, INDEPENDENTLY RE-FETCHED AND PARSED by this fact-check pass. Spec row reads 'B 180 進化版 | 180 | 1,332 | 汽油 | 直列4汽缸 | 七速自手排 | 前輪驅動 | 136 hp/5500 rpm | 燃4,800 / 牌7,120'. Body text confirms 25/26 年式 offers the single B 180 進化版 trim at 180 萬, up 1 萬 from the prior year, and lists the 進化版 added equipment. Also confirms the BSG starter-generator +14 hp, and that the 燃料 classification is 汽油 (gasoline), not 油電."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan — 所有全新車型","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/models.html","note":"The lineup scout's original source for the NT$1,800,000 list price. This page again would NOT load during the fact-check pass (60 s timeout), so it was not read directly; the figure was independently re-verified on U-CAR instead and matches exactly."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 正式售價181萬元、177萬元起，小改款A-Class及B-Class國內發表","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/74607","note":"The 2023-04-20 TW facelift launch at NT$1,770,000 for B 180, single-trim, and the BSG belt-driven starter-generator adding 14 hp. Also documents 特選優惠套裝配件 at NT$130,000 / NT$289,000. URL confirmed live (HTTP 200) during the fact-check pass; content carried over from the original research pass rather than re-read in full."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 僅B 180單一車型、導入48V輕油電，小改款B-Class接單資訊流出","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/74112","note":"Confirms the facelift B 180 carries a BSG 48V 輕油電 mild-hybrid (not a full hybrid), +14 hp, 0-100 km/h 9.4 s, and records the pre-facelift B 180 price of 1,710,000. Basis for classifying the car as gasoline. URL confirmed live (HTTP 200) during the fact-check pass."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 導入B 180與B 200、售價163萬元起，大改款B-Class正式售價公布","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/47685","note":"W247 Taiwan launch, June 2019: B 180 = NT$1,630,000. Used as the original-list denominator for the 7-year retention ratio. URL confirmed live (HTTP 200) during the fact-check pass."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 中古車 — BENZ B-CLASS 搜尋結果","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?brand=BENZ&model=B-CLASS","note":"PRIMARY used-market dataset, INDEPENDENTLY RE-FETCHED AND FULLY PARSED by this fact-check pass on 2026-08-12 (共 34 筆, 28 listings extracted with generation, year, displacement, mileage and price). W247 dealer ASKING prices: 2024 @42,060 km NT$1,099,000; 2023 @43,000 km NT$1,088,000; 2020 @39,800 km NT$868,000; 2019 @68,389 km NT$838,000; 2019 @77,869 km NT$898,000; 2019 @118,694 km NT$738,000. W246 predecessor: 2018 @36,873 km NT$579,000 (ad states 新車168萬, AMG 運動版); 2017 @62,339 km NT$468,000; 2016 @110,000 km NT$438,000; 2016 @120,091 km NT$438,000; 2016 @124,516 km NT$458,000. The 2020 @39,800 km row is the single best-matched comparator for this buyer's ~6,600 km/yr profile and was MISSED by the original research pass. All are 車商售價 and were discounted 10-12% to reach private sale, then a further 14-15% to reach dealer trade-in."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — B180 中古車價格列表","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?q=B180&u=1","note":"Second independent used-price dataset, INDEPENDENTLY RE-FETCHED by this fact-check pass (共找到 55 輛車). Verified rows: 2023 @43,696 km NT$1,128,000; 2019 @80,000 km NT$958,000; 2019 @75,381 km NT$758,000; 2019 @153,000 km NT$580,000; 2016 @124,516 km NT$458,000; 2016 @75,327 km NT$458,000; 2016 @80,000 km NT$438,000. Listing sets rotate between page loads, so some rows cited by the original pass were no longer present; only re-verified rows are relied on. Again dealer asking prices, adjusted the same way."},{"name":"比迪行銷 — 賓士保養費用大公開：深度解析養車成本","url":"https://www.whbydcc.com/賓士保養費用/","note":"PRIMARY maintenance cost basis, INDEPENDENTLY RE-FETCHED AND READ by this fact-check pass. Verified quotes: 小保養（A保養）NT$8,000-15,000; 大保養（B保養）NT$15,000-30,000 '甚至更高…如果包含一些需要更換的耗材（例如火星塞、變速箱油等）'; '賓士的保養週期通常會是每 10,000 公里或每年一次（以先到者為準）'; 引擎腳、變速箱腳 NT$10,000-25,000; 傳統避震器一組 NT$20,000-40,000 (and a warning that 氣壓式避震器 costs far more per corner — not applicable to the steel-sprung B-Class); 傳動軸、李子串等底盤零件 from a few thousand to over ten thousand. Article dated 2025-08-03."},{"name":"泳輪汽車 — 總代理賓士B180進場小保養","url":"https://www.yonglun.tw/services/benz_maintenace/b180.html","note":"Independent Hsinchu workshop write-up of an actual B 180 小保養 (機油、機油濾芯、全車檢查) for under NT$4,000, explicitly stating that is 'less than half the Mercedes dealer price' — the cross-check that pins dealer 小保養 at roughly NT$9,000-11,000. Also documents 賓士輔助電瓶 as a recurring item and records the W246 B 180's original list as about 150 萬. URL confirmed live (HTTP 200) during the fact-check pass."},{"name":"修車趣 — 賓士 Mercedes-Benz B180 規格・保養費用・維修","url":"https://car.codecity.com.tw/m/mercedes-benz-b180","note":"Confirms 1,332 c.c. displacement and the annual tax figures that are EXCLUDED from this record by design (使用牌照稅 NT$7,120 + 公路養管費 NT$4,800 = NT$11,920/yr). Those two figures were independently corroborated by the U-CAR spec row ('燃4,800 / 牌7,120') during this fact-check pass. URL confirmed live (HTTP 200). Has no crowd-sourced B 180 repair receipts, one reason the year 7 and 10 maintenance confidence is low."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan — 保固 (原廠保固 3 年不限里程)","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/services/warranty.html","note":"Basis for the 3-year unlimited-mileage standard warranty that makes years 0-3 repair-free, and for the fact that years 4-6 extended warranty is a separately purchased option (not assumed here). WEAKEST SOURCE IN THIS RECORD: the mercedes-benz.com.tw domain would not load in either the original or the fact-check pass, so this page has never been read directly — it rests on a search-result snippet plus the well-established TW market convention. Flagged rather than dropped because the warranty term drives the year 0-3 repair-free assumption."},{"name":"CarBuzz — Mercedes-Benz B-Class Is Dead After The Current Generation","url":"https://carbuzz.com/mercedes-benz-kills-off-compact-car/","note":"INDEPENDENTLY RE-FETCHED AND READ by this fact-check pass, which CORRECTED how it was characterised. By Ian Wright, published 2026-03-13. The article confirms the B-Class dies after the current generation with no successor, but on timing it says only that the 2023 facelift 'makes it LIKELY the B-Class will go out of production later this year or early next year' — i.e. late 2026 or early 2027, speculative. The original research pass rendered this as production 'confirmed to end around June 2026', which is more specific and more certain than the source supports. The discontinuation itself is sound and still justifies (a) the run-out discount on the new car and (b) the extra haircut on the 7-year and 10-year residuals; only the June 2026 date has been removed."}]},"mercedes-c200-avantgarde":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr, far below the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000. Every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000/21,000/35,000/49,000/70,000). Two consequences. (1) Used values are quoted against LOW-MILEAGE comparables, not the mileage-blind average. My own scrape of 8891 confirms the premium is real: a 2014 C 200 Avantgarde with 50,000 km asks 550,000 while a 2015 C 200 Avantgarde with 155,000 km asks only 449,000 — the older but low-km car is worth 22% more. Within the current generation the same effect appears: a 2023 C 180 with 33,000 km asks 1,398,000 (64.4% of its original list) while 2022-2023 C 200s with 65,000-66,000 km sit at 59-61%. I apply roughly +5 percentage points of retention for this buyer's mileage. (2) Maintenance is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven: Assyst Plus triggers on '10,000 km or 1 year, whichever first', so this owner always hits the calendar trigger and never the mileage one. POWERTRAIN: EQ Boost is a 48V belt-driven integrated starter-generator (ISG) adding 22 hp of assist to the 1.5L turbo. It cannot move the car on electricity alone, so it is classified 'gasoline', NOT hybrid. Tax (牌照稅/燃料稅) and insurance are excluded by design and appear nowhere in these figures.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"INTERPOLATED, no direct listing — and I verified that absence myself rather than taking it on trust. I scraped 8 pages of 8891's Mercedes-Benz used inventory (6,118 cars listed; 41 C-Class Sedan entries recovered) and the newest C-Class Sedan registration present is 2023. There is genuinely no 2024-2026 W206 sedan on the market, so no 1-year comparable exists. This is bounded interpolation between a known year-0 (list 2,610,000) and the year-3 anchor below, using the German-luxury year-1 pattern: dealer retail asking about 79% of list = 2,062,000; private sale = x0.88 = 1,810,000; trade-in = private x0.87 = 1,570,000. Trimmed from the 1,840,000 the original record carried, to stay consistent with the year-3 anchor I re-based below. A 28.3% loss against real_cost in year one is the steep German first-year hit, deliberately NOT Toyota-like retention."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REAL LISTINGS, current generation, RE-SCRAPED AND RE-BASED IN THIS AUDIT. Confirmed present on 8891 today: a 2023 W206 C 200 at 1,499,000 / 66,000 km, and a 2022-registered C 200 at 1,450,000 / 65,000 km. The original record's second anchor (1,538,000 at 53,000 km) does NOT appear in the live data and I could not reproduce it, so it is dropped. DENOMINATOR CORRECTED: the original used a MY2023 C 200 list of 2,430,000; the correct figure is about 2,470,000 — KingAutos reports the 23/24年式 C 200 rose 80,000 to 2,550,000, so the preceding 23年式 was 2,470,000, and FindCar's MY2023 C 200 新車 average of 2,457,000 corroborates. Against 2,470,000 the two real cars retain 60.7% and 58.7% of list as DEALER ASKING at 3-4 years with 65,000-66,000 km. LOW-MILEAGE ADJUSTMENT, now evidenced rather than assumed: a 2023 C 180 with only 33,000 km asks 1,398,000 against its 2,170,000 original list = 64.4%, the best low-km current-generation comparable available. Our buyer is lower still at 21,000 km, so I use 65% dealer asking = 1,696,500; private sale 12% below dealer retail = 1,493,000 -> 1,490,000; trade-in a further 13% below private = 1,300,000. The 1,450,000-1,499,000 listed figures are 車商售價 and are NOT what the owner receives. Confidence lowered from 'high' to 'medium' because one of the two original anchors could not be reproduced."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"BRACKETED between real points; reviewed in this audit and left unchanged. W206 is only about 4 model years old, so year 5 is a one-year extension. Upper bracket, verified today: 4-year-old W206s with high mileage — a 2022-registered C 200 at 1,450,000 / 65,000 km and a 2022 C 180 at 1,280,000 / 69,000 km — sit at 58.7% and 59.5% of their original list. Lower bracket, also verified today: a 2021 W205 C 300 星夜版, 60,000 km, asking 1,180,000 against roughly 2,890,000 = 40.8% at 5 years, though that was a run-out model and so is pessimistic. I set year 5 at 52% dealer asking of 2,610,000 = 1,357,000, inside that bracket and nudged up for our 35,000 km. Private sale = x0.88 = 1,190,000; trade-in = x0.87 = 1,040,000. The year3->year5 drop of about 12 points keeps German mid-life decline steep; it does not flatten."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION — no 7-year-old W206 exists (launched Dec 2021). SOURCE REPLACED IN THIS AUDIT with a data point I verified myself. The original leaned on a 2019 C 300 進化版 at 1,098,000 that I could not find in the live listings. What IS present on 8891 today: a 2019-registered W205 C 200 進化版, 89,200 km, asking 819,000. Its original list was 2,270,000-2,310,000 (a dealer listing quotes 新車價227萬 for the 2019式 C200進化版; FindCar's MY2019 C 200 新車 average is 2,310,000), so that is 35.6% of list as dealer asking at 7 years — on a car with 89,200 km. Our car will have 49,000 km, far below that, so applying the roughly +5 point low-mileage premium evidenced in assumptions gives 41% of 2,610,000 = 1,070,000 dealer asking. Private = x0.88 = 940,000; trade-in = x0.87 = 820,000. Values unchanged from the original record, but they now rest on a listing I confirmed rather than one I could not. Out of warranty by now, and the used market prices in repair risk on a 48V Benz, which is why the tail keeps falling."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREDECESSOR GENERATION, same method as year 7; all points below re-confirmed in my own 8891 scrape. Real W205 points at age 9-12: 2017 C 200 Exclusive, 130,400 km, 619,000 against roughly 2,320,000 = 26.7%; 2016 C 200 Exclusive, 107,000 km, 598,000 against roughly 2,260,000 = 26.5%; 2015 C 200 Avantgarde, 155,000 km, 449,000 against roughly 2,150,000 = 20.9%; and critically a 2014 C 200 Avantgarde with only 50,000 km asking 550,000 against roughly 2,110,000 = 26% at TWELVE years — the low-km car holds the same ratio as cars two and three years younger, which is what quantifies the low-mileage premium at roughly +5 percentage points. I applied 31% of 2,610,000 = 809,000 dealer asking for our 70,000 km car. Private = x0.88 = 710,000; trade-in = x0.87 = 620,000. Explicitly extrapolated, not observed. Note the tail does not flatten: years 7 to 10 shed another 24% of remaining value."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Taiwan Mercedes dealer Service A pricing of 8,000-15,000 (whbydcc 賓士保養一次多少錢; tyaward quotes 8,000-12,000 typical). Used 12,000 for a C-Class 4-cyl. Inside the 3-year unlimited-mileage factory warranty, so no repair spend, but servicing is still paid."},{"y":3,"source":"Service B basic 12,000-18,000 and brake fluid 2,500-4,500 per Taiwan dealer price guides (whbydcc, tyaward). Still fully inside the 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty, so zero repair allowance — this is the cheapest window of ownership and it is genuinely cheap."},{"y":5,"source":"Tire set 32,000-45,000 per the Taiwan guides, pushed to 48,000 because the 2026 星耀版 runs 19-inch AMG wheels (low-profile rubber, not the 18-inch base fitment) — a spec confirmed in this audit from U-CAR's own 星耀版 description. Brake pads 15,000-30,000 quoted at 30,000-50,000 km; took the low end since 35,000 gentle km is easy on pads. The step up from 32,000 to 103,000 is the warranty expiring plus the first tire set landing in the same window — at this mileage tires are replaced on AGE (5-6 years), not wear."},{"y":7,"source":"Transmission fluid 15,000-30,000 (60,000 km interval), plugs 4,000-8,000 for a 4-cyl at 50,000-80,000 km, brake fluid 2,500-4,500 per the Taiwan dealer price guides. Fully out of warranty: the 25,000 risk line is a probability-weighted allowance for the German items the brief calls out — thermostat housing, electric water pump, coil packs — not a certainty of failure."},{"y":10,"source":"Suspension 30,000-60,000 and major electrical 15,000-80,000 per the Taiwan dealer guides; second tire set on age again. The 35,000 for the 48V ISG is the mild-hybrid-specific line the brief asks for: a full replacement runs 60,000-120,000 in Taiwan, weighted down for the chance it survives. Deliberately NOT a RAV4-like tail — a 9-year-old Benz out of warranty is where the money goes, and low mileage does not protect rubber, coolant, batteries or 48V electronics, all of which fail on age."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — Mercedes-Benz C-Class 車型價格與規格","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/mercedes-benz/c-class/7151/overall","note":"PRIMARY price source, re-fetched and re-parsed in this audit (403s a plain fetcher; retrieved with a browser user-agent). Live 售價(萬) spec table: C 180 星耀版 225, C 200 星耀版 261, C 300 星耀版 305. Also the source for 1,496 c.c. / 204 hp / 九前速手自排 / 後輪驅動, for 'C200 星耀版也增加 19 吋 AMG 鋁圈、MBUX 擴增實境導航功能', and for '全車系皆配置有 EQ Boost 動力科技，能額外提供 22 匹馬力輔助' — the basis for classifying this gasoline, not hybrid."},{"name":"U-CAR 問答 — 2026年式 C-Class 星耀版售價調整幅度","url":"https://aigc.u-car.com.tw/answer/merced-26750918","note":"SECOND, INDEPENDENT confirmation of the list price, added in this audit: 'C 180 星耀版為 225 萬元，C 200 星耀版為 261 萬元，C 300 星耀版為 305 萬元'. This is what settles the contradiction with the model page's older narrative text. Flagged as an AI-generated U-CAR page, hence used only as corroboration of the spec table, not as sole authority."},{"name":"KingAutos — 《台灣賓士》年式配備更新｜Mercedes-Benz C-Class 車系配備與售價更新","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/352464","note":"Fetched directly in this audit. Two load-bearing facts. (1) TRIM: '23/24年式C200將AMG Line套件列為標配' and, for the Estate, '取消舊款入門且售價(240萬元起)較親民的C200 Avantgarde車型' — the C 200 Avantgarde was discontinued in 2023, which is why the trim label was corrected. (2) PRICE HISTORY: '售價調漲8萬元，來到255萬元起' for the 23/24年式 C 200, which fixes the MY2023 C 200 list at about 2,470,000 and corrects the year-3 retention denominator."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz 二手行情 (used inventory)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/c200","note":"Re-scraped in this audit: 8 pages, 6,118 cars in inventory, 41 C-Class Sedan listings extracted with registration year, mileage and asking price. CORRECTION TO THE ORIGINAL RECORD'S NOTE: despite the '/c200' path this is NOT a C 200-specific page — it returns the whole Mercedes-Benz used inventory and must be filtered client-side. Confirmed present: 2023 C 200 1,499,000/66,000 km; 2022-reg C 200 1,450,000/65,000 km; 2023 C 180 1,398,000/33,000 km; 2022 C 180 1,280,000/69,000 km; 2021 C 300 星夜版 1,180,000/60,000 km; 2019 C 200 進化版 819,000/89,200 km; 2017 C 200 Exclusive 619,000/130,400 km; 2016 C 200 Exclusive 598,000/107,000 km; 2015 C 200 Avantgarde 449,000/155,000 km; 2014 C 200 Avantgarde 550,000/50,000 km. NOT reproducible today and therefore dropped: a 1,538,000/53,000 km W206 C 200, a 2020 C 180 at 938,000, and a 2019 C 300 進化版 at 1,098,000. All prices are 車商售價 and were discounted to private/trade-in."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz C-Class 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/c","note":"Confirmed reachable (HTTP 200) in this audit. Same inventory surface as above; used as a cross-check that the newest C-Class Sedan registration on the market is 2023, i.e. there is genuinely no 1-year-old comparable to quote."},{"name":"金融財子 — 賓士保養一次要多少錢與費用算給你聽","url":"https://tyaward.com.tw/汽機車-2/賓士保養一次要多少錢","note":"URL re-confirmed reachable in this audit. Service A 8,000-12,000 原廠 (3,000-6,000 外廠), Service B 12,000-18,000 basic rising to 25,000-30,000+ with plugs/transmission fluid/brake consumables; includes a real itemised dealer invoice (GLA 200 Service B with brake fluid, 12,656 before a 725 oil voucher). Also gives tires 32,000-45,000 and suspension 30,000-60,000."},{"name":"比迪行銷 — 賓士保養一次多少錢：原廠與外廠費用解析","url":"https://www.whbydcc.com/賓士保養一次多少錢/","note":"URL re-confirmed reachable in this audit. Service A 8,000-15,000, Service B 15,000-30,000 原廠; confirms the '10,000 km or 1 year whichever first' interval and the A/B alternation, plus independent cycles for brake fluid (2 years), spark plugs (50,000-80,000 km) and transmission fluid."},{"name":"比迪行銷 — 賓士保養週期深度解析","url":"https://www.whbydcc.com/賓士保養週期/","note":"URL re-confirmed reachable in this audit. Component-level Taiwan pricing used for the later windows: brake fluid 2,500-5,000, spark plugs 4,000-8,000 for a 4-cylinder, transmission fluid at 60,000 km, and the 60,000-120,000 km major-item intervals."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan — 保固 (warranty)","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/services","note":"Warranty structure verified in this audit: 3 years unlimited-mileage basic new-car warranty as standard, with a separately purchased 4th-6th year extension offered before the basic cover lapses. Confirms the maintenance plan_notes treatment — defects only, routine servicing paid from year 1, no extension assumed in years 4-10."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 206世代 C-Class 國內正式發表，210萬起","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/67780","note":"URL re-confirmed reachable in this audit. W206 Taiwan launch, Dec 2021, official range 2,100,000-2,890,000. Establishes the current generation is only about 4 model years old, which is why years 5/7/10 had to be extrapolated from W205."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 新一代 W205 C-Class 國內發表，正式售價195萬起","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/23818","note":"URL re-confirmed reachable in this audit. W205 launch pricing and trim structure, used as the denominator when converting old W205 asking prices into retention ratios for the year-7 and year-10 extrapolation."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — Benz C200 年份別新車與中古車均價","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/","note":"URL re-confirmed reachable. Used only as corroboration of two denominators recovered via search snippets: MY2023 C 200 新車均價 2,457,000 (supports the 2,470,000 derived from KingAutos) and MY2019 C 200 新車均價 2,310,000 (supports the year-7 W205 baseline). Citing the site root rather than guessing a deep URL."}]},"mercedes-cla180":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. All checkpoints use the 7,000 km/year midpoint, so assumed_km = 7,000 x years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). At this mileage Mercedes' 1-year-or-10,000 km service interval is triggered by TIME, not distance, so the car is serviced annually and never reaches a mileage-based interval early; consumables such as tyres and brake fluid age out rather than wear out. Licence tax (牌照稅), fuel tax (燃料稅), insurance and fuel are deliberately EXCLUDED from every figure per the table's design. Powertrain is classified 'gasoline' per this table's rule that a 48V mild hybrid is not a hybrid — see purchase.notes for the corrected technical description of the system. Resale figures assume the car stays in the low-mileage band, and every used-market anchor used below is a LOW-MILEAGE listing rather than a mileage-blind average, because low-mileage cars sell above that average in Taiwan.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN from a prior estimate of NT$1,460,000 (76% retention), which was too high for a German car in year 1. No C174 data can exist — the car launched in Taiwan on 2026-03-19, five months ago. Anchor is the direct predecessor at the same age: 8891 中古車 currently lists a MY2025 C118 CLA 200 at NT$1,700,000 @11,100 km (auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cla/cla200). Against the facelift CLA 200 list of NT$2,090,000 that is 81.3% DEALER ASKING retention; cutting 11% to reach a private-sale figure gives 72.4%. Applying 72% to NT$1,920,000 gives NT$1,380,000, i.e. an implied dealer asking of about NT$1,550,000. Cross-checks: the A 180 platform sibling in this dataset uses 70.3% at year 1, and a brand-new CLA 180 can be bought for about NT$1,880,000 net of discount, so a one-year-old must sit clearly below that. Two effects partly cancel — the MY2025 predecessor is a run-out model (depresses it) while the C174 is a fresh generation with waiting lists (supports it) — so the predecessor ratio is used as-is. Confidence stays low: this rests on a single predecessor listing and zero data for the actual car."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED UP from NT$1,150,000. Anchored on REAL listings of the direct predecessor at exactly this age and this mileage. 8891 中古車 currently shows MY2023 C118 CLA 200 (facelift, Taiwan list NT$2,090,000, verified via U-CAR 「正式售價分別為209萬及214萬元起」) at NT$1,498,000 @19,500 km, NT$1,458,000 @20,000 km and NT$1,450,000 @20,000 km, with higher-mileage cars falling to NT$1,388,000 @56,000 km and NT$1,250,000 @50,000 km. The prior research used a NT$1,420,000 dealer anchor, which is BELOW this low-mileage cluster — wrong direction, given the buyer profile explicitly calls for low-mileage listings. Correct low-mileage dealer asking is about NT$1,470,000. These are 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking), not what an owner receives; cutting 11% gives a private sale of about NT$1,308,000, i.e. 62.6% retention of that car's list. Applying 62% to NT$1,920,000 gives NT$1,190,000 (implied dealer asking about NT$1,337,000). Dealer trade-in a further 13% below private sale. The ~38% three-year loss is the German pattern and is far steeper than a Japanese equivalent."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED UP from NT$900,000 (47%), which was internally impossible: the prior record's own five-year figure sat BELOW what real six- and seven-year-old predecessors are actually asking. Interpolated between two real anchors on the direct predecessor. Upper anchor is the year-3 MY2023 cluster above (62.6% private). Lower anchor is 8891's MY2020 C118 CLA 200 at NT$1,058,000 @53,000 km — against the pre-facelift list of NT$1,880,000 (confirmed at launch, 「售價188萬起」) that is 56.3% dealer asking, so 50.1% private at SIX years, on a car carrying more mileage than ours would. A MY2019 at NT$990,000 @117,000 km is consistent with it. Five years therefore lands near 50%, not 47%: 0.50 x 1,920,000 = NT$960,000, dealer trade-in 13.5% below. Held at exactly 50% rather than the 53-54% a straight interpolation would give, because the predecessor cluster is spec-inflated (AMG Line, heavy options) and because the C174 will be mid-cycle with a facelift on sale by 2031. Deliberately noted: MY2022 listings (NT$1,580,000-1,668,000 at ~10,000 km) ask MORE than same-condition MY2023 cars, which is a COVID-era pricing artefact and was excluded rather than used to lift this figure."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the PREVIOUS generation, as required — no C174 and no C118 car is seven years old at a comparable point. Uses the C117 CLA (Taiwan list taken as ~NT$1,890,000 for CLA 200; see open questions, this denominator could NOT be verified first-hand and directly scales the answer). 8891 shows MY2018 C117 cars, now eight years old, asking NT$688,000 @79,000 km, NT$659,000 @113,000 km and NT$588,000 @119,000 km. Our car would be at only ~56,000 km at eight years, so a ~8-10% low-mileage premium over the NT$688,000 car gives a dealer asking near NT$750,000; cutting 11% for private sale gives about NT$665,000, i.e. ~35% eight-year retention. Interpolating back to seven years gives ~40%, and 0.40 x 1,920,000 = NT$770,000. Held at 40% rather than the ~45% the newer C118 six-year point would imply, because the C117 is the only generation with real data at this age and the used market openly prices in out-of-warranty repair risk once the 3-year factory warranty is long gone — the curve keeps falling here rather than flattening the way a Lexus would. Dealer trade-in a further 14% below private sale. Sibling cross-check: the A 180 record uses 36.7% at year 7."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the PREVIOUS generation, and the best-evidenced point on the curve after year 3. Real C117 listings on 8891 today at almost exactly our assumed mileage: MY2016 (ten years old) asking NT$630,000 @64,000 km and NT$658,000 @69,000 km, against NT$558,000 @120,000 km for a high-mileage example. Our car at ten years has ~70,000 km, so the NT$630,000-658,000 pair are direct analogues and NO speculative low-mileage premium is needed — this corrects the prior method, which applied a 15% premium to the 120,000 km car and only coincidentally landed in the same place. Low-mileage dealer asking is therefore about NT$645,000; cutting 11% gives a private sale of about NT$574,000, i.e. ~30.3% retention of that car's ~NT$1,890,000 list. Applying 30% to NT$1,920,000 gives NT$575,000. A MY2016 at NT$246,000 was excluded as an outlier (almost certainly accident-damaged or a finance headline). Dealer trade-in cut a full 15% below private sale, the widest gap on the curve, because dealers price aged out-of-warranty German stock defensively. Confidence stays low despite the good listing cluster, because the C117 list price used as the denominator is unverified."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Cost of a single Service A at a Mercedes-Benz Taiwan dealer, from aggregated Taiwan cost guides and Mobile01 owner reports (Service A quoted at NT$8,000-15,000; ~NT$11,000 used for a 1.5L entry model), plus minor consumables. The Assyst Plus service computer sets the A/B code from time, mileage and driving pattern, and at 7,000 km/year the annual trigger always comes first. Warranty term of 3 years unlimited mileage verified against Mercedes-Benz Taiwan warranty descriptions."},{"y":3,"source":"Two annual dealer visits (one Service B ~NT$20,000 + one Service A ~NT$11,000) plus ~NT$3,000 of consumables, priced off the Taiwan Service A/B ranges of NT$8,000-15,000 and NT$15,000-30,000 reported by dealer cost guides and owner forum posts. Brake fluid falls inside the Service B package at the 2-year mark. No wear parts due yet at 21,000 km. Matches the NT$35,000 the A 180 sibling record uses for the same window."},{"y":5,"source":"Two dealer services plus age-driven consumables. Tyre cost taken at NT$8,000-9,000 per corner fitted for 18-inch premium rubber, giving ~NT$34,000 a set — trimmed from a prior NT$40,000, which overstated a CLA-sized fitment; the A 180 sibling record quotes NT$32,000 for the same 225/45R18. Front pads and discs at a Mercedes dealer trimmed to ~NT$24,000 on the same basis. AGM batteries for this platform run about NT$12,000. This is the first window carrying real wear cost and the first outside warranty, which is exactly where the German cost curve separates from a Japanese one."},{"y":7,"source":"Two dealer services plus wear and early out-of-warranty failure items. Supported by Taiwan cost guides noting the 60,000 km major cycle (transmission fluid, spark plugs, belts) can push a single visit past NT$40,000, and by an owner report of a ~NT$230,000 bill at 7.5 years covering brake discs, pads, water pipes and belts. Risk items are probability-weighted, not assumed certain. Itemised Taiwan dealer pricing for coil packs and thermostat housing could not be found in any source, so those figures are estimates and this window is marked low."},{"y":10,"source":"Extrapolated out-of-warranty cost for a 7-10 year old Mercedes in Taiwan, built item by item rather than as a lump sum. Grounded in Taiwan dealer cost guides (大保養 NT$16,000-25,000 rising past NT$40,000 at major cycles, one owner quoted NT$58,000 for a comprehensive service before additional cooling work) and the ~NT$230,000 / 7.5-year owner report. Two corrections to the prior research applied here: the gearbox is an 8-speed dual-clutch, not a 7G-DCT, and the second tyre set and front brake job were trimmed to CLA-appropriate unit costs. The 48V machine is the specific mild-hybrid risk item for this powertrain and is worse than a belt-driven starter-generator because it sits inside the transmission; no Taiwan source gives itemised pricing for it, so both the failure cost and the weighting are estimates, and this window is marked low."}],"sources":[{"name":"UDN 汽車 — 新一代 Mercedes-Benz CLA 在台上市 台幣 187 萬元起","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/124115/9391149","note":"FETCHED FIRST-HAND and the single strongest price source. Quotes all four variants with 建議售價: CLA 200 with EQ Technology 187萬, CLA 250+ with EQ Technology 220萬, CLA 180 192萬, CLA 220 225萬. This is what confirms list_price = 1,920,000 and settles the 187萬-vs-192萬 ambiguity: 187萬 is the electric CLA 200, not the CLA 180."},{"name":"8891 新車頻道 — 大改款 CLA 台灣上市報導","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/mercedes-benz/cla/21537","note":"FETCHED FIRST-HAND. Confirms Taiwan launch 2026-03-19, four variants, the band 「價格帶落在187～225萬間，各車型均較預售價再降7萬」, that the entry price undercuts the previous CLA's 210萬, and CLA 180 spec (1.5L turbo four, 136hp/20.4kgm, 0-100 in 8.8s, 48V). IMPORTANT: on re-fetch this article gives NO per-variant price table, only the band — the prior research cited it as confirming CLA 180 = 192萬, which it does not do on its own."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz CLA 200 二手車在售清單","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cla/cla200","note":"FETCHED FIRST-HAND; source of every real used data point. Listings captured today include MY2025 1,700,000 @11,100 km; MY2024 1,390,000 @20,000 km; MY2023 1,498,000 @19,500 km, 1,458,000 @20,000 km, 1,450,000 @20,000 km, 1,388,000 @56,000 km, 1,250,000 @50,000 km, 1,199,000 @35,400 km; MY2020 1,058,000 @53,000 km; MY2019 990,000 @117,000 km; MY2018 688,000 @79,000 km, 659,000 @113,000 km, 588,000 @119,000 km; MY2016 658,000 @69,000 km, 630,000 @64,000 km, 558,000 @120,000 km; MY2015 528,000 @75,000 km, 488,000 @67,000 km. All are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking) and were cut 11% to reach private-sale figures. Note the prior research misattributed the 1,199,000 @35,400 km car to MY2022 — it is MY2023 — and missed the MY2016 cars at 64,000-69,000 km that are the exact-mileage analogues for the ten-year point."},{"name":"DuckDuckGo 搜尋 — CLA 180 台灣售價 192萬 vs 187萬 交叉查證","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=%22CLA+180%22+%22192%E8%90%AC%22+OR+%22187%E8%90%AC%22+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9","note":"Search page fetched first-hand. Returns five independent outlets agreeing on CLA 180 = 192萬: U-CAR (「燃油車型則具備CLA 180以及CLA 220兩款車型，新車售價分別為192萬元以及225萬元」), Auto-Online (「CLA 180：192萬元、CLA 220：225萬元」), Yahoo 汽車, TVBS 地球黃金線 and a PTT repost of the U-CAR piece."},{"name":"DuckDuckGo 搜尋 — 小改款 C118 CLA 2023 台灣售價","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=%E5%B0%8F%E6%94%B9%E6%AC%BE+CLA+2023+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82+CLA200+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+%E8%90%AC%E5%85%83+U-CAR","note":"Search page fetched first-hand. Establishes the year-1/year-3 denominator: U-CAR 「小改款CLA同樣提供Coupé及Shooting Brake雙車系選擇，正式售價分別為209萬及214萬元起」, corroborated by 地球黃金線 「台灣賓士開出建議售價203萬與209萬元起」. So the MY2023-2025 facelift CLA 200 list is NT$2,090,000."},{"name":"DuckDuckGo 搜尋 — C118 CLA 200 2019 台灣上市售價","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=C118+Mercedes-Benz+CLA+200+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+2019+%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+188%E8%90%AC+%E9%A0%90%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9","note":"Search page fetched first-hand. Establishes the pre-facelift denominator used for the five-year point: FindCar 「Benz 賓士,CLA200,2019年新車參考價:188萬」 and a launch report 「CLA 200與250兩車型推出、售價188萬起」. So the C118 CLA 200 launched in Taiwan at NT$1,880,000."},{"name":"DuckDuckGo 搜尋 — 新世代 CLA 180 M252 引擎與 8 速雙離合器變速箱規格","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%96%E4%BB%A3+CLA+180+1.5L+M252+48V+%E8%BC%95%E6%B2%B9%E9%9B%BB+8%E9%80%9F+%E9%9B%99%E9%9B%A2%E5%90%88%E5%99%A8+27%E9%A6%AC%E5%8A%9B+%E9%A9%85%E5%8B%95","note":"Search page fetched first-hand, and the basis for the powertrain correction. Confirms engine code M252, an 8-speed dual-clutch (NOT the older 7G-DCT), and a 48V electric machine integrated into the gearbox rather than belt-driven, adding ~30hp and permitting low-load 'electric sailing'. Classification stays 'gasoline' per this table's 48V rule, but the prior record's claim that the system cannot move the car electrically at all is wrong."},{"name":"DuckDuckGo 搜尋 — 賓士台灣原廠保固與保養套餐是否內含","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3%E8%B3%93%E5%A3%AB+%E6%96%B0%E8%BB%8A+%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A+3%E5%B9%B4+%E5%8E%9F%E5%BB%A0%E4%BF%9D%E5%9B%BA+%E4%B8%8D%E9%99%90%E9%87%8C%E7%A8%8B+%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E5%A5%97%E9%A4%90+CLA","note":"Search page fetched first-hand. Confirms Mercedes-Benz Taiwan's 3-year unlimited-mileage factory warranty (「負3年期且不限里程之保固責任」) and that scheduled servicing is NOT bundled as standard — 保養套裝 are sold separately or thrown in as time-limited campaigns (one snippet: 「凡於3月入主CLA、CLA Shooting Brake加碼再贈3年保養套裝」). Basis for treating years 0-3 as repair-risk-free but still paying full service invoices, with the campaign caveat recorded in plan_notes."},{"name":"DuckDuckGo 搜尋 — 賓士 Service A / Service B 台灣保養費用","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=%E8%B3%93%E5%A3%AB+CLA+%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A+%E8%B2%BB%E7%94%A8+Service+A+Service+B+%E5%8E%9F%E5%BB%A0+%E5%B0%8F%E4%BF%9D+%E5%A4%A7%E4%BF%9D+%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC+mobile01+%E5%AF%A6%E5%8B%99","note":"Search page fetched first-hand, aggregating Taiwan dealer cost guides and Mobile01 owner posts. Gives dealer Service A at NT$8,000-15,000 and Service B at NT$15,000-30,000+, describes the Assyst Plus system that generates A1/B3-style service codes from time, mileage and driving pattern, and notes independent shops at roughly NT$6,000 per 10,000 km against higher official rates. These are the unit costs behind every maintenance checkpoint."},{"name":"DuckDuckGo 搜尋 — 賓士 CLA 二手行情交叉查證","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=%E8%B3%93%E5%A3%AB+CLA+%E4%BA%8C%E6%89%8B+%E8%A1%8C%E6%83%85+8891+CLA200+2022+2023+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+%E8%90%AC%E5%85%83+%E5%85%AC%E9%87%8C","note":"Search page fetched first-hand, used to cross-check the 8891 listing page. Surfaces MY2022 CLA 200 at 1,580,000 (「總代理僅跑一萬 低里程」) and 1,668,000, and MY2023 at 1,376,000 and 1,238,000. The MY2022 pair ask more than same-condition MY2023 cars, a COVID-era pricing artefact; both were excluded from the five-year derivation rather than used to inflate it."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 純電187萬、燃油192萬元起，大改款 CLA 車系國內正式發表","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/87172","note":"NOT read first-hand — direct fetch returns HTTP 403, same as the prior research reported. Its headline and body text were read only through the search-result snippet cited above. Listed for traceability; the price it carries is independently confirmed by the UDN page, which does load."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan — CLA 車型與售價官方頁","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/models/saloon/cla/overview.html","note":"NOT read first-hand — timed out after 60s on every attempt, reproducing the prior research's failure. The official 建議售價 therefore still rests on six independent Taiwan outlets rather than the brand site. Listed for traceability, not as a page that was parsed."}]},"mercedes-cla200-eq":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, far below the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year. All checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). Because low-mileage cars sell above the mileage-blind average, every value checkpoint is anchored on LOW-MILEAGE 8891 listings of the closest siblings (2023 EQA 250 at 10,200 km, 2023 EQB 300 at 16,000 km), not on the whole listing spread. EXCLUDED BY DESIGN: tax and insurance. Also EXCLUDED from maintenance (but a real ownership cost): home charger installation - a 7-11 kW wallbox in a Taiwanese apartment building typically runs NT$40,000-80,000 including the Taipower meter application and riser wiring, and can exceed NT$100,000 if the building must first pass a collective-housing EV charging permit; budget it separately. Taiwan BEVs are 牌照稅-exempt through 2030 and the 貨物稅 reduction is understood to be already inside the NT$1,870,000 list price, so neither is a further saving to model here (this audit could not re-fetch the official page to confirm the 貨物稅 wording - mercedes-benz.com.tw times out from this network - so it is reported as the researcher's reading, not as re-verified fact). Electricity cost is not modelled. At 7,000 km/year the servicing schedule is TIME-driven, never mileage-driven: the car never reaches a mileage trigger before a calendar one.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, but the researcher's supporting claim was FALSE and is corrected here. The record asserted 8891 shows ZERO listings for the CLA with EQ Technology and that 'the whole Mercedes BEV range shows no 1-year-old cars at all'. The live 8891 CLA board (auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cla, 545 cars, read 2026-08-12) in fact carries 'M-Benz CLA 2026款 CLA 250+ 純電, 2026年, 8,000公里, 217.0萬', flagged 車行勿擾喔！ - i.e. a genuine 個人自售 PRIVATE listing of this exact model line at ~5 months old, asking 98.6% of the CLA 250+'s NT$2,200,000 list. That is an aspirational asking price on a near-new car from a seller anchored to what he paid, not a transacted 1-year value, so it is NOT used to set this figure; it is recorded as a weak UPPER-BOUND signal that argues against going lower than modelled here. The number itself comes from the German-BEV first-year loss pattern applied to the verified NT$1,870,000 list: implied dealer retail asking ~NT$1,440,000 (77% of list), from which private sale is set ~11% BELOW dealer asking (NT$1,280,000) and dealer trade-in a further ~13% below private (NT$1,110,000). The steep 31% first-year loss is deliberate and is corroborated by Mercedes cutting NT$70,000 before deliveries began. Private sale at 68.4% of list sits correctly inside the German BEV band and just below the combustion CLA 180's year-1 position, which is the right relationship. A German BEV holding Toyota-like year-1 value would be wrong."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Derived from real LOW-MILEAGE sibling listings on 8891, every one of which this audit re-fetched and confirmed line by line on 2026-08-12. EQA 250 (auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqa, 10 cars nationwide, current list NT$2,170,000): 2023 cars asking 140.0萬 at 1.02萬公里, 135.0萬 at 3.7萬公里, 125.0萬 at 4萬公里, 122.0萬 at 1.4萬公里 - low-mileage 3-year dealer retail ~NT$1,350,000 = 62% of list. EQB 300 4MATIC (auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqb, 11 cars nationwide, current list NT$2,670,000): 2023 cars asking 158.0萬 at 1.6萬公里 and 155.0萬 at 3.15萬公里 = ~59% of list. Applying that 59-62% dealer-retail band to the CLA's NT$1,870,000 gives ~NT$1,120,000 dealer asking. ADJUSTMENT MADE: those are 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking, most tagged 實體車行), not what an owner receives - private sale set ~11% below at NT$1,000,000, and dealer trade-in a further ~13% below at NT$870,000. KNOWN LIMITATION, unchanged from the original: the denominators are CURRENT list prices, while the 2023 cars were sold at 2022/2023 prices, so the ratio is a close proxy rather than an exact retention."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the older end of the Mercedes BEV curve on 8891, re-fetched and confirmed by this audit 2026-08-12. Bracketing points: a 2022 EQA 250 with 9.5萬公里 asks 99.6萬 (46% of the EQA's NT$2,170,000 list) at ~4 years; 2022 EQB 300s with 7.63萬-13.45萬公里 ask 106.8萬-113.8萬 (40-43% of list). Implied CLA dealer retail at 5 years ~NT$843,000 = 45% of list - set at the upper end of that band precisely because this car has only 35,000 km where the EQA/EQB comparators have 76,300-134,500 km. Private sale set ~11% below dealer asking (NT$750,000), trade-in ~14% below private (NT$645,000). Confidence is low: no Mercedes compact BEV has yet traded at 5 years in Taiwan, and the car is out of its 3-year warranty by this point, which the used market prices in. At 40% of list this sits correctly among the German BEV peers and well below the combustion CLA 180's 5-year position."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED VIA PREDECESSOR-GENERATION RATIO - no 7-year data exists for any Mercedes compact BEV in Taiwan. DENOMINATOR CORRECTED BY THIS AUDIT: the researcher divided by ~NT$3,290,000, but all three EQC cars on 8891 are the 400 4Matic 運動版, whose Taiwan launch price was NT$3,500,000 (NT$3,290,000 corresponds to the cheaper base ELECTRIC ART trim, so the original ratio was computed against the wrong variant and flattered retention). The listings re-confirmed 2026-08-12 (auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqc, only 3 cars in the whole country): 2020 EQC 400 4Matic 運動版 asking 108.0萬 at 3萬公里, 108.0萬 at 3.6萬公里, and 99.0萬 at 12.9萬公里. Against the correct NT$3,500,000 that is 30.9% dealer-retail retention at 6 years even at 30,000 km, not the ~33% claimed. Extending one year gives ~28% of list, then adding back ~3-4 points because the CLA is a much cheaper car (cheaper cars retain a higher percentage) on a far better and newer platform (542 km vs the EQC's 417 km) gives ~31% = ~NT$580,000 dealer asking; private sale set ~12% below (NT$510,000), trade-in ~15% below private (NT$435,000). The corrected denominator and the added relative adjustment roughly cancel, so the figures themselves are retained. The tail keeps falling rather than flattening the way a Lexus does, because the car is four years out of its 3-year warranty and the market prices in high-voltage repair risk. Confidence low: single weak comparator (3 listings) of a different, larger, discontinued model, and the EQC launch price could not be re-fetched in this session."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED BY AUDIT (was NT$230,000 private / NT$190,000 trade-in). The original rested on a single bad anchor: 'a 2016 CLA 200 with 50,000 km asks NT$246,000 on 8891 = 14% dealer-retail retention at 10 years'. Re-reading that board (auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cla, 545 cars, 2026-08-12) shows the listing is a 2016 CLA250 (2017款), not a CLA 200, and its title is 【買車送你一年車貸，限時優惠中】 - a financing-hook bait price, and an extreme outlier against every comparable on the same page: 2016 CLA200 at 12萬公里 asks 55.8萬, 2017 CLA200 at 11萬公里 asks 55.8萬, 2015 CLA250 at 11.82萬公里 asks 62.9萬, 2018 CLA250 at 8萬公里 asks 69.8萬, 2014 CLA250 at 5.5萬公里 asks 47.7萬. The real 10-year low-mileage combustion CLA sits at ~NT$550,000-700,000 dealer retail, i.e. ~30-35% of list, NOT 14% - and that is consistent with the combustion CLA 180 record in this same batch. Rebuilt on the correct anchor: take the combustion CLA's genuine ~32% 10-year dealer-retail retention and apply a heavy BEV penalty, because the ~8-year high-voltage battery warranty has lapsed inside this window and a pack replacement approaches the whole value of the car, which the Taiwan used market discounts hard. That gives ~18% of list = ~NT$345,000 dealer asking; private sale ~13% below (NT$300,000), trade-in ~15% below private (NT$255,000) - at this value many dealers will only offer scrap-adjacent money. Private at 16.0% of list still sits at the weak end of the German BEV peer group and is roughly HALF the combustion CLA's 10-year retention, so the BEV penalty is preserved; the tail still falls steeply from 27% at year 7 rather than flattening. Explicitly extrapolated - no BEV of any German brand has reached 10 years old in Taiwan - hence low confidence."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Modelled on the Mercedes-Benz Taiwan service structure (保養 A / A Plus / B / B Plus scheme) plus the 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty. Cost is low because all repairs are warranty-covered and at 7,000 km almost nothing is consumed; it is not zero because Taiwan is understood to bundle no free scheduled maintenance. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED BY AUDIT from medium to low: Mercedes Taiwan publishes no EQ servicing price table, no owner receipt could be retrieved (Mobile01 blocks automated access), and this audit could not re-fetch mercedes-benz.com.tw at all (HTTP 000, host times out), so even the warranty and service-scheme structure that bounds this figure is unconfirmed. A modelled dealer-rate estimate, not a quote."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers years 1-3 only (not cumulative). Bounded by the assumed 3-year unlimited-mileage Mercedes-Benz Taiwan warranty, which means the owner pays only calendar consumables and labour in this window - brake fluid is the one substantive item. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED BY AUDIT from medium to low for the same reason as year 1: the warranty term and the 保養 A/B structure that bound this number could not be re-verified in this session, and Mercedes Taiwan publishes no EQ service price list. Modelled dealer-rate estimate."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers years 3-5 only. REDUCED BY AUDIT from NT$98,000 to NT$78,000: the original carried a NT$46,000 dealer-fitted 19-inch tyre set, which is above the going Taiwan dealer rate for this size (~NT$8,000-10,000 per tyre fitted, i.e. ~NT$38,000 a set), and the period as a whole sat only NT$12,000 below the combustion CLA 180's same window despite the BEV having no oil, filter, plug or DCT service in it. This is still the step change in the curve: the 3-year warranty has lapsed so the owner now pays everything, and the age-driven tyre set plus the first 12V battery both land here. No published price table or owner receipt for EQ servicing could be retrieved (Mobile01 blocks automated access; mercedes-benz.com.tw times out), so these are modelled from market dealer rates rather than sourced quotes - hence low confidence."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers years 5-7 only. REDUCED BY AUDIT from NT$125,000 to NT$88,000. The original placed this BEV window ABOVE the combustion CLA 180's equivalent window (NT$105,000), which is not defensible: the combustion car's 5-7 year spend is dominated by the 1.3L turbo, its 48V starter-generator, plugs, coils and DCT service, none of which exist here. It also double-charged a 12V battery at year 7 when one was already fitted at year 5 - a 4-5 year part, so the next one falls in the 7-10 window and has been moved there. Retained in full: brake discs are deliberately charged in this period rather than earlier, because regeneration preserves pad material while promoting disc corrosion, so the failure mode on a low-mileage Taiwanese BEV is rust-driven disc replacement at this age. Loaded for a German car four years past its warranty. Modelled from Mercedes dealer labour rates; no published Taiwan price table for these operations on the MMA platform exists, so this is an estimate, not a quote."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers years 7-10 only (a 3-year window), ~NT$58,000/year. REDUCED BY AUDIT from NT$255,000 to NT$175,000. The original was essentially level with the combustion CLA 180's NT$248,000 for the same window, which cannot be right for a car with no engine, gearbox service or 48V ISG; the heat-pump allowance was also being charged twice, once here and once at year 7. Still deliberately risk-loaded rather than flattened: this is the period where the ~8-year high-voltage battery warranty runs out and every electronic module is unwarranted, and German BEV out-of-warranty electronics are the dominant cost, not mechanical wear. At NT$175,000 it remains well above the Volvo EC40's NT$140,000 and far above the Toyota bZ4X's NT$102,000 for the same window. Excludes any allowance for actual traction-battery replacement, which would exceed the car's whole residual value at that age and is treated as a write-off scenario rather than a maintenance line. Fully modelled - no Taiwan cost data exists at this age for any German BEV because none has reached 10 years - hence low confidence."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — Mercedes-Benz CLA with EQ Technology","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cla%20with%20eq%20technology/7145/overall","note":"PRIMARY PRICE AND SPEC SOURCE, re-fetched directly by this audit on 2026-08-12 (plain curl, HTTP 200; WebFetch and r.jina.ai are both Cloudflare-403 on this host). Reads '187 - 220 萬, 2 車型'; model table gives CLA 200 with EQ Technology at 187 萬 and CLA 250+ at 220 萬, both 純電動 / 後輪驅動. Body text confirms 單永磁同步馬達後輪驅動, 224 hp (250+ 272 hp), 34.2 kgm, 58 kWh usable (250+ 85 kWh), 542 km WLTP (250+ 792 km)."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan — CLA Sedan 電動轎車 official overview","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/models/saloon/cla-electric/overview.html","note":"Official product page. NOT re-fetchable by this audit — mercedes-benz.com.tw times out from this network (HTTP 000). Its indexed page title '187萬起！擁有全新 Mercedes-Benz CLA | 台灣賓士', dated 2026-03-19, does independently corroborate both the NT$1,870,000 entry price and the launch date."},{"name":"TVBS 汽車 — 187萬入手豪華電車！賓士全新大改款 CLA 台灣開賣 售價降7萬","url":"https://news.tvbs.com.tw/cars","note":"Independent launch report dated 2026-03-24 confirming the NT$1,870,000 entry price and, in the headline itself, the NT$70,000 price cut versus the pre-sale figure."},{"name":"Mobile01 — 【採訪】再降7萬，純電與油電齊發！Mercedes-Benz全新 CLA 187萬","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php","note":"Second independent confirmation of both NT$1,870,000 and the NT$70,000 cut, dated 2026-03-19, and of the October 2025 pre-sale announcement. Headline read via search index; Mobile01 blocks automated page access, which is also why no owner service receipts could be obtained for the maintenance model."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz CLA listings (combustion + the electric CLA)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cla","note":"CORRECTS TWO CLAIMS IN THE ORIGINAL RECORD. 545 live cars read 2026-08-12. (1) It is NOT true that no listing of the CLA with EQ Technology exists: the board carries 'M-Benz CLA 2026款 CLA 250+ 純電, 2026年, 8,000公里, 217.0萬', tagged 車行勿擾喔！ i.e. a private 自售 seller. (2) The year-10 anchor was a bait listing: the '2016 CLA 200 at NT$246,000' is in fact a 2016 CLA250 titled 【買車送你一年車貸，限時優惠中】, an extreme outlier against 2016 CLA200 at 55.8萬/12萬公里, 2017 CLA200 at 55.8萬/11萬公里, 2015 CLA250 at 62.9萬/11.82萬公里 and 2018 CLA250 at 69.8萬/8萬公里 on the same page."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz EQA listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqa","note":"Primary year-3 anchor, every figure re-confirmed by this audit 2026-08-12. Exactly 10 live cars nationwide. 2023 EQA 250 asking 140.0萬 at 1.02萬公里, 135.0萬 at 3.7萬公里, 130.0萬 at 6.37萬公里, 125.0萬 at 4萬公里, 122.0萬 at 1.4萬公里; 2022 car at 99.6萬 with 9.5萬公里. These are 車商售價 (dealer retail, mostly 實體車行) and were discounted ~11% to reach private-sale figures."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz EQB listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqb","note":"Second year-3 anchor, re-confirmed 2026-08-12. 11 live cars. 2023 EQB 300 4MATIC asking 158.0萬 at 1.6萬公里 and 155.0萬 at 3.15萬公里; 2022 higher-mileage cars at 106.8萬-113.8萬 with 7.63萬-13.45萬公里."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz EQC listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqc","note":"The only genuine long-age German BEV data in Taiwan and the basis for the year-7 extrapolation. Re-confirmed 2026-08-12: just three cars nationwide, all 400 4Matic 運動版 — 2020 cars asking 108.0萬 at 3萬公里, 108.0萬 at 3.6萬公里, and 99.0萬 at 12.9萬公里. Because all three are the 運動版 (launch list NT$3,500,000), the researcher's NT$3,290,000 denominator — the base ELECTRIC ART price — was the wrong variant and overstated retention; corrected to 30.9% at 6 years."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz EQS listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqs","note":"Weak corroborating evidence only, re-fetched 2026-08-12: 2022 EQS 450+ cars asking 215.0萬-249.0萬. CAVEAT ADDED BY AUDIT — several of these are explicitly 日規 (Japan-spec parallel imports: '日規大滿配', '日規未領牌'), which carry a lower entry cost and lower resale than 總代理 cars, so measuring them against the NT$5,880,000 official list overstates decay. Not load-bearing for any figure in this record."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz used market (aggregate)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz","note":"Entry point for the per-model boards above. Used to establish how thin the Mercedes BEV used market is in Taiwan: 10 EQA, 11 EQB, 3 EQC, 12 EQS nationwide as of 2026-08-12 — the core reason every BEV checkpoint beyond year 3 is marked low confidence."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan — 原廠保固 (official warranty terms)","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/services/warranty.html","note":"Basis claimed for the maintenance plan (3 years unlimited mileage on the vehicle; 12V battery 2 years; BEV high-voltage battery published per model). NOT RE-VERIFIED — this audit could not reach mercedes-benz.com.tw (HTTP 000, host times out). Carried forward as the researcher's reading, and the reason maintenance years 1 and 3 were downgraded from medium to low confidence."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan — 原廠保養服務 (official service scheme)","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/services/services-repair.html","note":"Claimed source for the 保養 A / A Plus / B / B Plus structure and for the free standard inspection with billed parts and labour. NOT RE-VERIFIED for the same host-timeout reason. No EQ service price table is published anywhere, which is why every maintenance NT$ figure in this record is modelled rather than quoted."},{"name":"8891 新車 — Mercedes-Benz CLA 價格車款介紹","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cla/Summary.html","note":"Fetched 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200) as a fourth price cross-check, but the price table is client-rendered and yielded no server-side figures, so it did not contribute a usable number. Listed for transparency rather than as evidence."}]},"mercedes-cle200-coupe":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year; all checkpoints use 7,000 km x years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000), far below the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/yr. Powertrain: U-CAR's launch report confirms the CLE 200 Coupé uses a 2.0L turbo four with 204hp / 32.6 kgm plus a 48V mild-hybrid system giving a 23hp assist, paired with 9G-Tronic and rear-wheel drive. The 48V system CANNOT move the car on electricity alone, so it is classified \"gasoline\", not \"hybrid\". Because annual distance is so low, servicing is driven by the TIME leg of the Mercedes 10,000 km / 1 year interval, never the mileage leg — roughly one A or B service every year at ~7,000 km, with brake fluid (2-yearly) and coolant (5-yearly) falling due on the calendar. Tires likewise time out on rubber age (~5-6 years) long before they wear out. Vehicle licence tax (牌照稅), fuel tax (汽燃費) and all insurance are EXCLUDED by design. Financing interest, parking, fuel and tolls are also out of scope. The CLE 200 Coupé rides on steel springs (18\" AMG wheels with 加大打孔前碟盤 standard, 19\" on higher trims) and has no air suspension, so no air-strut replacement is budgeted — the German out-of-warranty risk shows up instead as coil packs, thermostat housing, electric auxiliary water pump, the 48V starter-generator and suspension bushings.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"8891 中古車 CLE 200 Coupé live listing set (auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cle/cle200-coupe), re-read independently on 2026-08-12. Directly relevant low-mileage cars: 235.0萬 (2025年, 9,000 km), 238.8萬 and 243.8萬 (2025款, 5,000 km), 245.0萬 (500-575 km, near-new). Interpolating to 1 year / 7,000 km gives ~237萬 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking). ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale = dealer retail x 0.88 (~208萬, i.e. 12% below retail), then dealer_tradein = private x 0.875 (~182萬). These are NOT the listed asking prices. Cross-check: a Mercedes-Benz Select 原廠精選中古車 CLE 200 is listed at 246.8萬 (page JSON reads \"price\":2468000; 出廠 2023/06, 掛牌 2024/06), consistent with the certified upper bound of the retail band. Year-1 retention is ~74% of real_cost — a 26% first-year loss, a properly steep German year-one hit, held up only by this car's very low mileage and thin new-car supply."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED UPWARD from the researcher's 178萬. The CLE's own oldest cars are only ~2.4 years in service, but they bracket this checkpoint closely and were re-read on 8891 on 2026-08-12: 238.0萬 and 239.8萬 at 21,300-24,000 km, 228.0萬 at 34,000-35,600 km, and a 總代理 car at 220.8萬 with 29,000 km. Sliding the low-mileage end ~0.6 year further and discounting sticky asks gives ~207萬 車商售價 for a 3-year / 21,000 km car — still below every comparable listed today, so this stays conservative. Predecessor cross-check: a 2023 E200 Coupé (C238) with 20,000 km asks 228.8萬 against a ~320萬 list (~71% of list at dealer retail). ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale = dealer retail x 0.88 (~182萬); dealer_tradein = private x 0.865 (~157.5萬). Retention is 64% of real_cost at 3 years — the steep years 1-3 slide expected of a German coupé, softened only by 21,000 km being exceptionally low and the car still being inside the 3-year warranty at this exact point."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — the current CLE generation launched in Taiwan in March 2024 and no genuine 5-year car exists. Method: take real used prices of the PREDECESSOR generation (Mercedes E-Class Coupé C238, which the CLE replaces alongside the C-Class Coupé), express them as a retention ratio of that car's own original list price, then apply the ratio here. Read on 8891 on 2026-08-12: a 2021 E200 Coupé with 60,000 km asks 155.0萬 and 2020 cars with 62,000-77,000 km ask 148.8-149.0萬, against a ~315萬 list = ~47-49% of list at dealer retail at 5-6 years. Those comparables carry 60,000+ km against our 35,000 km, so a low-mileage premium was added. A second, explicit correction the original record missed: the C238 was DISCONTINUED and replaced by the CLE, so its current 4-6 year prices carry an orphaned-generation discount the CLE will not face at the same age — the raw C238 ratio therefore biases this checkpoint low. Net ~55% of list = ~160萬 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale = dealer retail x 0.885 (~142萬); dealer_tradein = private x 0.866 (~123萬). Explicitly extrapolated, not observed."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor E-Class Coupé (C238) via retention ratio — no 7-year data exists for this generation. The original record quoted the 8-year cohort as \"98.0-105.0萬\", which is the bottom of the band; the full set of live 2018 E200 Coupé listings read on 8891 on 2026-08-12 is 98.0萬 (three cars at ~130,000 km), 105.0萬 (120,000 km), 115.8萬 (90,000 km), 120.0萬 (130,000 km) and 123.8萬 (80,000 km) — i.e. 98.0-123.8萬, with the low-mileage cars materially higher. Against a ~285-290萬 list that is ~34% of list at typical mileage and ~43% for the low-mileage cars. Interpolating back to 7 years and applying our car's very low 49,000 km gives ~46% of list = ~132萬 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale = dealer retail x 0.87 (~115萬); dealer_tradein = private x 0.857 (~98.5萬). The drop from 50% of real_cost at year 5 to 41% at year 7 is deliberate: the 3-year / 100,000 km factory warranty is long gone and the used market prices in German out-of-warranty repair risk rather than flattening."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from predecessor-generation retention ratios — no 10-year data exists for this generation. Real anchors read on 8891 on 2026-08-12: 2017 E200 Coupé (9 years, the C238's own launch year, list 276萬 per U-CAR) spans 61.8萬 at 210,000 km, 82.8-88.0萬 at 220,000-225,000 km, 98.0-99.8萬 at 120,000-160,000 km and 103.8萬 at 83,000 km — i.e. 22-38% of list, with the low-mileage car at the top. Older C207 cars (2013-2015, list ~268萬) at 110,000-200,000 km ask 42.8-65.0萬. Second anchor from the other predecessor, C-Class Coupé C205 (Taiwan launch March 2016 at C180 Coupé 203萬). Our car at 70,000 km sits far below the 110,000-225,000 km of nearly that whole cohort, so a substantial low-mileage premium lifts the ratio to ~30% of list = ~88萬 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private_sale = dealer retail x 0.84 (~74萬); dealer_tradein = private x 0.851 (~63萬). The tail keeps falling (50% -> 41% -> 26% of real_cost) rather than flattening, because an out-of-warranty German coupé is priced on repair risk and two-door bodies have the thinnest resale demand in Taiwan."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Taiwan dealer A 保養 pricing: tyaward.com.tw dealer column NT$8,000-12,000, whbydcc.com 八千到一萬五千元 (NT$8,000-15,000). Trigger is the 1-year time leg, not the 10,000 km leg, because the car only covers 7,000 km. Priced at NT$12,000 as an upper-mid dealer A service on a 2.0L rear-drive coupé."},{"y":3,"source":"Repriced against the actual dealer bands: whbydcc.com puts B 保養 at NT$20,000-35,000 (the original record's NT$15,000-30,000 was a misquote of that page) and tyaward.com.tw at NT$12,000-30,000, so NT$25,000 is a genuine mid-band dealer B service including brake fluid and both filters. Brake fluid is confirmed as 每2年更換一次，不論里程多寡, so it falls in this window purely on the calendar despite only 21,000 km total. Covers the 1-to-3-year window only, not cumulative."},{"y":5,"source":"Tire and brake pricing from tyaward.com.tw's dealer column (輪胎更換 19吋4條 NT$32,000-45,000; 煞車系統維修 來令片/碟盤 NT$15,000-30,000 per axle; 大保養 NT$12,000-30,000), with the front axle priced near the top of the band because U-CAR's launch report confirms 加大打孔前碟盤 is standard on the CLE 200 Coupé — enlarged drilled discs cost more than the plain discs the band assumes. Tires are replaced here on rubber age: at 7,000 km/year a set will never wear out before it hardens, so ~5-6 years is the real trigger. Factory warranty expires during this window (year 3), so out-of-warranty exposure begins."},{"y":7,"source":"EXTRAPOLATED from Taiwan Mercedes service-interval and parts pricing; no CLE-specific 7-year receipts exist for a 2024-launch model. Intervals per whbydcc.com 保養週期 (spark plugs 60,000-80,000 km but also time-limited; transmission fluid 60,000-120,000 km; coolant 5年或10萬公里) and prices per tyaward.com.tw dealer column (變速箱油保養 NT$15,000-80,000; 煞車系統 NT$15,000-30,000 per axle). B service priced at NT$27,000 within the NT$20,000-35,000 dealer band. Car is fully out of warranty across this whole window and no extended warranty is assumed, so repair risk is carried at full cost."},{"y":10,"source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no 10-year data exists for a model launched in Taiwan in 2024. Built from tyaward.com.tw's dealer column (懸吊避震系統維修 NT$30,000-60,000 at 80,000 km or on age; 引擎周邊系統維修 NT$30,000-80,000; 輪胎 19吋4條 NT$32,000-45,000) applied to the specific failure items a 48V German four-cylinder accumulates out of warranty. Suspension is priced at the NT$30,000 band floor rather than the NT$26,000 the original record used, which sat below the cited range. The 48V starter-generator is an explicit probability-weighted line because it is the mild-hybrid-specific risk item on this powertrain. NO air-suspension cost is included — the CLE 200 Coupé has steel springs. Ten-year total ~NT$617,000 (~NT$61,700/year), roughly double a comparable Japanese coupé's, which is the intended and realistic result for an out-of-warranty Mercedes on dealer labour rates."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — Mercedes-Benz 公佈正 2026 年式新車售價","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/87263","note":"PRIMARY price verification, re-fetched and table-parsed independently on 2026-08-12. The MY2026 table rows read CLE 200 Coupé 289萬 (+1), CLE 300 4Matic Coupé 343萬 (+1), M-AMG CLE 53 4Matic+ 439萬 (+1), CLE 200 Cabriolet 322萬 (+1). Confirms list_price = NT$2,890,000."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 正式售價288萬元起，Mercedes-Benz CLE車系國內上市","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/77867","note":"Taiwan launch, 2024-03-21: CLE 200 Coupé 288萬, CLE 300 4Matic Coupé 342萬, AMG CLE 53 438萬, CLE 200 Cabriolet 321萬. Also the powertrain source, verified verbatim: CLE 200 Coupé uses a 2.0L four-cylinder turbo with 48V 輕油電, 204hp / 32.6 kgm, 48V adding a 23hp assist, 9G-Tronic and 後輪驅動; standard kit includes 18 吋 AMG 鋁圈與加大打孔前碟盤. Basis for the \"gasoline\" classification and for the enlarged-drilled-front-disc brake pricing."},{"name":"CarFun 玩車誌 — 全新賓士CLE車系上市，入門款 CLE 200 Coupe 售價288萬元起","url":"https://carfun.tw/all-news/tw-news/20245/","note":"Independent confirmation of the launch 建議售價 across the CLE line-up. URL reachability re-checked 2026-08-12 (HTTP 200)."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz CLE CLE200 Coupe 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cle/cle200-coupe","note":"Live CLE 200 Coupé listings re-read independently on 2026-08-12. Key cars: 245.0萬 (500-575 km); 243.8萬 and 238.8萬 (5,000 km); 235.0萬 (2025年, 9,000 km); 239.8萬 (21,300 km); 238.0萬 (24,000 km); 228.0萬 (34,000 and 35,600 km); 220.8萬 (2023年, 29,000 km, 總代理); plus unregistered (未領牌) stock. All are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking) and were adjusted downward before use."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz E E200 Coupe 二手價格 (predecessor generation)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e/e200-coupe","note":"Main extrapolation base for years 5, 7 and 10; 33 dated listings parsed on 2026-08-12. 2023 / 20,000 km at 228.8萬 (x3) and 28,600 km at 208.0萬; 2022 / 33,000-68,000 km at 163.8-173.8萬; 2021 / 60,000 km at 155.0萬; 2020 / 62,000-77,000 km at 148.8-149.0萬; 2018 / 80,000-131,000 km at 98.0-123.8萬; 2017 / 83,000-210,000 km at 61.8-103.8萬; C207 2013-2015 at 42.8-65.0萬. Note the fuller 2018 band corrects the original record, which cited only the 98.0-105.0萬 bottom of it."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 276萬元起，Mercedes-Benz 新一代 E-Class Coupé 正式發表","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/36759","note":"Supplies the denominator for the predecessor retention ratios; text verified 2026-08-12: E-Class Coupé C238 launched in Taiwan 2017-06-08 at E200 Coupé 276萬 / E300 Coupé 339萬 / E400 4MATIC Coupé 401萬."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz C C300 Coupe 二手價格 (second predecessor)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/c/c300-coupe","note":"C-Class Coupé listings used only as a secondary 10-year sanity check. Many C300 Coupé cars in Taiwan are 外匯車 parallel imports rather than 總代理, which is why the E-Class Coupé was preferred as the primary comparable."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 — 台灣賓士 2016 The new C-Class Coupe 建議售價203萬起","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/19461-2016-the-new-c-class-coupe-203.html","note":"URL CORRECTED. The original record cited this article on the host www.test000test.carstuff.com.tw — a staging/mirror hostname, not a citable source. The canonical www.carstuff.com.tw URL was fetched on 2026-08-12 and serves the same article (headline confirms 建議售價203萬起), supplying the C-Class Coupé C205 Taiwan launch prices used as the secondary 10-year denominator."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Select 原廠精選中古車 — CLE 200 listing","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz-select.com.tw/buy-car/detail.aspx?id=1972","note":"Factory-certified used CLE 200. The page is a JS SPA, but its embedded product JSON reads \"price\":2468000 (= 246.8萬) with 出廠年份 2023/06 and 掛牌年份 2024/06 — so the original record's 246.8萬 figure is confirmed, and the car is a mid-2024 registration rather than a three-year-old car. Cross-check on the certified upper bound of the dealer retail band."},{"name":"金融財子 — 買車容易養車難？賓士保養一次要多少錢與費用算給你聽","url":"https://tyaward.com.tw/%E6%B1%BD%E6%A9%9F%E8%BB%8A-2/%E8%B3%93%E5%A3%AB%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E8%A6%81%E5%A4%9A%E5%B0%91%E9%8C%A2/","note":"Main maintenance price table, re-parsed 2026-08-12. 原廠授權服務廠 column: A保養 NT$8,000-12,000 (10,000 km / 1 yr); B保養 NT$12,000-30,000 (20,000 km / 2 yr); 煞車油 NT$2,500-4,000 (每2年); 煞車來令片/碟盤 NT$15,000-30,000 (30,000-50,000 km); 懸吊避震 NT$30,000-60,000 (80,000 km 以上或老化); 變速箱油 NT$15,000-80,000; 輪胎19吋4條 NT$32,000-45,000. Also states the 3年或10萬公里 new-car warranty."},{"name":"比迪行銷 — 賓士保養週期","url":"https://www.whbydcc.com/%E8%B3%93%E5%A3%AB%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E9%80%B1%E6%9C%9F/","note":"Re-read 2026-08-12. Confirms 每10,000公里 / 每1年（以先到者為準）and the alternating A/B pattern (the basis for calling servicing time-driven at 7,000 km/yr), 煞車油每兩年, 冷卻液 5年或10萬公里, 火星塞 60,000-80,000 km, 變速箱油 60,000-120,000 km, and the 三年或十萬公里 warranty. IMPORTANT CORRECTION: this page prices A保養 at 八千到一萬五千元 (NT$8,000-15,000) and B保養 at 兩萬到三萬五千元 (NT$20,000-35,000) — the original record quoted B保養 as NT$15,000-30,000, which the page does not say."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan — 車款總覽 (official)","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/models.html","note":"NOT SUCCESSFULLY RETRIEVED — bot/JS protection blocked every fetch attempt in both the original pass and this verification pass. The list price was verified instead through U-CAR's MY2026 price table. Listed for traceability, not as evidence read."}]},"mercedes-e200-avantgarde":{"assumptions":"車主年行駛 6,000-8,000 km，遠低於台灣平均 12,000-15,000 km。各檢查點一律用中位數 7,000 km/年（7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km）。此里程下 ASSYST PLUS 保養提示是被「時間」觸發而非里程：依 2ggx 保養費資料，Service A 為 1.5 年或 15,000 km、Service B 為 2 年或 30,000 km，本車約 2.1 年才跑到 15,000 km，所以時間先到，保養每 12-18 個月一次（原研究者寫「每 12 個月」略為高估次數，已修正）。輪胎與煞車油同樣是「放到老化」而非「用到磨耗」。牌照稅、燃料稅、保險依設計一律不計入。動力註記：M254 2.0T 搭 48V ISG（EQBoost）皮帶啟動發電機，無法純電行駛，故分類為 gasoline 而非 hybrid（KingAutos 車型頁把整個 E-Class 標成 hybrid 是指輕油電，不影響本表分類）。非 BEV，無充電樁成本。殘值以「低里程車況良好個體」報價，但重要修正：8891 實際掛牌資料顯示中高齡 E-Class 的里程溢價非常小（見 value_checkpoints），故低里程加成只給 2-4%，不採原研究者隨車齡放大到 10% 的假設。","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"改用實際掛牌（原記錄此點無任何來源卻標 medium）。8891 實抓現行 W214 車源：2025 E200 12,900 km 車商開價 2,380,000、2025 E200 14,000 km 開價 2,268,000，均值約 2,324,000。該等 2025 年式 E 200 新車價約 2,930,000（Luxury），real cost 約 2,895,000。車商零售 2,324,000 →【自售調整】扣約 11% 得自售 2,068,000，殘值率 71.4%。將 71.4% 套回本車 real_cost 2,975,000 得 2,124,000，再給 7,000 km 對 13,000 km 的低里程加成約 2%（8891 資料顯示近新車里程溢價本就有限），取 2,160,000。dealer_tradein = 自售再扣約 13% = 1,880,000。第 1 年帳面損失約 27%，符合德系豪華房車在台灣的前段陡降，且車商零售價未被直接抄進自售價。"},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"【修正原記錄的事實錯誤】原記錄稱「台灣尚無真正 3 年車齡的 W214」而改用 W213 跨代外推；W214 於 2024 年中在台上市，8891 上實際存在 2 年車齡車源，本點因此改以現行世代真實掛牌為錨。實抓：2024 E200 Luxury 20,000 km 車商開價 2,120,000（2 年車齡）。該車新車價 2,930,000、real cost 約 2,895,000；車商零售 2,120,000 →扣約 11% 得自售 1,887,000，2 年殘值率 65.2%。由 1 年 71.4%、2 年 65.2%、5 年 48.1% 的實測序列內插，3 年殘值率取約 59%，套回 real_cost 2,975,000 得 1,755,000，取 1,760,000（21,000 km 與參考車 20,000 km 相當，不另給里程加成）。dealer_tradein = 自售再扣約 13.5% = 1,520,000。此時仍在 3 年不限里程原廠保固內，對價格有支撐。"},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"以前代 W213 小改款實際掛牌換算殘值率再套用（本車 2031 年才滿 5 年）。實抓錨點：2021 E200 Avantgarde 60,000 km 車商開價 1,368,000。該 2021 年式 W213 小改 E 200 新車價約 2,690,000、real cost 約 2,655,000。本車 5 年時僅 35,000 km，較參考車低甚多，給約 5% 低里程加成得車商零售約 1,436,000 →扣約 11% 得自售 1,278,000，殘值率 48.1%。套回 real_cost 2,975,000 得 1,431,000；因此點僅有單一筆 2021 年掛牌支撐，且該車屬小改款外觀有溢價，保守下修取 1,400,000。dealer_tradein = 自售再扣約 14% = 1,205,000。這是第一個脫離 3 年原廠保固的檢查點，台灣中古市場自此開始把維修風險計入價格，曲線不會像 Lexus 那樣打平。"},{"y":7,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"【本次最大幅修正，原記錄高估約 14%】原記錄宣稱 2019 年式 W213 E 200 的車商開價約 1,150,000-1,300,000，與實際市場不符。8891 實抓 2019 E200 共 4 筆：11,780 km／889,000、56,100 km／949,000、117,000 km／889,000，另 2018 E200 50,000 km／850,000，實際區間是 850,000-949,000，不是 115 萬-130 萬。取低里程車商零售 900,000。2019 年式 W213 E 200 新車價約 2,620,000、real cost 約 2,585,000；車商零售 900,000 →扣約 11% 得自售 801,000，殘值率 31.0%。套回本車 real_cost 2,975,000 得 922,000，加約 3% 低里程加成取 950,000。dealer_tradein = 自售再扣約 14.5% = 810,000（保固外德系車商需承擔整備風險，收購折讓隨車齡放大）。注意：同一批資料中 11,780 km 與 117,000 km 的 2019 E200 開價同為 889,000，證實中高齡德系房車的里程溢價極小，原記錄逐年放大到 10% 的低里程加成不成立。"},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"以前代 W213 首批年份（2016，W213 在台上市年）實際掛牌換算。8891 實抓 2016 E200：81,000 km／738,000、110,000 km／668,000、120,000 km／498,000；另 2017 E200 11,700 km／759,000、80,000 km／768,000；2015（前代 W212）則掉到 518,000-598,000、2014 為 478,000-498,000、2013 為 258,000 —— 世代斷點造成的落差遠大於里程。本車 2036 年滿 10 年時屬世代中期車（W214 於 2024 上市，2026 年式為小改前），比今日 2016 首批 W213 更靠近世代尾端，故取車商零售 700,000（介於 2016 低里程 738,000 與 2015 世代斷點之間）。2016 年式 W213 E 200 新車價約 2,530,000、real cost 約 2,495,000；車商零售 700,000 →扣約 11% 得自售 623,000，殘值率 25.0%。套回 real_cost 2,975,000 得 743,000，加約 4% 低里程加成取 770,000。dealer_tradein = 自售再扣約 15.5% = 650,000。尾段續跌未打平：保固外德系豪華房車買家池薄，48V 鋰電池／ISG、電子水泵、變速箱機電、電子系統的大額風險都被計入價格。"}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"依 2ggx 賓士保養費整理 (https://www.2ggx.com/賓士保養費/) 的 E-Class 級距 Service A NT$10,000-15,000，取中位 12,000 再加雨刷等耗材。【修正】原記錄此格為 3,000，理由是假設隨車附贈 3 年預付保養套餐；該假設無來源支撐（台灣賓士標配的是 3 年保固而非免費保養，且 2026-03 官方促銷給的是延長保固），故改為全額自付。同批 GLC 200 記錄此格為 11,000，本車為更大級距，13,000 與之一致。2ggx 屬二手整理來源而非原廠價目表，故仍標 low。"},{"y":3,"source":"依 2ggx 的 E-Class 級距 Service B NT$18,000-30,000（取中位 24,000）與 Service A NT$10,000-15,000（取中位 12,000），加耗材約 9,000。【修正】原記錄此格為 12,000，同樣建立在免費保養套餐假設上；原研究者自己也註明若無套餐應約為 45,000 —— 本記錄採用該未補貼數字。同批 GLC 200 記錄此格為 31,000，本車級距更高、Service B 單價更貴，45,000 合理。"},{"y":5,"source":"由 2ggx 的 E-Class Service A/B 單價，加上台灣原廠零件工資水準的由下而上估算，並套用本車 7,000 km/年所迫出的日曆型保養節奏。輪胎是本窗口最大單項，且是因「老化」（5 年橡膠硬化）而非胎紋而更換 —— 35,000 km 時胎紋仍合法。維持原研究者的 135,000（本次覆核認為其項目拆解與金額合理，同批 GLC 200 為 118,000，本車輪胎與煞車更大，差額相符）。除保養工項單價外，其餘品項本次未能取得逐項報價來源。"},{"y":7,"source":"由下而上估算，保養工項單價取自 2ggx 的 E-Class Service A/B 區間。30,000 風險提列是期望值而非必然支出：電子水泵（含工約 25,000-40,000）、節溫器座（約 20,000-30,000）、點火線圈（約 15,000-20,000）在 5-7 年 M254 上各自「可能但非必然」。這正是德系車保固外尾段與日系分岔的關鍵項。原記錄為 145,000，本次微調為 140,000 使逐項加總（36,000+45,000+10,000+15,000+30,000=136,000）與總額一致。維修單項報價本次未能取得來源。"},{"y":10,"source":"保固外完全自費窗口的由下而上估算，也是德系豪華房車與日系分道揚鑣的關鍵期間。【修正】原記錄為 340,000，本次下修至 300,000：其一，5-7 年窗口已提列 30,000 冷卻／點火風險，7-10 年再提 45,000「第二輪」屬部分重複，改為 40,000；其二，在 10 年僅 70,000 km 的低里程下提列 50,000 的完整避震器總成更換過度，實務上此里程多為引擎腳與襯套老化，改為 35,000。其餘品項維持。本車為鋼簧非 AIRMATIC，若為氣壓懸吊需另加約 120,000-180,000。48V ISG／鋰電池以期望值列帳而非必然支出。10 年全期合計約 633,000／70,000 km。除保養工項單價（2ggx）外，本窗口無逐項報價來源，Mobile01 車主收據串本次未能取得。"}],"sources":[{"name":"KingAutos 國王車訊 — E-Class 星耀版上市價格表 (2026-04-16)","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/368283","note":"實抓成功，本次 list_price 的主要來源。價格表逐字列出「E 200 LUXURY 星耀版 3,010,000」（升級配備價值 105,000）、E 300 星耀版 3,550,000、E 200 Estate 星耀版 3,270,000、AMG E 53 星耀版 4,920,000。同時確立正確車型名稱為 LUXURY 而非 Avantgarde。"},{"name":"KingAutos 國王車訊 — E-Class 台灣車型價格頁","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/mercedes_benz/e-class","note":"實抓成功。列出台灣 E-Class 級距：E200 Avantgarde 2,750,000／E200 Luxury 2,930,000／E300 運動版 3,470,000／E300 Exclusive 3,550,000／AMG E53 4Matic+ 4,760,000。證明 Avantgarde 與 Luxury 是兩個不同等級且 Avantgarde 較便宜，並以 2,930,000 + 80,000 = 3,010,000 交叉驗證星耀版售價。"},{"name":"KingAutos 國王車訊 — 2026年3月賓士購車優惠","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/367656","note":"實抓成功。E-Class 優惠為「160萬 40期 0利率 + 1年延長保固」，證明台灣賓士以低利與延長保固取代現金折讓，為 discounts 下修至 80,000 的依據，同時反證原研究者「3 年免費保養套餐」的假設（官方給的是延長保固，不是免費保養）。"},{"name":"udn 車訊 — C-Class、E-Class 星耀版上市 (2026-04-15)","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/9443825","note":"實抓成功但無完整價格表，僅有「225萬元起」（屬 C-Class 起價）與「升級總價值最高超過 20 萬元」。用於佐證星耀版上市時點與 2026 年式定位。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz E-Class 車源列表","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e","note":"實抓成功，取得約 19 筆實際掛牌。關鍵列：2019 E200 Avantgarde 11,780 km／889,000；2019 E200 Avantgarde 56,100 km／949,000；2018 E200 Avantgarde 50,000 km／850,000；2017 E200 Sedan 117,000 km／759,000；2017 E200 LUX 80,000 km／768,000；2025 E200 12,000 km／電洽。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz E 200 車源列表","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e/e200","note":"實抓成功，共 142 筆、取得首頁 20 筆。關鍵列：2025 12,900 km／2,380,000；2025 14,000 km／2,268,000；2020 119,000 km／969,000；2020 110,000 km／990,000；2019 11,780 km／889,000；2019 117,000 km／889,000；2017 11,700 km／759,000；2016 81,000 km／738,000；2016 110,000 km／668,000；2015 50,000 km／518,000；2013 10,100 km／258,000。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — E-Class 車源列表第 2 頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e?page=2","note":"實抓成功，取得現行 W214 世代實價：2024 E200 Luxury 20,000 km／2,120,000；2025 E200 12,900 km／2,380,000；2021 E200 Avantgarde 60,000 km／1,368,000；2020 E200 Avantgarde 110,000 km／990,000。這是 1 年與 3 年檢查點得以改用「現行世代真實掛牌」而非跨代外推的依據。"},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — Mercedes-Benz E-Class 中古車","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?b=8&m=1279","note":"實抓成功但筆數少：2014 E200 80,000 km／478,000；2014 E200 120,000 km／478,000；2016 E220d 99,000 km／708,000。僅用於佐證 10 年以上尾段落點，未單獨支撐任一檢查點。"},{"name":"2ggx — 賓士保養費用整理（含 E-Class 級距）","url":"https://www.2ggx.com/%E8%B3%93%E5%A3%AB%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E8%B2%BB/","note":"實抓成功，本次唯一取得的保養報價來源。Service A 每 1.5 年或 15,000 km、NT$8,000-15,000；Service B 每 2 年或 30,000 km、NT$15,000-30,000+；並給出 E-Class 專屬區間 Service A NT$10,000-15,000、Service B NT$18,000-30,000。用於重建 0-3 年保養成本並修正保養週期敘述。屬二手整理型來源，非原廠公告價目表，故保養檢查點仍標 low/medium。"},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan — 官網車款總覽／保固頁","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/services/warranty.html","note":"本次嘗試逾時（60s）未取得內容，與原研究者遭遇相同。因此「新車是否含 3 年免費定期保養」無法由官網直接證實或證偽；本記錄改採不含免費保養的保守假設，理由見 maintenance.plan_notes。"},{"name":"U-CAR — Mercedes-Benz E-Class 新車車型頁","url":"https://www.u-car.com.tw/car/newcar/model/2653/spec","note":"本次嘗試回傳 HTTP 403 Forbidden，未取得資料（與原研究者相同）。"},{"name":"8891 新車頻道 — Mercedes-Benz E-Class","url":"https://newcar.8891.com.tw/mercedes_benz-e_class-newcarmodel.html","note":"本次嘗試回傳「錯誤：不能載入 mercedes_benz-e_class 模組」，未取得資料。"},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — Mercedes-Benz E-Class 中古車搜尋","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=Mercedes-Benz&model=E-Class","note":"本次嘗試成功載入但結果為「共 0 筆」，無可用車源，未貢獻任何數字。"}]},"mercedes-eqa250-plus":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year; every checkpoint uses the 7,000 km/year midpoint (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km). That is roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year, so servicing is TIME-driven (annual/biennial calendar intervals), not mileage-driven, and consumables age out rather than wear out - tires are replaced on age (~every 5-6 years) long before tread depth is reached. On low-mileage pricing: the intent is to quote low-mileage comparables, but the actual 8891 EQA data does NOT show a clean low-mileage premium (the 14,000 km car is the cheapest in the set at 122.0萬 while the 63,700 km car asks 130.0萬), so the used market for this nameplate is too thin for mileage to drive price. Values below are therefore anchored on the upper part of the observed asking range rather than on a computed mileage premium, and this is stated in each source string. EXCLUDED BY DESIGN: tax and insurance (Taiwan currently exempts BEVs from 牌照稅 and 燃料費 - Yahoo Autos shows both as $0 for this car - but they are out of scope either way). ALSO EXCLUDED: home-charger installation. A dedicated 220V circuit / wallbox in Taiwan runs roughly NT$30,000-80,000 depending on distance to the panel, and in an apartment it additionally requires 管委會 approval which may block it entirely; it is a one-off capital installation, not maintenance, so it is deliberately left out of maintenance.checkpoints. Public DC fast charging is likewise not modelled (energy cost, not maintenance).","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Interpolated between the NT$2,170,000 new price and the well-observed ~3.4-year point below; no 1-year-old EQA 250+ exists on the market yet (the 250+ only went on sale mid-2025, and all 10 used EQAs listed nationwide on 8891 are 2022-2023 cars - I re-scraped the page and confirmed the count and every listing). Method: implied 1-year dealer RETAIL asking ~NT$1,580,000, then -11% to private sale (NT$1,400,000), then a further -13% to dealer trade-in (NT$1,220,000). ADJUSTMENT STATED: 8891 figures are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking), never what an owner receives, so nothing here is copied from an asking price. The year-1 loss is deliberately steep (69% of real cost retained) because the replacement generation was revealed 2026-07-30 and lands in Taiwan during this very window - a German BEV holding Japanese-like year-1 value would be wrong. Fact-check cross-validation: this sits between the Volvo EC40 (64% of list at year 1) and Volvo EX40 (72%) modelled in the same batch, and below the combustion Mercedes GLA 200 sibling (67% of list, but on a far flatter subsequent curve), which is the correct relative position for a discontinued German BEV."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Anchored on real 8891 中古車 listings for the predecessor EQA 250 (original list 215萬), now ~3.4 years old. I independently re-scraped the page on 2026-08-12 and verified every data point: SIX distinct cars - five 2023 cars at 140.0萬/10,200 km, 135.0萬/37,000 km, 130.0萬/63,700 km, 125.0萬/40,000 km, 122.0萬/14,000 km, plus one 2022 car at 99.6萬/95,000 km (a seventh is 電洽, no price). CORRECTION TO THE PRIOR RECORD's REASONING: it claimed the low-mileage end commands a premium, but its own data refutes that - the 14,000 km car is the CHEAPEST at 122.0萬 and the 63,700 km car asks MORE (130.0萬) than the 40,000 km car (125.0萬). In a market this thin, mileage barely prices. I therefore anchor on the upper part of the observed asking range (~NT$1,350,000-1,400,000 dealer retail) on condition/spec grounds rather than on a mileage premium. Adjustments stated explicitly: (a) shaded to ~NT$1,250,000 dealer retail because the EQA nameplate is confirmed discontinued - the 2023 cars listed today have not yet priced in the 2026-07-30 merger announcement; (b) dealer retail -11% to private sale = NT$1,110,000; (c) private -13% to dealer trade-in = NT$965,000. Implies 51% of list retained at 3 years versus the ~62% dealer-ASKING retention visible today - the gap IS the retail-to-private spread plus the nameplate-death discount. Corroborating anchor I found that the prior record missed: a 2023 GLA 200 (combustion, near-identical original price) asks 165.8萬 at 28,000 km on the same site, i.e. the petrol GLA holds ~18% more than the electric EQA at the same age. That spread is the BEV penalty, observed directly within the same nameplate family."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - no 5-year data exists for this generation. NOTE: the prior record had years=35000 here (the km value had been copied into the years field), which broke the checkpoint sequence; corrected to 5. Two real anchors, both re-verified by direct scrape on 2026-08-12: (1) the oldest EQA on 8891, a 2022 car at ~4.4 years with 95,000 km, asking 99.6萬; adjusting UP for our car's far lower 35,000 km gives roughly 115萬 at 4.4 years, extrapolated to ~105萬 dealer retail at 5 years. (2) The nearest real Mercedes BEV tail available: 2020 EQC 400 4Matic 運動版 at 6 years asking 108.0萬 (30,000 km) and 108.0萬 (36,000 km), with a 129,000 km car at 99.0萬 - only three EQCs listed nationwide, on a car that listed around 300萬 when new. Shaded to ~NT$920,000 dealer retail for the dead nameplate and the 800V successor generation, then -11% to private (NT$820,000) and -15% to trade-in (NT$700,000). Confidence stays low: I could NOT source the EQC's exact original Taiwan list price, so the ~300萬 figure is a sanity reference only and was never used as a computed input."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the PREDECESSOR-GENERATION method - no 7-year EQA can exist (Taiwan launch was 2022). Real anchors on 8891, all re-verified by direct scrape 2026-08-12: 2020 EQC at 6 years asking 108.0萬 (30,000 km); Mercedes GLA W156 at 9 years (2017, 89,000 km) asking 58.5萬. The EQA is a GLA-bodied car and today's GLA 200 (216萬, confirmed on Yahoo Autos) is a direct price peer of this EQA (217萬), so the GLA tail is the right shape to borrow, then penalised for BEV-specific risk. Critically, the high-voltage battery warranty expires at 8 years - this is genuinely sourced, not assumed: an actual 8891 listing for a 2022 EQA advertises '高壓電池保固至2030年11' (2022/11 + 8 years), and I confirmed that exact string in the page text. A 7-year car is therefore being valued right at the edge of that cliff and the market discounts it hard. Implied ~NT$620,000 dealer retail (29% of list), -12% to private (NT$550,000), -15% to trade-in (NT$465,000). The tail keeps falling rather than flattening - correct for an out-of-warranty German BEV, unlike a Lexus."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED via predecessor generation, expressed as a retention ratio and applied to this car. Real anchors, all four individually re-verified in the scraped page text on 2026-08-12: Mercedes GLA W156 at 10 years (2016 cars) asking 53.8萬/54,100 km, 51.8萬/80,000 km, 48.0萬/94,000 km, and at 9 years 58.5萬/89,000 km (2017) - i.e. roughly 22-25% of the CURRENT same-nameplate GLA 200 list (216萬), or roughly 30-33% of its own-era list price. I could not source the 2016 GLA's original list price, which remains the main weakness and the reason for low confidence; the ratio is normalised against the current GLA 200 price instead. A 10-year BEV must sit BELOW the combustion equivalent: the HV battery warranty has been expired for two years, a pack replacement is a six-figure TWD event, and Taiwan's used market prices battery uncertainty punitively on thin-demand German EVs. I therefore took ~17% of list = ~NT$360,000 dealer retail, -11% to private (NT$320,000), -16% to trade-in (NT$270,000). Fact-check cross-validation: 16% of real cost at year 10 matches the Volvo EC40 (16%) and Volvo EX90 (17%) BEVs modelled in this batch and sits well below the combustion Mercedes GLA 200 sibling (23%), which is the correct ordering. Being explicitly extrapolated, not silently invented."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Estimate from Taiwan Mercedes dealer rates; no published EQ service price table found. Bounded by the assumed 3-year vehicle warranty. Trimmed from the prior NT$8,000 to sit sensibly above the Volvo BEV peers (NT$1,000-2,000, which appear to assume an included service plan) without matching the petrol GLA 200's NT$11,000."},{"y":3,"source":"Estimate from Taiwan Mercedes dealer rates; no published EQ service price table found. CORRECTED from NT$32,000, which was identical to the combustion GLA 200's figure for the same window even though a BEV has no oil service here. Rebuilt bottom-up: two annual inspections (~NT$9,000 total) + brake fluid (~NT$5,000) + cabin filter (~NT$4,000)."},{"y":5,"source":"Estimate from Taiwan Mercedes dealer rates and Taiwan premium tire pricing; no published EQ service price table found. Trimmed from NT$105,000, chiefly by pricing a 235/50R19 premium set at a realistic Taiwan fitted price (~NT$40,000) rather than NT$50,000."},{"y":7,"source":"Estimate from Taiwan Mercedes dealer rates; no published EQ service price table found. Trimmed from NT$115,000: the prior version charged a full NT$25,000 module contingency plus a NT$12,000 A/C service as certainties in a window where the car is only 7 years old and has covered 49,000 km. Contingency is now probability-weighted, which is what an expected-cost model requires - but weighted at NT$12,000 rather than a token amount, because the assumed 3-year vehicle warranty expired four years before this window and sensor / control-module failures on an EQ are dealer-only work. This keeps period cost rising monotonically with age."},{"y":10,"source":"Estimate from Taiwan Mercedes dealer rates and typical EQ parts pricing; no published table or owner receipts obtainable (Mobile01 returns HTTP 403 to automated fetching). Trimmed from NT$260,000, which stacked six separate large repairs as if each were certain. Still the heaviest period by design - out of warranty, with thermal-management and charging-system risk concentrated here - and still well above any Japanese BEV's tail, but the individual risk items are now probability-weighted rather than each charged in full."}],"sources":[{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan - all models (official)","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/models.html","note":"HONEST CAVEAT, RE-TESTED BY THE FACT-CHECK: this page does not respond from this environment (curl returns status 000 after timeout), so it could NOT be read and is not a basis for any figure here. Retained only to record the canonical official URL. The NT$2,170,000 list price rests on the two sources below, both of which I fetched and read verbatim."},{"name":"U-CAR - 26MY Mercedes-EQ EQA 250+ road test","url":"https://roadtest.u-car.com.tw/roadtest/article/85805","note":"PRIMARY PRICE VERIFICATION, fetched and read 2026-08-12. Verbatim: '配備/電氣性能/電池容量升級，新年式 EQA 250+售價 217 萬' and '新年式 EQA 車系以「EQA 250+」取代原有的「EQA 250」車型，維持單一車型、217 萬的售價'. Its model box shows '1 車型 217 萬'. Also confirms usable battery raised 66.5 -> 70.5 kWh."},{"name":"ETtoday 車雲 - Taiwan Mercedes EQA/EQB new model year","url":"https://speed.ettoday.net/news/2974767","note":"SECOND PRICE VERIFICATION, fetched and read 2026-08-12. Verbatim: '目前台灣EQA售價217萬'. Confirms EQA 250+ replaces the 250 as the sole trim ('未來250+將直接取代舊款250') and gives NEDC 606 km from the Bureau of Energy filing."},{"name":"Yahoo Autos Taiwan - M-Benz EQA 250+ trim page","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/m-benz-eqa-2025-250","note":"CORRECTED SCOPE. The prior record cited this as a third price verification showing '217 (萬)'. I fetched the page and it carries NO price whatsoever. It is retained ONLY as the source for Taiwan BEV tax status: 牌照稅 $0 and 燃料稅 $0 (both excluded from this model by design). Do not treat it as price evidence."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - all used Mercedes-Benz EQA listings in Taiwan","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqa","note":"PRIMARY USED-VALUE SOURCE. Independently re-scraped by the fact-check on 2026-08-12; the page states '共找到 10 輛車' and every figure below was matched in the page text. Only TEN EQAs nationwide - direct evidence of thin used demand for German BEVs in Taiwan. Actual 車商售價 asking prices: 2023/10,200 km 140.0萬 (listed twice); 2023/14,000 km 122.0萬; 2023/37,000 km 135.0萬; 2023/40,000 km 125.0萬 (listed twice); 2023/63,700 km 130.0萬 (listed twice); 2022/95,000 km 99.6萬; one 2023/23,800 km at 電洽. All are DEALER RETAIL asks and were adjusted downward to private-sale and trade-in figures. One listing also evidences the 8-year HV battery warranty ('高壓電池保固至2030年11' on a 2022 car), a string confirmed in the raw page text."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - used Mercedes-Benz GLA listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/gla","note":"Predecessor-generation anchor for the 7- and 10-year checkpoints, re-scraped 2026-08-12 (279 cars listed). All four cited anchors individually confirmed in the page text: GLA W156 2016 at 53.8萬/54,100 km, 51.8萬/80,000 km, 48.0萬/94,000 km; 2017 at 58.5萬/89,000 km. ADDITIONAL ANCHORS FOUND BY THE FACT-CHECK that strengthen the BEV-penalty argument: a 2023 GLA 200 asks 165.8萬 at 28,000 km, versus the 2023 EQA's 140.0萬 top ask at similar age - the petrol GLA holds materially more than the electric EQA from the same price bracket; and a 2022 GLA whose listing states '新車200萬' asks 129.9萬 at 50,000 km (~65% at 4 years), far flatter than the EQA curve."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - used Mercedes-Benz EQC listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqc","note":"The only real Mercedes BEV tail data in Taiwan, used for the 5- and 7-year checkpoints. Re-scraped 2026-08-12 and confirmed: '共找到 3 輛車' - 2020 EQC 400 4Matic 運動版 at 108.0萬/30,000 km; 108.0萬/36,000 km; 99.0萬/129,000 km. A car that listed around 300萬 new, at six years old. Evidences how hard German BEVs fall in this market. CAVEAT: the EQC's exact original Taiwan list price could not be sourced, so ~300萬 is a sanity reference only, never a computed input."},{"name":"ETtoday 車雲 - all-new GLA revealed, replaces EQA, Taiwan 2027","url":"https://speed.ettoday.net/news/3210054","note":"MATERIAL TO THE WHOLE MODEL, and fully verified verbatim by the fact-check on 2026-08-12. Dated 2026-07-30 08:03. Verbatim: '象徵GLA與EQA產品線正式整合' - the EQA nameplate is discontinued. Successor GLA 250+ has an 85 kWh pack, 800V architecture, 320 kW DC charging, 657 km WLTP, from EUR 48,599.60 (article: '約折合新臺幣180萬元'). Also verbatim: '台灣經銷端早已私下排隊接單', with a 2027 Taiwan arrival, headlined '新台幣200萬有找'. This drives both the larger run-out discount and the steeper depreciation curve."},{"name":"Yahoo Autos Taiwan - M-Benz GLA 200 摘星版 price","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/m-benz-gla-2026-200%E6%91%98%E6%98%9F%E7%89%88","note":"Price-peer reference, fetched and confirmed 2026-08-12: the current GLA 200 摘星版 lists at 216萬 versus this EQA's 217萬, confirming the GLA is a valid same-price, same-segment nameplate for the retention-ratio extrapolation at years 7 and 10."}]},"mercedes-eqb250-plus":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, well below the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000 km/year. All checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). At this mileage the EQB never reaches its 25,000 km service trigger, so servicing is purely time-driven (annual) and the used values quoted are read off LOW-MILEAGE listings rather than the mileage-blind market average. IMPORTANT CAVEAT ADDED ON REVIEW: the live 8891 EQA 250 cluster shows only a weak mileage gradient (2023 cars ask 122-140萬 across 10,200-63,700 km), so the low-mileage premium is real but much smaller than a naive reading suggests; it is applied conservatively here rather than being used to offset a full year of age. EXCLUDED BY DESIGN: (1) home charger installation - a 7.4 kW wallbox plus Taipower meter/wiring typically runs NT$40,000-80,000 for a house and can exceed NT$100,000 in an apartment complex needing a 社區 electrical review; it is a real ownership cost but it is not maintenance, so it is left out of maintenance.checkpoints entirely; (2) all tax and insurance, per the table spec - Taiwan does currently exempt BEVs from 牌照稅/燃料稅, but the statutory end-date has been extended repeatedly and could not be verified to any specific year from a primary source in this pass, so no claim about its expiry is made here (it is excluded from the model either way); (3) electricity/charging cost. The official list price already has the EV 貨物稅 (commodity tax) reduction baked in, per Mercedes-Benz Taiwan's own footnote, so no further tax rebate should be applied on top.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN on review (was 1,500,000 private / 1,290,000 trade-in). EXTRAPOLATED - no 1-year-old EQB 250+ exists on the Taiwan market. The original record justified this point by claiming the Mercedes-Benz Select certified EQE/EQS SUVs sit at 'around 65% of their original list'; I re-read that inventory and that claim is WRONG - EQE 300 SUV 出廠 2024/04, 4,755 km asks 233.8萬 and EQS 450 4MATIC SUV 出廠 2024/03, 3,114 km asks 426萬, which against their current lists is roughly 72-78%, not 65%. Those points are also contaminated by EQ-line price cuts, so I discarded them as the anchor and rebuilt this checkpoint from same-brand, same-channel listings instead. METHOD: (a) closest combustion analogue by size and price, GLA 200 (list 216萬 vs EQB 222萬), certified 出廠 2024/12 with 4,728 km asks 178萬 = 82.4% of list at 1.7 years, implying ~86-87% certified at 1.0 year; (b) the measured BEV penalty at matched age from the same certified inventory - EQA 250 出廠 2023/08 (3.0 y) asks 149.8萬 = 69% of its 217萬 list, versus GLC 300 4M Coupé 出廠 2023/09 (2.9 y) at 265.8萬 ≈ 80% - i.e. ~11 points, and German BEV loss is front-loaded so most of that penalty is already present at year 1; (c) certified-to-ordinary-retail step measured directly, EQA 250 certified 149.8萬 at 11,261 km vs ordinary 8891 EQA 250 140.0萬 at 10,200 km = ordinary retail is ~6.5% below certified. Chain: 87% - 9 points = ~78% certified = ~172萬; x0.935 = ~161萬 ordinary dealer retail asking. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale set ~11% below that dealer asking = 144萬, per the 車商售價 > 自售價 > 車商收購價 chain; dealer trade-in a further ~14% below private = 124萬. Low-mileage premium included but held small, per assumptions.notes. This is a ~33% first-year loss against real_cost - the steep German-BEV year-one hit, and it now sits with the EQE siblings in this batch rather than above them."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN on review (was 1,270,000 private / 1,090,000 trade-in) and CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from high to medium. The underlying listings were re-fetched and are all genuine, but the original record read the dealer-asking level off the TOP of the cluster. Live 8891 中古車 EQA 250 asking prices, re-read 2026-08-12 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-index.html?keyword=EQA), 2023 cars i.e. exactly 3 years old: 140.0萬 / 10,200 km (x2), 135.0萬 / 37,000 km, 130.0萬 / 63,700 km (x2, certified), 125.0萬 / 40,000 km (x2), 122.0萬 / 14,000 km - cluster mean ~131萬, and ~135-136萬 at our 21,000 km. The EQA 250 is the right analogue: single motor, 190 hp, list 217萬 against the EQB 250+'s 222萬. Adding ~2% for the EQB's higher list and 7-seat body gives ordinary dealer retail asking ~138萬, not the 145萬 originally used. Cross-check, same age: EQB 300 4MATIC 2023 / 16,000 km asks 158.0萬 and 2023 / 31,500 km asks 155.0萬 against a 267萬 list = ~59% - if anything that pulls the 250+ lower still. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale set ~12% below the 138萬 dealer asking = 121萬; dealer trade-in a further ~14% below = 104萬. CONFIDENCE: medium, not high. There are ZERO used EQB 250+ listings in Taiwan - all eleven live EQB listings are the dual-motor EQB 300 4MATIC, because the 250+ only arrived in Feb 2024 - so this number is read off a DIFFERENT model and is a proxy, however well-populated that proxy is. 'High' overstated it."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED DOWN on review (was 990,000 private / 850,000 trade-in). Anchored on real 4-year-old EQ listings re-verified 2026-08-12: EQA 250, 2022, 95,000 km asking 99.6萬 (46% of its 217萬 list); EQB 300 4MATIC, 2022, 76,300 km asking 113.8萬 (x2) and 2022, 130,000-134,500 km asking 106.8萬 / 106.9萬 (43% of a 267萬 list). Every real 2022 BEV listing is high-mileage, so a low-mileage adjustment is needed - but the original record over-credited it. The live EQA cluster shows only a weak mileage gradient at constant age (122-140萬 spanning 10,200-63,700 km), so low mileage does NOT offset a full extra year of age as originally assumed. Rebuilt: a 4-year EQ BEV at ~35,000 km asks ~110-115萬; one further year of age takes it to ~104萬 ordinary dealer retail asking at 5 years, versus the ~113萬 originally used. Combustion cross-check from the certified inventory: GLA 180 出廠 2021/05 (5.3 y), 82,698 km at 122.8萬 - the combustion sibling holds visibly better, which is the BEV penalty this record applies throughout. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale ~12% below dealer asking = 92萬; dealer trade-in a further ~14% below = 79萬. That is ~41% of list at 5 years. Note the factory warranty is 3 years and the 2-year 延保 is conditional (see maintenance.plan_notes), so this window is at or past the end of warranty cover, which is consistent with the fall steepening here."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"UNCHANGED on review - the underlying data was re-fetched and is genuine. EXTRAPOLATED FROM PREDECESSOR-GENERATION DATA: the current EQB only reached Taiwan in 2022 and the 250+ trim in Feb 2024, so no genuine 7-year data exists for this car and none has been invented. Method as required by the brief: take the real Taiwan used prices of the oldest German BEV actually sold here, the BMW i3 REx (on sale in Taiwan from ~2014, original list ~239萬), express them as a retention ratio of ITS original list, then apply that ratio to this car. Live 8891 中古車 i3 asking prices re-read 2026-08-12 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-index.html?keyword=i3), all four listings on the site: 2017 REx, 140,000 km at 52.0萬; 2016 REx, 83,000 km at 59.8萬; 2016 REx, 90,000 km at 45.8萬; 2015 REx, 110,000 km at 45.8萬 - i.e. ~19-25% DEALER ASKING retention at 9-11 years. Interpolating that curve back to 7 years gives ~32-33% dealer asking, nudged up slightly for our car's much lower mileage (49,000 km vs the i3s' 83,000-140,000 km): dealer retail asking ~72萬. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale ~11% below = 64萬; dealer trade-in a further ~16% below = 54萬. Confidence stays low: this is a cross-model, cross-brand extrapolation, and the i3 is an unusual car (carbon tub, small battery, range-extender) whose collapse may overstate the EQB's. Caveat recorded rather than smoothed away."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"UNCHANGED on review - underlying data re-fetched and genuine. EXTRAPOLATED FROM PREDECESSOR-GENERATION DATA, same method and same caveat as year 7; no 10-year EQB exists. Here the BMW i3 REx data sits at exactly the target age, which is the strongest available evidence for a decade-old German BEV in Taiwan: 2016 REx, 90,000 km asking 45.8萬 and 2015 REx, 110,000 km asking 45.8萬, against a ~239萬 original list = ~19% DEALER ASKING retention at 10-11 years. Our car will have only 70,000 km, meaningfully below those, so the ratio is lifted to ~22% dealer asking = ~49萬 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale ~14% below dealer asking = 42萬; dealer trade-in a further ~17% below = 35萬 - the private-vs-trade-in gap widens on old BEVs because dealers discount hard for battery uncertainty they cannot warrant. Key driver: the high-voltage battery warranty is 8年/16萬km (now verified from the official spec table, see sources), so it has expired by year 8, and a pack replacement at NT$600,000-900,000+ exceeds the entire value of the car - the market prices in that cliff, which is why the tail keeps falling instead of flattening. Treat as directional, not precise."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Covers years 0-1. Estimated from Mercedes-Benz Taiwan dealer service norms for an EQ-model first annual visit. Warranty terms per the official 原廠保固條款 (3 years unlimited mileage). No per-visit price is published by Mercedes-Benz Taiwan, so the NT$8,000 is a class-norm estimate rather than a quoted figure. Unchanged on review; consistent with the EQE siblings in this batch."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers years 1-3 only (not cumulative). Two dealer visits at ~NT$10,000 each plus brake fluid and consumables. Interval logic per the Mercedes EQ 1-year/25,000 km service policy - at 7,000 km/year the mileage trigger is never reached, so servicing is purely calendar-driven. This is the one window where warranty cover is not in doubt: the 3-year unlimited-mileage factory warranty applies regardless of how the car was financed. Per-visit pricing is a class-norm estimate; Mercedes-Benz Taiwan publishes no service price list. Unchanged on review."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers years 3-5 only. REVISED UP on review, from NT$110,000 to NT$125,000. The original record applied no repair-risk loading here on the grounds that the 贈2年延保 extended cover to ~year 5, while simultaneously booking a NT$120,000 cash discount in purchase - but that promotion is 需符合指定條件 and the advertised EQB incentive is finance-shaped (150萬60期0利率), so a cash buyer plausibly does not qualify. A NT$15,000 risk-weighted allowance is now carried for this window instead of assuming free cover. The rest of the period is wear items, which no warranty covers in any case: tire replacement is age-driven (at 7,000 km/year the original tires reach only ~35,000 km but are 5 years old and rubber ages out regardless of tread; the 2,105 kg kerb weight and 385 Nm instant torque also wear tires faster than a comparable petrol SUV), and the rusted-disc item is a genuine BEV-specific failure mode in Taiwan's humidity because regenerative braking leaves the friction brakes barely used. Tire size 235/50 R19 verified from the official spec table. Costs are Mercedes-Benz Taiwan dealer-rate estimates for this class, not verified receipts."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers years 5-7 only. FULL UNSUBSIDISED COST - the 3-year factory warranty and any 2-year 延保 extension have both expired, so this period carries genuine out-of-warranty repair risk, which is also why the residual value falls steeply here. The electric coolant pump and the electric A/C compressor are the expensive BEV-specific analogues to a combustion car's water pump and belt-driven compressor: fewer of them, but each far dearer at Mercedes dealer labour rates. Deliberately excludes any HV battery work, which is still inside the verified 8年/16萬km battery warranty in this window. Estimated from Mercedes-Benz Taiwan dealer-rate norms and known EQ-platform failure patterns, not from verified receipts - along with year 10 this is the least-sourced part of the record. Unchanged on review."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers years 7-10 only. The heaviest period by far, and the honest reason a German BEV is not a cheap car to keep: everything is out of warranty, dealer labour rates are unchanged by the car's age, and from year 8 the high-voltage battery has outlived its warranty - now verified as 8年/16萬km from the official 8891 per-trim specification table rather than inferred from a used-car advert as in the original record. A full pack replacement (NT$600,000-900,000+) is deliberately NOT budgeted because almost no owner does it - they sell the car instead, which is precisely the behaviour that produces the ~19% year-10 residual above; only a module/diagnostic risk allowance is carried. Ten-year maintenance totals ~NT$571,000, roughly double a RAV4-class Japanese SUV - correctly reflecting German dealer rates, larger brakes and 19-inch tires, and out-of-warranty electronics risk - while still sitting below an equivalent German PETROL SUV because there is no oil service, no spark plugs and no DPF. Estimated from class norms, not verified receipts. Unchanged on review."}],"sources":[{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan - EQB official model page (PRIMARY, list price)","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/models/suv/eqb/overview.html","note":"Primary source for the list price, re-fetched and re-confirmed during this fact-check: the page renders '參考售價為 ... 2,220,000' for the EQB 250+, plus full technical data. Also carries the official footnote that the EV 貨物稅減徵 is already deducted from the shown price. Confirms the researcher's figure exactly - 0% deviation."},{"name":"8891 新車 - EQB per-trim specification and price table (DECISIVE per-trim price evidence)","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqb/Specification.html","note":"Added during this fact-check. The per-trim table that the original record was missing: '共 2 款車型' - EQB 2026年式 250+ at 222萬 and EQB 2026年式 300 4MATIC at 267萬, both 全部在售. Also the source for several facts the original record listed as open questions or inferences: 前/後輪尺碼 235/50 R19, 電池保固 8年/16萬km, 電池容量 70.5 kWh, 馬達最大馬力 190hp, 馬達最大扭力 39.3kgm, 電動馬達 1 具, 驅動型式 前輪驅動, 車重 2,105 kg, 5門7座, 上市時間 2025.03, 532 km WLTP."},{"name":"8891 新車 - Mercedes-Benz EQB price and spec summary page","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqb/Summary.html","note":"Independent confirmation of the price range: 2026 EQB 原廠建議售價 222-267萬. Also the source for the current incentives used in the discount build-up - 貸款 150萬60期0利率(指定年式車型) and 保固：贈2年延保(需符合指定條件) - and for the segment ranking (小型SUV休旅熱度 第 41 名) cited as evidence of dealer flexibility. The '需符合指定條件' wording is what drove the maintenance correction in years 3-5."},{"name":"8891 新車 - EQA per-trim specification and price table (analogue denominator)","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqa/Specification.html","note":"Added during this fact-check. Confirms EQA 2026年式 250+ at 217萬 - the denominator underpinning the year-3 retention ratio derived from real EQA 250 used listings - and confirms the same 電池保固 8年/16萬km term across the EQ compact range."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - live EQA used listings (single-motor BEV analogue, PRIMARY used-value evidence)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-index.html?keyword=EQA","note":"Re-fetched and item-by-item re-verified on 2026-08-12; every listing the original record quoted is genuine. Live dealer RETAIL asking prices: 2023 / 10,200 km at 140.0萬 (x2); 2023 / 14,000 km at 122.0萬; 2023 / 37,000 km at 135.0萬; 2023 / 40,000 km at 125.0萬 (x2); 2023 / 63,700 km at 130.0萬 (certified); 2022 / 95,000 km at 99.6萬. One listing advertises '高壓電池保固至2030年11' on a 2022 car. NOTE THE WEAK MILEAGE GRADIENT across this cluster - that is what forced the year-5 correction. These are 車商售價 and are adjusted down for private sale at every checkpoint."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - live EQB used listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-index.html?keyword=EQB","note":"Re-fetched and re-verified on 2026-08-12. Confirms the record's central data problem: every live EQB listing is an EQB 300 4MATIC, ZERO are EQB 250+. Dealer retail asking: 2023 / 16,000 km at 158.0萬; 2023 / 31,500 km at 155.0萬; 2023 / 30,000 km at 148.0萬 (x2); 2022 / 76,300 km at 113.8萬 (x2); 2022 / 130,000-134,500 km at 106.8萬 / 106.9萬. Against a 267萬 list that is ~59% at 3 years and ~43% at 4 years."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Select 原廠精選中古車 (official certified used inventory)","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz-select.com.tw/buy-car","note":"Re-fetched 2026-08-12; 131 units in stock. The TOP of the dealer retail band. Verified rows: EQB 300 4M, 出廠 2023/04, 16,506 km at 158萬; EQA 250, 出廠 2023/08, 11,261 km at 149.8萬; EQE 300 SUV, 出廠 2024/04, 4,755 km at 233.8萬; EQE 350 4MATIC SUV, 出廠 2024/04, 6,182 km at 266萬; EQS 450 4MATIC SUV, 出廠 2024/03, 3,114 km at 426萬. CORRECTION: the original record described the EQE/EQS points as '~65% of original list'; against current lists they are nearer 72-78%, so they were discarded as the year-1 anchor. Used instead for the year-1 rebuild: GLA 200, 出廠 2024/12, 4,728 km at 178萬; GLC 300 4M Coupé, 出廠 2023/09, 7,798 km at 265.8萬; GLA 180, 出廠 2021/05, 82,698 km at 122.8萬; A 180, 出廠 2024/03, 3,026 km at 143萬."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - live BMW i3 used listings (10-year German BEV proxy)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-index.html?keyword=i3","note":"Re-fetched and re-verified on 2026-08-12 - all four live listings match what the original record quoted exactly. The predecessor-generation evidence used for the year-7 and year-10 extrapolation, since no German BEV of that age exists for the EQB itself: 2017 REx / 140,000 km at 52.0萬; 2016 REx / 83,000 km at 59.8萬; 2016 REx / 90,000 km at 45.8萬; 2015 REx / 110,000 km at 45.8萬. Against a ~239萬 original list this is ~19-25% dealer-asking retention at 9-11 years."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan - 原廠保固條款 (official warranty terms)","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/services/warranty.html","note":"Official warranty text: 3 years unlimited mileage on the vehicle, 12V battery 2 years unlimited mileage, and BEV HV battery warranty published per model. Basis for the warranty-coverage logic in maintenance.plan_notes. The model-specific HV battery term is NOT on this page - it is taken from the 8891 per-trim spec table (8年/16萬km) instead."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan - all services page","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/services.html","note":"Checked specifically to see whether Mercedes-Benz Taiwan publishes a public service price table. It does not - it directs owners to the 0800-036-524 line for repair-cost information. This is why every per-visit maintenance figure is a class-norm estimate and nothing in maintenance is rated above medium."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - live Mercedes GLB used listings (combustion sibling)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-index.html?keyword=GLB","note":"Cited by the original researcher as the combustion cross-check for the BEV depreciation penalty (GLB holding ~70% dealer asking at 3 years vs ~59-65% for the EQ BEVs). NOT independently re-verified in this fact-check pass - the BEV-vs-combustion penalty used in the corrected numbers was instead re-derived from the Mercedes-Benz Select certified inventory (EQA 250 vs GLC 300 4M Coupé at matched age), which I did verify. Retained for traceability, but it is not load-bearing for any figure in this record."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan - all models overview (URL originally cited by the lineup scout)","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/models.html","note":"The URL the original lineup scout cited for the price. It renders the model lineup and the '本圖片及建議售價僅供參考' disclaimer but no per-trim price table, so it does not on its own substantiate NT$2,220,000. Recorded for traceability only; the actual verification came from the EQB model page and the 8891 per-trim spec table."}]},"mercedes-eqe300-suv":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, far below the Taiwan average of ~12,000-15,000. Every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000/21,000/35,000/49,000/70,000). At this mileage the Mercedes EQ schedule is entirely TIME-driven (annual, or 25,000 km whichever comes first) - the car never reaches the mileage trigger, so it gets 10 annual services in 10 years. Consumables are age-driven too: 235/55R19 tires harden out at ~5-6 years long before they wear out at 35,000 km, and brake discs on a regen-braked EV in humid Taiwan corrode from disuse rather than wear thin. EXCLUDED BY DESIGN: tax and insurance. ALSO EXCLUDED: home AC charger installation, typically NT$40,000-80,000 in Taiwan for a 7kW wallbox plus building-committee approval and cabling - a real ownership cost but not maintenance, so it appears in no maintenance period. Electricity/charging cost is not modelled. The official list price is already net of the government BEV commodity-tax reduction - verified against the footnote on the official Taiwan spec sheet, which I downloaded and text-extracted myself.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"CORRECTED BY AUDIT (was NT$2,020,000 private / NT$1,780,000 trade-in). Anchor verified by direct fetch this time, not via search snippet: 8891 listing auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4400395.html is a real MY2025 EQE SUV at 車商 (dealer) asking NT$2,198,000, 上極汽車, Taichung - i.e. a genuine ~1-year-old dealer retail price. The researcher escalated that anchor to NT$2,250,000-2,300,000 on the grounds that a MY2026 car is newer than the MY2025 observed; that double-counts model-year freshness, because when this buyer's MY2026 car turns 1 in Aug 2027 it occupies exactly the slot the MY2025 occupies today, competing against MY2027 new cars. Correct method is to haircut the observed figure directly: NT$2,198,000 x 0.88 = ~NT$1,935,000, taken as NT$1,940,000 private (11.7% below dealer retail asking, inside the 8-15% band). Dealer trade-in a further 12% below private = NT$1,700,000. Quoted from low-mileage stock as this buyer does 7,000 km/yr. That is a 32.5% loss against real_cost in year one - correctly front-loaded for a German BEV in Taiwan and far steeper than a Japanese equivalent."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Two direct same-nameplate comparables on 8891, both re-confirmed by this audit at auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqe: a 2024 EQE SUV 300 with 11,000 km at dealer asking NT$2,050,000 (~2.5 yr, = 68.6% of its NT$2,990,000 launch list), and a 2023 EQE SUV 350 4Matic with 31,000 km at dealer asking NT$2,200,000 (~3 yr, on a NT$3,580,000 list = 61.5%). Applying 61.5% to this car's NT$3,000,000 list gives ~NT$1,845,000 dealer retail, plus ~4% for the low 21,000 km = ~NT$1,920,000 DEALER RETAIL. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale 13.5% below dealer retail (NT$1,660,000), trade-in a further 13% below private (NT$1,440,000). Both listed cars were deliberately chosen low-mileage. NOTE: the direct EQE SUV 300 comparable would imply a slightly HIGHER year-3 value (~NT$1,715,000 private); the more conservative 350-derived ratio is retained because both are thin-market asking prices, and the EQE 300 SEDAN evidence is much weaker (a 2023 EQE 300 sedan with 32,000 km listed 自售 at NT$1,500,000)."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - no EQE SUV is 5 years old yet (launched TW Feb 2024). Predecessor proxy: Mercedes EQC 400 4MATIC 運動版, original TW list NT$3,500,000, which this audit verified independently (7car and carstuff both report the 2019 launch pair as 330萬 for ELECTRIC ART and 350萬 for 運動版). Live 8891 listings re-confirmed today: a 2020 car with 30,000 km at dealer asking NT$1,080,000 and another with 36,000 km at the same NT$1,080,000, i.e. 30.9% of original list as DEALER RETAIL at 6 years. Back-projecting that curve to 5 years gives ~37% of list, then +8% relative for the EQE SUV's much better range (587 vs 417 km) and 10-year battery warranty = ~43% of list, ~NT$1,290,000 dealer retail. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private 12% below (NT$1,130,000), trade-in 14% below private (NT$970,000). Years 3-5 re-steepen because the 3-year factory warranty has expired and the EQ generation is turning over."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the same EQC predecessor proxy (list NT$3,500,000, verified). At 6 years the low-mileage dealer-retail asking is NT$1,080,000 = 30.9% of list. SOURCE CORRECTION BY AUDIT: the researcher also cited a 129,000 km EQC at NT$990,000 as a dealer-retail point (28.3% of list); 8891 in fact shows that car as a 自售 PRIVATE seller, so it is already a private price and the private-equivalent tail is LOWER than the researcher modelled, not higher. That reinforces keeping this checkpoint low rather than raising it. Extending the dealer-retail curve one more year gives ~26-27% of list, plus ~8% relative adjustment for the EQE SUV = ~29%, i.e. ~NT$880,000 DEALER RETAIL on this car's NT$3,000,000 list. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private 13% below dealer retail (NT$760,000), trade-in 14% below private (NT$650,000). The tail keeps falling rather than flattening - by year 7 the car is four years out of warranty and the used market is pricing in high-voltage repair risk on an obsolete EQ platform."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"PURE EXTRAPOLATION - no German BEV in Taiwan has reached 10 years (the EQC, the oldest, only arrives at 10 years in 2029-2030), so there is no genuine data point and none has been invented. Method: extend the EQC retention curve (30.9% of list at 6 years, from real 8891 dealer listings verified today) to 10 years, which lands near 14% of list = ~NT$420,000 DEALER RETAIL, cross-checked against 10-year-old German luxury cars in Taiwan which sit around 12-15% of list. The BEV-specific penalty is that the 10-year/250,000 km battery warranty expires exactly here, so the year-10 buyer gets zero pack coverage on a 90.56 kWh battery that costs more to replace than the car is worth. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private 14% below dealer retail (NT$360,000), trade-in 17% below private (NT$300,000)."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Mercedes EQ Service A reported by a Taiwan owner at ~NT$3,445, rounded up to NT$6,000 to reflect real dealer invoicing once labour, cabin filter and sundries are included. Service is annual, not mileage-triggered, at 7,000 km/yr. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED BY AUDIT from medium to low: that owner figure was reported 'via search' from an owner group with no citable URL, it has no corresponding entry in sources[], and Mercedes-Benz Taiwan publishes no public EQ service price table. A single uncitable data point cannot carry medium confidence."},{"y":3,"source":"Two annual EV services at Mercedes Taiwan dealer rates: ~NT$9,000 for the year-2 visit carrying the 2-year brake-fluid change, ~NT$7,000 for the year-3 plain Service A, plus ~NT$3,000 of consumables (cabin filter, wipers) = NT$19,000. ARITHMETIC CORRECTED BY AUDIT: the researcher's breakdown named only NT$9,000 + NT$7,000 = NT$16,000 against a stated period_cost of NT$19,000; the consumables line reconciles it. Cumulative 3-year spend is therefore NT$25,000. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED BY AUDIT from medium to low: the cross-check invoked ('the widely quoted Taiwan figure of ~NT$18,000 for 3 years of EV maintenance vs ~NT$42,000 for combustion') carries no URL and appears in no sources[] entry, and the underlying per-service rate is the same uncitable owner report used at year 1."},{"y":5,"source":"Warranty expires at year 3, so this is the first unsubsidised period. Tire size 235/55R19 confirmed against the official Taiwan spec PDF (wheel codes R17 / R55) by this audit; pricing from Taiwan retail for premium EV-rated 235/55R19 (Michelin e.Primacy class) at ~NT$8,000-9,000 each fitted. Replacement is triggered by rubber age at 5 years, since 35,000 km alone would not wear them out. 12V aux battery cost reflects the Mercedes EQ part plus mandatory coding. Timing of the 12V failure and the tire change are estimates, hence low confidence."},{"y":7,"source":"Fully out of warranty. The brake job is the counter-intuitive big item: regen means the pads barely wear, but low annual mileage plus Taiwan humidity corrodes the discs until an annual inspection condemns them - a well-documented EV ownership cost, not an invented one. Coolant is on a ~6-year interval and the EQE's multi-circuit thermal system needs a vacuum fill at dealer labour rates. No air-strut allowance is carried because the standard car has steel springs (code 485, verified against the official spec PDF); a car optioned with AIRMATIC (code 489, NT$96,000) would need roughly NT$60,000-100,000 added here. The risk allowance is an expected-value figure for German BEV out-of-warranty items, not a certainty, hence low confidence."},{"y":10,"source":"EXTRAPOLATED - no EQE SUV is anywhere near this age, so this is an expected-value model, not observed receipts. Built from the known failure profile of 8-10 year old German BEVs (EQC/i3 era) plus Mercedes Taiwan dealer labour rates: A/C compressor, on-board charger and DC-DC converter are the recognised high-cost electrical items, and a 2,440 kg SUV eats suspension components. The traction pack is deliberately excluded because the 10-year/250,000 km warranty still holds through this window - the buyer's exposure begins the day after. 10-year maintenance total of ~NT$469,000 is roughly 2.5-3x a Japanese SUV equivalent and below a combustion Mercedes GLE, which is the correct relative position for a German luxury BEV."}],"sources":[{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan official spec & price sheet (X294 EQE SUV, 2025-06-27)","url":"https://benz-taiwan.com/PDF/%E8%A6%8F%E6%A0%BC%E9%85%8D%E5%82%99X294-EQE-SUV-20250627.pdf","note":"Primary source. Downloaded and text-extracted independently by this audit with Swift PDFKit, not taken on trust. Confirms line-by-line: MY2025 EQE 300 SUV NT$2,990,000 (vs 350 4MATIC NT$3,580,000 and AMG EQE 43 NT$4,700,000), 最大馬力 245 hp, 後輪驅動 RWD, 90.56 kWh usable, 587 km WLTP, 2,440 kg kerb, 235/55R19 wheels (codes R17/R55). Critically: 懸吊系統 = 舒適型懸吊 (code 485) standard, while AIRMATIC 氣壓懸吊系統 (code 489) is a NT$96,000 option on the 300 and 350 and standard only on the AMG. Footnote confirms the price is already net of the BEV commodity-tax reduction."},{"name":"8891 新車 - 2026 model year EQE SUV Taiwan pricing","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/mercedes-benz/eqe-suv/22137","note":"Fetched directly by this audit. Dated 2026-07-06. MY2026 EQE 300 SUV NT$3,000,000 and EQE 350 4Matic SUV NT$3,590,000, each +NT$10,000; entry model gains a panoramic electric sunroof as standard."},{"name":"TVBS Cars - 2026 model year EQE range update","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/330852","note":"Fetched directly by this audit. Dated 2026-07-07. Independent confirmation: 'EQE 300 SUV：300萬元（調漲1萬元）' and 'EQE 350 4Matic SUV：359萬元（調漲1萬元）'."},{"name":"U-CAR - 2026 model year EQE SUV pricing","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/89060","note":"Third independent confirmation of the list price, added by this audit. Direct fetch returned HTTP 403; the figures were read from the search-result snippet, which states 售價調漲 1 萬元，分別為 300 萬元以及 359 萬元."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Mercedes-Benz EQE used listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqe","note":"Fetched directly by this audit. Source of the year-3 anchors: 2024 EQE SUV 300 with 11,000 km at dealer asking NT$2,050,000, and 2023 EQE SUV 350 4Matic with 31,000 km at dealer asking NT$2,200,000. Both are 車商售價 dealer retail and were discounted 12-13.5% to private sale before use. The same page also shows a 2023 EQE 300 SEDAN with 32,000 km listed 自售 (private) at NT$1,500,000 against a dealer-listed 2023 sedan with 75,000 km at NT$1,590,000 - a same-nameplate pair that empirically supports the size of the dealer-to-private haircut applied throughout."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - MY2025 EQE SUV 300 listing, Taichung (year-1 anchor)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-4400395.html","note":"FETCHED DIRECTLY BY THIS AUDIT - the researcher had only seen this URL as a verbatim string in search results. Confirmed genuine: 2025 EQE SUV, dealer (車商, 上極汽車), Taichung, asking NT$2,198,000. This is the sole year-1 anchor, and the audit applies the private-sale haircut to it directly rather than escalating it for model year."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Mercedes-Benz EQC used listings (predecessor proxy)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqc","note":"Fetched directly by this audit. Proxy for years 5, 7 and 10, all 2020 EQC 400 4Matic 運動版: 30,000 km at NT$1,080,000 (dealer) and 36,000 km at NT$1,080,000 (dealer), giving 30.9% dealer-retail retention at 6 years against the NT$3,500,000 original list. CORRECTION: the third listing, 129,000 km at NT$990,000, is a 自售 PRIVATE seller, not a dealer as the researcher recorded - so it is already a private price and cannot be used as a dealer-retail data point."},{"name":"7Car / CarStuff - EQC 400 4MATIC Taiwan launch pricing (2019)","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/66214","note":"Verified by this audit via search snippet to confirm the proxy's original list price, which the entire 5/7/10-year extrapolation depends on: 建議售價分別是新台幣 330 萬與 350 萬 for the EQC 400 4MATIC ELECTRIC ART and 運動版 respectively. The NT$3,500,000 figure used for the 運動版 is correct."},{"name":"U-CAR - EQE 300 SUV Taiwan launch (Feb 2024)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/77586","note":"Direct fetch returned HTTP 403; confirmed via search snippet reading 開出 299 萬的新車售價. Records the EQE 300 SUV's Taiwan debut at NT$2,990,000, which establishes the age and list-price base of the used comparables."},{"name":"EV Database - Mercedes-Benz EQE SUV 300","url":"https://ev-database.org/car/3283/Mercedes-Benz-EQE-SUV-300","note":"Fetched directly by this audit. Independent confirmation of 90.6 kWh usable capacity, 2,445 kg kerb weight, RWD and ~586 km WLTP. Note it lists 265 PS against the Taiwan sheet's 245 hp - a market/model-year difference; the Taiwan figure is used. Supports the tire and suspension wear assumptions."},{"name":"U-CAR AIGC - Mercedes-Benz Taiwan extended warranty pricing","url":"https://aigc.u-car.com.tw/answer/cclass-10072005","note":"Seen in search results only, NOT fetched or verified by this audit. C-Class reference: NT$42,000 for year 4 alone, NT$77,000 for years 4-5 combined. Used only to describe the extended-warranty option in plan_notes; NOT applied as a subsidy, so no number in this record depends on it."}]},"mercedes-eqe350-plus":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, roughly half the Taiwan average. All checkpoints use the 7,000 km/year midpoint (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km). At this mileage every service interval is TIME-driven, not mileage-driven: the Mercedes EQ schedule is 2 years or 25,000 km, so the car always hits the 2-year clock long before the km limit, and tyres age out (5-6 years) rather than wear out. Low-mileage cars sell above the mileage-blind average, so every value checkpoint is quoted against real low-mileage listings and says so. EXCLUDED BY DESIGN: 牌照稅 and 燃料費 (both NT$0 for BEVs in TW anyway under the current exemption), insurance, electricity/charging. ALSO EXCLUDED from maintenance: home wallbox installation, which for an EQE-class car in TW runs roughly NT$40,000-100,000 (charger hardware plus 台電 用電申請 and the wiring run, more in an older apartment building) — a real one-off ownership cost, but not maintenance, so it is in no period_cost. Depreciation figures are private-sale proceeds to the owner, not dealer asking prices.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no 1-year-old EQE 350+ exists on the TW used market yet. Nearest real anchors, 8891 (auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqe), read 2026-08-12, both 2 years old and both 車商 asking prices: 2024 EQE SUV 300, 11,000 km, NT$2,050,000; 2024 EQE SUV 350 4Matic, 31,000 km, NT$2,200,000. CORRECTION TO PREVIOUS DRAFT: it scored the first of these against a NT$3,580,000 launch list for 57% retention. Wrong denominator — the EQE SUV 300 launched in TW at NT$2,990,000 (U-CAR, Feb 2024, '正式發表EQE 300 SUV 299萬起'); NT$3,580,000 is the EQE SUV 350 4Matic (July 2023). Correct figures: 2,050,000/2,990,000 = 68.6% and 2,200,000/3,580,000 = 61.5% dealer retail at 2 years, i.e. a 61-69% band, not 57%. The saloon trades below the SUV in TW, so I set year-1 saloon DEALER RETAIL at ~72% of list = NT$2,383,000 — above the observed 2-year band, as a 1-year car must be. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale 12% below dealer ask -> NT$2,100,000 (63% of list); dealer trade-in a further 14% below private -> NT$1,800,000. The 7,000 km reading is well under a normal 1-year car and is already reflected in the 72%. A ~37% first-year loss is still deliberately steep — this is a German luxury BEV in Taiwan, the weakest-retaining combination in this batch — but it is no longer propped up by the mis-derived 57% figure."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REAL EQE saloon listings on 8891 (auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqe), read 2026-08-12. CORRECTION TO PREVIOUS DRAFT — this is the material error in the record. It cited '2023 EQE 300, 32,000 km, DEALER ASKING NT$1,500,000' and then took a further 12.5% off it to reach private sale. That listing is 自售 (private), not 車商 — so the draft double-discounted an already-private price. It also omitted the genuine dealer anchor sitting on the same page: 2023 EQE 300, 75,000 km, 車商 asking NT$1,590,000. Together those two ARE the dealer-vs-private spread: the dealer asks NT$90,000 more on a car with more than double the mileage. Third anchor: 2022 EQE 300 (V295, 241 hp), 40,500 km, 車商 NT$1,556,000. All were NT$3,260,000 new. So dealer retail for a 3-4 year EQE 300 saloon is ~NT$1,556,000-1,590,000 (48-49% of list) and private ask is ~NT$1,500,000 (46%). Our car is a better proposition than any of them: the 350+ trim rather than the 300, and 21,000 km rather than 32,000-75,000. Dealer retail set at ~52% of NT$3,310,000 = NT$1,720,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale 12.5% below dealer ask -> NT$1,500,000 (45% of list); dealer trade-in 15% below private -> NT$1,270,000. Cross-check: the NT$1,500,000 private figure is independently corroborated by the real 自售 listing above, on a lower-trim car with 50% more mileage. Also removed from this checkpoint's reasoning: the previous draft's claim that the collapse is 'amplified by the official list-price cut from NT$3,580,000 to NT$3,310,000'. No such cut occurred (see purchase.notes). Excluded outlier: auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-3712829.html, a 2023 EQE at a Taipei dealer (桑尼車庫) asking NT$3,280,000 — verified real but wildly out of line with every other 2022-2023 EQE, and above even the 2023 AMG EQE 53 listings on the same page; treated as stale or mis-specified."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the closest real Mercedes BEV in TW at this age — the EQC, since no EQE is 5 years old yet. 8891 (auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqc), read 2026-08-12: 2020 EQC 400 4Matic 運動版, 30,000 km and 36,000 km, both 車商 asking NT$1,080,000; plus a 129,000 km 自售 car at NT$990,000. TIGHTENED vs previous draft: both dealer cars are specifically the 運動版 / AMG Line, which launched in TW at NT$3,500,000, not the NT$3,300,000 Electric Art (8891 新車 and Yahoo Autos both confirm the NT$3,300,000 / NT$3,500,000 two-variant split). So the correct ratio is 1,080,000/3,500,000 = 30.9% dealer retail at 6 years on genuinely low mileage — the same low-km profile as this buyer — rather than the draft's looser '31-33%'. RETENTION RATIO APPLIED TO THIS CAR: one year earlier on that curve, ~36% dealer retail = NT$1,250,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale 12% below dealer ask -> NT$1,100,000 (33% of list); dealer trade-in 15% below private -> NT$930,000. Set slightly above the raw EQC line because the EQE carries a 10-year/250,000 km HV battery warranty (vs the EQC's 8yr/160,000 km), still live here and the single biggest thing a used-BEV buyer prices. Rebased upward from the previous draft's NT$1,030,000 to stay consistent with the corrected year-3 anchor."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — no 7-year-old German BEV exists in the TW market. Base is the same real EQC data (2020 EQC 400 4Matic 運動版, 30,000 and 36,000 km, 車商 asking NT$1,080,000 = 30.9% of its NT$3,500,000 launch list at 6 years; auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqc, read 2026-08-12). Pushing that ratio one further year and allowing for the car being 4 years out of its 3-year vehicle warranty — the market openly prices in air-suspension, thermal-management and electronics repair risk by then — gives ~28% DEALER RETAIL = NT$940,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale 11% below dealer ask -> NT$830,000 (25% of list); dealer trade-in 16% below private -> NT$700,000. The fall decelerates slightly but does not stop: -24% from year 5, against -27% for year 3 to 5. It does not fall harder only because the HV battery is still under the 10yr/250,000 km >=70%-capacity warranty (cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/127611) at 49,000 km, nowhere near the limit."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"FULLY EXTRAPOLATED — there is no 10-year-old German BEV in Taiwan to observe, so this is a ratio transferred from a weaker proxy and should be read as such. Proxy: premium BEVs of that vintage on 8891 (auto.8891.com.tw/tesla/model-s), read 2026-08-12: 2018 Model S 75D, 66,000 km, dealer asking NT$998,000, and 2017 Model S 75D, 236,000 km, NT$958,000 — roughly 29% of a ~NT$3,450,000 original list as dealer retail at 8-9 years. Mercedes BEVs trade materially below Tesla in Taiwan (thinner used demand, no charging-network halo, and by 2036 the EQE will be two generations discontinued with a shrinking parts and specialist base), and the HV battery warranty expires exactly at year 10, which is the moment buyers start discounting for a NT$1m+ pack. Dealer retail set at ~19% of list = NT$640,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale 14% below dealer ask -> NT$550,000 (17% of list); dealer trade-in 20% below private -> NT$440,000. The tail keeps falling rather than flattening: -34% from year 7 over three years, a steeper three-year drop than the two-year drop before it. This is the German out-of-warranty pattern, not the Lexus one."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Interval logic from the Mercedes EQ 2-year/25,000 km schedule applied to this buyer's 7,000 km/yr; warranty term from cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/127611 and mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/services/warranty.html. Cost is a consumables-only estimate — nothing scheduled falls in this window."},{"y":3,"source":"Estimate built from the EQ 2-year service content, priced at Mercedes-Benz Taiwan dealer labour rates. Item list and TW interval bands cross-checked against faqs.tw/ev-maintenance-tw (verified live 2026-08-12), German column: brake fluid every 2-3 yrs at NT$3,000-5,000 for BMW; a Benz dealer sits at or above that. No official MB TW EQ price table was obtainable, so this is a reasoned estimate rather than a quoted figure."},{"y":5,"source":"Tyre replacement driven by age not mileage at 7,000 km/yr; 19-inch AMG Line wheels confirmed on the 2026 EQE 350+ Yahoo Autos trim page (fetched in full 2026-08-12). Priced well above the NT$30,000-50,000 Tesla Model 3 tyre band in faqs.tw/ev-maintenance-tw because the EQE is a 2,415 kg car on larger staggered premium rubber and that source puts German EV servicing 20-30% over Tesla. 12V battery, coolant and brake-fluid intervals from the same source. Warranty expiry at year 3 per cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/127611. Estimated, not quoted."},{"y":7,"source":"Coolant interval (5 yrs / 80,000 km, NT$8,000-15,000 in the German column) and brake-pad life (5+ yrs, NT$15,000-25,000 German column) from faqs.tw/ev-maintenance-tw, verified live 2026-08-12, scaled to Mercedes dealer pricing and to disc-plus-pad rather than pads alone. HV battery coverage from cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/127611. The electronics allowance is a judgement call for a 5-7 year out-of-warranty German car, not a sourced figure."},{"y":10,"source":"Risk-weighted estimate, not a quote — the itemised worst case comes to roughly NT$490,000 and has been discounted to NT$340,000 assuming the owner declines some dealer work or uses an EV independent for routine items. Deliberately far above a Japanese equivalent, as the out-of-warranty German tail requires: dealer labour rates, air suspension, large staggered tyres and a wide electronics failure surface. The one thing holding it DOWN is that the HV battery remains under the 10yr/250,000 km >=70% warranty at 70,000 km (cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/127611), so no pack-replacement provision is included — a genuine and unusual advantage of the EQE over most BEVs at this age. Item intervals cross-checked against faqs.tw/ev-maintenance-tw. Ten-year maintenance total NT$573,000, front-light and tail-heavy."}],"sources":[{"name":"TVBS Cars — 2026 model-year Mercedes-Benz Taiwan lineup and prices","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/330852","note":"Fetched in full 2026-08-12. Primary price verification: 2026MY EQE 350+ saloon NT$3,300,000 -> NT$3,310,000 (+NT$10,000), power up to 320 hp, 693 km WLTP. Article dated 2026-07-07. Same article gives 2026MY EQE 300 SUV NT$3,000,000 and EQE 350 4Matic SUV NT$3,590,000, and notes the AMG EQE 43 SUV was dropped. Confirms list_price NT$3,310,000."},{"name":"U-CAR / Mobile01 (via DuckDuckGo HTML search proxy) — EQE saloon Taiwan price history","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=U-CAR+EQE+300+%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+326%E8%90%AC+2022+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3%E8%B3%93%E5%A3%AB","note":"Read 2026-08-12 as a search proxy (WebSearch budget exhausted; direct U-CAR fetches return 403). DISPROVES the previous draft's central claim. 2022 TW EQE saloon lineup: EQE 300 at NT$3,260,000 ('EQE 300正式售價來到326萬') and AMG EQE 43 4Matic at NT$4,820,000. No EQE 350+ saloon existed in TW in 2022. Mobile01 snippet confirms the 350+ arrived later as the 300's replacement at NT$3,300,000, '比起過往EQE 300僅小幅增加4萬元' — a NT$40,000 increase, not a NT$270,000 cut."},{"name":"U-CAR (via DuckDuckGo HTML search proxy) — EQE SUV Taiwan launch prices","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=Mercedes-Benz+EQE+SUV+300+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+2023+U-CAR","note":"Read 2026-08-12. Supplies the correct denominators for the year-1 checkpoint: EQE SUV 300 launched Feb 2024 at NT$2,990,000 ('正式發表EQE 300 SUV 299萬起'); EQE SUV 350 4Matic launched July 2023 at NT$3,580,000, AMG EQE 43 4Matic SUV at NT$4,650,000. The previous draft scored the used EQE SUV 300 against NT$3,580,000, which is the 350 4Matic's price."},{"name":"Yahoo Autos Taiwan — 2026 M-Benz EQE 350+ trim page","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/m-benz-eqe-2026-350＋","note":"Fetched in full 2026-08-12; URL verified live despite the full-width ＋. Spec confirmation: 320 hp / 57.6 kgm, 96 kWh, rear drive, 693 km WLTP, 2,415 kg, 3,120 mm wheelbase, 19-inch AMG Line wheels, rear-axle steering, 牌照稅 and 燃料費 both NT$0. Silent on AIRMATIC — the reason the air-suspension allowance is conditional."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz EQE used listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqe","note":"Fetched twice 2026-08-12 to confirm seller types, 14 listings. CORRECTION: the 2023 EQE 300 / 32,000 km / NT$1,500,000 car is 自售 (PRIVATE), not 車商 as the previous draft recorded — both fetches agree. The true dealer anchor at the same age, omitted by that draft, is 2023 EQE 300 / 75,000 km / 車商 NT$1,590,000. Other listings used: 2022 EQE 300 (V295 241hp) / 40,500 km / 車商 NT$1,556,000; 2024 EQE SUV 300 / 11,000 km / 車商 NT$2,050,000; 2024 EQE SUV 350 4Matic / 31,000 km / 車商 NT$2,200,000. Dealer asks were discounted 11-14% to reach private sale."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz EQC used listings (age proxy)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqc","note":"Fetched 2026-08-12, 3 listings. The only Mercedes BEV in TW old enough to anchor years 5 and 7: 2020 EQC 400 4Matic 運動版, 30,000 km and 36,000 km, both 車商 asking NT$1,080,000; plus a 129,000 km 自售 car at NT$990,000. Both dealer cars are the 運動版 (AMG Line), which launched at NT$3,500,000 — so 30.9% dealer retail at 6 years on low mileage."},{"name":"8891 新車 / Yahoo Autos (via DuckDuckGo proxy) — EQC 400 4MATIC Taiwan launch prices","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=EQC+400+4MATIC+%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3+%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82+%E5%94%AE%E5%83%B9+%E8%90%AC%E5%85%83","note":"Read 2026-08-12. Confirms the two-variant split used to pin the EQC retention ratio: 'EQC提供400 4Matic單一動力，推出Electric Art、AMG Line運動版2車型，售價分別為330、350萬元'. The 8891 used cars are the 運動版, hence NT$3,500,000 is the correct denominator."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Tesla Model S used listings (10-year BEV proxy)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/tesla/model-s","note":"Cited by the prior researcher and retained as the year-10 proxy: 2018 75D / 66,000 km / NT$998,000 and 2017 75D / 236,000 km / NT$958,000, roughly 29% of list at 8-9 years dealer retail. NOT independently re-fetched in this pass — year 10 is marked low confidence partly for that reason. Discounted hard for the EQE because Mercedes BEVs trade below Tesla locally."},{"name":"TVBS Cars — EQE SUV Taiwan launch, warranty terms","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/127611","note":"Cited by the prior researcher for the warranty frame used throughout: 3年不限里程全車保固 plus a high-voltage battery warranty of 10 years or 250,000 km guaranteeing >=70% capacity. This is why no pack-replacement provision appears even in the 7-10y window. Not re-fetched in this pass; the warranty terms match Mercedes EQ practice in other markets but remain single-sourced."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan — warranty page","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/services/warranty.html","note":"Read via search snippet only — every direct fetch of mercedes-benz.com.tw timed out, in this pass as well as the prior researcher's. Supports the 3-year unlimited-mileage vehicle warranty and the existence of an extended warranty covering years 4-6, purchasable during the original term. Treated as corroborating, not primary."},{"name":"faqs.tw — 台灣電動車保養費用","url":"https://faqs.tw/ev-maintenance-tw","note":"Fetched and verified live 2026-08-12. The only retrievable structured TW EV maintenance cost reference. Prices by brand: coolant 5 yrs / 80,000 km (BMW NT$8,000-15,000, Tesla NT$5,000-8,000); brake fluid 2-3 yrs (BMW NT$3,000-5,000, Tesla NT$2,000-3,000); brake pads 5+ yrs (BMW NT$15,000-25,000, Tesla NT$8,000-12,000); tyres every 40,000-60,000 km (Tesla Model 3 NT$30,000-50,000); German EVs '比 Tesla 貴 20-30%'. The prior draft's wider spans mixed in the Luxgen column and an NT$80,000 tyre figure not found on the page; the German column is used here."},{"name":"8891 — individual used EQE listing (verified, excluded as outlier)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-infos-3712829.html","note":"Fetched 2026-08-12 and confirmed real: 2023 Mercedes-Benz EQE, 車商 桑尼車庫 in Taipei, asking NT$3,280,000. EXCLUDED from the value curve — it is above even the 2023 AMG EQE 53 listings on the same platform and out of line with every other 2022-2023 EQE, so it reads as stale or mis-specified. Recorded for transparency."}]},"mercedes-gla200":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year; every checkpoint uses the 7,000 km/year midpoint (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km), roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/yr. Consequences: (a) service intervals are TIME-driven, not mileage-driven — Mercedes ASSYST PLUS calls for service at 1 year or ~15,000-20,000 km whichever comes first, and at 7,000 km/yr the year always arrives first, so the owner pays for exactly one dealer visit per year; (b) tires age out rather than wear out, replaced roughly every 5-6 years on date code, not tread; (c) the used comparables quoted are LOW-MILEAGE listings, which sit above the mileage-blind market average, and the source strings say so per checkpoint. Powertrain: the 1.3L turbo (M282) carries a 48V belt-driven starter-generator adding 14 hp — verified via 自由時報. It CANNOT move the car on electricity alone, so it is classified 'gasoline', not 'hybrid'. Excluded by design: 牌照稅, 燃料稅, 強制險 and 任意險, fuel, parking and tolls. No home-charger cost applies (not a BEV). The GLA runs steel springs, not air suspension, so no air-spring replacement is provisioned.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"SOURCE CORRECTED BY THIS AUDIT. The previous record described the Mercedes-Benz Select anchor as 'a 2025 GLA 200, 4,728 km, asking NT$1,728,000'. I fetched that exact listing (mercedes-benz-select.com.tw detail id=3606) and it is materially different: a 2024/12-build GLA 200 AMG LINE registered 2025/04, 4,728 km, asking NT$1,780,000 — a richer trim, ~16 months old not 12, and NT$52,000 more expensive than reported. Re-derivation on the corrected figures: NT$1,780,000 is a factory-certified retail ASK, the top of the band; ordinary dealer retail is ~6% below at approx. NT$1,675,000. PRIVATE-SALE ADJUSTMENT: private = dealer retail less 13.5% -> approx. NT$1,450,000 (67.9% of real_cost). TRADE-IN ADJUSTMENT: dealer trade-in = private less 13% -> NT$1,260,000. Note the AMG Line comparable is roughly equipment-equivalent to the 摘星版 (pano roof, Burmester), so no further trim correction applied. A ~NT$685,000 loss in year one on a NT$2,135,000 outlay is the steep German year-one hit. Confidence medium: one certified listing, and certified asks are the least representative end of the market."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"MODEL-YEAR MIS-AGEING CORRECTED. In August 2026 the 3-year point is the 2023 model year, not the 2024 cars the previous record interpolated from. I re-fetched auto.8891.com.tw and the genuine 2023 listings are: 2023 @ 17,000 km asking NT$1,598,000 and 2023 @ 28,000 km asking NT$1,658,000 — the buyer's 21,000 km sits between them, an unusually good mileage match. The previous record labelled the first as a 2024 car and discarded the second as trim-contaminated. Both asks are likely partly AMG-Line-contaminated (they exceed the ordinary-retail estimate for a 1-year-old car), so I did NOT take them at face value; I treat NT$1,600,000 as an upper bound on dealer retail and set clean-spec dealer retail at approx. NT$1,505,000. PRIVATE-SALE ADJUSTMENT: private = dealer retail less 13.5% -> NT$1,300,000 (60.9% of real_cost). TRADE-IN: private less 13% -> NT$1,130,000. Cross-checked against the clean 2022 @ 22,000 km listing at NT$1,438,000 (4 years old), which brackets this from below as it should. Confidence medium: real listings, but trim contamination forced a judgement call."},{"y":5,"conf":"high","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"DEALER-RETAIL TRAP CORRECTED — this was the central error in the record. I independently re-fetched auto.8891.com.tw and confirmed the anchor listings are genuine: two 2021 H247 GLA 200s at 37,000 km asking NT$1,300,000 and NT$1,298,000. At 5 years that is 7,400 km/yr, essentially this buyer's exact profile, same generation and engine family — the strongest comparable in the record. BUT the previous version reported private_sale_price NT$1,250,000, which is only 3.8% below the observed DEALER ASKING price of NT$1,300,000 for the identical car. The brief requires 8-15%. The inflation entered through ratio laundering: retention was expressed against the 2021 car's lower NT$1,990,000 list, then multiplied by this car's higher real_cost, which silently undid the private-sale haircut. CORRECT CHAIN: dealer retail ask NT$1,300,000 -> private = less 11% -> NT$1,157,000, plus approx. NT$20,000 for the 摘星版's richer equipment (the used market repays only a fraction of a spec premium) -> NT$1,175,000 (55.0% of real_cost). TRADE-IN: private less 13.6% -> NT$1,015,000. Higher-mileage 2021 cars in the same listing set (68,000 km -> NT$1,238,000; 103,000 km -> NT$1,058,000) confirm the low-mileage premium is real and material."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — the current H247 generation only reached Taiwan in 2020, so no genuine 7-year H247 data exists. Per the brief's method: take the PREDECESSOR X156 at 7 years (2019 cars), express it as a retention ratio of ITS original list, then apply to this car's real_cost — but with the private-sale haircut applied to the OBSERVED price, not laundered through the ratio as the previous version did (it reported NT$1,055,000 where its own stated method yields ~NT$985,000). Real data: FindCar shows 2019 GLA 200 (1.6L, X156) used average NT$968,000 against a NT$2,010,000 new-car reference. I also cross-checked against verified 8891 H247 listings one year younger: 2020 @ 51,000 km -> NT$1,138,000 and 2020 @ 65,000 km -> NT$1,188,000 dealer ask, which low-mileage-adjusted give ~NT$1,090,000 private at 6 years — so ~NT$990,000 at 7 years follows consistently from two independent directions. CHAIN: low-mileage-adjusted dealer retail approx. NT$1,125,000 -> private less 12% -> NT$990,000 (46.4% of real_cost); trade-in = private less 14% -> NT$850,000. Confidence low: different generation, and the mileage correction is a judgement call, not an observed listing."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"DEALER-RETAIL TRAP CORRECTED — the previous version reported a private_sale_price of NT$560,000 while the observed 8891 DEALER ASKING prices for 2016 X156 GLA 200s are NT$538,000 @ 54,100 km, NT$550,000 @ 66,000 km and NT$588,000 @ 93,000 km (FindCar average NT$568,000). A private seller cannot beat the dealer's shop-window price; that figure was structurally impossible. CORRECT CHAIN: this buyer's 70,000 km at 10 years sits inside the comparables' mileage band, so NO low-mileage markup is warranted — dealer retail approx. NT$550,000 -> private = less 12% -> NT$484,000, plus a small allowance for the richer original spec -> NT$500,000 (23.4% of real_cost). TRADE-IN: private less 16% -> NT$420,000 (dealer margin percentages widen on cheap old stock). The 7-to-10-year collapse is not modelling pessimism: the observed market really does ask ~NT$550,000 for a 2016 GLA while a 2019 fetches ~NT$970,000-1,040,000, because by then the car is long out of warranty and buyers price in the repair bill modelled below. Confidence low: predecessor generation, single age cohort."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"CHANGED: NT$10,000 -> NT$11,000. The previous figure sat BELOW both real invoices it claimed to be anchored on, with no stated justification for the gap. I verified the PTT invoice myself: official-dealer GLA service, parts NT$8,164 + labour NT$3,714 = NT$11,878. A second GLA owner at 2yr/11,000 km reported NT$11,000-11,500. The year-1 visit is the lighter Service A of the A/B alternation, so NT$11,000 sits just under the verified invoices rather than well under them. Warranty is 3 years unlimited mileage, defects only — servicing is NOT free, so this is a real out-of-pocket cost."},{"y":3,"source":"UNCHANGED — reviewed and found sound. Two annual visits in this window: Service B approx. NT$18,000 and Service A approx. NT$11,000, plus approx. NT$3,000 consumables. Service B sized from the Taiwan NT$15,000-30,000 band for this class and from the verified PTT invoice that already reached NT$11,878 WITHOUT a full brake-fluid-and-air-filter B service. No warranty subsidy applied — the 3-year coverage is warranty only, not maintenance."},{"y":5,"source":"CHANGED: NT$100,000 -> NT$92,000, entirely from the tire line (NT$42,000 -> NT$34,000). The GLA is a COMPACT SUV; four quality 19in tires (235/50R19 class) run NT$30,000-36,000 fitted in Taiwan, and NT$42,000 is a mid-size-SUV number. Everything else reviewed and kept. Servicing per the verified invoice anchors. Brakes: Taiwan aftermarket Benz pads are only NT$2,100-4,800 per axle, but this plan assumes dealer parts, hence NT$12,000 for a front axle. Consumables are Taiwan market ranges, not receipts, so confidence is medium. No prepaid-package or extended-warranty subsidy applied: neither is standard."},{"y":7,"source":"UNCHANGED — reviewed and found defensible, and independently corroborated during this audit. Servicing is anchored on the verified PTT invoices; everything else is a RISK-WEIGHTED PROVISION, not a quoted job, which is why confidence is low. Corroboration: the same PTT thread I fetched to verify the GLA invoice also documents a BMW G30 530i at 7.5 years / 110,000 km billed NT$135,598 in one visit — a German car of similar age carrying a bill larger than this entire 2-year window, which suggests NT$120,000 is not over-provisioned. The M282's coil-pack and thermostat-housing exposure and the 7G-DCT's fluid requirement are the specific German cost drivers; a Japanese equivalent would carry roughly half this figure."},{"y":10,"source":"CHANGED: NT$335,000 -> NT$285,000. EXTRAPOLATED risk model, no receipts for this age of H247 — the generation is only 6 years old in Taiwan. Two reasons for the trim. (1) Internal inconsistency: the same dataset books NT$210,000 for this window on the LARGER GLC 200 4MATIC, and a compact GLA with smaller brakes, smaller tires and a simpler 1.3L M282 cannot plausibly cost 60% more than the 2.0L GLC. (2) The original stack triple-counted low-probability events at near-full cost (48V pack NT$45,000 + turbo NT$25,000 + mechatronic NT$22,000); these are risk-weighted expected values across a population, not certainties for one car, so they are reduced to NT$35,000 / NT$18,000 / NT$16,000. The tire set also drops from NT$45,000 to NT$36,000 for the compact-SUV fitment. NT$285,000 still keeps the ten-year total at approx. NT$540,000, materially above a Japanese equivalent, which is the point. Sized from Mercedes-Benz Taiwan dealer labour rates and the M282/7G-DCT known-failure profile. Confidence low and explicitly so — this is modelled, not observed."}],"sources":[{"name":"自由時報汽車頻道 — 賓士用豪華小休旅吸引年輕人 GLA 200 摘星版配備全到位還降價","url":"https://auto.ltn.com.tw/news/29327","note":"PRIMARY PRICE VERIFICATION — FETCHED AND READ BY THIS AUDIT. Confirms GLA 200 摘星版 = NT$2,160,000 after an official NT$60,000 cut from NT$2,220,000. Also confirms the powertrain verbatim: 1.3L four-cylinder turbo, 163hp/27.6kgm, 48V adding 14hp, 7-speed DCT — the basis for classifying this as 'gasoline' rather than 'hybrid'. Lists the added equipment (panoramic roof, Burmester with Dolby Atmos, logo projectors). This single source carries the price; it does not depend on the two 403 URLs below."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz GLA 200 二手車 listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/gla/gla200","note":"CORE USED-VALUE SOURCE — FETCHED AND RE-READ BY THIS AUDIT; all listings cited below were confirmed to exist. 49 listings. Verified data points: 2024 @ 8,092 km NT$1,688,000; 2024 @ 26,200 km NT$1,588,000; 2023 @ 17,000 km NT$1,598,000; 2023 @ 28,000 km NT$1,658,000; 2022 @ 22,000 km NT$1,438,000; 2022 @ 50,000 km NT$1,360,000; 2021 @ 37,000 km NT$1,300,000 and NT$1,298,000; 2021 @ 68,000 km NT$1,238,000; 2021 @ 103,000 km NT$1,058,000; 2020 @ 51,000 km NT$1,138,000; 2020 @ 65,000 km NT$1,188,000; 2020 @ 90,000 km NT$1,038,000. NOTE: the previous record mis-aged several of these by one model year, which corrupted its 3-year checkpoint. ALL figures are 車商售價 (DEALER RETAIL ASK) and were stepped down 11-13.5% to private sale and a further 13-16% to trade-in, as documented per checkpoint."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Select 官方認證中古車 — GLA 200 AMG Line, 4,728 km","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz-select.com.tw/buy-car/detail.aspx?id=3606","note":"1-YEAR ANCHOR — FETCHED BY THIS AUDIT AND FOUND MISQUOTED IN THE PREVIOUS RECORD. Actual listing: 2024/12 build registered 2025/04, GLA 200 AMG LINE (sports package, 360 camera, keyless, wireless charging), 4,728 km, asking NT$1,780,000. The previous record described it as a '2025 GLA 200' at 'NT$1,728,000' — wrong trim, wrong age by ~4 months, and NT$52,000 low. Corrected figures were used to re-derive the 1-year checkpoint. This is factory-certified retail, the very top of the asking band, so ~6% was trimmed to ordinary dealer retail before the private-sale haircut."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — 賓士原廠保養工單討論","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1742136666.A.09E.html","note":"REAL MAINTENANCE INVOICE — FETCHED AND VERIFIED BY THIS AUDIT. Confirms the GLA official-dealer figures: parts NT$8,164 + labour NT$3,714 = NT$11,878. The thread also contains a strong corroborating data point for the later windows: a BMW G30 530i at 7.5 years / 110,000 km billed NT$135,598 in a single visit, labour alone NT$55,012 — evidence that the years 5-7 and 7-10 German provisions are not inflated."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — Benz GLA 一萬一保養工單","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1675951165.A.B33.html","note":"SECOND MAINTENANCE INVOICE, cited by the previous researcher: GLA at 2 years / 11,000 km, official dealer, NT$11,000-11,500 covering engine oil, oil and cabin filters, and brake fluid, paid INSIDE the 3-year warranty window. NOT independently re-fetched by this audit — it is consistent with the invoice above, which I did verify, so it is retained as supporting rather than load-bearing evidence."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — Benz GLA200 2019 查詢","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/benz%20gla200%202019","note":"7-YEAR BASELINE. Gives the 2019 GLA 200 new-car reference of NT$2,010,000 and the X156 generation identification (1.6L, distinct from the current 1.3L H247), making it the correct predecessor comparator. Used-car average NT$968,000. NOT re-fetched by this audit; the 7-year checkpoint was cross-checked against verified 8891 2020 listings so it does not rest on this source alone."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — Benz GLA200 中古車列表","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&b=8&m=1231","note":"Sanity bound only. ~79-80 GLA200 listings averaging NT$804,000 across ALL years — a mileage-blind, age-blind average deliberately NOT used as any checkpoint value. NOT re-fetched by this audit."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — Mercedes-Benz GLA (X156) 國內上市發表","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/23571","note":"10-YEAR BASELINE. Original Taiwan launch pricing for the X156: GLA 200 at NT$1,850,000, GLA 200 CDI 4MATIC at NT$1,990,000. Interpolated with the 2019 NT$2,010,000 reference for a ~NT$1,900,000 2016 list. NOT re-fetched by this audit; the 10-year value is now derived directly from observed 2016 asking prices rather than from this denominator, so its influence is reduced."},{"name":"uptogo.com.tw — 賓士保養一次要多少錢","url":"https://uptogo.com.tw/汽機車/車輛維修保養/賓士保養一次要多少錢？/","note":"Secondary range check on Taiwan Mercedes servicing: Service A NT$8,000-15,000, Service B NT$15,000-30,000, servicing due annually or every 10,000 km. The annual trigger is what makes this a time-driven plan at 7,000 km/year. NOT re-fetched by this audit; used only as a band, with the verified PTT invoices carrying the actual numbers."},{"name":"車輛保修行情網 (carce.cc) — Benz 維修項目行情","url":"https://www.carce.cc/fix/category/385/Benz","note":"Taiwan brake-pad pricing reference: aftermarket Benz pads NT$2,100-4,800 per axle plus labour, OEM several times higher. Basis for the dealer-level brake figures in the 3-5, 5-7 and 7-10 windows. NOT re-fetched by this audit."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan — 原廠保固說明","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/services/warranty.html","note":"WARRANTY SCOPE. 3 years / unlimited mileage covering manufacturing defects, NOT free scheduled maintenance. NOT re-fetched by this audit, but the conclusion is independently supported by the verified owner invoices paid inside the warranty window, so no early-period maintenance subsidy is applied."},{"name":"Mobile01 — Mercedes-Benz 25/26年式 豪華小型車售價變動討論","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=303&t=7151687","note":"UNVERIFIED — DOWNGRADED BY THIS AUDIT. The previous record presented this as independent confirmation of the price cut. It returned HTTP 403 to me, so I could not read it and cannot confirm the GLA 180 / GLA 200 figures attributed to it. Retained for traceability only; it carries no weight in this record. The NT$2,160,000 price rests on 自由時報, which I did read."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — Mercedes-Benz GLA 車型概覽（原 scout 來源）","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/mercedes-benz/gla/7191/overall","note":"UNREAD BY ANYONE IN THIS CHAIN. Returned HTTP 403 to the previous researcher and again to me. Not treated as verification of anything. The price it reportedly carried was independently confirmed via 自由時報."}]},"mercedes-glb200-5seat":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, roughly half the Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. All checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). Mercedes' service interval is 10,000 km OR 12 months, whichever comes first (confirmed on CW Group's Taiwan Mercedes service guide), so at 7,000 km/year every service in the 10-year window is TIME-triggered and never mileage-triggered: the owner pays for the same number of dealer visits as a 15,000 km/year driver. Low mileage therefore cuts resale loss substantially but saves very little maintenance. Resale figures quote low-mileage comparables where the comparable pool is genuinely higher-mileage than our car, and explicitly decline to apply a low-mileage uplift where it is not (see the 10-year checkpoint, whose GLA comparables average ~71,000 km, essentially identical to our car's 70,000 km). Licence tax (牌照稅), fuel tax (燃料費) and all insurance (強制險/任意險) are EXCLUDED by design and appear nowhere in purchase, maintenance or selling_costs. Fuel/energy cost is also out of scope. This is a steel-sprung compact SUV with no air suspension, so no air-strut replacement is budgeted.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED — the new MMA-platform GLB has zero used examples anywhere (deliveries start Q4 2026), so every figure here transfers from the predecessor X247, whose 2020 Taiwan launch price of NT$2,160,000 for GLB 200 is within 0.5% of this car's NT$2,150,000, making the retention-ratio transfer unusually clean. Nearest real anchors, read directly off 8891 (2026-08) and all 車商售價 (dealer retail asking): a 2024 GLB 200 AMG facelift with 3,000 km asks NT$1,838,000 and a 2024 with 25,000 km asks NT$1,798,000, both against a facelift list near NT$2,380,000 — i.e. 75-77% dealer retail at TWO years. CORRECTION TO PRIOR PASS: the earlier researcher read 8891's \"2.5万\" as 2,500 km; it is 25,000 km. The genuine low-mileage 2-year car is the 3,000 km example at NT$1,838,000. Extrapolating one year up gives roughly 84-85% dealer retail at 1 year for a low-km car, then -12% to private sale gives ~74%. I hold at 73.5% (NT$1,580,000) rather than nudging higher because this is a first-model-year car facing an electric GLB sibling listed NT$170,000 BELOW it, which anchors the badge downward. A ~26.5% first-year loss is deliberately far steeper than the ~85% a RAV4 holds and sits inside the German band in this table (65-74%). Trade-in cut a further 14% from private."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"Anchored on real 8891 X247 GLB 200 listings read directly (2026-08), all 車商售價: a 4-year-old 2022 GLB 200 AMG 7-seat with 69,000 km asks NT$1,388,000 against a facelift list near NT$2,380,000 (58.3% dealer retail). Interpolating back to 3 years gives roughly 64-66% dealer retail at a mileage-typical ~45,000 km. Our car carries 21,000 km, under half that, so I added ~6% for low mileage to reach ~69% dealer retail, then cut 12% to private sale (60.7%) and a further 14% to trade-in. Result NT$1,290,000 = 60.0% of list at 3 years — materially below the ~75% a Toyota RAV4 holds at the same age. Still inside the 3-year unlimited-mileage factory warranty at this point, which supports the private price."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"REVISED UP from a prior pass's NT$1,090,000 — that figure was an openly-admitted 'judgement haircut' below the data rather than a reading of it, and a haircut is not evidence. Re-derived from real 8891 X247 listings read directly (2026-08), all 車商售價: 2021 GLB 200 7-seat, 72,600 km, NT$1,328,000; 2021 GLB 200 AMG, 70,000 km, NT$1,280,000; 2021 GLB 200 AMG, 60,000 km, NT$1,188,000; plus a 2020, 69,000 km, at NT$1,258,000 as a 6-year cross-check. Critically, these are AMG Line / 7-seat cars whose list was ~NT$2,290,000, NOT the NT$2,160,000 base — using the correct denominator gives 51.9-58.0% dealer retail, averaging ~55.3%, which is LOWER than the prior pass computed. Our car at 35,000 km carries roughly half these cars' mileage, so +7% for low mileage gives ~59% dealer retail; -12% to private sale gives 52.1% = NT$1,120,000; -14.7% again to trade-in. FindCar's reported NT$1,390,000 average for 2021 GLB 200 is noted but not used — it is above every individual listing I could actually see. At 52.1% of list this is consistent with the GLC 200 (51.1%) in this table and above the X3/Q5 (42-43%), which the GLB's real listings do support."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor generation — the GLB nameplate only launched in Taiwan in 2020, so no 7-year-old GLB of any generation exists and none was invented. Proxy is the Mercedes GLA X156, the brand's previous Taiwan compact SUV, launched June 2014 at NT$1,850,000 for GLA 200. On 8891 today a 2019 GLA 200 with 70,000 km asks NT$650,000 = 35.1%. CORRECTION TO PRIOR PASS: that listing is a 個人/自售 private listing ('18年出廠一手女用車'), NOT 車商售價, so the usual -12% dealer-to-private conversion must NOT be applied to it — it is already a private-sale figure. The prior pass described applying '-12% to private' but its stated arithmetic did not actually produce its stated number, so the narrative was wrong even where the figure was roughly serviceable. Correct treatment: 35.1% is a private-sale retention at 7 years and ~10,000 km/year; our car at 49,000 km is lower-mileage still, so +6% gives ~37.2%, and on NT$2,150,000 that is ~NT$800,000. I set NT$820,000, allowing a small upward nudge because the X156's list price had drifted below NT$1,850,000 by 2019, which makes 35.1% a mild understatement of true retention. Trade-in -15%. The step down from year 5 is intentionally the steepest in the curve: the 3-year factory warranty plus a maximum 3-year extension both expire by year 6, after which the Taiwan market prices out-of-warranty German repair risk rather than the car."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the predecessor generation, same method as year 7. Real 8891 listings for the 10-year-old 2016 GLA 200 (X156, list NT$1,850,000), read directly 2026-08, all 車商售價: NT$538,000 at 54,100 km, NT$550,000 at 66,000 km, NT$588,000 at 93,000 km — averaging ~NT$558,000 = 30.2% dealer retail. Converting to private at -12% gives ~26.5% private retention. CORRECTION TO PRIOR PASS: it added '+12% for our car's very low 70,000 km' — but those GLA comparables average roughly 71,000 km, essentially IDENTICAL to our car's 70,000 km, so there is no low-mileage advantage to claim at this checkpoint and the uplift was unjustified. Removing it: 26.5% of NT$2,150,000 = NT$570,000, which I shade to NT$560,000 (26.0%) for first-model-year MMA electronics risk and the 48V lithium pack a GLA X156 never carried. Trade-in cut a wider 17% because dealers barely want a decade-old German; many will simply decline the car, so NT$465,000 is close to a floor rather than a market. At 26.0% the tail is still falling, not flattening — the observed German pattern and the opposite of a Lexus. Cross-check: a 2014 GLA 200 at 130,000 km still asks NT$478,000 at 12 years, confirming the decline continues past year 10."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Taiwan Mercedes A-Service quoted at NT$8,000-15,000 across Taiwan service-cost write-ups; interval of 10,000 km or annually verified directly on the CW Group Taiwan service guide. Single scheduled visit because 7,000 km/year triggers the annual clock, never the 10,000 km clock. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from a prior pass's \"high\": no official Mercedes-Benz Taiwan service price table was ever read (that host timed out), and a broad NT$8,000-15,000 blog range read via search snippet does not support a high rating."},{"y":3,"source":"Two annual dealer visits in the 1-3y window. REVISED DOWN from a prior pass's NT$45,000, which costed the year-3 B-Service at NT$32,000 — above the verified Taiwan B-Service band of NT$15,000-30,000, and unjustified at only 21,000 km where the mileage-triggered items in a full 60,000 km service simply do not apply while the time-triggered ones (brake fluid, filters) do. NT$25,000 sits at the top of the verified band, which is appropriate for a main-dealer visit but not above it. A-Service at the observed NT$8,000-15,000 range."},{"y":5,"source":"Spark plugs at 40,000-50,000 km or on the time schedule (verified directly on the CW Group Taiwan service guide); at 35,000 km this is time-driven. Tires are the clearest low-mileage effect in reverse: 35,000 km would not wear a set out, but 5-year-old rubber must be replaced anyway, so this cost cannot be avoided by driving less. Brake pad cost scaled down from the ~NT$26,000 OEM front+rear figure since only fronts are due; a Taiwan owner receipt reporting ~NT$55,000 for a visit including pads and discs supports this order of magnitude. Warranty expiry per Mercedes-Benz Taiwan's 3-year term."},{"y":7,"source":"Transmission fluid interval 40,000-60,000 km, verified directly on the CW Group Taiwan Mercedes service guide — at 49,000 km this window is genuinely reached, and it is the one big item our low-mileage buyer hits on mileage rather than time. Dual-clutch fluid service is materially dearer than a torque-converter drain-and-fill, hence NT$20,000. AGM batteries in Taiwan's heat typically last 4-6 years. The NT$25,000 risk allowance is an explicit estimate, not a quote: from year 4 there is no warranty backstop and dealer labour rates apply to every fault. This is the first period where a German meaningfully separates from a Japanese equivalent — the RAV4's comparable window is NT$53,000."},{"y":10,"source":"Risk-weighted extrapolated budget, not a quoted table — stated plainly. REVISED DOWN from a prior pass's NT$300,000, which summed every named failure item at its full replacement cost as if all of them fire in the same three-year window; an allowance across a probability of failure is the correct treatment, so the 48V pack, water pump/thermostat, suspension and electronics lines are all probability-weighted here. The certain items (three services, tires, plugs, discs, 12V battery) are unchanged and carry NT$133,000 of the total on their own. Item selection follows documented Mercedes four-cylinder weak points and the fact that a 48V mild hybrid carries a lithium pack and DC/DC converter a plain petrol car does not. Age, not mileage, drives almost everything: at 70,000 km the powertrain is barely run in, but rubber, coolant, batteries and electronics have all aged 10 years in a hot, humid climate. NT$240,000 over three years is NT$80,000/year for a decade-old out-of-warranty German SUV, consistent with the observed dealer per-visit baseline plus repairs, and still 2.2x the RAV4's NT$107,000 for the same window."}],"sources":[{"name":"KingAutos — 全新純電 GLB 降價搶市 (2026-07-16, new GLB Taiwan pre-sale pricing)","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/369615","note":"PRIMARY PRICE SOURCE, re-read directly by this pass. Prints the pre-sale table verbatim: 燃油 GLB 200 (五座) 接單價 215 萬, GLB 200 AMG Line (七座) 236 萬, 純電 GLB 200 electric (五座) 198 萬, GLB 250+ electric AMG Line (七座) 241 萬, alongside the outgoing 建議售價 for comparison."},{"name":"TVBS Cars — new-generation GLB Taiwan price and spec table","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/333047","note":"SECOND INDEPENDENT PRICE CONFIRMATION, re-read directly by this pass — same four prices. Also the powertrain source: 1.5L four-cylinder turbo, 163 hp / 25.5 kgm, 48V mild hybrid with ~30 hp assist, 8-speed DCT, 0-100 km/h 8.7 s, top speed 208 km/h, kerb weight 1,840 kg."},{"name":"U-CAR News — 台灣賓士公布大改款 GLB 國內預接資訊","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/89205","note":"THIRD INDEPENDENT PRICE CONFIRMATION. U-CAR returns HTTP 403 to automated fetchers, so this was read via a search-result snippet quoting 「燃油動力的 GLB 車系將提供 200 5 座以及 GLB 200 AMG Line 7 座兩種車型，預售價格則為 215 萬元與 236 萬元」. Snippet-only, flagged as such."},{"name":"KingAutos — 台灣賓士降價加配備｜7人休旅 GLB 最多降13萬 (2025-09-01)","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/365102","note":"Outgoing X247 GLB pricing after the Sept 2025 cut: GLB 180 摘星版 5座 NT$2,010,000, GLB 200 摘星版 7座 NT$2,280,000, AMG GLB 35 NT$3,080,000. Two uses: judging how far a German discounts once it is a slow seller, and establishing that no 5-seat GLB 200 existed in the outgoing lineup — which is why the new generation is the correct car to price."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz GLB 200 used listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/glb/glb200","note":"PRIMARY USED-VALUE SOURCE for years 1-5, re-read directly by this pass (2026-08, 42 vehicles listed). Real 車商售價 asking prices captured: 2024/3,000km NT$1,838,000; 2024/25,000km NT$1,798,000; 2022/69,000km NT$1,388,000; 2021/72,600km NT$1,328,000; 2021/70,000km NT$1,280,000; 2021/60,000km NT$1,188,000; 2020/69,000km NT$1,258,000. NOTE: this page renders mileage in 万 units — '2.5万' is 25,000 km, not 2,500 km, which a prior pass misread. All figures adjusted -12% to private sale and a further 14-17% to trade-in."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz GLA 200 used listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/gla/gla200","note":"PREDECESSOR-GENERATION SOURCE for years 7 and 10, re-read directly by this pass. GLA X156: 2019/70,000km NT$650,000 listed by an INDIVIDUAL seller ('18年出廠一手女用車'), not a dealer — so it is already a private-sale price and no dealer-to-private cut applies; 2016/54,100km NT$538,000, 2016/66,000km NT$550,000, 2016/93,000km NT$588,000, all 車商; 2014/130,000km NT$478,000 as a 12-year cross-check. Converted to retention ratios against the GLA's own NT$1,850,000 list, then applied to the GLB."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz GLB range overview","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/glb","note":"Cross-check on the GLB 200 listings by model year and body style. Important caveat carried into the source strings: most surviving X247 GLB 200 listings are AMG Line / 7-seat cars whose original list was ~NT$2,290,000-2,380,000, not the NT$2,160,000 base — using the base as denominator overstates retention."},{"name":"channel-auto — Mercedes-Benz GLB Taiwan launch, 2020-05-04","url":"https://channel-auto.com/2020/05/04/mercedes-benz-glb-197wan/","note":"Original X247 GLB Taiwan launch prices: GLB 180 NT$1,970,000, GLB 200 NT$2,160,000, GLB 200d NT$2,160,000. Independently re-confirmed by this pass via search snippet ('GLB 200售價分別為197萬元及216萬元', '柴油款GLB 200 d售價則為216萬元'). The predecessor's NT$2,160,000 is within 0.5% of this car's list, making the retention-ratio transfer unusually clean. Snippet-read, not direct fetch."},{"name":"U-CAR — 台灣賓士 GLA-Class 發表 (2014-06-24)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/23571","note":"GLA X156 Taiwan launch prices: GLA 200 NT$1,850,000, GLA 200 CDI 4MATIC NT$1,990,000, GLA 45 AMG NT$3,080,000 — the denominator for the 7- and 10-year retention ratios. Read via search snippet; U-CAR blocks direct fetch. Caveat noted in the year-7 source: the X156's street price had drifted below NT$1,850,000 by 2019, so this denominator mildly understates true retention."},{"name":"CW Group Repair — 賓士保養攻略：一次搞懂保養項目與時機","url":"https://www.cwgrouprepair.com/post/賓士保養攻略：一次搞懂保養項目與時機","note":"Re-read directly by this pass. Confirms the service INTERVALS used to build the schedule: oil + filter every 10,000 km or 1 year; spark plugs 40,000-50,000 km; transmission fluid 40,000-60,000 km; drive belts 60,000-80,000 km. CORRECTION: this page does NOT publish A/B-Service prices — a prior pass implied it contributed pricing. Intervals only."},{"name":"UpToGo — 賓士保養一次要多少錢？原廠與外廠維修清單與費用大解析","url":"https://uptogo.com.tw/汽機車/車輛維修保養/賓士保養一次要多少錢？/","note":"MAINTENANCE COST BASIS: Mercedes Taiwan A-Service NT$8,000-15,000, B-Service NT$15,000-30,000 or higher. Returns HTTP 403 to automated fetchers; figures read via search snippet and independently re-confirmed by this pass through a second search. Snippet-only — this is why the year-1 maintenance confidence was downgraded from high to medium."},{"name":"PTT / Taiwan owner service receipts (via search snippet)","url":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=%E8%B3%93%E5%A3%AB+GLB+200+%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A+%E8%B2%BB%E7%94%A8+%E5%8E%9F%E5%BB%A0+A+Service+B+Service+%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC+Mobile01","note":"Owner-reported Taiwan Mercedes dealer receipt of roughly NT$55,000 for a comprehensive visit including brake pads and discs, plus mention of loyalty parts discounts. Used only as an order-of-magnitude sanity check on the years 5-7 brake and service lines. This is the search-results URL actually fetched, not a fabricated thread permalink."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan — 原廠保固 (warranty terms)","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/services/warranty.html","note":"Official 3-year / unlimited-mileage warranty from delivery or first registration — the basis for treating years 0-3 as repair-free and years 4+ as fully owner-paid. Host times out on direct fetch; read via search snippet. Flagged as unverified-by-direct-read."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Taiwan — 車款總覽 (official model/price index)","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/models.html","note":"Official price index. This host timed out on every direct fetch attempt across both passes, so it contributed nothing directly; the NT$2,150,000 figure rests instead on three independent secondary sources that agree exactly, two of which were read directly. Listed for traceability, not as a source actually read."},{"name":"FindCar — 2021 Benz GLB 200 used-market average","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/","note":"WEAK CITATION, flagged: this is a bare homepage, not a deep link to the quoted data, and the underlying claim (a NT$1,390,000 average across five 2021 GLB 200 cars) sits ABOVE every individual 2021 listing I could actually see on 8891. Retained for transparency but explicitly NOT used to set any figure in this record."}]},"mercedes-glb250-electric":{"assumptions":"低里程車主：年均 6,000-8,000 km，取中位 7,000 km，遠低於台灣平均 12,000-15,000 km。各檢查點一律 assumed_km = 7,000 × 年數（7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km）。此里程下保養完全由時間決定而非里程：10 年只跑 70,000 km，永遠碰不到原廠的里程門檻，因此以一年一次年度檢查為主軸。低里程在中古市場有加分，本表殘值一律取同齡車源的低里程上緣並在 source 註明。【時間點已修正】2026-07-16 開放預售，依 ETtoday 現場報導全車系「第 4 季正式上市交車」，即 2026 年 Q4 起交車；TVBS 提到的「2027 年 3 月才開始生產」是針對入門的 GLB 200 electric，不是本車 250+。前手把入門車型的投產時間套用到整個車系，據此宣稱「第 1 年市場尚不存在」，已更正。即使如此，2026-08-12 當下仍未有實車交付，所有殘值與保養數字本質上都是推估。稅與保險依設計排除（台灣 BEV 牌照稅與燃料費均為 0 元，已由 Yahoo 汽車 EQB 車款頁實測確認，本表仍不計）。家用充電樁安裝（含電力申請與佈線，一般 NT$40,000-80,000）屬持有成本但不算保養，刻意排除、不列入 maintenance；公共充電電費同樣不列。","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"已下修前手數字（原 1,700,000 = real_cost 的 70.2%，對德系純電偏高，接近日系水準）。本車 2026 Q4 才開始交車，第 1 年市場尚不存在，只能由同廠純電的實測曲線回推。本人於 2026-08-12 curl https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqb 與 /eqa（皆 HTTP 200）取得台灣賓士純電全部在售車源，最年輕的 EQB 為 2024 年式（2 年車）且標「電洽」不報價，故第 1 年無直接可比車。改以「車商開價鏈」推導：德系純電第 1 年車商開價約當新車牌價 75%（2,410,000 × 75% ≈ 1,807,500），自售價 = 車商開價 −12% ≈ 1,590,000（占 real_cost 65.7%），車商收購價 = 自售價 −13% ≈ 1,385,000。旁證：8891 上 2024 年式 EQE SUV 300（1.1 萬公里、約 2 年車）車商開價 2,050,000，對其新車牌價約 300 萬僅剩約 68%，顯示德系純電在台前兩年即掉三成以上，第 1 年 70% 的自售價不可能成立。低里程（7,000 km）已取上緣。"},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"以前代 EQB（X243）在 8891 的真實在售車源換算，並修正前手的推導錯誤。前手用「Mercedes-Benz Select 原廠精選中古車 EQB 300 4MATIC、2023/04、16,506 km、1,580,000」當錨點，並主張 CPO 是價格鏈最上緣、需先 −6% 才等於一般車商售價。本人 curl https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqb（HTTP 200）發現同一台車就掛在 8891 上（2023 年、1.6 萬公里、158.0 萬、新北市實體車行，標題「2023年總代理EQB300跑少保固中」），它本來就是一般車商開價，前手多加的那一階 CPO 折讓是憑空捏造的。改用 8891 全部 4 筆有報價的 3 年低里程車源：1.6 萬 km／158.0 萬、3.0 萬 km／148.0 萬、3.0 萬 km／148.0 萬、3.15 萬 km／155.0 萬。EQB 300 4MATIC 新車牌價 2,670,000 已由本人以兩個獨立來源確認（Yahoo 汽車車款頁 267 萬、TechNews 267 萬）。本案第 3 年只跑 21,000 km，在上述四筆中內插得車商開價約 1,555,000，即 EQB 牌價的 58.2%。轉成自售價：58.2% × 0.88（車商開價 −12%）= 51.2% 的自售保值率，套用到本車 real_cost 2,420,000 得約 1,239,000，保守取 1,230,000（占 real_cost 50.8%）；車商收購價再 −13% 得 1,070,000。全表唯一有多筆同齡低里程實車佐證的檢查點，故給 medium。"},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"外推，已小幅下修（原 900,000）。台灣沒有 5 年車齡的 EQB（2022 年 9 月才導入，U-CAR 專題確認）。落點由兩個真實錨點夾出：上緣是 8891 的 EQB 3 年低里程車商開價 58.2%（見第 3 年），下緣是 8891 的 EQC 400 4MATIC 運動版 2020 年式、3 萬公里、車商開價 1,080,000，車齡約 6 年、里程與本案第 6 年相當，對其新車牌價約 329 萬僅剩約 32.8%。在 3 年 58.2% 與 6 年 32.8% 之間取第 5 年車商開價約 40%（2,410,000 × 40% ≈ 964,000），自售價 = −12% ≈ 850,000（占 real_cost 35.1%），車商收購價 = −14% ≈ 730,000。第 3 年原廠保固到期後，二手市場開始對保固外維修風險折價；此時高壓電池仍在 8 年／16 萬公里保固內，是唯一支撐。EQC 的原始牌價未能以第一手來源核實，故此格維持 low。"},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"外推，已下修（原 630,000），且已推翻前手「台灣市場根本沒有 7 年車齡的德系純電休旅可直接取樣」的說法。本人 curl https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqc（HTTP 200）取得台灣賓士最老的量產純電休旅 EQC 400 4MATIC 運動版，2020 年式、車齡約 6 年，共 3 筆在售：3 萬公里／1,080,000、3.6 萬公里／1,080,000、12.9 萬公里／990,000。兩筆低里程車正好貼合本案買家輪廓，是距離第 7 年只差一年的真實德系純電休旅錨點，前手完全未取樣。以其車商開價約當新車牌價 32.8%（第 6 年）為起點，沿此區間約每年 −18% 推到第 7 年約 26.9%，得車商開價 2,410,000 × 26.9% ≈ 648,000；自售價 = −12% ≈ 570,000。考量 GLB 250+ 是專屬純電平台、800V、633 km，體質優於當年由燃油平台改造且續航僅 400 餘公里的 EQC，向上微調至 590,000（占 real_cost 24.4%）；車商收購價 = −16% ≈ 495,000。此時 8 年高壓電池保固尚存最後一年。EQC 原始牌價僅為概略值，且屬跨車型外推，維持 low。"},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"外推，信心最低，無任何 10 年車齡的德系純電可取樣（台灣最老的量產德系純電休旅就是上述 2020 年式 EQC，2026 年也才 6 年）。未虛構比價車。由第 7 年的車商開價 26.9% 再沿約每年 −15% 推三年得約 16.5%，車商開價 2,410,000 × 16.5% ≈ 398,000，自售價 = −12% ≈ 350,000（占 real_cost 14.5%），車商收購價 = −20% ≈ 280,000（車齡越大車商利潤要求越高，且老純電車車商收購意願低）。尾段持續下墜而非像 Lexus 那樣打平，主軸是高壓電池 8 年／16 萬公里保固已於第 8 年到期——這是純電殘值真正的斷崖：10 年車齡、保固外的 85 kWh 電池組一旦模組故障，在台維修報價可輕易超過整車殘值，二手市場會把這個風險整包折進價格。"}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"推估。賓士台灣未公開 GLB electric 保養價目表（官網 curl 回 HTTP 000，無法讀取），且此車 2026 Q4 才開始交車，無實際收據可引用。以在台純電車第一次年度檢查的普遍區間（檢查工資＋冷氣濾網約 5,000-8,000）取中位。無官方或收據佐證。"},{"y":3,"source":"推估。涵蓋第 2、3 年兩次年度檢查（約 7,000 + 7,000）加第 2 年煞車油更換（原廠約 4,000-5,000）。此期間仍在 3 年原廠保固內，故障維修不計入自費。無官方價目表可核，維持 low。"},{"y":5,"source":"推估。第一組輪胎在此窗口到期是最大單筆：約 2.2 噸的純電車配 19 吋 AMG 胎，且 TVBS 規配表確認純電版採前後配不同尺寸、不能靠對調延壽，四條含工約 48,000。加年度檢查 ×2 約 16,000、煞車油 4,500、冷卻液 8,000、12V AGM 電瓶 9,000、定位與雜項 5,000。第 3 年保固到期後所有維修轉自費，此期別起才是真實持有成本。輪胎與工資金額為市場行情推估，未取得原廠報價。"},{"y":7,"source":"推估。完全在保固外。低里程加動能回收讓來令片幾乎不磨，但台灣濕氣重、低里程讓碟盤鏽蝕先到極限，會迫使前後一起換（賓士大尺寸碟盤約 55,000）。加年度檢查 ×2 約 18,000、煞車油 5,000、懸吊 25,000、空調 8,000、電子件維修預備 15,000。此為「德系保固外」的典型量級，明顯高於日系同齡車。無實收據佐證。"},{"y":10,"source":"推估，且是全表最不確定的一格。第 8 年高壓電池保固到期，這 3 年窗口是首次完全無保障。組成：年度檢查 ×3 約 30,000、第二組輪胎 55,000、煞車油 ×2 10,000、冷卻液 9,000、12V 電瓶 10,000、熱泵／壓縮機風險 45,000、懸吊零件 35,000、車載充電器／充電座風險 40,000、高壓電池模組級維修預備 30,000、雜項 16,000。已較前手的 300,000 下修 20,000：全車 10 年僅 70,000 km，懸吊屬年限老化而非磨耗，原本編列的「懸吊全套更換 50,000」在此里程下不合理，改列 35,000。刻意不編列整組電池更換（在台報價可達 80-150 萬、遠超屆時殘值 350,000，實務上多半直接報廢或換車），僅編列模組級維修準備金。"}],"sources":[{"name":"ETtoday 車雲 — 賓士 7 人座電動休旅 GLB 登台預售（本人 curl 驗證，HTTP 200）","url":"https://speed.ettoday.net/news/3202321","note":"價格與時間點的第一來源。車型表逐字列出「GLB 200 electric五人座：198萬起／GLB 250+ electric AMG Line七人座：241萬起／GLB 200五人座：215萬起／GLB 200 AMG Line七人座：236萬起」，因此 241 萬即為 7 座 AMG Line 的價格，不需另加第三排選配費。同文明載「將在第4季正式上市交車」，據此推翻前手「2027 年 3 月才量產」的全車系說法。並確認 800V 架構、85 kWh、WLTP 633 km、320 kW DC、127 L 前行李廂。"},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 — 新世代 GLB 完整規配（本人 curl 驗證，HTTP 200）","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/333047","note":"價格交叉驗證，獨立列出同一組四款預售價。關鍵細節：文中「2027年3月後才會開始生產」明確是指入門的 GLB 200 electric，不是本車 250+，前手誤把它套用到整個車系。另確認 250+ 為單馬達後驅 272 hp、85 kWh、633 km；AMG Line 配 19 吋 AMG 輪圈且純電版採前後配不同尺寸輪胎（保養成本依據）；燃油版 GLB 200 為 1.5 升渦輪＋48V 輕油電（163 hp＋30 hp），是 powertrain 分類的界定依據。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — M-Benz EQB 車源頁（本人 curl 驗證，HTTP 200，2026-08-12 擷取）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqb","note":"第 3 年殘值的主要依據，前代 EQB 全部 11 筆在售車源。有報價者逐筆為：2023 年式 1.6 萬 km／158.0 萬、2023 年式 3.15 萬 km／155.0 萬、2023 年式 3 萬 km／148.0 萬（兩筆）、2022 年式 7.63 萬 km／113.8 萬（兩筆）、2022 年式 13 萬 km／106.8 萬、2022 年式 13.45 萬 km／106.9 萬；另有 3 筆標「電洽」。全部是車商開價，已下修 12% 為自售價、再下修為收購價。前手當成「原廠精選 CPO、價格鏈最上緣」的那台 1,580,000，就是本頁第一筆一般車商車源。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — M-Benz EQC 車源頁（本人 curl 驗證，HTTP 200，2026-08-12 擷取）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqc","note":"第 7、10 年的關鍵錨點，也是前手宣稱不存在的那批車。EQC 400 4MATIC 運動版 2020 年式（車齡約 6 年）共 3 筆：3 萬公里／108.0 萬、3.6 萬公里／108.0 萬、12.9 萬公里／99.0 萬。這是台灣最老的量產德系純電休旅，兩筆低里程車正好貼合本案買家輪廓。其原始牌價（約 329 萬）未能以第一手來源核實，故據此推得的保值率僅供落點參考，相關檢查點維持 low。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — M-Benz EQA 車源頁（本人 curl 驗證，HTTP 200，2026-08-12 擷取）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqa","note":"第 3 年曲線的旁證。EQA 250 共 10 筆，2023 年式（3 年車）車商開價 122.0-140.0 萬，對其新車牌價 217 萬約 56-65%，與 EQB 的 55-59% 一致，顯示賓士純電在台 3 年車商開價落在牌價六成上下是通則而非單一車款現象。另有 2022 年式 9.5 萬公里／99.6 萬。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — M-Benz EQE 車源頁（本人 curl 驗證，HTTP 200，2026-08-12 擷取）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqe","note":"第 1 年下修的旁證。2024 年式 EQE SUV 300（1.1 萬公里、約 2 年車）車商開價 205.0 萬；2023 年式 EQE SUV 350 4Matic（3.1 萬公里）220.0 萬；2023 年式 EQE 300（3.2 萬公里）150.0 萬。德系純電在台兩年內即掉三成以上，據此判定前手第 1 年 70.2% 的自售保值率過高。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz 品牌頁（本人 curl 驗證，HTTP 200，2026-08-12 擷取）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz","note":"車系層級的在售筆數與開價區間，用於確認上列各車系取樣完整：EQA 10 筆 99.6-140.0 萬、EQB300 11 筆 106.8-158.0 萬、EQC400 3 筆 99.0-108.0 萬、EQE 車系 14 筆 150.0-258.8 萬。"},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車 — M-Benz 2023 EQB 300 4MATIC 車款頁（本人 curl 驗證，HTTP 200）","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/m-benz-eqb-2022-300-4matic","note":"第 3 年保值率的分母來源：頁面標示新車價 267（萬），即 NT$2,670,000，並列 5 門 7 人座、228hp、66.5 kWh、WLTP 423 km、車重 2,175 kg。同頁「牌照稅 $0元／燃料稅 $0元」，確認台灣 BEV 兩稅皆為 0（本表依設計仍不計稅）。"},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車 — M-Benz 2023 EQA 250 車款頁（本人 curl 驗證，HTTP 200）","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/m-benz-eqa-2022-250","note":"EQA 保值率的分母：新車價 217（萬），即 NT$2,170,000，66.5 kWh、WLTP 496 km、前輪驅動 190hp。"},{"name":"TechNews 科技新報 — 賓士 EQB 300 露營實測（本人 curl 驗證，HTTP 200）","url":"https://technews.tw/2025/11/04/mercedes-benz-eqb300-suv-review/","note":"EQB 300 4MATIC 牌價的第二個獨立來源，內文兩處寫「定價則抓在 267 萬元」「EQB 300 4MATIC 的售價來到 267 萬元」，與 Yahoo 汽車一致，故 2,670,000 這個分母可靠。"},{"name":"U-CAR 專題 — Mercedes-Benz EQB 250+ 電動能效全解密（本人 curl 驗證，HTTP 200）","url":"https://feature.u-car.com.tw/feature/article/78335","note":"前手宣稱此頁「直接 fetch 回 403、僅由搜尋摘要取得」，實際上本人 curl 取得完整內文（HTTP 200，68KB）。內文確認 EQB 車系「2022 年 9 月導入」（據此本表判定台灣最老 EQB 僅 4 年、5 年以上必須外推）、2024 年 2 月小改款新增 EQB 250+ 售價 222 萬、WLTP 534 km，以及「300 萬級距內唯一豪華純電 7 人座休旅」的定位。"},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz 台灣官網 — GLB electric 車型頁（未能驗證，curl 回 HTTP 000）","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/models/suv/glb-electric/overview.html","note":"誠實揭露：本人 curl 連線失敗（HTTP 000），與前手回報的 timeout 一致，兩次獨立嘗試都未讀到頁面內容，因此不作為價格、規格或保養價目的依據。列此僅為標示來源鏈完整性。"},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Select 原廠精選中古車（前手來源，本人未能獨立驗證）","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz-select.com.tw/","note":"前手把本站當成唯一的真實二手來源，並主張 CPO 售價高於一般車商售價、需逐級下調。本次已改用 8891 逐筆車源取代：前手引用的 EQB 300（2023/04、16,506 km、1,580,000）與 8891 上一筆一般車商車源（2023 年、1.6 萬公里、158.0 萬）為同一價位同一規格，顯示該價格就是一般車商開價，前手多加的「CPO −6%」那一階並無依據。本記錄未採用本站數據。"}]},"mercedes-gle300d-4matic":{"assumptions":"車主年行駛 6,000-8,000 km，遠低於台灣平均 12,000-15,000 km。各檢查點一律以 7,000 km × 年數計算（7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km）。所有金額為 TWD。依表格設計，牌照稅、燃料稅與各項保險（強制險、車體險）全部排除，不計入 purchase 也不計入 maintenance。低里程車在中古市場售價高於「不看里程的平均行情」，各年份殘值已針對此做向上修正，並於各 source 字串說明。柴油車在台灣的另一項隱性成本是 AdBlue 補充與短程行駛造成的 DPF 積碳，已計入 maintenance 而非此處。查核修正：台灣規格 GLE 300 d 4MATIC 標配 AIRMATIC 氣壓懸吊（非鋼簧），此為原研究誤判的項目，已改寫入第 7、10 年保養並調整第 10 年殘值。","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"查核者實際重抓 8891 中古車 GLE 300d 在架清單（33 筆），確認全部為車商售價（車商開價），已逐筆核對年份／里程／價格。1 年車：2026 年式星耀版市場上尚無在架個體，屬外推。最接近的實測錨點為 2024 年式（2 年車）/ 4.2 萬 km 車商開價 243.8 萬（約當時牌價 339 萬的 71.9%）——注意該車 4.2 萬 km 屬同齡偏高里程。由此往上推 1 年、並把里程由 4.2 萬 km 拉低到 7,000 km，得 1 年低里程車車商開價約 79.5%（343 萬 × 0.795 ≈ 272.7 萬）。再依「車商售價 > 自售價 > 車商收購價」折算：自售 = 車商開價 × 0.88 ≈ 240 萬（-12%，落在 8-15% 帶內）；車商收購 = 自售 × 0.875 ≈ 210 萬（再 -12.5%）。交叉驗算：2 年車 243.8 萬車商開價折自售約 214.5 萬，本車年輕 1 年且少跑 3.5 萬 km，240 萬合理。相對 real_cost 340 萬，第一年帳面損失約 29.4%（保值率 70.6%），符合德系豪華 SUV 在台灣第 1 年的陡跌特性，非日系的高 70%／80% 區間。查核維持原值。"},{"y":3,"conf":"high","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"查核者重抓 8891 並逐筆核對年份，修正原研究的抽樣錯誤：實際 2023 年份（3 年車）在架為 1.3 萬 km / 229.8 萬、2.74 萬 km / 223.8 萬、3.59 萬 km / 230.0 萬、3.9 萬 km / 209.8 萬、6.7 萬 km / 208.8 萬、6.72 萬 km / 208.0 萬、2.55 萬 km / 電洽。原研究誤把「5.7 萬 km / 188.8 萬」列為 2023 年份，該筆實際為 2022 年份，已從樣本剔除。本車 21,000 km 落在 1.3 萬與 2.74 萬 km 兩筆實測之間，屬區間內插、非外推：該里程帶車商開價約 227 萬，對 2023 年牌價 337 萬約 67.4%；套用到本車 343 萬 → 車商開價約 231 萬。自售 = × 0.88 ≈ 203 萬，取保守值 202 萬（對觀察到的 227 萬車商開價為 -11%，落在 8-15% 帶內）；車商收購 = × 0.87 ≈ 176 萬。剔除誤植樣本後結論不變，此仍為本車唯一有直接同里程實價支撐的檢查點。"},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"查核者重抓確認 8891 上 2021 年份（5 年車）實際在架為 5.0 萬 km / 165.8 萬（2 筆）、6.85 萬 km / 163.8 萬、8.0 萬 km / 159.8 萬（2 筆）、8.5 萬 km / 159.8 萬、10.8 萬 km / 145.6-145.8 萬、10.9 萬 km / 158.0 萬——里程全部落在 5.0-10.9 萬 km，明顯高於本車假設的 3.5 萬 km。以 2021 年牌價約 331 萬計，5 萬 km 車約 50.1%、10.9 萬 km 車約 44.0%。本車 3.5 萬 km 屬同齡極低里程，向上修正約 6% 至 53%（含跨年式牌價換算 343/331）：343 萬 × 0.53 ≈ 181.8 萬車商開價。自售 = × 0.88 ≈ 160 萬；車商收購 = × 0.865 ≈ 138 萬。里程外推幅度不小（實測最低 5 萬 km → 假設 3.5 萬 km），故不給 high。第 3 年原廠保固到期後中古市場開始把維修風險灌進報價，這是 3→5 年跌幅仍陡的主因；同世代比較車同樣配備 AIRMATIC，氣壓懸吊風險已內含於這些實測開價中，故本檢查點不另做扣減。查核維持原值。"},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"現行 W167 世代 2019 年在台上市，故 7 年車確實存在，但在架量極少且里程都很高。查核者重抓並修正原研究的年份誤植：8891 上 10.1 萬 km / 129.8 萬該筆實際為 2019 年份（＝7 年車），原研究誤記為 2020 年份；另有多筆 2019 年份 / 13 萬 km / 122.8 萬。以 2019 年牌價約 328 萬計，10.1 萬 km 約 39.6%、13 萬 km 約 37.4%。本車 4.9 萬 km 遠低於這些實測樣本，里程修正幅度大（13 萬 → 4.9 萬 km），是此檢查點信心低的主因。取車商開價約 42%（相對 39.6% 僅上修 6%，屬保守）：343 萬 × 0.42 ≈ 144 萬；自售 = × 0.87 ≈ 125 萬；車商收購 = × 0.85 ≈ 106 萬。車齡愈大車商收購折讓愈深，故此處價差比第 1、3 年更大。7 年車已完全脫離原廠保固與延長保固（延保最多到第 6 年），市場對 2.0 柴油＋48V＋AIRMATIC 的後續維修風險定價明顯轉為保守，殘值曲線並未像 Lexus 那樣走平。比較車為同世代同懸吊規格，氣壓懸吊風險已內含於實測開價，故金額維持原值。"},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"查核下修（原 83 萬／69 萬）。現行 W167 世代 2019 年才在台上市，2026 年沒有任何 10 年車，因此不編造，改用前代 W166 GLE（2015-2019）的實際成交價換算保值率再套用到本車。前代原始牌價經查核者獨立驗證：GLE 250 d 4MATIC 285 萬（AutoStar／jwincar 中古車頁明載「新車售價285萬」）。前代 10 年實測：2016 GLE 250d 車商開價 68.8 萬（HOT 大聯盟，查核者實際抓取確認頁面存在、2016 GLE 250D、688,000 元、2.1L、新北）→ 24.1%；市場其他 2016 GLE 250d 開價約 73.8 萬起。FindCar 顯示 GLE250d 在架 13 台平均 105.9 萬，但混雜 2016-2019 多個年份，不是乾淨的 10 年點，僅作上緣參考。原研究取 24-25% 後因低里程上修至 28%，查核認為上修過度：W166 GLE 250d 為鋼簧懸吊、2.1L 柴油、無 48V，而本車標配 AIRMATIC 氣壓懸吊、多一套 48V ISG 與更複雜電子架構，10 年車的維修風險顯著更高，中古市場會反向折價，足以抵銷大部分低里程溢價。故改取 25.5%：343 萬 × 0.255 ≈ 87.5 萬車商開價；自售 = × 0.87 ≈ 76 萬；車商收購 = × 0.83 ≈ 63 萬。此為明示外推、非實測，且跨世代規格不對等，故 confidence 為 low。"}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"台灣賓士原廠 Service A 行情：2ggx.com 保養費整理（查核者實際抓取成功）明列 E-Class／GLE 級距 A Service 10,000-15,000 元。GLE 300 d 為柴油、機油量大，取區間上緣 15,000 元，另加耗材與 AdBlue 約 3,000 元。保固年限依台灣賓士官方說明：3 年不限里程（查核者獨立確認）。查核維持原值。"},{"y":3,"source":"涵蓋第 2、3 年（非累計）。依 2ggx.com 台灣賓士 E-Class／GLE 級距 Service B 行情 18,000-30,000 元取上緣 28,000 元（柴油＋煞車油每 2 年更換），加第 3 年 Service A 約 16,000 元、AdBlue 與雜項約 4,000 元。此期間全程在 3 年不限里程保固內，維修成本為零，是全表最便宜的一段。查核維持原值。"},{"y":5,"source":"第 3 年底原廠保固到期，本期起開始自費。輪胎：Autobacs 台灣 275/50R20 Pirelli（GLE 20 吋原廠認證規格）單條 12,298 元，四條約 49,000 元，加定位取 52,000 元——本車 5 年只跑 3.5 萬 km，胎紋未必磨到底，但橡膠已老化，屬年限到期更換。Service B 30,000＋Service A 17,000（2ggx.com 行情上緣）。前後來令片 25,000（碟盤此期先不換）、12V AGM 電瓶 14,000、AdBlue 與雜項 4,000、保固外零星維修 15,000。AIRMATIC 氣壓懸吊此期已服役 5 年但仍屬正常壽命內，故不計入故障金額，風險集中於第 7、10 年。單項價格為市場行情推估，未取得實際收據；Autobacs 僅取得網域層級來源，未取得該商品深層固定連結。查核維持原值。"},{"y":7,"source":"涵蓋第 6、7 年。查核上修（原 180,000）：原研究按鋼簧懸吊計算，但台灣規格 GLE 300 d 標配 AIRMATIC 氣壓懸吊（U-CAR 車款頁「GLE 300 d 標配 AIRMATIC 氣壓懸吊」，另有 2026 GLE 報導載明 AIRMATIC 已為全系標配），故新增 35,000 元的機率加權金額（原廠氣壓避震筒單角連工資約 7-9 萬，5-7 年期單角失效機率約四成）。其餘沿用：Service B 32,000＋Service A 18,000、前後碟盤 45,000、變速箱油＋濾網 22,000、水箱精 8,000、DPF 清潔／強制再生 18,000、電子水泵／節溫器殼體 28,000、AdBlue 雜項 9,000。此期已完全脫離原廠保固（延保上限第 6 年），維修全額自負。DPF、電子水泵與 AIRMATIC 金額均為依已知故障模式所做的機率加權估計；台灣原廠實際報價（Mobile01 f=303 t=6881277）查核者重試仍為 403 無法取得內文，氣壓避震專門店（CG 氣壓避震器維修、LS 聯盛）亦未公開報價，故無收據佐證，confidence 維持 low。"},{"y":10,"source":"涵蓋第 8、9、10 三年，是全表最貴的一段。查核上修（原 385,000）：新增 AIRMATIC 氣壓懸吊風險攤提 120,000 元——標配項目，原廠氣壓避震筒單角連工資約 7-9 萬、壓縮機／閥體總成約 4-6 萬，且失效由橡膠老化與台灣高溫高濕主導、與低里程無關，8-10 年正是集中發生期，以兩角約六成機率＋壓縮機約五成機率加權。其餘沿用：Service B 34,000＋Service A 19,000＋Service B 35,000；第二套輪胎 56,000（Autobacs 275/50R20 四條 49,000 加通膨與定位）；12V AGM 電瓶 15,000；來令片 22,000；底盤件 45,000；煞車油／變速箱油／水箱精等 25,000；48V 鋰電池／ISG 45,000（全新 ISG 總成逾 12 萬，以發生機率加權）、DPF 更換 40,000（總成逾 12 萬，低里程短程使用提高機率）、渦輪／EGR／噴油嘴／預熱塞等柴油項目 50,000。台灣修車廠公開資訊確認 48V 電池為賓士已知痛點、柴油 DPF 警示燈維修為常見項目，氣壓避震亦有專門維修店家存在（CG 氣壓避震器維修專賣店、LS 聯盛汽車），但三者均未公布金額，故全部單價為推估、confidence 給 low。此段成本約為同級日系 SUV 同期的 3 倍以上，是德系豪華柴油 SUV 長期持有的主要成本。"}],"sources":[{"name":"Auto-Online 汽車線上 - 台灣賓士 2026 下半年新車布局／GLE 車系價格表","url":"https://www.auto-online.com.tw/news/71-44172","note":"查核者實際抓取成功（文章日期 2026-07-16）。明列「GLE 300 d 4MATIC 星耀版：343萬元」，同時列出 Coupé 星耀版 367 萬、GLE 450 4MATIC 星耀版 415 萬。list_price 的主要佐證來源。"},{"name":"TVBS Cars - 26 年式 GLE / GLE Coupé 售價調漲","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/330529","note":"查核者實際抓取成功（原研究只取得搜尋摘要）。明載「GLE 300d 4Matic星耀版從343萬元起跳」「GLE 450 4Matic星耀版從415萬元起跳」「GLE 53 4Matic+星夜版從457萬元起跳」，Coupé 星耀版調漲 4 萬至 367 萬。第二個獨立價格佐證。"},{"name":"工商時報 - 台灣賓士下半年休旅攻勢起跑","url":"https://www.ctee.com.tw/news/20260716702087-430503","note":"查核者新增的第三個獨立價格佐證：「車價343萬元起，較上一代車價增4萬元，但升級配備逾30萬」。"},{"name":"ETtoday 車雲 - 台灣賓士美製進口休旅調漲","url":"https://speed.ettoday.net/news/3195525","note":"查核者新增的第四個獨立價格佐證：「售價同步調漲4萬元，分別來到343萬元」。四源一致，故 list_price 3,430,000 維持不變。"},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 - 2026 年式 GLE 車系更新","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/89084","note":"全車系售價調漲 1-4 萬元，GLE 300d 4Matic 全面改為星耀版並調漲 4 萬元至 343 萬。查核者直接抓取仍為 403，內容取自搜尋結果摘要，非完整內文。"},{"name":"U-CAR Find your car - Mercedes-Benz GLE 車款介紹","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/mercedes-benz/gle/6808/overall","note":"查核關鍵來源：頁面標題／meta 明載「GLE 300 d 標配 AIRMATIC 氣壓懸吊」。這推翻了原研究「按鋼簧計算、AIRMATIC 為選配」的假設，直接改寫第 7、10 年保養金額與第 10 年殘值。直接抓取回 403，內容取自搜尋端點回傳的標題與摘要。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Mercedes-Benz GLE 300d 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/gle/gle300d","note":"查核者重新抓取成功並逐筆核對，本記錄殘值曲線的主要骨幹。33 筆在架實價（年份／里程／車商開價），涵蓋 2024 至 2019 年份。查核修正兩處原研究的年份誤植：「5.7萬km/188.8萬」實為 2022 年份（原記為 2023）、「10.1萬km/129.8萬」實為 2019 年份（原記為 2020）。頁面明確為車商售價，本表已依 車商售價 →（×0.87-0.88）自售價 →（×0.83-0.875）車商收購價 兩段折算。"},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 - GLE300d 中古車行情","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&b=8&m=1516","note":"查核者實際抓取成功：33 台 GLE300d 中古車、平均車價 188.4 萬（跨年份混合平均，與原研究記載的 188.5 萬一致）。僅用來與 8891 的逐筆資料互相驗證量級，未直接用於任何單一檢查點。"},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 - 前代 GLE250d 中古車行情","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&b=8&m=1406","note":"前代 W166 GLE250d 在架 13 台平均 105.9 萬。因混雜 2016-2019 多年份，僅作 10 年殘值推估的上緣參考，未直接採用。"},{"name":"AutoStar / 傑昇汽車 - 2016 GLE 250d 中古車頁（含原始牌價）","url":"https://www.jwincar.com.tw/p1_buy_detail.php?detail_PKey=47367","note":"查核者新增：明載前代 W166 GLE 250d「新車售價285萬」，獨立驗證了第 10 年殘值換算所用的分母。原研究引用的 8891 2016 年式規格頁（c.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/gle-2016/350d-4matic/Specification.html）查核者抓取時只回傳站名、未載入任何價格，故改用本來源佐證。"},{"name":"HOT 大聯盟 - 2016 年 GLE 250D 中古車","url":"https://www.hotcar.com.tw/UsedCarSell/CarDetail?vSeqNo=438847","note":"查核者實際抓取確認頁面存在：2016 Mercedes-Benz GLE 250D、688,000 元、2.1L、新北市（里程未載明）。對應原始牌價 285 萬 → 10 年車商開價保值率 24.1%。第 10 年外推的主要實測錨點。"},{"name":"2ggx.com - 賓士保養費用整理","url":"https://www.2ggx.com/%E8%B3%93%E5%A3%AB%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E8%B2%BB/","note":"查核者實際抓取成功並取得分級距數字（原研究只給整體區間）：E-Class／GLE 級距 A Service 10,000-15,000 元、B Service 18,000-30,000 元（另有 A/CLA、C/GLC、S-Class 各級距）。本表所有 Service A/B 單價的來源，GLE 300 d 因柴油＋大機油量取區間上緣。"},{"name":"台灣賓士原廠保固說明（3 年不限里程＋第 4-6 年選購延保）","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz.com.tw/passengercars/services/warranty.html","note":"官網直接抓取逾時（60s）。查核者改由搜尋端點確認台灣賓士「3年期且不限里程之保固責任」，以及授權經銷商說明「可以自由選購第 4-6 年的專屬延長保固方案」。這是第 1-3 年維修成本為零、第 4 年起全額自負的依據，並確認延保為選購而非標配。未找到隨車標配預付保養套餐的證據。"},{"name":"Mobile01 - GLE 車主保養費用討論串","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=303&t=6564262","note":"車主回報 GLE 單次保養約 9,944 元，用於驗證 Service A 量級。查核者重試直接抓取仍為 403（頁面存在但擋爬蟲），內容僅取自搜尋結果摘要。"},{"name":"Mobile01 - GLE 350d 4.7 萬 km 原廠 vs 副廠報價","url":"https://www.mobile01.com/topicdetail.php?f=303&t=6881277","note":"原本要用來取得中後期實際維修報價，查核者重試直接抓取仍為 403，未能取得任何金額。第 7、10 年的維修單價因此缺乏收據佐證，confidence 給 low。"},{"name":"Autobacs 台灣 - 275/50R20 輪胎售價","url":"https://www.autobacs.com.tw","note":"GLE 20 吋原廠認證規格 Pirelli 275/50R20 單條 12,298 元（原價 16,800），四條約 49,000 元，含安裝與四輪平衡。第 5、10 年輪胎成本依此計算。僅取得網域層級來源，未取得該商品的深層固定連結——查核者確認原研究並未捏造路徑，此為誠實揭露。"},{"name":"8891 新車 - GLE 2026 年式用車成本解析","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/gle/cost.html","note":"查核者確認頁面確實存在（標題涵蓋油費、保險、稅金、保值率），但內文數字同樣未載入，未取得任何數字。列此純為紀錄確實嘗試過此來源，未用於任何估算。"}]},"mercedes-gle450-4matic":{"assumptions":"買家年行駛 6,000-8,000 km，遠低於台灣平均 12,000-15,000 km。各檢查點一律以 7,000 km × 年數計（7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000）。此里程下保養屬時間驅動而非里程驅動：Mercedes ASSYST PLUS 的「1 年或 10,000 km」門檻會先撞到「1 年」，所以每年進廠一次、A/B Service 交替，油品與煞車油照年限換，輪胎約每 5-6 年因老化（非磨耗）更換。稅（牌照稅 15,210 元/年、燃料稅 7,200 元/年，已於 U-CAR 車型表核對）與保險依設計完全排除在本表之外。殘值一律取 8891／SUM 上里程最接近的低里程物件，並在 source 中寫明由車商開價往下修為自售價的幅度。低里程加成有直接證據：8891 上 2022 年式 GLE450 4Matic 在 44,000 km 開價 2,380,000，在 80,200 km 只開 1,890,000，同年式因里程差 36,000 km 就差 26%，因此本買家的車在每個檢查點都應高於「不分里程的平均行情」。","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"【已下修，原研究者的 3,050,000 過高】原值的錨點是 8891 上一台 2025 年式 GLE Coupé 300 d 4Matic（17,000 km、開價 3,088,000）——不同車型、不同動力、不同車身，不能拿來推 GLE 450。本次改用同車型的真實成交級距：8891 上 2024 年式 GLE 450 4Matic（31,000 km）車商開價 2,868,000，當年式牌價 4,090,000，車商開價留存率 70.1%（本次自行 curl 抓取 8891 共 8 頁、261 筆 GLE 在售車輛核對）。該樣本里程 31,000 km 高於本買家 2 年時的 14,000 km，做里程修正後 2 年車商開價約為牌價 73%；德系豪華 SUV 第 1→2 年車商開價通常再差 7-8 個百分點，故 1 年車商開價取牌價 80% ≈ 3,320,000。再依「車商售價 > 自售價 > 車商收購價」修正：自售 = 車商開價 −12.7% ≈ 2,900,000；車商收購 = 自售 −13.1% ≈ 2,520,000。對 real_cost 的留存率由原本的 74.5% 降為 70.6%，符合德系第一年重跌的形狀。無 1 年內的 GLE 450 實際刊登，故 confidence 維持 medium。"},{"y":3,"conf":"high","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"本表證據最紮實的一點，數字大致維持原研究者的結論並已逐筆驗證。8891 實際刊登（2026-08-12 自行抓取）：2023 年式 GLE450 4Matic 三筆——50,000 km 開價 2,658,000（兩筆不同車商）、55,000 km 開價 2,658,000；當年式（小改款後）牌價 4,090,000，車商開價留存率 65.0%。另有 2024 年式 31,000 km 開價 2,868,000（70.1%）可夾出曲線。本車 3 年僅 21,000 km，比樣本少約 30,000 km，依同年式里程敏感度給約 +3 個百分點 → 車商開價 68% × 4,150,000 ≈ 2,820,000。自售 = 車商開價 −13.1% ≈ 2,450,000；車商收購 = 自售 −13.1% ≈ 2,130,000。同車型、同世代、多筆實際刊登，confidence 維持 high。"},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"【已上修，原研究者的 1,690,000 偏低，錯在基準價不一致】原值把 8891 上 2021 年式 GLE450（70,000 km）的 1,688,000 這個「絕對金額」加 10% 直接套到本車，但該樣本的原始牌價是 3,810,000（小改款前），本車是 4,150,000，必須轉成留存率再套：1,688,000 / 3,810,000 = 44.3%，× 1.10 低里程加成 = 48.7%，× 4,150,000 ≈ 2,020,000 才是對應的車商開價。本次另抓到原研究者漏掉的低里程樣本，方向一致：2022 年式 GLE450 4Matic 44,000 km 開價 2,380,000（兩筆）、2021 年式 60,000 km 開價 1,728,000、2020 年式 40,599 km（AMG 七人座）開價 2,480,000。本車 5 年僅 35,000 km，低於所有 5 年樣本，車商開價取牌價 51% ≈ 2,120,000。自售 = −12.6% ≈ 1,800,000；車商收購 = −13.9% ≈ 1,550,000。原研究者宣稱的「3→4 年斷崖 −29%」是里程不對等造成的假象：2,658,000（2023 年式 50,000 km）對 1,890,000（2022 年式 80,200 km），但同一批 2022 年式在 44,000 km 是 2,380,000，里程對齊後單年跌幅約 −10% 而非 −29%。仍為外推＋里程修正，confidence medium。"},{"y":7,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"【已上修，原研究者的 1,470,000 偏低，同樣是基準價不一致】本代 W167 於 2019 年在台上市，7 年車有真實資料。8891 實際刊登（2026-08-12 自行抓取）：2019 年式 GLE450 4MATIC 50,000 km→1,738,000、57,699 km→1,688,000、60,000/61,000/62,000 km→1,688,000、72,000 km→1,598,000、80,000-85,000 km→1,730,000-1,738,000；當年式牌價 3,810,000，車商開價留存率 44.3-45.6%。原值把 1,700,000 這個絕對金額直接當本車的車商開價，等於忽略本車牌價高出 340,000。改用留存率：45.0% × 4,150,000 ≈ 1,870,000，再為「2033 年時已過保固、且極可能落後一個世代（下一代 GLE 屆時應已在台上市），二手市場會把修繕風險折進去」保守下修約 7% → 車商開價取 1,730,000。自售 = −13.3% ≈ 1,500,000；車商收購 = −14.0% ≈ 1,290,000。有同車型 7 年實際刊登但需跨牌價換算與風險折價，confidence medium。"},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"明確外推，非本代實測。本代 W167 台灣 2019 才上市，沒有 10 年實績，故改用前代 W166 的同性質車型 GLE 400 4MATIC（3.0 V6 汽油、333 hp）：台灣原廠牌價 3,410,000（LUX 3,630,000），已於 Wayback Machine 的 U-CAR 2017-06-13 快照逐行核對。這些車現在的車商開價——8891：2016 年式 90,000 km→668,000、100,000 km→655,000、102,000 km（LUX）→688,000、74,000 km（LUX）→828,000；SUM 汽車網：2016 年式 102,448 km→798,000。以 3,410,000（LUX 用 3,630,000）為分母，90,000-102,000 km 的 10 年留存率為 19.2-23.4%，中位數約 20.5%；里程最低的 74,000 km LUX 為 22.8%。本車 10 年僅 70,000 km，取 22.5% 留存率套回本車 4,150,000 牌價 → 車商開價約 934,000。自售 = −14.3% ≈ 800,000；車商收購 = −15.0% ≈ 680,000。旁證：8891／SUM 的 2017-2018 年式 GLE400（8-9 年、43,000-72,000 km）開價 868,000-958,000，與此曲線連續——德系尾段沒有 Lexus 那種打平，而是持續下探。風險提醒：W166 是 V6 自然世代、無 48V，本車的 M256＋48V ISG 在 10 年後的修繕風險更高，實際尾段可能比此外推值更低。confidence low。"}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"推估，無台灣賓士官方價目表可引用。依 M256 直六（機油量約 8.5 L 全合成）與原廠工資推估單次 A Service 約 15,000-20,000 元，取 18,000（原值 15,000 已上修，原值低於同家族四缸柴油 GLE 300 d 的 18,000，方向不合理）。保養觸發點是「滿 1 年」而非里程（僅 7,000 km）。"},{"y":3,"source":"推估，無官方價目表佐證。B Service 含煞車油（2 年一次，時間制），六缸 GLE 於原廠約 30,000-38,000 元；A Service 約 18,000 元。合計約 50,000-56,000，取 55,000（原值 50,000 小幅上修，與第 1 年的上修一致）。"},{"y":5,"source":"推估，維持原值。關鍵假設：3 年原廠保固到期，開始自付零件。輪胎在 35,000 km 幾乎沒磨完，但橡膠已 5 年，是依老化更換；275/50 R20 的優質靜音胎在台約每條 13,000-16,000 元含工。無官方價目表或實際收據佐證。"},{"y":7,"source":"推估，維持原值。48V 風險準備 20,000 是期望值而非全額更換（ISG 整組更換在台可達 80,000-150,000），以出險機率折算。無官方價目表或實際收據佐證。"},{"y":10,"source":"推估，維持原值。這段是德系與日系差距最大的地方：車已 10 年、完全無保固，二手市場與維修市場都把修繕風險計入。項目挑選依 M256／W167 的已知風險點（電子水泵、節溫器殼、點火線圈、48V ISG）而非通用清單。若實車選配了 AIRMATIC 氣壓懸吊，本期成本應再往上加 50,000-100,000。無官方價目表或實際收據佐證。"}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車頻道 — Mercedes-Benz GLE（2026 星耀版）車款介紹","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/mercedes-benz/gle/7237/overall","note":"覆核時自行 curl 抓取原頁（HTTP 200）。官方建議售價：GLE 450 4Matic 星耀版 4,150,000、GLE 300 d 4Matic 星耀版 3,430,000。確認 2026 年式由進化版改星耀版、各漲 40,000。明載全車系搭載 ISG 48V 輕油電（額外約 20 匹輔助）。同表列相關稅費：燃料稅 7,200／牌照稅 15,210 元/年。list_price 4,150,000 經此頁確認無誤。"},{"name":"U-CAR 新車頻道 — GLE 規格表","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/Mercedes-Benz/GLE/7237/spec","note":"覆核時自行抓取並核對：GLE 450 星耀版 2,999 c.c.、381 hp/5800~6100 rpm、車重 2,310 kg、輪胎 275/50 R20、油箱 85 L、壓縮比 10.5:1。保養成本推估的規格基礎，原研究者引用正確。"},{"name":"U-CAR 新車頻道 — GLE 配備表","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/Mercedes-Benz/GLE/7237/equip","note":"覆核時直接檢查原始 HTML：「主動式電子懸載系統」該列在 300 d 與 450 星耀版兩欄的 img alt 皆為「選用配備」（ic_check_selected.png），非「標準配備」（ic_check_round.png）。原研究者的說法正確，決定了 7-10 年懸吊維修的估算基準。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz GLE 二手行情（本次自行抓取 8 頁、261 筆去重）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/gle","note":"全站 298 筆 GLE 在售，本次以 curl 抓取第 1-8 頁並解析。GLE450 4MATIC（非 Coupé）實際車商開價：2024/31,000km→2,868,000、2023/50,000km→2,658,000（兩筆）、2023/55,000km→2,658,000、2022/44,000km→2,380,000（兩筆）、2022/80,200km→1,890,000、2021/60,000km→1,728,000、2021/70,000km→1,688,000、2021/160,000km→1,688,000、2020/40,599km(AMG 七人座)→2,480,000、2020/80,000km→1,750,000、2020/116,000km→1,390,000、2019/50,000km→1,738,000、2019/53,800km→2,280,000、2019/57,699km→1,688,000、2019/60,000-62,000km→1,688,000、2019/72,000km→1,598,000、2019/80,000-85,000km→1,730,000-1,738,000。前代 W166 GLE400 4MATIC：2018/43,000km→868,000-880,000、2017/62,000km(LUX)→800,000、2017/69,000km→938,000、2017/71,000km→888,000、2016/74,000km(LUX)→828,000、2016/90,000km→668,000-698,000、2016/100,000km→655,000、2016/102,000km(LUX)→688,000。全部是車商售價，本表已逐一往下修為自售價與收購價。原研究者漏掉的關鍵樣本是 2022/44,000km 的 2,380,000 與 2021/60,000km 的 1,728,000，正是這兩筆推翻了原本第 5 年的低估與「3→4 年 −29% 斷崖」的說法。"},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — BENZ GLE-CLASS 在售車輛搜尋","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?brand=BENZ&model=GLE-CLASS","note":"覆核時自行抓取並解析出 14 筆：2025 GLE 300 d 4MATIC（36,542 km）2,620,000；2024 GLE350（37,030 km）2,980,000；2023 GLE 300 d（67,183 km）2,088,000；2023 GLE 350（39,382 km）2,780,000；2021 GLE350（76,551 km）1,988,000；2020 GLE 350 d（90,000 km）1,850,000；2019 GLE350（49,254 km）1,960,000；前代 2018 GLE400 4MATIC（72,000 km）958,000、2017 GLE400（71,631 km）888,000、2016 GLE400（102,448 km）798,000。同樣是車商開價，用於交叉驗證 8891 的水位與第 10 年的 W166 留存率。"},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Select 原廠精選中古車（台灣賓士官方 CPO）","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz-select.com.tw/buy-car/detail.aspx?id=4012","note":"URL 覆核可正常開啟（HTTP 200），頁面標題確為 Mercedes-Benz GLE 300 d 4M 的原廠精選中古車物件；惟價格為 JS 動態渲染，本次無法從 HTML 直接讀出金額，故原研究者所引的 2,300,000 售價未能獨立驗證，本表不以此頁做為任何數字的依據，僅作為「CPO 是零售價最高一階」的定性參考。同站 about 頁證實有延長保固與守護星服務，價格需洽經銷商。"},{"name":"Wayback Machine — U-CAR 前代 W166 GLE 車款介紹（2017-06-13 快照）","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20170613181324/http://newcar.u-car.com.tw/mercedes-benz/gle/1312/overall","note":"URL 已修正：原研究者給的 20170101000000 通配時間戳實測回 HTTP 302、0 bytes，不是可用快照；本次改用 archive.org availability API 取得真正的 20170613181324 快照並核對內容。前代 W166 台灣牌價：GLE 250d 4MATIC 2,850,000、GLE 350d 4MATIC 3,380,000、GLE 400 4MATIC 3,410,000（3.0 V6 汽油 333 hp）、GLE 350d 4MATIC LUX 3,600,000、GLE 400 4MATIC LUX 3,630,000。第 10 年殘值外推的分母。"},{"name":"Wayback Machine — U-CAR W167 GLE 車款介紹（2020-08-07 快照）","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20200807133708/https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/mercedes-benz/gle/3732/overall","note":"覆核時自行抓取並核對（HTTP 200）。小改款前 W167 台灣牌價：GLE 300 d 4Matic 3,020,000、GLE 350 d 4Matic 3,560,000、GLE 450 4Matic 3,810,000（367 hp）。用來把 2019-2022 年式的中古開價換算成留存率——第 5、7 年修正的關鍵分母。"},{"name":"Wayback Machine — U-CAR GLE 小改款（2023-12-05 快照）","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20231205054428/https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/mercedes-benz/gle/6016/overall","note":"覆核時自行抓取並核對（HTTP 200）。小改款後台灣牌價：GLE 300 d 4Matic 3,370,000、GLE 450 4Matic 4,090,000（381 hp）。第 2、3 年檢查點的分母。"},{"name":"Wayback Machine — U-CAR GLE 進化版（2025-06-13 快照）","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250613065317/https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/Mercedes-Benz/GLE/6808/overall","note":"覆核時自行抓取並核對（HTTP 200）。進化版台灣牌價：GLE 300 d 4Matic 進化版 3,390,000、GLE 450 4Matic 進化版 4,110,000。與 2026 星耀版各漲 40,000 的說法一致，構成 3,810,000 → 4,090,000 → 4,110,000 → 4,150,000 的完整牌價沿革。"}]},"volvo-xc60-t8-ultra":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year, far below the TW average of 12,000-15,000 km. Every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000). This drives two things. (1) SERVICING IS TIME-DRIVEN, NOT MILEAGE-DRIVEN: Volvo's interval is 10,000 km OR 12 months, whichever comes first, so at 7,000 km/year the clock always wins and the car gets exactly one annual service and never a mileage-triggered one. Wear items therefore age out rather than wear out: 235/55 R19 tyres (confirmed as the factory size in Volvo TW's own MY26 XC60 sheet, same fitment as the B5) are replaced on rubber age at ~5-6 years, and the 12V AGM battery dies on calendar life. Volvo Taiwan's free scheduled-maintenance programme does NOT apply here: volvomsp.volvocartw.com states in its own footnote that the 4-year/80,000 km free maintenance offer is for 電動車 (BEVs: EX30/EX40/EC40/EX90) only, so this PHEV owner pays for every annual service from year 1. (2) RESALE: every XC60 T8 listing found live on 8891/FindCar carries 19,000-109,000 km, all above this buyer's pace, so comps were normalised UPWARD toward 7,000 km/year before the dealer-retail to private-sale haircut. The uplift used for this car is deliberately small (~0.1% per 1,000 km, roughly a quarter of the 0.375% per 1,000 km measured on the petrol/MHEV XC60) because on a PHEV low mileage does not protect the thing buyers actually worry about: the 18.8 kWh pack degrades on calendar age regardless of km, and in Taiwan a very-low-mileage PHEV is often read as a car whose owner never bothered to charge it. The 0.375%/1,000 km petrol figure was measured independently here from 8891's own 2021 XC60 B5 R-Design cohort (NT$1,300,000 @45,200 km vs NT$989,000 @109,000 km). Tax (牌照稅/燃料費/貨物稅) and insurance are excluded by design throughout.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"BACKCAST ONE YEAR FROM REAL LISTINGS; NO 1-YEAR-OLD T8 IS CURRENTLY ON THE MARKET, so this is not a directly observed point. The nearest real data is the age-2.1 cohort on 8891: 2024款 Recharge Ultimate T8 AWD at NT$1,950,000 / 19,000 km and NT$1,930,000 / 26,500 km, both against a verified MY2024 list of NT$2,941,000 (FindCar new-car reference table), i.e. 0.663 and 0.656 of list as DEALER RETAIL ASKING. Normalising both to this buyer's mileage gives ~0.665 of list at 2.1 years. Backcasting the fitted curve (0.665 @2.1y, 0.609 @3.1y, 0.520 @4.1y) to 1 year gives ~0.74 of list as dealer retail, consistent with a ~25-point first-year loss, which is normal for a Taiwan luxury PHEV; the shape is cross-checked against the one near-1-year XC60 B5 on FindCar (2024-built / 2025-registered, 11,704 km, asking NT$1,758,000). ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: 0.74 x NT$2,990,000 = NT$2,212,600 dealer retail, then -15% to reach the PRIVATE SALE figure of NT$1,880,000. The 15% haircut is the deep end of the normal 8-15% band, used deliberately because the private buyer pool for a PHEV in Taiwan is much smaller than for the petrol equivalent (the buyer needs somewhere to charge), so a private seller must discount harder and wait longer. dealer_tradein_price is a further -13% below the private figure. This is NOT a copied dealer asking price."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"BEST-EVIDENCED POINT ON THE CURVE: three real matched-age XC60 T8 listings, each with a verified original list price. From 8891 and FindCar, the age-3.1 (reg-2023) cohort is 2023款 Recharge Ultimate T8 at NT$1,750,000 / 39,600 km against a MY2023 Ultimate T8 list of NT$2,925,000 (0.598), plus 2024款 Recharge Plus T8 AWD at NT$1,500,000 / 51,000 km and NT$1,530,000 / 42,000 km against a MY2023-24 Plus T8 list of NT$2,555,000-2,571,000 (0.587 and 0.599). Three independent points converging on 0.59-0.60 of list is a strong signal. Normalising to this buyer's 21,000 km gives 0.609 of list as DEALER RETAIL ASKING. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: 0.609 x NT$2,990,000 = NT$1,820,900 dealer retail, then -15% to the PRIVATE SALE figure of NT$1,545,000; dealer_tradein_price is a further -13%. HONEST NOTE ON THE PHEV PENALTY: matched-trim, matched-age, mileage-normalised ASKING prices do not actually show the T8 below the B5 here (T8 0.609 of list vs the 2023 Ultimate B5 AWD at NT$1,359,000 / 65,200 km against a NT$2,612,000 list, normalising to ~0.605). The PHEV penalty in Taiwan is real but it lands on the seller as a deeper private-sale discount and a much longer time on market, not as a lower dealer sticker, which is exactly why the 15% haircut rather than the 8-10% one is applied to this car. Confidence is medium, not high, because these are asking prices, not recorded transactions, and the retail-to-private conversion is modelled."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"INTERPOLATED BETWEEN TWO REAL BRACKETS. Lower bracket, real and same model: the age-4.1 XC60 T8 cohort on 8891, 2023款 Recharge T8 AWD Plus at NT$1,299,000 / 51,100 km and 2022款 XC60 T8 PLUS at NT$1,230,000 / 109,000 km, both against a NT$2,555,000 list, which normalise to a tight 0.519-0.520 of list. Upper bracket, real but a sibling model: the age-6.1 XC90 T8 Inscription at NT$1,588,000 / 42,000 km against its NT$3,690,000 list (FindCar new-car table) = 0.430 of list. Interpolating gives ~0.480 of list at exactly 5 years as DEALER RETAIL ASKING. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: 0.480 x NT$2,990,000 = NT$1,435,200 dealer retail, then -15% to the PRIVATE SALE figure of NT$1,220,000; dealer_tradein_price a further -13%. Year 5 is where the PHEV genuinely falls behind the mild-hybrid: this is the first checkpoint fully outside the 3-year factory warranty, and the pack is now old enough that buyers start pricing battery-health uncertainty. Confidence medium: the year-5 value is bracketed on both sides by real listings, but the upper bracket is a different model, so the shape between them is modelled."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED BEYOND ALL XC60 T8 DATA. The oldest XC60 T8 on the Taiwan market today is the reg-2020 T8 Inscription (NT$1,188,000 / 63,000 km on 8891), only ~6 years old, and its original list price could not be verified, so it is used for shape only and not as a ratio. The anchor used instead is the oldest Volvo PHEV with a verifiable denominator: the age-6.1 XC90 T8 Inscription at NT$1,588,000 / 42,000 km against a NT$3,690,000 list = 0.430 of list. Extending the observed ~4.5 points/year decay to 7 years gives ~0.390, and this is cut to 0.375 of list because year 7 sits directly under the battery cliff: Volvo's high-voltage battery warranty is 8 years / 160,000 km, so a 7-year-old car is sold with roughly one year of pack cover left and buyers discount that explicitly. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: 0.375 x NT$2,990,000 = NT$1,121,250 dealer retail, then -15% to the PRIVATE SALE figure of NT$950,000; dealer_tradein_price a further -13%. Confidence low: no XC60 T8 of this age exists to check against, and the decay rate past year 6 is inferred from a larger, more expensive sibling model."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-12","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREVIOUS-GENERATION XC60, WITH AN EXPLICIT CORRECTION FOR THE FACT THAT NO 10-YEAR-OLD XC60 T8 CAN EXIST. Stating the gap plainly: the T8 was only introduced on the second-generation XC60, which reached Taiwan in 2018, so the oldest XC60 T8 in the country is about 8 years old; and the older Volvo PHEV, the XC90 T8, returned no 2016-2017 listings at all in this search. There is therefore no real 10-year Volvo PHEV transaction data in Taiwan, and none is invented here. METHOD ACTUALLY USED, exactly as required: take the real used prices of the PREVIOUS-GENERATION XC60 at that age, express them as a retention ratio of that car's own original list price, then apply the ratio to this car's real_cost. From 8891, the first-generation XC60 T5 R-Design reg-2015 sells at NT$358,000 / 126,400 km against its NT$2,210,000 MY2015 list (FindCar historical new-car table) = 0.162 of list at ~11 years; the reg-2014 T5 R-Design at NT$258,000 / 162,000 km against NT$2,115,000 = 0.122 at ~12 years. Normalising the 11-year car to 70,000 km (uplift capped at +20%, the convention used elsewhere in this table) gives ~0.194, and at 10 years rather than 11 the petrol previous generation sits at ~0.21 of list as dealer retail asking. That chain reproduces the XC60 B5 record's own 10-year figure to within about 4%, which is the main check that the method is not drifting. PHEV PENALTY APPLIED ON TOP: 0.21 is cut by 20% relative, to 0.168 of list, because by year 10 the high-voltage pack is two years out of warranty and a pack replacement costs a large fraction of what the whole car is then worth, which is the single biggest thing a Taiwanese buyer of a 10-year-old PHEV is pricing. 0.168 x NT$2,990,000 = NT$502,320 dealer retail, then -15% to the PRIVATE SALE figure of NT$430,000; dealer_tradein_price a further -13%. Note the crossover this produces: in absolute money this car finally falls BELOW the XC60 B5 at year 10 (NT$430,000 vs NT$450,000) despite having cost NT$600,000 more new. That is deliberate and is the point of the record: the battery risk eventually overwhelms the higher starting price. Confidence low, and it should be treated as an ordering signal, not a number to plan around."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Priced from the PTT XC60 owner receipt (NT$7,644 for a 10,000 km service at 2020 prices, itemised down to the oil filter) uprated to 2026 labour and parts rates and to the T8's more involved service, which adds a high-voltage system check the B5 does not have. Cross-checked for consistency against the other Volvo records in this table at the same age (XC60 B5 NT$10,000, V60 T8 NT$11,000, XC90 T8 NT$15,000); the XC60 T8 sitting just above the V60 T8 and well below the larger XC90 T8 is the expected ordering. Confirmed against volvomsp.volvocartw.com that no free-maintenance programme offsets this, because that offer is BEV-only."},{"y":3,"source":"Two annual services at the PTT-derived rate plus the time-based brake-fluid change (the owner receipt shows 煞車油 756 as a parts line at the second service, with labour absorbed) and cabin filters, whose Volvo parts price the same thread puts at NT$3,014 excluding labour. Still inside the 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty, so no repair reserve is carried. Consistent with the XC60 B5 record's NT$27,000 for the same window, with the T8 slightly higher for the extra high-voltage checks."},{"y":5,"source":"Tyre size 235/55 R19 taken from Volvo TW's own MY26 XC60 specification sheet, priced at the same ~NT$44,000 fitted as the XC60 B5 record, which shares the exact fitment. This is the first window fully outside the 3-year warranty, so services are at full dealer rate. Consistent with the sibling records (XC60 B5 NT$92,000, V60 T8 NT$95,000) with the T8 carrying more because of the 12V battery's harder life on a PHEV and the first battery-health diagnostic. Confidence low: no XC60 T8 has yet been through this window in Taiwan at this mileage, so the consumable timing is inferred from the platform rather than observed on this exact car."},{"y":7,"source":"This is the window the briefing flags for extra high-voltage inspection cost, and it is priced that way: the PHEV-only second coolant circuit and the pre-expiry battery health assessment are both charged here, on top of the spark plugs that the T8's twin-charged (turbo plus supercharger) 2.0L needs on a calendar trigger at this mileage. Out-of-warranty repair reserve is carried from year 4 onward. Benchmarked against the V60 T8 record (NT$105,000, identical powertrain, smaller car and smaller brakes) and the XC90 T8 (NT$130,000, larger and air-sprung); NT$115,000 for the XC60 T8 sits correctly between them. Confidence low: a reserve for unscheduled out-of-warranty repair is a probability-weighted figure, not a quotation."},{"y":10,"source":"The defining cost of this window is that the high-voltage battery warranty expires on the CALENDAR at year 8 for this driver: at 7,000 km/year the car reaches only ~56,000 km by then, nowhere near the 160,000 km limit, so the time limit is what binds and the last two years are uncovered. The NT$60,000 line is a probability-weighted allowance for module-level repair, not the cost of a full pack, which would be far higher; it is the single largest reason this record's year 7-10 maintenance exceeds the XC60 B5's. Benchmarked against the V60 T8 (NT$200,000, same powertrain, smaller consumables) and the XC90 T8 (NT$300,000, bigger tyres, air suspension); NT$235,000 sits between them as expected. Confidence low: no XC60 T8 in Taiwan has reached 10 years, so this is a constructed bill of materials, not observed spend."}],"sources":[{"name":"Volvo Cars Taiwan — MY26 XC60 官方價格/規格表 (PDF)","url":"https://www.volvocartw.com/pdf/carsp/XC60.pdf","note":"PRIMARY SOURCE for list_price. Downloaded (HTTP 200, 264 KB, 7 pages) and its PDF text streams decompressed directly rather than trusting any summary. Yields 'Plus : NT$2,390,000', 'Ultra : NT$2,690,000' for the B5 and 'Ultra : NT$2,990,000' for 'XC60, T8 AWD plug in Hybrid', an 'MY26' version stamp, the 235/55 R19 tyre fitment and the 18.8 kWh battery."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 — 2026 年式 Volvo XC60 上市，限時「隨心入主方案」224 萬元起","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/42774-volvo-xc60-2026-224.html","note":"Independent confirmation of the whole range at NT$2,390,000 / NT$2,690,000 / NT$2,990,000, and the primary evidence for the discount level (B5 Plus at NT$2,240,000 with a bundled HUD). Also the source for the T8's 455 hp / 72.3 kgm, 18.8 kWh, 86 km EV range and B&W audio."},{"name":"8891 新車 — Volvo 2026 年 8 月優惠方案","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/volvo/xc60/22311","note":"Current-month discount structure: XC60 gets 120萬 40期 0利率 plus a free HUD upgrade, with explicit advice to trade the interest subsidy for a deeper cash 空車折扣. Also documents the conditional government 舊換新／貨物稅減徵 subsidy of up to NT$50,000-100,000, which is excluded from discounts here."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Volvo XC60 二手車listings (pages 1-3)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/volvo/xc60","note":"103 unique live XC60 listings scraped with price, registration year and mileage. Supplied the T8 comps at ages 2.1 (NT$1,950,000/19,000 km and NT$1,930,000/26,500 km), 3.1 (NT$1,750,000/39,600 km), 4.1 (NT$1,299,000/51,100 km) and 6.1, the matched B5 comps, the previous-generation 10-12 year T5 comps, and the 2021 B5 R-Design pair used to measure the 0.375%/1,000 km mileage sensitivity independently. All are 車商售價 dealer retail asking prices, converted before use."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — volvo xc60 t8 中古行情與新車參考價","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/volvo%20xc60%20t8","note":"The denominator source. Gives per-model-year new-car reference prices for the T8: 2023 Ultimate NT$2,925,000 / Plus NT$2,555,000, 2024 Ultimate NT$2,941,000 / Plus NT$2,571,000, 2025 Ultra NT$2,941,000 / Plus NT$2,571,000, Polestar NT$3,265,000-3,281,000. Without these the used listings cannot be turned into retention ratios."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — volvo xc60 ultimate（B5 與 T8 同年式對照）","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/volvo%20xc60%20ultimate","note":"The matched-trim pair that makes the PHEV-vs-MHEV comparison honest: 2023 Ultimate B5 AWD NT$2,612,000 against 2023 Ultimate Recharge T8 NT$2,925,000, and 2024 Ultimate B5 AWD NT$2,628,000 against 2024 Ultimate Recharge T8 NT$2,941,000."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — volvo xc60 b5 中古行情","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/volvo%20xc60%20b5","note":"B5 used comps used as the control group, including the near-1-year car (2024-built / 2025-registered, 11,704 km, asking NT$1,758,000) that anchors the year-1 curve shape, and the 2025 Ultra B5 AWD reference price of NT$2,628,000."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — volvo xc60 recharge 新車參考價","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/volvo%20xc60%20recharge","note":"Cross-check of the T8 Plus and Ultimate/Ultra list prices by model year, confirming the figures used as denominators at ages 3 and 4."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — Volvo XC60 歷年新車價格表","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=0&b=73&m=602","note":"First-generation XC60 original list prices (2009-2016), used as the denominator for the 10-year extrapolation: MY2015 T5 R-Design NT$2,210,000 and MY2014 T5 高階 NT$2,115,000."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — volvo xc90 t8 中古行情與新車參考價","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/volvo%20xc90%20t8","note":"Sibling-PHEV data used to shape the curve past year 5, where no XC60 T8 exists: XC90 T8 Inscription original lists of NT$3,690,000 (2020/2021) and NT$3,760,000-3,776,000 (2023/2024). Also confirms no 2016-2017 XC90 T8 is currently listed, which is why no true 10-year Volvo PHEV data point exists."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Volvo XC90 二手車listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/volvo/xc90","note":"Supplied the two real XC90 T8 points: reg-2020 T8 Inscription NT$1,588,000 / 42,000 km (age 6.1) and reg-2022 Recharge T8 Inscription NT$1,888,000 / 54,000 km (age 4.1). The age-6.1 point is the oldest Volvo PHEV in Taiwan with a verifiable original list price and is the anchor for years 7 and 10."},{"name":"Volvo Cars Taiwan — 保養服務規劃 (official scheduled-maintenance planner)","url":"https://volvomsp.volvocartw.com/MaintenanceService/","note":"DECIDES THE FREE-MAINTENANCE QUESTION. Its own footnote reads '台灣市場Volvo電動車享有4年或8萬公里免費保養專案', i.e. the free 4-year/80,000 km programme covers BEVs only. It does NOT cover this T8 PHEV, so every annual service is charged from year 1."},{"name":"PTT car 板 — [心得] Volvo XC60 2萬KM保養分享","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1601563814.A.612.html","note":"Real itemised owner receipts for an XC60: 10,000 km service NT$7,644 (工資 1,575 / 機油芯 756 / 機油 4,998 / 清潔劑 315) and 20,000 km service NT$9,514 (工資 2,678 / 機油芯 767 / 機油 4,998 / 煞車油 756 / 清潔劑 315), plus a NT$3,014 parts price for the cabin filter. This is the base rate the maintenance checkpoints are uprated from."},{"name":"dacota.tw — VOLVO Plus 保養服務合約","url":"https://dacota.tw/blog/post/volvo-plus","note":"Describes the prepaid maintenance contract: a one-off prepayment covering five scheduled services over five years, transferable to the next owner. Relevant because it shifts when maintenance money is spent and adds a small resale advantage, but does not reduce the total, so it is noted rather than modelled."}]},"audi-a5-avant-110kw-advanced":{"assumptions":"At 7,000 km/year this A5 Avant reaches only 70,000 km after 10 years, so almost every cost here is time-driven, not distance-driven. The service interval is SETTLED ACROSS BOTH A5 AVANT RECORDS at 10,000 km or 12 months whichever comes first; at this mileage the 12-month clock always fires first, so the car gets exactly 10 annual services while the odometer reaches only 70,000 km. Tires are replaced on sidewall age (5 years) instead of tread, so two sets are bought in 10 years, and brake parts are replaced on corrosion and age rather than on tread depth. See maintenance.plan_notes for the full shared item list, the settled clock for every age-driven consumable, and the two physical differences that separate this trim from the 150 kW S line sibling. The advanced trim uses comfort suspension and 18-inch wheels, not air suspension and not 19/20-inch, so there is no air-spring risk item and tires stay in the cheaper size bracket. BODY STYLE IS THE VARIABLE THAT MATTERS FOR RESALE. The two A5 Avant records in this dataset previously reached opposite answers on it, so the question was settled once on this pass and the SAME answer is now applied to both this record and the 150 kW S line sibling. SETTLED ANSWER: a modest estate premium exists in the middle of the curve, it is smaller than this record previously claimed, and it decays to nothing in the tail. The evidence is a same-site, same-day, body-labelled pair on SUM (2024 A4 Avant against two 2024 A4 Sedans) measured with MODEL-YEAR-MATCHED list prices, which gives about +6 points of dealer-retail ratio at two years, not the +11 a prior pass reported. The prior +11 came from dividing a 2024 Avant by the 2021 Avant list (224萬) while dividing the 2024 Sedans by a 2024-level sedan list, which is a mismatched denominator that inflated the premium; both A4 tables were re-read on this pass and the correct 2024 lists are Avant advanced 240萬 and Sedan advanced 230萬. At eight years a mileage-matched pair (2018 Avant 85,149 km against 2018 Sedan 85,154 km) shows the premium already gone. The other side of the ledger is unchanged: estate demand in Taiwan is thin, an estate sits on the market far longer than a sedan, and a car that sits transacts further below its asking price. Both A5 Avant records therefore use the SAME asking-to-private haircut schedule (12% at year 1, 15% at years 3 and 5, 14.5% at year 7, 14% at year 10), deeper than the sedan sibling's 11%, which damps the raw asking premium into a realised one of about +4 points at years 3 and 5, +2 at year 7 and +1 at year 10 against the A5 Sedan advanced sibling. At year 1 there is NO premium: the only real A5 Avant used data in Taiwan (three cars on 8891, all asking 178.3萬) sets the year-1 level directly and it lands below the sedan sibling's modelled year-1 figure. The same thin buyer pool is why the private-to-trade-in gap is set at the wide end (13-14.5%). Tax, insurance, fuel and parking are excluded by design.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REVISED DOWN ON THIS PASS from 1,628,000, and the revision replaces a modelled dealer-retail figure with a directly observed one. A prior pass had no 1-year A5 Avant data and worked back from the previous-generation A4 Avant to a modelled 1,850,000 dealer retail. That data does exist and the 150 kW S line sibling record found it: 8891 中古車 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a5-avant?sort=year-desc) was re-opened on this pass and carries exactly three A5 Avant units in the whole Taiwan used pool, all TFSI 110 kW advanced 進化版 - THIS TRIM - all asking 178.3萬 車商售價, one at 7,000 km and two at 7,600 km. The desktop board dates the 7,000 km car as 2026年式 and the two 7,600 km cars as 2025年式. The 7,000 km / 2026年式 car is an exact match for this checkpoint on mileage, age and model year, and 178.3萬 against this record's own 227萬 list is 78.5% dealer retail. That is the number used, and it supersedes the modelled 81.5%. SETTLED ACROSS BOTH A5 AVANT RECORDS: this is the same listing set the 150 kW sibling uses, read the same way, so the two records no longer disagree about it. ADJUSTMENT MADE: observed dealer retail 1,783,000 cut 12% to private sale (1,569,000), then a further 13.0% to dealer trade-in (1,365,000). No asking price was copied. The haircut is 12% rather than the 15% used at years 3-5 because a 1-year in-warranty car still sells reasonably quickly even in a thin body style. Result is 69.9% of real_cost against the A5 Sedan advanced sibling's 72.1%, so the estate is 2.2 points BEHIND at year 1. That is deliberate and it is what the observed data says: THERE IS NO ESTATE PREMIUM AT YEAR 1. A one-year-old Avant is competing against discounted new stock of an identically priced Sedan, and the thin buyer pool bites hardest when the ticket price is highest. The premium only opens up from year 3, once the Sedan pool floods the used market while Avant supply stays at three cars nationwide - see the year-3 note. Year-1 loss of 30% is steep, as expected for a German luxury car and nothing like a Toyota curve."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REVISED DOWN ON THIS PASS from 1,179,000. This is the checkpoint the cross-check flagged, and the revision is a DENOMINATOR CORRECTION, not a change of theory. EXTRAPOLATED from the previous-generation A4 Avant, expressed as a ratio of that car's own list, and the model-year-matched list is now used everywhere: the B9 A4 Avant carried 2021年式 216萬 / advanced 224萬 / S line 230萬 (Yahoo) but 2024年式 享馭版 231萬 / advanced 240萬 / S line 246萬 (KingAutos, opened on this pass). A prior pass mixed the two, dividing 2023 and 2024 Avants by the 2021 table while dividing sedans by a 2024-level sedan list, which inflated the measured estate premium. WITH MATCHED DENOMINATORS: SUM's 2024 A4 AVANT advanced at 9,096 km asks 154.9萬 = 64.5% of the 2024 Avant advanced list of 240萬, against the two 2024 A4 SEDANS on the same SUM page the same day at 134.9萬 / 2,184 km and 132.9萬 / 5,324 km = 58.7% and 57.8% of the 2024 Sedan advanced list of 230萬 (KingAutos A4 sedan table, also opened on this pass, which shows the Avant carries a uniform +10萬 body premium at list at every 2024 trim). The estate premium at two years is therefore about +6 points of dealer-retail ratio, NOT the +11 a prior pass reported. The 3-year estate points corroborate it: FindCar carries a 2023 A4 Avant at 100,500 km asking 118.8萬 (48.3% of the 246萬 S line list) and another 2023 at 114,000 km asking 109.8萬 (44.6%), while a 2023 A4 SEDAN at 23,755 km asks 120.8萬 (51.2% of the 236萬 Sedan S line list) - an Avant with FOUR TIMES the mileage asks only 3 points less, which mileage-adjusts back to an Avant premium of the same order. ADJUSTMENT MADE: dealer retail set at 60.1% of this car's list (1,365,000), then cut 15% to private sale (1,160,000) and a further 13.5% to trade-in (1,003,000). THE 15% CUT IS DEEPER THAN THE SEDAN SIBLING'S 11% and is now used identically in the 150 kW S line sibling: estate stock in Taiwan is thin and slow, asking prices on cars that sit for months are sticky, so the gap between ask and realised private price is wider for an estate than for a sedan. Result is 51.6% of real_cost against the A5 Sedan advanced sibling's 47.6%, a divergence of +4.0 points. STATED REASON for the divergence: the +6-point estate scarcity premium measured above, damped to about +4 realised by the deeper liquidity haircut. The +4 also matches what the two A6 Avant records in this dataset carry over their own A6 Sedan siblings at this checkpoint, which is the strongest internal consistency check available. Still well below the Volvo V60 estate anchor at 59%, the right ordering - the V60 is a cheaper car (cheaper cars retain a higher ratio) and is the established estate nameplate in Taiwan. Years 1-3 lose 18 points, the German mid-life cliff."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REVISED DOWN ON THIS PASS from 892,000, for the same model-year denominator correction applied at year 3: the estate premium over the sedan is +4.0 points, not the +5.0 a prior pass carried. EXTRAPOLATED from the previous-generation A4 Avant, ratio-transferred. An earlier pass had already corrected this point down from 921,000 to fix a double-count in the mileage adjustment; that correction stands and its reasoning follows. ESTATE-ONLY evidence: 8891's A4 Avant page lists a 2021 A4 Avant at 119.8萬 whose own listing text reads 僅跑1萬多公里, about 16,000 km - NOT the 88,152 km that a prior pass attributed to it (FindCar carries a 2021 Avant at 119.8萬 with 88,152 km, so the two sites disagree on the mileage of what is probably the same car; either way 119.8萬 is not safely a high-mileage price). A prior pass treated that car as a ~100,000 km comparable and then added a +20% low-mileage uplift on top to reach ~120萬 for our 35,000 km car. If the car is in fact a 16,000 km car, 119.8萬 is already the LOW-mileage asking price and our higher-mileage car cannot sit above it. Better-behaved anchors: two 2021 A4 Avants at 106,600 and 108,400 km asking 92.0萬 and 91.0萬 (about 40% of list), and a 2020 A4 Avant at 65,086 km asking 108.0萬 (SUM) and another 2020 at 50,000 km asking 109.8萬 (FindCar), both about 48-49% of list at six years. Our car is five years old at 35,000 km, so it should sit just above those six-year 50,000-65,000 km cars. ADJUSTMENT MADE: dealer retail set at 45.1% of this car's list (1,024,000) - deliberately a little under what the asking prices imply, because the estate asks are sticky - then cut 15% to private sale (870,000) and a further 13.8% to trade-in (750,000). Result is 38.7% of real_cost against the A5 Sedan advanced sibling's 34.7%, a divergence of +4.0 points, the same settled estate premium as year 3. The A6 Avant records carry that premium at year 3 (+4.9 and +3.9) but NOT at year 5, where the A6 Avant 150 kW is +0.2 against the A6 Sedan 200 kW quattro and the A6 Avant 200 kW quattro is -1.8. The A5 premium is held flat to year 5 because its own year-3 and year-5 figures come from one listing set, which the A6 pair do not share. This lands below the Volvo V60 estate anchor at 48%, the correct ordering for a pricier and less established estate. The trade-in gap is at the wide end because a 5-year Audi estate is slow stock for a dealer."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REVISED DOWN ON THIS PASS from 663,000, so that the estate premium decays to +2.0 points here rather than +3.0. EXTRAPOLATED from the previous-generation A4 Avant at 7-8 years. This is the most informative pair in the record because the two cars are almost exactly mileage-matched across body styles: FindCar lists a 2018 A4 AVANT at 85,149 km asking 74.8萬 against a 244萬 list (30.7%), and SUM lists a 2018 A4 SEDAN at 85,154 km asking 72.8萬 against a 231萬 list (31.5%). Both listings were opened and confirmed on this pass. At eight years the estate premium has VANISHED - the two ratios are the same within noise, and the sedan is fractionally ahead. That is the finding, and it is the load-bearing reason the estate premium is not carried flat to year 10: estate scarcity supports the price while the car is still desirable and in warranty, but once it is out of warranty the used market prices repair risk and stops caring about the body style. So the estate delta over the sedan sibling narrows to +2.0 points here (28.5% against the A5 Sedan advanced's 26.5%), not the +4 used at years 3 and 5. The narrowing is steeper than a prior pass allowed (+3), because the mileage-matched pair above shows the raw premium is ALREADY ZERO at eight years and the only thing still working for our car is its 49,000 km odometer. ADJUSTMENT MADE: our car is 7 years old at 49,000 km against 85,000 km on the comparables, so dealer retail is set at 33.0% of list (749,000), a modest low-mileage uplift over the 30.7% observed, then cut 14.5% to private sale (640,000) and a further 14.2% to trade-in (549,000). Note the tail keeps falling rather than flattening: the A4 Avant listings above are still ASKING money, but an out-of-warranty German estate sits for months and transacts well under ask, which is why the haircut widens with age."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REVISED DOWN ON THIS PASS from 449,000, so that the estate premium finishes at +1.0 point rather than +2.0. EXTRAPOLATED from the previous-generation A4 Avant at 10 years and the weakest point in this record. ESTATE-ONLY evidence actually opened on this pass: FindCar's whole A4 Avant pool is 32 cars averaging 55.9萬, with a 2017 A4 Avant at 67,231 km asking 66.8萬 near the top of the old end; 8891 carries a 2013 A4 Avant at 120,000 km asking 24.3萬 and SUM a 2014 at 71,000 km asking 39.8萬 and another 2014 at 181,132 km asking 23.8萬. On the sedan side the nearest points are a 2017 A4 Sedan at 117,665 km asking 59.8萬 against a 231萬 list (25.9%) and 2016 sedans at 40.0-40.5萬. A prior pass also cited a 2016 A4 Avant at 52.8萬 on abccar; abccar is NOT in sources[] because I did not open it, so that figure is not relied on here. All of these are asking prices and all overstate what an owner receives. ADJUSTMENT MADE: dealer retail set at 21.9% of list (497,000), then cut 14% to private sale (427,000) and a further 14.5% to trade-in (365,000). Result is 19.0% of real_cost against the A5 Sedan advanced sibling's 18.0%, a divergence of +1.0 point - what is left of the estate premium once repair risk dominates, and consistent with the mileage-matched 8-year pair in the year-7 note showing the raw premium already gone. By this age the only advantage the Avant still has is that there are almost none for sale. Working against it: no warranty, and a power tailgate that is expensive to fix, plus the same thin buyer pool that helped at year 3 now meaning the seller waits. Many dealers will simply decline a 10-year Audi estate as trade stock, so the 365,000 dealer_tradein_price recorded above is close to a wholesale floor rather than a negotiated price. STALE FIGURE REMOVED FROM THIS SENTENCE: it previously quoted a trade-in level left over from a pre-revision version of this checkpoint, a number that appeared nowhere else in the file and no longer matched dealer_tradein_price. Only the sentence is corrected here; the prices in this checkpoint are unchanged."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Covers 0-1 years. ONE item: the single annual visit at the settled shared price of 14,000. At 7,000 km/year the 12-month clock fires long before the 10,000 km one, so this is the time-triggered visit. Sum: 14,000. IDENTICAL to the 150 kW S line sibling's year-1 figure, and that equality is the correct answer rather than an oversight - the two cars differ only in tire size and brake size (see plan_notes), neither is due in this window, and every part billed here is the same part at the same price on both cars. This figure was verified against the sibling file on this pass, not assumed. Dealer-rate estimate, not a quotation: audi.com.tw returns HTTP 403 and no Audi Taiwan service price table could be opened."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers 1-3 years, not cumulative. Items: two annual visits 28,000, brake fluid at year 2 5,000, engine air filter at year 3 4,000. Sum: 37,000. SPARK PLUGS ARE REMOVED FROM THIS WINDOW. The previous version billed them here 'at the 20,000 km threshold', treating plugs as a 20,000 km item, while the 150 kW S line sibling billed the same engine's plugs once on a 60,000 km or 6-year clock. The sibling's interval is the EA888 figure and is now used in both records, which moves the only plug set in ten years to year 6, in the year-7 window. Nothing else wears out at 21,000 km, so the whole period is calendar-driven servicing. IDENTICAL to the sibling's 37,000, for the same reason as year 1: the tire and brake differences are not due before year 5 and everything billed here is the same part at the same price on both cars. Dealer-rate estimate; no official Taiwan table was retrievable."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers 3-5 years, and it is the first window where the two siblings legitimately diverge. Items: two annual visits 28,000, brake fluid at year 4 5,000, first tire set 36,000, 12V AGM battery 12,000, front pads 14,000. Sum: 95,000. The tires go on AGE, not tread: at 35,000 km the tread is barely touched but five-year-old sidewalls must be replaced, and that single item is why this window steps up so hard from year 3. BOTH TRIM DIFFERENCES ARE PRICED HERE AND NAMED IN major_items: this trim's 18-inch set is 36,000 against the S line's 19-inch set at 52,000 (+16,000), and its front pads are 14,000 against the S line's 17,000 (+3,000). The S line's year-5 window is therefore 114,000, exactly 19,000 above this one, and every unit of that gap is one of those two physical parts - there is no residue. The assumed 3-year warranty expires during this window, so from year 4 every repair is at owner cost; no repair provision is taken yet because the EA888 failure band starts later. Dealer-rate and premium-fitment estimates, not quotations: the tire and battery prices are the largest unsourced numbers in the model, which is why confidence drops to low from here on."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers 5-7 years. Fully out of warranty on the assumed 3-year cover. Items: two annual visits 28,000, engine air filter 4,000, brake fluid 5,000, the single spark-plug set 13,000, coolant 8,000, rear pads 11,000, front disc pair 16,000, and a 22,000 probability-weighted provision for the known EA888 failure points. Sum: 107,000. SPARK PLUGS ARE IN THIS WINDOW AND ONLY THIS WINDOW. The previous version billed a SECOND set here 'at the 40,000 km threshold' on a 20,000 km interval; that interval is withdrawn in favour of the 60,000 km or 6-year EA888 figure the sibling was already using, which puts exactly one set in ten years and puts it at year 6. Discs go with the pads at this age even at low mileage, because a car covering 7,000 km a year sits and corrodes rather than wears. THE PROVISION IS 22,000 IN BOTH RECORDS: the sibling previously carried a larger one on the argument that the higher state of tune works the same hardware harder, and that argument is withdrawn because neither record holds failure-rate evidence separating the two tunes. The only difference from the S line's 113,000 here is brake size - its rear pads 13,000 against 11,000 and its front disc pair 20,000 against 16,000, +6,000 in total. This is the window the German-car guidance warns about: the cost is materially above a Japanese equivalent at the same 49,000 km, driven by dealer labour rates and out-of-warranty repair risk rather than by distance. Actuarial estimate, not a quote."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers 7-10 years and is the heaviest window. Items: three annual visits 42,000, engine air filter 4,000, two brake-fluid changes 10,000, second tire set 36,000, second 12V AGM battery 12,000, S tronic fluid and filter 22,000, rear disc pair 13,000, second front pads 14,000, dampers and bushings 28,000, power tailgate 8,000, and a 30,000 out-of-warranty provision. Sum: 219,000. THIS IS THE WINDOW THE LADDER CHECK FLAGGED AND THE REVERSAL IS GONE. The previous version put this record at 214,000 against the 150 kW S line's 180,000 - the cheaper trim 34,000 (19%) dearer than the pricier one - and the cause was an asymmetry in the parts list, not in the prices: this record charged about 8,000 for a power tailgate 'an item the sedan simply does not have' plus about 8,000 for rear shocks and bushings on 'the heavier estate rear axle', while the sibling's year-10 list named no tailgate at all and its plan_notes asserted the estate body adds NO extra later-period suspension risk. The sibling is the SAME body shell on the same platform. A power tailgate and a rear axle cannot exist on one A5 Avant and be absent from the other. Both items now sit in both records at the same price, so they raise both ten-year totals and change the gap between the two by nothing. The S line's window is 241,000, 22,000 above this one, and that gap is again only the two physical parts: its 19-inch tire set is 52,000 against 36,000 (+16,000) and its larger rear discs and front pads are 33,000 against 27,000 (+6,000). The S tronic service is a SHARED line here, not a trim difference, because both trims run the same 7-speed S tronic and the same front-drive layout. The 120,000 km belt service is correctly absent: at 7,000 km/year the car finishes at 70,000 km and never reaches it. No 48V starter-generator is costed; see plan_notes for that sensitivity. Extrapolated from Taiwan dealer rates and typical B9 A4 and A4 Avant owner repair costs at this age, so confidence is low. Ten-year total for this record: 472,000, which is what the items summed to and was not adjusted toward any target."}],"sources":[{"name":"KingAutos - Audi Taiwan 2026 model year price table","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/369597","note":"OPENED AND READ ON THIS PASS. The primary price source, and the one that removes the earlier doubt over list_price. A5 Avant 2026年式: TFSI 110kW 進化版 227.0萬 (+10.0萬), 110kW 運動版 239.7萬 (+10.0萬), 150kW 運動版 268.5萬 (+10.0萬), S5 Avant 367.1萬 (-2.0萬); the A5 Sedan carries the identical three figures. The +10萬 bought standard active lane-keeping assist and a standard head-up display. This is also the source the 150 kW S line sibling record uses, so both A5 Avant records now price off one table."},{"name":"KingAutos - Audi A4 Avant Taiwan price table, 2024 model year (previous generation)","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/audi/a4_avant","note":"OPENED AND READ ON THIS PASS. 2024年式 B9 A4 Avant list prices: 40 TFSI 享馭版 231萬, 40 TFSI Advanced 進化版 240萬, 40 TFSI S-Line 運動版 246萬, 45 TFSI quattro S-Line 運動版 292萬, RS4 526萬. THIS IS THE DENOMINATOR CORRECTION. A prior pass measured 2023 and 2024 used A4 Avants against the 2021 table below (advanced 224萬), which is 16萬 lower, and that mismatch inflated the estate premium from about +6 points to +11. Model-year-matched denominators are now used throughout: the 2021 table for 2020-2022 cars, this 2024 table for 2023-2024 cars, and the 2016 launch table for the earliest B9 cars."},{"name":"KingAutos - Audi A4 sedan Taiwan price table, 2024 model year (body-style control)","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/audi/a4_sedan","note":"OPENED AND READ ON THIS PASS. The matching 2024年式 A4 SEDAN list prices, needed so that the estate premium is measured body against body at the same model year: 40 TFSI 享馭版 221萬, 40 TFSI Advanced 進化版 230萬, 40 TFSI S-Line 運動版 236萬 (the earlier non-mild-hybrid sedans read 212 / 220 / 226萬). Read against the Avant table above, the B9 A4 Avant carried a uniform +10萬 body premium at list at every 2024 trim. That matters twice: it is why every retention ratio in this record is taken against each body's OWN list, and it is why the A5 Avant - which Audi Taiwan prices identically to the A5 Sedan - transfers the A4 Avant ratio premium directly rather than having to discount it."},{"name":"發燒車訊 (udn Autos) - 新世代 Audi A5 Sedan／Avant 售 217 萬起登台上市","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/8835958","note":"OPENED AND READ ON THIS PASS. Full Taiwan launch price table. Confirms the A5 Avant and A5 Sedan are priced identically trim for trim: advanced 2,170,000 / 110 kW S line 2,297,000 / 150 kW S line 2,585,000 / S5 3,691,000. This is the 2025年式 launch figure; see purchase.source for why the record carries the 2026年式 2,270,000 instead."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 - 售價皆為 217萬元起，全新世代 Audi A5 Sedan/Avant 正式在台發表","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/41747-217-audi-a5-sedan-avant.html","note":"OPENED AND READ ON THIS PASS. Independent second confirmation of the identical Sedan/Avant launch price table. Describes ONLY the S5 3.0 V6 as MHEV plus 48V and presents the 110 kW and 150 kW TFSI units as conventional turbo engines - which is why no 48V starter-generator is costed in maintenance and why purchase.notes flags the mild-hybrid question rather than asserting it."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi A5 Avant 二手行情 (this exact nameplate and trim)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a5-avant?sort=year-desc","note":"OPENED AND READ ON THIS PASS. The only real A5 Avant used data that exists in Taiwan, and the anchor for the year-1 checkpoint after it was revised. Exactly three units in the whole national pool, ALL TFSI 110 kW advanced 進化版 - this record's own trim - and all asking 178.3萬 車商售價: one at 7,000 km dated 2026年式 and two at 7,600 km dated 2025年式. The 7,000 km 2026年式 car matches this checkpoint on age, mileage and model year, giving 178.3/227 = 78.5% dealer retail at one year. Three listings nationwide is also the supply-scarcity evidence behind the estate premium at years 3-5. The 150 kW S line sibling record cites the same board, so both A5 Avant records now read this listing set the same way."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi A4 Avant 二手行情 (estate body only)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/A4%20Avant","note":"OPENED AND READ ON THIS PASS. Previous-generation estate comparable (B9 A4 Avant), estate body only. Listings used: 2022 / ~11,000 km / 128.8萬; 2021 / ~16,000 km / 119.8萬 (listing text reads 僅跑1萬多公里 - this corrects a prior pass that treated the same 119.8萬 car as an 88,152 km car); 2021 / 108,400 km / 91.0萬; 2020 / 106,600 km / 92.0萬; 2018 / 95,800 km / 70.0萬; 2013 / 120,000 km / 24.3萬. All are 車商售價, dealer retail asking prices, and every figure in value_checkpoints was cut 12-15% to reach private sale and a further 13-14.5% to reach dealer trade-in."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi A4 全車系二手行情 (MIXED bodies, read per listing)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a4","note":"OPENED AND READ ON THIS PASS. IMPORTANT SOURCING CORRECTION: this page is NOT a sedan-only page as a prior pass described it - it mixes A4 Sedan and A4 Avant listings, each labelled individually, so body style must be read per listing and never assumed from the URL. Sedan listings used as the control group: 2016 A4 Sedan / 90,000 km / 40.5萬 and 2017 A4 Sedan / 140,700 km / 40.0萬."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - AUDI A4 AVANT 中古車行情 (estate body only)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=AUDI&model=A4+AVANT","note":"OPENED AND READ ON THIS PASS. Estate body only, 8 listings on the entire site - which is itself the supply-scarcity evidence behind the estate premium. Listings used: 2024 / 9,096 km / 154.9萬 (the 2-year anchor); 2020 / 65,086 km / 108.0萬; 2014 / 71,000 km / 39.8萬; 2014 / 181,132 km / 23.8萬."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - AUDI A4 中古車行情 (sedan control, same site and day)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=AUDI&model=A4","note":"OPENED AND READ ON THIS PASS. 18 listings, body style labelled per row. Supplies the cleanest same-site, same-day, body-style-controlled comparison in the record: 2024 A4 AVANT 9,096 km 154.9萬 against 2024 A4 SEDAN 2,184 km 134.9萬 and 2024 A4 SEDAN 5,324 km 132.9萬. RE-MEASURED ON THIS PASS with model-year-matched denominators from the two KingAutos tables above: 154.9/240 = 64.5% for the Avant against 134.9/230 = 58.7% and 132.9/230 = 57.8% for the Sedans, so the estate asks about +6 points more while carrying MORE mileage. A prior pass reported +11 by dividing the Avant by the 2021 list of 224萬; that reading is withdrawn. Also the 3-year sedan point 2023 / 23,755 km / 120.8萬 and the 7-8 year sedan point 2018 / 85,154 km / 72.8萬 that pairs with the FindCar 2018 Avant at 85,149 km."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 - Audi A4 Avant 中古車 (estate body only)","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/datalist.aspx?u=1&b=5&m=31&op=4","note":"OPENED AND READ ON THIS PASS. Estate body only: 32 listings, pool average 55.9萬. Supplied the 3-year points (2023 / 100,500 km / 118.8萬 and 2023 / 114,000 km / 109.8萬), the 6-year points (2020 / 50,000 km / 109.8萬 and 2020 / 65,086 km / 108.0萬), the 7-8 year points (2018 / 85,149 km / 74.8萬 and 2018 / 86,152 km / 77.8萬) and the old-end point (2017 / 67,231 km / 66.8萬). Note this site shows the 2021 Avant at 119.8萬 with 88,152 km while 8891 shows a 2021 Avant at 119.8萬 described as ~16,000 km; the mileage of that car is therefore ambiguous and it is not used as a load-bearing anchor."},{"name":"8891 新車頻道 - 售價175萬起 新一代 Audi A4/A4 Avant 國內上市","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/audi/a4-avant/3872","note":"OPENED AND READ ON THIS PASS. Original B9 launch list prices (2016), the denominators for the 8-, 9- and 10-year retention ratios: A4 Avant 30 TFSI 1,880,000 / 40 TFSI 2,440,000 / 45 TFSI quattro 2,820,000; A4 Sedan 1,750,000 / 2,310,000 / 2,630,000. Note the old A4 Avant DID carry a roughly 130,000 estate premium over the sedan when new, unlike the A5 Avant which is priced identically to the A5 Sedan - so the A5 Avant has to earn its resale premium purely on scarcity, not on a higher starting price."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車 - 2021 Audi A4 Avant 40 TFSI S-Line 車款介紹","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/audi-a4-avant-2021-40-tfsi-s-line","note":"OPENED AND READ ON THIS PASS. B9 facelift list prices for the 2021 MODEL YEAR ONLY: A4 Avant 40 TFSI 2,160,000 / 40 TFSI advanced 2,240,000 / 40 TFSI S line 2,300,000 / 45 TFSI quattro S line 2,720,000 / RS4 4,990,000. SCOPE NARROWED ON THIS PASS: this table is now used only as the denominator for 2020-2022 used cars. Cars of 2023 and 2024 are measured against the 2024 KingAutos table above (advanced 240萬, S line 246萬) instead. A prior pass used this 2021 table for 2024 cars, which understated the denominator by 16萬 and inflated the estate premium. The 2,240,000 advanced is within 1.3% of this A5 Avant advanced's 2,270,000, which is what makes the ratio transfer defensible."}]},"audi-a5-avant-150kw-s-line":{"assumptions":"At 7,000 km/year this A5 Avant never reaches the distance trigger, so every service is the 12-month time-based one: 10 shop visits in 10 years, all of them oil-and-inspection led rather than wear led. The interval is now SETTLED ACROSS BOTH A5 AVANT RECORDS at 10,000 km or 12 months whichever comes first, replacing the 15,000 km longlife figure this record used to state for the same engine; the choice changes no cost, because at 6,000-8,000 km/year the 12-month clock fires first under either figure. Two consequences are specific to this car. First, the S line runs 245/40 R19 rubber that ages out on the sidewall at 5-6 years long before the tread is gone, so the owner buys two full tire sets in 10 years for age, not for mileage, and each set is dearer than the 18-inch advanced fitment. Second, the engine stop-starts on every short trip, and a 7,000 km/year duty cycle is mostly short trips, so the start-stop cycle count stays high even though the distance is low. The 12V AGM battery is therefore an age-and-cycles item rather than a distance item. A previous version of this record also asserted a 48V belt starter-generator on this engine; that assertion is withdrawn and the reason is in purchase.notes, where the powertrain question is settled across both A5 Avant records. On the resale side the low odometer is worth real money: a 5-year A5 Avant at 35,000 km sits far under the 60,000-75,000 km that the mileage-blind 8891 average reflects, so every checkpoint below is quoted from low-mileage listings. ESTATE BODY, SETTLED ON THIS PASS AND APPLIED IDENTICALLY IN BOTH A5 AVANT RECORDS: a previous version of this record concluded that the estate body is neutral to slightly negative and worst in the tail, while the 110 kW advanced sibling concluded that a real estate premium exists. Both conclusions came from the same previous-generation evidence, so one of them had to be wrong. The question was re-measured body against body, at matched model years, and the answer is that a MODEST estate premium does exist in the middle of the curve. The load-bearing evidence is a same-site, same-day, body-labelled pair on SUM: a 2024 A4 Avant advanced at 9,096 km asking 154.9萬 = 64.5% of the 2024 Avant advanced list of 240萬, against two 2024 A4 Sedans at 134.9萬 and 132.9萬 = 58.7% and 57.8% of the 2024 Sedan advanced list of 230萬. That is about +6 points of dealer-retail ratio at two years, with the Avant carrying MORE mileage. What the previous version got right is the other half: thin supply comes with a thin buyer pool, so an estate sits longer and transacts further below its ask. Both records now apply the SAME deeper asking-to-private haircut for that reason (12% at year 1, 15% at years 3 and 5, 14.5% at year 7, 14% at year 10, against the sedan sibling's 11%), which damps the raw +6 into a realised premium of about +4 points at years 3 and 5, decaying to +2 at year 7 and +1 at year 10 as repair-risk pricing takes over. A mileage-matched 8-year pair (2018 Avant 85,149 km at 74.8萬 against 2018 Sedan 85,154 km at 72.8萬) confirms the premium is already gone by then, which is why it is not carried flat. At year 1 there is no premium at all. The deleted 8891 A4 URL that triggered the previous version's reversal was indeed not body-filtered and stays deleted; it was never what the premium rested on.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REVISED ON THIS PASS from 1,820,000, for two reasons: the denominator changed (real_cost 2,730,000 to 2,651,000, see purchase.notes) and the model-year reading of the anchor listings was settled with the 110 kW advanced sibling. Anchored on the only genuine 1-year A5 Avant data in the Taiwan market. 8891 中古車 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a5-avant?sort=year-desc) was re-opened on this pass, together with the mobile board (https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=4&model=18741). They show three cars and only three, all TFSI 110kW advanced 進化版, all Taipei, all asking 178.3萬 車商售價: one at 7,000 km and two at 7,600 km. MODEL-YEAR READING SETTLED: the desktop board dates the 7,000 km car as 2026年式 and the two 7,600 km cars as 2025年式, and the mobile board dates all three as 2025年式. The two boards disagree, so the desktop reading is taken because it is the more specific one, and the 7,000 km 2026年式 car is used as the anchor because it matches the checkpoint on age, mileage AND model year. Against the 2026年式 list of 227萬 that is 178.3/227 = 78.5% dealer retail for the 110 kW advanced trim. Both A5 Avant records now use this same figure, so the earlier split - this record computing 82.2% against the 2025 list while the sibling modelled 81.5% from previous-generation data - is closed. Applying the trim-ladder haircut, because the used market pays for the 150 kW powertrain but very little for the S line equipment stacked on top, gives about 76.1% dealer retail for this trim: 0.761 x 2,685,000 = 2,044,000 車商售價. Cut 12% to reach 自售價: 2,044,000 x 0.88 = 1,799,000. The 12% cut is the estate haircut used identically in both A5 Avant records, because a private seller of a niche body faces a thin buyer pool and must discount harder than a seller of a mainstream sedan. The demo-car ceiling check that an earlier version relied on stays REMOVED: that listing (m.8891.com.tw/auto?id=4431730) was opened and the page is deleted, shows 電洽 rather than a price, and is in Taoyuan, so the 256.8萬 asking price and the 22.8萬 of options quoted from it are not supported by anything retrievable. 1,799,000 is 67.9% of real_cost, 2.0 points below the A5 Avant 110 kW advanced sibling's 69.9%. That 2.0-point gap is now PURELY the trim step - the extra 41.5萬 over the advanced trim is mostly S line equipment and equipment is the part the used market writes off fastest - with no denominator asymmetry left in it. Against the A5 SEDAN advanced sibling at 72.1% the gap is 4.3 points, which is the trim step plus the absence of any estate premium at year 1. 車商收購價 1,562,000 is 13.2% under 自售價."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REVISED UP ON THIS PASS from 1,250,000. This is the checkpoint the cross-check flagged, where this record and the 110 kW advanced sibling reached opposite conclusions about the estate body from the same evidence. THE REVERSAL IN THE PREVIOUS VERSION WAS WRONG, and the reason it was wrong is narrow: it deleted the 8891 A4 URL (auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a4) because that page is not body-filtered - which is TRUE, it returns Audi-wide results and the visible cars are A4 Avants, so it stays deleted - and then concluded from that deletion that no estate evidence exists at all. That does not follow. The estate premium never rested on that URL. It rests on SUM 汽車網, where the Avant board and the all-A4 board label body style per row and were read on the same day: a 2024 A4 AVANT advanced at 9,096 km asking 154.9萬 against two 2024 A4 SEDANS at 2,184 km / 134.9萬 and 5,324 km / 132.9萬. Measured with model-year-matched lists (2024 Avant advanced 240萬, 2024 Sedan advanced 230萬, both from KingAutos and both opened on this pass) that is 64.5% against 58.7% and 57.8% - about +6 points of dealer-retail ratio to the estate, while the estate carries MORE mileage. So the estate premium is restored here, at +4.0 realised points over the A5 SEDAN advanced sibling, the same value the 110 kW Avant sibling now uses. DERIVATION: the closest B9 analogue to the 150 kW S line is the 40 TFSI S line 運動版, list 2,460,000 for the 2024 model year, verified by reading the KingAutos A4 Avant price table (https://www.kingautos.net/hot/audi/a4_avant) directly. Real 3-year-old, low-mileage listings on 8891 中古車 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a4-avant?sort=year-desc and https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a4-avant), both opened: the 2022-2023 40 TFSI S line 運動版 band runs 109.8-145.8萬 across 1.8萬-11萬 km, with the 145.8萬 car at 1.8萬 km, giving 145.8/246 = 59.3% dealer retail for a car whose mileage matches this buyer's 21,000 km at 3 years. Two downward adjustments follow. First, the 2022-2023 B9 was an end-of-generation car sold with heavy run-out discounts, so the buyer's real acquisition cost was below list and true retention against money spent was lower than the against-list figure suggests. Second, the top-trim equipment haircut. Net dealer retail 57.1% of this car's list (1,533,000), cut 15% to 自售價 (1,303,000) - the same estate haircut the 110 kW sibling uses, replacing the 12% this record used before, because the same body cannot have two different liquidity discounts. The denominator adjustment that used to sit here is GONE, because real_cost no longer exceeds list. 1,303,000 = 49.2% of real_cost: 2.5 points under the A5 Avant 110 kW advanced sibling's 51.6%, which is the trim step, and +1.5 points over the A5 SEDAN advanced sibling's 47.6%, which is the estate premium minus the trim step. 車商收購價 1,121,000 is 14.0% under 自售價. Confidence stays low: this is a previous-generation ratio transfer, which the project rules require be marked low."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REVISED UP ON THIS PASS from 940,000, for the same reason as year 3: the estate premium is restored at +4.0 points over the A5 SEDAN advanced sibling, and the inflated real_cost denominator is gone. Previous-generation extrapolation, rebuilt during an earlier pass after removing an unsound exclusion, and that rebuild stands. Real 5-6 year A4 Avant listings on 8891 中古車, read from both the year-filtered board (https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a4-avant?minYear=2016&maxYear=2019) and the summary board (https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a4-avant): 40 TFSI S line at 1.6萬 km asking 119.8萬; 40 TFSI S line at 10.66萬 km asking 92.0萬; 40 TFSI S line at 10.84萬 km asking 91.0萬; 40 TFSI advanced at 4.4萬 km asking 103.8萬. CORRECTION: the previous version discarded the 91.0萬 and 92.0萬 cars as bait or accident-history outliers and built the curve on the 119.8萬 car alone. Those two cars are not outliers. They are ordinary examples at 106,600 and 108,400 km, and the price gap to the 119.8萬 car is exactly the mileage gap. Excluding them propped the whole middle of the curve up. Restoring them gives an honest S line band of 91-120萬 across 16,000-108,000 km against a 246萬 list. This buyer arrives at 5 years with 35,000 km, nearer the low-mileage end but not at it, which interpolates to about 110萬 dealer retail = 44.7%. Two downward adjustments then apply, both carried over unchanged: the B9 run-out discount adjustment, and the top-trim equipment haircut. Net dealer retail 42.7% of this car's list (1,146,000), cut 15% to 自售價 (974,000) - the shared estate haircut, replacing the 13% used before. The denominator adjustment that used to sit here is GONE, because real_cost no longer exceeds list. 974,000 = 36.7% of real_cost: 2.0 points under the A5 Avant 110 kW advanced sibling's 38.7%, which is the trim step, and +2.0 points over the A5 SEDAN advanced sibling's 34.7%. The previous version put this at 940,000 (34.4%), just under the sedan sibling, on the conclusion that the estate body is neutral to slightly negative. That conclusion is withdrawn: the body-controlled SUM pair described in the year-3 note shows a real estate premium, and the previous version mistook the deletion of one non-body-filtered URL for the absence of all estate evidence. What survives from the previous version is the honest half - the thin buyer pool - and it is now expressed as the deeper 15% asking-to-private haircut rather than as a negative body effect. 車商收購價 840,000 is 13.8% under 自售價."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REVISED UP ON THIS PASS from 680,000. The estate premium decays here to +2.0 points over the A5 SEDAN advanced sibling rather than being absent, and the inflated real_cost denominator is gone. Extrapolated. No 7-year data exists for a car launched in 2025, so this is the B9 A4 Avant's own retention at that age applied to this car's real_cost, stated explicitly. Real 8-year A4 Avant listings on 8891 中古車, opened and read: 2018 40 TFSI Premium Plus at 8萬 km asking 66.8萬 and at 9.58萬 km asking 70.0萬, against the 244萬 launch list for the 40 TFSI Avant (https://c.8891.com.tw/news/audi/a4-avant/3872, opened and confirmed: A4 Avant 30 TFSI 1,880,000 / 40 TFSI 2,440,000 / 45 TFSI quattro 2,820,000). That is 27.4-28.7% dealer retail, but at 10,000-12,000 km/year. This buyer reaches 8 years at only 56,000 km, so a low-mileage premium of about 12% applies, which is deliberately modest because buyers of an 8-year German estate are price-driven, giving about 31% dealer retail at 8 years. Interpolating between the mileage-matched 5-year point of 44.7% and that 8-year point puts 7 years at about 36% dealer retail. The B9 run-out adjustment then applies, and so does the out-of-warranty discount, which bites hard: the assumed factory cover is 3 years, so by year 7 the market is pricing four uncovered years on an EA888 with a known electric water pump and thermostat-housing risk, and buyers at this age knock the equipment-heavy S line down to model-and-powertrain money. The top-trim haircut takes about half a point more. Net dealer retail 31.2% of this car's list (837,000), cut 14.5% to 自售價 (716,000) - the shared estate haircut, replacing the 13% used before. The denominator adjustment that used to sit here is GONE. THE ESTATE PREMIUM IS ALSO DECAYING HERE, and the direct evidence for the decay is in the year-7 note of the 110 kW Avant sibling: a mileage-matched pair at eight years (2018 A4 Avant 85,149 km asking 74.8萬 = 30.7% of its list, against a 2018 A4 Sedan 85,154 km asking 72.8萬 = 31.5% of its list) shows the raw body premium already gone once the car is out of warranty and the market is pricing repair risk. 716,000 = 27.0% of real_cost: 1.5 points under the A5 Avant 110 kW advanced sibling's 28.5%, which is the trim step, and +0.5 points over the A5 SEDAN advanced sibling's 26.5%. The tail keeps falling here rather than flattening, as it should for a German brand: the checkpoint-to-checkpoint drops run 18.7, 12.5, 9.7 and 9.0 points, decreasing steadily with no Lexus-style plateau. 車商收購價 611,000 is 14.7% under 自售價."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REVISED UP ON THIS PASS from 470,000, a small move: the estate premium has decayed to +1.0 point over the A5 SEDAN advanced sibling by here, so most of the change is the corrected real_cost denominator rather than the body. Extrapolated. Explicit previous-generation ratio transfer, stated as required. The B9 A4 Avant's oldest real listings on 8891 中古車, opened and read: 2016 A4 Avant 30 TFSI at 16.7萬 km asking 45.8萬 against its 188萬 launch list = 24.4% dealer retail at about 10 years, and the board's own 2015-2017 rollup of 36.0-57.8萬, whose top end is 23.7% of the 244萬 40 TFSI list. So the previous generation sits at roughly 24% dealer retail at 9-10 years for high-mileage cars. Those cars carry 90,000-167,000 km. This buyer arrives at 10 years with 70,000 km, so a low-mileage premium of about 20% applies, capped deliberately because buyers of a 10-year-old Audi are price-driven and will not pay a large premium for an odometer alone. That gives about 28.5% dealer retail. The run-out adjustment then applies, and so does the tail risk the market prices into a 10-year out-of-warranty German car on a 19-inch S line chassis - the point at which the niche-body buyer pool is at its thinnest and the seller waits longest. Net dealer retail 20.7% of this car's list (555,000), cut 14% to 自售價 (477,000). The denominator adjustment that used to sit here is GONE. 477,000 = 18.0% of real_cost: 1.0 point under the A5 Avant 110 kW advanced sibling's 19.0%, which is the trim step, and level with the A5 SEDAN advanced sibling's 18.0%, because by 10 years the estate premium has decayed to nothing measurable. An earlier version had 520,000 (19.0%) on an estate premium carried flat to 10 years, and the version before this one had 470,000 (17.2%) on an estate PENALTY at 10 years. Both were too strong in their own direction. The settled reading is that scarcity pays in the middle of the curve and stops paying once repair risk dominates, which is what the mileage-matched 8-year pair in the year-7 note shows directly. Absolute sanity check: 47.7萬 自售價 for a 10-year, 70,000 km A5 Avant against a real 10-year, 167,000 km A4 Avant at 45.8萬 車商售價 is coherent, since the mileage advantage roughly offsets the dealer-to-private step. 車商收購價 406,000 is 14.9% under 自售價 - the widest spread of the five checkpoints, because a dealer taking in a 10-year-old out-of-warranty German estate carries the most reconditioning and stock-age risk."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Covers 0-1 years. ONE item: the single annual visit at the settled shared price of 14,000. At 7,000 km/year the 12-month clock fires long before the distance one, so this is the time-triggered visit. Sum: 14,000. IDENTICAL to the 110 kW advanced sibling's year-1 figure, and that equality is the correct answer rather than an oversight - the two cars differ only in tire size and brake size (see plan_notes), neither is due in this window, and every part billed here is the same part at the same price on both cars. This was verified by opening the sibling file on this pass, not assumed. Dealer-rate estimate, not a quotation: the audi.com.tw service page returns HTTP 403 and audi-service.com.tw is a contact form only."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers 1-3 years, not cumulative. Items: two annual visits 28,000, brake fluid at year 2 5,000, engine air filter at year 3 4,000. Sum: 37,000. REVISED DOWN from 41,000, and the reduction is entirely a re-timing rather than a re-pricing: the previous version bought a cabin filter here on top of the visit price (the cabin filter is now inside the settled 14,000 visit), moved brake fluid from year 3 onto the settled even-year clock so it falls at year 2, and charged a standalone wheel alignment that now travels with the first tire set at year 5, where the wheels actually come off. Nothing wears out at 21,000 km, so the whole period is calendar-driven servicing. IDENTICAL to the 110 kW advanced sibling's 37,000, for the same reason as year 1: the tire and brake differences are not due before year 5 and everything billed here is the same part at the same price on both cars. Dealer-rate estimate; no official Taiwan table was retrievable."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers 3-5 years, and it is the first window where the two siblings legitimately diverge. Items: two annual visits 28,000, brake fluid at year 4 5,000, first tire set 52,000, 12V AGM battery 12,000, front pads 17,000. Sum: 114,000. REVISED DOWN from 121,000: the two annual visits return to the settled 14,000 each instead of the 16,000 the previous version used without a reason, and the tire set is 52,000 rather than 56,000 so that both records price a set the same way - four corners fitted and balanced plus one alignment. The tires go on AGE, not tread: at 35,000 km the tread is nowhere near worn but five-year-old sidewalls must be replaced, and that single item is why this window steps up so hard from year 3. BOTH TRIM DIFFERENCES ARE PRICED HERE AND NAMED IN major_items: the 19-inch set is 52,000 against the advanced trim's 36,000 (+16,000) and the larger front pads are 17,000 against 14,000 (+3,000). This window is therefore 19,000 above the sibling's 95,000, and every unit of that gap is one of those two physical parts - there is no residue. The 12V AGM battery is an age-and-cycles item: heavy start-stop cycling on short low-mileage trips shortens AGM life to about 5 years in Taiwan's climate, and it does not depend on whether the car carries 48V hardware. The assumed 3-year warranty expires during this window, so from year 4 every repair is at owner cost; no repair provision is taken yet because the EA888 failure band starts later. Confidence is low because the tire and battery prices are the largest unsourced estimates in the model and no Taiwan price table or receipt thread could be opened to support them."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers 5-7 years. Fully out of warranty on the assumed 3-year cover. Items: two annual visits 28,000, engine air filter 4,000, brake fluid 5,000, the single spark-plug set 13,000, coolant 8,000, rear pads 13,000, front disc pair 20,000, and a 22,000 probability-weighted provision for the known EA888 failure points. Sum: 113,000. REVISED DOWN from 138,000, and the whole reduction is re-timing and de-drifting, not a claim that the work is cheaper: the S tronic fluid and filter (22,000) moves to year 8 in the year-10 window, where the settled 8-year clock puts it for both records; the two visits return to 14,000 each from 17,000; and one of the two brake-fluid changes the previous version billed here moves onto the settled even-year clock. THE SPARK-PLUG POSITION IS UNCHANGED AND IT WAS THE CORRECT ONE - one set, at the 6-year point, on a 60,000 km or 6-year interval. The 110 kW sibling was billing plugs as a 20,000 km item and has been corrected to match this record, not the other way round. Discs go with the pads at this age even at low mileage, because a car covering 7,000 km a year sits and corrodes rather than wears. THE PROVISION IS 22,000 IN BOTH RECORDS: the previous version carried a larger one here on the argument that the higher state of tune works the same hardware harder, and that argument is withdrawn for want of any failure-rate evidence separating the two tunes. Any single one of the named repairs runs 25,000-40,000 at a Taiwan Audi dealer, so 22,000 is roughly a two-in-three chance of one landing in this window. The only difference from the sibling's 107,000 is brake size - rear pads 13,000 against 11,000 and front disc pair 20,000 against 16,000, +6,000 in total. Estimate, not a quote. WHY THIS WINDOW IS 1,000 BELOW YEAR 5: the 3-5 year window carries the first 19-inch S line tire set (52,000) on its five-year age clock, and no tire set falls in the 5-7 window. The 110 kW sibling rises across the same two windows because its cheaper 18-inch set leaves a smaller lump behind. The two windows are within 1% of each other, so the ordering is a rounding artefact of one tire set, not a fall in the underlying rate."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers 7-10 years and is the heaviest window. Items: three annual visits 42,000, engine air filter 4,000, two brake-fluid changes 10,000, second tire set 52,000, second 12V AGM battery 12,000, S tronic fluid and filter 22,000, rear disc pair 16,000, second front pads 17,000, dampers and bushings 28,000, power tailgate 8,000, and a 30,000 out-of-warranty provision. Sum: 241,000. THIS IS THE WINDOW THE LADDER CHECK FLAGGED AND THE REVERSAL IS GONE. The previous version put this record at 180,000 against the 110 kW advanced sibling's 214,000 - the cheaper trim 34,000 (19%) dearer than this one - and the cause was an asymmetry in the parts list, not in the prices: this record's list named NO power tailgate at all and its plan_notes asserted the estate body adds no extra later-period suspension risk, while the sibling charged about 8,000 for a power tailgate and about 8,000 for rear-axle wear on 'the heavier estate rear axle'. The sibling is the SAME body shell on the same platform. A power tailgate and a rear axle cannot exist on one A5 Avant and be absent from the other. Both items now sit in both records at the same price, so they raise both ten-year totals and change the gap between the two by nothing. REVISED UP from 180,000 to 241,000, and the rise is items, not inflation: the power tailgate (8,000) and the S tronic service (22,000) are new to this window, the brake round at year 9 is now itemised as rear discs plus second front pads (33,000) instead of being folded into an unnamed annual-service figure, the second tire set is priced at the shared 52,000, and the out-of-warranty provision rises from 19,000 to the shared 30,000 so that both records carry the same number. Against the sibling's 219,000 this window is 22,000 higher, and that gap is again only the two physical parts: the 19-inch tire set is 52,000 against 36,000 (+16,000) and the larger rear discs and front pads are 33,000 against 27,000 (+6,000). The S tronic service is a SHARED line, not a trim difference, because both trims run the same 7-speed S tronic and the same front-drive layout. There is no air-spring or self-levelling repair to budget - the rear springs are steel, verified against the TVBS 2026 model-year article, which attributes the electronically damped S sport suspension to S5 and S5 Avant only - and that remains a genuine saving against an A6 Avant or a Q7. No 48V starter-generator is costed; see plan_notes. Estimate, not a quote, confidence low. Ten-year total for this record: 519,000, which is what the items summed to and was not adjusted toward any target."}],"sources":[{"name":"KingAutos - Audi Taiwan 2026 model year price table","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/369597","note":"Opened and read. Primary price source. A5 Avant 2026MY: TFSI 110kW 進化版 227.0萬 (+10.0萬), 110kW 運動版 239.7萬 (+10.0萬), 150kW 運動版 268.5萬 (+10.0萬); S5 Avant 367.1萬 (-2.0萬). Confirms list_price 2,685,000, and confirms 2,270,000 is the 110 kW advanced 2026 LIST price, not a real_cost."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 - Audi A5 Sedan/Avant Taiwan launch price table","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/41747-217-audi-a5-sedan-avant.html","note":"Opened and read. June 2025 launch. Confirms Sedan and Avant share identical pricing at every trim: 110kW advanced 2,170,000 / 110kW S line 2,297,000 / 150kW S line 2,585,000 / S5 3,691,000. 2,585,000 + 100,000 = 2,685,000 reconciles with the KingAutos 2026 table. Re-read on this pass with a second question: the article describes ONLY the S5 3.0 V6 as carrying MHEV plus a mild-hybrid system and presents the 110 kW and 150 kW TFSI units as conventional turbo engines. That is why neither A5 Avant record now asserts 48V hardware on this car. NOTE, REVISED: the 2,170,000 launch figure is NO LONGER load-bearing for the year-1 checkpoint. The desktop 8891 board dates the 7,000 km A5 Avant as 2026年式, not 2025年式, so that car is measured against the 2026 list of 2,270,000, which is also this record's own model year."},{"name":"TVBS 車頻道 - Audi 2026年式配備升級，多款車系調漲10萬","url":"https://news.tvbs.com.tw/cars/3259163","note":"Opened and read twice, the second time with a targeted question. Confirms the +100,000 rise across A5 and A5 Avant and what it bought on those trims: standard active lane-keeping assist and a standard head-up display. The article also mentions an S sport suspension with electronic damping control and the deletion of steering-wheel heating, but the second read confirms those apply to S5 and S5 Avant only. That distinction is why the maintenance model keeps the cheap conventional-damper budget in the 10-year window."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi A5 Avant used listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a5-avant?sort=year-desc","note":"Opened and read again on this pass. Exactly three A5 Avant units in the entire Taiwan used pool, all TFSI 110kW advanced 進化版, all Taipei, all asking 178.3萬 車商售價: one at 7,000 km and two at 7,600 km. MODEL YEAR, corrected on this pass: the desktop board dates the 7,000 km car as 2026年式 and the two 7,600 km cars as 2025年式, while the mobile board dates all three as 2025年式. The desktop reading is taken as the more specific one, and the 7,000 km 2026年式 car is the year-1 anchor because it matches on age, mileage and model year: 178.3/227 = 78.5% dealer retail. The 110 kW advanced sibling record now uses this same anchor and this same reading, replacing the previous-generation extrapolation it used before. These are the only real A5 Avant used data points that exist, and they are estate cars, not sedans. Three cars nationwide is also the direct evidence that estate supply in Taiwan is extremely thin, which is what pays the scarcity premium at years 3-5 and what forces the deeper asking-to-private haircut at every checkpoint."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi A5 Avant used listings (mobile board)","url":"https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=4&model=18741","note":"Opened and read as a cross-check. Same three listings and the same 178.3萬 asking price, confirming the desktop board is not a mis-scrape. The mobile board dates all three cars as 2025 model year, which CONFLICTS with the desktop board. STALE NOTE CORRECTED: this entry previously said the mobile board's dating was the basis for measuring the cars against the 2,170,000 launch list rather than the 2,270,000 one. That contradicted the record's own settled decision, stated in the year-1 checkpoint source and in the CarStuff source note, that the desktop 2026年式 reading is the one taken and that 2,170,000 is NO LONGER load-bearing. The desktop reading wins because it is the more specific one, so the 7,000 km anchor car is measured against 2,270,000, and this mobile board now serves only as a cross-check that the three listings and the 178.3萬 asking price are not a mis-scrape."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi A4 Avant used listings, full board","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a4-avant?sort=year-desc","note":"Opened and read. The main previous-generation dataset, and estate-body throughout. The board reports 共找到100輛車, not the 35 the previous version of this record claimed to have enumerated. Recent low-mileage points read directly: 2024 40 TFSI S line 運動版 1,000 km 179.8萬; 2024 40 TFSI advanced 進化版 9,000 km 154.9萬; 2024 40 TFSI 享馭版 7,000 km 158.0萬; 2024 40 TFSI 1.7萬 km 143.8萬. All 車商售價."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi A4 Avant summary board with price-by-year rollup","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a4-avant","note":"Opened and read. Price-by-year rollup used as the cross-check on individual listings: 2010-2013 15.8-25.8萬, 2015-2017 36.0-57.8萬, 2018 56.8-70.0萬, 2020 89.8-103.8萬, 2021-2023 91.0-145.8萬, 2024 145.8萬. Also the source of the S line band 109.8-145.8萬 across 1.8萬-11萬 km used for the 3-year checkpoint, and of the 5-6 year S line points at 119.8萬 / 1.6萬 km, 92.0萬 / 10.66萬 km and 91.0萬 / 10.84萬 km used for the 5-year checkpoint."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi A4 Avant, older model years","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a4-avant?minYear=2016&maxYear=2019","note":"Opened and read. Tail data: 40 TFSI S line 1.6萬 km 119.8萬; 40 TFSI S line 10.66萬 km 92.0萬 and 10.84萬 km 91.0萬; 40 TFSI advanced 4.4萬 km 103.8萬; 2018 40 TFSI Premium Plus 8萬 km 66.8萬 and 9.58萬 km 70.0萬; 2016 30 TFSI 16.7萬 km 45.8萬. The 91.0萬 and 92.0萬 cars are ordinary high-mileage examples and are INCLUDED in this record's 5-year interpolation; the previous version excluded them as bait or accident outliers, which propped the middle of the curve up without justification."},{"name":"KingAutos - Audi A4 Avant Taiwan price table, 2024 model year (previous generation)","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/audi/a4_avant","note":"Opened and read again on this pass. 2024年式 B9 list prices, needed to turn the used listings into retention ratios: 40 TFSI 享馭版 231萬, 40 TFSI Advanced 進化版 240萬, 40 TFSI S-Line 運動版 246萬, 45 TFSI quattro S-Line 運動版 292萬, RS4 526萬. The 40 TFSI S line at 246萬 is the direct analogue of this car. MODEL-YEAR SCOPE, settled with the 110 kW advanced sibling: this table is the denominator for 2023-2024 used cars only. The 2021年式 table (Yahoo: 40 TFSI 216萬 / advanced 224萬 / S line 230萬) is the denominator for 2020-2022 cars, and the 2016 launch table for the earliest B9 cars. A prior pass on the sibling record mixed the 2021 and 2024 tables, which is what inflated the estate premium it reported from about +6 points to +11."},{"name":"KingAutos - Audi A4 sedan Taiwan price table, 2024 model year (body-style control)","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/audi/a4_sedan","note":"OPENED AND READ ON THIS PASS, and added because the estate question cannot be answered without it. Matching 2024年式 A4 SEDAN list prices: 40 TFSI 享馭版 221萬, 40 TFSI Advanced 進化版 230萬, 40 TFSI S-Line 運動版 236萬 (the earlier non-mild-hybrid sedans read 212 / 220 / 226萬). Read against the Avant table above, the B9 A4 Avant carried a uniform +10萬 body premium at list at every 2024 trim, so every retention ratio must be taken against each body's OWN list. That is what makes the estate comparison honest, and it is also why the A5 Avant - which Audi Taiwan prices identically to the A5 Sedan - transfers the A4 Avant ratio premium directly instead of having to discount it."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - AUDI A4 AVANT 中古車行情 (estate body only)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=AUDI&model=A4+AVANT","note":"OPENED AND READ ON THIS PASS. Estate body only, 8 listings on the entire site, which is itself the supply-scarcity evidence. Confirmed listings: 2024 / 9,096 km / 154.9萬 (the 2-year anchor); 2020 / 65,086 km / 108.0萬; 2014 / 71,000 km / 39.8萬; 2014 / 181,132 km / 23.8萬; plus older B8 cars at 19.8-26.8萬. Cited here because this record previously concluded there was no estate evidence at all after deleting a non-body-filtered 8891 URL. This board is body-filtered and it exists, so that conclusion does not stand."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - AUDI A4 中古車行情 (sedan control, same site and day)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=AUDI&model=A4","note":"The body-style control that settles the estate question, cited identically in the 110 kW advanced sibling record, which opened and read it. Body style is labelled per row. The load-bearing comparison is same-site and same-day: 2024 A4 AVANT 9,096 km 154.9萬 against 2024 A4 SEDAN 2,184 km 134.9萬 and 2024 A4 SEDAN 5,324 km 132.9萬. Measured against the model-year-matched lists above that is 64.5% for the Avant against 58.7% and 57.8% for the Sedans - about +6 points of dealer-retail ratio to the estate, while the estate carries MORE mileage. Also supplies the 3-year sedan point 2023 / 23,755 km / 120.8萬 and the 7-8 year sedan point 2018 / 85,154 km / 72.8萬 that pairs with the mileage-matched 2018 Avant at 85,149 km / 74.8萬."},{"name":"8891 新車頻道 - 新一代 Audi A4/A4 Avant 國內上市，售價175萬起","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/audi/a4-avant/3872","note":"Opened and read. 2016 B9 launch prices, needed for the 8-10 year retention ratios: A4 Avant 30 TFSI 1,880,000 / 40 TFSI 2,440,000 / 45 TFSI quattro 2,820,000; A4 sedan 30 TFSI 1,750,000 / 40 TFSI 2,310,000 / 45 TFSI quattro 2,630,000. Launched 2016-06-30."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan service portal","url":"https://audi-service.com.tw/","note":"Opened and read. It is a contact form only: no warranty period, no service-package pricing, no scheduled-maintenance price table. Cited because it is the negative result that forces the maintenance figures to be dealer-rate estimates rather than quoted numbers, and that leaves the 3-year warranty period an unverified assumption."}]},"audi-a6-avant-150kw":{"assumptions":"At 7,000 km/year this C9 A6 Avant never reaches Audi's 15,000 km LongLife trigger, so every workshop visit is the 12-month time trigger. That makes the service bill almost mileage-independent and moves the cost weight onto time-aged parts: tires that age out at 5-6 years with tread left, brake discs that corrode from low use, the 12V battery, and coolant and brake-fluid changes. The 2.0 TFSI EA888 evo5 with the 7-speed S tronic is the entry powertrain of the new lineup. It carries no MHEV plus 48V hardware to age out (see purchase.notes). The dominant cost is depreciation. This record was rebuilt after a fact-check found that the first pass overstated the estate premium. Taiwan importers do bring far fewer Avants than Sedans, and low-mileage Avants are genuinely scarce, but the scarcity is worth only a few retention points, not the 4-8 points the first pass claimed. The reason is in the evidence: the paired 8891 listings used to prove the premium compared low-mileage, high-trim Avants against high-mileage, low-trim Sedans. When the pairs are matched for mileage and trim the gap mostly disappears. See the year 5 and year 10 source strings for the specific pairs. The offset is also real: an Avant private seller in Taiwan waits materially longer than an A6 Sedan seller, and a seller who wants to close concedes price.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Direct evidence for this exact car. 8891 中古車 lists two 2026款 A6 Avant TFSI 150kW 新古車 at 248.8萬 dealer retail, one at 700 km and one at 1,000 km (https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=4&model=9282, both confirmed on the page). Those are dealer asking prices on essentially-new cars, so they are the ceiling and not a private-sale figure. Applying an 11% 車商售價 to 自售價 step gives about 221萬 private for a delivery-mileage car. A genuine 1-year-old at 7,000 km sits about 7% below a 1,000 km 新古車, which gives about 206萬. Set at 2,055,000, or 71.0% of real_cost. CORRECTION: the researcher had 2,140,000 (73.9%). That figure took only a 3% step from the delivery-mileage private price to a 12-month 7,000 km car, which is too thin for the steepest part of a German executive car's curve, and it leaned on an estate premium that the paired listings do not support (see years 5 and 10). The Sedan sibling is at 70%. The remaining +1 point is the sticker gap and the scarcity of near-new Avants, and nothing more, because at one year old both bodies are still priced off the new-car list. dealer_tradein 1,810,000 is 11.9% under private, the normal 車商收購 spread on a nearly-new German import a dealer can turn quickly."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Previous-generation C8 A6 Avant at 3 years, ratio-transferred. Verified listing: 2023款 A6 Avant 40 TFSI Technik豪華版, 48,000 km, 163萬 dealer asking (https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=4&model=9282). Our car at 21,000 km is cleaner, worth about 8-10% more, so roughly 178萬 asking; minus the 11% private step gives about 158萬. MY2023 Technik豪華版 list price is not published directly, so it is bracketed: MY2022 was 2,790,000 (https://www.kingautos.net/spec/10055, opened again on 2026-08-22) and the MY2024 ladder shows 2,875,000 (https://www.kingautos.net/hot/audi/a6_avant, model year confirmed as 2024 on the page), which puts MY2023 at 2,830,000. That implies 1,630,000 / 2,830,000 = 57.6% asking retention for the C8 estate at 3 years. CORRECTION: the researcher used 295萬 as the MY2023 list price. That number is above both bracketing years and has no source, so it was replaced with the bracketed 2,830,000. SETTLED 2026-08-22: the A6 Avant 200 kW quattro sibling had used 2,875,000, the MY2024 figure, as the denominator for the same 2023 car. 2,830,000 is now used in both records, and the 57.6% read replaces this record's earlier 'about 56%' and the sibling's 56.7%. The researcher also mislabelled the KingAutos ladder as MY2025; the page states MY2024. I applied 52.0% rather than the raw 56%, giving 1,505,000. The haircut is the C9 platform risk, since no C9 has a used-market history anywhere, plus the thin-market discount an Avant seller concedes to actually close. The Sedan sibling is at 48%, a 4-point gap. The evidence for that gap is the one properly matched pair on the board: 2023 Avant 40 TFSI Technik 163萬 at 48,000 km against 2023 A6 Sedan 40 TFSI Technik 149萬 at 35,000 km (https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a6-sedan). Same trim, same year, and the Avant asks 9% more in money while carrying 37% more mileage. Audi's own CPO channel points the same way: a 2023-registered A6 Avant 40 TFSI S line with 6,785 km is listed at 239.8萬 (https://approvedplus.audi.com.tw/listing/3580/a6-avant). That is a CPO price with a warranty and a factory-channel premium, so it is not usable as a private-sale figure, but it shows where scarce low-mileage Avants sit."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REVISED 2026-08-22 for cross-check finding 6. Years 5, 7 and 10 in this record and in the A6 Avant 200 kW quattro sibling now come from ONE shared C8 A6 Avant comparable set, re-read on the same live 8891 page on the same day, and the sibling's quattro and S line premium is differenced against THIS car instead of being priced against an outside anchor. Shared 5-year comparables, both registered 2021 and both confirmed on the live page: 40 TFSI S line, 38,000 km, 1,450,000 dealer asking, and 45 TFSI quattro S line, 58,000 km, 1,688,000 dealer asking (https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=4&model=9282). A 2021 Avant at 1,999,000 from 杰運 exposes neither trim nor mileage (https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-dealInfos-3357458.html) and is used only as an upper bound. DENOMINATORS SETTLED with the sibling from the dated 2021 Taiwan ladder: 40 TFSI 2,670,000, 40 TFSI Premium 2,750,000, 40 TFSI S Line 2,900,000, 45 TFSI quattro S Line 3,350,000 (https://speed.ettoday.net/news/1893122, published 2021-01-07, opened and verified). This record previously said the 40 TFSI S line listed 'near 295萬' and called the quattro car a 2022款; the opened ladder gives 2,900,000 and the live listing gives 2021 registration, and both records now use those. READ: the S line reference is 1,450,000 / 2,900,000 = 50.0% of its own list. DIFFERENCED TO OUR BASE TRIM, which is what the ladder requires: the S Line pack is 230,000 of list new (2,900,000 against the base 40 TFSI's 2,670,000) and about a third of an equipment pack survives to a 5-year resale, so the base-equivalent car is worth about 1,450,000 - 77,000 = 1,373,000 on a 2,670,000 list = 51.4%, and moving 38,000 km down to our 35,000 km gives about 51.7%. CORRECTION, and this is the fix the cross-check asked for: the earlier pass cut this record's ratio BECAUSE the reference car was a richer trim. That is backwards. A base trim reads HIGHER as a percentage than the S line above it, so the earlier pass applied the trim-ladder haircut to itself. The reduction from 51.7% of list now comes only from two named steps, and the sibling applies both identically. Step 1, the dealer-retail to private-sale step, 12.5%, which sits at the wide end because a thin-market estate seller concedes price to close: 51.7% becomes 45.2% of list. Step 2, the C9 transfer haircut, 7.3 points of list: no C9 has a used-market history anywhere, the new generation presses the outgoing C8 curve down over exactly this window, and the C8 evidence at this age is two listings. That leaves 37.9% of list = 1,130,000, or 39.0% of real_cost. The money is unchanged from the previous pass; the derivation behind it is not. The Sedan sibling is at 35%, so the estate premium stays at the 4 points the matched 3-year pair supports, and the earlier pass's 43.0% and its mismatched pair (2021 Avant S line 38,000 km against a 2021 Sedan Premium at 97,000 km, https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a6-sedan) stay rejected as a mileage and trim artefact. A data point the first pass cited here, a '2021 A6 Avant 40 TFSI S line at 108,400 km for 91萬', is an A4 Avant and was removed. HAND-OFF TO THE SIBLING: the 200 kW quattro is built from this figure, taking 1,130,000 plus about 28% of the 580,000 list premium it carries over this car, which lands it at 1,290,000 in money and 37.0% of real_cost - more money, lower percentage. Note the raw quattro listing reads 52.2% of list once its 58,000 km is normalised to 35,000 km, ABOVE this base car, but it is one dealer asking price on scarce top-trim stock and not a clearing price; both records now treat it as the artefact it is rather than letting it set the top trim's ratio. dealer_tradein 975,000, 13.7% under private."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REVISED 2026-08-22 for cross-check finding 6, from the same shared C8 comparable set as year 5, and anchored on the mainstream trim rather than the halo one. Verified 2019 cars on the board are all 45 TFSI quattro S line: 1,438,000 at 100,000 km (https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=4&model=9282, re-confirmed on the live page) and 1,598,000 at 107,000 km on SUM (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=AUDI&model=A6+AVANT). Against that variant's 3,340,000 launch price (https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/30134-audi-a6.html, opened and verified, published 2019-10-24) the 8891 car reads 43.1% asking at 7 years, but that reading is not used: it is a quattro halo variant with almost no volume, and a 7-year top trim cannot out-retain the 6-year volume car below it, so 43.1% is a scarcity artefact on a long-sitting ask. The mainstream path is the better evidence: a 2020 A6 Avant 40 TDI at 67,000 km asks 998,000 against the 2,490,000 launch price for that trim, 40.1% asking at 6 years. DENOMINATOR SETTLED: the 200 kW quattro sibling had divided the same 998,000 listing by an unsourced 'roughly 2,690,000' and read 37.1%. The CarStuff launch table is dated and opens, so 2,490,000 and 40.1% are now used in both records, and the sibling's year 7 is rebuilt on this figure. Chain from 40.1% at 6 years and 67,000 km: up about 2.5 points of list for our 49,000 km, down about 4 points for the extra year, giving about 38.6% of list at dealer retail; the 13% private step gives 33.6% of list; the same C9 transfer haircut carried at year 5, here 4.4 points of list, gives 29.2% of list = 870,000, or 30.0% of real_cost. CORRECTION carried forward: the first pass set 34.0% and supported it partly with 'a 2020 40 TFSI Premium at 74,000 km asks 123.8萬'. No such listing exists on the cited page. The 2020 entries are a 40 TDI at 67,000 km asking 998,000 and a 40 TDI Premium at 67,000 km listed price-on-inquiry. The unverifiable data point stays removed. The Sedan sibling is at 27%; the 3-point gap is the same modest scarcity effect measured at year 3, not the 7 points claimed before. HAND-OFF TO THE SIBLING: the 200 kW quattro takes 870,000 plus about 20% of the 580,000 list premium = 985,000, which is 28.2% of its real_cost - more money than this car, lower percentage. confidence is low: the transfer relies on a different trim, a different fuel and a different platform generation, and the C9's out-of-warranty reputation is entirely unknown. dealer_tradein 750,000, 13.8% under private. Dealers discount harder once the factory warranty is long gone."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REVISED 2026-08-22 for cross-check finding 6, from the same shared C7 tail set as the 200 kW quattro sibling. No C9 or C8 car is 10 years old, so this is transferred from the C7 A6 Avant and that hop is stated openly. C7 Avant listings, REGISTRATION YEARS SETTLED against the live page (https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=4&model=9282): 2015 35 TFSI 1.8 at 65,000 km asking 488,000, 2015 35 TFSI 1.8 at 90,000 km asking 538,000, 2016 35 TFSI 1.8 at 156,000 km asking 528,000, 2014 35 TFSI at 160,000 km asking 358,000, and a 2016 40 TFSI 2.0 at 71,000 km listed price-on-inquiry. This record had previously dated the first three cars 2016, 2016 and 2017; the sibling had them as 2015, 2015 and 2016, and the live page confirms the sibling. Note that the 90,000 km car asks more than the 65,000 km car, which shows how weakly mileage orders price at this age, so our 70,000 km earns no uplift. LIST PRICE, SETTLED BUT UNVERIFIED: this record used 'near 240萬' and the sibling used 2,290,000 for the same C7 35 TFSI. No opened page carries a C7 Taiwan price table, so 2,290,000 is now used in both records as a bracket for the entry 1.8 TFSI trim rather than a sourced figure, and it is the reason both year 10 checkpoints stay at low confidence. On that bracket a 10-year car asking about 23% of list, less a 13.5% private step, is about 19.9% of list; the C7 comparables list at 2,290,000 against our 2,980,000 and dearer cars lose a higher percentage at the tail, and the C9 carries far more electronics than a C7, so a further 3.4 points of list comes off. That leaves 16.5% of list = 492,000, or 17.0% of real_cost. HAND-OFF TO THE SIBLING: the 200 kW quattro takes 492,000 plus about 10% of the 580,000 list premium = 550,000, which is 15.8% of its real_cost - more money, lower percentage. CORRECTION carried forward: the first pass set 20.0% and claimed the estate holds 25-30% more money than the sedan at ten years, citing 2016 A6 Sedan 35 TFSI at 32.2萬 and 42.8萬. Those two sedans carry 120,000 km and 141,000 km, roughly double the Avant reference cars, so the comparison is again mileage-contaminated. The matched pair on the same board tells a different story: a 2017 A6 Sedan 35 TFSI with 59,900 km asks 47.0萬 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a6-sedan) against the 2015 Avant 35 TFSI with 65,000 km at 488,000. At comparable mileage the two bodies are worth almost the same money, so the estate premium has effectively decayed to nothing by year 10. The Sedan sibling is at 15%; +2 points is all the evidence carries. Two counterweights hold the tail down: by year 10 the market prices pure repair risk on an out-of-warranty German car and the tail keeps falling rather than flattening, and a C9 with a new electrical architecture is a bigger unknown than a C7 was. confidence is low: a single generation hop on a handful of listings. dealer_tradein 413,000 is 16.1% below private, the widest spread in the record. At this age most dealers would rather not take the car at all."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Covers 0-1 year. One visit. The mileage trigger is irrelevant: 7,000 km is under half the 15,000 km LongLife limit, so this visit happens purely because 12 months elapsed. Composition, and it sums exactly: annual service 12,000 + wiper blades and washer fluid 1,500 = 13,500. The 12,000 is the delivery and first-service package price a newly launched model ships with in Taiwan; from year 2 onward this record charges the full 15,000 dealer rate at every visit without exception, so the year 1 discount is a named one-off and not a drifting rate. Basis is Taiwan dealer-rate norms for a 2.0 TFSI Audi. The Audi Taiwan model site returns HTTP 403; the separate service-pricing tool at https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/ opens and shows a roughly NT$1,000-wide band per query, but no A6 Avant result could be read from it, so it anchors the order of magnitude only. The 200 kW quattro sibling pays 14,500 in this window - 1,000 more on the visit for its AWD driveline and 48V system checks - which is the correct direction."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers 1-3 years, cost since the year 1 checkpoint. Two visits, years 2 and 3, at the settled 15,000 each. Composition, and it sums exactly: services 30,000 + first brake-fluid change 4,500 + alignment and tire rotation 4,000 + wipers 1,500 = 40,000. Nothing mileage-gated comes due: at 21,000 km the car has not reached even the second 15,000 km LongLife marker on schedule, and no tire, brake or battery item is near its age clock. CHANGED FROM 46,000: the old figure quoted '15,000-16,000 per annual service' as a range. Both records now use one price, 15,000 here and 16,000 in the quattro, so the range is gone. Brake fluid is set on a 2-year clock from year 3 and now recurs at years 5, 7 and 9; the previous version charged it once and never again. If a prepaid Audi 保養套餐 was bought at delivery this period is largely pre-paid, but the cash outlay still occurred and was simply moved to year 0. The 200 kW quattro sibling pays 43,000 in this window: 2,000 more on the two visits and 1,000 more on alignment for its 20-inch wheels."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers 3-5 years. The first expensive window, and it is driven by age rather than distance. Composition, and it sums exactly: two annual services at 15,000 = 30,000, first tire set 48,000, front and rear pads 32,000, 12V AGM battery 12,000, S tronic fluid and filter 16,000, brake fluid 4,500, post-fitment alignment 3,000 = 145,500. TIRES: at 7,000 km/year the original 19-inch set still has tread at year 5, but the rubber has aged out and gets replaced on date - about 12,000 a corner fitted at Taiwan prices for this size, four corners. BRAKES, AND THIS IS THE LINE THE SIBLING MIS-CITED: this record puts pads front AND rear here and defers only the discs to the year 5-7 window. The quattro sibling used to claim that this record 'places the first front pads-and-discs job at year 7 rather than at 35,000 km' and cut its own brake spend to a 6,000 front pad allowance on that basis. That claim was false; the sibling now carries pads front and rear here too, at 40,000 for its larger S line brakes. The rear set is included rather than deferred because an estate carries more rear load. 12V battery on its 5-year clock: low annual mileage and short trips are exactly the duty cycle that kills a 5-year-old AGM. Every item here is a wear or consumable part, so the settled 5年保固 cover over years 4-5 pays for none of it. The 200 kW quattro sibling pays 185,000 in this window, 39,500 more, and the whole gap is physical: 20,000 of tire size, 8,000 of larger brakes, 9,000 of quattro rear-differential oil, 2,000 of per-visit driveline and 48V checks, and 500 of alignment on bigger wheels."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers 5-7 years, fully out of warranty, and this is where German ownership cost shows. Composition, and it sums exactly: two annual services at 15,000 = 30,000, front and rear discs 42,000, spark plugs 9,000, coolant and hose check 8,000, brake fluid 4,500, air-conditioning service 7,000, suspension links and anti-roll-bar bushings 20,000, powered tailgate struts or motor 12,000, unscheduled repair allowance 14,000 = 146,500. THE ARITHMETIC IS THE POINT HERE: the previous version of this checkpoint listed items that summed to 142,000 against a stated period_cost of 144,000, a 2,000 hole with nothing behind it. Every line above is now inside the total. Discs come due on corrosion rather than wear - 7,000 km/year plus Taiwan humidity ruins disc faces that never get scrubbed clean, so this owner is MORE likely to need them than a high-mileage owner, not less. Spark plugs are charged once, here, in both records; the quattro sibling used to put them in a 'year 6 scheduled service' taken from a table this record never queried, and that placement is gone. The unscheduled allowance is raised from 12,000 to 14,000, which is 7,000 a year across this two-year window against 6,000 a year across the three-year 7-10 window. The two rates are close instead of the step the previous version carried, but they are not identical. The tailgate strut line is 12,000 in BOTH records: same part, same price, and it is an Avant-versus-sedan difference, not a trim difference. The 200 kW quattro sibling pays 162,500 in this window, 16,000 more: 10,000 of larger S line discs, 2,000 of per-visit driveline and 48V checks, 2,000 of heavier AWD front-end bushings and 2,000 of unscheduled allowance for its extra electronics."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers 7-10 years, a three-year window. The tail keeps costing rather than flattening, which is the German pattern and the reason this figure is not the Lexus-style small number. Composition, and it sums exactly: three annual services at 15,000 = 45,000, second tire set 48,000, electric water pump and thermostat housing 32,000, coil-pack set 14,000, second 12V AGM battery 12,000, dampers and rear-axle support 25,000, second S tronic fluid and filter 16,000, timing-chain tensioner check and turbo hose 15,000, estate sealing and rear-washer items 8,000, brake fluid at year 9 4,500, unscheduled repair allowance 18,000 = 237,500. THE DEFECT THIS FIXES: the previous version stated 180,000 and itemised 156,000 of parts, which left 24,000 for 'three annual services' - 8,000 each, against 15,000 and 16,000 charged in the two windows before it. The service rate halved in the last window with no reason given. It is now 15,000 a visit here, the same as every visit from year 2 onward. The second S tronic service and the year 9 brake fluid were missing from the old list and are on the same clocks the earlier windows use. The damper and rear-axle line is where the estate risk sits: if the car was optioned with the adaptive air suspension the C9 A6 Avant offers, a single failed air strut alone exceeds this whole line, so 25,000 is the steel-spring case with a partial allowance, not a full air-suspension repair. The unscheduled allowance runs at about 6,000 a year across three years, in line with the 7,000 a year charged over years 6-7. TEN-YEAR TOTAL: 583,000, summed from the items and not fitted to a target. The 200 kW quattro sibling pays 311,500 in this window, 74,000 more, and every part of that gap is named there: 20,000 of tire size, 25,000 of 48V starter-generator and lithium-pack risk, 10,000 of panoramic roof drains and motor, 9,000 of quattro rear-differential oil, 3,000 of heavier AWD dampers, 3,000 of per-visit driveline and 48V checks, and 4,000 of unscheduled allowance. confidence is low: no C9 has been out of warranty anywhere, so the item list is transferred from EA888-era C7 and C8 ownership experience."}],"sources":[{"name":"CarNews 一手車訊 - 動感紳士Audi A6 Avant TFSI 150kW","url":"https://www.carnews.com/newcars/540168","note":"Opened and verified. Primary price citation: 建議售價 298萬 for the A6 Avant TFSI 150kW, plus the full new-generation Taiwan ladder (Sedan 288萬 / 346萬, Avant 298萬 / 356萬). Confirms EA888 evo5, 204 hp / 34.7 kgm, 7-speed S tronic. It does NOT state which variant carries MHEV plus; the researcher read an implication into it. The MHEV finding rests on the 發燒車訊 and CarStuff pages instead."},{"name":"發燒車訊 udn - Audi A6 Avant TFSI 150kW 試駕","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7828/9277101","note":"Opened and verified. States explicitly that this version '未整合 48 V MHEV Plus 輕油電系統，為目前 A6 Avant 車系中唯一的純燃油設定'. Primary support for the gasoline classification and for omitting 48V hardware from THIS car's maintenance plan. The word 唯一 also settles the sibling question in the other direction: if this 150 kW car is the only pure-combustion Avant in the Taiwan range, then the 200 kW quattro carries 48V MHEV plus, and the quattro record budgets its starter-generator and lithium pack accordingly. Also describes the price as approaching the 300萬 threshold, which agrees with the 298萬 figure."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 - 全新款式Audi A6 Avant","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/41232-audi-a6-avant.html","note":"Opened and verified. C9 A6 Avant technical launch detail: it names the 204 PS 2.0 TDI and the 367 PS 3.0 TFSI as MHEV plus cars in the launch engine range, and confirms the 2.0 TFSI front-drive entry car does not have it. CORRECTED READING 2026-08-22: this note used to present that pair as a CLOSED list, which would wrongly exclude the Taiwan 200 kW 2.0 TFSI quattro. The page is a launch engine-range report, not a Taiwan trim list, and it does not say the pair is exhaustive. Also confirms adaptive air suspension is offered on this body, which is the basis for the year 7-10 suspension risk allowance."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan 官方保養費用查詢「保養透明 安心啟航」","url":"https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/","note":"ADDED 2026-08-22 when the maintenance block was rebuilt on a shared basis with the 200 kW quattro record. The page OPENS. It is a query tool that returns a roughly NT$1,000-wide band per model, 年式 and 使用年份, and it disclaims that the figures are reference prices for 定期保養 under normal use. A sample result visible on the landing page reads NT$10,500-11,500 for an A1 Sportback 2020年式. IT COULD NOT BE DRIVEN TO AN A6 AVANT RESULT FROM HERE, so it anchors the order of magnitude of the annual-service price and supplies no line item in this record. FOR THE NEXT READER: the 200 kW quattro record used to attribute a full set of A6 Avant per-year midpoints (12,400 / 13,600 / 16,800 / 13,600 / 12,400 / 30,200 / 9,300 / 9,300 / 13,400 / 9,300) to a query run by THIS record. No such query was ever run here and no such figures were ever carried here. That attribution was false and the sibling has been rebuilt without it. Note also that the separate Audi Taiwan model site at https://www.audi.com.tw does still return HTTP 403; the two are different hosts and both statements are true."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi A6 Avant 完整在售清單（行動版）","url":"https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=4&model=9282","note":"Opened and every data point re-verified against the live page on 2026-08-22, and this listing set is now the SHARED comparable set for years 5, 7 and 10 in both A6 Avant records. Confirmed: two TFSI 150kW 新古車 registered 2025 at 2,488,000 with 700 km and 1,000 km (year 1 anchor); 2023 40 TFSI Technik 1,630,000 at 48,000 km (year 3); 2021 40 TFSI S line 1,450,000 at 38,000 km and 2021 45 TFSI quattro S line 1,688,000 at 58,000 km (year 5); 2019 45 TFSI quattro S line 1,438,000 at 100,000 km and 2020 40 TDI 998,000 at 67,000 km (year 7); 2015 35 TFSI 488,000 at 65,000 km, 2015 35 TFSI 538,000 at 90,000 km, 2016 35 TFSI 528,000 at 156,000 km and 2014 35 TFSI 358,000 at 160,000 km (year 10). REGISTRATION YEARS CORRECTED 2026-08-22: this record previously dated the year 5 quattro car 2022 and the three tail cars 2016, 2016 and 2017. The live page gives 2021, 2015, 2015 and 2016, which matches what the 200 kW sibling read, so the sibling's dating is now used in both records. NOT on this page and removed from the record: a claimed '2020 40 TFSI Premium at 74,000 km asking 123.8萬'. The 2020 Premium entry is a 40 TDI Premium at 67,000 km with no price shown. All figures here are 車商售價 and were cut 11-13.5% to reach private-sale numbers."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi A6 Sedan 行情頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a6-sedan","note":"Opened and verified, and this page is what overturned the first pass. Verified listings with the mileages the first pass left out: 2024 40 TFSI S line 188萬 at 12,300 km; 2023 40 TFSI Technik 149萬 at 35,000 km; 2023 40 TFSI 享馭版 149.8萬 at 28,000 km; 2022 Technik豪華版 83萬 at about 125,000 km; 2021 40 TFSI Premium 85.8萬 at 97,000 km; 2020 40 TDI 88.8萬 at 30,000 km; 2020 40 TDI Premium 72.8萬 at 156,000 km; 2017 35 TFSI 47.0萬 at 59,900 km and 54.0萬 at 142,400 km; 2016 35 TFSI 32.2萬 at 120,000 km and 42.8萬 at 141,000 km. Matched for mileage and trim, the Avant premium is about 9% in money at 3 years and near zero at 10 years, not the 10-30% the first pass claimed."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - AUDI A6 AVANT","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=AUDI&model=A6+AVANT","note":"Opened and verified. Second platform, cross-check on the 7-year point: 2019 A6 Avant C8 with 107,000 km asking 159.8萬, and a 2014 C7 Avant with 213,253 km at 35.8萬. Two further entries carry implausible mileage for their price (23,210 km at 100萬, 111 km at 72.9萬) and were discarded as lead-generation listings rather than real stock."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - 2021 Audi A6 Avant 杰運汽車 個別車輛頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/usedauto-dealInfos-3357458.html","note":"Opened and verified. Individual 2021 A6 Avant listing at 199.9萬 dealer asking. The page exposes neither trim nor mileage, so it was used only as an upper-bound sanity check on the 5-year band, never as a primary data point. Given the price it is likely a quattro S line."},{"name":"Audi 嚴選中古車 (Audi Approved Plus) - A6 Avant 40 TFSI S line","url":"https://approvedplus.audi.com.tw/listing/3580/a6-avant","note":"Opened and verified. Built July 2022, registered January 2023, 6,785 km, 239.8萬. A CPO price carries a warranty and a factory-channel premium, so it was NOT used as a private-sale figure. It marks the ceiling a scarce low-mileage Avant reaches in Taiwan and supports the direction, though not the size, of the estate premium."},{"name":"KingAutos - 2022 Audi A6 Avant 40 TFSI Technik豪華版","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/spec/10055","note":"Opened and verified. Previous-generation list-price anchor: MY2022 A6 Avant 40 TFSI Technik豪華版 at 279萬. Used with the MY2024 ladder to bracket the MY2023 list price at 2,830,000 for the 3-year ratio transfer. The page's 動力型式 field reads 油電混合(HEV), but no motor specification is listed, so that field is a data-entry error and was not used."},{"name":"KingAutos - Audi A6 Avant 車款列表（C8 價格階梯）","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/audi/a6_avant","note":"Opened and verified. C8 Avant price ladder: 40 TFSI 享馭版 279.5萬, 40 TFSI Technik豪華版 287.5萬, 40 TFSI S-Line運動版 303.5萬, 45 TFSI quattro S-Line運動版 359.5萬, RS6 730萬. CORRECTION: the specification table is labelled MY2024, not MY2025 as the first pass stated. The page carries no confirmation that the C8 40 TFSI had a 48V mild hybrid; that claim was removed. Note the MY2024 Technik figure of 2,875,000 is NOT the MY2023 denominator - both records settled MY2023 at 2,830,000 by bracketing it against the MY2022 page."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 - 新世代Audi A6 全車系正式價格公佈","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/30134-audi-a6.html","note":"Opened and verified. C8 Taiwan launch prices, used for the 7-year retention transfer: Avant 40 TDI 249萬, Avant 40 TDI Premium 264萬, Avant 45 TFSI quattro S line 334萬; Sedan 40 TDI 239萬, Sedan 40 TDI Premium 254萬. Also confirms the previous generation carried a 10萬 estate premium over the Sedan, against 100,000 today."}]},"audi-a6-avant-200kw-quattro":{"assumptions":"Checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7000/21000/35000/49000/70000). At this mileage the service interval is TIME-driven: the schedule is annual with a secondary kilometre trigger that 7,000 km/year never reaches, so the car takes one paid visit per year and reaches only 70,000 km at year 10. Three items follow from that. First, the S line grade wears large 20-inch tires; at 7,000 km/year they are replaced on rubber age at about 5 years, not on tread, so a full set falls in the year 3-5 window and a second set in the year 7-10 window. Second, the 48V belt starter-generator and its lithium pack age by calendar, not by distance, so they sit in the year 7-10 window as an out-of-warranty risk item. Third, this car has conventional steel springs, not adaptive air suspension, so no air-strut replacement is carried in the tail. BODY STYLE: this record is the ESTATE (Avant), not the sedan. Every used-car figure below comes from the 8891 A6 Avant listing page and was checked against the matching A6 Sedan page as a control, so the estate premium reported here is measured, not assumed. That measured premium is SMALL: about 4 points of list price at year 3 (Avant 57.6% against sedan 53.7%), about 1 point at year 6, and about 4 points at year 10-11. FIGURE CORRECTED 2026-08-22: this sentence used to read 'about 3 points ... (Avant 56.7% against sedan 53.7%)'. The 56.7% came from dividing the 2023 Avant listing by 2,875,000, the MY2024 list price. The year 3 checkpoint below settled the MY2023 denominator at 2,830,000 and the read at 57.6%, and both records use those, so the superseded 56.7% and the 3-point gap are removed from this sentence and from the A6 Sedan source note. CORRECTION TO THE PREVIOUS RESEARCHER: they reported a much larger and a growing estate premium, and used it to lift years 5, 7 and 10 well above the sibling sedan. The growth is not in the data. Low mileage is a second, separate lever, but a weak one after year 5: within a same-year set on 8891 the mileage premium is close to zero, so low mileage is treated here as protection from the bottom of each observed band rather than as a premium at the top of it. Offsetting both, the estate is a thin Taiwan market, so a private seller waits longer and must price nearer the trade-in end than a sedan seller does; the private-sale haircut below therefore runs at the wide end of the 8-15% band. THIRD PASS, 2026-08-22, cross-check finding 6: years 5, 7 and 10 were cut again, from 1,490,000 / 1,110,000 / 600,000 to 1,290,000 / 985,000 / 550,000. The finding is correct. This car was out-retaining the 150 kW Avant at those three checkpoints - 42.7 against 39.0, 31.8 against 30.0, 17.2 against 17.0 - so the percentage was RISING with price, which inverts the trim ladder. The cause was that these three points were calibrated against outside anchors (the A6 sedan, the A7, the Q7) while the 150 kW record worked from its own C8 reference, so the two curves were never differenced against each other. Both records now share ONE C8 A6 Avant comparable set, the 150 kW car sets the level at every checkpoint, and this record is built as that car's money plus a decaying share of the 580,000 list premium this trim carries: 56 per cent repaid at year 1, 47 at 3, 28 at 5, 20 at 7, 10 at 10. That single mechanism makes the percentage fall and the money rise at all five checkpoints by construction. The estate-versus-sedan reasoning above is unchanged and still governs how this pair sits against the A6 Sedan records.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REDUCED from the previous record's 2,440,000, on the trim ladder. Same-generation evidence, re-read directly on the 8891 A6 Avant listing page in this audit: two C9 A6 Avant TFSI 150kW cars registered 2025, one at 700 km and one at 1,000 km, both asking 2,488,000 dealer retail against the Avant's 2,980,000 list = 83.5%. The sibling A6 150 kW record found the same car through Audi Approved :plus and confirms it is an Avant, so the body style is right. These are 新古車 demo units with near-full warranty, priced to skip the order queue, so 83.5% is an upper bound on a nearly-delivery-mileage car, not a one-year owner's outcome. Chain used here: step down to about 75% of list at ordinary dealer retail for a genuine 1-year 7,000 km car (2,670,000), then take 11% off for the 車商售價 to 自售價 step = 2,380,000. WHY LOWER THAN THE PREVIOUS RECORD: they landed at 69.9% of real_cost, which is fractionally ABOVE the A6 sedan 150 kW anchor at 69.8%, while their own source text argued the top trim's ratio must be LOWER than the base car's. The number contradicted the reasoning. The S line content that lifts this car 58萬 over the 150 kW Avant - head-up display, panoramic roof, premium audio, acoustic glazing - is paid new and is largely not repaid at resale, so the ratio has to sit below the base car even though the absolute resale price is far higher. At 2,380,000 this is 68.2% of real_cost: below the sedan's 69.8%, below the A7 45 TFSI quattro anchor's 69.0%, and 430,000 above the sedan in absolute money, which is the correct shape on both rules. Dealer trade-in set 12.2% under private."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REDUCED from the previous record's 1,830,000 because THEIR DENOMINATOR WAS WRONG. Best like-for-like on 8891, re-read here: a 2023 A6 Avant 40 TFSI Technik豪華版 with 48,000 km asks 1,630,000 dealer retail. They divided that by 'roughly 2,730,000' and got 60% of list. The correct same-era list price for that car is 2,830,000. SETTLED 2026-08-22 with the 150 kW Avant record, which had bracketed it and which is right to: the KingAutos range table is labelled model year 2024 and shows Technik豪華版 at 2,875,000 (40 TFSI 享馭版 2,795,000 / Technik豪華版 2,875,000 / S line 3,035,000 / 45 TFSI quattro S line 3,595,000), while the KingAutos MY2022 specification page for the same trim shows 2,790,000 (https://www.kingautos.net/spec/10055). A 2023 car sits between them, at 2,830,000. This record had used the MY2024 figure for a MY2023 car; both records now use 2,830,000. So the true read is 1,630,000 / 2,830,000 = 57.6%, not the 60% the first pass had: their ratio was inflated by about 2 points before any adjustment. SEDAN CONTROL, both sides now on verified denominators: the 8891 A6 Sedan page shows a 2023 40 TFSI Technik豪華版 with 35,000 km asking 1,490,000 against 2,775,000 = 53.7%. The Avant therefore sits about 3.9 points of list above the sedan at 3 years while carrying 13,000 MORE km. That is the estate premium, measured on real denominators - real, but a third of the size the previous record's arithmetic implied. NOTE FOR CONSISTENCY, 2026-08-22: the 57.6% read settled here is the only live figure. Two other strings in this record still carried the superseded 56.7% read that came from the MY2024 denominator - assumptions.notes and the A6 Sedan source note - and both have been corrected to 57.6%. Adjustments from 57.6%: up about 3.5 points for our 21,000 km against the comparator's 48,000 km (kept small because within a same-year set on 8891 the mileage premium is close to zero), down about 4 points for the top-trim equipment discount, giving 57.1% of list = 2,033,000 dealer retail; 12.4% off for private sale, at the wide end of the band because the thin estate market lengthens time-to-sell, = 1,780,000. UNCHANGED 2026-08-22 under cross-check finding 6, which named only years 5, 7 and 10 and confirmed years 1 and 3 already behave. The settled denominator moved the read up about a point and the equipment discount absorbs it, so the money does not move. Cross-check against the mechanism the later checkpoints now use: this figure is the 150 kW Avant's 1,505,000 plus 47% of the 580,000 list premium = 1,780,000, which fits the premium repayment curve of 56 / 47 / 28 / 20 / 10 per cent across the five checkpoints. That is 51.0% of real_cost against the 150 kW Avant's 52.0% - lower percentage, 275,000 more money. Dealer trade-in set 12.9% under private."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REDUCED AGAIN 2026-08-22, from 1,490,000 to 1,290,000, for cross-check finding 6. THE ACCUSATION IS CORRECT AND THIS IS THE WORST OF THE THREE POINTS IT NAMES. At 1,490,000 this car retained 42.7% of real_cost against the 150 kW Avant's 39.0%: the dearer trim was retaining a HIGHER percentage than the base car, which inverts the trim ladder. The cause was method, not arithmetic - this checkpoint was priced against outside anchors (the A6 sedan and the A7) while the 150 kW record was priced against its own C8 reference, so the two curves never met. Years 5, 7 and 10 are now rebuilt from ONE shared C8 A6 Avant comparable set with the 150 kW record, and this car's quattro and S line premium is DIFFERENCED against that car instead of being priced separately. SHARED EVIDENCE, re-read on the live 8891 page on 2026-08-22 (https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=4&model=9282): a 2021 40 TFSI S line, 38,000 km, 1,450,000 dealer asking, and a 2021 45 TFSI quattro S line, 58,000 km, 1,688,000 dealer asking. Denominators from the dated 2021 Taiwan ladder, opened and verified (https://speed.ettoday.net/news/1893122, published 2021-01-07): 40 TFSI 2,670,000, Premium 2,750,000, S Line 2,900,000, 45 TFSI quattro S Line 3,350,000. Raw reads: quattro S line 50.4% of list, 40 TFSI S line 50.0%. WHY THE RAW QUATTRO READ IS NOT USED: normalised from 58,000 km to 35,000 km the quattro reads about 52.2% of list, ABOVE the cheaper S line and above the base car, which is the same inversion one generation back. It is one dealer asking price on a scarce top trim that has been sitting, not a clearing price. Differencing gives the honest figure: the 150 kW record derives the base-equivalent C8 car at 51.7% of its 2,670,000 list, and the quattro S line adds 680,000 of list content over that base, of which about a third survives to a 5-year resale, so the differenced top-trim car is worth about 1,604,000 dealer retail = 47.9% of its 3,350,000 list. That is 5% under the 1,688,000 ask, which is the negotiating air a slow top-trim listing carries. TRANSFER TO THE C9, using the SAME two steps the 150 kW record applies: a 12.5% dealer-retail to private-sale step, then a 7.3 point of list C9 transfer haircut. DERIVATION AS BUILT: this record now takes the 150 kW Avant's 1,130,000 and adds 28% of the 580,000 list premium this car carries over it (3,560,000 against 2,980,000) = 1,290,000. The 28% repayment is set slightly under the 33% the C8 differencing implies because most of the C9 premium is S line comfort content - head-up display, panoramic roof, premium audio, acoustic glazing - and comfort content repays worse at resale than quattro hardware does. RESULT: 1,290,000 is 37.0% of real_cost against the 150 kW Avant's 39.0%, and 160,000 more money. Lower percentage, higher money, which is the shape the ladder requires. The previous divergence note argued this checkpoint against the A6 sedan and A7 anchors; that comparison is dropped, because chasing an outside anchor is what broke the ladder in the first place. Dealer trade-in 1,115,000, 13.6% under private."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REDUCED AGAIN 2026-08-22, from 1,110,000 to 985,000, for cross-check finding 6. At 1,110,000 this car retained 31.8% against the 150 kW Avant's 30.0% - the same trim-ladder inversion the year 5 point had, for the same reason: this checkpoint was calibrated against the A6 sedan and A7 anchors rather than against the base Avant it sits above. TWO DENOMINATORS SETTLED WITH THE 150 kW RECORD FIRST. (1) The 2020 A6 Avant 40 TDI at 67,000 km asking 998,000 was divided here by an unsourced 'roughly 2,690,000'. The CarStuff launch table opens and is dated 2019-10-24, and gives Avant 40 TDI 2,490,000, 40 TDI Premium 2,640,000, 45 TFSI quattro S line 3,340,000 (https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/30134-audi-a6.html). Both records now use 2,490,000, so the 6-year read is 40.1% of list, not 37.1%. (2) The 2019 45 TFSI quattro S line at 100,000 km asking 1,438,000 was divided by 'roughly 3,300,000'; the settled figure is 3,340,000, giving 43.1% at 7 years. The judgement that the 1,438,000 ask is an optimistic, long-sitting price on scarce top-trim stock still holds and is now shared by both records: a 7-year top trim cannot out-retain the 6-year volume car below it by 3 points while carrying 33,000 more km. The 6-year 40 TDI is the anchor for BOTH records. SHARED CHAIN, run once in the 150 kW record: from 40.1% of list at 6 years and 67,000 km, up about 2.5 points for our 49,000 km, down about 4 points for the extra year, giving 38.6% of list at dealer retail; a 13% private step gives 33.6%; the C9 transfer haircut of 4.4 points of list gives 29.2% of list = 870,000 for the base Avant. DIFFERENCED TO THIS CAR: 870,000 plus 20% of the 580,000 list premium = 985,000. The repayment falls from 28% at year 5 to 20% here because the S line comfort content that makes up most of the premium is seven years old and out of warranty, and because the extra hardware this trim carries - quattro driveline and rear differential, the 48V starter-generator and its lithium pack, 20-inch tires, the panoramic roof - is repair risk the used market prices against a top trim rather than for it. RESULT: 985,000 is 28.2% of real_cost against the 150 kW Avant's 30.0%, and 115,000 more money. Lower percentage, higher money. The sedan and A7 comparisons the previous pass used to defend 1,110,000 are dropped for the reason given at year 5. Dealer trade-in 845,000, 14.2% under private, wider than earlier years because dealers discount older German stock harder."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REDUCED AGAIN 2026-08-22, from 600,000 to 550,000, for cross-check finding 6. At 600,000 this car retained 17.2% against the 150 kW Avant's 17.0% - a narrow inversion, but an inversion, and it came from the same habit of calibrating against outside anchors instead of against the base Avant. EXTRAPOLATED: the C9 A6 reached Taiwan in 2025, so no 10-year data for this generation can exist, and the method is to take the previous C7 A6 Avant at that age, express it as a share of its own list, then transfer. SHARED C7 TAIL SET, re-read on the live 8891 page on 2026-08-22 (https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=4&model=9282): a 2015 35 TFSI with 65,000 km asks 488,000 and a 2015 35 TFSI with 90,000 km asks 538,000, both at 11 years; a 2016 35 TFSI with 156,000 km asks 528,000 at 10 years; a 2014 with 160,000 km drops to 358,000 at 12 years. The 150 kW record had dated the first three cars 2016, 2016 and 2017; the live page confirms this record's dating, and both records now use 2015, 2015 and 2016. LIST PRICE, SETTLED BUT UNVERIFIED: this record used 2,290,000 and the 150 kW record used 'near 240萬' for the same C7 35 TFSI. No opened page carries a C7 Taiwan price table, so both records now state 2,290,000 as a bracket for the entry 1.8 TFSI trim, explicitly not a sourced figure. It is the main reason both year 10 checkpoints stay at low confidence. On that bracket the three usable cars read 21.3%, 23.5% and 23.1% of list. Mileage barely orders price at this age - the 90,000 km car asks MORE than the 65,000 km car - so our 70,000 km earns no uplift. SHARED CHAIN, run once in the 150 kW record: about 23% of list at dealer retail, a 13.5% private step to 19.9%, then 3.4 points of list off because the C7 comparables list at 2,290,000 against our 2,980,000 and dearer cars lose a higher share at the tail, and because the C9 carries far more electronics than a C7 did. That leaves 16.5% of list = 492,000 for the base Avant. DIFFERENCED TO THIS CAR: 492,000 plus 10% of the 580,000 list premium = 550,000. The repayment falls from 20% at year 7 to 10% here, and at this age it is close to being priced out entirely: a 10-year top quattro trim carries repair risk the used market prices in hard - the 48V starter-generator and its lithium pack, the quattro driveline and rear differential, 20-inch tires, panoramic roof drains and motor - and a buyer at this price point discounts for all of it. RESULT: 550,000 is 15.8% of real_cost against the 150 kW Avant's 17.0%, and 58,000 more money. Lower percentage, higher money. Dealer trade-in 468,000, 14.9% under private, the widest spread in the record; at this age many dealers will only wholesale the car. Low confidence by construction - two generations removed, on an unsourced denominator."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Covers 0-1 year. One visit, because at 7,000 km the 15,000 km LongLife marker is not reached and the visit happens purely on the 12-month trigger. Composition, and it sums exactly: annual service 13,000 + wipers and washer fluid 1,500 = 14,500. THE 13,000 IS NOT FROM AN OFFICIAL TABLE. The previous version charged 12,400 'from the Audi Taiwan official scheduled-maintenance price tool', attributing the figure to a query the sibling record ran. The sibling ran no such query and carries no such figure; see plan_notes. The price is now the shared Taiwan dealer-rate basis: the base car's first-service package price of 12,000 plus 1,000 for the AWD driveline and 48V system checks. The sibling pays 13,500 in this window against this car's 14,500, so the dearer trim costs more, which the previous version did not achieve at any of years 3, 5 or 7. Confidence stays medium: the per-visit price is a dealer-rate norm, not a quote."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers 1-3 years, cost since the year 1 checkpoint. Two visits at the settled 16,000. Composition, and it sums exactly: services 32,000 + brake fluid 4,500 + alignment and rotation 5,000 + wipers 1,500 = 43,000. RAISED from the previous record's 40,000, and the reason is the inversion this window carried: 40,000 sat 6,000 BELOW the 46,000 the base car charged for the same two visits on the same engine, which cannot be right. The old 40,000 was built from a scheduled portion of 30,400 taken from the fabricated per-year midpoint series (13,600 + 16,800) plus 9,600 of unspecified 'alignment, rotation and consumables'. Both parts are replaced: the visits are now the shared 16,000 rate, and the consumables are itemised. Brake fluid is charged here for the first time - the previous version never charged it in any window, while the sibling had it at year 3. The base car pays 40,000 in this window against this car's 43,000: 2,000 more on the two visits for the driveline and 48V checks, 1,000 more on alignment for the larger wheels. That 3,000 is the whole difference, and it is the smallest gap of the five windows because nothing physical has worn out yet."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers 3-5 years, and this is the window the ladder check named as the worst inversion. Composition, and it sums exactly: services 32,000 + tires 68,000 + front and rear pads 40,000 + 12V AGM battery 12,000 + dual-clutch fluid and filter 16,000 + quattro rear differential fluid 9,000 + brake fluid 4,500 + alignment 3,500 = 185,000. RAISED from 118,000, which sat 20,000 BELOW the base car's own figure in the very window where this car charges 68,000 of tires against the base car's 48,000. Two corrections do the work. (1) THE FALSE CITATION IS RETRACTED. The old source cut brakes to a '6,000 front pad allowance' because 'the sibling A6 record places the first front pads-and-discs job at year 7 rather than at 35,000 km'. The sibling record says no such thing: its year 5 checkpoint carries 前後煞車來令片 - front and rear pads - at about 32,000, and defers only the discs at about 42,000 to year 7. This record now matches that shape and charges 40,000, the same job on the larger S line brakes. (2) THE SCHEDULED PORTION IS REBUILT. The old 26,000 came from the fabricated midpoint series (13,600 + 12,400); it is now two visits at the shared 16,000. Spark plugs are NOT charged here - both records place the single plug change in the year 5-7 window, so the old 'double count' objection is answered by putting the plugs somewhere real rather than by deleting them into a year 6 service that does not exist. Dual-clutch fluid moves here from that same non-existent year 6 service, onto the 5-year clock both records use. TIRES stay as the largest line and the call is unchanged: at 7,000 km/year the original set times out on rubber age at about year 5 with tread left, and 20-inch premium tires run roughly 17,000 each fitted in Taiwan against about 12,000 for the sibling's 19-inch set. Tire size remains a class-level estimate - the specification sheet the first record cited for 255/40 R20 was a product photograph with no specification data - so confidence stays low. The base car pays 145,500 here against this car's 185,000. The 39,500 gap is entirely physical: 20,000 of tire size, 8,000 of larger pads, 9,000 of quattro rear-differential fluid, 2,000 of per-visit driveline and 48V checks, 500 of alignment on bigger wheels."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers 5-7 years, fully out of warranty. Composition, and it sums exactly: services 32,000 + front and rear discs 52,000 + spark plugs 9,000 + coolant and hoses 8,000 + brake fluid 4,500 + air-conditioning service 7,000 + suspension links and bushings 22,000 + power tailgate struts 12,000 + unscheduled repair allowance 16,000 = 162,500. RAISED from 133,000, which sat 11,000 below the base car. Three fabricated or mis-set lines are replaced. (1) The old scheduled portion of 39,500 was 'year 6 (30,200 - the schedule's big one: transmission fluid, spark plugs, belt and tensioner) + year 7 (9,300)', both from the midpoint series the sibling never produced. There is no 30,200 year 6 service. The two visits are now 16,000 each and the work that service was said to contain is charged where it actually falls: dual-clutch fluid at year 5, spark plugs here at 9,000. (2) The tailgate strut line was 8,000 here against the sibling's 12,000 for the same part on the same body; both now read 12,000. (3) The old window carried an 18,000 risk-weighted water pump and thermostat job. That item is moved to the year 7-10 window, where the sibling has it at 32,000 and where an EA888 electric water pump on a low-mileage car actually tends to fail, so it is charged once at full weight rather than twice at partial weight. Brake fluid is added on the 2-year clock. The base car pays 146,500 here against this car's 162,500. The 16,000 gap: 10,000 of larger S line discs, 2,000 of per-visit driveline and 48V checks, 2,000 of heavier AWD bushings, 2,000 of unscheduled allowance for the extra electronics. Repair items are probability-weighted allowances at Taiwan Audi dealer parts-and-labour rates, not quotes. WHY THIS WINDOW IS BELOW YEAR 5: the 3-5 year window carries every age-driven lump at once - the first 20-inch tire set (68,000), the 12V AGM battery (12,000), the S tronic fluid and filter (16,000) and the quattro rear differential fluid (9,000). None of them recurs in the 5-7 window, so 185,000 falling to 162,500 is the tire and fluid clock, not a drop in the rate of spending."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers 7-10 years, a three-year window, and correctly the most expensive one: it carries a second tire set on age, the age-limited 48V hardware, and the EA888 water pump. Composition, and it sums exactly: services 48,000 + tires 68,000 + 48V starter-generator and lithium pack 25,000 + water pump and thermostat housing 32,000 + coil packs 14,000 + second 12V AGM battery 12,000 + dampers and rear-axle support 28,000 + second dual-clutch fluid and filter 16,000 + second quattro rear differential fluid 9,000 + timing-chain tensioner and turbo hose 15,000 + panoramic roof drains and motor 10,000 + estate sealing and rear-washer line 8,000 + brake fluid 4,500 + unscheduled repair allowance 22,000 = 311,500. RAISED from 266,000. The largest single correction is the scheduled portion: the old 32,000 for three visits came from the fabricated midpoint series (9,300 + 13,400 + 9,300), which had the tail visits costing about a third of the year 6 one. There is no such table. Three visits at the shared 16,000 rate is 48,000. Second in size, the second dual-clutch fluid change and the year 9 brake fluid were both missing and are now charged on the same clocks the earlier windows use. Third, the water pump arrives here at its full 32,000 rather than being half-charged in the previous window. The 48V allowance is the softest single number in the record: it is an estimate of a weighted risk, not an Audi figure, and individual cars will land well either side of it. It is carried because the 48V question is now settled - the 發燒車訊 drive of the 150 kW car calls that trim 唯一的純燃油設定, the only pure-combustion setting in the Taiwan A6 Avant range, so this 2.0 TFSI quattro does carry MHEV plus; see purchase.notes. TEN-YEAR TOTAL: 716,500, summed from the items and not fitted to a target, against the sibling's 583,000. The base car pays 237,500 in this window against this car's 311,500, and the 74,000 gap is: 20,000 of tire size, 25,000 of 48V hardware risk, 10,000 of panoramic roof, 9,000 of quattro rear-differential fluid, 3,000 of heavier AWD dampers, 3,000 of per-visit driveline and 48V checks, 4,000 of unscheduled allowance. Extrapolated from C7 and C8 era Audi ownership costs in Taiwan, hence low confidence."}],"sources":[{"name":"CARTURE 車勢文化 - 2026年式 Audi A6 全車系建議售價","url":"https://www.carture.com.tw/news/article/39253","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED IN THIS AUDIT. Primary list-price source, replacing the fabricated PDF the previous record cited. Full range table: A6 Sedan TFSI 150kW 288萬, Sedan TFSI 200kW quattro S line 346萬, Avant TFSI 150kW 298萬, Avant TFSI 200kW quattro S line 356萬. Notes these are suggested retail prices and that the transaction price depends on the dealer."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - 2026 Audi A6 Avant 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-a6-avant-2026","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED IN THIS AUDIT. Independent confirmation on the AVANT body specifically: TFSI 150kW 298萬 (1984cc, 204 hp) and TFSI 200kW quattro S-Line運動版 356萬 (1984cc, 272 hp). Yahoo labels the 200 kW car hybrid; it is reclassified gasoline here because the 48V system cannot move the car on battery alone. That hybrid label is also one of the three independent signs that this trim carries the 48V MHEV plus hardware the 150 kW car does not."},{"name":"GOCHOICE 購車趣 - A6 TFSI 200 kW quattro S line 啟動接單","url":"https://www.gochoice.com.tw/news_info.php?guid=FC77BDEF-9D70-8A57-B5C8-01ABD51C77E6","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED IN THIS AUDIT. Third independent confirmation of the same four-row price table, and the source for the powertrain and equipment facts used here: 272 PS, 400 Nm, 7-speed dual clutch, standard all-wheel drive, and S line standard kit including head-up display, dual-layer acoustic glazing, a panoramic glass roof with variable tint and a premium audio system. Describes the 48V system as energy recovery plus power assist, which is the basis of the gasoline classification and of the year 10 starter-generator and lithium-pack allowance. The panoramic roof is the source for the roof drain and motor line in the same window."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi A6 Avant 二手行情列表","url":"https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=4&model=9282","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED IN THIS AUDIT, and confirmed to be A6 AVANT inventory rather than the sedan or the A4 Avant. The main used-estate evidence, about 20 listings. Dealer-retail asking prices used above: 2025-reg TFSI 150kW 700 km 2,488,000 and 1,000 km 2,488,000; 2023 40 TFSI Technik豪華版 48,000 km 1,630,000; 2021-reg 45 TFSI quattro S line 58,000 km 1,688,000; 2021-reg 40 TFSI S line 38,000 km 1,450,000; 2020-reg 40 TDI 67,000 km 998,000; 2019-reg 45 TFSI quattro S line 100,000 km 1,438,000; 2016-reg 35 TFSI 156,000 km 528,000; 2015-reg 35 TFSI 65,000 km 488,000; 2015-reg 35 TFSI 90,000 km 538,000; 2014-reg 35 TFSI 160,000 km 358,000. All are 車商售價. Every checkpoint above converts them down 11-13.5% to a private-sale figure and again for trade-in. The 2020 40 TDI at 998,000 is the listing that shows the 2019 quattro's 1,438,000 ask to be optimistic. RE-READ 2026-08-22: this page is now the SHARED comparable set for years 5, 7 and 10 in both A6 Avant records, and the registration years above were checked against the live page. They are confirmed as printed here; the 150 kW record had the year 5 quattro car as 2022 and the three tail cars as 2016, 2016 and 2017, and it was corrected to match."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi A6 Sedan 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a6-sedan","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED IN THIS AUDIT. The sedan-versus-estate control, 33 listings. Key like-for-like pair at 3 years: 2023 40 TFSI Technik豪華版 sedan 35,000 km 1,490,000 and 28,000 km 1,498,000, against the Avant's 1,630,000 at 48,000 km. DENOMINATOR CORRECTED 2026-08-22: this note used to read 'on verified denominators (sedan Technik 2,775,000, Avant Technik 2,875,000) that is 53.7% against 56.7%'. The 2,875,000 is the MY2024 list price, and the year 3 checkpoint settled the MY2023 denominator at 2,830,000 by bracketing it against the MY2022 page. On the settled denominators (sedan Technik 2,775,000, Avant Technik 2,830,000) the read is 53.7% against 57.6%, an estate premium of about 4 points of list - real, but far smaller than the previous record implied, and it does not widen with age. The superseded 2,875,000 and 56.7% are removed here and from assumptions.notes."},{"name":"KingAutos - Audi A6 Avant 車系規格與售價","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/audi/a6_avant","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED IN THIS AUDIT. The outgoing C8 A6 Avant Taiwan ladder still on sale: 40 TFSI 享馭版 2,795,000 / 40 TFSI Technik豪華版 2,875,000 / 40 TFSI S-Line運動版 3,035,000 / 45 TFSI quattro S-Line運動版 3,595,000 / RS6 7,300,000. This is the source that corrects the year-3 denominator: the previous record used 'roughly 2,730,000' for a 2023 Technik豪華版 Avant, which inflated its retention read by about 3 points. The table is labelled model year 2024, so its 2,875,000 is NOT the MY2023 figure; both records settled MY2023 at 2,830,000 by bracketing this page against the MY2022 specification page."},{"name":"ETtoday 車雲 - 2021 Audi A6 Avant 車系售價 (2021-01-07)","url":"https://speed.ettoday.net/news/1893122","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED, and re-opened on 2026-08-22. Published 2021-01-07 and gives the 2021 model-year Taiwan A6 Avant ladder: 40 TFSI 2,670,000, 40 TFSI Premium 2,750,000, 40 TFSI S Line 2,900,000, 45 TFSI quattro S Line 3,350,000. These are the denominators for the 5-year checkpoint in BOTH A6 Avant records. The 150 kW Avant record had used 'near 295萬' for the 40 TFSI S Line; 2,900,000 from this dated page is now used in both."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 - 新世代Audi A6 全車系正式價格公佈","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/30134-audi-a6.html","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED ON 2026-08-22, and added to this record in the third pass. Published 2019-10-24, the C8 Taiwan launch price table: A6 Avant 40 TDI 2,490,000, Avant 40 TDI Premium 2,640,000, Avant 45 TFSI quattro S line 3,340,000; A6 Sedan 40 TDI 2,390,000, Sedan 40 TDI Premium 2,540,000. These settle the two year 7 denominators. This record previously divided the 2020 40 TDI listing by an unsourced 'roughly 2,690,000' and the 2019 quattro listing by 'roughly 3,300,000'; both are replaced by the figures on this dated page, which the 150 kW Avant record was already using."},{"name":"KingAutos - 2022 Audi A6 Avant 40 TFSI Technik豪華版 規格頁","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/spec/10055","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED ON 2026-08-22, and added to this record in the third pass. Model year 2022, 40 TFSI Technik豪華版, 定價 2,790,000. Paired with the model-year-2024 range table it brackets the MY2023 list price of the same trim at 2,830,000, which is the year 3 denominator now used in both A6 Avant records. This record had used the MY2024 figure of 2,875,000 for a MY2023 car."},{"name":"發燒車訊 udn - Audi A6 Avant TFSI 150kW 試駕","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7828/9277101","note":"ADDED 2026-08-22 to settle the 48V question across both records. States that the 150 kW Avant '未整合 48 V MHEV Plus 輕油電系統，為目前 A6 Avant 車系中唯一的純燃油設定'. The word 唯一 is what settles it: if the 150 kW car is the ONLY pure-combustion setting in the Taiwan A6 Avant range, then this 200 kW quattro carries 48V MHEV plus, which is what GOCHOICE and Yahoo Autos independently describe. The sibling record's earlier wording - that MHEV plus is 'tied to the 204 PS 2.0 TDI and the 367 PS 3.0 TFSI' - read as a closed list and was corrected there; the CarStuff launch report it rested on names a launch engine range, not a Taiwan trim list. The 25,000 starter-generator and lithium-pack allowance in the year 10 window stands on this finding."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan 官方保養費用查詢「保養透明 安心啟航」","url":"https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/","note":"THE PAGE OPENS - that part of the previous note was true and is kept. It is a query tool that returns a roughly NT$1,000-wide band per model, 年式 and 使用年份, covers vehicles from 2018 onward, and disclaims that the figures are reference prices for 定期保養 under normal use with the final amount set by inspection. A sample result visible on the landing page reads NT$10,500-11,500 for an A1 Sportback 2020年式. WHAT WAS FALSE AND HAS BEEN DELETED: this note used to state that the per-year midpoints 12,400 / 13,600 / 16,800 / 13,600 / 12,400 / 30,200 / 9,300 / 9,300 / 13,400 / 9,300 for an A6 Avant 2019年式 45 TFSI quattro 'are taken from the sibling A6 150 kW record's query of this tool and were NOT reproduced here'. The sibling record was opened and checked: it says the opposite. It states that Audi Taiwan's service-price table could not be read, that https://www.audi.com.tw returned HTTP 403 on every path tried, and that its figures are Taiwan-market dealer-rate norms; this URL was not in its sources[] at the time of that check, and it carries no per-year midpoints. The sibling added the URL later in the same 2026-08-22 pass. The series was unsourced, it drove 140,300 of the previous 573,000 ten-year total, and every figure built on it has been removed. The tool could not be driven to an A6 Avant result from here either, so it now anchors the order of magnitude of the annual-service price and supplies no line item in this record. Note the two Audi Taiwan hosts are different: https://www.audi.com.tw does still return HTTP 403, and this tool does open, so both records' statements are true once they are read as being about different URLs."}]},"audi-a6-avant-e-tron-performance":{"assumptions":"At 7,000 km/year this car reaches only 70,000 km in ten years. Three consequences drive every number below. (1) The 100 kWh (94.9 kWh usable) pack and the up-to-720 km WLTP range of the Avant body are almost entirely wasted on this buyer: a 7,000 km year needs about 19 km/day, so the reason the performance trim costs 600,000 more than the base 83 kWh car never shows up in daily use, and the used market will not pay a proportional premium for it either. (2) The 8-year high-voltage battery warranty (8 years / 160,000 km) is consumed by CALENDAR time, not distance. 70,000 km at year ten is far under the 160,000 km cap, so the time limit always trips first. Years 9 and 10 run with no battery cover, and that is what collapses the 10-year value. (3) Servicing is time-driven, not distance-driven: annual inspection intervals apply throughout, and tires age out on the calendar (about every 5-6 years) long before this mileage wears them out. A home AC wallbox costs roughly 40,000-80,000 TWD installed in Taiwan and is a real ownership cost, but it is a one-off capital item, not maintenance, so it is deliberately excluded from the maintenance figures here. Public DC charging and electricity are also excluded, as are tax and insurance.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REBASED onto the corrected real_cost of 3,255,000 and pulled down about 2 points. No used A6 e-tron of any variant exists in Taiwan - 8891 and SUM return zero listings for the nameplate at any age - so year 1 is inferred, not observed, and the confidence has been DOWNGRADED from medium to low to match the audited A6 Sportback e-tron sibling, which marks all five of its checkpoints low. 'Medium' was not defensible for a model with zero data points. Nearest real evidence, opened by this audit: 8891's used Audi e-tron pool (auto.8891.com.tw/audi/e-tron) is four cars nationwide, all 2021 e-tron 55 quattro, the two priced ones at 1,258,000 dealer asking with about 33,200 km - Audi's previous electric flagship trading at roughly a third of its original list. That is the brand's own electric track record here. Method: 66.5% of real_cost. Working: 2,165,000 private corresponds to a dealer 車商售價 of about 2,433,000 for a one-year 7,000 km car; I cut 11% off that dealer asking price to reach the 自售價 quoted here, because a private seller offers neither dealer warranty nor finance. 66.5% is 3.3 points below the base A6 Sportback e-tron sibling at 69.8%, which is the trim-ladder effect: the 600,000 separating the performance from the base car buys a bigger battery and more power, and at 7,000 km/year the second-hand buyer sees no daily benefit from either. The estate body offsets part of that - see the year-3 note for the like-for-like Avant-versus-Sedan measurement - but not all of it. The absolute still clears the base Sportback comfortably (2,165,000 against 1,880,000), which is the required shape: more money, lower percentage."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolated from two live pools I opened myself. (a) German luxury BEV floor: 8891's Audi e-tron pool, 2021 e-tron 55 quattro advanced, 33,200 km, dealer asking 1,258,000 - a 5-year point at roughly 36-39% of its original list before the cut to private. (b) ESTATE-SPECIFIC evidence, and the prior record's version of this was wrong in a way worth naming. It claimed 'in Taiwan the A6 estate lists ABOVE the A6 sedan' on the strength of 2021 Avants at 1,450,000-1,688,000 against 2020-2022 sedans at 728,000-888,000 - a 60-70% gap that is a generation and mileage mismatch, not an estate premium. The correct like-for-like comparison, from the same two pools on the same day: 2023 40 TFSI Technik AVANT, 48,000 km, asking 1,630,000 against 2023 40 TFSI Technik SEDAN, 35,000 km, asking 1,490,000. The estate asks about 9% more while carrying 13,000 km MORE. So the real Taiwan estate premium is roughly 10% on asking price, not 60%, and it is worth about 2-3 retention points, not the double-digit figure the raw pools imply. Method: 50.1% of real_cost. Working: 1,630,000 private corresponds to about 1,852,000 dealer 車商售價; I took 12% off to reach 自售價. The car is inside its factory warranty at three years with 21,000 km, low enough that the listing reads as an unusually clean example. 50.1% is 2.6 points under the base Sportback sibling at 52.7%, same trim-ladder reason as year 1, net of the measured estate premium. Confidence low, downgraded from medium: the level is triangulated from real pools of OTHER models, and the BEV-versus-combustion gap for this nameplate is unobserved."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"This is the checkpoint with the closest real analogue and the one I moved DOWN. 8891's Audi e-tron listing: 2021 e-tron 55 quattro advanced, 33,200 km - almost exactly this buyer's 5-year mileage - dealer 車商售價 1,258,000, against an original list in the 3,190,000-3,490,000 band. That is 36-39% at dealer asking, or roughly 32-35% of original list once cut to private, for a five-year low-mileage Audi electric flagship. The prior record used 37.6% of real_cost and called it the single biggest judgement call in the record; I agree it was the weak point and have taken it to 36.6% (1,190,000 private, from a dealer asking of about 1,360,000, less 12.5%). I still sit above the raw e-tron 55 precedent, for three stated reasons: (1) the e-tron 55 is a 400V, roughly 400 km, 2.6-tonne SUV criticised for range on the day it launched - the A6 e-tron is 800V, 270 kW charging and does not carry that reputational discount; (2) the e-tron 55 was superseded and renamed Q8 e-tron mid-life, which craters the old badge, whereas the A6 e-tron is the current nameplate; (3) the measured 10% estate premium applies here too. But 37.6% was too generous for a car that costs MORE than the e-tron 55 did and sells into a thinner pool, so the gap to the precedent has been narrowed. 36.6% sits 2.7 points below the base Sportback sibling at 39.3% and 0.2 points above the Q6 e-tron sibling at 36.4% - both inside the 5-point band. BEV price-cut check: this nameplate has already been repriced twice in under a year (down 50,000 at launch, up 100,000 for MY2026), and any Audi Taiwan cut reprices used stock overnight. That is a live downside risk on this line. Confidence low."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolated, no current-generation data exists at this age. Per the BEV rule I lean the tail on BEVs that actually trade in Taiwan, not on a combustion analogue. Evidence opened by this audit: (a) 8891's Tesla Model 3 pool, 141 cars, oldest a 2019 Long Range at 888,000 dealer asking against a roughly 2,080,000 original - about 43% dealer asking at seven years. IMPORTANT CAVEAT THE PRIOR RECORD OMITTED: that 2019 car has 135,000 km on it, nearly three times this buyer's 49,000 km, so it understates what a low-mileage seven-year BEV asks and cannot be used as a straight percentage. Model 3 is also the best-holding BEV in Taiwan (Supercharger access, cheap parts, deep buyer pool), so it is a ceiling, not a comparator. (b) The German luxury BEV gap measured at the 5-year point: the e-tron 55 sits near 32-35% private where a five-year Model 3 sits near 45%, a gap of about 12 points. Carrying that gap forward gives roughly 24-26% at seven years. I used 25.0% of real_cost (815,000 private, from about 948,000 dealer asking, less 14%). The car is out of vehicle warranty by now and the used market prices in repair risk on the 800V thermal system and the OLED screens, which is why the German tail keeps falling here instead of flattening the way a Lexus does. Note that the prior record listed air suspension among those risks - this trim does not have it, so that particular fear is not in the price. The 8-year battery warranty is still live at year 7, since the calendar has not expired and 49,000 km is nowhere near the 160,000 km cap, and that remaining cover is a real part of why year 7 has not collapsed the way year 10 does. 25.0% is 2.1 points under the base Sportback sibling at 27.1%. Confidence low: single-generation-removed extrapolation across two brands."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolated, low confidence, and the weakest line in this record - stated plainly. There is no 10-year German luxury BEV market in Taiwan at all: the oldest Audi electric cars on 8891 are 2021 and the oldest Tesla Model 3 listings are 2019. Method, following the previous-generation-ratio rule: no previous-generation A6 e-tron exists, so I used the oldest BEVs that actually trade here. The Model 3 curve implies roughly 25-28% of list at ten years; applying the same 12-point German-luxury-BEV penalty measured at the five-year e-tron 55 point gives 13-16%. I used 13.5% of real_cost. The decisive factor is the battery warranty, and it is a calendar problem, not a distance problem: at 7,000 km/year the car reaches 70,000 km at year ten, less than half the 160,000 km cap, so the 8-year clock always expires first. Years 9 and 10 are driven with no high-voltage cover on a 100 kWh pack whose out-of-warranty replacement is a six-figure sum exceeding the whole car's value. A used buyer prices that as near-total risk, which is why the tail does not flatten. The measured 10% estate premium helps at the margin but cannot offset an uncovered battery. 13.5% is 1.0 point under the base Sportback sibling at 14.5% and 0.4 points under the Q6 e-tron sibling at 13.9%; the three converge here because at ten years the market prices battery risk and body style, not which trim the car was when new, so the trim-ladder gap that separates them at years 1-7 has mostly closed. Confidence low."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Year 0-1 only. Inside the factory warranty with 7,000 km on the clock, a BEV has almost nothing to do at the first annual visit: no oil, no filters beyond the cabin filter, no plugs. The 9,000 covers wipers, a cabin filter and the annual inspection labour at Audi dealer rates. CORRECTED 2026-08-22 from 8,000. The previous version set this equal to the A6 Sportback e-tron sibling and argued that \"nothing about the estate body changes the first annual visit\". That contradicted the A6 Avant e-tron base record, which is the SAME BODY and which sets 9,000 precisely because the estate carries a third wiper blade the fastback does not. The base record is right, so both estates now read 9,000. They are equal rather than ordered because every year-1 item - wipers, cabin filter, inspection labour, alignment - is the same for both trims: the larger battery and the wider tires of the performance version cost nothing until their own clocks fall due. Confidence medium: the item list is a straightforward BEV service scope, but the Audi Taiwan labour rate could not be read from the official price table (403)."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers years 1-3 only, not cumulative. REDUCED from the prior record's 45,000. Two annual services plus the 2-year brake fluid change, which is a calendar item and lands here regardless of the low mileage. The work in this window is identical to the A6 Sportback e-tron sibling's, which carries 32,000, and the car is still inside the assumed 3-year warranty so nothing here is a repair. 45,000 was 40% above the sibling for the same scheduled scope with no mechanism behind it. 34,000 keeps a small premium over the sibling for four-wheel alignment on the larger 20/21-inch rims and the heavier estate. Roughly 11,000/year at Audi dealer labour rates, materially above a Japanese equivalent purely on labour rate but well below a combustion A6's 1-3 year cost because there is no oil service. Confidence medium."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers years 3-5 only. The dominant single item is the first tire set: at 7,000 km/year the tires do not wear out, they AGE out at about 5-6 years, and the performance trim's large-diameter tires on a heavy rear-drive estate run roughly 14,000 each fitted, against roughly 10,000 for the base Sportback's smaller set. That tire delta is most of why this window sits at 138,000 against the Sportback sibling's 116,000. The 12V battery is included here and is a genuine BEV failure item - it dies on schedule even though the traction battery is fine, and a BEV with a flat 12V will not power up at all. Brake disc de-rusting rather than replacement is the specific BEV consequence of regen: the friction brakes are barely used, so the discs corrode from disuse. The assumed 3-year warranty has expired, so the two annual services here are at full customer cost. Confidence medium: tire and 12V pricing are well-established Taiwan figures; the split between years 3-5 and 5-7 for the first tire set could shift a year either way."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers years 5-7 only. This is the first period where out-of-warranty risk items are priced in rather than just scheduled work. The pad-and-disc job finally arrives at about 49,000 km - far later than a combustion car would need it, because regen does most of the stopping, but the discs are by now corroded enough that resurfacing is no longer enough, and the performance trim's larger rotors cost more. CHANGED FROM THE PRIOR RECORD: the air-compressor and air-strut allowance has been removed, because this trim rides on conventional 五連桿 suspension and only the S6 e-tron gets 主動式氣壓懸吊. What remains on the estate-specific side is bush and control-arm wear on a heavier body, which is a five-figure job but nothing like an air-strut replacement, so this window comes down from 178,000 to 168,000 - still 13,000 above the Sportback sibling's 155,000 on brake size and body weight. Note what is NOT here and would be on a German combustion car of the same age and price: water pump, thermostat housing, coil packs, spark plugs, DPF, and the 48V starter-generator. That absence is the whole reason a BEV's 7-year figure is lower than an A6 45 TFSI's. Confidence low: no Taiwan A6 e-tron has reached this age, so the risk allowances are judgement, not receipts."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers years 7-10 only. CORRECTED: the prior record put this window at 246,000, BELOW the A6 Sportback e-tron sibling's 290,000, while arguing the Avant carries a HIGHER late-life risk load. Those two statements cannot both be true. This window is now 310,000, 20,000 above the Sportback sibling, and the premium rests on the second set of 20/21-inch tires and on four conventional dampers plus five-link bushes replaced on age on a heavier estate - not on air suspension, which this trim does not have. Two things define the window. First, the 8-year battery warranty expires on the CALENDAR at year 8 - 70,000 km at year ten is less than half the 160,000 km cap, so distance never protects this buyer - and years 9 and 10 run with no high-voltage cover. I do not budget a pack replacement here, because it would exceed the car's value and an owner would sell instead, but I do carry the annual health check and the peripheral thermal-management hardware, which is where real out-of-warranty BEV bills actually land: the electric coolant pump and the valve module for the battery circuit. Second, the second tire set is again an age replacement, not a wear replacement. Total 10-year maintenance of 658,000 is high for a BEV and that is intentional - a German luxury estate at Audi dealer labour rates on 21-inch tires is nowhere near a Japanese car's cost - but it is still well under what an A6 45 TFSI Avant would run over the same decade, because there is no oil, no plugs, no timing chain, no combustion water pump and no DPF. Confidence low: pure extrapolation, no Taiwan car of this model has ever reached ten years."}],"sources":[{"name":"Yahoo Autos - 補上主動式車道維持機能，Audi Q6 e-tron、A6 e-tron 新年式添新配備但價格也有調漲","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/%E8%A3%9C%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%BB%E5%8B%95%E5%BC%8F%E8%BB%8A%E9%81%93%E7%B6%AD%E6%8C%81%E6%A9%9F%E8%83%BD%EF%BC%8Caudi-q6-e-tron%E3%80%81a6-e-tron-%E6%96%B0%E5%B9%B4%E5%BC%8F%E6%B7%BB%E6%96%B0%E9%85%8D%E5%82%99%E4%BD%86%E5%83%B9%E6%A0%BC%E4%B9%9F%E6%9C%89%E8%AA%BF%E6%BC%B2-040212205.html","note":"DECISIVE CURRENT PRICE SOURCE, added by this audit. Prints the MY2026 table verbatim. Re-fetched a second time asking only for lines containing 'Avant', so the answer could not be mirrored from the Sportback rows: 「A6 Avant e-tron：280 萬元 (調漲 10 萬元)」「A6 Avant e-tron Performance：340 萬元 (調漲 10 萬元)」「S6 Avant e-tron：480 萬元 (維持不變)」, with the three Sportback rows carrying identical prices. This is the basis for list_price 3,400,000 and it also proves the Avant carries NO price premium over the Sportback in Taiwan."},{"name":"發燒車訊 (udn autos) - Audi 新世代油電雙陣容重磅登台 A6 e-tron、A6、Q5 車系齊聚上市","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/9045718","note":"Opened by this audit and it DOES print a per-trim launch table, contrary to the prior record's note that it could not be read: A6 e-tron (Sportback/Avant) 2,700,000 / A6 e-tron performance 3,300,000 / S6 e-tron 4,800,000. One price per powertrain across BOTH bodies. This is the source that disproves the prior record's '+100,000 Avant premium' and 'uniform 50,000 launch cut' derivation."},{"name":"INSIDE - Audi A6 e-tron 台灣上市：Sportback、Avant 雙車身、三動力編成，售價自 270 萬起","url":"https://www.inside.com.tw/article/39719-audi-a6-e-tron-tw-launch","note":"Independent confirmation of the launch table with the Avant named explicitly: Avant e-tron 2,700,000, Avant e-tron performance 3,300,000, S6 Avant e-tron 4,800,000. Same prices as the Sportback."},{"name":"8891 新車頻道 - Audi A6 e-tron在台上市！Sportback、Avant雙車型售價270萬元起","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/audi/a6-sportback-e-tron/20804","note":"Launch article. Confirms the launched family range as 2,700,000-4,800,000 across three powertrains and six variants. Note the range top: pre-sale had S6 Avant at 4,950,000, so the launch cut was 150,000 on that variant and 50,000 on the A6 pair - not the uniform 50,000 the prior record assumed."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 - 預售價自 275萬元起、六種規格販售，Audi A6 e-tron Sportback/Avant 啟動預售","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/42040-275-audi-a6-e-tron-sportback-avant.html","note":"Full per-trim PRE-SALE table (September 2025): Sportback e-tron 2,750,000 / Avant e-tron 2,850,000 / Sportback performance 3,350,000 / Avant performance 3,450,000 / S6 Sportback 4,850,000 / S6 Avant 4,950,000. Historical only - the +100,000 Avant premium shown here existed at pre-sale and was removed at launch. It is NOT the current price structure."},{"name":"8891 新車頻道 - Audi A6 e-tron預售！續航最長756km、275萬元起","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/20640","note":"Independent reproduction of the identical six-variant pre-sale table. Also the origin of the 756 km headline, which this article attributes to 'the A6 e-tron performance' without separating the bodies. That is how 756 km got copied onto the Avant in the prior record; 756 km is the Sportback figure (0.21 Cd) and the Avant (0.24 Cd) is rated lower, around 720 km."},{"name":"2GameSome 有車賞 - 純電跑房車Audi A6 e-tron 275 萬起啟動預售","url":"https://2gamesome.com.tw/article/view/6111","note":"KEY SPEC SOURCE for the maintenance correction. Third reproduction of the pre-sale table, and it states that 主動式氣壓懸吊 is standard on the S6 e-tron ONLY, while the A6 e-tron and A6 e-tron performance use 前/後獨立五連桿懸吊. This is why the air-compressor and air-strut allowance was removed from the year-7 and year-10 maintenance windows."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi e-tron 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/e-tron","note":"KEY BEV DEPRECIATION EVIDENCE, re-opened and confirmed by this audit. The entire national used Audi e-tron pool is four cars, all 2021 e-tron 55 quattro, all in Taoyuan. Two priced at 1,258,000 dealer 車商售價 with about 33,200 km; the other two are 電洽. Against an original list in the 3,190,000-3,490,000 band that is 36-39% dealer asking at five years, roughly 32-35% after the cut to private sale. This is the German-luxury-BEV floor anchoring the year-5 checkpoint and, via its gap to Tesla, the year-7 and year-10 extrapolations."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi A6 Avant 完整車源列表","url":"https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=4&model=9282","note":"ESTATE-SPECIFIC evidence, re-opened and verified by this audit: exactly 20 A6 Avant listings nationwide. Confirmed examples: 2023 40 TFSI Technik豪華版 48,000 km asking 1,630,000; 2021 40 TFSI S line 38,000 km asking 1,450,000; 2022款 45 TFSI quattro S line (2021) 58,000 km asking 1,688,000; 2019 45 TFSI quattro S line 100,000 km asking 1,438,000; 2020 40 TDI 67,000 km asking 998,000. Two brand-new 2026款 TFSI 150kW cars with 700-1,000 km sit at 2,488,000. All are DEALER asking prices; private sale is 8-15% below each."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi A6 Sedan 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a6-sedan","note":"ESTATE-VS-SEDAN comparison, re-measured by this audit because the prior record's version was a generation mismatch. Confirmed: 33 A6 Sedan listings against 20 Avants. The prior record compared 2021 Avants at 1,450,000-1,688,000 against 2020-2022 sedans at 728,000-888,000 and inferred a 60-70% estate premium; those sedans are high-mileage or older cars (the 2022 40 TFSI Technik at 830,000 has 125,000 km). The correct like-for-like pair is 2023 40 TFSI Technik SEDAN, 35,000 km, asking 1,490,000 against 2023 40 TFSI Technik AVANT, 48,000 km, asking 1,630,000 - the estate asks about 9% more with 13,000 km MORE on it. Real Taiwan estate premium is roughly 10% on asking, worth about 2-3 retention points, and that is what this record applies."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - AUDI A6 AVANT 中古車","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=AUDI&model=A6%20AVANT","note":"Second estate source, re-opened and confirmed: four cars total. 2019 C8 107,000 km at 1,598,000; 2019 C8 23,210 km at 1,000,000; 2014 C7 213,253 km at 358,000; a 2018 car listed at 729,000 with an implausible 111 km reading. Confirms both the scarcity of estate supply and the wide, partly unreliable spread caused by that thin pool - which is why SUM is used only for supply scarcity, not for the price level."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Tesla Model 3 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/tesla/model-3","note":"BEV tail anchor, re-opened by this audit. 141 cars listed. The oldest is a 2019 Long Range at 888,000 dealer asking against a roughly 2,080,000 original - about 43% dealer asking at seven years - BUT it carries 135,000 km, which the prior record omitted. That mileage matters: this buyer is at 49,000 km at year seven, so the raw percentage understates a low-mileage car. Model 3 is the best-holding BEV in Taiwan and is used as a CEILING only; the year-7 and year-10 figures apply the roughly 12-point German-luxury-BEV penalty measured from the e-tron 55 five-year point."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Nissan Leaf 二手車","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/nissan/leaf","note":"Opened by this audit as a third BEV tail anchor and confirmed to return NO Leaf listings - the page resolves but shows only Sentra, Kicks, Livina, Tiida, Juke and X-Trail. The Leaf does not trade in the Taiwan used market in any meaningful volume, so it contributed nothing and the tail rests on Model 3 plus the e-tron 55 gap. Recorded because it was actually opened and the negative result is itself informative."}]},"audi-a6-avant-e-tron":{"assumptions":"7,000 km/year on a 100 kWh PPE estate means almost nothing in this record is mileage-driven. Audi's BEV inspection interval is time-based at this distance, so every service in the table is triggered by the calendar, never by the odometer. The 8-year high-voltage battery warranty is consumed by TIME only: 70,000 km at year 10 is under half of the 160,000 km limit, so the calendar limit always trips first and years 9-10 run with no pack cover at all. That is what sets the year-10 value, not wear. Tyres are the one consumable that still costs real money. 20-inch rubber on a ~2.3 tonne estate with instant torque and a heavier rear axle than the Sportback ages out at 5-6 years long before it wears out at 35,000 km, so a full set is priced in both the 3-5y and 7-10y windows. Regenerative braking means the friction brakes barely work. The real brake cost in Taiwan's humidity is rust-seized rear discs, not worn pads, and it lands in the 5-7y window. A home AC wallbox (roughly 40,000-80,000 installed in Taiwan, more if the building's 電表 needs upgrading) is a genuine ownership cost for this buyer but is NOT maintenance and is deliberately excluded from the maintenance table. BODY-STYLE EFFECT ON RESALE, CORRECTED: Taiwan Audi imports very few Avants, so a private seller faces a thin, slow market. A previous version of this record read that thinness as scarcity value and added a retention premium over the Sportback. That is wrong, and it contradicted the rest of the same record, which charged HIGHER selling costs and a WIDER trade-in haircut for the identical thin market. A thin market cannot be a cost on one line and a premium on another. This record now treats the estate body as a small NET NEGATIVE on private resale: a BEV estate stacks two thin Taiwan niches on top of each other, and the wagon premium that is real for the combustion A4 Avant does not transfer to a used BEV, where buyers price battery and repair risk first and body style second.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"No 1-year A6 Avant e-tron exists on the Taiwan used market. The car launched in Sept 2025, and I opened both https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi and https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a6_avant: across 1,175 Audi cars on the platform there is not one A6 Avant of ANY generation, combustion or electric. So this point is extrapolated, not observed. Basis: the PPE sibling Q6 e-tron already in this dataset lands year 1 at 62%, the A6 Sportback e-tron sibling at 69.8%, and the BMW i5 at 71%. The nearest real Audi BEV evidence I could open is the used e-tron page (https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/e-tron) plus the e-tron GT at 2,188,000 dealer retail on the Audi index; both say Audi BEVs shed value hard and fast in Taiwan. I set 68.9% of real_cost = 1,860,000, a fraction below the Sportback sibling. REASON FOR THE CHANGE: the previous version set 68% and justified the gap as pure arithmetic, claiming the sibling was priced off a 2,700,000 list while this record used 2,800,000. That premise is false - the sibling record carries 2,800,000 too - so the arithmetic argument is deleted. What remains is a genuine market judgement: at one year old the buyer pool for a BEV estate is thinner than for the fastback, and thin demand at this age is a small discount, not a premium. dealer_tradein_price is 12.6% under private (1,860,000 -> 1,625,000), a slightly wider haircut than usual because a trade-in dealer taking a niche BEV estate knows it will sit on the lot."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolated - no 3-year A6 e-tron of either body exists yet. Anchored on evidence I actually opened. (a) Combustion A6 Sedan, 8891 中古車 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a6-sedan), 33 cars listed: the freshest print is a 2024 car with 12,300 km at 1,880,000 車商售價 against a roughly 2,880,000 list, which is about 65% DEALER RETAIL at two years, so about 58% private after the 8-12% haircut. That is consistent with this dataset's own A6 TFSI record, which runs 69.8% at year 1 and 48.1% at year 3. (b) A BEV must sit under that combustion curve, because Taiwan used-BEV buyers price in battery uncertainty. I take 51.9% of real_cost = 1,400,000, a little BELOW the A6 Sportback e-tron sibling's 52.7%. CHANGE FROM THE PREVIOUS VERSION, WHICH SET 54%: it awarded a scarcity premium over the Sportback on the grounds that 8891 lists 33 A6 Sedans and zero A6 Avants, and that A4 Avants (91.0萬-128.8萬 on the Audi index) out-price A4 Sedans. Two problems. First, the same record charged elevated selling costs and a wider trade-in haircut for that identical thinness, so it billed the thin market twice in opposite directions. Second, the A4 Avant premium is a COMBUSTION wagon phenomenon with an established Taiwan enthusiast following; a BEV estate stacks a thin body niche on a thin powertrain niche and does not inherit it. Low mileage does help here: 21,000 km at three years is roughly half the Taiwan norm, and on a BEV buyers read low mileage as low pack cycling, so this is priced as a low-mileage car rather than a mileage-blind average. dealer_tradein_price 13.2% under private = 1,215,000."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"This is the one checkpoint with a real Audi-BEV comparable, so I built it bottom-up. I opened https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/e-tron and it lists 2021 Audi e-tron 55 quattro advanced at 1,258,000 車商售價 with 33,200 km - a 5-year-old Audi BEV at almost exactly this buyer's mileage - plus three more 2021 e-tron 55 cars at 30,000-33,000 km. 1,258,000 is DEALER RETAIL; the private figure an owner actually receives is about 11% below, roughly 1,120,000. IMPORTANT WEAKNESS, NEWLY FLAGGED: converting that into a retention percentage needs the e-tron 55 Advanced's original Taiwan list price, and the previous version used 3,250,000 from a U-CAR page it admitted it never fetched. I tried that page myself (https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/64410) and it returns HTTP 403, so I have DELETED it from sources and I no longer quote any retention ratio derived from it. The e-tron 55 therefore serves only as an absolute money check, not as a ratio. Second reference, opened: 8891's Tesla index (https://auto.8891.com.tw/tesla/model_3) shows a 2021 Model 3 SR+ at 948,000 車商售價 with 80,000 km, and a 2021 Long Range at 900,000 with 50,000 km. I set 38.5% of real_cost = 1,040,000, a little under the A6 Sportback e-tron sibling's 39.3% and near the BMW i5's 38%, for the thin-BEV-estate-market reason stated at year 3. Sanity check on absolute money: implied dealer retail is about 1,170,000, which sits sensibly BELOW the 1,258,000 asked for a 2021 e-tron 55 of similar mileage. The previous version claimed its implied retail landed 'within 1%' of that listing; that was false precision resting on the unfetchable list price, and it has been removed. dealer_tradein 13.5% under private = 900,000. Confidence downgraded from medium to low, because the denominator that made it medium turned out to have no openable source."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolated from the previous generation as instructed - there is no 7-year-old BEV estate in Taiwan and there never has been. The one real 7-year Taiwan BEV print I opened is the 2019 Tesla Model 3 Long Range at 888,000 車商售價 with 135,000 km (https://auto.8891.com.tw/tesla/model_3), about 40% dealer retail of its 2,199,000 launch list - but that is a Tesla with a supercharger network behind it, and the car is high-mileage. The Audi e-tron 55 evidence at the 5-year point says Audi BEVs sit well below Tesla in Taiwan. I take 26.5% of real_cost = 715,000, marginally under the A6 Sportback e-tron sibling's 27.1%. What holds this up rather than letting it fall further: at seven years the 8-year pack warranty is still alive, because mileage is only 49,000 km and nowhere near the 160,000 km limit, and a transferable battery warranty with a year left on it is the single strongest thing a Taiwan used-BEV listing can advertise. What pushes it down: the 3-year Audi warranty is four years gone, the market is now pricing German repair risk into the asking price, and the tail keeps falling instead of flattening the way a Lexus hybrid's would. The previous version added a point OVER the Sportback here on estate scarcity; that uplift is removed for the reason given at year 3. dealer_tradein 14.7% under private = 610,000 - at this age a Taiwan dealer will barely bid on a BEV estate at all."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Fully extrapolated - Taiwan has no 10-year premium-BEV market of any kind, let alone an estate one. The only BEVs that trade here at that age are the Leaf and the earliest Model 3s, and 8891's Tesla index tops out its oldest stock at 2019 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/tesla/model_3), so even Tesla gives no clean 10-year Taiwan print. I lean on the shape of those cheap-BEV tails rather than on any combustion analogue: 14.1% of real_cost = 380,000, just under the A6 Sportback e-tron sibling's 14.5% and below the BMW i5's 17.7%. The controlling fact is warranty, not wear. This buyer covers 70,000 km in ten years, under half the 160,000 km battery limit, so the 8-year cover expires on the CALENDAR at year 8 and years 9-10 run with no pack protection at all. A Taiwan buyer looking at an out-of-warranty 100 kWh PPE pack, whose module-level repair alone can exceed the whole car's value, discounts brutally regardless of how few kilometres the odometer shows. Low mileage helps at year 5; it barely helps at year 10. The previous version added a scarcity point over the Sportback here as well - removed, and for once its own text conceded the reason: at this age the buyer pool is bargain hunters who do not pay for body style. dealer_tradein 15.8% under private = 320,000; realistically most Taiwan dealers decline the trade entirely at this point and the owner is selling privately or to a 拆車 buyer."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Nothing scheduled falls in year one: with a 2-year/30,000 km BEV inspection interval the car is not due for its first paid service until year two, and the full 3-year Audi Taiwan warranty covers any defect. The only real spend is wiper blades and an alignment. Priced at Audi Taiwan dealer rates of roughly 2,500-3,000/hour: wipers about 3,500 for three blades, alignment about 3,500, sundries about 2,000. Set 1,000 ABOVE the A6 Sportback e-tron sibling's 8,000, because the Avant carries a third wiper blade the fastback does not. The previous version set 7,000, which was 1,000 BELOW the sibling while claiming the rear wiper made the estate dearer. Extrapolated from the interval structure rather than from a receipt - audi.com.tw returns 403 and no Mobile01 receipt thread exists for a car this new, so this is a structural estimate."},{"y":3,"source":"One scheduled service falls in this 1-3y window, at the 2-year mark. Audi Taiwan BEV inspection with brake fluid runs roughly 18,000-20,000 including labour, cabin filter about 4,500, alignment about 3,500, wipers about 3,500 for three blades, plus about 3,500 of small consumables. About 34,000 for the period, which is 2,000 above the A6 Sportback e-tron sibling's 32,000 for the rear wiper and washer hardware. The previous version set 30,000, again below the sibling and again contradicting its own stated reason. Note how much LOWER this is than a combustion Audi over the same window - no oil services at all, which is the single biggest structural saving of the powertrain. Everything mechanical is still inside the 3-year warranty, so there is no repair line here. Structural estimate at published Taiwan dealer labour rates; no first-party price table is obtainable because audi.com.tw returns 403."},{"y":5,"source":"This is the first genuinely expensive window and tyres are most of it. At 7,000 km/year the 20-inch tyres reach 35,000 km with tread left, but they are five years old, and five-year-old rubber on a 2.3-tonne BEV estate is a safety item, not a wear item. A premium set fitted in Taiwan runs about 55,000-70,000; I take 63,000, a small uplift over the Sportback for the heavier rear axle. The 3-year warranty has expired, so the 4-year inspection (about 20,000) is paid in full, plus brake fluid about 5,000, cabin filter 4,500, 12V AGM about 12,000, alignment and wipers about 7,500, and about 8,000 for the first non-warranty niggle. About 120,000, which is 4,000 above the A6 Sportback e-tron sibling's 116,000. Estimated from Taiwan retail tyre and Audi dealer labour pricing. No owner receipt exists for a car of this generation because none is old enough."},{"y":7,"source":"The friction brakes are the headline here and it is a BEV-specific story: after seven years of regenerative braking the pads still have material left, but rear discs that are rarely used corrode and seize in Taiwan's climate, so the car needs discs AND pads front and rear at Audi Taiwan prices - roughly 80,000. Add the 6-year inspection about 22,000, battery-circuit coolant service about 15,000, brake fluid 5,000, rear dampers and bushings about 28,000 (estate item - the Sportback carries less rear load), and about 18,000 of out-of-warranty risk allowance for the thermal-management pump or a charge-port module, both known BEV failure points once cover lapses. About 168,000, which is 13,000 above the A6 Sportback e-tron sibling's 155,000 - almost all of it the rear suspension work. Materially higher than a Japanese equivalent over the same window, purely on Audi dealer labour rates and the size of the brake hardware. Extrapolated - no A6 e-tron in Taiwan is seven years old."},{"y":10,"source":"The defining event in this window is not a service, it is the warranty clock: the 8-year battery cover runs out on the CALENDAR at year 8 while the odometer sits at only 56,000 km, so years 9 and 10 are driven with the most expensive component in the car completely uncovered. I carry an explicit risk allowance for that rather than pretending it is free or pricing a full pack replacement that would exceed the car's value. Build-up: second tyre set about 65,000, two scheduled inspections about 48,000, 12V AGM 12,000, coolant and brake fluid about 22,000, electric AC compressor risk-weighted at about 60,000 (a real failure costing 90,000-120,000 when it happens, discounted for probability), suspension refresh plus tailgate struts and rear wiper motor about 32,000, and about 63,000 of post-warranty high-voltage and electronics risk covering a battery module, an onboard-charger module or an OLED display. About 302,000. Ten-year total across all periods is 633,000, deliberately above the A6 Sportback e-tron sibling's 601,000. The 32,000 gap is the estate's rear suspension load, tailgate hardware and rear wiper, and nothing else, because the powertrain and brakes are identical - and unlike the previous version of this record, the estate is now dearer in every one of the five windows, not just the last three. It sits well above the Q6 e-tron's 509,000 (smaller wheels, less body hardware) and well below the BMW i5's 825,000. A BEV whose ten-year maintenance looked like a combustion Audi's would be wrong; so would one that looked like zero, and 633,000 is neither. Fully extrapolated - no data of this age exists for any PPE car anywhere in Taiwan."}],"sources":[{"name":"INSIDE - Audi A6 e-tron 台灣上市：Sportback、Avant 雙車身、三動力編成","url":"https://www.inside.com.tw/article/39719-audi-a6-e-tron-tw-launch","note":"Opened and re-verified by this check. The single most useful page: the complete official Taiwan launch price table, confirming the Avant is priced IDENTICALLY to the Sportback at every powertrain - 2,700,000 / 3,300,000 / 4,800,000 for both bodies. Primary evidence for the no-estate-premium finding."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 - 預售價自275萬元起、六種規格販售，Audi A6 e-tron Sportback/Avant 啟動預售","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/42040-275-audi-a6-e-tron-sportback-avant.html","note":"Opened and re-verified. Full pre-sale table: Sportback 2,750,000 / Avant 2,850,000, performance 3,350,000 / 3,450,000, S6 4,850,000 / 4,950,000 - a consistent 100,000 estate premium on all three tiers. Read with the INSIDE launch table, this proves Taiwan Audi dropped the estate premium between pre-sale and launch."},{"name":"8891 新車頻道 - Audi A6 e-tron在台上市！Sportback、Avant雙車型售價270萬元起","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/audi/a6-sportback-e-tron/20804","note":"Opened and re-verified. Independent confirmation of the 270萬-480萬 launch span. Does NOT break the table down by variant, so it corroborates the range and nothing finer."},{"name":"DDCAR - 補上主動式車道維持機能，Audi Q6 e-tron、A6 e-tron 新年式添新配備但價格也有調漲","url":"https://www.ddcar.com.tw/article/43417","note":"Opened (HTTP 200) but the article body will NOT render through the fetcher - only the header, the headline and the footer come back. The headline alone confirms that the 2026 model year added active lane-keeping and raised prices; the SIZE of the rise (+100,000 to 2,800,000 on both A6 e-tron bodies) is not readable from the page. This is why the 2026MY step is medium confidence, not high. The 2,800,000 figure is retained because model_year is 2026 and the sibling A6 Sportback e-tron record in this dataset carries the same list price."},{"name":"DDCAR - 入手價270萬元起！Audi A6 e-tron 正式上市","url":"https://www.ddcar.com.tw/article/41032","note":"Opened, body did not render - only the headline confirming the 270萬 launch entry price. Corroborates INSIDE and 8891 on the launch figure and nothing more."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi 二手 e-tron 行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/e-tron","note":"Opened and re-verified. THE key used-value evidence: four 2021 Audi e-tron 55 quattro cars, the priced ones at 1,258,000 車商售價 with 33,200 km, the rest at 30,000-33,000 km with price on inquiry. A real 5-year-old Audi BEV at almost exactly this buyer's mileage. Treated as DEALER RETAIL and cut about 11% to roughly 1,120,000 for the private-sale equivalent. Used ONLY as an absolute money check, NOT as a retention ratio, because the e-tron 55's original Taiwan list price has no source I can open."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi 全車系二手行情索引","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi","note":"Opened and re-verified. Brand-wide used index, 1,175 cars. Two findings: e-tron GT (2022) at 2,188,000 車商售價, confirming how hard Audi BEVs fall in Taiwan; and A4 Avant listings running 910,000-1,288,000. NOTE ON THE A4 AVANT SIGNAL: the previous version of this record used it to justify an estate retention premium. It is not transferable - the A4 Avant is a combustion wagon with an established Taiwan following, whereas this car stacks a thin body niche on a thin BEV niche."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi A6 Avant 二手","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a6_avant","note":"Opened and re-verified, and the RESULT ITSELF is the finding: ZERO A6 Avant listings of any generation. The page returns A4 Avants, A6 Sedans, Q5s and Q7s instead - the A6 estate is simply absent. This is the direct evidence that Taiwan's A6-class estate market is thin to the point of non-existence. This record reads that as a burden on the private seller (long time-to-sell, elevated 刊登 cost, slightly softer retention), not as scarcity value."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi A6 Sedan 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a6-sedan","note":"Opened and re-verified. 33 cars listed. Used as the combustion counterweight and as the sedan-vs-estate listing-count contrast (33 vs 0). Freshest print: 2024 car, 12,300 km, 1,880,000 車商售價 - about 65% dealer retail at two years against a roughly 2,880,000 list, so about 58% private. Sets the ceiling the BEV curve must sit under. IMPORTANT BODY-STYLE CAVEAT: this page is the SEDAN, not the estate. It is used only as an upper bound on the combustion curve and never as a direct comparable for this car."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Tesla Model 3 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/tesla/model_3","note":"Opened and re-verified. Used per the brief's instruction to lean long-horizon BEV extrapolation on the oldest BEVs that actually trade in Taiwan. Key prints: 2019 Model 3 Long Range 888,000 / 135,000 km (a genuine 7-year Taiwan BEV), 2021 Model 3 SR+ 948,000 / 80,000 km, 2021 Long Range 900,000 / 50,000 km. The oldest stock on the page is 2019, so Taiwan still gives no clean 10-year BEV print. These bracket the optimistic end of the Taiwan BEV band; the Audi e-tron print brackets the pessimistic end."}]},"audi-a6-sedan-200kw-quattro":{"assumptions":"BODY STYLE: this record is the four-door A6 SEDAN, not the A6 Avant estate. The dataset already holds the estate as 'audi-a6-avant-200kw-quattro', and every used-car figure below was read from the 8891 A6 Sedan listing page, with the 8891 A6 Avant page used only as a control for the body premium and for the quattro evidence the sedan market cannot supply. Checkpoints use assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000), so the car reaches only 35,000 km at year 5 and 70,000 km at year 10. Four consequences follow. (1) The service interval is TIME-driven. Audi's schedule triggers at 12 months or at a kilometre limit this owner never reaches, so the car takes one paid visit per year and ten visits in ten years. (2) Consumables age out instead of wearing out. Tires are replaced on rubber age at about 5-6 years with tread still left, which puts a set in the year 3-5 window and a second set in the year 7-10 window. (3) The factory warranty is 3 years unlimited mileage plus years 4 and 5 under 100,000 km. At 7,000 km/year the owner is at 35,000 km when it ends, so it is a genuine five-year cover for this profile and all repair risk falls into the year 5-7 and year 7-10 windows. (4) quattro all-wheel drive and the 48V belt starter-generator add hardware the 150 kW front-drive car does not carry, and that hardware ages by calendar, so it sits in the tail. On resale the low odometer protects this car from the bottom of each observed band rather than lifting it to the top: within a same-year set on 8891 the mileage effect is large up to about year 5 (a 2022 A6 Sedan at 43,400 km asks 123.8萬 against 83.0萬 for the same trim at 124,900 km) and weaker after it.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"SOURCE BASE REPLACED. The audited record built this point from Google-indexed 8891 listing titles behind a google.com/search URL. That URL was opened in this audit and returns Google's error page, not results, so it is not a citation and was deleted. The 8891 A6 Sedan listing page itself opens and was used instead. It carries no genuine one-year sedan, so the point is bracketed. Upper bracket, from the 8891 A6 Avant control page: a 2026 A6 Avant TFSI 150kW with 700-1,000 km asks 248.8萬 dealer retail against a 298萬 list, 83.5%, but that is delivery mileage, not a year of use. Lower bracket, same generation family on the sedan page: a 2024 A6 Sedan 40 TFSI 豪華版 with 30,000 km asks 132.8萬 against a 277.5萬 list, 47.9% at about two years, on more than four times this owner's pace. A one-year car at 7,000 km therefore sits near 75-76% of list as DEALER RETAIL, about 2,600,000. Cutting 12.5% to reach the PRIVATE SALE figure gives 2,270,000. That is 67.0% of real_cost, 2.8 points under the A6 150 kW Sedan sibling and 320,000 above it in absolute money, which is the correct shape: the S line and quattro premium raises the money but is least repaid in the first year. Dealer trade-in 1,995,000 is 12.1% under the private figure, holding the 車商售價 > 自售價 > 車商收購價 chain."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"RAISED from the audited record's 1,545,000, because that figure applied the trim penalty twice: it scaled the C8 evidence to this car's list, then took a further 8% haircut for the trim ladder, then also held the result under the base trim. Evidence, read from the 8891 A6 Sedan page that actually opens: a 2022 A6 Sedan 40 TFSI Technik 豪華版 with 43,400 km asks 123.8萬 dealer retail against a 277.5萬 list, 44.6% at four years, and the same trim with 124,900 km asks 83.0萬, 29.9%, which is the size of the mileage penalty in this segment. Interpolating the low-mileage line back to three years gives about 52% of list as dealer retail. Applied here: 3,460,000 x 0.52 = about 1,800,000 dealer retail, cut 11.4% for the PRIVATE SALE figure, giving 1,595,000. That is 47.1% of real_cost, one point under the A6 150 kW Sedan sibling and 250,000 above it in money. The car is still inside the factory warranty at this point. Dealer trade-in 1,395,000 is 12.5% below private. DIVERGENCE STATED: this is 8.9 points under the BMW 5 Series 520i anchor at 56%. The reason is supply and programme depth, not an error. BMW Taiwan sells the 5 Series in far larger numbers with a deep 認證中古 channel, while the A6 is a thin Taiwan market, and the live 8891 A6 Sedan asks at three to four years do not support a mid-fifties private-sale retention."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"RAISED from the audited record's 1,140,000. This is the largest correction and it has two causes. FIRST, the audited record abandoned the documented method here. It wrote that it did NOT carry the previous generation's retention ratio across and pinned an absolute money band instead. The method for cars with no real data at this age is to take the previous generation's real used price, express it as a ratio of that car's own list, and apply the ratio, so the deviation is what dragged the whole tail down. SECOND, its underlying quote could not be reproduced: it cited a 2020 A6 Sedan 40 TDI S-line at 125.8萬 from a Google search URL that returns an error page, while the 8891 A6 Sedan page that does open shows a 2020 A6 Sedan 40 TDI with 30,000 km asking 88.8萬. Evidence used here, all from pages opened in this audit. Sedan line: that 2020 40 TDI at 88.8萬 against a roughly 260萬 list is 34.2% dealer retail at six years, on genuinely low mileage. quattro line, from the 8891 A6 Avant control page: a 2021 A6 Avant 45 TFSI quattro S line with 58,000 km asks 168.8萬 against the 335萬 C8 list confirmed on ETtoday, 50.4% dealer retail at five years. The sedan body runs a few points under the estate, so a five-year S line quattro sedan sits near 44% of list as dealer retail, about 1,520,000. Cutting 13% for the PRIVATE SALE figure gives 1,315,000, which also sits between the two brackets those lines imply (about 1,180,000 from the sedan TDI line, about 1,450,000 from the Avant quattro line). Result is 38.8% of real_cost. DIVERGENCE STATED: that is 3.4 points ABOVE the A6 150 kW Sedan sibling's 35.4%, a crossing the trim-ladder rule needs a reason for. The reason is that quattro is a drivetrain step, not an equipment grade, and both quattro records in this dataset already show the same crossing at year 5 against their front-drive siblings. Warranty ends at the close of this period. Dealer trade-in 1,140,000 is 13.3% below private, widening because this is where dealers start pricing post-warranty risk."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolated, so confidence stays low. The current generation is one year old in Taiwan and has no real seven-year data. Real comparables from the 8891 pages opened here. Sedan line: a 2018 A6 Sedan 35 TFSI with 59,900 km asks 47.0萬 dealer retail against a 238萬 list, 19.7% at eight years, on a 1.8-litre front-drive base car with more than twice this owner's mileage. quattro line: a 2019 A6 Avant 45 TFSI quattro S line with 100,000 km asks 143.8萬 against a list between 335萬 and 359.5萬, about 42% at seven years. Method: express each as a ratio of its own list, correct the sedan point upward for age, mileage and the 2.0 quattro top trim (to about 29% of list) and the Avant point downward for body and for the fact that a 100,000 km ask on a rare estate is optimistic (toward the low thirties), then apply the reconciled ratio of about 32% of list as dealer retail, about 1,110,000. Cutting 13% for the PRIVATE SALE figure gives 965,000, 28.5% of real_cost. The audited record's 872,000 was derived from a 2019 sedan quote at 117.0萬 that does not appear on the live 8891 sedan page and came from an unopenable search URL. DIVERGENCE STATED: this is 9.7 points under the A7 Sportback 45 TFSI quattro anchor at 38.2%. Reason: the A7 is a low-volume niche body whose Taiwan used supply is tiny, which holds asks up, while the A6 Sedan is the volume body and its live eight-year asks are far weaker. This car is also out of warranty from year 6 and the market prices in Audi repair risk on a quattro plus 48V car. Dealer trade-in 828,000 is 14.2% below private."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolated from the C7 generation, so confidence stays low. Real ten-year data from pages opened in this audit: Yahoo Autos' 2016 A6 Sedan page gives the list ladder as 35 TFSI 238萬 (1798cc, 190hp), 40 TFSI 279萬 (1984cc, 252hp) and S6 469萬, and the 8891 A6 Sedan page shows a 2016 A6 Sedan 35 TFSI with 120,000 km asking 32.2萬 dealer retail, 13.5% of its own list at ten years on high mileage, with 2015 and 2014 cars at 28.8萬 and 24.0萬 behind it. Method: take that 13.5%, add for the 2.0-litre engine, the quattro top trim and half the mileage, which lifts the ratio to about 17-18% of list as dealer retail, roughly 600,000, then cut 14% for the PRIVATE SALE figure. That gives 512,000, 15.1% of real_cost. The deduction sits at the conservative end of that band because by year 10 this car is five years out of warranty and carries a 48V starter-generator, a 48V battery and a quattro driveline that a front-drive 35 TFSI never had, and the Taiwan market discounts hard for that exposure. Cross-checks: 512,000 is 92,000 above the A6 150 kW Sedan sibling in absolute money, as the trim ladder requires, and 88,000 below the A6 Avant 200 kW quattro sibling's 600,000, as the body relationship requires. DIVERGENCE STATED: this is 6.2 points under the A7 Sportback anchor at 21.3%, for the same supply reason given at year 7. Dealer trade-in 435,000 is 15.0% below private, the widest gap in the table because trade-in bids on ten-year German cars are effectively wholesale-auction bids."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"One paid visit. The scheduled figure is the mid range between the two readings of Audi Taiwan's official service-price tool described in plan_notes, about 11,000 for a year-1 service on the newer C9 platform, plus about 4,000 for wipers, washer fluid and an alignment check. Nothing else is due: the car is inside the 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty and brakes and tires are untouched at 7,000 km. Confidence is medium, not high as filed, because the official table answers only through a form and the figure could not be reproduced. In line with the A6 150 kW Sedan sibling at 15,000 and the A6 Avant 200 kW quattro sibling at 16,000."},{"y":3,"source":"Two paid visits in this window: about 12,000 for the year-2 service and about 17,000 for the year-3 service, which adds brake fluid and the cabin dust filter, both taken as the mid range between the two readings of the official tool. About 9,000 more covers wipers, alignment and wheel balancing. Total 38,000. Still fully inside the factory warranty, so no repair allowance is carried, and brake pads are not due at 21,000 km. Confidence lowered from high to medium for the reason given at year 1. Sits between the A6 150 kW Sedan sibling at 37,000 and the A6 Avant 200 kW quattro sibling at 40,000."},{"y":5,"source":"Scheduled work is two visits, about 28,000 for the pair on the mid range of the two readings of the official tool. The dominant line is tires: at 7,000 km/year the S line's 20-inch set ages out at about five years with tread left, and a dealer-fitted set of four premium 20-inch tires runs about 62,000 in Taiwan. Alignment and balancing after the fit add about 6,000, and wipers, cabin filter and washer consumables about 12,000. Total 108,000. Front brake pads and discs, which the audited record charged here at 35,000 km, were moved to the year 5-7 window as early; the same correction was already made on the A6 Avant 200 kW quattro sibling. Everything mechanical is still inside the 5-year / 100,000 km warranty in this window, so no repair allowance is carried. Compare the A6 Avant 200 kW quattro sibling at 118,000, which carries the same tire size on a heavier body."},{"y":7,"source":"The first period outside the factory warranty, which ends at the close of year 5. The year-6 major service covers spark plugs, automatic transmission oil, air filter and the V-belt with its tensioner; it is carried at about 32,000, the mid range between the two conflicting readings of Audi Taiwan's official tool (30,200 from the A6 Avant record in this dataset against 43,100-44,100 claimed in the audited record). The year-7 service adds about 10,000. Front brake pads and discs, moved here from the year 3-5 window, run about 30,000 at an Audi dealer. A 12V AGM battery on a 48V car needs dealer coding and runs about 16,000 fitted. Coolant service and thermostat-housing work add about 14,000. The remaining 28,000 is an out-of-warranty allowance for the failure items this drivetrain family is known for in Taiwan: electric water pump, coil packs, sensors and control-arm bushings. Total 130,000, materially above a Japanese equivalent in the same window, which is expected for Audi dealer labour rates and larger brakes. Sits just under the A6 Avant 200 kW quattro sibling at 133,000 and above the A6 150 kW Sedan sibling at 120,000."},{"y":10,"source":"Three scheduled visits, about 33,000 for the set on the mid range of the two readings of the official tool, with the year-9 visit adding brake fluid and the cabin filter. Consumables and risk dominate the rest. The year-5 tire set ages out again, so a second set of four 20-inch tires falls due at about 60,000. Front and rear discs and pads together are about 45,000. The 48V starter-generator and its battery are the item unique to this powertrain out of warranty; a 40,000 allowance carries the risk that it may or may not fail inside ten years. Water pump and thermostat are about 28,000. Dampers, bushings and engine mounts are about 25,000 on a ten-year-old car even at low mileage, because rubber ages on a clock. The remaining 15,000 is a general allowance for MMI faults, sensors and oil leaks. Total 246,000, against 266,000 for the A6 Avant 200 kW quattro sibling on the same drivetrain in a heavier body and 223,000 for the A6 150 kW Sedan, which has no quattro driveline, no 48V hardware and smaller wheels. Ten-year total across all periods is 537,000."}],"sources":[{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - 2026 Audi A6 Sedan 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-a6-sedan-2026","note":"OPENED IN THIS AUDIT. Independent list-price verification: two variants only, TFSI 150kW 288萬 (1984cc, 204hp) and TFSI 200kW quattro S-Line 運動版 346萬 (1984cc, 272hp). Confirms 3,460,000 at 0% divergence. The page labels the 200kW car 油電混合; it labels the plain 2016, 2019, 2021 and 2023 A6 the same way, so the label is a site category, not a specification."},{"name":"CARTURE 車勢文化 - 2026年式 Audi A6 全車系建議售價","url":"https://www.carture.com.tw/news/article/39253","note":"OPENED IN THIS AUDIT. Second independent list-price source, full four-row table: Sedan TFSI 150kW 288萬 / Sedan TFSI 200kW quattro S line 346萬 / Avant TFSI 150kW 298萬 / Avant TFSI 200kW quattro S line 356萬."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi A6 Sedan 在售車輛清單","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/audi/a6-sedan","note":"OPENED IN THIS AUDIT and now the primary used-car evidence for this record, replacing seven google.com/search URLs that return an error page. Live dealer-retail asks read from it: 2024 40 TFSI 豪華版 30,000 km 132.8萬; 2022 40 TFSI Technik 豪華版 43,400 km 123.8萬; 2022 40 TFSI Technik 豪華版 124,900 km 83.0萬; 2020 40 TDI 30,000 km 88.8萬; 2018 35 TFSI 59,900 km 47.0萬; 2016 35 TFSI 120,000 km 32.2萬; 2015 35 TDI 170,000 km 28.8萬; 2014 35 TFSI 110,900 km 24.0萬. All are 車商售價. No C8 A6 Sedan quattro appears, which matches the C8 sedan price ladder."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Audi A6 Avant 在售車輛清單 (body control)","url":"https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=4&model=9282","note":"OPENED IN THIS AUDIT. Used only as a control for the estate premium and as the quattro evidence the sedan market cannot supply. Live dealer-retail asks: 2021 45 TFSI quattro S line 運動版 58,000 km 168.8萬; 2021 40 TFSI S line 38,000 km 145.0萬; 2019 45 TFSI quattro S line 100,000 km 143.8萬; 2023 40 TFSI Technik 豪華版 48,000 km 163.0萬; 2020 40 TDI 67,000 km 99.8萬; 2026 TFSI 150kW 700-1,000 km 248.8萬."},{"name":"ETtoday 車雲 - 2021 Audi A6 全車系售價","url":"https://speed.ettoday.net/news/1893122","note":"OPENED IN THIS AUDIT. C8 list ladder used as the retention basis at year 5. Sedan 40 TFSI 257萬 / Premium 265萬 / S Line 280萬; Avant 40 TFSI 267萬 / Premium 275萬 / S Line 290萬 / 45 TFSI quattro S Line 335萬. Confirms Taiwan sold no quattro C8 A6 Sedan, so the quattro comparison must run through the Avant."},{"name":"KingAutos - Audi A6 Avant 車系規格與售價","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/audi/a6_avant","note":"OPENED IN THIS AUDIT. Later C8 ladder: Avant 40 TFSI 享馭版 279.5萬, Technik 豪華版 287.5萬, S-Line 運動版 303.5萬, 45 TFSI quattro S-Line 運動版 359.5萬. Used to date the 45 TFSI quattro S line list between 335萬 and 359.5萬 across the C8 run."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - 2023 Audi A6 Sedan 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-a6-sedan-2023","note":"OPENED IN THIS AUDIT. C8 list prices used as the retention basis at year 3: 40 TFSI 享馭版 269.5萬, Technik 豪華版 277.5萬, S-Line 運動版 293.5萬."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - 2021 Audi A6 Sedan 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-a6-sedan-2021","note":"OPENED IN THIS AUDIT. C8 sedan list prices at the year-5 basis: 40 TFSI 257萬, Premium 265萬, S-Line 280萬. Three variants only, no quattro."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - 2019 Audi A6 Sedan 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-a6-sedan-2019","note":"OPENED IN THIS AUDIT. C8 launch-year sedan listing: 40 TDI Premium 254萬, one variant only."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車機車 - 2016 Audi A6 Sedan 車款總覽","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/audi-a6-sedan-2016","note":"OPENED IN THIS AUDIT. C7 list prices used as the retention basis at year 10: 35 TFSI 238萬 (1798cc, 190hp), 40 TFSI 279萬 (1984cc, 252hp), S6 469萬."},{"name":"Audi Taiwan 官方保養費用查詢 (保養透明 安心啟航)","url":"https://service-pricing.audi-service.com.tw/","note":"OPENED IN THIS AUDIT and the site works, but it answers only through a form: a direct fetch returns its default result (an A1 Sportback 2020年式 band of NT$10,500-11,500) and the A6 per-year table could not be reproduced. Two records now report conflicting readings of this tool for the A6 45 TFSI, most sharply on the year-6 major service (30,200 against 43,100-44,100). The maintenance figures here take the mid range between them and no maintenance checkpoint is rated above medium."}]},"bmw-3-series-330i-m-sport":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/year against a Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000 km/year. Every checkpoint uses the 7,000 km/year midpoint: 7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km. BODY STYLE CONFIRMED: the Yahoo Autos 2026 330i M Sport trim page returns 車身型式 4-door sedan, 5 seats. Every used comparable used below is also a Sedan. The 8891 index and the FindCar G20 query were both re-opened for this check and every listing they return is titled '3-Series Sedan' or 'Sedan G20'. No Touring (5-door wagon) listing enters this record. THREE THINGS DRIVE THIS CAR'S NUMBERS AT 7,000 KM/YEAR. (1) BMW Condition Based Service is time-driven here, not distance-driven. The annual counter and the 24-month brake-fluid counter trip long before the B48 distance interval, so the plan bills one dealer visit per year and ages consumables out on the calendar. (2) The running-cost penalty over the 320i M Sport is almost all consumables, not service labour. The Taiwan-spec 330i M Sport wears staggered 19-inch runflat tyres and larger M Sport front brakes on the same B48 2.0-litre block, so tyre and brake line items are much larger while the annual oil service is nearly identical. At 7,000 km/year those tyres age out at 5-6 years with tread left, so the owner pays the 19-inch runflat bill twice in ten years and never gets the mileage back. (3) Low mileage is worth money at 5-10 years, but LESS than the previous draft assumed. Re-opened evidence: on 8891 a 2019 330i Luxury Line at 48,000 km asks NT$1,080,000 while a 2019 330i Luxury Line at 82,000 km asks NT$1,038,000. A 34,000 km difference moves the ask about 4%, not 20%. Trim moves the ask far more than the odometer does: 2019 M Sport cars ask NT$1,158,000-1,298,000 against NT$898,000-1,080,000 for Luxury Line cars of the same year. Every checkpoint below therefore applies a mileage adjustment of about 1.5-2% per 10,000 km, not the double-digit adjustments the previous draft used. EXCLUDED BY DESIGN: 牌照稅 (NT$11,230/yr for 1,998cc) and 燃料稅 (NT$6,180/yr) per the Yahoo Autos spec page, plus all insurance, fuel, parking and tolls.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"RAISED FROM NT$2,030,000. THE PREVIOUS DRAFT MISREAD ITS OWN ANCHOR. It reported the 8891 listing as 'a 2025 330i at 1,500 km asking NT$2,438,000', called that an implausible 展示車 outlier, and discounted the anchor down to NT$2,360,000 on that basis. The 8891 330i index was re-fetched for this check and the listing reads 2025 3-Series Sedan 330i M Sport, 1.5萬km, 243.8萬 - that is 15,000 km, not 1,500 km. A 2025 car at 15,000 km is an ordinary one-year car, not a demonstrator, so there was nothing to discount. The same re-fetch surfaced a SECOND 2025 330i M Sport at 3,000 km asking NT$2,550,000, which the previous draft did not report and which is the genuine low-mileage end. DEALER RETAIL FOR OUR CAR: interpolating the two reproduced asks (NT$2,550,000 at 3,000 km, NT$2,438,000 at 15,000 km) to 7,000 km gives about NT$2,480,000 車商售價. ADJUSTMENT TO PRIVATE SALE: minus 14.5% (2,480,000 x 0.855 = 2,120,000). The deep end of the 8-15% band is used deliberately, because a private seller of a nearly-new car competes against dealer stock that carries warranty, certification and financing. DEALER TRADE-IN NT$1,840,000 is 13.2% under private sale. DIVERGENCE STATED: retention is 73.0% of real_cost against 71.0% for the 320i M Sport sedan sibling, so the pricier trim retains 2.0 points MORE at year one, which reverses the normal trim ladder. The reason is in the observed asks and is not an assumption: same-age dealer asks run NT$2,480,000 for the 330i against NT$1,980,000 for the 320i (from the sibling record's own 8891 fetch), a ratio of 1.25 on a list-price ratio of only 1.20. Nearly-new 330i supply in Taiwan is thin because 汎德's volume trim is the 320i, so the year-one market does not discount the engine step. The ladder reverts to normal from year 5 onward, where the premium stops being paid. It is also 1.1 points above the 3 Series Touring 330i M Sport record; that gap is inside the noise of a two-listing sample."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"RAISED FROM NT$1,610,000, AND THE ANCHOR WAS REPLACED. The previous draft leaned on '2023 at 40,000 km asking NT$1,758,000' and on '2022 at 26,000 km asking NT$1,528,000'. Neither listing reproduced on re-fetch of the same 8891 330i index. What DID reproduce, and is used here, is a 2024 3-Series Sedan 330i M Sport at 37,200 km asking NT$2,090,000 and a 2022 3-Series Sedan 330i M Sport 白金極智版 at 42,200 km asking NT$1,720,000. Those two bracket the three-year point. Straight-line between them puts a mileage-blind 2023 330i M Sport at about NT$1,900,000 車商售價; our car carries roughly 17,000 fewer km than either comparable, worth about +4% at this age on the mileage sensitivity measured in assumptions.notes, giving about NT$1,970,000. ADJUSTMENT TO PRIVATE SALE: minus 14% (1,970,000 x 0.86 = 1,694,000), rounded to NT$1,690,000. DEALER TRADE-IN NT$1,465,000 is 13.3% under private. NOTE ON THE PREVIOUS DRAFT'S SECOND ARGUMENT: it shaded its number down because 'the 2023 comparable sold new at about 289萬 while this record's basis is 299萬'. The FindCar 2021 query returns the 2021 Sedan 330i M Sport new-car reference at 278萬, so list price has climbed about 21萬 in five years, and the general direction of that argument is right. It is already inside the observed 2022 and 2024 asks used here and is not applied a second time. RETENTION 58.2% against 55.9% for the 320i M Sport sedan (a stated +2.3-point divergence, same thin-supply reason as year 1) and against 59.0% for the 3 Series Touring 330i M Sport, which the sedan should and does sit just below."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"RAISED FROM NT$1,270,000, AND THE PREVIOUS DRAFT'S PREMISE WAS WRONG. It stated 'NO CLEAN 5-YEAR 330i LISTING EXISTS' and interpolated off a 13-16%-per-year ladder instead. A five-year listing does exist: the FindCar 2021 330i query returns a 2021 BMW 330I M SPORT Sedan at 91,299 km asking NT$1,498,000 (星岑車業, Tainan). The same query returns a 2021 330i M-Sport at 8,942 km asking NT$2,538,000; that second one is DISCARDED, because NT$2,538,000 is 91% of the 2021 car's own NT$2,780,000 list price after five years and is not credible as a real ask. MILEAGE ADJUSTMENT: our car has 35,000 km against the usable comparable's 91,299 km, worth about +9% at the 1.5-2% per 10,000 km rate measured in assumptions.notes, giving about NT$1,630,000 車商售價. CROSS-CHECK ON THE OBSERVED LADDER: the reproduced asks run 2024 NT$2,090,000 and 2022 NT$1,720,000, about 11% per model year, which extends to roughly NT$1,530,000 for a mileage-blind 2021 car; adding the same low-mileage premium gives about NT$1,660,000. The two routes agree inside 2%, so NT$1,630,000 is used. ADJUSTMENT TO PRIVATE SALE: minus 15% (1,630,000 x 0.85 = 1,385,500), rounded to NT$1,385,000. The deep end of the band is used because a five-year German sedan out of warranty is the hardest kind of car to sell privately. DEALER TRADE-IN NT$1,190,000 is 14.1% under private. RETENTION 47.7% against 48.0% for the 320i M Sport sedan, so the trim ladder is back in its normal order from here on: absolute resale is higher (NT$1,385,000 against NT$1,160,000) while the ratio is slightly lower. Confidence stays low, because one usable 2021 listing is a thin base."},{"y":7,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"BEST-SOURCED CHECKPOINT, AND THE ONE THE PREVIOUS DRAFT GOT CLOSEST TO. Its eight FindCar listings reproduced EXACTLY on re-fetch: 2019/70,000km NT$1,298,000 (G20 330i Msport), 2019/90,000km NT$1,198,000, 2019/80,000km NT$1,158,000 (M版), 2019/86,458km NT$1,048,000, 2019/81,938km NT$1,038,000 (Luxury), 2018/118,441km NT$1,038,000, 2019/96,917km NT$998,000, 2019/104,628km NT$948,000; all titled Sedan G20. The 8891 index independently returns 2019 Sedan 330i M Sport NT$1,288,000 at 106,000 km, 2019 Sedan 330i M Sport NT$1,198,000 at 90,000 km, 2019 Sedan 330i Luxury Line NT$1,080,000 at 48,000 km, 2019 Sedan 330i Luxury Line NT$1,038,000 at 82,000 km and 2019 Sedan 330i Luxury Line NT$920,000 at 64,000 km. METHOD CHANGED, NUMBER BARELY MOVED. The previous draft took a median across ALL trims and added about 20% for mileage. That over-states mileage and under-states trim: the 8891 pair above shows 34,000 fewer km moving a Luxury Line ask only about 4%, while M Sport cars of the same year ask about 19% more than Luxury Line cars. Restricting to M Sport gives a median of about NT$1,236,000 at a median 86,000 km; adjusting our 49,000 km car by about +6% gives about NT$1,300,000. Cross-checking from the same-mileage Luxury Line car (NT$1,080,000 at 48,000 km) plus the 19% M Sport premium gives about NT$1,285,000. Both routes land near NT$1,300,000 車商售價, so that is used. ADJUSTMENT TO PRIVATE SALE: minus 14% (1,300,000 x 0.86 = 1,118,000), rounded to NT$1,120,000. DEALER TRADE-IN NT$950,000 is 15.2% under private; the spread widens with age because dealers price in out-of-warranty risk. RETENTION 38.6% against 41.4% for the 320i M Sport sedan and 40.0% for the 3 Series Touring 330i M Sport - below both, as the trim ladder and the Taiwan wagon premium both require. The car is fully outside its 3年/4萬公里 factory warranty here. Confidence medium rather than high: thirteen listings is a real sample, but they are asking prices, not transactions."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREVIOUS GENERATION. NO REAL 10-YEAR G20 DATA EXISTS AND NONE IS INVENTED. The G20 reached Taiwan in 2019, so the oldest car is 7 years old today and a genuine 10-year G20 price cannot exist until 2029. METHOD: take the real used price of the previous-generation F30 330i M Sport at 10 years, express it as a retention ratio of that car's OWN original cost, then apply that ratio to this car's real_cost. STEP 1 - the F30's own list price, re-verified this session: the Yahoo Autos 2016 3-Series Sedan model page returns 318i 178萬 / 318d 196萬 / 320i進化版 199萬 / 320i M Sport 215萬 / 330e Luxury 266萬 / 330i M Sport 267萬 / 340i M Performance 339萬 / M3 490-503萬. So NT$2,670,000, with real cost about NT$2,610,000 on the same discount-plus-fees logic. The Yahoo Autos F30 330i M Sport trim page confirms the hardware and the body: 1,998cc, 252hp@5200rpm, 35.7kgm@1450rpm, 8AT, M 18/19-inch wheels, 4-door sedan. STEP 2 - its real price today: the 8891 330i index returns a 2016 3-Series Sedan 330i M Sport at 100,000 km asking NT$628,000 車商售價. STEP 3 - mileage adjustment: our car reaches only 70,000 km, worth about +8% at this age, giving about NT$678,000 車商售價. STEP 4 - private sale at minus 13% is about NT$590,000, a ratio of 590,000 / 2,610,000 = 22.6%. STEP 5 - applied to real_cost 2,905,000 that gives NT$657,000. SET AT NT$650,000 (22.4%) so the top trim does not out-retain the 320i M Sport sedan (22.6%) at this age: by year 10 the engine premium is worth nothing, while the staggered 19-inch runflats and M Sport brakes are a live cost the next owner must fund. Absolute resale still sits above the 320i (NT$650,000 against NT$550,000), which the trim ladder requires. Cross-check attempted and failed honestly: the FindCar 2016 F30 query returns 沒有符合查詢條件的車輛, zero listings, so the F30 anchor rests on one 8891 datapoint. Confidence low by construction. DEALER TRADE-IN NT$530,000 is 18.5% under private, the widest spread of any checkpoint, because at ten years most dealers will only take the car as a 抵價 write-down."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"One time-driven annual CBS visit inside the 3年/4萬公里 factory warranty. 7,000 km is nowhere near any distance interval, so this is the calendar service only. Probability-weighted between the campaign case (原廠保養套裝 applies, owner pays about NT$3,000 of wear items) and the no-package case (about NT$12,000, being the NT$10,222 owner receipt carried over from the sibling 320i sedan record for the same B48 engine, plus wipers and cabin filter). Weighted to NT$9,000. No 330i-specific uplift here: tyres and brakes are untouched at 7,000 km, so the 19-inch and M-brake premium has not yet been triggered. Confidence downgraded from medium to low in the adversarial check, because no maintenance page was opened first-hand for this record."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers years 1-3: two more annual CBS visits plus the 24-month brake-fluid change, all still inside the 3年/4萬公里 warranty at 21,000 km. Same probability weighting as year 1 between the campaign package case (about NT$12,000) and the no-package case (about NT$30,000: two services near NT$11,000 each, plus brake fluid near NT$4,500, plus filters). Weighted to NT$24,000, NT$4,000 above the sibling 320i sedan's NT$20,000. The uplift is the larger brake-fluid volume on the M Sport brake system and the extra alignment work that staggered 19-inch fitment attracts, not a higher service labour rate. Confidence downgraded from medium to low in the adversarial check, for the reason given at year 1."},{"y":5,"source":"First period outside the factory warranty, and the first period where the 330i's consumables bite. Build-up: two annual services at about NT$12,000 each (NT$24,000, now at full unsubsidised dealer price) + a full set of staggered 19-inch runflats at about NT$66,000 fitted, replaced on AGE at 5 years with tread remaining because 35,000 km would not wear them out + brake fluid NT$4,000 + a 12V AGM battery about NT$15,000, also an age replacement at 5 years + engine and cabin filters NT$6,000 + four-wheel alignment NT$3,000 = NT$118,000. BRAKES ARE DELIBERATELY NOT IN THIS PERIOD: at 7,000 km/year the front pads have seen only 35,000 km, below the 50,000-60,000 km where M Sport pads and discs are normally replaced, so that cost sits in the year-7 window instead. NT$13,000 above the sibling 320i sedan's NT$105,000, and the whole gap is the 19-inch runflat set. Consumable prices are TW dealer estimates, not a fetched price table."},{"y":7,"source":"Fully out of warranty. The used market prices this period as repair risk and so does this record. Build-up: two annual services at about NT$13,000 each (NT$26,000) + M Sport front pads and discs about NT$38,000 (the 330i's larger front brakes, against roughly NT$26,000 for the 320i's) + rear pads NT$14,000 + brake fluid NT$4,000 + B48 spark plugs, four plus labour, about NT$12,000 + coolant change NT$6,000 + filters NT$6,000 + an out-of-warranty provision of NT$32,000 for the B48's two known age-related leak points, the plastic thermostat housing and the oil filter housing gasket = NT$138,000. NT$26,000 above the sibling 320i sedan's NT$112,000, driven by the brake sizes and a slightly larger risk provision for the higher-output tune. Estimated from parts pricing, not a fetched table."},{"y":10,"source":"Years 7-10, the period where a German luxury sedan's tail cost is real and a Lexus's is not. Build-up: three annual services at about NT$14,000 each (NT$42,000) + a SECOND set of 19-inch staggered runflats about NT$68,000, again replaced on age not wear + electric water pump and thermostat about NT$52,000, the single most predictable big-ticket B48 failure at this age + four ignition coils NT$18,000 + a second 12V AGM battery NT$15,000 + rear discs and pads NT$20,000 + valve cover gasket oil leak NT$25,000 + ZF 8HP transmission oil and filter service NT$18,000 + a provision of NT$35,000 for dampers, control-arm bushings and electrical ancillaries, which the M Sport sport suspension reaches sooner than the standard setup and which would also absorb a 48V starter-generator replacement if the Taiwan car carries one = NT$293,000, rounded to NT$300,000. TOTAL 10-YEAR MAINTENANCE NT$589,000 (9,000 + 24,000 + 118,000 + 138,000 + 300,000), against NT$485,000 for the 320i M Sport sedan, NT$580,000 for the 3 Series Touring 330i M Sport, NT$547,000 for the 4 Series 420i and NT$540,000 for the Mercedes C 200. Highest of the group, and the reason is specific rather than generic: two sets of staggered 19-inch runflat tyres plus one set of M Sport brakes account for almost the whole gap over the 320i. Estimated, not fetched."}],"sources":[{"name":"KingAutos 國王車訊 — 2026 BMW 3 Series Sedan 車款總覽","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/bmw/3_series_sedan","note":"RE-FETCHED IN THE ADVERSARIAL CHECK AND REPRODUCED. Returns the 2026 Taiwan lineup as 318i Sport 219萬 / 320i M Sport 249萬 / 330i M Sport 299萬 / M340i xDrive 368萬, with 330i M Sport marked 汽油, 1,998cc, 245hp. Also confirms the M340i xDrive sedan is still listed. CAUTION: the same table prints the M340i as 2,998cc / 245hp, which is wrong for a car that makes about 374hp, so the price column is used here and the spec column is not trusted on its own."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車 — 2026 BMW 3-Series Sedan 330i M Sport 規格","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-3-series-sedan-2026-330i-m-sport","note":"RE-FETCHED AND REPRODUCED. Second independent price confirmation at 299萬, plus 1,998cc, 245hp@4500rpm, 40.8kgm@1600rpm, 8AT, 13.8 km/l combined, 牌照稅 NT$11,230, 燃料稅 NT$6,180. Also the BODY-STYLE source: 車身型式 4-door sedan, 5 seats. Contains no electric-motor, ISG or mild-hybrid entry."},{"name":"BMW Taiwan 線上預訂 — 3 Series (G20 LCI)","url":"https://reserve.bmw.com.tw/all-models/g20lci","note":"OPENS, BUT CARRIES NO PRICE TABLE. Re-fetched in this check: returns the online-ordering terms and conditions plus the disclaimer 建議售價僅供參考. Kept because it opens and because it documents that the scout's price URL cannot confirm a per-trim price; no number in this record rests on it."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — BMW 3-Series 330i 中古行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/330i","note":"PRIMARY USED-CURVE SOURCE, RE-FETCHED. Every listing is titled 3-Series Sedan. What this fetch returned: 2025 330i M Sport 3,000km NT$2,550,000; 2025 330i M Sport 15,000km NT$2,438,000; 2024 330i M Sport 37,200km NT$2,090,000; 2022 330i M Sport 白金極智版 42,200km NT$1,720,000; 2020 330i 70,000km NT$1,198,000 and NT$1,180,000; 2019 330i M Sport 106,000km NT$1,288,000; 2019 330i M Sport 90,000km NT$1,198,000; 2019 330i Luxury Line 48,000km NT$1,080,000; 2019 330i Luxury 48,000km NT$1,080,000; 2019 330i Luxury Line 82,000km NT$1,038,000; 2019 330i 81,000km NT$1,030,000; 2019 330i Luxury Line 64,000km NT$920,000; 2019 330i Luxury Line 138,000km NT$898,000; 2016 330i M Sport 100,000km NT$628,000. TWO CORRECTIONS AGAINST THE PREVIOUS DRAFT: the 2025 car reads 1.5萬km (15,000 km), not 1,500 km, and a second 2025 car at 3,000 km / NT$2,550,000 exists. The previous draft's 2023/40,000km NT$1,758,000 and 2022/26,000km NT$1,528,000 rows did NOT reproduce and are not used. All figures are DEALER RETAIL asks and were cut 13-15% to reach private sale at every checkpoint."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — G20 BMW 330i 中古行情","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/g20%20bmw%20330i","note":"PRIMARY 7-YEAR SOURCE, RE-FETCHED AND REPRODUCED EXACTLY, including mileages. 8 vehicles, average NT$1,090,000, all Sedan G20: 2019/70,000km NT$1,298,000 (G20 330i Msport), 2019/90,000km NT$1,198,000, 2019/80,000km NT$1,158,000 (330i M版), 2019/86,458km NT$1,048,000, 2019/81,938km NT$1,038,000 (Luxury), 2018/118,441km NT$1,038,000, 2019/96,917km NT$998,000, 2019/104,628km NT$948,000. Three listings share one Taoyuan dealer (肇楓汽車) at the top of the band, so the M Sport median rather than the maximum was used."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — 2021 BMW 330i 查詢","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/2021%20bmw%20330i","note":"ADDED IN THE ADVERSARIAL CHECK. This is the five-year listing the previous draft said did not exist. Returns a 2021 BMW 330I M SPORT Sedan at 91,299 km asking NT$1,498,000 (星岑車業, Tainan) and a 2021 330i M-Sport Sedan at 8,942 km asking NT$2,538,000 (discarded as not credible at 91% of the 2021 list price after five years). The same page gives the 2021 new-car reference prices that separate the two bodies: Sedan 330i M Sport 278萬, Touring 330i M Sport 285萬."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車 — 2016 BMW 3-Series Sedan (F30) 車型價格表","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/model/bmw-3-series-sedan-2016","note":"RE-FETCHED AND REPRODUCED. Previous-generation list price for the year-10 extrapolation: F30 330i M Sport 建議售價 267萬 (full table 318i 178萬 / 318d 196萬 / 320i進化版 199萬 / 320i M Sport 215萬 / 330e Luxury 266萬 / 330i M Sport 267萬 / 340i M Performance 339萬 / M3 490-503萬)."},{"name":"Yahoo 汽車 — 2016 BMW 3-Series Sedan 330i M Sport 規格 (F30)","url":"https://autos.yahoo.com.tw/new-cars/trim/bmw-3-series-sedan-2016-330i-m-sport","note":"RE-FETCHED AND REPRODUCED. F30 hardware and body confirmation for the extrapolation: 1,998cc, 252hp@5200rpm, 35.7kgm@1450rpm, 8AT, M 18/19-inch wheels, 4-door sedan, 5 seats. The page carries the tax figures but no price, which is why the model-level table above supplies the 267萬."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — 2016 BMW 330i F30 查詢","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/2016%20bmw%20330i%20f30","note":"NEGATIVE RESULT, RE-CHECKED AND REPRODUCED. The page opens and returns 沒有符合查詢條件的車輛, zero listings. The intended second F30 cross-check fails, so the year-10 extrapolation rests on one 8891 F30 datapoint. This is why year 10 is marked low confidence."}]},"bmw-3-series-touring-318i-sport":{"assumptions":"7,000 km/year on a B48 2.0T petrol estate. Three effects are specific to this car. First, every service in the plan is time-driven, not mileage-driven: BMW Condition Based Service calls the oil service at 12 months long before the car reaches the mileage trigger, so the owner pays for a full annual visit while using about half the interval. Second, tyres and the 12V AGM battery age out instead of wearing out, so both run on a 5-year clock and are replaced at year 5 and again at year 10, at about 35,000 km of wear each time. This matters twice over ten years, not once, and the same clock and the same two placements are used in all three Taiwan 3 Series Touring records. Third, low mileage is a real resale asset here: the 8891 stock of G21 320i Touring cars sits at 45,000-90,000 km by years 4-6, so a 318i Touring showing 35,000 km at 5 years or 49,000 km at 7 years is well under the visible market and prices above it. Working against that, the Sport trim is the base kit. The M Sport aero, 18-inch M wheels, harman/kardon and HUD that the Taiwan used market treats as the default 3 Series specification are a 260,000 option pack on this car (選配價26萬), not a separate model, and 156 hp is the weakest engine in the range.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"RAISED, 1,450,000 -> 1,485,000, AND REBUILT ON THE SHARED G21 TOURING SET. Still DERIVED, NOT OBSERVED: this model launched 2026-07-30, three weeks before this record, so no one-year-old 318i Touring exists and none is claimed. The shared set is the 8891 320i Touring stock page (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i-touring), re-opened 2026-08-22, which renders about 40 rows. Rows re-verified today and used by all three Taiwan Touring records: 2025 5,000 km 220.0萬 (BMW認證); 2025 3,000 km 電洽; 2024 9,000 km 192.8萬 (five cars); 2024 15,200 km 電洽; 2024 17,000 km 192.8萬; 2024 21,000 km 182.8萬; 2024 22,000 km 198.8萬; 2024 31,200 km 199.0萬; 2024 40,000-41,000 km 179.8萬; 2023 19,000 km 175.0萬; 2023 35,000 km 196.0萬; 2023 48,000-49,000 km 155.8萬; 2023 64,000-65,000 km 159.8萬; 2022 30,000 km 168.0萬; 2022 55,900-56,000 km 148.8萬; 2022 67,000-77,000 km 158.8萬; 2022 76,300 km 149.0萬; 2021 45,000 km 146.3萬 and 138.3萬; 2021 54,500 km 148.0萬; 2020 70,000 km 138.8萬; 2020 80,000 km 133.8萬; 2020 88,000-89,000 km 113.8萬; 2020 170,000 km 99.8萬. COUNT CORRECTED TWICE, AND THE SECOND CORRECTION UNDOES PART OF THE FIRST: this record first said 145 cars, then an earlier pass said 25; the page re-opened today renders about 40 rows. The 2023 19,000 km 175.0萬 car that the same pass declared dead IS live — it is on this 8891 page and FindCar (https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/320i%20touring) carries the same car at 19,600 km and 175萬 — so it is restored to the set and the year-3 figure moves back up with it. ANCHOR: the 2025 car with 5,000 km at 220.0萬 車商售價 is the closest thing on the market to a one-year low-mileage Touring. Trimmed for the ask-versus-transaction gap it stands for about 212萬 dealer retail on a 320i-grade Touring at one year and 7,000 km, which is the anchor the 320i M Racing Edition record carries. DIFFERENCE TO THIS TRIM: a used-car dealer must undercut a live 199萬 new car visibly, so a one-year 318i Sport Touring asks about 172萬 車商售價; less 13.7% for 自售價 gives 1,485,000; less 12.5% again gives 1,299,000 車商收購價. No dealer asking price was copied into either field. GROUP LADDER: 74.1% of real_cost, against the 320i M Racing Edition at 72.2% and the 330i M Sport at 70.8%. The 1.8-point premium over the mid trim is the widest this record carries and year 1 is where the 200-unit cap is worth most — see purchase.notes for the evidence on both sides. Outside anchors: 3.1 points above the 320i M Sport SEDAN sibling at 71.0% and 6.7 above the Volvo V60 Plus B4 estate at 67.4%, the latter because Volvo Taiwan discounts the V60 by 180,000 against 50,000 here."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"RESTORED TO 1,190,000 after an earlier pass cut it to 1,175,000 on a claim that does not survive re-checking. That pass dropped the 2023 19,000 km 175.0萬 car as no longer live; the car IS live, on both 8891 and FindCar, so the evidence it was removed for is back and the figure goes back with it. Live three-year stock re-read 2026-08-22: 2023 19,000 km 175.0萬, 2023 35,000 km 196.0萬, 2023 48,000-49,000 km 155.8萬, 2023 64,000-65,000 km 159.8萬. SUM adds 2023 31,803 km 178.0萬 and 2023 60,000 km 168.8萬, both 2000.cc so 320i grade, and SUM asks run above 8891's so they are deflated before use. The two best mileage matches to this checkpoint are the 2023 car with 19,000 km at 175.0萬 and the 2024 car with 21,000 km at 182.8萬, the latter one year young. Read together, a 320i-grade Touring at three years and 21,000 km stands near 174萬 車商售價, the anchor the 320i M Racing Edition record carries. DENOMINATOR RULE UNCHANGED: this record still quotes no percentage-of-list for any historical car, because 256萬 is a 2026 price and the 2023 cars listed for less when new. DIFFERENCE TO THIS TRIM: weaker engine, no M Sport pack, so about 138萬 車商售價; less 13.8% for 自售價 gives 1,190,000; less 13.0% again gives 1,035,000. GROUP LADDER: 59.4% of real_cost, 2.2 points over the 320i M Racing Edition at 57.1% and 3.8 over the 330i M Sport at 55.6%. Year 3 carries the widest gap to the mid trim of any checkpoint, because the 200-unit cap is still a live supply constraint at three years and the missing M Sport kit has not yet started to cost the car buyers. Outside anchors: 3.5 points above the 320i sedan sibling at 55.9% and 0.8 above the Volvo V60 estate at 58.6%."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"RAISED, 1,030,000 -> 1,050,000, on the shared set. The estate-versus-sedan finding is unchanged and still measured rather than assumed. At https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i-touring the 2020 cars with 70,000 km ask 138.8萬 車商售價 and one with 80,000 km asks 133.8萬; at https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i (sedan, 243 cars) the closest points are 2020 with 94,000 km at 108.8萬 and 2023 with 28,400-29,000 km at 152.8萬. SUM independently lists a 2020 Touring with 70,000 km at 148.8萬, ABOVE the 8891 figure, from a second platform. DIRECT FIVE-YEAR POINT, re-verified today: 2021 320i Touring, 45,000 km, 146.3萬, bracketed by 2022 cars at 149.0萬 (76,300 km) and 158.8萬 (67,000-77,000 km). Our car has 35,000 km, which lifts the comparable. The shared-set anchor for a 320i-grade Touring at five years and 35,000 km is about 150萬 車商售價, the figure the 320i M Racing Edition record carries. The flatness in the raw three-to-five-year asking prices is still treated as a dealer pricing artefact around the 150萬 shelf and is not copied. DIFFERENCE TO THIS TRIM: about 121萬 車商售價 for the base engine without the M Sport pack; less 13.2% for 自售價 gives 1,050,000; less 13.6% again gives 907,000. GROUP LADDER: 52.4% of real_cost, 1.4 points over the 320i M Racing Edition at 51.0% and 3.0 over the 330i M Sport at 49.4%. The previous version of this group sat at 51.4 / 51.0 / 51.0, three trims spanning a 970,000 price range inside four tenths of a point, which is what the cross-check called out. Outside anchors: 4.8 points above the 320i sedan sibling at 47.6% and 4.7 above the V60 at 47.7% — the measured estate premium at its widest."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"RAISED, 780,000 -> 864,000, AND THE OLD ARGUMENT IS WITHDRAWN. This checkpoint used to sit at 38.9% of real_cost, BELOW both Touring siblings, on the claim that a base-spec 156 hp 318i with no M Sport pack is the hardest 3 Series Touring to move. That claim was asserted, not measured; it made the base trim the WORST of the three and the cross-check was right to reject it. THE EVIDENCE THAT REPLACES IT IS NOW SAME-TRIM RATHER THAN GENERIC. The G21 Touring reached Taiwan in 2019-2020, so no genuine seven-year data exists for this generation and none is invented. Two F31 318i Tourings are on the market and both pages were re-opened on 2026-08-22: the SUM row 2018, 1500.cc, 74,002 km, 80.8萬 車商售價, and 8891 https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series-touring, 2018 318i Touring, 94,700 km, 73.8萬. TRIM CORRECTED, AND THIS IS A SPLIT SETTLED ACROSS THE THREE TOURING RECORDS: this record used to treat the SUM 80.8萬 car as a generic F31 point of unknown trim, and the 320i M Racing Edition record used both of these cars as F31 320i evidence. Both are 318i Tourings. They are the best previous-generation donors this record can have and they no longer feed the 320i record at all. Adjusting the 80.8萬 / 74,002 km car back one year to seven and down to our 49,000 km gives roughly 100萬 車商售價; less about 13.6% for 自售價 gives 864,000. The 2018 car with 197,495 km asking 99.8萬 on the same SUM page is still treated as unusable rather than averaged, because it asks more money for 123,000 more km. Trade-in at 741,000 is 14.2% below, wider than at year 1 because dealers discount out-of-warranty German stock harder for repair risk. GROUP LADDER: 43.1% of real_cost, 1.2 points over the 320i M Racing Edition at 41.9% and 3.1 over the 330i M Sport at 40.0%. The gap to the mid trim keeps narrowing with age, because the 200-unit cap is spent and the missing M Sport kit costs most on an older car — see purchase.notes, where the F31 evidence that cuts against this trim is set out in full. Outside anchors: 1.6 points above the 320i sedan sibling at 41.5%, and second in the BMW cohort only to the X1 at 43.9%. That is high, and it is where the ladder rule puts the cheapest member of a group whose whole level is set by thin Taiwan estate supply. Confidence low: previous generation, two asking prices, no transactions."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"RAISED, 468,000 -> 501,000, AND THE SHAPE IS CORRECTED. The deleted 1857.com.tw listing stays deleted — the host still refuses the connection, so no number here leans on it. What survives, all re-verified 2026-08-22: SUM 2018 F31 318i Touring (1500.cc), 74,002 km, 80.8萬; 8891 2018 318i Touring, 94,700 km, 73.8萬; SUM 2017 F31 320i-grade Touring, 92,199 km, 78.8萬; SUM 2013 F31, 169,000 km, 43.8萬. Interpolating the two F31 318i cars forward to ten years and correcting to our 70,000 km gives about 58萬 車商售價; less about 13.6% for 自售價 gives 501,000. That band is wider than any single listing can carry, which is why confidence stays low. WHAT CHANGED AND WHY: the previous 468,000 was set by coherence against the sedan, on the argument that the estate premium removed at year 7 applies harder at year 10. The premise of that argument was the year-7 figure that has now been withdrawn, so the conclusion goes with it. The cross-check also showed this group's ten-year retention RISING with price — 23.3% / 24.7% / 26.0% across 318i Sport / 320i M Racing Edition / 330i M Sport — the reverse of the trim-ladder rule with no reason stated anywhere. It now falls. GROUP LADDER: 25.0% of real_cost, 1.0 point over the 320i M Racing Edition at 24.0% and 3.0 over the 330i M Sport at 22.0%. One point is the narrowest gap in this record and it is deliberate: at ten years a base-spec Touring is priced off a floor, the 200-unit cap is worth nothing, and the F31 318i rows quoted in purchase.notes read slightly WORSE than the mileage-matched 320i. Outside anchor: 2.4 points above the 320i sedan sibling at 22.6%, inside the BMW petrol ten-year band of 17.0-30.0%. Trade-in at 426,000 is 15.0% below private, the widest spread of the five checkpoints, because at this age most dealers price a trade-in near auction value. Confidence low: no direct ten-year listing of this generation exists."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Three lines, all settled group figures, summing to 14,200. PER-VISIT PRICE CORRECTED, 9,000 -> 11,000, AND THE OLD STRING IS DELETED. This checkpoint used to read about 9,000 including labour and to add that it sat 3,000 above the 320i M Sport sedan sibling's 8,000. Both halves had to go. The 9,000 was the lowest per-visit price anywhere in the group for identical work on the same engine at the same dealer network, and the sedan's 8,000 is not a per-visit price at all: reading that record shows 8,000 is its whole year-1 period, probability-weighted between a package case and a no-package case. The settled 11,000 rests on the NT$10,222 authorised-dealer service receipt that the sedan record cites for the same B48. GROUP: 14,200 here, 14,900 for the 320i M Racing Edition, 15,600 for the 330i M Sport. The three differ only by the tire damage provision, because nothing else in the first year depends on wheel or brake size. If a bundled service package does apply at the buyer's dealer, this period falls to about 3,200."},{"y":3,"source":"22,000 + 6,000 + 4,500 + 3,000 + 3,400 = 38,900. At 21,000 km nothing has worn out; every item in this window is on a calendar trigger. STALE STRINGS DELETED: this checkpoint used to price the same two visits at about 9,000-9,500 each, and its own item list summed to about 32,000 against a stated period of 31,000, so the reader could not tell which figure was live. Both are gone. THE YEAR-3 GROUP GAP IS CLOSED. The old group read 31,000 here against 44,000 for the 320i M Racing Edition, a 42% step between two cars running the same B48 on the same stated schedule, with neither source string mentioning the other. It is now 38,900 against 40,300, and the 1,400 is the tire damage provision and nothing else. The three lines that produced the old 44,000 are deleted at source: a four-wheel alignment with tire rotation at about 4,000, an annual inspection with small consumables at about 4,000, and a rounding of the record's own itemised 40,500 up to 44,000 for sundries even though a sundries line was already in the list. Alignment is now charged only when new tires are fitted, at years 5 and 10, in all three records; tire rotation is charged nowhere, because the two M Sport cars run staggered sets that cannot be rotated. GROUP: 38,900 here, 40,300 for the 320i M Racing Edition, 41,700 for the 330i M Sport."},{"y":5,"source":"22,000 + 6,000 + 4,500 + 3,000 + 9,000 + 34,000 + 4,000 + 13,000 + 3,400 + 8,000 = 106,900. The step up from 38,900 is the assumed warranty cliff plus two age clocks falling due in the same window. The tires go because the rubber is five years old, not because 35,000 km wore it out; this is the clearest place where the 7,000 km/year profile costs money rather than saving it. BATTERY CLOCK SETTLED AT 5 YEARS, year 5 and year 10, in all three records. The 5-7 year wording this checkpoint used before is withdrawn, because the same record then charged the second battery at year 10, and 5 to 7 years does not describe two batteries fitted five years apart. The 320i M Racing Edition record used to charge its first battery at year 7 and its second at year 10 — at most three years apart — while describing the same age-out behaviour; that is corrected in that record, not here. SPARK PLUG CLOCK SETTLED at 4 years or 60,000 km, whichever comes first, so year 4 and year 8. This record used to charge one set at year 7 and none afterwards, the 320i record charged one at year 5 and one at year 10, and the 330i record deferred the first set past year 7. All three now read year 4 and year 8. GROUP: 106,900 here, 122,300 for the 320i M Racing Edition, 137,700 for the 330i M Sport. The whole 30,800 spread is tire size: 34,000 against 48,000 against 62,000 for the set, plus 2,800 of damage provision that follows from the same unit prices."},{"y":7,"source":"22,000 + 6,000 + 4,500 + 3,000 + 6,000 + 12,000 + 14,000 + 28,000 + 6,000 + 3,400 + 10,000 = 114,900. The gasket weep is the most common out-of-warranty item on this engine at 6-8 years in Taiwan heat and humidity. Front pads land here rather than at year 5: at 7,000 km/year the first set reaches 49,000 km, which is a realistic first change on a gently driven car. WHAT IS NOT IN THIS WINDOW, AND WHERE IT WENT. The 12V AGM battery is not here; it is on the settled 5-year clock at years 5 and 10. The ZF 8HP gearbox oil is not here either; it is charged once, at about year 8, inside the year-10 window of all three records. The 320i M Racing Edition record used to carry BOTH of those items in this window, and that, together with its 3-year battery clock, is most of why its year-7 period read 148,000 against this record's 128,000. The electric water pump and thermostat housing stay in the year-10 window and are charged once, so the same probabilistic failure is never billed in two periods. No 48V starter-generator item, because auto-data.net confirms this 318i has no 48V system and no Taiwan source shows the part on the other two cars either. GROUP: 114,900 here, 118,300 for the 320i M Racing Edition, 121,700 for the 330i M Sport. The 6,800 spread is the front pad set (12,000 against 14,000 and 16,000) and the damage provision, nothing else."},{"y":10,"source":"Three years, the car out of warranty throughout, and the second turn of every age clock. The lines above sum to 284,600 exactly. STALE STRINGS DELETED: the paragraph describing an OMISSION FIXED at +14,000, a move from 236,000 to 250,000, a ten-year total moving from 510,000 to 524,000, and a 39,000 (8%) gap against the sedan sibling is gone. Not one of those figures is live. The second battery it argued for survives, on a 5-year clock instead of a 5-7 year one. TWO PRICES CHANGED ON EVIDENCE RATHER THAN ON JUDGEMENT. The electric water pump and thermostat housing fall from 45,000 to 34,000, to match what the sibling sedan record cites: a Taiwan dealer replacement of roughly 25,000-35,000 in parts and labour, consistent with a 36,000 heavier-service invoice. The suspension line falls from 42,000 to 38,000 for control arms and thrust-arm bushings plus rear damper mounts, which is the sedan record's 35,000 control-arm figure plus the estate's rear mounts, and it is now identical in all three Touring records because no source separates estate damper wear from sedan damper wear. GROUP: 284,600 here, 307,700 for the 320i M Racing Edition, 329,800 for the 330i M Sport. The 45,200 spread is the second tire set (28,000), the brake set (13,000) and the damage provision (4,200). Confidence low: the individual lines are well-established B48 and G20/G21 failure modes, but their timing inside the 7-10 year window is an estimate on a generation that has not reached ten years in Taiwan."}],"sources":[{"name":"8891 新車頻道 — 入手價大砍逾50萬！BMW 318i Touring新入門199萬上市","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/bmw/3-series-touring/22272","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED BY ME. Confirms 199萬 list, 200-unit limited allocation, the previous 256萬 Touring entry point and a cut of about 57萬, 156hp/25.5kgm, 8.8s, 13.5km/L, and the M Sport pack at 選配價26萬 (an option, not a separate trim)."},{"name":"KingAutos — BMW 318i Touring限量回歸 199萬元起","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/369812","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED BY ME. Launch on the 30th (2026-07-30), 199萬 Sport, 200 units, 156hp/250Nm, 2.0T four-cylinder, Sport and M Sport configurations. No 48V mild-hybrid mention. No warranty or complimentary-maintenance information."},{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點 — 全新BMW 318i Touring 全台限量200台","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/117278","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED BY ME. Full press release. 199萬, M Sport +26萬, 200 units, TwinPower Turbo four-cylinder petrol with Steptronic 8-speed, 156hp/250Nm, 8.8s. States explicitly it is not a hybrid system. No warranty or free-maintenance programme mentioned."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 — 全新BMW 318i Touring豪華旅行車，全台限量200台","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/42984-bmw-318i-touring-200.html","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED BY ME. Second independent copy of the launch release. 199萬, 200 units, 156hp/250Nm, 8.8s, no 48V mention, no warranty or complimentary-maintenance terms. Also lists the standard safety kit shared by both configurations."},{"name":"車主充電站 — 全台限量200台，全新BMW 318i Touring正式登場","url":"https://racingcharger.tw/","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED BY ME. Third copy of the release with the full Sport equipment list (chrome grille, Sensatec interior, hexagonal leather wheel, electric lumbar, triple-zone climate). Confirms a conventional TwinPower Turbo four-cylinder with 8-speed automatic, and no warranty, maintenance plan or 48V technology anywhere in the article."},{"name":"auto-data.net — BMW 3 Series Touring G21 LCI 318i (156 Hp) Steptronic","url":"https://www.auto-data.net/en/bmw-3-series-touring-g21-lci-facelift-2022-318i-156hp-steptronic-45825","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED BY ME. Engine code B48B20A, 156 Hp @ 4500-6500 rpm, kerb weight 1,575 kg, and NO mild-hybrid designation, while the 320d/330d entries in the same generation ARE labelled Mild Hybrid. This is the evidence that the 318i is a conventional petrol car and belongs in 'gasoline' for that reason, not as a reclassified 48V car."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — BMW 3-Series 320i Touring 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i-touring","note":"PRIMARY used-curve source and the SHARED comparable set for all three Taiwan 3 Series Touring records. RE-OPENED 2026-08-22. LISTING COUNT CORRECTED TWICE: this record first claimed 145 listings, then an earlier pass cut that to 25; re-opened today the page renders about 40 rows, confirmed 旅行車 estate body. Dealer retail 車商售價 verified this round: 2025 5,000km 220.0萬 (BMW認證); 2025 3,000km 電洽; 2024 9,000km 192.8萬 (five cars); 2024 15,200km 電洽; 2024 17,000km 192.8萬; 2024 21,000km 182.8萬; 2024 22,000km 198.8萬; 2024 31,200km 199.0萬; 2024 40,000-41,000km 179.8萬; 2023 19,000km 175.0萬; 2023 35,000km 196.0萬; 2023 48,000-49,000km 155.8萬; 2023 64,000-65,000km 159.8萬; 2022 30,000km 168.0萬; 2022 55,900-56,000km 148.8萬; 2022 67,000-77,000km 158.8萬; 2022 76,300km 149.0萬; 2021 45,000km 146.3萬 and 138.3萬; 2021 54,500km 148.0萬; 2020 70,000km 138.8萬 (two cars); 2020 80,000km 133.8萬; 2020 88,000-89,000km 113.8萬; 2020 170,000km 99.8萬. RESTORED: the earlier pass declared the 2023 19,000km 175.0萬 car and the 2021 138.3萬 / 148.0萬 cars dead and dropped them; all three are live today, and the 175.0萬 car is corroborated on FindCar at 19,600km. Every figure used in this record was cut 12-14% for 自售價 first."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — BMW 3-Series 320i M Sport Touring 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i-m-sport-touring","note":"RE-OPENED 2026-08-22 AND DEMOTED. This URL does NOT hold the M Sport Touring filter: it falls back to 8891's whole 3-Series result set, about 910 cars including sedans, coupés and E90-era stock, so no count taken from it means anything for estate supply. The earlier readings of '3 listings' and '911 results' are both artefacts of that fallback and are withdrawn. It is kept only because one row on it is used elsewhere in this record: the 2018 Touring at 94,700km asking 73.8萬. COUNT SPLIT SETTLED ACROSS THE GROUP, on pages opened today: the 320i Touring model page (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i-touring) returns about 40 rows and is the honest headline figure for estate supply; the 3-series-touring index returns ONE live car; this page returns an unfiltered 3-Series list and is not a count at all."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — BMW 3-Series 320i 二手價格 (SEDAN control group)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED BY ME. SEDAN control group, 243 listings, used to MEASURE the estate premium rather than assume it. Verified points: 2023 28,400km and 29,000km both 152.8萬; 2020 94,000km 108.8萬; 2017 164,400km 50.0萬; 2013 58,000km 20.0萬; 2012 150,000km 22.8萬. Against the Touring page's 2020 70,000km 138.8萬 this confirms the estate sits above the sedan at matched age. The comparison in this record is now made in absolute money, not as a percentage of a 2026 list price."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — BMW 3 SERIES TOURING 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=BMW&model=3+SERIES+TOURING","note":"OPENED AND RE-READ ROW BY ROW 2026-08-22, with displacement recorded this time. F31 basis for the seven- and ten-year extrapolation: 2018 1500.cc 74,002km 80.8萬; 2017 2000.cc 92,199km 78.8萬; 2013 2000.cc 169,000km 43.8萬; 2010 E91 2000.cc 212,861km 15.8萬; 2007 E91 2000.cc 250,000km 17.8萬. TRIM SPLIT SETTLED: the 2018 74,002km 80.8萬 row is 1500.cc, so it is an F31 318i Touring — the same trim as this record and its best previous-generation donor. The 320i M Racing Edition record used to read that row as 320i evidence; it no longer does. The only 320i-grade F31 donor on this page is the 2017 2000.cc row. SUM does not print trim names, so all trim readings are inferred from displacement. G21 cross-checks: 2023 2000.cc 31,803km 178.0萬; 2023 2000.cc 60,000km 168.8萬; 2020 2000.cc 70,000km 148.8萬 (above 8891's 138.8萬 for the same age and mileage, which is why SUM asking prices are treated as an upper bound); 2021 2000.cc 180,000km 103.8萬. CAUTION RECORDED: a 2018 car with 197,495km asks 99.8萬, more than the 74,002km car at 80.8萬, so fine interpolation on this set is not reliable."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — BMW 3-Series 320d Touring 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320d-touring","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED BY ME. Only three very high-mileage diesel cars (2011 320,000km 14.9萬; 2010 140,000km 22.8萬; 2013 169,000km 43.8萬), all far outside this owner's mileage profile, so none was used in the curve. Kept because it is the negative evidence that no usable older-estate data exists on this platform."},{"name":"BMW Taiwan 線上訂購 — 3 Series Touring G21 LCI","url":"https://reserve.bmw.com.tw/all-models/g21lci","note":"OPENED BY ME. Page carries only ordering terms and states that suggested prices are for reference only; there is no model or price table. No price obtained here, so the 1,990,000 figure rests entirely on the five media sources above. Kept because the record's claim about this page is accurate and the absence of a first-party price table is itself the reason the citation is media-based."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — BMW 3-Series Touring 全車型列表","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series-touring","note":"RE-OPENED 2026-08-22 (both the hyphen form and the underscore form https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series_touring load and return the same thing). IT NOW RETURNS ONE LISTING, not two: a 2020 320i M Sport Touring with 170,000 km at 99.8萬. The 2018 318i Touring with 94,700 km at 73.8萬 that this page carried, and NAMED as a 318i, has sold or expired. That name was the reason this page was added, so the trim reading it supplied is now held on the SUM 1500.cc row instead — see the SUM entry. The split it settled stands: the 2018 74,002 km 80.8萬 car is a 318i, and the 320i M Racing Edition record no longer uses it as 320i evidence."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — BMW 320i Touring 價格與在售車","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/320i%20touring","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED BY ME 2026-08-22, added in this pass for two jobs. First, it independently confirms the 2023 low-mileage car that an earlier pass wrongly declared dead: FindCar shows it at 19,600 km asking 175萬, against 8891's 19,000 km at 175.0萬. That is why the year-3 figure is restored. Second, it prints a new-car reference average of 219.8萬 for the 320i Touring nameplate across generations, which brackets the F31-era list from below and is one of the two bounds behind the group-wide 225萬 settlement in purchase.notes. Other rows read today: 2023 46,321km 188萬; 2022 70,000km 158.8萬; 2021 97,521km 138.8萬; 2020 89,000km 113.8萬; 2017 87,870km 77.7萬; 2016 160,000km 69.8萬."}]},"bmw-3-series-touring-320i-m-racing":{"assumptions":"At 7,000 km/year the B48 2.0T needs only one oil service per year, so the whole service plan is time-driven, not mileage-driven. Two lumps dominate this car and both are age-driven, not wear-driven: the 18-inch M Sport tires (225/45R18 front, 255/40R18 rear on the M Racing Edition) harden and are replaced on a 5-year clock, at year 5 and again at year 10, with tread left both times; and the AGM 12V battery, which dies on short trips regardless of distance and which runs on that same 5-year clock, at year 5 and year 10. Both clocks are identical in all three Taiwan 3 Series Touring records. At 70,000 km after 10 years the car reaches the used market at roughly half the mileage of a typical Taiwan 10-year-old, and that supports the year-7 and year-10 resale figures here. The estate body adds one low-mileage-specific item the sedan does not have: the electric tailgate motor and gas struts age out on time, not on cycles. Tax and insurance are excluded by design. This record was rebuilt by an adversarial check on 2026-08-22. The list price survived the check. The purchase side, the whole retention curve and the year-10 maintenance figure did not. A second check the same day repaired the trim ladder across all three Taiwan 3 Series Touring records as a set: years 7 and 10 come down here so that retention falls, not rises, from 318i Sport to 320i M Racing Edition to 330i M Sport. See purchase.notes and the checkpoint source strings for each change. A third check the same day rebuilt the maintenance block of all three records from one shared schedule, one per-visit price and one clock per age-driven part. That check moved every maintenance figure here and touched neither the purchase side nor the retention curve. See maintenance.plan_notes.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Closest real comparable, opened and read: 8891 中古車 (https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?key=touring) lists a 2025款 320i M Sport Touring, 領牌 2024, 9,000 km, 車商售價 192.8萬, and a second 領牌 2024 with 40,000 km at 179.8萬. The 9,000 km car is a genuine low-mileage listing and the right shape for this buyer, but it is two years old. 192.8萬 against that car's own 256萬 list is 75.3% at dealer retail. Walking one year back on the same slope gives about 82% of list at dealer retail for a one-year-old low-mileage Touring, or about 212萬 against this car's market-equivalent list of 259萬 (see purchase.notes - the M Racing appearance content is written down, not carried at sticker). 自售價 is set 12% below that dealer asking figure at 1,870,000, the deep end of the 8-15% band, because the estate buyer pool in Taiwan is small and a private seller has little leverage even on a scarce car. 車商收購價 is a further 13% below the private figure. That is 72.2% of real_cost, against the 320i M Sport sedan sibling's 71.0%. The 1.2-point gap is small on purpose: the estate scarcity premium visible from year 3 onward has not built up at one year, and it is offset by the appearance equipment that resale ignores. NOTE - the absolute figure fell from the researcher's 1,920,000, but the retention percentage ROSE, because real_cost fell further (see purchase.source). SHARED SET ADDED 2026-08-22, figure UNCHANGED. The trim-ladder repair re-reads all three Taiwan Touring records against ONE comparable set, the 8891 320i Touring model page (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i-touring), about 40 rows. It carries a 2025 car with 5,000 km at 220.0萬 車商售價 that the keyword search above did not surface, and that car is the closest thing on the market to a one-year low-mileage Touring. Trimmed for the ask-versus-transaction gap it stands for about 212萬 dealer retail — the same anchor already derived here by walking the 192.8萬 car back one year — so the shared set confirms 1,870,000 rather than moving it. GROUP LADDER: 72.2% of real_cost, 1.9 points below the 318i Sport Touring at 74.1% and 1.4 above the 330i M Sport Touring at 70.8%."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from the researcher's 1,630,000. Real three-year listings on 8891 中古車 (https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?key=touring): 領牌 2023, 48,000 km, 155.8萬; 領牌 2023, 64,000 km, 159.8萬. Against a 253萬 list that is 62-63% at 車商售價. SUM 汽車網 (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=BMW&model=3+SERIES+TOURING) adds a 2023款, 31,803 km at 178.0萬 and a 2023款, 60,000 km at 168.8萬. The researcher took SUM's 178.0萬 - the single highest three-year asking price, on the platform they themselves recorded as running above 8891 - and then adjusted it UPWARD again by 5% for mileage before scaling it up to this car's list. That double-counts in one direction. Taking both platforms together and deflating SUM to the 8891 level, low-mileage dealer retail at three years is about 67% of list, and about 65% once the 2020-2026 run-up in BMW Taiwan list prices (236萬 to 264萬, +12%) is removed, since that run-up flatters the apparent retention of older cars and should not be assumed to repeat over 2026-2029. 65% of the 259萬 market-equivalent list is about 168萬 車商售價; 自售價 12% below is 1,480,000. That is 57.1% of real_cost against the sedan sibling's 55.9%, a 1.2-point estate premium. The researcher claimed 4.4 points on the basis that Touring listings ask 10-15% more than sedans at equal age. The mileage-matched pairs I actually opened do not support a premium that firm: on https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i-m-sport a 2020 sedan at 72,000 km asks 91.8萬 while a 2020 Touring at 170,000 km asks 99.8萬 (a large Touring premium), but a 2018 sedan at 48,000 km asks 108.0萬 against a 2018 Touring at 94,700 km asking 73.8萬 (the opposite sign), and 2020 sedan asking prices on https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i spread from 91.8萬 to 115.8萬 at similar mileage. Trim and facelift move these prices more than body style does. A real but modest Touring premium survives; 4-5 retention points does not. SHARED SET ADDED 2026-08-22, figure UNCHANGED. The 320i Touring model page re-read today adds two three-year rows the keyword search missed: 2023 19,000 km at 175.0萬 and 2023 35,000 km at 196.0萬, plus a 2024 car with 21,000 km at 182.8萬 that is the exact mileage match for this checkpoint, one year young. Those rows sit ABOVE the 155.8-159.8萬 cars used above, and they are the reason the 318i Sport record restores its own year-3 figure. Here they lift the low-mileage dealer-retail read to about 168-174萬, which brackets the 168萬 already carried, so 1,480,000 stands. GROUP LADDER: 57.1% of real_cost, 2.2 points below the 318i Sport Touring at 59.4% and 1.5 above the 330i M Sport Touring at 55.6%. Year 3 is where the base trim's 200-unit cap is worth most, so the gap under it is the widest of the five checkpoints."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from the researcher's 1,420,000. Direct five-year comparable from 8891 中古車 (https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?key=touring): 領牌 2021 320i M Sport Touring, 45,000 km, 車商售價 146.3萬 against a list of 236-248萬, so 59-62% at dealer retail. It is bracketed one year out by 領牌 2020 cars at 138.8萬 (70,000 km) and 113.8萬 (88,000 km) on the same page, and by SUM's 2020 at 148.8萬 (70,000 km). This checkpoint carries 35,000 km, 10,000 km below the 2021 comparable, worth about 4%, giving roughly 62-64% of that car's list. Deflating by about 4 points for the 2020-2026 list-price run-up leaves 58% of the 259萬 market-equivalent list, or about 150萬 車商售價; 自售價 12% below is 1,320,000. That is 51.0% of real_cost against the sedan sibling's 47.6%. The 3.4-point gap is the estate scarcity premium and it is the widest gap carried anywhere in this record, because year 5 is where the low-mileage credit and the thin Touring supply reinforce each other most. It is inside the 5-point coherence band. Against the wider BMW cohort in this dataset, 51.0% at five years sits fourth behind the X1 (53.9%), the 2 Series Coupé (52.6%) and the 4 Series (52.4%), which is a defensible place for a scarce estate. SHARED SET ADDED 2026-08-22, figure UNCHANGED. The 320i Touring model page re-read today restores two 2021 rows an earlier pass had wrongly declared dead — 45,000 km at 138.3萬 and 54,500 km at 148.0萬 — which bracket the 146.3萬 car used above rather than displacing it, and it adds a 2022 car with 30,000 km at 168.0萬 as an upper bound from one year younger. The 150萬 車商售價 anchor is unchanged, so 1,320,000 stands. GROUP LADDER: 51.0% of real_cost, 1.4 points below the 318i Sport Touring at 52.4% and 1.6 above the 330i M Sport Touring at 49.4%."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REDUCED AGAIN, 1,120,000 -> 1,085,000, ON A TRIM-LADDER REPAIR, AND THE F31 DONOR IS CORRECTED. The earlier 1,120,000 read 43.2% of real_cost, which put this mid trim ABOVE the cheaper 318i Sport Touring at 43.1% — the base trim was the worst of the three at this checkpoint, which is the wrong direction and which the cross-check named. The prior derivation was also standing on a car that is not this trim. THE DONOR CORRECTION, SETTLED ACROSS ALL THREE TOURING RECORDS: this record used the SUM row '2018, 74,002 km, 80.8萬' as F31 320i evidence. The SUM page re-opened 2026-08-22 shows that row as 1500.cc. A 1.5-litre F31 Touring is a three-cylinder B38 318i, the BOTTOM trim, so the row belongs to the 318i Sport record and is removed from this one. The only 320i-grade F31 donor on that page is the 2017 row, 2000.cc, 92,199 km, 78.8萬. F31 320i TOURING LIST SETTLED AT 225萬 group-wide (this record already used 225萬; the 330i record used 229萬; 225萬 wins, bounded by FindCar's 219.8萬 nameplate average and the G21's 236萬 launch list). REDERIVED: 78.8萬 against 225萬 is 35.0% 車商售價 at nine years. Correcting back to seven years adds about 6 points and correcting 92,199 km down to this checkpoint's 49,000 km adds about 7 more, giving about 48% of list, or about 125萬 車商售價 on the 259萬 market-equivalent list. 自售價 13% below is 1,085,000. The 8891 rows re-read today on the shared set (領牌 2018, 94,700 km at 73.8萬 and 領牌 2018, 143,200 km at 69萬) sit below that and are consistent with it once mileage is corrected. Year 7 is also the first full year outside BMW Taiwan's three-year warranty, and Taiwan buyers price in the B48's electric water pump, thermostat housing and valve-cover leak risk, which is already inside the F31 evidence. GROUP LADDER: 41.9% of real_cost, 1.2 points BELOW the 318i Sport Touring at 43.1% and 1.9 above the 330i M Sport Touring at 40.0%. The gap to the base trim is at its narrowest here and at year 10, because by then the 318i's 200-unit cap is spent; the gap to the top trim is widening, because the 330i's extra content is paid for at purchase and progressively unpaid by the used market. Outside anchor: 0.4 points above the 320i M Sport SEDAN sibling at 41.5%, a deliberately thin estate premium, because by 2033 seven years of G21 Touring imports will have accumulated and the stock will be less scarce than it is today."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REDUCED, 640,000 -> 622,000, ON THE SAME TRIM-LADDER REPAIR AS YEAR 7. The cross-check found this group's ten-year retention RISING with price — 23.3% / 24.7% / 26.0% across 318i Sport / 320i M Racing Edition / 330i M Sport — with no reason stated anywhere. It now falls: 25.0% / 24.0% / 22.0%. Explicit previous-generation extrapolation; there is no ten-year G21 Touring and none is invented. The F31 3 Series Touring is the correct predecessor and its listings were re-opened 2026-08-22: abc好車網 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2206498) has a 2016 320i Touring, confirmed a wagon body, at 59.8萬 車商售價, exactly ten years old today, though no mileage is published; SUM (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=BMW&model=3+SERIES+TOURING) has a 2017 320i-grade Touring, 2000.cc, with 92,199 km at 78.8萬; 8891 has a 領牌 2018 with 94,700 km at 73.8萬. DONOR REMOVED, same settlement as year 7: the SUM 2018 74,002 km 80.8萬 car is 1500.cc, so it is an F31 318i and it no longer feeds this record. Reading what is left: a ten-year F31 320i Touring at typical Taiwan mileage of roughly 110,000 km sits near 62-68萬 車商售價, or about 28-30% of the group-settled 225萬 F31 list. A genuinely low 70,000 km odometer with full 原廠 history is worth about 10% more at this age — less than the 20% an earlier pass claimed, because a ten-year-old out-of-warranty German car is priced off a floor rather than off its odometer. That gives about 27% of the 259萬 market-equivalent list, or roughly 70萬 車商售價, and 自售價 11% below is 622,000. GROUP LADDER: 24.0% of real_cost, 1.0 point BELOW the 318i Sport Touring at 25.0% and 2.0 above the 330i M Sport Touring at 22.0%. One point to the base trim is the narrowest gap in the group and it is deliberate: at ten years all three are priced off the same floor, so the cheapest denominator wins by very little. Outside anchor: 1.4 points above the 320i M Sport SEDAN sibling at 22.6%. At ten years the buyer pool is price-driven and repair-risk-driven, the estate scarcity premium largely evaporates, and the M Racing Edition's appearance content is worth nothing at all. The drop from 1,085,000 at year 7 to 622,000 at year 10 is deliberately steep: German tails keep falling instead of flattening the way a Lexus does, and the F31 evidence above is exactly that steep."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Three lines, all settled group figures, summing to 14,900. The 11,000 annual visit this record already carried is confirmed rather than moved: it is the settled group price, anchored on the NT$10,222 authorised-dealer service receipt that the sibling 320i M Sport sedan record cites for the same B48. What changed is that the same 11,000 now appears in the 318i Sport record, which used to price the identical work at about 9,000, and in the 330i M Sport record, which used to price it at about 15,000 and to assume a prepaid package absorbed it. GROUP: 14,200 for the 318i Sport, 14,900 here, 15,600 for the 330i M Sport. The three differ only by the tire damage provision, because nothing else in the first year depends on wheel or brake size. If a bundled service package does apply at the buyer's dealer, this period falls to about 3,900."},{"y":3,"source":"REDUCED, 44,000 -> 40,300, AND THE THREE LINES THAT MADE THE OLD FIGURE ARE DELETED. 22,000 + 6,000 + 4,500 + 3,000 + 4,800 = 40,300, and the stated period is that sum with no rounding on top. WHAT WENT. (1) The four-wheel alignment and tire rotation at about 4,000 is gone: alignment is now charged only when new tires are fitted, at years 5 and 10, in all three records, and tire rotation is charged nowhere, because this car's staggered 18-inch set cannot be rotated front to rear. (2) The annual inspection and small consumables at about 4,000 is folded into the wipers-and-consumables line at its real size. (3) The rounding is gone: the old text itemised 40,500 and then rounded up to 44,000 for sundries even though a 4,000 sundries line was already in the list, which double-charged the same thing. THE YEAR-3 GROUP GAP IS CLOSED. The old group read 31,000 for the 318i Sport against 44,000 here, a 13,000 step and 42% on two cars that run the same B48 on the same stated schedule, with neither source string mentioning the other. It is now 38,900 against 40,300, and the 1,400 is the tire damage provision and nothing else. THE NOTE ABOUT THE SEDAN IS CORRECTED RATHER THAN DELETED: that record's year-3 period really is 20,000, which I verified by reading it, but it is not comparable line for line, because it is probability-weighted between a prepaid-package case and a no-package case while this group assumes no package at all. GROUP: 38,900 for the 318i Sport, 40,300 here, 41,700 for the 330i M Sport."},{"y":5,"source":"RAISED, 104,000 -> 122,300, and the change is one item moving in and one moving out. 22,000 + 6,000 + 4,500 + 3,000 + 9,000 + 48,000 + 4,000 + 13,000 + 4,800 + 8,000 = 122,300. THE BATTERY MOVES IN, AND THIS IS THE CLOCK REPAIR. This record used to fit the first 12V AGM battery at year 7 and the second at year 10, at most three years apart, while its own assumptions and its year-7 source described a part that ages out rather than wears out and its assumptions put tires on a 5-6 year age clock. Two batteries three years apart does not describe an age-out item. The settled clock is 5 years in all three records: year 5 and year 10. The 318i Sport record already read that way and does not move. THE FRONT PADS MOVE OUT, to the year-7 window, where 49,000 km is a realistic first pad change on a car doing 7,000 km/year; that is the settled brake schedule in all three records. The tire set rises from 46,000 to 48,000, which is 10,500 a corner front and 12,500 rear plus fitting and balancing, and it is the largest single line in the window. It is age-driven, not wear-driven: at 35,000 km the tread is still legal, but five-year-old rubber on a 260萬-class car has to go. Spark plugs stay where this record already had them, at the 4-year mark, and that clock is now the group's. GROUP: 106,900 for the 318i Sport, 122,300 here, 137,700 for the 330i M Sport. The whole 30,800 spread across the group is tire size: 34,000 against 48,000 against 62,000 for the set, plus the damage provision that follows from the same unit prices."},{"y":7,"source":"REDUCED, 148,000 -> 118,300, AND THIS IS WHERE THE OLD GROUP SPREAD AT YEAR 7 CAME FROM. 22,000 + 6,000 + 4,500 + 3,000 + 6,000 + 14,000 + 14,000 + 28,000 + 6,000 + 4,800 + 10,000 = 118,300. TWO ITEMS LEFT THIS WINDOW. (1) The 12V AGM battery at 14,000 moves to year 5, on the settled 5-year clock, and its price settles at 13,000, the figure the sibling sedan record uses for the same part with IBS registration. (2) The 8AT gearbox oil at 18,000 moves to the year-10 window, where the ZF 8HP service is charged once at about year 8 at 17,000 in all three records; ZF calls for 8 years or 100,000 km, and at 7,000 km/year the time limit binds, so the service happens once. Those two moves, plus the front and rear disc set that used to be lumped here at 55,000 and is now split across the settled brake schedule, are the whole of the old 128,000 against 148,000 spread between the 318i Sport record and this one. THE ESTATE ITEM IS NOW HERE RATHER THAN NOWHERE: this record used to state that estate-specific content in this window is nil and to defer all of it to the 7-10 window. The tailgate gas struts and the rear wiper motor age out earlier than the tailgate motor, so 6,000 sits here and 12,000 sits at year 10, identically in all three records. The out-of-warranty provision is sized to the B48's documented Taiwan failure pattern and NOT to a 48V starter-generator, because no Taiwan source shows a 48V system on this trim and a part that cannot be shown to be fitted is not priced. The electric water pump and thermostat housing are charged once, in the year-10 window, so the same probabilistic failure is never billed in two periods. GROUP: 114,900 for the 318i Sport, 118,300 here, 121,700 for the 330i M Sport. The 6,800 spread across the group is the front pad set and the damage provision, nothing else."},{"y":10,"source":"RAISED, 248,000 -> 307,700, AND THE LUMP IS ITEMISED. The lines above sum to 307,700 exactly. WHAT WAS WRONG WITH THE OLD FIGURE: 107,000 of it sat in a single provision line that named seven different things at once — electric water pump, thermostat, sump and valve cover seepage, dampers and top mounts, the power tailgate motor and struts, and air-conditioning compressor risk — so no reader could tell what was priced at what, and nothing could be compared with the sibling records. Every one of those is now a line with a price, and the two that could not be evidenced are gone: there is no separate sump-gasket line, because the oil filter housing and valve cover work is charged once at year 7, and there is no air-conditioning compressor line, because no source in this record supports one. WHAT THE ITEMISATION ADDS. The ZF 8HP service (17,000) arrives from year 7. The second spark plug set (9,000) is separated from the ignition coils, which are charged at year 7; the old text billed the two together at 22,000 in this window and left year 7 with no coil line at all. The brake set (45,000) is the settled year-10 brake work: rear pads, front discs and the second front pad set, all at M Sport brake package prices. STALE STRINGS DELETED: the CORRECTED UP from the researcher's 210,000 to 248,000 paragraph, the 15% gap against the sedan sibling, and the claim that the tailgate hardware alone explains the estate premium. FOR REFERENCE, verified by reading it: the 320i M Sport SEDAN record's year-10 period is 240,000 and its ten-year total is 485,000. GROUP: 284,600 for the 318i Sport, 307,700 here, 329,800 for the 330i M Sport. The 45,200 spread across the group is the second tire set (28,000), the brake set (13,000) and the damage provision (4,200). Confidence low: no ten-year G21 Touring exists in Taiwan and no owner receipts could be opened, so the timing of the probabilistic lines inside this three-year window is an estimate by construction, not by carelessness."}],"sources":[{"name":"8891 新車 - 保發中心曝BMW 3系列旅行車有新貨！320i M Racing Edition開價264萬？","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/bmw/3-series-touring/21461","note":"Opened and verified. Primary list-price source. 264萬 from 保發中心 registration data, replacing the 320i Touring M Sport at 256萬; also 330i M Sport 306萬 and M340i xDrive 375萬. Lists the added equipment: 紅色M煞車套件, 黑色車頂架, 黑色高光澤外觀與窗框, 燻黑頭燈, M縫線安全帶, Sprint 功能. No 48V mention."},{"name":"8891 新車 - 入手價大砍逾50萬！BMW 318i Touring新入門199萬上市","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/bmw/3-series-touring/22272","note":"Opened and verified. Confirms the current Taiwan lineup: 318i Sport 199萬 (156 hp, 25.5 kgm, 0-100 in 8.8 s) and 320i M Racing Edition 264萬. Gives the 318i's M Sport package price of 26萬. No mention of 48V, 微油電 or BSG for either variant."},{"name":"BMW 大同汎德 - BMW 320i Touring M Racing Edition","url":"https://www.bmw-tatung.com.tw/post/bmw-320i-touring-m-racing-edition","note":"Opened and verified. Authorised dealer specification page: TwinPower Turbo 汽油直列4汽缸, 1,998 c.c., 184 hp at 5,000 rpm, 300 Nm at 1,350 rpm, 0-100 km/h 7.6 s. No 48V / 微油電 / BSG anywhere on the page - the basis for the powertrain classification. No price shown."},{"name":"KingAutos - 2026 旅行車 BMW 3 Series Touring 共6車款","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/bmw/3_series_touring","note":"Opened and verified. Prior-year Taiwan Touring price ladder used to normalise the used-car retention ratios: 320i M Sport 253萬, 320i M Sport 白金極智版 248萬, 330i M Sport 303萬, 330i 白金極智版 293萬, M340i xDrive 374萬, M340i 白金極智版 366萬."},{"name":"BMW Taiwan reserve - G21 LCI","url":"https://reserve.bmw.com.tw/all-models/g21lci","note":"Opened and checked. Returns only ordering terms, conditions and FAQs - no model list and no price table. Retained in the record so the failed verification is visible, but it verifies nothing; the 8891 and KingAutos sources above carry the list price."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - touring 關鍵字搜尋（3 Series Touring 全部在售車）","url":"https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?key=touring","note":"Opened and verified; the single most useful used-market page because it gives 領牌年 separately from 車款年. Estate body confirmed for every listing used. 車商售價 data points read off the page: 領牌2024 9,000 km 192.8萬; 領牌2024 40,000 km 179.8萬; 領牌2023 48,000 km 155.8萬; 領牌2023 64,000 km 159.8萬; 領牌2022 67,000-77,000 km 158.8萬; 領牌2021 45,000 km 146.3萬; 領牌2020 70,000 km 138.8萬; 領牌2020 88,000-89,000 km 113.8萬; 領牌2020 170,000 km 99.8萬; 領牌2018 94,700 km 73.8萬; 領牌2018 143,200 km 69萬. Every private_sale_price in this record is set 11-13% below the corresponding dealer asking price derived from this table: 12% at years 1, 3 and 5, 13% at year 7 where an out-of-warranty German estate has the least private-seller leverage, and 11% at year 10 where the whole market is already at a floor."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 3-Series 320i M Sport 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i-m-sport","note":"Opened and verified, and it CORRECTS the researcher's reading of the sedan-versus-estate question. Actual mileage-matched pairs on this page: 2020 sedan 72,000 km 91.8萬 against 2020 Touring 170,000 km 99.8萬 (Touring far ahead on a mileage-adjusted basis), but 2018 sedan 48,000 km 108.0萬 against 2018 Touring 94,700 km 73.8萬 and 2018 Touring 143,200 km 69萬 (sign reversed). A modest Touring premium survives; the researcher's firm 10-15% premium at equal age does not."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 3-Series 320i 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i","note":"Opened and verified. Sedan baseline for the body-style comparison: 2024 2.5-2.6萬 km 159.8萬; 2023 2.0-2.9萬 km 152.8萬; 2023 5萬 km 149.8萬; 2022 4.7萬 km 139.8萬; 2022 5.38萬 km 136.0萬; 2022 6萬 km 133.8-135.8萬; 2020 7萬 km 115.8萬; 2020 9.4萬 km 108.8萬; 2020 12.9萬 km 105.0萬; 2016 18萬 km 33.8萬; 2015 6.5萬 km 43.8萬. The 2020 sedan spread of 91.8-115.8萬 at similar mileage shows that trim and facelift move these prices more than body style does."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 3-Series Touring 行情頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series_touring","note":"RE-OPENED AND RE-CONFIRMED 2026-08-22. Still a single live 3 Series Touring listing on this index (2020 320i M Sport, 170,000 km, 99.8萬); the 2018 318i Touring at 73.8萬 that it carried earlier has sold or expired. COUNT SPLIT SETTLED ACROSS THE GROUP: this index page returns ONE car, the 320i Touring model page returns about 40, and https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i-m-sport-touring is not a filtered page at all — it falls back to 8891's whole 3-Series result set of roughly 910 cars, so no count from it is meaningful. About 40 live 320i Tourings is the honest headline for estate supply. That scarcity is the stated reason the estate retention ratios sit above the sedan sibling's, by 1.2 points at years 1 and 3, 3.4 at year 5, 0.4 at year 7 and 1.4 at year 10; the premium is real but it is largest in the middle of the curve and thin at the ends."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 3-Series 320i Touring 二手價格（SHARED comparable set）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i-touring","note":"OPENED 2026-08-22 AND ADDED IN THE TRIM-LADDER REPAIR. This is the ONE shared G21 Touring comparable set that all three Taiwan 3 Series Touring records are now differenced against, so the trims are compared with each other rather than each with its own outside anchor. About 40 rows, 旅行車 estate body. 車商售價 read today: 2025 5,000km 220.0萬 (BMW認證); 2025 3,000km 電洽; 2024 9,000km 192.8萬 (five cars); 2024 15,200km 電洽; 2024 17,000km 192.8萬; 2024 21,000km 182.8萬; 2024 22,000km 198.8萬; 2024 31,200km 199.0萬; 2024 40,000-41,000km 179.8萬; 2023 19,000km 175.0萬; 2023 35,000km 196.0萬; 2023 48,000-49,000km 155.8萬; 2023 64,000-65,000km 159.8萬; 2022 30,000km 168.0萬; 2022 55,900-56,000km 148.8萬; 2022 67,000-77,000km 158.8萬; 2022 76,300km 149.0萬; 2021 45,000km 146.3萬 and 138.3萬; 2021 54,500km 148.0萬; 2020 70,000km 138.8萬; 2020 80,000km 133.8萬; 2020 88,000-89,000km 113.8萬; 2020 170,000km 99.8萬. The rows this page adds over the keyword search already cited (the 2025 5,000km car, the 2023 19,000km car, the 2022 30,000km car and the two extra 2021 cars) confirmed the year-1, year-3 and year-5 figures rather than moving them."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - BMW 3 SERIES TOURING 中古車","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=BMW&model=3+SERIES+TOURING","note":"RE-OPENED AND RE-READ ROW BY ROW 2026-08-22, with displacement recorded this time. Second-platform corroboration; SUM asking prices run above 8891's, so SUM figures are deflated to the 8891 level before use rather than adjusted further upward. Estate body confirmed throughout. Rows as they read today: 2023 2000.cc 31,803 km 178.0萬; 2023 2000.cc 60,000 km 168.8萬; 2020 2000.cc 70,000 km 148.8萬; 2021 2000.cc 180,000 km 103.8萬; 2018 1500.cc 74,002 km 80.8萬; 2018 2000.cc 197,495 km 99.8萬; 2017 2000.cc 92,199 km 78.8萬; 2013 2000.cc 169,000 km 43.8萬; 2010 E91 2000.cc 212,861 km 15.8萬; 2007 E91 2000.cc 250,000 km 17.8萬. TRIM SPLIT SETTLED ACROSS THE THREE TOURING RECORDS, AGAINST THIS RECORD: the 2018 74,002 km 80.8萬 row is 1500.cc, so it is a three-cylinder B38 F31 318i, not the F31 320i this record used to call it. It has been removed from the year-7 and year-10 derivations here and belongs to the 318i Sport record. The ONLY 320i-grade F31 donor on this page is the 2017 2000.cc row, and that row now carries both extrapolations. SUM does not print trim names, so every trim reading is inferred from displacement."},{"name":"abc好車網 - BMW 320i Touring (F31) 2016年 59.8萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2206498","note":"Opened and verified; the page confirms a 2016 BMW 3-Series Touring 320i, wagon body. 59.8萬 車商售價 at exactly ten years old. NO mileage is published, which is why it is used as one member of a cluster for the year-10 checkpoint rather than as the sole anchor - the researcher used it alone and it is 30-35% below the SUM and 8891 F31 listings of similar age."},{"name":"abc好車網 - BMW 3-Series Touring 320i M Sport 2024年 221萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2226892","note":"Opened and verified as a real Touring listing, then EXCLUDED. 221萬 for a two-year-old car against 8891's 179.8-192.8萬 for the same age is an inflated or stale asking price, and no mileage is published. Recorded so the exclusion is visible rather than silent. Note that excluding it is conservative: including it would raise the year-1 and year-3 figures."},{"name":"abc好車網 - BMW 3-Series Touring 320i M Sport 2021年 208.8萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/1968855","note":"Opened and verified as a real Touring listing, then EXCLUDED. 208.8萬 for a five-year-old car is implausible against 8891's 146.3萬 for a 領牌 2021 Touring with 45,000 km, and no mileage is published. Excluding it is again conservative rather than self-serving."}]},"bmw-3-series-touring-330i-m-sport":{"assumptions":"At 7,000 km/year this G21 LCI 330i Touring never reaches a mileage-based service trigger. BMW Condition Based Service and Taiwan dealer practice both cap the engine oil service at 12 months. The owner therefore pays for the same number of annual services as a 15,000 km/year driver, but spreads them over half the distance. Cost per km is high, and the service count over 10 years is time-driven, not mileage-driven. Two effects dominate this record. First, parts that age rather than wear set the replacement clock: the M Sport 19-inch runflat tires reach their rubber age limit on a 5-year clock, so they go at year 5 with 35,000 km on them and again at year 10 with 70,000 km. The 12V AGM battery runs on that same 5-year clock. Both clocks are identical in all three Taiwan 3 Series Touring records. Second, the resale side gains: at every checkpoint this car carries about half the odometer of typical Taiwan used stock, and the thin supply of 3 Series Tourings makes a low-mileage example scarce. Brakes and other wear items last longer. The out-of-warranty risk items on the B48 engine (electric water pump, thermostat housing, valve cover gasket, ignition coils) are age and heat-cycle driven, not distance driven, so low mileage does not protect against them. The whole retention curve in this record was rebuilt on 2026-08-22 by a trim-ladder repair that reworked all three Taiwan 3 Series Touring records as a set. Years 1, 3, 5 and 10 came down; year 7 was already correct and did not move. The purchase side and the selling costs were not challenged and are unchanged. The maintenance plan WAS challenged, by a later check the same day that rebuilt all three Touring maintenance blocks from one shared schedule, one per-visit price and one clock per age-driven part, and every maintenance figure in this record moved. See maintenance.plan_notes. See purchase.notes for the root cause and the checkpoint source strings for each figure.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REDUCED AGAIN, 2,140,000 -> 2,106,000, ON A GROUP TRIM-LADDER REPAIR. The 2,140,000 read 71.9% of real_cost against the 320i M Racing Edition Touring's 72.2%, a gap of three tenths of a point between two trims 385,000 apart in real_cost; across years 1, 3 and 5 the three Taiwan Tourings tracked each other to within one point, which a 970,000 price span cannot produce. All five checkpoints here are now differenced against the other two Touring records on ONE shared G21 comparable set (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i-touring, about 40 rows, re-opened 2026-08-22) rather than each against its own outside anchor. THE SHARED-SET READ FOR THIS CHECKPOINT: the one-year anchor on that page is the 2025 car with 5,000 km asking 220.0萬 車商售價, which is 320i grade. Trimmed for the ask-versus-transaction gap it stands for about 212萬 dealer retail on a 320i-grade Touring at one year, the same anchor the other two records carry. This trim's step up from that anchor is content, not car: the 330i's 303萬 list buys 245 hp, the M Sport brake package and 19-inch wheels over a 253萬 320i M Sport, a 50萬 step that the Taiwan used market pays only part of. Carrying about 60% of that step, that is 30萬, gives roughly 242萬 車商售價 at one year, and 自售價 13.0% below gives 2,106,000. GROUP LADDER: 70.8% of real_cost, 1.4 points below the 320i M Racing Edition at 72.2% and 3.3 below the 318i Sport at 74.1%, which is the correct direction for the most expensive trim. Sedan baseline, re-read from the opened page. 8891 中古車 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/330i) shows a 2025 330i SEDAN at 243.8萬 車商售價. The prior record read the odometer on that car as '1,500-3,000 km'; the page says 1.5萬 km, that is 15,000 km, so the prior reading was wrong by a factor of ten. The 243.8萬 figure itself is confirmed. All 62 listings on that page are sedans, so this is an explicit sedan baseline, and the estate adjustment is applied on top of it and stated. Converting 243.8萬 to 自售價 at -11% gives about 217萬, about 74% of the 330i sedan real_cost of about 293.5萬. That figure is not carried straight across, for two reasons. First, it inverts the trim ladder: it would put the 330i sedan above the audited 320i sedan record at 71.0%, and the top trim must retain the lower percentage. Second, 243.8萬 is one 車商 ask in a thin one-year 330i segment, and the standard -11% haircut under-corrects an ask that has not transacted. I therefore anchor on the audited 320i sedan at 71.0% and add a small estate premium. The estate premium is at its narrowest at year 1, because a one-year-old car still competes with a discounted new one of the same body. The top-trim haircut then takes most of that premium back, because the M Sport equipment built into the 303萬 list is largely not paid for by the used market. Net 70.8% of real_cost = 2,106,000, which is 0.2 points UNDER the 320i sedan sibling. That is a change of sign from the earlier +0.9 and it is deliberate: the estate scarcity premium is real but at one year it is smaller than the top-trim haircut, because a one-year-old car still competes with a discounted new one of the same body and the M Sport content inside the 303萬 list is the part the used market pays least for. THE OTHER SEDAN IS NOT USED AS THE ANCHOR, AND THIS IS STATED RATHER THAN HIDDEN: the audited 330i M Sport SEDAN record retains 73.0% at year 1 and 58.2% at year 3, ABOVE the 320i M Sport sedan's 71.0% and 55.9%. That sedan pair is itself inverted against the trim-ladder rule, so anchoring this estate on the 330i sedan would import the defect this repair exists to remove. The anchor is the audited 320i sedan. Estate asks for the same body, all opened and all confirmed as Touring bodies, not sedans: abccar 2024 330i Touring M Sport at 275萬 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2149615) and 2023 330i Touring M Sport at 259.8萬 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2136151). Those are optimistic 車商 asks on scarce stock that sits unsold, and neither was copied into private_sale_price; 2,106,000 sits about 23% below the 2024 ask. dealer_tradein_price is 12.6% below private sale."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REDUCED AGAIN, 1,755,000 -> 1,654,000, ON THE GROUP TRIM-LADDER REPAIR. This was the worst checkpoint in the group: 59.0% of real_cost put the most expensive Touring ABOVE the 318i Sport at 58.6% and the 320i M Racing Edition at 57.1%, so the ladder ran backwards at three years as well as at ten. SHARED-SET READ: the 8891 320i Touring model page re-opened 2026-08-22 carries three-year rows an earlier pass missed — 2023 19,000 km at 175.0萬 and 2023 35,000 km at 196.0萬 — beside the 2023 48,000-49,000 km cars at 155.8萬 and the 2023 64,000-65,000 km cars at 159.8萬, plus a 2024 car with 21,000 km at 182.8萬 that is the exact mileage match one year young. Read together, a 320i-grade Touring at three years and 21,000 km stands near 174萬 車商售價, which is the anchor all three records now share. Carrying about 16萬 of the 50萬 content step from a 253萬 320i M Sport to this 303萬 car gives about 190萬 車商售價, and 自售價 13% below gives 1,654,000. The step carried is 30萬 at year 1, 16萬 here, 19萬 at year 5, 12萬 at year 7 and 5萬 at year 10. That sequence is not smooth between years 3 and 5, and it is left unsmoothed on purpose: each anchor is a different row of one shared set with its own mileage correction, and the 2萬 wobble is smaller than the rounding on the rows themselves. Year 3 is the low point because the three-year rows on the shared set are unusually strong (a 2023 car with 19,000 km still asking 175.0萬), which lifts the 320i-grade anchor faster than it lifts the top trim. GROUP LADDER: 55.6% of real_cost, 1.5 points below the 320i M Racing Edition at 57.1% and 3.8 below the 318i Sport at 59.4%. Two reads, both from opened pages, are retained below because they set the shape of the drop rather than the level. (1) Sedan baseline: 8891 shows a 2023 330i sedan at 175.8萬 車商售價 with 40,000 km, about 59% of its 299萬 list, and a 2022 car at 172.0萬 with 42,200 km. Our car has 21,000 km, about half, which is worth a few points. (2) Estate evidence, which points upward: SUM 汽車網 (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=BMW&model=3+SERIES+TOURING) lists a 2023 3 Series Touring with 31,803 km at 178.0萬 車商售價 and another with 60,000 km at 168.8萬. Both rows are 2000.cc, so they are 320i-grade Tourings against a 250萬 list, which is about 71% 車商售價 at three years against the sedan's 59%. SUM does not print the trim, so the 320i reading is an inference from displacement and is flagged as such. Converting the estate figure to 自售價 at -11% gives about 63% of list. abccar has a 2023 330i Touring at 259.8萬 with 2,000 km and a 2022 330i Touring at 258萬, both opened and both confirmed as Touring bodies, but both are garage-queen or slow-moving asks. So Taiwan Touring listings do sit above the equivalent sedan listings, because importers bring in very few. I carry only part of that gap into the model, because these are asking prices on cars that sit unsold. I carry only a small part of that gap, and the top-trim haircut then takes it back: the result is 55.6% of real_cost, 0.3 points UNDER the 320i sedan anchor of 55.9%. The year 1 to year 3 drop is now 15.2 points, against 15.1 for the 320i M Racing Edition and 14.7 for the 318i Sport, so all three Tourings lose value at the same rate in the window where a German car loses it fastest; only the level differs, and it differs in the right direction. dealer_tradein_price is 13.1% below private sale; the spread widens because a dealer that takes a rare Touring into stock must price in a longer holding period."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REDUCED AGAIN, 1,515,000 -> 1,470,000, ON THE GROUP TRIM-LADDER REPAIR. The 1,515,000 read 50.9% against the 320i M Racing Edition's 51.0% and the 318i Sport's 51.4% at the time — three trims spanning 970,000 of real_cost inside half a point, which the cross-check named as the clearest sign that the three curves had been built independently and then landed on top of each other. SHARED-SET READ: on the 8891 320i Touring model page re-opened 2026-08-22, the five-year row is the 領牌 2021 car with 45,000 km at 146.3萬, bracketed by a second 2021 car at 138.3萬, a 2021 with 54,500 km at 148.0萬, 2022 cars at 149.0萬 (76,300 km) and 158.8萬 (67,000-77,000 km), and 2020 cars at 138.8萬 (70,000 km) and 133.8萬 (80,000 km). This checkpoint carries 35,000 km, below every one of them, which lifts the comparable to about 150萬 車商售價 for a 320i-grade Touring at five years — the same anchor the other two records carry. Carrying about 19萬 of the 50萬 content step gives about 169萬 車商售價, and 自售價 13% below gives 1,470,000. GROUP LADDER: 49.4% of real_cost, 1.6 points below the 320i M Racing Edition at 51.0% and 3.0 below the 318i Sport at 52.4%. Best-evidenced checkpoint for this body. Real 330i Touring 車商售價 asks at five to six years, both pages opened and both confirmed as Touring bodies: abccar 2021 330i Touring M Sport at 199.8萬 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2156957) and a 2020 car at 215萬 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2003827), against a 285萬 original list. The 2020 ask sits above the 2021 car from the same platform, so it is stale on the high side and is used only as an upper bound. The single genuine PRIVATE listing is the strongest evidence and was opened and confirmed: FindCar carries a 2020 G21 330i Touring, 9,700 km, 163萬, marked 個人自售, New Taipei City (https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/330i%20touring). At six years that is a 57% asking ratio against its 285萬 list, and a real transaction is a few points under. That car has 9,700 km where this buyer would have 42,000 km at six years, and a 32,000 km gap is worth about 8 to 10 points in Taiwan, so normalising it gives about 48 to 50% at six years. Interpolating back to five years and 35,000 km gives about 53 to 55% of list. I trim to 49.4% of real_cost = 1,470,000, because every figure above is an ask rather than a closed deal, and because the top non-M grade takes the trim-ladder haircut. Sedan cross-check from 8891: a 2022 330i sedan with 42,200 km at 172.0萬 車商售價 is about 53% of its 290萬 list, so about 47% 自售價 at four years with far more mileage; a five-year sedan at our mileage lands near 45 to 47% of list, and this estate sits about 2 points above it. That is +1.8 points over the 320i sedan sibling at 47.6%. Year 5 remains the widest estate premium this record carries, which is right — it is the point where the low-mileage credit and the thin Touring supply reinforce each other most — but it is 1.6 points narrower than the earlier figure, because the earlier figure was measuring against an outside anchor instead of against the other two Tourings. dealer_tradein_price is 13.2% below private sale."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"HELD AT 1,190,000 THROUGH THE GROUP TRIM-LADDER REPAIR — this is the only checkpoint in this record the repair did not move. At 40.0% of real_cost it was already the lowest of the three Tourings at year 7, which is the correct place for the most expensive trim, so nothing needed to change. GROUP LADDER: 40.0% of real_cost, 1.9 points below the 320i M Racing Edition at 41.9% and 3.1 below the 318i Sport at 43.1%. The 320i figure moved down to reach that ordering; this one did not. F31 LIST SETTLED GROUP-WIDE AT 225萬: this record read the F31 320i Touring's Taiwan list as 229萬 while the other two Touring records read it as 225萬. One value is now used in all three and it is 225萬, an inference bounded by two opened pages — FindCar's 219.8萬 new-car reference average for the 320i Touring nameplate (https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/320i%20touring) and the G21's 236萬 February 2020 launch list (SuperMoto8). The denominator below is rewritten to 225萬; it moves the donor ratio by half a point and does not move the result. REDUCED, 1,290,000 -> 1,190,000, and the donor car is corrected. The G21 Touring reached Taiwan in February 2020, so the oldest example is about 6.5 years old as of 2026-08-22 and no genuine seven-year G21 Touring exists. PRIOR ERROR: the record extrapolated from the SUM row '2018, 74,002 km, 80.8萬' and described it as a '320i-grade F31 Touring against a 229萬 original list'. The opened SUM page shows that row as 1500.cc. A 1.5 L three-cylinder F31 Touring is a 318i, that is the BOTTOM trim, against a list near 199萬, not 225萬. Two things were wrong: the denominator, and the trim. 80.8萬 against 199萬 is about 41% 車商售價 at eight years, about 36% 自售價 of list, and it is a bottom-trim ratio applied to a top-trim car, which inverts the trim ladder. That row now belongs to the 318i Sport record and to no other, a split settled across all three Touring records. The correct estate donor here is the SUM row '2017, 92,199 km, 78.8萬', re-opened and re-confirmed as 2000.cc on 2026-08-22, so 320i grade against the settled 225萬 list: about 35% 車商售價 at nine years, about 31% 自售價 of list. Correcting that to seven years and to 49,000 km rather than 92,199 km lifts it to about 39 to 40% of list, before the top-trim haircut. A second and better read, which the prior record missed, comes from the opened 8891 sedan page: a 2019 330i SEDAN with 48,000 km at 108.0萬 車商售價. That is the same trim and almost exactly this record's year-7 mileage. Against a 283萬 list it is 38% 車商售價, about 34% 自售價 of list at seven years. Adding a narrowed estate premium of about 5 points gives about 39% of list, that is 40.0% of real_cost = 1,190,000. The estate premium deliberately NARROWS here: scarcity still helps, but at seven years the car is far outside the three-year 汎德 warranty, and the market discounts a top-trim four-cylinder harder than a 320i because the known failure items (electric water pump, thermostat housing, valve cover gasket) become the buyer's problem. This is -1.5 points BELOW the 320i sedan sibling at 41.5%, which is the correct direction for the top trim at this age and is inside the 5-point band. dealer_tradein_price is 13.9% below private sale, because dealers price an out-of-warranty rare estate defensively."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REDUCED HARD, 775,000 -> 655,000. THIS CHECKPOINT IS WHERE THE GROUP DEFECT ORIGINATED AND IT IS THE LARGEST SINGLE CHANGE IN THE REPAIR. At 775,000 this record read 26.0% of real_cost against the 320i M Racing Edition's 24.7% and the 318i Sport's 23.3%, so ten-year retention ROSE with price across a 970,000 span — the exact reverse of the trim-ladder rule, with no reason stated in any of the three records. The rule is not reversed here, so the number moves. It now reads 22.0%, against 24.0% for the 320i M Racing Edition and 25.0% for the 318i Sport. WHAT WAS WRONG WITH THE OLD DERIVATION, and it was a real error rather than a rounding difference. The old text took a 320i-grade estate to 30% of list, applied a 'top-trim haircut' to reach 26% OF LIST, and then read that 26% straight off as 26% OF REAL_COST. Those are not the same denominator. This car's real_cost of 2,975,000 is 98.2% of its 3,030,000 list, so 26% of list is 26.5% of real_cost, not 26.0% — the haircut was applied to the ratio and then quietly given back by the denominator swap. Worse, the haircut was applied to a 320i-grade ratio derived from a 225萬 F31 list and then carried onto a car whose list is 303萬, which imports the top trim's larger denominator without imposing the larger absolute loss that goes with it. REDERIVED, one denominator throughout. Estate donor, from the SUM page re-opened 2026-08-22: a 2017 3 Series Touring, 2000.cc so 320i grade, 92,199 km, 78.8萬 車商售價. Against the group-settled 225萬 F31 list that is about 35% 車商售價 at nine years, about 31% 自售價. Correcting to ten years costs about 3 points and correcting 92,199 km down to 70,000 km returns about 2 points, so a 320i-grade estate lands near 30% of ITS list, which is the 24.0% of real_cost the 320i M Racing Edition record carries, that is about 69萬 車商售價. The top-trim step is then taken in MONEY, not in ratio: at ten years all three Tourings are priced off the same floor, so the 330i's extra content earns roughly 5萬 over a 320i-grade car and no more, giving about 74萬 車商售價. 自售價 11.5% below is 655,000, that is 22.0% of real_cost and 21.6% of list. Sedan cross-check from the opened 8891 page: a 2016 330i sedan with 100,000 km at 62.8萬 車商售價 against a list near 269萬 is about 23% 車商售價, so about 21% 自售價 of list at ten years; correcting for 70,000 km rather than 100,000 km and adding a thin estate premium gives about 23% of list, which brackets 21.6% from above and confirms the direction of the change. GROUP LADDER: 22.0% of real_cost, 2.0 points below the 320i M Racing Edition at 24.0% and 3.0 below the 318i Sport at 25.0%. The gap to the mid trim is at its widest here, and that is the whole story of this record: the 330i's content premium is paid in full at purchase and is worth nothing at ten years, so the biggest denominator takes the biggest percentage loss. Outside anchor: 0.6 points BELOW the 320i M Sport sedan sibling at 22.6%, a change of sign from the earlier +3.4. Estate scarcity does not survive to ten years on a top-trim car that no dealer wants in stock. Supporting scarcity evidence, from pages opened today: the 8891 3 Series Touring index now shows ONE listing across the whole platform, the 2020 320i M Sport Touring at 99.8萬 with 170,000 km — the 2018 318i Touring at 73.8萬 that page also carried has sold or expired — while the same platform carries 62 330i sedans. The tail keeps falling rather than flattening, as expected for a German car far outside warranty. dealer_tradein_price is 15.0% below private sale: at this age many dealers will not take a rare estate into stock at all, and bid only wholesale-auction money."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"RAISED, 8,000 -> 15,600, BECAUSE THE PREPAID PACKAGE ASSUMPTION IS GONE. The old 8,000 was wipers, one alignment and screen wash only, on the assumption that a prepaid scheduled-maintenance package absorbed the 12-month oil service. It does not: the sibling 320i M Sport sedan record, read for this repair, shows the 3年/4萬公里原廠保養套裝 appearing only in dated campaigns, so it is a purchase-window gift and not standard equipment. The owner pays for the annual visit at the settled 11,000, the same price as the other two Touring records, anchored on the NT$10,222 authorised-dealer service receipt the sedan record cites for the same B48. The first-year four-wheel alignment is deleted: alignment is charged only when new tires are fitted, at years 5 and 10, in all three records. GROUP: 14,200 for the 318i Sport, 14,900 for the 320i M Racing Edition, 15,600 here. The three differ only by the tire damage provision, because nothing else in the first year depends on wheel or brake size. The old figures ran the other way — 11,000 / 12,000 / 8,000 — so the most expensive car in the group was the cheapest to run in its first year. If a bundled package does apply at the buyer's dealer, this period falls to about 4,600."},{"y":3,"source":"RAISED, 22,000 -> 41,700, for the same reason as year 1: the two annual visits and the 24-month brake fluid change are paid, not absorbed by a package that cannot be shown to be standard. 22,000 + 6,000 + 4,500 + 3,000 + 6,200 = 41,700. No wear parts yet — at 21,000 km in three years the brakes are nowhere near replacement, and every item in this window is on a calendar trigger. THE SEDAN COMPARISON IS CORRECTED RATHER THAN DELETED: the old text said the audited 3 Series sedan sibling carries 20,000 in the same window and that the small addition here is Touring consumables. Reading that record shows 20,000 really is its year-3 period, but it is not comparable line for line, because it is probability-weighted between a prepaid-package case and a no-package case while this group assumes no package at all. The addition here is not Touring consumables; it is two full-price dealer visits. GROUP: 38,900 for the 318i Sport, 40,300 for the 320i M Racing Edition, 41,700 here, differing only by the tire damage provision."},{"y":5,"source":"REBUILT, 140,000 -> 137,700, and the total moving very little hides four changes underneath it. 22,000 + 6,000 + 4,500 + 3,000 + 9,000 + 62,000 + 4,000 + 13,000 + 6,200 + 8,000 = 137,700. (1) The annual visits fall from about 15,000 each to the settled 11,000. (2) THE 12V AGM BATTERY COMES BACK TO YEAR 5. The old text moved it out to the 5-to-7 window on the argument that a 4-to-6 year battery on a low-use car normally fails later, and on a rule that period cost must rise with age. The rule is withdrawn for this group and the clock is settled at 5 years in all three records, year 5 and year 10. (3) SPARK PLUGS COME IN, at the 4-year mark. The old record deferred them past year 7 by reading the 60,000 km limit and ignoring the 4-year one, on a plan whose premise is that time comes first. (4) The front pads and discs move out to the settled brake schedule: front pads at year 7, discs at year 10. The tire set stays the dominant line and stays age-driven: at 35,000 km the tread is legal, but five-year-old runflat rubber goes. It is trimmed from about 65,000 to 62,000, which is 15,500 a corner, to hold one price ladder across the group against the 320i's 48,000 and the 318i's 34,000. GROUP: 106,900 for the 318i Sport, 122,300 for the 320i M Racing Edition, 137,700 here. The whole 30,800 spread across the group is tire size, plus the damage provision that follows from the same unit prices."},{"y":7,"source":"REDUCED, 150,000 -> 121,700, and the reason is that three items left this window rather than that the car got cheaper. 22,000 + 6,000 + 4,500 + 3,000 + 6,000 + 16,000 + 14,000 + 28,000 + 6,000 + 6,200 + 10,000 = 121,700. WHAT LEFT. (1) The 12V AGM battery at about 16,000 goes back to year 5 on the settled 5-year clock, at the settled 13,000. (2) The rear pads and discs go to year 10: on the settled brake schedule the first pad change is the FRONT set at 49,000 km, and rear pads follow at 70,000 km. (3) The electric water pump and thermostat housing at about 40,000 are charged once, and only in the year-10 window, in all three records, so the same probabilistic failure is not billed in two periods; what stays here is the gasket weep, at the group figure of 28,000. WHY THIS WINDOW WAS RAISED IN THE FIRST PLACE, AND WHY THAT IS UNDONE: the old text raised year 7 from 115,000 to 150,000 explicitly so that period cost would rise with age. That rule is withdrawn for this group. On a 7,000 km/year car the calendar puts the tire set, the battery and the spark plugs in years 5 and 10, so year 7 is genuinely the quiet window and it is left that way. GROUP: 114,900 for the 318i Sport, 118,300 for the 320i M Racing Edition, 121,700 here. The 6,800 spread across the group is the front pad set (12,000 against 14,000 and 16,000) and the damage provision, nothing else."},{"y":10,"source":"RAISED, 260,000 -> 329,800, and every line is now priced separately instead of sitting inside a probability-weighted repair pool. The lines above sum to 329,800 exactly. WHAT IS NEW HERE. The ZF 8HP gearbox oil and filter (17,000) arrives, at about year 8: this record used to charge it nowhere at all, while the 318i record charged it at year 10 and the 320i record at year 7. The second spark plug set (9,000) is at year 8 on the 4-year clock rather than at 60,000 to 70,000 km, and the first set is now at year 4, so the old wording about plugs finally reaching their interval is deleted. Rear pads, front discs and the second front pad set (51,000 together) are the settled year-10 brake work. WHAT IS REMOVED. The conditional 48V starter-generator and 48V battery-module line is gone: no Taiwan source that could be opened shows a 48V system on this four-cylinder trim, and the group rule is that a part which cannot be shown to be fitted is not priced. Neither sibling record carries a 48V line in any window, so keeping a conditional one here made this record the only one exposed to it. The rear self-levelling air spring removal from an earlier pass stands. The valve cover gasket line is gone from this window because that repair is charged once, at year 7. FOR REFERENCE, verified by reading it: the sibling BMW 3 Series 330i M Sport SEDAN record's year-10 period is 300,000 and its ten-year total is 589,000, so this estate sits about 10% above the same trim in sedan form once the tailgate hardware and the larger tire and brake fitment are added. The ZF 8HP service is NOT part of that gap: the sedan record charges 變速箱油更換 in its own year-10 window, so both cars carry it once. The old divergence note comparing a 580,000 total with the 320i M Sport sedan's 485,000 is deleted, because the 580,000 is dead. GROUP: 284,600 for the 318i Sport, 307,700 for the 320i M Racing Edition, 329,800 here. The 45,200 spread across the group is the second tire set (28,000), the brake set (13,000) and the damage provision (4,200). Confidence low: the individual lines are well-established B48 and G20/G21 items, but their timing inside this three-year window is an estimate, and no Taiwan price table or owner receipt could be opened to quote them."}],"sources":[{"name":"KingAutos - 2026 旅行車 BMW 3 Series Touring 車款介紹","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/bmw/3_series_touring","note":"Opened and re-verified for this check. PRIMARY LIST-PRICE SOURCE. 2026 model year lineup: 320i M Sport 253萬, 330i M Sport 303萬, M340i xDrive 374萬, plus 320i M Sport白金極智版 248萬, 330i M Sport白金極智版 293萬, M340i xDrive白金極智版 366萬. Spec table gives 245 hp at 4,500 rpm for the standard 330i M Sport and 258 hp for the 330i M Sport白金極智版, which is the evidence that kills the prior record's 48V inference: both outputs are on sale at once."},{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點 - 二度小改款 BMW 3-Series & 3-Series Touring 正式在臺上市","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/108806","note":"Opened and re-verified. December 2024 second-LCI launch price list: 318i Sport 219萬, 320i M Sport 249萬, 330i M Sport 299萬, M340i xDrive 368萬, 320i M Sport Touring 256萬, 330i M Sport Touring 306萬, M340i xDrive Touring 375萬. Used as launch price history, not as the 2026 model year list. Also confirms that 48V 高效複合動力 is named only for the six-cylinder M340i."},{"name":"SuperMoto8 - BMW G21 3 Series Touring 236 萬元起在台上市","url":"https://www.supermoto8.com/articles/5753","note":"Opened and re-verified. February 2020 original G21 Touring Taiwan launch prices: 320i Touring 236萬, 330i M Sport Touring 285萬, M340i xDrive Touring 355萬. Used as the original-list denominator for the five-year and six-year used listings."},{"name":"TCar - 全新 BMW 3 系列 / 3 系列 Touring 售價","url":"https://www.tcar.tv/article.php?infoid=7801&pmid=0&lmenuid=2&smenuid=43","note":"Opened and re-verified. December 2022 first-LCI Taiwan price list: 320i M Sport Touring 250萬, 330i M Sport Touring 299萬, M340i xDrive Touring 370萬. Used as the denominator for the 2022 to 2024 used listings."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 3-Series 330i 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/330i","note":"Opened and re-read. SEDAN baseline, explicitly not estate. 62 listings, all sedans, no Touring on the page. 車商售價 rows read this round: 2025 243.8萬 at 1.5萬 km (the prior record misread this odometer as 1,500-3,000 km, a factor-of-ten error), 2022 172.0萬 at 4.22萬 km, 2020 119.8萬 at 7萬 km, 2019 108.0萬 at 4.8萬 km, 2019 128.8萬 at 10.6萬 km, 2016 62.8萬 at 10萬 km, 2017 59.8萬 at 22萬 km. The 2019 car with 48,000 km is the key new datapoint for the year-7 checkpoint: it is the same trim at almost exactly this record's year-7 mileage."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 3-Series Touring 二手 listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series-touring","note":"RE-OPENED 2026-08-22. IT NOW RETURNS ONE LISTING, NOT TWO: the 2020 320i M Sport Touring at 99.8萬 with 170,000 km. The 2018 318i Touring at 73.8萬 with 94,700 km has sold or expired from this index; its ask still appears in 8891's wider unfiltered 3-Series result set, but the page that carried the 318i trim NAME no longer shows it. Confirms the scarcity premise directly, and confirms that this page is the estate body, not the sedan. COUNT SPLIT SETTLED ACROSS THE THREE TOURING RECORDS: this index returns 1, the 320i Touring model page returns about 40, and https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i-m-sport-touring is not a filtered page at all — it falls back to the whole 3-Series list of roughly 910 cars, so no count from it means anything. About 40 live 320i Tourings is the honest headline for Taiwan estate supply."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 3-Series 320i Touring 二手價格（SHARED comparable set）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/3-series/320i-touring","note":"OPENED 2026-08-22 AND ADDED IN THE TRIM-LADDER REPAIR. This is the ONE shared G21 Touring comparable set that all three Taiwan 3 Series Touring records are now differenced against, so the trims are compared with each other rather than each with its own outside anchor. About 40 rows, 旅行車 estate body, 320i grade throughout. 車商售價 read today: 2025 5,000km 220.0萬 (BMW認證); 2025 3,000km 電洽; 2024 9,000km 192.8萬 (five cars); 2024 15,200km 電洽; 2024 17,000km 192.8萬; 2024 21,000km 182.8萬; 2024 22,000km 198.8萬; 2024 31,200km 199.0萬; 2024 40,000-41,000km 179.8萬; 2023 19,000km 175.0萬; 2023 35,000km 196.0萬; 2023 48,000-49,000km 155.8萬; 2023 64,000-65,000km 159.8萬; 2022 30,000km 168.0萬; 2022 55,900-56,000km 148.8萬; 2022 67,000-77,000km 158.8萬; 2022 76,300km 149.0萬; 2021 45,000km 146.3萬 and 138.3萬; 2021 54,500km 148.0萬; 2020 70,000km 138.8萬; 2020 80,000km 133.8萬; 2020 88,000-89,000km 113.8萬; 2020 170,000km 99.8萬. Anchors taken from it: about 212萬 車商售價 at one year, 174萬 at three years, 150萬 at five years, all for a 320i-grade Touring. This record then adds a content step for the 330i and takes the top-trim haircut on top."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 - BMW 320i Touring 價格","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/320i%20touring","note":"OPENED 2026-08-22 AND ADDED IN THE TRIM-LADDER REPAIR. Prints a new-car reference average of 219.8萬 for the 320i Touring nameplate across generations. With the SuperMoto8 G21 launch list of 236萬 above it, that brackets the F31-era 320i Touring list, which is why all three Touring records now settle on 225萬 for it instead of this record's earlier 229萬. Also corroborates the 2023 low-mileage car on the shared 8891 set at 19,600 km and 175萬."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - BMW 3 SERIES TOURING 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=BMW&model=3+SERIES+TOURING","note":"Opened and re-read row by row, all Touring bodies: 2021 2000cc 180,000km 103.8萬; 2023 2000cc 60,000km 168.8萬; E91 2010 2000cc 212,861km 15.8萬; 2018 2000cc 197,495km 99.8萬; 2020 2000cc 70,000km 148.8萬; 2023 2000cc 31,803km 178.0萬; 2018 1500cc 74,002km 80.8萬; F31 2013 2000cc 169,000km 43.8萬; 2017 2000cc 92,199km 78.8萬; E91 2007 2000cc 250,000km 17.8萬. CORRECTION TO THE PRIOR RECORD, RE-CONFIRMED ROW BY ROW ON 2026-08-22: the 2018 74,002km row is 1500.cc, so it is a 318i Touring against a list near 199萬, not the '320i-grade F31 Touring against a 229萬 list' the prior record called it. The correct previous-generation donor for a 330i is the 2017 2000.cc row, and its denominator is now the group-settled 225萬 rather than 229萬. SUM does not print trim names, so all trim readings here are inferred from displacement. This split is settled identically in all three Taiwan 3 Series Touring records: the 1500.cc row feeds only the 318i Sport record, and the 2017 2000.cc row is the single F31 320i-grade donor shared by the other two."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 - 330i Touring 價格","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/330i%20touring","note":"Opened and re-verified. The only genuine PRIVATE-SALE data point found anywhere: 2020 G21 330i Touring, 9,700 km, 163萬, marked 個人自售, New Taipei City, listed with 5AU 駕駛輔助. Used for the year-5 checkpoint after normalising the odometer from 9,700 km to a realistic 42,000 km at that age. The same page also prints a new-car reference price history for this nameplate: 2016 269萬, 2017 274萬, 2018 276萬, 2020 285萬, 2021 285萬, 2022 290萬, 2023 299萬, 2024 303萬. That history is the second independent source for the 303萬 list price."},{"name":"abc 好車網 - BMW 3-Series Touring 330i M Sport 2024年 275萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2149615","note":"Opened this round and confirmed as a Touring body, 330i M Sport, 2024, ask 2,750,000 from 捷恒汽車. Treated as an optimistic 車商售價 on scarce stock, not as a transaction price. NOT copied into private_sale_price."},{"name":"abc 好車網 - BMW 3-Series Touring 330i M Sport 2023年 259.8萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2136151","note":"Opened this round and confirmed as a Touring body, 330i M Sport, 2023, ask 2,598,000. The prior record admitted it had never opened this page and used only the search summary. Treated as a garage-queen outlier and used only as directional evidence that three-year Touring asks sit far above sedan asks."},{"name":"abc 好車網 - BMW 3-Series Touring 330i M Sport 2022年 258萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2164481","note":"Opened this round and confirmed as a Touring body, 330i M Sport, 2022, ask 2,580,000 from 巧鑫汽車. Against a 299萬 list that is an 86% 車商售價 ask at four years, far above the sedan's 51 to 58% at the same age. Reported as found, but discounted in the model, because it is an ask on a slow-moving rare car."},{"name":"abc 好車網 - BMW 3-Series Touring 330i M Sport 2021年 199.8萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2156957","note":"Opened this round and confirmed as a Touring body, 330i M Sport, 2021, ask 1,998,000 from 宥禾國際車業. The most grounded of the abccar Touring asks and the main 車商售價 input to the year-5 checkpoint after the 11% haircut to 自售價."},{"name":"abc 好車網 - BMW 3-Series Touring 330i M Sport 2020年 215萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2003827","note":"Opened this round and confirmed as a Touring body, 330i M Sport, 2020, ask 2,150,000 from 勝億汽車. Judged stale and high-side, because it sits above the 2021 car at 199.8萬 on the same platform. Used only as an upper bound."}]},"bmw-5-series-530i-m-sport":{"assumptions":"Every checkpoint uses 7,000 km/year (7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km), about half the Taiwan average. Three effects follow. (1) The B48TU2 with the 48V belt starter-generator uses BMW Condition Based Service, so at this distance the oil service always falls due on the time counter, never the distance counter. Every service in this record is an annual one. (2) The 530i M Sport is the only G60 sedan trim on 20-inch wheels with staggered run-flat tyres, 245/40R20 front and 275/35R20 rear, against 245/45R19 on the 520i. Both sizes were read off the TVBS spec table for this check. At 7,000 km/year the tyres are scrapped for age at 5-6 years with tread left, so the owner pays for ONE full set inside the 10-year window and gets no distance benefit from it. CORRECTED: the earlier version of this record charged TWO full sets in 10 years. That does not hold. The factory set ages out in the year 5-7 window, and its replacement ages out around year 11-12, outside this window. (3) A 70,000 km 10-year car is far below the 100,000-180,000 km that the 8891 and SUM listings for 7-9 year old 5 Series actually show, so every resale figure here is quoted against low-mileage listings and carries a premium over the mileage-blind average. EXCLUDED by design: 牌照稅, 燃料費, insurance, and fuel. The 48V system cannot move the car on battery alone, so this record is gasoline, not hybrid.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"SOURCE REWRITTEN AND CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from 'high' to 'medium' by this audit; the price itself is unchanged. WHAT IS ACTUALLY OBSERVABLE: 8891 中古車 (auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series/530i) was re-opened on 2026-08-22 and shows a 2025 G60 530i M Sport at 7,000 km asking 288萬, carrying BMW 原廠認證中古車 / BPS 原廠保固. That is 車商售價, a dealer RETAIL asking price on a certified car, and 85% of the 339萬 list. WHAT WAS NOT CONFIRMED: the previous version built the figure on an invented 'ordinary non-certified dealer retail of about 258萬', interpolated between the 288萬 certified cars and a claimed non-certified 2025 530i at 16,000 km asking 218.8萬. This audit could not confirm that 218.8萬 car as a 總代理 530i. The 8891 520i page shows 韓規 parallel-import G60 cars at 218.0-229.8萬, the same band, so a mis-attributed parallel-import 520i is the likelier reading and the interpolation is deleted. METHOD NOW USED: BPS certification is a dealer product (extended factory warranty, certified inspection) that a private seller cannot offer, so it is stripped first, then the private-sale cut is applied. Calibrating against the audited 520i sedan sibling, whose 238萬 BPS-certified 9,000 km car resolves to 203萬 private, the 40萬 new-car trim gap is worth about 24萬 to the used market after one year. 203萬 + 24萬 = 227萬. The figure sits 21% below the 288萬 certified dealer asking, well outside dealer retail, and gives 68.7% of real_cost against the 520i sibling's 68.9%."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolated. The G60 530i M Sport only went on sale in Taiwan on 2024-11-18, so no genuine 3-year 總代理 car exists yet. Previous-generation anchor re-read on 8891 for this audit: G30 530i M Sport LCI cars registered 2022, so about 4 years old, at 52,000-97,000 km ask 153.0-153.8萬 as 原廠認證 BPS 車商售價, which is 45% of the same 339萬 list the G30 530i M Sport carried at its February 2017 Taiwan launch (confirmed on 7Car, opened for this audit: 建議售價 339 萬元起). Our car at 3 years and only 21,000 km sits a full year younger and at a quarter to a third of that mileage, so about 208萬 dealer retail is the reading, and private sale is 208萬 less 12% = 1,835,000. That is 55.5% of real_cost against the 520i sibling's 56.4%, a 0.9-point gap in the expected direction: the more expensive trim gives up a slightly higher share. The 1-to-3 fall is steep because that is the German pattern in Taiwan; the 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty is still running at this checkpoint and the cliff comes immediately after it. Dealer trade-in 13.5% below private sale, matching the BMW sibling records in this dataset."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolated from the previous generation, whose Taiwan list price was IDENTICAL, so no rebasing is needed: 7Car records the G30 530i M Sport launching in Taiwan at 339萬 in February 2017, the same number this G60 carries. 8891 shows 2022-registered G30 530i M Sport LCI cars, about 4 years old, at 52,000-97,000 km asking 153.0-153.8萬 as certified 車商售價. Our car is one year older but at 35,000 km, roughly offsetting, so about 153萬 dealer retail. Private sale = 153萬 less 12% = 1,350,000, which is 40.8% of real_cost against the 520i sibling's 41.4%. EXPLAINED DIVERGENCE: that is 6.2 points below the Mercedes E 200 sibling at the same age. The reason is observable rather than assumed. 8891 currently carries 韓規 parallel-import G60 520i cars asking 218.0-229.8萬 (re-read for this audit; the previous version of this record quoted 198.8-225.0萬, corrected here), and the i5 shares this exact body shell, so the G60 gasoline sedan is squeezed from both sides in a way the E-Class is not. This period also crosses out of warranty, which is where German cars in Taiwan fall hardest. The figure sits at the top of the observed band because of the mileage premium. Dealer trade-in 14% below private sale."},{"y":7,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolated from the previous generation at the same age and the same 339萬 original list price. 8891, re-opened for this audit, shows 2019-registered G30 530i cars, 7 years old, asking 99.8-123.8萬 at 80,000-170,000 km. Our owner reaches only 49,000 km at 7 years, so the car sits at or slightly above the low-mileage top of that band: about 122萬 dealer retail, 36% of 339萬. Private sale = 122萬 less 12% = 1,070,000, which is 13.6% below the 123.8萬 dealer asking and 32.4% of real_cost against the 520i sibling's 32.6%. SUM 汽車網 corroborates the level with G30 sedans of the same vintage: 2019 cars at 105,532 km asking 96.8萬, at 110,000 km asking 106.8萬 and at 142,385 km asking 109.8萬. Confidence is medium, not high, because the ratio comes from the G30 and is then applied to this car's real_cost; no G60 in Taiwan is 7 years old. Dealer trade-in 15% below private sale."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED UPWARD by this audit, 535,000 to 600,000. WHAT WAS WRONG: the previous version derived this checkpoint from F10 listings, rebasing the F10 520i's roughly 259萬 list onto a 339萬 530i. That is the wrong evidence base twice over, wrong generation and wrong trim class, and it undershoots. The F10 quotes themselves are accurate and were re-read for this audit (SUM shows a 2016 F10 at 53,154 km asking 53.9萬 and a 2016 at 124,523 km asking 78.8萬), but almost every F10 in that list is a high-mileage 520-class car. WHAT REPLACES IT: 8891 carries DIRECT same-trim evidence. G30 530i cars registered 2017-2018, now 8-9 years old, ask 85.0-99.8萬 as 車商售價 at 100,000-170,000 km. Extending that trend one year and adding the low-mileage premium for a 70,000 km car gives roughly 88萬 dealer retail; private sale at a 12% cut would be about 77萬. The figure is deliberately held BELOW that, at 600,000, for two reasons: 8891 asking prices on 9-year German sedans sit far above transaction prices, and the audited 520i sedan sibling, same body and same market, is at 500,000. 600,000 is 18.2% of real_cost against the 520i sibling's 17.0%, a 1.2-point gap, and restores a 100,000 absolute premium over the 520i. The previous 535,000 left a premium of only 35,000 on a 400,000 new-car list gap, which the direct 8891 evidence contradicts. EXPLAINED DIVERGENCE: 18.2% is 7.8 points below the Mercedes E 200 sibling at 10 years. The reason is the same 韓規 parallel-import and i5 body-shell pressure cited at year 5, plus the fact that by 2036 the market prices in the 48V BSG unit, the electric water pump and the 14.9-inch curved display as single-point out-of-warranty failures. Dealer trade-in 17% below private sale, matching the deeper cut the BMW sibling records take on old cars. Confidence low: no G60 in Taiwan is anywhere near this age."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"RAISED from 6,000. The previous figure zeroed the first service against the 汎德 3年/4萬公里保養套裝 gift, which this dataset excludes for the 520i sibling and therefore excludes here. The owner pays the 定保 invoice. Level is set from the 520i sedan sibling's audited 10,000 for the same B48 service, plus the alignment that the staggered 20-inch fitment needs and the 19-inch car does not. Non-trivial and the lowest period, as expected inside warranty."},{"y":3,"source":"RAISED from 24,000, same reason as year 1: the service package gift is excluded, so two annual 定保 invoices are charged. Base level follows the 520i sedan sibling's audited 29,000 for the equivalent period. The 13,000 gap over the sibling is the run-flat casing line, which is genuinely 530i-specific: a damaged 20-inch run-flat sidewall cannot be plug-repaired and the tyre is replaced individually at a price no 19-inch non-run-flat fitment reaches. Still inside the 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty, so no repair cost."},{"y":5,"source":"CUT from 165,000. The previous figure loaded a whole 68,000 tyre set into this period on the argument that the factory tyres age out at exactly 5 years. Ageing out at 5-6 years places the replacement in the 5-7 window, which is the year-7 period under the convention the 520i sedan sibling uses, and loading it here is what made the old schedule fall from year 5 to year 7. Warranty and any service package have both expired at the start of this period, so this is the first fully unsubsidised one. Brake line is above the 520i sibling's 12,000 because the M brake package takes discs as well as pads. The PTT G30 receipt sets the independent-shop ceiling for front discs plus front and rear pads at 41,710."},{"y":7,"source":"RAISED from 138,000 and now above year 5, which restores monotonicity. The tyre set moves here from year 5 because the factory rubber ages out at 5-6 years, matching the convention the 520i sedan sibling uses. The tyre line is the single largest 530i-versus-520i split: TVBS confirms 245/40R20 and 275/35R20 staggered run-flats on this trim against 245/45R19 on the 520i, and the sibling's audited 19-inch set is 46,000 against 68,000 here. The 48V BSG belt is a 530i and 520i shared line but is carried explicitly because the belt-driven starter-generator makes the accessory belt a load-bearing part that is replaced preventively rather than run to failure. 車主充電站 prices an independent 3-year / 60,000 km major service at 35,900 and reports G-generation BMWs as low-trouble, which is why the unscheduled allowance stays at 22,000 rather than a large-repair reserve."},{"y":10,"source":"RAISED from 238,000 and rebuilt against the 520i sedan sibling's audited 244,000 item list for the same period, scaled up for the M brake package and the adaptive dampers. NO SECOND TYRE SET is carried here. The previous version charged two full sets across 10 years; at 7,000 km/year the factory set ages out in the 5-7 window and its replacement ages out around year 11-12, which is outside this window, so only one set is chargeable. Seven years out of warranty. The electric water pump and thermostat is carried as a near-certain expense rather than a contingency because it is the classic BMW item at this age. Confidence low: no G60 in Taiwan has reached this age, so the item list is projected from F10 and G30 out-of-warranty experience rather than measured."}],"sources":[{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 - 2025 BMW 5 Series Sedan 規格配備表","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/bmw/2025-bmw5-series-sedan","note":"OPENED AND READ 2026-08-22. The independent price confirmation this audit relied on: 520i M Sport 296萬, 530i M Sport 339萬. Also the source of the tyre sizes that drive the maintenance model: 530i 245/40R20 and 275/35R20 staggered, 520i 245/45R19."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 5-Series 530i 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series/530i?force=1","note":"OPENED AND READ 2026-08-22. Primary used-price source and the direct same-trim evidence at every checkpoint. G60: a 2025 car at 7,000 km asking 288萬 as BMW 原廠認證中古車 / BPS 原廠保固. G30: 2022-registered LCI cars at 52,000-97,000 km asking 153.0-153.8萬 certified; 2019 cars at 80,000-170,000 km asking 99.8-123.8萬; 2017-2018 cars at 100,000-170,000 km asking 85.0-99.8萬. All are 車商售價, dealer asking prices, and were cut 12% to reach private sale. The 2017-2018 band is what replaced the F10 rebase at year 10."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 5-Series 520i 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series/520i?force=1","note":"OPENED AND READ 2026-08-22. Used to calibrate the dealer-retail-to-private-sale cut against the audited 520i sibling record, and to document the 韓規 parallel-import G60 supply. CORRECTION: the observed parallel-import band is 218.0-229.8萬 for 2024-2025 cars, not the 198.8-225.0萬 the previous version of this record quoted. That band also overlaps the 218.8萬 car the previous version treated as a non-certified 總代理 530i, which is why that data point was dropped."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - BMW 5 SERIES SEDAN G30 中古車","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/BMW/5%20SERIES%20SEDAN%20G30","note":"OPENED AND READ 2026-08-22. Second independent used-price source for the previous generation, each listing with mileage attached: 2020 cars at 30,000-87,136 km asking 119.8-142.0萬; 2019 cars at 105,532-142,385 km asking 96.8-109.8萬; 2017-2018 cars at 35,600-274,834 km asking 63.8-99.8萬. Corroborates the year-7 level. The list mixes 520i and 530i, so it is used only as a level check, never as the primary anchor."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - BMW 5 SERIES SEDAN F10 中古車","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/BMW/5%20SERIES%20SEDAN%20F10","note":"OPENED AND READ 2026-08-22. Quoted accurately by the previous version (2016 at 53,154 km asking 53.9萬, 2016 at 124,523 km asking 78.8萬, 2016 at 124,779 km asking 45.8萬) but DEMOTED by this audit. Almost every F10 in the list is a high-mileage 520-class car on a roughly 259萬 original list, so rebasing it onto a 339萬 530i undershoots. Retained as background only; the year-10 figure now rests on the direct 8891 G30 530i listings instead."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - 2024 BMW 5 SERIES SEDAN G60 個車頁","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carinfo-781580.php","note":"OPENED AND READ 2026-08-22. A 2024 G60 sedan at 15,000 km asking 227.8萬 車商售價, unregistered, described as 全網最低價. Cross-check that reproduces the audited 520i sibling record's year-1 figure through the same 12% conversion. Note this is a 520i-class G60, not a 530i, and is used only for the conversion check."},{"name":"PTT car 板 - [分享] BMW 530 6萬公里保養","url":"https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/car/M.1638972068.A.109.html","note":"OPENED AND READ 2026-08-22. Real owner receipt for a G30 530i at 4 years and 60,000 km, total 80,085: four Michelin Primacy 28,152; front discs plus front and rear pads and an air filter at an independent shop 41,710; dealer oil service and inspection 10,223. CAVEAT this audit added: the poster states aggressive driving brought the brake work forward, so the brake figure is a ceiling, not a typical cost."},{"name":"車主充電站 - BMW F30 328i、G20 330i、M340i、G30 530i 通病保養問題懶人包","url":"https://racingcharger.tw/bmw-f30-328i%E3%80%81g20-330i%E3%80%81m340i%E3%80%81g30-530i%E9%80%9A%E7%97%85%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E5%95%8F%E9%A1%8C%E6%87%B6%E4%BA%BA%E5%8C%85%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%96%E5%8C%AF%E8%BB%8A%E8%A9%B2%E6%80%8E/","note":"OPENED AND READ 2026-08-22. Independent BMW specialist interview: annual small service 8,800 including a 20-point inspection, and a 3-year / 60,000 km major service 35,900 on a B48. Also states G-generation cars 真的都沒甚麼問題, which kept the unscheduled repair allowance moderate, with the caveat the article itself gives that G cars were still young when it was written."},{"name":"8891 新車 - BMW 優惠總表","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/bmw/x3/21078","note":"OPENED AND READ 2026-08-22. Confirms the 汎德 promotion table lists 贈3年/4萬公里保養套裝 plus a first year of comprehensive insurance for the 5系列, X5 and X6 lines, and that BMW Taiwan sells on low monthly payments rather than deep cash cuts. Recorded as CONTEXT ONLY. This audit deliberately does NOT count the service package, because it is a time-limited gift that covers the whole 5 系列 line and the 520i sibling record excludes it; counting it here would break comparability between the two records."},{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點 - BMW 全新 G30 5-Series 正式在台發表","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/41049","note":"OPENED AND READ 2026-08-22. Confirms the previous-generation G30 530i M Sport launched in Taiwan at 建議售價 339 萬元起 in February 2017, the same number the G60 carries. This is what allows G30 used prices to convert to retention ratios for this car with no rebasing, and it is why the G30 is used at years 3, 5 and 7 in place of the F10."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - BMW 5 Series 車款介紹與價格表","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/bmw/5%20series/7073/overall","note":"NOT RE-OPENED: returns HTTP 403 to automated fetch on 2026-08-22. Retained because the 520i sibling record in this dataset quotes its price table verbatim as '520i M Sport 299 / 530i M Sport 339' (萬) for the 2026 model year, and because TVBS, which did open, confirms 339萬 independently. No figure in this record depends on U-CAR alone."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 - 正式售價339萬，大改款BMW 530i M Sport國內上市","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/80714","note":"NOT RE-OPENED: returns HTTP 403 to automated fetch on 2026-08-22. Cited for the 2024-11-18 Taiwan launch date and the 530i-only equipment (20-inch 938M wheels, M blue brake package). The launch date matters because it is why no 3-year or older G60 530i exists in Taiwan. Price is corroborated by TVBS."}]},"bmw-5-series-touring-520i-m-sport":{"assumptions":"7,000 km/year on a 190hp 2.0T estate means every service trigger is the calendar, not the odometer. BMW CBS would call an oil service at roughly 10,000-15,000 km, so at this rate the car reaches the 12-month limit first every year and never banks a skipped service. The same applies to the wear parts that cost real money on this car: 19-inch M tyres age out at 5-6 years with only 35,000-42,000 km on them, brake fluid is a 2-year item regardless of distance, and the AGM 12V battery dies on age plus the parasitic draw of the 48V and OS 8.5 electronics rather than on mileage. Short low-mileage trips are also the worst case for a 48V mild-hybrid B48: the belt-driven starter-generator cycles constantly in stop-start traffic while the engine rarely reaches sustained load. On the resale side the low odometer matters more for this car than for most, because the used pool of petrol G61 Tourings in Taiwan is tiny (imports started March 2025, single trim), so a 35,000 km 5-year example is a rare listing rather than one of fifty. Working against that: an estate in Taiwan has a thin buyer pool, so the private seller should budget a longer time-to-sell than the 520i sedan owner, which is why the selling costs carry an extra listing allowance rather than a lower price.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED. The previous version of this record claimed the 8891 listing at 2,650,000 車商售價 was a 2025 G61 Touring with 'about 4,000-4,700 km, an almost exact match for this buyer's 7,000 km profile'. That is wrong by a factor of ten. Re-reading https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series/520i-touring shows the 2,650,000 cars at 40,000 km and 47,000 km. The one 2025 Touring that does carry about 4,000 km is listed 價格電洽 with no published price, so it cannot anchor anything. The 2,650,000 ask was also rejected as the year-1 anchor on its own merits. At 40,000 km and about 1.3 years it implies 86.6% of the 3,060,000 launch list in DEALER RETAIL, while the sedan control group on https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series/520i asks 2,198,000-2,298,000 for 2025 cars with only 2,000-3,800 km, or about 75.2% of the 2,990,000 sedan list. A higher-mileage estate cannot out-retain a near-delivery sedan by eleven points; that single ask (it appears three times at the identical price, so it is most likely one car or one dealer's stock) is an optimistic ask on rare inventory, not a transaction. The year-1 figure is therefore built from the sedan control plus the estate premium that IS observed consistently across two older generations. That premium measured in dealer retail is about +6 points at 5 years (G31 Touring 48.0% of its list against G30 sedan 39.2% of its list) and about +7 points at 10 years (see the 10-year checkpoint). Applying +6 points to the sedan's 75.2% gives about 81% dealer retail, or an equivalent ask near 2,510,000; cutting 11% for the dealer-retail-to-private-sale step gives about 2,233,000. Set 2,250,000, which is 73.5% of real_cost against the sedan sibling's 69%. That +4.5-point divergence is the estate finding: the Touring is the only petrol 5 Series estate importable in Taiwan, new supply is order-only, and the 2026 price rise to 3,090,000 lifted the ceiling the used cars price against. It is under the 5-point flag threshold and matches the premium carried at every other checkpoint. Dealer trade-in set 9% under private sale, which puts it about 20% under dealer asking, inside the 15-20% 收購價 band that https://www.littletsenggarage.com/usedcar-price-list/ actually states. NOT re-opened in the 2026-08-22 maintenance repair pass; that pass touched maintenance only."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED for the dealer-retail trap. The previous version set private sale at 1,840,000 while the dominant dealer asking price for the same car is 1,838,000, so the 'private sale' figure was effectively a dealer retail figure. Read off the previous-generation G31 520i Touring M Sport, expressed as a ratio of its own list. G31 Touring M Sport launched in Taiwan October 2020 at 2,950,000 and was 2,990,000 for the 2021 model year. Three-year-old (2023) examples today: 8891 lists one at 1,838,000 車商售價 with 38,000 km, and the same listing repeats three times in the pool, so it is the market ask (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series/520i-touring); abc好車網 lists a 2023 520i Touring M Sport at 2,180,000 車商售價 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2284072, confirmed Touring body, not the sedan). Weighting toward the repeated 8891 ask gives a reference dealer retail of about 1,950,000 at 38,000 km. This buyer arrives at 21,000 km, so the like-for-like ask rises about 4% to roughly 2,030,000. Cutting 11.8% for the private-sale step gives about 1,790,000, which is 59.9% of the G31's own 2,990,000 list. Applied to this car's real_cost 3,060,000 that is 1,790,000 (58.5%). The sedan sibling sits at 56% at 3 years, so the Touring runs +2.5 points, the same scarcity effect as elsewhere and smaller here than at year 1 because by year 3 the G61 Touring will have three full import years of supply behind it instead of one. Note the 2023 G31 cars were run-out stock sold alongside the new G60 sedan and carried heavier new-car discount, which if anything makes this read conservative. No trim-ladder adjustment applies: M Sport is the only Touring trim sold in Taiwan, so there is no cheaper grade for the used market to prefer. Dealer trade-in 10% under private sale. NOT re-opened in the 2026-08-22 maintenance repair pass."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED for the dealer-retail trap. The previous version set private sale at 1,380,000, which is exactly the lowest dealer ASKING price in the pool, so the private figure was again a dealer retail figure. Previous-generation G31 520i Touring M Sport at 5 years, expressed as a ratio of its own 2,990,000 list. Current 2021 examples: 8891 shows 1,380,000 車商售價 with 96,000 km (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series/520i-touring); abc好車網 shows 1,431,000 at 和運優質中古車 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2258374) and 1,498,000 at 元禾國際 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2283160). Both abc好車網 listings were opened for this check and both are genuinely the Touring body, not the sedan. Mid dealer retail is about 1,436,000 on cars carrying normal Taiwan 5-year mileage of roughly 70,000-96,000 km. This buyer arrives at 35,000 km, about half, and a genuinely low-odometer example in a 31-car nationwide Touring pool commands a real premium, worth about 7% on the ask here, lifting the like-for-like ask to roughly 1,540,000. Cutting 11.7% for the private-sale step gives about 1,360,000, or 45.5% of the G31's own list. Applied to real_cost 3,060,000 that is 1,360,000 (44.4%). The sedan sibling is 41% at 5 years, so +3.4 points, the same estate-scarcity reason and consistent in size with years 1, 7 and 10. Sedan sanity check, with one correction to the earlier version: the 8891 sedan cars at 1,020,000-1,090,000 車商售價 with 70,000-96,600 km are 2020 models, not 2021 as previously stated (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series/520i). Against a G30 520i M Sport list of about 2,690,000 that is 39.2% dealer retail, which is where the sedan record's 41% comes from once the low-mileage uplift is applied. Dealer trade-in 11% under private sale, slightly wider than the early checkpoints because a 5-year German estate is the car a 車商 discounts hardest on for standing stock risk. NOT re-opened in the 2026-08-22 maintenance repair pass."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolated, and stated as such. There is no 7-year data for a G31 520i Touring M Sport because Taiwan only received that car in October 2020, so the oldest local example is about 6 years old. Two bridges instead. First, the 8891 Touring pool does show 2018 520i Touring cars at 938,000-998,000 車商售價 with 120,000-131,600 km (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series/520i-touring). Against a period list of roughly 2,680,000-2,750,000 that is about 35% private-sale retention at 8 years once the mileage of this buyer's car is allowed for, so roughly 37-38% at 7 years. Second, the sedan side at 7 years is directly measurable: 8891 shows 2019 G30 520i M Sport at 890,000-950,000 車商售價 with 107,000-119,000 km, which after the same haircut and a low-mileage uplift for a 49,000 km car reproduces the sedan record's 33%. Setting the Touring about 3.6 points above the sedan, the same gap carried at years 1, 3, 5 and 10, gives 36.6%. Applied to real_cost 3,060,000 that is 1,119,960, rounded to 1,120,000. Confidence is low because both bridges are proxies rather than direct G61 Touring observations. The German tail rule is respected: the car is four years past its 3-year warranty and the used market prices repair risk on the 48V starter-generator, the electric water pump and the estate-specific rear suspension and tailgate hardware, so the curve keeps falling rather than flattening. Dealer trade-in 12% under private sale. NOT re-opened in the 2026-08-22 maintenance repair pass."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolated from the previous-previous generation, and stated as such. The F11 520i Touring is the only 5 Series estate with real 10-year Taiwan data. 8891 currently shows 2016 F11 520i Touring at 668,000, 688,000, 698,000 and 728,000 車商售價 with 92,000-130,000 km, and a 2015 at 488,000 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series/520i-touring). Taking the 2016 mid of about 695,000 less 11% gives roughly 619,000 private sale; against an F11 520i Touring list of roughly 2,650,000 that is about 23.4% at 10 years. The matching F10 SEDAN read from the same platform is corrected in this pass: the previous version quoted 2016 520i sedans at 398,000-460,000, but https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series/520i actually spans 398,000-560,000, so the mid is about 479,000, not 430,000. Less 11% is about 426,000, or roughly 16.5% of its own list, which is where the sedan record's 17% comes from. The truncated top end in the earlier version made the sedan look worse and inflated the apparent estate premium. The corrected raw estate premium at 10 years is about +7 points, not the +8-9 previously claimed. I did NOT carry the full +7 points across. The Touring is set at 21.5% against the sedan sibling's 17%, a +4.5-point premium, for three reasons: the F11 Touring sample is small and may include 外匯 parallel imports whose original list price cannot be verified; a 10-year G61 carries far more failure-prone content than an F11 did (OS 8.5 head unit, 48V starter-generator and DC-DC converter, electrically actuated tailgate, and the estate-specific rear suspension hardware), so the market discounts repair risk harder on this generation; and a thin market cuts both ways at 10 years, where the buyer pool for an out-of-warranty German estate is genuinely small and time-to-sell is long. 21.5% of real_cost 3,060,000 is 657,900, rounded to 658,000. Confidence low: this is an explicit two-generations-back ratio transfer, not observed G61 data. Dealer trade-in 13% under private sale, the widest gap of the five checkpoints, because a 10-year German estate is stock most 車商 will only take on a deep trade-in number. NOT re-opened in the 2026-08-22 maintenance repair pass."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"REVISED DOWN from 13,000 to 11,000. The old figure used an unsourced 11,000-12,000 service price and sat above every BMW in the table costing under 3.4 million, including the sedan sibling built on the same engine and serviced by the same dealer network. The service price is now settled at the sedan record's 9,000, taken from the owner work orders on https://tyaward.com.tw/汽機車-2/bmw保養大概多少錢/ (re-opened for this pass: first service 8,000-9,600, second 8,500-8,700, third 8,500-10,000, CBS interval about 10,000 km or 1 year). Only one service falls in this window because at 7,000 km/year the annual timer fires long before the mileage trigger. The car is inside the 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty for the whole window, so no repair spend is budgeted; that warranty covers repairs only and never the 定保 invoice. The single genuine estate difference is the rear wiper blade and rear washer fluid, worth about 1,000 over the sedan's 10,000. Caveat carried over from the sedan record: those work orders are 3 Series / 4 Series / X1 jobs, not a 5 Series, so a 5 Series is likely at or slightly above the top of the band."},{"y":3,"source":"REVISED DOWN from 46,000 to 31,000, the largest single correction in this record. The old figure was higher than every BMW in the table below 3.4 million, higher than the 530i M Sport Sedan's 42,000 on the same platform with a bigger engine, and 17,000 above the 520i M Sport Sedan that shares this car's engine, service schedule, dealer and warranty. That premium could not be defended: in years 1-3 the only estate hardware in play is a rear wiper. Rebuilt from the sedan's 29,000 line for line - two annual services at the settled 9,000 (18,000), cabin plus engine air filter 5,000, brake fluid at the fixed 24-month interval 3,500 - plus 4,500 for wipers and sundries against the sedan's 2,500, the extra being the rear blade and rear washer. The old version also charged 5,000 for a wheel alignment and tyre rotation in this window; that line is deleted, because at 21,000 km on original tyres there is nothing to align or rotate, and the sedan correctly places its first alignment in the 3-5 window. Still fully inside the warranty, which expires at the very end of this window, so no repair or wear-part failure spend is included. Original tyres, pads and discs are all untouched at 21,000 km."},{"y":5,"source":"REVISED DOWN from 98,000 to 66,000. Two changes. First, the spark plug set (13,000) moved out of this window and into the 7-year window, which is where the sedan record puts it and where it belongs: the B48 plug interval is roughly 60,000 km or four to five years, and this car has covered 35,000 km. Second, the remaining line items are now the sedan's 62,000 exactly - two services at the settled 9,000, first AGM battery 13,000, first front pad set 12,000, coolant 4,000, brake fluid 3,500, filters 5,000, alignment 2,500, first out-of-warranty sundries 4,000 - plus 4,000 of genuine estate content: rear wiper blades, the rear washer nozzle and line, and the tailgate seal and cargo-cover hardware an estate has and a sedan does not. The old version priced the first front pad set at 20,000 'on the 19-inch M brake package' while the sedan priced the same part on the same package at 12,000; that split is settled at 12,000. The warranty expires at 36 months, at the start of this window, so from here everything is owner-paid. Confidence medium: the item list is well established for a Taiwan B48 5 Series, but no published 汎德 price table for the G61 could be opened, so the amounts are dealer-rate estimates rather than quoted receipts."},{"y":7,"source":"REVISED DOWN from 175,000 to 140,000, but the estate content inside it went UP. The old 175,000 was inflated by a 70,000 tyre set; that is now settled at the sedan record's 46,000 for the same four 19-inch staggered M run-flats, because no source on either body publishes a tyre size and both cars carry the same 19吋M專屬輪圈 package. The old version also had no estate-specific line at all in this window even though it is the first window outside warranty in which estate hardware genuinely starts to fail. Two such lines are now priced explicitly: the electric tailgate gas struts, which sag and are replaced in pairs at around year 6 on a powered hatch, at 8,000; and the rear wiper circuit service, blades and washer nozzles at 5,000. The rear brake job is set 4,000 above the sedan's because the estate rear axle carries more static load. The out-of-warranty provision is 25,000 against the sedan's 20,000, the extra 5,000 covering the tailgate microswitch, the hatch position sensors and the rear-hatch electrics that have no sedan counterpart. Base items follow the sedan: two services at the mixed dealer/independent rate 14,000, plugs and filters 14,000, brake fluid and alignment 6,000. Total estate premium in this window is 22,000 against the sedan's 118,000. Confidence low because no G61 in Taiwan is 7 years old yet, so the provision is actuarial, not observed."},{"y":10,"source":"REVISED UP from 198,000 to 301,000, the correction the cross-check asked for. The old 198,000 was wrong in three ways at once. It was BELOW this record's own 5-to-7 window on a per-year basis (66,000/year against 87,500/year) even though it covers three years instead of two on a car that is a decade old and seven years out of warranty. It was 46,000 BELOW the 520i M Sport Sedan's 244,000 in the same window, which is the exact opposite of the estate-hardware story this record tells. And it was below the same window on smaller and cheaper BMWs in the table - the 1 Series 120 M Sport at 265,000, the 3 Series Touring 318i Sport at 250,000, the 3 Series Touring 320i M Racing at 248,000, the 2 Series Coupe 220i at 225,000 and the X1 sDrive20i at 230,000 - which no 3-million-class estate can defend. Rebuilt from the sedan's 244,000 line list, retained item for item, plus 57,000 of estate hardware that fails exactly here: the electric tailgate spindle drive motor and its second set of gas struts at 22,000; a rear damper set load-rated for the estate body, lifting the four-damper line from the sedan's 30,000 to 36,000; a rear control-arm bushing and rear spring refresh at 18,000, because the estate rear axle carries more static load for ten years; the rear wiper motor, linkage and washer circuit at 6,000; and the tailgate wiring loom at 5,000, which chafes where it crosses the hinge and is a known failure on every powered hatch. The suspension budget is a CONVENTIONAL damper, spring and control-arm refresh, not an air-spring replacement, because no Taiwan-market source opened for this pass confirms rear self-levelling or air suspension on the G61 Touring. The failure cluster behind the engine lines (電動水幫浦, 節溫器, valve-cover seepage, coil packs) is the one named on https://tyaward.com.tw/汽機車-2/bmw保養大概多少錢/, which quotes the thermostat alone at about 15,000 連工帶料 at an independent and a 60,000 km major service at 20,000-35,000 at a dealer. The new window is 301,000, the most expensive of the five in total AND in cost per year (100,333/year against the 5-7 window's 70,000/year), and it sits above every smaller BMW in the table. Ten-year total 549,000 against the sedan's 463,000. No second tyre set: the first set went on at about year 6 and at 7,000 km/year the replacement falls at roughly year 11-12, outside this window. Confidence low: fully extrapolated, since the oldest G61 Touring in Taiwan is about 1.5 years old and no owner-cost data exists for this generation at 10 years."}],"sources":[{"name":"8891 新車 - BMW 5系列新年式入手價漲3萬","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/bmw/5-series-sedan/21113","note":"Opened and read for this check. 2026 model year Taiwan price list announced 2025-12-15: 520i M Sport Touring 3,090,000 (up 30,000 from 3,060,000), 520i M Sport Sedan 2,990,000, 530i M Sport Sedan 3,390,000. Primary verification of list_price."},{"name":"KingAutos - 汎德《BMW 5 Series》配備升級","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/366450","note":"Opened and read for this check. Independent second confirmation of 520i M Sport Touring at 3,090,000 for the new model year, plus the equipment changes (illuminated kidney grille, ventilated front seats, Bowers & Wilkins audio)."},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 - 新年式520i房車與旅行車小漲3萬","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/294319","note":"Opened and read for this check. Third confirmation of the 3,060,000 to 3,090,000 step for the 520i M Sport Touring, dated December 2025."},{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點 - 新臺幣306萬元起 BMW 520i Touring M Sport 正式登臺","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/110716","note":"Opened and read again for the 2026-08-22 maintenance pass. March 2025 Taiwan launch: 190hp/310Nm B48 with 48V mild hybrid, 8-speed Steptronic, single-variant Touring line-up, launch price 3,060,000 (now superseded). Re-checked specifically for suspension and tyre content: it lists the 19-inch M Sport wheels and the sensor-operated electric tailgate as standard, and mentions NO 氣壓懸吊, NO 自動水平調節 and NO tyre size. Both of those absences feed the maintenance plan."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 - BMW 520i Touring M Sport 燃油動力追加登場","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/41313-306-bmw-520i-touring-m-sport.html","note":"Opened and read again for the 2026-08-22 maintenance pass. Confirms 單一車型 Touring offering at the 3,060,000 launch price, the 48V system, and the 19吋M專屬輪圈 package that drives the tyre and brake costs - with NO tyre size published, which is why the tyre set price is settled at the sedan record's 46,000 rather than this record's earlier unsourced 70,000. Also confirms the sensor-operated electric tailgate as standard, which is the hardware the 5-7 and 7-10 windows now price. No air suspension, no warranty and no free-maintenance programme mentioned."},{"name":"incar.tw - BMW G61 520i Touring M Sport 試駕","url":"https://incar.tw/post/bmw-g61-520i-touring-m-sport-test-drive","note":"Re-opened for the 2026-08-22 pass specifically to settle the rear air suspension question the cross-check raised. The review describes only an M Sport damper setup and contains no mention of 氣壓懸吊, 自動水平調節, rear air suspension or self-levelling. CarStuff and 7Car were re-opened with the same question and also show none. That is why the 7-10 year window prices a conventional rear damper, spring and control-arm refresh rather than an air-spring replacement. Also confirms the 19-inch M wheels and 570-1,700L cargo volume."},{"name":"金融財子 - BMW 保養大概多少錢？原廠保養費用與常見維修項目","url":"https://tyaward.com.tw/汽機車-2/bmw保養大概多少錢/","note":"Opened and read for the 2026-08-22 pass. This is the source the 520i M Sport Sedan record uses, adopted here to settle the annual service price the two records disagreed about. Owner work orders: first 定保 8,000-9,600, second 8,500-8,700, third 8,500-10,000, so about 9,000 per visit; CBS interval about 10,000 km or 1 year, whichever comes first. Also names the post-warranty failure cluster used in the 7 and 10-year windows - 電動水幫浦, 節溫器, valve-cover oil seepage and coil packs - quotes the thermostat at about 15,000 連工帶料 at an independent, and states a 60,000 km major service runs 20,000-35,000 at a dealer. Caveat repeated from the sedan record: the work orders are 3 Series / 4 Series / X1 jobs, not a 5 Series. The itemised parts table the sedan record also cites (比迪行銷) now returns HTTP 403 to automated fetch, so its URL is deliberately not listed here."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 5-Series 520i Touring 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series/520i-touring","note":"Primary used-car source for the ESTATE body. Re-read for this check; 31 cars nationwide, confirmed. Key 車商售價 points with their ACTUAL mileage: 2025 G61 at 2,650,000 with 40,000-47,000 km (the earlier version of this record misread these as 4,000-4,700 km, and a separate 2025 car with about 4,000 km is listed 價格電洽 with no price); 2023 at 1,838,000 with 38,000 km, repeated three times; 2022 at 1,680,000-1,738,000 with about 89,000 km; 2021 at 1,380,000 with 96,000 km; 2018 at 938,000-998,000 with 120,000-131,600 km; 2016 F11 at 668,000-728,000 with 92,000-130,000 km; 2015 at 488,000. All are dealer retail asking prices and were mileage-adjusted first, then cut about 11-12% to reach private-sale figures."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 5-Series 520i 二手價格 (sedan cross-check)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series/520i","note":"Sedan control group, 252 cars, re-read for this check and used to calibrate the haircut and to size the estate premium. 2025 M Sport 2,198,000-2,298,000 with only 2,000-3,800 km; 2020 1,020,000-1,090,000 with 70,000-96,600 km (the earlier version labelled these 2021); 2019 M Sport 890,000-950,000 with 107,000-119,000 km; 2016 398,000-560,000 (the earlier version truncated the top end at 460,000). The 2025 sedan asks at near-delivery mileage are what expose the 2,650,000 Touring ask as an outlier."},{"name":"abc好車網 - BMW 5-Series Touring 520i M Sport 2023年 218萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2284072","note":"Opened for this check and confirmed to be the Touring wagon body, not the sedan. 3-year-old G31 Touring at 2,180,000 車商售價. Upper bound of the 3-year dealer-retail spread."},{"name":"abc好車網 - BMW 5-Series Touring 520i M Sport 2021年 149.8萬","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2283160","note":"Opened for this check and confirmed to be the Touring wagon body. 5-year-old G31 Touring at 1,498,000 車商售價 (元禾國際車業). Upper bound of the 5-year dealer-retail spread."},{"name":"abc好車網 - BMW 5-Series Touring 520i M Sport 2021年 143.1萬 (和運)","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2258374","note":"Opened for this check and confirmed to be the Touring wagon body. 5-year-old G31 Touring at 1,431,000 車商售價 from a 和運 franchise outlet, a conservative franchise-dealer ask rather than an independent trader's. Used with the 8891 and 元禾 listings to set the 5-year midpoint."},{"name":"小曾車庫 - 二手車價格表 2026年 台灣中古車行情總覽","url":"https://www.littletsenggarage.com/usedcar-price-list/","note":"Opened and read for this check. States the Taiwan price chain used throughout: 收購價 runs 15-20% below the listed 售價, and a private seller nets 10-20% above 收購價. The earlier version of this record set dealer trade-in 12.5-13.5% below private sale, which put trade-in about 23% below dealer asking, outside the band this source states. The gaps are now 9-13%, widening with age, which keeps trade-in inside or close to the 15-20% band."},{"name":"8891 新車 - 2026 BMW 5-Series Touring 520i M Sport 車型頁","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/m/kindsum/9524/model/27302","note":"Opened for this check. Confirms the 2026 model year Touring 520i M Sport exists as the sole Touring trim. The 原廠建議售價 field does not render for automated fetch, so list_price was verified from the three news sources instead."},{"name":"8891 新車 - 2026 BMW 5-Series Touring 車系總覽","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series-touring/Summary.html","note":"Opened for this check. The 2026 Touring line-up page loads but the price and variant table does not render for automated fetch. No additional Touring variant is listed, consistent with the single-trim finding from 7Car and CarStuff."}]},"bmw-i5-touring-edrive40":{"assumptions":"At 7,000 km/year this G61 reaches only 70,000 km in ten years, so almost every ownership cost here is driven by TIME, not distance. Three consequences specific to THIS car. (1) The 83.9 kWh pack carries an 8-year/160,000 km warranty; at 7,000 km/year the car is at roughly 56,000 km when year 8 arrives, so the CALENDAR limit always trips first and years 9-10 run with no HV battery cover. The year-10 resale is priced by the used market on that fact, and the 7-10y maintenance window carries an explicit uncovered-pack reserve. (2) BMW's CBS service is condition-based but has a 24-month floor, so servicing is annual regardless of mileage - a BEV owner driving 7,000 km/year still pays a full annual dealer visit and still changes brake fluid on the 2-year clock. (3) Tires and the 12V auxiliary battery are replaced on AGE, not wear. A BEV wears tires faster per km than a combustion 5 Series (2.3 t kerb weight, 430 Nm from zero, and a Touring that is heavier again over the rear axle), but at 7,000 km/year the 5-6 year age limit still arrives before the tread limit, so two tire sets fall inside ten years. Regenerative braking means the pads barely wear; the discs are condemned on corrosion from disuse in Taiwan's humidity instead. A home AC wallbox (typically 40,000-70,000 TWD installed for a 7 kW unit, plus building/management-committee approval which is the real obstacle in Taiwanese apartment blocks) is a genuine ownership cost but is NOT maintenance and is deliberately excluded from every figure below. Electricity, tax and insurance are also excluded by design.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"BODY-STYLE DISCLOSURE, made first because it governs the confidence rating. There is NO used i5 Touring evidence in Taiwan at any age. This audit fetched https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/i/i5-edrive40 and confirmed 27 live listings, model years 2024-2025, EVERY ONE a sedan (轎車); not a single Touring appears. The Touring launched 2024-06-06 with deliveries from August 2024 (TVBS) on an allocation of about 180 cars a year, so the oldest example in the country is 2 years old and none has yet reached the used market. Every figure at this checkpoint is therefore derived from the sedan and adjusted, never observed on the estate body. That is why confidence is low, not medium - the earlier draft rated this medium, which this audit judged too generous. METHOD. The low-mileage sedans that match this buyer's 7,000 km/year ask 243.0-250.0萬 車商售價 at 5,000-16,000 km, with a thin low tail at 209.8萬 and higher-mileage 32,000 km cars at 219.8萬. Those cars are roughly 1-2 years old against a 2024 sedan list of 3,290,000. Chain applied: 車商售價 247萬 -> 自售價 at -12% = about 217萬 -> 車商收購價 a further -13%. The -12% (rather than -8%) sits inside the 8-15% private-versus-retail band and is taken near its middle because the estate's thin buyer pool lengthens the sale and weakens the seller's position. Back-solving that 1-2 year point to exactly year 1 gives about 71% of real_cost for the SEDAN body, which matches the i5 sedan sibling record. For the TOURING I add 2 points, for the 180-unit allocation, the absence of any rival pure-electric luxury estate, and the fact that the i5 has taken no official price cut. 3,285,000 x 73% = 2,398,050, set at 2,400,000. Trade-in 2,090,000 is 13% under private; BMW BPS 原廠認證 buys aggressively on a car it will recertify and resell at a premium. DIVERGENCE vs the i5 sedan anchor (1y 71%): +2 points, inside tolerance, reason stated. Note this is the checkpoint where the estate premium is weakest, because a nearly-new car still competes against a discounted new one."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTION MADE BY THIS AUDIT - the earlier draft's evidence for this checkpoint did not exist. It claimed 'the oldest car in that pool is a 2023 at 209.8萬 車商售價 with 9,000 km - about 3.2 years old' and derived 57% from it. This audit fetched https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/i/i5-edrive40 and found NO 2023 car: all 27 listings are model year 2024 or 2025. No 2023 i5 can exist in Taiwan, because the car launched here in June 2024 - a fact the earlier draft asserted correctly in its own year-5 note, contradicting its year-3 note. The 209.8萬 / 9,000 km car is real but is a 2024 or 2025 example priced at the bottom of the pool, not a 3-year-old car. The 3-year figure therefore has no observed anchor of any kind and is now an EXTRAPOLATION, with confidence cut from medium to low. REBUILT METHOD. Start from the i5 sedan sibling at 54% and add the estate differential. That differential is measured, not assumed: on the previous-generation combustion cars this audit fetched both pools and compared them at matched ages. G31 530i Touring (list 3,490,000, per 7Car) averages 135.7萬 for 2019, 125.1萬 for 2018 and 118.9萬 for 2017 - that is 38.9%, 35.8% and 34.1% of its own list at 7, 8 and 9 years. G30 530i sedan (list about 3,280,000) averages 99.9萬 for 2019, 93.2萬 for 2018 and 90.5萬 for 2017 - 30.5%, 28.4% and 27.6%. The Taiwan estate therefore sits +6 to +8 retention points ABOVE the sedan of the same age and drivetrain. I apply only +3 to a BEV, not the measured +6 to +8, because a large share of the combustion Touring's strength is enthusiast demand for a petrol wagon and that will not transfer wholesale to an electric one. 54% + 3 = 57%. 3,285,000 x 57% = 1,872,450, set at 1,870,000. Trade-in 1,620,000 = 13% under private. Shape check: 73% to 57% is a 16-point fall across years 1-3, the steep early German luxury loss the brief describes, and year 3 is also where BMW's 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty ends and the Taiwan market discounts an out-of-warranty German BEV visibly. DIVERGENCE vs i5 sedan anchor (3y 54%): +3 points, from the measured estate differential above."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolation, labelled as such - no i5 Touring exists at 5 years anywhere, and none will before 2029. METHOD, two steps. Step 1, the Taiwan estate-versus-sedan differential measured on the previous-generation combustion 5 Series, both pools fetched by this audit. https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series/530i-touring holds 10 cars asking 112.8-138.0萬 車商售價 at 7-9 years with 41,400-132,000 km, against an original 530i Touring M Sport list of 3,490,000 (https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/44374). https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series/530i holds 108 cars; the matched years average 99.9萬 for 2019, 93.2萬 for 2018 and 90.5萬 for 2017 against a roughly 3,280,000 list. Estate 34-39% of own list, sedan 28-31%, so +6 to +8 points at matched age. ARITHMETIC CORRECTION BY THIS AUDIT: the earlier draft put the 2019 sedan average at 'about 108萬'; the actual pool averages 99.9萬, which makes the measured estate premium larger than the draft claimed, not smaller. OUTLIER DISCARDED BY THIS AUDIT: the draft also cited abc好車網 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/car/1554714) at 228萬 for a 2018 530i Touring M Sport as 'directional confirmation'. This audit opened that page and the car and price are as described, but 228萬 is 65% of the 349萬 list at 8 years, which is irreconcilable with the 119.8-135.8萬 that three 2018 Tourings ask on 8891. It is a stale or mispriced listing, it contradicts rather than confirms, and it no longer carries any weight in this record. Step 2, apply the differential. Sedan body about 38% at 5 years; add 3 points, not the measured 6-8, for the enthusiast-demand reason given at year 3. 3,285,000 x 41% = 1,346,850, set at 1,350,000. The 35,000 km odometer is this seller's single strongest argument and should be led with - the mileage-blind market at 5 years assumes 60,000-75,000 km. Trade-in 1,160,000 = 14% under private; the discount widens with age because a dealer taking a 5-year-old out-of-warranty BEV into stock carries real inventory risk. DIVERGENCE vs i5 sedan anchor (5y 38%): +3 points, from the measured Taiwan estate premium above."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Pure extrapolation, stated openly - no 7-year BEV estate exists in Taiwan and none will until 2031. Two anchors, deliberately not a single combustion analogue. Anchor A, the oldest BEVs that actually trade here: this audit fetched https://auto.8891.com.tw/tesla/model-3 (141 live cars) and found 2019 Long Range at 88.8萬 with 135,000 km, and 2020 cars at 75.8-99.9萬 with 75,000-145,000 km - roughly 40-45% of original list at dealer retail at 6-7 years. Tesla's Taiwan residuals were crushed by repeated OFFICIAL price cuts that repriced the whole used stock overnight, which the i5 has never suffered, so Anchor A is a FLOOR, not a target. Anchor B, the combustion estate curve at the same age: 7-year G31 530i Tourings hold about 39% of list at dealer retail even at 98,000 km. Against those two I set 31% of real_cost - below the combustion estate, above the Tesla band - because year 7 is where the BEV-specific penalties bite: the 3-year warranty is four years gone, the used market prices in an HV battery whose replacement cost exceeds the car's value, and Taiwanese buyers of second-hand German BEVs are a small and cautious group. The 49,000 km odometer partly offsets this; it is roughly half what a 7-year-old car normally shows, and battery state-of-health, which a buyer reads off the car before anything else, benefits directly from low cycle count and from AC home charging rather than repeated DC fast charging. 3,285,000 x 31% = 1,018,350, set at 1,020,000. Trade-in 865,000 = 15% under private; at this age most dealers will only wholesale the car. DIVERGENCE vs i5 sedan anchor (7y 29%): +2 points, the estate premium narrowing as battery risk starts to dominate body style."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Lowest-confidence figure in the record, reasoning given in full rather than a number asserted. No 10-year BEV of any body style has meaningful Taiwan volume, and no BEV estate exists at all. Basis, three strands. (1) The previous-generation combustion estate: https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series_touring holds just two cars, both 2018 and therefore EIGHT years old, not ten - a 540i at 168.0萬 with 100,000 km and a 520i Luxury at 98.8萬 with 120,000 km, which is 34-39% of their own list at year 8. AGE CORRECTION BY THIS AUDIT: the earlier draft presented these same two cars as 10-year evidence. Rolling year 8 forward on the same slope puts the combustion estate near 27-31% at year 10. (2) The oldest Taiwan BEVs at 6-7 years already sit at 40-45% dealer retail and are still falling, not flattening. (3) The decisive factor is warranty. HV battery cover is 8 years OR 160,000 km, and this owner reaches only about 56,000 km at year 8, so the CALENDAR limit trips first every time; years 9 and 10 are driven with no pack cover, and a used buyer prices that ruthlessly on a car whose pack replacement quote at 汎德 would exceed the whole asking price. That is why this tail keeps falling instead of flattening the way a Lexus does. I set 19% of real_cost: 3,285,000 x 19% = 624,150, rounded to 620,000. The estate body is worth only about 1 point at this age - a 10-year-old luxury BEV wagon is a curiosity, and the scarcity that supports a 5-year-old car turns into an absence of buyers at 10 years, so time-to-sell rather than price becomes the binding constraint. The maintenance side carries an uncovered-pack RESERVE, not a full pack replacement: an actual pack failure in years 9-10 would total the car rather than be repaired, and that scenario is expressed in this collapsed resale figure, not double-counted in maintenance. Trade-in 510,000 = 18% under private; below about 600,000 a Taiwanese dealer treats a 10-year-old German BEV as a wholesale or export unit. DIVERGENCE vs i5 sedan anchor (10y 18%): +1 point."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"REVISED 2026-08-22, 10,000 to 9,000. Inside BMW Taiwan's 3-year unlimited-mileage new-car warranty, so anything that fails is free and the owner pays only for the annual inspection and consumables. The whole window is one dealer visit: a BEV annual check has no oil, no oil filter, no engine air filter and no plugs, which is what collapses the bill against the 13,000 the 5 Series Touring 520i sibling pays for the same window with an oil service in it. Brake fluid is not due until 24 months, and at 7,000 km nothing is mileage-triggered at all. RATE CHANGE: the visit was priced at 8,000 on the strength of Mobile01 threads that all return HTTP 403 and were deleted from sources[]. It is now 6,000, anchored on the only hard invoice evidence for a BMW BEV in this dataset - the iX3 record's 汎德 invoice at NT$3,400 for a 12-month CBS inspection - marked up for the 5-series labour band. Peer check: i4 6,000, iX1 8,000, iX3 5,000. Confidence low: the rate basis is an in-dataset cross-reference and judgement, not a citable i5 source."},{"y":3,"source":"REVISED 2026-08-22, 36,000 to 25,000. Still fully inside the 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty, so this window is inspections and consumables only. Two annual visits plus the 24-month brake fluid change, which is the one item that arrives on the calendar no matter how little the car is driven. No tires, no 12V battery and no brake work: regenerative braking means the pads are barely touched at 21,000 km. Itemised 13,000 + 3,000 + 4,000 + 1,500 + 3,000 = 24,500, set at 25,000. TWO RATE CHANGES, both from the deleted-source problem recorded in plan_notes. The annual visit drops from 9,000 to 6,500 and the brake fluid from 5,000 to 3,000; the iX3 record's 汎德 invoice puts the same fluid change at NT$2,586, so 5,000 was roughly double the only real quote in the dataset. Peer check: i4 22,000, iX1 27,000, iX3 17,000, and the combustion 5 Series Touring 520i 46,000 for a window containing two oil services. This is the checkpoint where the BEV advantage is largest in percentage terms."},{"y":5,"source":"REVISED 2026-08-22, 125,000 to 80,000. The step change in the record, because the 3-year warranty has expired and the annual visit now carries whatever it finds. TIRES - THE MAIN CORRECTION. The old curve bought a complete staggered set here for 72,000. The fitment is 245/40 R20 front and 275/35 R20 rear, verified on the U-CAR spec table by the i5 sedan sibling and consistent with the 20-inch standard wheel that TVBS confirms for this car. A staggered fitment cannot be rotated, and on a rear-driven 2.2-tonne BEV the axles wear at completely different rates: the rears take 430 Nm from standstill and are finished near 30,000 km, while the fronts do almost no braking because one-pedal regen does it. At 35,000 km the REARS are worn out and the FRONTS are not, so only a rear pair is bought here. This is the BEV point the brief calls out - faster tire wear from weight and torque - priced on the axle where it actually happens instead of doubled across both. PRICE SETTLED WITH THE SEDAN RECORD: the full staggered set is 68,000 at year-5 money in both records, split 30,000 front and 38,000 rear; the Touring no longer pays a premium per tire for the same tire. 12V BATTERY: BEVs are hard on the auxiliary battery because the HV system keeps the 12V bus awake for telematics, pre-conditioning and charge scheduling, so 4-5 years is normal; 13,000 fitted, matching the i4 and iX3 records rather than the old 16,000. Itemised 14,000 + 3,000 + 38,000 + 13,000 + 3,000 + 4,000 + 5,000 = 80,000. Peer check: i4 104,000, iX1 101,000, iX3 80,000, combustion 5 Series Touring 520i 98,000. Confidence low, for the deleted-source reason in plan_notes."},{"y":7,"source":"REVISED 2026-08-22, 155,000 to 135,000. First fully out-of-warranty window. THE 45,000 REAR SELF-LEVELLING SUSPENSION PROVISION IS DELETED. It is not on the Taiwan spec sheet, which lists only 雙A臂 front and 多連桿 rear, and this audit re-opened the TVBS launch report and found it itemises suspension BY VARIANT: the i5 Touring M60 xDrive gets M進階跑車化電子懸吊 and 主動式電子防傾桿, and the eDrive40 gets no such entry. A report that names the expensive suspension on the sister trim and says nothing about this one is evidence the eDrive40 does not have it. What the car does have is conventional multi-link geometry, so 12,000 of bush and drop-link work replaces the provision. TIRES: the front pair is bought here, at 49,000 km and about six years of rubber age - the fronts survived the year-5 rear replacement because regen means they barely brake, but age and wear together condemn them now. BRAKES: the counter-intuitive BEV item, and it is real. Pads on an i5 are barely worn at 49,000 km, but in Taiwan's humidity the discs rust from disuse and are condemned on corrosion and lip rather than thickness, and BMW replaces discs with pads. Priced at 30,000 for the front axle, matching what the 5 Series 530i M Sport record pays for front pads and discs on the same M brake package - there is no reason the identical hardware costs more because the car is electric. COOLANT: the i5 runs separate HV battery and drive-unit thermal circuits and BMW specifies a service around this age; one of the few fluids a BEV genuinely still needs. No spark plugs, no coil packs, no engine water pump, no thermostat housing, no DPF, no 48V starter-generator - none exist on this car, which is why this window is 40,000 lighter than the 175,000 the combustion 5 Series Touring 520i spends over the same years. Itemised 15,000 + 3,500 + 32,000 + 30,000 + 12,000 + 12,000 + 9,000 + 22,000 = 135,500, set at 135,000. Peer check: i4 122,000, iX1 112,000, iX3 136,000. Confidence low."},{"y":10,"source":"REVISED 2026-08-22, 524,000 to 256,000 - the largest single correction in this record and the source of almost all of the 850,000-to-505,000 change. THREE DELETIONS, ALL DOCUMENTED. (1) REAR AIR-SUSPENSION REPAIR, 90,000, DELETED. Same reason as year 7: the Taiwan spec table lists 多連桿 rear and TVBS credits the electronic suspension to the M60 alone. A 43,000 conventional damper, arm, bush and bearing overhaul takes its place, in line with the 34,000 the 530i record spends on four dampers and the 60,000 the i4 and iX3 records spend on heavy-BEV suspension. (2) UNCOVERED HV BATTERY RESERVE, 105,000, DELETED AS A SEPARATE LINE. This was double-counting by the record's own admission: the old text said a real pack failure would total the car rather than be repaired, and that the scenario was priced into the collapsed year-10 resale figure. It cannot also sit in maintenance. The calendar-expiry fact is unchanged and still stated - at 7,000 km/year the car is near 56,000 km when year 8 arrives, so the 8-year limit trips long before the 160,000 km one - but it is now expressed where it belongs, in the resale curve and in a major_items note. Every other BMW BEV record here does the same: the iX3 states the year-8 expiry and carries one 72,000 provision, not a separate pack reserve. (3) THE 80,000 DRIVE-UNIT RESERVE AND A SEPARATE A/C LINE, MERGED. One 65,000 provision now covers the on-board charger, DC-DC converter, HV thermal-management pump, electric A/C compressor, contactors and charge-port actuator. That is the same failure list the i4 (70,000) and iX3 (72,000) records provide for, and the anchor is unchanged: the oldest BEVs with real Taiwan service history, Tesla Model 3 and Nissan Leaf, fail on DC-DC converters, charging modules and coolant pumps rather than on the pack itself, and BMW parts and labour price above both. TIRES: one rear pair, not a full set. The fronts were fitted at year 7 and at 70,000 km on an axle that barely brakes they are not due again; the rears fitted at year 5 are. Priced at 40,000 against a full-set price of 72,000 at year-10 money, the same full-set figure the i5 sedan record uses. KEPT: the 15,000 powered tailgate and rear wiper line. These are the real Touring-only wear items, no sedan carries them, and they are the honest reason this car costs a little more than the i5 sedan. Itemised 24,000 + 6,000 + 40,000 + 22,000 + 14,000 + 15,000 + 43,000 + 65,000 + 15,000 + 12,000 = 256,000. This window is still ABOVE the combustion 5 Series Touring 520i's 198,000, and that is deliberate, not an oversight: the BEV advantage genuinely reverses in the final window because the pack cover has lapsed and the expensive electric parts are dealer-only with no independent repair trade in Taiwan, while a 520i's water pump, thermostat and coil packs are commodity items. The i4 and iX3 records show the same reversal. The ten-year TOTAL is what must sit below the combustion car, and at 505,000 against 530,000 it does. Peer check: i4 265,000, iX1 248,000, iX3 290,000. Confidence low - no i5 in Taiwan has reached this age and no BEV estate will before 2034."}],"sources":[{"name":"BMW Taiwan online reserve - G61 i5 Touring","url":"https://reserve.bmw.com.tw/all-models/g61","note":"Opened successfully by this audit. Serves only online-ordering terms, FAQ and privacy policy, and states 建議售價僅供參考. It carries NO price table, so it did not confirm the price and is not cited as the pricing source. Listed for transparency about what was checked."},{"name":"KingAutos - BMW i5 Touring 車款詳細介紹","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/bmw/i5_touring","note":"PRIMARY price source, opened and re-verified by this audit. Two trims: eDrive40 M Sport 339萬 (3,390,000) and M60 xDrive 495萬. Both imported BEV, 83.9 kWh."},{"name":"7Car - 售價維持不變，續航里程全面升級 2026 年式 BMW i5 & i5 Touring 正式登臺","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/112937","note":"Opened and re-verified. Confirms the 2026 model-year launch on 2025-09-02, prices held unchanged from 329萬, the switch to silicon-carbide inverters, low-rolling-resistance tires and revised bearings, and 602 km WLTP for the eDrive40 Touring. This is the evidence for the no-official-price-cut finding used in the retention curve."},{"name":"ETtoday 車雲 - 329萬起不變！BMW新i5房車／旅行車上市","url":"https://speed.ettoday.net/news/3026796","note":"Opened and re-verified. Gives the 2026 line trim by trim: i5 eDrive40 M Sport 329萬, M60 485萬, i5 Touring eDrive40 M Sport 339萬, i5 Touring M60 496萬. Third independent confirmation of 3,390,000 and of the unchanged pricing."},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 - BMW i5 Touring雙動力339萬起上市，今年配額180輛","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/196202","note":"Opened and re-verified again on 2026-08-22 for the maintenance rebuild. Fourth price confirmation at 339萬. Also the source for the Taiwan launch date 2024-06-06, first deliveries August 2024, the 180-unit annual allocation, the roughly 85/15 eDrive40-to-M60 pre-order split, and the 20-INCH standard wheel size. NEW AND DECISIVE FOR THE MAINTENANCE CURVE: the report itemises suspension BY VARIANT. It credits the i5 Touring M60 xDrive with M進階跑車化電子懸吊 and 主動式電子防傾桿 and gives the eDrive40 no suspension entry at all. Combined with the Taiwan spec sheet, which lists only 雙A臂 front and 多連桿 rear, this is why the 45,000 year-7 and 90,000 year-10 rear self-levelling air-suspension provisions were DELETED from this record. A source that names the expensive suspension on the sister trim and stays silent on this one is evidence of absence."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW i5 eDrive40 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/i/i5-edrive40","note":"CORE used-market evidence, re-fetched by this audit. 27 live listings, ALL model year 2024-2025 and ALL sedans (轎車) - no Touring appears at any price. Low-mileage cars at 5,000-16,000 km ask 243.0-250.0萬 車商售價, with a low tail at 209.8萬 and 32,000 km cars at 219.8萬. This fetch is what disproved the earlier draft's '2023 car at 209.8萬, about 3.2 years old' anchor: no 2023 i5 exists in Taiwan, because the car launched here in June 2024. All figures are DEALER RETAIL and are reduced by 12% to reach 自售價 and a further 13-18% to reach 車商收購價."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 5-Series 530i Touring 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series/530i-touring","note":"Estate-body evidence, re-fetched by this audit. 10 cars: 2019 at 128.8萬 and 138.0萬 (98,000 km), 2018 at 119.8, 119.8 and 135.8萬 (41,400-124,000 km), 2017 at 112.8 and 125.0萬 (117,000-132,000 km). Against a 3,490,000 original list that is 38.9% at 7 years, 35.8% at 8 and 34.1% at 9, at dealer retail."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 5-Series 530i (sedan) 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series/530i","note":"The sedan control group, re-fetched by this audit; 108 live cars. Matched-year averages are 99.9萬 for 2019, 93.2萬 for 2018 and 90.5萬 for 2017 against a roughly 3,280,000 original list - 30.5%, 28.4% and 27.6% at dealer retail. The earlier draft put the 2019 average at 'about 108萬'; the corrected 99.9萬 makes the measured Taiwan estate premium +6 to +8 retention points, larger than the +4 to +6 the draft claimed. Only +3 of it is applied to this BEV."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - BMW 5-Series Touring 總覽","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/bmw/5-series_touring","note":"Re-fetched by this audit. Confirms how thin the Taiwan estate pool is - exactly TWO live cars nationwide, both 2018: a 540i at 168.0萬 with 100,000 km and a 520i Luxury at 98.8萬 with 120,000 km. Basis for the longer time-to-sell assumption in selling_costs. These cars are EIGHT years old, not ten; the earlier draft presented them as 10-year evidence and that framing has been corrected."},{"name":"abc好車網 - 2018 BMW 530i Touring M Sport (G31)","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/car/1554714","note":"OUTLIER, DISCARDED BY THIS AUDIT. The page opens and does show a 2018 530i Touring M Sport at 228萬, but that is 65% of the 349萬 list at 8 years and is irreconcilable with the 119.8-135.8萬 that three 2018 Tourings ask on 8891. It is stale or mispriced. The earlier draft cited it as 'directional confirmation' of the estate premium; it contradicts rather than confirms, and it carries no weight in any figure in this record. Retained here only to document that it was checked and rejected."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Tesla Model 3 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/tesla/model-3","note":"Re-fetched by this audit; 141 live cars. The oldest BEVs that genuinely trade in Taiwan, used as the year-7 and year-10 anchor instead of a combustion analogue. 2019 Long Range 88.8萬 at 135,000 km; 2020 cars 75.8-99.9萬 at 75,000-145,000 km; 2021 cars 79.8-99.8萬. Roughly 40-45% of original list at dealer retail at 6-7 years, and treated as a FLOOR because repeated official Tesla price cuts repriced that stock while the i5 has had none."},{"name":"7Car - BMW 530i Touring M Sport 精緻旅行風範","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/44374","note":"Re-fetched by this audit. Confirms the original Taiwan list price of the G31 530i Touring M Sport at 349萬元起, introduced July 2017. This is the denominator in the estate retention-ratio calculation used at years 3, 5 and 7."}]},"landrover-range-rover-evoque-p250-s":{"assumptions":"At 7,000 km/year this car never reaches a distance-based service trigger. The Ingenium 2.0 MHEV schedule is 26,000 km or 12 months, so every visit is the 12-month one and the interval is purely time-driven. That matters more here than on the German rivals because Land Rover Taiwan bundles 6 years of complimentary scheduled maintenance (6年零負擔原廠保養): six light annual visits are absorbed by the plan, so from delivery to year 6 the owner pays for wear items only, and the cost wall arrives all at once when the plan lapses. Wear parts on this car age out on time, not distance: the tires reach the end of their service life around year 5-6 at 35,000-42,000 km, and the 12V AGM battery plus the 48V lithium pack of the belt-integrated starter-generator degrade on calendar age. IMPORTANT CORRECTION on how low mileage is treated at resale. The previous version of this record made the low-mileage gap its single largest upward adjustment. The listing evidence does not support that. 8891 shows a 2022 P200 R-Dynamic S with 8,600 km at 1,138,000, which is BELOW the same model year and trim with 30,000 km at 1,199,000, and the qualifying 2016 L538 cars at 100,000 km and 137,000 km sit within 2% of each other. The Taiwan Evoque market prices repair risk and remaining warranty far above the odometer, so a low-mileage Evoque earns only a small premium. Low mileage still helps this owner on maintenance, but it does not rescue the resale curve. The Evoque L551 rides on coil springs with optional adaptive dampers, not air suspension, so the air-spring failures that dominate full-size Range Rover ownership cost do not apply to this record. This record is the four-door (5D) body; the previous-generation L538 3-door Coupé is a different body and is excluded from the used-price evidence.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Real anchor from 8891 中古車, re-pulled and confirmed on 2026-08-22: a 2025 Evoque P250 Dynamic SE with 5,600 km listed at 1,958,000 車商售價 (dealer retail asking). The 2025MY Dynamic SE listed new at 2,680,000 (KingAutos gives the 2026 Dynamic SE at 2,690,000, +10,000 year on year), so its equivalent real_cost was about 2,618,000 and dealer retail is 74.8% of that at effectively this buyer's mileage. Converting dealer retail to 自售 with an 11% haircut gives about 1,743,000, or 66.6% for the Dynamic SE. The base S loses less equipment value into the used market, so its RATIO holds up marginally better per the trim-ladder rule, while its absolute price is lower: 1,470,000 private sale, against an implied 車商售價 of about 1,650,000. Trade-in 1,275,000 is 13.3% under the private figure. CORRECTED from 1,490,000: the previous record asserted that the new-price gap of 410,000 compresses to a used gap of 'roughly 280,000', but 1,743,000 minus its own stated answer of 1,490,000 is 253,000, so the arithmetic did not close. DIVERGENCE STATED: 64.9% of real_cost is 11 points below the BMW X1 (76%), 8 below the Audi Q3 (73%), and below both the Volvo XC40 (67%) and the Mercedes GLA (68%). Land Rover year-1 depreciation in Taiwan is steeper than every German equivalent in this anchor set because the buyer pool for a used JLR is thin and reliability anxiety starts pricing the car down from the very first resale."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Real anchors from 8891 中古車 and SUM 汽車網 for the 2023 model year, both re-pulled on 2026-08-22: 8891 lists a 2023 P200 R-Dynamic S with 35,500 km at 1,300,000 車商售價, and SUM lists a 2023 Evoque with 62,019 km at 1,238,000. The 2023 P200 R-Dynamic S listed new at about 2,290,000, essentially this car's price point, so no cross-model ratio is needed. CORRECTED - the low-mileage premium was too aggressive. The previous record pushed dealer retail to 1,400,000 for 21,000 km, a premium of 100,000 (+7.7%) over the 35,500 km listing. Its own two 2023 points span 26,500 km for a price gap of only 4.8%, which implies about +2.6% over 14,500 fewer km, or about 1,335,000 - not 1,400,000. A third listing settles it: 8891 shows a 2022 P200 R-Dynamic S with 8,600 km at 1,138,000, BELOW the same year and trim with 30,000 km at 1,199,000. The Taiwan Evoque market barely pays for low mileage, so the large premium was unsupported and contradicted the record's own stated principle. Using 1,335,000 車商售價 with an 11% 自售 haircut gives 1,185,000, or 52.3% of real_cost. Trade-in 1,030,000 is 13.1% below. DIVERGENCE STATED: 52.3% is below the Audi Q3 (55%), the Volvo XC40 (56%), the Mercedes GLA (61%) and the BMW X1 (65%, a 13-point gap). Year 3 is where the 3-year factory warranty ends, and the Taiwan used market reprices JLR product at that boundary more sharply than it does any German rival in this set."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Anchors re-pulled from 8891 中古車 and SUM on 2026-08-22. The only genuine 5-year-old listing is a 2021 P200 R-Dynamic S with 90,000 km at 1,060,000 車商售價. Supporting 4-year-old points: 2022 P200 R-Dynamic S 30,000 km / 1,199,000; 2022 P200 R-Dynamic S 8,600 km / 1,138,000; 2022 P200 R-Dynamic S 86,000 km / 988,000; 2022 P250 R-Dynamic SE 83,000 km / 1,198,000; SUM 2022 34,637 km / 1,199,000. That 2022 group shows the mileage effect is real but weak and noisy - the 8,600 km car is priced BELOW the 30,000 km car - so only a modest premium is justified for this buyer's 35,000 km. Lifting the 2021 base by about 6% gives roughly 1,124,000, and the base S sits under the R-Dynamic grade, so about 1,060,000 車商售價. An 11% 自售 conversion gives 935,000, or 41.3% of real_cost, and trade-in 808,000 is 13.6% below. CORRECTED from 1,030,000: the previous figure applied a 4% year-step to the 30,000 km 2022 listing and then skipped the trim step entirely, which left a base S priced as though it were an R-Dynamic. Once a JLR is out of warranty the Taiwan market prices repair risk far more heavily than the odometer, which caps how much credit the low-mileage assumption can earn from here on. DIVERGENCE STATED: 41.3% is just under the Audi Q3 (42%), well under the XC40 (47%), and 13 points under both the BMW X1 (54%) and the GLA (55%). Year 5 is the second year outside the 3-year warranty and the first at which a Taiwan buyer visibly prices in the Ingenium cooling and timing exposure."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"The current generation L551 launched in Taiwan in mid-2019, so genuine 7-year cars are scarce. Interpolated from real 6-year listings re-pulled from 8891 中古車 on 2026-08-22: a 2020 P250 R-Dynamic SE with 51,000 km at 998,000 車商售價 and a 2020 P200 R-Dynamic S with 85,000 km at 950,000. The 51,000 km car nearly matches this buyer's 49,000 km, and the pair again shows a weak mileage effect - 34,000 km of separation is worth about 5%, and the lower-mileage car is also the higher trim, so the true mileage credit is smaller still. Rolling one year back to a 2019 early-build L551, which the market treats with extra suspicion, and stepping down from R-Dynamic SE to base S, gives about 760,000 車商售價. A 12% 自售 haircut - wider with age, because the private seller has no warranty or 認證中古車 story to offer - gives 668,000, or 29.5% of real_cost. Trade-in 572,000 is 14.4% below. CORRECTED from 760,000, which the previous record derived from a 車商售價 basis of 865,000 less 12%; that basis held the R-Dynamic SE trim level and gave the low-mileage assumption more credit than the two 2020 listings support. DIVERGENCE STATED: 29.5% is below the XC40 (32%) and Q3 (33%), 14 points below the X1 (44%) and 17 below the GLA (46%). The reason is specific and not a rounding artefact: year 7 is the first year outside Land Rover's 6-year complimentary maintenance plan AND the fourth outside the 3-year warranty, so the year-7 buyer is the first one exposed to full-retail JLR servicing plus uncapped repair risk on the Ingenium timing chain and the 48V starter-generator. Taiwan prices that transfer of risk into the sale price far harder than it does for a BMW or Mercedes of the same age."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - no current-generation L551 has reached 10 years in Taiwan (it launched mid-2019). Method as instructed: take the PREVIOUS generation L538 at that exact age, express it as a retention ratio of its own original list price, then apply that ratio to this car's real_cost. BODY-STYLE FILTER APPLIED: the L538 sold in Taiwan in both a 5-door body and a 3-door Coupé, and this record is the four-door (5D) body, so only listings that state the body are used. Qualifying listings re-pulled on 2026-08-22: 8891 2016 2.0 5D SE with 137,000 km at 568,000 車商售價 and 2016 2.0 Si4 5D HSE with 100,000 km at 555,000; SUM 2016 with 137,864 km at 568,000 and 2016 with 101,000 km at 558,000. EXCLUDED as body-ambiguous: the 2017 Si4 HSE pair at 170,000 km / 468,000, the 8891 2014 entry at 182,700 km / 350,000, and the SUM 2014 and 2013 entries - none of them states 5D, and a Coupé is not evidence for this record. The 2016 5D SE listed new in Taiwan at about 2,390,000, so its equivalent real_cost was about 2,335,000 and its dealer-retail retention is 568,000 / 2,335,000 = 24.3% at 137,000 km. Note how flat the qualifying set is: the 137,000 km and 100,000 km cars sit within 2% of each other, so the odometer is close to irrelevant at this age. A low-mileage adjustment of about +9% on dealer retail - NOT the +20% the previous record applied - gives about 620,000, or 26.6%. A 13% 自售 haircut gives 434,000, or 19.2% of real_cost. Trade-in 367,000 is 15.4% below, the widest gap of any checkpoint, because a decade-old JLR is a slow-turning, high-risk unit a dealer will only take at a defensive price. CORRECTED from 545,000: the previous +20% premium lifted the PRIVATE sale figure to the same retention the real cars show at dealer RETAIL, which cannot be right, and the qualifying 5-door listings do not support it. DIVERGENCE STATED: 19.2% is below every anchor - XC40 (21%), GLA (23%), Q3 (25%) and X1 (30%, an 11-point gap). That is the intended result, not an error. The Land Rover 7-to-10-year tail in Taiwan is worse than the German brands' because out-of-warranty repair exposure is severe and the buyer pool at this age is very small."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Cost is near zero by construction: the car is inside both the 3-year/100,000 km factory warranty and year 1 of the 6-year complimentary maintenance programme (landrover.tw 最新銷售方案; 8891 新車 21915). At 7,000 km nothing has worn out. The 8,000 covers wipers, one alignment and balancing and a tire rotation - the only items the plan does not pay for in the first year - priced at a Land Rover dealer rather than a mainstream workshop. Raised slightly from the previous 6,000, which was thin for premium-SUV dealer labour. Estimate, not an official tariff: Land Rover Taiwan publishes no price list."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers the window from year 1 to year 3. Scheduled servicing is still plan-covered and the car is still inside warranty to the end of year 3, so this is wear items only. Front pads at 21,000 km is early on distance but normal on a heavy SUV doing short urban trips, which is exactly this buyer's profile; JLR front pads and fitting run about 18,000 at a Taiwan dealer, and the balance is consumables. Estimate based on brand and class - no official Land Rover Taiwan service tariff is published."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers year 3 to year 5. This is the first period the tires fall due, and at 7,000 km/year they age out rather than wear out - the deciding factor is the calendar, which is exactly why the low-mileage profile does NOT save money here. The car is out of warranty from year 3 but still inside the maintenance plan, so scheduled labour is free and everything listed is a wear item the plan explicitly excludes. Figures are class-and-brand estimates; JLR tire and brake parts prices in Taiwan run roughly 15-20% above the German equivalents for the same size. Against the sibling anchors this period looks normal because the free-servicing benefit and the higher JLR parts prices largely cancel out."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers year 5 to year 7 and contains the cliff edge: the 6年零負擔原廠保養 programme expires at year 6, so year 7 is the first year the owner pays a Land Rover dealer full retail for routine work, on a car four years out of warranty. The 55,000 repair line is a probability-weighted single incident, not a certainty - JLR Ingenium cars in Taiwan commonly need one meaningful non-wear repair in this window, most often cooling-system plastics or an electrical module. Raised from the previous 48,000 to stay coherent with the corrected year-7 resale figure, which now sits below every German anchor precisely because the market prices this exposure. NOT included, deliberately: air-suspension compressor and struts, which the L551 Evoque does not have (coil springs with optional adaptive dampers). This period is materially above the Q3 and XC40 anchors and reflects JLR labour rates plus the end of free servicing landing in the same window. Estimate - no published Land Rover Taiwan tariff exists to verify per-visit pricing."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers year 7 to year 10, entirely outside warranty and outside the maintenance plan. At 70,000 km the engine is not worn out by distance, but the timing chain and tensioner on the Ingenium four are an age-and-thermal-cycle failure as much as a mileage one, and short urban trips are the worst duty cycle for chain tensioner wear - so the low-mileage assumption gives this owner LESS protection here than it would on a German engine. Raised from the previous 320,000. Total 10-year maintenance across all five periods is 679,000. DIVERGENCE STATED: that is 139,000 above the GLA 200 anchor (540,000), 201,000 above the X1 (478,000) and 287,000 above the Q3 (392,000). The reason is not the routine servicing - six of the ten years of scheduled work are free on this car and are free on none of the anchors - it is the repair tail. JLR parts prices, dealer labour rates and the failure rate of the Ingenium cooling and timing components in Taiwan are all higher than the German equivalents, and the corrected used-value curve above shows the market agrees: the 5-, 7- and 10-year resale ratios now sit below every German anchor for exactly this reason. A 10-year maintenance figure that matched a BMW X1 would contradict the resale evidence in the same record. Extrapolated from brand reputation and component-level pricing, not from a receipt set - the Mobile01 and U-CAR owner threads on Evoque servicing returned HTTP 403 and could not be opened, so no verified receipt underpins these numbers, and confidence is low."}],"sources":[{"name":"KingAutos - 《Range Rover Evoque》入手價降6萬元 高階車款頭燈升級","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/363149","note":"Primary list-price verification, opened 2026-08-22. 2026MY table: P250 S 2,280,000 (-60,000 vs the 2025MY 2,340,000), P250 Dynamic SE 2,690,000, 都會魅影版 2,320,000 / 2,730,000. Also gives the Ingenium 2.0 MHEV spec at 249 PS / 365 Nm. This is the article page, NOT the stale kingautos.net/hot/land_rover hub."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 - 售價 228 萬元起，2026 年式 Range Rover Evoque 四款新車型編成正式發售","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/41527-228-232-2026-range-rover-evoque.html","note":"Second independent confirmation, opened 2026-08-22. Same four-trim 2026MY price table and the single Ingenium 2.0 four-cylinder MHEV powertrain, 249 PS / 365 Nm, across the whole range."},{"name":"udn 發燒車訊 - Range Rover Velar、Evoque 新年式車型登台","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/9537706","note":"Third confirmation, opened 2026-08-22. Confirms the 1 June 2026 range revision, the Evoque P250 S at 2,280,000 and the addition of a P250 Hoxton Edition."},{"name":"Land Rover 台灣 - 最新銷售方案","url":"https://www.landrover.tw/offers-and-finance/offers/index.html","note":"Official offers page, opened 2026-08-22. Confirms the bundled 6年零負擔原廠保養, 72-period 0% financing with the Evoque capped at 1,800,000, and a first-year 車體險 subsidy. CRITICAL for the discount correction: this page publishes NO cash discount. The 100,000 figure on it is an accessory-upgrade benefit for EXISTING Land Rover, Jaguar, Defender and Discovery owners, not a cash discount for a new buyer - the previous record conflated the two."},{"name":"8891 新車 - Land Rover 六月購車專案解析","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/land-rover/range-rover/21915","note":"Opened 2026-08-22. Confirms the Evoque and Discovery Sport are the two lines qualifying for the full 1,800,000 / 72-period 0% tier plus the complimentary maintenance, and quotes the plan exclusion verbatim: 此專案不包含駕駛磨耗如輪胎、來令片、雨刷片等非保修消耗性零件. Its FAQ says a cash buyer who declines the 0% plan can negotiate a 現金空車折讓 but states NO amount, so it does not support the previous 100,000 discount figure."},{"name":"Land Rover 台灣 - 原廠保養專案計畫","url":"https://www.landrover.tw/ownership/service-and-maintenance/service-plans.html","note":"Official service-plan page, opened 2026-08-22. Confirms a maximum six-year term, genuine parts with a 12-month parts warranty, and that remaining benefit transfers to the next owner - a small positive for the year-1 to year-5 resale figures. No TWD prices anywhere on the page."},{"name":"Land Rover 台灣 - 原廠保固","url":"https://www.landrover.tw/ownership/warranty/standard-warranty.html","note":"Opened 2026-08-22. Standard warranty confirmed in the page's own words as 100,000 公里或 3 年, whichever comes first. No separate MHEV or 48V battery coverage is published. At 7,000 km/year the owner uses only 21,000 of the 100,000 km allowance before the time limit expires."},{"name":"Land Rover 台灣 - 保養與維修服務","url":"https://www.landrover.tw/ownership/maintenance/index.html","note":"Checked for an official service price table. There is none - the page carries no TWD figures and routes to a dealer booking form. This is why every maintenance period cost in this record is medium or low confidence rather than high."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Range Rover Evoque 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/land-rover/range-rover-evoque","note":"Main used-car evidence, 106 listings, independently re-pulled on 2026-08-22 rather than taken on trust. Confirmed data points: 2025 P250 Dynamic SE 5,600 km / 1,958,000; 2023 P200 R-Dynamic S 35,500 km / 1,300,000; 2022 P250 R-Dynamic SE 83,000 km / 1,198,000; 2022 P200 R-Dynamic S 30,000 km / 1,199,000; 2022 P200 R-Dynamic S 86,000 km / 988,000; 2021 P200 R-Dynamic S 90,000 km / 1,060,000; 2020 P250 R-Dynamic SE 51,000 km / 998,000; 2020 P200 R-Dynamic S 85,000 km / 950,000. NEW data point found in this check and not present in the previous record: 2022 P200 R-Dynamic S with 8,600 km at 1,138,000 - priced BELOW the same year and trim at 30,000 km. That listing is the direct evidence that the Taiwan Evoque market does not pay much for low mileage, and it is why the low-mileage premiums at years 3, 5, 7 and 10 were all reduced. ALL of these are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking). Every private_sale_price in this record is 11-13% BELOW the corresponding dealer asking price, and every dealer_tradein_price is a further 13.1-15.4% below that."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Evoque 2016-2020 model years","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/land-rover/range-rover-evoque?year=2016-2020","note":"Opened 2026-08-22. Source of the previous-generation L538 data used for the 10-year extrapolation. Body-qualifying (5D, four-door) listings: 2016 2.0 5D SE 137,000 km / 568,000; 2016 2.0 Si4 5D HSE 100,000 km / 555,000. Body-ambiguous and therefore EXCLUDED: 2017 Si4 HSE 170,000 km / 468,000 (two listings, neither states 5D, and the L538 also sold as a 3-door Coupé in Taiwan). All dealer retail. Confirms the Taiwan Evoque has a genuine deep used history, and that the qualifying 100,000 km and 137,000 km cars sit within 2% of each other - the odometer is nearly irrelevant at this age."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - Land Rover 中古車搜尋","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LAND+ROVER","note":"Second used-car platform, opened 2026-08-22 to cross-check 8891 rather than rely on one source. Evoque entries: 2023 62,019 km / 1,238,000; 2022 34,637 km / 1,199,000; 2017 170,058 km / 468,000; 2016 137,864 km / 568,000; 2016 101,000 km / 558,000; 2014 114,000 km / 458,000; 2013 170,960 km / 299,000. The 2016 and 2022 figures agree with 8891 within about 2%, which is why the 3- and 5-year checkpoints are rated medium rather than low. The 2017, 2014 and 2013 entries carry no body designator and were excluded from the 10-year basis on body-style grounds."},{"name":"8891 汽車 - 2023 Range Rover Evoque P250 R-Dynamic SE 車型頁","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/m/kindsum/10418/model/25603","note":"Re-opened on 2026-08-22 to try to pull the 原廠建議售價 and 行情 band. The page loads but renders only the 原廠建議售價 heading and a 加載中 placeholder - no price data appears. Nothing from it is used in the numbers above. Retained because the URL does open; listed for completeness."}]},"landrover-range-rover-p400-se-swb":{"assumptions":"At 7,000 km/year this car never reaches a distance-based service trigger, so every visit is the annual time trigger. Low mileage does NOT protect the two things that dominate this record's cost. First, the air suspension: the strut bladders, the compressor and the valve block age on calendar time and on raise/lower cycles, not on distance, so a 70,000 km 10-year Range Rover carries almost the same air-suspension risk as a 140,000 km one. Second, the 22-inch tyres age out at 5-6 years with tread left, so both tyre sets in the 10-year window are replaced for age, not wear. Low mileage does help resale, because Taiwanese used Range Rover buyers screen on the odometer as a proxy for repair exposure. But the credit is smaller than it first appears: the buyer's fear is of calendar-driven air-suspension and module failure, which a low odometer does not answer. A low-mileage car sells sooner than a high-mileage one; it does not sell for German-SUV money.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from the previous draft's 4,340,000. Evidence base, from 8891 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/land-rover/range-rover): the only near-one-year full-size cars on the page are diesel D350 SE SWB units - 1,270 km asking 5,180,000, plus 43 km and 12,300 km cars showing 電洽. The 5,180,000 car is a delivery-mileage demonstrator, not a one-year car, and it is a D350 diesel, a line the 26MY range has now dropped, so it carries a discontinued-fuel discount this petrol car does not. Stepping that down for a genuine 1-year / 7,000 km petrol P400 SE SWB gives a realistic dealer retail ask near 4,650,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale is 12.9% below that dealer ask (4,650,000 → 4,050,000), inside the 8-15% band, at the wide end because a 4M-plus private transaction on a full-size Range Rover has very few buyers and the seller concedes to close. Dealer trade-in a further 11.4% below private at 3,590,000 - dealers pay thin because the car will sit on their lot. Low-mileage premium is included: 7,000 km on a one-year Range Rover is a genuine selling point here. Result is 67.1% of real_cost. DIVERGENCE STATED: that is 7.9 points below the Cayenne (75%), 4.9 below the X5 (72%) and 3.9 below the 7 Series (71%). The Cayenne gap exceeds the 5-point tolerance and the reason is the brand, not the segment - a Taiwan buyer discounts a Land Rover against a Porsche or a BMW from year one, because the repair-exposure fear is attached to the badge and does not wait for the warranty to expire."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from the previous draft's 3,500,000. This is the checkpoint with real same-model listings, and they must be handled carefully because they are not transaction evidence. 8891 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/land-rover/range-rover) shows TWO 2023 P400 SE SWB cars, 10,000 km and 18,000 km, both asking the identical round number 4,380,000. Identical asks on cars with different mileage is the signature of stale anchor pricing. Two cross-checks confirm the asks are unsold and high. First, the same page lists a 2023 P400 HSE LWB (2023 list 6,410,000, a MORE expensive car) asking 4,280,000 - less than the supposedly cheaper SE SWB. Second, the ratio test: 4,380,000 against the SE SWB's own 2023 list of 5,970,000 is 73.4% of list at three years, while the two LWB cars on the same page sit at 66.8% (HSE LWB) and 67.6% (Autobiography LWB, 7,080,000 list, asking 4,788,000). The two LWB cars agree with each other and the SE SWB pair does not agree with them. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED, AND IT EXCEEDS THE 8-15% BAND - REASON STATED: private sale 3,150,000 is 28% below the observed 4,380,000 ask. The 8-15% ask-to-private band assumes the ask is a market-clearing price. Here it is not: there are two of these cars nationwide, they are priced at an identical round number, and a more expensive car on the same page asks less. Against a corrected dealer ask built from the LWB-implied 67% of list (about 3,700,000 for this car at 26MY list), 3,150,000 is a 15% haircut - at the band edge. I take the corrected ask as the real one. Dealer trade-in 12.7% below private at 2,750,000. Our car has 21,000 km against these cars' 10,000-18,000, so no extra low-mileage premium is taken. Result 52.2% of real_cost. DIVERGENCE STATED: 3.8 points below the Cayenne (56%) and the 7 Series (56%), and 6.8 below the X5 (59%). The X5 gap exceeds tolerance; the reason is the brand discount described in purchase.notes, applied from year one rather than only after the warranty expires."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from the previous draft's 2,420,000, because the previous draft's own method was internally inconsistent. No five-year L460 exists anywhere: the generation launched in Taiwan in November 2022 at 5,970,000 for this variant (price ladder confirmed on the KingAutos model page, which opens; the U-CAR launch article the previous draft cited returns HTTP 403 and has been removed from sources). PREVIOUS-GENERATION METHOD, STATED EXPLICITLY, WITH THE PRIOR ERROR NAMED: the previous draft read '44-46% of original list on dealer ask' at five years off the L405 line. That cannot be right, because the same L405 line is directly observed at SIX years asking 27% of list - a 2020 SDV6 HSE with 65,000 km at 1,588,000 against a roughly 5,800,000 list. A fall from 45% to 27% inside one year is not a depreciation curve; the five-year figure was inflated. Rebuilt: taking the observed 6-year diesel point (27%) and the observed 8-year petrol point (a 2018 3.0 SCV6 Vogue, 56,000 km, asking 1,698,000, roughly 31% against an assumed 5,000,000-5,500,000 original list - I could not open a 2018 Taiwan price list, so that list figure is an assumption and is the weakest input here), petrol L405 dealer ask at five years reads to about 40% of list, not 44-46%. Applied to this car's 6,150,000 list that is a dealer ask near 2,470,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale 13% below at 2,150,000, inside the band; dealer trade-in a further 14.4% below at 1,840,000. A modest low-mileage credit is included (35,000 km against the 60,000-80,000 typical of a five-year Range Rover here), offset against the L460 being electronically more complex than the L405 it is extrapolated from. Result 35.6% of real_cost. DIVERGENCE STATED: 8.4 points below the Cayenne (44%) and 10.4 below the X5 (46%), both outside tolerance. This is where the brand gap widens: the 3-year factory warranty is gone and the buyer now owns the air-suspension, module and infotainment risk outright."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"This is the best-grounded extrapolation in the record, because previous-generation L405 cars of exactly this age are actually listed. 8891 shows a 2019 3.0 SDV6 HSE at 120,000 km asking 1,480,000 (seven years old), a 2020 SDV6 HSE at 65,000 km asking 1,588,000 (six years old), and three 2018 3.0 SCV6 Vogue petrol cars asking 1,538,000 / 1,688,000 / 1,698,000 at 79,800 / 87,300 / 56,000 km (eight years old). Converting those to ratios of their own original list gives roughly 27% at six years (diesel) and roughly 31% at eight years (petrol, best car). Our seven-year petrol car on 49,000 km should sit between them, near 29.6% of list on DEALER ASK, i.e. about 1,820,000. ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale 14.3% below that at 1,560,000, inside the band at its wide end; dealer trade-in 16% below private at 1,310,000, the widest gap yet because dealers actively avoid stocking out-of-warranty full-size Range Rovers and will often only take one on consignment. Result 25.9% of real_cost. DIVERGENCE STATED - THIS IS THE HEADLINE OF THE RECORD: 11.1 points below the Cayenne (37%) and 10.1 below the X5 (36%), far outside tolerance. The reason is observed, not narrative. Taiwan already prices a six-year full-size Range Rover at 27% of original list on dealer ask - a level the German SUVs in this dataset do not reach until ten years. The market is pricing the known JLR failure set (air struts, compressor, valve block, Pivi/infotainment modules, electrical faults) as a liability the next owner assumes in full. KingAutos' ownership-cost ranking (https://www.kingautos.net/345805) puts Land Rover third-worst overall behind Porsche and BMW, gives the Range Rover a 49.63% ten-year major-repair probability, and states the failures arrive at unpredictable intervals - which is exactly the fear the used price reflects."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from the previous draft's 1,020,000. Extrapolated from the L405 tail, then checked against the observed plateau. Reading the petrol L405 line downward from the eight-year point (about 31% of list on dealer ask) to ten years gives roughly 16-17% of list on dealer ask, i.e. about 1,000,000 for this car; ADJUSTMENT APPLIED: private sale 15% below that at 850,000, at the band edge, with a low-mileage credit for 70,000 km against the 130,000-150,000 km a typical ten-year Range Rover shows here, offset against the L460 carrying more failure-prone hardware than the L405 (rear-axle steering actuator, active anti-roll, Pivi Pro, 48V BiSG). Dealer trade-in 18.8% below private at 690,000 - the widest spread in the record. PLATEAU CROSS-CHECK from the same 8891 page: a 2010 5.0 V8 SC with 120,000 km asks 988,000 and a 2010 5.0 V8 with 88,800 km asks 588,000. (The previous draft cited the first of these as a 2011 car; the listing is a 2010.) Two sixteen-year-old cars spread across 588,000-988,000 with the higher-mileage one asking more is the signature of a flat bottom where age has stopped mattering because nobody wants the repair exposure at any age. A ten-year L460 at about 1,000,000 on dealer ask sits at the top of that same plateau, which is the right place for it - it has already fallen into the zone the whole model line collapses into. Result 14.1% of real_cost. DIVERGENCE STATED: below the Cayenne (19%), the X5 (18%) and the 7 Series (17%), and essentially level with the A8 (13%) - the worst retainer in the sibling set. That is the intended reading: at ten years a full-size Range Rover in Taiwan is worth what a large German sedan nobody wants is worth. Confidence low: this is extrapolation from a different generation, not observed L460 data."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"The Land Rover Taiwan 保養方案 page, which I opened, confirms the plan is maintenance-cost-only and paid, so this period is not free. Time-driven interval: at 7,000 km the car is nowhere near a distance trigger, so this is the annual service. RATE BASIS: assumption, not a sourced figure. The Mobile01 owner thread the previous draft relied on returns HTTP 403 and has been removed from sources, so the per-visit level here is my own estimate for authorised-dealer labour on a 3.0 six-cylinder flagship. Confidence lowered from medium to low for that reason."},{"y":3,"source":"Two annual visits at authorised-dealer rates, one carrying the filter set and the 2-year brake fluid change. Still inside the 3-year new-car period, so nothing here is a repair - it is scheduled work plus consumables. Brake pads are NOT due: 21,000 km on a car driven this gently does not wear pads out. RATE BASIS: same assumption as the year-1 checkpoint, stepped up for major-service content. No openable Taiwan owner-cost source exists behind these figures, so confidence is lowered from medium to low."},{"y":5,"source":"The tyre line drives this period and it is mileage-blind by design: 22-inch tyres on a Range Rover are 25,000-27,000 each fitted in Taiwan, and at 7,000 km/year they age out with tread remaining, so this is a calendar replacement. Front pads and discs at 35,000 km are justified by kerb weight, not distance - a Range Rover eats front brakes regardless of how gently it is driven. Warranty has expired, so all of this is owner-paid. Spark plugs are NOT included here; the Ingenium interval puts them in the next window. Service-rate basis is the same assumption declared in plan_notes."},{"y":7,"source":"This is the first period where JLR-specific out-of-warranty risk lands, and the air strut is the single largest line. Air-strut bladders perish on calendar time and on raise/lower cycles, so 49,000 km gives no protection - this is exactly why the low-mileage assumption does not reduce this record's later maintenance the way it would for a German car on steel springs. KingAutos' Taiwan ownership-cost ranking (https://www.kingautos.net/345805), which I opened, places Land Rover third-worst overall behind Porsche and BMW, gives the Range Rover a 49.63% major-repair probability, and states that the failures arrive at unpredictable intervals rather than on a schedule - so a one-strut event inside a two-year window at this age is the realistic central case, not a worst case. Confidence low because the timing of the first air-suspension failure is the least predictable number in this record."},{"y":10,"source":"The 7-10 year window carries the bulk of the record's maintenance because that is where JLR out-of-warranty risk concentrates in Taiwan. Air suspension alone is 325,000 of this figure across the remaining struts plus the compressor and valve block; struts do not fail simultaneously, so an owner who replaced one corner at year 6-7 replaces the others across the following three years. The 48V BiSG is specific to this P400 MHEV powertrain and has no equivalent line in the German petrol anchors. Rear-axle steering and active anti-roll actuator risk is folded into the electrical/module line rather than costed separately, because a failure there is possible but not central-case inside 70,000 km. Cross-check: KingAutos (https://www.kingautos.net/345805) quotes a US 10-year Range Rover ownership cost of about USD 18,228, which the article itself converts to roughly NT$546,800. Taiwan JLR dealer labour and imported-parts markup run roughly 2x US independent-shop cost, bringing that benchmark to roughly 1,100,000-1,200,000 for the full 10 years - and that US figure is an average across owners, many of whom sell before the worst years, and it does not carry two full sets of 22-inch tyres. Our total of 1,453,000 for an owner who keeps the car the whole way sits sensibly above that benchmark. Confidence low: the individual failure timings are unpredictable by the source's own account."}],"sources":[{"name":"Range Rover Taiwan official - 26MY 完整產品陣容","url":"https://www.rangerover.com/zh-tw/news/rr-rrs-26my.html","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED. Official 26MY Taiwan price list. P400 SE SWB 6,150,000. Confirms the 26MY Range Rover is petrol-only (diesel dropped)."},{"name":"發燒車訊 udn - 2026年式 Range Rover 與 Range Rover Sport 正式上市","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/9373219","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED. Independent confirmation of the full 26MY five-variant Taiwan price table and that equipment was upgraded without a price rise."},{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點 - Range Rover 與 Range Rover Sport 新年式產品陣容","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/115746","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED. Third confirmation of the 26MY prices, and describes the P400 as the 3.0 Ingenium six-cylinder mild-hybrid petrol."},{"name":"2GameSome - 編成全數重整！26 年式 Range Rover 正式上市","url":"https://2gamesome.com.tw/article/view/6606","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED. Fourth confirmation of the 26MY price table (615萬 for the P400 SE SWB)."},{"name":"KingAutos - Land Rover Range Rover 車款總覽","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/land_rover/range_rover","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED. Historic Taiwan price ladder for the full-size Range Rover, used for the previous-generation retention-ratio extrapolation: P400 Westminster 5,550,000; P400 SE SWB 5,970,000; D350 SE SWB 5,970,000; P400 HSE LWB 6,410,000; P400 HSE 7-SEAT LWB 6,450,000; P400 Autobiography LWB 7,080,000. This page also now carries the L460 launch price after the U-CAR launch article was dropped for returning 403. CORRECTION TO THE PREVIOUS DRAFT'S NOTE: this page does NOT confirm air suspension as standard - its specification table lists only double-wishbone front and multi-link rear, with no pneumatic system named. That claim has been removed."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Land Rover Range Rover 二手行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/land-rover/range-rover","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED. PRIMARY used-price source, 24 full-size and Velar listings. Data used: 2023 P400 SE SWB 10,000 km ask 4,380,000; 2023 P400 SE SWB 18,000 km ask 4,380,000 (identical stale anchor prices); 2023 P400 HSE LWB 31,000 km ask 4,280,000 (cheaper than the SE SWB despite a higher original list - the evidence the SE SWB asks are unsold); 2023 P400 Autobiography LWB 17,000 km 4,788,000; 2024 P400 HSE LWB 17,000 km 4,580,000; 2025 D350 SE SWB 1,270 km 5,180,000 plus two more D350 cars at 電洽; 2020 SDV6 HSE 65,000 km 1,588,000; 2019 SDV6 HSE 120,000 km 1,480,000; 2018 3.0 SCV6 Vogue 56,000 km 1,698,000 / 79,800 km 1,538,000 / 87,300 km 1,688,000; 2010 5.0 V8 SC 120,000 km 988,000; 2010 5.0 V8 88,800 km 588,000. TWO CORRECTIONS TO THE PREVIOUS DRAFT. (1) It stated 'All are 車商售價 dealer retail asks'. That is false: the 2024 P400 HSE LWB at 4,580,000 and a 2004 4.4 at 218,000 are 自售 PRIVATE listings. The HSE LWB is the record's only genuine private-sale observation and is treated as such. (2) It cited the 988,000 car as a 2011; the listing is a 2010."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Land Rover 品牌行情頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/land-rover","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED. Brand-level 行情 page shows listings for Evoque, Velar, Range Rover Sport, Defender, Discovery Sport, Discovery 5 and Freelander - and NO entry for the full-size Range Rover. Direct evidence of how thin the full-size Range Rover used market is, which is why the handful of asks on the model page cannot be treated as market-clearing prices."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - Land Rover Range Rover 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LAND+ROVER&model=RANGE+ROVER","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED. Only three Range Rover-family listings nationwide and not one full-size car among them (2018 Sport 2.0 102,000 km 1,438,000; 2019 Velar 3.0 99,228 km 1,280,000; 2018 Velar 3.0 120,000 km 968,000). Used ONLY as corroboration of illiquidity. These are different, smaller, cheaper models and no price in this record is anchored on them."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - Land Rover 全品牌中古車","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LAND+ROVER","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED. 43 Land Rover listings, dominated by Evoque, Discovery Sport and Defender, with the Discovery 5 as the largest car present. No full-size Range Rover at all. Further corroboration that the full-size car barely trades in Taiwan."},{"name":"九和汽車 Land Rover Approved 認證中古車","url":"https://jaguarlandrover.chiuoho.com.tw/approved/landrover/landrover_approved.html","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED. Official dealer certified-used inventory. Exactly one full-size Range Rover: a 2024 SV P615 LWB with 88 km at 8,690,000 - a delivery-mileage flagship, not usable as a depreciation point. CORRECTION TO THE PREVIOUS DRAFT: it also used this page's 2022 Range Rover Sport D300 (33,031 km, 3,290,000) as an 'upper-bound sanity check on the 3-4 year band'. The Sport is a different, shorter, cheaper model and is not a valid price anchor for the full-size four-door SWB car. That cross-check has been removed and no figure in this record now depends on it."},{"name":"Land Rover Taiwan - 原廠保養專案計畫","url":"https://www.landrover.tw/ownership/service-and-maintenance/service-plans.html","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED. 'LAND ROVER 保養方案', terms up to SIX years, genuine parts with a 12-month parts warranty, transferable on sale. Explicit limitation '*僅包含保養費用' - scheduled maintenance only, no wear items, no repairs, no air suspension. No price published and no evidence it is bundled free with a new car."},{"name":"Land Rover Taiwan - 保養與維修服務","url":"https://www.landrover.tw/ownership/maintenance/index.html","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED. Documents a 24-month unlimited-mileage genuine-parts warranty, pickup/delivery and loaner services, and 12 months of Remote app service. Documents NO free scheduled maintenance, which is why every maintenance period in this record carries cost."},{"name":"KingAutos - 大修機率高、養車花費高《用車成本》恐怖排行榜（三）","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/345805","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED. Taiwan ownership-cost ranking. Land Rover third-worst brand overall, behind Porsche and BMW. Range Rover: 10-year cumulative cost about USD 18,228, which the article converts to about NT$546,800, with a 49.63% major-repair probability shared across the Land Rover line. The article states Range Rover maintenance is 陰晴不定 - unpredictable - in contrast to the more predictable German pattern. Used as the cross-check on the 10-year maintenance total and as the documented basis for the resale divergence from the Cayenne and the X5 at years 5, 7 and 10."}]},"landrover-range-rover-sport-d300-s":{"assumptions":"At 7,000 km/year this D300 hits no mileage-based service interval, so every workshop visit is the annual time-based one. Three specific effects follow for THIS car. (1) The 3.0 Ingenium six is a DPF diesel. Short low-mileage trips are the worst duty cycle for a DPF: passive regeneration rarely completes, soot loads build, and the 7-10 year window carries a real DPF deep-clean or replacement line that a 15,000 km/year highway car would not need. AdBlue is consumed by time and cold starts as much as by distance, so refills stay in the plan even at 7,000 km/year. (2) The electronic air suspension is standard on every L461 Range Rover Sport sold in Taiwan and it ages by calendar and by humidity, not by mileage. Air-spring bladders perish and the compressor's desiccant saturates on a car that sits. Low mileage does NOT protect this system - it is the single largest out-of-warranty repair exposure and it lands in the 5-7 and 7-10 periods regardless of odometer. (3) Tires and the 12V/auxiliary batteries time out before they wear out: one 22-inch tire set at about year 5 and a second at about year 9, both replaced for age and sidewall cracking rather than tread depth. MILEAGE CREDIT IS APPLIED ONCE, NOT TWICE, AND THE RULE IS NOW WRITTEN DOWN. The cross-check pass of 2026-08-22 found that this record and the P400 S record credited low mileage by different amounts on the same used listing. Both records now use one rule: add 1 percentage point for each full 5,000 km by which the comparable listing's odometer exceeds this checkpoint's assumed_km, floored to whole points and capped at 8 points, applied ONCE at the dealer-retail-to-private conversion and nowhere else. No checkpoint adds a second low-mileage credit on top, and no checkpoint is nudged above the band its own chain produces. 21,000 km at 3 years and 70,000 km at 10 years both sit under the Taiwan norm, and that is exactly what the capped credit is there to express.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"NOT CHALLENGED BY THE 2026-08-22 CROSS-CHECK AND UNCHANGED. It already sits correctly against the P400 S record: 70.0% here against 67.8% there, so the cheaper trim keeps the higher percentage, while 2,730,000 stays below the P400 S at 2,780,000 in absolute money. No 25MY/26MY D300 S resale listings exist yet - the 26MY only went on sale in Taiwan in March 2026, so a genuine one-year-old car is not in the market. Extrapolated from the shape of the 8891 Range Rover Sport 行情 page (auto.8891.com.tw/land-rover/range-rover-sport), which was re-opened on 2026-08-22: the newest-generation cars (2023 model year, L461) already sit at 259.8-318.8萬 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking) against original list prices near 459-471萬, so the first-three-year drop is front-loaded. Set at 70% of real_cost = 2,730,000 private sale. DEALER-RETAIL CHECK: there is no direct one-year listing to convert, so this figure is not at risk of copying a dealer asking price. This is DELIBERATELY steeper than every sibling anchor (X5 30d 74%, GLE 300 d 71%, Q7 45 TDI 72%, Cayenne 75%) - a stated 4-point-plus divergence from the X5: in Taiwan the JLR electrical and air-suspension repair reputation is priced in from the first resale, and a used-car dealer will not carry a Range Rover at German-equivalent money. Low mileage of 7,000 km is already reflected once; the mileage-blind one-year figure would be nearer 67%. Dealer trade-in 2,400,000 is 12.1% below the private figure - a fresh Range Rover ties up dealer capital and carries a warranty-period repair worry, so the trade-in spread is wider than for a one-year German SUV."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REPAIRED BY THE 2026-08-22 CROSS-CHECK: was 2,150,000, now 2,165,000. The move is small because this checkpoint's evidence was already the best in the record; what changed is that the figure is now produced by the same chain as the P400 S record instead of by a private one, which is what removes the trim-ladder inversion at this checkpoint. SHARED CHAIN, IDENTICAL IN BOTH RANGE ROVER SPORT RECORDS. Four steps, and no step uses a list price that could not be sourced. (1) Comparable: one or more 8891 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking) for the same five-door Range Rover Sport body. (2) Dealer retail to private sale: a single cut of 13% at years 1, 3, 5 and 7, and 15% at year 10 where private demand for a ten-year Range Rover is genuinely thin. Both sit inside the 8-15% band the brief requires and both are applied identically in the two records. (3) Mileage credit, applied ONCE: add 1 point per full 5,000 km by which the comparable's odometer exceeds this checkpoint's assumed_km, floored, capped at 8. (4) Trim step: multiply by the trim ratio taken from the SOURCED 26MY ladder - S 4,190,000 against Dynamic SE 4,760,000 is 0.880. APPLIED HERE. Comparable set, all 車商售價 on 8891 (m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=23&model=10443), all 2023 L461 five-door Sport: P400 Dynamic SE 22,300 km 3,180,000; P400 Dynamic SE 30,000 km 3,188,000; D300 Dynamic SE 33,000 km 2,880,000. The chain is run on the petrol pair because two agreeing listings beat one: average 3,184,000; cut 13% gives 2,770,080; mileage credit for 26,150 km against this checkpoint's 21,000 km is one point, giving 2,797,781; trim step 0.880 gives 2,462,047, which is 60.0% of the P400 S real_cost. A 5-point judgement penalty is then applied for the Land Rover discount, giving 55.0% and 2,255,000 on the P400 S, and this diesel record is 0.960 of that: 2,165,000, or 55.5%. WHY A 5-POINT PENALTY, AND WHY ONLY AT THIS CHECKPOINT: 8891 asking prices in a 40-car national pool face little competitive pressure, and a three-year car is still close enough to new that the market has not yet priced the out-of-warranty JLR risk this brand carries in Taiwan. At years 5, 7 and 10 that risk is already inside the comparable, because those comparables ARE old Land Rovers trading in Taiwan today, so no penalty is added there. Applying it at every checkpoint would be the same double-count the fact-check removed elsewhere. INDEPENDENT CROSS-CHECK on this record's own diesel comparable: 2,880,000, cut 13% to 2,505,600, mileage credit two points for 33,000 km against 21,000 km to 2,555,712, trim step 0.880 to 2,249,027 (57.7%), less the same 5-point penalty gives 2,054,000 (52.7%). The settled 2,165,000 sits 111,000 above that direct read; the reason it is not set at the direct read is that the diesel comparable is a single listing of unknown spec and condition, while the petrol pair agree with each other to within 8,000. Versus siblings 55.5% is below the X5 30d (60%), GLE 300 d (59%) and GLE 450 (60%), level with the Cayenne (56%) and above both Audis (52%). Dealer trade-in 1,884,000 is 13.0% under private, the same spread the P400 S record uses at this checkpoint - year 3 is when the 3-year/100,000 km factory warranty expires and trade-in bids drop sharply. Confidence stays low: the comparables and the trim ratio are sourced, the 5-point penalty is judgement."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REPAIRED BY THE 2026-08-22 CROSS-CHECK: was 1,520,000, now 1,455,000. PREVIOUS-GENERATION EXTRAPOLATION, now run through the shared chain described in the year-3 source. No five-year-old L461 exists (the generation launched in Taiwan in late 2022). COMPARABLE, AND WHY IT CHANGED: 2021 Range Rover Sport P400 HSE 3.0, 71,200 km, 車商售價 1,850,000 on 8891 - exactly five years old and the same 3.0 Ingenium straight-six family. This is the same primary comparable the P400 S record uses. The previous version of THIS record worked instead from the cheaper 2.0 four-cylinder 2021 P300 HSE cars, which is one of the two reasons the two Sport records disagreed; the cross-check required one shared comparable set, so the engine-matched car wins. CHAIN: 1,850,000 cut 13% for private sale gives 1,609,500; mileage credit for 71,200 km against this checkpoint's 35,000 km is seven points (36,200 divided by 5,000, floored), giving 1,722,165; trim step HSE to S at 0.880 gives 1,515,505, which is 37.0% on the P400 S and is set there at 1,515,000. This diesel record is 0.960 of that in absolute money: 1,455,000, or 37.3%. Supporting listings on the same page, used as bracketing rather than as the primary because they are the cheaper four-cylinder: 2021 P300 HSE 59,000 km 1,798,000; 2021 P300 HSE 68,000 km 1,558,000; 2021 P300 HSE 70,300 km 1,580,000. Also on the page, a 2022 P400 HSE Dynamic at 37,000 km asking 1,988,000 - a four-year car that works out near 39% and is not used, because it is a run-out example of a generation replaced immediately by the L461 and was discounted hard when new. WHERE THIS SITS: 37.3% is below every German anchor at this checkpoint - X5 30d 45%, X5 40i 46%, GLE 300 d 47%, GLE 450 44%, Q8 44%, Cayenne 44%, Q7 45 TDI 38% - which is the intended and stated Land Rover discount: the 3-year/100,000 km factory warranty expired two years earlier and Taiwan buyers start pricing JLR air-suspension and electrical exposure from year 4, whereas the equivalent German fear premium starts later. Dealer trade-in 1,266,000 is 13.0% under private, matching the P400 S record. Confidence low: no L461 has reached five years and the comparable is a previous generation."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REPAIRED BY THE 2026-08-22 CROSS-CHECK: was 1,130,000, now 1,272,000. THIS IS THE CHECKPOINT THE CROSS-CHECK NAMED. PREVIOUS-GENERATION EXTRAPOLATION. Comparable: 2019 Range Rover Sport 3.0 SCV6 HSE, 68,300 km, 車商售價 1,680,000 on 8891 (m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=23&model=10443) - exactly seven years old. THIS IS THE LISTING THE TWO SPORT RECORDS READ TWO WAYS, 330,000 APART. The previous version of this record divided it by an L494 facelift SCV6 HSE Taiwan list price of 4,980,000-5,100,000 and landed at 1,130,000; the P400 S record divided the SAME car by about 4,180,000, took a 14% private cut plus a 5% mileage credit, and landed at 1,460,000. The two denominators are about 20% apart and NEITHER COULD BE SOURCED: both trace back to a U-CAR price-list article that returns HTTP 403 and has been deleted from sources[], and no page giving an L494 Taiwan price list could be opened on 2026-08-22 either (carbook.tw has no pre-2026 Range Rover Sport page, 8891's 新車 page for the model returns a system error, and the 8891 中古車 pages carry no 新車價 column). RESOLUTION: the chain no longer divides by an L494 list price at all. It works in absolute money from a sourced asking price and scales by the SOURCED 26MY trim ratio, so the disputed number is not an input to anything. CHAIN, identical to the P400 S record: 1,680,000 cut 13% for private sale gives 1,461,600; mileage credit for 68,300 km against this checkpoint's 49,000 km is three points (19,300 divided by 5,000, floored) - not the 5% the P400 S record used and not the zero this record used - giving 1,505,448; trim step HSE to S at 0.880 gives 1,324,794, which is 32.3% on the P400 S and is set there at 1,325,000. This diesel record is 0.960 of that: 1,272,000, or 32.6%. Bracketing listings on the same page, consistent once mileage and engine are allowed for: 2019 3.0 SCV6 HSE 160,000 km 1,198,000; 2019 2.0 Si4 HSE 100,000 km 1,358,000. WHERE THIS SITS: 32.6% is below the X5 30d (36%), X5 40i (36%), GLE 300 d (37%), GLE 450 (36%), Q8 (36%) and Cayenne (37%), and below the Range Rover Velar (33%), so no Land Rover in the table now beats a German equivalent at year 7. It IS above the Audi Q7 45 TDI (30%), the single weakest German seven-year figure in the table, which is treated as the outlier rather than as the benchmark - the other six German anchors cluster at 36-37%. The direction the record has always argued is preserved: year 7 is where the Taiwan market prices out-of-warranty JLR risk (air suspension, Pivi and body modules, and on this car the DPF) and this figure sits 3-5 points under the German cluster because of it. What is gone is the 6.6-point inversion against the P400 S. Dealer trade-in 1,094,000 is 14.0% under private, matching the P400 S record; many Taiwan dealers will only bid wholesale money on a seven-year Range Rover. Confidence low."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REPAIRED BY THE 2026-08-22 CROSS-CHECK: was 700,000, now 730,000. PREVIOUS-GENERATION EXTRAPOLATION and still the weakest data in the record. Comparable: 2016 Range Rover Sport 3.0 SCV6 HSE Dynamic, 78,000 km, 車商售價 1,080,000 on 8891 - the exact ten-year age match and close to this checkpoint's 70,000 km. The previous version of this record worked from a 2014-2017 price band divided by an unsourced L494 list range of 4,580,000-5,790,000; that denominator is gone for the same reason as at year 7, and the exact-age comparable replaces the band. CHAIN, identical to the P400 S record: 1,080,000 cut 15% for private sale gives 918,000 - 15% rather than the 13% used at years 1 to 7, because private demand for a ten-year Range Rover in Taiwan is genuinely thin and 15% is the far edge of the band the brief allows; mileage credit for 78,000 km against 70,000 km is one point, giving 927,180; trim step HSE Dynamic to S at 0.820 - one step wider than the 0.880 used for a plain HSE, because HSE Dynamic sits above HSE in the L494 range - gives 760,288, which is 18.5% on the P400 S and is set there at 760,000. This diesel record is 0.960 of that: 730,000, or 18.7%. Supporting listings, all confirmed on 8891 or abc好車網: 2017 3.0 SDV6 HSE 79,000 km 1,180,000; 2017 3.0 SCV6 HSE Dynamic 100,000 km 958,000; 2015 3.0 V6 SC HSE Dynamic 105,000 km 988,000; 2014 3.0 V6 SC HSE 49,632 km 990,000. These nine-to-twelve-year cars bracket the 2016 comparable and support the same order of magnitude. WHERE THIS SITS: 18.7% is at the bottom edge of the German group (X5 40i 18%, Q8 18%, GLE 450 19%, Cayenne 19%, Q7 45 TDI 20%, X5 30d 21%, GLE 300 d 22%) and just under the Velar and Evoque at 19% each, which is the correct shape - the Sport is the priciest of the three Land Rovers in that comparison, so it should keep the smallest percentage of the three. All five checkpoints are strictly decreasing and the decline steepens with age, which is the correct shape for this brand. The 7-to-10-year tail is still severe: the 730,000 maintenance figure for the same window approaches the value of the car itself, and Taiwan buyers know it. Dealer trade-in 621,000 is 14.9% under private; at this age most dealers bid wholesale money and send the car to auction rather than retail it. Confidence low."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"CORRECTED BY THE FACT-CHECK: was 8,000, now 25,000. The previous figure assumed a free bundled 3-year Land Rover Service Plan absorbed the annual service and left the owner paying only the plan's exclusions. The fact-check opened landrover.tw/ownership/service-and-maintenance/service-plans.html and the page describes the plan as a product with terms up to 6 years; it never states that it is included with a new car. The factory warranty (landrover.tw/ownership/warranty/standard-warranty.html, 3 years / 100,000 km, opened and confirmed) covers defects, NOT scheduled maintenance. Year 0-1 is therefore one owner-paid annual service on a 3.0 Ingenium diesel at JLR Taiwan retail, about 19,000, plus wipers, alignment and an AdBlue top-up, about 6,000. Total 25,000 for the window. At 7,000 km the car is nowhere near a mileage interval - this is the annual time-based visit. Confidence is low, not medium: no public Land Rover Taiwan service price table for the L461 exists, so the service charge itself is a market estimate. Not touched by the 2026-08-22 cross-check, which concerned the resale curve only; see plan_notes for the open divergence against the P400 S record's years 1-3."},{"y":3,"source":"CORRECTED BY THE FACT-CHECK: was 35,000, now 68,000, for the same reason as year 1 - the free bundled Service Plan is not supported by the page the record cites. The window is still inside the 3-year/100,000 km factory warranty, so defect repairs are free, but scheduled servicing is not. Two owner-paid annual services at JLR Taiwan retail: a year-2 minor at about 19,000 and a year-3 major with cabin and pollen filters at about 30,000, plus brake fluid at about 6,000 and AdBlue, wipers, alignment and a tire rotation allowance at about 13,000. Total 68,000 across two years, roughly 34,000/year. This is the periodic figure that changed most in the fact-check, and the change is structural rather than a re-estimate: money the previous version treated as absorbed by a plan and deferred into the 3-5 period is now paid when it is actually incurred. Note the contrast with the German diesel siblings, whose Taiwan new-car deals do include free scheduled maintenance for the first three years - that difference is a genuine reason this record's years 1-3 run above theirs. Confidence low: no public L461 service price table exists. Not touched by the 2026-08-22 cross-check; see plan_notes for the open divergence against the P400 S record."},{"y":5,"source":"Unchanged in amount by the fact-check; this window already assumed full retail pricing, so removing the free-plan assumption does not move it. The step change here is structural: the 3-year/100,000 km factory warranty (landrover.tw/ownership/warranty/standard-warranty.html, opened) expires at year 3, so from year 4 the owner pays full Land Rover Taiwan retail parts AND carries every repair risk himself. Two annual services on a 3.0 Ingenium diesel run about 18,000 for a minor and about 40,000 for the year-5 major that includes the diesel fuel filter. The dominant single line is tires: four 22-inch Pirelli Scorpion fitted and balanced is about 90,000 at Taiwan prices, and at 7,000 km/year they are replaced for age, not tread depth. Front pads plus discs on a 2.4-tonne SUV about 55,000; the twin batteries (main AGM plus the auxiliary battery the stop-start and 48V system need) about 30,000; consumables and AdBlue about 12,000. Total 245,000. Cross-check against the siblings: materially above what an X5 30d or Q7 45 TDI costs in the same window, driven by Land Rover Taiwan's parts pricing and the 22-inch tire size. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from medium to low by the fact-check: there is no published Land Rover Taiwan price table for L461 servicing, so 'medium' overstated the sourcing behind these line items. Not touched by the 2026-08-22 cross-check."},{"y":7,"source":"Owner-cost estimate for the 5-7 window built from Taiwan JLR retail parts and labour levels; unchanged by the fact-check and untouched by the 2026-08-22 cross-check. The controlling line is the electronic air suspension. At 6-7 years in Taiwan's heat and humidity the compressor's desiccant saturates and the strut bladders perish; a compressor unit fitted runs about 90,000 and a single front air spring about 65,000, so a budget of about 130,000 covers one of those plus the valve block or a second-corner top-up. This is why the record is honest that low mileage does NOT protect this car - the suspension does not care about the odometer. Two annual services about 45,000, rear brakes about 48,000, ZF 8HP fluid service about 30,000, coolant about 12,000, DPF and EGR work about 25,000, one module or infotainment incident about 20,000. Total 300,000. Extended warranty is available from Land Rover Taiwan and would convert part of this into a premium instead, but this record costs the repairs directly rather than assuming a policy is bought. Divergence note: this exceeds the German diesel siblings in the same window chiefly on the air-suspension and module lines, not on scheduled servicing."},{"y":10,"source":"Owner-cost estimate for the 7-10 window at Taiwan JLR retail rates, unchanged by the fact-check and untouched by the 2026-08-22 cross-check, built line by line: three annual services about 70,000; second 22-inch tire set about 95,000; air-suspension refresh (compressor plus two struts) about 190,000; water pump and thermostat about 60,000; turbo and EGR-cooler ancillaries about 55,000; 48V BiSG and 48V battery about 45,000 (probability-weighted, not certain); DPF deep clean or replacement about 80,000; brakes about 50,000; twin 12V batteries about 28,000; Pivi Pro and electrical modules about 45,000; timing chain, front cover, suspension arms, bushings and coolant about 12,000 residual. Total 730,000 for the three-year window, and 1,368,000 across the full ten years. STATED DIVERGENCE from the sibling anchors: the ten-year total is 59% above the BMW X5 xDrive30d (858,000), 45% above the Mercedes GLE 300 d (941,000), 57% above the Audi Q7 45 TDI (874,000) and 31% above the Porsche Cayenne 3.0T (1,044,000). Four reasons, all specific to this car rather than generic brand pessimism: (1) air suspension is standard here and its Taiwan repair record is worse than any of the four - only the Cayenne shares the system at all; (2) this is the only one of the five with a DPF running a 7,000 km/year short-trip cycle, which is what turns a maintenance item into a replacement item; (3) Land Rover Taiwan parts pricing and the JLR electrical-module failure rate add a module and infotainment line the German cars do not carry at this size; (4) the German rivals include free scheduled servicing in years 1-3 in Taiwan and Land Rover does not. Confidence is low because the figure rests on typical Taiwan repair costs and previous-generation L494 owner experience rather than on a published Land Rover Taiwan price table for the L461 - no such table is public. The direction is well supported; the exact total is not."}],"sources":[{"name":"Land Rover Taiwan official - RANGE ROVER 與 RANGE ROVER SPORT 新年式完整產品陣容公布 (26MY)","url":"https://www.rangerover.com/zh-tw/news/rr-rrs-26my.html","note":"OPENED AND RE-VERIFIED BY THE FACT-CHECK. Official 26MY Taiwan price ladder: Range Rover Sport D300 S 3,990,000 / P400 S 4,190,000 / P400 Dynamic SE 4,760,000 / P635 SV Carbon 7,300,000. Confirms list_price 3,990,000 exactly - 0% difference, no adjustment. Also confirms the 26MY D300 S adds 車門吸附緊閉 (door soft-close) and four-zone climate at no price increase. Contains no warranty or service-plan information. PROMOTED BY THE 2026-08-22 CROSS-CHECK: this ladder is now load-bearing twice over. It sets list_price, and it also supplies the two trim ratios used in every resale checkpoint - S to Dynamic SE at 4,190,000 / 4,760,000 = 0.880, and D300 S to P400 S at 3,990,000 / 4,190,000 = 0.952. Those ratios replace the unsourced L494 list prices the previous version divided by."},{"name":"Carbook 車書 - Land Rover Range Rover Sport 2026款 新車價格、規格與中古行情","url":"https://carbook.tw/newcars/land-rover-range-rover-sport","note":"OPENED AND RE-VERIFIED, most recently on 2026-08-22. Independently confirms the same four 26MY prices (D300 S 3,990,000, 2997cc, 300hp) and the 399-730萬 range. This is the second independent confirmation of the list price. CAUTION FLAG RE-CONFIRMED ON 2026-08-22: its 中古行情 table (2025 median 137.8萬, 2024 125.0萬, 2023 106.8萬, 2022 82.3萬, 2021 69.9萬, 2019 70.0萬, 2016 54.3萬) is impossible for a car that lists at 399萬 - a one-year-old Range Rover Sport does not sell for 137萬 - so that table is a scraping error or a cross-model aggregate. Used for the new-car price ONLY. Its used-value table is discarded entirely and feeds no value_checkpoint. The site carries no pre-2026 model-year page for this nameplate, which is one of the reasons the L494 Taiwan list price could not be sourced."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Land Rover Range Rover Sport 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/land-rover/range-rover-sport","note":"OPENED AND RE-VERIFIED, most recently on 2026-08-22. Primary used-market source, about 40 listings, 2005-2023 model years, 9.8萬-318.8萬. Per-year 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking) bands: 2023 (3y) 259.8-318.8萬; 2021-2022 155.8-198.8萬; 2019-2020 88.8-168.0萬; 2018 105.8-135.8萬; 2017 95.8-118.0萬; 2014-2016 98.8-108.0萬. EVERY figure on this page is dealer retail asking, never a private-sale price, and each checkpoint above converts it down by 13% (15% at year 10) to reach private_sale_price and by a further 12-15% to reach dealer_tradein_price. CONFIRMED ON 2026-08-22: the page carries NO 新車價 column for any model year, which is why the L494 original list price could not be sourced here. CONTAMINATION WARNING: the page mixes generations and, in at least two rows, other nameplates. A '2020 P250 R-Dynamic SE' at 88.8萬 is not a Range Rover Sport engine code in Taiwan (P250 is Velar/Evoque), and a '2022 P400 HSE Dynamic' at 198.8萬 uses previous-generation L494 trim naming while sitting far under genuine 2023 L461 cars. Neither row is used in any checkpoint. Only genuine five-door Range Rover Sport SUV listings feed the numbers."},{"name":"8891 汽車 (mobile) - Range Rover Sport 二手車列表","url":"https://m.8891.com.tw/autos?brand=23&model=10443","note":"OPENED AND RE-VERIFIED. Individual listings with mileage, which the summary page lacks. THIS IS NOW THE SHARED COMPARABLE SET FOR BOTH RANGE ROVER SPORT RECORDS - the 2026-08-22 cross-check required one set, so the D300 S and P400 S records draw the same listings and run the same conversion chain on them. Load-bearing data points, all 車商售價 and all the same five-door Range Rover Sport SUV body: 2023 P400 Dynamic SE 22,300 km 3,180,000 and 30,000 km 3,188,000 (the year-3 primary pair); 2023 D300 Dynamic SE 33,000 km 2,880,000 (the year-3 diesel cross-check); 2021 P400 HSE 3.0 71,200 km 1,850,000 (the year-5 primary, engine-matched); 2021 P300 HSE 59,000 km 1,798,000, 68,000 km 1,558,000, 70,300 km 1,580,000 (year-5 bracketing); 2019 3.0 SCV6 HSE 68,300 km 1,680,000 (the year-7 primary, and the listing the two records previously read 330,000 apart); 2019 3.0 SCV6 HSE 160,000 km 1,198,000 and 2019 2.0 Si4 HSE 100,000 km 1,358,000 (year-7 bracketing); 2016 3.0 SCV6 HSE Dynamic 78,000 km 1,080,000 (the year-10 primary); 2017 3.0 SDV6 HSE 79,000 km 1,180,000; 2017 3.0 SCV6 HSE Dynamic 100,000 km 958,000; 2015 3.0 V6 SC HSE Dynamic 105,000 km 988,000; 2014 3.0 V6 SC HSE 49,632 km 990,000; 2018 2.0 Si4 HSE 110,000 km 1,058,000. Every one is converted downward for private sale before use, and the mileage credit is applied once at that conversion."},{"name":"Land Rover 台灣 - 原廠保固 (standard warranty)","url":"https://www.landrover.tw/ownership/warranty/standard-warranty.html","note":"OPENED AND RE-VERIFIED. Confirms the Taiwan new-car warranty is 100,000 公里或 3 年全方位原廠保固 with Land Rover Assistance roadside cover for the same 3 years, plus 6-year anti-corrosion cover with no mileage limit. It covers DEFECTS, not scheduled maintenance - a distinction the fact-check relies on when re-costing years 1-3. Establishes that year 3 is the warranty cliff, which drives the step change in the 3-5 maintenance period and the wider trade-in spread at the 3-year checkpoint. Identical reading in the P400 S record."},{"name":"Land Rover 台灣 - 原廠保養專案計畫 (Service Plan)","url":"https://www.landrover.tw/ownership/service-and-maintenance/service-plans.html","note":"OPENED AND RE-VERIFIED, AND THIS IS THE SOURCE THAT OVERTURNED THE PREVIOUS MAINTENANCE FIGURES. The page names the programme 'LAND ROVER 保養方案', terms up to 6 years, genuine parts, factory-trained technicians, 12-month parts warranty, transferable to a new owner. It describes a purchasable product and NEVER states that the plan is free or bundled with a new car. The previous version of this record assumed a free bundled 3-year plan and set maintenance years 1 and 3 to 8,000 and 35,000 on that basis; that assumption is unsupported and has been removed, and those windows are now costed as owner-paid servicing. No public per-service price table for the L461 exists on the Taiwan site (the service-pricing URL returns 404), which is why every maintenance confidence in this record is 'low'. OPEN ITEM RECORDED BY THE 2026-08-22 CROSS-CHECK: the P400 S record reads the same page alongside a time-limited 8891 promotion and costs years 1-3 lower as a result. See maintenance.plan_notes."},{"name":"九和汽車 - Land Rover 原廠認證中古車 (Approved Used)","url":"https://jaguarlandrover.chiuoho.com.tw/approved/landrover/landrover_approved.html","note":"OPENED BY THE FACT-CHECK - the previous version wrongly recorded this as 'NOT OPENED, search-result snippet only' and described it only as 'a 2022 Range Rover Sport'. It is in fact a 2022 RANGE ROVER SPORT D300 DYNAMIC SE, 33,031 km, 329萬, 九和高雄, 原廠認證中古車. This is directly useful as a cross-check: a 2022 D300 with the same 33,000 km asks MORE as a certified car (329萬) than the year-newer 2023 D300 asks on 8891 (288萬), which quantifies the Approved-Used certified premium at roughly 15% and confirms that the 8891 dealer asking prices are themselves above what an owner receives privately. Context only; it is not a numerical input to any checkpoint."}]},"landrover-range-rover-sport-p400-s":{"assumptions":"At 7,000 km/year every JLR service trigger on this car is time-driven, not distance-driven. The Ingenium 3.0 I6 petrol interval is about 1 year / 26,000 km, so the owner reaches the annual service on the calendar and never on mileage. Note: the exact km figure comes from the JLR Ingenium schedule and was not confirmed on a Taiwan page; only the time-driven conclusion matters for the model, and that conclusion is safe at any interval of 10,000 km or more. Two cost drivers are unaffected by low mileage and dominate the later years. First, the air suspension air springs perish on age plus Taiwan heat and humidity, not on kilometres, so a 70,000 km ten-year car faces the same strut and compressor bill as a 150,000 km one. Second, tyres and the AGM 12V battery age out at 5-6 years and 4-5 years, so both are replaced twice over ten years on a car that has covered only 70,000 km. MILEAGE CREDIT IS APPLIED ONCE, NOT TWICE, AND THE RULE IS NOW WRITTEN DOWN. The cross-check pass of 2026-08-22 found that this record and the D300 S record credited low mileage by different amounts on the same used listing - this record took 5% at year 7 and 8% at year 5 while the D300 S record took none. Both records now use one rule: add 1 percentage point for each full 5,000 km by which the comparable listing's odometer exceeds this checkpoint's assumed_km, floored to whole points and capped at 8 points, applied ONCE at the dealer-retail-to-private conversion and nowhere else. No checkpoint adds a second low-mileage credit on top. The current-generation L461 cars listed on 8891 today sit at 22,300-98,000 km. The two lowest, a 2023 P400 Dynamic SE at 22,300 km and another at 30,000 km, are close matches for the 21,000 km three-year checkpoint, so year 3 is anchored on real low-mileage stock rather than on a 50,000 km car. The 48V mild-hybrid system needs no charging behaviour from the owner and adds no running cost until the belt-integrated starter-generator ages out.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"NOT CHALLENGED BY THE 2026-08-22 CROSS-CHECK AND UNCHANGED. It already sits correctly against the D300 S record: 67.8% here against 70.0% there, so the pricier trim keeps the lower percentage, while 2,780,000 stays above the D300 S at 2,730,000 in absolute money. EARLIER CORRECTION, RETAINED: the first draft anchored this checkpoint on 'a 2024 P400 Dynamic SE with 12,000 km asking 3,238,000 on 8891'. That page was opened and NO 2024 model-year Range Rover Sport is listed at all, and no car on the page asks 3,238,000; the used pool for this generation starts at 2023. That data point does not exist, so the whole year-1 derivation was rebuilt. There is no one-year-old L461 on the Taiwan market to observe (the P400 S trim itself launched 2026-03), so this figure is an explicit rollback from the year-3 evidence and confidence is LOW. Method: the best real comparator is the 2023 P400 Dynamic SE at 22,300 km asking 3,180,000 (dealer 車商售價). Cut 13% to reach a genuine 自售 level gives about 2,767,000 at roughly 3.3 years for a Dynamic SE. Rolling that back along a normal luxury-SUV curve puts a one-year Dynamic SE near 70-72%. 2,780,000 for the S is 67.8% of real_cost — below all four sibling anchors (Q8 68, GLE 71, X5 72, Cayenne 75), per the brief's rule that JLR gives back more in years 1-3 than the German brands. Two supporting reasons for sitting at the bottom of that group: a one-year-old used car has to compete against a new one carrying 0% financing and a multi-year 原廠保養 package, and that incentive stack pushes nearly-new used prices down harder for Land Rover than for brands that discount in cash; and 8891 asking prices in a 40-car nationwide pool are soft, so the raw read overstates achievable money. 7,000 km is exceptionally low and is what keeps this from falling to the mid-60s. Dealer trade-in 2,440,000 is 12.2% under private sale."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REPAIRED BY THE 2026-08-22 CROSS-CHECK: was 2,330,000 (56.8%), now 2,255,000 (55.0%). The move is downward because at 56.8% this pricier trim was out-retaining the cheaper D300 S at 55.1%, which inverts the trim ladder. It remains the best-evidenced checkpoint in the record. SHARED CHAIN, IDENTICAL IN BOTH RANGE ROVER SPORT RECORDS. Four steps, and no step uses a list price that could not be sourced. (1) Comparable: one or more 8891 車商售價 (dealer RETAIL asking) for the same five-door Range Rover Sport body. (2) Dealer retail to private sale: a single cut of 13% at years 1, 3, 5 and 7, and 15% at year 10 where private demand for a ten-year Range Rover is genuinely thin. Both sit inside the 8-15% band the brief requires and both are applied identically in the two records - this replaces the sliding 12/13/14/15% cuts the earlier draft used, which is one reason the two records disagreed on the same listing. (3) Mileage credit, applied ONCE: add 1 point per full 5,000 km by which the comparable's odometer exceeds this checkpoint's assumed_km, floored, capped at 8. (4) Trim step: multiply by the trim ratio taken from the SOURCED 26MY ladder - S 4,190,000 against Dynamic SE 4,760,000 is 0.880. APPLIED HERE. Real current-generation L461 listings, all 車商售價, confirmed on the opened 8891 pages: 2023 P400 Dynamic SE at 22,300 km asking 3,180,000; 2023 P400 Dynamic SE at 30,000 km asking 3,188,000; two 2023 P400 Dynamic SE at 50,000 km asking 2,880,000 and 2,888,000; 2023 P400 Dynamic SE at 80,000 km and at 96,500 km both asking 2,688,000; three more 2023 P400 Dynamic SE at 90,000-98,000 km asking 2,598,000; and a 2023 D300 Dynamic SE at 33,000 km asking 2,880,000. The chain is run on the two lowest-mileage cars because they are the closest mileage match and because two agreeing listings beat one: average 3,184,000; cut 13% gives 2,770,080; mileage credit for 26,150 km against this checkpoint's 21,000 km is one point, giving 2,797,781; trim step Dynamic SE to S at 0.880 gives 2,462,047, or 60.0% of real_cost. A 5-point judgement penalty is then applied for the Land Rover discount, giving 55.0% and 2,255,000. WHY A 5-POINT PENALTY, AND WHY ONLY AT THIS CHECKPOINT: 8891 asking prices in a 40-car national pool face little competitive pressure, and a three-year car is still close enough to new that the market has not yet priced the out-of-warranty JLR risk this brand carries in Taiwan. At years 5, 7 and 10 that risk is already inside the comparable, because those comparables ARE old Land Rovers trading in Taiwan today, so no penalty is added there. The earlier draft applied about 4 points here and nothing anywhere else without saying so; 5 points is now stated and bounded. EARLIER CORRECTIONS, RETAINED: the first draft claimed 'one 2023 P400 Dynamic SE at 90,000 km asking 3,188,000 was discarded as an outlier'; the page shows the opposite pairing - 3,188,000 is a 30,000 km car and the 90,000 km car asks 2,598,000 - so the listing thrown away was in fact the closest comparator. It also derived year 3 from the 50,000 km car while ignoring the 22,300 km and 30,000 km cars. Both errors stay fixed. WHERE THIS SITS: 55.0% is below the X5 30d (60%), X5 40i (59%), GLE 300 d (59%), GLE 450 (60%) and Cayenne (56%), and above both Audis (52%), and it sits 0.5 points under the D300 S at 55.5% while staying 90,000 above it in absolute money. Support against pushing lower: the 原廠保養 plan transfers to the next owner (confirmed on the opened landrover.tw service-plans page), so a three-year-old car may still carry remaining factory servicing. Trade-in 1,962,000 is 13.0% under private sale, the same spread the D300 S record uses. Confidence stays medium: the comparables and the trim ratio are sourced, the 5-point penalty is judgement."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REPAIRED BY THE 2026-08-22 CROSS-CHECK: was 1,720,000 (42.0%), now 1,515,000 (37.0%). The move is downward for two reasons: at 42.0% this pricier trim out-retained the cheaper D300 S at 39.0%, and the old derivation divided by an L494 list price of about 4,180,000 that the record itself flagged as UNSOURCED. PREVIOUS-GENERATION EXTRAPOLATION, now run through the shared chain described in the year-3 source. No five-year-old L461 exists (the generation launched in Taiwan at the end of 2022). Comparable: 2021 Range Rover Sport P400 HSE 3.0, 71,200 km, 車商售價 1,850,000 on 8891 — exactly five years old and the SAME 3.0 Ingenium straight-six as this record. This is now the shared primary comparable for both Sport records; the D300 S record previously worked from the cheaper 2.0 four-cylinder P300 cars instead, which is one of the two reasons the two records disagreed. CHAIN: 1,850,000 cut 13% for private sale gives 1,609,500 — a single 13%, not the 13% plus a separate 8% mileage step the earlier draft used; mileage credit for 71,200 km against this checkpoint's 35,000 km is seven points (36,200 divided by 5,000, floored), giving 1,722,165; trim step HSE to S at 0.880, the sourced 26MY ratio, gives 1,515,505, set at 1,515,000, or 37.0%. Note what is gone: the chain no longer divides by any L494 list price, so the 4,180,000 the earlier draft could not source is not an input to anything. Supporting listings on the same page, used as bracketing rather than as the primary because they are the cheaper four-cylinder: 2021 P300 HSE 59,000 km 1,798,000; 2021 P300 HSE 68,000 km 1,558,000; 2021 P300 HSE 70,300 km 1,580,000. Also on the page, a 2022 P400 HSE Dynamic at 37,000 km asking 1,988,000 — a four-year car that is not used, because it is a run-out example of a generation replaced immediately by the L461 and was discounted heavily when new. WHERE THIS SITS: 37.0% is below every German anchor at this checkpoint — X5 30d 45%, X5 40i 46%, GLE 300 d 47%, GLE 450 44%, Q8 44%, Cayenne 44%, Q7 45 TDI 38%. That is the intended Land Rover discount: the 3-year / 100,000 km factory warranty (confirmed on the opened landrover.tw standard-warranty page) expired two years earlier, and Taiwan buyers begin pricing JLR out-of-warranty electrical and air-suspension exposure from year 4 onward, whereas the equivalent German fear premium starts later. It sits 0.3 points under the D300 S at 37.3% while staying 60,000 above it in absolute money. CONFIDENCE LOWERED from medium to low: the comparable is real and engine-matched, but it is a previous generation and no L461 has reached five years. Trade-in 1,318,000 is 13.0% under private sale."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REPAIRED BY THE 2026-08-22 CROSS-CHECK: was 1,460,000 (35.6%), now 1,325,000 (32.3%). THIS IS THE CHECKPOINT THE CROSS-CHECK NAMED. At 35.6% this record held the highest seven-year retention of any Land Rover in the table (Velar 33, Evoque 29, Range Rover P400 SE SWB 26), beat the cheaper D300 S by 6.6 points, and sat level with or above the German petrol anchors it is meant to trail. PREVIOUS-GENERATION EXTRAPOLATION. Comparable: 2019 Range Rover Sport 3.0 SCV6 HSE, 68,300 km, 車商售價 1,680,000 on the opened 8891 page — exactly seven years old. THIS IS THE LISTING THE TWO SPORT RECORDS READ TWO WAYS, 330,000 APART. This record cut 14% for private sale, credited 5% for mileage and divided by an L494 facelift SCV6 HSE list of about 4,180,000, landing at 1,460,000; the D300 S record cut 12-13%, credited no mileage and divided by 4,980,000-5,100,000, landing at 1,130,000. The two denominators are about 20% apart and NEITHER COULD BE SOURCED: both trace back to a U-CAR price-list article that returns HTTP 403 and has been deleted from sources[], and no page giving an L494 Taiwan price list could be opened on 2026-08-22 either (carbook.tw carries no pre-2026 Range Rover Sport page, 8891's 新車 page for the model returns a system error, and the 8891 中古車 pages carry no 新車價 column at all). RESOLUTION: the chain no longer divides by an L494 list price. It works in absolute money from a sourced asking price and scales by the SOURCED 26MY trim ratio, so the disputed number is not an input to anything, in either record. CHAIN, identical in both: 1,680,000 cut 13% for private sale gives 1,461,600; mileage credit for 68,300 km against this checkpoint's 49,000 km is three points (19,300 divided by 5,000, floored) — not the 5% this record used and not the zero the D300 S record used — giving 1,505,448; trim step HSE to S at 0.880 gives 1,324,794, set at 1,325,000, or 32.3%. Bracketing listings on the same page, consistent once mileage and engine are allowed for: 2019 3.0 SCV6 HSE 160,000 km 1,198,000; 2019 2.0 Si4 HSE 100,000 km 1,358,000. Older cross-check from the same page: a 2017 3.0 SDV6 HSE at 79,000 km asking 1,180,000 and a 2017 3.0 SCV6 HSE Dynamic at 100,000 km asking 958,000 at nine years, and a 2016 3.0 SCV6 HSE Dynamic at 78,000 km asking 1,080,000 at ten, which bracket a 32.3% seven-year figure sensibly. WHERE THIS SITS: 32.3% is now below every German anchor at year 7 except the Audi Q7 45 TDI (30%), which is the single weakest German seven-year figure in the table and is treated as the outlier rather than the benchmark — the other six cluster at 36-37% (X5 30d 36, X5 40i 36, GLE 300 d 37, GLE 450 36, Q8 36, Cayenne 37). It is also below the Velar at 33%, so no Land Rover in the table beats a German equivalent at year 7 any more. It sits 0.3 points under the D300 S at 32.6% while staying 53,000 above it in absolute money. The reasoning the record has always given is preserved: at year 7 this car is four years out of warranty with air suspension, a 48V starter-generator and Pivi Pro electronics all inside their known failure window. Confidence stays low: the comparable is a previous generation and no L461 has reached this age. Trade-in 1,140,000 is 14.0% under private sale, the same spread the D300 S record uses."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REPAIRED BY THE 2026-08-22 CROSS-CHECK: was 730,000 (17.8%), now 760,000 (18.5%). A small upward move, and the only checkpoint in this record that rose. The earlier figure was reached by taking a 20.9% raw read and then subtracting about 3 points by assertion; the shared chain now produces the answer mechanically instead. Fully extrapolated; no L461 will be ten years old until 2033. Comparable: 2016 Range Rover Sport 3.0 SCV6 HSE Dynamic, 78,000 km, 車商售價 1,080,000 on 8891 — both the right age and close to this checkpoint's 70,000 km. CHAIN, identical in both records: 1,080,000 cut 15% for private sale gives 918,000 — 15% rather than the 13% used at years 1 to 7, because private demand for a ten-year Range Rover in Taiwan is genuinely thin and 15% is the far edge of the band the brief allows, and this now replaces the vaguer 'wider than the standard band' language the earlier draft used; mileage credit for 78,000 km against 70,000 km is one point, giving 927,180; trim step HSE Dynamic to S at 0.820 — one step wider than the 0.880 used for a plain HSE, because HSE Dynamic sits above HSE in the L494 range — gives 760,288, set at 760,000, or 18.5%. The chain does not divide by the L494 SCV6 HSE Dynamic list of about 4,480,000 the earlier draft used, which was UNSOURCED for the same reason as at year 7. Supporting L494 evidence at nine to twelve years, all confirmed on 8891 or abc好車網: 2017 3.0 SDV6 HSE, 79,000 km, 1,180,000; 2017 3.0 SCV6 HSE Dynamic, 100,000 km, 958,000; 2017 3.0 SCV6 HSE Dynamic, mileage undisclosed, 1,280,000 on abc好車網; 2015 3.0 V6 SC HSE Dynamic, 105,000 km, 988,000; 2014 3.0 V6 SC HSE, 49,632 km, 990,000. WHERE THIS SITS: 18.5% is at the bottom edge of the German group (X5 40i 18, Q8 18, GLE 450 19, Cayenne 19, Q7 45 TDI 20, X5 30d 21, GLE 300 d 22) and just under the Velar and Evoque at 19% each, which is the correct shape — the Sport is the priciest of the three Land Rovers in that comparison, so it should keep the smallest percentage of the three. It sits 0.2 points under the D300 S at 18.7% while staying 30,000 above it in absolute money. The reasons the record gives for a hard ten-year tail still stand and are what keep this at the bottom of the group rather than the middle: a ten-year-old Range Rover is close to unsellable privately in Taiwan, and the L461 carries materially more electrical content than the L494 (Pivi Pro, 48V belt-integrated starter-generator, more modules), all of it past expected life by year 10 alongside the air springs and compressor. The low odometer does not rescue this, because the expensive failures are age-driven. Confidence low. Trade-in 646,000 is 15.0% under private sale — at this age most dealers will only take the car as a wholesale trade."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Covered by both the 3-year factory warranty and the multi-year 原廠保養 programme (landrover.tw standard-warranty and service-plans, both opened; programme terms from the opened 8891 新車頻道 July 2026 article). At 7,000 km the car reaches its first service on the calendar, not on distance, and the scheduled work is free on covered trims. Raised from 8,000 in the earlier draft to 12,000 because the promotion article qualifies the free-maintenance term with 'select trims' and 'varies by authorised dealer contract', and the P400 S is the entry trim — the earlier draft assumed the headline term applied to it without evidence. The 12,000 is genuine out-of-pocket only: wipers and one alignment, both named exclusions, plus a small allowance for the trim risk. Confidence downgraded from high to medium: the warranty and plan pages are solid, but the actual out-of-pocket amounts here have no Taiwan price source behind them. Not touched by the 2026-08-22 cross-check, which concerned the resale curve only; see plan_notes for the open divergence against the D300 S record's years 1-3."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers years 1-3 only. Still inside both the warranty and the free maintenance programme, so this is the cheapest window of the car's life and the figure is low by design rather than by omission. At 21,000 km the original brake pads are not yet due on a car this lightly driven, and the original tyres are only three years old so they are not yet age-expired. Raised from 35,000 in the earlier draft to 52,000 for the same reason as year 1: the promotion article restricts the headline free-servicing term to select trims and lets dealer contracts vary it, so an entry-trim S may be paying for one of these three services. The rest is alignments, wipers and a kerb-damage / tyre-repair allowance appropriate to low-profile 22-inch rubber on Taiwan roads. Any mechanical or electrical failure in this window is a warranty claim, not an owner cost. Confidence downgraded from high to medium — the programme boundary for this specific trim is not published. Not touched by the 2026-08-22 cross-check; see plan_notes for the open divergence against the D300 S record."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers years 3-5, and is untouched by the 2026-08-22 cross-check. The step up has one clear cause: the 3-year / 100,000 km warranty ended at year 3 (confirmed on the opened landrover.tw standard-warranty page) while free scheduled maintenance is probably still running, so the owner pays nothing for servicing but everything for wear, age and repair. Tyres, brake pads and wipers are named exclusions in the 8891 promotion article, so all three sit with the owner regardless of the plan. Tyre cost is age-driven, not mileage-driven — a set of four 22-inch tyres for a 2.4-tonne Sport runs 20,000-25,000 each fitted, so 88,000 is a mid-market figure rather than a dealer price. The transmission fluid figure of about 30,000 scales an owner-reported Discovery Sport figure of roughly 23,000 up to a 3.0 straight-six Sport; that owner thread (Mobile01) returned HTTP 403 and has been deleted from sources[], so treat this line as unsourced. The 25,000 electrical allowance is modest for JLR precisely because a factory programme is probably still active and dealers absorb some goodwill work while the customer is still in the network."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers years 5-7 and is the window where this record separates hardest from its German siblings; untouched by the 2026-08-22 cross-check. The free maintenance programme runs out somewhere in years 4-6 (landrover.tw service-plans caps it at six years; the 8891 新車頻道 article shows the Sport benefit applies to select trims and varies by dealer contract), so servicing moves fully onto the owner mid-period — I bill roughly 1.5 services rather than 2 to reflect that uncertainty. The air suspension line is the defining JLR cost and it is age-driven: air springs perish on rubber age plus Taiwan heat and humidity, so a 49,000 km car is exposed exactly as much as a high-mileage one, and 6-8 years is the normal Taiwan failure window. One strut plus a valve block at about 110,000 is a single-corner assumption, deliberately not a full four-corner replacement, which is held back to the 7-10 window. Spark plugs and coils are the item that exists here and not on the diesel D300 S record; conversely nothing in this record carries DPF cost. Confidence is low because no L461 has reached seven years in Taiwan and these are L494-era and Ingenium-family repair costs applied forward, with no live price citation behind any individual line."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers years 7-10, entirely out of warranty and out of the maintenance programme, and this is where the brief's rule that a Range Rover must not look like an X5 is actually paid for; untouched by the 2026-08-22 cross-check. Roughly 470,000 of this 770,000 is repair risk rather than scheduled work, and it is concentrated in items the German siblings do not carry at the same severity: the air suspension on a heavier body, the 48V belt-integrated starter-generator standard on every P400, the Ingenium water pump and front-cover oil leaks, and JLR's Taiwan electrical and infotainment record. The big-ticket allowances are probability-weighted rather than booked at full replacement cost — a timing chain job on an Ingenium six is nearer 120,000 if it happens, and a BiSG unit nearer 110,000, but neither is certain on a 70,000 km car, so each is carried at roughly half. Tyres appear a second time because at 7,000 km/year they are always replaced on age, never worn out. Ten-year cumulative maintenance is 1,484,000 (12,000 + 52,000 + 240,000 + 410,000 + 770,000), about 48% above the X5 anchor and 63% above the GLE; that divergence is intentional and is carried by this period and the previous one. Confidence is low — no current-generation car has reached this age anywhere, and these figures come from L494 and Ingenium-family repair experience projected forward with no live Taiwan price citation."}],"sources":[{"name":"Land Rover Taiwan (rangerover.com/zh-tw) — 26MY Range Rover and Range Rover Sport lineup announcement","url":"https://www.rangerover.com/zh-tw/news/rr-rrs-26my.html","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED. Official 建議售價. Range Rover Sport 26MY: D300 S 3,990,000 / P400 S 4,190,000 / P400 Dynamic SE 4,760,000 / P635 SV Carbon 7,300,000. Confirms the P400 S list price of 4,190,000 used in this record and the Ingenium 3.0 straight-six MHEV petrol spec, 400 PS / 550 Nm. No maintenance programme is mentioned on this page. PROMOTED BY THE 2026-08-22 CROSS-CHECK: this ladder is now load-bearing twice over. It sets list_price, and it also supplies the two trim ratios used in every resale checkpoint — S to Dynamic SE at 4,190,000 / 4,760,000 = 0.880, and D300 S to P400 S at 3,990,000 / 4,190,000 = 0.952. Those ratios replace the unsourced L494 list prices the earlier drafts of both Sport records divided by."},{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點 — RANGE ROVER SPORT 導入全新 P400 S 車型","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/115746","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED. Independent confirmation of the 4,190,000 P400 S price and the same four-variant 26MY ladder. Describes the engine as Ingenium 3.0L straight-six mild hybrid petrol, same output as the P400 Dynamic SE, positioned between D300 S and P400 Dynamic SE."},{"name":"壹蘋新聞網 — Range Rover Sport 新增 P400 S 車型","url":"https://news.nextapple.com/auto/20260312/65EA770E34426D153640EEC74EF5E8A8","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED. Third confirmation of the 26MY prices and the P400 S positioning. Also states the SV Carbon is limited to 30 units in Taiwan."},{"name":"UDN 發燒車訊 — 2026年式 Range Rover 與 Range Rover Sport 正式上市","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/9373219","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED. Fourth confirmation of the same four prices. Gives the launch date 2026-03-11 and the '配備提升、價格不變' framing, which is why the P400 S is treated as a five-month-old trim with limited discount room. Notes the 26MY equipment additions (door soft-close, quad-zone climate)."},{"name":"Carbook 車書 — Land Rover Range Rover Sport 2026款 新車價格、規格與中古行情","url":"https://carbook.tw/newcars/land-rover-range-rover-sport","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED 2026-08-22 BY THE CROSS-CHECK PASS. Fifth independent confirmation of the same four 26MY prices (D300 S 3,990,000 / P400 S 4,190,000 / P400 Dynamic SE 4,760,000 / P635 SV Carbon 7,300,000). Its 中古行情 table (2025 median 137.8萬, 2023 106.8萬, 2019 70.0萬, 2016 54.3萬) is impossible for a car listing at 399-419萬 and is a scraping error or a cross-model aggregate; it is discarded entirely and feeds no value_checkpoint. Recorded here for one further reason: the site carries no pre-2026 model-year page for this nameplate, which is part of why the L494 Taiwan list price could not be sourced in either Sport record."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Land Rover Range Rover Sport 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/land-rover/range-rover-sport","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED, most recently on 2026-08-22. Primary used-price source, and the source of the largest corrections in this record. All figures here are 車商售價 (dealer retail asking), NOT what an owner receives; the shared chain cuts 13% to reach 自售 at years 1-7 and 15% at year 10, then a further 12-15% to reach 車商收購價. 40 Range Rover Sport cars listed nationwide, which is why asking prices are treated as soft. CONFIRMED ON 2026-08-22: the page carries NO 新車價 column for any model year, which is why the L494 original list price could not be sourced here. EARLIER CORRECTIONS, RETAINED: the first draft cited a '2024 P400 Dynamic SE / 12,000 km / 3,238,000' as the year-1 anchor — no 2024 model-year car is listed and no listing asks 3,238,000, so that data point does not exist and year 1 was rebuilt without it; and the draft said a '2023 P400 Dynamic SE at 90,000 km asking 3,188,000' was discarded as an outlier, when the page shows 3,188,000 belongs to a 30,000 km car and the 90,000 km car asks 2,598,000. Listings confirmed on the page and used here, now shared with the D300 S record: 2023 P400 Dynamic SE 22,300 km 3,180,000 and 30,000 km 3,188,000 (the year-3 primary pair, and the roll-back basis for year 1); 2023 P400 Dynamic SE 50,000 km 2,880,000 and 2,888,000, 80,000 km 2,688,000, 96,500 km 2,688,000, and three at 90,000-98,000 km 2,598,000; 2023 D300 Dynamic SE 33,000 km 2,880,000 (the D300 S record's year-3 cross-check); 2022 P400 HSE Dynamic 37,000 km 1,988,000; 2021 P400 HSE 3.0 71,200 km 1,850,000 (the year-5 primary, engine-matched); 2021 P300 HSE 59,000 km 1,798,000, 68,000 km 1,558,000, 70,300 km 1,580,000; 2019 3.0 SCV6 HSE 68,300 km 1,680,000 (the year-7 primary, and the listing the two Sport records previously read 330,000 apart); 2019 3.0 SCV6 HSE 160,000 km 1,198,000; 2019 2.0 Si4 HSE 100,000 km 1,358,000; 2016 3.0 SCV6 HSE Dynamic 78,000 km 1,080,000 (the year-10 primary); 2017 3.0 SDV6 HSE 79,000 km 1,180,000; 2017 3.0 SCV6 HSE Dynamic 100,000 km 958,000; 2015 3.0 V6 SC HSE Dynamic 105,000 km 988,000; 2014 3.0 V6 SC HSE 49,632 km 990,000. Every listing is a five-door Range Rover Sport, matching this record's body style."},{"name":"8891 新車頻道 — 七月買 Land Rover 全車系豪贈最高6年原廠免保養","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/land-rover/range-rover/22144","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED, with corrections. Confirms Range Rover Sport is among the models getting multi-year free 原廠保養, but qualifies it as applying to SELECT TRIMS ('0-6 年') and states terms vary by authorised dealer contract — the earliest draft treated a flat 5-year term for the Sport as settled, which this page does not support, so years 1 and 3 of the maintenance curve were raised. Also confirms complimentary electric side steps on Range Rover and Sport and a first-year 車體險 subsidy. TWO FURTHER CORRECTIONS: the 0% 72-month financing ceiling is stated as up to 3,000,000 for the Range Rover flagships and 1,800,000 for Evoque, so the draft's '2,400,000 on the Sport' is unsupported; and the campaign registration deadline is 2026-07-31, so this specific programme had ENDED by today's date. Most useful confirmed detail: the plan covers periodic materials and labour per factory specification and EXCLUDES wear items, naming brake pads, tyres and wiper blades — this is what puts those items in the owner's column at every checkpoint. The article states no cash discount figure, so the 150,000 in purchase.discounts remains an estimate. OPEN ITEM RECORDED BY THE 2026-08-22 CROSS-CHECK: the D300 S record declines to credit this campaign at all and costs its years 1-3 higher as a result. See maintenance.plan_notes."},{"name":"Land Rover Taiwan — 原廠保固","url":"https://www.landrover.tw/ownership/warranty/standard-warranty.html","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED. Standard new-car warranty confirmed as 100,000 公里或 3 年 全方位原廠保固與道路救援服務, whichever comes first. At 7,000 km/year only the time limit binds, so the car is out of warranty at year 3 with 21,000 km. This is the hinge for the year-5 maintenance step up and for the year-5 resale discount against the German anchors. Identical reading in the D300 S record."},{"name":"Land Rover Taiwan — 原廠保養專案計畫","url":"https://www.landrover.tw/ownership/service-and-maintenance/service-plans.html","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED. Confirms the maintenance plan runs to a maximum of six years, is usable at any authorised service centre, uses genuine parts with a 12-month parts warranty, and — relevant to the year-3 and year-5 resale figures — that all remaining benefits transfer to the new owner if the car is sold before the plan expires. No prices are published, which is why every maintenance amount in this record is an estimate rather than a quoted figure. The page describes a purchasable product and does not itself state that the plan is free with a new car; the free-servicing claim in this record rests on the separate 8891 campaign article, and the D300 S record reads the same page without crediting that campaign. See maintenance.plan_notes."},{"name":"abc好車網 — 2017 Range Rover Sport 3.0 SCV6 HSE Dynamic listing","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2184191","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED. Nine-year-old L494 dealer asking price of 1,280,000 at 毅龍汽車, used as a cross-check on the year-10 extrapolation. Mileage is not disclosed on the listing, which is why it is a supporting rather than a primary data point."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — Land Rover Range Rover Sport 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LAND+ROVER&model=RANGE+ROVER+SPORT","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED, with a correction. The earliest draft claimed this page shows 'a stated market average of about 1,729,000 across 51 Range Rover Sport cars'. It does not: the page carries exactly ONE listing, a 2018 2.0 at 102,000 km in Taoyuan asking 1,438,000, and that single car is also the stated average. The corrected reading still supports the same judgement the draft drew from it — this model trades extremely thinly in Taiwan — but the '51 cars' figure was wrong and has been removed. The listing detail also confirms the body style as 五門五人座 with air suspension and electric side steps, matching this record."}]},"landrover-range-rover-velar-p250":{"assumptions":"At 7,000 km/year this Velar never reaches a mileage-driven service trigger, so the service interval is time-driven for all ten years. The new-car warranty is 3 years or 100,000 km. I confirmed that term verbatim on the official Land Rover Taiwan warranty page. IMPORTANT CORRECTION TO THE PRIOR RECORD: the prior record built its whole cost shape on a '6-year or 102,000 km free scheduled-maintenance programme'. I fetched both official pages myself. The warranty page states only the 3-year/100,000 km warranty, the paint and anti-corrosion terms, and a 12-month parts warranty. The servicing page describes only 彈性保養服務 and states no free-maintenance term at all. The 6-year claim is therefore unverified, and this record no longer assumes it. Scheduled servicing is treated as owner-paid from year 4, which is the first year outside the one term I could actually confirm. That moves real cost earlier and removes the artificial year-6 cliff the prior record created. Two mileage effects work in the owner's favour on resale: the 8891 Velar pool is dominated by cars at 60,000-120,000 km by year 5-8, so a 35,000 km 5-year car and a 49,000 km 7-year car sit at the top of their year cohort. One caveat found in the live data: in the 2021-2022 Velar band the asking prices cluster at 145-160萬 almost regardless of distance, so the low-mileage credit is much smaller than a naive mileage curve implies. One effect works against the owner: the 2.0 Ingenium petrol runs annual oil services on the calendar, not on use. The Belgravia Edition rides on coil springs with adaptive dampers, not the electronic air suspension of the six-cylinder Velars, so the classic Range Rover air-compressor and air-strut bill does not apply. The later-period suspension risk is dampers, bushings and arms instead.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"RAISED from the prior record's 2,180,000. Best 1-year comparable in the 8891 Velar pool (https://auto.8891.com.tw/land-rover/range-rover-velar), which I fetched myself: a 2025 P250 Dynamic SE at 21,400 km asking 268萬 車商售價. Every price on 8891 is dealer retail asking, confirmed on the page. The denominator is no longer an estimate: the official 25MY spec PDF lists P250 DYNAMIC SE at 3,530,000, so the dealer retail ask is 268/353 = 75.9% of list. Cutting 11.5% to reach a realistic 自售 figure gives 237萬, i.e. 67.2% of that car's list. Scaling to our car's smaller 329萬 list gives 237 x (329/353) = 221萬. Our car has 7,000 km against that comparable's 21,400 km, which supports a further credit; I hold that credit as a cushion rather than spending it, and set 2,210,000 (68.6% of real_cost 3,220,000). WHY THE PRIOR FIGURE WAS WRONG: it cited a '2024 P250 S at 3,872 km asking 248萬' as a 2-year cross-check implying about 70% private, then set the 1-year car at 67.7% - which would put the 1-year car BELOW its own 2-year comparable (218萬 against about 221萬 private). I could not find that 3,872 km listing on either page of the live pool. The real 2-year car on page 2 is a 2024 P250 S at 24,000 km asking 198萬 (about 175萬 private), and 2,210,000 sits correctly above it. Versus anchors, 68.6% is below the Audi Q5 (70%), BMW X3 (74%), Mercedes GLC (74%) and Volvo XC60 (73%), which is the required position for Land Rover. Dealer trade-in 1,910,000 is 13.6% below private sale; JLR trade-in spreads run at the wide end of the 10-15% band because dealers price in warranty-transfer and reconditioning risk on the brand."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"UNCHANGED in value, but re-derived from listings I verified and DOWNGRADED from 'high' to 'medium' confidence. The prior record rested this checkpoint on a '2023 P250 R-Dynamic S at 22,000 km asking 199.8萬'. That listing does not appear on either page of the live 8891 Velar pool that I fetched, so I do not rely on it. The 2023 cars I can actually see are 32,000 km / 188.8萬 and 34,700 km / 189.0萬, plus 80,000 km and 86,000 km both at 175.8萬 - all 車商售價. Taking the 188.8萬 car and cutting 11.5% for a private sale gives 167萬 at 32,000 km. Our car is at 21,000 km, which supports a small credit, and the independent ceiling is the 2-year 2024 P250 S at 24,000 km / 198萬 dealer, about 175萬 private - a 3-year car must sit below that. Both routes land in the 167-172萬 band, so 1,690,000 (52.5% of real_cost) survives the recheck unchanged. DIVERGENCE FROM ANCHORS, STATED: 52.5% is 13 points below the BMW X3 anchor (66%) and 10 below the Mercedes GLC (62%). The reason is that the 3-year/100,000 km warranty - the one term I confirmed verbatim on landrover.tw - has just expired at this checkpoint, and the buyer pool for an out-of-warranty Range Rover in Taiwan thins sharply at exactly the point where an X3 or a GLC still sells easily. My figure sits between the Audi Q5 anchor (50%) and the Volvo XC60 anchor (55%), which is the right company. Dealer trade-in 1,450,000 is 14.2% below private sale."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REDUCED from the prior record's 1,450,000, which was too high. The prior record built this from a '2021 P250 S at 34,000 km asking 208萬', called that ask an outlier, then still used a figure above what the rest of the pool supports. I could not find that 208萬 listing on either page of the live pool. What the pool actually contains across both pages, all 車商售價: 2022 P250 R-Dynamic S at 6,000 km / 155.8萬; 2022 P250 R-Dynamic S at 41,000 km / 159.8萬; 2022 P250 R-Dynamic S at 110,000 km / 145.0萬; 2021 P250 R-Dynamic S at 67,000 km / 155.8萬; 2021 P250 R-Dynamic S at 89,000 km / 149.0萬. The decisive one is the 4-year car at 6,000 km asking 155.8萬 - LOWER mileage than our 5-year 35,000 km car and a year YOUNGER, yet asking the same as a 67,000 km 2021. That is the finding: in this band the Velar market has a floor and mileage barely moves it, so the large low-mileage credit the prior record applied is not supported by the evidence. Cutting the 155.8-159.8萬 cluster by 11.5% gives 138-141萬 private for 4-year cars; a 5-year car at 35,000 km belongs just under that. I set 1,370,000 (42.5% of real_cost). Versus anchors, 42.5% sits below the BMW X3 (49%), Mercedes GLC (51%) and Volvo XC60 (49%) and above the Audi Q5 (35%), which is the correct position for a Land Rover. Dealer trade-in 1,175,000 is 14.2% below private sale."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REDUCED from the prior record's 1,090,000 and DOWNGRADED to low confidence. Real 7-year and 8-year cars exist because the Velar reached Taiwan in May 2018. The only true 7-year P250 comparable in the pool is a 2019 P250 S at 112,000 km asking 95萬 車商售價, about 84萬 private. The dense 8-year evidence is the 2018 P250 S cluster at 72,000-79,000 km: 93.0萬, 95.8萬, 99.8萬 and 105.8萬 車商售價, i.e. about 82-94萬 private. Our car is one year younger than that cluster and at 49,000 km carries much less distance, but the year-5 finding above shows this pool does not pay a large mileage premium, so I apply a restrained credit rather than the 20-25% a naive curve would give. That puts a 7-year, 49,000 km car near 118萬 dealer retail and about 105萬 private. I set 1,050,000 (32.6% of real_cost). I DISCOUNT the 168.8萬 ask at abc好車網 (https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2160190) entirely: I opened it and the page states neither the trim nor the mileage, so the prior record's 'about 40,000 km' is not supported by the listing, and at 168.8萬 it would price a 7-year car above every 2021 and 2022 car in the 8891 pool, which no consistent curve supports. Versus anchors, 32.6% is below the Mercedes GLC (41%), BMW X3 (37%) and Volvo XC60 (37%) and above the Audi Q5 (24%). The stated reason for the gap to the German three is that an out-of-warranty 7-year Range Rover in Taiwan carries a repair-risk discount they do not - the 2018 cluster proves it, sitting at 27-30% of a 309萬 list. Dealer trade-in 900,000 is 14.3% below private sale."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, and REDUCED from the prior record's 660,000. No 10-year Velar exists - the model reached Taiwan in May 2018, so the oldest cars are 8 years old. PROXY: Range Rover Evoque L538 at 10 years, from the 8891 Evoque pool (https://auto.8891.com.tw/land-rover/range-rover-evoque), which I fetched and checked for body style because the L538 was also sold as a 3-door Coupe and a Convertible. The cars I use are confirmed five-door: 2016 2.0 5D SE at 137,000 km / 56.8萬 and 2016 2.0 Si4 5D HSE at 100,000 km / 55.5萬. I DROP the third car the prior record used, the 2016 Si4 HSE Dynamic at 125,000 km / 49.8萬, because its listing carries no 5D marker and I cannot confirm the body style. Against an original list near 275萬 those five-door cars show 20-21% dealer retail retention, so a private sale 11.5% under those asks is 18-18.5% of original list. WHY THE PRIOR FIGURE WAS WRONG: it lifted the PRIVATE ratio to 20.5%, which put a private sale at 10 years at or above the DEALER RETAIL ratio of its own proxies - internally impossible - and left the Velar 4.5 points ABOVE the Audi Q5 anchor (16%) in the tail, contradicting the rule that Land Rover's 7-10 year tail is worse than the German brands because out-of-warranty repair risk in Taiwan is severe. Our car reaches only 70,000 km at 10 years, about half the proxies' distance, which justifies a small lift but not one that inverts the dealer/private relationship. I set 610,000 (18.9% of real_cost). INDEPENDENT CROSS-CHECK, and this is why the corrected figure is better than the old one: interpolating between the 7-year figure (32.6%) and this 10-year figure (18.9%) gives about 28% at 8 years, and the real 8-year 2018 Velar P250 S cluster (93.0-105.8萬 dealer retail against a 309萬 list, so 26.5-30.4% private) brackets that exactly. The prior pair of figures interpolated high against the same real data. Versus anchors, 18.9% is below the Mercedes GLC (27%) and BMW X3 (24%) and just above the Audi Q5 (16%). Dealer trade-in 522,000 is 14.4% below private sale, inside the 10-15% band; the prior record's 560,000 against 660,000 was a 15.2% spread, outside it."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Cost is low because the car is new and inside the 3-year/100,000 km warranty confirmed on https://www.landrover.tw/ownership/warranty/warranty-and-roadside-assistance.html. Anything faulty is a warranty claim. RAISED from the prior record's 6,000, which assumed a free-service programme I could not verify and then still charged only wipers and one alignment. Even with the first service treated as covered or near-nominal, 12,000 is the realistic floor for a set of wiper blades and a four-wheel alignment on 21-inch wheels at Land Rover labour rates, plus small consumables. At 7,000 km the service is triggered by the 12-month clock, not by distance."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers years 1 to 3, the last cheap period. The car is inside the confirmed 3-year/100,000 km warranty for the whole window, so every fault is a claim and the scheduled items are at worst nominal. RAISED from the prior record's 20,000 for the same reason as year 1: the prior figure assumed an unverified free-service programme covered both annual services outright. 35,000 covers two years of wipers, alignment, tyre rotation and small consumables at Land Rover pricing, with the scheduled work itself treated as covered or near-nominal. At 21,000 km the brake pads are barely worn and the original tyres are only three years old, so neither falls in this window. The warranty expires at the end of it, which is the hinge of the whole record."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers years 3 to 5 and is where the correction bites hardest. RAISED from the prior record's 185,000. The prior record kept both annual services free here on the strength of the unverified 6-year programme; this record charges them, because the only term I could confirm - the 3-year warranty - has expired before this window opens. A self-paid annual service at a Land Rover dealer in Taiwan is 20,000-30,000 for oil, filters and inspection, so 50,000 for two is realistic. Tyres dominate the rest: at 7,000 km/year the 21-inch tyres are replaced on age at about 5 years, not on tread, and a set of four premium 21-inch tyres in Taiwan runs 60,000-80,000. Front pads and discs at 35,000 km on a 1,875 kg car (DIN kerb weight, from the official spec sheet) are due. The AGM 12V battery is a 4-6 year item and JLR batteries need registration to the BMS, so it is a dealer job. The 55,000 fault reserve is the important line: the warranty ended at year 3, and Taiwan owner reports for this era of JLR centre on the Pivi/InControl head unit, parking sensors and body electrics rather than the drivetrain."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers years 5 to 7. Only slightly above the prior record's 225,000, but for sound reasons rather than a programme expiry: both annual services in this window are owner-paid, and the year-7 one coincides with spark plugs and brake fluid, which is why 75,000 covers the pair rather than the 40,000 the prior record allowed for a single year. The Ingenium four's known items land here: spark plugs on the 6-year clock, and the water pump and thermostat, a documented weak point on this engine family and a 30,000-40,000 job because the belt drive sits inside the timing case. The ZF 8HP oil and filter change is not on JLR's schedule but every Taiwan specialist recommends it by year 7. Rear brakes come due at 49,000 km having not been touched at year 5. The 65,000 fault reserve is larger than the year-5 one because nothing is covered any more: turbo actuator and vacuum ancillaries, infotainment modules, and damper and bushing wear all become owner cost. NOT INCLUDED, and this is a real saving specific to this trim: no air-suspension compressor and no air-strut replacement, because the P250 Belgravia uses coil springs; and no 48V starter-generator, because the official 25MY spec sheet lists no MHEV system on this engine."},{"y":10,"source":"EXTRAPOLATED for a 10-year Velar, which does not exist yet in Taiwan - the model arrived in May 2018 and the oldest cars are 8 years old. REDUCED from the prior record's 535,000, and the reduction is deliberate. The prior record booked a timing chain, tensioner and guide replacement at 90,000 as a near-certain line. On the Ingenium 2.0 PETROL at only 70,000 km that is not a scheduled or expected job - the notorious chain failures on this engine family were concentrated on the early 2.0 diesel and on high-hour, poor-oil-history cars. Treating it as certain overstated the total, so I carry it as a probability-weighted reserve of 45,000 instead, and say so plainly. I also trimmed the damper and arm line from 85,000 to 70,000 for the same low-distance reason. Three years of fully self-paid dealer servicing at about 32,000 each is the base. The second tyre set is again an age replacement, not a tread replacement, at 70,000 km total. Damper and bushing refresh replaces what would be air-strut work on an air-sprung Velar. The A/C compressor and the electrical reserve reflect the Taiwan climate and this generation's infotainment and body-electrics record. TOTAL 10-YEAR MAINTENANCE is 1,032,000 (12,000 + 35,000 + 240,000 + 250,000 + 495,000)."}],"sources":[{"name":"發燒車訊 / udn 國內車訊 - Range Rover Velar、Evoque 新年式車型登台","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/9537706","note":"Fetched and read by me. Confirms 'Velar P250 Belgravia Edition 建議售價 329 萬元起' and Evoque P250 from 228 萬元起. No warranty or maintenance terms on this page."},{"name":"地球黃金線 TVBS - Velar、Evoque 年式升級，Belgravia 與 Hoxton 車型同步登場","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/324329","note":"Fetched and read by me. Second independent confirmation: 'Velar P250 Belgravia Edition建議售價329萬元起'. No engine table."},{"name":"8891 新車 - 新年式 Range Rover Velar 與 Evoque 上市","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/land-rover/range-rover-evoque/21897","note":"Fetched and read by me. Third confirmation of 329萬 and the source for the single-trim fact: '新年式Range Rover Velar車型精簡，僅導入P250 Belgravia Edition單一等級，售價329萬'."},{"name":"Land Rover 台灣 - 25MY Range Rover Velar 官方規格表 (PDF)","url":"https://www.landrover.tw/content/dam/lrdx/pdfs/Taiwan/25MY_Range_Rover_Velar_Spec.pdf","note":"Fetched AND successfully extracted. The prior record called this 'a scanned-image PDF with no extractable text' - that is incorrect; it embeds 97 font objects and its text streams decompress to readable content. Extracted: two 25MY trims, P250 S at 3,170,000 and P250 DYNAMIC SE at 3,530,000; one engine for both - Ingenium 2.0L, 1,997 cc, 250 PS/5,500 rpm, 365 Nm/1,300-4,500 rpm; CommandShift 8-speed ZF; 0-100 km/h 7.5 s; 217 km/h; 10.01/13.33/11.9 km/L; 1,875 kg DIN; 4,797 mm long, 2,874 mm wheelbase, 1,683 mm tall, 213 mm ground clearance. NO MHEV or 48V entry anywhere on the sheet - documentary support for the 'gasoline' classification. The 3,530,000 figure is the confirmed denominator for the year-1 checkpoint."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Range Rover Velar 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/land-rover/range-rover-velar","note":"Fetched and read by me, BOTH pages of the 50-car pool. Primary used-price source for years 1, 3, 5 and 7. Every price is 車商售價 (dealer retail asking), stated on the page; I cut 11.5% to reach the 自售 figures. Page 1: 2025 P250 Dynamic SE 21,400 km / 268萬; 2023 P250 R-Dynamic S 32,000 km / 188.8萬, 34,700 km / 189.0萬, 80,000 km / 175.8萬, 86,000 km / 175.8萬; 2022 P250 R-Dynamic S 41,000 km / 159.8萬; 2021 P250 R-Dynamic S 67,000 km / 155.8萬; 2019 P250 S 112,000 km / 95萬; 2018 P250 S 72,000 km / 95.8萬, 73,200 km / 93.0萬, 79,000 km / 105.8萬. Page 2: 2024 P250 S 24,000 km / 198萬; 2022 P250 R-Dynamic S 6,000 km / 155.8萬 and 110,000 km / 145.0萬; 2021 P250 R-Dynamic S 89,000 km / 149.0萬; 2018 P250 S 74,000 km / 99.8萬. NOT FOUND on either page, despite being cited by the prior record: a 2023 at 22,000 km / 199.8萬, a 2021 P250 S at 34,000 km / 208萬, a 2024 P250 S at 3,872 km / 248萬, and a 2024 P250 S at 22,000 km / 203.8萬. Those four are not relied on in this record."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Range Rover Evoque 二手價格行情","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/land-rover/range-rover-evoque","note":"Fetched and read by me. Used ONLY as the 10-year proxy, because no 10-year Velar exists. Body style was checked deliberately, because the Evoque L538 was also sold as a 3-door Coupe and a Convertible and only the five-door is a valid proxy for the Velar. Confirmed five-door: 2016 2.0 5D SE 137,000 km / 56.8萬 and 2016 2.0 Si4 5D HSE 100,000 km / 55.5萬. EXCLUDED: 2016 Si4 HSE Dynamic 125,000 km / 49.8萬, used by the prior record, because its listing carries no 5D marker and I cannot confirm the body style. Against an original list near 275萬 the confirmed five-doors show 20-21% dealer retail retention at 10 years."},{"name":"Land Rover 台灣 - 保固與道路救援","url":"https://www.landrover.tw/ownership/warranty/warranty-and-roadside-assistance.html","note":"Fetched and read by me. Warranty confirmed verbatim: '您可享有 100,000 公里或 3 年全方位原廠保固與道路救援服務'. Also states a 6-year anti-corrosion term and a 12-month parts and accessories warranty. The page does NOT state any free scheduled-maintenance term. This is the only maintenance-relevant term in this record that is directly quoted from the manufacturer."},{"name":"Land Rover 台灣 - 保養 (車主服務)","url":"https://www.landrover.tw/ownership/servicing/index.html","note":"Fetched and read by me. CONTRADICTS the prior record, which cited this page for a '6-year / 102,000 km free scheduled-maintenance programme'. The page states no free-maintenance term at all. It describes only 彈性保養服務, which '會根據駕駛風格和情況，計算車輛何時需要保養'. Because that programme could not be confirmed on any official page, this record no longer assumes it and charges scheduled servicing to the owner from year 4."},{"name":"abc 好車網 - 2019 Range Rover Velar, 金程汽車","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2160190","note":"Fetched and read by me. Dealer listing at 168.8萬. The page states NEITHER the trim NOR the mileage, so the prior record's 'about 40,000 km' is not supported by the listing and the car cannot be confirmed as a P250 rather than a 3.0 P380. DISCOUNTED entirely when setting the 7-year figure: at 168.8萬 it would price a 7-year car above every 2021 and 2022 car in the 8891 pool."},{"name":"abc 好車網 - 2018 Range Rover Velar S P250, 元禾國際車業","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2179782","note":"Fetched and read by me. 2018 S P250 asking 108.8萬 dealer retail; trim confirmed, but the page states no mileage. Used only as a soft upper bound on the 8-year cluster, not as a mileage-matched comparable."},{"name":"Range Rover 官方 - 26MY Range Rover / Range Rover Sport 新聞頁","url":"https://www.rangerover.com/zh-tw/news/rr-rrs-26my.html","note":"Fetched and read. This is the URL the scout pass cited for the 3,290,000 list price, but it contains NO Velar price - only 26MY Range Rover (615萬-1,030萬) and Range Rover Sport (399萬-730萬). Retained only to document that the scout citation was wrong; the price is sourced to the three Taiwan media pages above."}]},"lexus-is300h-flagship":{"assumptions":"At 7,000 km/year this car is time-driven, not mileage-driven. Lexus Taiwan sets the interval at 每半年或1萬公里, whichever comes first, and the 原廠認證機油 page states 低頻車行駛每半年 for the oil change. The owner never reaches 10,000 km inside six months, so the calendar always triggers first: 2 visits a year, 20 visits in 10 years, for only 70,000 km. WARRANTY: lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx was re-opened on 2026-08-22 and grants 自交車日起 4 年或行駛 120,000 公里 PLUS a free 5th year / 140,000 km to an owner who services every six months without delay. This owner services every six months by construction, so the 5th year is earned and the first uncovered year is year 6, not year 5. TRACTION BATTERY, CORRECTED IN THIS PASS: the prior draft of this record stated the traction battery is covered 8 years / 160,000 km as a verified fact. Re-reading the same official page shows it names 「Lexus Electrified 電池保證」 with NO published duration. The 8年/160,000km figure is widely quoted in Taiwan but is NOT confirmed on the official page, so it is now treated as unverified in all three IS records. The practical conclusion is unchanged: whatever the term, it lapses on TIME long before this owner's odometer matters, so the year-10 window carries a probability-weighted provision rather than a covered repair. Two car-specific effects on cost: (1) the 旗艦版 runs a SQUARE 235/40 R19 fitment (Lexus spec API, car id 8464, re-confirmed 2026-08-22) which ages out after about 5 years long before 35,000 km wears it out, but unlike the F Sport staggered fitment it can be rotated front to rear; (2) the 2AR-FSE hybrid uses regenerative braking, so at 49,000 km the friction brakes are an age and corrosion job, not a wear job. On the value side, low mileage helps this car because the live IS300h pool on 8891 is mostly 38,000-230,000 km examples.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REBUILT ON A SINGLE FAMILY-WIDE COMPARABLE SET, 1,485,000 -> 1,475,000. THE COMP SET IS NOW SETTLED ONCE FOR ALL THREE IS RECORDS. The live 8891 IS300h page, re-opened 2026-08-22, returns 13 cars, nine of them F Sport, and EVERY 2019-2026 row is an F Sport. No 豪華版 or 旗艦版 of any recent year is listed anywhere in the country. So the F SPORT curve is the measured spine and this car is derived DOWN from it, rather than each record picking its own anchor and drifting out of ladder order. SPINE AT ONE YEAR: 2026 IS300h F Sport, 9,000 km, asking 195.8萬 車商售價, about six months old at 91.5% of the 214萬 F Sport list. Rolling to 12 months and 7,000 km gives about 179.5萬 dealer retail; less 12% for the 車商售價 to 自售價 step gives 1,580,000 private for an F Sport. DERIVATION: the new-price gap from this car to the F SPORT is 152,000 and 68% of it survives at one year, the highest fraction in the schedule because at one year the market is still close to list-proportional and the measured F Sport demand uplift is at its strongest. 1,580,000 - 103,360 = 1,476,640, taken as 1,475,000. LADDER CHECK, which is what the cross-check asked for: 1,425,000 (豪華版) < 1,475,000 (this car) < 1,580,000 (F Sport) in money, and 76.7% > 75.3% > 74.9% in retention. Both orderings correct. Retention 75.3% of the corrected real_cost of 1,958,000, below the ES300h 豪華版 sibling (78.0%) and the ES300h 頂級版 (80.3%), which is the right direction for a low-volume run-out nameplate. Trade-in 1,283,000 is 13.0% below private. Confidence stays LOW: no 2025 IS300h is listed at all and this rests on one confirmed listing plus an age roll and a trim step."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REBUILT ON THE SHARED SPINE, 1,255,000 -> 1,215,000. REAL 2023 LISTINGS, re-opened 2026-08-22 and reconciled across two platforms because they disagree, which the prior draft did not do. 8891 IS300h page: 2023 300h F Sport, 38,000 km, 135.0萬 - note this is the same car the prior draft cited at 149.8萬, and today's page shows 135.0萬, so the higher figure is not carried. 8891 hybrid 2019-2022 board: two 2023 300h F Sport rows at 90,000 km, 135.8萬. SUM 汽車網: a 2023 F Sport hybrid, 46,000 km, 156.8萬. A three-year F Sport therefore asks 135.0-156.8萬, centre about 145萬 at roughly 42,000 km. This buyer's car shows 21,000 km, worth about +2%, giving about 148萬 dealer retail for an F SPORT; less 12% gives the 1,300,000 spine. DERIVATION: 56% of the 152,000 gap survives at three years. 1,300,000 - 85,120 = 1,214,880, taken as 1,215,000. LADDER CHECK: 1,175,000 < 1,215,000 < 1,300,000 in money, 63.2% > 62.1% > 61.6% in retention. Retention 62.1%, below both ES300h siblings (65.4% and 65.6%) and the NX350h 頂級版 (69.2%). ASKING-PRICE STICKINESS is priced in rather than argued separately: the 8891 board prices a 2022 F Sport with 116,000 km at 129.8萬 while a 2021 F Sport with 77,000 km asks 128.8萬, so these asks are mileage-blind dealer anchoring on a scarce nameplate and are not transactions, which is why the 12% haircut is taken off a centre and not off the top of the band. Trade-in 1,057,000 is 13.0% below private."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REBUILT ON THE SHARED SPINE, 1,110,000 -> 1,080,000. THIS IS THE CHECKPOINT THE CROSS-CHECK FLAGGED AS THE WRONG DIRECTION: the prior version put this car at 57.6% retention ABOVE the cheaper 豪華版 at 56.5%, which no stated reason justified. Two corrections fix it. First, real_cost rises to 1,958,000 once the discount is settled at 60,000, which alone removes about a point. Second, both trims are now derived from one spine with one surviving-gap schedule, so the inversion cannot recur by construction. SPINE: the 8891 hybrid 2019-2022 board, re-opened 2026-08-22, returns 24 cars. The 2021 F Sport rows are 138.8萬 at 60,200 km (listed twice), 128.8萬 at 77,000 km, 126.8萬 at 110,000 km and 113.8萬 at 130,000 km. A five-year F Sport at 35,000 km would ask above the 138.8萬 top of that band on a mileage-blind board; it is placed at about 131萬 DEALER RETAIL instead, deliberately below the observed ask, because the board is demonstrably mileage-blind (a 2022 car at 116,000 km asks 129.8萬 against a 2021 car at 77,000 km at 128.8萬). Less 12% gives the 1,155,000 F Sport spine. DERIVATION: 48% of the 152,000 gap survives at five years. 1,155,000 - 72,960 = 1,082,040, taken as 1,080,000. LADDER CHECK: 1,045,000 < 1,080,000 < 1,155,000 in money, 56.2% > 55.2% > 54.7% in retention. Retention 55.2%, 2.4 points above the ES300h 頂級版 sibling (52.8%) and 2.0 under the ES300h 豪華版 (57.2%), and the divergence argument is retained because it is about the nameplate rather than the trim: Lexus Taiwan has launched an all-new ES and the ES 500e now shares the ES showroom page, so the outgoing ES300h is visibly the old shape, while today's used IS300h is the SAME XE30 generation as the new car and has no successor until 2027. Scarcity reinforces this - 13 IS300h cars on the largest platform in the country. Trade-in 940,000 is 13.0% below private. CONFIDENCE MEDIUM: several confirmed same-year listings, but the trim step is modelled because no 旗艦版 of any recent year is listed."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REBUILT ON THE SHARED SPINE, 895,000 -> 863,000. No 2019 IS300h exists in the live 8891 pool - the 2019-2022 board's oldest row is a 2020 300h F Sport asking 126.8萬 with 135,000 km - so this point is bridged rather than measured, and the bridge now runs through the second platform instead of a bare step. SUM 汽車網, re-opened 2026-08-22, carries a 2019 IS at 82.8萬 with 79,073 km and a 2020 IS at 92.8萬 with 71,668 km. This buyer's car is the same age as the 2019 row with 49,000 km, about 62% of its mileage, worth roughly +15%, giving about 95萬 dealer retail for a mid-ladder car. The F SPORT spine is set one trim step above that at about 104.5萬 dealer retail; less 12% gives 920,000 private, which is also inside the 5-to-7-year step band observed on the Lexus hybrid siblings (0.77 to 0.84; 1,155,000 x 0.797 = 920,000). DERIVATION: 38% of the 152,000 gap survives at seven years. 920,000 - 57,760 = 862,240, taken as 863,000. LADDER CHECK: 835,000 < 863,000 < 920,000 in money, 44.9% > 44.1% > 43.6% in retention. Retention 44.1%, between the ES300h 豪華版 (47.8%) and the ES300h 頂級版 (43.0%). RISK NOTED: kingautos.net/tag/lexus-is carries 'Lexus IS 大改款終於要來了！2027 年純電上市'. If the BEV replacement lands on time the year-7 owner is selling an orphaned nameplate, which is the main downside risk here and is why this point stays low confidence. The SUM rows are also not confirmed to be 300h hybrids rather than gasoline IS300, so the anchor carries real width."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REBUILT ON THE SHARED SPINE, 580,000 -> 568,000. THIS IS THE BLOCKER THE CROSS-CHECK RAISED: at 580,000 this car resold for 40,000 LESS than the cheaper 豪華版 at 620,000, even though it costs more new. That ordering is now impossible because all three curves come off one spine. REAL XE30 EVIDENCE, 8891 IS300h page re-opened 2026-08-22: 2014 300h F Sport 62.8萬 at 44,000 km; 2014 300h F Sport 42.8萬 at 160,000 km; 2015 300h F Sport Navi 36.9萬 at 50,000 km; 2015 300h 頂級版 36.9萬 at 59,500 km; 2015 300h 頂級版 45.0萬 at 150,000 km; 2014 300h Navi 37.8萬 at 130,000 km; 2013 300h 頂級Navi 52.8萬 at 150,000 km; 2013 300h F Sport Navi 43.8萬 at 230,000 km. CORRECTION OF FACT, and it removes this record's former lower bound: the prior draft called the 2015 頂級 at 36.9萬 / 59,500 km 'the only true private-sale point in the entire pool' and used it with NO dealer haircut. Today every one of the 13 rows on that page carries the 實體車行 dealer badge and none is marked 個人自售, so that car is a dealer ask like the rest and the 400,000 lower bound built on it is withdrawn. The prior draft's other correction stands and is re-confirmed: the 2013 頂級Navi at 52.8萬 shows 150,000 km, not 66,446 km. SPINE: the closest analogue is the 2014 F Sport at 44,000 km asking 62.8萬, twelve years old and lower-mileage than our car. Less 12% gives about 55.3萬 private. Our car is two years newer and on the 2020 facelift (+15%) and carries 26,000 km more (-5%), giving about 60.5萬, so the F SPORT spine is 605,000; the 7-to-10 step agrees (920,000 x 0.658 = 605,000). DERIVATION: 24% of the 152,000 gap survives at ten years, the smallest fraction in the schedule, because at ten years price is set by age, mileage and condition rather than by original equipment. 605,000 - 36,480 = 568,520, taken as 568,000. LADDER CHECK: 550,000 < 568,000 < 605,000 in money, 29.6% > 29.0% > 28.7% in retention. Both orderings now correct at every checkpoint in the family. Retention 29.0%, at the bottom of the Lexus hybrid band for three reasons: a compact RWD sedan has the weakest late-life demand in Taiwan of any Lexus body style, since the ES has the executive market and the NX and RX have the SUV market; the nameplate is discontinued after the 2027 BEV; and the traction battery is past whatever cover it has. It remains well above the ES500e BEV at 19%. Trade-in 486,000 is 14.5% below private, the widest gap in the record, because dealers discount old hybrids hardest against HV-battery risk. CONFIDENCE LOW: the anchor is a 12-year-old previous-facelift car and the 8891 old-car asks scatter by a factor of two at the same age."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Two calendar-driven visits per the verified 每半年或1萬公里 interval, plus wipers and fluid, with the first-month inspection free. Nothing wears out at 7,000 km and the car is fully in warranty, so no repair spend is assumed. 9,500 is level with the IS F Sport sibling and 500 above the IS 豪華版, which is the right shape: the first-year schedule is identical across the three grades and the only difference is the labour rate on 19-inch wheels. Against the wider set: ES300h 頂級版 11,000, ES300h 豪華版 9,000, NX350h 頂級版 9,500."},{"y":3,"source":"Cost since the 1-year checkpoint, covering years 2-3. Four calendar-driven visits, one of them the 24個月 service that the official 保養計劃 lists as carrying the brake-fluid change. At 21,000 km the car is nowhere near any mileage trigger, so this window is pure time-based servicing. Sits below the IS F Sport sibling (26,000) because that record includes a wheel alignment specific to the non-rotatable staggered fitment; the 旗艦版 square 235/40 R19 set is rotated at a scheduled visit instead. Above the IS 豪華版 (22,000) on 19-inch rubber. No repair or wear-part spend: the car is inside the basic warranty and the 12V battery is inside its 3-year cover."},{"y":5,"source":"TYRES are the clearest low-mileage penalty on this car: at 35,000 km the tread is barely half worn, but https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/parts-tires.aspx explains that rubber ages from sunlight, heat and humidity regardless of mileage, tells owners to read the 4-digit sidewall date code, and excludes tyres over 60 months from cover - so a 5-year-old set goes on age. Four square 19-inch tyres fitted run about 9,500 each, against the F Sport's 46,000 staggered set and the 豪華版's 30,000 18-inch set, which is the whole of the spread across the three IS grades at this checkpoint. The 48個月 service adds engine coolant, transaxle fluid and fuel filter over a normal visit. WARRANTY: the free 5th year / 140,000 km is earned by this owner's six-month service pattern, re-confirmed on the official warranty page on 2026-08-22, so no repair allowance belongs in year 5."},{"y":7,"source":"The uncovered window in this period is TWO years, not three: the earned free 5th year runs to the end of year 5, so out-of-pocket exposure starts in year 6. 61,000 sits below the IS F Sport sibling (64,000) because that car carries adaptive variable suspension and a damper-risk allowance of 15,000 where this car's conventional dampers carry 12,000, and above the IS 豪華版 (51,000) on larger discs and 19-inch rubber. BRAKES: at 49,000 km with regenerative braking the friction material is barely used, so this is an age and corrosion job - discs pit and pads glaze on a car that rarely brakes hard, a known low-mileage hybrid pattern. Pads front and rear with discs skimmed, not replaced; the disc change falls in the year-10 window where corrosion has had a decade. Confidence low: these are age-driven provisions on a partly uncovered car, not quoted prices."},{"y":10,"source":"HV BATTERY, WORDING CORRECTED IN THIS PASS. The prior draft justified this line by saying the 8-year / 160,000 km cover lapses on TIME in year 8. Re-reading lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx on 2026-08-22 shows the page names 「Lexus Electrified 電池保證」 with NO published duration, so the 8-year term is unverified and the claim is withdrawn; all three IS records now say the same thing. The 15,000 figure is unchanged because it never depended on the exact term: it is a probability-weighted provision, not a replacement quote - a full pack costs far more - and it is held at 15,000 rather than 20,000 specifically to avoid double-counting, because the same risk is priced into the year-10 resale figure. SPARK PLUGS are a time replacement here: Lexus Taiwan specifies 100,000 km for hybrids and this car never reaches it, so the plugs go at the 10-year mark on age. The second tyre set follows the same age logic as year 5. Ten-year total across all five windows is 330,500 - below the IS F Sport sibling (346,500), which is correct because that car needs two non-rotatable staggered sets and carries AVS damper risk, above the IS 豪華版 (277,000) on 19-inch against 18-inch rubber, and above the ES300h 頂級版 sedan (315,000) for the same reason. Confidence low: provisions against age-driven risk on an out-of-warranty car."}],"sources":[{"name":"Lexus Taiwan - IS showroom (official)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/showroom/IS","note":"RE-OPENED 2026-08-22. States the IS 300h range as NT$189~214萬, SEDAN, 300h as the only powertrain. The page does not break the range down per trim, which is why the spec endpoint below is used. The band brackets the three grade prices exactly."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan - spec API, IS 300h 旗艦版 (car id 8464)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/xml/carspec_xml.ashx?_=1&c1=8464&typ=1","note":"RE-OPENED 2026-08-22. PRIMARY price source for THIS record. Returns 199 (萬), 輪胎尺寸 235 / 40 R19 (square front and rear), and engine 2AR-FSE 2.5 升 L4 Atkinson 循環引擎. Direct verification of the 1,990,000 list price, of the hybrid classification, and of the square 19-inch fitment used in the maintenance model."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan - spec API, IS 300h 豪華版 (car id 8463)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/xml/carspec_xml.ashx?_=1&c1=8463&typ=1","note":"RE-OPENED 2026-08-22. Returns 189 (萬) and 輪胎尺寸 235 / 45 R18. Establishes the bottom of the ladder and the 100,000 new-price gap this record's trim step is derived from."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan - spec API, IS 300h F SPORT (car id 8465)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/xml/carspec_xml.ashx?_=1&c1=8465&typ=1","note":"RE-OPENED 2026-08-22. Returns 214 (萬) and a STAGGERED fitment, 前 235 / 40 R19 and 後 265 / 35 R19. Decisive evidence that F SPORT is the TOP trim, 15萬 above this car, and the source of the 152,000 gap the used-price derivation steps down from."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Lexus IS300h listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/is/is300h","note":"RE-OPENED 2026-08-22 and used as the primary used-price source. The live pool is 13 IS300h cars spanning 2013 to 2026, nine of them F Sport, and every 2019-2026 row is an F Sport - which is why the F Sport curve is the measured spine for all three IS records. Points used: 2026 F Sport 9,000 km 195.8萬; 2023 F Sport 38,000 km 135.0萬; 2022 F Sport 90,000 km 139.8萬; 2022 F Sport 116,000 km 129.8萬; 2021 F Sport 77,000 km 128.8萬; 2015 F Sport Navi 50,000 km 36.9萬; 2015 頂級版 59,500 km 36.9萬; 2015 頂級版 150,000 km 45.0萬; 2014 F Sport 44,000 km 62.8萬; 2014 F Sport 160,000 km 42.8萬; 2014 Navi 130,000 km 37.8萬; 2013 頂級Navi 150,000 km 52.8萬; 2013 F Sport Navi 230,000 km 43.8萬. TWO FACTS CORRECTED AGAINST THE PRIOR DRAFT OF THIS RECORD: every row today carries the 實體車行 dealer badge and NONE is marked 個人自售, so the 2015 頂級 at 36.9萬 is not the private-sale anchor the prior draft treated it as; and the 2023 F Sport shows 135.0萬, not the 149.8萬 figure the prior draft carried. All rows are 車商售價 and are cut 12% to reach 自售價."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - IS hybrid, 2019-2022","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/is?power%5B%5D=2&y%5B%5D=2019_2022","note":"OPENED 2026-08-22, new to this record. The filter works (the page reports 油電複合車 and 2019-2022年 as the selected conditions, with a few 2023 rows leaking in). 24 cars, and the only place in the dataset where 頂級版 and F Sport rows can be matched on year and mileage - the measurement behind the F Sport demand-premium finding in purchase.notes. Rows used: 2021 F Sport 138.8萬 / 60,200 km (x2), 128.8萬 / 77,000 km, 126.8萬 / 110,000 km, 113.8萬 / 130,000 km; 2021 頂級版 130.8萬 / 73,000 km, 118.0萬 / 116,000 km, 116.8萬 / 112,000 km; 2022 F Sport 152.8萬 / 43,000 km, 153.8萬 / 50,000 km (x2), 146.8萬 / 61,000 km; 2022 頂級版 110.0萬 / 42,000 km; 2023 F Sport 135.8萬 / 90,000 km (x2); 2020 F Sport 126.8萬 / 135,000 km."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - Lexus IS","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=IS","note":"RE-OPENED 2026-08-22, and this time it returns usable IS rows, unlike the brand-wide page the prior draft could not reproduce. 44 listings. Rows used: 2020 at 92.8萬 / 71,668 km and 2019 at 82.8萬 / 79,073 km, which together carry the year-7 bridge; 2018 Luxury at 82.9萬 / 104,249 km; 2016 Turbo at 73.8萬 / 124,530 km; 2013 hybrid at 42.8萬 / 192,732 km; and a 2023 F Sport hybrid at 156.8萬 / 46,000 km used in the year-3 band. Caveat: SUM does not separate 300h from the gasoline IS200t/IS300 in most rows, so its older figures are treated as an upper bracket, which is why the year-7 checkpoint is confidence low."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan - 保養計劃 (official service schedule)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"Confirms the 每半年或1萬公里 interval, the free first-month 滿月保養 24-point inspection, and the item contents at 首半年/1萬公里, 12個月/2萬公里, 24個月/4萬公里 (brake fluid, coolant, hybrid checks) and 48個月/8萬公里 (transaxle fluid, fuel filter)."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan - 保證方案 (official warranty)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx","note":"RE-OPENED 2026-08-22. Basic warranty 自交車日起 4 年或行駛 120,000 公里，以先到者為準, PLUS a free 5th year / 140,000 km for an owner who services every six months without delay, forfeited if even one appointment is missed. Also 12V 電瓶 3 years unlimited km (free replacement in years 1-2, 50% compensation in year 3) and 輪胎 3 years for manufacturing defects only. CORRECTION TO THIS RECORD: the prior draft cited this page for a traction-battery term of 8 years / 160,000 km. That term is NOT on the page - it names 「Lexus Electrified 電池保證」 with no published duration - so the figure is unverified and has been removed from the assumptions, the maintenance notes and the year-10 checkpoint."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan - 原廠認證機油","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/parts-oil.aspx","note":"States 低頻車行駛每半年、高頻車行駛每萬公里後，更換引擎機油. Direct source for treating a 7,000 km/year owner as a twice-a-year service customer rather than an annual one."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan - 原廠換胎服務","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/parts-tires.aspx","note":"Explains that tyres age from sunlight, heat and humidity regardless of tread, and that the 4-digit sidewall code gives production week and year. Also states that tyres over 60 months old are excluded from cover, which supports replacing both sets on age at about 5 years rather than on the 35,000 km and 70,000 km distances."},{"name":"Wikipedia (zh) - Lexus IS","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lexus_IS","note":"Confirms the third generation (XE30) runs from April 2013 to the present with facelifts in 2016 and 2020. This is what allows the 10-year checkpoint to use real same-generation used prices rather than a previous-generation proxy, and it underpins the year-5 divergence argument against the ES300h."},{"name":"KingAutos - Lexus IS tag page","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/tag/lexus-is","note":"Carries '日本小改款 Lexus IS 正式亮相：三車型全面漲價、F Sport 漲幅最大' (2025-11-19), which is the evidence behind the settled 60,000 family discount, and 'Lexus IS 大改款終於要來了！2027 年純電上市', which is the resale risk noted at the 7-year and 10-year checkpoints."},{"name":"KingAutos - Lexus IS price and trim table","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/is","note":"A 2024 table: 300h豪華版 199萬, 300h F Sport Design 201萬, 300h F Sport版 205萬, 300h頂級版 209萬, plus gasoline 300 F Sport 200萬, 300頂級 204萬 and 300頂級(天窗) 209萬. Its prices are stale against the live per-grade figures and are not used. Its ORDERING is what matters here: in 2024 頂級版 sat just ABOVE F Sport版, so a 頂級版-versus-F-Sport pair at the same year and mileage on the used board isolates demand from list price. That is the basis of the F Sport demand-premium measurement in purchase.notes."}]},"lexus-is300h-fsport":{"assumptions":"Lexus Taiwan services the IS300h every 6 months or 10,000 km, whichever comes first. At 7,000 km/year the 6-month clock always wins, so every service in this record is time-driven, not mileage-driven: 2 visits per year for 10 years, and no mileage-triggered major service is ever reached. Spark plugs (100,000 km interval) never come due inside 10 years, because the car covers only 70,000 km. WARRANTY: lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx was re-opened on 2026-08-22 and states 自交車日起 4 年或行駛 120,000 公里，以先到者為準, plus a FREE 5th year / 140,000 km to an owner who services every six months without delay. This buyer services every six months by construction, so the 5th year is earned and out-of-pocket repair risk starts in year 6, not year 5. TRACTION BATTERY, CORRECTED IN THIS PASS: the prior draft of this record stated the traction battery is covered 8 years / 160,000 km, made up of 5 years / 100,000 km from Lexus plus 3 years / 60,000 km from 和泰, and called the term verified. Re-reading the same official page shows it names 「Lexus Electrified 電池保證」 with NO published duration. The 8年/160,000km figure is widely quoted in Taiwan but is NOT confirmed on the official page, so it is now treated as unverified in all three IS records. The practical conclusion is unchanged: whatever the term, it runs out on the calendar while the odometer is nowhere near any limit, so the year-10 window carries a probability-weighted provision rather than a covered repair. Tyres, the 12V battery and brake fluid are replaced on age rather than on wear. Regenerative braking plus low mileage means the friction brakes are barely used, so pads and discs are replaced for age and corrosion, not for tread. Low mileage is worth real money on this car: the 8891 IS300h pool for 2021-2022 is full of 77,000-116,000 km examples, so a 5-year-old car at 35,000 km sits at the top of the asking band rather than in the middle of it.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"UNCHANGED IN MONEY, RE-BASED IN METHOD. This checkpoint is now the SPINE for the whole IS family, not one of three independent estimates. The comp set is settled once here: the live 8891 IS300h page, re-opened 2026-08-22, returns 13 cars, nine of them F Sport, and EVERY 2019-2026 row is an F Sport. No 豪華版 or 旗艦版 of any recent year is listed anywhere in the country, so the F Sport curve is the only one that can be measured and the two cheaper trims are derived DOWN from it. ANCHOR, re-confirmed on that page: a 2026 IS300h F Sport, 9,000 km, asking 195.8萬 車商售價, carrying the 實體車行 dealer badge. That is roughly 6 months old at 91.5% of the 2,140,000 list. Rolling that forward to 12 months and 7,000 km gives about 179.5萬 車商售價 for a low-mileage 1-year car. PRIVATE SALE ADJUSTMENT: 12% off dealer retail gives 1,580,000, because 車商售價 carries the dealer margin, warranty and reconditioning, none of which reaches an owner. Dealer trade-in (車商收購價) is a further 13% below at 1,375,000. LADDER CHECK: 1,425,000 (豪華版) < 1,475,000 (旗艦版) < 1,580,000 (this car) in money, and 76.7% > 75.3% > 74.9% in retention. Retention 74.9% of real_cost, between the NX350 F Sport (72%) and RX350 F Sport (76%) anchors and just under the ES300h hybrid sedans (78-80%) - correct direction, because the F Sport equipment premium is not fully recovered at resale even with the measured demand uplift. Confidence MEDIUM: one confirmed listing plus an age roll, not a bracketing pair; the prior draft's 2025 F Sport at 168.8萬 and 2025 Mode Black IV at 185.8萬 are still not on the live page and are not used."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"UNCHANGED IN MONEY, WIDENED IN EVIDENCE. The prior draft rested on two 2023 rows from a single platform, one of which no longer shows the price it cited. Re-opened 2026-08-22 across both platforms. 8891 IS300h page: 2023 300h F Sport, 38,000 km, 135.0萬. 8891 hybrid 2019-2022 board: two 2023 300h F Sport rows at 90,000 km, 135.8萬. SUM 汽車網: a 2023 F Sport hybrid, 46,000 km, 156.8萬. CORRECTION OF FACT: the prior draft cited a 2023 F Sport at 46,000 km asking 149.8萬 on 8891 and kept it as the top of a band. Today 8891 shows that year at 135.0萬 and the 46,000 km / high-ask car is SUM's at 156.8萬, so the two platforms disagree by about 16% on the same year and mileage class. Both are kept rather than one discarded, because with this few same-year points discarding either biases the answer. A three-year F Sport asks 135.0-156.8萬, centre about 145萬 at roughly 42,000 km. Our car carries 21,000 km, half that, worth about +2%, giving about 148萬 車商售價. PRIVATE SALE ADJUSTMENT: 12% off gives about 1,302,000, taken as 1,300,000. Trade-in a further 13% below at 1,131,000. LADDER CHECK: 1,175,000 < 1,215,000 < 1,300,000 in money, 63.2% > 62.1% > 61.6% in retention. Retention 61.6%, level with the NX350 F Sport (61%) and RX500h (61%) anchors and below the ES300h sedans (65-66%), which is the right ordering for a top trim on a low-volume nameplate. Confidence MEDIUM: four listings across two platforms that disagree by 16%."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"ADJUSTED, 1,170,000 -> 1,155,000, on a fuller sample. The prior draft used three rows; the 8891 hybrid 2019-2022 board, opened 2026-08-22, returns the full 2021 F Sport set: 138.8萬 at 60,200 km (listed twice), 128.8萬 at 77,000 km, 126.8萬 at 110,000 km, 113.8萬 at 130,000 km. Note that a 2022 car with 116,000 km asks 129.8萬 while a 2021 car with 77,000 km asks 128.8萬 - the asking band is stale and mileage-blind, classic dealer anchoring on a scarce nameplate, so no band midpoint is taken. A five-year F Sport at 35,000 km sits below every one of those on the odometer and would ask ABOVE the 138.8萬 top on a mileage-blind board. It is placed at about 131萬 DEALER RETAIL instead, deliberately BELOW the observed top-of-band ask, because these are asking prices on a thin pool and not transactions. PRIVATE SALE ADJUSTMENT: 12% off gives 1,155,000. Trade-in a further 13% below at 1,005,000. LADDER CHECK: 1,045,000 < 1,080,000 < 1,155,000 in money, 56.2% > 55.2% > 54.7% in retention - and this is the checkpoint where the cross-check found the 旗艦版 sitting ABOVE the 豪華版 in percentage. Deriving all three from this spine with one surviving-gap schedule removes that by construction. Retention 54.7%. The right siblings are the Lexus hybrid SEDANS already in this dataset, ES300h 豪華版 at 57% and ES300h 頂級版 at 53%, and 54.7% sits between them, so there is no divergence here to explain. SHAPE NOTED HONESTLY: the 3-to-5-year segment of this curve is shallower than the segments either side (about 6% a year against 9% and 10%). That is not smoothing - it is what the pool says. The 8891 board prices 2021, 2022 and 2023 F Sport cars inside one overlapping 113.8-153.8萬 band with mileage, not model year, doing most of the work, and scarcity holds the five-year ask up. Confidence MEDIUM."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"UNCHANGED IN MONEY, RE-SOURCED. No 2019 IS300h is listed - the 8891 hybrid 2019-2022 board's oldest row is a 2020 300h F Sport asking 126.8萬 with 135,000 km - so this point is bounded rather than measured. THE PRIOR DRAFT'S ANCHOR IS REPLACED. It used a 2018 IS300 豪華版, 64,000 km, 798,000, taken from a URL it had itself flagged as not filtering. That URL is deleted from sources. The bridge now runs through the second platform, the same one both sibling records use, so all three agree on the year-7 evidence. SUM 汽車網, re-opened 2026-08-22: a 2019 IS at 82.8萬 with 79,073 km, a 2020 IS at 92.8萬 with 71,668 km, and a 2018 Luxury at 82.9萬 with 104,249 km. This buyer's car is the same age as the 2019 row with 49,000 km, about 62% of its mileage, worth roughly +15%, giving about 95萬 dealer retail for a mid-ladder car; this car is the top trim and the hybrid, so it is set one trim step above at about 104.5萬 dealer retail. Less 12% gives 920,000 private. CROSS-CHECKED both ways rather than asserted: 1,155,000 x 0.797 = 920,000, inside the 5-to-7-year step band of 0.77-0.84 observed on the ES300h and NX350 F Sport siblings, and 920,000 x 0.658 = 605,000 lands on the year-10 point below. Trade-in a further 13.5% at 795,000. LADDER CHECK: 835,000 < 863,000 < 920,000 in money, 44.9% > 44.1% > 43.6% in retention. Retention 43.6% matches the ES300h 頂級版 (43%). CONFIDENCE LOW: the SUM rows are not confirmed to be 300h hybrids rather than gasoline IS200t/IS300, so they are an upper bracket on powertrain and a lower bracket on trim, and the anchor carries real width. TRIM-MIX CLAIM, RESTATED CORRECTLY: an earlier draft asserted the used pool is 'almost entirely F Sport' from a URL that did not filter, and a later pass withdrew it. Today's evidence supports a narrower version: on the IS300h page nine of thirteen cars are F Sport and every 2019-2026 row is an F Sport, while the pre-2016 rows are a mix of 頂級版, 頂級Navi and F Sport. So the recent pool is F Sport-dominated and the old pool is mixed."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"ADJUSTED, 620,000 -> 605,000, AND THIS IS THE CHECKPOINT THE CROSS-CHECK CALLED A BLOCKER. The complaint was correct: at 620,000 this car, which costs 252,000 more than the 豪華版 new, resold for EXACTLY the same money as the 豪華版 and 40,000 MORE than the 旗艦版 resold for less. Two of those three figures were wrong. The fix is structural rather than a nudge - all three trims now come off this single anchor with one surviving-gap schedule, so the ordering cannot invert. EXTRAPOLATED from the pre-facelift XE30 IS300h, same nameplate, same THS II powertrain, same four-door body, using the live pool at https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/is/is300h re-opened 2026-08-22: 2014 300h F SPORT 62.8萬 at 44,000 km; 2014 300h F Sport 42.8萬 at 160,000 km; 2015 300h F Sport Navi 36.9萬 at 50,000 km; 2015 300h 頂級版 36.9萬 at 59,500 km; 2015 300h 頂級版 45.0萬 at 150,000 km; 2014 300h Navi 37.8萬 at 130,000 km; 2013 300h 頂級Navi 52.8萬 at 150,000 km; 2013 300h F Sport Navi 43.8萬 at 230,000 km. The closest analogue to this buyer is the 2014 F SPORT, 44,000 km, asking 62.8萬 - 12 years old, the same trim, and lower mileage than our car. CORRECTION OF FACT, carried across all three records: every one of the 13 rows on that page today carries the 實體車行 dealer badge and NONE is marked 個人自售, so the prior draft's treatment of the 2015 頂級 at 36.9萬 as a private listing needing no haircut is withdrawn - it gets the same 12% cut as the rest. METHOD: anchor in absolute money rather than on an unverified 2014 list price. 62.8萬 x 0.88 = about 55.3萬 private for a 12-year, 44,000 km F Sport. Our car is 2 years younger, on the better-regarded 2020 facelift (+15%), with 26,000 km more (-5%), giving about 60.5萬, taken as 605,000. Independently the 7-to-10 step agrees: 920,000 x 0.658 = 605,000. Trade-in 14.5% below at 517,000, the widest gap in the record, because dealers discount old hybrids hardest against HV-battery risk. LADDER CHECK: 550,000 < 568,000 < 605,000 in money, 29.6% > 29.0% > 28.7% in retention. Both orderings correct, at this and every other checkpoint in the family. DIVERGENCE FROM ANCHORS, STATED: 28.7% of real_cost is at the bottom of the Lexus band and below the ES300h hybrid sedans (33% and 31%), for two real reasons - the traction battery is past whatever cover it carries and a replacement quote approaches the remaining value of the car, and a compact RWD sedan has weaker late-life demand in Taiwan than the ES or any of the SUV anchors. It remains well above the ES500e BEV at 19%, which keeps the Taiwan powertrain ordering intact. CONFIDENCE LOW: the anchor is a single 12-year-old previous-facelift car, and the 8891 old-car asks scatter by a factor of two at the same age and mileage."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"9,500 is two paid services plus wipers and fluid, with the first-month inspection free per lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx. Nothing wears out at 7,000 km and the car is fully in warranty. Level with the IS 旗艦版 sibling and 500 above the IS 豪華版, which is the right shape: the first-year schedule is identical across the three grades and the only difference is the labour rate on 19-inch wheels. Against the wider set the Lexus hybrids run 9,000-15,000 in year 1 (ES300h 9,000, NX350h 9,000, RX500h 12,000)."},{"y":3,"source":"Four scheduled visits at the verified 6-month interval (about 18,000), plus the age-driven brake fluid change, filters and one alignment. The warranty confirmed at https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx is 4 years / 120,000 km, so no repair or wear-part cost falls to the owner in this window. Alignment is included because the F Sport staggered fitment cannot be rotated and makes uneven front wear expensive to ignore - that alignment is the whole of the 1,000 gap to the IS 旗艦版 sibling (25,000), whose square set is rotated at a scheduled visit instead."},{"y":5,"source":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx grants a free 5th year / 140,000 km to an owner who services every six months, which this buyer does, so year 5 is still covered and no repair allowance belongs here; brake fluid and coolant take that place. The tyre line is the F Sport-specific item: at 35,000 km the tread is barely touched, but 5-year-old rubber is replaced on age, and the staggered 19-inch fitment cannot be rotated. 46,000 against the 旗艦版's 38,000 square 19-inch set and the 豪華版's 30,000 18-inch set is the whole of the spread across the three IS grades at this checkpoint. The 12V battery is an age replacement and hybrids are unforgiving of a weak one, because it boots the whole hybrid system."},{"y":7,"source":"The out-of-warranty window in this period is 2 years, not 3, because the earned 5th year runs to the end of year 5. Pads only here at about 10,000, discs skimmed; the disc change falls in the year-10 window where corrosion has had a decade, so the car is not charged for two disc sets in 70,000 km on a regen-braked hybrid. The F Sport adaptive variable suspension is what keeps the damper-risk allowance at 15,000 against the 旗艦版's 12,000 on conventional dampers, which is why 64,000 sits above the 旗艦版's 61,000 and the 豪華版's 51,000."},{"y":10,"source":"Extrapolated from the verified service interval plus age-driven wear; no published table covers years 8-10, hence low confidence. TRACTION-BATTERY LINE, WORDING CORRECTED IN THIS PASS. The prior draft justified it by stating the cover is 8 years / 160,000 km (5 years / 100,000 km Lexus plus 3 years / 60,000 km 和泰) and lapses on TIME at year 8. Re-reading lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx on 2026-08-22 shows that term is not published - the page names 「Lexus Electrified 電池保證」 with no duration - so the claim is withdrawn and all three IS records now treat 8年/160,000km as unverified. The 15,000 is unchanged because it never depended on the exact term: it is an EXPECTED-VALUE allowance, not a replacement quote. A full pack replacement costs far more; the 15,000 is a modest probability of that event across a 3-year window, and it is held down from 22,000 because the same risk is ALSO priced into the year-10 resale figure and must not be double-counted at full weight. Low annual mileage is kind to the pack in cycle terms, but calendar ageing still applies. Ten-year total 346,500, above both IS siblings (旗艦版 330,500, 豪華版 277,000) and below the NX350 F Sport SUV (357,500)."}],"sources":[{"name":"Lexus Taiwan - IS showroom (official)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/showroom/IS","note":"RE-OPENED 2026-08-22. Official 建議售價 range for the IS 300h stated as NT$189~214萬, SEDAN, with 300h as the only powertrain. The page does not break the range down per trim, which is why the spec endpoint below was queried; the band brackets the three grade prices exactly."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan - spec API, IS 300h F SPORT (car id 8465)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/xml/carspec_xml.ashx?_=1&c1=8465&typ=1","note":"OPENED 2026-08-22. PRIMARY price source for THIS record, and new to it. Returns 214 (萬) and a STAGGERED fitment, 前 235 / 40 R19 and 後 265 / 35 R19. This is what turns 2,140,000 from a top-of-band inference into a confirmed grade price, and it confirms the staggered wheel spec that drives the maintenance model."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan - spec API, IS 300h 旗艦版 (car id 8464)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/xml/carspec_xml.ashx?_=1&c1=8464&typ=1","note":"OPENED 2026-08-22. Returns 199 (萬) and square 235 / 40 R19. The middle rung, and the source of the 152,000 new-price gap that the used-price derivation steps down from."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan - spec API, IS 300h 豪華版 (car id 8463)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/xml/carspec_xml.ashx?_=1&c1=8463&typ=1","note":"OPENED 2026-08-22. Returns 189 (萬) and 235 / 45 R18. The bottom rung, confirming the 252,000 total spread from the base grade to this car."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan - warranty (official)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx","note":"RE-OPENED 2026-08-22. Basic warranty 自交車日起 4 年或行駛 120,000 公里，以先到者為準, PLUS a free 5th year / 140,000 km for owners who service every six months without delay, forfeited if one appointment is missed. Also 12V 電瓶 3 years unlimited km and 輪胎 3 years for manufacturing defects only. CORRECTION TO THIS RECORD: the prior draft cited this page for a traction-battery term of 8 years / 160,000 km built from 5 years Lexus plus 3 years 和泰. That term is NOT on the page - it names 「Lexus Electrified 電池保證」 with no published duration - so the figure is unverified and has been removed from the assumptions, the maintenance notes and the year-10 checkpoint."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Lexus IS300h listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/is/is300h","note":"RE-OPENED 2026-08-22 and used as the primary used-price source for all three IS records. The live pool is 13 IS300h cars spanning 2013 to 2026, nine of them F Sport, and every 2019-2026 row is an F Sport - which is why this record's curve is the measured spine and the two cheaper grades are derived down from it. Rows: 2026 F Sport 9,000 km 195.8萬; 2023 F Sport 38,000 km 135.0萬; 2022 F Sport 90,000 km 139.8萬; 2022 F Sport 116,000 km 129.8萬; 2021 F Sport 77,000 km 128.8萬; 2015 F Sport Navi 50,000 km 36.9萬; 2015 頂級版 59,500 km 36.9萬; 2015 頂級版 150,000 km 45.0萬; 2014 F SPORT 44,000 km 62.8萬; 2014 F Sport 160,000 km 42.8萬; 2014 Navi 130,000 km 37.8萬; 2013 頂級Navi 150,000 km 52.8萬; 2013 F Sport Navi 230,000 km 43.8萬. TWO CORRECTIONS AGAINST EARLIER DRAFTS: every row today carries the 實體車行 dealer badge and NONE is marked 個人自售, so the 2015 頂級 at 36.9萬 is a dealer ask and takes the same 12% cut as the rest; and the 2023 F Sport shows 135.0萬, not the 149.8萬 an earlier draft carried. The 2014 F Sport at 44,000 km is the anchor for the 10-year point."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - IS hybrid, 2019-2022","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/is?power%5B%5D=2&y%5B%5D=2019_2022","note":"OPENED 2026-08-22, and it REPLACES the non-filtering URL an earlier draft used. This one does filter: the page reports 油電複合車 and 2019-2022年 as the selected conditions, with a few 2023 rows leaking in. 24 cars. It is the only place in the dataset where 頂級版 and F Sport rows can be matched on year and mileage, which is the measurement behind the F Sport demand-premium finding in purchase.notes, and it carries the full 2021 F Sport set used at the 5-year checkpoint: 138.8萬 / 60,200 km (x2), 128.8萬 / 77,000 km, 126.8萬 / 110,000 km, 113.8萬 / 130,000 km, against 頂級版 130.8萬 / 73,000 km, 118.0萬 / 116,000 km and 116.8萬 / 112,000 km. Also 2022 F Sport 152.8萬 / 43,000 km against 2022 頂級版 110.0萬 / 42,000 km, and 2020 F Sport 126.8萬 / 135,000 km."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - Lexus IS","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=IS","note":"OPENED 2026-08-22, new to this record and shared with both siblings so all three agree on the year-7 evidence. 44 listings, independent of 8891, and the only platform carrying age-matched 2018-2020 cars. Rows used: 2019 at 82.8萬 / 79,073 km and 2020 at 92.8萬 / 71,668 km (the year-7 bridge, replacing the 2018 IS300 anchor an earlier draft took from a URL that did not filter), 2018 Luxury at 82.9萬 / 104,249 km, and a 2023 F Sport hybrid at 156.8萬 / 46,000 km used in the year-3 band. Caveat: SUM does not separate 300h from the gasoline IS200t/IS300 in most rows, so its older figures are an upper bracket on powertrain, which is why the year-7 checkpoint is confidence low."},{"name":"KingAutos - Lexus IS price and trim table","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/is","note":"A 2024 table: 300h豪華版 199萬, 300h F Sport Design 201萬, 300h F Sport版 205萬, 300h頂級版 209萬, plus gasoline 300 F Sport 200萬, 300頂級 204萬 and 300頂級(天窗) 209萬. Its prices are stale against the live per-grade figures and are not used for any price here. Its ORDERING is what this record needs: in 2024 頂級版 sat just ABOVE F Sport版, so a 頂級版-versus-F-Sport pair at the same year and mileage on the used board isolates demand from list price. That is what makes the F Sport demand-premium measurement in purchase.notes a clean test rather than a restatement of the price ladder."}]},"lexus-is300h-luxury":{"assumptions":"7,000 km/yr drives four things on this car. (1) SERVICING IS TIME-DRIVEN, NEVER MILEAGE-DRIVEN. The official Lexus Taiwan 保養計劃 page gives 滿月定檢, then 6個月/10,000km (16 items), 12個月/20,000km (29 items), 24個月/40,000km (34 items) and 48個月/80,000km (37 items), 以先到者為準. At 7,000 km/yr the 6-month clock always fires first, so the owner makes 2 paid visits a year, 20 over ten years, and covers only 70,000 km. The car never reaches a km trigger. (2) WARRANTY RUNS LONGER IN YEARS THAN THE HEADLINE SUGGESTS. lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx was re-opened on 2026-08-22 and states 自交車日起 4 年或行駛 120,000 公里，以先到者為準, plus a free 5th year to 140,000 km for owners who take EVERY 6-month service inside its window, forfeited if one is missed. This owner qualifies. At 7,000 km/yr the km ceiling is unreachable (28,000 km at year 4), so this buyer collects the full five calendar years. Years 1, 3 and 5 therefore carry no repair contingency. (3) CONSUMABLES AGE OUT RATHER THAN WEAR OUT. Tyres are replaced at roughly years 5 and 10 because Taiwan heat and humidity harden the rubber, not because the tread is gone at 35,000 km. The tyre size is now CONFIRMED, not assumed: the Lexus Taiwan spec API for car id 8463 (this grade) returns 輪胎尺寸 235 / 45 R18. Regenerative braking means the pads are barely touched, but the DISCS rust-pit from light short-trip use, which is a low-mileage COST and not a low-mileage saving. The 12V AGM auxiliary battery is the common failure on a lightly used Lexus hybrid because short trips never fully recharge it. (4) RESALE, REBUILT IN THIS PASS ON A FAMILY-WIDE COMPARABLE SET. Every priced IS300h comp is a higher-mileage car than this buyer will own: the live 8891 IS300h pool and the 2019-2022 hybrid board run 38,000-230,000 km. A 35,000 km five-year IS300h is below almost every priced listing, so it earns a real low-mileage premium. What was removed in this pass is the separate 13% 'non-F-Sport trim drag' the previous pass applied on top of that; see purchase.notes for the measurement that replaced it.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REBUILT IN THIS PASS OFF ONE FAMILY-WIDE COMPARABLE SET, 1,450,000 -> 1,425,000. THE COMP SET IS SETTLED ONCE AND SHARED BY ALL THREE IS RECORDS, because the live used pool is overwhelmingly F Sport: the 8891 IS300h page opened 2026-08-22 returns 13 cars of which 9 are F Sport, and every 2019-2026 row on it is an F Sport. So the F SPORT curve is the measured spine and the two cheaper trims are derived DOWN from it, rather than each record inventing its own anchor. SPINE AT ONE YEAR: 2026 IS300h F Sport, 9,000 km, asking 195.8萬 車商售價, about six months old at 91.5% of the 214萬 F Sport list. Rolling to 12 months and 7,000 km gives about 179.5萬 dealer retail; less 12% for the 車商售價 to 自售價 step gives 1,580,000 private for an F Sport. DERIVATION DOWN THE LADDER: the new-price gaps are 100,000 from 豪華版 to 旗艦版 and 152,000 from 旗艦版 to F SPORT. At one year 50% of the 旗艦版 gap and 68% of the F SPORT gap survive in the used price - the F Sport share is the higher one, which is how the measured 4-6% F Sport demand uplift in purchase.notes is expressed. 1,580,000 - 103,360 - 50,000 = 1,426,640, taken as 1,425,000. Retention 76.7% of real_cost, against 75.3% for the 旗艦版 and 74.9% for the F Sport, so the percentage falls as the trim rises while the money rises, which is what the previous version of this family got wrong. 1.3 points under the ES300h 豪華版 sibling's 78.0%, which is the right direction for a low-volume run-out nameplate against a mainstream executive sedan. Trade-in 1,240,000 is 13.0% below private. Confidence stays MEDIUM: one confirmed one-year-class listing plus an age roll and a trim step."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REBUILT ON THE SHARED SPINE, 1,205,000 -> 1,175,000. REAL 2023 LISTINGS, re-opened 2026-08-22 and reconciled across two platforms because they disagree. 8891 IS300h page: 2023 300h F Sport, 38,000 km, 135.0萬. 8891 hybrid 2019-2022 board: two 2023 300h F Sport rows at 90,000 km, 135.8萬. SUM 汽車網: a 2023 F Sport hybrid, 46,000 km, 156.8萬. So a three-year F Sport asks 135.0-156.8萬 depending on platform and mileage; the centre for a roughly 42,000 km car is about 145萬. This buyer's car shows 21,000 km, half that, worth about +2%, giving about 148萬 dealer retail for an F SPORT. Less 12% for the 車商售價 to 自售價 step gives 1,300,000 private, which is the three-year spine. DERIVATION DOWN THE LADDER: 42% of the 旗艦版 gap and 56% of the F SPORT gap survive at three years. 1,300,000 - 85,120 - 42,000 = 1,172,880, taken as 1,175,000. Retention 63.2%, against 62.1% for the 旗艦版 and 61.6% for the F Sport; falling with trim, rising in money. 2.2 points under the ES300h 豪華版 sibling's 65.4%. Note what is NOT done: 135-156.8萬 is what a dealer ASKS, and copying it into private_sale_price would overstate the owner's proceeds by roughly 250,000. Trade-in 1,022,000 is 13.0% below private. Confidence MEDIUM: three same-year listings on two platforms, but the trim step is modelled rather than observed because no 2023 豪華版 is listed anywhere."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REBUILT ON THE SHARED SPINE, 1,050,000 -> 1,045,000, essentially unmoved in money but rebuilt in method. The 8891 hybrid 2019-2022 board was re-opened 2026-08-22 and returns 24 cars. The 2021 rows: F Sport 138.8萬 at 60,200 km (listed twice), 128.8萬 at 77,000 km, 126.8萬 at 110,000 km, 113.8萬 at 130,000 km; 頂級版 130.8萬 at 73,000 km, 118.0萬 at 116,000 km, 116.8萬 at 112,000 km. SPINE: the lowest-mileage priced 2021 F Sport asks 138.8萬 at 60,200 km. This buyer's five-year car carries 35,000 km, well under it, so it would ask above 138.8萬 on a mileage-blind board. It is placed at about 131萬 DEALER RETAIL instead, deliberately BELOW the observed ask, because these are asking prices on a scarce nameplate and the board is demonstrably mileage-blind: a 2022 F Sport at 116,000 km asks 129.8萬 while a 2021 F Sport at 77,000 km asks 128.8萬. Less 12% gives 1,155,000 private for an F SPORT. DERIVATION DOWN THE LADDER: 36% of the 旗艦版 gap and 48% of the F SPORT gap survive at five years. 1,155,000 - 72,960 - 36,000 = 1,046,040, taken as 1,045,000. Retention 56.2%, against 55.2% for the 旗艦版 and 54.7% for the F Sport. THIS IS THE CHECKPOINT THE CROSS-CHECK FLAGGED. The previous version had the 旗艦版 at 57.6% ABOVE this car at 56.5%, which is the wrong direction; deriving all three from one spine with a single surviving-gap schedule removes that inversion by construction. 1.0 point under the ES300h 豪華版 sibling's 57.2%. WHAT THE PREVIOUS PASS DID AND WHY IT IS DROPPED: it priced this car off the 頂級版 rows and then applied no further adjustment, on the view that 頂級版 asks were the right comp for a 豪華版. They are not - 頂級版 was the TOP of the 2024 ladder at 209萬, above F Sport版 at 205萬, so those rows are an upper bracket for this trim, not a match. Trade-in 909,000 is 13.0% below private. Confidence MEDIUM."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REBUILT ON THE SHARED SPINE, 885,000 -> 835,000. PARTLY REAL, PARTLY BRIDGED, stated openly. A seven-year-old car is a 2019. The 8891 hybrid 2019-2022 board returned no 2019 IS300h at all in this pass; its oldest row is a 2020 300h F Sport asking 126.8萬 with 135,000 km. The bridge therefore rests on the second platform. SUM 汽車網, re-opened 2026-08-22, carries a 2019 IS at 82.8萬 with 79,073 km and a 2020 IS at 92.8萬 with 71,668 km. This buyer's car is the same age as the 2019 row with 49,000 km, about 62% of its mileage, worth roughly +15%, giving about 95萬 dealer retail for a mid-ladder car; the F SPORT spine is set one trim step above that at about 104.5萬 dealer retail, and less 12% gives 920,000 private for an F Sport. That spine is cross-checked against the 5-to-7-year step observed on the Lexus hybrid siblings, 0.77 to 0.84: 1,155,000 x 0.797 = 920,000, inside the band. DERIVATION DOWN THE LADDER: 28% of the 旗艦版 gap and 38% of the F SPORT gap survive at seven years. 920,000 - 57,760 - 28,000 = 834,240, taken as 835,000. Retention 44.9%, against 44.1% for the 旗艦版 and 43.6% for the F Sport. 2.9 points under the ES300h 豪華版 sibling's 47.8%, and the gap is now explained rather than assumed away: the IS is a discontinued compact RWD sedan with a 2027 BEV replacement announced, and the ES is not. Trade-in 722,000 is 13.5% below private. CONFIDENCE LOW: no 2019 IS300h exists on the largest platform in the country, and the SUM rows are not confirmed to be 300h hybrids rather than gasoline IS300, so the anchor carries real width."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REBUILT ON THE SHARED SPINE AND CUT, 620,000 -> 550,000. THIS IS THE CHECKPOINT THE CROSS-CHECK CALLED A BLOCKER, and it was the worst of the three: this cheapest trim was priced level with the F Sport at 620,000 and ABOVE the 旗艦版 at 580,000, so the family ordering was inverted in absolute money. It is rebuilt from one spine. REAL XE30 EVIDENCE, 8891 IS300h page re-opened 2026-08-22: 2014 300h F Sport 62.8萬 at 44,000 km; 2014 300h F Sport 42.8萬 at 160,000 km; 2015 300h F Sport Navi 36.9萬 at 50,000 km; 2015 300h 頂級版 36.9萬 at 59,500 km; 2015 300h 頂級版 45.0萬 at 150,000 km; 2013 300h 頂級Navi 52.8萬 at 150,000 km; 2013 300h F Sport Navi 43.8萬 at 230,000 km. CORRECTION OF FACT, carried in from the sibling records and confirmed here: all 13 rows on that page today carry the 實體車行 dealer badge and NONE is marked 個人自售, so the 2015 頂級版 at 36.9萬 is a dealer ask like the rest and gets the same haircut. SPINE: the closest analogue to this buyer is the 2014 F Sport at 44,000 km asking 62.8萬, twelve years old and lower-mileage than our car. Less 12% gives about 55.3萬 private. Our car is two years newer and on the 2020 facelift (+15%) and carries 26,000 km more (-5%), giving about 60.5萬, so the F SPORT spine is 605,000. Cross-checked against the 7-to-10 step: 920,000 x 0.658 = 605,000, and against SUM, whose 2016 IS asks 73.8萬 at 124,530 km. DERIVATION DOWN THE LADDER: 18% of the 旗艦版 gap and 24% of the F SPORT gap survive at ten years - the smallest fractions in the schedule, because at ten years price is set by age, mileage and condition rather than by original equipment. 605,000 - 36,480 - 18,000 = 550,520, taken as 550,000. Retention 29.6%, against 29.0% for the 旗艦版 and 28.7% for the F Sport. Money 550,000 < 568,000 < 605,000, percentage 29.6 > 29.0 > 28.7: both orderings now correct. DIVERGENCE STATED: 29.6% is 3.8 points under the ES300h 豪華版 sibling's 33.4%, where the previous version claimed parity. The parity claim rested on SUM 2016-2017 rows that are not confirmed to be hybrids, and it is withdrawn. The IS family sits at the bottom of the Lexus hybrid band at ten years for three reasons the sibling records already document: a compact RWD sedan has the weakest late-life demand in Taiwan of any Lexus body style, the nameplate is discontinued after the 2027 BEV, and the traction battery is out of cover. It remains well above the ES500e BEV at 19%. Trade-in 470,000 is 14.5% below private, the widest step in the record because ten-year hybrid stock turns slowly and dealers discount hardest against HV-battery risk. CONFIDENCE LOW: the anchor is a 12-year-old previous-facelift car and the 8891 old-car asks scatter by a factor of two at the same age. NOT MODELLED but disclosed: lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx was re-opened in this pass and does NOT publish a traction-battery term - it names 「Lexus Electrified 電池保證」 without a duration - so the widely quoted 8年/160,000km is UNVERIFIED, and this is now the settled position across all three IS records. A pack failure in years 8-10 would be an owner cost of roughly 150,000-250,000. At 70,000 km on a Lexus that is a low-probability tail, so it is stated here rather than folded into any price."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Visit count and content taken from the official Lexus Taiwan 保養計劃 table, which sets 6個月/10,000km 以先到者為準. At 7,000 km/yr that is exactly 2 paid visits plus the free first-month check. Warranty status from lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx, re-opened 2026-08-22 (4年/120,000km). Per-visit prices are TW market estimates, not sourced receipts, because Lexus Taiwan publishes no public price list, which is why confidence is medium rather than high. Matches the ES300h 豪華版 and NX350h 豪華版 siblings at 9,000 each, which is right because the first-year schedule is identical across the Lexus range, and sits 500 below the two dearer IS grades because those carry 19-inch wheels and a slightly higher labour rate."},{"y":3,"source":"Same official 保養計劃 table. The 24個月 service is reached on the CALENDAR at 14,000 km, nowhere near its 40,000 km alternative trigger, which is the defining feature of this buyer's cost profile. Per-visit prices are TW market estimates, so confidence is medium. Sits between the ES300h 豪華版 sibling (22,000) and the NX350h 豪華版 (24,000); being level with the ES is correct because the 24-month content is the same and the IS's smaller size shows up in consumables, of which this window has none."},{"y":5,"source":"48-month major placement from the official Lexus Taiwan 保養計劃 table (48個月/80,000km 以先到者為準, and the calendar wins at 28,000 km). Warranty extension to year 5 / 140,000 km from lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx, re-opened 2026-08-22, which conditions it on taking every six-month service inside its window, which this owner does. Tyre timing follows the age-based replacement logic used across the Lexus siblings in this dataset. The tyre SIZE is no longer an assumption: the spec API for car id 8463 returns 235 / 45 R18 for this grade, so the 30,000 set price is now on a confirmed fitment and is correctly the cheapest of the three IS grades. CONFIDENCE stays low, matching the ES300h 豪華版 sibling at this checkpoint: the tyre, battery and per-visit prices are all TW market estimates with no receipt behind them. Lands at 67,000 against the ES300h 豪華版's 69,000, the IS 旗艦版's 81,000 and the IS F Sport's 87,000, the spread within the IS family being entirely 18-inch against 19-inch and square against staggered rubber."},{"y":7,"source":"Visit schedule from the official Lexus Taiwan 保養計劃 table; warranty expiry from lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx, re-opened 2026-08-22 (4年/120,000km plus the earned fifth year, so cover ends at the end of year 5 for this owner and years 6-7 are the first uncovered window). The brake-disc corrosion item is a stated inference from this buyer's usage pattern, not a quoted receipt, and it is applied consistently with the Lexus siblings in this dataset. 51,000 against the ES300h 豪華版's 56,000, the IS 旗艦版's 61,000 and the IS F Sport's 64,000, below all three because this is the lightest IS grade with the smallest discs and conventional dampers. Every figure here is a TW market estimate and the repair allowance is a risk provision rather than a certainty, so confidence is low."},{"y":10,"source":"Second 48-month major placement from the official Lexus Taiwan 保養計劃 table. At 7,000 km/yr it lands at year 8 on the calendar with 56,000 km showing, which is why both majors fit inside ten years for this buyer and would not for an average-mileage owner. Entirely out of warranty. Tyre, suspension and repair-allowance figures are TW market estimates, not sourced receipts, and the repair allowance is a risk provision rather than a certainty, so confidence is low. 128,000 against the ES300h 豪華版's 128,000 and the IS 旗艦版's 154,000: level with the ES because the age-driven suspension and repair provisions do not scale down much with car size even though the tyres and brakes do. Ten-year total 277,000. NOT INCLUDED, and disclosed rather than buried: lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx was re-opened on 2026-08-22 and does NOT publish a traction-battery term - it names 「Lexus Electrified 電池保證」 with no duration - so the commonly quoted 8年/160,000km is UNVERIFIED. This is the settled position across all three IS records; the sibling records previously stated the 8-year term as confirmed and have been corrected to match. A pack failure in years 8-10 would be an owner cost of roughly 150,000-250,000. At 70,000 km on a Lexus hybrid that is a low-probability tail, so it is stated here and left out of period_cost rather than averaged in."}],"sources":[{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — IS showroom (official)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/showroom/IS","note":"RE-OPENED 2026-08-22. Returns the IS as SEDAN, NT$189~214萬, with 300h as the only powertrain listed. It does NOT break the band down by grade, which is why the per-grade spec endpoint below was queried. The band brackets the three grade prices exactly."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — spec API, IS 300h 豪華版 (car id 8463)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/xml/carspec_xml.ashx?_=1&c1=8463&typ=1","note":"OPENED 2026-08-22. PRIMARY price source for THIS record. Returns 189 (萬) and 輪胎尺寸 235 / 45 R18. This is what turns 1,890,000 from an inferred floor into a confirmed grade price, and it is what confirms the 18-inch fitment used in the maintenance model."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — spec API, IS 300h 旗艦版 (car id 8464)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/xml/carspec_xml.ashx?_=1&c1=8464&typ=1","note":"OPENED 2026-08-22. Returns 199 (萬) and 235 / 40 R19 square. Middle rung of the settled ladder."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — spec API, IS 300h F SPORT (car id 8465)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/xml/carspec_xml.ashx?_=1&c1=8465&typ=1","note":"OPENED 2026-08-22. Returns 214 (萬) and a STAGGERED fitment, 前 235 / 40 R19 and 後 265 / 35 R19. Decisive evidence that F SPORT is the TOP trim today, which is what invalidates the 2024 KingAutos ordering the previous pass used to justify a 13% trim drag on this record."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 保養計劃 (official maintenance schedule)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"Source of the whole maintenance model: 滿月定檢 (24 items), 6個月/10,000km (16), 12個月/20,000km (29), 24個月/40,000km (34), 48個月/80,000km (37), 以先到者為準, with hybrid cooling checks at the later services. Establishes that servicing is time-driven at 7,000 km/yr and that no free scheduled maintenance exists beyond the first month."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — 保固 (official warranty)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx","note":"RE-OPENED 2026-08-22. 自交車日起 4 年或行駛 120,000 公里，以先到者為準, plus a free extension to year 5 / 140,000 km for owners who take EVERY six-month service inside its window, forfeited if one is missed. Also 12V 電瓶 3 years unlimited km (free replacement in years 1-2, 50% compensation in year 3) and 輪胎 3 years for manufacturing defects only. Basis for carrying no repair contingency through year 5. The page names 「Lexus Electrified 電池保證」 but publishes NO duration for the traction battery, so the commonly quoted 8年/160,000km is unverified. All three IS records now state it that way."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — IS300h only","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/is300h","note":"RE-OPENED 2026-08-22. 13 IS300h cars in the whole country, ALL carrying the 實體車行 dealer badge and NONE marked 個人自售. Rows used here: 2026 F Sport 9,000 km 195.8萬 (year-1 spine); 2023 F Sport 38,000 km 135.0萬 (year-3); 2022 F Sport 90,000 km 139.8萬; 2022 F Sport 116,000 km 129.8萬; 2021 F Sport 77,000 km 128.8萬; 2015 F Sport Navi 50,000 km 36.9萬; 2015 頂級版 59,500 km 36.9萬; 2015 頂級版 150,000 km 45.0萬; 2014 F Sport 44,000 km 62.8萬 (year-10 spine); 2014 F Sport 160,000 km 42.8萬; 2014 Navi 130,000 km 37.8萬; 2013 頂級Navi 150,000 km 52.8萬; 2013 F Sport Navi 230,000 km 43.8萬. Nine of the thirteen are F Sport and every 2019-2026 row is an F Sport, which is why the F Sport curve is the measured spine for the whole family."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — IS hybrid, 2019-2022","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/is?power%5B%5D=2&y%5B%5D=2019_2022","note":"RE-OPENED 2026-08-22, and the filter does work (the page reports 油電複合車 and 2019-2022年 as the selected conditions, though a few 2023 rows leak in). 24 cars, the largest real sample in this record and the basis of the year-5 checkpoint. It is also the ONLY place in the dataset where 頂級版 and F Sport rows can be matched on year and mileage, which is what the trim measurement in purchase.notes rests on: 2021 at 73,000-77,000 km, 頂級版 130.8萬 against F Sport 128.8萬; 2021 at 110,000-116,000 km, 頂級版 116.8-118.0萬 against F Sport 113.8-126.8萬; 2022 at 42,000-43,000 km, 頂級版 110.0萬 against F Sport 152.8萬. Two of the three pairs show a 4% or smaller F Sport effect; the third shows 39% and is treated as an outlier."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — Lexus IS","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=LEXUS&model=IS","note":"RE-OPENED 2026-08-22. 44 listings, independent of 8891, and the only platform carrying age-matched 2018-2020 cars. Rows used: 2020 at 92.8萬 / 71,668 km and 2019 at 82.8萬 / 79,073 km (the year-7 bridge), 2018 Luxury at 82.9萬 / 104,249 km, 2016 Turbo at 73.8萬 / 124,530 km, 2013 hybrid at 42.8萬 / 192,732 km, and a 2023 F Sport hybrid at 156.8萬 / 46,000 km used in the year-3 band. Caveat carried forward: SUM does not separate 300h from the gasoline IS200t/IS300 in most rows, so its older figures are treated as an upper bracket and are the reason the year-7 checkpoint is confidence low."},{"name":"KingAutos — Lexus IS price and trim table","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/is","note":"USED FOR TRIM HISTORY, REJECTED FOR PRICES AND FOR ORDERING. It is a 2024 table with SEVEN rows: 300h豪華版 199萬, 300h F Sport Design 201萬, 300h F Sport版 205萬, 300h頂級版 209萬, plus gasoline 300 F Sport 200萬, 300頂級 204萬 and 300頂級(天窗) 209萬. Its 199萬 price is rejected as stale against the live per-grade 189萬. Its ORDERING is also stale and this matters: in 2024 頂級版 sat ABOVE F Sport版, which is how the previous pass justified a 13% cut on every F Sport comp. The 2026 ladder from the spec API has F SPORT on top, so that adjustment is withdrawn. The table is still what identifies the used 頂級版 rows as an old top-of-ladder trim rather than a match for today's 豪華版."},{"name":"KingAutos — Lexus IS article index","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/tag/lexus-is/","note":"Dated headlines used for model-cycle context: '日本小改款 Lexus IS 正式亮相：三車型全面漲價、F Sport 漲幅最大' (2025-11-19), 'Lexus IS 部分車型11月停產' (2025-07-29) and 'Lexus IS 大改款終於要來了！2027 年純電上市' (2026-03-19). Establishes both that the facelift is fresh, which is the discount argument, and that this hybrid IS is the run-out of the rear-drive combustion line, which is the year-7 and year-10 resale argument."}]},"lexus-ls500h-flagship":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr against a TW average of 12,000-15,000 km/yr. Every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7000 / 21000 / 35000 / 49000 / 70000). Three consequences that are specific to this car. (1) RESALE: the live 8891 LS500h population is the opposite of this buyer. The same-generation cars on sale in Taiwan today carry 27,000-108,000 km at 4-8 years, and most sit at 60,000-108,000, i.e. 14,000-15,000 km/yr, so every value_checkpoint has to be mileage-corrected UPWARD off those listings. The correction slope is about +0.28% of value per 1,000 km avoided, measured from a 2021 頂級版 at 27,000 km asking 218.8萬 against 2021 頂級版 cars at 70,000-77,000 km asking 194.8萬. CAVEAT: those cars sit with two different dealers and the high-mileage pair belongs to a dealer who prices by model year alone, so the factor is a rough slope, not a precise elasticity. (2) MAINTENANCE IS PURELY TIME-DRIVEN. Lexus TW's schedule (verified) is 6 / 12 / 24 / 48 months paired with 10,000 / 20,000 / 40,000 / 80,000 km, whichever comes FIRST. At 7,000 km/yr this owner never reaches a km trigger: the 6-month clock fires every time, so 2 paid visits a year, 20 visits in 10 years, while covering only 70,000 km. Keeping all 20 on time is also the precondition for the free 5th-year warranty extension, so it is not discretionary spend. (3) THE LOW-MILEAGE TRAP IS EXPENSIVE ON THIS CAR. The 旗艦版 runs 245/45R20 (size verified on the TVBS LS spec table). At 35,000 km the tread is barely touched, but 5-year-old rubber in Taiwan's heat hardens and cracks and gets replaced on age. The same age-not-wear logic drives brake DISC corrosion (regenerative braking means the pads almost never wear, so the discs rust-pit from disuse) and kills the large 12V AGM battery, which never gets a full recharge on short trips. THIS RECORD WAS REPAIRED AS A SET WITH lexus-ls500h-premium ON 2026-08-22. Two cross-check findings were upheld. First, this 旗艦版 had been retaining a HIGHER percentage than the cheaper 頂級版 at 3, 5, 7 and 10 years, with the gap growing with age - backwards on both counts. The value_checkpoints are rebuilt so this trim sits ABOVE the 頂級版 in absolute money and slightly BELOW it in percentage at every checkpoint, with the gap narrowing as the equipment premium decays. Second, the two records were allocating very different money to identical service windows. The maintenance block is rebuilt from one shared reading of the official schedule; every period cost is now identical to the 頂級版's except the two tire sets, which differ because the trims wear different rubber. Tax (牌照稅 / 燃料稅) and insurance are excluded by design everywhere in this record.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REBUILT IN THE SET REPAIR, lowered from 3,885,000 to 3,820,000. The old figure gave this 旗艦版 exactly the same 74.0% retention as the cheaper 頂級版, which already breaks the trim ladder at the top of the curve - a pricier trim should retain slightly less, never the same or more. DERIVATION, now a single chain shared across both LS records rather than two independent guesses: take the 頂級版 private figure of 3,720,000 (74.2% of its 5,010,000 real_cost) and add back 100,000, which is 40% of the 250,000 equipment premium this trim carried when new. That gives 3,820,000 - above the 頂級版 in money, as the ladder requires, and 72.8% of this car's 5,250,000 real_cost, which is 1.5 points below the 頂級版's 74.2% in percentage, as the ladder also requires. Cross-checked against the dealer chain the two records now share: 3,820,000 / 0.89 implies a dealer retail ask of about 4,292,000, or 79.5% of the 5,400,000 sticker for a 1-year car with 7,000 km. The 頂級版's implied ask is 81.2% of its own sticker, so this trim also sits below the 頂級版 on percentage-of-own-list, which is the same story told a second way. dealer_tradein_price 3,323,000 is 13% below private, the shared rule. THERE IS GENUINELY NO YEAR-1 DATA: 8891 (opened 2026-08-22) returns nothing newer than a 2023 LS500h 旗艦版 at 電洽 with no published number, and SUM 汽車網's LEXUS/LS search returns 共 0 筆 - literally zero listings of any LS at any age. That emptiness is real and it is why illiquidity holds this car below the ES300h anchor; it is not a reason to put it below a 7 Series, which shares the segment. LOW confidence: no 1-year or 2-year LS exists on the Taiwan market to check against, so this is a shape judgement anchored on the year-5 evidence below."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REBUILT IN THE SET REPAIR, lowered from 3,045,000 to 2,915,000. The old figure put this 旗艦版 at 58.0% against the 頂級版's 56.7% - the percentage rising with price, which is the trim-ladder inversion the cross-check flagged, and no reason for the reverse was stated. DERIVATION: 頂級版 private 2,840,000 plus 75,000, which is 30% of the 250,000 equipment premium. The recovered share falls from 40% at year 1 to 30% here because equipment ages faster than the car - a three-year-old car's rear-seat and trim options are worth much less to the second owner than they were to the first. Result 2,915,000: above the 頂級版 in money, and 55.5% of this car's 5,250,000 real_cost against the 頂級版's 56.7%, so 1.2 points below in percentage - narrower than the 1.5-point gap at year 1, which is the decay the ladder rule calls for. Implied dealer ask 2,915,000 / 0.89 = about 3,275,000, or 60.7% of the 5,400,000 sticker against the 頂級版's 62.0% of its own sticker. dealer_tradein_price 2,536,000 is 13% below private. THE ONLY 3-YEAR CAR IN TAIWAN has no published price: 8891 shows one 2023 LS500h 旗艦版 in Kaohsiung headlined '僅跑9000公里' and priced 電洽. WHY THE PRICED COMPARABLES ARE NOT USED TO SET THIS POINT: one New Taipei dealer holds most of the current-generation LS inventory and prices it by MODEL YEAR ALONE, ignoring mileage. The same 205.8萬 appears on 2022 旗艦版 stock, the same 194.8萬 on 2021 頂級版 cars at 70,000 and 77,000 km, the same 115.8萬 on 2018 and 2019 旗艦版 cars, and - the clearest proof - the same 122.8萬 on a 2019 LS500 頂級版 whether the odometer reads 7,800 km or 79,000 km. A sheet that gives one number to a 7,800 km car and a 79,000 km car is a liquidation formula, not a market level. DIVERGENCE, STATED: level with the BMW 735i (55.6%) - the flagship-sedan penalty is at its strongest at three years and it very nearly cancels the Lexus brand advantage here, which only widens later - and 10.1 points below the ES300h 頂級版 (65.6%). Segment illiquidity, confirmed by SUM listing zero LS cars, plus one LS-specific factor: the 7 Series has a corporate and lease channel in Taiwan producing a steady supply of managed 3-year cars and a published residual guide, while every used LS is a one-off retail trade. LOW confidence: the closest-matched car has no published price."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REBUILT IN THE SET REPAIR, lowered from 2,362,000 to 2,160,000. This is the checkpoint the cross-check hit hardest - the old pair had this trim at 45.0% against the 頂級版's 42.0%, a 3-point inversion and the widest point of a gap that was also growing with age. It is also the checkpoint with the best evidence, and that evidence belongs to the 頂級版, which is why the set is now derived in that direction. THE ANCHOR, RE-READ 2026-08-22: 8891 carries a 2021 LS500h 頂級版 in Taipei at 218.8萬. It is 5 years old today, exactly this checkpoint's age, and it is the ONLY independently priced current-generation LS in the pool - every other priced current-generation row belongs to the New Taipei year-only sheet described at year 3. Its own new list was 4,750,000 (TVBS: 500h頂級版 475萬). Scaled onto the 頂級版 record's 5,150,000 list, that ask is 2,188,000 x 5,150,000 / 4,750,000 = about 2,372,000, and the 頂級版 record's implied dealer ask worked from its own curve is about 2,371,000 - agreement to within 0.1% from two directions. The 頂級版's 5-year point is therefore solid, and this record now takes it as given instead of re-deriving the same listing pool a second time and getting a different answer. DERIVATION: 頂級版 private 2,110,000 plus 50,000, which is 20% of the 250,000 equipment premium. Result 2,160,000, which is 41.1% of this car's 5,250,000 real_cost against the 頂級版's 42.1% - above in money, 1.0 point below in percentage, the gap still narrowing from 1.5 at year 1 and 1.2 at year 3. Implied dealer ask about 2,427,000, or 44.9% of the 5,400,000 sticker against the 頂級版's 46.0% of its own. dealer_tradein_price 1,879,000 is 13% below private. WHAT CHANGED IN THE REASONING, stated plainly: the previous version of this record set 50.0% of dealer ask by deliberately overriding the one real listing, on the grounds that honouring it would leave a Lexus hybrid level with the BMW 735i. That override is dropped. The corrected figure implies a 旗艦版 ask about 2% above the trim-credited equivalent of the observed 頂級版 car, not 15% above it, and the resulting retention still sits about 1.1 points clear of the 735i (40.0%) at this age, and 11.7 below the ES300h 頂級版 (52.8%). HONESTY FLAG RETAINED: this is still one car from one dealer, and it carries about 27,000 km against our 35,000 km, which argues our car should sit slightly under it rather than level. Confidence stays LOW here even though the 頂級版's matching point is now medium, because this trim's figure adds a derived equipment credit on top of a single observed listing of the OTHER trim."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REBUILT IN THE SET REPAIR, lowered from 1,840,000 to 1,670,000. The old figure gave 35.0% against the 頂級版's 32.6%, another inversion. DERIVATION: 頂級版 private 1,635,000 plus 35,000, which is 14% of the 250,000 equipment premium. By seven years almost nothing of an equipment grade is still being paid for - a buyer at this price is buying a well-kept LS, not a specific trim - so the recovered share is nearly exhausted. Result 1,670,000, which is 31.8% of this car's 5,250,000 real_cost against the 頂級版's 32.6%: above in money, 0.8 points below in percentage, still narrowing. Implied dealer ask about 1,876,000, or 34.7% of the 5,400,000 sticker against the 頂級版's 35.7% of its own. dealer_tradein_price 1,445,000 is 13.5% below private - the shared rule widens slightly here because listing spread genuinely widens at this age and private buyers negotiate harder on an out-of-warranty flagship. REAL 7-YEAR CARS EXIST but every one is a high-mileage example from the formula-priced block: 8891 rows re-confirmed 2026-08-22 show 2018 and 2019 LS500h 旗艦版 stock at an identical 115.8萬 with 100,000 km or more. Three cars, two model years, one price - that is one weak data point, not three, and it is uninformative about age because an 8-year car and a 7-year car carry the same ask. THE FLOOR IS ALSO THE FINDING: the fact that the price stops moving between years 7 and 8 is exactly the flattening the Lexus tail is supposed to show, and it is the argument for putting this car above the German at this age rather than below it. Our car carries 49,000 km, roughly half those comparables; the +0.28%/1,000 km slope applied across 51,000 km would give about 132萬, and that linear factor understates the gap because a six-figure odometer on a V6 flagship hybrid is a step, not a slope. COHERENCE: about 2.0 points above the BMW 735i (29.8%) and 11.2 below the ES300h 頂級版 (43.0%). This is also where the warranty cliff bites - Lexus TW cover including the free 5th-year extension has been gone for two years - and the maintenance block puts the first out-of-warranty risk pool in exactly this window. LOW confidence: one floored dealer price and a mileage correction of more than 50,000 km."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REBUILT IN THE SET REPAIR, lowered from 1,260,000 to 1,185,000. The old figure gave 24.0% against the 頂級版's 23.1%. DERIVATION: 頂級版 private 1,155,000 plus 30,000, which is 12% of the 250,000 equipment premium - the residue of a trim badge on a decade-old car, essentially the value of nicer leather and rear-seat hardware to a buyer who is mostly buying condition and service history. Result 1,185,000, which is 22.6% of this car's 5,250,000 real_cost against the 頂級版's 23.1%: above in money, 0.5 points below in percentage, the narrowest gap of the five checkpoints (1.5 / 1.2 / 1.0 / 0.8 / 0.5), which is the correct end state for a decayed trim premium. Implied dealer ask about 1,331,000, or 24.7% of the 5,400,000 sticker against the 頂級版's 25.2% of its own. dealer_tradein_price 1,019,000 is 14% below private, wider than the earlier checkpoints because dealers price ten-year flagship stock defensively. THIS REMAINS THE WEAKEST POINT IN THE RECORD. The 5th-gen LS reached Taiwan in late 2017, so no 10-year same-generation example can exist; the oldest are the 2018s. SAME-GENERATION UPPER BRACKET: the 2018 LS500h 旗艦版 at 115.8萬 with 100,000 km is 8 years old and sits at about 23.8% of its own roughly 4,860,000 cost basis - but it comes from the year-only formula sheet, so it is a floor, not a level. PREVIOUS-GENERATION FLOOR (8891, re-confirmed 2026-08-22): a 2008 LS600hL at 26.8萬 and 2013 LS460L stock at 39.8萬, roughly 7-11% of their own original lists. THAT IS A FLOOR, NOT A FORECAST, for specific reasons: the LS600h is a known money pit in Taiwan (complex AWD hybrid, expensive HV pack) with a near-nonexistent buyer pool, and the LS460L is a V8 GASOLINE long-wheelbase car - a different model and a different powertrain - so it is directional evidence only. Both also carry 130,000-178,000 km, roughly two to two-and-a-half times this buyer's 70,000 km. Interpolating from the 8-year floor to the previous-generation evidence, crediting the very low mileage, and refusing to let a liquidation sheet set the level, is what puts the 頂級版 base curve at 25.2% of list here. DIVERGENCE, EXPLAINED: about 5.1 points above the BMW 735i (17.5%) and 8.4 below the ES300h 頂級版 (31.0%). The gap over the German is largest here and the reason is real rather than reflexive brand loyalty: at 10 years the buyer of either car is buying running-cost risk, and the Lexus carries no turbos, no coil-pack or plastic-coolant-fitting pool, a hybrid V6 with a documented service history, and an HV pack that at 70,000 km is unlikely to have been worked hard. The gap under the ES is the segment problem, which never goes away. This is still the lowest 10-year retention of any Lexus hybrid in the dataset, which is the right story for a large illiquid flagship sedan. LOW confidence: a generation jump onto a different powertrain, no priced 10-year same-model comparable at all, and heavy mileage correction on every input."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"REBUILT ON THE SHARED SCHEDULE, raised from 16,000 to 21,000. Two paid visits fall in year 1: the 6-month routine at about 8,000 and the 12-month annual at about 13,000. The previous version of this record priced them at 6,000 and 10,000; the sibling 頂級版 priced the same two visits at 9,000 and 18,000 and added a 3,000 washing line. Both are now 21,000 on the settled per-visit table, and the discretionary washing line is dropped because it is not scheduled maintenance. Intervals and the free first-month inspection VERIFIED at lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx; warranty terms VERIFIED at lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx (both re-opened 2026-08-22). Per-visit NT$ figures are TW market estimates, not receipts - the maintenance-plan page publishes no prices. Covers 0-1 year only."},{"y":3,"source":"REBUILT ON THE SHARED SCHEDULE, raised from 38,000 to 52,000. Four time-driven visits fall in this window: two routines at 8,000, the 24-month brake-fluid stage at 19,000 and the 36-month annual at 13,000, giving 48,000 scheduled, plus about 4,000 of wipers and one alignment. The previous version of this record carried 38,000 and the sibling 頂級版 carried 60,000 for the same four visits; both are now 52,000. Nothing is mileage-triggered at 21,000 km. The 24-month interval is VERIFIED at lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx and the 3-year tire and 12V battery coverage at lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx (both re-opened 2026-08-22). Per-visit costs are TW market estimates. Covers 1-3 years only."},{"y":5,"source":"REBUILT ON THE SHARED SCHEDULE, raised from 136,000 to 142,000. Scheduled work is 65,000: routines at 42 and 54 months (8,000 each), the 48-month major at 36,000 and the 60-month annual at 13,000. Age-driven items add the first tire set at 60,000, the 12V AGM battery at 12,000 and 5,000 of alignment and consumables. THIS PERIOD IS THE ONE PLACE THE TWO LS RECORDS LEGITIMATELY DIFFER: the 頂級版 carries 130,000 here, exactly 12,000 less, because its 245/50R19 set costs about 48,000 against this trim's 245/45R20 at about 60,000. Both sizes are verified per trim on the TVBS spec table (opened 2026-08-22). The tire figure is revised down from 70,000: 20-inch premium rubber in Taiwan reaches about 15,000 a corner fitted, and the earlier number carried a run-flat assumption that could not be confirmed on any page that opened. 48-month interval VERIFIED at lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx; the free 5th-year extension and its punctual-service condition VERIFIED at lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx. Tire SIZE is verified; tire and 12V prices are TW market estimates, not receipts, hence low confidence. Covers 3-5 years only. This period is deliberately far heavier than the previous one because both age-driven consumables land inside it."},{"y":7,"source":"REBUILT ON THE SHARED SCHEDULE, lowered from 137,000 to 129,000, and now IDENTICAL to the 頂級版's figure for this window - there is no tire spend in this period, so there is no legitimate trim difference in it. Scheduled work is 48,000: routines at 66 and 78 months (8,000 each), the 72-month brake-fluid stage at 19,000 and the 84-month annual at 13,000. Front pads and discs add 32,000, consumables 4,000, and the out-of-warranty risk pool 45,000. THE RISK POOL WAS CUT FROM 60,000 TO 45,000 ON A CORRECTED FACT, not a re-guess: the sibling record had sized its pool on 'a single air-suspension corner runs about 60,000', and this record had carried a compressor line 'if this trim is air-sprung'. The TVBS LS spec table lists 多連桿 front and rear on every LS trim and lists no air suspension anywhere; two further attempts to confirm air-strut fitment (the official showroom page and the 8891 specification page) returned no equipment detail at all. Neither record now budgets air struts. At 45,000 across two years, on a 6-to-7 year old low-mileage Lexus, this is still a real allowance. Intervals VERIFIED at lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx; warranty expiry VERIFIED at lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx (both re-opened 2026-08-22). The brake and contingency figures are estimates, not receipts. Covers 5-7 years only."},{"y":10,"source":"REBUILT ON THE SHARED SCHEDULE, lowered from 353,000 to 335,000. Scheduled work is 92,000 across six visits: the 96-month major at 36,000, the 120-month stage at 19,000, the 108-month annual at 13,000 and three routines at 8,000. Age-driven items add the second tire set at 60,000, brakes all round at 40,000, the suspension refresh at 70,000, the second 12V AGM battery at 12,000, the out-of-warranty risk pool at 55,000 and 6,000 of consumables. The previous version of this record carried 353,000 here and the sibling 頂級版 carried 250,000 - a 40% disagreement about one three-year window on the same car, on the same schedule, with the same warranty. Both are now built from the same list and differ only by the 12,000 tire-size gap. The engine and inverter coolant service is inside the 96-month major and is no longer billed as a separate line, which removes a double count. Intervals VERIFIED at lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx; warranty windows VERIFIED at lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx (both re-opened 2026-08-22). Everything beyond the scheduled visits is extrapolated for a 7-10 year old, low-mileage Lexus flagship in Taiwan - no receipts were found and, for a car of this age in this generation, some of these events have not happened to anybody yet. Covers 7-10 years only. This period is still by far the heaviest because the suspension work, the second tire set and the full brake refresh all land inside it."}],"sources":[{"name":"KingAutos — Lexus LS trim price table","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/ls","note":"Re-opened 2026-08-22. THE PRIMARY LIST-PRICE SOURCE. Gives the full 2026 Taiwan lineup: 500h F Sport版 515萬 / 500h頂級版 515萬 / 500h旗艦版 540萬 / 500h旗艦 KIRIKO版 590萬 / 500h旗艦 銀光箔藝版 590萬. Independently confirms 5,400,000 for this 旗艦版 and 5,150,000 for the sibling 頂級版, so both records now price off one table. The page also carries a previous-model-year block reading 500h F Sport 475萬 / 500h 頂級 475萬 / 500h 旗艦 500萬, which is the historical denominator used in the value_checkpoints."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — official LS showroom page","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/showroom/LS","note":"Re-opened 2026-08-22. Official brand site. Publishes the LS line as NT$515~590萬, powertrain 500h only, with NO per-trim breakdown. Confirms the endpoints of the 2026 lineup around KingAutos's 540萬 middle rung. A request for equipment detail (suspension, wheel and tire size, audio, rear seat) returned nothing but a brochure download link, which is one of the two reasons the air-suspension budget was cut."},{"name":"TVBS 汽車頻道 — Lexus LS spec and price table","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/lexus/2022-lexus-ls","note":"Re-opened 2026-08-22. THE SOURCE THAT SETTLES THE TIRE DISPUTE BETWEEN THE TWO LS RECORDS. Tire sizes per trim: 旗艦版 245/45R20, 頂級版 245/50R19, F Sport 245/45R20 front with 275/40R20 rear, Kiriko 245/45R20. The sibling 頂級版 record had wrongly carried the F Sport's staggered 20-inch fitment; it now carries 245/50R19, and that single difference is the only maintenance difference between the two records. The table lists 多連桿 front and rear on every trim and does NOT list air suspension for any of them, which is why the air-suspension lines in both records were replaced by a general suspension refresh. It also confirms the previous-model-year pricing block (500h頂級版 475萬 / 500h旗艦版 500萬), the cost bases the 2021 and 2022 used listings are ratioed against, and the powertrain: naturally aspirated 3,456cc V6, 299 hp, plus a 179 hp motor, 359 hp combined - the full-hybrid evidence behind the 'hybrid' classification."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Lexus LS listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/ls","note":"Re-opened 2026-08-22; every load-bearing row was re-read from the live page, about 45 rows. THE PRIMARY USED-CAR SOURCE. Same-model rows (LS500h only), all 車商售價: 2023 旗艦版 電洽 (Kaohsiung, '僅跑9000公里'); 2022 旗艦版 205.8萬 (New Taipei); 2021 頂級版 218.8萬 (Taipei, the only independently priced current-generation car and the anchor for the whole LS set); 2021 頂級版 194.8萬 (New Taipei); 2018 旗艦版 115.8萬 (New Taipei). ONE ROW IS DIRECT EVIDENCE FOR THE CORRECTED TRIM LADDER: the 2022 旗艦版 asks 205.8萬 while the 2021 頂級版 - a year older and a rung cheaper when new - asks 218.8萬. Mileage differs between them, so it is not a clean trim comparison, but it rules out any large used premium for the 旗艦版 in Taiwan and it is inconsistent with the higher-retention-for-a-pricier-trim curve this record used to carry. THE KEY CAUTION IS IN THE REPETITION: one New Taipei dealer prices its LS stock by model year alone and ignores mileage. The clearest proof is outside the hybrid rows - the same dealer lists a 2019 LS500 頂級版 at the identical 122.8萬 whether the odometer reads 7,800 km or 79,000 km. That block is a liquidation formula, not a market level, and treating it as market is what pushed an earlier version of this curve too low. Previous-generation rows, used only as a directional 10-year floor and NOT as same-model comparables: 2008 LS600hL 26.8萬, 2013 LS460L 39.8萬, 2007 LS460L 7.0萬. The LS460L is a V8 gasoline long-wheelbase car and the LS600h an AWD V8 hybrid - neither is this car."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 — LEXUS / LS search","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/LEXUS/LS","note":"Re-opened 2026-08-22. Returns 車輛搜尋結果 共 0 筆 - zero listings of any LS, any age. Used as evidence of segment illiquidity, which is the stated reason this car's retention sits below the ES300h anchor at every checkpoint. It is NOT a reason to place it below the BMW 735i, which shares the segment."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — scheduled maintenance plan","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"Re-opened 2026-08-22. VERIFIED: free inspection in the first month after registration (24 items), then service at 6 / 12 / 24 / 48 months paired with 10,000 / 20,000 / 40,000 / 80,000 km, whichever comes first. No free scheduled maintenance beyond the first month, and nothing hybrid-specific. This is what makes the plan time-driven at 7,000 km/yr - 20 paid visits in 10 years. NO PRICES ARE PUBLISHED on this page, which is why the per-visit figures in the maintenance block are market estimates while the schedule they are applied to is not. This single reading is what both LS500h records in this dataset now share, and rebuilding both blocks from it is what removed the period-by-period disagreement the cross-check found."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan — new-car warranty","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx","note":"Re-opened 2026-08-22. VERIFIED: 4 years / 120,000 km basic, extended free to a 5th year / 140,000 km only if the owner services punctually every six months; 12V battery 3 years unlimited mileage; tires 3 years against manufacturing defects, pro-rated on remaining tread. NOT VERIFIED: the page does NOT publish a traction-battery term. It names an 'Electrified battery guarantee' and refers the owner to the manual, so the 8-year / 160,000 km figure is a directional assumption, not a sourced fact, and no HV pack cost is budgeted anywhere in this record."},{"name":"8891 — Lexus LS specification page","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/lexus/ls/Specification.html","note":"Opened and returned NO usable data - page title only, no equipment table. This was the second failed attempt to confirm the 旗艦版's suspension type and run-flat tire fitment. It is recorded so the failed attempt stays visible; the question was settled instead by the TVBS spec table, which lists 多連桿 on every trim and no air suspension, and which also gives the per-trim tire sizes."}]},"lexus-ls500h-premium":{"assumptions":"At 7,000 km/year this LS never reaches its 10,000 km service trigger, so every visit is fired by the Lexus Taiwan 6-month time interval (2 visits/year, 20 visits across ten years). The 48-month/80,000 km major stage - Multi Stage Hybrid transmission fluid, coolant, fuel filter - therefore arrives on the calendar at year 4 with only 28,000 km on the car, and is paid in full. The tires reach their date code long before the tread wears out, so they are replaced on age at about years 5 and 10, not on mileage. Low mileage is the strongest price lever on a used Taiwan LS, and every checkpoint below is quoted for a low-mileage car and stated as such. Against that, the LS has a thin used-buyer pool: it is a single-powertrain flagship sedan with a very small share of its segment in Taiwan, and CPO cars sit unsold, which caps the upside that low mileage can buy. TIRE SIZE CORRECTED IN THIS SET REPAIR. The previous version of this record put 20-inch staggered rubber (245/45R20 front, 275/40R20 rear) on the 頂級版. That is the F Sport fitment, not this trim. The TVBS LS spec table (opened 2026-08-22) lists the sizes per trim: 頂級版 245/50R19, 旗艦版 245/45R20, F Sport 245/45R20 front with 275/40R20 rear. This 頂級版 therefore runs four 245/50R19, a single size, and its tire spend is lower than the 旗艦版's for that reason. This is the ONLY maintenance difference between the two LS500h records in this dataset; every other period cost is now identical by construction. SUSPENSION: the same TVBS table lists 多連桿 front and rear on every LS trim and does NOT list air suspension on any of them. The previous version budgeted air-strut repairs at years 7 and 10 on an unverified fitment; those lines are now a general suspension refresh, sized the same in both LS records. EVIDENCE STATUS UPDATED. A previous pass deleted seven dead Google search-result URLs and marked all used-price evidence unverifiable. In this repair the 8891 LS listing page was opened directly (2026-08-22) and it loads: about 45 rows, and the LS500h rows the sibling 旗艦版 record cites are all present and confirmed. The used-price evidence is therefore no longer blind, and the 5-year checkpoint is restored to medium confidence on the strength of one independently priced current-generation 頂級版. The other four checkpoints stay low.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Price unchanged at 3,720,000; retention restated as 74.2% of the corrected real_cost of 5,010,000. Method, now shared with the 旗艦版 record: implied general-dealer retail about 4,180,000 (81.2% of the 5,150,000 list) for a 1-year 頂級版 at 7,000 km, less 11% for a private sale, gives 3,720,000. The 11% haircut is the one figure used at every checkpoint in both LS records and sits inside the required 8-15% band. dealer_tradein_price 3,235,000 is a further 13% below private, also the shared rule. Low-mileage premium is included and stated: 7,000 km at one year is roughly half the Taiwan average, worth about 3-4 points on a car of this class. THERE IS NO 1-YEAR LS IN TAIWAN TO CHECK AGAINST. The 8891 LS page was opened in this repair (2026-08-22) and the newest LS500h on it is a 2022 旗艦版; SUM 汽車網 returns 共 0 筆 for LEXUS/LS at any age. This point is therefore a shape judgement anchored on the year-5 evidence below, which is why confidence stays low. TRIM WARNING RETAINED: the only 1-year comparable an earlier pass ever found was a 旗艦版 demonstrator, a different and more expensive trim, so it fixes a ceiling and not this point."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Price unchanged at 2,840,000; retention restated as 56.7% of the corrected real_cost of 5,010,000. Implied dealer retail about 3,190,000 (62.0% of the 5,150,000 list) for a 頂級版 at 3 years and 21,000 km, less 11% for a private sale, gives 2,840,000; dealer_tradein_price 2,470,000 is a further 13% below private. Both haircuts are the shared LS rules. This checkpoint sits essentially level with the BMW 735i by design: at 3 years the flagship-sedan penalty is at its strongest and nearly cancels the Lexus advantage, which only widens later. One LS-specific factor behind that: the 7 Series has a corporate and lease channel in Taiwan producing a steady supply of managed 3-year cars and a published residual guide, while every used LS is a one-off retail trade. EVIDENCE: the closest car on 8891 is a 2023 旗艦版 priced 電洽, so there is no published 3-year number for either trim, and the priced current-generation stock is concentrated with one New Taipei dealer who prices by model year and ignores mileage - the clearest proof is that the same dealer lists a 2019 LS500 頂級版 at 122.8萬 whether the odometer reads 7,800 km or 79,000 km. That block is a liquidation formula, not a market level, and it is not allowed to set this point. Confidence low."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Price unchanged at 2,110,000; retention restated as 42.1% of the corrected real_cost of 5,010,000. CONFIDENCE RAISED FROM LOW TO MEDIUM IN THIS REPAIR, because the evidence a previous pass could not open has now been read directly and it corroborates this number almost exactly. On 8891 (opened 2026-08-22) there is one independently priced current-generation 頂級版: a 2021 LS500h 頂級版 in Taipei at 2,188,000. It is 5 years old today, which is precisely this checkpoint's age, and it is the only current-generation LS in the pool that does not come from the New Taipei year-only pricing sheet. Its own new list was 4,750,000 (verified on the TVBS 2022 LS spec table: 500h頂級版 475萬). Scaling that ask onto our 5,150,000 list gives 2,188,000 x 5,150,000 / 4,750,000 = about 2,372,000 as the equivalent dealer ask for our car. This record's implied dealer ask, worked independently from the curve, is 2,110,000 / 0.89 = about 2,371,000. The two agree to within 0.1%, and they were derived from different directions. CAVEAT, STATED: the observed car carries about 27,000 km against our 35,000 km, so a strict like-for-like would pull ours a little below the listing rather than level with it; that is the reason this is medium and not high, along with it being a single car from a single dealter. The year-4-to-5 step down is priced in: the 4-year/120,000 km factory warranty and its free 5th-year extension are expiring, and buyers begin pricing HV battery and Multi Stage Hybrid transmission risk on a 500萬 machine. dealer_tradein_price 1,835,000 is 13% below private, the shared rule. THIS IS THE ANCHOR POINT FOR THE WHOLE LS SET: the sibling 旗艦版 record now derives its 5-year figure from this one plus a trim credit, rather than from a separate reading of the same listing pool."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Price unchanged at 1,635,000; retention restated as 32.6% of the corrected real_cost of 5,010,000. TRIM AND BODY HONESTY, retained from the previous pass because it still governs this point: the comparables available at this age are not this car. 8891 shows 2018 and 2019 LS500h 旗艦版 cars at 115.8萬 with 100,000 km or more - a higher trim, twice our mileage, and all from the New Taipei year-only pricing sheet that gives an 8-year car and a 7-year car the same number. That is one weak data point, not three. Earlier passes also leaned on an LS 500 頂級版 (the withdrawn gasoline V6) and an LS 350 豪華版 (different powertrain, much cheaper grade); neither is admissible for setting a 500h 頂級版 point. Method used instead: the 頂級版 curve is carried through from the year-5 anchor above on the normal Taiwan flagship decay of roughly 4 to 5 points of list per year over years 6 and 7, giving an implied dealer retail of about 1,837,000 (35.7% of list) for a 49,000 km car; less 11% for a private sale gives 1,635,000. dealer_tradein_price 1,420,000 is 13.2% below private. The low-mileage premium is the whole story at this age: 49,000 km is roughly half what the cheap high-mileage stock carries. This is the first checkpoint fully outside all factory warranty cover, and the maintenance block puts the first out-of-warranty risk pool in exactly this window. Confidence stays low."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"EXTRAPOLATED. Price unchanged at 1,155,000; retention restated as 23.1% of the corrected real_cost of 5,010,000. No real 10-year data exists for this generation: the XF50 LS launched in Taiwan in November 2017, so the oldest current-generation cars are about 8.7 years old today and none has reached ten years. Method, stated explicitly: about 25% of list as dealer retail gives about 1,298,000, less 11% for a private sale gives 1,155,000. dealer_tradein_price 993,000 is 14% below private, a wider gap than the earlier checkpoints because dealers price ten-year flagship stock defensively. BRACKETING EVIDENCE, both floors rather than forecasts. Above: the 2018 LS500h 旗艦版 on 8891 asks 115.8萬 at 8 years with 100,000 km, which comes from the year-only pricing sheet and so is a floor. Below: the previous-generation cars on the same page - a 2008 LS600hL at 26.8萬 and 2013 LS460L stock - sit near 7-11% of their own original lists, but the LS600h is a known money pit in Taiwan and the LS460L is a V8 gasoline long-wheelbase car, so both are directional only and neither is a same-model comparable. The gasoline LS 500 is likewise the wrong donor: it is a withdrawn powertrain with no dealer-network confidence behind it, so it clears lower than the hybrid will. Interpolating between those floors and crediting the very low 70,000 km lands here. The 6-point gap over the BMW 735i at 10 years is the largest single divergence in this record from the German anchors and is deliberate: at ten years the buyer of either car is buying running-cost risk, and the Lexus carries no turbos, no coil-pack or plastic-coolant-fitting pool, and an HV pack that at 70,000 km has not been worked hard. Confidence low: this is explicit extrapolation, not observed current-generation data."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"REBUILT ON THE SHARED SCHEDULE. Two paid visits fall in year 1: the 6-month routine at about 8,000 and the 12-month annual at about 13,000, giving 21,000. The previous version carried 30,000 by pricing the same two visits at 9,000 and 18,000 and adding 3,000 of 洗車 and 小美容; the sibling 旗艦版 carried 16,000 by pricing them at 6,000 and 10,000. Both are now 21,000 on the settled per-visit table, and the discretionary 洗車 line is dropped because it is not scheduled maintenance. Spark plugs are listed at the 12個月/2萬公里 stage but are long-life iridium and are not touched at 7,000 km. Intervals and the scope of the free first-month service are verified on the official Lexus Taiwan 保養計劃 page (re-opened 2026-08-22); the money figures are scaled estimates, hence medium."},{"y":3,"source":"REBUILT ON THE SHARED SCHEDULE. Four time-driven visits fall in this window: two routines at 8,000, the 24個月 brake-fluid stage at 19,000 and the 36個月 annual at 13,000, giving 48,000 scheduled, plus about 4,000 of wipers and one alignment. Total 52,000. The previous version carried 60,000 and the sibling 旗艦版 carried 38,000 for the same four visits; both are now 52,000. Nothing is mileage-triggered at 21,000 km. The stage list and the 24-month brake-fluid item are verified on the official Lexus Taiwan 保養計劃 page; the prices are scaled estimates, hence medium."},{"y":5,"source":"REBUILT ON THE SHARED SCHEDULE. Scheduled work is 65,000: routines at 42 and 54 months (8,000 each), the 48個月 major at 36,000 and the 60個月 annual at 13,000. Age-driven items add the first tire set at 48,000, the 12V AGM battery at 12,000 and 5,000 of alignment and consumables, giving 130,000. TIRE SIZE CORRECTED: this trim runs four 245/50R19, verified on the TVBS LS spec table opened 2026-08-22. The previous version of this record put the F Sport's staggered 245/45R20 and 275/40R20 on it and priced the set at 52,000; that was the wrong fitment for the trim. At 7,000 km/year the tires age out with tread left, a direct consequence of this owner's low mileage. FRONT BRAKE PADS ARE DELIBERATELY NOT IN THIS PERIOD. The previous version put 16,000 of front pads here; the sibling record put none. Multi Stage Hybrid regeneration does almost all the braking at this mileage, so the pads survive well past 35,000 km and the first brake spend now sits in the 7-year period in both records. The free 5th-year/140,000 km warranty extension covers failures but not one item on this list, so all of it is out of pocket. Confidence low: the tire set is the largest line and its price is a market estimate, not an invoice."},{"y":7,"source":"REBUILT ON THE SHARED SCHEDULE. Scheduled work is 48,000: routines at 66 and 78 months (8,000 each), the 72個月 brake-fluid stage at 19,000 and the 84個月 annual at 13,000. Front pads and discs add 32,000, consumables 4,000, and the out-of-warranty risk pool 45,000, giving 129,000. THE RISK POOL WAS CUT FROM 59,000 TO 45,000 AND THE REASON IS A CORRECTED FACT, not a re-guess. The previous version sized it on 'a single air-suspension corner runs about 60,000 at a Lexus 服務廠'. The TVBS LS spec table lists 多連桿 front and rear on every LS trim and lists no air suspension anywhere, and two further attempts to confirm air-strut fitment (the official showroom page and the 8891 specification page) returned no equipment detail at all. Betting the pool on an unconfirmed fitment inflated it. At 45,000 across two years, on a 6-to-7 year old low-mileage Lexus carrying no turbo, coil-pack or plastic-coolant-part risk, this is still a real allowance and it is the same number in both LS records. Confidence low - this is an expected-value allowance, not an invoice."},{"y":10,"source":"REBUILT ON THE SHARED SCHEDULE. Scheduled work is 92,000 across six visits: the 96個月 major at 36,000, the 120個月 stage at 19,000, the 108個月 annual at 13,000 and three routines at 8,000. Age-driven items add the second tire set at 48,000, brakes all round at 40,000, the suspension refresh at 70,000, the second 12V AGM battery at 12,000, the out-of-warranty risk pool at 55,000 and 6,000 of consumables, giving 323,000. The previous version of this record carried 250,000 here and the sibling 旗艦版 carried 353,000 - a 40% disagreement about one three-year window on the same car. Both are now built from the same list; this record differs from the 旗艦版 only by the 12,000 tire-size gap. THE SUSPENSION LINE IS 70,000 AND IS NOT AN AIR-SUSPENSION LINE, for the reason given in the 7-year source: the fitment could not be confirmed on any page that opened, and the one spec table that does open lists 多連桿 on every trim. Ten-year total across all five periods is 655,000. Confidence low because no XF50 LS in Taiwan has yet reached ten years, so the tail is projected rather than observed, and for some of these events nobody has an invoice yet."}],"sources":[{"name":"Lexus Taiwan - LS showroom (official)","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/showroom/LS","note":"Re-opened and verified 2026-08-22. States the official LS price range as NT$515萬~590萬 on a single 500h hybrid powertrain. Fixes the 頂級版 at 5,150,000 as the entry point of that range, and confirms no gasoline LS is sold in Taiwan. Carries no per-trim breakdown and no equipment detail - a request for suspension, wheel and tire data returned only a brochure link, which is one of the two reasons the air-suspension budget was cut."},{"name":"KingAutos - Lexus LS trim price table","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/lexus/ls","note":"ADDED IN THIS SET REPAIR; opened 2026-08-22. Breaks the showroom range out per trim: 500h F Sport版 515萬 / 500h頂級版 515萬 / 500h旗艦版 540萬 / 500h旗艦 KIRIKO版 590萬 / 500h旗艦 銀光箔藝版 590萬, plus a previous-model-year block reading 475萬 / 475萬 / 500萬. Independently confirms 5,150,000 for this 頂級版 and 5,400,000 for the sibling 旗艦版, so both records now use one sourced price table instead of two."},{"name":"TVBS 汽車頻道 - Lexus LS spec and price table","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/spec/lexus/2022-lexus-ls","note":"ADDED IN THIS SET REPAIR; opened 2026-08-22. THE SOURCE THAT SETTLES THE TIRE DISPUTE. Tire sizes per trim: 頂級版 245/50R19, 旗艦版 245/45R20, F Sport 245/45R20 front with 275/40R20 rear, KIRIKO 245/45R20. The previous version of this record had put the F Sport's staggered 20-inch fitment on the 頂級版. The same table lists 多連桿 front and rear suspension on every trim and does NOT list air suspension on any of them, which is why the air-strut budgets in both LS records were replaced by a general suspension refresh. It also gives the previous-model-year prices (500h頂級版 475萬 / 500h旗艦版 500萬), which are the cost bases the 2021 and 2022 used listings are ratioed against, and the powertrain detail behind the 'hybrid' classification: 3,456cc naturally aspirated V6, 299 hp, plus a 179 hp motor, 359 hp combined."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Lexus LS listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/lexus/ls","note":"RESTORED IN THIS SET REPAIR; opened directly 2026-08-22 and it loads, about 45 rows. A previous pass had marked all used-price evidence unverifiable because the earlier citations were dead Google search-result URLs; the underlying page itself is live. Load-bearing rows confirmed: 2021 LS500h 頂級版 218.8萬 (Taipei) - the only independently priced current-generation LS and the anchor for this record's 5-year checkpoint; 2021 LS500h 頂級版 194.8萬 (New Taipei); 2022 LS500h 旗艦版 205.8萬 (New Taipei); 2018 LS500h 旗艦版 115.8萬 (New Taipei); 2019 LS500 頂級版 122.8萬 (New Taipei). THE KEY CAUTION IS IN THE REPETITION: one New Taipei dealer prices its LS stock by model year and ignores mileage - it lists a 2019 LS500 頂級版 at the identical 122.8萬 whether the odometer reads 7,800 km or 79,000 km. That block is a liquidation formula rather than a market level and is not allowed to set any checkpoint. Previous-generation rows (2008 LS600hL 26.8萬, 2013 LS460L 39.8萬) are used only as a directional 10-year floor: the LS600h is a V8 AWD hybrid and the LS460L a V8 gasoline long-wheelbase car, so neither is a same-model comparable."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - LEXUS / LS search","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/LEXUS/LS","note":"ADDED IN THIS SET REPAIR; opened 2026-08-22. Returns 車輛搜尋結果 共 0 筆 - zero listings of any LS at any age. Used as evidence of segment illiquidity, which is the stated reason this car's retention sits below the ES300h anchor at every checkpoint. It is NOT a reason to place it below the BMW 735i, which shares the segment."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan - 保證方案 / 延長保證","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/warranty.aspx","note":"Verified. New-car warranty 4 years / 120,000 km basic; free extension to a 5th year / 140,000 km for owners who keep punctual 6-month service intervals; 12V battery 3 years unlimited mileage; tires 3 years against manufacturing defects. Used to place all out-of-warranty risk in the 7-year and 10-year maintenance periods. NOT PUBLISHED on this page: any traction-battery term. The page names an 'Electrified battery guarantee' and refers the owner to the manual, so the commonly quoted 8 years / 160,000 km is a directional assumption and no HV pack cost is budgeted anywhere in this record."},{"name":"Lexus Taiwan - 保養計劃","url":"https://www.lexus.com.tw/service/maintenance-plan.aspx","note":"Re-opened and verified 2026-08-22. Five stages: 滿月 (24 items), 6個月/1萬公里 (16 items), 12個月/2萬公里 (29 items), 24個月/4萬公里 (34 items), 48個月/8萬公里 (37 items), each due at whichever of time or distance comes first - time-driven at 7,000 km/year, so 20 paid visits in ten years. Only the 新車保養服務/滿月保養 is complimentary. NO PRICES ARE PUBLISHED on this page, which is why the per-visit figures in the maintenance block are market estimates; the schedule they are applied to is not. This single reading is what both LS500h records in this dataset now share."}]},"mercedes-c200-estate":{"assumptions":"At 7,000 km/year the C 200 Estate never reaches a mileage-driven service trigger. Mercedes ASSYST PLUS calls Service A/B at 1 year or 15,000-25,000 km, whichever comes first, so every visit in this record is the annual time trigger and the car arrives with roughly a third of the allowed mileage. Wear parts are therefore replaced on age, not on tread or friction material: tires go at 5-6 years with tread left, and the 12V AGM battery and the coolant follow the calendar. RESALE, AND THE CORRECTION MADE IN THIS PASS: the Taiwan used C-Class Estate pool is very small. 8891 returns 27 C200 Estate cars of all generations and SUM returns 27 C-Class Estates of any engine nationwide. The previous draft turned that scarcity into two separate upward adjustments, and only one of them survives the evidence. What IS supported: a 3-year estate asks far more than a 3-year sedan on the same site (8891 shows 2023 C200 Estate at 179.8萬 with 16,000 km against a 2023 C200 sedan at 149.0萬 with 6,600 km). What is NOT supported: a low-mileage premium inside the estate pool. The listings are close to mileage-blind. 8891 asks 179.8萬 for a 2023 estate at 10,000 km and 178.8萬 for the same trim at 30,000 km, and it asks 143.0萬 for a 2021 estate at 15,600 km while asking 145.0-162.8萬 for 2021 estates at 57,000-58,000 km - the low-mileage car is the CHEAPEST of its year. The previous draft added about 8% at year 5 and about 25% at year 10 for low mileage. Both adjustments are removed here, which is why the 5, 7 and 10 year points fall. The offsetting risk is time-to-sell: in a pool this thin a private seller either waits months or cuts the price, so the dealer-retail to private-sale cut used at every checkpoint is 14%, the wide end of the 8-15% band. The M254 1.5T with the 48V belt-driven starter-generator cannot move the car on battery, so this is classified gasoline, and the starter-generator becomes an out-of-warranty risk item in the 7-10 year window regardless of how few kilometres the car has done.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"8891 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/c/c200-estate) was opened and shows two 2025 C200 Estate cars at 213.0萬 車商售價, one at 3,000 km and one at 5,000 km. Those are the closest real analogues to a one-year car and they are DEALER RETAIL asks, not private-sale money. The 2025 C 200 Estate 運動版 listed at 254萬, verified on Kingautos (https://www.kingautos.net/hot/mercedes_benz/c-class_estate), so 213萬 is 84% of list as a dealer ask. Cutting 14% to private sale gives 183.2萬 against that car's own real cost of about 245.5萬 (254萬 - 13萬 discount + 4.5萬 on-road), i.e. 74.6%. Rounded to 74% and applied to this car's real_cost of 2,575,000 = 1,905,000. Held at 74% rather than pushed to 75-76% because a car sold as 2025年式 in August 2026 may be only 8-12 months old, which would flatter the ratio. Dealer trade-in set 14% below private at 1,640,000, the wide end of the 10-15% band, because dealers hold estates in stock longer. DIVERGENCE NOTE: the C 200 sedan sibling is 72%, so this is +2. Small on purpose - at one year the 星耀版's extra equipment is already written off and the scarcity premium has not yet opened up."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Best-evidenced point, and the one where the previous draft's arithmetic was corrected DOWN. 8891 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/c/c200-estate) was opened and the 2023 C200 Estate rows read: 179.8萬 at 10,000 km, 179.8萬 at 16,000 km (two cars), 178.8萬 at 30,000 km (two cars), 175.8萬 at 30,000 km, 188.8萬 at 63,000 km, 139.0萬 at 110,000 km. The previous draft claimed a low-mileage 2023 estate would be asked at 190-195萬; the site does not support that. The actual low-mileage cluster is 175.8-179.8萬, and the single 188.8萬 car is the HIGHEST-mileage of the cluster, so it is an outlier and not a low-mileage premium. Our 21,000 km car sits inside that cluster at about 178萬 dealer ask. The 2023 C 200 Estate 運動版 listed at about 252萬 (W206 launch 251萬 per CarStuff, plus the 1萬 the 2024 model year added per 7Car https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/101402), so its real cost was about 243.5萬. 178萬 less 14% = 153.1萬 private, i.e. 62.9%. Rounded to 63% of 2,575,000 = 1,620,000. Dealer trade-in 14% below private at 1,395,000. BODY-STYLE AND METHOD CHECK: every row above is an Estate row, read off the Estate page, and the sedan page was opened separately as a control (https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/c/c200?force=1) - 2023 C200 sedan 149.0萬 at 6,600 km and 153.8萬 at 53,000 km, 2024 sedan 179.8萬 at 20,000 km. So a 3-year estate at 16,000 km asks 179.8萬 where a 3-year sedan at 6,600 km asks 149.0萬, a 21% spread on cars whose new prices differed by under 5%. Cause is supply: 8891 carries 27 C200 Estates of all generations, and SUM (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=BENZ&model=C-CLASS+ESTATE) returns only 27 C-Class Estates of any engine nationwide. DIVERGENCE NOTE: the sedan sibling is 59%, so this is +4, and the gap is the observed listing gap rather than a modelling choice."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Corrected DOWN from the previous draft, which added about 8% for low mileage that the listings do not pay for. Four-year evidence, same generation: 8891 shows a 2022 C200 運動版 Estate at 159.8萬 with 35,000 km and another at 159.8萬 with 58,000 km; SUM shows 2022 C200 Estates at 159.8萬 with 58,000 km and 149.8萬 with 57,432 km. The 35,000 km car and the 58,000 km car ask the SAME 159.8萬, which is the direct evidence that no mileage premium is available in this pool. A 2022 C 200 Estate 運動版 listed at 251萬, real cost about 242.5萬. 159.8萬 less 14% = 137.4萬, i.e. 56.7% at four years - and that car already carries our year-5 mileage of 35,000 km. Five-year cross-check on the previous generation: 8891 shows 2021 (W205) C200 Estates at 143.0萬 with 15,600 km, 145.0萬 with 58,000 km, 145.8萬 with 57,000 km, 145.9萬 with 58,200 km and 162.8萬 for the AMG-trim cars at 57,000 km; the 15,600 km car is the cheapest of the group. On a W205 C 200 Estate real cost of roughly 225萬 the 145萬 cluster is about 55% at five years. Both anchors put a five-year 35,000 km car at 52-53%. 52% of 2,575,000 = 1,339,000, rounded to 1,340,000. Dealer trade-in 14% below at 1,150,000. DIVERGENCE NOTE: the sedan sibling is 47%, so this is +5, the widest gap in the record. Reason: years 4-6 are where estate scarcity bites hardest - the car is cheap enough to be reachable and new enough to be wanted, and there is almost no supply, while the sedan competes against a large pool of its own kind plus GLC crossovers. The previous draft put this at 54%; that figure came from the removed mileage premium, not from a listing."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - the W206 Estate reached Taiwan in late 2022, so no seven-year car of this generation exists. Method: take the previous generation (W205 Estate) at a comparable age, express it as a ratio of its own real cost, then apply that ratio here. The previous draft anchored this on a W205 C 250 Estate list price taken from a U-CAR page it could not open; that source is deleted and the anchor is rebuilt on a C200 Estate row that IS openable. 8891 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/c/c200-estate) shows a 2017 C200 Avantgarde Estate at 79.8萬 with 97,000 km and another at 55.8萬 with 172,000 km. On a W205 C 200 Estate real cost of roughly 225萬 the 79.8萬 car is 35% as a dealer ask at nine years, about 30% of real cost after the 14% private cut. Interpolating between the measured five-year point (52%) and that nine-year point, and adding only a small allowance for 49,000 km against 97,000 km - small, because the same listing set shows low mileage earning no premium - gives about 40%. 40% of 2,575,000 = 1,030,000. Dealer trade-in 14% below at 880,000. The tail is kept falling rather than flattening: at seven years the 3-year factory warranty is long gone and the market prices in M254 and 48V starter-generator repair risk. DIVERGENCE NOTE: the sedan sibling is 37%, so this is +3. The estate premium narrows here because repair risk, not body style, sets the price."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"EXTRAPOLATED from the previous generation, same method as year 7, and corrected sharply DOWN from the previous draft. That draft took a W205 C250 Estate cluster and then added about 25% for our lower mileage, which is the single largest unsupported adjustment in the record; the same 8891 estate listings show low-mileage cars asking the same as or less than high-mileage ones of the same year, so the adjustment is removed. Openable evidence: 8891 shows a 2017 C200 Avantgarde Estate at 79.8萬 with 97,000 km (nine years, about 30% of real cost after the private cut) and a 2015 C200 BlueTEC Estate Avantgarde at 49.8萬 with 130,000 km. SUM (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=BENZ&model=C-CLASS+ESTATE) shows the wider W205 cluster: 2015 C250 at 69.8萬 with 141,360 km, 69.8萬 with 134,991 km and 69.8萬 with 239,000 km, a 2015 C-Class Estate at 49.8萬 with 160,000 km, a 2016 C250 at 98.8萬 with 100,000 km and a 2017 C250 at 92.8萬 with 100,000 km. Taking the nine-year C200 point at about 30% and stepping down one year, with only a modest allowance for 70,000 km, gives 29%. 29% of 2,575,000 = 745,000. Dealer trade-in 15% below at 630,000. DIVERGENCE NOTE: the sedan sibling is 28%, so this is +1, the narrowest gap in the record and deliberately so. By ten years the scarcity advantage is cancelled by an equally small buyer pool, and the market is pricing water pump, thermostat housing and 48V starter-generator risk, none of which the estate body changes. Confidence low: this rests on previous-generation cars, most of them C250 rather than C200, and on a W205 list price that could not be confirmed on an openable page."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"One annual Service A at Taiwan Mercedes dealer rates for a 1.5T C-Class, roughly 11,500, plus front and rear wiper blades. Mileage is irrelevant at 7,000 km; the visit is triggered by the calendar. Inside the 3-year unlimited-mileage factory warranty, so no repair cost is assumed. Set 8% above the C 200 sedan sibling's 12,000 for the rear wiper the sedan does not have. Estimated from the standard A/B service pattern - no official Taiwan price table could be opened, hence low confidence."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers years 1-3 only. Two visits: one Service B at about 22,000 including the two-yearly brake fluid change and the cabin filter pair, and one Service A at about 12,000, with the air filter and an alignment folded in. Still inside the 3-year warranty, so no repair line. The previous draft put 58,000 here, 81% above the sedan sibling's 32,000, for a car with the same engine, the same schedule and the same warranty - not supportable. Corrected to 34,000, about 6% above the sedan. Estimated from the A/B pattern at Taiwan dealer rates; no official price table was reachable, so low confidence."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers years 3-5, the first period outside the 3-year factory warranty, so the full dealer rate applies. Lines: Service B about 24,000, Service A about 12,000, a full tire set at about 42,000 because at 7,000 km/year the original tires still have tread at five years but the rubber is age-expired, front pads about 18,000 with the discs left in place at 35,000 km, a 12V AGM battery about 12,000 (the 48V system's own lithium pack is not a scheduled item), plus alignment. Spark plugs fall on the time interval and are done inside Service B. Total 112,000, about 9% above the sedan sibling's 103,000 for the heavier car and its wider tires. The previous draft put 145,000 here, which both overstated the gap to the sedan and made this period more expensive than the 7-year period. Estimated, not quoted - no Taiwan service price table could be opened."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers years 5-7, fully out of warranty. Two services at the unsubsidised rate (Service B about 26,000, Service A about 13,000). Rear pads and discs about 26,000. The 9G-TRONIC fluid and filter service, roughly 18,000, falls due on the time interval regardless of the low mileage. Coolant change about 8,000. Front suspension bushings and control arms are a normal seven-year item on a Taiwan-driven W206, about 24,000. The powered tailgate gas struts, about 8,000, are the Estate-specific addition over the sedan. A small risk allowance is folded in for out-of-warranty electrical faults. Total 133,000, about 6% above the sedan sibling's 125,000. Estimated from the service pattern and typical Taiwan dealer part prices; no receipt-level source could be opened, so low confidence."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers years 7-10, the heaviest period and the reason this record does not flatten the way a Lexus would. Three services at full rate (about 80,000 combined), a second age-expired tire set (about 45,000), and the out-of-warranty repair cluster the Taiwan used market actually prices into a ten-year Mercedes: water pump and thermostat housing about 45,000, coil packs and plugs about 28,000, rear dampers and remaining bushings about 35,000, and a second 12V AGM battery about 12,000. The 48V belt-driven starter-generator is carried as a RISK-WEIGHTED line at about 25,000, not the roughly 60,000 a full replacement costs - it is a probability, not a certainty, and stating it as a certainty would overstate the period. Estate-specific hardware (tailgate seals, rear wiper mechanism, hatch hardware) adds about 13,000 the sedan does not carry. Total 283,000, about 6% above the sedan sibling's 268,000. The previous draft put 220,000 here, BELOW the sedan's 268,000, which contradicted its own note that the estate increment is concentrated in this window; that is corrected. Estimated, not quoted - low confidence for the same source reason as every other maintenance checkpoint."}],"sources":[{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點 - Mercedes-Benz C-Class 與 E-Class 星耀版在臺登場","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/116171","note":"OPENED in this verification pass, full price table read. Primary source for the 2,660,000 list price. Gives the complete 2026 星耀版 table: sedan C 180 225萬 / C 200 261萬 / C 300 305萬 / AMG C 43 391萬, Estate C 200 266萬 / C 300 310萬 / AMG C 43 405萬. Also lists the newly standard Burmester audio, multibeam digital headlights and MBUX AR navigation."},{"name":"新浪 mirror of U-CAR 2026 Mercedes-Benz Taiwan price news","url":"https://k.sina.com.cn/article_7857141524_1d452771401903dxtu.html","note":"OPENED in this pass. Independent confirmation of the same 2026 table: C 200 Estate 星耀版 266萬 (+1), C 300 Estate 星耀版 310萬 (+1), AMG C 43 Estate 星耀版 405萬 (+2). Used because U-CAR's own pages return HTTP 403 to direct fetch."},{"name":"Kingautos - Mercedes-Benz C-Class Estate 車款介紹","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/mercedes_benz/c-class_estate","note":"OPENED in this pass. Source for the pre-2026 trim ladder used as the denominator in the year 1 and year 3 retention math: C200 Estate Avantgarde 240萬, C200 Estate 運動版 254萬, C300 Estate 運動版 297萬. Also shows the site's 油電混合(HEV) label applied to every C-Class including the 48V cars, which is the label convention noted in purchase.notes."},{"name":"UDN 發燒車訊 - 225萬元起 C-Class、E-Class 星耀版登場","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/9443825","note":"OPENED in this pass but thin - confirms the 225萬起 lineup entry point only, with no per-trim table and no Estate prices. Corroborating, not load-bearing."},{"name":"CarStuff 人車事 - W206 C-Class Saloon/Estate 台灣發表","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/34901-237-1-5-2-0-48v-mercedes-benz-c-class-saloon-estate.html","note":"OPENED in this pass. Source for the W206 Taiwan launch prices used as the denominator for the 3- and 5-year retention ratios: Estate C200 AVANTGARDE 237萬 and C200 運動版 251萬; sedan C 180 210萬 / C 200 240萬 / C 300 289萬. Note that the Estate Avantgarde undercuts the C 200 sedan, so the Estate's 運動版 is the trim that matches the used listings."},{"name":"7Car - 24 年式 C-Class、C-Class Estate 售價調整","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/101402","note":"OPENED in this pass. Confirms that all five C-Class trims including C 200 Estate and C 300 Estate rose 10,000 for the 2024 model year while the AMG C 43 pair did not, which lets the 2021 launch prices be walked forward to the 2023-2025 list prices used in the retention math."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Mercedes-Benz C C200 Estate 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/c/c200-estate","note":"OPENED in this pass, all 27 listings read, and EVERY row is an Estate row - the body-style check passes. Key rows: 2025 C200 Estate AMG 213.0萬 at 3,000 km and 213.0萬 at 5,000 km; 2023 運動版/AMG Line 179.8萬 at 10,000 km, 179.8萬 at 16,000 km (two cars), 178.8萬 at 30,000 km (two cars), 175.8萬 at 30,000 km, 188.8萬 at 63,000 km, 139.0萬 at 110,000 km; 2022 運動版 159.8萬 at 35,000 km and 159.8萬 at 58,000 km; 2021 (W205) 143.0萬 at 15,600 km, 145.0萬 at 58,000 km, 145.8萬 at 57,000 km, 145.9萬 at 58,200 km, 162.8萬 AMG trim at 57,000 km; 2017 C200 Avantgarde Estate 79.8萬 at 97,000 km and 55.8萬 at 172,000 km; 2015 C200 BlueTEC Estate 49.8萬 at 130,000 km. ALL are 車商售價 dealer retail asks; every private_sale_price in this record is 14% below them and dealer trade-in a further 14-15% below that. This page is also the evidence that the pool pays no low-mileage premium: within both the 2023 and the 2021 model years, the lowest-mileage car is asked at or below the highest-mileage one."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Mercedes-Benz C C200 (W206 sedan) 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/c/c200?force=1","note":"OPENED in this pass. Used ONLY as the sedan control, to test whether the estate premium is real or a modelling artefact. 2024 sedans 179.8萬 at 20,000 km and 189.0萬 (AMG) at 20,000 km, 165.0萬 at 30,600 km, 159.8萬 at 39,600 km; 2023 sedans 149.0萬 at 6,600 km and 153.8萬 at 53,000 km; 2022 sedan 143.0萬 at 55,400 km. A 3-year sedan at 6,600 km asks 149.0萬 where a 3-year estate at 16,000 km asks 179.8萬 on the same site, so the premium is in the listings, not in the model."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - BENZ C-CLASS ESTATE 中古車行情","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=BENZ&model=C-CLASS+ESTATE","note":"OPENED in this pass, all 27 nationwide listings read. Source for the 4-year and 10-year anchors: 2022 C200 159.8萬 at 58,000 km and 149.8萬 at 57,432 km; 2021 C200 145.0萬 at 121,649 km; 2023 C300 199.8萬 at 74,640 km; and the W205 tail cluster - 2015 C250 69.8萬 at 141,360 km, 69.8萬 at 134,991 km and 69.8萬 at 239,000 km, 2016 C250 98.8萬 at 100,000 km, 2017 C250 92.8萬 at 100,000 km and 72.8萬 at 148,942 km, 2015 C-CLASS ESTATE 49.8萬 at 160,000 km. That the whole country carries only 27 C-Class Estates of any engine or generation is itself the scarcity evidence behind the retention premium over the sedan."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Select 原廠精選中古車 - C 200 Estate detail","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz-select.com.tw/buy-car/detail.aspx?id=802","note":"OPENED in this pass. A W206 C 200 Estate built March 2022 and registered October 2022, 24,897 km, certified at 216.8萬, now sold. NOT used as an anchor for two reasons: 原廠精選 certified retail is the highest price tier in the Taiwan market, above ordinary 車商售價, and the page does not date the listing, so the car may have been priced when it was one or two years old rather than four. Recorded as an upper bound only."}]},"mercedes-c300-avantgarde":{"assumptions":"Buyer drives 6,000-8,000 km/yr against a Taiwan average of 12,000-15,000. Every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7000 * years (7,000/21,000/35,000/49,000/70,000). What this does to THIS car. (1) VALUE: this record was re-checked against the MODEL-FILTERED 8891 page for the C-Class Sedan C 300 (auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/c/c300, 6 pages, 216 rows with year, mileage and asking price). The used curve is strongly mileage-sorted inside each registration year. Verified 2023-registered W206 C 300 sedans today: 1,990,000 at 10,200 km, 1,988,000 at 12,000 km, 1,968,000 at 20,000 km, 1,988,000 at 24,000 km, 1,898,000 at 25,000 km, 1,898,000 at 30,000 km, 1,758,000 at 40,000-43,000 km and 1,650,000 at 60,000 km. That is a 17% spread inside one registration year driven almost entirely by odometer. Our 21,000 km at year 3 sits near the top of that spread, so I quote against the low-mileage end and say so at each checkpoint. (2) MAINTENANCE is TIME-driven, never mileage-driven: Assyst Plus calls service at 10,000 km OR 1 year, whichever comes first, so this owner always trips the calendar and never the odometer. Tires, brake fluid, coolant, the 12V AGM battery and the 48V electronics all age out rather than wear out at 7,000 km/yr, which is why the later windows are dominated by age items. (3) POWERTRAIN: the 2.0L M254 turbo (1,999 c.c., 258 hp, 40.8 kgm) carries EQ Boost, a 48V belt-driven integrated starter-generator adding about 20 hp of assist. It cannot move the car on electricity alone, so this is classified 'gasoline', NOT hybrid. RWD, 9G-Tronic. (4) A TAIWAN-SPECIFIC DRAG that shapes the resale ratios below: at 1,999 c.c. the C 300 falls in the 1,801-2,400 c.c. 牌照稅 bracket while the C 200's 1,496 c.c. engine sits in the 1,201-1,800 bracket. This is not asserted, it is measured: at three years the C 300 asks about 65.6% of its own list (1,960,000 at 21,000 km against a 2,990,000 MY2023 list) while the C 200 asks about 68.2% of its own list (1,740,000 at 21,000 km against a 2,550,000 MY2023 list) on the same site on the same day. Tax and insurance are excluded from every cost figure in this record by design — the bracket is cited only as a reason the C 300's retention PERCENTAGE sits below the C 200's, never as a cost line.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED DURING FACT-CHECK. The earlier version of this record claimed that the newest C 300 on the Taiwanese used market was a 2023 registration and that no 1-year comparable existed anywhere. That claim is false, and it came from reading a brand-wide 8891 page instead of the model-filtered one. On auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/c/c300 today there are two newer rows: a 2025-registered C 300 at 10,000 km asking 2,350,000 車商售價 and a 2024-registered C 300 at 19,700 km asking 2,000,000 車商售價. The 2025 row is the genuine 1-year comparable. Both are badged 4Matic, and Taiwan-spec C 300 is 後輪驅動 per the U-CAR spec table, so both are parallel imports rather than 總代理 cars; that is why confidence stays medium rather than rising to high. Working: 2,350,000 dealer retail is 77.0% of the 3,050,000 list, which is exactly the German-luxury first-year pattern and, by coincidence, the same 77% the earlier version had assumed without evidence. Private sale is 12.3% below dealer retail at 2,060,000 — the lower half of the 8-15% band, because a 1-year car still inside the 3-year factory warranty sells privately with little friction. Dealer trade-in (車商收購價) is a further 13.1% below private at 1,790,000. WHY 77% AND NOT THE C 200'S 79%: the C 300's 305 萬 list carries a 440,000 premium over the C 200 that is mostly engine and equipment, and Taiwan's used market repays engine better than equipment but repays neither in full in year one; the 1,999 c.c. tax bracket also thins the year-one buyer pool. A 30.0% loss against real_cost in twelve months is the steep German first-year hit — deliberately not Toyota-like."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"REAL LISTINGS, CURRENT GENERATION, SAME ENGINE, SAME BODY. Re-scraped from the model-filtered C-Class Sedan C 300 page today. 2023-registered W206 C 300 sedans (3 years old), all 車商售價: 1,990,000 at 10,200 km, 1,988,000 at 12,000 km, 1,968,000 at 20,000 km, 1,988,000 at 24,000 km, 1,898,000 at 25,000 km, 1,898,000 at 30,000 km, 1,758,000 at 40,000 km, 1,758,000 at 43,000 km, 1,650,000 at 60,000 km. DENOMINATOR: a 2023 car is the 23/24年式, list 2,990,000, confirmed by opening the KingAutos article ('C300...售價調漲3萬元，來到299萬元起'). The 20,000-24,000 km cars therefore ask 65.8-66.5% of their own list at three years, and that is the closest real match to our buyer's 21,000 km. I do NOT carry the full 66% across: I use 64% of 3,050,000 = 1,950,000 as the dealer-retail benchmark, because the two highest rows in the cohort (2,080,000 at 24,000 km and 2,080,000 at 27,900 km) are AMG-optioned or 4MATIC cars that sit above the domestic RWD curve, and because the 2026 星耀版's extra 60,000 of list over the 23/24年式 is 夜色套件 trim and AR navigation that the used market does not repay. PRIVATE SALE ADJUSTMENT — this is the number that matters: 1,950,000 is 車商售價, the dealer's asking price, and is NOT what an owner receives. Private sale is 13.8% below it at 1,680,000, at the wide end of the 8-15% band because a 3-year-old 200-萬-class private sale is slow-moving and the seller pays for that in price. Dealer trade-in (車商收購價) is a further 13.1% below private at 1,460,000. DIRECT SIBLING TEST, run on the same site the same day rather than assumed: the C 200 sedan cohort at the same age asks 1,750,000 at 20,000 km and 1,638,000 at 26,000 km against a 2,550,000 MY2023 list, i.e. about 68.2% at 21,000 km, versus 65.6% for the C 300. The C 300 really does retain about 2.6 points less than the C 200 in percentage terms while holding more absolute money, and this record reproduces that: 1,680,000 is 190,000 ABOVE the C 200 record's 1,490,000 in cash while sitting 1.9 retention points BELOW it. CONFIDENCE DOWNGRADED from high to medium during the fact-check: the listing rows are real and reproducible, but the denominator comes from a magazine article rather than a Mercedes-Benz Taiwan price table, and the 13.8% private-sale haircut is a judgement, not an observation. The in-dataset C 300 Estate record rates its best-evidenced checkpoint medium for the same reason."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED DURING FACT-CHECK, and the correction moved the number up. The earlier version anchored this checkpoint on a single 2021-registered W205 C 300 星夜版 at 60,000 km asking 1,180,000, called it the pessimistic bracket, and set dealer retail at 51% of list. That row is a low outlier. On the model-filtered page today the rest of its own cohort asks far more: 2021-registered C 300 星夜版 at 40,000 km 1,550,000, at 42,000 km 1,550,000 and at 53,000 km 1,658,000, all 車商售價, against the documented 2,760,000 list of the W205 C 300 星夜版 (U-CAR's 新舊世代 comparison table). That is 56-60% of list at five years, not 42.8%. A first-generation W206 point brackets it from the same side: a 2021-registered 2022款 C 300 at 25,000 km asks 1,680,000 against a 2,890,000 launch list, 58.1%. Straight reading of the cohort at 35,000 km therefore gives about 56.5% of list. I mark that DOWN to 52.1% of 3,050,000 = 1,590,000 dealer retail, and the reason is stated rather than hidden: the 2021-2023 registration cohort is priced in a Taiwan used market still inflated by the new-car supply shortage of those years and by two list-price increases since, and these checkpoints are forward-looking to 2031, so that anomaly should not be assumed to persist. The same markdown discipline is applied at year 3 (66% observed, 64% used). Private sale 13.8% below dealer retail = 1,370,000; dealer trade-in 13.1% below private = 1,190,000. That is 46.6% of real_cost, which sits 0.4 points BELOW the in-dataset C 200 sedan (47.0%) and 0.9 points below the C 300 Estate (47.5%) — the same trim-ladder relationship this record holds at every other checkpoint. The 3->5 fall of 10.5 retention points keeps German mid-life decline steep rather than flattening."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREVIOUS GENERATION — no 7-year-old W206 exists (launched Sept 2021), so I take real W205 C 300 sedan prices at that age, convert them to a ratio of THAT car's own list, and apply the ratio here. METHOD CORRECTED during the fact-check: the earlier version used only 90,000 km rows and then added a made-up 3.4-point low-mileage bump. That was unnecessary, because the cohort contains genuine low-mileage cars at our checkpoint's odometer. Real 2019-registered W205 C 300 進化版 sedans on the model-filtered page today, all 車商售價: 1,080,000 at 50,000 km, 1,058,000 at 50,000 km, 1,058,000 at 53,000 km, 968,000 at 50,000 km, then 1,098,000 at 59,700 km, 1,098,000 at 64,400 km, 1,098,000 at 80,000 km, 1,098,000 at 80,500 km, 1,030,000 at 90,000 km, 968,000 at 90,000 km, 928,000 at 97,000 km. The median at 50,000-53,000 km is about 1,058,000, and that is within 1,000 km of this checkpoint's assumed 49,000 km, so it is read directly. Note that mileage barely moves this cohort: the 50,000 km cars and the 90,000 km cars overlap, which is itself the finding — by year seven the market prices age and repair risk, not the odometer. DENOMINATOR, and this is the weak link: the W205 C 300 進化版 list is taken as about 2,700,000, interpolated between two documented points I opened (the 2014 W205 launch top model C 250 AMG Line at 258 萬, U-CAR, and the final W205 C 300 星夜版 at 276 萬, U-CAR's W206 comparison table). No page giving the 進化版 C 300 list directly could be retrieved, so this figure is an estimate and it drives the whole checkpoint. 1,058,000 / 2,700,000 = 39.2% of list; applied to 3,050,000 that is 1,196,000 dealer retail, which I round to 1,230,000 to stay inside the band the 1,098,000 cluster implies. Private 13.8% below = 1,060,000; trade-in 13.0% below private = 920,000. HONEST CAVEAT, this is still the least certain judgement in the record: taken at face value the W205 evidence puts the C 300 at parity with or slightly ABOVE the C 200 at seven years (the 2019 C 200 進化版 comparables ask 896,000 at 64,000 km and 898,000 at 72,000 km, about 39-40% of their own list, versus 39.2% here). I place the C 300 1.0 point BELOW the C 200 rather than at parity for two stated reasons: the 1,999 c.c. 牌照稅 bracket thins the 7-year buyer pool exactly where budget matters most, and a 258 hp 2.0T M254 with a 48V ISG carries more out-of-warranty repair risk than the C 200's 1.5T, which a 7-year used buyer prices in. Confidence low, as required for cross-generation extrapolation on an estimated denominator."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"EXTRAPOLATED FROM THE PREVIOUS GENERATION, same method as year 7, and re-based during the fact-check onto rows at our own odometer instead of a 130,000 km median plus a bump. Real 2016-registered W205 C 300 sedans on the model-filtered page today, all 車商售價: 660,000 at 58,000 km, 789,000 at 69,000 km, 780,000 at 69,000 km, 758,000 at 70,000 km, 788,000 at 74,400 km, 660,000 at 75,000 km, 698,000 at 90,000 km, 698,000 at 99,000 km, 600,000 at 100,000 km, 598,000 at 101,000 km, 738,000 at 110,000 km, 668,000 at 120,000 km, 688,000 at 139,200 km, 628,000 at 150,000 km. The cluster AT 70,000 km, which is exactly this checkpoint, runs 660,000-789,000 with a median near 760,000. DENOMINATOR, again the weak link: the 2016 W205 C 300 list is taken as about 2,620,000, bracketed between the documented 2014 C 250 AMG Line at 258 萬 (the model the 2.0T C 300 replaced, U-CAR launch report) and the documented final C 300 星夜版 at 276 萬 (U-CAR W206 comparison table). No page giving the 2016 C 300 list directly could be retrieved. 760,000 / 2,620,000 = 29.0% of list as dealer asking at ten years and 70,000 km; applied to 3,050,000 that is 885,000, and I use 930,000 (30.5%) because the 2016 cohort is a run-out model year of a generation the market has already written off, while a 2036 W206 will still be the second-newest C-Class generation on the road. Private 14.0% below = 800,000; trade-in 13.1% below private = 695,000. The width of the private haircut is deliberate: at this age a private seller in a thin market often waits months or gives up and takes the 收購價. The tail does NOT flatten the way a Lexus does: years 7 to 10 shed another 24.5% of remaining value, which is the out-of-warranty repair risk being priced in. Explicitly extrapolated on an estimated denominator, not observed. If the 2016 list were 2,500,000 rather than 2,620,000 this checkpoint would be about 1 retention point higher, so treat 27.2% as the centre of a 26-28% band."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Taiwan Mercedes dealer Service A pricing of 8,000-15,000 原廠 from both guides I opened; one costs a first-year A service on a 1.33L GLA 200 at about 10,000, so 13,000 for a 2.0L C-Class with more oil is the correct place on that scale. Level with the in-dataset C 300 Estate (13,000) and one notch above the C 200 sedan (12,000). Inside the 3-year factory warranty, so no repair spend — but servicing is still paid, there is no free-maintenance programme. Confidence downgraded from high to medium during the fact-check: the only sources are commercial workshop pages, not a published Mercedes-Benz Taiwan price table."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers years 1-3, not cumulative. Service B 基礎 12,000-18,000 原廠 plus 煞車油 2,500-4,000 per the two Taiwan dealer guides; one publishes an itemised invoice for a GLA 200 second-year Service B with brake fluid at 12,656 before an oil voucher, and a 2.0L C 300 sits above that small car. Still fully inside the 3-year warranty, so zero repair allowance — this is genuinely the cheapest window of ownership. Confidence downgraded from high to medium for the same reason as the year-1 window: no official price table stands behind these numbers."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers years 3-5. One guide prices 輪胎更換（19吋4條）at 32,000-45,000 原廠; I use 50,000 because the C 300 星耀版 runs a STAGGERED set — 輪胎尺寸 225/40 R19 with 後輪尺寸 255/35 R19, both read off the U-CAR spec table I fetched — and 255-section rears in a premium brand sit above that uniform-set band. 來令片 8,000-15,000 per axle 原廠, taken at 17,000 for the 258 hp car's larger front brakes; at 35,000 gentle km the fronts are the only set due. The jump from 35,000 to 110,000 is the warranty expiring and the first tire set landing in the same window — at 7,000 km/yr tires are replaced on AGE (5-6 years), not tread."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers years 5-7, all out of warranty. From the two Taiwan dealer guides: 變速箱油 15,000-30,000, 火星塞 6,000-12,000 for a 4-6 cylinder at 50,000-80,000 km, 碟盤 15,000-30,000 per set plus 來令片, AGM 電瓶 8,000-15,000 原廠 with a 3-5 year life (so this is its second, and it is an AGE replacement — 49,000 km does not save it), 煞車油 2,500-4,000. The 28,000 risk line is a probability-weighted allowance for the German failure items, not a certainty; it is 3,000 above the C 200's equivalent because the 2.0T's electric water pump and coil packs are the more heavily loaded parts."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers years 7-10. One guide publishes 懸吊避震系統維修 30,000-60,000 and major 電系/電子 items at 15,000-80,000; the other gives 碟盤 15,000-30,000 and AGM 8,000-15,000. Second tire set is again an AGE replacement at 70,000 km. The 38,000 for the 48V ISG is the mild-hybrid-specific line: a full replacement runs 60,000-120,000 in Taiwan, weighted down for the chance it survives to year 10, and set above the C 200's 35,000 because the 2.0T's ISG works harder. Deliberately NOT a flat Japanese tail: a 9-year-old out-of-warranty Benz is where the money goes, and low mileage protects none of the rubber, coolant, battery or 48V electronics, all of which fail on the calendar. Total 286,000 brings the ten-year figure to 581,000 — above the C 200 sedan (540,000) and below the C 300 Estate (628,000) and the larger E 200 (633,000), which is the correct order."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — Mercedes-Benz C-Class 規格表 (spec)","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/mercedes-benz/c-class/7151/spec","note":"PRIMARY price and spec source. 403s a plain fetcher; retrieved with a browser user-agent and parsed this session. Live 售價 row: C 180 星耀版 225 萬, C 200 星耀版 261 萬, C 300 星耀版 305 萬. C 300 column: 排氣量 1,999 c.c., 引擎最大馬力 258 hp/5,800 rpm, 九前速手自排, 傳動方式 後輪驅動, 車重 1,675 kg, 車長 4,793 mm (the 4,751 mm figure belongs to the C 180 and C 200), 輪胎尺寸 225/40 R19 with 後輪尺寸 255/35 R19, 動力系統 48V輕油電混合, 能源 汽油, 平均油耗 14.3 km/l, 電池種類 鋰離子電池 with 電池總容量 0.96 kWh and 純電池里程 blank, 車身型式 轎車/Sedan, 車門數 4門. This is the basis for the 3,050,000 list price, for the 'gasoline, not hybrid' classification, for the four-door body confirmation, and for the staggered tire sizes that drive the tire costs."},{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點 — Mercedes-Benz C-Class 與 E-Class 星耀版同步在臺登場","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/116171","note":"INDEPENDENT SECOND CONFIRMATION of the list price, opened this session. Gives the same 星耀版 ladder as U-CAR: C 180 225 萬, C 200 261 萬, C 300 305 萬, AMG C 43 391 萬; Estate line C 200 Estate 266 萬, C 300 Estate 310 萬; E-Class E 200 LUXURY 301 萬. Two outlets agreeing exactly is why no override of the 3,050,000 list price was needed. The C 200 sedan figure of 261 萬 also matches the in-dataset C 200 星耀版 record, and the 310 萬 Estate figure matches the in-dataset C 300 Estate record, so the whole price ladder is internally consistent."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz C-Class Sedan C300 二手行情 (model-filtered)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/c/c300","note":"MAIN USED-VALUE SOURCE. My own scrape this session: 6 pages, 216 rows parsed with registration year, mileage and asking price, every title reading 'M-Benz C-Class Sedan', so the body style is confirmed four-door and no Estate or Coupe row is mixed in. This is the URL the earlier version of the record MISSED; it used a brand-wide page instead and drew a false conclusion from it (see the /mercedes-benz/c300 entry below). W206 rows recovered: 2025 reg 2,350,000/10,000 km; 2024 reg 2,000,000/19,700 km; 2023 reg 1,990,000/10,200 km, 1,988,000/12,000 km, 1,968,000/20,000 km, 1,988,000/24,000 km, 1,898,000/25,000 km, 1,898,000/30,000 km, 1,758,000/40,000-43,000 km, 1,650,000/60,000 km; 2022 reg 1,980,000/50,100 km, 1,920,000/34,800 km, 1,738,000/44,000 km, 1,688,000/38,000 km; 2021 reg 1,680,000/25,000 km. W205 rows used for the 5-, 7- and 10-year extrapolations: 2021 星夜版 1,550,000/40,000 km, 1,550,000/42,000 km, 1,658,000/53,000 km and one low outlier at 1,180,000/60,000 km; 2019 進化版 1,080,000/50,000 km, 1,058,000/50,000 km, 1,058,000/53,000 km, 968,000/50,000 km, five at 1,098,000 (59,700-80,500 km), 1,030,000/90,000 km, 968,000/90,000 km; 2016 sedans 660,000/58,000 km, 789,000/69,000 km, 780,000/69,000 km, 758,000/70,000 km, 788,000/74,400 km, 660,000/75,000 km, 698,000/90,000 km, 600,000/100,000 km, 738,000/110,000 km, 688,000/139,200 km. Every one of these is a 車商售價 (dealer retail asking) and was cut 12-14% to private sale and a further 13% to trade-in before being used. CORRECTION RECORD: the earlier version of this record stated that the newest C 300 anywhere was a 2023 registration and that no 1-year comparable existed. The 2025 and 2024 rows above disprove that."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz C-Class Sedan C200 二手行情 (sibling calibration)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/c/c200","note":"Opened and scraped this session (4 pages) to TEST the 'C 300 retains less than C 200' claim rather than assume it. C 200 sedan rows: 2025 reg 2,080,000/16,800 km; 2024 reg 1,890,000/20,000 km, 1,880,000/23,000 km, 1,798,000/20,000 km; 2023 reg 1,750,000/20,000 km, 1,750,000/24,000 km, 1,638,000/26,000 km, 1,650,000/30,600 km; 2021 reg 1,450,000/15,000 km, 1,366,000/50,000 km, 1,298,000/40,000 km; 2019 進化版 896,000/64,000 km, 898,000/72,000 km, 868,000/78,000 km, 810,000/89,200 km. Finding used in this record: at three years the C 200 asks about 68.2% of its own 2,550,000 MY2023 list while the C 300 asks about 65.6% of its own 2,990,000 MY2023 list, which is direct evidence for the 2-point retention gap this record applies. At seven years the two are close to level, which is why the year-7 note flags that checkpoint as the least certain judgement."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — /mercedes-benz/c300 (verified NEGATIVE result)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/c300","note":"Opened and checked this session, and the earlier version's caveat is CONFIRMED: despite the /c300 path this URL does NOT return a C 300-filtered result set. Page 1 returns E-Class, CLA, GLE, GLA, AMG GT, S-Class and C-Class Coupe rows mixed together. The correct model-filtered path is /mercedes-benz/c/c300, the same scheme the in-dataset C 300 Estate record uses. Cited so the next reader does not repeat the mistake that produced the false 'no 1-year comparable exists' claim."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 210萬起，M-Benz 206世代 C-Class 與 C-Class Estate 國內正式發表","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/67780","note":"Opened and parsed this session. Three load-bearing facts. (1) W206 Taiwan launch 2021-09-15 with C 180 210 萬 / C 200 240 萬 / C 300 289 萬 — the generation is only about 5 model years old, which is why years 7 and 10 had to be extrapolated. (2) Its 新舊世代 C-Class 價格對比 table gives the FINAL W205 prices: C 180 進化版 206 萬, C 200 星夜版 233 萬, C 300 星夜版 276 萬, C 300 Estate 星夜版 285 萬. The 276 萬 figure is the documented denominator behind the year-5 anchor and, with the 2014 C 250 figure, brackets the year-7 and year-10 denominators. (3) States 全車系皆有 48V 輕油電混合動力系統輔助，能提供額外 20 匹馬力輔助, gives the C 300 as 2.0 升渦輪增壓, 258 匹, 40.8 公斤米, 9G-Tronic, and names the C 300 as an AMG Line 車型."},{"name":"KingAutos — 《台灣賓士》年式配備更新｜Mercedes-Benz C-Class 車系配備與售價更新","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/352464","note":"Opened and parsed this session. Fixes the MY2023 denominators used at the 3-year checkpoint and in the C 200 sibling test: 'C300...售價調漲3萬元，來到299萬元起' and 'C200...售價調漲8萬元，來到255萬元起' for the 23/24年式. So a 2023-registered C 300 had a list of 2,990,000 and a 2023-registered C 200 had a list of 2,550,000. The same article states the C 300's added equipment for that increase was worth only 2.5 萬, which supports treating year-on-year trim additions as value the used market does not repay."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 — 正式售價195萬起，新一代 M-Benz C-Class 國內發表 (W205)","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/23818","note":"Opened this session. W205 launched in Taiwan 2014-07-21 with C 180 195 萬, C 200 Avantgarde 215 萬, C 200 Exclusive 226 萬, C 250 AMG Line 258 萬 — no C 300 in the launch range. The 258 萬 C 250 AMG Line is the model the 2.0T C 300 later replaced, so it is the documented LOWER bracket for the W205 C 300 list prices used as denominators at years 7 and 10 (upper bracket 276 萬 from article 67780). Stated plainly: neither the 2016 C 300 list nor the 2019 C 300 進化版 list could be sourced directly, so both denominators are interpolations between these two documented points, and that is the main reason those two checkpoints are rated low confidence."},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — Mercedes-Benz C-Class 車系沿革","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/Mercedes-Benz/C-Class/7151/history","note":"Opened (HTTP 200) and parsed. Reported honestly as a NEGATIVE result: the page is a narrative generation history from the 190E onward and contains no per-trim historical prices, so it contributed nothing to the W205 denominators. Listed because it was opened and checked, not because it supports a number."},{"name":"金融財子 — 賓士保養一次要多少錢：原廠與外廠費用完整解析","url":"https://tyaward.com.tw/汽機車-2/賓士保養一次要多少錢","note":"Opened this session (HTTP 200). Source of: the 每10,000公里或每滿1年（以先到者為準）interval and the A/B alternation; 原廠 Service A 8,000-12,000 (外廠 3,000-6,000); 原廠 Service B 基礎 12,000-18,000 rising to 25,000-30,000+ with plugs/transmission fluid/brake consumables; a real itemised invoice (GLA 200 second-year Service B with brake fluid, 12,656 before a 725 oil voucher); 煞車油 2,500-4,000; 變速箱油 15,000-30,000; 懸吊避震系統維修 30,000-60,000; 電系/電子 15,000-80,000; and 輪胎更換（19吋4條）32,000-45,000 原廠 — the band deliberately exceeded at 50,000-54,000 for this car's staggered 255-section rears. Also states the warranty as 3年或10萬公里. CAVEAT: this is a commercial workshop marketing page, not an official Mercedes-Benz Taiwan price table, which is why every maintenance confidence in this record is capped at medium."},{"name":"比迪行銷 — 賓士保養一次多少錢：原廠與外廠費用解析","url":"https://www.whbydcc.com/賓士保養一次多少錢/","note":"Opened this session (HTTP 200). Independent second guide, used to bound the same items: 原廠 A 保養 8,000-15,000, 原廠 B 保養 15,000-30,000, B 保養 at 20,000 km or 2 years alternating with A, 煞車油 every 2 years or 40,000 km, 來令片 8,000-15,000 per axle 原廠, 碟盤 15,000-30,000 per set, AGM 電瓶 8,000-15,000 原廠 with a 3-5 year life and mandatory computer coding, 火星塞 6,000-12,000 every 50,000-80,000 km. Confirms the same 10,000 km / 1 year whichever-first interval independently of the first guide. Same caveat: commercial content, not an official price table."}]},"mercedes-c300-estate":{"assumptions":"7,000 km/year is about half the Taiwan average, so this car's cost is driven by time, not distance. Three effects dominate. (1) Mercedes ASSYST PLUS asks for service at 1 year or about 20,000-25,000 km, whichever comes first. At 7,000 km/year the annual timer always fires first, so the owner pays for 10 services in 10 years and never reaches a mileage-triggered service. The car gets no cost relief from low mileage on scheduled service. (2) The 19-inch AMG staggered tires (245/40R19 front, 275/35R19 rear) age out before they wear out. Two sets in 10 years is an age decision, not a tread decision. (3) On resale the low odometer is worth real money on this body. The C-Class Estate used pool in Taiwan is small and most listed cars carry 50,000-80,000 km, so a 21,000 km car at 3 years or a 35,000 km car at 5 years sits at the top of a thin market. Every checkpoint below is quoted against low-mileage listings, not against the mileage-blind average.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"No 1-year-old S206 C 300 Estate exists on the market, so the anchor is the same body one trim down: two 2025 C 200 Estate cars on 8891 中古車 at 3,000 km and 5,000 km, both asked at 213.0萬 車商售價 (dealer retail) against a 2025 list of about 264萬, i.e. 80.7% of list. Two effects then apply to the C 300. The used market compresses the trim ladder hard on this body, which the 3-year rows prove directly (a 2023 C 200 Estate at 63,000 km asks 188.8萬 while a 2023 C 300 Estate at 68,000 km asks only 186.8萬 — the C 300's 44萬 list premium has already gone to about zero at 3 years). At 1 year the compression is milder but real, so I used 77% of list rather than 80.7%, giving about 239萬 dealer retail. The private-sale step down is 11% (239萬 dealer retail to 213萬 自售), the lower half of the 8-15% band because a 1-year car still carrying factory warranty sells privately with little friction. Rounded to 2,130,000, i.e. 71.0% of real_cost. Dealer trade-in 收購價 is a further 12.4% below the private figure. This sits 0.7 points BELOW the in-dataset C 200 sedan (71.7%) and is intended to sit below the C 200 Estate as well: at 1 year the estate scarcity premium has barely opened up, while the C 300's higher price point and option-heavy 星耀版 kit already depreciate faster than the model itself."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Best-evidenced checkpoint. Real 8891 中古車 rows for the S206 C 300 Estate (this exact car and body, launched in Taiwan 2022-02-25 at 297萬): a 2023 car at 68,000 km asking 186.8萬 and a 2023 car at 78,000 km asking 183.8萬, both 車商售價. Both are high-mileage; our buyer is at 21,000 km, so the ask must be adjusted upward. The size of that adjustment is set by the 4-year rows on the same page, which do have low-mileage cars: 2022 at 28,000 km asking 198.0萬 and 2022 at 26,000 km asking 180.0萬 (median about 189萬), against 2022 at 51,200 km asking 169.0萬. A 3-year 21,000 km car therefore lands around 198萬 dealer retail, and I used that. A 12% private-sale haircut gives 1,740,000, or 58.0% of real_cost. Dealer trade-in is a further 12.9% below. IMPORTANT: this is DOWN from a naive read of the raw asks. The 2021-2023 registration cohort is priced in a Taiwan used market still inflated by the new-car supply shortage of those years and by two rounds of list-price increases since; these checkpoints are forward-looking to 2029 and that anomaly should not be assumed to persist. Against the in-dataset C 200 sedan (59.0%) this is 1 point LOWER, which is the intended relationship: the estate body is genuinely scarce and helps, but the C 300's higher price point, its 212,000 TWD of 星耀版 equipment that the used market does not pay for, and the observed trim-ladder compression against the C 200 Estate more than cancel that help."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Anchored on a direct age-and-mileage comparable rather than extrapolated: a 2021 C 300 Estate at 36,000 km asking 163.8萬 車商售價 on 8891 中古車 — 5 years old, and within 1,000 km of this checkpoint's assumed 35,000 km. The same page's higher-mileage 2021 rows show the mileage penalty on that vintage (60,000 km at 139.8萬, 67,000 km at 133.8萬), and the 4-year 2022 rows bracket it from above (28,000 km at 198.0萬, 26,000 km at 180.0萬). Two corrections pull in opposite directions and roughly cancel: 2021 cars predate the Feb-2022 Taiwan launch of the S206, so they are previous-generation 外匯車 (grey imports), which trade BELOW 總代理 cars and should be marked up; against that, the 2021-2023 cohort is priced in a still-inflated used market and these figures are forward-looking to 2031, so they should be marked down. I held dealer retail at about 163萬, applied a 12.5% private-sale haircut, and got 1,425,000, or 47.5% of real_cost. Dealer trade-in is a further 13.0% below. Against the C 200 sedan (47.1%) this is only 0.4 points higher — the mid-curve is the one place a thin-supply body actually helps, but the help is worth well under a point here, not the 5-6 points a raw reading of estate asking prices would suggest. Asking prices on a scarce body are not transaction prices: a wagon sits on the lot longer at a higher ask, and the private seller does not capture that."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolated from the PREVIOUS generation, because the S206 C 300 Estate has only existed in Taiwan since Feb 2022 and no genuine 7-year car of this generation exists. Method stated explicitly: I took real C 300 Estate rows on 8891 中古車 at that age and read their dealer-retail asks directly, then adjusted for mileage and for grey-import status. Data used: a 2019 car at 90,000 km asking 118.0萬 and a 2018 car at 54,000 km asking 108.8萬 (a second 2018 at 150,000 km asks 83.0萬, and a 2017 at 100,000 km asks 88.8萬). These are S205-generation 外匯車, which trade below 總代理 cars, so a 7-year 總代理 S206 at only 49,000 km should sit above the 118.0萬 row. I used about 126萬 dealer retail and a 13% private-sale haircut, giving 1,095,000, or 36.5% of real_cost. Dealer trade-in is a further 13.2% below. The car is well past the 3-year 原廠保固 by now and the market prices out-of-warranty repair risk into it, so the curve keeps falling rather than flattening. Against the C 200 sedan (37.2%) this is 0.7 points lower: past year 5 the estate scarcity premium stops offsetting the extra complexity this car carries (rear-axle-steering actuator, 48V starter-generator, staggered 19-inch rubber), all of which are pure liabilities to a used buyer. Confidence low because the base data is previous-generation grey-import stock."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolated from the previous generation by the same stated method. Data used from 8891 中古車, C 300 Estate rows only: a 2017 car at 40,000 km asking 99.0萬 and a 2017 car at 100,000 km asking 88.8萬 車商售價 — 9-year-old cars bracketing this checkpoint's 70,000 km from both sides. The C 200 Estate page gives the older tail for shape (2015 at 130,000 km asking 49.8萬, 2011 at 190,000-240,000 km asking 29.8萬), and the 2014-2015 C 300 Estate rows at 25.5-39.8萬 are an older generation again, not a valid comparable for a 2036 car. Taking about 92萬 dealer retail for a 10-year 70,000 km car and a 14% private-sale haircut (the widest of the five, because at this age a private seller in a thin market often waits months or gives up and takes the 收購價) gives 795,000, or 26.5% of real_cost. Dealer trade-in is a further 13.8% below. Against the C 200 sedan (28.1%) this is 1.6 points LOWER, and that is the intended shape: at 10 years a 48V ISG, an electric water pump, a rear-axle-steering actuator and estate rear suspension are all liabilities the buyer discounts, and the small pool of estate buyers is also the pool least willing to take on a 310萬-when-new German car with no warranty. Scarcity supports price in the middle of the curve and stops helping at the tail. Confidence low: no data for this generation at this age exists."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"One annual visit only, because 7,000 km is nowhere near the mileage trigger. Service A on a 2.0T M254 at a Taiwan Mercedes dealer runs about 11,000-15,000 TWD; I used 13,000, one notch above the in-dataset C 200 sedan's 12,000 for the larger engine and oil volume, level with the E 200. Nothing else is due at 7,000 km on a 1-year-old car. Estimated from dealer labour rates and the standard A-service parts list; no official Taiwan price table was reachable."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers years 1-3 only, not cumulative. Two visits: Service B at year 2 (about 27,000) and Service A at year 3 (about 13,000), plus an alignment (about 4,000) that a 19-inch staggered setup wants at least once in the period. Still inside the 原廠三年不限里程保固, so no repair items and no wear items yet — at 21,000 km the original tires and brake pads are nowhere near done. If the buyer bought a dealer prepaid 保養套餐 this period would be roughly 38,000 instead. Sits between the C 200 sedan (32,000) and the E 200 (45,000). Estimated from dealer labour rates; no published Taiwan price table was reachable."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers years 3-5. Scheduled work is about 43,000 (B at year 4 about 29,000, A at year 5 about 14,000). The big line is tires: at 7,000 km/year the original set reaches 35,000 km with tread left, but at 5-6 years the rubber has hardened and must be replaced on age, which is exactly the low-mileage owner's penalty. A staggered 19-inch AMG set in a premium summer compound runs about 11,000-13,000 per corner fitted, so about 48,000. Front pads and discs at about 25,000 reflect this car's larger brakes and a 1.8-tonne estate. The 12V AGM support battery at about 12,000 typically fails between years 4 and 6 on 48V-equipped Mercedes and is a known early item. Alignment about 4,000. Warranty expires at year 3, so the last two years of this window carry repair exposure, though at 35,000 km nothing major is expected yet. Estimates, not a quoted table."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers years 5-7, all out of warranty. Scheduled work about 46,000 (B at year 6, A at year 7, both a little dearer than earlier as parts prices drift). Age and thermal-cycle items now land: spark plugs on the M254 (about 15,000 fitted), a coolant change (about 8,000), and rear pads and discs (about 22,000) which reach the end of their life a period later than the fronts. The two provisions are risk-weighted rather than certain: the thermostat and water pump area on this engine family is a recognised weak point (about 18,000), and the belt and tensioner driving the 48V starter-generator is the mild-hybrid-specific item this car has and a Japanese equivalent does not (about 15,000). Front suspension bushings at about 12,000. Confidence low because failure rates for the M254 at this age in Taiwan are not documented anywhere I could retrieve."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers years 7-10, the period where a German luxury car stops being cheap and where this record must not flatten. Three scheduled visits total about 84,000. The second tire set (about 52,000) is again an age replacement, not a wear one. Transmission oil and filter on the 9G-Tronic at about 22,000 is the classic year-8 item. The remaining lines are risk provisions sized by likelihood rather than certainties, and they are what separates this car from a Japanese equivalent: the electric water pump and thermostat housing (about 28,000), coil packs and injectors (about 16,000), the 48V starter-generator and its DC-DC converter (about 22,000 — this car has a mild-hybrid electrical system that a naturally aspirated Japanese car does not), and the rear-axle-steering actuator that is standard on the 星耀版 C 300 and has no counterpart on the C 200 (about 14,000). Rear suspension arms and bushings at about 17,000 are the estate-specific item: the wagon rear end carries more load and its bushings wear earlier than the sedan's. Plus a second 12V AGM battery (13,000), a second front brake set (25,000) and an air-conditioning service (10,000). Total 303,000, which brings the 10-year figure to 628,000 — above the CLE 200 (617,000) and just below the larger E 200 (633,000). Confidence low: none of this is a quoted table, and the true out-of-warranty repair bill on any individual car varies enormously."}],"sources":[{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點 — Mercedes-Benz C-Class 與 E-Class 星耀版同步在臺登場","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/116171","note":"Primary price source, opened and read. Confirms the 正2026年式 C-Class Estate line: C 200 Estate 266萬, C 300 Estate 310萬, AMG C 43 4MATIC Estate 405萬. Same page gives the sedan line (C 180 225萬, C 200 261萬, C 300 305萬), and its C 200 sedan figure matches the in-dataset C 200 sedan record's 2,610,000 list price, which validates the whole table. Also confirms the 星耀版 content: Burmester audio, digital headlights, MBUX navigation, night package, 19-inch AMG wheels, Estate-exclusive HUD, and rear-axle steering with variable damping on the C 300."},{"name":"KingAutos 國王車訊 — C300 操控黑科技下放！C-Class 星耀版","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/368281","note":"Independent confirmation of the list price, opened and read: C 300 Estate 星耀版 NTD 3,100,000. States the 星耀版 added equipment is worth 212,000 TWD (variable damping with rear-axle steering that cuts the turning circle by 40 cm, night package with 19-inch AMG multi-spoke wheels, Estate-exclusive head-up display). That 212,000 figure is used in this record to argue the resale side pays for the model and powertrain, not the option grade."},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 — 台灣賓士新增 C 300 Estate 建議售價 297 萬元起","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/40648","note":"Powertrain and launch-history source, opened and read. Confirms the C 300 Estate went on sale in Taiwan on 2022-02-25 at 297萬 with the 2.0L turbo plus 48V EQ Boost mild hybrid, 258 hp and 40.8 kgm plus 20 hp of boost, 9-speed automatic, 0-100 km/h 6.0 s. This launch date is what proves the 2022 and 2023 used listings below are genuine S206 總代理 cars and the 2021-and-older ones are previous-generation grey imports. It is also the basis for classifying this car as gasoline rather than hybrid: the 48V ISG cannot drive the car on its own."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz C300 Estate 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/c/c300-estate","note":"Main used-value source, opened and read in full (33 listings, 32 車商售價 and 1 自售). Every figure quoted is a DEALER RETAIL asking price, never what an owner receives. S206 rows used: 2023 at 68,000 km 186.8萬; 2023 at 78,000 km 183.8萬; 2022 at 28,000 km 198.0萬; 2022 at 26,000 km 180.0萬; 2022 at 51,200 km 169.0萬. Previous-generation rows used for the 5-, 7- and 10-year extrapolations: 2021 at 36,000 km 163.8萬; 2021 at 60,000 km 139.8萬; 2021 at 67,000 km 133.8萬; 2020 at 110,000-115,000 km 128.0萬; 2019 at 90,000 km 118.0萬; 2019 at 120,000 km 115.8萬; 2018 at 54,000 km 108.8萬; 2017 at 40,000 km 99.0萬; 2017 at 100,000 km 88.8萬. CORRECTION NOTE: the previous version of this record cited a '2023 car with 29,000 km asking 213.8萬' as the anchor for the 3-year checkpoint and rated that checkpoint high confidence. No such row appears on this page. The 3-year figure has been rebuilt from the rows that do exist and the confidence downgraded. Every private_sale_price in this record is cut 11-14% below the corresponding dealer retail figure."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz C200 Estate 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/c/c200-estate","note":"Opened and read (27 listings). Used for the 1-year anchor, since no 1-year C 300 Estate exists, and as the estate-body sibling check. All rows confirmed as 旅行車 bodies, not sedans. Rows used: 2025 at 3,000 km and 2025 at 5,000 km both 213.0萬; 2023 at 10,000 km and 2023 at 16,000 km both 179.8萬; 2023 at 30,000 km 175.8-178.8萬; 2023 at 63,000 km 188.8萬; 2022 at 35,000 km 159.8萬 (自售); 2021 at 57,000-58,000 km 145.0-162.8萬; 2017 at 97,000 km 79.8萬; 2015 at 130,000 km 49.8萬. Key finding used in this record: the 2023 C 200 Estate at 63,000 km asks 188.8萬 while the 2023 C 300 Estate at 68,000 km asks 186.8萬. The used market has already compressed the C 300's 44萬 list premium to about nothing by year 3, which is why this record retains a LOWER percentage than the C 200 Estate while still holding a higher absolute price."},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz C200 二手價格 (sedan, calibration)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/c/c200","note":"Opened and read (167 listings indexed). Used to test the estate-versus-sedan claim rather than assume it. C 200 SEDAN rows: 2024 at 20,000 km 189.0萬; 2023 at 53,000 km 153.8萬; 2020 at 63,000 km 103.0萬; 2018 at 91,500 km 72.8萬; 2015 at 155,000 km 44.0萬. Finding: at similar age and mileage the estate's dealer-retail ask does run well above the sedan's (2023 estate at 63,000 km 188.8萬 versus 2023 sedan at 53,000 km 153.8萬). That gap is real but it is a gap in ASKING prices on a thin-supply body, where a car sits on the lot longer at a higher number; a private seller does not capture it. This record therefore credits the estate body only about half a point at the 5-year checkpoint and nothing elsewhere, instead of the 5-6 points a raw reading would give."},{"name":"KingAutos — 2026 Mercedes-Benz C-Class Estate 車款介紹","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/mercedes_benz/c-class_estate","note":"Engine specification cross-check, opened and read: C 300 Estate 1,999 cc turbo inline-4, 258 hp at 5,800 rpm, 40.8 kgm at 2,000-3,200 rpm, plus a 20 hp motor, 9-speed automatic, rear-wheel drive. This page still carries the pre-update 運動版 naming and the 297萬 price, so it was NOT used for the list price — only for the hardware list that drives the maintenance model."}]},"mercedes-cla180-shooting-brake":{"assumptions":"7,000 km/year makes every service on this car time-driven, not distance-driven. Mercedes ASSYST PLUS calls the CLA in at 1 year or about 15,000-25,000 km, whichever comes first, so this owner always hits the 1-year trigger and never the distance trigger: 5 services by year 5 and 10 by year 10, at 70,000 km total. The same low use flips the consumable list from wear-driven to age-driven. Tires on the 18-inch estate wheels are replaced on rubber age at about 5-6 years with tread left, not on wear. Brake discs corrode from short trips and standing rather than wear thin. The 12V auxiliary battery and the 48V lithium module both age on calendar time and on short-trip charge cycles, which is the worst duty cycle for them. On the resale side the low odometer helps, but less than the previous version of this record assumed. The 8891 CLA 200 Shooting Brake board (28 live cars, verified) does show the low-mileage cars at the top of their year band (MY2024 at 11,000 km asks 1,688,000 while MY2022 at 82,800 km asks 1,328,000), but the effect inverts at the old end: the MY2016 car with 80,000 km asks 508,000 while three MY2016 cars with 131,000-132,100 km ask 598,000. So a low-mileage premium is real at 1-5 years and is NOT applied after year 7. Offsetting all of this, the estate market is thin: 8891 shows only 28 CLA 200 Shooting Brake cars against 558 CLA listings in total, so a private seller waits materially longer for a buyer than a CLA sedan seller does.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from 1,510,000. No 1-year local stock exists for this car: deliveries only started in Q3 2026. Extrapolated from the previous-generation X118 CLA 200 Shooting Brake, and stated as such. Verified anchor on 8891 (auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cla/cla200-shooting-brake, page opened and the full 28-car board read): MY2024 CLA 200 Shooting Brake, 11,000 km, dealer retail ask 1,688,000. Backing that ask down 11% per the dataset price chain gives about 1,503,000 private at 2 years old. The previous version rolled that single listing forward to a 78-80% one-year ratio and set 1,510,000, i.e. 74.9% of real_cost. Three problems with that: (a) 1,688,000 is the single highest ask on the entire board and dealer asks on near-new cars are the stickiest and most negotiable of all; (b) the proxy is a 163 hp CLA 200 whose own list was about 2,080,000, a step above this 136 hp entry car; (c) real_cost here carries the 50,000 tax-inflated sticker described in purchase.notes, worth about 2.5 points. Corrected to 1,450,000 = 72.0% of real_cost and 72.9% of list. That is +1.0 point on the CLA 180 sedan anchor's 71%, which is the size of estate premium the live listings actually support (see the 3-year checkpoint for the apples-to-apples derivation), not the +4 previously claimed. Dealer trade-in set 12.4% under private sale, inside the dataset's 10-15% band."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from 1,310,000, and this checkpoint is where the previous record's central error was found. Extrapolated from the X118 CLA 200 Shooting Brake, stated as such. Verified MY2023 estate rows on 8891: 15,600 km ask 1,568,000 (彰化), 35,000 km ask 1,448,000 (高雄), 38,000 km ask 1,458,000 (新北). Taking the two mid-mileage cars at about 1,453,000 and applying the 11% private-sale haircut gives roughly 1,293,000, or 62.2% of that car's approximately 2,080,000 list. THE ERROR: the previous version claimed the MY2023 CLA 200 SEDAN 'tops out at 1,398,000 ask on 35,000 km' and concluded the estate runs about 5 points above the sedan. Opening the CLA overview page (auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cla) shows a MY2023 sedan asking 1,498,000 on 44,000 km and another at 1,328,000 on 31,000 km. The sedan top ask is 1,498,000, not 1,398,000. Redone properly against list price, the MY2023 estate sits at 62.2% and the MY2023 sedan at roughly 61-62%: the estate premium is about +1 point, not +5. The same holds at MY2022, where the estate asks 1,298,000 on 44,100 km against a sedan at 1,200,000 on 35,400 km, which is about +2.7 points once each is divided by its own higher list. The 小曾車庫 sentence 五門 Shooting Brake 因為稀有加上保值性，通常收購價比四門好很多 was verified verbatim and is directionally right, but it is a dealer's marketing copy about absolute trade-in cash, not a retention ratio, and the live boards size the real effect at 1-3 points. Corrected to 1,250,000 = 62.0% of real_cost, 62.8% of list, +1.0 point on the sedan anchor's 61%. Dealer trade-in set 13.2% under private sale. Mercedes-Benz Taiwan's Agility 星自選 3-year guaranteed buyback lands near the trade-in level, not the private figure."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from 1,090,000. The X118 MY2021 cars are 5 years old today. Verified MY2021 estate rows on 8891: 59,000 km ask 1,390,000 (桃園) and 69,000 km ask 1,298,000 (台中). A THIRD ROW USED BY THE PREVIOUS VERSION WAS MISATTRIBUTED: it cited 'MY2021, 44,000 km, ask 1,328,000 (Kaohsiung)', but the 44,000 km / 1,328,000 Kaohsiung car on the board is a MY2022, i.e. a 4-year-old car pulled into the 5-year cluster, which biased the cluster upward. Using only the two genuine MY2021 cars gives about 1,344,000 dealer retail, or roughly 1,196,000 private after the 11% haircut. That reads high as a ratio, but both cars carry 59,000-69,000 km and neither listing confirms the trim; the board mixes CLA 200 and CLA 250 Shooting Brakes, and a CLA 250 launched near 2,360,000 rather than the CLA 200's approximately 1,960,000, so the apparent ratio is unreliable in that direction. The dependable cross-check is the trade-in side: 小曾車庫's table (opened and read) puts a 5-year-old CLA 200 SB at 1,050,000 trade-in and warns on the same page 實際收購價通常還要再折1-2年, which walks it to the 850,000-950,000 band. This record's 890,000 dealer trade-in sits in the middle of that band, which is the strongest single validation in the record. Set at 1,030,000 = 51.1% of real_cost and 51.8% of list, +2.1 points on the CLA 180 sedan anchor's 49%. The previous +5 point gap is not supported: the raw '10 points above the sedan' claim rested on comparing a MY2021 CLA 250 sedan against estate listings of unconfirmed trim. Reasons the estate premium is trimmed to +2.1 here: the 50,000 tax-inflated sticker costs about 2.5 points, the 136 hp CLA 180 is the entry engine against a 163 hp proxy, and by 2031 the used market reads a 2026 petrol CLA against a showroom of MMA-platform EVs. Dealer trade-in set 13.6% under private sale."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from 885,000, but only slightly, because this checkpoint gained a direct comparable the previous version overlooked. Method: take real previous-generation Shooting Brake listings at this age, express them against that car's own original list, then apply the ratio. THE MISSED ROW: the 8891 board carries a MY2019 CLA 200 Shooting Brake, 65,000 km, dealer retail ask 950,000 (台中). A MY2019 car is exactly 7 years old today, so this is a direct 7-year estate comparable, and the previous version interpolated around it from MY2018 cars instead of using it. Applying the 11% private-sale haircut gives about 845,500, which is roughly 44% of the X117 facelift list of about 1,920,000. Supporting MY2018 rows (8 years old), all verified: 54,000 km ask 698,000, 89,000 km ask 698,000, 110,000 km ask 678,000, i.e. about 620,000 private or 32% of list at 8 years. The one-year step from 44% to 32% is steep and is exactly the German out-of-warranty cliff the dataset expects. Set at 825,000 = 40.9% of real_cost, 41.5% of list, +0.9 point on the CLA 180 sedan anchor's 40%. The estate premium is held to under a point here because from year 3 the warranty is gone and the Taiwan used market prices repair risk on the German drivetrain and the 48V hardware regardless of body style. Dealer trade-in 710,000, 14.0% under private sale, a wider spread than the early checkpoints because dealers discount an out-of-warranty European estate harder and hold it longer in a thin market; it is also consistent with 小曾車庫's table once its own 1-2 model-year discount warning is applied."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from 645,000, the largest correction in the record. Extrapolated from the X117 generation, stated as such. Verified 10-year-old rows on 8891: MY2016 at 131,000-132,100 km asking 598,000 (three separate 嘉義 listings) and MY2016 at 80,000 km asking 508,000 (桃園); MY2015 cars sit at 480,000-498,000 across 80,000-150,000 km. Against the X117's own list of about 1,880,000-1,920,000, the MY2016 group at roughly 576,000 dealer retail converts to about 513,000 private, i.e. 27% of original list. The previous version set 645,000 = 32.4% of list and justified the gap with a low-mileage upward adjustment for this owner's 70,000 km. THAT ADJUSTMENT IS CONTRADICTED BY THE SAME PAGE: the MY2016 car with the LOWEST mileage on the board (80,000 km) asks the LEAST of its year group (508,000), while the three 131,000 km cars ask 598,000. At 10 years a European estate prices on condition, service history and saleability, not on the odometer, so no low-mileage premium is applied here. Set at 570,000 = 28.3% of real_cost, 28.6% of list. That is 1.7 points BELOW the CLA 180 sedan anchor's 30%, and the inversion is deliberate and is the second finding of this review: the estate premium that is real at years 1-7 disappears by year 10, because at that age the rarity that helps a 3-year-old Shooting Brake becomes a liability, the buyer pool for a decade-old 1.5L turbo with an aged 48V lithium module and an 8-speed dual clutch is tiny, and a private seller waits months. The German tail keeps falling rather than flattening the way a Lexus does. Dealer trade-in 485,000, 14.9% under private sale, the widest spread in the record, because at this age most dealers will only take the car as a wholesale trade."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"REBUILT IN THIS PASS: 14,000 to 13,000. Distance is irrelevant at 7,000 km; the annual clock fires the service. The Service A line was 12,000 here against 11,000 in the CLA 180 sedan record for the same oil, the same filter and the same inspection on the same 1.5L engine at the same dealer. No reason was given for the 1,000 gap and there is none, so it is now set equal to the sedan at 11,000. The estate premium in this window is 1,000 and it is a rear wiper blade and rear washer fluid, which is the only thing an estate consumes here that a sedan does not; the powered tailgate and the rear wiper motor are inside the assumed 3-year warranty. No prepaid package is netted off because none is standard on the CLA 180. Confidence stays low: no dealer price list or official page was successfully opened for this record, so this is a brand-norm estimate, not a quote."},{"y":3,"source":"REBUILT IN THIS PASS: 48,000 to 36,000, the largest proportional correction in the record and one of the two windows the cross-check named. The old figure was 41% above the CLA 180 sedan's 34,000 for a window in which the two cars share an engine, a gearbox, a service schedule and a full factory warranty, so a 41% gap was never defensible. Three lines were wrong. First, a 5,000 contingency for one non-warranty item was carried while the car is still inside the assumed 3-year unlimited-mileage warranty; the same source paragraph then said the whole window sits inside the warranty so no repair risk is carried, which contradicts the line item. Removed. Second, a 4,000 four-wheel alignment plus tire rotation was charged at 21,000 km; rotation on a front-drive car at that distance is not due, and a single alignment at year 3 is 2,000. Trimmed. Third, Service B and Service A were priced at 24,000 and 12,000 against the sedan's 20,000 and 11,000 for identical work; both are now set equal to the sedan. What remains is two annual time-driven visits, one of them the brake-fluid Service B that Mercedes schedules at 2 years regardless of distance, plus consumables. The estate premium is 2,000 and it is the rear wiper blade and the extra load-bay cleaning, nothing more, because every estate-specific failure item in this window is warranty-covered. A dealer 預付式保養套餐 bought at delivery would cut this window by roughly 15%, but it is optional and therefore not applied. Confidence low for the same sourcing reason as the 1-year period."},{"y":5,"source":"REBUILT IN THIS PASS: 118,000 to 114,000, a small change because this window was never the problem - it ran only 7% above the sedan. Unit costs are now aligned line by line with the CLA 180 sedan record so the remaining gap is only estate hardware: services 31,000 (was 36,000), tires 34,000 for the same 225/45R18 fitment the sedan quotes (was 42,000), 12V AGM 12,000 (was 9,000). Spark plugs, previously charged here at 10,000, are moved to the 5-7 year window to sit where the sedan sibling puts them; carrying the same part in two different windows across two records of the same engine was a needless divergence. Front brakes are 25,000 against the sedan's 24,000: the estate carries about 50 kg more mass on identical brakes, which is worth roughly 1,000 a job and no more. The tire line is the defining low-mileage item: at 7,000 km/year the 18-inch tires still have tread at 5 years but are replaced on rubber age, so this owner pays for a full set while covering only 35,000 km, and the estate pays exactly what the sedan pays because the fitment is the same. Discs are replaced with the pads because short-trip use in Taiwan's humidity corrodes them faster than it wears them. The 3-year warranty expiry inside this window is why the period cost roughly triples against the previous one. The estate premium here is 4,000 and it is deliberately small: the powered tailgate drives and the rear wiper motor are 6-10 year failures, not 3-5 year ones, so provisioning them here would repeat the shape error this pass is fixing. Extrapolated from Mercedes-Benz Taiwan dealer parts-and-labour norms; no published table was reachable, so this is estimated rather than quoted."},{"y":7,"source":"REBUILT IN THIS PASS: 152,000 to 110,000, the correction the cross-check was really pointing at. The old figure sat 45% above the CLA 180 sedan's 105,000 for the same engine, the same 8F-eDCT gearbox and the same age, and the reason was double-counting rather than estate content. The old list charged a 26,000 coolant-and-thermostat-housing line AND a separate 22,000 electric-coolant-pump provision here, and then the 7-10 window charged 22,000 again for water pump, thermostat and hoses if not already replaced in the previous window; the same failure was provisioned twice across two windows. It also pulled the 18,000 dual-clutch fluid and filter service forward to years 5-7 while the sedan schedules it in years 7-10, and added a 14,000 front suspension and damper line that the sedan does not reach until that same later window. All three are now carried once, in the 7-10 window, matching the sedan. What is left is the sedan's own 5-7 year list at the sedan's own prices, plus 8,000 of genuine estate hardware appearing for the first time: the powered tailgate struts lose gas pressure at about 6-7 years in Taiwan's humidity, and the rear wiper motor starts to fail. Short-trip low-mileage use does not protect against the coolant and coil items - it makes them more likely, not less. Out-of-warranty period, estimated from the standard German four-cylinder risk list rather than from a published Taiwan table."},{"y":10,"source":"REBUILT IN THIS PASS: 205,000 to 264,000, and this is the window the cross-check was right about. The old figure was 17% BELOW the CLA 180 sedan's 248,000 for the same car with a bigger body on it, which is not defensible under any reading, and it was below the sedan precisely where this record's own stated estate mechanism lands: the powered tailgate drive, the tailgate struts and the rear wiper motor are age-driven failures that happen at 7-10 years, not at 3-7. The estate is now 16,000 above the sedan here, which is more than half of the whole 28,000 ten-year estate premium, and the shape finally matches the words. Three shared-drivetrain items moved INTO this window from the old 5-7 year list, where they were being double-counted: the dual-clutch fluid and filter service, the electric coolant pump and thermostat housing, and the suspension bushings and dampers. Each is now charged once, at the sedan's price, in the sedan's window. The 48V line changed in substance as well as in place: the machine is integrated inside the 8F-eDCT and is NOT the belt-driven starter-generator this record previously described, so it is provisioned at the sedan sibling's probability-weighted 32,000 for a 60,000-90,000 transmission-opening job rather than as a cheaper bolt-on swap. The second tire set is again an age replacement at only 70,000 lifetime km. The 14,000 estate line is the powered tailgate hardware verified as standard on this car in this pass, the rear wiper motor, and the tailgate loom and seals, all probability-weighted rather than assumed certain. Total across all five periods is unchanged at 537,000, still 5.5% above the CLA 180 sedan anchor's 509,000; what changed is that the 28,000 gap now sits in the windows where the estate hardware actually fails instead of in the windows where the two cars are mechanically identical. Extrapolated, low confidence."}],"sources":[{"name":"8891 新車 - 賓士CLA Shooting Brake雙動力194萬起上市","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/mercedes-benz/cla-shooting-brake/21879","note":"Opened and read during this verification pass. Confirms CLA 180 at 1,990,000, CLA 200 with EQ Technology at 1,940,000 and CLA 250+ with EQ Technology at 2,270,000, and states 燃油款符合新購小型車5萬元貨物稅減徵, which is why the petrol sticker sits 50,000 above the EV. This is the primary and independently re-verified source for list_price. Re-opened again in this pass while settling the 48V architecture; it gives the same 136hp/20.4kgm plus 30hp of motor assist through an 8速DCT, but it likewise does not state the motor's mechanical integration."},{"name":"8891 新車 - 賓士CLA Shooting Brake官網上架！售價比CLA貴7萬","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/mercedes-benz/cla-shooting-brake/21872","note":"OPENED AND READ IN THIS PASS, which upgrades it from the 'not re-opened, treat the equipment list as unverified' status it carried before. It confirms 感應式電動尾門 (hands-free powered tailgate) in the base equipment list of EVERY CLA Shooting Brake variant, so the powered tailgate is standard on the CLA 180 Shooting Brake and is a real cost item rather than an assumed one; this is what the maintenance section's estate premium is built on. It also confirms the 70,000 estate premium over the matching CLA sedan, the 1,990,000 list, and the powertrain as a 1.5L turbo four at 136hp/20.4kgm with a 48V motor adding 30hp through an 8-speed DCT. It does NOT state whether that motor is belt-driven or integrated in the gearbox - see the udn source for how that was settled."},{"name":"地球黃金線 (TVBS) - 大改款CLA Shooting Brake開價194萬起正式開賣","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/323914","note":"Cited by the original researcher as independent confirmation of the 1,990,000 list and of the CLA 180 powertrain (1.5L turbo petrol plus 48V mild hybrid, 8-speed dual clutch), and as the only source naming Agility 星自選. Not re-opened in this pass. The list price it is cited for is confirmed elsewhere; the detailed output and torque figures previously quoted in this record have been removed from the notes because they were not re-verified."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Mercedes-Benz CLA200 Shooting Brake 二手車列表","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cla/cla200-shooting-brake","note":"Opened and the full board re-read during this verification pass. The primary used-price evidence, and confirmed to be the ESTATE body, not the sedan: 28 live CLA 200 Shooting Brake listings. Rows verified and used - MY2024 11,000 km 1,688,000; MY2023 15,600 km 1,568,000, 35,000 km 1,448,000, 38,000 km 1,458,000; MY2022 44,100 km 1,298,000, 44,300 km 1,298,000, 44,000 km 1,328,000, 64,000 km 1,488,000, 82,800 km 1,328,000; MY2021 59,000 km 1,390,000, 69,000 km 1,298,000; MY2019 65,000 km 950,000; MY2018 54,000 km 698,000, 89,000 km 698,000, 110,000 km 678,000; MY2017 66,000 km 558,000 through 91,000 km 728,000; MY2016 80,000 km 508,000 and three cars at 131,000-132,100 km 598,000; MY2015 104,000 km 488,000, 130,000 km 498,000, 150,000 km 480,000. TWO CORRECTIONS FOUND HERE against the earlier version of this record: the 44,000 km / 1,328,000 Kaohsiung car is a MY2022 and not a MY2021, so it does not belong in the 5-year cluster; and the MY2019 car at 950,000 is a direct 7-year estate comparable that the earlier version did not use. These are 車商售價 (dealer retail asks); each was reduced 11% to reach the private-sale figures and a further 12-15% for dealer trade-in, per the dataset price chain."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Mercedes-Benz CLA 二手價格行情總覽","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cla","note":"Opened and read during this verification pass. Confirms the scarcity finding: 558 CLA listings in total against only 28 Shooting Brakes. THIS PAGE CARRIES THE MAIN CORRECTION IN THIS RECORD. Sedan rows read here - MY2023 44,000 km 1,498,000; MY2023 31,000 km 1,328,000; MY2022 35,400 km 1,200,000; MY2021 23,000 km 1,480,000; MY2019 61,000 km 1,300,000; MY2018 80,000 km 698,000. The earlier version of this record claimed the MY2023 sedan 'tops out at 1,398,000' and used that to justify a 5 to 10 point estate premium over the sedan. The real sedan top ask is 1,498,000. Once each body is divided by its own list price, the estate premium at MY2022 and MY2023 is about 1 to 3 retention points, not 5 to 10, which is why every checkpoint in this record was reduced."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - BENZ CLA-CLASS 中古車列表","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=BENZ&model=CLA-CLASS","note":"Opened in this pass, but only aggregate information could be read: 81 CLA-CLASS listings, model years 2013-2024, mileage 19,000-194,000 km, asks 398,000-1,980,000, mixed CLA200 / CLA250 / CLA45 sedan and Shooting Brake. The specific per-car rows the earlier version quoted from this site (MY2022 SB 35,681 km 1,448,000; MY2020 CLA250 SB 92,000 km 1,380,000; MY2015 SB 193,998 km 488,000; MY2021 CLA250 sedan 71,000 km 1,288,000) could NOT be confirmed at row level and are no longer relied on anywhere in this record. The site is retained only as a band-level corroboration that the 8891 asks are not an outlier platform."},{"name":"小曾車庫 - Mercedes Benz 賓士 CLA 中古車收購行情評估（五門）","url":"https://www.littletsenggarage.com/mercedes-benz-cla-value-5door/","note":"Opened and read during this verification pass, and it is genuinely the FIVE-DOOR Shooting Brake page, not the sedan one. A Taiwan dealer's 收購行情 (trade-in) table for the X117 Shooting Brake: CLA200SB 2019 1,050,000, 2018 950,000, 2017 850,000, 2016 770,000; CLA250SB 2019 1,220,000 down to 2016 920,000. The sentence 五門 Shooting Brake 因為稀有加上保值性，通常收購價比四門好很多 was confirmed verbatim. Read with care: it is dealer marketing copy about absolute trade-in cash on a body that listed higher when new, not a statement about retention ratio, and the live 8891 boards size the real ratio premium at 1-3 points. The same page warns 實際收購價通常還要再折1-2年, which is the basis for this record's 5-year trade-in of 890,000 sitting inside that page's implied 850,000-950,000 band."},{"name":"udn 汽車 - Mercedes-Benz CLA 220 road test (8F-eDCT and 48V architecture)","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7828/9553442","note":"ADDED IN THIS PASS to settle a disagreement between this record and the CLA 180 sedan sibling about the same external fact. This record said the 48V machine was a BELT-DRIVEN starter-generator; the sedan record said it was integrated inside the 8-speed dual clutch. Opened and read: the article states 全新研發的 8F-eDCT 八速雙離合器變速箱，內部深度整合 48V 高效輕油電系統以優化傳遞效率 and describes the car pulling away on the electric motor with the engine still at 0 rpm, which a belt-driven starter-generator cannot do. The sedan record was correct and this record was wrong; both now use the integrated 8F-eDCT description and the same probability-weighted 32,000 provision in the 7-10 year window. The article covers the CLA 220, which shares this MMA-platform 1.5L petrol plus 48V drivetrain with the CLA 180, so it is used for architecture only and not for any price or equipment figure. The dataset rule that a 48V mild hybrid is classified gasoline is unaffected, and this record stays gasoline."}]},"mercedes-cla200-shooting-brake-eq":{"assumptions":"7,000 km/year is the single most important driver for this car, and every checkpoint uses assumed_km = 7,000 x years. (1) Servicing is calendar-driven, not distance-driven: at 7,000 km/year the car never reaches a mileage-based interval, so every service in the maintenance table below is an annual visit. (2) The high-voltage battery warranty is consumed by TIME, not distance: at 7,000 km/year the car reaches only 70,000 km at ten years, about 37% of the 190,000 km distance limit, so the 8-year calendar limit always trips first. Years 9-10 run with no battery cover, and the Taiwan used market prices that risk hard. This is the main reason the 10-year figure is low. (3) Charging frequency, CORRECTED in this audit: the previous record said the owner charges once every 8-10 days. That is wrong arithmetic. 7,000 km/year is about 19 km/day, and a 20-80% window on a 525 km WLTP car gives roughly 250-315 km of real use, so this owner charges about once every two weeks. The pack sees very few full cycles, so measured state of health at 7-10 years should be good, but a buyer cannot see that without a report and pays for the risk anyway. (4) Tires are replaced on age, not tread: at 35,000 km the 225/45R18 set still has tread but is 5 years old, and nobody stretches 5-year-old rubber on a heavy BEV. (5) A home AC wallbox (roughly 30,000-60,000 TWD installed in Taiwan) is a real ownership cost but is NOT maintenance and is excluded from the maintenance figures. Electricity, licence tax and insurance are also excluded by design.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolated - this car has no Taiwan used market at any age (announced May 2026, deliveries began Q3 2026). Anchors, both re-opened and re-read in this audit. (a) Estate body, petrol generation: 中華賓士原廠精選中古車 currently lists exactly two 2025 CLA 200 Shooting Brake (petrol, 1332 c.c.) with 4,628 km and 7,053 km, both at 1,768,000 TWD. That is a CPO 原廠認證 asking price, the very top of the 車商售價 tier, and it is a petrol car, so it is used only as a shape. (b) BEV level: 8891 中古車 EQA listings, verified live today. Applying the BEV ratio rather than the petrol one gives dealer retail near 1,540,000 for a 1-year CLA 200 EQ SB at 7,000 km; PRIVATE SALE is set 11% below that at 1,368,000, which is 70% of real_cost. No dealer asking price was copied into private_sale_price. CORRECTION APPLIED IN THIS AUDIT: the previous record set 71%, two points above the CLA 200 EQ sedan sibling (69%), on the claim that in Taiwan the estate lists at or above the sedan. That claim did not survive re-checking - see the year-3 note - so the estate premium is cut to ONE point and is justified on verified scarcity alone (the entire national CPO network holds only two CLA Shooting Brake). The 70,000 body premium is a body premium, not an equipment-package premium, so unlike an AMG Line spend it partly survives resale. Low-mileage adjustment applied: 7,000 km is roughly half what a mileage-blind 1-year average assumes. Dealer trade-in is set at 85.5% of private, marginally wider than the sedan's 87%, because a 車商 discounts for the longer holding time of a niche body."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Anchored on the closest real BEV data available, re-opened and re-read today: 8891 中古車 Mercedes EQA listings show 2023 EQA 250 (3 years old) at 1,220,000-1,400,000 dealer retail across ten cars with mileage from 1,400 to 63,700 km, plus a 2022 car at 996,000 with 95,000 km. Against an EQA list of about 2,090,000 that is roughly 58-67% of list as DEALER RETAIL at three years, with the high end being near-delivery-mileage cars. Taking about 1,225,000 dealer retail for a 21,000 km CLA 200 EQ SB and cutting 12% for the private-sale tier gives 1,075,000, which is 55% of real_cost. BODY-STYLE EVIDENCE CORRECTED IN THIS AUDIT - this is the most important fix in the record. The previous version claimed that 8891 shows a 2021 CLA 200 Shooting Brake at 1,390,000 sitting at the TOP of the same-year sedan band, and built a two-point estate premium on it at every checkpoint. Re-reading the live 8891 pages, the Shooting Brake listing actually present is a 2022 CLA200 1.3L Shooting Brake with 31,000 km at 1,328,000, which the previous record had entered as a 2023 SEDAN. On the 8891 CLA200 index the same car sits mid-band against 2023 sedans at 1,250,000 / 1,450,000 / 1,458,000, not at the top of it. The evidence therefore shows the estate listing INSIDE the sedan band, not above it, so the premium is cut from two points to one and applies only at years 1 and 3 while the car is fresh and warranted. 55% is one point above the sedan sibling (54%) and matches the EQA sibling (55%). The 三年保證價格購回承諾 on the Agility programme puts a soft floor exactly at this checkpoint."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Real comparable, verified live today: 8891 中古車 lists a 2022 EQA 250 (4 years old) at 996,000 dealer retail with 95,000 km. Our car at 5 years carries only 35,000 km, so it sits above that car on mileage but below it on age; net, dealer retail lands near 890,000, and private sale 12% under that gives 782,000, which is 40% of real_cost. The petrol estate curve is much stronger and was deliberately NOT used: copying a petrol CLA curve onto a BEV would be the single largest error available here. ESTATE PREMIUM REMOVED FROM THIS CHECKPOINT ONWARDS. The previous record kept a two-point premium here (42%). From year 5 the Taiwan market prices battery risk, warranty position and repair exposure, none of which the body shape changes, and the verified listing evidence never supported an estate premium in the first place. 40% is therefore level with both the CLA 200 EQ sedan sibling (40%) and the EQA sibling (40%). Warranty position matters at this checkpoint: 3-year factory cover plus the commonly-taken 2-year extension expires exactly at year 5, so this is the last checkpoint where a buyer still gets vehicle warranty, and the price step after it is steep."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"No 7-year data exists for any Mercedes BEV in Taiwan - the EQ line is too young - so this is explicit extrapolation. Method: take the previous-generation estate's real 7-year retention as a shape, then replace its level with the BEV level. Verified petrol reference from the 8891 CLA200 index today: 2019 CLA200 sedans at 990,000 and 1,098,000 against an original list near 1,880,000, i.e. roughly 53-58% dealer retail at seven years for the PETROL car; a 2018 CLA250 Shooting Brake with 195,000 km sits far lower at 730,000, but that is a mileage artefact and is not used as the level. A Taiwan BEV of the same age trades far below its combustion equivalent: the oldest BEVs that actually change hands here (2019 Tesla Model 3, 2016-2017 Nissan Leaf, Kona EV) show that once out of vehicle warranty the discount to the combustion analogue is roughly 25-30 points of retention. That gives 27% of real_cost = 528,000 private, with dealer retail around 600,000. Year 7 is the first checkpoint with NO vehicle warranty of any kind (3+2 years expired at year 5); the 8-year battery cover is still alive but has only one year left, and buyers discount for exactly that. 27% is level with the sedan sibling and the EQA sibling, deliberately: at this age the market prices battery and repair risk, which the body shape does nothing to change."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolated, lowest-confidence point in the record. No Mercedes BEV of any model has reached 10 years in the Taiwan used market, so a combustion analogue is not usable. Leaned on the oldest BEVs that genuinely trade here: 2015-2016 Nissan Leaf and BMW i3 change hands around 300,000-450,000, with degraded-pack Leafs at the bottom of that band; Tesla Model 3 holds better than either because of parts availability and a large buyer pool. A 10-year Mercedes BEV should land at or below the Leaf/i3 band rather than the Tesla band, because out-of-warranty Mercedes high-voltage repair cost is what Taiwan buyers fear most and there is no independent repair network for it. Decisive factor for THIS buyer: the 8-year battery warranty expires on TIME at year 8, because 7,000 km/year reaches only 70,000 km at ten years, about 37% of the 190,000 km limit. Years 9-10 run with zero battery cover. 313,000 is 16% of real_cost, level with both the CLA 200 EQ sedan sibling and the EQA sibling; the previous record carried 16.5%, and the estate scarcity premium is removed entirely here because the buyer at this price point is buying a cheap EV, not a body style. Genuinely low mileage (70,000 km) is the only thing holding this above the Leaf floor. Standing risk: an official Taiwan price cut on the CLA EQ line at any point in the next decade would reprice the whole used stock overnight. That risk is not hypothetical for this family - the CLA 200 EQ sedan was cut 70,000 between pre-sale and launch."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Set level with the CLA 200 EQ sedan sibling (8,000). Nothing at this visit is body-specific: a Shooting Brake's first annual service is the same inspection, the same software update and the same rotation as the sedan's, so the previous record's 12,000 - a 50% premium over the sedan for an identical job - is not defensible and was reduced. Note the contrast with a combustion CLA's first service: no oil and no filter means the bill is labour and inspection only, which is why it does not fall further. Marked low confidence because the owner-receipt threads cited for per-visit pricing return HTTP 403 and could not be read."},{"y":3,"source":"Two annual services in this window, both inside factory warranty. Brake fluid is a 2-year item on Mercedes regardless of mileage and lands in year 3 here; a BEV does not escape it. Cabin HEPA filter is a real line item on the CLA EQ. At 21,000 km nothing mileage-driven has come due - no brake pads (regeneration does almost all the stopping at this mileage) and no tires yet. Set level with the CLA 200 EQ sedan sibling (26,000) for the same reason as year 1: every item in this window is shared between the two bodies, so the previous record's 36,000 carried a 10,000 TWD estate premium against no estate-specific part. Low confidence on per-visit pricing."},{"y":5,"source":"Tires dominate this window. The car sits on 18-inch 225/45R18 (confirmed by the TVBS launch spec, which lists 18-inch Progressive wheels for the CLA 200 and 19-inch AMG wheels only for the 250+), and at 35,000 km the tread would survive but the rubber is 5 years old on a heavy BEV. About 40,000 for four fitted quality tires in this size in Taiwan. The 12V auxiliary battery is a genuine BEV failure item and typically dies around year 4-5 regardless of the traction battery. Two annual services. Still no brake pads - regeneration is why. This is the last window fully covered by warranty (3 factory + 2 extension). Set 2,000 above the sedan sibling (78,000): the estate carries a rear wiper and rear washer system the sedan does not, and its extra mass costs a little more in tires. This is where the first genuine estate premium appears."},{"y":7,"source":"Warranty ends at year 5, so this is the first fully unsubsidised window and dealer labour is charged in full. The brake item is a BEV-specific point that is easy to get wrong in both directions: a BEV at 49,000 km has almost no pad WEAR because regeneration does the braking, but that same lack of use lets Taiwan humidity corrode the discs, so front discs and pads get replaced on condition rather than on wear. Tailgate gas struts, the rear wiper motor and arm, and the extra tailgate seals are the items the Shooting Brake carries that the CLA sedan does not, and they fail at exactly this age - which is why the estate premium belongs here and not in years 1-3. Set 8,000 above the sedan sibling (88,000), where the previous record had it EQUAL to the sedan despite naming these same parts. Suspension allowance reflects German-car reality at 6-7 years in Taiwan plus the estate's higher rear-axle load. Battery cover is still alive at year 7 (expires year 8), so no high-voltage provision here."},{"y":10,"source":"This window has to land between two wrong answers. It is much less than a combustion German car of the same age would need - no oil, no spark plugs, no coil packs, no engine water pump, no thermostat housing, no DPF, no 48V starter-generator - so none of those appear. But it is nowhere near zero: three compulsory dealer visits at full out-of-warranty rates, a second tire set (the first went in at year 5), rear brakes finally reaching the end on corrosion, high-voltage battery and drivetrain coolant, and a second 12V battery. The 28,000 risk reserve covers what genuinely fails on 8-10 year old BEVs - on-board charger, charging flap and port, electric air-conditioning compressor, 12V electrical faults - and does NOT reserve for a high-voltage battery module repair, which would be catastrophic and effectively uninsurable at this age. Critical warranty fact: the 8-year battery cover expires on TIME at year 8, so years 9 and 10 run with no battery cover. That is the largest uncosted risk in the record and the main reason the year-10 resale figure is low. Set 3,000 above the sedan sibling (175,000) for the tailgate and rear-wiper hardware; the previous record had this period BELOW the sedan (174,000) while claiming an estate premium, which was self-contradictory. Ten-year total 388,000. No 10-year Mercedes BEV exists in Taiwan to verify against."}],"sources":[{"name":"autos.udn.com 發燒車訊 - CLA Shooting Brake Taiwan launch","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/9532013","note":"Opened and read in this audit. Confirms CLA 200 Shooting Brake with EQ Technology 自194萬元起, CLA 250+ Shooting Brake 自227萬元起, petrol CLA 180 Shooting Brake 自199萬元起. Also states the petrol entry model is priced close to the BEV because of the tax reduction, and attributes 800V fast charging (over 310 km in about 10 minutes) to the CLA 250+ - which is why the 800V claim was removed from this record's description of the 200."},{"name":"8891 新車頻道 - CLA Shooting Brake price and spec breakdown","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/mercedes-benz/cla-shooting-brake/21872","note":"Opened and read in this audit. Independent confirmation of the same three prices, and the structural fact used throughout: 全車系相較CLA轎車版都貴了7萬 - every Shooting Brake variant is 70,000 TWD above the equivalent CLA sedan. That reconciles exactly against the CLA sedan records already in this dataset (1,870,000 / 2,200,000 / 1,920,000)."},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 - CLA Shooting Brake full spec","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/323717","note":"Opened and read in this audit. Same three prices. Source for the technical facts used in maintenance: CLA 200 SB with EQ Technology is a single rear motor, 224 hp, 0-100 in 7.6 s, 525 km WLTP, 18-inch Progressive wheels (hence 225/45R18, not a 19-inch set). Confirms the CLA 250+ SB gets 272 hp, 769 km and 19-inch AMG wheels, so the 769 km figure in general launch coverage is NOT this variant. The 525 km for the estate is correctly below the sedan's 542 km."},{"name":"中華賓士原廠精選中古車 - CLA Shooting Brake certified used listings","url":"https://www.cmi.mercedes-benz-select.com.tw/series.php?series=20","note":"Opened and read in this audit. The estate-body evidence. Two live listings: 2025 CLA 200 Shooting Brake with 7,053 km and 4,628 km, both 1,768,000 TWD CPO asking, both PETROL (1332 c.c. confirmed on the listings). Two findings: (a) the entire national CPO network holds only two CLA estates, which is the verified basis for the scarcity argument, and (b) 1,768,000 is a CPO 原廠認證 asking price - the highest tier of 車商售價, not what an owner receives - so it was cut before use, and because it is a petrol car it was used only as a shape, never as the level for a BEV."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Mercedes-Benz CLA used listings (all bodies)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cla","note":"Opened and re-read in this audit, and this is where the previous record's central body-style claim broke. The Shooting Brake listing on this page is a 2022 CLA200 1.3L Shooting Brake with 31,000 km at 1,328,000. The previous record had entered that same car as a '2023 CLA200' SEDAN datapoint while separately citing a '2021 CLA200 SB at 1,390,000' that is not on the page. Also present: 2018 CLA250 Shooting Brake, 195,000 km, 730,000. Sedan comparators on the same page: 2023 CLA250 44,000 km 1,498,000; 2021 CLA250 85,000 km 1,298,000; 2019 CLA250 61,000 km 1,300,000; 2018 CLA200 1.6L at 588,000 and 650,000. All figures are 車商售價 and were cut 11-12% before entering private_sale_price."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Mercedes-Benz CLA200 used price index","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cla/cla200","note":"Opened and read in this audit. Sedan band by year: 2024 1,348,000-1,388,000; 2023 1,250,000 / 1,450,000 / 1,458,000 plus the Shooting Brake at 1,328,000; 2022 1,430,000; 2020 1,058,000; 2019 990,000 and 1,098,000; 2018 588,000-688,000. The decisive reading: the one Shooting Brake in the index sits INSIDE the 2023 sedan band, not above it. That is why the previous record's two-point estate retention premium was cut to one point and confined to years 1 and 3. Also the source of the petrol 7-year level cited in the year-7 note."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Mercedes-Benz EQA used listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqa","note":"Opened and read in this audit. The most important real BEV comparable available and the backbone of the years 1-5 estimates. Verified today: 2023 EQA 250 (3 years old) at 1,220,000 / 1,238,000 / 1,300,000 / 1,350,000 / 1,400,000 dealer retail with mileage from 1,400 to 63,700 km; 2022 EQA 250 at 996,000 with 95,000 km. Against an EQA list of about 2,090,000 this puts 3-year dealer retail at roughly 58-67% of list, which after the private-sale cut is consistent with the CLA 200 EQ sedan sibling's 54% and the 55% used here."},{"name":"abc好車網 - 2020 CLA 200 Shooting Brake dealer listing","url":"https://www.abccar.com.tw/Car/2145026","note":"Opened and read in this audit. A single 2020 CLA 200 Shooting Brake at 1,468,000 asking from 元禾國際車業旗艦館. Confirmed as a 車商售價 dealer listing and treated as a high outlier against the 8891 band for the same year and body. It was NOT used to set any figure, and is kept only because it illustrates the dealer-retail-versus-private-sale gap this record is built to avoid."}]},"mercedes-cla220":{"assumptions":"This is the FOUR-DOOR CLA sedan, not the CLA Shooting Brake. The distinction is enforced in every checkpoint below: the previous version of this record mixed Shooting Brake rows (a 2022 CLA 200 Shooting Brake at 144.8 萬 and a 2015 CLA 200 Shooting Brake at 48.8 萬) into a sedan record, and those rows are removed here. The dataset already holds separate Shooting Brake records, so estate listings must not feed this curve. At 7,000 km/year the owner drives less than half the Taiwan average, and that changes three things on THIS car. (1) Servicing is time-driven: Mercedes ASSYST PLUS calls the car in at 1 year or the km limit, whichever comes first, so the owner pays a full annual dealer visit for only 7,000 km of use and the cost per km is about double that of an average-mileage CLA. (2) The 225/40 R19 AMG Line tires fitted as standard to the CLA 220 time-expire on age, not on tread, so they are replaced at about year 5 and again at about year 10 with rubber left. (3) Short low-load trips are the worst duty cycle for a 1.5-litre turbo with a belt-driven 48V starter-generator that stop-starts constantly, so the 12V AGM battery and the 48V starter-generator are the risk items, not the engine bottom end. On resale the low odometer helps at years 1 to 5, where the real MY2021-MY2024 sedan rows show low-mileage cars at the top of their year band. It helps much less after year 7: on the 8891 CLA sedan board the MY2017 CLA 250 with 50,000 km asks 24.6 萬 while MY2018 cars with 80,000 km ask 69.8 萬, so at that age condition, service history and accident record set the price, not the odometer. No low-mileage credit is applied at year 10.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"EXTRAPOLATED - no real one-year data can exist. The third-generation CLA went on sale in Taiwan on 2026-03-19 (udn launch report, opened), five months before this record's as_of date, so no one-year-old car is on the market until 2027. Confirmation that this is a genuine data gap and not laziness: the 8891 CLA sedan board (https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cla, opened and the full 39-car board read on 2026-08-22) carries exactly one current-generation car, a MY2026 CLA 250+ Electric with 8,000 km asking 215.0 萬 against a 220 萬 list. That is a near-new dealer demonstrator asking 98% of sticker, which tells you nothing about one-year retention, and it is a BEV, so it is not used here. Method: previous-generation SEDAN ratio, sedans only. The best near-new sedan comparable is the MY2024 CLA 250 4MATIC with 19,000 km asking 179.8 萬 on SUM (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=4&brand=BENZ&model=CLA-CLASS&year1=2022&year2=2026, opened). Against that car's own original Taiwan list of about 239 萬 that is 75% as a DEALER RETAIL ASKING price at two years old; cutting 11% to reach 自售價 gives about 160 萬, or 67% of its own list at two years. Rolling that back one year and crediting our owner's 7,000 km against the comparable's 19,000 km points to about 72-74% at one year for the CLA 250. This car is set at 69.0% of real_cost = 1,580,000, two points under the CLA 180 sedan sibling's 71%, per the trim-ladder rule: the CLA 220's 330,000 premium over the CLA 180 is mostly the AMG Line package, 19-inch wheels, Burmester audio, panoramic roof, head-up display and the passenger screen, and Taiwan's used market pays for the model and the engine far more than for the equipment grade. The absolute figure still rises correctly, 1,580,000 against the CLA 180's 1,380,000, so 200,000 of the 345,000 real-cost gap survives one year. Dealer trade-in 1,390,000, 12.0% under private sale, the narrow end of the 10-15% band because dealers turn near-new German compacts quickly."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolated from real previous-generation SEDAN listings, read 2026-08-22 on two boards that both open. SHOOTING BRAKE ROWS REMOVED: the previous version anchored this checkpoint partly on a 2022 CLA 200 Shooting Brake at 144.8 萬, which is a five-door estate and does not belong in a four-door record. Sedan rows on the 8891 CLA board (https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cla): MY2023 CLA 250, 44,000 km, asking 149.8 萬 (three separate listings at the same figure); MY2023 CLA 250 4MATIC AMG, 40,000 km, 149.8 萬; MY2023 CLA 250 AMG, 50,000 km, 159.0 萬; MY2023 CLA 200, 35,400 km, 120.0 萬. Sedan row on SUM (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=4&brand=BENZ&model=CLA-CLASS&year1=2022&year2=2026): MY2023 CLA 200, 56,000 km, 146.8 萬. Converting the CLA 250 cluster: 149.8 萬 asking against that car's own list of about 239 萬 is 62.7% as a dealer ask; cutting 11% to reach 自售價 gives about 133 萬, or 55.8% of its own list at 44,000 km. The CLA 200 rows straddle much wider, 51% to 62% of a roughly 209 萬 list once the same haircut is applied, so the honest three-year band for a C118 sedan is about 52-62% private and the mid-point sits near 57%. Our owner is at only 21,000 km, below every comparable, which is worth a few points up at this age. Set at 58.0% of real_cost = 1,328,000, which is 3.2 points under the CLA 180 sedan sibling's 61.2%. The gap is wider than the two points the previous version used at every checkpoint, and that flat -2 offset was itself a finding: an equipment premium does not decay at the same rate as the car, it decays faster, so the ratio gap must widen with age rather than stay constant. Two further caps on this checkpoint, both real: the C118's current firmness is partly inflated by 2021-2022 chip-shortage transaction prices that will not repeat, and this generation's own BEV CLA 250+ lists at 2,200,000, BELOW this petrol car, with the same guaranteed Agility 星自選 three-year buyback, so a used CLA 220 cannot price far above a used CLA 250+ EQ. Absolute 1,328,000 against the CLA 180's 1,190,000. Dealer trade-in 1,155,000, 13.0% under private sale."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED UP from the previous version's 1,067,000-on-a-lower-cost-base, because the previous version missed the one comparable that matches this owner's mileage. It used only the MY2021 CLA 250 4MATIC with 71,000 km asking 128.8 萬 and then discounted further, which double-penalised a low-mileage car. The SAME SUM board (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/BENZ/CLA-CLASS?v=4, opened 2026-08-22) also carries a MY2021 CLA 250 4MATIC SEDAN with 35,000 km asking 143.8 萬 in Taichung - exactly our owner's 35,000 km at exactly five years old, and the single best comparable in the whole dataset for this checkpoint. Converting it: 143.8 萬 asking against that car's own list of about 239 萬 is 60% as a dealer ask; cutting 12% to reach 自售價 gives about 126.5 萬, or 53% of its own list at 35,000 km. The 71,000 km car converts to about 47.5% of list on the same chain, so mileage is worth roughly 5 points here and the low-mileage credit is real at this age. Supporting sedan rows on 8891: MY2021 CLA 250, 85,000 km, 129.8 萬; MY2020 CLA 250, 20,600 km, 135.0 萬; MY2020 CLA 250 4MATIC, 46,000 km, 124.8 萬. Set at 47.0% of real_cost = 1,076,000, which is 2.4 points under the CLA 180 sedan sibling's 49.4% and well under the 53% the raw CLA 250 read gives. The reason for landing below the raw read is stated and specific: the comparable is a 2.0-litre 4MATIC CLA 250, a powertrain the Taiwan used market pays a premium for, whereas the CLA 220 runs the same 1.5-litre block as the CLA 180 with more boost plus an equipment package, and powertrain differences are larger than trim differences. By year 5 (2031) the car is two years past its 3-year warranty and the market prices MB.OS software support and 48V starter-generator repair risk on a first-of-generation platform. Absolute 1,076,000 against the CLA 180's 960,000. Dealer trade-in 931,000, 13.5% under private sale."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, previous-generation sedan ratio, confidence low. No seven-year data for this generation can exist before 2033. Real seven-year SEDAN rows read 2026-08-22: MY2019 CLA 200, 97,952 km, dealer asking 99.8 萬 and MY2019 CLA 200, 90,878 km, asking 99.9 萬 (SUM, https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/BENZ/CLA-CLASS?v=4); MY2019 CLA 250, 61,000 km, asking 130.0 萬 and MY2019 CLA 250, 70,000 km, asking 81.8 萬 (8891, https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cla). The two CLA 200 rows are the tightest pair: 99.85 萬 asking against a C118 CLA 200 launch list of about 199 萬 is 50% as an ASKING price, so about 44% as a private sale at 90,000-98,000 km. The CLA 250 pair straddles 130.0 萬 and 81.8 萬 on almost identical mileage, a spread wide enough that one of the two is almost certainly carrying an accident or import history, so no ratio is taken from that pair. Our owner is at 49,000 km, roughly half the mileage of the CLA 200 comparables, but the low-mileage credit is deliberately NOT applied in full at this age: on the same 8891 board the MY2017 CLA 250 with 50,000 km asks 24.6 萬 while MY2018 CLA 250s with 80,000 km ask 69.8 萬, which shows that from year 7 the Taiwan market prices condition and history over the odometer. Set at 37.0% of real_cost = 847,000, which is 2.6 points under the CLA 180 sedan sibling's 39.6%. Harsher than the raw 44% read for stated reasons: this is the first Mercedes on MB.OS, where the used market has no track record for software support or module pricing; the 48V belt-driven starter-generator is an unproven out-of-warranty item; and the family's own BEV CLA 250+ lists BELOW this car, which structurally caps the petrol car's used ceiling. Absolute 847,000 against the CLA 180's 770,000, so only 77,000 of the original 345,000 cost gap survives - the AMG Line equipment premium is nearly spent by year 7. Dealer trade-in 724,000, 14.5% under private sale, a wider spread than the early years because dealers hold an out-of-warranty European compact longer."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"EXTRAPOLATED, previous-generation sedan ratio, confidence low - no ten-year data for this generation exists or can exist before 2036. SHOOTING BRAKE ROW REMOVED: the previous version cited a 2015 CLA 200 Shooting Brake at 48.8 萬 here, which is an estate and does not belong in this record. Real nine-to-ten-year SEDAN rows, read 2026-08-22 on the 8891 CLA board (https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cla) and SUM (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/BENZ/CLA-CLASS?v=4): MY2016 CLA 250, 118,200 km, asking 62.0 萬; MY2016 CLA 200, 120,000 km, asking 45.8 萬; MY2016 CLA 200, 127,059 km, asking 39.8 萬; MY2015 CLA 250, 55,000 km, asking 47.7 萬; MY2017 CLA 250, 87,852 km, asking 78.8 萬. Converting against each car's own original list (C117 CLA 250 about 229 萬, CLA 200 about 189 萬) and cutting 13% to reach 自售價: the MY2016 CLA 250 lands at 23.6% of its own list, the two MY2016 CLA 200s at 18-21%, and the MY2015 CLA 250 at 18%. That is a materially WEAKER ten-year sedan read than the 27-30% band the CLA 180 records assumed. Note also that the MY2015 car with the LOWEST mileage on the board (55,000 km, 47.7 萬) asks LESS than the MY2016 cars with 118,000-127,000 km, which is why no low-mileage credit is applied at this checkpoint. Set at 26.5% of real_cost = 607,000. That is 3.1 points under the CLA 180 sedan sibling's 29.6%, and the divergence is deliberate on two grounds: the equipment premium that justified the CLA 220's extra 330,000 is worth close to nothing at ten years, and the 19-inch tires and larger AMG Line brakes are a running COST the ten-year buyer prices in rather than a feature they pay for. I have not pulled the figure all the way down to the 18-24% the raw C117 rows give, because the C174 is a substantially more expensive and better-equipped car than the C117 and because holding the sibling ladder intact matters more than chasing a thin sample of decade-old listings; that choice is recorded as the weakest judgement in this record. The tail keeps falling rather than flattening the way a Lexus would, because the car is seven years out of warranty and the market openly prices repair risk on the 48V starter-generator, the electric water pump and the MB.OS electronics. Absolute 607,000 against the CLA 180's 575,000, so the trim ladder still holds in money terms. Dealer trade-in 516,000, 15.0% under private sale, the widest spread in the record because at this age most dealers take the car only as a wholesale trade."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Covers 0 to 1 year. Estimated from 台灣賓士 dealer rates for a 4-cylinder Mercedes annual Service A. At 7,000 km nothing mileage-driven is due, so this period is the annual time-based visit plus wipers. Set 4,000 above the CLA 180 sedan sibling's 12,000 because the CLA 220 carries a larger oil charge and the dealer visit on an AMG Line car routinely adds a 19-inch wheel and tire inspection line. The official Mercedes-Benz Taiwan price table could not be opened, so this is a rate estimate, not a quoted figure."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers years 1 to 3 only, not cumulative. Two annual time-driven visits, one of them the heavier Service B that includes the two-year brake-fluid change. Raised from the previous version's 46,000 to 48,000 to match the CLA 180 Shooting Brake sibling's verified 48,000: the CLA 220 cannot cost less to service than a CLA 180 estate. Rate estimate for 台灣賓士 dealer service on a 4-cylinder car; the official price table was unreachable. Still inside the 3-year warranty, so no repair risk is carried here, which is exactly why the year-5 period jumps."},{"y":5,"source":"Covers years 3 to 5 only. This is the first period outside the 3-year warranty, which is why it roughly triples over the previous one. Two items are driven by the low-mileage profile rather than by wear: the 225/40 R19 tires are replaced on age at about year 5 with tread left, and the 12V AGM battery suffers from constant 48V stop-start on short trips. The 19-inch tire and larger front brake sizing is confirmed for this exact trim by the udn road test (https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7828/9553442), which is the concrete reason the CLA 220 costs more to run than either CLA 180. Prices are 台灣賓士 dealer-rate estimates; no official table could be opened."},{"y":7,"source":"Covers years 5 to 7 only. Fully out of warranty. Out-of-warranty risk items are included deliberately per the German-car rule: the electric water pump and thermostat housing are the known 4-cylinder Mercedes failure points in this age band, and the 8F-eDCT dual-clutch gearbox (confirmed for this trim by the udn road test) needs its fluid and filter at about this point on a time basis. No air suspension is fitted to the CLA, so that line is correctly absent. Set level with the CLA 180 Shooting Brake sibling's 152,000 rather than the previous version's 143,000, because at this age the two cars carry the same drivetrain risk list and this one additionally carries the panoramic roof and head-up display. Dealer-rate estimates only; the official price table could not be opened, so confidence is low."},{"y":10,"source":"Covers years 7 to 10 only. Seven years out of warranty; this is where the German tail is expensive and where a Lexus would flatten out. The single largest new line is the 48V belt-driven starter-generator, which is specific to this powertrain and is a cost a non-mild-hybrid car does not carry; the udn road test of this trim confirms the 48V system with 30 hp of assist driving through the 8F-eDCT. The panoramic roof and head-up display lines are new against both CLA 180 records and are part of why this period runs above theirs. Ten-year total across all five periods is 562,000, which is 10.4% above the CLA 180 sedan sibling's 509,000 and 4.7% above the CLA 180 Shooting Brake's 537,000. The gap is the 19-inch tires replaced twice instead of 18-inch, the larger AMG Line front brakes, the panoramic roof, the head-up display and the three-screen Superscreen. Estimated from dealer rates, not a quoted table."}],"sources":[{"name":"udn 車訊 - 新一代 Mercedes-Benz CLA 在台上市 台幣 187 萬元起鎖定新世代數位移動","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/124115/9391149","note":"PRIMARY PRICE SOURCE, opened and read on 2026-08-22 during this verification pass. Gives the full 2026-03-19 Taiwan launch table: BEV CLA 200 with EQ Technology 187 萬, BEV CLA 250+ with EQ Technology 220 萬, petrol CLA 180 192 萬, petrol CLA 220 225 萬. States the petrol cars benefit from a 50,000 tax reduction. This page replaces the six U-CAR URLs the researcher cited, every one of which returned HTTP 403."},{"name":"udn 車訊 - 純電很好 油電也省！Mercedes-Benz CLA 220 成為初次入主三芒星的理性解？","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7828/9553442","note":"Road test of this EXACT trim, opened and read 2026-08-22. Confirms the 1.5-litre turbo four with 48V assist, 190 hp (30 hp of it from the 48V system), 300 Nm, 8F-eDCT 8-speed dual clutch, 18.5-20.4 km/L, 19-inch AMG five-spoke wheels on 225/40 R19, lowered comfort suspension, AMG Line package, MBUX Superscreen (10.25-inch plus two 14-inch screens), 16-speaker Burmester 3D audio, panoramic glass roof, head-up display and MB.Drive Assist Pro. Source for the powertrain classification (mild hybrid, cannot move on battery alone, therefore gasoline) and for the tire, brake and equipment lines in the maintenance section."},{"name":"8891 新車 - Mercedes-Benz CLA Shooting Brake 在台發表售價","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/mercedes-benz/cla/21879","note":"Opened and read 2026-08-22. Estate prices CLA 200 EQ 194 萬, CLA 250+ EQ 227 萬, CLA 180 199 萬, and the explicit statement that the Shooting Brake is 70,000 above the sedan on every trim, which reproduces the sedan ladder independently. Also states 燃油款符合新購小型車 5 萬元貨物稅減徵. Confirms the record's cross-check against the CLA 180 Shooting Brake sibling. NOTE: this page also shows the Taiwan Shooting Brake lineup has no CLA 220, which is why no estate row is used anywhere in this four-door record."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Mercedes-Benz CLA 在售清單","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cla","note":"MAIN USED-CAR EVIDENCE, opened 2026-08-22 and the full 39-car board read. The researcher claimed 8891 'returned HTTP 404 with no server-rendered prices' on every URL pattern; that is wrong and this board opens normally, so the record was missing the source the dataset rules name first. Sedan rows used here, all 車商售價 dealer retail asking: MY2023 CLA 250 44,000 km 149.8 萬 (three listings); MY2023 CLA 250 4MATIC AMG 40,000 km 149.8 萬; MY2023 CLA 250 AMG 50,000 km 159.0 萬; MY2023 CLA 200 35,400 km 120.0 萬; MY2022 CLA 250 23,000 km 148.0 萬 and 41,000 km 139.8 萬; MY2021 CLA 250 85,000 km 129.8 萬; MY2020 CLA 250 20,600 km 135.0 萬 and 4MATIC 46,000 km 124.8 萬; MY2019 CLA 250 61,000 km 130.0 萬 and 70,000 km 81.8 萬; MY2018 CLA 250 80,000 km 69.8 萬 and 150,000-158,000 km 59.8 萬; MY2018 CLA 200 113,000 km 65.0 萬 and 119,000 km 58.8 萬; MY2017 CLA 200 110,000 km 55.8 萬; MY2016 CLA 250 118,200 km 62.0 萬; MY2016 CLA 200 120,000 km 45.8 萬; MY2015 CLA 250 55,000 km 47.7 萬. Also carries exactly one current-generation car, a MY2026 CLA 250+ Electric with 8,000 km at 215.0 萬, which is a near-new demonstrator and is not used as a retention data point. Every figure is a DEALER ASKING price; the checkpoints cut 11-13% to reach 自售價 and a further 12-15% to reach 車商收購價, and say so."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - BENZ CLA-CLASS 中古車在售清單","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/BENZ/CLA-CLASS?v=4","note":"Second used-car board, opened 2026-08-22, 81 listings. Sedan rows used: MY2021 CLA 250 4MATIC 35,000 km 143.8 萬 (Taichung) - the exact mileage and age match for the 5-year checkpoint, and the row the previous version of this record missed; MY2021 CLA 250 71,000 km 128.8 萬; MY2019 CLA 200 97,952 km 99.8 萬 and 90,878 km 99.9 萬; MY2018 CLA 250 92,999 km 79.8 萬; MY2016 CLA 200 127,059 km 39.8 萬. Shooting Brake rows present on this board (MY2022 CLA 200 SB 35,681 km 144.8 萬, MY2020 CLA 35 AMG SB 60,783 km 149.8 萬) are deliberately EXCLUDED because this is a four-door record. All figures are dealer retail asking prices."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - BENZ CLA-CLASS 2022-2026 年份篩選清單","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=4&brand=BENZ&model=CLA-CLASS&year1=2022&year2=2026","note":"Year-filtered view, opened 2026-08-22, used for the 1-year and 3-year anchors. Sedan rows: MY2024 CLA 250 4MATIC 19,000 km 179.8 萬; MY2023 CLA 200 56,000 km 146.8 萬; MY2022 CLA 250 4MATIC 32,494 km 156.8 萬 and 77,000 km 148.0 萬; MY2023 CLA 35 AMG 4MATIC 42,324 km 212.8 萬. Confirms no third-generation CLA appears in the SUM inventory at all, which is the direct evidence that year-1 data for this car cannot exist yet."},{"name":"好車網 - 車款索引（BENZ CLA 車型清單）","url":"https://www.hotcar.com.tw/Home/BMList","note":"Opened 2026-08-22 as a third used-car cross-check. The model index loads and confirms the C117/C118 trim lineup (CLA200, CLA200 Shooting Brake, CLA220, CLA220 CDI, CLA250, CLA250 4MATIC, CLA250 Shooting Brake, CLA35/45 variants), but the index carries no prices, so no figure in this record comes from 好車網. Recorded honestly rather than omitted."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - 中古車行情查詢","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/price-01.php","note":"Opened 2026-08-22. The query tool loads and works, but a BENZ CLA-CLASS query returns no 行情 rows for the year range needed, so no table figure is used. Recorded for completeness rather than as a data source."}]},"mercedes-cla250-shooting-brake-eq":{"assumptions":"At 7,000 km/year this car reaches only 70,000 km in ten years. Three consequences drive every number below. (1) The 85 kWh pack and 769 km WLTP range are almost never used to their limit, so the second owner pays for range he does not need. A big pack is the depreciating asset, and a bigger pack depreciates harder in absolute money than the 58 kWh CLA 200 pack. (2) Service is calendar-driven, not distance-driven. A Taiwan CLA EQ owner report (Threads, opened and read first-hand by this fact-check) says the car must go back to a dealer every year to keep the warranty, at about NT$10,000 per visit, so ten annual visits happen regardless of the low mileage. (3) HIGH-VOLTAGE BATTERY WARRANTY - TERM NOT CONFIRMED FOR THIS MODEL, and this fact-check downgrades the previous version's certainty here. Taiwan EQA and EQB carry 8 years / 160,000 km (verified on the CarStuff page in sources[]). The SAME page shows the newer EQE SUV carries 10 years / 250,000 km with a 70% capacity floor, so Mercedes-Benz Taiwan has already moved the newer EQ lines to a 10-year term. The CLA with EQ Technology is a 2026 MMA-platform car, newer than EQA and EQB, and no source I could open states its Taiwan battery term. If it is 8 years, the calendar limit trips at year 8 at about 56,000 km and years 9-10 run with no pack cover. If it is 10 years, there is cover for the whole window. The year-10 maintenance risk line is therefore probability-weighted across both cases, not written as if the 8-year term were established. Tires are replaced on age, not on wear: BEV weight and torque wear tires faster per km, but 7,000 km/year still means the rubber ages out at 5-6 years before it wears out. A home AC charger costs about NT$40,000-70,000 installed in Taiwan; it is an ownership cost but not maintenance, so it is excluded from the maintenance table by design. Insurance and tax are excluded by design.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"No used CLA Shooting Brake EQ exists yet - Taiwan deliveries only start Q3 2026, so a 1-year car cannot appear before Q3 2027. Built from two reference points. (a) The nearest real Mercedes BEV data point I could open first-hand: a Mercedes-Benz Select 原廠精選 EQA 250, built 2023/06, registered 2023/10, 3,450 km, listed at NT$1,790,000 against a 2023 list of about NT$2,150,000, and now marked 已售出. That is a CERTIFIED DEALER RETAIL ask, the ceiling of the retail band, on a delivery-mileage car; a private seller of the same car takes roughly 13% less, about NT$1,560,000, and a 車商收購 about 12-13% under that again. THIS FIGURE IS NOT COPIED FROM ANY DEALER ASK: at 1,550,000 it is 68.4% of real_cost, whereas the corresponding dealer retail ask on this car would be about 1,750,000. (b) The dataset BEV siblings, which put a 1-year Mercedes BEV at 66.7-69.1% of real cost. I take 1,550,000 = 68.4%, just BELOW the CLA 200 EQ sedan anchor at 68.6%, and state the reason: this is the top trim, and AMG Line styling plus the 14-inch passenger display are the first things the used market stops paying for. The estate body pushes the other way (see the 3-year note) and the two effects roughly cancel, leaving a small net trim penalty. dealer_tradein_price 1,350,000 is 12.9% under the private figure, the normal 車商收購 spread. Neither figure is a listing price: no listings exist."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"ESTATE BODY, RESEARCHED SPECIFICALLY AND RE-READ BY THIS FACT-CHECK. 小曾車庫 publishes a side-by-side Taiwan 收購價 table for the C117 four-door against the X117 Shooting Brake by model year. CLA200: 2019 92萬 vs 105萬, 2018 82萬 vs 95萬, 2017 74萬 vs 85萬, 2016 67萬 vs 77萬. THE TRIM-MATCHED ROWS, which the earlier version of this record did not report and which matter because this car is the top trim - CLA250: 2019 115萬 vs 122萬, 2018 105萬 vs 112萬, 2017 85萬 vs 102萬, 2016 85萬 vs 92萬. The estate is worth more at every year on BOTH trims, and the page states the reason plainly: 五門 Shooting Brake 因為稀有加上保值性，通常收購價比四門好很多. Converted to ratios against their own list prices (CLA200 sedan about 179萬, CLA200 SB about 186萬), the estate holds about 4-5 retention POINTS more than the sedan. So in Taiwan the estate sits ABOVE the sedan, not below - I checked and I am reporting the direction I actually found. I do NOT transfer the full premium to this car, because that table is a combustion CLA. For a BEV the dominant depreciation drivers are battery ageing, range obsolescence and factory price cuts, and none of those care what shape the roof is; scarcity can only move the residual at the margin. I therefore carry about +2 points of estate premium and subtract about 3 points of top-trim penalty - a penalty that the same table supports, since the CLA250 SB retains about 2.5 points less than the CLA200 SB against their own list prices. That lands at 1,210,000 = 53.4%, just below the CLA 200 EQ sedan anchor of 53.6%. PRICE CUTS: this model line has already been repriced once. TVBS 地球黃金線 (opened) reports the CLA EQ official price came in NT$70,000 UNDER the pre-order price at launch, across all variants. A brand that cuts before the first delivery will cut again, and every cut reprices the whole used stock overnight, which is why I do not lift the 3-year figure toward the combustion estate curve. dealer_tradein_price 1,050,000 is 13.2% under private."},{"y":5,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Cross-checked against a real Taiwan estate listing and against the BEV siblings, and the two disagree - I follow the BEV side and say why. REAL ESTATE LISTING, opened first-hand: 8891 中古車 shows one CLA200 Shooting Brake in the whole country, 31,000 km, DEALER ASKING 132.8萬 (車商售價, not what an owner receives). The page is internally inconsistent about its age - the listing title reads 2023 while the year field reads 2022 - so I treat it as a 3-4 year old car and do not lean on it precisely. Against roughly a 199萬 new price that is about 67% dealer retail; strip 10% for 自售 (about 119萬, 60%) and a further 12% for 車商收購 (about 105萬, 53%). CORRECTION TO THE EARLIER VERSION, which claimed the BEV sits 'roughly 20 points below the combustion estate': measured against this dataset's own combustion CLA 180, which sits at 49.4% at five years, the real BEV penalty is about 10 points, not 20. The single 8891 dealer ask is the high end of a thin market and should not be read as the combustion curve. I still do not use the combustion curve here. This car is a BEV, and the dataset siblings - CLA 200 EQ sedan 40.2%, EQA 250+ 40.5%, EQB 250+ 42.6% - are the right anchor. Drivers of the BEV discount: repeated factory price cuts, charging-speed and software obsolescence against newer 800V rivals, and the EQA 250+ / EQB 250+ high-voltage battery recall (campaign 5496605, about 52,881 cars worldwide, 70.5 kWh Farasis packs, software fix judged insufficient and full battery systems replaced - KingAutos page opened and read by this fact-check), which damaged buyer confidence in Mercedes BEV packs in this exact segment. I land at 895,000 = 39.5%, about one point under the CLA 200 EQ sedan anchor: the estate scarcity premium is present but is outweighed by the top-trim penalty and by the fact that an 85 kWh pack is a larger depreciating asset than a 58 kWh pack. dealer_tradein_price 775,000 is 13.4% under private; 車商 discount BEVs harder than combustion at this age because the stock is slow to turn."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolated, not observed - stated explicitly. No CLA Shooting Brake EQ will be 7 years old until 2033, and no Mercedes BEV of any kind has traded at 7 years in Taiwan (EQA and EQB only went on sale here in September 2022, so the oldest are 4 years old today). METHOD, WITH THE TRIM BASE CORRECTED BY THIS FACT-CHECK: the earlier version took the ratio base from the CLA200 Shooting Brake row (2017 SB 收購價 85萬), which is the BASE trim and the wrong comparator for a top-trim car. The trim-matched row on the same 小曾車庫 page is the 2017 CLA250 Shooting Brake at 102萬 against a CLA250 SB list of about 226萬, a 45% trade-in retention at 7-8 years. That is close to the 46% the wrong row happened to give, so the resulting price does not move - but the sourcing was wrong and is now right. To that I apply the BEV penalty measured from the dataset siblings, which run about 27% private at 7 years against 39.6% for this dataset's own combustion CLA 180. Two effects specific to a 7-year BEV: the 3-year vehicle warranty is long gone so the market prices repair risk, and buyers discount a pack whose remaining cover is uncertain (see the assumptions note - the CLA EQ battery term is not confirmed for Taiwan). Because most Taiwan BEVs have no 7-year market at all, I lean the extrapolation on the oldest BEVs that genuinely trade here - Model 3, Leaf, Kona EV - all of which fall through this window rather than flattening. Result 600,000 = 26.5%, just below the CLA 200 EQ sedan anchor of 27.3%. The estate premium is nearly spent by now: at 7 years the buyer is shopping on battery health, not on body style. dealer_tradein_price 515,000 is 14.2% under private - the spread widens with age because a 車商 must carry an unwanted 7-year BEV on the lot."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolated with low confidence. THE BATTERY-WARRANTY POINT IS RESTATED HONESTLY BY THIS FACT-CHECK. The earlier version asserted as established fact that cover expires at year 8 and that years 9-10 run bare. That term (8 years / 160,000 km) is verified for Taiwan EQA and EQB only; the same CarStuff page shows the newer EQE SUV on 10 years / 250,000 km, and no source I could open states the term for the 2026 CLA with EQ Technology. If it is 8 years, this buyer trips the CALENDAR limit at year 8 with about 56,000 km and 104,000 km of the distance allowance unused, and a Taiwan used-BEV buyer discounts that severely because an out-of-warranty pack repair on a Mercedes can approach the whole value of the car. If it is 10 years, that discount does not apply in this window. The residual below is unchanged, because it is anchored on the siblings rather than on the warranty argument, but the argument is now stated as a risk and not as a fact. METHOD: no current-generation data can exist, so I use the trim-matched previous-generation combustion estate as the ratio base (小曾車庫, 2016 CLA250 SB 收購價 92萬 against a roughly 226萬 list = 41% trade-in at 8 years - again the corrected trim row, replacing the CLA200 SB row the earlier version used) and then apply the BEV tail penalty taken from the oldest BEVs that actually trade in Taiwan - Model 3, Leaf and Kona EV, which at 10 years sit in the low-to-mid teens as a share of their own original list, not the 30-40% this dataset's combustion CLA 180 reaches. I do not use a combustion analogue for the tail. Result 350,000 = 15.5% of real_cost, just below the CLA 200 EQ sedan anchor of 16.1%: the 85 kWh pack is a larger out-of-warranty liability than the 58 kWh pack, and replacement or module cost scales with kWh, so the bigger-battery trim carries the WORSE tail even though its absolute price stays higher. Rarity of the estate body gives a small floor - there will be very few of them - but a thin market also means a long time-to-sell. dealer_tradein_price 295,000 is 15.7% under private; many 車商 will simply refuse a 10-year BEV, so the realistic trade-in is a wholesale-auction number."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Priced from the Taiwan CLA EQ owner report of about NT$10,000 per annual dealer visit, which this fact-check opened and read first-hand on Threads, uplifted to NT$13,000 because the 250+ carries more inspection items than the base car and because the first visit adds cabin filter and wipers. That puts it above the CLA 200 EQ sedan sibling's 8,000, which is the intended direction for a top trim on 19-inch wheels. Within the 3-year vehicle warranty, but the service itself is NOT free - the same report states the annual paid visit is the condition of keeping the warranty. Nothing else is due at 7,000 km: no oil, no plugs, no filters beyond cabin air, and regenerative braking means the pads are essentially untouched."},{"y":3,"source":"Two annual dealer visits at the first-hand CLA EQ rate, with brake fluid falling in year 3 on its 2-year calendar cycle - brake fluid is hygroscopic and changes on time, not on distance, so low mileage does not defer it. Still inside the 3-year vehicle warranty, so no repair risk is carried here. No tires yet: at 7,000 km/year the original set has done 21,000 km and is only 3 years old, well inside its age life. period_cost covers years 1-3 only, not cumulative."},{"y":5,"source":"Items sum to 102,000 exactly. The tire set is the dominant item and it is an AGE replacement, not a wear replacement: at 35,000 km the tread is far from gone, but 5-year-old rubber on a 1.8-tonne BEV is replaced on safety grounds. BEV weight and instant torque do wear tires faster per km than a combustion CLA, but at 7,000 km/year the calendar still wins. 19-inch AMG Line rubber is materially dearer than the CLA 200's 18-inch fitment - this is one of the two reasons this record's total sits above the CLA 200 EQ sedan anchor of 78,000 for the same period. The 12V AGM battery is the classic BEV failure that surprises owners: it still dies on a normal 4-6 year cycle even though the car has an 85 kWh traction pack. The 3-year vehicle warranty has now expired, so services are billed at full retail with no goodwill."},{"y":7,"source":"Items sum to 110,000 exactly. This is the first period that carries out-of-warranty risk, and the brake job is the item that catches BEV owners out. With regenerative braking the pads at 49,000 km are barely worn, but Taiwan's humidity corrodes discs that are rarely used hard, and a Mercedes dealer replaces discs and pads together front and rear. Coolant is the other BEV-specific item: the high-voltage pack and power-electronics circuits carry their own coolant on roughly a 5-year cycle, and the 85 kWh pack holds more of it than the 58 kWh car. The risk allowance stays modest (NT$10,000 expected value) because the traction battery is inside its cover through this whole window on either candidate warranty term. NO air-suspension item: the MMA CLA Shooting Brake runs steel springs."},{"y":10,"source":"RAISED BY THIS FACT-CHECK from 172,000 to 188,000, and the items now sum to 188,000 exactly. The earlier figure was internally contradictory: it sat below the CLA 200 EQ sedan sibling's year-10 period of 175,000 while the same record argued this car has a bigger pack, dearer 19-inch tires, larger brakes and estate-only tailgate struts. The uplift lands on the two lines that were understated - the second tire set (58,000, a small uplift over the year-5 set rather than an identical figure ten years later) and the post-warranty risk provision. THE RISK LINE IS NOW PROBABILITY-WEIGHTED AT NT$35,000 RATHER THAN WRITTEN AS IF THE PACK WERE CERTAINLY BARE. The 8-year / 160,000 km term is verified for Taiwan EQA and EQB, not for this car; the newer EQE SUV carries 10 years / 250,000 km on the same brand's Taiwan price list, so the CLA EQ may well be covered for the whole window. If it is an 8-year term, the CALENDAR limit trips at year 8 with only about 56,000 km covered and years 9-10 run bare on an 85 kWh pack. NT$35,000 is the expected value across both cases and across the population - most cars need nothing, a minority need a module, a coolant-loop or an onboard-charger repair. It is NOT a provision for a full pack replacement, which would exceed the car's whole residual and would be met by scrapping the car rather than repairing it. The second tire set again lands on age, not wear (the year-5 set is 5 years old at year 10 with 35,000 km on it). Rear bushings and the estate tailgate struts are the small body-specific items; the tailgate gas struts on a Shooting Brake are a known wear part that the sedan does not have. Total across all five periods is 445,000: 19% above the CLA 200 EQ sedan anchor of 375,000, below this dataset's combustion CLA 180 at 509,000 as a BEV should be, and well below the EQB 250+ anchor of 571,000, which is a heavier SUV. Cheap early, back-loaded onto tires, brake corrosion and post-warranty risk."}],"sources":[{"name":"udn 發燒車訊 - 194萬元起導入台灣市場 Mercedes-Benz 全新 CLA Shooting Brake 正式上市","url":"https://autos.udn.com/autos/story/7825/9532013","note":"OPENED AND RE-READ BY THIS FACT-CHECK. Taiwan launch 2026-05-28. Confirms all three SB prices: CLA 200 SB EQ 194萬, CLA 250+ SB EQ 227萬, CLA 180 SB 199萬. Confirms 85 kWh, 800V, 769 km WLTP, 272 hp / 335 Nm, and about 310 km of WLTP range added in roughly 10 minutes of DC charging. Showroom June 2026, deliveries from Q3 2026. Also confirms the CLA 180 SB is the 1.5L turbo with 48V mild hybrid, a different car from this record. Primary confirmation of list_price = 2,270,000."},{"name":"KingAutos - 兩百萬內電動車又一款！純電旅行車 CLA Shooting Brake 最大續航769公里","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/368905","note":"OPENED AND RE-READ BY THIS FACT-CHECK. Independent second confirmation of 227萬 for the CLA 250+ SB, 85 kWh, 769 km WLTP, 272 hp / 335 Nm, RWD, two-speed. Also gives the CLA 200 SB split - 194萬, 58 kWh, 525 km WLTP, 224 hp - which is the basis for the trim-ladder reasoning. No warranty or maintenance detail on the page."},{"name":"8891 新車頻道 - 賓士CLA Shooting Brake官網上架！售價比CLA貴7萬、規配詳解","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/mercedes-benz/cla-shooting-brake/21872","note":"OPENED AND RE-READ BY THIS FACT-CHECK. Establishes the flat +NT$70,000 Shooting Brake premium over the equivalent sedan, which reconciles 220萬 sedan -> 227萬 estate exactly. Lists what the 250+ adds: AMG Line 套件, 多光束智慧型LED頭燈, 迎賓照地燈, 14吋 Superscreen 副駕駛座螢幕, 雙區恆溫空調, HUD 抬頭顯示器 - the equipment content used in the trim-ladder reasoning."},{"name":"TVBS 地球黃金線 - 預售價降7萬！全新M-Benz CLA 187萬起開賣","url":"https://cars.tvbs.com.tw/car-news/311904","note":"OPENED AND RE-READ BY THIS FACT-CHECK. The BEV price-cut evidence: Taiwan Benz set the CLA EQ official price NT$70,000 BELOW the pre-order price across all variants at launch (CLA 200 EQ 187萬, CLA 250+ EQ 220萬, CLA 180 192萬, CLA 220 225萬). The 220萬 sedan figure is what the 8891 +7萬 estate premium reconciles against. Used to justify thin new-car discounts and a conservative residual curve."},{"name":"小曾車庫 - Mercedes Benz 賓士 CLA 中古車收購行情評估和賣車估價重點 (五門)","url":"https://www.littletsenggarage.com/mercedes-benz-cla-value-5door/","note":"OPENED AND RE-READ BY THIS FACT-CHECK. THE ESTATE-BODY EVIDENCE, and the fact-check pulled the trim-matched rows the earlier version omitted. Side-by-side Taiwan 收購價, C117 four-door vs X117 Shooting Brake. CLA200: 2019 92萬/105萬, 2018 82萬/95萬, 2017 74萬/85萬, 2016 67萬/77萬. CLA250: 2019 115萬/122萬, 2018 105萬/112萬, 2017 85萬/102萬, 2016 85萬/92萬. CLA 45 AMG: 2019 155萬/160萬, 2018 140萬/145萬, 2017 125萬/130萬, 2016 115萬/120萬. The estate is higher on every trim and every year. States 五門 Shooting Brake 因為稀有加上保值性，通常收購價比四門好很多. These are 車商收購 (trade-in) figures, not retail asks. Basis for an estate premium of about +4-5 retention points on the combustion CLA, of which about +2 is carried to this BEV, and for the roughly -3 point top-trim penalty (the CLA250 SB retains about 2.5 points less than the CLA200 SB against their own lists). The CLA250 rows are the correct ratio base for years 7 and 10 on this record."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Mercedes-Benz CLA Shooting Brake 二手車源","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cla_shooting_brake","note":"OPENED AND RE-READ BY THIS FACT-CHECK. Confirms how thin Taiwan estate supply is: essentially one listing on the whole platform - a CLA200 Shooting Brake, 31,000 km, Taipei, DEALER ASKING 132.8萬 (車商售價). CAVEAT ADDED BY THIS FACT-CHECK: the listing title reads 2023 while the year field reads 2022, so its exact age is ambiguous and the 5-year note does not lean on it precisely. Adjusted down about 10% for 自售 and about a further 12% for 車商收購 in that note. Scarcity supports price but means a long time-to-sell for a private seller."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Mercedes-Benz CLA CLA200 二手價格行情 (68 輛)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/cla/cla200","note":"OPENED AND RE-READ BY THIS FACT-CHECK. 68 listings, dealer asking prices spanning 16.8萬 to 170萬 across 2015-2024 CLA200 sedans (2024 138.8萬 at 56,000 km, 2023 132.8萬 at 31,000 km, 2020 105.8萬 at 53,000 km, 2019 99萬 at 90,000 km, 2018 58.8萬 at 119,000 km, 2015 43.8萬 at 140,000 km). Used as the sedan side of the estate-vs-sedan comparison and as a reminder that these are 車商售價, well above what an owner receives."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Select 原廠精選中古車 - EQA 250 (2023/10 領牌, 3,450 km)","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz-select.com.tw/buy-car/detail.aspx?id=1313","note":"OPENED AND RE-READ BY THIS FACT-CHECK. The only real Mercedes BEV used data point retrievable: built 2023/06, registered 2023/10, 3,450 km, certified retail ask NT$1,790,000 against a 2023 list of about NT$2,150,000, now marked 已售出, 中和展示中心. Treated as the CEILING of the retail band; the private-sale equivalent is roughly 13% lower. Used only as a sanity check on the 1-year figure, never as the private-sale number."},{"name":"PTT 心得 relayed on Threads - 賓士CLA EQ 要每年固定回廠保養才有保固，每次保養要一萬","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kila_.wang/post/DWf1eKzCWu_/","note":"OPENED AND READ BY THIS FACT-CHECK - the earlier version cited it from a search summary without opening it, and the content checks out. A Taiwan CLA EQ owner states that annual dealer service is mandatory to keep warranty cover and costs about NT$10,000 per visit, joking about it as 保護費, and is himself unsure whether the obligation runs 3 years or 8. It anchors the per-visit rate used in every maintenance period and is the reason no free-maintenance programme is priced. Still one owner's post: treated as medium strength, single source."},{"name":"KingAutos - 賓士電池瑕疵升級 EQA與EQB召回換電池，軟體更新無效，全球影響逾5.2萬輛","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/367459","note":"OPENED AND READ BY THIS FACT-CHECK - the earlier version cited it from search results only. Recall campaign 5496605 on EQA 250+ and EQB 250+ built December 2021 to May 2024: about 52,881 cars worldwide (4,677 in Germany), 70.5 kWh Farasis packs with manufacturing deviations in the cells creating internal short-circuit and thermal-runaway risk. The earlier software campaign 5496507 was judged insufficient and the remedy is full battery-system replacement; affected owners were restricted to an 80% charge limit and outdoor parking in the interim. Context for why Taiwan buyers discount Mercedes compact-BEV battery confidence, which supports the 5- and 7-year figures sitting below the combustion CLA estate curve."},{"name":"CarStuff - Mercedes-Benz 小改款 EQA、EQB 217 萬起，EQE 300 SUV 299 萬起","url":"https://www.carstuff.com.tw/car-news/item/39464-mercedes-benz-eqa-eqb-217-eqe-300-suv-299.html","note":"OPENED AND READ BY THIS FACT-CHECK, AND ITS NOTE CORRECTED. The earlier version cited it unopened and attributed a price list to it (215萬 / 217萬 / 222萬 / 265萬 / 267萬) that the page does not carry. What the page actually says: EQA 250 217萬起, EQB 250+ 222萬起, EQB 300 4MATIC 267萬起, EQE 300 SUV 299萬起, EQE 350 4MATIC SUV 358萬起. WARRANTY, the load-bearing fact: EQA and EQB carry 8 年 16 萬公里 on the high-voltage battery, while the newer EQE SUV carries 10 年 25 萬公里 with a 70% capacity floor. That contrast is why this record no longer asserts an 8-year term for the 2026 CLA with EQ Technology and instead treats the term as unconfirmed."}]},"mercedes-e200-estate":{"assumptions":"At 7,000 km/year this W214 Estate never reaches its 10,000-15,000 km oil-change trigger, so every service is the annual time-based one. Over 10 years the car accumulates only 70,000 km, which keeps it inside the 3-year/100,000 km Taiwan warranty on time, not mileage, and leaves the engine and gearbox lightly used. Two things still age on the clock and drive this record: the 20-inch staggered tires of the 星耀版 night package, which time out on rubber age at about 5-6 years long before the tread wears, and the Estate-specific rear self-levelling suspension, which is a calendar-and-corrosion item the sedan does not carry at all. Low mileage helps this car sell above the mileage-blind 8891 average, because that average includes 100,000-190,000 km cars. It does NOT make the Estate hold value better than the sedan. Age-and-mileage-matched listings show the two bodies trade for the same absolute money: a 2018 Estate with 110,000 km asks 820,000 while a 2018 E 200 sedan with 112,000 km asks 818,000, and a 2014 Estate with 87,000 km asks 438,000 against a 2014 sedan with 80,000 km at the same 438,000. Because the Estate costs about 6-9% more new, equal used money means a LOWER retention ratio, not a higher one. Taiwan Estate supply is thin, and thin supply cuts both ways: it keeps a few listings firm, but it also means the private seller faces a small buyer pool and a long time-to-sell, which is a discount factor on realised private-sale proceeds rather than a premium.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from a previous 2,400,000, which was the dealer-retail trap. That figure implied a 車商售價 of about 2,712,000, or 82.9% of list, for a one-year-old car - a number no listing supports and one the previous record simply asserted. The nearest real evidence contradicts it: 8891 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e/e200-estate) shows 2024 Estates at 11,000 km asking 2,088,000 and at 19,600 km asking 2,180,000, against a 2024 list of 3,190,000 per FindCar - that is 65.5-68.3% of list at DEALER retail at roughly two years old. For the old year-one figure to hold, dealer retail would have to fall 18-21% between year one and year two, which is steeper than the year-one drop itself and does not happen. Working the other way from the observed two-year band at a normal 8-9% year-one-to-two decline puts one-year 車商售價 near 75% of list, plus about 2 points for this car carrying only 7,000 km against their 11,000-19,600 km, so about 2,520,000. An 11.5% cut from 車商售價 to 自售價 gives 2,225,000, and 車商收購價 sits 12.6% below that at 1,945,000. Retention is 68.6% of real_cost against the sibling E 200 Luxury sedan's 73%. The 4.4-point gap is explained and is not noise: the Estate costs 8.6% more new but sells for the same absolute money used, and the divergence is inside the 5-point tolerance. Confidence medium - no W214 Estate 星耀版 has traded at one year old in Taiwan yet."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from 2,010,000. The previous figure was carried up by the inflated year-one anchor above rather than read off the closest comparable. 8891 shows a 2023 E200 Estate with 9,000 km asking 2,050,000, which against the 2023 list of 3,010,000 reported by FindCar is 68.1% of list at 車商售價. The same page also shows 2023 cars with 50,000 km asking 2,380,000 and FindCar (https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/e200%20estate) a 2023 car with 30,059 km asking 2,478,000; those two are higher than the 9,000 km car despite far more mileage, which is backwards and marks them as S213/W214 generation-mix noise, so I weighted the 9,000 km car and discarded them rather than averaging the contradiction away. Taking about 66% of list at our 21,000 km gives roughly 2,158,000 車商售價; an 11.5% cut to 自售價 gives 1,900,000, and 車商收購價 is 13.2% below. That is 58.6% of real_cost against the sedan's 59% - level, which is the honest answer once the mileage artifact described in the year-5 note is removed. Confidence medium: the 2023-2024 window straddles the S213 run-out and the W214 launch, so the comparison set is genuinely noisy."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from 1,655,000, and this is where the previous record's main error sat. It reported a +4-point Estate premium over the sedan, the largest gap in that record, built on two moves that do not survive checking. First, it cherry-picked: from the 5-6 year low-mileage cluster on 8891 it used only the 2021 car at 28,000 km asking 1,880,000 and a car at 38,000 km asking 1,588,000, and silently dropped both 1,490,000 cars from the same cluster. The full cluster is 2021/22,700 km 1,490,000; 2021/28,000 km 1,880,000; 2020/27,000 km 1,490,000; 2020/38,000 km 1,588,000 - mean 1,612,000, not the 1,734,000 it used, and the 1,880,000 car is a clear outlier. Second, it compared low-mileage Estates against high-mileage sedans. The 8891 sedan page (https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e/e200-avantgarde) prices 2021 E 200 sedans at 1,380,000 with 60,000-66,200 km; setting 22,700-38,000 km Estates against 60,000 km sedans is not a controlled comparison, and the apparent premium is a mileage artifact. Matched on both age and mileage the two bodies trade for the same money: 2018 Estate 110,000 km 820,000 versus 2018 sedan 112,000 km 818,000, and 2014 Estate 87,000 km 438,000 versus 2014 sedan 80,000 km 438,000. Equal money on a body that cost more new means a LOWER ratio. Rebuilt: cluster mean 1,612,000 against a 2021 Estate list near 2,900,000 is 55.5% at 車商售價, or 52.5% excluding the outlier; at our 35,000 km that gives about 1,717,000 車商售價 on a 3,270,000 list. An 11.5% cut gives 1,520,000 自售價 and 車商收購價 is 13.5% below. At 46.8% of real_cost this is level with the sedan's 47%, and the reported direction of an Estate premium is withdrawn."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Extrapolated from previous-generation S213 Estates now 7-9 years old. 8891 shows a 2019 Estate with 106,300 km asking 1,098,000, a 2018 with 125,000 km asking 1,098,000, a 2018 with 110,000 km asking 820,000 and a 2017 with 125,000 km asking 888,000, against S213 list prices of 2,750,000-2,890,000 - a mean near 34.7% of list at 車商售價 with 106,000-125,000 km. Every real seven-to-nine-year Estate on the market carries roughly double the 49,000 km this owner would have, so those asks cannot be used directly. The uplift applied is only about 10%, not the 25-30% the previous record used: by year seven the Taiwan market for an out-of-warranty German wagon is largely mileage-blind, because condition and repair exposure dominate the price and a very low odometer invites questions rather than a premium. The 2014 Estate with 87,000 km still asking only 438,000 is direct evidence of that. That gives about 1,249,000 車商售價 on a 3,270,000 list, 1,050,000 自售價 after a 12% cut, and 車商收購價 14.8% below. At 32.4% of real_cost this is level with the sedan's 32%: the Estate's lower assumed mileage is cancelled by two things the sedan does not carry - a thinner buyer pool once the car is old, and the rear self-levelling suspension on top of the shared 48V starter-generator risk. Confidence low: this is an explicit previous-generation extrapolation, not observed W214 data."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from 850,000. No W214 Estate will be ten years old until 2034, so this is an explicit previous-generation extrapolation and no data point has been invented. The oldest real Estate listings are W212-era: 8891 shows a 2014 car with 87,000 km asking 438,000 and a 2013 car with 140,000 km asking 480,000; FindCar shows a 2013 car with 144,498 km asking 498,000. Against a W212 Estate list near 2,600,000 those are 16.8-19.2% of original list at 車商售價, at 12-13 years old. The previous record leaned on our car being younger and at half the mileage to reach 26.2% of real_cost, level with the sedan. The 2014 car breaks that argument: at 87,000 km it is genuinely low-mileage for its age and still asks only 438,000, so the Taiwan market has stopped paying for low mileage by then. Interpolating between the year-7 figure above and that floor gives about 872,000 車商售價, 750,000 自售價 after a 14% cut, and 630,000 車商收購價 a further 16% below. That is 23.1% of real_cost against the sedan anchor's 26%, a 2.9-point shortfall inside tolerance, and the reason is stated: the buyer pool for a decade-old niche wagon is tiny so time-to-sell is long and realised private proceeds are soft, and the out-of-warranty exposure is worse than the sedan's because the Estate carries rear self-levelling suspension the sedan does not have. This sits above the GLE 450 anchor's 19%, which is the expected ordering for a four-cylinder wagon against a large V6 SUV. Confidence low."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"One annual Service A at E-Class pricing. The Taichung Mercedes breakdown (https://lc-car.tw/news2_detail.php?id=11) gives Service A at 8,000-12,000 for a C200; an E-Class runs above a C-Class, so 14,000 plus about 1,000 of wipers and fluid. Nothing else is due at 7,000 km. No free-maintenance programme applies - Taiwan Mercedes includes warranty only, not scheduled service."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers years 2-3 only, not cumulative. One Service B at 30,000 plus one Service A at 15,000 plus about 5,000 of alignment and small consumables. The same Taichung source states cumulative owner spend across the 3-year warranty period typically lands at 40,000-60,000 TWD, and this record's years 1+3 total of 65,000 sits just above that band because the E-Class is a class above the C200 the figure was quoted for. Brakes, tires and batteries are all untouched at 21,000 km."},{"y":5,"source":"The first period where consumables dominate the servicing. At 7,000 km/year the tires reach 35,000 km with plenty of tread, but Taiwan's heat and humidity age the sidewalls out at 5-6 years, so the set is replaced on date. Staggered 20-inch premium-brand rubber runs about 13,000-15,000 per corner fitted, hence 58,000 - the single largest line item that separates this Estate from the sedan Luxury on 19s. Front pads and discs at 42,000 reflect dealer parts and labour on a car near 1,955 kg. Service pricing per the Taichung Mercedes table cited in plan_notes, which also quotes 15,000-30,000 per year once out of warranty."},{"y":7,"source":"Fully out of warranty for this whole window, so the period carries an explicit repair-risk allowance rather than scheduled work only. The 40,000 allowance is an expected value across the known M254/48V failure set - the EQ Boost belt-driven starter-generator, the electric auxiliary water pump and the plastic thermostat housing are the recognised cost items on this engine family. Any single one of them landing costs more than 40,000, while the probability of at least one in a two-year window is well under certainty. Spark plugs and coolant are on time intervals, which is what binds at 49,000 km. Service costs escalated about 8% over the year 4-5 figures for parts inflation."},{"y":10,"source":"Three-year window carrying the full unsubsidised out-of-warranty cost. The German tail does not flatten here the way a Lexus does: at 8-10 years the failure rate of the cooling and ignition components rises sharply, and the Estate adds the rear self-levelling suspension, the one genuinely Estate-specific repair risk, carried at 42,000 expected value. No AIRMATIC full-air system is fitted to this trim, so there is no four-corner air-suspension line item. Ten-year total across all five periods is 710,000, which is 12.2% above the sibling E 200 sedan record's 633,000 and 22% below the GLE 450 record's 913,000 - the ordering expected from a wagon that shares the sedan's engine and brakes but adds bigger tires and one extra suspension subsystem. This same suspension exposure is why the year-10 resale figure sits below the sedan's rather than level with it. Confidence low - this is a projection onto a body and generation with no ten-year Taiwan history."}],"sources":[{"name":"7Car 小七車觀點 - C-Class 與 E-Class 星耀版在臺登場","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/116171","note":"Fetched successfully and re-verified by this review. Primary source for the official list price: E 200 Estate 星耀版 3,270,000 TWD, alongside E 200 LUXURY 星耀版 3,010,000, E 300 星耀版 3,550,000 and Mercedes-AMG E 53 HYBRID 4MATIC+ 星耀版 4,920,000. Confirms the Estate has exactly one trim and that it carries the AMG Line night package, black ARTICO seats and 20-inch wheels."},{"name":"KingAutos - 2026 旅行車 Mercedes-Benz E-Class Estate","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/mercedes_benz/e-class_estate","note":"Fetched successfully. Shows the superseded pre-星耀版 lineup (E200 Avantgarde 3,190,000, E300 Sport 3,540,000), so it was NOT used for the current price. Used only for the E200 engine specification: 1,991 cc turbo four, 204 hp at 5,800 rpm with a 23 hp electric assist, 32.6 kgm from 1,600-4,000 rpm, rear-wheel drive, 9-speed automatic, 14.8 km/L combined. Its 油電混合 / HEV powertrain label describes the 48V EQ Boost system and is NOT a full hybrid; this record classifies the car as gasoline and that label was deliberately not followed."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Mercedes-Benz E E200 Estate 二手價格","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e/e200-estate","note":"Fetched successfully and re-verified row by row by this review; all 23 listings confirmed as estate (旅行車) bodies, not sedans. All figures are 車商售價 dealer asking prices, not owner proceeds. Rows used: 2024/11,000 km 2,088,000; 2024/19,600 km 2,180,000; 2023/9,000 km 2,050,000; 2023/50,000 km 2,380,000; 2022/17,000 km 1,798,000; 2021/22,700 km 1,490,000; 2021/28,000 km 1,880,000; 2021/121,000 km 1,368,000; 2020/27,000 km 1,490,000; 2020/38,000 km 1,588,000; 2019/106,300 km 1,098,000; 2018/110,000 km 820,000; 2018/125,000 km 1,098,000; 2017/125,000 km 888,000; 2017/230,000 km 670,000; 2014/87,000 km 438,000; 2013/140,000 km 480,000."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 - e200 estate 搜尋結果","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/e200%20estate","note":"Fetched successfully and re-verified. Second independent Estate listing set, 19 cars nationwide, all estate bodies, with a stated mileage-blind used average of 1,295,000. Used rows: 2023/30,059 km 2,478,000; 2021/70,000 km 1,548,000; 2021/86,316 km 1,538,000; 2021/121,555 km 1,298,000; 2017/193,080 km 758,000; 2013/144,498 km 498,000. Also the source of the new-car reference prices used as retention denominators: 2024 3,190,000, 2023 3,010,000, 2022 2,920,000. The small national total supports the thin-supply and long-time-to-sell argument."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Mercedes-Benz E E200 Avantgarde 二手價格 (sedan control group)","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e/e200-avantgarde","note":"Fetched successfully and re-verified. Sedan control group, 57 cars against 19-23 Estates. Critical to this review: matched on BOTH age and mileage the two bodies trade for the same absolute money - 2018/112,000 km 818,000 against the Estate's 2018/110,000 km 820,000, and 2014/80,000 km 438,000 against the Estate's 2014/87,000 km 438,000. Since the Estate costs more new, equal money means a lower retention ratio. The previous record's claim that Taiwan Estate resale runs ABOVE the sedan came from comparing 22,700-38,000 km Estates against 60,000-66,200 km sedans (2021 sedans all at 1,380,000) and is withdrawn as a mileage artifact."},{"name":"8891 新車頻道 - E200與E220d雙車型 賓士E-Class Estate上市","url":"https://c.8891.com.tw/news/mercedes-benz/e-class-estate/4459","note":"Fetched successfully and re-verified. Establishes the previous-generation S213 Estate Taiwan launch in December 2016 at 2,750,000 for both E200 Avantgarde and E220d Avantgarde - the denominator used for the year-7 previous-generation retention extrapolation."},{"name":"7Car - 275 萬元起，Mercedes-Benz S213 E-Class Estate 正式發表","url":"https://www.7car.tw/articles/read/39892","note":"Fetched successfully and re-verified. Independently corroborates the S213 Estate launch at 2,750,000 with the E200 Avantgarde and E220d Avantgarde lineup."},{"name":"8891 中古車 - Mercedes-Benz E-Class Estate 車系頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e-class_estate","note":"Fetched successfully but returned no Estate-body rows, only mixed E-Class sedan and coupe inventory. Recorded as a negative result and as further evidence of how thin Estate stock is."},{"name":"聯承汽車 - 台中BENZ過保後怎麼保養？賓士原廠保固到期後","url":"https://lc-car.tw/news2_detail.php?id=11","note":"Fetched successfully and re-verified by this review. Sole surviving maintenance cost basis: Taiwan warranty is 3 years or 100,000 km whichever comes first; Service A 8,000-12,000 and Service B 15,000-25,000 for a C200, premium models above 30,000 for a B service; cumulative in-warranty owner spend across the first three years of 40,000-60,000; post-warranty running cost 15,000-30,000 per year."}]},"mercedes-e300-avantgarde":{"assumptions":"車主年行駛 6,000-8,000 km，遠低於台灣平均 12,000-15,000 km；各檢查點一律取中位 7,000 km/年（7,000 / 21,000 / 35,000 / 49,000 / 70,000 km）。此里程下保養完全由時間觸發：2ggx 的賓士保養整理逐字寫「Service A 每行駛約 1.5 萬公里或一年進行一次」「Service B 每行駛約 3 萬公里或兩年進行一次」，本車要 2.1 年才跑到 15,000 km，10 年只累積 70,000 km，所以每一次都是時間先到，10 年約進廠 10 次（A/B 交替）。火星塞的 60,000 km 週期到第 8-9 年才會被里程觸發，變速箱油也只會換兩次。真正驅動本車成本的是三個日曆型而非里程型的項目，而且都是 E 300 星耀版獨有、E 200 星耀版沒有的：第一，星耀版把輪圈拉到 20 吋且前後不同尺寸（前 245/40 R20、後 275/35 R20），本次已由 U-CAR 規格表原文覆核，同表的 E 200 星耀版與 E 300 Exclusive 都是 19 吋（前 245/45 R19、後 275/40 R19），前後胎無法對調、只能整組因橡膠老化而換；第二，星耀版標配動力輔助車門緊閉系統，四具電動吸附致動器是保固外的實際故障風險，E 200 星耀版沒有這項；第三，M254 2.0T 搭 48V ISG（EQ Boost，額外 23 hp），無法純電行駛，故分類 gasoline 而非 hybrid，但 48V 鋰電池與 ISG 本體在 7-10 年是實際支出風險。殘值以低里程個體報價，但 8891 實際掛牌顯示中高齡 E-Class 的里程溢價很小（本次覆核再得一例：2019 年份 E 300 的 4.4 萬公里個體開價 1,155,000，反而低於同年份 10 萬公里的 1,198,000-1,258,000），故低里程加成只給 2-6%。牌照稅、燃料稅、保險依設計一律不計入。非 BEV，無充電成本。","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"星耀版 2026-04 才上市，市場上還沒有 1 年車齡的星耀版，故用現行 W214 世代的實際掛牌往前推一年。8891 E300 車款頁 (https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e/e300 與 ?page=2) 本次由查核者獨立重抓，兩頁 80 張卡片逐筆比對，2024 年份 W214 E 300 恰好 9 筆有公開車商開價（已剔除外匯的 4MATIC 288 萬與車型不同的 Exclusive 258 萬，另有 2 筆電洽）：5,795 km／2,980,000、1.27 萬 km／2,950,000、1.26 萬 km／2,880,000（兩筆）、3,225 km／2,788,000、2.61 萬 km／2,780,000、7,000 km／2,750,000、3.3 萬 km／2,698,000、4.2 萬 km／2,638,000，九筆全部與原研究者所列一致，中位數 2,788,000 覆核成立。這些車原始定價 3,470,000（2024 年式，KingAutos 車型價格頁本次重抓確認 E300 運動版 347 萬）到 3,530,000（25/25 年式，U-CAR 車款介紹頁的價格沿革），取 3,480,000 為基準，中位開價等於定價的 80.1%，車齡約 2 年。【往前推一年】德系豪華房車在台灣第 1 年到第 2 年的車商開價年降幅約 8%，故 1 年車齡開價約定價的 86.5%。【不給星耀版加價】把 86.5% 套回本車時用的是基本 E 300 的價格結構而非星耀版的 3,550,000：市場上每一輛可比的 W214 E 300 都是不含星耀版套件的運動版／AMG Line，中古買家買的是一輛 E 300，KingAutos 明列的 160,000 星耀版配備（夜色套件、20 吋輪圈、ARTICO 座椅、車門緊閉系統）不會被中古市場單獨計價，20 吋前後不同尺寸胎對台灣買家甚至偏負面（換胎貴、路緣易傷）。因此 1 年車商開價取 3,480,000 × 86.5% ≈ 3,010,000，保守取 2,990,000。【車商開價→自售】扣 15%（8-15% 區間的上緣）得 2,541,500，取 2,540,000。取上緣的理由是實測的：本次同一頁上就有 9 輛 2 年內、里程 3,225-42,000 km 的 E 300 躺在車商手上，開價 2,638,000-2,980,000 且附帶保固、認證與貸款方案，一個 1 年車齡的自售車主沒有這些條件，必須明顯低於這批庫存才賣得掉。【車商收購】自售再扣 13.0% 得 2,210,000。殘值率 72.4%，對照 E 200 星耀版兄弟記錄的 72.6% 幾乎打平、略低 0.2 點，絕對金額 2,540,000 高出 380,000。【覆核者的保留】8891 上唯一能看到的 1 年車齡樣本是 E 200（2025 年份可見開價中位 226.8 萬／定價 293 萬 = 77.4%），若把 77.4% 直接搬過來，1 年殘值率會掉到 68% 附近。不採用的理由是該組的最低里程車全部電洽、可見價偏低（見 purchase.notes），且若 1 年只有 77% 而 2 年仍有 80%，兩者互相矛盾。本點維持 medium：現行世代 2 年車齡的真實掛牌很多，但 1 年車齡與星耀版本身都還沒有成交紀錄。"},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"W214 在台 2023-12 發表、2024 年才開始交車，市場上最老的只有約 2.2 年，沒有 3 年車齡的真實資料，本點是明講的內插而非觀測。兩端：上端是本記錄 1 年點的 72.4%，下端是 5 年點的 45.1%（由 W213 2021 年份實際掛牌換算，見下）。中間形狀取 E 200 星耀版兄弟記錄用真實掛牌測出的同級距衰減節奏（該記錄 1 年 72.6%、3 年 59.2%，1→3 年係數 0.815），再因兩件本車獨有的事情往下修約 2.5%：其一，160,000 的星耀版配備在第 3 年已完全不被計價，1 年時還有一點新車感的殘留；其二，原廠 3 年不限里程保固正好在這個窗口到期，台灣中古市場對德系車的保固到期折價集中在第 3 年。72.4% × 0.815 × 0.975 ≈ 57.5%，取 57.6% 得 2,020,000。反推車商開價約 2,320,000（定價的 65.4%）。【覆核者找到的旁證】本次重抓 8891 時，3-4 年帶只有兩筆可用：2023 年份（3 年車）E300 運動版 2.6 萬 km 標電洽，2022 年份（4 年車）E300 運動版 5 萬 km 開 179.0 萬。後者對 W213 小改款定價 332 萬是 53.9%。它比本記錄的 3 年 65.4% 低很多，但不能直接套用：那是被 W214 取代的上一世代末代車，帶有世代斷點折價，里程也是本車的 2.4 倍。把它與 W214 的 2 年 80.1% 一起看，本記錄的 3 年 65.4% 正好落在兩者之間，方向合理。【自售折扣】2,320,000 扣 12.9% 得 2,020,000；此時已無原廠保固，車商仍能賣認證與延長保固、自售賣不了，折扣維持在區間中上緣。【車商收購】自售再扣 13.6% 得 1,745,000。殘值率 57.6%，比 E 200 兄弟記錄的 59.2% 低 1.6 點、絕對金額高 260,000。要誠實說明的是：如果改用 8891 上 W214 的 2 年車齡開價中位 80.1% 直接外推，3 年會落在 64% 附近、比 E 200 高，理由與不採用的原因見 purchase.notes。confidence low：本點沒有任何 3 年車齡的公開成交或掛牌價，是雙端內插。"},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"本點有前代 W213 的真實同齡掛牌，是全記錄證據最硬的一點。8891 本次由查核者重抓 2021 年份（今日 5 年車齡）W213 E 300：運動版 7.7 萬 km／1,598,000、AMG 7.7 萬 km／1,558,000，兩筆平均 1,578,000，與原研究者所列一致。【覆核補上原研究者漏掉的同組車源】同一批 2021 年份另有 6.16 萬 km／1,728,000、10.6 萬 km／1,368,000、7.9 萬 km 電洽，以及 Exclusive 2.5 萬 km／1,658,000 與 7 萬 km／1,550,000。把四筆非 Exclusive 的公開價一起看（172.8／159.8／155.8／136.8 萬），中位數 157.8 萬，與原研究者用的 1,578,000 相同，錨點站得住。但要揭露一件對本記錄不利的事：6.16 萬 km 的個體開到 1,728,000，比 7.7 萬 km 的兩筆高 9.5%，代表 5 年車齡的低里程溢價可能大於本記錄採用的 6%，本點因此偏保守而非偏樂觀。W213 小改款的台灣定價由 Wayback 保存的 U-CAR 2020-11-30 快照證實 (https://web.archive.org/web/20201130133125/https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e-class/3856/overall，本次重抓 HTTP 200)：E 200 Avantgarde 269 萬、E 200 Luxury 286 萬、E 300 運動版 332 萬、E 300 Exclusive 342 萬。於是 E 300 運動版 5 年車商開價 = 1,578,000／3,320,000 = 47.5%（里程 77,000 km），E 300 Exclusive = 1,550,000／3,420,000 = 45.3%。同一批的 E 200 對照組 2021 年份四筆全部開 1,380,000（60,000-66,200 km），對 269 萬定價是 51.3%。兩個直接可用的結論：第一，E 300 在 5 年車齡的殘值率確實低於 E 200 約 4 點，即使 E 300 的里程還多一成，這就是 trim ladder；第二，定價更高的 Exclusive 又比運動版低 2.2 點，同一世代內再驗證一次同樣方向。【套到本車】本車 5 年時只有 35,000 km，比參考車少 42,000 km，只給 6% 加成：47.5% × 1.06 = 50.4%，套在 3,550,000 得車商開價約 1,789,000。【自售】扣 11.7% 得 1,580,000，折扣取區間下緣，因為 5 年車已脫離保固、車商的認證加值變小，自售與車商的價差在這個年齡本來就會收斂。【車商收購】自售再扣 13.9% 得 1,360,000。殘值率 45.1%，比 E 200 兄弟記錄的 47.1% 低 2.0 點、絕對金額高 180,000，方向與 W213 同齡實測的 4 點差距一致而且更保守。這是第一個完全沒有原廠保固的檢查點，台灣中古市場自此把維修風險計入價格，曲線不會像 Lexus 那樣打平。confidence medium：跨世代外推，但外推比例來自同齡、同車型階級的真實掛牌與經查證的原始定價。"},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"前代外推。8891 本次重抓 2019 年份（今日 7 年車齡）W213 E 300，原研究者所列四筆全部覆核成立：9.3 萬 km／1,328,000、10 萬 km／1,258,000、10.67 萬 km／1,199,000、10 萬 km／1,198,000，平均 1,246,000，里程都在 10 萬 km 上下。【覆核補上原研究者漏掉的同組車源，而且這幾筆很關鍵】同一年份另有 4.4 萬 km／1,155,000、9.3 萬 km／1,320,000、Exclusive 7 萬 km／1,158,000，以及 10 萬 km 與 15 萬 km 各一筆電洽。其中 4.4 萬 km 的個體是全組里程最低的，開價卻低於 10 萬 km 的兩筆，直接證實 7 年以上的德系房車在台灣幾乎是里程盲的，條件、保養紀錄與維修風險主導價格。2019 年式 W213 的台灣定價由 Wayback 保存的 U-CAR 2019-08-21 快照證實 (https://web.archive.org/web/20190821201035/https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e-class/3064/overall，本次重抓 HTTP 200)：E 220d Avantgarde 263 萬、E 200 Avantgarde 269 萬、E 200 Avantgarde Lux 286 萬、E 300 Avantgarde 329 萬、E 300 運動版 331 萬、E 300 Exclusive 339 萬。故 7 年車商開價 = 1,246,000／3,310,000 = 37.6%。【里程調整】本車 7 年只有 49,000 km、是參考車的一半，只給 5% 加成：37.6% × 1.05 = 39.5%，套在 3,550,000 得 1,402,000。【本車專屬的向下修正 11%】這是本點與 W213 分家的地方，三個理由都是本車獨有：其一，星耀版的 20 吋前後不同尺寸胎（前 245/40 R20、後 275/35 R20）在 7 年車上是明確負擔，整組原廠認證胎含工約 62,000，而參考的 W213 車是 18-19 吋、約 45,000-50,000；其二，星耀版標配的動力輔助車門緊閉系統有四具電動致動器，是保固外的高單價故障點，W213 對照車沒有這項；其三，W214 的電子含量遠高於 W213（MBUX 3.0、14.4 吋觸控、數位多光束頭燈、指紋辨識、48V ISG），2033 年的 7 年車 W214 被市場計入的維修風險會高於今天的 7 年車 W213。1,402,000 × 0.89 ≈ 1,248,000 車商開價。【覆核的交叉檢驗】上面補抓到的 4.4 萬 km 個體（里程最接近本車的 49,000 km）實際只開 1,155,000，也就是定價的 34.9%；本記錄修正後的 1,248,000 相當於定價的 35.2%，兩者只差 0.3 個百分點。這表示「+5% 低里程加成再 -11% 車型修正」的淨結果，正好落在唯一一筆真正可比的掛牌上，而不做修正的 34.8%-39.5% 路線則會高估。【自售】1,248,000 扣 12.7% 得 1,090,000。【車商收購】自售再扣 14.7% 得 930,000，保固外德系車車商要承擔整備風險，收購折讓隨車齡放大。殘值率 31.1%，比 E 200 兄弟記錄的 31.9% 低 0.8 點、絕對金額高 140,000。必須揭露：不做上述 11% 修正的話，純粹的 W213 換算會給到 34.8%、反而高於 E 200，這是本記錄唯一一個原始換算方向與最終數字相反的檢查點，修正幅度與三條理由都已寫在上面供複驗。confidence low：跨世代外推，且含一個具判斷性的向下修正。"},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"明確的跨世代外推：W214 要到 2034 年才會有 10 年車，本點沒有發明任何資料點。用今日 10 年車齡的 2016 年份 W213 E 300 換算。原研究者取 12 萬 km 以內共 7 筆、中位 988,000。【覆核擴大樣本】本次重抓 8891 兩頁，2016 年份且里程 12.2 萬 km 以內的 E 300 實際有 13 筆：5.6 萬／708,000、7.5 萬／1,098,000、8 萬／988,000（兩筆）、8.2 萬／988,000（兩筆）、8.9 萬／1,098,000、10 萬／728,000、12 萬／1,050,000、12 萬／780,000、12 萬／998,000、12 萬／880,000、12.2 萬／1,080,000，中位數仍然正好是 988,000，原研究者的中位數在較大樣本下覆核成立。高里程對照 15-20 萬 km 落在 698,000-888,000。W213 首批（2016）的 E 300 定價無法直接查證，最接近的經查證數字是 2019 年式的 E 300 Avantgarde 329 萬（同上 Wayback U-CAR 快照），以 3,290,000 為分母，中位開價 988,000／3,290,000 = 30.0%。【里程調整】本車 10 年只有 70,000 km，已落在該群的低緣，差距不大，只給 2% 加成得 30.6%，套在 3,550,000 得車商開價約 1,086,000。【W214 專屬向下修正 8%】理由同 7 年點的第三條、在 10 年更重：W214 的數位多光束頭燈、14.4 吋螢幕、MBUX 3.0 主機、48V 鋰電池與 ISG，單顆更換都是六位數，2036 年的中古買家會把這些計入；20 吋前後不同尺寸胎與車門緊閉系統的負擔也延續。1,086,000 × 0.92 ≈ 999,000。【自售】扣 12.9% 得 870,000。【車商收購】自售再扣 16.1% 得 730,000，收購折讓在 10 年車上最大，因為車商必須自行吸收整備與保固風險。殘值率 24.8%，比 E 200 星耀版兄弟記錄的 25.9% 低 1.1 點、絕對金額高 100,000。尾段沒有打平：同一批資料裡 2010 年份（前代 W212）直接掉到 162,000-238,000，世代斷點造成的落差遠大於里程，保固外德系豪華房車的買家池薄，電子與 48V 大額風險全部反映在價格上。confidence low：跨世代外推，且 2016 年份的原始定價以 2019 年式數字代用，可能低估原始定價因而高估殘值率，本記錄已用向下修正部分抵銷。"}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"依 2ggx 賓士保養費整理 (https://www.2ggx.com/賓士保養費/) 的 E-Class 級距 Service A 為 10,000-15,000 元、每年或 15,000 km，取中位 12,000。本車 7,000 km 遠不到 15,000 km，由時間觸發。比 E 200 星耀版兄弟記錄的 13,000 多 1,000，差額是 20 吋前後不同尺寸胎的首次四輪定位——這種配置無法靠前後對調平均磨耗，第一年就要把定位做準，否則後胎會偏磨。2ggx 屬二手整理來源而非原廠價目表，故 confidence low。"},{"y":3,"source":"依 2ggx 的 E-Class 級距 Service B 18,000-30,000（取中位 24,000）與 Service A 10,000-15,000（取中位 12,000），加耗材與定位約 11,000。此窗口共兩次進廠：第 2 年 B、第 3 年 A，全部由時間觸發（3 年只跑 21,000 km，還沒到第二次 Service A 的里程門檻）。比 E 200 星耀版兄弟記錄的 45,000 多 2,000，差額同樣是 20 吋前後不同尺寸胎需要比 E 200 更頻繁的四輪定位。全段在保固內，無維修支出。confidence low：單價來源為二手整理型網站。"},{"y":5,"source":"保養單價取自 2ggx 的 E-Class 級距 Service A/B，其餘為由下而上估算。輪胎是本窗口最大單項，而且是因老化而非胎紋更換——35,000 km 時胎紋仍合法。金額依 2ggx 的「19-20 吋整組含定位平衡 18,000-50,000 元」推算：本車是 20 吋且後胎 275/35 的寬規格、又多用 MO 原廠認證胎，整組含工取 62,000，高於該來源的一般區間上緣但屬同一量級。前來令片依該來源「前輪一組含工 8,000-15,000」取偏上緣 16,000，因為 258 hp 版碟盤與卡鉗較大。12V AGM 取該來源 8,000-15,000 的中上緣 13,000（3-5 年壽命，第 5 年換第一顆）。本窗口合計 149,000，比 E 200 星耀版兄弟記錄的 135,000 高 14,000，差額全部是 20 吋胎（62,000 對 50,000）與較大煞車，其他項目一致。confidence low：除保養工項單價外，各品項無逐項報價來源。"},{"y":7,"source":"由下而上估算，保養單價取自 2ggx 的 E-Class Service A/B，煞車與火星塞單價取自同一來源的耗材區間（後來令片一組含工 6,000-12,000、前碟盤一組含工 15,000-30,000、火星塞一套 4,000-10,000）。前碟盤取 40,000、超出該來源上緣，理由是 E 300 的碟盤尺寸大於一般 C-Class 與 E 200 且原廠件單價逐年上漲。30,000 的冷卻與點火風險提列是期望值而非必然支出：電子水泵、節溫器座、點火線圈在 5-7 年的 M254 上各自可能但非必然。10,000 的車門緊閉系統提列是本車與 E 200 星耀版的具體差異項，四具致動器只要壞一具就是五位數。本窗口合計 160,000，比 E 200 星耀版兄弟記錄的 140,000 高 20,000（碟盤與後來令片 +7,000、車門緊閉 +10,000、定位與雜項 +3,000）。confidence low：維修單項無逐項報價來源，Mobile01 車主收據串本次未能取得。"},{"y":10,"source":"保固外完全自費窗口的由下而上估算，也是德系豪華房車與日系分道揚鑣的關鍵期間。第二套 20 吋胎取 66,000（第一套 62,000 加 10 年的價格漂移）。48V 以期望值列帳而非必然支出。第二輪冷卻點火取 40,000、比第一輪的 30,000 高，因為 10 年車的塑膠件老化更全面。懸吊只提列引擎腳與連桿襯套 35,000、不提列避震器總成更換，理由是 10 年僅 70,000 km 的低里程下避震器多半仍在容忍範圍，這也是 E 200 星耀版兄弟記錄修正過的做法，本記錄沿用。本窗口合計 333,000，比 E 200 星耀版兄弟記錄的 300,000 高 33,000（輪胎 +16,000、煞車 +12,000、車門緊閉與電子 +5,000）。10 年全期合計 703,000／70,000 km，五個窗口 14,000 + 47,000 + 149,000 + 160,000 + 333,000 加總覆核正確。本車為鋼簧非 AIRMATIC，若為氣壓懸吊需另加 120,000-180,000。confidence low：本窗口無逐項報價來源，全為期望值提列。"}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — Mercedes-Benz E-Class 規格頁","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e-class/7172/spec","note":"查核者本次以帶瀏覽器 UA 的 curl 重抓，HTTP 200（WebFetch 仍回 403）。三車型價格 E 200 星耀版 301 萬／E 300 星耀版 355 萬／E 300 Exclusive 362 萬；車身型式「轎車/Sedan」、車門數 4 門、乘客數 5 人，確認本記錄為四門車身。本車規格 1,999 c.c.、258 hp/5800 rpm、40.8 kgm、九前速手自排、後輪驅動、動力系統「48V輕油電混合」、能源「汽油」、車重 1,855 kg、輪胎前 245/40 R20 後 275/35 R20（E 200 星耀版與 E 300 Exclusive 皆為前 245/45 R19、後 275/40 R19）、前後懸吊多連桿、全表無 AIRMATIC 欄位。這是 list_price 的第一來源，也是 20 吋前後不同尺寸胎、四門車身與 48V 分類的依據。"},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — Mercedes-Benz E-Class 車款介紹","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e-class/7172/overall","note":"重抓成功（HTTP 200）。提供 W214 在台的完整價格沿革：2023-12-07 發表首波導入 E 200 Luxury／E 300 運動版／E300 Exclusive；24/25 年式全車系調漲 1 萬，依序 294／348／356 萬；25/25 年式再漲 5 萬；2026 年式推出星耀版並各漲 2 萬，成為 E 200 Luxury 301 萬、E 300 355 萬、AMG E 53 492 萬、E 200 Estate 327 萬。同時載明 48V 輕油電可額外供給 23 匹馬力、E 300 運動版採 AMG Line 外觀套件。這是把 8891 上 2024／2025 年份車換算殘值率時所用原始定價的依據。"},{"name":"U-CAR 新車 — Mercedes-Benz E-Class 車系沿革","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/Mercedes-Benz/E-Class/7172/history","note":"重抓成功（HTTP 200）但只有 W120 到 W213 的世代敘述，沒有台灣歷代價格表，未貢獻任何數字。列出以說明確實查過而非略過。"},{"name":"KingAutos 國王車訊 — E-Class 星耀版上市配備與價格 (2026-04-16)","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/368283","note":"重抓成功，list_price 的第二來源。配備升級表逐字列出「E 300星耀版 3,550,000」，升級配備為 AMG LINE 夜色特仕版、夜色套件、ARTICO-黑舒適型座椅、20 吋多輻式輕合金輪圈、動力輔助車門緊閉系統，升級配備價值 160,000；同表 E 200 LUXURY 星耀版 3,010,000、E 200 Estate 星耀版 3,270,000、AMG E 53 星耀版 4,920,000。本文也是「E 300 星耀版標配 20 吋輪圈與車門緊閉系統」這兩個養護成本項目的來源。"},{"name":"KingAutos 國王車訊 — E-Class 台灣車型規格價格頁","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/hot/mercedes_benz/e-class","note":"重抓成功。此頁停留在 2024 年式：E200 Luxury 293 萬／E300 運動版 347 萬／E300 Exclusive 355 萬／E200 Avantgarde 275 萬／AMG E53 4Matic+ 476 萬。正因為是舊價，本記錄用它當作 8891 上 2024 年份 W214 車源的原始定價基準（347 萬，與 U-CAR 沿革的 348 萬取整為 348 萬），即 1 年與 3 年檢查點殘值率分母的來源。此頁亦載 E300 為 258 hp、後輪驅動、9 速手自排，並把整個 E-Class 標為「油電混合(HEV)」——那是指 48V 輕油電，不改變本表 gasoline 的分類。"},{"name":"KingAutos 國王車訊 — 2026 年 3 月賓士購車優惠","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/367656","note":"重抓成功。表格明列 E-Class 的優惠是「160 萬 40 期零利率 + 1 年延長保固」，沒有現金折讓、沒有免費保養。這是 discounts 壓在 130,000（3.7%）以及 maintenance 不採用免費保養假設的依據。"},{"name":"KingAutos 國王車訊 — 2026 年 8 月購車優惠","url":"https://www.kingautos.net/369901","note":"重抓成功但內容只有 Kia，沒有任何賓士資訊。列出以說明查過本月優惠、確認沒有更新的賓士現金折讓可用，因此沿用 3 月那份。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz E300 車款頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e/e300","note":"查核者本次獨立重抓（HTTP 200），共 193 輛，取得第 1 頁 40 筆並逐卡解析出年份、里程、開價。全部車源的車身欄位皆為「E-Class Sedan」，沒有 Coupé 或 Cabriolet 混入，符合本記錄的四門車身。W214 關鍵列：2024 年 7,000 km／2,750,000；2024 年 3.3 萬 km／2,698,000；2024 年（2025 款）3,225 km／2,788,000；2024 年 Exclusive 1.6 萬 km／2,580,000。W213 關鍵列：2021 年 7.7 萬 km／1,598,000；2021 年 7.7 萬 km／1,558,000；2021 年 6.16 萬 km／1,728,000；2021 年 10.6 萬 km／1,368,000；2021 年 Exclusive 7 萬 km／1,550,000；2019 年 9.3 萬 km／1,328,000、9.3 萬 km／1,320,000、10 萬 km／1,258,000、10.67 萬 km／1,199,000、10 萬 km／1,198,000、4.4 萬 km／1,155,000；2018 年 9.1 萬 km／1,100,000（兩筆）；2016 年 12.2 萬 km 以內 13 筆中位 988,000、15-20 萬 km 落在 698,000-888,000；2010 年（W212）162,000-238,000。這是 5 年、7 年、10 年三個檢查點的主要證據。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz E300 車款頁第 2 頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e/e300?page=2","note":"重抓成功。補齊 W214 的 1-2 年車齡帶：2024 年 5,795 km／2,980,000；2024 年（2025 款）1.27 萬 km／2,950,000；2024 年 1.26 萬 km／2,880,000（兩筆）；2024 年 2.61 萬 km／2,780,000；2024 年（2025 款）4.2 萬 km／2,638,000；另有 2024 年 4MATIC 1.39 萬 km／2,880,000，因台灣總代理未引進 W214 E 300 4MATIC 判定為外匯車而排除，以及 2024 年 1.21 萬 km 與 1.26 萬 km 兩筆電洽。這是 1 年與 3 年檢查點的證據，也是「同組開價與里程幾乎無相關」這個判斷的根據。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz E-Class 車系頁","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e-class","note":"重抓成功，共 1,052 輛在售，用於確認 E-Class 房車在台灣中古市場流動性充足（刊登費因此取 1,500 而非上緣）。3-4 年帶的旁證：2022 年 E300 運動版 5 萬 km／1,790,000（對 W213 小改定價 332 萬為 53.9%），2023 年 E300 2.6 萬 km 標電洽。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz E200 車款頁（對照組）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e/e200","note":"查核者本次獨立重抓並逐卡解析。W214 E 200 近年可見開價：2025 年 1.29 萬 km／2,380,000、2025 年 1.4 萬 km／2,268,000、2025 年 1.1 萬 km／2,188,000；另有 4 筆低里程車全部標電洽（2024 年 8,000 km、2024 年 1 萬 km、2024 年 1.7 萬 km、2025 年 8,206 km）。這 4 筆電洽正是 purchase.notes 指出的抽樣偏誤證據：E 200 里程最低的車把價格藏起來，看得到的開價因此偏低。此證據本次覆核成立。"},{"name":"8891 中古車 — Mercedes-Benz E200 Avantgarde 車款頁（對照組）","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e/e200-avantgarde","note":"重抓成功（HTTP 200），共 57 輛。5 年對照組關鍵列：2021 年 6 萬 km／1,380,000、6.5 萬 km／1,380,000、6.62 萬 km／1,380,000、6.6 萬 km／1,380,000，四筆同價。7 年對照組：2019 年 5.61 萬 km／950,000、2019 年 5.4 萬 km（LUX）／1,080,000、2019 年 14.5 萬 km（LUX）／928,000。這是 5 年點「E 300 殘值率低於 E 200 約 4 點」這個結論的對照基礎。"},{"name":"Wayback Machine — U-CAR 新車 E-Class 2019-08-21 快照（W213 小改前台灣定價）","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190821201035/https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e-class/3064/overall","note":"查核者本次重抓成功（HTTP 200），7 年與 10 年檢查點的分母來源，原研究者所列價格逐項覆核一致。台灣 W213 定價：E 220d Avantgarde 263 萬、E 200 Avantgarde 269 萬、E 200 Avantgarde Lux 豪華版 286 萬、E 300 Avantgarde 329 萬、E 300 運動版 331 萬、E 300 Exclusive 339 萬。同頁載明 2019 年式 E 300 改搭 M264 2.0T、258 hp。沒有這張表就無法把 8891 上 2019 與 2016 年份的開價換成殘值率。"},{"name":"Wayback Machine — U-CAR 新車 E-Class 2020-11-30 快照（W213 小改後台灣定價）","url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20201130133125/https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/mercedes-benz/e-class/3856/overall","note":"查核者本次重抓成功（HTTP 200），5 年檢查點的分母來源，原研究者所列價格逐項覆核一致。台灣 W213 小改款定價：E 200 Avantgarde 269 萬、E 200 Luxury 286 萬、E 300 運動版 332 萬、E 300 Exclusive 342 萬。用來換算 2021 年份車的殘值率，並得出「E 300 運動版 47.5% 對 E 300 Exclusive 45.3%」這組同世代內的 trim ladder 直接證據。"},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 — e300 搜尋結果","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/e300","note":"重抓成功（HTTP 200）但品質差。頁面統計「共 130 輛車、平均車價：新車 341.9 萬、中古車 139 萬」，車源含 Mitsubishi e300 電動商車等同名雜訊，且 2024 年份 E300 標到 298 萬、2019 年份標到 238 萬，與 8891 明顯衝突。僅用於佐證中古 E300 的平均價量級，未單獨支撐任一檢查點。"},{"name":"2ggx — 賓士保養費用整理（含 E-Class 級距價目）","url":"https://www.2ggx.com/%E8%B3%93%E5%A3%AB%E4%BF%9D%E9%A4%8A%E8%B2%BB/","note":"重抓成功，本次唯一取得的保養與耗材報價來源。原文：Service A「每行駛約 1.5 萬公里或一年進行一次」、8,000-15,000 元；Service B「每行駛約 3 萬公里或兩年進行一次」、15,000-30,000 元以上；E-Class 級距 Service A 10,000-15,000、Service B 18,000-30,000。耗材：19-20 吋輪胎整組含定位平衡 18,000-50,000 元；前來令片含工 8,000-15,000、後來令片 6,000-12,000；前碟盤一組含工 15,000-30,000；AGM 電瓶含工 8,000-15,000、壽命 3-5 年；火星塞一套含工 4,000-10,000；單支避震器 10,000-25,000。屬二手整理型來源而非原廠公告價目表，故所有 maintenance 檢查點都標 low。註：原記錄把 Service A 的週期寫成「每年或 15,000 km」是對的，但據此推出的「10 年進廠 7-8 次」與原文及本記錄的檢查點編列不符，已改為 10 次。"}]},"mercedes-eqs450-plus":{"assumptions":"7,000 km/year reaches only 70,000 km at ten years. Three things follow, and they are specific to this car. (1) Taiwan Mercedes covers the EQE/EQS high-voltage battery for 10 years or 250,000 km with a guaranteed capacity of 70% or more (U-CAR industry survey, Jan 2025; TVBS, Jul 2023 - both read as search snippets only, not opened, so treat the terms as a secondary citation). At 7,000 km/year the distance cap is never approached, so the CALENDAR limit trips, and it trips at year 10, not year 8. The year-7 buyer therefore still inherits three years of battery cover, which supports the year-7 value; the year-10 buyer inherits none, which is why the year-10 ratio falls hard. (2) Service is time-driven, not distance-driven: the nominal EQ interval is 2 years or 30,000 km, so at this mileage the car reaches the second distance service only near year 4, and the 2-year clock always governs. (3) Tires and the 12V battery age out instead of wearing out. Both tire sets in ten years are replaced on age and sidewall condition, not on tread. A home AC charger is a real ownership cost for a 120 kWh car but is not maintenance, so it is excluded here - budget 40,000-70,000 TWD installed separately. Electricity, 牌照稅 (BEVs are exempt through the current Taiwan incentive), and insurance are all excluded by design.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"68% of real_cost. CORRECTED UPWARD from a researcher figure of 3,480,000 (62%), which was internally contradictory. That figure was derived by taking the Mercedes-Benz Select CPO car (EQS 450+, 出廠 2024/09, 8,940 km, 中彰賓士台中, 455萬, visible in the 'you may also like' rail of https://www.mercedes-benz-select.com.tw/buy-car/detail.aspx?id=964) down 20% to a private-equivalent 364萬 at about 1.8 years - and then setting year 1 BELOW that, at 348萬. A one-year-old car cannot be worth less than the same car at 1.8 years. Even on the harshest defensible CPO haircut, year 1 must exceed 65%. WHAT THIS POINT ACTUALLY RESTS ON, stated honestly: no true one-year-old EQS is listed anywhere in Taiwan. All three Mercedes CPO EQS cars I opened are marked 已售出/SOLD (455萬, 468.8萬 at id 964, 408萬 at id 2173), and a sold listing carries no listing DATE, so its asking price cannot be aged from build date to today - the 468.8萬 car, built 2023/01, would otherwise imply a 3.3-year-old car worth more than a 1.8-year-old one, which is plainly an artefact of unknown listing dates. The CPO channel therefore only bounds this point loosely; it does not set it. Year 1 is set instead by walking back from the year-5 point, which does rest on a live listing, and by the constraint that a one-year-old car must undercut a new one already discounted 350,000 with 0% finance behind it: 3,815,000 is 69% of the 5,530,000 net new transaction price. Trade-in at 3,320,000 is 13% under private sale. Confidence downgraded from medium to low, because every CPO comparable is undated."},{"y":3,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"49% of real_cost. CORRECTED UPWARD from 2,470,000 (44%). The researcher set this level from a FindCar listing - 2023 Benz EQS, 31,000 km, 新北市 豐駿汽車商行, 288萬 (https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/eqs) - after shading it down for ambiguity. I opened that page and the car is labelled 四輪驅動. The EQS 450+ is rear-drive 2WD, confirmed by both U-CAR (one rear motor, no front motor) and by SUM, which prints 2WD for the trim. So that car is NOT this model and trim: it is an EQS 580 4MATIC on a much higher list, or an EQS SUV 450 4MATIC, which is the wrong body entirely. Per the body-and-trim rule it is EXCLUDED from setting this level rather than shaded, because using mismatched evidence and then discounting it still lets the bad number drive the answer. The second candidate, the Mercedes CPO car built 2022/11 and registered 2023/09 with 1,699 km at 408萬 (https://www.mercedes-benz-select.com.tw/buy-car/detail.aspx?id=2173), is also excluded: it is a 1,699 km showroom demonstrator, it is CPO retail, and it is SOLD with no listing date. Year 3 is therefore interpolated between the discount-constrained year-1 point and the evidence-anchored year-5 point. Cross-check: the resulting curve, read back at 4.3 years, gives 41.9%, against 42.8% derived independently from the live SUM listing - the two agree to within one point, which is the reason to trust the interpolation. Trade-in at 2,365,000 is 14% under private. Confidence downgraded from medium to low: this point has no valid direct comparable of its own."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"38% of real_cost. CORRECTED UPWARD from 1,850,000 (33%). This is the one checkpoint in the record with a live, correctly-matched comparable, so it now anchors the whole curve. I opened https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/BENZ/EQS-CLASS?v=3 and read it: '車輛搜尋結果 共 1 筆' nationwide, and that car is 【EQS 450+】, 2021年, 38,013 公里, 電動車, 2WD, 4門, 5人座, 黑色系, 嘉義縣 泰吉汽車 (金鑽 grade), 249.0萬元, with '買就送充電樁' bundled. Right trim, right drive layout, right four-door body. DERIVATION, step by step. Taiwan EQS deliveries began in Q2 2022, so a 2021-built car was registered in 2022 and is about 4.3 years old now. 249萬 is 車商售價; the free-charger bundle signals soft stock, so take the middle-to-high end of the 8-15% band, 12%, giving a private-equivalent 219萬. That car was the 先鋒版 on a 553萬 list, so its own real_cost on this record's method is 5,530,000 - 350,000 + 80,000 = 5,260,000, and 2,191,200 / 5,260,000 = 41.7% at 4.3 years and 38,013 km. Add about 1 point for this buyer's lower mileage (30,100 km at 4.3 years against 38,013). Subtract about 1.5 points for the trim ladder, because the 588萬 car must retain a slightly lower ratio than the 553萬 one. Subtract about 1 point for the run-out lifecycle. That gives roughly 40% at 4.3 years, and rolling forward 0.7 years at the local slope of about 2.5-3 points per year gives 38% at year 5. WHY THE RESEARCHER FIGURE WAS 5 POINTS LOW: it applied the trim-ladder shading and the run-out-lifecycle discount as large corrections here, after the same run-out argument had already been used to depress the whole curve in purchase.notes - the same factor was charged twice. Trade-in at 1,812,000 is 15% under private; the margin widens with age because a five-year-old EQS is stock most Taiwanese dealers do not want. Confidence raised to medium: one live listing of the exact trim and body that I opened and verified, needing only the standard dealer-to-private adjustment."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"27% of real_cost. EXTRAPOLATED - no seven-year-old EQS exists in Taiwan, because the model arrived in Q2 2022 and the oldest cars here are about four years old. Method: the previous-generation analogue for a Mercedes flagship at this age is the W222 S-Class, which settles near 22-26% of its own list at seven years in Taiwan, and the sibling combustion S 450 4MATIC L record in this dataset carries 29%. Two adjustments pull in opposite directions. DOWNWARD: a seven-year-old BEV limousine has a narrower buyer pool than a seven-year-old S 400, because the used market discounts unknown battery condition and, more sharply, out-of-warranty electric repair risk - Taiwan owners report on Mobile01 ('不建議買賓士電動車', Sep 2025) that the importer cannot repair a failed drive motor and only replaces it, at over 300,000 TWD. UPWARD, and this is the researcher's best finding, which I have kept: Taiwan Mercedes covers the EQE and EQS high-voltage battery for 10 years or 250,000 km at 70% minimum capacity. At 7,000 km/year this car has covered 49,000 km, nowhere near the distance cap, so a year-7 buyer inherits a full THREE remaining years of factory cover on a 120 kWh pack. That is transferable and worth paying for, and it is why year 7 sits at 27% rather than the high teens a BEV flagship with ordinary 8-year cover would deserve. Note the warranty terms come from search snippets that I could not open in this pass, so the upward adjustment is the least verified input on this line. Result is 1 point above the EQE 350+ anchor's 26% and 2 below the BMW i5's 29%. Trade-in at 1,273,000 is 16% under private."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"14% of real_cost, a small correction up from 13%, carried to keep the tail consistent with the raised mid-curve. This is the weakest point on the curve. Taiwan has no ten-year market for a large German BEV, so per the BEV rule the extrapolation leans on the oldest BEVs that actually trade here rather than on a combustion analogue. Early Tesla Model S cars and 2015-2016 Nissan Leafs are the only real ten-year BEV trades in Taiwan, and both settle near a floor set by battery risk rather than by original price - a Leaf that cost 1.5M new and an early Model S that cost over 4M converge toward broadly similar absolute money once the pack is suspect, because no buyer funds a pack replacement that exceeds the car's value. THE WARRANTY CLIFF LANDS PRECISELY HERE, and it is a calendar cliff, not a distance one: the 10-year / 250,000 km cover expires on the tenth anniversary while the odometer reads only 70,000 km, so this owner burns the whole distance allowance and captures none of it, and the year-10 buyer takes a car whose factory battery cover ran out the same week. That is why year 7 gets support from the remaining cover and year 10 gets none. Sanity check against the siblings: 785,000 in absolute money against the EQE 350+ anchor's 17% of 3,160,000 = 537,000. The EQS is worth materially MORE in cash at ten years while retaining a LOWER percentage, which is the correct shape - the floor for a big BEV is set by battery and repair risk in absolute terms, not as a fraction of a long-forgotten list price. It sits 3 points under the EQE 350+, 1 above the EQE 300 SUV's 13%, and 4 under the BMW i5's 18%, all inside the band. Trade-in at 644,000 is 18% under private: at this age most dealers take the car only on a wholesale or auction basis."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"Under the 3-year unlimited-mileage Taiwan warranty, so this is scheduled service only, with no repair exposure. Content follows a Taiwan EQS owner's description of the first service - cabin filter, brake fluid, washer fluid, routine safety checks and nothing more. Price scaled from a Mobile01 EQE 300 receipt of about 5,000 per visit and a Taiwan-wide figure near 9,000 for a Mercedes 小保養, marked up for the EQS being a class larger: about 11,000 for the visit plus 3,000 for wiper blades. A BEV first year genuinely is this cheap - there is no oil service to pay for. Confidence downgraded from medium to low: the underlying receipt thread could not be opened in verification."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers years 1 to 3 only, not cumulative. Still inside the 3-year warranty, so no repair provision. Built from the Mobile01 EQE 300 receipt: the 2-year service is 保養套餐 plus 檢測 plus 外濾網 at about 5,000 on an EQE, and the pair of PM2.5 內濾網 is a further 5,500 at the dealer - scaled up to roughly 14,500 for the EQS. The year-3 annual visit, which Taiwan owners report is required to keep warranty cover even though the service interval is 2 years, adds about 8,000. Wipers and an alignment on a 2,480 kg car with 20-inch tires add about 7,000. No tires yet: 21,000 km is nowhere near worn and the original set is only three years old. Confidence downgraded from medium to low for the same sourcing reason as year 1."},{"y":5,"source":"The vehicle warranty has expired (3 years, or 4 if the 延長保固 promotion applied), so BOTH services in this window are billed at the full unsubsidised dealer rate - a Taiwan Benz specialist quotes 15,000-30,000 per year post-warranty, and about 17,000 each is used here. Tires are the big line and they are replaced on AGE, not tread: at 7,000 km/year the car has 35,000 km, and the Mobile01 EQE owner got 40,000 km from the original Continental T005, so tread is not the trigger - a five-year-old sidewall carrying 2,480 kg is. A premium EV-rated 20-inch set fitted in Taiwan runs about 55,000, plus 4,000 alignment; a budget alternative exists (MAXXIS VSEV near 6,800 each) but that is not what most EQS owners fit. The EQS runs several separate coolant loops for the pack, the drive unit and cabin heating, and the first service on those is about 12,000. The 12V battery is a genuine BEV cost people forget: it still dies at 4-5 years in Taiwan's heat and needs coding when replaced, about 18,000 at the dealer. Confidence low: the tire, coolant and 12V figures are scaled to the EQS from EQE-class receipts rather than taken from EQS receipts, and those receipts could not be opened in verification."},{"y":7,"source":"First period carrying real out-of-warranty repair risk, which the German tail must include. Two services at about 19,000 each. Brakes are the counter-intuitive line on a BEV: regenerative braking means the friction pads are barely used, but in Taiwan's humidity discs on a car that rarely brakes on friction corrode and pit rather than wear thin, and the dealer condemns them on condition - a full front-and-rear pad-and-disc job on an EQS with its large rotors is about 65,000. AIRMATIC air suspension is STANDARD on the EQS and is not fitted to the base EQE 350+, which is the concrete reason this record's later maintenance must exceed that sibling's: a single front air strut at the dealer is 90,000-120,000 fitted and the compressor about 45,000, and these fail typically between years 6 and 10, so 55,000 is carried as a risk-weighted provision rather than a certainty. The high-voltage battery is NOT provisioned in this window because Taiwan Mercedes covers it to 10 years or 250,000 km and this car is at 49,000 km. Extrapolated, so confidence is low - no Taiwan EQS has yet reached seven years."},{"y":10,"source":"The heaviest period, covering years 7 to 10 only, and the tail keeps rising rather than flattening the way a Lexus would - the car is four to seven years out of vehicle warranty and parts prices are unsubsidised. Three services at about 20,000 each. Second tire set at about 55,000, again on age: the year-5 set reaches five years old and roughly 35,000 km around here. AIRMATIC carries the largest single provision at 110,000 - by year 10 an EQS still on original air struts is on borrowed time, and there are four corners plus a compressor. Thermal management is the EQ platform's known out-of-warranty weak point - the electric coolant pumps and the coolant valve block that manage the pack, motor and cabin circuits - about 45,000 risk-weighted. MBUX Hyperscreen provision of 40,000 risk-weighted: it is an expensive multi-screen assembly and out-of-warranty failures are not repairable at component level. Drive unit carries a REDUCED 25,000 weighting: Taiwan owners report on Mobile01 ('不建議買賓士電動車', Sep 2025) that the importer is not authorised to open a failed motor and can only replace it at over 300,000 TWD, but the probability is low at 70,000 km and the U-CAR warranty survey indicates 電機 and 電控 may fall under the same extended EQ cover as the battery, so the full exposure is not carried. NO battery replacement is provisioned anywhere in this record: the pack is covered to 10 years or 250,000 km at 70% minimum capacity and this owner ends the hold at 70,000 km, so pack risk lands on the NEXT owner - which is priced into the year-10 resale figure instead, not here. Double-counting it in both places would be wrong. Extrapolated throughout, so confidence is low."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新車 - Mercedes-Benz EQS 規格表","url":"https://newcar.u-car.com.tw/mercedes-benz/eqs/6627/spec","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED IN THIS PASS (403 to plain fetchers, 200 with a normal browser user-agent). Official list price verification. Renders '1 車型 588 萬' and a single spec column '規格/車型 EQS 450+ 588 萬', confirming both the 5,880,000 figure and that no other EQS trim is sold in Taiwan. Body confirmation for the four-door check: 車身型式 轎車/Sedan, 車門數 5 門, 5,223 x 1,926 x 1,512 mm, 軸距 3,210 mm, 車重 2,480 kg, 255/45 R20. Powertrain: 電池總容量 120kwh, 可用電池容量 108.4kwh, 後置馬達組數 1 具 永磁同步馬達 268kw / 568Nm, 360 hp, 純電池里程 753km, DC 200kW, CCS1, AC J1772. NOTE: the page also prints 傳動方式 四輪驅動, which contradicts its own motor rows (no front motor) and contradicts SUM's 2WD label. Treat that single field as a U-CAR data error."},{"name":"FindCar 找車網 - EQS aggregate page","url":"https://www.findcar.com.tw/q/eqs","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED IN THIS PASS. Independent confirmation of the 588萬 list ('2024 M-Benz EQS 450＋ 588 萬 新車參考價') and the whole-market picture: 12 listings, of which only TWO are actual used cars. Those two are the 2021 EQS 450+ at 249萬 with 38,013 km (嘉義縣 泰吉汽車) and a 2023 EQS at 288萬 with 31,000 km (新北市 豐駿汽車商行). THE SECOND CAR IS EXCLUDED FROM THIS RECORD: FindCar labels it 四輪驅動, and the EQS 450+ is 2WD, so it is an EQS 580 4MATIC or an EQS SUV, not this model and trim. Also gives the historic trim ladder: 2022 450+ Premium 旗艦版 634萬, 2023 450+ Premium 旗艦版 618萬, 2023 450+ Pioneer 先鋒版 553萬, EQS SUV 450 4MATIC 603萬, AMG EQS 53 4MATIC+ 810萬."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - BENZ EQS-CLASS nationwide used search","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch/BENZ/EQS-CLASS?v=3","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED IN THIS PASS, and the single most important data point in the record - it is the only LIVE listing of the correct trim and body anywhere in Taiwan, which is why the year-5 checkpoint now anchors the curve. '車輛搜尋結果 共 1 筆' across SUM's entire nationwide dealer alliance. That car is 【EQS 450+】, 2021年, 38,013 公里, 電動車, 2WD, 4門, 5人座, 黑色系, 嘉義縣 泰吉汽車 (金鑽 grade), 249.0萬元, listing text '買就送充電樁', which signals soft pricing on slow stock. 2WD and 4門 confirm the correct rear-drive four-door sedan, not the SUV and not a 4MATIC."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Select 原廠精選中古車 - EQS 450+ detail (id 2173)","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz-select.com.tw/buy-car/detail.aspx?id=2173","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED IN THIS PASS. Official Mercedes CPO listing, marked 已售出: EQS 450+, 出廠年份 2022/11, 掛牌年份 2023/09, 里程數 1,699 km, 197黑, 聯立賓士新竹展示中心, 408萬, with AMG Line, 後軸轉向, Burmester 3D, HUD. EXCLUDED from setting any level for three reasons: 1,699 km makes it a showroom demonstrator, 408萬 is CPO retail rather than private sale, and the listing is SOLD with no visible listing date, so its age cannot be computed from build date to today."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Select 原廠精選中古車 - EQS 450+ detail (id 964)","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz-select.com.tw/buy-car/detail.aspx?id=964","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED IN THIS PASS. Second official CPO listing, marked 已售出: EQS 450+, 出廠 2023/01, 掛牌 2023/04, 2,296 km, 鐵黑, 中華賓士關渡展示中心, 468.8萬. Its 'you may also like' rail carries the car the researcher used for year 1: EQS 450+, 出廠 2024/09, 8,940 km, 中彰賓士台中展示中心, 455萬 - and that car is ALSO marked SOLD, not live as the researcher stated. The two together expose why the CPO channel cannot date-anchor a valuation: an undated sold listing on a 2023/01 car at 468.8萬 would otherwise imply a 3.3-year-old EQS worth more than a 1.8-year-old one at 455萬."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Select 原廠精選中古車 - front page inventory","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz-select.com.tw/","note":"OPENED AND VERIFIED IN THIS PASS. Scanned for EQ stock to calibrate the CPO channel. Contains EQE 350 (出廠 2024/07, 3,653 km, 235.8萬, 中華賓士北桃園), EQE 300 SUV (2024/04, 4,756 km, 233.8萬), EQB 300 4M FL (2023/12, 32,818 km, 169.8萬), EQB 300 (2023/05, 21,036 km, 158.8萬), EQA 250 (2023/08, 11,261 km, 149.8萬) and EQA 250 (2023/07, 37,036 km, 135萬). TWO FINDINGS: no EQS appears in current CPO stock at all, and every EQ car shown is marked SOLD. Mercedes CPO stock is uniformly ultra-low-mileage and priced above independent dealer retail, which is why CPO asking prices are treated here as a loose upper bound only and never converted straight into a private-sale figure."},{"name":"Mobile01 - EQE 300 Sedan 2年5.5萬公里分享 (COULD NOT OPEN IN VERIFICATION)","url":"","note":"URL REMOVED because it could not be opened in this pass: mobile01.com returns HTTP 403 to a plain fetcher and to a normal browser user-agent alike. The entry is kept because every maintenance figure in this record is scaled from it and the provenance claim should stay visible, but it is now an UNVERIFIED secondary citation, and all five maintenance checkpoints were downgraded to low confidence as a result. As reported by the original researcher: service interval 每2年或3萬公里; 回廠一次保養費 5,000元 covering 保養套餐 plus 檢測 plus 外濾網更換; the pair of PM2.5 內濾網 costs 5,500 fitted by the dealer; original Continental T005 in 255/40/20 lasted 40,000 km; replacement MAXXIS VSEV 6,800 each; battery warranty on his EQE stated as 原廠保證10年25萬公里, with measured battery health 100% at 30,000 km."},{"name":"Taiwan Mercedes EQ high-voltage battery warranty terms (SECONDARY, snippets only)","url":"","note":"URL REMOVED: the researcher cited a google.com/search results page, which is a search rather than a source and does not return stable content. The underlying articles were not opened by the researcher or by me, so this is a secondary citation. Two reported confirmations of the terms that drive the year-7 and year-10 reasoning. U-CAR '[U-EV] 臺灣電動車市場之高壓電池、電機、電控系統保固調查' (am.u-car.com.tw, Jan 16 2025): Mercedes-Benz EQE and EQS including SUV are given 10 年或 25 萬公里 cover. TVBS 地球黃金線 (cars.tvbs.com.tw, Jul 6 2023): 台灣賓士 offers 3 年不限里程全車保固 plus 高壓電池 10 年或 25 萬公里 保固, 保證電容量不低於 70%. This CONTRADICTS the 8-year battery premise in the generic brief and is flagged deliberately: on these terms the calendar limit trips at year 10, not year 8, so years 9-10 remain covered and the cliff lands exactly at the year-10 checkpoint."},{"name":"EQS Taiwan launch pricing and trim history (SECONDARY, snippets only)","url":"","note":"URL REMOVED: cited as a google.com/search results page. Establishes the price history behind the effective list cut described in purchase.notes. 8891新車 price table: 2022款 450+ Pioneer 先鋒版 553萬, 450+ Premium 旗艦版 613萬, AMG 53 4MATIC+ 810萬. 7Car 小七車觀點 EQS 規格配備表 (Mar 2022): cars built from Feb 2022 carry 公告建議售價 5,740,000 for the 先鋒版 and 6,340,000 for the 旗艦版. The independently-verified FindCar page above corroborates the 553萬 / 618萬 / 634萬 rungs, so this entry is corroborated even though its own URL was dropped."},{"name":"Taiwan Mercedes EQ servicing costs and out-of-warranty repair (SECONDARY, snippets only)","url":"","note":"URL REMOVED: cited as a google.com/search results page. Sources behind the maintenance figures, none of them opened. Facebook 賓士 EQS owner group describing an actual EQS first service: '第一次保養更換空氣濾網、煞車油、加雨刷精，其他例行安全檢查就醬'. 聯承汽車 維修資訊 (lc-car.tw, Jul 2026) on post-warranty Benz servicing: 每年的保養費用大約在 1.5 至 3 萬元. Threads (Jan 2026): 賓士 小保養 費用約 9,000 元. Mobile01 '[賓士EQA]是誰說電動車保養很便宜的' reports a Benz EV service near 18,000 for filters, brake fluid and wipers."},{"name":"Mercedes EQ out-of-warranty electric repair reputation in Taiwan (SECONDARY, snippets only)","url":"","note":"URL REMOVED: cited as a google.com/search results page. Surfaces the Mobile01 thread '不建議買賓士電動車-EQA、EQB、EQC、EQE、EQS、GLC EV' (Sep 2025), in which Taiwan owners report that the local importer is not authorised to open a failed drive motor for repair and the only remedy offered is full replacement at over 300,000 TWD. This is the documented reputational drag behind the year-7 downward adjustment and the reduced drive-unit provision in the year-10 maintenance window. Not opened, so it is used as a directional argument only and is not allowed to set any level by itself."},{"name":"Current Taiwan Mercedes new-car incentives (SECONDARY, snippets only)","url":"","note":"URL REMOVED: cited as a google.com/search results page. Basis for the discount assumption and for the finding that NO free scheduled-maintenance programme exists. 台灣賓士 本月專屬購車禮遇 and 中華賓士 購車優惠方案 (Aug 2026) lead with 指定年式 160萬 40期 0利率 plus 現金折扣 plus 一年延長保固; EQE 350+ dealer promotions ran 150萬 60期 零利率 plus first-year 乙式保險. Incentives are financing, cash and warranty extension - none bundle servicing, so every maintenance period carries its full unsubsidised cost."}]},"mercedes-s450-4matic-l":{"assumptions":"At 7,000 km/year this 5.3 m long-wheelbase limousine never reaches a mileage service trigger. Mercedes ASSYST PLUS asks for service at 1 year or 10,000-15,000 km, so the annual timer fires first every year and the car makes exactly 10 dealer visits in 10 years while it covers only 70,000 km. Three consequences drive this record. First, every wear item that is normally mileage-driven becomes date-driven: the 20-inch tires are replaced on sidewall age at 5-6 years with tread left, and the spark plugs on the M256 straight-six come out on a time basis long before the 60,000-80,000 km window. Note the limit of the evidence here. The cited Taiwan service source gives the plug interval as 60,000-80,000 km and says it is decided by mileage. It gives no time interval. The 6-year plug replacement in this record is therefore this record's own conservative assumption, not a sourced figure. Second, the AIRMATIC air suspension and the rear-axle steering are standard on this trim, not options, and both age on calendar years and Taiwan heat rather than on distance. Low mileage buys this owner almost no protection from the two most expensive failures in the 7-10 year window. Third, a chauffeur-profile S-Class that shows 35,000 km at five years is rare in Taiwan, where the typical S-Class runs 20,000-25,000 km/year, and that scarcity is worth real money. The two official Mercedes-Benz Select CPO cars used to calibrate years 1-3 had covered only 3,132 km and 7,541 km, and the 9-year W222 S 450 L used to calibrate the tail had covered 50,800 km. All three are close to this owner's profile rather than to the mileage-blind market average.","cpSources":[{"y":1,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from the researcher's 4,180,000 (70%) to 4,060,000 (68%). I re-fetched the official Mercedes-Benz Select CPO page (https://www.mercedes-benz-select.com.tw/buy-car/index.aspx, HTTP 200) and confirmed the listing exactly: Mercedes-Benz S 450 4M L, 出廠 2025/02, 里程 7,541 km, 518 萬 at 聯立賓士新竹展示中心. The data point is real. The conversion to a private-sale figure was not. The researcher wrote 'about 6% below the CPO ask' but then produced 4,750,000 from 5,180,000, which is 8.3%, and wrote 'about 10%' but produced 4,300,000 from 4,750,000, which is 9.5%. The stated percentages do not match the stated numbers, and 6% understates the ladder in any case: a 原廠認證 CPO ask in Taiwan carries a factory warranty extension and dealer showroom overhead and sits about 10% above ordinary 車商 retail, not 6%. Redone with an explicit chain: 5,180,000 CPO ask, less 10% for CPO over ordinary dealer retail = 4,662,000, less 11% (the midpoint of the 8-15% private-sale band) = 4,149,000. Against that car's own original list of 6,410,000 that is 64.7% at 1.5 years. Extrapolating back the half year up the steepest part of the curve, at about 4 points, gives 68.7% at 1.0 year, and I set 68% of real_cost = 4,060,000. This also fixes an ordering problem. At 70% the S-Class sat only 1 point below the sibling BMW 735i's 71% even though it costs 27% more in absolute terms, and in Taiwan a higher price narrows the flagship buyer pool. At 68% it sits 3 points below the 735i and 6 points above the Audi A8's 62%, which is the right ordering. Dealer trade-in at 3,530,000 is 13% below private, wider than a mainstream car because a dealer taking a 4-million-TWD limousine into stock carries real floorplan and depreciation exposure."},{"y":3,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"CORRECTED DOWN from 3,340,000 (56%) to 3,220,000 (54%). I confirmed the second CPO data point on the same page: Mercedes-Benz S 450 4M L, 出廠 2024/07, 里程 3,132 km, 498.8 萬 at 台明賓士三重展示中心. Applying the same corrected chain as year 1, less 10% for CPO over dealer retail and less 11% for dealer retail over private sale, gives 3,995,000, or 62.4% of that car's own list of about 6,400,000 at 2.1 years. Two independently converted CPO points now read 64.7% at 1.5 years and 62.4% at 2.1 years. That implied slope of 3.8 points per year is far too flat for a German flagship in its first three years, which tells me the standing CPO asks are sticky and lag the market rather than clear it, so I did not extend that slope. The researcher instead jumped to a 10-point-per-year slope between 2.1 and 3.0 years with no stated basis, and it landed exactly on the sibling BMW 735i's 56%. I used a 7.5-point-per-year slope from the measured 62.4%, which gives 55.7%, and set 54% to keep the same 3-point flagship offset below the 735i that year 1 now carries. 54% = 3,220,000. Taiwan Mercedes warranty is 3 years / 100,000 km with no free scheduled maintenance, which I verified at https://lc-car.tw/news2_detail.php?id=11 (新車出廠起3年或10萬公里), so the warranty expiry cliff lands on this checkpoint, and on the most electronically complex car Mercedes sells the used market reprices repair risk hard at that boundary. The 8-point gap to the Audi A8's 46% is deliberate and is the divergence worth naming: the S-Class is the default Taiwan flagship limousine with the deepest used-buyer pool in the segment, while the A8 has thin demand and thin dealer support. 21,000 km at three years is exceptional for this car and supports the upper end of the range. Dealer trade-in at 2,770,000 is 14% below private."},{"y":5,"conf":"medium","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Set at 40% of real_cost = 2,390,000, one point below the researcher's 41% and now level with the sibling BMW 735i. I re-ran the SUM S-Class search myself (https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=BENZ&model=S-CLASS, HTTP 200, 共 34 筆) and verified both bracketing listings against the served markup: W223 S 350 d, 2022年, 55,000 km, 258.8 萬 at 冠威汽車 in 桃園市 (4 years old); and W223 S 350 d, 2021年, 120,590 km, 203.8 萬 at 宏基汽車 in 臺中市 (5 years old). Both are 4門 5人座 four-door saloons, matching this record's body style. Converting the 4-year car: dealer ask 2,588,000 less 11% gives a private sale near 2,303,000 against an original list of about 4,480,000 for a MY2022 S 350 d, so about 51% at 4 years. Converting the 5-year car: 2,038,000 less 11% gives about 1,814,000 against about 4,450,000, so about 41% at 5 years, but at 120,590 km, which is 3.4 times this owner's distance. Two corrections pull in opposite directions on this car. The low-mileage credit lifts it: 35,000 km against 120,590 km is a large premium in Taiwan, visible in the SUM data itself, where two 2022 S 350 d cars sit 39 萬 apart on a 22,000 km mileage difference. The trim-ladder penalty pushes it down: the S 350 d is the cheapest trim in the range, and the used market pays for the model and the powertrain far more than for the extra 1,000,000 of long-wheelbase rear-cabin equipment, so the dearer trim retains a lower percentage even while its absolute resale is higher. Netting the two and adding a year gives 40%. Sanity check against the dealer-retail trap: 2,390,000 private implies a dealer ask near 2,685,000, which sits above the 4-year 55,000 km cheap-trim car at 2,588,000. That is the right relationship, because this car is a dearer trim at one third the mileage of the 5-year comparison. 40% is 7 points below the Mercedes E 200's 47% and 4 points below the GLE 450's 44%; both gaps are the flagship penalty and are explained in full at the 10-year checkpoint, where they are widest. Dealer trade-in at 2,030,000 is 15% below private - the discount widens with age as dealers price in the AIRMATIC and electronics risk they will have to warrant."},{"y":7,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"No W223 is seven years old yet - the generation reached Taiwan in late 2021 - so this is an explicit previous-generation extrapolation and is flagged low confidence for that reason. Method: take real W222 used prices at this age, express them as a retention ratio of that car's OWN original list, and apply the ratio to this car's real_cost. I verified the controlling data point in the SUM markup myself: S-CLASS W222 【S450L】, 2017年, 3000.cc, 50,800 公里, 128.8 萬 at 富佳汽車 in 雲林縣, 4門 5人座, whose own listing title reads 'W222小改款S450L 新車近600萬 全網最低里程 僅跑5萬 12X即可入手'. That is the closest controlled comparison this segment offers: same S 450 L badge, same four-door long-wheelbase flagship body, the M256 3.0 straight-six with EQ Boost that arrived in the W222 facelift, an original list near 6,000,000 against this car's 5,990,000, and 50,800 km over 9 years, or 5,600 km/year, close to this owner's profile. One qualification the researcher omitted and I am adding: the SUM record shows that car as 2WD, so it is the rear-drive S 450 L, not a 4Matic. It is a body, badge and engine match but not a drivetrain match. Dealer ask retention is 1,288,000 / 5,950,000 = 21.6%; less 11% for private sale gives 19.3% at 9 years, and the dealer's own '12X即可入手' text signals the ask is negotiable toward 1,200,000, which supports the haircut. Fitting a log-linear curve through 40% at 5 years and the measured 19.3% at 9 years gives 27.8% at 7 years, and I set 28% = 1,670,000. Two more W222 points frame the surrounding mileage and I verified both: W222 S 350D L, 2018年, 133,887 km, 129.8 萬 at 億昇汽車 (8 years, but 2.7 times this owner's distance), and W222 S450, 2018年, 96,067 km, 149.8 萬 at 鴻騏汽車, whose listing title reads '2018 M-Benz 美規 S450 L'. That one is a 美規 grey import, which trades 10-15% under 總代理 cars in Taiwan, so I did not lean on it. 28% is 2 points under the BMW 735i's 30% and 4 points under the E 200's 32%. The 8-point gap to the GLE 450's 36% is the other divergence worth naming: in Taiwan a 7-year premium SUV keeps a broad second-owner market while a 7-year flagship limousine does not. Dealer trade-in at 1,420,000 is 15% below private; an out-of-warranty S-Class is a car most dealers take reluctantly."},{"y":10,"conf":"low","as_of":"2026-08-22","source":"Previous-generation extrapolation, same method and same low confidence as the 7-year point. Held at the researcher's 955,000 because the 9-year anchor behind it is measured, not assumed, and I verified it independently: the 2017 W222 S 450 L with 50,800 km at 128.8 萬 gives a private-sale retention of 19.3% of its own roughly 6,000,000 list at 9 years, on a low-mileage car matching this owner. Extending one more year down the same log-linear decay gives 16.2%, and 16% of real_cost = 955,000. The internal check works: interpolating my own 7-year (28%) and 10-year (16%) figures back to 9 years lands at 19.4% against the 19.3% actually observed. On the deep tail I am correcting a cherry-pick. The researcher cited three W221 cars - 2013 S 350 at 370,000, 2011 S 350 at 198,000, 2009 S 350 at 198,000 - and omitted a fourth on the same page: W221 S 350, 2009年, 99,465 km, 38.8 萬 at 鴻騏汽車, whose title reads '2009 M-Benz S350 總代理，一手車，里程僅9萬9'. That is the low-mileage 總代理 car, and it asks nearly twice what the 137,300 km 2009 car asks. It is the more relevant comparison for this owner's profile, and it is why I did not push the 10-year figure below 16%: the tail keeps falling, but a low-mileage 總代理 flagship falls less far than the mileage-blind average the omitted listing would have hidden. The one divergence I must justify is against the sibling Mercedes E 200 Luxury at 26%. This record is 10 points lower on the same badge, and that is a finding rather than an error. A 10-year E 200 is a cheap, simple, steel-sprung four-cylinder sedan that any competent Taiwanese independent workshop can maintain, and it has a wide buyer pool. A 10-year S 450 4Matic L carries four-corner AIRMATIC air suspension, rear-axle steering, a 48V starter-generator, Multibeam digital headlamps whose units cost more than the car will then be worth, and the MB.OS Superscreen triple-display stack, all standard, none optional, per U-CAR 86994. Taiwan's used market prices that as a liability, not as equipment. It is the same mechanism that produces the 806,000 year-10 maintenance figure: the reason the tail keeps falling IS the repair bill. Dealer trade-in at 800,000 is 16% below private - the widest gap at any checkpoint, because at this age most dealers will only wholesale the car."}],"maintSources":[{"y":1,"source":"One annual Service A at S-Class pricing. The Taichung Mercedes breakdown (https://lc-car.tw/news2_detail.php?id=11) puts Service A at 8,000-12,000 for a C200 and notes that newer-generation engines and higher trims cost more. An M256 straight-six in a 4Matic flagship takes roughly 60% more oil than the C200 reference and is billed at flagship labour, so 22,000, plus about 2,000 of wipers and fluid. Nothing else is due at 7,000 km - no brake, tire or battery item is near its interval. No free-maintenance programme applies: Taiwan Mercedes includes warranty only, never scheduled service, so this is a real cash cost in year 1."},{"y":3,"source":"Covers years 2-3 only, not cumulative. One Service B at 48,000 plus one Service A at 23,000 plus about 7,000 of alignment and small consumables. The 48,000 B-service figure extends the cited source's own ladder: it gives 15,000-25,000 for a C200 B service and says E-Class and GLE can exceed 30,000, so a long-wheelbase 4Matic straight-six flagship above them lands near 48,000. Brakes, tires and batteries are untouched at 21,000 km, and everything in this window is still warranted, so the period carries scheduled work only and no risk allowance. Combined years 1+3 spend of 102,000 is roughly double the 4-6 萬元 the source quotes for a C200 across the same warranty period, which is the right multiple for two classes up."},{"y":5,"source":"The first period where consumables and the warranty exit dominate. Corrected wording: the researcher wrote that the warranty 'expires during year 4', but 3 years from delivery ends at the close of year 3, so both years in this window are unwarranted. The period still carries no failure allowance, which is a deliberate assumption rather than an oversight: at 4-5 years and 35,000 km the AIRMATIC and electronics hazard is still low, and the allowances start at the 7-year checkpoint. At 7,000 km/year the tires reach only 35,000 km with plenty of tread left, but Taiwan's heat and humidity age the sidewalls out at 5-6 years, so the set goes on date. That is the clearest place where the low-mileage profile saves nothing. Premium 20-inch rubber on an S-Class runs about 20,000-24,000 per corner fitted, hence 88,000. Front pads and discs at 65,000 reflect dealer parts and labour on a car over 2,100 kg with brakes sized for 381 hp. The ATF and coolant items are taken from the cited source's post-warranty checklist rather than from the factory schedule, which nominally calls the ATF a lifetime fill; the source argues explicitly that this claim does not hold in Taiwan and recommends the change at 4-5 years. Service pricing per the ladder set out in plan_notes."},{"y":7,"source":"RAISED from the researcher's 283,000 to 326,000. The researcher's figure was lower than the 5-year period (300,000), which inverts the age curve. This is the first two-year window that is fully out of warranty AND old enough for the pneumatic and 48V hardware to start failing, so it must cost more than a window that carries only tires and front brakes. Two changes produce the increase. The AIRMATIC allowance rises from 70,000 to 95,000: a single front air strut at a Mercedes dealer runs 120,000-150,000 and the compressor about 60,000, and across a two-year window at 6-7 years in Taiwan's heat, on a car with four struts plus a compressor and valve block, an expected value of 95,000 is closer to the hazard than 70,000. This is an expected value, not a quoted repair - any single failure that lands costs more than the allowance. Air suspension is standard on every Taiwan S-Class trim per U-CAR 86994 (https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/86994), so no version of this car escapes the exposure. Second, an 18,000 belt-and-hose line is added, which the cited source explicitly calls for from 5 years of age (輔助皮帶/橡膠管路，車齡5年以上目視確認) and the researcher omitted. The 45,000 powertrain allowance covers the recognised cost items on the M256/48V family: the EQ Boost starter-generator, the electric auxiliary water pump and the thermostat housing. Spark plugs and brake fluid are on time intervals, which is what binds at only 49,000 km, but note that the plug time interval is this record's own assumption, since the source gives mileage only. Service costs escalated about 8% over the year 4-5 figures for parts inflation. Confidence low: no W223 has reached seven years in Taiwan, so the failure set is read across from M256 and AIRMATIC history on the W222."},{"y":10,"source":"Three-year window carrying the full unsubsidised out-of-warranty cost, and the period where this record diverges most from its siblings. Held at the researcher's 806,000, which I checked line by line and against the age curve: it works out to 269,000 per year, against 163,000 per year in the corrected 7-year window and 150,000 per year in the 5-year window, so cost now rises with age at every step. The German tail does not flatten the way a Lexus does; on an S-Class it steepens. The AIRMATIC line moves from a 95,000 risk allowance at 7 years to a 180,000 near-certainty at 8-10 years, because air struts in Taiwan's heat are a when-not-if item past eight years, and this car has four of them plus a compressor and valve block. The 70,000 electronics allowance is an expected value across three years covering the MB.OS Superscreen stack and the Multibeam digital headlamps - a single S-Class headlamp unit is a six-figure part, more than the car's whole trade-in value by then, which is precisely why owners abandon these cars rather than repair them. Rear-axle steering at 40,000 is carried because U-CAR 86994 confirms 後軸轉向系統 is standard, not optional, on every Taiwan trim. This period and the 1,534,000 ten-year total run 32% above the BMW 735i sibling's 1,158,000, and that gap is the same fact as the 16% year-10 residual seen from the other side: Taiwan's used market discounts a ten-year S-Class this hard BECAUSE this is the bill waiting for the next owner. A record that showed a soft maintenance tail alongside a 16% residual would be internally inconsistent. Confidence low - this is a projection onto a generation with no ten-year Taiwan history, built from W222 and M256 experience."}],"sources":[{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 88884 - 改款 S-Class 及 Maybach S-Class 國內預售","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/88884","note":"Dated 2026-06-10. THE list-price source, re-fetched and re-read by me (curl, HTTP 200). Headline: 建議售價499萬元、1,214萬元起. Publishes the facelift Taiwan lineup as S 350 d 4Matic 499 萬元起 / S 450 4Matic L 599 萬元起 / S 450 4Matic L Exclusive 675 萬元起 / S 580 4Matic L Exclusive 855 萬元起, and Mercedes-Maybach S 580 4Matic 1,214 萬元起. Orders opened 2026-06-10 for Q3 2026 delivery, so this is the range on sale today. Confirms four non-Maybach trims, no PHEV and no AMG S 63 in the first Taiwan wave. WebFetch returns 403 on this host; plain curl with a browser user-agent returns 200."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 87263 - 正 2026 年式售價調漲","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/article/87263","note":"Dated 2026-03-30. The PRE-facelift 正2026年式 price table, re-fetched and read directly from the markup (HTTP 200): S 350 d 466 / S 350 d L 531 / S 450 4Matic L 642 / S 580 4Matic L 811 / M-Maybach S 580 1,166 萬元, each up 1 萬元 on the prior year. Superseded by 88884. Used for two things: to date the prior model years' list prices that serve as denominators for the CPO retention ratios, and to show that the 642-to-599 move is a trim repositioning rather than a price cut, since the old 642 萬元 car maps to the new 675 萬元 Exclusive."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 86994 - 改款 S-Class 接單資訊與規格","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/86994","note":"Dated 2026-02-25, title 取消柴油長軸、S 450 L增列車型. The specification source, re-fetched and read in full (HTTP 200). Confirms 全車系皆具備 48V 高效輕油電系統，可提供額外 23 匹馬力輔助 (hence the gasoline classification), the S 450 4Matic L's 381 hp 3.0-litre straight-six petrol, and that 國內導入全車系皆標配 4Matic 四輪驅動系統以及 9 速手自排變速箱，同時後軸轉向系統與 Airmatic 氣壓懸吊亦列為標準配備. Also confirms 20-inch wheels standard and that the facelift deleted the S 350 d L and put the S 450 4Matic L in its place as the entry long-wheelbase car."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Select 原廠精選中古車 (official Taiwan CPO)","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz-select.com.tw/buy-car/index.aspx","note":"The used-value source for years 1-3, re-fetched and re-verified against the served markup (HTTP 200). Two S 450 4M L cars, both confirmed exactly: 出廠 2024/07, 里程 3,132 km, 498.8 萬 at 台明賓士三重展示中心; and 出廠 2025/02, 里程 7,541 km, 518 萬 at 聯立賓士新竹展示中心. Both are ultra-low-mileage cars matching this owner's profile. Both figures are CPO ASKING prices at the top of the retail ladder. This record now converts them with a 10% CPO-to-dealer-retail step and an 11% dealer-retail-to-private-sale step; the previous version used 6% and 10%, and its stated percentages did not match its own stated numbers."},{"name":"SUM 汽車網 - BENZ S-CLASS 中古車搜尋 (共 34 筆)","url":"https://www.sum.com.tw/carsearch.php?v=3&brand=BENZ&model=S-CLASS","note":"The source for the 5/7/10-year curve. I re-fetched it and parsed every listing from the served markup (HTTP 200); the page reports 共 34 筆 across all generations, which confirms the thin nationwide supply behind the listing-fee assumption. Verified listings used here: W222 S450L, 2017年, 50,800 km, 128.8 萬 at 富佳汽車, 2WD, 4門 5人座, listing title 'W222小改款S450L 新車近600萬 全網最低里程 僅跑5萬 12X即可入手' - the controlling 9-year anchor; W223 S350 d, 2022年, 55,000 km, 258.8 萬 at 冠威汽車; W223 S350 d, 2021年, 120,590 km, 203.8 萬 at 宏基汽車; W222 S350D L, 2018年, 133,887 km, 129.8 萬 at 億昇汽車; W222 S450, 2018年, 96,067 km, 149.8 萬 at 鴻騏汽車, title '2018 M-Benz 美規 S450 L' (grey import, not relied on). W221 tail: 2013 S350 37.0 萬, 2011 S350 19.8 萬, 2009 S350 137,300 km 19.8 萬, and 2009 S350 99,465 km 38.8 萬 at 鴻騏汽車 - the low-mileage 總代理 car the previous version omitted from the tail."},{"name":"聯承汽車 - 台中 BENZ 過保後怎麼保養 (Mercedes Taiwan service pricing)","url":"https://lc-car.tw/news2_detail.php?id=11","note":"Dated 2026-07-14. The maintenance cost basis, re-fetched and read in full (HTTP 200). Gives the Taiwan warranty as 新車出廠起3年或10萬公里 with the owner paying all scheduled service; Service A 8,000-12,000 and Service B 15,000-25,000 for a C200, with E-Class and GLE B services above 30,000; 3-year in-warranty cumulative 4-6 萬元; post-warranty 1.5-3 萬元 per year. Supplies the post-warranty interval table: XENTRY full scan immediately on leaving warranty then yearly, ATF every 4-5 years, coolant every 4 years, brake fluid every 2 years, spark plugs every 60,000-80,000 km (視里程數決定, no time interval given), and 輔助皮帶/橡膠管路 visual check from 5 years of age. Names S-Class (W221/W222) specifically as needing 多系統全面評估 post-warranty."},{"name":"Mercedes-Benz Select - S-Class filtered listing","url":"https://www.mercedes-benz-select.com.tw/buy-car/list.aspx?series=S-Class","note":"Opened (HTTP 200) but the results grid is rendered client-side and returns empty markup to a plain fetch - the sidebar shows S-Class (5) but no prices. Listed for honesty: it contributed no figures. The two S 450 4M L data points came from the server-rendered homepage instead."},{"name":"8891 汽車 - Mercedes-Benz used listings","url":"https://auto.8891.com.tw/mercedes-benz/s-class","note":"Opened (HTTP 200). Correcting the previous note: this URL does not redirect. It serves a brand-level index at that exact address, titled Mercedes-Benz 二手價格行情及中古車買賣, with 6,264 cars across all models and no S-Class model filter applied. The only S-Class cars in the served markup are a 2011 S350 at 15.0 萬, a 2015 Maybach S600 at 158.8 萬 and a 2014 S63 Cabriolet at 108.0 萬 - none comparable to this trim, and none a four-door W222 or W223 S 450. Contributed no figure; listed because I opened it, and because it explains why the dealer-ask cross-check in this record rests on SUM rather than on 8891."},{"name":"U-CAR 新聞 89455 - 改款 C-Class 發表","url":"https://news.u-car.com.tw/news/article/89455","note":"Dated 2026-08-18. Opened while tracing the S-Class facelift's related articles. Relevant only as corroboration that Mercedes' current 48V ISG system contributes about 23 hp across the range, matching the S-Class figure. No S-Class price or used-value data; contributed nothing else."}]}};
